        {
          "id": "krea2-25e56d31e909fbf84621157f",
          "alias": "单男白毛衣室内坐手持物",
          "prompt": "In indoor dining scenes, the lighting is natural warm light with moderate brightness. In the middle shot, the figure wears a red, blue, and white plaid knit cardigan with a dark turtleneck underneath. He holds chopsticks in his right hand and brings noodles to his mouth, while his left hand holds a white spoon. In front of him, a red bowl holds noodles and green ingredients. The body sits beside a red dining table, with a transparent glass cup filled with yellow liquid inside. Background elements include red curtains, green plants, wooden window frames, and glass windows. Nearby, you can see the red seat backs. His expression was natural. Detail presentation: The plaid cardigan has clear knit textures and sharp edges in color patchwork; High-neck garments fit closely around the neck; The glass is transparent, and the liquid color is even; The texture of the red curtain fabric, the veins of plant leaves, and the wood grain of the wooden window frame are all clearly visible. The whole area is presented in real detail under warm lighting.",
