          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙桌边坐",
          "prompt": "In indoor dressing table scenes, the lighting is soft and even. In a low-angle downward shot, the figure wears a black off-shoulder dress with straps that fit the shoulder curve, featuring leather trim and hollow-out designs, a high slit reaching the thighs, and a natural hem. Wear long black gloves that fit the curve of your arms; Wearing black mesh stockings with clear mesh textures. He wears a golden floral headdress with sharp petal patterns, green leaves scattered throughout, some hanging over his shoulders. Sit in front of the dressing table, slightly turning your body, stretching your left leg forward, placing your right hand on the dressing table, and resting your left hand on your left knee. The background features a vintage dressing table with a round mirror on the countertop (reflecting the surrounding environment). On the sides are white vases and white flowers, surrounded by green vines with clear leaf textures; Nearby, there are beaded decorations, round and glossy. The overall look is presented with a realistic texture under soft lighting.",
