        {
          "id": "krea2-d8eca5322af25b2fbd4a2a7c",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫海滩沉思持包",
          "prompt": "On a sunny daytime coastal highway scene, sunlight slants from above, making the overall scene bright with short and clear shadows. In full-body composition, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the subject on the right side of the frame, conforming to the rule of thirds. She wore a light blue long-sleeved shirt with a neat fit that fit the shoulders and back, with the hem tucked into a black pleated skirt that naturally fell above the knees, with pleats evenly distributed. Carrying a brown canvas backpack with straps pressed against the shoulders, the surface of the bag showing slight signs of use. Wearing white mid-calf socks and black leather shoes, with the right foot on the bicycle pedal and the left foot suspended in the air. The bicycle is an off-white retro model, with a metal mesh basket on the front wheel, and screw details visible at the connection between the handlebars and frame. The road surface is dark gray asphalt with white markings along the edges, and the guardrails are made of white metal structures with reflective surfaces. The background is an extended coastline, with a light yellow beach, a blue-green gradient of seawater from near to far, and distant mountains covered with vegetation, with clear outlines. The depth of field is relatively shallow, with clear figures and bicycles in the foreground, and the background slightly softening between sea and sky.",
