        {
          "id": "krea2-ed907c4accd1fa54ac53b553",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道摆拍",
          "prompt": "In outdoor street scenes, sunlight shines from the upper right, creating a clear contrast between light and dark, casting sharp shadows on the ground and figures. In full-body composition, a slightly upward perspective is used, with the main subject following the rule of thirds, positioned slightly to the left of the frame. The figure is slightly tilted, arms raised above their shoulders, left hand slightly above the right, in a relaxed pose. She wears a white short-sleeved shirt with a black bow at the collar, slightly wrinkled fabric, and neatly arranged buttons. She wears a dark pleated skirt, the hem slightly lifted with movement, the folds clearly visible. She wears white mid-calf socks and black leather loafers, with noticeable glare on the upper. A black glossy shoulder bag with straps draped across the chest. The background features gray building walls with a \"Biru Biru\" sign hanging on it, along with several posters and notices below. One of the signboards is red with white characters printed with CCTV and Thai-Japanese characters. The foreground features a metal mesh fence with distinct horizontal bars and vertical bars, and the floor is cement-paved, with fine cracks and wear marks on the surface. The depth of field is shallow, the figures are clear, and the background is slightly blurred.",
