        {
          "id": "krea2-e51d92315d4e78f82bb6c708",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫公寓坐注视",
          "prompt": "Inside the public transport carriage, natural light streams in diagonally from the right window, while the left side is in soft shadows. In the middle shot, a slightly upward angle is used, and the subject follows the rule of thirds, positioned slightly to the left of the frame. The figure sits sideways on a blue plastic seat, leaning slightly to the right, turning his head toward the window, and gazing straight to the right. She wears a white short-sleeved sailor-collared shirt with a gray satin bow at the collar, the fabric is flat, and the cuffs are rolled up and folded. She wore a deep gray plaid pleated long dress, with the hem draped over the thighs and the edge of the seat, with distinct layers of pleats. Her hands were folded on her knees, holding a pink phone, with the earphone cable hanging down to her chest. Outside the background window, you can see a blurred city streetscape, including traffic lights, green belts, and distant building silhouettes. The glass windows reflect the structural lines inside the carriage. The edges of the foreground seats are clear, while the interior structure of the rear compartment is slightly blurred, creating a moderate depth of field.",
