        {
          "id": "krea2-5643aedbf1ff3a744139d507",
          "alias": "单女蓝短裙公寓沉思蹲",
          "prompt": "In open outdoor public areas, natural light shines from above and slightly behind, creating soft shadows. In medium shots, use a slightly low angle, with the subject centered in focus, body angled to the side, head turned toward the lens. The figure is in a squatting position, with knees bent and feet flat on the ground, maintaining a stable center of gravity. She wore a blue plaid pleated skirt with red and white threads forming a mesh, the hem voluminous, and the edges showing stitching marks. Black socks cover the calves, paired with thick-soled black leather shoes. The upper is highly reflective and the sole texture is clear. Raise your right hand to your chest in a two-finger gesture, paint your nails pink polish, rest your left hand naturally on your thigh, and wear a black beaded bracelet and metal ring. The background is blurred with people, the ground is paved gray with regular textures, and the distant sky is grayish-white with no obvious clouds.",
