        {
          "id": "krea2-b10b56a5e6b45c43b98719e6",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣城市沉思",
          "prompt": "In urban street scenes, natural light shines from the upper left, creating soft shadows on the right side of the subject. In the middle shot, a head-up angle is used, with the subject positioned in the right corner of the painting in the third-section position. No obvious expression. She wears a beige long-sleeved knit top with cuffs that fit tightly to her wrists, and the fabric surface has fine textures. She pairs a black-and-white polka-dot mini skirt with a hem that falls to mid-thigh, and the fabric is slightly pleated. She wears black platform leather shoes with reflective uppers, tight laces, and white mid-calf socks covering her calves. A black canvas backpack is carried over the shoulder, with the strap draped across the chest. The foreground left hand is partially shot, fingers pinched into a heart shape, nails painted with light-colored polish, and a silver ring is worn. The background features street signs with street names in both English and Chinese. The building walls behind it are yellowed, windows are densely arranged, the edges of the steps are clear, and the floor is made of gray cement with fine cracks and wear marks.",
