        {
          "id": "krea2-0af0a21ebddc13a42f5f36de",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔街道坐",
          "prompt": "In the outdoor green areas beside brick walls, natural light shines from above to the left, creating a contrasting effect of light and shadow. In the middle shot, a head-to-head angle is used, with the subject on the right side of the frame, following the rule of thirds. The figure sits sideways on a low brick wall, with the left leg straight, the right leg bent, feet on the wall, and body slightly leaned back. The head is turned toward the lens, revealing subtle pores and natural shine. She wears a dark blue long-sleeve cropped top with fabric that fits the shoulder and back lines, paired with light blue denim shorts. The hem is rolled up, and the fabric has slight wrinkles and a faded texture. She wears white platform sneakers with clean uppers, tight laces, and white mid-calf socks. Beige shoulder bag with straps crossing over the chest. The background features gray brick walls with clear joints, leaf edges appearing transparent under light, dense branches, and leaf veins clearly visible. The depth of field is moderate, with clear figures in the foreground, and the background wall and plants are slightly blurred.",
