        {
          "id": "krea2-deaf315a7fa49bba1af44d0b",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙户外蹲",
          "prompt": "In outdoor waterside scenes, natural light shines from above, reflecting the sky and tree shadows on the water, creating a contrasting effect of light and shadow. The figure is in a squatting posture, leaning forward, knees bent, hands naturally resting in front of their knees, and the right hand slightly suspended near the water's surface. Looking down, she wears a white sleeveless dress adorned with tiny red floral patterns. The hem ruffles naturally with her posture, and the fabric is thin and hugged to the figure. She wears dark lace-up ankle boots with clear leather texture and neat edge stitching, paired with deep purple ankle socks. The ground is an uneven mix of rocks and soil, interspersed with sparse grass and fallen leaves. The grassy details in the foreground are clear, the middle is a calm water surface, with reflections gently swaying with microwaves, and the background is distant blurry tree shadows and reflections of daylight.",
