        {
          "id": "krea2-1dfd390c9ce589609480923d",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣室内沉思跪",
          "prompt": "In the interior scene, light projects diagonally from the left side of the image, creating soft shadows on the surfaces of figures and furniture. In middle shots, a level perspective is used, with the subject centered in focus. The figure kneels on a light gray wooden floor, body turned sideways to the camera, head turned forward, wearing a white wide-brimmed headband on top, a red short-sleeved knit top with clear fabric texture and cuffs that fit the arm contours. The lower half wears a patchwork plaid pleated skirt, made from patchwork patches of blue-gray, green-brown, and burgundy plaid fabric pieces, with evenly distributed pleats and the skirt naturally folded at the knees. She wears white ankle socks with fine ruffled cuffs, paired with shiny red Mary Jane shoes. The upper is noticeably reflective and the buckle is a round metal. The background features a white bed and drawer cabinet, with a black round handle on the cabinet doors. The headboard is made of vertical striped wood panels, and the top edge is illuminated by a light-colored light strip. The depth of field is relatively shallow, the wood grain on the foreground floor is clear, the details of figures in the middle are prominent, and the background furniture appears slightly blurred.",
