          "alias": "单女粉高领衫室内",
          "prompt": "In the indoor white corner scene, natural light shines from the left side diagonally above, creating a clear light and shadow boundary between the wall and the floor. In the middle shot, a level view is used, with the subject on the right side of the frame, conforming to the rule of thirds. She wore a light pink turtleneck knit sweater, with a plush texture on the fabric, and the cuffs and hem had ribbed closures with clear texture. Her legs were bent and raised, ankles crossed, wearing off-white slouch socks with multiple layers of pleats. The right palm is pressed downward to support the body, fingers naturally extended, and nails neatly trimmed to a pale pink. The background is pure white walls and floor, with no clutter, a shallow depth of field, a clear main subject, and a slightly blurred background.",
