        {
          "id": "krea2-4b229f63ea7ac3ff649ae5ba",
          "alias": "单女白西装城市冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "Under the night sky, urban rooftop scenes feature artificial warm light projected from the front side, illuminating the main building and nearby areas, while the windows of the background buildings emit scattered cold white and warm yellow lights. In the medium shot, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the female figure focused slightly to the right, following the rule of thirds. The figure sits on the edge of a light-colored outdoor sofa, body slightly turned with the left shoulder resting against the armrest, right hand resting on left wrist, left hand naturally resting on thigh, fingertip wearing a metal ring. Slightly high-light reflections are visible. She wears an off-white blazer and matching trousers, with a crisp and draped fabric. The neckline is open, the cuffs rolled up to mid-arm, and on her left wrist is a dark blue dial watch with a black strap. The foreground sofa has clear edges and fabric textures; The glass railing in the middle of the view reflects softly, and two square standing lights at the rear emit even warm light; The background features distinct outlines of high-rise buildings, neatly arranged window panes, some windows lit up, and the distant sky shows a deep gray-blue transitional color with no clouds.",
