          "alias": "单女制服广场沉思坐伸展",
          "prompt": "In pure white platform scenes, uniform soft light shines from directly above and in front, giving the overall image a low-contrast brightness. In full-body composition, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the subject centered and the subject facing the camera head-on. Women sit at the edge of the platform, stretching their left leg forward, bending their right leg for support, leaning their body slightly, and naturally placing their arms behind them for support. She wears a black fitted dress paired with a beige sleeveless blazer. The shoulders of the jacket are crisp, the fabric has fine weaves, and the front is decorated with black triangular cuts. Her legs are covered with black semi-transparent stockings, giving her a clear contour and a soft reflective surface. He wears black square-toe flats with suede uppers and square diamond-inlaid metal buckles at the laces. The background features light gray walls, with large white letters \"DAZED\" and \"KOREA\" printed at the top, and small print of Korean and English on the left and right respectively. The depth of field is relatively shallow, with sharp edges of the foreground platform and slightly blurred background text.",
