          "prompt": "In indoor scenes, soft light projects from the left front of the figure, creating uniform illumination without obvious shadows. In full-body composition, a head-to-head angle is used, with the subject centered in focus, the body slightly tilted to the right, and the back lightly leaning against a light gray cement wall, which features fine vertical seams and grainy textures. The female figure sits on a deep blue short velvet carpet, legs crossed, left leg on top, right knee bent on the ground, wearing off-white square-toed flat shoes with smooth uppers and clearly visible clasp structures. She wears a loose white long-sleeved shirt with a slightly open collar, the hem tucked into the bottom, and the cuffs rolled up to mid-arm, with natural pleats and a slight sheen. Place your right hand above your right thigh, with multiple silver rings on your fingers, and your left hand supporting yourself on the ground behind you, palm touching the ground. She wears a slender silver chain necklace around her neck, and her earlobes hang from slender earrings. The feature wall occupies the upper half of the frame, while the carpet fills the lower half, with a shallow depth of field and slightly blurred edges.",
