          "prompt": "Indoor scenes, natural light streams in diagonally from the left window, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. In medium shots, a level angle is used, with the subject centered in focus. The female figure sits on the edge of a dark green leather sofa, her body slightly turned to the camera, her head facing the camera directly. Wearing an off-white woolen coat, the fabric has a fine plush texture, a vertical neckline, a naturally hanging waist tie, and wide and slightly puffy cuffs. Lightly rest your right hand on your left shoulder collar, fingers slightly bent, and nails neatly trimmed. The left leg is bent, the right leg extends forward, and the black ankle boot edge is visible. In the foreground sits a black leather handbag, with a smooth surface without obvious wrinkles, matte gold metal fasteners, and matching tassels hanging at the end of the strap. The background is a light-colored curtain that emits evenly scattered light, while the right edge of the frame leaves a dark shadow area to create visual contrast. Moderate depth of field, clear figures, distinct details on the sofa and clutch, and slightly blurred backgrounds.",
