          "alias": "单女白毛衣室内坐",
          "prompt": "In indoor scenes, natural light shines from the left side diagonally above, giving the image a soft and even brightness. In medium shots, a level view is used, with the subject positioned slightly to the right of the frame, which conforms to the rule of thirds. The character sits sideways at a table, head turned toward the camera, revealing upper teeth, wearing an off-white coarse knit sweater with three-dimensional twisted patterns, and naturally curled cuffs and hem edges. She wore a black-gray plaid pleated skirt, with neatly arranged pleats and a slight drape in the fabric. The right hand rests on the table, fingers lightly touch the edge of the laptop, while the left hand is not in the frame. On the table sat a silver-gray laptop, a white wireless headphone case, and a stack of orange-covered books, with slightly worn edges. The background features a light brownish-yellow horizontal striped wall with a black square lighting fixture on the wall, with a shallow depth of field, a slightly blurred background, and sharp objects in the foreground.",
