          "alias": "单女白衬衫室内沉思坐",
          "prompt": "In indoor scenes, the lighting is even and soft, with diffused light from above and in front creating a bright neutral tone overall. In full-body composition, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the subject positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, following the rule of thirds. The figure sits on a light gray fabric sofa, slightly turning to the camera, with the left leg naturally extended, the right knee bent and resting on the left knee, toes pointing downward. She wore a white short-sleeved shirt with a tight collar, the cuffs rolled up to her forearms, and a thin belt tied around her waist. She wore a pink and white plaid mini skirt with the hem slanting to one side, revealing her inner thighs and a white lace garter belt. Her legs are dressed in sheer, thin stockings, smooth on the surface with a soft reflective sheen. He wore white pointed high heels, with smooth, untextured uppers. Her left hand naturally rests on her thigh. The depth of field is moderate, with clear legs and shoes in the foreground, and the sofa and wall in the background slightly blurred.",
