          "alias": "单女米毛衣桥沉思站立持相机",
          "prompt": "In scenes beside the outdoor bridge structure, natural light enters the frame diagonally from the right rear of the figure, creating soft backlighting and camera halos. In medium shots, a level perspective is used, with the subject positioned slightly to the left of the frame, which conforms to the rule of thirds composition. The figure stands sideways, with the head slightly turned toward the camera, wearing a light beige knit hat with a dark gray trim and metal buttons on the brim, with the hat surface texture clearly visible. Wear fine-rimmed glasses with reflective edges. Holding a book with a portrait photo on the cover in his left hand, the spine facing outward, with the text visible on the cover. She wore a light brown long-sleeved dress with a ruffled neckline, cinched cuffs forming pleats, and the fabric surface showing fine fabric texture. The left background features rusted metal bridge columns with mottled and uneven surfaces, while the right background is blurred, revealing distant pedestrians and building silhouettes. The depth of field is shallow, with clear figures in the foreground and soft defocus in the background.",
