          "alias": "单女棕西装街道注视",
          "prompt": "In front of the building entrance next to the city street, natural light shines from the upper side, creating soft shadows between the figures and the ground. In full-body composition, a head-to-head angle is used, with the subject centered in focus. The figure's body is slightly turned to the right side of the frame, with the head slightly lowered and gaze downward. He wears a brown beret on top, with a flat hat and edges that fit the shape of the head. On top, she wears a light brown-white plaid short blazer with a clear collar structure, dark brown trim at the cuffs, and rounded metallic buttons. Underneath, she wears a white ruffled collar shirt with a distinct layered neckline. She wears a brown vest on the outside, with three buttons arranged vertically on the front. She paired a high-waisted short skirt with a plaid pattern, with fine stitching at the hem and a metal chain decoration hanging at the waist. Her right hand is tucked into the side pocket of the skirt, while her left hand hangs naturally while holding a black quilted handbag, with a strap made of metal chain and leather patchwork. He wears brown knee-high boots with smooth uppers, metal buckles on the sides, paired with white slouch socks, and ribbed cuffs. The floor is made of gray square stone bricks with clear gaps, the background building walls are made of beige stone, the door frames are made of dark metal, and the glass reflects ambient light and shadow. The depth of field is layered from front to back, with clear ground textures nearby, complete figure outlines in the middle ground, and slightly blurred architectural details in the background.",
