        {
          "id": "krea2-1ade2fe844b28e66e4d8c569",
          "alias": "单女制服窗边坐",
          "prompt": "For indoor scenes, light comes from the upper right window, creating a uniform and soft environment that illuminates the main body and the bed. In medium shots, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the main body centered in focus, the body slightly turned to the right of the lens, and the head facing the camera directly. Women sit on beds with two-tone sheets, left leg straight, right leg bent, right hand resting on right knee, left hand naturally resting beside thigh. She wears a white long-sleeved shirt over a black sleeveless vest, with two gold buttons on the front and a light blue and white patterned silk scarf at the collar. Visible micropores and natural glow. Black stockings cover her legs, with even surface reflection. She wears black pointed high heels with smooth uppers and heels that stand upright. The left side of the sheets features an off-white base with gray patterns, while the right side features deep brown and light brown vertical striped fabric, with clear textures. The background is a wooden wall with embedded shelves, on which is a small potted green plant. The flowerpot is made of white ceramic, with small, dense leaves. The depth of field is shallow, the foreground bedsheet texture is clear, and the background wall is slightly blurred.",
