          "alias": "单女制服室内沉思叉腰",
          "prompt": "In the indoor scene, the light comes from a slightly higher front position, uniform and soft. The medium shot uses a head-to-head angle, with the female figure centered in focus, her body slightly sideways to the right of the lens, head facing directly. Wearing a white satin shirt with a neckline open to the chest, buttons not fully fastened, a smooth reflective fabric surface with natural pleats, wide cuffs that cinch at the wrists. Left hand on hip, arms naturally bent. A thin chain cross pendant is worn around the neck, and the metal surface reflects ambient light. Wrist wears a round dial watch with a dark leather strap with clear texture. The background is a light gray wall, with part of the door frame edges visible on the left where the ground meets the floor. The floor is paved with gray and white tiles, creating a shallow depth of field and a slightly blurred background that highlights the main figure.",
