          "alias": "单女连衣裙室内坐（2）",
          "prompt": "In the indoor scene, natural light enters diagonally through the large window on the left, providing soft and even illumination that illuminates the main object and parts of the background. In medium shots, the focus is at a level angle, with the main body centered in focus, the body slightly sideways to the left of the lens, and the head facing the camera directly. The woman sits on the edge of a light gray fabric sofa, with her right leg naturally bent and resting on her left leg, her left hand gently resting on her right knee, and her right hand resting on the armrest of the sofa, maintaining a stable posture. The dress features embossed floral patterns with black edges. Blue throw pillows are placed at the sofa backrest, with a wooden grille partition and marble wall as the backdrop, and the floor covered in light-colored polished tiles that reflect ambient light. Moderate depth of field, clear foreground figures, slightly blurred backgrounds, but still recognizable materials and structures.",
