          "alias": "制服厨房手持物",
          "prompt": "In commercial kitchen environments, ceiling lights combined with the light reflected by stainless steel equipment create uniform and bright illumination. In middle shots, a level perspective is used, with the subject centered in focus. Fine pores and natural sheen are visible, teeth neatly exposed, wearing a white apron with shoulder straps that fit the collarbone, red webbing at the waist, slight indentations and stitching on the fabric surface, and a small brand label visible at the edge of the right pocket. The background features a stainless steel stove and smoke hood, with a black burner and an unlit gas vent. The left shelf holds bread and sliced vegetables, with a shallow depth of view. The pots in the front are clear, while the ingredients and equipment in the background are slightly blurred.",
