        {
          "id": "krea2-99fff6d0ec242abf9f712947",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙沙发坐",
          "prompt": "Indoor scenes feature artificial light sources projected from the upper front, providing soft and even light. The background wall presents a city night scene, with clear reflections on water and architectural silhouettes. In medium shots, use a level viewing angle, with the subject positioned slightly to the right of center of the frame, which conforms to the rule of thirds composition. The figure sits on a light olive green leather sofa, with the body slightly turned to the left side of the frame, head facing the camera directly. Fingers slightly spread out, nails neatly trimmed to a natural color. She wore a pink long-sleeve tight dress with a U-shaped neckline, snug shoulder lines, cuffs tightly tied to wrists, a noticeably cinched waist, and a hem that hugged the thigh curve, with slight stretch pleats on the fabric. The sofa backrest has a diamond-shaped stitching texture, with slight wear on the edges. The background city image has moderate bokeh, and distant lights appear point-like defocused.",
