        {
          "id": "krea2-7127eebaa4ee055b40c83354",
          "alias": "单女透视蓝衬衫办公室沉思坐",
          "prompt": "In indoor office scenarios, artificial light is projected from the upper left, creating soft and even light and an overall warm tone. In full-body composition, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the subject positioned on the right side of the frame, conforming to the rule of thirds. The figure sits in a brown leather office chair, slightly turned to the camera, with his head facing the camera directly. Naturally draped over the shoulders, wearing a deep blue pinstriped shirt with an open neckline, subtle pleats in the fabric, and cuffs that fit the wrist. She wore a black short skirt made of leather-reflective material, with neat edges. With legs together and stretched forward, wearing black sheer stockings that clearly show the leg lines, and black pointed high heels with red accents on the soles. My left hand lightly rests on the gray folder on the table, while my right hand rests next to my laptop. The background features light-colored walls and wooden bookcases, and the carpet features a bold brown and blue geometric pattern with distinct textures. The wood grain on the foreground desk is clear, the metal bracket of the mid-view chair reflects ambient light, and the bookshelf grille structure in the background is orderly.",
