          "prompt": "In the rear seat scene, natural light enters diagonally through the side window, creating soft lighting, while raindrops outside the window cling to the glass to create a defocused background. In medium shots, a level angle is used, with the subject centered in focus. The figure sits on a brown leather seat, body slightly tilted, left leg bent over the right leg, right foot resting on the edge of the cushion. She wears a black dress with white floral patterns, a burgundy lapel, slight pleats in the fabric, and cuffs that cinch at the forearms. Holding a transparent plastic cup with a green drink in her left hand, holding another cup with her right, her knuckles long, wearing a black ring and smartwatch. The shoulder is made of burgundy leather handbag, with a smooth, reflective surface and clear metal fasteners. She wears black thin stockings on her legs, shiny red platform high heels, thick heels, and a noticeably glossy upper. On the left side of the foreground, there is a blurred obstruction, the depth of field decreases from near to far, water droplets on the car window appear irregularly, and the distant street scene blurs into gray-green patches.",
