          "prompt": "On a street lined with cherry trees on both sides, natural light slanted from above, giving the overall scene a bright and soft tone. In the middle shot, a head-to-head angle is used, with the subject positioned on the right side of the frame, following the rule of thirds. Wearing a blue denim off-shoulder top, the shoulder pleats are natural, the cuffs are gathered to create a voluminous silhouette, and the fabric texture is clearly visible with visible stitching and slight fading marks. She wore a white high-waisted skirt that hugged her figure, with clear buttons at the waist. On the left wrist, she wears a black strap watch, with her arm naturally hanging down. In the background, the cherry blossom branches are intertwined, with petals densely covering the canopy, some of which drift down to the road. Vehicles are parked on both sides of the road: a dark-colored SUV on the left, a white van and a black sedan on the right, their body reflections reflecting the surrounding environment. The ground is a gray asphalt pavement, with tree shadows casting strip-like shadows. In the distance, building walls are made of red brick and light gray paint, with clearly defined window frame structures. The depth of field is shallow, the foreground figures are clear, the background slightly blurred but still retains details.",
