          "prompt": "On the sandy area by the water, natural light shines from the side and top, creating soft shadows between the figures and the ground. In full-body composition, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the subject positioned slightly to the right of the frame, following the rule of thirds. The figure is lying on his side, with his upper body supported by his left arm, body tilted toward the lower left corner of the painting, head turned to the right, wearing a light blue short-sleeved T-shirt with white \"LOS ANGELES DODGERS\" printed on the back, and the fabric naturally wrinkled due to the posture. She wears gray-white-blue plaid shorts with clear texture on the upper panel, and a small red label visible in the right back pocket. Her left leg is bent, and she wears black platform lace-up boots with smooth, reflective boots, paired with gray slouch socks with a distinct knit texture. His right hand lightly touched the sand, fingers slightly spread. The foreground is fine sandy ground with footprints and indentations on the surface; The middle ground shows a shimmering, light brown water surface with dense and continuous ripples; There are no other objects in the background, only extending to the boundary between water and sky.",
