          "prompt": "In the indoor bedroom scene, natural light streams in diagonally from the right window, creating a soft and cool light tone that creates a transition between light and shadow on the walls and bedding. In medium shots, a top-down angle is used, with the subject centered in focus. The figure lies sideways on a bed, resting his head on overlapping arms, facing the camera, legs slightly raised and crossed, feet facing upward. Subtle pores and natural sheen are visible. She wears a sleeveless top with a blue and white plaid bow tie, the tie strap hanging down to the shoulder side, and the fabric texture is clear with slight wrinkles. The bedsheet features a light blue background printed with floral patterns, with natural folds and light and shadow variations on the surface. In the foreground, transparent plastic bags containing sliced lemons and small green balls are scattered, with some cards printed with hand-painted flowers and letters. The feature wall has a pale green mottled texture, with octagonal mirror frames hanging in the corners. The mirror reflects a blurred light, the window screen is half-transparent, and the scenery outside is blurred. The overall depth of field is relatively shallow, with the remaining areas gradually blurred.",
