          "alias": "单女灰毛衣室内坐指向",
          "prompt": "In indoor scenes, soft warm lighting shines diagonally from above, creating an even and bright lighting effect throughout the scene. In the middle shot, a level view is used, with the subject on the right side of the frame, conforming to the rule of thirds. The figure sits sideways on a beige fabric sofa, legs naturally extended and slightly crossed, toes pointing toward the lower left corner of the frame. The head is slightly turned to the camera, revealing teeth to reveal tiny pores and natural shine. She wears a sleeveless gray knit vest layered with a loose cardigan in the same color scheme, with natural wrinkles at the edges of the fabric. Holding a transparent glass cup in her left hand, her nails painted with deep purple nail polish. He wears a white jade bracelet on his right wrist. The sofa cushions are thick with slight indentations on the surface. The background wall is light beige, and hangs an abstract painting with a black border featuring colorful geometric shapes. On the left sofa armrest, there's a blue plush toy, and behind it is another pale pink plush toy. The depth of field is relatively shallow, the foreground sofa texture is clear, and the background wall and painting are slightly blurred.",
