          "prompt": "In outdoor lakeside scenes, natural light gently shines from the rear diagonally, giving the overall image a warm yellow tone. Use a head-up angle, slightly sideways to the right of the lens. The figure's head is slightly tilted, wearing an off-white shirt with lace trim on the collar and cuffs. The fabric is thin and semi-transparent, with fine pleats and embroidered patterns on the surface. The buttons are made of round white plastic. The background is a calm lake, reflecting the outline of the distant forest. The dense branches and leaves of the trees gradually change from green to yellow-brown, and faintly visible pale stone steps along the lakeshore. The depth of field is relatively shallow, with clear figures in the foreground, and the background water surface and woods slightly blurred, creating a layered separation.",
