          "alias": "单女白毛衣庭院站立",
          "prompt": "In outdoor shaded courtyard environments, natural light diffuses from above and sides, creating a soft and even lighting effect. In full-body composition, use a level perspective, with the subject positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, following the rule of thirds. The figure slightly turns to the left side of the camera, with the head turned toward the camera. On top, she wears an off-white coarse knit sweater with vertical striped texture, loose and naturally draped cuffs, and a light blue sailor-collared shirt with a deep blue bow at the collar, made of a slightly glossy material. She wears a blue and white plaid pleated short skirt with a radial pleated hem and neat fabric edges. Arms naturally folded in front of the body, hands gently clasped. Standing barefoot on wet cement ground, the toes are clearly shaped, and the arch lines are natural. On the left side of the background, you can see the red brick columns, with a rough surface and marks of gray cracks; The green plants behind are blurred and blurred, with leaf outlines faintly visible; The wooden eaves structure above runs across the upper part of the painting, with wood grain and seam details clearly visible. The depth of field is relatively shallow, with clear foreground figures and a gradually softening background.",
