        {
          "id": "krea2-3fff55f6b3ce527c12f37efb",
          "alias": "白T恤厨房冷淡倚靠手持物",
          "prompt": "In kitchen scenes, natural light enters from the right side, creating a soft transition between light and dark, with walls and countertops presenting a cool gray-green tone. In full-body composition, use a head-to-head angle, with the subject slightly focused to the left, following the rule of thirds. The figure leans sideways against the control table, with the right arm resting on the edge of the table, the left hand gently resting on the surface, legs naturally crossed, and the left leg slightly bent to support the body. Wearing a white sleeveless tank top, the fabric fits the body perfectly, with slight pleats at the edge of the shoulder straps; Layer it with a light gray knit cardigan, with naturally rolled cuffs and hem for clear texture. Wearing light gray shorts, loose pant legs, obvious side seams, and fabric with a slight drape. The feature wall is covered with vertical tiles with neat joints; The upper shelves hold glass jars, cardboard boxes, and dried flower branches; On the left side of the counter is a white plate rack and ceramic bottles; on the right, you can see a pink toaster and dinner tray, with fried eggs and tomatoes on the plate. The depth of field is relatively shallow, the front countertop texture is clear, and the objects behind are slightly blurred.",
