          "prompt": "At night, urban street scenes feature artificial light sources projecting from multiple directions, including streetlights, shop signs, and decorative string lights, creating a mixed warm white and cool white light effect. In medium shots, a slightly low angle is used for upward viewing, with the subject positioned slightly to the right of the frame, which conforms to the rule of thirds composition. The figure sits at the edge of a wooden bench, with his body slightly turned to the camera and his head facing the camera. Natural pores and a slight sheen are visible. She wears a black suede short jacket with fine plush texture, paired with black skinny shorts underneath that fit the waistband to the waistline. Crossed legs, left leg stacked over right, wearing black knee-high leather boots with slight pleats and leather reflection, and chunky heel structure. The left hand rests lightly on the left knee, while the right hand naturally rests on the edge of the bench. In the background, you can see the building facade, blue shop signs, glowing tree-shaped decorations, and distant vehicle silhouettes. The depth of field is shallow, the background is slightly blurred, and gaps and moss traces can be seen on the foreground stone floor.",
