          "alias": "单女全裸外套注视",
          "prompt": "In the building facade scene beside city streets, natural light shines diagonally from the upper right side, creating a clear distribution of light and shadow. In full-body composition, a slightly upward viewing angle is used, with the subject positioned slightly to the right of the frame, conforming to the rule of thirds composition. The subject's body is angled sideways, with the head slightly lowered and gaze directed toward the lower left ground. He wears a red beret, with a clear velvet texture and slightly sunken edges. The front of the coat is open, black buttons are neatly arranged, and the lining is made of brown-white plaid fabric with naturally folded edges. She wore a red high-waisted short skirt that hugged the curves of her legs, and the material was slightly stretchy. She lifts her right leg, wears nude stiletto sandals, laces wrapped around her ankle to secure them, and her toenails painted dark nail polish. His left hand gently rests on the wall, fingers bent slightly; the wall is made of light gray stone, with fine cracks and shadows accumulated on the surface. The floor is paved with gray bricks, with clear joints, and some areas are covered by character projections. The facade of the building in the background features relief decorations with three-dimensional lines, bright in the light, and dark shadows in the backlight.",
