          "prompt": "Indoor scenes have uniform and soft lighting, coming from the upper front with no obvious shadows. For medium shots, use a head-up angle with the subject centered in focus. The figure sits at the edge of a white bathtub, leaning slightly forward, legs hanging naturally in the air, feet not touching the ground. Place your hands on the edges of the tub on both sides, and let your fingers naturally spread to fit against the tub wall. The ends are slightly inturned at the ends, and she wears a loose white T-shirt with dark letters printed on the chest. The fabric has slight pleats, and the cuffs are naturally rolled up. She pairs it with gray drawstring shorts, with the elastic waistband clearly visible. Her legs are covered with light gray transparent stockings, the toes are slightly darker, and the bathtub is filled with white plastic balls, with even surface reflection. On the left side of the background is an off-white tassel ornament, while on the right is a green palm leaf plant, with slender leaves and distinct veins. The depth of field is moderate, with clear figures in the foreground, and the background plants and decorations slightly blurred.",
