          "prompt": "In outdoor courtyard scenes, natural light streams diagonally from the upper left, creating a contrasting light and shadow effect. In the middle shot, use a level view angle, with the subject positioned slightly to the right of the three-quarter line. The figure sits on a wooden bench, slightly tilted toward the camera, with his head facing the camera. She wears a white short-sleeved T-shirt with a slightly curled hem that fits the waist, and a light pink letter print on the chest. She wears blue denim shorts with flicked edges, and the metal buckle on the belt is clearly visible. Her legs are brought together and stretched forward, wearing white mid-calf socks with fine ribbed cuffs, paired with deep blue and white-trimmed canvas shoes, with laces tied in a bow pattern. On the wooden stool on the right side, there is an off-white canvas tote bag with natural folds and a slight reflective surface. The background is a light yellow wall, with dense yellow vines hanging above. The leaves and petals show clear patterns under the light, and the concrete floor reflects fallen leaves and tree shadows, with clear depth of field from near to far.",
