          "prompt": "In the library's bookshelf aisle, natural light streams in diagonally through high windows, illuminating the wooden bookshelves and the floor, creating a soft transition between light and shadow. In full-body composition, a head-to-head angle is used, with the subject positioned slightly to the left of the center, conforming to the rule of thirds. She wears a light beige long-sleeved shirt with a neat fabric with slight wrinkles, a collar that folds to the top, and sleeves rolled up to the middle of her forearm. She wears an olive green pleated short skirt with a radiating crease, and a belt fastened to the center of her abdomen. A brown leather shoulder bag slung crossbody over the right shoulder, with fine texture on the surface and a reflective metal clasp. Her legs are dressed in beige vertical striped long socks, paired with black Mary Jane shoes with smooth uppers and metal clasps. Gently support the spine of the book with your left hand, let your right hand hang naturally, fingers slightly bent. The wood-grained bookshelf in the foreground is clear, the book spines are tightly arranged, and the background passage extends to the distant window frame. The depth of field gradually blurs from near to far, and the reflection from the ground reveals the silhouettes of the figures.",
