          "prompt": "In outdoor snowy scenes, natural light shines from above, creating bright, cool-toned light and shadow. In medium shots, use a slightly lower upward angle, with the subject centered in focus. The figure sits on a yellow sled, leaning slightly forward, legs straight, feet facing the camera. A red knitted scarf wraps around the neck, with clear texture and naturally curled edges. He wears red-and-white gloves on both hands, holds a sled tow rope, and the backs of his hands show fine veins outlined. She wears off-white striped shorts with slightly worn cuffs on the legs, and white platform shoes with stitched details on the upper and light brown soles. The background features a large area of snow with irregular indentations and depressions. The distant snowy field extends to the edge of the frame, the sky is cloudless, the overall depth is clearly defined, the snow surface in the foreground is clearly grained, the middle ground features prominent character details, and the background blur is soft.",
