        {
          "id": "krea2-5433f0baa17dbc98dcf03618",
          "alias": "全裸白衬衫室内沉思坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "In a bright indoor environment, natural light enters through the left window, creating a soft side light. In medium shots, use a level view with the subject centered slightly to the right in focus. The figure sits on a dark gray chair, leaning slightly forward, legs together, knees slightly bent, and toes pointing forward. The right hand holds a white porcelain cup with red floral patterns on the body, and the fingers naturally curve to hold the cup. Wearing a loose white shirt with an open neckline, the hem naturally falling to mid-thigh, the fabric pleats clearly visible, hugging the body's curves. The inner layer is sheer, nude-colored pantycoons with a white heart-shaped pattern. The material is thin and sheer, with subtle leg muscle lines. The background features a white wall decorated with embossed patterns, with a black TV cabinet on the wall, reflecting light. In the foreground is a round marble tabletop with gray and white patterns on the surface. On the table are tea sets including a teapot, teacups, and a snack plate, each holding slices of strawberries. The floor is made of gray tiles, smooth and reflective, with distinct depth and layering, and a distinct background blur that highlights the main subject.",
