        {
          "id": "krea2-9865e7735ebfe16186e6e248",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙室内沉思跪手持物",
          "prompt": "In an indoor environment with a pure white background, the light is even and soft, shining from the front and above, creating a bright and shadow-free illumination effect. She wore a black lace spaghetti strap dress with slender straps, a pleated neckline, and fabric that hugged the curves of the body, giving a semi-transparent texture. She wears black fishnet stockings with repeated geometric patterns on her legs, black high heels, and clearly defined ankles and arches. The figure kneels on a black metal-framed chair with a gray leather surface, smooth and slightly reflective. Hold the chair back with your left hand, extend your arm, make your joints and knuckles clearly visible, and bend your fingers naturally. The chair has a simple structure, with straight black metal pipes and smooth connections. The background is a single white with no distractions, a shallow depth of field, clear foreground and subject, and a completely blurred background that highlights the figure's posture and costume details.",
