          "alias": "单女制服室内脱衣",
          "prompt": "In indoor environments, light comes from the front slightly left, creating a uniform transition between light and dark. In medium shots, a low-angle low-angle downward view is used, with the subject positioned slightly to the right center, following the rule of thirds. The back muscles have natural lines, and the shoulder blades are clearly defined. She wears a black spaghetti strap bra that fits the shoulders, with a small buckle structure in the center of the back. She wears black lace pants on the bottom, with legs clinging to the curves of her legs. The lace pattern is continuous and richly detailed, showing off the contours of her skin below. Place both hands on either side of your hips, fingers slightly apart, elbows spread outward, and the muscle lines of your arms are clearly defined. The background is a light gray wall with a flat surface without decoration. On the right wall hangs a circular object with blurred edges, out of focus. There is a clear difference in depth between foreground and middle ground; the main subject is clear, the background is blurred, and the overall composition presents a high-contrast black-and-white effect.",
