        {
          "id": "krea2-12c3fc99a8b85f8eb0835ef6",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道坐交叠",
          "prompt": "In outdoor street scenes, natural light shines from the upper sides, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. In medium shots, use a slightly top-down angle, with the subject centered slightly to the right in focus. The figure is seated, leaning forward, with legs crossed on a bench, left leg in front and right leg behind, with the feet fully visible. The head tilts slightly, and the expression relaxes. Wearing a white short-sleeved T-shirt with green lettering on the chest, the fabric fitting the shoulder and torso curves, the fabric pleats naturally appearing with movement. She wears dark shorts with smooth hems and a slight texture. Hands folded on the left knee, fingers naturally bent, wrists worn with a thin string bracelet. She wears white platform sneakers with orange stripes and star patterns on the upper, laces tied in a bow pattern, and stitching details on the tongue and upper. White knit socks are stacked at the cuff, with the cuff folded upward, forming multiple pleats. The background features a dark green wall with circular decorations and text signs. The glass door on the right reflects street views, and the floor is made of gray tiles with fine scratches and a grainy texture. The foreground features wooden benches with clear grain, the middle features figures and the ground, and the background is the building facade. The depth of view is distinct and the focus is on the entire figure.",
