          "alias": "白衬衫露台站立",
          "prompt": "In outdoor high-rise terrace scenes, natural light shines from above, creating bright, warm-toned light and shadow. In the middle shot, a head-to-head angle is used, with the subject on the right side of the frame, following the rule of thirds. The figure stands sideways, with the head slightly lowered, showing a natural sheen and a calm expression. Wearing a white vertical striped shirt, the straps slide down to the arms, the cuffs rolled up, the fabric texture is clearly visible, the hem drapes naturally, and the shoulder lines are smooth. Raise your right hand and lightly touch your right shoulder, relax your fingers, and move naturally. The background is a cluster of city buildings, with dense high-rises in the distance and metal railings running across the bottom of the frame. The smooth surface reflects light and reflects the surrounding environment. The sky is clear, light blue, and cloudless. The depth of the field is distinctly layered: the foreground features railings and the figure's body, the middle ground shows the architectural outline, and the background features distant mountains and the skyline. The overall composition is highly clear and richly detailed.",
