          "id": "krea2-0d90cc762d5843e70a66ea21",
          "alias": "单女粉外套室内沉思倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "In indoor scenes, natural light shines from the left, creating a soft transition between light and shadow. In the middle shot, a head-to-head angle is used, with the subject on the right side of the frame and the body in a diagonal pose, which conforms to the rule of thirds composition. The figure leans sideways against a wooden cabinet, head slightly lowered, gaze directed to the lower right, neatly combed and fixed backward, expression calm. Wearing a pink long-plush coat, the fur is fluffy and layered, covering the shoulders and arms, with fine fiber structures visible on the fabric. Wearing black tights underneath, the leg lines are smooth, and black high heels are sharp, with smooth, reflective uppers. His right hand lightly touches the phonograph dial; his fingers are long, and his nails are neatly trimmed. The background is a light-colored wall with a smooth surface without obvious texture. The wooden cabinet surface features natural wood grain, and the drawer edges have metal handles. Under the cabinet are several glass jars, each transparent and filled in various colors, with cork stoppers at the mouths. The floor is a light-colored herringbone parquet with clear grain and reflects a small amount of light. Overall, the depth of field is relatively shallow, with clear foreground figures and slightly blurred backgrounds.",
