          "alias": "单女连体衣室内躺拥抱",
          "prompt": "In indoor scenes, natural light enters diagonally from the left, creating a soft contrast of light and shadow. The figure lies sideways on a pink cushioned bench, head slightly raised, arms naturally bent, elbows supported on the mat. His expression was calm. She wears a leopard-print bodysuit, the fabric hugging the curves of her body, with clear spotted patterns on the surface and slim straps. She wears black fishnet stockings on her legs with a regular mesh structure on the upper surface, and high heels with black plush uppers, and light-colored soles. Bend your right leg, lift your sole upward, extend your left leg, and bend your knee slightly. The background features white brick walls, with regularly arranged brick joints that are rough in texture, casting shadows on the wall. In the foreground, you can see the edges of black plush objects, which are fluffy and create a color contrast with the pink cushions. The depth of field is clear, the main details of the subject are prominent, the background is slightly blurred, the overall composition is stable, and the lighting is evenly distributed.",
