          "alias": "单女浴室注视",
          "prompt": "In indoor bathroom scenes, light comes from a warm source in front of the mirror, shining from above and in front; in the middle shot, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the subject positioned on the left side of the frame, away from the camera, head slightly turned to the right, facing the mirror. Fingers slightly spread, hand movements clearly visible. Place your left hand on the edge of the sink, extend your arm, bend your elbow slightly, and wear a fine metal bracelet on your wrist. The washbasin is made of light gray marble, with a smooth surface and natural texture. On the table, items such as golden faucets, transparent glass bottles, black lipstick tubes, and combs are arranged tightly together but not chaoticly. The mirror reflects the person's frontal image, with the gaze looking straight ahead. The background is a light gray wall and the edge of the frame, which is made of metal and has a noticeable reflection. The depth of field gradually blurs from near to far, the details of the sink in the foreground are clear, the outlines of figures in the middle are well-defined, and the background mirror and wall surface appear slightly blurred.",
