          "alias": "单女红外套街道沉思吸烟",
          "prompt": "In city street scenes at night, artificial light sources shine from above, creating strong contrasts of light and dark and local highlights. In medium shots, the view is from a low angle, with the subject positioned slightly above the center of the frame. Attached to the neck and shoulders. She wears a deep red plush coat with a distinct plush texture on the surface, with the edges naturally hanging down to cover the shoulders and arms. Underneath, she wears a red lace bra with slim straps, clearly showing the contours of her chest. She wears a red pleated long skirt with irregular layers, and the fabric surface features vertical stripes and reflective effects. The right hand wears a red glove and holds a lit cigarette; the smoke drifts upward, appearing semi-transparent near the light source. In his left hand, he carries a glossy red handbag. The surface of the bag is smooth, adorned with metal decorations, and the shape is full, with smooth edges. The background features the building facades on both sides, with walls featuring light-colored stone textures and rectangular windows, some of which emit warm yellow light. The street surface is made of dark gray asphalt with white parking markings. A dark-colored car is parked on the left, and a green sedan is parked on the right, with the body surface reflecting surrounding light. The overall depth of field gradually blurs from near to far, with foreground objects clear and background architectural outlines slightly blurred.",
