          "prompt": "In indoor kitchen scenarios, the cold white light from inside the refrigerator mixes with warm yellow light from the environment, creating a contrast between light and dark. She wore a white, fluffy plush jacket with clear fabric texture, fine plush textures on the surface, and rounded shoulder lines. She wears light beige lace stockings on the lower body, with clear leg contours and lace patterns forming a continuous mesh structure that covers the entire calf to thigh. Holding food in his right hand, he brought it to his mouth, fingers long, and his nails painted dark nail polish. Rest your left hand on the edge of the refrigerator door, your hand movements natural. The refrigerator door opened, and inside the shelves were several jars and bottled items, some labels blurry and legible. The background is kitchen cabinets, with smooth surfaces and a grayish-white color, similar to the color of the refrigerator doors. The foreground shows the inside of the refrigerator door, with a distinct metallic texture that reflects the outlines of surrounding objects. The depth of field is relatively shallow, the background is slightly blurred, highlighting the main subject and local details of the refrigerator.",
