        {
          "id": "krea2-b4ad70d951e74beeefc296bb",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套椅上坐",
          "prompt": "In front of the indoor wooden wall background, natural light shines from the upper sides, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. In the middle shot, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the subject on the right side of the frame, following the rule of thirds. The figure sits sideways on a wooden chair, with the left leg bent and folded over the right, knee slightly raised, and feet not fully visible. Raise your right hand behind your head, making the arm lines clearly visible. Place your left hand naturally on your left knee, with the back of your hand facing up, and your nails neatly trimmed. She wears a dark blue plush jacket made of thick material with fine plush textures. The collar is open, revealing a light-colored tight garment underneath, with clear contours around the abdomen and waist. The hem of the coat hangs down to the ground, covering part of the seat and carpet. He wore high heels with colorful geometric patterns on the upper, slender heels, and pointed toes. The chair is made of wood, with a curved backrest and natural wood grain and slight wear on the surface. The floor is covered with a purplish-red short velvet carpet, soft in texture with slight curled edges. The feature wall is made of vertical wood panels, with colors gradient from light brown to dark brown, with continuous and consistent grain patterns. The overall depth of field is relatively shallow, with clear foreground and midfield, slightly blurred backgrounds, and no strong shadows.",
