          "alias": "单女灰毛衣浴室冷淡手持物",
          "prompt": "In indoor bathroom scenes, light comes from the upper left position, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. In medium shots, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the subject positioned on the right side of the frame, body in a sideways posture, head slightly turned toward the lens. She wears a dark gray tight knit long-sleeve top with vertical stripes on the fabric, obvious pleats on the shoulders and arms, and the garment clings closely to the torso, highlighting her body curves. Hold the metal showerhead with your right hand, bending your fingers to grip the edge of the showerhead. Place your left hand in front of your chest, elbow slightly raised, and the garment at your wrist may show slight stretching or deformation. The background features brown marble walls with irregular dark patterns, and localized reflections that appear in cool tones. The ground is not fully visible, but the edges of light-colored tiles are visible. The overall depth of field gradually blurs from near to far, with clear clothing details in the foreground, distinct figures in the middle ground, and the texture of the background wall fades with distance, with even shadow distribution matching the direction of the light source.",
