          "alias": "多人浴室沉思持镜",
          "prompt": "In indoor bathroom scenes, the light comes from a warm source in front of the mirror, shining from the sides and behind the subject, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. In the middle shot, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the subject positioned on the right side of the frame, body in a three-quarter side-profile posture, back facing the camera and head turned toward the mirror. Raise your right hand, bend your elbow, and hold the transparent glass with fingers; the liquid inside reflects light. The background is marble walls with horizontal striped patterns. The mirrored surface reflects the backs of figures and parts of the washbasin area. Metal trays are placed on the countertop, with multiple transparent glass containers on the trays. The bottle labels are clearly visible, and the surface is reflective. The depth of field is distinct and layered: the foreground features the outlines of figures and details of clothing, the middle ground shows the sink and mirror reflections, and the background features walls and blurred images in the mirror.",
