          "alias": "单女衬衫椅上坐",
          "prompt": "In the open outdoor grassy areas, natural light shines from the sides and above, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. In the middle shot, a head-to-head angle is used, with the subject on the right side of the frame, following the rule of thirds. The figure sits on a wooden folding chair, leaning slightly forward, with the left leg bent and raised, the right leg naturally hanging down, feet touching the ground. She wears a plaid shirt with a gray-white base with red threads, the hem hangs naturally, and the cuffs are slightly loose. Underneath is a black tight top, with black stockings on the legs, smooth surfaces that reflect a little light. The wrist wears a black strap with stitching details along the edges. The background features green grass extending into distant woods, the sky is pale blue, clouds are sparse, and light is evenly spread. The overall depth of field is clearly defined, grass leaves are clearly visible in the foreground, figures in the middle are well-defined, and background vegetation is slightly blurred, creating a natural depth of field effect.",
