          "alias": "单女制服厨房冷淡蹲喝",
          "prompt": "In kitchen scenarios, indoor lighting shines from above, creating a uniform cool white glow. In medium shots, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the subject positioned slightly to the right of center of the frame. The figure is in a squatting position, with knees bent and body leaning forward, left leg supporting the ground, right leg bent and raised, feet touching the ground. With its head slightly tilted back, it was drinking liquid from a white bottle. Wearing a light pink spaghetti strap dress, the hem naturally drapes over the thighs, the fabric showing pleats and a slight sheer feel. The right hand holds the bottle, arms stretched straight upward, left hand naturally resting on the floor, fingers spread, nails painted with white nail polish. In the background, the refrigerator door is open, displaying multiple bottles of beverages and condiments inside, with clearly visible bottle labels. The inner wall of the refrigerator is made of white plastic with a smooth surface. The floor is made of light-colored tiles with fine textures, scattered with packaging boxes and snack residues. The edges of objects on the ground in the foreground are blurred, the figures in the middle are clear, and the details inside the background refrigerator are discernible. The depth of field gradually decreases from near to far.",
