          "prompt": "In indoor scenes, warm yellow light shines from above slightly to the left, with soft light focused on figures and seating areas, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. In middle shots, a level perspective is used, with the subject centered in focus. The figure sits on a vintage-style armchair with carved armrests, slightly turned to the right side of the frame, with the head facing the camera and part of it hanging down in front of the shoulder. She wears a brown-and-black faux fur coat with a clear plush texture, thick fur at the neckline and cuffs, and fluffy edges. Cross your arms over your chest, clinging tightly to your coat, with your fingers naturally bent. She wears black striped tights with stripes arranged diagonally, and the material has a slight reflective effect. He wears black pointed high heels, with smooth uppers and slender heels. The seats are wrapped in yellow-green fabric, with gold buttons on the armrests and backrest edges, and the legs are made of dark wood with visible wood grain details. The background wall is a dark green wainscoting panel, on which hang two gold-framed paintings. The patterns in the paintings are traditional Eastern style, with colors mainly of earth yellow and ochre. The floor was covered with a blue-and-white patterned carpet, with obvious wear on the edges and localized dust accumulation. On the left, you can see the dark fireplace frame; the interior is hollow, with metal tools standing upright beside it. The overall depth of field is clearly defined: the foreground features figures and seats, the middle ground features carpets and fireplaces, and the background features walls and paintings. Light reflects differently across different material surfaces, including fabric diffuse reflection, metallic highlight reflection, and a faint gloss of wood.",
