          "alias": "单女黑短裙室内沉思跪",
          "prompt": "In indoor scenes, light shines evenly from the left side of the frame, creating a soft transition between light and shadow. She wore a leopard-print long-sleeved top made of fabric that hugged the curves of her torso, with clear patterns and slight pleats at the cuffs. She paired a black short skirt with a flat hem that hugged the hips. Kneeling cross-legged on a brown leather sofa, left leg bent and raised, red stockings exposed at the ankle, right leg straight, knee close to the ground. The red stockings have a smooth surface with a highly reflective texture, naturally revealing the muscle lines of the legs. She wears black pointed shoes with matte uppers and slender heels. The sofa is made of orange-brown leather, with even stitching and slight wear on the surface, and a curved backrest. The character's right hand rests on the edge of the sofa, fingers naturally extended, and the left hand rests on the carpet in front of them. The carpet features a beige base color with intricate geometric patterns, composed of dark brown and black, with clear surface texture. The background is pure white walls, with no decorations. The overall depth of field is moderate, the background is slightly blurred, and the details of the front carpet are clear and legible.",
