          "prompt": "In the outdoor open field scene, natural light scatters evenly from above, the sky is covered with grayish-white clouds, and the overall lighting is soft with no obvious shadows. In medium shots, a head-to-head angle is used, with the subject positioned on the left side of the frame, body slightly turned to the lens, head lowered, and gaze directed toward the ground. The character is female, wearing a black strapless long dress with a hem that hugs the hips, a pleated waist, and a matte texture of the fabric, which naturally folds with movement. She held onto the edge of the wooden fence with one hand, her arm outstretched, the other hand naturally hanging at her side, legs bent, one foot on the railing beam, the other suspended in the air, wearing black flat shoes. The fence is made of gray wood, with weathering marks and wood grain on the surface, and slightly rough edges. The background is a vast green grassland, with dense leaves of varying heights. In the distance, rows of trees form a deep green forest line, and the sky occupies the upper part of the composition. The clouds are thick but evenly distributed. The depth of field is clearly defined, the foreground fence is clearly focused, the middle shots show details of people and grass, and the background forest and sky gradually blur, giving the overall composition a natural depth transition.",
