          "alias": "单女白衬衫镜前沉思坐",
          "prompt": "In indoor mirror scenes, warm yellow light shines from above and sides, creating soft transitions of light and shadow. In middle shots, a level perspective is used, with the subject centered in focus. Painted with deep red lipstick. Wearing a loose white shirt, the hem naturally falls to mid-thigh, the cuffs slightly pleated, and the fabric surface shows fine textures. Her left leg rests on her right, knee bent, and she wears black pointed high heels with smooth tops and slender heels. Sitting on a wooden chair with beige cushions, the legs are dark brown with slight wear on the surface. The background shows hangers full of clothes, with a white slip dress hanging on the right, and multiple pairs of shoes inside a mesh storage bag on the left. The floor is made of light yellow tiles, with fine scratches and reflective surfaces. The frame features a gold carved border with embossed patterns along the edges, reflecting the surrounding environment. The foreground is the edge of a mirror, the middle is the figure and chair, and the background is clothing and storage areas. The depth of the field is clearly defined, details are clear up close, and the distant areas gradually blur.",
