          "alias": "单女黑连体衣室内沉思倚靠",
          "prompt": "In indoor scenes, light enters diagonally from the left, creating a soft transition between light and dark, with an overall warm tone. In full-body composition, a head-to-head angle is used, with the subject centered in focus. The figure leans sideways against a white doorframe, leaning slightly forward, with the left leg upright and the right leg slightly bent, toes touching the ground, presenting a relaxed yet slightly postured posture. The head is slightly turned toward the camera, and her expression is natural. On top of her head is a white beret with a slightly slanted brim. On top, she wears a black off-shoulder bodysuit with a heart-shaped neckline, shoulder lines that fit the body, and a smooth fabric surface with a slight reflective sheen. She wears beige-soled black polka-dot tight tights, evenly distributed in pattern, made of transparent material, and clearly showing the muscle lines of her legs. She wears black high heels with slim heels and metallic decorative details on the upper. The background is a light pink wall, with a white door on the right side. The door handle is a golden circle with a reflective surface. The floor is a dark wood finish with clear grain, contrasting with the walls. The depth of field is well-defined, with the foreground as the main subject, the middle as a door and wall, no obvious objects in the background, and the overall composition is simple, with the focus on the figure.",
