        {
          "id": "krea2-ce5903e8cf23e468b102ea3b",
          "alias": "单女蓝高领衫室内坐",
          "prompt": "In the classical interior decoration environment, warm yellow light enters diagonally from the left side of the painting, creating a soft transition between light and dark. In middle shots, a level perspective is used, with the subject centered in focus. The figure sits facing forward on a carved armchair, leaning slightly forward, knees together, legs naturally crossed, feet facing the camera. She wore a light blue turtleneck dress with a smooth fabric surface featuring black polka dot patterns, wide sleeves in a puffy style, and slight pleats at the cuffs. The skirt cinches at the waist, with the hem naturally falling to mid-thigh. Arms around a cat in alternating white and brown hues, the cat relaxed with its head slightly raised, wearing black stockings with smooth leg lines, black pointed high heels adorned with metal fasteners. The chair is made of pink velvet fabric with gold carved edges, and the backrest curves are distinct. The background wall is beige with golden plant and bird patterns, the edges of the wall panels are decorated with relief decorations, and the floor is a parquet wood with natural wood grain on the surface. The depth of view is well defined: the foreground features figures and chairs, the middle ground features walls and some furniture, the background features distant wall details, and the overall focus is on the interaction area between the figures and the cat.",
