        {
          "id": "krea2-079e59e6de5d068c41fdfa82",
          "alias": "单女衬衫室内站立喝",
          "prompt": "In indoor scenes, warm yellow light shines from the right side, with the light source coming from the flames burning inside the fireplace, creating a soft side lighting effect. In the medium shot, a head-to-head angle is used, with the subject positioned on the left side of the frame, the body slightly tilted, presenting a natural standing posture. The shirt is loose and the hem hangs naturally. Underneath, she wears a light-colored camisole with thin and narrow straps, and on the bottom, she wears dark brown vertical striped tights. The leg lines are clear, and the material has a distinct ribbed structure. Fingers naturally bent, left hand placed on the front of the thigh. The background features a modern-style fireplace embedded in the wall, with a glass door reflecting orange-red firelight. Around the fireplace is a light-colored stone countertop, and the wall is off-white, with a smooth surface without decoration. The floor is light wood with fine grain and minimal reflectivity. The depth of field is distinct, the foreground figures are well-defined, the middle fireplace area is slightly blurred, and the background wall and distant space are further blurred, resulting in a natural transition of light and shadow and soft shadows.",
