        {
          "id": "krea2-04f40ff5419a16a6098da02d",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫厨房蹲交叠",
          "prompt": "In the indoor kitchen scene, natural light shines from the left window, creating a soft side lighting effect. In the middle shot, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the subject positioned slightly to the left center, following the rule of thirds. The figure is in a squatting posture, with legs crossed and tucked in front of the body, toes pointing toward the ground, body slightly leaning forward, arms wrapped around knees, hands naturally resting on the legs. The character is slightly turned to the right side of the camera, with the head slightly lowered, wearing a white ruffled shirt with wide sleeves and multiple layers of pleats. The collar is a standard lapel design, with subtle textures on the fabric surface that fits the contours of the shoulders and arms. She paired the bottom with black stockings, made of smooth material and clearly showing her leg lines. The background features light green cabinets with smooth door surfaces and metal handles, with slight wear on the edges. The floor is wooden, with clear grain and deep colors, creating a contrast with the overall environment. The foreground shows the lower body of the figure and the ground, with depth of field gradually blurring from near to far. The background cabinets and wall details remain clear, and the overall light and shadow transitions are natural, with no obvious shadow overlap.",
