        {
          "id": "krea2-26eeb741d16d6a0321b54b54",
          "alias": "单女外套户外坐摆拍",
          "prompt": "In outdoor scenes, natural light shines from an oblique top, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. In medium shots, use a level viewing angle, with the subject positioned slightly to the left of the frame, which conforms to the rule of thirds. The figure sits sideways on a black square object, legs together and stretched forward, feet slightly rotated outward, right leg covering left leg. Her head is slightly turned toward the camera, wearing a leopard-print plush jacket. The fabric has a clear texture and a distinct plush texture, with the neckline open, revealing a colorful floral mini skirt underneath, with fine pleats at the hem. Purple leggings hug the leg line, made of smooth material that reflects a subtle sheen. She wears white high-heeled sandals, with multiple crossed straps on the upper with fine holes, and the heel is slender and vertical to the ground. In the background, parts of the body of other figures can be seen, dressed in dark jackets and jeans, each in a distinct pose, in a state of bokeh and out of focus. The floor is made of gray cement, with fine cracks and wear marks on the surface. On the left side of the foreground, a metal bracket partially appears in the frame, with a clear structure and sharp edges. The overall depth of field is distinct, the subject is clear, and the background gradually blurs.",
