        {
          "id": "krea2-f7207283453319c2e9568ddd",
          "alias": "红毛衣室内持相机",
          "prompt": "In indoor scenes, natural light enters diagonally from the right window, creating soft side lighting. In medium shots, a head-to-head angle is used, with the subject on the left side of the frame slightly tilted toward the camera. Layered with a red hollowed-out knit shawl covering both arms and back, the fabric texture is clearly visible with regular holes. The left hand lightly touches the left wooden door frame, fingers naturally extended, palm pressed against the door panel. The door frame is made of light brown wood, with natural wood grain and subtle textures on the surface. The background features warm yellow walls, and the window frame on the right is a dark brown wooden structure. Outside the window, you can see the stone wall and the blurred architectural outline. The depth of the field is well defined: the foreground features figures and door frames, the middle ground features walls and the edges of the shawls, the background features windows and exterior structures, and the background is slightly blurred.",
