        {
          "id": "krea2-497a17db14801b3e38779904",
          "alias": "单女短裤室内沉思坐手持物",
          "prompt": "In indoor scenes, natural light enters diagonally from the left window, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. In the medium shot, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the subject positioned on the right side of the frame, sitting at an angle, with the left leg bent and raised on the wooden tabletop in front, and the right leg naturally extended. She wore a black sleeveless zip-up top with clear shoulder lines, white stripes on the chest, fabric that hugged her body, and a surface with fine textures. She wears dark shorts on the bottom, and her calves are naturally defined. Hold the drink box with your right hand, bend your arms naturally at your side, and rest your left hand on the chair back. She wears black-and-white sneakers paired with white long socks with the cuff curled upward. The background features a brown leather sofa with natural wrinkles and wear marks on the surface, and a chessboard and several chess pieces placed on the sofa. On the rear windowsill, green plants, glass bottles, and stacked books are displayed; on the right, a white cabinet and a globe can be seen. Drink containers with metal lids placed on the foreground table have noticeably reflective surfaces. The overall depth of field is distinct, with clear details on the nearby tabletop and figures, background objects gradually blurring, and light casting soft shadows on walls and furniture surfaces.",
