          "alias": "白短裤室内坐",
          "prompt": "In indoor scenes, light shines from the front slightly left, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. In middle shots, a level perspective is used, with the subject centered in focus. The figure sits sideways on a wooden chair, leaning slightly forward, turning his head to the left, with some curls that fit the contours of his neck. He wore a red and black vertical striped short-sleeved jersey with white \"PAOLA\" lettering and the number \"10\" printed on the back. The lettering edges were clear, and the fabric surface showed slight wrinkles and stretch marks. The lower half is paired with white shorts with thin red and black stripes along the hems, and the fabric is flat and fits the curve of the hips. The chair backrest is made of dark brown wood, the seat cushion has a beige base with dark geometric patterns, and the fabric texture is clearly visible. The seat surface is indented due to pressure. The background is a light gray curtain with evenly distributed vertical folds, with the overall depth of field gradually blurring from near to far. The details of the foreground figures are clear, while background elements are blurred.",
