          "alias": "单女绿旗袍室内沉思坐吸烟",
          "prompt": "In indoor scenes, warm yellow light shines diagonally from the right, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. With a slightly tilted head, she wears a green plaid sleeveless qipao with a traditional Chinese frog button. The fabric surface has fine textures, and the pleats naturally spread out according to her posture. Raise your right hand, fingers holding a lit cigarette; the smoke slowly rises upward from the tip, forming a fine curl. Her left hand rests on her knee, and her earrings are white teardrop-shaped pendants, with metallic gleaming edges. On the left side of the background sits a vintage radio, with an off-white and black casing that combines white and black. The speaker grille is made of round metal with a slight reflective surface. The rear wall is light brown with a fine grainy texture, the window glass lets in blurred external light, and the window frame lines are clear. The ground in the foreground is a dark wooden floor, with wood grain parallel to the bottom of the painting, and localized shadows cast by light and shadow. The depth of field is shallow, the subject is clear, and the background is slightly blurred, creating a natural halo effect.",
