          "alias": "单女黑T恤商店哭泣蹲",
          "prompt": "In the convenience store refrigeration area, artificial lighting is evenly distributed from above, with bright and cool lighting. In the middle shot, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the subject on the right side of the frame, following the rule of thirds. The figure is in a half-squat position, with the right knee on the ground, the left leg bent to support the body, the upper body leaning forward, arms extended toward the left shelf, and the right hand near the product display area. She wears a black spaghetti-strap camisole with narrow straps that fit the collarbone and shoulder line, with fabric that fits closely to the chest contour and no obvious texture. She wears light blue ripped jeans with irregular tears at the knees, clear flickering at the edges, and loose legs that cover the calves, featuring the unique coarse texture of denim. The background features refrigerated shelves, with metal frames and transparent glass doors clearly visible. The products inside the shelves are neatly arranged, and the packaging colors are diverse but not sharply contrasting. Behind them are two white vertical refrigerated cabinets, with flat surfaces and control panels at the top. Food containers are stacked inside glass doors, with visible details. The floor is covered with light gray tiles with slight reflection, and the overall depth of field gradually decreases from the figures in the foreground to the shelves in the background, creating a distinct spatial layer.",
