          "alias": "单女米短裙室内冷淡摆拍",
          "prompt": "In a dim indoor environment, a beam of cool white light from the projector shines from the sides and rear, creating a strong contrast between light and dark. In the medium shot, a slightly top-down angle is used, with the subject positioned on the right side of the frame, facing away from the camera and the body in a side profile. She wears a light-colored cropped cropped top on top, with her back fully exposed, light and shadow clearly distributed, and her spine and rib structure visible. She wore a beige high-waisted skirt with white panties exposing the waist and printed with \"Calvin Klein.\" The fabric was naturally pleated and hugged the curves of her hips. The character's right arm is bent and raised, with the hand close to the head, and the muscle lines of the arm are slightly shadowed by the pose. The background is a dark brown wall, with a framed X-ray image hanging on it. The image shows the human torso skeleton, marked with an \"L\" on the left side. The projection light source is located at the lower left of the image and does not appear directly in the field of view, but its projection path is clearly visible. The foreground features a corner of a wooden tabletop, with wear marks and natural wood grain on the surface, and slightly rough edges. The overall depth of field is relatively shallow, with the main subject's back and projection area clearly defined. The background wall gradually blurs with distant objects, and light forms a soft transitional halo between the wall and the clothing surface.",
