          "prompt": "Inside the aircraft cabin, natural light enters diagonally through the porthole, creating a bright and even lighting effect. In medium shots, use a head-up angle to shoot, with the subject on the left side of the frame, body slightly turned to the lens, head facing the lens. The figure sits with one leg crossed, the left leg resting on the right, the right hand gently resting on the seat backrest, and the left hand resting on the thigh, showing a relaxed posture. Wearing a white long-sleeved shirt with an open neckline and buttons tied to the second button, the fabric hugging the shoulder and torso curves, smooth and wrinkle-free. She paired the bottom with black shorts and sheer nude-colored stockings, a light blue belt at the waist, and a metal buckle that was highly reflective. The neck wears a blue and white silk scarf tied at the back, with a smooth edge and fine patterned patterns. The background features the aircraft cabin wall and portholes, with a blurred sky outline visible outside. The gray floor inside has a fine grained texture, and the seats are made of dark gray fabric with a smooth surface and distinct edges. The depth of field is well-defined: the foreground shows partial figures and seats, the middle ground shows the cabin structure, and the background features the porthole and the blurred external areas. The overall composition is stable, with the focus on the upper body and hand details.",
