        {
          "id": "krea2-bc20165ef638169e16f0574e",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装屋顶交叠",
          "prompt": "Dressed in a vibrant royal blue professional suit, paired with a white collared shirt underneath and a thin white belt at the waist, the overall look is professional and elegant. She smiles with composure and confidence, her left hand resting lightly on the armrest of the seat, her right hand naturally hanging down, wearing a silver watch on her wrist, legs crossed, showcasing the competence and approachability of a professional woman. The foreground focuses on the main figure, with a background typical of the cabin interior: deep blue carpets, neatly arranged black leather seats, curved portholes, and lighting strips on the cabin roof. The light outside the window is bright, creating a soft backlight effect that makes the figure's outline appear slightly transparent. The middle shot continues the deep space of the cabin, with the seat arrangement extending deep into the frame, creating a realistic sense of space. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame. The edges of the portholes and the lines of the seats guide the gaze to converge on the subject, creating visual balance and stability. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from natural light from the porthole, illuminating the figure from the right side, creating a soft transition of light and shadow to emphasize a sense of depth; Interior lighting supplements shaded areas, making the overall color palette warm and layered. The atmosphere combines the sophistication of modern business with the tranquility of a flight journey, presenting a professional, efficient, yet approachable professional image, like a real-life scene photo taken with a high-precision camera, offering strong visual appeal and narrative tension.",
