        {
          "id": "krea2-669b1fc9f9ddc0dc9893987e",
          "alias": "单女蓝长裤森林微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a forest path in the park, naturally draped over her shoulders. She wears a form-fitting gray long-sleeved sports top and high-waisted dark blue skinny pants, with the outline of the clothing clearly outlining her figure. She turned slightly to the side, her left hand naturally hanging down, her posture relaxed and confident, wearing a gentle smile, revealing a relaxed and joyful mood. The foreground is the main subject, occupying the left central position of the composition, with the body slightly tilted, creating a natural sense of movement. In the middle of the ground, the dappled grass and fallen leaves cover the ground. The grass is dense, with colors transitioning from bright green nearby to dark yellow in the distance. The ground is scattered with dead branches and broken leaves, enhancing the sense of authenticity. The background features rows of trees, thick trunks, clear bark texture, overlapping canopies, and sunlight streaming through the gaps in the leaves, creating interplay of light and shadow. In the distance, blurred green vegetation and open space can be seen, creating a sense of depth. The composition uses low-angle downward shots, making the figures appear upright and imposing, while trees serve as natural frames to guide the gaze toward the figures. The lighting is natural daylight, coming from a slanting top angle, softly illuminating the front of the subject and creating delicate shadow transitions. The overall atmosphere is bright and warm, full of vitality and tranquility, presenting the authentic texture of everyday outdoor shooting. It feels as if you could casually capture it with a regular camera, featuring slight film graininess and true color reproduction, creating a close, natural, and lifelike image.",
