        {
          "id": "krea2-1eb990620fff836a66dff925",
          "alias": "单女蓝高领衫户外自信持相机",
          "prompt": "A voluptuous woman lounges lazily in an outdoor woven hammock. She wears a light blue turtleneck sleeveless top and beige shorts, her hands gently touching the back of her head, looking relaxed and confident. The hammock is woven from thick hemp rope, with clearly visible mesh and a rustic texture. The hammock hangs above a wooden platform, with blurred green trees and a wooden fence in the background. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled light and shadows, creating a warm and gentle afternoon atmosphere. The overall composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. The hammock forms a natural guiding line, and light shines from the upper left, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The shadows are soft, with warm yellow, light blue, and off-white as the main tones, accented by green plants, presenting a tranquil beauty of everyday life. It feels like a real moment captured with an amateur camera, with a slight film graininess and natural exposure effect. The overall image is full of life and cultural warmth",
