          "alias": "单女连衣裙椅上坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor rattan chair, wearing an orange-blue geometric plaid spaghetti strap dress with green straps that outline an elegant silhouette. She wears sunglasses on her chest and a slender necklace around her neck, her posture relaxed and natural. Her right arm rests lightly on the edge of the chair, legs crossed. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the middle shot, with the foreground showing the dark woven chair's detailed details, revealing clear textures and textures. The center features the entire body and part of the seat, with a blurred tropical riverside scenery, shaded by green trees, and gently flowing river water. Stones and dead leaves scatter along the shore, with palm tree shadows swaying in the distance. The overall composition uses a centered composition, with the figure slightly centered slightly to the left, light and shadow coming from the upper right side. Soft sunlight evenly falls on the figure, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The shadows are subtle but not abrupt, and the overall atmosphere is warm and peaceful, full of lazy and pleasant summer afternoon moods. The color palette is mainly warm yellow and orange, accented with green and blue, creating a fresh and natural visual effect. The image feels realistic like everyday handheld camera photography, with rich details and clear layering. With slight depth blur, it presents an artistic beauty within everyday scenes",
