        {
          "id": "krea2-cbce73aada48809a307699c7",
          "alias": "单女米泳装车内微笑坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the driver's seat of a light-colored car, her body slightly tilted, her right hand resting lightly on her thigh, and her left hand naturally resting on the edge of the car door. Her posture is relaxed and confident, her expression calm with a hint of gentle smile with a soft glow. Her makeup is exquisite and natural, wearing a beige fitted one-piece swimsuit with a black thin strap design. The chest and sides of her waist are adorned with American flag patterns, with bright red, white, and blue stripes and star patterns. The fabric has a silky smooth texture that hugs her body curves. Highlighting the full body lines, the foreground features interior details such as black leather seats, steering wheel, and center console. The instrument panel area is faintly visible, the inside of the doors is wrapped in light leather with stitched edges, and the middle features a focus on the subject. The background through the windshield reveals the outdoor scene, with lush green forests in the distance, thick branches and foliage, and upright trunks. The sky is light blue, with thin clouds and bright but not glaring light. The overall atmosphere is calm and everyday, and the composition uses close-up shots. The figure occupies the main position in the frame, slightly to the left, forming a visual focal point. Light and shadow come from the front right, and natural light enters diagonally through the car window, illuminating the front and sides of the car, creating soft shadows and enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color scheme is warm and harmonious, dominated by beige, brown, green, and blue, creating a sense of privacy and comfort in real-life scenes. The image has a slight film graininess and low saturation processing, simulating amateur camera shooting effects and presenting a simple and authentic documentary style. It was as if capturing a leisurely moment inside the car on a summer afternoon",
