        {
          "id": "krea2-833f76fe90224912b9466071",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔街道微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a heavily modified gray pickup truck, smiling, wearing light blue skinny jeans and a gray printed cropped tank top. Her hands naturally rest on the wide black front bumper, she wears black-and-white sneakers, a blue wristband on her wrist, and a visible tattoo on her left arm, exuding a relaxed and confident posture; The foreground is a close-up of the female subject and the front of the vehicle; the middle ground is the lower part of the vehicle and the grassy ground; the background is an outdoor area parked by other vehicles under a clear sky. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures centered and the vehicle serving as a visual support point forming a stable framework, guiding the gaze to focus on the interaction between the figure and the vehicle. Light comes from directly above to the right, providing ample sunlight and creating clear and soft shadows, highlighting the figure's outline and the metallic texture of the vehicle. The overall atmosphere is vibrant and individualistic, carrying a street culture vibe. The images are vivid in color, with pink trim strips forming a strong contrast with the gray body, presenting an industrial aesthetic style that blends ruggedness and refinement, as if shot with an amateur camera—rich in detail and full of everyday life",
