        {
          "id": "krea2-fbb2eba0bddf1921afb28506",
          "alias": "单女白短裙街道站立（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street, wearing a beige woven straw hat with a wide brim and hollowed-out patterns. She wears a white puff-sleeve top and a white skirt printed with green cactus and yellow floral patterns. Her right hand extends forward, and a delicate rose-gold bracelet is on her wrist. She slightly turns to look back, focusing on a close-up of her half-body body. In the foreground, her outstretched arm and clearly visible clothing details are in the background. In the middle is the street extending behind her, with tiny cracks and manhole covers on the gray asphalt surface. On the left is a modern building, with glass curtain walls reflecting light. At the entrance stands a bright pink door frame, with a passerby wearing a mask, a black short skirt, and a jacket standing by the door. The background is a cluster of towering buildings, and on the right is a white van parked. In the distance, green trees and utility poles are parked. The composition combines close-up figures with mid- and long-range environments in a deep layout, with a slightly tilted perspective creating a dynamic snapshot effect. The view extends further back to the background street, creating a natural flow of sightlines, with light and shadow coming from the intense midday sunlight. The light is bright and sharp, casting clear shadows on the subject. Sunlight filters through leaves, creating mottled spots on the ground and clothing. The overall atmosphere is filled with the freshness and vitality of a summer city. The tones are bright and warm, with sharp color contrasts. It combines the casual feel of daily life with exquisite studio-like lighting effects, presenting a street style that is both authentic, natural, and slightly artistic",
