        {
          "id": "krea2-3996062d2f7887822589c48a",
          "alias": "单女镜前俏皮展示",
          "prompt": "Her body is angled sideways, she glances back slightly and smiles, her posture natural and relaxed, showcasing a healthy and energetic physique. The background is a modern gym environment, with green artificial turf and gray exercise mats on the floor. In the distance, you can see black training chairs, hanging TRX training belts, and red metal fitness equipment. The mirror reflects a sense of depth in the space. The ceiling is fitted with industrial-style metal track lights and fluorescent tubes, providing bright and even lighting. The overall color scheme is mainly cool, with pink belts and green flooring accented in some areas. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned near the center on the left side of the frame. The phone and arm form a visual guide line extending from the foreground to the main subject, creating a realistic atmosphere for everyday life. The lighting is soft and the details are clear, giving the authentic feel of everyday amateur equipment shooting, presenting a relaxed and comfortable fitness lifestyle moment.",
