        {
          "id": "krea2-b4b90aedc90626923442cfa6",
          "alias": "单女灰长裤街道俏皮自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman is taking a selfie on a city street, wearing an off-white off-shoulder cropped long-sleeve top and gray-green high-waisted wide-leg pants. Her right hand is raised in a V-shaped gesture, with natural folds and light and shadow changes on her wrist. Her left hand hangs naturally, her posture relaxed and casual, her makeup exquisite, and her expression slightly playful and confident. She wears a simple silver necklace and geometric gold earrings. The background is a gray asphalt road and sidewalk, with a lush shrub in the middle with plump, moist leaves and clear edges. In the distance, a dark gray modern sedan is parked by the roadside. The body lines are smooth, wheel details are clear, headlights reflect faint light, and in the distance, blurred outlines of pedestrians and city buildings are visible. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, with the figure occupying the center-left position, forming a visual focal point. The foreground highlights the character's movement and clothing details. Mid-point greenery provides color contrast and layering. Background vehicles and streets create a realistic urban environment. The lighting is soft natural daylight, creating a bright and fresh overall atmosphere with the authentic texture of everyday street photography. Light and shadow shine from the upper right, with delicate shadow transitions. The folds of the clothing show subtle changes in light and shadow, with tones mainly in off-white, gray-green, and dark gray, accented with bright green and metallic sheen. The image carries a sense of everyday life and artistic beauty, presenting a casual and natural yet refined urban fashion style",
