          "id": "krea2-ee44904a47265e0acfd610fc",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙公寓沉思自拍",
          "prompt": "She wears a blue-and-white plaid spaghetti strap dress with striped and metallic sequin decorations on the hem, paired with black wide-leg pants and black flat shoes. She carries a black leather tote bag in her left hand and a phone in her right for selfies. She wears black sunglasses, a gold ring, and a silver bracelet, striking an elegant and natural pose. The background features white walls and black hangers, and the floor is made of dark gray reflective material. The composition uses a diagonal perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the frame, creating visual guidance. The lighting is soft and even, creating an atmosphere of everyday privacy. The overall style combines fashion and a sense of life, presenting a realistic and refined personal dressing recording scene",
