        {
          "id": "krea2-3e909c217ba040139996d521",
          "alias": "单女水边微笑注视",
          "prompt": "She holds a blue-wrapped drink in her right hand, her left hand naturally raised behind her head, her posture relaxed and graceful. A small yellow bag is slung across her shoulder, with the lake at dusk in the background and the distant misty city skyline. The sky is dyed a soft orange-pink gradient by the sunset, with sunlight streaming from the upper left creating a distinct backlight effect, outlining a golden halo along the edges of the figures. In the foreground are beige railings and a few green leaves. The middle shot features a calm lake and trees along the shore, while the distant view is a blurred silhouette of buildings. The overall composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered slightly to the left, and the gaze is guided to her drink and warm smile. The light is soft and layered, creating a leisurely, comfortable, and youthful daily atmosphere. The image presents a realistic texture reminiscent of a casual phone shot, with slight film graininess and natural color transitions. The tones are warm and slightly retro, with rich details but not overly sharpened. The overall style is close to everyday real-life documentary photography, capturing the most beautiful moments of summer evenings",
