        {
          "id": "krea2-7be2e6efd232cc5936e0fe9a",
          "alias": "单女紫T恤摄影棚害羞自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman is taking outdoor selfies, her makeup delicate and natural, carrying a touch of playfulness and gentleness. She slightly tilts her head to look at the camera, showing a friendly yet slightly shy smile. She wears a form-fitting light purple short-sleeve T-shirt with a slight sheen, accentuating her body curves. She wears an off-white thin shoulder strap bag across her shoulder. In the background is a huge beige plush bear doll, whose head and body occupy most of the right side of the frame. The surface is soft and fluffy, and the doll is adorned with a colorful Korean badge. Above, you can see a green metal structure and a sign with the words \"DREAM STUDIO.\" The overall scene is set in an open commercial or entertainment venue, with natural daylight that is soft and even, illuminated from the front left. The composition uses close-ups, with figures occupying the left side and the doll on the right creating visual balance. The doll's volume and color contrast enhance the visual interest. The slightly overhead view creates a relaxed and casual everyday atmosphere, with main tones of warm yellow, light purple, and off-white. Accented with greenery, the overall atmosphere is warm and lively, full of everyday life's approachability, with a realistic shooting feel. It feels like a moment casually captured with a regular phone, rich in detail, natural light and shadow, and distinct layers, presenting a street selfie style that is both realistic and slightly artistic",
