        {
          "id": "krea2-35eb991c37fc934cf2b035ad",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙忧伤倚靠",
          "prompt": "She wears a sleeveless dress with a blue-gray plaid pattern, with a simple and elegant neckline and a natural hem that spreads across the floor, creating a soft pleat. Around her neck is a slender gold necklace, and the pendant is a simple letter H-shape, adding a delicate detail to the overall look. Her posture is relaxed and natural, arms folded over her knees, body slightly leaning forward. With a faint sense of contemplation and tranquility, the background is a rough gravel floor with distinct grains and a realistic texture. Scattered on the ground is a patch of orange-red fallen leaves, bright but not abrupt, adding traces of the seasons and visual layers to the composition. The composition uses medium shots and close-ups, with the figure occupying a slightly central position, heads slightly tilted, forming a natural visual guiding line. Light comes from the sides and rear, belonging to a warm dusk glow, creating delicate contour light and subtle shadow transitions, with interwoven light and shadow creating a tranquil, A warm yet slightly melancholic atmosphere, with the overall color scheme mainly warm yellow and earth tones, paired with cool-toned plaid clothing, creating a contrast of warm and cool that enhances visual tension. The image texture is close to everyday phone photography, with slight noise and realistic color reproduction, as if capturing an unintentional moment, full of life and artistic flair. The background is naturally blurred, highlighting the subject while preserving the realism of the environment. The overall image conveys a youthful, gentle, restrained, and story-rich beauty.",
