        {
          "id": "krea2-b27fb90e130dfcb5738658ef",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙泼洒",
          "prompt": "She wears a light blue vertical stripe spaghetti strap dress with a white puff-sleeve shirt underneath with delicate pleated necklines. She slung an off-white woven handbag crossbody over her shoulder, with hollowed-out patterns on the body. Her left hand hangs naturally, and she wears a gold thin bracelet on her wrist. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left center, with a mid-shot portrait that occupies about two-thirds of the frame, with blurred green trees and spots of light in the background. It presents a soft bokeh effect, with sunlight pouring down from above and the sides, creating warm highlights and delicate shadows on the subjects. The lighting is soft and bright, with a fresh and natural overall tone, mainly light blue, white, and green, creating a tranquil, gentle, and youthful summer afternoon atmosphere. The images have a film-like texture, rich in detail, and natural transitions of light and shadow, as if shot with an old 35mm camera, with slight graininess and natural color shifts, showcasing the unintentionally beautiful moments of daily life",
