          "alias": "单女白衬衫镜前俏皮站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a white short-sleeved shirt and a black-gray plaid pleated skirt in her school uniform, paired with matching plaid ties, wearing glasses, standing in front of a mirror for a selfie. Her left hand gently rests on the frame, her right hand holds a pink phone, and her wrist wears a multi-layered silver bracelet. Her posture is natural and playful, with an indoor background reflecting a washing machine, shelves, and daily necessities. The wall is covered with white tiles, and the light comes from the indoor ceiling light, soft and even. The overall tone is cool, and the composition centers on the figure, forming a symmetrical mirror layout. In the foreground, the person and phone are in the background. The middle view shows a mirror-reflected part of the room, with the background showing the washing machine and corner storage area. The light and shadow layers are clear but lack strong contrasts, creating a realistic and everyday atmosphere full of life and youthful vibes. It presents the texture of amateur photography shot with a mobile phone, rich in detail, clear images, with slight graininess and real noise. The colors are natural and the overall style closely reflects real life campus portraits, full of youthful energy and privacy",
