        {
          "id": "krea2-fe79b34b37b8527e1298254d",
          "alias": "单女白T恤车内坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the driver's seat, wearing a gray crew-neck sweatshirt with a white T-shirt underneath, her seatbelt draped across her chest, her expression gentle and serene. Looking directly at the camera, the background is a blurry city street outside the window, with green trees, shrubs, and building silhouettes visible in the distance. The dark leather seats and rooftop trim inside the car are clearly visible. The composition uses close-up shots, with the figure occupying the main subject, positioned at the visual center. The lighting is soft and even, with natural light from outside the car, creating a sense of everyday realism. The overall atmosphere is quiet and comfortable, full of life. The style resembles everyday phone selfies, with a slight film texture and graininess. The colors are natural and true, the tones are warm, the composition is simple, the background blur enhances the subject, and the transitions between light and shadow are delicate, presenting a friendly, casual everyday aesthetic",
