        {
          "id": "krea2-965c3a132359b084336d9904",
          "alias": "单女白外套山野持杯",
          "prompt": "Dressed in a white fluffy plush jacket and beige short skirt, white over-the-knee boots, and holding an orange-yellow drink, she looked elegant and relaxed. Her wine glass held ice cubes and orange slices, red nail polish accented her fingertips, and a white handbag beside her. The background was a vast city skyline, with towering buildings and distant mountain outlines clearly visible. The mountaintops were covered in pure white snow, the sky was grayish-white, and the overall lighting was soft and even. Natural light streamed in through the window, creating a peaceful and sophisticated atmosphere. The composition features a centered figure on the right, with figures and sofas in the foreground, a city building cluster in the middle, and distant mountains and sky in the background, creating a distinctly layered sense of space. The light and shadow are soft, with mainly white, beige, and orange tones, paired with urban gray and snow-capped mountain white, presenting an atmosphere where urban luxury and natural grandeur blend together. It resembles a high-quality living scene shot at dusk with a professional camera, featuring a slight film texture and delicate details",
