        {
          "id": "krea2-2e7e3476bc0cff5ac95424c8",
          "alias": "单女灰外套广场忧伤喝",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose gray long coat paired with a colorful plaid knit cardigan and a black short skirt, paired with light gray ribbed tights and black square-toe Mary Jane shoes. Her ankles are adorned with metal buckles. In her right hand, she carries a woven silver-gray handbag, and in her left, she holds a white paper cup while sipping coffee. Her posture is natural and relaxed. The background is a beige stone wall and glass display window, which reflects the street scene and pedestrians. The floor is paved with gray granite tiles, creating an overall casual atmosphere of everyday street life. The composition centers the figure slightly to the left, using the lines of the bench to guide the view. The lighting is soft and even, presenting the natural light of cloudy or evening days. The tones are mainly gray, white, and beige, accented with plaid patterns, creating a tranquil yet slightly melancholic urban life atmosphere. The texture is delicate and authentic, resembling street snapshots taken with a professional camera, full of a strong sense of everyday life and fashion",
