        {
          "id": "krea2-96c702d5b709081c41941435",
          "alias": "单女米风衣街道沉思站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a street-side newsstand, wearing a long beige trench coat over a black dress and a black beret. Her posture is elegant yet slightly contemplative, with her left hand tucked into her coat pocket, a small black bag in her right, and black pointed high-heeled mules. The overall look is vintage and fashionable, with her clear silhouette in the foreground and a glass display filled with magazine covers, with magazine titles like \"Orobie,\" \"STORI MILITARE,\" and \"ARCHÉ\" clearly visible. The colors are rich but not cluttered. The background is a corner of a city street, with gray stone slabs paved on the ground with slight wear along the edges. The composition uses a symmetrical vertical central axis, with the figure centered slightly to the left, forming a visual focal point and creating a tranquil urban street atmosphere. Light and shadow from the afternoon sunset gently fall on the surface of the trench coat, creating a delicate transition of light and shadow. Shadows fall on the floor and windows, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color tone is warm and layered, presenting a texture reminiscent of everyday photography, as if shot with an old camera The image has slight graininess and color saturation, authentic and natural, full of life and artistic beauty",
