        {
          "id": "krea2-f2e597388765f9505a2455de",
          "alias": "单女黑风衣霓虹夜景沉思站立",
          "prompt": "Wearing a glossy black long trench coat and white wide-leg pants with a short black top underneath, the posture is natural and relaxed. With hands in pockets, the expression is calm and slightly detached. The overall look is modern and fashionable, with figures clearly standing out in the foreground, occupying the center of the frame. The middle features blurred streets and traffic tracks, presenting a dynamic blur effect created by long exposures. Colorful lights drag into strips of light, with neon tones of red, yellow, blue, and white interwoven and flowing, creating a strong sense of urban dynamism and speed. The background is a deep night sky and distant architectural silhouettes. The blurring treatment makes the main subject stand out. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with figures and zebra crossings forming visual guides, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The light mainly comes from neon and car headlights in the surrounding environment, creating high-contrast light and shadow. The trench coat's surface has a noticeable reflective texture, enhancing the material's expressiveness. The overall atmosphere is both cold and psychedelic, as if capturing a frozen moment in the city night, exuding the texture of high-end fashion photography. It also retains the slight noise and graininess that may occur with amateur cameras or regular equipment shooting at night, adding a sense of real life. The image tones are mainly black, white, and gray, accented with warm halos, creating a visual tension that is both calm and vibrant. It is suitable for expressing the independent and confident image of modern urban women, blending fashion shoots with street documentary photography.",
