        {
          "id": "krea2-5c1dd02eb22e16a10a542a6b",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙镜前自信蹲自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman is taking a selfie in front of an indoor mirror. She wears a black sequin strapless top and a high-slit long dress, with the hem naturally draping to the floor. Her hands gently pull the hem of the dress, striking an elegant and confident pose. She holds a pink phone in her right hand for the shoot, her left hand gently caresses the hem of her skirt, wearing black pointed high heels, squatting on a light gray plush carpet. The background is a simple white wall, with a circular metal-framed mirror hanging on the left wall. On the right side, you can see power outlets and some green plant decorations. The floor features a light wood texture, with a centrally symmetrical composition. Figures occupy the main subject, while the camera shoots from a low angle upward, highlighting body lines and clothing texture. The lighting is soft and even, coming from the upper front, creating a warm and bright home atmosphere. The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with pink phones and gold accessories. The light and shadow transitions are natural and details clear, presenting a fashionable intimate moment in daily life, with authentic photography texture and a sense of life",
