        {
          "id": "krea2-dc960c1261451c3eb5c4fce3",
          "alias": "单女米西装城市倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a beige pinstripe suit paired with a blue-and-white plaid shirt and a white knit sweater, with a red-black striped tie at the neckline. She wears metal-framed glasses, gracefully leaning against a bookshelf. Her left hand gently rests on the edge of the shelf, her right hand tucked into her pants pocket, and a gold bracelet on her wrist. The overall look blends academic style with urban fashion. The foreground features the main figure occupying the left central position of the composition, using a medium perspective to highlight the person's entire body and part of the environment. The background is a dark wooden bookshelf topped with books such as \" TIME', BAZAAR, and other magazines. On the left, a warm yellow desk lamp emits soft light, creating a warm light and shadow effect; on the right, there is blurred glass or mirror reflection, creating a sense of spatial layering. Light enters diagonally from the left, creating contrasts of light and shadow and highlighting three-dimensional contours. The overall atmosphere is calm and intellectual beautiful, with warm brown, beige, and blue tones dominated by a vintage film texture, presenting a realistic and artistic atmosphere reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The images feature cinematic light and shadow treatment and delicate texture expression, making them suitable for fashion portraits or artistic scenes of everyday life",
