        {
          "id": "krea2-97856fb6ef5f5c2d51631b4e",
          "alias": "单女透视白衬衫椅上冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an esports chair, wearing a white shirt and red tie, paired with a plaid mini skirt and sheer stockings. She smiles at the camera with a relaxed and confident posture, her right leg resting on the table, her left hand lightly touching the keyboard, and her right hand naturally letting down. The background features neatly arranged esports equipment and monitors. Blue ambient lights cast soft light from the ceiling edge, illuminating the entire space. The floor is covered with gray tiles reflecting a faint sheen. In the middle ground, multiple computer screens can be seen displaying game screens or interfaces, and some monitors have privacy screens. In the distance, you can faintly see other empty gaming chairs and headphones on the shelves. The composition centers on the person, using low-angle shooting to enhance visual impact. The foreground highlights the leg lines and hand movements, the middle shots show environmental details, the background blur creates spatial layering, and the light and shadow come from embedded downlights and cool-toned LED strips, creating a contrast between light and shadow. The overall atmosphere blends modern technology with youthful energy, presenting a realistic feel reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting, with slight noise and natural shadows. Moments captured by a real camera are moderately saturated, preserving original light and shadow details to emphasize a sense of presence and everyday life.",
