        {
          "id": "krea2-e56a9cfa14dd663f9dc81aae",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙困倦躺演奏",
          "prompt": "A woman wore an Alice's Adventures in Wonderland-themed blue and white dress, with a black bow, white stockings, and black leather shoes. She lay on her back on the emerald green lawn, arms naturally outstretched, hands gently clasped at the sides of her head, her expression relaxed yet slightly dreamy, as if immersed in a fantastical dream. The scattered playing cards stood in stark contrast to the surrounding playing cards. These red, black, and white cards were casually arranged around her, some facing up, some facing down. presenting a chaotic yet orderly aesthetic. The composition uses a top-down angle, with the main subject positioned slightly below the center of the painting forming a focal point. The foreground features clear grassy textures and some playing cards, the middle ground shows the figure's body and scattered playing cards, and the background extends into the distant green lawn. The overall color scheme is natural green, dotted with blue, white, and the red-black hues of playing cards. The light and shadow are soft, and sunlight pours in from above, casting faint shadows on the figures and the grass. It creates a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere, with a strong narrative and surreal style, as if capturing a moment from a fairy tale, with the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment, rich in detail, layered, and full of poetry and imagination",
