        {
          "id": "krea2-e7dc1f5869a7314c7380d2cc",
          "alias": "单女连体衣自信躺",
          "prompt": "She wore a deep blue, smooth-textured bodysuit with a white lapel and pink bow, white plush decorations on the shoulders and waist, and a pair of small white plush tails on her back. In her right hand, she held a pink, white, and black sci-fi-style pistol with intricate design and glowing details. She wore white wrist guards and tilted her body slightly at a three-quarter angle The left hand gently supports the gun body, with an elegant and confident posture. The foreground features the main figure occupying the main position in the frame. The middle ground is a soft, blurred green vegetation background. Leaves in the sunlight present rich layers of light and shadow, and deep in the background, the outlines of trees are blurred to create a natural bokeh effect. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds, with the figure positioned near the center on the right side of the frame, facing the camera direction to create strong visual guidance. Light comes from the upper left, and the natural light is soft and even, creating delicate transitions between highlights and shadows. The overall atmosphere is warm and vibrant, with pink, blue, and white as the main colors, forming a striking contrast with the green background yet harmoniously unified. The image has the texture of professional photography, as if shot with a large-aperture prime lens. The background blurs naturally, details are clear, and the light and shadow treatment is exquisite, presenting an artistic feel that is both everyday and full of imagination",
