        {
          "id": "krea2-2feac2fdd33eb70efb9cbd0a",
          "alias": "单女橙长裤公寓自信站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of an indoor corridor, naturally draped over her shoulders, appearing friendly and confident. She wears a black high-neck, cropped long-sleeve top that reveals a flat belly and waistline. She pairs it with orange high-waisted tight pants that fit her body and outline graceful curves. Her posture is naturally relaxed. The foreground shows her full-body image, occupying the center position. The middle frame features the walls and floor on both sides. The left wall is decorated with geometric patterns, the right side is pure white, and the floor is light gray wood grain. At the end of the corridor, there is a dark door frame and a blurred bench outline. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical style, with the figure centered and the background blurred to highlight the subject. Light and shadow come from ceiling fixtures above, providing soft and even lighting that creates a warm and bright indoor atmosphere. The overall color palette is dominated by black, orange, and gray, with sharp contrasts yet harmonious unity. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a professional camera, with the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The details are rich and the layers are distinct. It presents a visual effect that is both everyday and aesthetically pleasing",
