        {
          "id": "krea2-1f43eded28ecb93bbc17935e",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道站立自拍",
          "prompt": "At the very center of the Shibuya intersection in Tokyo, a woman stands at the edge of a crosswalk, slightly leaning toward the camera. She wears a black leather jacket paired with a black-and-white patchwork top and a lace mini skirt, black knee-high boots, and a small red bag. Her overall look is full of Japanese street fashion. Her posture is natural and relaxed, as if she had just taken a selfie. The background is a bustling crowd and towering skyscrapers, with huge electronic billboards flashing with \"Rakuten,\" \"IKEA,\" and \"Starbucks.\" and other brand logos. The colorful neon signs contrast sharply with the clear blue sky. Pedestrians weave through wide intersections, some looking down at their phones, others hurrying along. The ground is paved with reddish-brown tiles and yellow tactile pavings. Sunlight pours down from the upper right, casting clear shadows on the ground. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, highlighting the main subjects while introducing vertical lines of urban buildings into the frame, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The light and shadows are bright and sharp, presenting the intense daylight effect. The overall atmosphere is both authentic and full of urban vitality, like a casual snapshot taken with a regular camera, preserving the authentic texture of life and the drama of those moments.",
