        {
          "id": "krea2-c3f88408f294e7971067d8f2",
          "alias": "单女灰西装户外微笑跪",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on the outdoor steps, wearing a dark gray blazer paired with a white shirt and black pleated skirt, black stockings, and brown leather shoes. She wears a Minnie-themed headband with shiny decorations, gently resting her hands on the black metal railing, smiling at the camera with an elegant and natural posture. The background is the entrance of a building, with light green walls paired with brown wooden doors. The door features diamond-shaped glass windows and the \"207\" door number, and on the left wall hangs a lit vintage wall lamp that emits a warm yellow glow. Colorful heart emojis float around her, creating a lively and dreamy atmosphere. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, body slightly tilted, forming a visual guiding line. The lighting is soft and even, and the overall tone is warm and harmonious, presenting a scene full of childlike fun and youthful vitality in daily life. It's like capturing a moment casually with a portable camera—full of realism, rich details, natural light and shadow transitions, moderate color saturation, and a strong sense of life and artistic beauty",
