          "id": "krea2-8adf0aaff7326f4a2cbc6d5d",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙街道自信站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside a stone pillar on a city street, wearing a black long-sleeved heart-shaped cut-out top and a black high-waisted short skirt, paired with white pointed high heels and carrying a small dark green leather bag. Her posture is elegant and natural, her hands lightly gripping the bag straps, her expression calm and confident. The overall look is simple yet fashionable, with the foreground featuring the main figure and the base of the stone pillars. In the middle is a street-paved street with vehicles and buildings in the background. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure standing out in the center. The stone pillars serve as visual support to enhance stability. Light comes from above, creating a soft contrast of light and dark. Sunlight casts clear shadows on the ground, creating a warm and bright afternoon atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with deep green and red. The layers of light and shadow are rich, giving the image a realistic street style feel, as if shot with a professional camera. The details are clear and color saturation moderate, presenting authentic moments of urban fashion life, full of modernity and artistic flair",
