          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor lawn, wearing a black-and-white plaid spaghetti top and a white pleated short skirt, white platform canvas shoes, and a white quilted chain bag over her shoulder. She turns sideways and smiles back, her posture natural and elegant. In the foreground, her full body is clearly outlined, with a lush green grass stretching into the distance. On the right is a wooden windmill cabin, with windmill blades partially visible. The background features rolling green mountains and a clear, deep blue sky. The sunlight is bright, the light soft and bright, forming clear shadows. The overall composition uses a three-part method. The figure is positioned on the left side of the frame, while the windmill building occupies the right, creating visual balance. The gaze is guided from the figure to distant mountains, with rich layers of light and shadow, fresh and bright colors, full of summer pastoral atmosphere, presenting a realistic and artistic photographic style from everyday life, as if taking high-quality photos with a professional camera on a sunny day, with exquisite details and a relaxed and pleasant atmosphere",
