          "alias": "单女T恤门微笑坐比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, wearing a colorful striped T-shirt with horizontal stripes in pink, yellow, gray, and white. The neckline is off-white, the sleeves are loose and slightly pleated, and there is a white letter print on the left chest. She is slightly turned to the camera, wearing a gentle smile, raising her right hand in a V-shaped gesture. Around her neck hangs a slender gold necklace. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left center, and the composition is a close-up. The figure occupies most of the image, with a background of light-colored walls and a blurred indoor environment. On the right side, you can see some dark door frames or cabinet edges. The lighting is soft and even, coming from the front and slightly left, creating a warm and natural atmosphere. The overall color tone is mainly warm tones, with moderate saturation, clear details, and authentic texture. It presents a relaxed and casual feeling of everyday life, as if taken naturally with a phone, full of vitality and warmth",
