          "alias": "单女毛衣持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a wide-brimmed straw hat, with a gentle breeze creating a naturally relaxed state. The rough woven texture of the hat's edge is clearly visible, and the brim casts soft shadows. She wears a light-colored knit top with exquisite details at the collar and cuffs, set against a clear blue sky and a few lush pine branches. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying the upper center of the frame, creating a strong visual direction. Light comes from the upper side, bright and soft, with natural shadow transitions creating a warm and radiant summer atmosphere. The colors are mainly blue, white, and brown, fresh and natural, with a delicate image texture, a slight film graininess, and realistic light and shadow layers, reminiscent of snapshots taken with a daily portable camera, full of life and youthful energy",
