        {
          "id": "krea2-4cf5f2e45a4f39b0be18a726",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙街道微笑站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street, naturally draped over her shoulders with a gentle smile, looking at the camera with an elegant and relaxed posture. She wears a light beige sleeveless dress that is light and flowing, with thin straps revealing graceful shoulder and neck lines. On her arm is a simple gold bracelet, her wrist naturally hanging down. The background is a clear blue sky and white clouds. The sun is shining, the sky is deep blue, dotted with a few fluffy white clouds. On both sides of the street are typical Japanese-style buildings, with beige and white exterior walls and sloped roofs. Green plants dot the walls, the street is a dark gray asphalt pavement, with green bicycle lane markings on the right, and a blue circular traffic sign standing by the roadside featuring pedestrian patterns and Japanese text. In the distance, you can see other pedestrians walking. The overall composition combines close-up shots with the environment. The figure is positioned slightly in the center left of the frame, with a slight tilt and a head looking back at the camera, creating a natural visual direction. Light comes from the upper right, and sunlight shines on the figure, creating soft highlights and shadows. It creates a warm and comfortable atmosphere, with rich layers of light and shadow, moderate color saturation, and fresh, natural tones. It feels as realistic as everyday phone photography, as if captured with amateur equipment, full of life and youthful energy. The overall image presents a tranquil, pleasant, and warm Japanese street style with clear details and authentic texture, evoking the leisurely and beautiful summer afternoon street scene",
