          "id": "krea2-2a25b0f292dee7c55ee8f920",
          "alias": "单女街道自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman is taking a selfie on a city street. She holds her phone for a selfie with a white case and a blue camera module. She wears pearl earrings and a multi-layered necklace. The background is a curved street building facade with glass windows, signs, and pedestrians. Green railings and pavement bricks form the foreground, with shop windows and traffic signs visible in the distance. The overall shot uses a low-angle wide-angle lens. The image presents a fisheye distortion effect, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame. The composition has strong visual guidance, with bright and natural lighting. Sunlight from the upper right creates soft shadows, with vibrant and saturated colors full of vitality and youthful energy, creating a relaxed and enjoyable urban living atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if shot with everyday hobby equipment, with slight graininess and realistic light and shadow transitions, presenting a friendly and natural street style style",
