        {
          "id": "krea2-c784156c2941449a690fe7f7",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣庭院俏皮站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a sun-dappled courtyard path, naturally draped over her shoulders. She wears a light green knit cardigan with fluffy white feather decorations on the cuffs, paired with an off-white lace skirt adorned with black bow patterns and delicate polka dots. The overall look is fresh and sweet. She holds a vintage film camera in both hands, with a beige patterned handbag hanging from her wrist. The background is a lively streetside courtyard, with lush greenery on the left, including monstera and potted shrubs. On the right are steps with geometric patterned floor tiles and a row of clay flowerpots. In the distance, you can see the walls, awnings, and windows of old buildings. Sunlight filters through the leaves, creating a mix of light and shadow on the ground and figures. The light is warm and soft, creating a lazy afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses a central symmetrical style, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, the foreground the edge of the wooden platform, the middle ground featuring the main figure and some plants, and the background layered with buildings and greenery. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and green. It creates a beautiful moment in everyday life, as if captured with an old-fashioned camera, with a slight film graininess and natural exposure transitions. The image texture is delicate, full of storytelling and the atmosphere of everyday life",
