        {
          "id": "krea2-aa8c620e4beb66cb8d12d34d",
          "alias": "单女泳装船上微笑站立戏水",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the yacht deck of a tropical island, wearing a white long-sleeved sun-protective top with a bikini underneath. One side of the cover-up slit reveals her leg lines. She raises her right hand to shield herself from the sun, wears an orange wristband and a white bracelet, smiling at the camera with an elegant and relaxed posture. The background is clear green waters and distant green hills covered with dense vegetation. The sky is deep blue dotted with a few white clouds, and on the water, another person wearing an orange life jacket is swimming. The composition centers on the person center-left. The foreground features a yacht's white railing, the middle features people and seawater, and the background features hills and sky. The overall view uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the contours of the figures and the layering of the environment. The lighting is bright and soft, with sunlight shining from above creating natural highlights and shadows. The shimmering water reflects blue-green tones, creating a fresh, comfortable, and summer vacation atmosphere. The realistic shooting texture, with slight graininess and natural color transitions, feels like a professional camera capturing everyday moments on a clear afternoon",
