        {
          "id": "krea2-2da877321ac8e813d3256f69",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣沙发坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a beige velvet round armchair, wearing an off-white ribbed knit cardigan dress with a lapel-like design, neatly arranged buttons, and long sleeves naturally draped down. Her legs are crossed, black stockings wrapping her slender legs, and she holds an open old book. The pages are yellowed with simple sketch patterns naturally draped over her shoulders, her makeup exquisite, as if lost in thought or drawn to something. The background is a pure white pleated fabric curtain, creating a soft and pure atmosphere. The overall composition uses a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, forming the visual focal point. Light softly enters from the left, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. Shadows gently fall on the right side and on the chair, emphasizing three-dimensionality. The layers of light and shadow are rich, the tones warm and vintage, with a film photographic texture. The image presents a tranquil, elegant, and slightly nostalgic everyday aesthetic, as if captured on a quiet afternoon with an old-fashioned camera, carrying a strong sense of artistry and storytelling",
