        {
          "id": "krea2-c6be33ab64371104aaddf603",
          "alias": "单女米风衣街道忧伤坐持杯",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window of a café, wearing a beige trench coat over a white turtleneck sweater and pink pants, holding a white ceramic coffee cup. Her makeup is delicate and natural, her right hand gently gripping the cup, while her left hand rests on a book on the table. The frame is shot through an old glass window, framed in deep red wood. The glass has slight reflections and scratches, creating a nostalgic atmosphere. In the foreground, the vertical lines of the window frame and the glass reflect, the middle scene shows the woman and her tea snacks. The composition uses a framed style, using window frames to form natural frames that guide the viewer to focus on the figures. The light comes from a mix of warm yellow indoor light and natural outdoor light, creating a soft side backlighting effect. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and story-rich, with warm tones and a film-like texture, presenting a cinematic narrative style. It seems to capture a lonely yet elegant moment in a city at dusk. The images have a strong sense of everyday life and realism, like street photography taken with an old-fashioned camera—rich in detail, clear layers, full of life and artistic beauty",
