        {
          "id": "krea2-1c0fb2622fb7431cd465f375",
          "alias": "单女全裸粉连衣裙沙发沉思坐持花",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a black leather sofa, wearing a vibrant coral pink mini dress adorned with shiny silver rhinestones on the shoulders and cuffs. The skirt skirt lightly covers her thighs, paired with sheer nude stockings and black pointed high heels. Her legs are elegantly crossed, hands naturally crossed on the knees, and the overall posture appears dignified and relaxed. The sofa's surface is smooth and reflective, showcasing delicate leather texture and sheen. The background is light gray walls and dark gray tiled floor, with a black iron flower stand placed on the right. On top is a bouquet of softly colored flowers, including pink, white, blue, and yellow flowers and green leaves. The composition centers on the figure, using a medium perspective where the figure occupies the main part of the composition. The flower stand serves as a visual balance point on the right side, forming a stable triangular structure. Light comes from the front slightly left, softly illuminating the subject evenly. Shadows naturally cast onto the sofa and floor, creating a warm indoor atmosphere. The overall tone is warm and harmonious, details rich, and texture is authentic. It carries the naturalness and life atmosphere of everyday amateur photography, as if shooting intimate moments at home. The transitions of light and shadow are delicate and layered, highlighting the gentleness of the subjects and the comfort of the environment, filling the images with a tranquil and elegant atmosphere",
