        {
          "id": "krea2-23e6c6296fc9ab7767fb129b",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣街道愤怒行走吸烟",
          "prompt": "A woman walks through a city street, wearing a light pink long-sleeved cardigan and an off-white tight tank top, paired with gray high-waisted sports leggings and off-white platform sneakers. The overall look is simple, fashionable, and full of energy. She carries a brown paper bag printed with \"PARIS BAGUETTE\" in her left hand and a cigarette in her right, striking a casual and natural posture. A small round bag in a white-brown color block slung over her shoulder. The background is a blurred city street, with distant green trees, road signs, and vehicle silhouettes. The ground is paved with gray stone paved walkways, with sunlight streaming down from above, creating soft and clear shadows on the subjects. The light is bright but not glaring, presenting a warm summer afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-angle portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, body slightly tilted, creating a sense of dynamism and authentic life. The overall tone is fresh and natural, with rich details, giving the texture of everyday documentary photography, as if capturing a moment outdoors with a professional camera. It captures an ordinary yet vivid everyday moment from urban life, with delicate light and shadow transitions and moderate color saturation, highlighting the main characters while preserving the authenticity of the environment, presenting a relaxed, casual, and slightly fashionable urban living scene",
