        {
          "id": "krea2-bdbf8501527d5b87d0c74974",
          "alias": "单女俏皮躺持包",
          "prompt": "Her left hand gently holds a bundle of hay ornaments, a thin red cord bracelet on her wrist, and a brown leather shoulder bag on her back. The main focus is on the right side of the foreground, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame. The composition uses close-ups combined with the environmental background to create a natural and intimate visual feeling. The middle ground features several huge natural rocks and dense green trees. The leaves display rich green layers under the sunlight, with dappled light and shadow scattered on the ground and figures, creating a texture of interwoven light and shadow. The background is the blue ocean and distant mountain silhouettes. The sky is clear and dotted with a few white clouds. The overall lighting is bright daylight, with strong sunlight shining from above and sides, creating clear shadows and highlights. The contrast is striking, the atmosphere is fresh and natural, full of summer vibes. The image has warm tones, moderate color saturation, and rich details, giving it the realism of everyday phone photography. It feels as if capturing a fleeting moment during a trip, with a slight film texture and soft depth blur effects. The composition is full of everyday life, presenting an overall relaxed, joyful, romantic, and pleasant vacation atmosphere",
