        {
          "id": "krea2-c6ce6118d0fbbb8cbae8a7fa",
          "alias": "城市冷淡注视",
          "prompt": "The overall look blends gothic and futuristic elements, with the background set inside a modern industrial-style building, dark gray concrete structures interlaced with metal stairs, In the distance, the glass curtain wall reflects cool-toned light; nearby, the railing surface shows slight rust and wear marks. The floor is rough cement. The tall glass wall on the right reflects the outlines of figures and the environment. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, with the figure occupying the left central position, body lines extending deep into the frame, guiding the gaze toward the rear space. The foreground railing forms a diagonal visual guideline, with the main subject in the middle clearly prominent. The background is blurred to create a sense of layering, and light and shadow come from the upper side, creating contrast between light and shadow. Shadows fall on the sides of the body and beneath the railing, creating an overall atmosphere that is calm, mysterious, and full of urban detachment. The color palette is mainly black, gray, and white, accented with a touch of purple and silver, presenting a realistic texture reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment photography. The details are rich but not overly embellished, retaining slight noise and natural light and shadow transitions, as if casually captured by a camera on the street.",
