        {
          "id": "krea2-bad025d572f6d1b187333e17",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣街道站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street, her body slightly radiating a healthy glow. She wears an off-white slim-fit long-sleeve cardigan with a white top underneath. The front of the cardigan is decorated with a gold zipper and buttons, and she pairs high-waisted gray tight sweatpants with smooth lines that fit her figure. A handbag with an off-white pleated design slung over her shoulder, holding a phone in her right hand, her posture naturally relaxed, her body slightly turned to the side, her head turned toward the camera. The background is a blurred city building, and the glass curtain wall reflects the light blue of the sky and the shadows of clouds. In the distance, the outlines of high-rise buildings and street details can be faintly seen. The overall composition uses a mid-field portrait, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, leaving space on the left side to create visual balance. Light comes from the front and above, with bright, soft natural light evenly illuminating the subject. The shadows are subtle and natural, creating a clean and transparent atmosphere. The tones are mainly gray and white, with a delicate and realistic texture, as if shot with a professional camera. It has a strong daily documentary style and urban fashion vibe, while retaining a sense of everyday moments and moderate color saturation. The contrast is soft, presenting a fresh, elegant, and slightly lazy image of a modern urban woman",
