        {
          "id": "krea2-6103eb607021eb9d98ebc42e",
          "alias": "单女连体衣车库微笑站立",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a black, high-gloss, tight leather jumpsuit stands in the center of the underground parking lot, smiling gently at the camera. Her hands hang naturally, her posture elegant and composed. The jumpsuit fits her curves perfectly, highlighting a healthy, full-bodied figure and slender proportions. Paired with black pointed high heels, the overall look is modern and fashionable. The foreground figure occupies the main position, with a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure is positioned slightly below the center of the frame, while the center extends to the distant parking space and white parking line. The lines are clearly arranged in parallel, creating a strong sense of perspective and spatial depth. The background features several neatly parked cars, including a white SUV, a silver sedan, and a red compact car. The vehicle colors contrast with the ambient tones, creating a daily urban atmosphere. The building structure consists of concrete columns and curved ceilings, with embedded lights on the top emitting warm yellow light. The light gently reflects off the ground and body, creating a contrasting light and shadow layer. The overall lighting is mainly illuminated from the front and sides. Highlighting the figure's body curves and the texture of clothing, with natural shadow transitions, the atmosphere combines a cool industrial feel with a private, sensual tone. The main color palette is black, gray, and brown, accented with warm yellow lighting, presenting a low-key luxury yet slightly mysterious visual effect. It resembles professional studio lighting combined with real scene shooting, exuding a high-end cinematic feel and a fashionable blockbuster quality. The details are rich and storytelling, as if capturing a moment of an urban night returner or model waiting in a quiet garage. The images present a highly realistic style. The material is delicately rendered, the leather reflects realistically, the overall composition is stable and full of tension, the visual focus is clear, and the atmosphere is immersive and evocative",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
