        {
          "id": "krea2-82b5f7b44170e466107f8841",
          "alias": "单女牛仔街道沉思站立持书",
          "prompt": "A low-angle low-angle shot of a woman stands on a white circular platform, her body slightly leaning forward, holding an open newspaper in both hands, her expression natural and slightly contemplative. Her green hooded sweatshirt is printed with the word \"LOVE,\" paired with light-colored denim shorts and white high-top sneakers, with white socks visible at the ankles. The overall look is casual and daily, with a clear, cloudless blue sky in the background. The colors are highly saturated, and the composition uses a vertical elongated frame, with the main subject occupying a slightly lower central position from the feet up to the head. It creates a strong visual guiding line, emphasizing the slender figure of the character and the sense of spatial height. The lighting is bright midday sunlight, coming from above and slightly behind, creating soft shadows. The overall atmosphere is fresh, free, and full of youthful energy. It features an outdoor street style that simulates real camera shooting effects. Using medium format cameras or high-end mobile lenses, with slight depth of field control, a clear foreground, a pure background, realistic color reproduction, delicate texture, natural light and shadow transitions, and a slight film graininess and slight overexposure. It creates a visual experience that combines documentary and artistic elements",
