        {
          "id": "krea2-467123b786745fd9c60da2ea",
          "alias": "单女棕牛仔乡村蹲展示",
          "prompt": "A woman squats outdoors, wearing a brown strapless top and ripped denim shorts, wearing a woven straw hat, striking an elegant and relaxed pose. The overall look blends rural pastoral and modern fashion elements. The background is blurred green plants and wooden structures, creating a warm and soft natural atmosphere. Sunlight filters through leaves, casting dappled light and shadow, creating a visual effect of alternating light and shadow. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, body slightly tilted, showcasing graceful curves. In the foreground, a bottle of beverage and ground reflections enhance the realism of the scene. Light shines from the upper left, while shadows fall softly on the right. The overall color palette is mainly warm brown, off-white, and green, presenting a tranquil and pleasant summer afternoon atmosphere. It feels like a professional camera photo taken in natural light, featuring high resolution, delicate texture, and realistic light and shadow performance. The image is rich in detail, with distinct color layers, full of a sense of life and artistic beauty",
