        {
          "id": "krea2-940433e03ec138994786a33a",
          "alias": "单女棕西装街道忧伤站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the stone wall on Rue des Ursins in Paris's 4th arrondissement. She wears a beige and dark brown double-breasted plaid blazer, paired with a white collared shirt and a black tie, paired with tight black trousers and high-top black leather boots. Her arms are crossed over her chest, her posture confident yet slightly cold, wearing large hoop earrings, her expression calm yet powerful. In the foreground are rough stone walls and floors, with a blue street sign reading \"RUE DES URSINS\" written in white letters on the wall. and the green small sign \"CRUE JANVIER 1910\". The middle view features narrow cobblestone streets extending into the distance, flanked on both sides by typical Parisian vintage buildings. The gray-brown stone walls, blinds, and vintage street lamps are arranged in an orderly manner. In the background, more architectural silhouettes and faint light can be seen. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with figures positioned slightly to the center. The street lines create a strong perspective guiding the gaze into the distance. Light and shadow come from scattered light on cloudy days, creating an overall cool tone, mainly gray, brown, and black, creating a calm, The retro and slightly melancholic urban atmosphere features delicate image texture, with slight film graininess and soft shadow details, presenting the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting.",
