        {
          "id": "krea2-842173516f801f24358af3a5",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣城市神秘坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a red leather seat in the cinema, wearing an off-white plush short cardigan with a black sequin mini skirt underneath. Her legs are crossed, hands folded on her knees, nails painted bright red, wearing a pearl necklace and earrings, a light-colored small bag slung over her shoulder, and black platform boots. She calmly gazes at the camera, with neatly arranged red and blue cinema seats in the background. The walls are covered with dark red geometric wallpaper, topped with black metal decorations, and light pours in from above. The contrast between light and shadow between the seats and the figures creates a warm yet slightly mysterious atmosphere. The overall composition uses a medium perspective, with the characters positioned on the right side of the frame and the left side reserved to showcase the cinema environment. The light and shadows are soft and layered, presenting a tranquil beauty where urban fashion and privacy blend together. The tones are mainly warm red, deep blue, and off-white, with a slight grainy texture and film filter effects, resembling a real scene shot with an amateur camera. The details are rich and authentic, full of life and artistic tension",
