        {
          "id": "krea2-d7df69a7f4d9d252ef204bbf",
          "alias": "单女橙外套森林神秘坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits atop a thick tree stump in the forest, wearing an orange wool jacket paired with a striped knit top and a teal plaid pleated skirt. Her black knee-high boots and stockings accentuate her long legs. Her right hand gently rests on the red scarf at her collar, her posture elegant and relaxed. The background is a blurry, dark forest, with tall trees arranged in the distance, creating a peaceful yet slightly mysterious atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center, and the stump serving as a foreground element to enhance the sense of spatial layering. The light is soft with a faint backlight effect, making the figure's outline clear. Meanwhile, scattered dead leaves and soil on the ground enrich the scene's realism. The overall tone is warm and calm, with natural transitions of light and shadow, presenting a realistic beauty reminiscent of everyday amateur photography, as if captured in a moment captured with a regular camera on an autumn afternoon, full of strong life atmosphere and artistic appeal",
