        {
          "id": "krea2-32ab26dfca3a82d83ee16596",
          "alias": "单女模特黑长裤车库冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A female cosplayer stands in a dimly lit underground parking lot, wearing a black fitted long-sleeve top and black high-waisted pants. The top features a unique design, with cutouts on the shoulders and a white heart-shaped pattern on the chest. Large openings on both sides of the waist reveal the skin on the abdomen, giving the overall look a futuristic and sexy vibe. The background is a blurred parking lot environment, with gray concrete floors, distant pillars, and lights visible. On the right side, there are yellow and black warning stripes, and on the upper left, a circular ceiling light emits a soft white light, forming a slight halo behind the figure. The entire shot uses a shallow depth of field, with the subject clearly prominent. The background is blurred, the composition is centered to the left, and the figure occupies the main position. Light comes from above and from the side, creating a natural transition between light and shadow. The atmosphere is cold and mysterious, evoking the loneliness of an urban night walker. The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with a touch of yellow warning color, presenting a realistic feel reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting. With a slight graininess and film texture, it feels like a portable camera capturing a moment of street art performance in low-light conditions, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
