          "alias": "单女灰高领衫雪地冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden platform in the snow, wearing a gray turtleneck knit dress with intricate twisted patterns and three-dimensional embossed patterns. The fitted cut highlights her curves, with thin straps on the shoulders, paired with light-colored stockings and silver bow garters. The background is a stone wall covered in thick snow and withered tree trunks. The snow features natural textures and light and shadow changes, and the overall composition is center-to-right. The figures occupy the visual center, using a medium shot: the foreground is the edge of the wooden platform and some legs, the center is the main subject and snow, while the background is stone walls and trees. The lighting is soft and even, presenting a warm and tranquil atmosphere on a winter afternoon. The color scheme is mainly gray and white, accented with warm skin tones and deep gray details on clothing, creating a contrast that is both cool and cozy. The image texture is delicate and authentic, resembling a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, offering strong visual guidance. It highlights the elegant posture of the figures and the tranquil beauty of the winter setting",
