        {
          "id": "krea2-c0e93bcb5d0d798303e5b83f",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣车厢忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window seat on a high-speed train, wearing a gray knit cardigan paired with a white shirt and plaid bow tie, paired with a gray-black plaid pleated skirt. She slightly lowers her head, her expression slightly contemplative and gentle, her posture naturally relaxed, hands folded on her knees, and a dark blue backpack placed beside her. The strap rests on the seat, focusing on a close-up of the person, positioned slightly to the left of the composition. In the foreground are the person and backpack, and in the middle is a silver-gray metallic train seat and armrest. The background features green forests rushing by outside the window and blurred railway tracks. The dynamic blur created by the train movement creates a strong sense of motion. The scenery outside the window stretches horizontally, creating a dynamic contrast with static figures. The composition uses a close-up portrait perspective, with background blurring. The visual guide line leads from the character's line of sight outside the window and back to the person, forming a circular visual flow. Light comes from the side of the window, soft and natural, typical of scattered light on cloudy days. The indoor lighting is even, and the overall color palette is mainly gray, white, blue, and green, with a moderate temperature and coolness. The atmosphere is quiet and slightly lonely from travel, with a daily documentary style, as if shot with a regular camera or phone. Details are realistic, textures are clear, and the image has a slight film graininess, enhancing realism. Overall, it presents a blend of youthful campus style and modern commuting scenes, creating a sense of everyday beauty that is both restrained and storytelling",
