        {
          "id": "krea2-2c9c7943c8a948bf0eef0634",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫樱花困倦站立持伞",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the drizzle holding a transparent umbrella. She wears a white collared shirt paired with an off-white V-neck knit tank top. The collar of the vest is decorated with light blue stripes, and a small badge is embroidered on the left chest. Her left hand holds a transparent umbrella with a white handle. The umbrella surface is covered with raindrops and falling cherry blossom petals. The background is a blurred pink flowering tree and lush green natural scenery, creating a soft bokeh effect. The composition uses close-up shots, with the figure center-right, looking directly at the camera, creating a gentle and tranquil atmosphere. The lighting is soft on a cloudy day. The overall color palette is mainly soft off-white, light pink, and gray-green, with evenly soft light and shadow without strong contrasts, presenting a hazy, dreamy film texture, reminiscent of everyday moments shot with a vintage camera, with slight graininess and a cinematic feel with slightly lower color saturation. This emphasizes realism and the sense of life, highlighting the tranquility and poetry of youth strolling in the rain. The entire scene is full of delicate emotional expression and artistic flair",
