        {
          "id": "krea2-f3fd1508ba86f2436c285fd7",
          "alias": "单女银连衣裙摄影棚沉思站立",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a light silver silk-textured strapless long dress, adorned with delicate subtle embroidery and three-dimensional floral decorations. She stands between two traditional Chinese scrolls: the left scroll has a white background painted with ink-colored bamboo leaves and calligraphy; the right scroll has a beige gray background, printed with ink-style tropical plants and landscape scenes. She leans slightly to the side, one hand gently caressing the edge of the scroll, the other naturally hanging down, her expression calm yet slightly thoughtful. In the foreground, several blurred green bamboo leaves extend diagonally from the lower left corner, creating natural visual obstruction and layering. The middle ground focuses on the main subject, while the deep black background highlights the scroll and the contours of the figures. The composition uses close-ups combined with framed compositions, using scrolls to form natural borders that highlight the figures. The light is soft and even, coming from the upper front, creating a warm transition of light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, blending Eastern classical aesthetics with modern photographic texture, presenting a poetic artistic conception like a painting. The color palette mainly features cool silver-gray, dark green, and deep black, accented with warm yellow floral decorations. The color contrast is harmonious, details rich, and the texture is realistic, as if a professional studio has carefully arranged lighting using softboxes and reflectors, offering high resolution and cinematic quality.",
