        {
          "id": "krea2-d70161ad144fe3e0b9f4e1ce",
          "alias": "单女棕西装舞台冷淡倚靠交叠",
          "prompt": "Her body leans back slightly, legs crossed and raised, left leg draped over right, posture elegant yet full of tension. She wears a loose brown blazer over black lace lingerie, translucent white stockings and black stiletto sandals, fluttering in the breeze, her expression slightly cool and confident. Her hands gently rest on the edge of the bench, creating an atmosphere that is both sexy and artistic. The foreground features a clear wooden bench with rough and natural texture, while the center is the main subject, occupying the left central position, shot from a low angle, highlighting the lines of the figure's legs and overall posture, forming a smooth diagonal composition. The background is a dark backdrop, simple yet layered. The ground is gray cement with slight reflections, and the light and shadow come from the front left spotlight, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow and creating a dramatic light and shadow effect. The overall atmosphere is both fashionable and private, as if captured on a small stage or studio, presenting a high-end fashion photography style with the texture and detail of professional photography equipment. At the same time, it retains the naturalness and realism of everyday amateur shooting",
