        {
          "id": "krea2-63e4c69dabbad5a44a0c6e0b",
          "alias": "单女灰浴袍镜前温柔持镜",
          "prompt": "She wears a dark gray velvet bathrobe, soft and voluminous, with a wide neckline revealing her full bust. The waist strap is loosely tied, and one side of the collar slips down, forming a high slit design. The lines of her legs are faintly visible at the slit. Her right hand gently supports the edge of the bathrobe, fingers painted with red nail polish, and her left ring finger wears a ring. The overall posture is elegant and relaxed. In the foreground is the white edge of the washbasin and mirror reflections, while in the middle is the female subject occupying the center right of the frame. The background features a shower area with white tiled walls, where the silver shower and hoses are clearly visible. The mirror edges and door frames have a metallic texture, and light comes from the indoor ceiling lights and mirror lighting, softly illuminating the subject evenly. The shadows are subtle and natural, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. The composition uses a symmetrical vertical central axis, with the subject slightly centered to the right, emphasizing a blend of sexiness and comfort. The overall style is realistic and natural, with the authentic texture of everyday home photography, as if capturing life moments casually with a phone or regular camera, accented with red nails, with clear layers, clean and simple visuals, rich details, presenting a lazy yet refined home aesthetic.",
