        {
          "id": "krea2-33a11a90cafc7a262407358b",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙沙发自信坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a gray fabric sofa, wearing a white spaghetti strap dress with a naturally draped hem, tassel decorations at the neckline, and a simple and comfortable overall look. Her feet are bare, her feet slightly crossed, showing a relaxed and comfortable lifestyle. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the middle frame, with a slightly tilted perspective to create a sense of movement and balance. The foreground features the sofa and the legs of the figure. The middle shot features the full body and upper body of the subject, with a background composed of light gray curtains, white walls, and a black-framed decorative painting featuring artistic calligraphy. The curtains are delicately pleated, the walls clean and tidy, and the floor is covered with light-striped carpets. The lighting is soft and even, blending natural indoor light with ambient light to create a warm and bright atmosphere. The shadows are subtle and natural, with the overall tone mainly gray and white, creating a fresh and peaceful home living atmosphere. The image texture is authentic, details rich, and it feels authentic and intimate for everyday family photography. It's as if you casually capture those warm moments with a regular camera or phone, full of life and youthful energy",
