        {
          "id": "krea2-ef81150fab4be5102e68f114",
          "alias": "单女摄影棚冷淡站立叉腰",
          "prompt": "Standing with hands on hips beside a bright yellow Porsche sports car, she poses confidently, her expression calm yet full of tension, showcasing a blend of elegance and strength. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, her body slightly tilted, and the lines of her legs smoothly extend to the foreground, creating a strong visual direction. The background is a simple off-white wall with subtle textures, creating a clean and crisp sense of space. The ground is a dark gray asphalt pavement, reflecting the contours of the vehicle and the figure. The middle ground features the rear of the car and the rear wheels. The yellow paint gleams metallicly in the sunlight, the silver multi-spoke wheels are exquisitely designed, the tires are clearly visible, the door handles and mirrors are well-detailed, and the composition uses low-angle downward shots to highlight the tall figure and the dynamic lines of the vehicle, presenting a strong contrast overall. The bright yellow contrasts sharply with the deep black clothing, with light and shadow coming from the upper right. The light is soft but clearly directioned, casting clear shadows that enhance three-dimensionality and spatial layering, creating an atmosphere that is fashionable, cool, and vintage. It looks as if shot in a professional studio or outdoors in daylight, featuring a high-end advertising style while preserving the details and texture of real shooting. The images are full of modern urban aesthetics, conveying themes of speed, freedom, and individual expression",
