        {
          "id": "krea2-a9e5606fe996dab002d694e0",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜公寓俏皮倚靠",
          "prompt": "She is turning sideways to look back at the camera, her expression slightly playful and gentle. Her body leans slightly forward, her hands resting on the armrests of a dark brown leather sofa, right leg bent and raised, feet resting on the sofa cushion, dressed in black stockings and black flat shoes, her posture elegant and relaxed. The background is the indoor environment, with white semi-transparent sheer curtains gently draping behind, creating a hazy, soft light effect. On the left side is a dark gray side table with several magazines and books stacked on it, the spines clearly visible. One of the books features the word \"LOEWE\" on the cover, with a vintage silver film camera placed next to it. The body details are exquisite, and the overall composition uses a diagonal angle. The characters are positioned slightly to the left of the frame, forming a visual guiding line. The design extends from the sofa and plush cushions in the foreground to the main body in the middle ground, then transitions to books and curtains in the background. The layers are distinct, with light coming from the front slightly left, creating delicate and natural shadows. The overall atmosphere is warm and comfortable, combining fashion and a sense of everyday life, with a slight everyday shooting feel. The color palette is mainly blue, white, and gray Accented with warm-colored lipstick and dark stockings, the colors are harmoniously unified, the image is rich in detail, the texture is clear, the stitching and wrinkles of the denim fabric, the soft texture of the plush is realistically presented, and the sheen and reflection of the leather are all realistically presented, presenting a visually authentic, natural, and artistically beautiful visual experience",
