        {
          "id": "krea2-34aa76738bd5ee54360f9073",
          "alias": "单女黑西装室内自信倚靠展示",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a black blazer and a lace-patched mini skirt leans elegantly against a wall in a classical, off-white style. Her makeup is exquisite, her left hand resting lightly on the wall, her right hand naturally hanging down, her posture composed and expressive. Her right leg is bent and raised, toes touching the ground, and her left leg stands upright to support her body, showcasing her long leg lines and the perfect silhouette of her high heels. She wears black stockings and black patent leather high heels with red soles, creating a fashionable and feminine look, set against a beautifully decorated indoor setting. The walls feature vertical groove lines and simple geometric shapes. The floor is paved with marble tiles with gray-blue textures, providing soft and even lighting. Coming from the upper front, it creates a warm and sophisticated atmosphere. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, body in a diagonal posture. The straight lines of the wall guide the visual focus on the subject. The background blur emphasizes the foreground figure, with delicate light and shadow. The color scheme is mainly black, white, and beige, accented with a red shoe sole as a visual highlight. Overall, it presents a portrait style that combines artistic flair with everyday beauty, resembling high-quality portraits taken with a professional camera. The details are rich, texture is authentic, and it possesses strong visual appeal and emotional expression",
