        {
          "id": "krea2-285bc6f968fa909ad5111b53",
          "alias": "电梯冷淡注视",
          "prompt": "The overall look is modern and fashionable, with a metallic interior wall of the elevator in the background, subtle reflections and textures on the surface, and white text above them ch'a mullo' amato amar perdona. How you live your life is your business. Just remember, our hearts and our bodies are given to us only once. Before you know it, your heart is worn out; as your body there comes a point when no one looks at it, much less wants to come near it.\", The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered and occupying the main part of the picture. The lighting is soft and even, with natural light coming from the front slightly above, creating delicate shadows that blend urban fashion with everyday life. The color palette is mainly gray-black, paired with cool metallic tones. The overall atmosphere is calm, rational, and modern, with a slight film graininess and slight motion blur, reminiscent of real moments captured with an amateur camera, presenting a visual style that is both everyday and artistic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
