        {
          "id": "krea2-466390700c51dfcecc017953",
          "alias": "单女蓝旗袍花园坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the railing of a stone bridge in a Chinese garden, wearing a deep blue sleeveless qipao with a large blue-purple peony pattern, with golden lines outlining the petals. The fabric has a silky sheen and delicate pleats, and the neckline is elegant and unique. Her right hand rests lightly on the railing, her left hand hangs naturally, and she wears black sheer mesh high heels with rhinestone decorations on the upper, her right leg elegantly folded over her left. One side of the skirt lifts slightly to reveal the orange-red fabric lining. The background is a typical Jiangnan garden, with rustic wooden pavilions and upturned eaves nestled among dense green trees. The clear pond water reflects the scenery along the shore, and sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled shadows. The overall composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, and light coming from the upper left, creating a gentle transition of light and shadow that creates a tranquil and elegant Eastern charm. The colors are mainly blue, green, and brown, rich and harmonious in layers. It presents a realistic style with a cinematic sense of storytelling, as if capturing a tranquil moment in an afternoon courtyard. The details are authentic and natural, the texture delicate, and the atmosphere warm and leisurely",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
