        {
          "id": "krea2-462ffeba6f1bf4b4a3a915f6",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙公园微笑站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors, wearing a light blue spaghetti strap dress, a gentle smile, elegant and relaxed posture, hands gently resting on her waist, simple rings on her fingers, overall fresh and natural. The background features a blurred carousel and amusement park architectural silhouette, sunlight pours in from behind, creating a soft backlight effect that creates a warm and hazy atmosphere. The foreground features clear and prominent figures, the middle ground is a blurred amusement ride, the background sky is bright and pale, and the composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the main subject positioned slightly to the right center of the frame. The layers of light and shadow are rich, highlights transition smoothly, shadows are delicate and natural, and the overall color scheme mainly features warm and cool contrasts, with blue-gray tones interwoven with warm yellow sunlight, presenting a dreamy and tranquil afternoon feel, as if shot with a professional camera at sunset. It features a slight film grain texture and realistic lens halo, with cinematic color rendering and spatial depth. The details are exquisite, clothing textures are clearly visible, background bokeh is soft, and out-of-focus imaging is natural. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday authenticity",
