        {
          "id": "krea2-43a774f89bf8c83ce3743770",
          "alias": "单女米西装沙发微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a gray fabric sofa, wearing a beige double-breasted suit jacket paired with a white lace Peter Pan collar and white cuffs. She wears black stockings and platform ankle boots with black-and-white patchwork, adorned with gold chains at the ankles, creating an elegant and vintage look; Naturally draped over the shoulders, wearing a gentle smile, with a relaxed and confident posture; In the foreground, she closes up her body and legs, with her hands naturally resting on the edge of the sofa. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the subject, while the background is a blurred bed and a white pillow. Warm yellow light pours in from the left, creating a cozy and comfortable indoor atmosphere. The light and shadow are soft and the shadows delicate, with a warm tone with a slight film texture and graininess typical of everyday photography. Overall, it presents a private, cozy, and lively home scene, as if captured casually by a phone or camera. It offers visual effects that combine realism and artistry",
