        {
          "id": "krea2-03778b327ba5cbe44846e94d",
          "alias": "单女粉旗袍椅上坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor wooden bench, wearing a light pink modified qipao. The fabric is lightweight, silky, and naturally pleated. The neckline and cuffs are designed simply and elegantly, with a skirt slightly slit in an A-shape, revealing slender leg lines. A pink rose is pinned to the handbag, and a necklace of pearls and pink beads is worn around her neck. Sunlight pours in from the upper right, with blurred greenery and distant architectural silhouettes in the background The green plants have rich layers, with branches and leaves appearing semi-transparent under the backlight. The wooden bench has clear textures and natural wear marks on the surface. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The lighting is warm and bright, presenting the golden atmosphere of early morning or evening. The overall color palette is mainly pink, off-white, and light green, harmoniously unified with natural light and shadow transitions, creating a tranquil, elegant, and poetic everyday scene. It feels as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens, with clear details and perfect background blur. It features a cinematic realistic style, with a slight film graininess to enhance realism and a nostalgic atmosphere",
