        {
          "id": "krea2-acefb7ae369c0ed83022f620",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装广场神秘坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a vintage, elegant blue-toned suit sits on a stone bench in the city square. She wears a light blue wide-brimmed hat, adorned with a huge pleated bow in the same color, creating a mysterious and enchanting aura. She wears pearl earrings and a pearl necklace, with a delicate silver brooch pinned to her neck. She wears a deep blue fitted long-sleeved jacket with light blue fabric patched at the collar and cuffs, a few buttons on the front placket, and a light blue high-waisted skirt at the hem, lined with white tulle and trimmed with ruffle details. She crosses her legs, wears mesh stockings and a pair of light blue suede pointed high heels, and her right hand is lightly draped over her knee with a white glove resting gracefully and calmly. In the background is a blurred classical arcade complex, topped with orange-red flowerpotted plants, and the floor paved with gray stone slabs. The overall composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame. The green plants in the foreground and the edge of the flowerbed on the right form a natural framework. Guiding the gaze to focus on the subject, the lighting is soft and even, presenting warm natural light like early morning or evening. The light and shadow delicately outline the texture and layers of the garment. The colors are mainly shaded with different shades of blue, accented by white, beige, and green, creating a tranquil, noble, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. It resembles a mid-20th-century fashionable street photography photo, with the graininess and authentic texture of film photography, presenting the realism and artistic atmosphere of everyday amateur equipment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
