        {
          "id": "krea2-5325ed56a80b6d6e69a4bad0",
          "alias": "单女旗袍桌边持扇",
          "prompt": "Her left hand gently touches her shoulder, while her right hand holds a round fan painted with flowers and butterflies. Her posture is elegant yet reserved. The exquisite embroidery and pearl decorations on the qipao appear faintly in the sunlight. The background is the shimmering lake and hazy greenery. In the distance, water and sky meet, while the nearby stone table is mottled and ancient. Leaves and branches naturally hang from the top of the painting, forming a natural frame. The overall composition adopts a medium-angle perspective, with the figure positioned on the right side of the painting. The left side is reserved to showcase the environment, with soft and bright lighting. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled shadows, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The tones are elegant and soft, mainly pale pink, white, and light green, with a slight vintage film texture. The images have a slight graininess and natural exposure, presenting a documentary aesthetic reminiscent of everyday shooting. The background blur highlights the subject, and the overall style blends classical Eastern aesthetics with modern photography, combining traditional charm with authentic life",
