        {
          "id": "krea2-459255253a66070e2d89fa80",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣沉思持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a dark brown knit hat with red and white woven patterns along the brim. She wears a thick knit sweater decorated with black and white stripes and geometric patterns on the cuffs and shoulders. Her right hand gently holds a withered yellow maple leaf, her fingertips slightly bent, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. Her head tilts back slightly, as if feeling the warm autumn sun. The background is a wooden structure covered in vines, the leaves have turned yellow and red, some of which glow in the sunlight with a semi-transparent texture. The branches crisscross, forming a natural framework. In the distance, you can see blurred tiled rooftops and blue skies. Light pours in from the upper left, creating a soft backlighting effect. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a warm and hazy atmosphere. In the foreground, a few yellowed leaves are blurred to enhance the sense of layering in the composition. The composition uses a low-angle upward shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right, leaving space on the left for the light and sky to extend. The visual guide leads from the foreground leaves to the figure, then extends overhead to the vines and sky. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, orange, and brown. It features a slight film graininess that mimics the texture of everyday camera shooting. The lens is chosen for medium focal length, with a shallow depth of field that highlights the subject, creating a scene filled with autumn tranquil poetry and nostalgia",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
