        {
          "id": "krea2-6ea0d5685184a4948a83be4a",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙叛逆躺演奏",
          "prompt": "A black short skirt paired with white lace socks and black platform loafers. The overall look is cute yet somewhat rebellious. The center frame shows a dazzling array of fruits and melons, with green watermelons and yellow-green Hami melons forming a vivid color contrast. The background features bright supermarket lights, price tags on shelves, and blurry distant customer silhouettes. The composition is shot from a low angle. The figure occupies the center left of the frame, with light from the top fluorescent lamp softly and evenly illuminating the entire scene, creating a realistic atmosphere of everyday life while retaining the fun of role-playing. The overall color scheme is mainly black and white, accented with bright fruit colors, presenting a unique beauty that lies between reality and fantasy. It feels like a snapshot casually captured with a regular camera, with slight noise and natural shadow transitions, enhancing the documentary feel and everyday life of the image",
