        {
          "id": "krea2-57d737079660429b378424cc",
          "alias": "单女红丝袜摄影棚神秘坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the steps of an indoor curved staircase, wearing a black sequin long-sleeve top and bright red tight stockings with high heels. Beside her, a red patent leather handbag rests on the steps, creating a strong color contrast. The overall composition centers on the figure, using a low-angle downward view to highlight the figure's figure and spatial depth. The staircase extends diagonally into the background, guiding the gaze upward and focusing on the main subject. The center features beige marble-textured stairs and dark metal handrails with clean and smooth lines. The background is a warm yellow wall and ceiling with textured details. In the distance, a blue halo from the arched doorway can be seen, adding a mysterious atmosphere. On the right, another figure's silhouette can be faintly seen, hinting at the real social environment of the scene. Light comes from embedded light strips at the top and spotlights on the sides, creating a soft and layered light and shadow effect. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, with red as the visual focal point striking out, making the scene full of fashion and artistic flair It has a professional studio-level texture while preserving the natural feel of real everyday scenes, as if capturing moments in a real environment with a high-resolution camera. The details are rich, the lighting and shadows are delicate, and the composition is balanced, presenting a sense of refinement and detachment in urban nightlife",
