          "id": "krea2-7d79907166775d1e6a88e4aa",
          "alias": "单女风衣废墟神秘坐",
          "prompt": "Sitting on a vintage wooden chair, her posture elegant and confident, her left hand gently resting on the chair back, right hand tucked into her trench coat pocket, black high heels outlining her long legs, toes slightly touching the ground, delicate makeup, background stacked old-style CRT TVs, the screen dim, reflecting faint light, TV cabinets and wooden floors in deep tones, the overall environment dim and nostalgic, composition with a symmetrical center, prominent figures centered, female main subject, the middle frame featuring chairs and part of the TV, and the background of layers of televisions, creating a sense of depth. Light and shadow from the side gently outline the contours, creating a warm yet slightly mysterious atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with the graininess and slight noise typical of film photography, as if shot with a professional camera in low-light conditions. The tones are warm, contrast moderate, presenting a unique beauty where vintage fashion and technological ruins intertwine",
