        {
          "id": "krea2-3648e1fb3cfbd4a92036b592",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙桌边俏皮站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a light blue V-neck dress with red and pink floral floral patterns. She stands slightly to the side, holding a pair of black-handled scissors in both hands, preparing to cut a piece of beige fabric. Her expression is focused and gentle. The background is an indoor kitchen, with dark cabinets and wooden countertops forming the middle ground. In the distance, soft natural light filters through the window, while the buildings outside are blurred. The overall composition uses a close-up of a medium and near portrait, with the figure centered slightly to the left, the body forming an S-curve. Scissors and fabric are placed below the foreground to form a visual guide, with light coming from the left window edge. It creates a warm and bright atmosphere, with natural shadow transitions, moderate color saturation, and a delicate and realistic image texture, evoking the natural feel and lively atmosphere of amateur camera photography in daily life. The overall color tone is fresh and soft, full of tranquil and elegant aesthetics for living.",
