        {
          "id": "krea2-203103ce800ab5f55d737edb",
          "alias": "单女白围巾困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways in front of deep red velvet curtains, her expression slightly contemplative and dreamy, exuding a quiet and reserved beauty. Her right hand gently strokes her neck, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her shoulders and arms are wrapped in a fluffy, soft white plush shawl, which is delicate and layered, forming a strong contrast with the dark background. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right, composed using a three-part method, with the figure occupying the main part of the painting to create a visual focal point. In the foreground, the clear white plush and upper body of the figure are clearly visible. The background features thick, wrinkled deep red velvet curtains with delicate texture. Light and shadow create a soft transition of light and shadow on the fabric. Light shines diagonally from the left, creating warm side backlighting, producing distinct highlights and shadows, emphasizing three-dimensionality and skin texture. The overall color scheme is mainly warm red and white, creating a private, tranquil, and atmospheric atmosphere. The image has a slight film graininess and natural lens distortion, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera, presenting a realistic and simple everyday style with a slightly upward view. Enhancing the character's elegance and sense of sanctity, the overall visuals have a cinematic and artistic atmosphere, with natural light and shadow flow, and subtle and profound emotional expression, like a silent monologue.",
