        {
          "id": "krea2-7cded3aa30b5477a48f5f14a",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙自信坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright against a blue background, wearing a blue-and-white off-shoulder dress with delicate ruffle designs and striped patterns, presenting an elegant and layered visual effect, showcasing a temperament that combines intellect and approachability. She wears a multi-layered gold necklace and long tassel earrings, with several rings adorning her fingers. The overall look is gorgeous yet refined. The foreground figure dominates the scene, with a relaxed and confident posture, hands naturally resting on the edge of the blue seat. The middle shot features the body and clothing details of the figures. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered. The background is a blue wall decorated with geometric lines, creating a unified and modern color tone. The texture of the clothing and the gloss of accessories create a visual focal point. The light and shadows are soft and even, with soft light from the upper front and natural shadow transitions. The overall atmosphere is calm and elegant, with the texture of high-end fashion photography, while retaining the realism and warmth of everyday shooting. The color scheme is mainly blue, contrasted with gold accessories. It creates a fresh yet luxurious visual experience, with rich detail—from the woven textures of clothing to the reflections of jewelry, all clearly visible, presenting professional-grade image quality. The style blends fashion portraits with artistic portraits, making it suitable for high-end brand promotion or personal image display.",
