          "alias": "单女蓝外套户外冷淡站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a natural setting, wearing a white inner layer and a blue-and-white color-blocked sports jacket, carrying a beige backpack over her shoulder. Her right hand gently grips the backpack strap, while her left hand holds a smartphone and white wired earphones. Her overall posture is relaxed and natural, with a clear and prominent foreground. The middle ground shows details of the figure's body and clothing, while the background features blurred green vegetation and gray rocks, presenting a shallow depth of field effect. The composition uses a centered composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The light is soft and even, coming from naturally scattered light. It creates a tranquil atmosphere in the early morning or evening, with a cool blue-green tone accented by white and beige, with delicate transitions of light and shadow. The overall image has a sense of daily life and youthful energy, as if captured with a regular camera, with slight film texture and natural noise, presenting a lifelike, authentic, and emotionally rich realistic style",
