        {
          "id": "krea2-29e968257e8fae876ff71193",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣门自信倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways against a wooden door frame, her makeup delicate and natural, her overall demeanor gentle and elegant. She wears a black-and-white patterned knit cardigan paired with a white tight tank top and light blue ripped jeans. Her right hand gently rests on the door frame, fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, and she wears a simple silver necklace. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the middle frame, composed using a three-part method, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame. The background is the indoor environment, and the blurred dark gray walls and wooden structure create a sense of spatial layering, with soft and even lighting. Coming from the front slightly left, it creates a natural transition of shadows. The overall atmosphere is calm and warm, offering the realistic texture of amateur camera photography in daily life. The light and shadow are delicate, color saturation is moderate, and details are rich, presenting a lifelike, highly realistic visual effect",
