        {
          "id": "krea2-83113cb9d0d46d941f10c4dc",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙室内站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman in a bright red velvet long dress stands elegantly in a vintage indoor setting. One side of the dress is adorned with a large bow design, the high slit reveals her long, beautiful legs, paired with black long gloves and shiny pointed high heels. The overall posture is dignified and full of tension. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the center right of the frame, while the middle frame features classical carved rosewood furniture, including a drawer cabinet on the left and a desk on the right, each decorated with dried flowers. The background features a simple light gray wall and wooden frame edges, with a vertical elongation proportion. The figure is center-left to create a visual focal point. The high slit and arm posture guide the gaze down to the feet, with soft and even light and shadow coming from the front left, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The overall style blends high-end fashion with classical elegance, presenting a refined texture reminiscent of professional studio shoots. There is a slight film graininess and natural shadow transitions, moderate color saturation highlighting the red main tone, with rich details and clear layering. It has a strong visual impact and artistic expressiveness",
