        {
          "id": "krea2-d06fc13272a4f22f817cfe28",
          "alias": "单女白短裤城市站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a Parisian-style arched balcony window, dressed in a white cropped top and white shorts, standing gracefully on one foot, gently supporting the black iron railing with both hands. Her expression is calm yet slightly detached. The overall atmosphere is filled with the laziness and poetry of urban life. In the foreground is a wooden floor and a half-open white arched glass window frame, with smooth lines and circular decorative details on the top. In the middle is a black hollowed-out iron railing, behind which is a typical Parisian architectural complex with gray roofs, Chimneys and white walls create a layered urban landscape, with a cloudy sky as the background. The lighting is soft and even, presenting the faint glow of early morning or evening. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures positioned at the center of the frame. The arched window frames form a natural frame, visually guiding the focus on the subject. At the same time, the perspective lines of the building outside the window enhance the sense of spatial depth. Light and shadow come from naturally diffused light, with the overall tone mainly gray and white, creating a calm and restrained modern urban aesthetic. The texture of the image is delicate and authentic. It feels like a real moment captured with a regular phone, full of everyday intimacy and artistic flair, rich in detail, with a peaceful and story-rich atmosphere",
