        {
          "id": "krea2-d67a14c3be0cb45c68f149e5",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤街道坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in front of a low stone wall outdoors, wearing fine-rimmed round glasses, natural makeup, a light blue short-sleeved T-shirt, with white lace-trimmed \"MAS APEA\" lettering and the number \"30\" printed on the chest. She pairs jeans with a simple silver pendant necklace around her neck, relaxed posture, hands naturally resting on her knees. The background is the city skyline, with tall buildings in the distance, green plants and red flowers dotting the area. The sky is gray-blue, with soft and even lighting. The overall composition is centered, with the figure positioned in the foreground, occupying the main position in the frame, with stone walls and grass in the center, and a blurred urban building background in the background. The lighting and shadows are natural, with no obvious shadows, creating a quiet and everyday atmosphere, resembling an afternoon street shot taken with a regular mobile phone. It is highly realistic, rich in detail, and fresh in color, conveying both the vitality of life and youthful beauty",
