        {
          "id": "krea2-9ae186fba267ca0c3a2c5e3e",
          "alias": "单女灰背心公园愤怒坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the stone steps of the park, wearing a gray sports vest and tight pants, wearing a light gray baseball cap with cute cartoon patterns. She sits sideways on a rough stone platform, leaning slightly forward, creating an atmosphere of contemplation and tranquility. The background is a winding stone-paved path, lush greenery and lush vegetation on both sides. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled light and shadows, creating a soft and warm natural lighting effect. The overall composition adopts a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame. A diagonal path guides the gaze into the distance, enhancing spatial depth. The foreground highlights the main subject and stone pedestal details, while the middle ground presents paths and vegetation layers. The background is blurred to focus on the figure. The light is naturally scattered, bright but not glaring. The tones are mainly gray, green, and off-white, harmoniously unified to present a fresh and natural outdoor leisure scene. It has the authentic texture and artistic beauty of everyday photography, like an outdoor portrait shot with a professional camera, capturing a moment of tranquility and composure after exercise. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and comfortable, full of life and youthful energy",
