          "alias": "单女黑西装霓虹夜景微笑行走持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a black cropped blazer and shorts, with leopard print patterns on the cuffs and collar. She wears a black beret with a leopard-print scarf tied at the brim, creating an overall vintage and fashionable look. She holds a black leather briefcase and wears platform high-heeled shoes, smiling as she glances back at the camera, confident and elegant. The background is blurred brick walls and street lights, with warm yellow streetlights and distant neon lights interlacing to create a soft halo, creating an urban nightlife atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with a dynamic walking posture and smooth and natural leg lines. The foreground is a ground-level sidewalk, while the middle ground features the subject and parts of the street environment. The background blur highlights the subject, with light from streetlights and shop signs, creating a contrast between light and shadow. The light and shadow intertwine with clear contours and soft shadows. The overall tone is dark but layered, presenting a realistic feel reminiscent of everyday street photography, as if shot with a professional camera in low-light conditions, with slight noise and natural lens distortion. Capture a vibrant and distinctive urban moment",
