          "alias": "单女灰毛衣椅上坐持包",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a rattan chair, wearing pink long-sleeved loungewear, gray knit socks, her legs curled up, holding a white plastic basket containing bread slices and a bag of snacks. She looks up, holding a small piece of bread in her right hand, as if carefully observing or interacting with someone. The background is a black-and-white checkered tile wall, with a plush teddy bear placed in the corner, accompanied by wooden furniture and plaid fabric. The overall lighting is soft and warm, with natural light streaming in from the left, creating a cozy and cozy home atmosphere. The layers of light and shadow are rich, mainly warm tones, with a slight film texture and grainy feel typical of everyday shooting, presenting a tranquil moment in real life, rich in life atmosphere and emotional warmth",
