        {
          "id": "krea2-fcf2c0a8c44ac781a0c9222f",
          "alias": "单女黑西装户外忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor wooden railing, wearing a black double-breasted blazer with gold buttons that reflect slightly in a dark tone. Her left hand rests naturally on her leg, her nails painted white, fingers slender, her expression calm and profound. The background is blurred greenery and reflections on the water, creating a hazy natural atmosphere. In the foreground is a mottled dark wooden railing with clear grain visible. The middle ground is the main figure, composed using a three-part method, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame. The left side space is reserved to enhance visual balance. The background blur highlights the subject, with soft and cool lighting, coming from the front and side, creating subtle contrasts of light and shadow. The light and shadow layers are rich, with the overall color scheme dominated by black, gray, and green, accented with golden details, creating a tranquil, sophisticated, and slightly melancholic artistic feel. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, with a slight film graininess, presenting a poetic moment casually captured in daily life. The atmosphere is quiet and full of storytelling. The composition is simple yet full of tension, sparking viewers' imagination.",
