        {
          "id": "krea2-8d0bd6b45809f5f80164c4a5",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙公园沉思站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a white one-shoulder pleated long dress stands beside a stone path in the woods, her expression slightly contemplative. Her hands gently stroke the hem of her skirt, her posture elegant and natural. The background features mottled gray rocks and scattered dead leaves. Several green plants extend into the painting from the left, with thick and upright trunks and soft light. The light from above creates a contrast of light and shadow, creating a tranquil atmosphere. The overall tone is cool, mainly gray and white, with rich layers of light and shadow, focusing on the figure. The background is blurred, and the composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. It preserves a sense of space, with visual guidance from the foreground plants to the main subject, extending to the stone steps behind, creating a sense of depth, as if capturing a fleeting moment at dusk. It carries the authentic texture of everyday amateur photography. The camera specs simulate real shooting effects, using an 85mm prime lens with an f/2.0 aperture, shutter speed of 1/125 sec, ISO 200, slight noise and film graininess, natural color reproduction, complete detail preservation, presenting an artistic and realistic style. Like a tranquil moment captured in a park or courtyard, full of poetry and storytelling",
