        {
          "id": "krea2-9aa42b7449b9e08fb25bb82c",
          "alias": "单女蓝高领衫门站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the door, wearing a dark blue turtleneck sleeveless top and a gray tight mini skirt, paired with black stockings and black pointed high heels. A white lanyard hangs around her neck, elegantly leaning against the wood-grain door panel. Her left hand gently rests on the doorknob, while her right hand gently strokes the hem. The overall look is refined and professional. The foreground is the main figure, occupying the left central position of the composition. In the center are wooden textured doors and light-colored walls. On the right are beige hanging curtains and white sheer drapes, with a dark brown striped carpet covering the floor. The composition uses a vertical mid-shot portrait, presenting the person fully from feet to head, forming a smooth visual flow. Light and shadow come from natural light on the left, while the background wall and curtains display a warm beige tone, harmoniously contrasting with the clothing colors. The overall atmosphere combines privacy with the texture of daily life, resembling a realistic photo taken with a professional camera. The details are rich, layered clearly, and the tone is calm, exuding a strong artistic realist atmosphere",
