        {
          "id": "krea2-b88e2b9b2aba0e18b91dc1a2",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣舞台困倦持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a loose gray knit sweater, with fluffy light gray plush plush puffs decorating the cuffs. Her posture is naturally slightly turned to the side, hands folded in front of her, presenting an overall quiet and slightly detached aura. The main subject is positioned slightly to the center, with her body and part of her arms in the center. The background is a pure light gray-white wall with slight light bokeh effects, creating a soft and dreamy atmosphere. The composition uses a vertical proportion, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame, forming the visual center, with soft and even light and shadow. It creates a natural transition between light and dark, with delicate shadows that are not abrupt. The overall color tone is mainly cool gray, giving the image a delicate and realistic texture, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens. It delivers high-resolution detail performance, presenting a tranquil beauty casually captured in daily life, while also refinedly reminiscent of artistic portrait photography. The style is close to film photography's grainy texture and soft colors, making it suitable for mobile wallpapers or social media profile pictures.",
