        {
          "id": "krea2-5f20174a1eddd8d5cad6d0ab",
          "alias": "单女黑旗袍庭院愤怒蹲",
          "prompt": "A woman squats in an outdoor courtyard, wearing a black sleeveless modified qipao. The high slit at the hem reveals her long legs, with delicate embroidery patterns on the neckline and shoulders. The overall look is elegant and modern, with a light-colored rose ornament pinned in her bun. She wears a gold watch strap and green bracelet on her wrist, black patent leather pointed stiletto heels with metal clasps on the upper, exuding a calm and confident posture. In the foreground are mottled red brick walls and several ceramic jars, which look somewhat worn and show signs of weathering In the middle shot, the woman is the main subject, positioned slightly to the left of the frame. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the figure's figure and temperament. The background is a gray-white cement wall covered with white tiles, with some areas showing stains and peeling. On the right, a door frame adorned with colorful decorations can be seen, with green tree branches and leaves extending from the upper left corner above. The lush branches and foliage create natural light and shadow shading, and sunlight filters through the leaves, casting soft spots. The light is bright but not glaring, presenting a warm afternoon atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly black, gray, and brown. Dotted with green plants and pale pink flowers, it creates a retro, nostalgic, yet fashionable visual effect. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if taken by a casual camera, with slight graininess and natural exposure. The composition is layered, emphasizing the fusion of Eastern aesthetics and modern fashion. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, full of life and artistic flair",
