          "prompt": "She wears a leopard-print camisole corset paired with a gray fluffy mini skirt, black platform ankle boots, and a black heart-shaped pendant necklace hanging around her neck. She leans sideways toward the camera with her arms naturally extended. The background is a white wainscoting wall, with a wooden decorative table and a golden metal stand table placed on the table. On the table are several books and a potted greenery. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward view, with the figure occupying the left central position of the frame. It forms a visual focal point, with soft and even light coming from the left window, creating a warm and bright home atmosphere. The color palette mainly consists of off-white, gray-brown, and black, accented with leopard print patterns and green plants, presenting a warm and youthful vibe of everyday life. The photo texture resembles professional camera shooting, with clear details and natural light and shadow transitions, giving a realistic and artistic feel to everyday life.",
