        {
          "id": "krea2-8d8250743ac879f2f0b75834",
          "alias": "单女蓝旗袍婚礼沉思注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a deep blue sleeveless qipao with a high slit adorned with delicate white and light green floral embroidery patterns. The fabric has a delicate sheen, and the slim cut highlights an elegant figure. Her left hand is lightly clenched into a fist at her side, while her right hand hangs naturally. She wears a simple pearl bracelet on her wrist and transparent, stiletto sandals. Her overall posture is dignified and composed, with the main figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the painting, set against a background of a massive white beaded curtain installation. Countless fine white threads hang down from the top, interspersed with strings of white pearls of various sizes, forming a dense vertical pattern. Behind the bead curtain is the three-dimensional pearl spelling \"KEADA,\" with letters made from dense round pearls with slightly reflective edges, creating a luxurious texture. The foreground is a smooth light gray floor that reflects subtle reflections of the figure and background. The middle ground is the space between the figure and the beaded curtain, where light and shadow create a soft transition of light and shadow, while the background is completely occupied by the bead curtain and brand logo. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure at the visual focal point. The vertical lines of the beaded curtain guide the gaze upward to converge onto the brand logo, creating a strong sense of depth. Light comes from the upper front, evenly and softly illuminating the subject, while delicate highlights and shadows are created on the beaded curtain, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly white, deep blue, and pearl white, with sharp contrast yet harmonious unity. The image is full of sophistication and ceremony, resembling a live shoot of a fashion show or brand event. It features professional studio lighting effects while preserving the natural texture and authentic details of everyday amateur shooting, presenting an artistic atmosphere that is both refined and full of life's charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
