        {
          "id": "krea2-df0765226607fc0eead06b19",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙室内温柔坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, wearing a white high-neck, tight-fitting long-sleeve top made of smooth, hugging her figure. She wears a black high-waisted skirt below, with one side of the skirt slightly opening to reveal her leg lines. Her right hand is dressed in white gloves, with black decorative details on her wrist. Her left hand gently strokes her thigh, her posture elegant yet slightly lazy. Her legs are crossed, and she wears black thin-strap high-heeled sandals. A delicate tattoo pattern is visible at the ankle. The overall look is fashionable and distinctive, with light beige vertical pleated curtains in the background, soft light streaming in from the side. A warm gradient of light and shadow forms on the walls and the subject, with the beam casting delicate vertical shadows on the curtains, creating a quiet and intimate atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, body slightly tilted, head slightly raised, and light mainly coming from the left, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The overall color palette is mainly warm white, beige, and black, harmoniously unified, presenting a visual effect that blends sophistication with everyday life, similar to portraits shot with a professional camera, with a slight grainy texture of film The background blur is handled well, making the subject stand out more and the painting is full of artistic atmosphere and a sense of everyday beauty",
