        {
          "id": "krea2-b55c9b7b5d91a6b225c35691",
          "alias": "单女灰西装酒吧严肃倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a gray suit, wearing a light-colored shirt and black stockings, wearing black high heels, gracefully leans against a bar with a golden metal frame. Her left hand gently rests on the counter, while her right hand holds a black high heel. Her legs are crossed, showing off her slender lines and confident demeanor. She wears exquisite earrings and slightly turns her head to look back at the camera. Her overall look is sharp and charming. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the center-left position of the frame, with the bar counter, golden table legs, and a white mug featuring a moon motif in the center. The background features bright floor-to-ceiling windows and a blurred outdoor scene. Light streams in through the windows, creating a soft backlighting effect that creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned on the left side of the frame, while the blank space on the right emphasizes the sense of space. Visual guidance naturally leads the audience through the characters' postures and line of sight. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with sharp contrasts of light and shadow. The overall color scheme is mainly gray, white, and gold, accented with dark tones, presenting a sense of sophistication and modern urban atmosphere, as if shot indoors with a professional camera. It captures a real and moving moment, with the texture of everyday amateur equipment. The image is delicate, details are clear, the atmosphere is quiet and elegant, full of the independence and composure of a professional woman",
