        {
          "id": "krea2-4cb251e65d98b824f8cf6fce",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙自信站立",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a white spaghetti strap dress stands before a mottled concrete wall covered in green vines, slightly turning to look back at the camera. Her expression is calm yet slightly lazy, her left hand gently supporting the hem of her skirt, her right leg elegantly raised, wearing a pair of thick-soled velvet ankle boots with brownish-yellow thick-soled ankles. The boots reach up to her calves and have thick, heavy heels. The overall look blends freshness with a retro feel. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the middle frame, composed in a vertical layout, with the figure occupying the main space. Vines hang down from the wall, winding down and covering the surface. Natural textures and layers are formed, with dense green leafy plants in the background. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled light and shadow, creating a soft contrast between light and shadow. Light comes from above, creating a warm and bright afternoon atmosphere. The foreground features a flat gray floor that forms a clear horizontal line with the wall. The visual guide naturally leads from the figure's posture and leg-raising movements to the body's curves and foot details. The overall color scheme is mainly white, green, and gray, accented with warm brown tones, presenting a tranquil, natural, and lifelike realistic style. It feels as if you're shooting with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, preserving authentic texture and slight graininess. The images are full of storytelling and emotional tension, combining fashion with a sense of everyday intimacy",
