        {
          "id": "krea2-acb2ffa4ac2cb9c98ccb5b3c",
          "alias": "单女灰长裤山野冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the foreground of a traditional wooden balcony, dressed in a black tight-fitting short-sleeved top and loose gray pants. She turns to the side and smiles back, her posture natural and elegant. Her right hand rests lightly on the rough, dark wooden railing, her wrist wears a simple bracelet, and her body leans slightly, showing soft curves and a relaxed demeanor. In the background are a cluster of layered Miao stilted houses, gray tiles and blue bricks, wooden structures built layer upon layer along the mountain. In the distance, the green hills are lush and lush, the slopes are densely wooded, the sky is overcast, and the light is soft and even. The overall color tone leans toward a cool tone, creating a tranquil and distant atmosphere. On the nearby balcony, several pots of blooming purple bougainvillea are placed among the green plants, creating visual highlights. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, with the left side left blank to showcase the magnificent village landscape. Wooden pillars and eaves form a natural frame, guiding the gaze into the distance. The light and shadow are natural, with no strong contrast, presenting a sense of realism for everyday shooting, as if captured with a regular camera in the early morning or afternoon, preserving the atmosphere of daily life and cultural warmth The overall composition combines the rich texture of ethnic customs with the relaxed and casual charm of modern life, conveying a tranquil, comfortable, and poetic travel moment.",
