        {
          "id": "krea2-2d52e8701c0f942662df3176",
          "alias": "单女长裤雪地冷淡伸展",
          "prompt": "A red-haired woman bends over and stretches in the snow, wearing a black tight long-sleeve top and gradient-colored leggings. The pants transition from deep purple on the hips to bright orange-red on the legs, highlighting her body lines and athletic beauty. She wears black platform Martin boots on soft snow, slightly tilting her head to look at the camera. The background is a white fence under a clear blue sky and the outline of a distant house. The sunlight is bright, with light streaming down from the upper left, casting clear shadows on the snow. The overall composition is bright and contrasting, with the figure centered slightly to the right. Using low-angle downward shots to highlight body curves and posture tension, the foreground features delicate snow textures and boot indentations, the middle ground shows the body's full body movement, background blur reduces details to preserve the ambiance, light and shadow layers are rich, and the interplay of cool and warm tones creates a winter outdoor vibe that coexists with warmth, reminiscent of amateur camera authenticity, with slight noise and natural exposure, presenting moments full of power and beauty in everyday life",
