          "alias": "单女白外套室内站立比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the center of the indoor scene, her makeup exquisite, hands making two V-shaped gestures in front of her chest, striking a natural and friendly pose. She wears a white stand-collar short jacket printed with delicate black-and-white floral patterns, paired with a black ribbed knit inner layer and a high-waisted black long skirt. The skirt sides are decorated with silver metal buttons, giving the overall look elegant and modern. The foreground features the main figure at the center of the composition, while in the middle you can see blurred green plants and the outlines of wooden tables and chairs. The background is a soft pinkish-purple gradient wall, with warm yellow striped lights above In the distance, you can faintly see the silhouette of a traditional Chinese building. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with figures standing out in the center. Light and shadow come from the front soft lighting, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The overall image has a delicate texture and harmonious colors, presenting a sense of realism and artistic beauty reminiscent of daily variety show recordings or fashion portraits. It has the clarity and layering of professional studio photography, while retaining a warm, everyday atmosphere",
