          "alias": "单女摄影棚冷淡手持物",
          "prompt": "The gold embroidery and silver armor details are exquisite. She holds a longsword, the hilt is deep blue with gold decorations, the blade reflecting a cold glow. The right hand grips the hilt tightly, while the left hand lightly touches the blade. The background is a soft light gray curtain, with a blurred effect that creates a dreamlike atmosphere. In the middle shot, layers of white fabric can be faintly seen. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main subject, highlighting her movements and expressions, with light and shadow coming from the left. This creates a contrast of light and shadow, making the character outlines clear. The overall atmosphere is solemn and mysterious, tinged with classical fantasy elements, like shooting in a professional studio. Using a large-aperture lens captures delicate textures and layers, presenting an artistic style for everyday amateur equipment. The lighting is soft and even, the tone is cool, emphasizing the blue and white main color scheme to create a noble and cool knight image",
