        {
          "id": "krea2-21674ec66466b536197d2022",
          "alias": "单女黑长裤城市忧伤喝",
          "prompt": "She wears a light gray hooded sweatshirt with red letters printed on the chest, paired with black skinny pants and black-and-white sneakers. Her ankles show white mid-calf socks, and she carries a small black leather bag with a gold chain strap. The overall look is casual and fashionable, with a glass curtain wall cluster of modern urban skyscrapers in the background, and dense trees and flower beds scattered in the distance. The sky is gloomy and grayish-white, with soft and even lighting. The composition centers on the figure, shot at a low angle. The foreground features clear grassy details, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background features blurred buildings and trees, creating a distinct sense of spatial layering. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is tranquil with a slight sense of urban detachment, presenting a tranquil moment full of youthful energy in daily life. It carries a slight film texture and a realistic life recording style, resembling a real scene shot with an ordinary phone in the afternoon, with natural tones. Rich in detail, rich in storytelling and immersion",
