        {
          "id": "krea2-28ca2b303d99ea16a043cede",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙广场坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a beige carpet in front of a light gray fabric sofa, wearing a V-neck long-sleeve dress with a pale yellow base and deep blue floral patterns. The dress features pleats at the waist and ties a thin strap made of matching fabric. The sleeves are puff-sleeved, giving the overall look elegant and layered. She is holding a white smartphone in her right hand for a selfie, with the phone camera pointed at herself. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, and she wears beige patent leather flats with gold square metal buttons on the toe of the shoes, her makeup exquisite. The background features a simple gray-brown wall, with a pink flower-shaped plush cushion and a blue-and-white penguin plush on the sofa. The composition centers on the figure, using a mid-angle perspective where the figure occupies the main subject. The light is soft and even, coming from the front slightly left, creating a warm and bright indoor atmosphere. The overall color tone is fresh and natural, evoking the warmth of daily life and a slight studio-like feel. The details are rich, the transitions between light and shadow are delicate, presenting a realistic and refined home selfie scene. It has a slight film texture and a low-saturation color tendency, as if it were high-quality life documentary captured with a professional camera in soft light",
