          "id": "krea2-3b92983fd622634c441216b4",
          "alias": "单女白制服走廊媚态跪摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on the gray carpet in the indoor corridor, wearing a white short-sleeved uniform shirt and a deep blue tight mini skirt. She has a gold wing badge on her left chest, her makeup exquisite, her right hand gently resting on the wooden door panel on the right, her left hand naturally resting on her knee, wearing a silver bracelet. Black stockings with lace trim make her pose elegant yet slightly provocative. The background is a simple indoor corridor, with beige walls and wooden door panels creating warm tones. The floor is covered with a gray-yellow geometric carpet, providing soft and even lighting. The overall composition uses a medium portrait. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with a slightly tilted body to create dynamic balance, which extends to body language. The layers of light and shadow are distinct, shadows transition softly, and the atmosphere is quiet and private, exuding the professionalism and sensual charm of a professional woman, presenting a style that combines the realism and artistry of everyday amateur equipment shooting",
