        {
          "id": "krea2-98f7971fcf7f495997676cda",
          "alias": "单女灰长裤户外站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a lush greenery, exuding a natural and fresh aura. She wears a loose white long-sleeved top made of light, soft material with a texture of pleats and flowing texture. One side of the hem is tied with a white drawstring forming an asymmetrical design, paired with a fitted light gray skinny pants that highlight her slender figure. Her hands are gently raised behind her head, her posture relaxed and elegant, and a delicate gold necklace around her neck adds a touch of detail and beauty. The foreground features blurred green grass and parts of the ground, the middle ground clearly presents the main subject, and the background features blurred tree branches and faintly visible white architectural structures. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect on and around the figures. The light is soft and warm, presenting the natural light of early morning or evening. The overall composition uses a centered composition, with the figure standing out in the center. The background blur treatment creates a strong sense of depth, with white, light gray, and green as the main tones, fresh and elegant. Filled with a tranquil and healing atmosphere, the images have the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. Slight noise and natural exposure transitions enhance the texture of the real world, as if capturing a tranquil moment under the afternoon sun. The overall style combines the vibe of everyday life with artistic beauty, conveying a relaxed, gentle, and serene mood.",
