        {
          "id": "krea2-2795d020b89809cf12124e2a",
          "alias": "单女金毛衣公园沉思坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a park bench, wearing a blue and yellow striped short-sleeved knit top and light blue jeans. She slightly tilts her head to the right side of the frame, her expression calm and thoughtful. Her right hand rests lightly on the chair's backrest, while her left hand rests naturally on her thigh, her posture relaxed and elegant. In the foreground is a brown wooden bench and sturdy willow trunks, with willow branches hanging down forming a natural green curtain. In the middle is the calm lake reflecting distant buildings and green trees. Several yellow boats float on the water, with hazy distant mountains and the outline of the park's buildings in the background. The composition uses the rule of thirds, with the figure positioned on the left side of the frame. The viewer's gaze guides them toward the open lake on the right. The light and shadow are soft and warm, presenting mottled points of afternoon sunlight filtering through the leaves. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and pleasant, full of life's vitality, like a natural moment captured with a daily phone. The tones are fresh and natural, details are realistic and delicate, with a slight film texture and slight noise, creating a gentle, lazy, and poetic urban leisure scene",
