        {
          "id": "krea2-d24f893558755a17b18ed1a4",
          "alias": "单女黑衬衫摄影棚自信坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a black satin shirt and a deep blue high-waisted slit skirt sits upright on an off-white fabric bench. Her makeup is exquisite, her left hand resting lightly on the edge of the bench, her right hand naturally resting on her knee, legs crossed, presenting an elegant and confident posture. She wears dark green pointed high heels, with delicate silk stockings. The overall look is sharp yet soft. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the left central position of the composition, while in the center are a light gray fabric bench, a round black glass coffee table, and on it are white plates, silver tableware, and a red apple. The background is a modern, minimalist interior space, including light gray brick walls, beige sofas, blue-gray carpets with botanical patterns, and wooden floors. The composition uses low-angle shots, with figures extending from bottom to top, creating a strong visual direction. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and warm, with the main light source coming from the right front, creating delicate transitions between highlights and shadows, creating a tranquil atmosphere that blends sophistication and privacy. The overall color palette is dominated by black, white, gray, and blue, accented with red and green, creating harmonious and unified colors, rich details in the image, and a realistic texture. It presents a professional studio-level portrait effect, with cinematic narrative and artistic atmosphere",
