        {
          "id": "krea2-e2b9d21bcae7f74e35cf5dd5",
          "alias": "单女绿连衣裙困倦手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in exquisite ancient-style Hanfu wore a magnificent golden phoenix headdress, adorned with tiny gemstones and tassels. Her makeup was fresh and elegant, with a slightly mysterious and gentle expression. She wore a light green sheer long dress made of light and transparent fabric, embroidered with green vine patterns. The neckline and cuffs were decorated with exquisite beaded strings and embroidery, and a gold-threaded brocade belt was tied around her waist. The skirt was flowing and layered, Her right hand gently holds a blue-and-black butterfly, which rests at her fingertips, its wings slightly spread. Her left hand hangs naturally, palm facing upward, as if receiving some kind of spiritual entity. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with an elegant posture and a slightly turned body forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The middle frame shows the woman's clothing details and hand movements. The background is a blurry outdoor forest path, with the ground covered in fallen leaves. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled light and shadow, creating soft halos and shadows. The composition uses close-ups. Using shallow depth to blur the background, it enhances the subject's three-dimensionality and visual focus. Light shines from above to create a natural contrast of light and dark. The folds of clothing exhibit delicate light and shadow effects, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and dreamy, infused with classical fairy charm and poetic beauty. The color tones are mainly turquoise and golden, paired with warm and cool contrasts, creating an extraordinary atmosphere, as if a fairy from ancient mythology has descended to earth. The image texture is delicate, color saturation moderate, and it has a sophisticated photographic and artistic atmosphere. Like high-quality portraits taken by professional photographers with medium format cameras in natural light, full of storytelling and immersion",
