        {
          "id": "krea2-f4fae6bf91f816cb60cb51b1",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服床俏皮坐",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a deep blue sailor uniform sits on a Japanese-style tatami mat covered with blue-and-white checkered pillows. She wears round glasses, her left hand resting lightly on the pillow, her right hand naturally placed at her side, ankles crossed and raised, wearing black stockings. Her posture is relaxed and slightly playful, presenting an overall youthful campus vibe; The foreground features a clear close-up of a pillow and her hands, rich in detail. In the background, you can see wooden bookshelves, globes, plush toys, and cork boards covered with photos, creating a warm and intimate room atmosphere. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure centered to form a visual focal point. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, with clear layers and soft warm lighting. Natural light streams in from the left window, creating a peaceful and comfortable afternoon atmosphere. The overall image has the texture of a realistic shot. It feels like everyday moments captured with an amateur camera, with warm tones, moderate color saturation, and intact detail preservation, slight film graininess, and slight lens distortion, enhancing realism and a sense of life",
