        {
          "id": "krea2-bf2228e5a51f6f978123d780",
          "alias": "单女长裤车库自信站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside a white Tesla Model Y in an outdoor parking lot. She wears an off-white tight long-sleeve top paired with matching high-waisted pants, a white thin camisole underneath, and a black-and-white striped knit sweater at her waist as decoration. She carries a bright green shoulder bag over her shoulder, smiles gently at the camera, and looks gracefully confident. The foreground clearly shows the main figure and parts of the vehicle, the middle is the rear of the car and some building column structures, and the background features a tree-lined park walkway and distant blurred pedestrians. The composition uses the center-left main figure to visually balance the vehicle on the right. The car's lines guide the gaze, and sunlight pours in from above, creating a soft and bright natural lighting effect. The overall atmosphere is fresh and natural, full of urban life, presenting the realism and fashion of everyday street photography. Shot with a Canon EOS R5 camera with a 24-70mm f/2.8 lens, shutter speed of 1/125 sec, ISO 100, f/4 aperture, capturing real-life moments with moderate color saturation. Rich in details, delicate texture, and possessing strong visual appeal and artistic expression",
