        {
          "id": "krea2-9f42de885a3138b4cd5d20f8",
          "alias": "单女制服庭院站立",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in pale pink Hanfu stands gracefully at the center of the frame, slightly turning to glance back. The umbrella is lightweight, with its ribs clearly visible. The edge is slightly tilted, shielding the figure from sunlight and creating a soft light and shadow effect. Her Hanfu is mainly made of light gauze, with wide, flowing sleeves, delicate embroidery at the collar and waist, and colors interwoven with pink, gold, and blue. A wide pink ribbon is tied around the waist, tied into a bow, the hem layered like a cloud, light as clouds. The background is a blurred stone wall or a corner of a courtyard, with a dark gray tone creating a strong contrast that highlights the main subject. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space. The shallow depth of field blurs the background, with light coming from above, soft and bright, like spring afternoon sunlight. The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, full of classical poetry. The texture is delicate, the colors are soft and uniform, presenting a serene and beautiful Eastern aesthetic conception. It looks like an ancient-style portrait, combining artistic flair with a sense of everyday life",
