        {
          "id": "krea2-351fd25a5735c56504a29830",
          "alias": "单女户外微笑持相机",
          "prompt": "She elegantly turns sideways to look back at the camera, smiling, showing a healthy and energetic figure. In the foreground are withered autumn leaf branches, partially blocking the lower left corner of the frame. In the middle is rolling mountains covered with colorful autumn vegetation. Green, orange, and yellow intertwine to create rich color layers. In the distant valley, faint town-building clusters can be seen, layered and stretching to the horizon. The sky is grayish-white with a slight mist. It creates a hazy and profound sense of space. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame, while the left side is blank to highlight the sense of space. The visual guide naturally transitions from the withered leaves in the foreground to the character, then extends to distant mountains and towns, forming a clear visual flow. The light and shadows are soft and even, scattered on cloudy days without strong shadows. The overall atmosphere is quiet and open, full of natural vibes and a lifelike outdoor photography texture, as if captured by a regular camera in a real environment. The tones are warm and authentic, with rich details. It offers both the authenticity and artistic beauty of daily documentation",
