        {
          "id": "krea2-9c18ea37c7ea97f49747c146",
          "alias": "单女白T恤海滩站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a seaside pier, gently stroking the back of her head with both hands, leaning slightly forward, showing a naturally relaxed posture. She wears a white lace-trimmed camisole top and high-waisted denim shorts, with a clear abdominal line. The overall look is simple yet fashionable, adding a touch of softness and spontaneity. The background is the open sea and distant rolling green mountains. The sky is deep blue, dotted with a few fluffy white clouds. On the right, an orange boat is moored on the water. Below the frame, a metal chain railing can be faintly seen, and sunlight pours in from the upper right, creating soft side lighting, with natural transitions of light and shadow, creating a warm and bright summer atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, leaving enough space to showcase the expansiveness and tranquility of the background, creating a sense of layering between front and back. The overall color tone is fresh and bright, with a realistic texture reminiscent of everyday shooting, as if captured casually with a regular camera, preserving the atmosphere of life and authentic light and shadow, presenting a relaxed and pleasant seaside vacation atmosphere.",
