        {
          "id": "krea2-3dd313a523f14bd53ec5700f",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫博物馆站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman is taking a selfie in a car showroom, her makeup exquisite, wearing an off-white silk tie-up shirt with a low neckline tied in a bow. The sleeves are made of semi-transparent tulle material, paired with a gray polka-dot mini skirt that fits her figure tightly. She wears light blue pointed stiletto heels with a bow on the upper of the shoe and a pearl bracelet on her wrist. She stands gracefully sideways, holding her phone in her right hand for a selfie, her body slightly leaning forward. The background is a blurred car showroom environment, with several black sedans neatly arranged, their bright paint reflecting the surrounding light. The floor is made of smooth gray tiles, with the overall composition using close-ups. Figures occupy most of the space, with a slightly lower perspective to highlight the main subject. The background is blurred to create depth of field, and light and shadow are evenly illuminated from the ceiling of the exhibition hall, soft and bright. The atmosphere is modern and fashionable, combining commercial flair with personal charm. The image texture is delicate and color harmonious, presenting a refined lifestyle vibe of urban women",
