        {
          "id": "krea2-d59b2c5cca1bb39c8a89da3b",
          "alias": "单女蓝背心城市冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white plush carpet, wearing a deep blue sleeveless top and a gray short skirt, paired with light-colored stockings and fine-rimmed glasses. She gazes intently at the silver Apple laptop in front of her, her left hand gently resting on the edge of the table, her right hand naturally resting on the floor, a work badge with a red tag hanging around her neck, and a pure white wall as the background, creating a minimalist yet bright space. In the foreground is a minimalist white round table with slender golden legs, on which sits an open laptop. The composition centers on the figure, using a slightly upward-looking perspective to highlight the subject. The lighting is soft and even, with natural light coming from the left in the foreground, creating delicate shadows. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, professional, and carries a touch of homely warmth. The color palette is mainly cool white, accented with gold and deep blue, presenting everyday moments from modern urban life. It feels like a realistic indoor photo taken with a professional camera, rich in details and layers, emphasizing authenticity and transitions of light and shadow.",
