        {
          "id": "krea2-9c3f0870ed20bdc01849ac21",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣秋叶坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits beside the outdoor stone steps. The edges of the maple leaves are slightly curled, with veins clearly visible, presenting a natural autumn feel. She wears an off-white loose knit cardigan with delicate texture, naturally folded pleats at the cuffs, and a light-colored floral dress underneath. The hem features elegant floral patterns, making the overall outfit warm and comfortable. The background is rough gray cement walls and tree trunks, with faint green plants dotting the left. The ground is paved with stone paved paths, and sunlight slanting down from the upper right, creating rich layers of light and shadow. Creating a warm and tranquil autumn atmosphere, the composition uses medium shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, gazing toward the lens. Maple leaves serve as a visual guide element to highlight the theme. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and gray-brown, harmoniously unified and realistic like everyday amateur camera photography. The lighting is natural, details are clear, and the image is full of life and artistic beauty, as if capturing a leisurely afternoon moment, presenting a tranquil and beautiful everyday photography style",
