        {
          "id": "krea2-8da60077982db0d2f624864f",
          "alias": "单女透视米连衣裙室内坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a modern-style indoor setting, wearing a light beige off-shoulder short-sleeve dress paired with matching high heels and sheer stockings. A blue lanyard hangs around her neck, wearing glasses, and she looks at the camera with a natural expression, elegant and relaxed. Her right hand gently supports the black cushion, while her left hand adjusts the high heels on her feet. Her leg lines are smooth, presenting a beauty that blends everyday elegance and refinement. The foreground presents her sitting posture, including her body, hand movements, and foot details. In the middle is a white plush chair and black square cushions. Next to it is a small round table framed with a black metal frame, on which sits a pot of withered plants and some documents. The background features gray terrazzo walls and dark gray columns. Beside the wall stands a large green palm plant. To the right is a black metal shelf with hanging green plants and several boxes of white-packaged items. The overall spatial design is simple and modern, with color palettes of gray, white, Black is the main theme, accented with green plants to bring vitality. The composition uses a center-left main figure, with diagonal lines guiding the view. The figure contrasts with the environment yet harmoniously unifies it. Light and shadow come from the soft indoor lighting above, creating a warm and realistic atmosphere. Shadows fall on the floor and walls, enhancing the spatial sense of three-dimensionality. The overall image presents a carefully captured moment from daily life, full of realism and vitality, as if taken with a high-quality amateur camera. With a slight film texture and natural noise, moderate color saturation, rich detail, and clear layering, it conveys a tranquil, comfortable, and slightly fashionable urban lifestyle aesthetic",
