        {
          "id": "krea2-0f4497f20d6b9d17902b9e80",
          "alias": "单女蓝礼服摄影棚媚态躺",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways on a soft off-white velvet sofa, wearing a deep blue sequined strapless gown with slender straps, a smooth and elegant back line adding a touch of laziness and sensuality. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with warm yellow light streaming in from one side, creating soft layers of light and shadow. Light casts delicate shadows on her skin and dress, creating a tranquil yet luxurious atmosphere. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the frame. The camera is slightly tilted to enhance visual dynamics. The colors are deep blue and black, paired with off-white and warm yellow halos to create a warm and cool contrast. Light and shadow shine diagonally from the left, highlighting texture. The edges of the frame have slight dark corners to strengthen the central subject, presenting a high-end feel of professional studio shooting, while preserving the natural texture of everyday amateur equipment. It seems to capture a private and authentic moment; the overall atmosphere is tranquil, elegant, and story-rich, with cinematic narrative tension.",
