        {
          "id": "krea2-5aeabb7239c169f7ab492b04",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙水边坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a wooden pavilion by the lake, wearing a pink spaghetti strap dress paired with a white knit cardigan. She gracefully turns sideways to look back at the camera, barefoot resting lightly on the edge of the wooden platform. Her legs are smooth and natural, presenting an overall sense of relaxation and romance in daily life. In the foreground, blooming pink cherry blossom branches stretch diagonally from above the frame, with dense and vibrant flowers. Some petals flutter gently in the wind, adding a touch of poetry and dreaminess to the scene. In the middle is a small round table covered with a white tablecloth next to the woman, with exquisite glass dessert bowls and fruit platters placed beside it. Next to it is a small wooden seasoning bottle, rich in details but not cluttered. The background is a calm, wide lake, reflecting the pale blue sky and the hazy outline of a bridge in the distance. The bridge structure is clearly visible but far apart, creating a distinct sense of spatial layering. The composition uses the center-right central position of the main figure, using cherry blossom branches in the foreground to form a natural framework while maintaining a relaxed lower body posture, creating visual balance and beauty. The light and shadow come from soft natural light in the morning or evening, with sunlight slanting from the left side. Delicate shadows transition through the folds of clothing, and cherry blossom petals have a semi-transparent texture when translucent. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, warm, and full of spring's vibe. The color palette is mainly pink-white, complemented by the blue-gray tones of lake water and the warm brown of the wood structure. The colors are harmonious and unified, presenting a realistic feeling similar to amateur camera shooting, as if capturing beautiful moments casually during travel. The lens slightly blurs the scenes, It preserves everyday details and imperfect realism, making the entire composition both artistic and aesthetically pleasing while maintaining the warmth and warmth of everyday life",
