        {
          "id": "krea2-52f2ce03cac2ac8f25c1ed52",
          "alias": "单女户外微笑持相机（2）",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman reveals a gentle smile. Her right hand gently holds a transparent four-leaf clover-shaped glass ornament. The leaves glow gently in the sunlight, presenting a crystal-clear texture. On the left side of the painting, several fresh green leaves hang down, forming a natural foreground frame. The leaf edges are clear and the veins distinct, with a blurred green plant background creating a bokeh effect and a tranquil outdoor atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center. The head is slightly tilted, with light coming from above, creating soft highlights and natural shadow transitions. The layers of light and shadow are rich, and the overall tone is mainly warm yellow-green, full of vitality and poetry. The image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and color saturation, as if shot with an old camera in the afternoon sunlight, capturing a quiet and beautiful moment and creating a fresh, romantic, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The details are exquisite and the emotions sincere, like a life-oriented artistic portrait.",
