        {
          "id": "krea2-78b536b673152b47623f7a0b",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙冷淡",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a white lace spaghetti strap long dress with delicate three-dimensional pleats, delicate shoulder straps, ruffled decorations on the chest, and a waist tie with hollowed-out cutouts. The skirt was light and flowing, featuring delicate embossed patterns. The overall look was elegant and layered. She leaned elegantly against a thick tree trunk, her right hand gently stroking the hem, her left hand naturally hanging down, her body slightly turned to the side, creating a soft S-shaped curve. The foreground features drooping willow branches and a few green leaves, partially obscuring the scene to create a hazy beauty. The middle ground features a female subject and tree trunks, while the background is a dense green forest. The blur process creates soft green light spots. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly to the right, with light and shadow coming from above and left, creating soft natural light. Light penetrates the leaves, casting mottled shadows on her body. The overall atmosphere is fresh and tranquil, full of poetry and romance, as if immersed in a secret summer forest retreat. The color palette is mainly white and green. The contrast between warm and cool is sharp, details are rich, texture is authentic, and it exudes a sense of sophistication and artistic flair. The shooting style resembles professional portrait photography, using a large-aperture lens with a shallow depth of field to highlight the subject, moderate color saturation, and transparent and bright images, presenting a dreamlike visual effect",
