          "prompt": "A woman wearing a light purple short-sleeved school uniform shirt and a dark blue pleated skirt, wearing a dark blue tie, sits on the outdoor floor paved with stone slabs, legs crossed, hands naturally resting on knees, and gently holding a black vintage leather suitcase in her left hand. The background is a blurred courtyard or campus environment, with green plants and building outlines visible. The depth of field is shallow, and the foreground clearly highlights the main subject. The middle frame features green plants and walls with blurred background, further blurring to form a soft bokeh. The overall composition uses a center shot, with the figure centered slightly to the left. The lighting is natural, soft outdoor light coming from the front side, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The transitions between light and shadow are delicate, shadows are soft, the tone is fresh and elegant, with a slight film texture and the graininess of everyday shooting. The overall image presents a tranquil beauty of a youthful campus, as if taken with a regular camera on a clear afternoon in a documentary-style photo, rich in detail and distinct layers. It has a sense of authenticity and a sense of everyday life",
