        {
          "id": "krea2-ceb224324a7ac39b12261121",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙户外微笑倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a light-colored sequin spaghetti strap dress, leaning sideways on a light blue curved structure, wearing a gentle smile that looks vivid and sweet. The dress is made of lightweight tulle adorned with tiny golden sequins that sparkle like stars in the light. The shoulder straps are inlaid with rhinestones, with exquisite details. The foreground features the main figure occupying the main position in the frame, with a close-up composition. The middle ground features a blurred light blue arc background structure, forming clean geometric lines that guide the viewer to focus on the figure. The background is a blurred green lawn, creating a fresh outdoor atmosphere. The overall lighting is bright and soft, coming from natural daylight, presenting a warm and transparent texture. The colors are mainly light blue, white, and green, with rich visual layers and harmonious tones. The images convey the natural feel and life atmosphere of everyday shooting, as if shot with a professional camera on a sunny daytime, capturing a peaceful and beautiful moment. The lens is slightly out of focus to enhance the hazy beauty, and the composition is slightly tilted, adding movement and approachability, creating a relaxed and pleasant overall atmosphere. Full of youthful energy and gentle temperament",
