        {
          "id": "krea2-5c96dd52a4bf5f761c847b04",
          "alias": "单女灰外套街道忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by a Parisian-style iron railing on a balcony, draped in a fluffy, heavy gray-and-white fox fur coat, paired with a black top and white stockings, beige flats, legs crossed, her posture lazy yet elegant, head slightly tilted, revealing a hint of melancholy and contemplation. She leans against a small round table in dark gray metal, on which sits a white ceramic cup and two silver ashtrays. The background is a typical Parisian Haussmann-style facade, with beige stone walls adorned with delicate decorative lines and a black wrought iron balcony. The distant street stretches into a hazy sky, with a grayish-white hue. The overall lighting is soft and even, presenting a cool, overcast winter afternoon. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the left side, slightly tilted to create a sense of layering between front and back. The foreground features a black cast iron railing with intricate patterns, the middle ground features the figures and tabletops, and the background features deep street scenes and architectural clusters. The light and shadow are delicate and the shadows soft, with an overall cool tone, mainly gray, white, and black, accented with a touch of beige and metallic sheen, creating a quiet, detached, and slightly nostalgic urban life atmosphere, with the authentic texture of everyday street photography and the atmosphere of an art film",
