        {
          "id": "krea2-3f8c0f57a31ba5e458cf2d7c",
          "alias": "单女椅上忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor bench, in a quiet and contemplative state. The garment has a delicate texture and clearly visible texture. The overall look is simple yet full of life's vibe. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with the body slightly tilted and the head slightly tilted, forming an elegant S-shaped curve. The background is a blurred city street or park path, with the road surface and distant scenery blurred presenting a soft blue-gray tone, creating a cool-toned atmosphere of dusk or early morning. Light shines diagonally from the upper left, creating a natural transition between light and dark. The shadows are delicate and not abrupt. The overall composition uses medium shots and large-aperture lenses to create a distinct shallow depth of field. The foreground is a partial wooden bench, with clean edge lines that echo the figure's posture. The visual guide line is formed by the person's gaze direction and body contours, with rich light and shadow layers, mainly cool blue and gray colors. White clothing accents create visual highlights, creating an overall atmosphere that is quiet, gentle, and slightly lonely, with the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment. It feels like a chance encounter on the street, capturing the most natural state of the subject. The overall image is full of storytelling and emotional tension.",
