        {
          "id": "krea2-a120b3e26255b29c138d458b",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫街道沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a black metal railing on a city balcony, her left hand naturally hanging down, nails painted red, wearing a gold thin chain necklace and bracelet, a black turtleneck tight short-sleeved top paired with dark jeans, and a wide black belt with multiple round holes and metal rings around her waist. The overall look is fashionable and street-style. Her posture is relaxed and confident, her body slightly tilted, head slightly tilted, expression somewhat lazy and contemplative, foreground with a clear railing and body silhouette. The middle ground is the balcony space where she stands and the distant blurred city buildings. The background features multi-story residential buildings and faintly visible hill outlines. The sky is pale blue, with soft and even light, resembling natural light in the early morning or evening. Light and shadow shine from the upper left. The overall composition uses the centered right position of the figure, using railing lines to guide the viewer's focus on the subject. The blurred background highlights the character's three-dimensionality and layering, with black, gray, and blue as the main colors, accented by gold accessories and red nail polish. It creates a sense of everyday beauty and artistic atmosphere in urban life, like a casual street snap moment, full of realism and the vibe of everyday life. The image texture is delicate and detailed, presenting a visual experience that blends fashion and casual style",
