        {
          "id": "krea2-7a0f7688770a98f2c0e15d56",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市冷淡坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the edge of the rear of a black pickup truck, wearing a tailored black one-shoulder dress over a sharply tailored black blazer. The jacket is casually draped over her shoulders, revealing one shoulder and arm, presenting a casual yet refined sense of fashion. The overall look exudes the coolness and elegance of modern urban style. The foreground features the main figure occupying the center-left side of the frame, composed in medium shots and close-ups. The background is a blurry cluster of city skyscrapers, with glass curtain walls reflecting the gray-blue sky. In the distance, the silhouettes of other buildings can be faintly seen, creating a sense of urban detachment. Light comes from the diffuse glow of a cloudy day, softly and evenly casting on the figures, creating delicate shadow transitions. The overall color palette is dominated by black, gray, and blue, creating a strong cool atmosphere. The painting presents a calm, sophisticated, and slightly mysterious visual impression. It features professional studio lighting texture while still retaining authentic natural lighting, similar to shooting with a full-frame camera paired with a large-aperture lens. The out-of-focus blur effect is obvious, depth of field control is precise, and the image layers are distinct. It has strong visual guidance that draws viewers' attention. The overall style combines the refinement of a fashion blockbuster with the realism of everyday street photography, as if capturing a moment of tranquility before the city night.",
