        {
          "id": "krea2-563b495675db7510a9e0fd1e",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣街道蹲泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman squats on a city street, wearing a light green knit hooded sweatshirt. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, paired with white platform sneakers paired with white socks. The shoes are decorated with black geometric lines, creating a casual and fashionable overall look. The main focus is a close-up of the person, occupying the left central position. The middle shot shows the squatting posture and leg outlines, with a blurred city street in the background, the road extending into the distance, flanked by blurred trees and shrubs. In the distance, a white sedan and a pedestrian's silhouette can be seen. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle to enhance the character's presence, creating a visual flow from far to near. The light and shadow are soft and warm, with sunlight pouring from the side and top, creating delicate transitions between highlights and shadows. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and warm, full of spring vibes, with the authentic texture of everyday street photography. The colors are mainly light green, white, and gray, fresh and natural, with distinct layers, presenting a tranquil and vibrant urban life scene",
