        {
          "id": "krea2-c0562d2a14db1cb23cc928d8",
          "alias": "单女倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "In her right hand, she gently holds a basket of brightly colored flowers, filled with orange-red roses and white daisies. Sunlight slants down from the upper left of the frame, creating a soft backlit silhouette and a warm and bright atmosphere. Beside her is a gray cement road and yellow curbstones. The composition is shot from a low angle from below. The figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, with a body slightly leaning forward, forming a natural visual guiding line. The foreground clearly highlights the subject, the middle ground features a road and flower baskets, and the blurred background presents a street scene. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, with strong contrasts of light and shadow, presenting a warm and unintentional moment in daily life. It feels like a real scene captured by a regular camera in the afternoon sunlight, full of vitality and youthful beauty. The tones are warm, details are realistic, and the texture is delicate, with the graininess of film photography and the soft transition of natural light. The overall scene is tranquil and poetic",
