        {
          "id": "krea2-0dac6ddcee2572df0dd78565",
          "alias": "单女黑外套森林站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a forest path, her expression slightly calm and distant, exuding a natural youthful vibe. She wears a loose black hooded jacket with the \"CAMEL\" brand logo on her chest. Her backpack features a black-and-white checkerboard pattern, slung across her shoulder. The overall look is simple yet full of street style, with both hands in the jacket pockets, looking relaxed and natural. The background is dense woods, with thick trunks painted white, sparse leaves filtering through dappled sunlight, and a path paved with gray bricks. On the right side, there are several yellow wooden supports dotted with green plants and low shrubs. Light streams through the treetops, creating a soft backlighting effect and a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, occupying the main visual focus. The background is blurred to highlight the main subject, with rich layers of light and shadow. Sunlight filters through the leaves to form dotted light spots. The overall tone is warm with a slight film texture, presenting a subtle beauty from everyday life. It feels like a moment casually captured with a regular camera, authentic and full of life",
