        {
          "id": "krea2-124d0e6a198d8ec00352f990",
          "alias": "单女橙毛衣城市站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the balcony railing, wearing an orange-white striped knit camisole and black high-waisted jeans, hands in her pockets, body slightly turned to the side, head slightly tilted, expression natural relaxed, abdominal lines clearly defined. The background features clear blue skies and white clouds, rolling hills and city buildings, with winding roads and dense residential buildings visible in the distance. Nearby, blooming pink cherry blossom branches extend from the left, a white metal railing runs across the foreground, and on the right is a gray concrete pillar. The overall composition adopts a mid-ground portrait perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The railings and cherry blossom branches in the foreground create a sense of layering with the cityscape in the background. The lighting is bright and soft natural daylight, with sunlight shining from the upper left and light shadows, creating a warm and tranquil spring atmosphere. The colors are mainly orange, white, and black, paired with pale blue skies and pink flowers, creating a harmonious and unified tone. The image has a realistic feel of everyday life with a slight film-like texture, as if captured with an amateur camera. With a slight graininess and natural color transitions, the overall atmosphere presents a relaxed and pleasant urban lifestyle. Soft light and shadow, rich details, balanced composition, and natural visual guidance, highlighting the main subjects while incorporating environmental elements to enhance the realism and immersion of the scene",
