        {
          "id": "krea2-8b306cf0394051940cdf7989",
          "alias": "单女金毛衣户外自信站立戏水",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under the sun, wearing a loose light yellow cut-out knit sweater with a V-neck design that highlights the neck line. The sleeves are puffy and comfortable, and the texture is clearly visible. Paired with white bottoms, the overall look is fresh and natural. Her hands gently hold a bouquet of flowers, composed of white and pale pink roses, green eucalyptus leaves, and daisies, wrapped in beige and white wrapping paper, presenting a soft and elegant texture. The foreground features the main figure and bouquet, the middle ground features the figure's body and parts of the environment, and the background features blurred green plants and golden light spots, creating a dreamlike bokeh effect. Light comes from the upper right, the warm afternoon sunlight gently bathing the figures, creating bright highlights and delicate shadow transitions, highlighting the texture of the skin and the layers of clothing. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is tranquil and warm, full of the romantic feeling of spring sunshine. The colors are mainly warm yellow tones, accented with white and green. The overall image is clean and transparent, full of artistic flair, resembling a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, featuring a slight film texture and natural graininess, presenting a realistic and beautiful everyday photography style",
