        {
          "id": "krea2-0110983ab6bd8bdbd421d5f4",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服户外微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A girl dressed in a blue and white school uniform sits on the outdoor stone steps. She wears dark blue pants and a light blue short-sleeved shirt, paired with a white vest-style vest. The collar features a green round school badge, with white stripes on the cuffs and pant legs. On her feet are slightly worn white platform sneakers, hands folded on the knees, body slightly leaning forward, a natural smile looking straight at the camera. The background is a city park or a corner of the campus, behind her is a beige marble-patterned building wall, surrounded by lush trees and shrubs. The ground is paved with gray brick sidewalks, with faint distant outlines of pedestrians and buildings faintly visible. The overall composition uses a mid-field perspective, with figures positioned slightly to the lower right of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The left side leaves space to show the layered environment. The edge of the stone steps in the foreground and the figures' postures guide the gaze toward the center. Light comes from the upper right, presenting a soft afternoon sunshine effect and creating delicate shadow transitions. The background blur emphasizes the subject, creating an authentic, intimate, and lively atmosphere. The overall image quality closely resembles the realism of everyday phone photography, with rich details without excessive embellishment, moderate color saturation, natural light and shadow, and slight noise, conveying beautiful moments of youth, tranquility, and everyday life",
