          "id": "krea2-49b640737f1ed36e1a84eedf",
          "alias": "单女旗袍楼梯忧伤跪注视",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on rustic stone steps, wearing a modified printed qipao. The colorful patterns cleverly blend with traditional clothing elements, with a red ribbon tied around the neckline. She looks down at the camera, her posture elegant yet tinged with playfulness. In the foreground is rough bluestone steps, with scattered green grass growing in the gaps. The stone surface texture is clearly visible, giving it a sense of era. The figure kneels on the right knee, bent left leg, wearing black platform Mary Jane shoes paired with white over-the-knee socks, creating a striking contrast. The visual focus is on the figure, with a low-angle downward shot to highlight the subject. The diagonal steps guide the gaze upward, enhancing the depth of the image. The middle ground is the staircase area where the figure stands. The background is blurred, faintly revealing the upturned eaves, gray tiles, white walls, and stone-carved column bases of the ancient Chinese architecture. On the right side, there is a retro copper streetlamp with winding branches, adding a nostalgic atmosphere. In the distance, the trees are lush and green, forming a soft contrast with the gray buildings. The overall lighting is naturally scattered, with a sky that is gloomy yet bright, creating a soft, evenly diffused light and shadow. The shadows are delicate without strong contrasts of light and dark, creating a quiet yet slightly melancholic atmosphere, as if a moment forgotten by time, full of unique charm where classical Eastern aesthetics collide with modern fashion. The image texture is authentic and details rich, as if shot with a professional camera in the early morning or on cloudy days, with slight film graininess and natural noise, presenting a daily yet highly artistic imaging style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
