        {
          "id": "krea2-d60634127ffd8f734525c2a5",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道站立持扇",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors on a city street, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a light green knit vest and a dark plaid pleated skirt. Her collar is tied with a light blue polka dot bow. She holds a small white handheld fan in her left hand and a piece of paper printed with a green illustration in her right, her posture natural and relaxed. The background is gray-white residential buildings, windows with blue borders, utility poles and messy wires crossing the frame. On the right side are metal railings and garbage sorting posters, and the ground is asphalt. In the lower right corner, there is a broken section of concrete steps. The overall composition centers on the person, shot in a medium shot, with a slightly lower viewpoint and soft natural daylight. The sunlight from the right side creates slight shadows, with fresh and elegant tones and a quiet, everyday atmosphere. It feels like a street portrait casually taken with a regular phone or camera, strong realism, rich in detail, and full of everyday life and a youthful campus vibe",
