        {
          "id": "krea2-1bbecc04cdfa6a2be77c28ed",
          "alias": "单女竹林持伞",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in white ink bamboo-patterned Hanfu holds an oil-paper umbrella painted with black and white bamboo leaf patterns. The umbrella surface is slightly tilted to shield the head, the handle is wooden, and the ribs are clearly visible. The Hanfu's wide sleeves are flowing, the fabric is thin and transparent, and the bamboo shadow pattern is blended in varying shades of ink. A deep green ribbon is tied around the waist. The overall costume is richly layered, with a blurry, quiet forest background, interlaced branches and leaves, and dappled light and shadow, creating a hazy natural atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center. The oil-paper umbrella occupies the upper half of the space, providing visual guidance. Light softly pours down from the sides and above, creating contrasts of light and shadow, highlighting the silhouettes of figures and details of the clothing. The overall color scheme is dominated by black, white, and gray, accented with a touch of green and red, presenting a classical elegance, tranquility, and a lingering artistic feel. It resembles a poetic scene from a Chinese ink painting, rich in cultural atmosphere and Eastern aesthetic conception",
