        {
          "id": "krea2-a4d5784b21450b27cf631449",
          "alias": "单女旗袍户外困倦倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a semi-transparent qipao with a blue base and red and pink floral patterns. The qipao features mid-sleeve designs with high slits reaching mid-thigh, revealing black stockings and lace-patterned high heels. She leans against a low white cement wall, her right hand naturally resting at her side, her posture elegant yet slightly lazy, her makeup exquisite, and her calm expression tinged with a hint of charm. The background is blurred green leaves and mottled sunlight forming bokeh lights, creating a soft and dreamy atmosphere. The foreground features a wooden floor and moss in the corners, while the center features the main figure and walls. The background features blurred trees and sky, with a vertical elongation ratio. The figure is center-right, with diagonal body lines guiding the view. Light and shadow come from natural light in the upper left, forming bright contour light and soft shadows. The overall color scheme is mainly blue-green, accented with red floral accents. The image has a film-like texture and slight graininess, resembling outdoor portraits taken with a professional camera, presenting an artistic atmosphere that blends Eastern charm with modern fashion",
