        {
          "id": "krea2-1feab33c42221f8322ad8cd2",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙俏皮站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "She wears a white dress with red floral spaghetti straps, which hugs her figure and highlights elegant curves. The shoulder strap features a thick blue chain design, echoing the blue handbag with a gold metal chain. The bag is simple and modern, with a gold clasp that reflects slightly in the light. She stands sideways, her body slightly tilted, her head turned toward the camera, her posture naturally relaxed. In the foreground, her upper body and handbag stand out clearly, while the center features a lush green lawn and several sturdy tree trunks The bark texture is rough and distinct, the trunk is dotted with purple orchids and greenery, with a background of blurred woods and shrubs, rich in layering. The sky shows a soft grayish-white tone, with evenly bright lighting, suitable for cloudy or scattered light environments. The overall composition features a figure centered to the right, forming a visual focal point. The light and shadow are soft and not harsh, with fresh and natural colors. Green, blue, and white are the main tones, accented with red and purple flowers, creating a peaceful and pleasant summer afternoon atmosphere. The texture of the painting is delicate, It feels as if shot with a professional camera, while preserving the natural and authentic feel of daily life, with a strong artistic aesthetic and lively atmosphere",
