        {
          "id": "krea2-c9e5d8fa96bc83b5ba01ce1c",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙窗边坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window in front of an old brick wall, wearing a white lace sheer long dress. The lightweight sheer fabric casts soft light in the sunlight, with delicate lace trim on the cuffs and collar. One hand rests lightly on her knee, the other rests on the floor, and she wears white sneakers. The overall look blends sweetness and casualness. The background is a mottled gray brick wall and rosewood window frame. The window is half-open, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow inside. Light streams in from the left, creating a warm and soft effect of light and shadow. The composition uses close-ups, with the main figures occupying the main subject, and the view slightly overhead to enhance affinity. The colors are mainly white, taupe, and red, creating a peaceful and romantic atmosphere, with a sense of realism and artistic beauty typical of everyday photography. It feels as if capturing a moment in a quiet afternoon, with a fresh and natural style, full of the spirit of life and poetic beauty",
