        {
          "id": "krea2-2b5e9b7e82457ebd92379d57",
          "alias": "单女旗袍森林自信站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a light-colored vertical striped qipao with a stand-collar short-sleeve design. The tailored cut highlights elegant curves. She leans sideways against a gray stone railing, hands gently clasped at her waist, her posture natural and composed. On her wrist is a white jade bracelet, her expression gentle and serene as she gazes at the camera. Sunlight streams down from the upper left, passing through dense green leaves to create dappled shadows. The leaves stretch along the foreground edge, some outlined brightly by the backlight. The middle shot is the main composition of the figure and stone railings, with a blurred deep green forest and faintly visible architectural structures in the background. The overall composition uses the rule of thirds, with the figure positioned near the right golden ratio point. The light is soft and warm, presenting a tranquil and pleasant summer afternoon. The colors are mainly fresh green, with elegant off-white and gray tones, with clear layers and rich details, conveying the realism and life atmosphere of everyday outdoor shooting, as if captured by a regular camera in natural light. It features a slight film texture and delicate graininess, creating an Eastern aesthetic that is both classical and modern",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
