        {
          "id": "krea2-3beab87495e76e512f345342",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙门冷淡持相机",
          "prompt": "She sat on the smooth gray floor tiles indoors, gently clutching a pair of pink fine-rimmed glasses. Around her neck were multiple layered necklaces, including pink collars and metal pendants. Her outfit was a satin pink ruffled top with black ruffled sleeves and skirt hem. Layers of pleats and bow decorations created a rich sense of depth. On her right side is a pink-toned plush toy, with a modern glass curtain wall and metal door frame in the background. The floor reflects soft light. The middle ground showcases clothing and posture. The background is simple and open, with natural light and shadow from above, bright and even. The main pink-black tones are warm white, creating a sweet yet slightly cool atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if captured with a portable camera. With a sense of everyday intimacy and artistic aesthetics, it captures moments of quiet composure in public spaces, full of youthful energy and personal expression.",
