        {
          "id": "krea2-6d9d878d99fa984f6e9142cd",
          "alias": "单女金西装小巷俏皮站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a narrow alley paved with stone slabs. She wears a loose pale yellow blazer paired with a white lace-up camisole underneath, shorts, and brown chunky-heeled mules. She holds a light yellow wide-brimmed straw hat in her right hand and gently lifts the heel of her right foot with her left. Her posture is natural, relaxed, and slightly playful, as if drawn to something. Her expression is focused and thoughtful. The overall look presents a lazy and casual French vintage style. On the left side of the foreground is a partial blue wooden door, with the edge of the door frame slightly mottled The wall is a rough beige cement texture. In the background, you can see a dark gray old door and a low metal bench. The floor is made of irregular stone slabs joined together, bearing the marks of time. In the distance, the wall is covered with blurry graffiti. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly in the center right of the painting, with a slightly tilted body to create a sense of dynamic balance. The visual guide extends from her line of sight to the upper left corner of the painting, creating a sense of spatial depth. The lighting is soft and warm, like slanting afternoon sunlight, with delicate and layered shadows. The overall atmosphere is calm and artistic, with warm yellow, off-white, and brown tones as the main colors, accented by blue door frames as cool contrasts. The images have a slight film graininess and natural halo, presenting a realistic texture similar to everyday handheld camera shooting. The details are rich but not overly embellished, full of life and artistic flair",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
