        {
          "id": "krea2-38f2bea62d02f37fe15fb3bd",
          "alias": "单女红高领衫城市冷淡行走阅读",
          "prompt": "She wears a bright red turtleneck short dress made of suede or suede, with a sharp cut featuring a front slit and side zipper details. She pairs it with black knee-high boots and carries a black handbag in her right hand. Her nails are painted deep red, creating a fashionable and vintage vibe. The figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, occupying the visual center, with a slightly turned body and head slightly tilted back, forming an elegant silhouette. The foreground is the street floor. A dark gray metal grille with clear texture is laid out. The middle frame shows the dynamic moment of a woman walking. In the background, the glass window of an Italian restaurant reflects the street scene and the blurred silhouettes inside. Above the window hangs a large green sign reading \"PIZZA CON CUCINA & BIRRE ARTIGIANALI,\" bold and powerful. Inside, you can see the red and white checkered tablecloth and diners. A man in a black suit walks past from the left, his figure blurred, creating a lived-in urban atmosphere. The composition uses low-angle shooting to enhance the character's presence and visual impact. The camera focuses on the female subject, with background blur to highlight the character. The light and shadow come from the slanting afternoon sunlight, warm and soft, creating a natural shadow transition. The overall color scheme is dominated by red, forming a strong contrast with the cool street environment. The atmosphere is both everyday and cinematic, presenting a blend of urban fashion and real life. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, and it has the graininess and slight noise typical of film photography. It feels like a street moment captured with an amateur camera, conveying a casual, authentic, and refined aesthetic experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
