        {
          "id": "krea2-4558376d88d3db054dbcdaf5",
          "alias": "单女金T恤桌边自信站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor lawn, wearing a yellow camisole and blue flared jeans, arms naturally spread, her posture relaxed, her expression gentle and confident, her makeup exquisite, and her overall look casual and fashionable. The background is lush woods and a blurry camping scene. In the distance, a white vehicle, folding chairs, and a picnic table can be seen. On the table are coffee utensils and bottled jars, creating a relaxed and cozy outdoor atmosphere. Sunlight filters through the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. The light is soft and warm, presenting a golden afternoon tone. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, clear grass and scattered flowers in the foreground. The middle ground features the figure and some camping gear, while the background features blurred trees and the sky. The layers are distinct, with the focus on the upper body of the subject. The depth of field is shallow, highlighting the subject. The overall style combines a sense of life and artistic beauty, as if shot with a professional camera in natural light. The details are rich, colors are realistic, and the warmth and tranquility of everyday life are imbued",
