        {
          "id": "krea2-edf88e0f6fa090d37eda0721",
          "alias": "单女透视黑丝袜摄影棚沉思倚靠交叠",
          "prompt": "The body leans slightly forward, arms crossed and hugged at the knees, left hand naturally hanging at the side. The fingers are long and painted with light pink nail polish. The posture is elegant yet slightly lazy, with a calm and deep expression with a soft sheen. Wearing black sheer stockings, the leg lines are smooth. On the feet are black platform ankle boots made of matte leather with slight wrinkles and reflective sheen. The heel is thick and stable, and the overall look is simple yet stylish. The composition is centered, with the figure occupying the main subject, shot in a medium shot. Highlights the upper body and leg details, with a pure and unobtrusive background, even, soft lighting, and softness from the softbox near the front. Shadows are soft, outlines are sharp, and there are no obvious hard shadows. The overall atmosphere is calm, simple, and modern, with a professional studio shooting feel. The light and shadow layers are distinct, with black, white, and gray as the main tones. The image is clean and crisp, conveying a calm, confident, and slightly detached temperament",
