        {
          "id": "krea2-d66f88ed6648501bb8846454",
          "alias": "单女紫浴袍闺房坐展示",
          "prompt": "Purple and white string earrings hang, and a warm pearl necklace is worn around her neck. The pendant is a delicate gold ornament. Her overall makeup is elegant and her temperament gentle and charming. In the foreground is her light purple outer robe, light and flowing, adorned with delicate gold embroidery patterns. The neckline and cuffs are decorated with delicate gold thread patterns, and underneath is an orange-pink strapless top. A wide purple ribbon is tied around her waist, with a three-dimensional flower and a hanging bead chain in the center. In the middle shot, she sits with her hands folded on her knees, her posture dignified. The background is blurred, presenting warm wood tones and faintly visible furniture outlines. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure centered slightly to the left, with soft and even light and shadow. The warm light from the front side creates a cozy and tranquil atmosphere. The overall composition is full of classical charm and poetic beauty, as if capturing a moment of tranquility in an ancient boudoir. It features a strong artistic atmosphere and a sense of everyday life, with rich details and authentic texture, like high-definition images shot with a professional camera, showcasing the splendor of traditional clothing and the inner temperament of the characters.",
