        {
          "id": "krea2-314ae3f058cea72907273d85",
          "alias": "单女手套高塔沉思坐持杯",
          "prompt": "Underneath, she wears a light-colored lace top, a bright red beret, and matching leather gloves. Her makeup is exquisite, her expression elegant yet slightly contemplative. She sits at a window table with a cup of pale yellow tea and matching white porcelain cups and saucers. Next to her is a bright red chain clutch decorated with studs. In the background, the towering buildings visible through the large window are clearly visible, including a spired tower in a typical Stalinist architectural style. The composition centers on the figure, occupying most of the space on the right side. The left blank space highlights the cityscape, with tea sets and clutches forming visual focal points in the foreground, figures and indoor environments in the middle, and the city skyline in the background. The overall approach uses close-up shots, with soft and natural lighting creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The color scheme is mainly off-white and red, accented with gold studs, presenting a retro and fashionable feel. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, with slight film graininess and a slightly warm tone that enhances realism and artistic atmosphere",
