        {
          "id": "krea2-d9a91cb2f1b72785b9cc83df",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙窗边媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden floor, wearing a black spaghetti strap dress and black stockings, gracefully curled up by the window. Her left hand hangs naturally, her expression contemplative and seductive. The background is a vintage-style dark gray floral wallpaper, with intricate pink and green floral patterns creating a strong nostalgic atmosphere. On the left is a green glass vase with withered branches and a withered imperial flower. The vase's surface has a slight reflection, and light streams diagonally into the room from the right, forming a bright beam. Illuminating the figure's body and parts of the wall, the strong contrast of light and shadow creates a clear transition between light and shadow, highlighting the main contour. The floor reflects soft warm-toned light spots. The overall composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure occupying the center slightly left, the body extending diagonally, guiding the gaze to the upper right. The foreground features a vase and part of the floor, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background is patterned wallpaper with clear layers. Extending further to background details, the lighting atmosphere is warm and mysterious, with a film cinematic texture and moderate color saturation. It presents a retro, private, and artistically rich tranquil scene, as if capturing a moment from an afternoon, with the realism and life atmosphere of everyday amateur equipment shooting, while also embodying the aesthetic of professional portrait photography",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
