        {
          "id": "krea2-4c15f9aa6aed900c90d96e57",
          "alias": "单女米西装街道沉思行走持包",
          "prompt": "A woman walks along a street paved with stone pavings, wearing a beige plaid suit jacket and matching shorts, a dark brown turtleneck sweater underneath, a brown belt tied at her waist, black pointed high heels, carrying a brown plush handbag in her left hand and a right hand in her pocket, her expression slightly contemplative. She walks past a white car, parked by the roadside, with smooth lines and clearly visible wheels. The background is a classical-style architectural wall decorated with geometric patterns. In the distance, black metal railings and blurred vehicle silhouettes appear. Sunlight slanted down from the upper right, casting long shadows on the stone pavement. The light was warm and soft, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The overall composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, facing the lower right. The scene presents a sense of everyday life and a fashionable urban street atmosphere. The tones are mainly warm brown, beige, and gray, with delicate textures and rich layers of light and shadow, as if taken with a professional camera. With a slight grainy film texture and natural exposure transitions, it creates an authentic and storytelling visual experience",
