        {
          "id": "krea2-491aee3f3c12f46544aeeb14",
          "alias": "单女短裙严肃倚靠持花",
          "prompt": "Her makeup is exquisite, holding a bouquet of blooming white lilies in both hands. The flowers are full and the green leaves set off the scene. The composition centers on the person, shot in a medium shot, with the person positioned on the right side and the left side blank to create visual balance. The background is a warm beige wood texture wall, with light softly streaming down from the left front onto the figure, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The light and shadow create a delicate texture on the skirt hem and skin. The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, full of sophistication and artistic flair. The lens simulates professional portrait photography, using a large-aperture prime lens with precise depth control that highlights subject details. The image tones lean toward warmth, with moderate color saturation, presenting a texture reminiscent of film reels. It feels like a photographer capturing moments in a private space, with the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting without losing professional standards. The composition is simple yet layered, extending to the bouquet in hand, creating a tranquil and story-rich image.",
