        {
          "id": "krea2-72bc49991727b4f5cd15d2ea",
          "alias": "单男街道俏皮行走注视",
          "prompt": "Wearing a black beret and holding a bouquet of bright red tulips and several magazines, he walks dynamically through the center of the city streets, his body slightly tilted, right leg stepping forward and left leg pushing back, arms swinging naturally, holding a bouquet in his left hand and a magazine in his right, his expression confident and playful. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the main subject, while street lines guide the gaze into the distance, creating a strong sense of depth. The color contrast is striking, the red and black combination highlights the characters, the light and shadow layers are rich, the atmosphere combines urban fashion with daily drama, and the visuals have a cinematic texture, as if from a retro-style street photography blockbuster, with clear details and authentic texture. It presents a vibrant and distinctive street art atmosphere",
