        {
          "id": "krea2-4ad259d04fd023ef541dca72",
          "alias": "单女红短裙街道自信站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a city street building, slightly tilted, hands tucked into the pockets of a red short skirt, looking relaxed and confident. The overall look presents a casual yet refined urban fashion vibe. She wears a blue and white striped knit cardigan with loose cuts and gold buttons, a white top underneath, and a high-waisted burgundy velvet mini skirt with delicate and lustrous texture. A dark brown leather handbag slung crossbody over her shoulder, small and vintage adding a touch of elegance. The background features beige stone walls and metal lattice windows. Light streams in from the right side, creating a soft contrast of light and shadow, creating a quiet and lazy atmosphere in the morning or afternoon. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The background is slightly blurred to highlight the subject. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, with blue, white, and red forming a striking contrast that echoes each other. The transition of light and shadow is natural, and the overall scene is full of life and artistic beauty. Street scenes snapped casually with a classic film camera carry a slight graininess and naturally warm tones, presenting authentic and warm everyday scenes",
