        {
          "id": "krea2-eb45c305b452624fc5af17c0",
          "alias": "单女短裙竹林持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a light-colored elegant traditional outfit with bamboo leaf patterns. The slanted shoulder design reveals one shoulder and collarbone line. Tassel earrings hang from her earlobes, presenting an elegant and natural posture. Her right hand gently caresses her collar, while her left hand lets it hang naturally. Overall, she presents the temperament of an Eastern classical beauty. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, with close-ups highlighting the figure's expression and clothing details. The foreground shows the upper body and part of the skirt, while the middle ground reflects the surrounding scenery on calm water. The background features rocky cliffs and dense reed beds. Sunlight pours down from the upper right, creating a soft backlight that creates a warm and bright atmosphere. The colors are mainly off-white, light gray, and light green, with natural transitions of light and shadow. The image texture is delicate and authentic, resembling outdoor portraits taken with a professional camera, exuding rich poetry and serene beauty",
