        {
          "id": "krea2-93a24e02c702c86a77edece9",
          "alias": "单女白浴袍床神秘坐",
          "prompt": "She wears an off-white silk robe, made of smooth, soft fabric with a delicate sheen, with dark threads on the cuffs and collar. She sits cross-legged, her right knee raised close to her chest, her left hand resting on the bed, her right hand naturally hanging down, fingers long, and a simple ring on her ring finger, her expression slightly lazy and mysterious. In the background is a vintage-style bedroom, with a classical oil painting framed in a gold-carved frame hanging on the light gray wall. The figure in the painting is blurred, and brown silk curtains hang at the head of the bed, edged with white tassels and lace On the right stands an old-fashioned desk lamp with a beige fabric shade decorated at the bottom. The lamp stand is a dark wood carved structure, with a semi-transparent white gauze curtain hanging by the window, gently swaying in the breeze. The overall light comes from the soft natural light on the left, creating a warm and hazy light and shadow effect. The composition uses a diagonal perspective, with the main subject positioned slightly to the left to create visual guidance. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, with tones dominated by off-white, light brown, and gray-pink. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, full of privacy and artistic flair. It seems to capture a tranquil moment of morning or dusk, with a film-like texture and slight graininess, presenting a realistic and everyday life feel reminiscent of amateur camera photography",
