        {
          "id": "krea2-98e57fef496eacae2a5392e0",
          "alias": "单女上衣摄影棚神秘侧头",
          "prompt": "An elegant female figure wears a wide-brimmed black top hat, creating a mysterious and noble aura. She wears a black long-sleeved gown with fine sequins, with sequins on her shoulders and chest sparkling like stars in the night sky under the faint light. Her makeup is exquisite, and the composition uses medium to near shots. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, with her head slightly tilted. The background is a soft gray gradient wall, simple and free of cluttered elements. The middle and background are blurred. Highlighting the layering of the subject, light comes from the front and side, creating a quiet and elegant atmosphere with a retro cinematic feel. The color palette is mainly black, gray, and silver, presenting professional studio lighting effects. The details are clear and sharp, with a delicate texture, embodying the aesthetic style of a high-end fashion blockbuster. It feels as if a top photographer is using a full-frame camera and prime lens to capture a moment full of storytelling.",
