          "id": "krea2-195827a7a54ddba778c74f47",
          "alias": "单女短裙城市沉思过肩",
          "prompt": "She turns sideways to look back at the camera, wearing multiple layers of gold chains and star-shaped pendants on her arm. A semi-transparent pink gauze outer layer drapes over her shoulders, the hem of the skirt naturally drapes in the wind, presenting a soft pleated texture. Her posture is elegant yet slightly contemplative, as if gazing into the distance. A pure white dove spreads its wings and flies past the upper left of the frame, its wings fully spread, feathers layered distinctly, graceful in posture. The background is a clear blue sky and shimmering sea. In the distance, you can see the blurred outline of the city skyline and coastline. In the foreground, the edge of the wooden boardwalk is visible, and the ground is in a warm yellow tone. The overall composition uses a three-part method: the subject is on the right, leaving space on the left for flying doves and the open sky, creating visual balance and dynamic guidance. Light comes from the upper right, shot in front of the light, with sunlight penetrating the clouds and casting warm highlights and soft shadows. The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The colors are mainly pink, blue, and gold, with moderate saturation. The contrast is harmonious, and the overall image has a strong artistic sense and cinematic texture, as if a meticulously crafted blend of professional studio lighting and outdoor real-life scenes, while retaining the realism of everyday handheld device shooting. The details are rich, layered and exudes poetic and tranquil beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
