        {
          "id": "krea2-76f1b902fc607c8cf05913f7",
          "alias": "单女白背心街道忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "In the night, a woman stands by the city street, wearing a white sleeveless top and a black long skirt. The blouse is tied into a bow at the waist, revealing part of her back line. She slightly turns to look back at the camera, her overall posture elegant and relaxed. The foreground is the edge of a metal railing, which extends diagonally to the lower left corner of the frame, forming a guiding line. The middle is the main figure, occupying the center to the right. The background is a blurry city nightscape, with the outline of an overpass and scattered streetlights visible in the distance. The light is warm yellow, creating a contrast against the cool-toned night. The sky is pitch black, and the ground reflects faint light. The composition uses low-angle downward shots to enhance the visual tension of the characters, while shallow depth of field highlights the subject. The background blur treatment focuses the focus on the subject. Light and shadow mainly come from ambient light sources, forming a cool blue tone with a dominant color temperature, accented with warm yellow spots in some areas, creating a quiet, melancholic, and slightly romantic atmosphere. The image has a slight graininess and film texture, as if shot at night with an amateur camera, capturing a real-life atmosphere. Overall, it presents a sense of the lonely beauty of an urban night, rich in details and rich in storytelling, balanced yet dynamic composition, ultimately landing in the distant background, creating a profound sense of space. The color layers are distinct, the contrast between warm and cool is strong, both modern and nostalgic, full of poetry and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
