        {
          "id": "krea2-2438e3ff9349f6bd92fb90cd",
          "alias": "单女灰外套沙发冷淡坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a beige fabric armchair, wearing a thick gray-and-black fox fur coat paired with black over-the-knee boots, legs crossed. Her posture is lazy yet confident, her expression slightly cold and aloof. Several white shopping bags printed with the word \"REVOLVE\" are scattered around her and in front of her, creating a luxurious atmosphere as if she had just finished shopping. In the foreground is an orange-brown carpet with vintage patterns, and in the middle is a classic-style interior space, including a dark carved wooden sideboard topped with a white lampshade. The desk lamp with a golden base is next to a beautifully mounted classical oil painting. In the background, two white hangers hang from black clothes and underwear, respectively. On the right is a lavishly decorated white door. The wall is adorned with exquisite relief lines, and the overall lighting is soft and warm. The combination of the desk lamp and ambient light creates a slightly top-down perspective, with the figure centered slightly to the left, forming the visual focal point. Background elements are evenly distributed on both sides to enhance the sense of spatial depth. The colors are mainly warm tones, blending off-white, gold, and deep brown Black and other classic color schemes create an atmosphere where high-end fashion coexists with private elegance, offering the authentic texture of everyday shooting. It feels like capturing a moment with a professional camera in a high-end boutique or private fitting room, retaining slight noise and natural exposure details, presenting luxury consumption scenes from real life, while also possessing the compositional beauty of artistic photography.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
