        {
          "id": "krea2-7986f055e10559f0a4018287",
          "alias": "单女小径严肃侧头",
          "prompt": "Her skin is fair and delicate, like congealed cream. She wears a white Hanfu with a cross-collar and right-lapel Hanfu. The fabric is thin and translucent, with faint lining patterns visible. The collar is embroidered with elegant patterns, and the collar is tied with a light gray bow. A golden pendant hangs on her chest, gorgeous yet elegant. Her right hand gently holds a string of dark brown Buddhist beads, and on her wrist is a gold bead bracelet. Her posture is dignified, her head slightly tilted, as if in deep thought or waiting. The foreground is the main figure, occupying most of the space. The middle features blurred wooden eaves and stone steps, while the background features mottled ancient walls and soft light spots filtering through the shadows of trees. Light pours down from the upper left, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The soft light and shadow create a tranquil and poetic atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups. The figure is center-right, with blank space on the left, creating a smooth visual path. The overall color scheme is mainly white, off-white, and light gray, accented with gold and dark brown. The colors are harmonious and unified, with delicate texture. The image carries slight film graininess and lens distortion, presenting a documentary and authentic feel reminiscent of everyday amateur camera shooting. The atmosphere is tranquil and distant, full of Eastern classical aesthetics",
