        {
          "id": "krea2-bd70988a3059a0bf3dbd0976",
          "alias": "单女黑风衣街道忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a stone curb on a city street, wearing a loose black trench coat over a light-colored shirt. Her expression is slightly contemplative and detached, her posture relaxed yet full of fashion. Her legs are crossed, left leg in front and right leg behind, knees slightly bent, wearing black knee-high boots that are smooth and glossy, the shaft fits the leg lines, and the heel is thick-soled. Her hands are folded over her knees, her left ring finger is wearing a ring, a small bracelet is visible on her right wrist, and her legs are adorned with dark stockings decorated with white geometric patterns. The pattern is dotted and combined with lines, adding layers of detail. The foreground features a rough gray stone curb, with yellow markings along the edges. The ground is a dark asphalt pavement. On the right side stands a green metal newsstand decorated with relief patterns. A poster is posted on the pavilion, vaguely but the words \"DECEMBRE\" are visible. The multi-story building facades are made of beige stone, with neatly arranged windows and some window frames in white or dark. Between the buildings are bare branches that intersect The sky is gloomy, the lighting is soft and even, and the overall tone is cool, mainly black, gray, and green. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, body slightly tilted to create dynamic balance. The light and shadows return to the legs and boots, with scattered light from cloudy days. The shadows are soft and the outlines clear, creating a quiet and urban atmosphere, with the realism and artistic tension of everyday street photography, as if capturing a poetic moment in an ordinary moment. The lens simulates the style of 35mm humanistic photography. Slight graininess and natural noise enhance the authentic texture, with moderate color saturation and low contrast, creating a subtle yet refined modern lifestyle aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
