        {
          "id": "krea2-df5a59c056fa434a045b00c1",
          "alias": "单女米外套街道俏皮坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a round marble table outside a Parisian street café. She wears a bright red beret, a beige long coat, a black-and-white striped shirt and a plaid skirt, black stockings and pointed high heels, a brown leather bag slung across her shoulders, a pen lightly held in her right hand, an open notebook in her left, and a vintage black film camera in front of her. She smiles and looks toward the right side of the frame, her expression gentle and focused. The background features a rosewood door frame and a French café sign, which reads \"BJERES à la.\" Pression Thé, Café, Chocolat Salades Composées\"—menu posters and books can be seen through the glass window by the door. The floor is paved with gray stone pavements, and green rattan chairs are nearby. The overall composition adopts a medium-angle perspective, with the figures positioned slightly to the left center. The table forms a visual guiding line, with soft and natural light and shadow. The warm sunlight from the left casts gentle shadows on the floor and walls, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The main colors are red-brown, off-white, and black-gray. The layers are rich and harmonious, presenting a retro, elegant, and everyday street style full of everyday life. It's as if you casually captured a moment with an old-fashioned camera, with slight graininess and film texture. The details are realistic and delicate, the poses of the people are natural and lively, the background slightly blurred to highlight the subject, and the overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
