        {
          "id": "krea2-d19c63ee48c898c30cd58354",
          "alias": "单女棕西装街道冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of a gray sidewalk on a city street, wearing a dark brown tailored suit jacket over a black turtleneck underneath, black-rimmed glasses, and exaggerated earrings. Beside her lie an open newspaper and a black glossy leather handbag. The background is a wide city road with clear white traffic markings and yellow curbstones. In the distance, you can see modern high-rise glass curtain wall buildings standing side by side with historic red brick buildings. Pedestrians and vehicles move through the streets. The overall composition is shot from a low angle, with the main focus on the figure. Newspapers and handbags in the foreground are used to visually guide the scene, highlighting the main subject. The lighting is soft and natural, presenting uniform diffused light on cloudy or evening days, creating an atmosphere that blends urban fashion with everyday life. The tone leans toward cool gray, with a slight film texture and graininess, presenting a realistic look similar to professional camera snapshots on the street. Rich in details and clear layering, it has a strong visual impact and artistic atmosphere",
