        {
          "id": "krea2-e036216ba81504944b760991",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙摄影棚神秘",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a black lace spaghetti strap dress, paired with black long gloves and a black mesh mini skirt, wearing a black top hat. She sat gracefully sideways on the floor in front of a gray-blue background, her left leg bent and right leg extended, right hand naturally resting on the floor to support her body. Her makeup was exquisite, and the overall look was full of vintage and mysterious elements. The shot was shot at a low angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left, leaving ample blank space in the composition. Light from the left created a strong contrast of light and shadow, with soft spotlights illuminating the subject and creating a dramatic light and shadow effect. The floor reflects the contours and shadows of the figures, while the background is simple and clean, with no distractions that highlight the subject. The colors are mainly black, gray, and blue, with a touch of warmth in the cool atmosphere. The overall style combines artistic and fashionable elements, reminiscent of portraits shot with high-end equipment in a professional studio, rich in detail and delicate texture, presenting a serene yet dynamic beauty",
