        {
          "id": "krea2-7e78bd6ba5cc37c9f91bf6fa",
          "alias": "单女灰外套城市冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the indoor window, facing the camera directly. Her makeup is delicate and natural, wearing a light gray plush jacket worn open, layered with a black lace-patched camisole featuring delicate polka dot lace decorations on the collar and cuffs. She wears dark gray slim-fit jeans, hands tucked into her pockets, looking relaxed and confident. The background is a clean, modern indoor environment, with a light gray-white wall. On the left side, black window frames and glass reflect, light enters from the side, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. The overall composition centers on the figure. Using medium shots to highlight the upper body and clothing details, the image is layered: the foreground is the main subject, the middle ground is the body and clothing, the background is a minimalist space, and light and shadow come from the front and side, creating a warm and soft atmosphere. The tone is cool but harmonized by the warm light, presenting a fusion of urban fashion and daily life. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if shot with a high-resolution camera, featuring slight film grain and natural depth blur. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of life, making the images tranquil yet attractive",
