        {
          "id": "krea2-2559081f9d992034040326e9",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙窗边媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the window of a Parisian balcony, wearing a black high-neck, fitted long-sleeve top and a black short skirt, paired with fishnet stockings. Her posture is elegant yet slightly stern. She looks directly at the camera, her left hand gently resting on the doorframe, her right hand naturally lowered, gently tugging at the hem of her skirt, creating an effortless sensuality and mystery. In the foreground is a vintage carved iron railing, with smooth lines and classical decorative details. In the middle is the woman's full silhouette, slightly turned to the side, forming a graceful S-shaped curve, with the background showing a blurred cityscape of Paris. In the distance, the outline of the Eiffel Tower is blurred but clearly discernible, shrouded in gray mist. The overall composition is in black and white, with soft and layered light and shadow. Light enters diagonally through the right window, emphasizing three-dimensionality. The shadows transition delicately, creating a tranquil, melancholic, and story-rich atmosphere. The composition uses a third-level method: the figures are positioned on the right side, with the left side left blank to enhance visual tension, guiding the gaze to focus on expressions and postures, while preserving the iconic building in the background, creating a strong visual contrast and sense of spatial depth. The overall style is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and a low-saturation texture, as if from an old black-and-white photo, full of nostalgia and artistic atmosphere. It simulates professional camera shooting effects, using an 85mm prime lens with a small aperture to control depth of field, capturing delicate details and soft bokeh, presenting a cinematic narrative and emotional tension.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
