        {
          "id": "krea2-cb79f299c0b3975eb2e94edd",
          "alias": "单女黑西装街道沉思蹲吸烟",
          "prompt": "A woman squats at the edge of a narrow city street on stone steps, dressed in a loose black blazer and black inner layer, paired with semi-transparent black stockings, gray knit stockings, and shiny pointed high heels. Her right hand gently strokes her thigh, with a thin ring on her ring finger. The background features mottled beige architectural walls, dark wooden doors, and iron window frames. The ground is slippery and reflective, revealing manhole covers and scattered cigarette butts. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the left, forming a visual focal point. The foreground features stone steps and partial boots, while the middle ground is the main subject and the extension of the street. The background shows the building facade and the depth of the alley. The lighting is soft and natural, diffused from cloudy days, with delicate shadows and a cool gray tone, creating a sense of loneliness and a fashionable urban street atmosphere. The photography style resembles professional street photography, using a large aperture lens to capture shallow depth of field, highlighting the contours and details of the figures. The visuals have cinematic narrative tension and the cold aesthetics of modern cities",
