          "id": "krea2-036d341e309d06327840692b",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫冷淡持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a white shirt paired with a beige knit cardigan, the collar slightly open with distinct layers. The background is a blurred blue sky and distant hazy scenery, presenting a shallow depth of field effect. Close-up shots are used, with light and shadow projecting diagonally from the upper left, forming a soft backlit contour. The shadow areas are delicate and soft, creating a peaceful and warm atmosphere. Full of youthful energy and poetic beauty, the tones are cool but the lighting is warm, creating a tranquil moment in the early morning or evening, as if capturing an unintentional moment. It carries the texture and realism of everyday photography, with a lens feel similar to medium format camera shooting, rich in detail, natural color reproduction, presenting a visual style that is both refined and lifelike",
