        {
          "id": "krea2-bda6302c1611184290b69acb",
          "alias": "单女困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands among dense green vines, slightly tilting her head up and gazing upward, as if in a silent conversation with nature. She wears light green light clothing, her arms naturally raised, fingers gently touching the leaves, her posture elegant and relaxed. In the foreground are layers of fresh green leaves, their edges clearly visible. Some leaves appear semi-transparent due to the light penetrating through, her expression calm and slightly thoughtful. The background is blurred green vegetation and bright light spots filtering through the leaves, creating a soft bokeh effect. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the subject positioned slightly to the upper right of the frame, leaving plenty of space for the branches and leaves in the foreground, enhancing depth and creating a natural flow of sight. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft natural light, with sunlight passing through the leaves from above and behind, creating mottled light and shadow. The overall color scheme is mainly fresh and bright green, accented with warm yellow halos, creating a tranquil, dreamy, and vibrant summer afternoon atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera. It features a slight grainy film texture and soft out-of-focus blur, presenting a vintage artistic visual style",
