        {
          "id": "krea2-2cf4b72af752b0b1190859ee",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a red velvet chair in a Parisian street café, wearing a black glossy leather jacket over a black camisole and transparent stockings with black polka dot patterns. Her left hand rests gently on her lap, while her right hand hangs naturally at the edge of the table. On the table are white ceramic coffee cups, silver sugar jars, and a vintage film camera. In the background, warm lighting from inside the café shines through glass doors, casting a blurred street scene. deep red marble columns and gold decorative lines outline a classical and elegant spatial structure, with warm yellow light streaming from inside. Creating a soft and layered light and shadow effect, the overall composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the characters positioned on the right side of the frame and the left side left emphasizing the ambiance. The camera slightly looks down, presenting a sense of privacy and artistic atmosphere in daily life. Light comes from the front right, creating delicate transitions between highlights and shadows. The colors are mainly red, black, and gold, evoking a retro and romantic urban lifestyle aesthetic. The image has a slight film graininess and natural depth blur, as if captured casually with an old-fashioned camera—authentic and full of storytelling",
