        {
          "id": "krea2-3d5b895dc7144b3f1d9ee716",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫酒吧沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of a retro-style café bar, wearing a black sleeveless turtleneck top and a red-black plaid skirt, paired with black over-the-knee stockings and black pointed high heels. Her right hand gently supports the bar, while her left hand adjusts her right foot. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her expression slightly contemplative and detached. Her body is slightly tilted, legs naturally bent, exuding a lazy yet confident aura. In the foreground, she dominates the main subject, clearly prominent. In the middle is a metallic bar countertop, with an old-fashioned coffee machine placed on top. A glass cup and several stacks of tissues, wooden decorative strips on the bar edge, a blurred café interior background showing other customers chatting or waiting, wine racks and shelves illuminated by warm yellow lighting behind create a cozy and intimate atmosphere. The composition uses medium shots in close-up, with the figures positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame. The slanted lines of the bar counter guide the viewer from the foreground to the background, creating depth and enhancing storytelling. The lighting and shadows are mainly warm yellow. Soft diffused light from ceiling chandeliers and background lights evenly illuminates the scene, with natural shadow transitions. The overall atmosphere blends the everyday feel of urban life with the tranquility of an art film, presenting a realistic and emotionally charged moment as if captured from a classic scene in an independent film. Shot with amateur cameras, slight noise and natural lens distortion enhance realism, moderate color saturation and low contrast, creating a warm and slightly nostalgic visual experience",
