        {
          "id": "krea2-2919e3c2589bf1e068b396ae",
          "alias": "单女透视紫礼服摄影棚自信侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a light purple sheer gown, with layers of skirt that are light and flowing. The semi-transparent material subtly reveals the contours of her skin. The shoulders and chest have pleated designs that add dimension and layers. She wears a pair of sparkling diamond earrings, tassel-shaped and set with multiple small diamonds. As she gently swayed, she sparkled brilliantly. On her fingers were two diamond-set rings—one on her ring finger and one on her middle finger. Her posture was dignified and confident, her head slightly tilted, as if silently communicating with the viewer. The background was blurred, presenting a warm-toned indoor environment, with wooden furniture and soft lighting faintly visible. It creates a warm and romantic atmosphere. The overall composition uses close-ups and background blur treatment to highlight the details and beauty of the subject. The lighting is soft and even, shining from the front slightly above, with natural shadow transitions. The light and shadow effects are delicate, enhancing the image's three-dimensionality and texture. The colors are mainly light purple, white, and warm yellow, harmoniously unified in tone, creating a noble and elegant yet gentle atmosphere. The entire image is full of artistic sense and visual appeal, as if it were a high-end portrait shot in a professional studio. At the same time, it carries the realism and familiarity of everyday amateur equipment shooting.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
