        {
          "id": "krea2-5e0f0c5df4227a12defced19",
          "alias": "单女短裙窗边展示",
          "prompt": "She smiles and glances back, her posture naturally relaxed, her hands gently swaying, the skirt slightly lifted with each step, showcasing a smooth and dynamic beauty. In the foreground is her clear full-body silhouette, the center features a dark carpet with geometric patterns and light gray walls on both sides, while the background extends into the corridor space. On the left, blinds let in soft light. Vintage-style warm chandeliers hang from the ceiling, with wall lamps embedded in the right wall. In the distance, you can faintly see the porch and decorative details. The overall composition uses a low-angle side view, with the figure positioned in the left two-thirds of the frame, forming a diagonal guiding line. The line of sight extends from the floor texture upward to the figure, then toward the background depth, creating a strong sense of perspective and spatial layering. The lighting and shadows are mainly warm yellow tones, blending the light from the ceiling fixtures with natural light from outside the window, creating a delicate transition of light and shadow on the figure's body and clothing. Soft shadows cast on the floor and walls, highlighting the texture of the clothing and the lines of the figure. The atmosphere is warm and sophisticated, as if capturing some unintentionally elegant moment. It has the texture and cinematic feel of professional portrait photography, while retaining the realism and slight noise typical of everyday handheld camera shooting, presenting an artistic style that is both refined and full of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
