        {
          "id": "krea2-a08d70cac296d424716ed7e5",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙庭院困倦注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a light, off-white sheer long dress adorned with golden sequins on the straps. The hem flutters in the wind, presenting a semi-transparent texture that faintly reveals her silhouette. In the foreground is a dark wooden window frame and gray floor tiles; in the center is a woman's elegant silhouette, while outside the window are greenery and stone paths. In the background are traditional Japanese wooden structures and a blurred courtyard landscape, shaded by lush trees. Branches and leaves hang down at the top of the frame, and the composition uses diagonal lines to guide the gaze from the lower left corner to the upper right, creating dynamic balance. The figure's posture occupies the center to the right, creating a sense of expansive space. The visual direction naturally leads the woman's neck and arms toward the sky. Light and shadow come from the high natural light angle on the right, creating a contrast of light and shadow that emphasizes three-dimensionality. Shadows cast onto the floor and window frames enhance spatial depth. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and slightly dreamy, with the texture of warm morning or afternoon light. The color palette mainly features off-white, light brown, and green, accented with gold, presenting a realistic feel reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting. It feels like capturing a moment with a phone or portable camera. The image has a slight film graininess and natural exposure transitions, rich in detail, clear layers, and full of poetry and a sense of life",
