        {
          "id": "krea2-69e1ee6df08f319cc13618c5",
          "alias": "单女短裙困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a Hanfu in pale blue and white hues, with light and transparent fabric. The layered skirt hem and wide sleeves flutter in the breeze, creating a flowing texture. The background is lush forest, lush and green. The leaves are reflected in the sunlight, creating mottled shadows. The grass is lush and green, sunlight pours from the treetops, casting soft light spots on the ground. The shot uses shallow depth of field, with the subject clearly standing out and the background blurred naturally. The composition is centered slightly upward, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, creating a tranquil, dreamy, and poetic atmosphere. Light comes from the sides and back, creating a backlighting effect that envelops the figure's outline in a soft halo. The edges of clothing shine through, creating a hazy beauty. The overall color tone is fresh and elegant, mainly green and white, accented with yellow bouquets. The image has a slight film grain texture, moderate color saturation, and a natural and realistic look. The overall style blends classical aesthetics with the realistic expression of modern photography, creating a tranquil, gentle, and vibrant atmosphere",
