        {
          "id": "krea2-feb0c490890c9dcd04b05dd7",
          "alias": "单女街道忧伤持包",
          "prompt": "The cuffs are decorated with yellow and red stripes, adding a touch of street style. A woven handbag is slung across her shoulder, adorned with geometric patterns and metal chains. The overall look exudes a retro-futuristic feel. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with a slightly tilted body creating a dynamic visual balance. The background is a deep night alley, with mottled and aged walls on both sides. Vague signs and signs are posted on the walls, and in the distance, city lights can be faintly seen flickering like stars, creating a blurred light spot. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the contours and aura of the figures, using contrast of light and shadow to enhance the subject. The foreground is darker, presenting a warm orange-yellow tone, while the surrounding environment is immersed in heavy shadows, creating a strong contrast between light and shadow. Light and shadow are cast from the upper left, leaving long shadows on the floor and walls, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil with a touch of mystery. The color palette is mainly deep green and dark, accented with red lenses and warm yellow halos, creating a lonely poetic atmosphere of an urban nightwalker. The texture resembles film photography, with slight graininess and color shifts, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting. The background is naturally blurred, extending to distant lights, forming an implicit visual path. The entire image is full of storytelling and emotional tension, like a street moment accidentally captured, recording a unique and captivating individual in the city night.",
