        {
          "id": "krea2-0f2e6d0a07b61e2430a2c4ca",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣室内坐（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the indoor floor, her body slightly turned to the camera, hands folded in front of her knees, her posture naturally relaxed. She wears a gray V-neck knit cardigan decorated with diamond patterns and black thin cords, paired with a white sheer puffy skirt with a light and flowing hem. She wears off-white ribbed ankle socks, giving the overall look a sweet and fresh look. The main focus is slightly left of the center of the composition, with the foreground showing details of the upper body and hands, and the middle shot extending to her legs and skirt hem. The background features a light beige wall and warm yellow sunlight streaming in from the right side. Light streams in diagonally from the right rear, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on the wall and the character, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups to highlight the character's expression and clothing texture. The lighting mainly uses side backlighting to outline the character's outline and produce a soft focus effect. The overall tone is warm, saturation is moderate, and details are rich, presenting a natural feeling reminiscent of everyday life shot with a mobile phone or regular camera. The image has a slight film grain texture and realistic exposure It seems to capture a warm moment of afternoon sunlight, blending Japanese style with home portraits. The subtle layers of light and shadow create a gentle, healing atmosphere, as if you can hear the breeze brushing through the curtains.",
