        {
          "id": "krea2-5040f96da04a1b70552246d2",
          "alias": "单女红短裙城市沉思",
          "prompt": "Wearing a white long-sleeve top and a red and black plaid mini skirt, her legs naturally apart, one foot lightly touching the ground, the other slightly raised, her posture elegant and relaxed, hands resting lightly on the sofa armrest, expression slightly contemplative and gentle. The background is a simple indoor environment, with dark blue curtains on the left side of the light gray wall, and a brightly colored abstract art painting hanging on the right wall, mainly in blue-orange tones. The image features geometric lines and blurred car outlines, creating an urban modern feel. The floor features light wood texture. The overall lighting is bright and soft, with natural light from the left window evenly illuminating the figures and the environment, creating a clear transition of shadows. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure centered slightly to the left, the body slightly tilted, creating rich layers of light and shadow, highlighting the main contours and the materiality of clothing. The atmosphere blends the relaxed feeling of daily life with artistic visual beauty, presenting an image effect that combines authentic life atmosphere with fashionable aesthetic style",
