        {
          "id": "krea2-67a5df11f99362bc20529efa",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣街道冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor pedestrian bridge, wearing an off-white short-sleeved knit sweater and a deep blue polka-dot long dress. She turns sideways to glance back, her right hand gently resting on the metal railing in an elegant and natural posture. The background features blurred green trees and pink bridge structures. Yellow road markings extend from the right side of the painting into the distance, forming a guiding line. The composition uses a mid-ground perspective, with the figure positioned on the left side of the frame, leaving space on the right to enhance depth. The background blurs out the main subject, and the light is soft and even, presenting a fresh atmosphere under natural daylight. The overall tone is cool, with a slight film texture, moderate color saturation, and rich layers of light and shadow, creating a peaceful, artistic, and slightly nostalgic everyday street style that feels like shooting in the afternoon with an old-fashioned camera. The details are realistic, the texture clear, and full of life and artistic beauty",
