        {
          "id": "krea2-0e515017589839dc0a925671",
          "alias": "单女粉外套摄影棚盘发",
          "prompt": "A woman wore exquisite ancient-style Hanfu, with pink and light blue fabric embroidered with delicate floral patterns. Over it was a pale pink sheer jacket adorned with gold piping at the collar and cuffs. Around her waist hung a light blue brocade sash adorned with a delicate gold floral jade pendant, with two strings of red and green gemstones hanging down, styled into an elegant ancient bun. Around her neck is a necklace made of pearls of various sizes and colored gemstones. In the center hangs a rounded pearl pendant. The background is a blurred natural scene, presenting soft green and gray tones to create a hazy atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the left center of the painting. The lighting is soft and even, coming from the front to the right. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, the overall tone is warm and soft, carrying a classical and elegant Eastern aesthetic charm. The image texture is delicate, as if taken from a professional studio or high-quality film shoot, presenting a tranquil yet story-rich artistic atmosphere",
