        {
          "id": "krea2-8e298aa4f699b40d7b046aa4",
          "alias": "单女户外困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "The doll is tied with a pink bow, its feet printed with small orange paw prints, and behind her stands a blooming cherry blossom tree, its pink and white flowers intertwined with tender green leaves, creating a soft background blur against the clear blue sky. Sunlight pours down from the upper left of the canvas, bright and warm, giving the entire scene a golden edge. The grass is dappled with light and shadow, and in the foreground, a pair of black platform Mary Jane shoes is casually placed on the grass, with a water cup nearby. The overall composition uses a low-angle upward shot to highlight the main subject. The cherry blossom tree in the background occupies the upper half of the frame, creating a natural framing effect. The visual direction is guided by the character's gaze and body orientation to the right side of the frame, creating a dreamy, romantic, and spring-filled atmosphere. The colors include pink, blue, White and green are the main tones, with moderate saturation, presenting a fresh and sweet visual effect, as if taken with a Canon DSLR under natural outdoor light, with delicate texture and authentic depth of field",
