        {
          "id": "krea2-5e30f4f412ca7242266ee688",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙门站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a half-open white carved door. She wears a blue-and-white quilted silk spaghetti strap dress with a V-neck design that fits her figure elegantly, the hem slightly knee-length, and the material glows softly under the warm light. Her left hand gently rests on the door frame, while her right hand hangs naturally. She carries a small white chain bag over her shoulder, with the gold chain creating a delicate contrast with the body. She wears a pair of gold thin-strap high-heeled sandals, her long legs smooth and smooth, her makeup exquisite, wearing a simple necklace and earrings, adorned with a gold bracelet on her wrist, with an indoor corridor as the background. Warm yellow lights cast from afar, and the floor is made of light-colored marble tiles that reflect a warm halo. Behind the door, a blurred outline of the interior space can be faintly seen. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered and the door frame forming a natural frame that guides the gaze to focus on the subject. Light and shadow enter diagonally from the right, creating a soft transition of light and shadow, highlighting the texture of clothing and the curves of the human body. The overall atmosphere combines the elegance of a modern city with the warmth of a private space. The image presents a high-end, fashionable photo style, with warm and harmonious tones and rich details. It possesses strong visual appeal and artistic appeal",
