        {
          "id": "krea2-20c2a0f7b02783f4e063d760",
          "alias": "单女窗边俏皮侧头",
          "prompt": "Her expression is slightly lazy and playful, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. In the foreground, the helicopter's interior features gray metal structures, black seats, and seatbelt details. In the middle shot, the woman occupies the left side of the frame, her body slightly tilted and her head slightly tilted. The composition uses close-ups combined with distant shots outside the window, with the view extending outward from inside the cockpit. The background features layers of green mountain peaks, with unique mountain shapes and dense vegetation. Distant mountains appear faintly in the mist, and the sky is covered with grayish-white clouds. The overall color scheme is mainly natural green, gray, and white, with light and shadow coming from natural light outside the window, creating a dynamic atmosphere in real flight. The image texture is close to everyday amateur camera shooting, with slight noise and natural color reproduction, presenting a moment where documentary realism and artistic beauty coexist. The composition is compact and layered, with natural interactions between people and the environment, conveying a sense of freedom and The intertwining of adventure and tranquility captures a moment in flight, combining speed with tranquility, as if time itself has frozen.",
