        {
          "id": "krea2-9dcb0fa84f2e651178e502a9",
          "alias": "单女灰西装街道冷淡行走过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman walks through a city street, wearing a gray sleeveless suit vest paired with a matching pleated mini skirt, a dark camisole underneath, burgundy over-the-knee socks, and black loafers. She holds a white paper cup of coffee and carries a small black bag over her shoulder. Her posture is confident and relaxed, with her right arm naturally hanging down as she holds a coffee cup. The overall look blends collegiate style with urban fashion. The background features stone exterior walls and green glass doors, while other pedestrians blur across the street. The ground is paved with stone slabs and tram tracks, and the composition uses a medium shot. The subject is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with the subject occupying the primary visual space. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, and the lighting is natural on cloudy days, soft and even, with a cool gray tone, creating a realistic atmosphere for everyday street photography. It has a slight film texture and graininess, moderate color saturation, rich details, and presents an effortless elegance and sense of life, as if captured casually with a regular camera, with a strong sense of documentary and artistic beauty",
