        {
          "id": "krea2-e8d6fa5151d6a541dc5e437b",
          "alias": "单女红外套街道沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a rattan chair in an outdoor café, wearing a bright red long coat paired with a white pleated shirt and a black short skirt. She wears tall black leather boots, black gloves on both hands, and a black beret. Her makeup is exquisite, her expression slightly lazy and contemplative. On the wooden round table beside her sits a cup of hot latte, pure white in a white cup, and beside her is a deep blue handbag. The table is decorated with several thin branches. The background features beige walls and glass windows, with gray stone tiles on the floor. Sunlight gently pours into the scene, creating a warm light and shadow effect. The overall composition uses a medium perspective, with the figures positioned on the right side of the frame, and the left side reserved for displaying tables, chairs, and the environment, creating a fashionable vintage Parisian street atmosphere. The color contrast is strong yet harmonious, with the red coat as the visual focal point, black elements balancing the overall tone. Light slanting from the upper left creates delicate shadow transitions, presenting a photographic style that is both everyday and full of artistic flair, as if captured with an amateur camera, authentic and full of storytelling",
