        {
          "id": "krea2-16af08688c4cb8b661e38595",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤椅上坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white high chair, her body turned to the right of the frame, her head slightly tilted back to look at the camera. She has a vertical tattoo on her back, wears a black spaghetti-strap tight tank top and light blue high-waisted denim shorts, paired with black thin-strap high-heeled sandals. Her left leg is bent and raised, while her right leg hangs naturally. Her ankle is adorned with delicate metal chains, her right hand gently resting on the chair back, while her left hand hangs naturally at her side. Her posture is elegant and relaxed. The chair cushion is made of blue-and-white striped fabric, with lush tropical plants and lush green leaves in the background, and palm tree trunks visible in the distance. The scene is set on an outdoor balcony or terrace with white railings, paved with gray stone slabs. Sunlight pours in from above, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. The light creates a delicate sheen on the skin and clothing, while shadows fall under the chairs and on the floor. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and relaxed. The composition uses a medium shot perspective, with the figure occupying the left central position. Geometric lines are used to guide the viewer's gaze using high chairs and railings, while the foreground highlights the details of the legs and feet. The middle shot presents the torso and seat, with background blur treatment. It enhances spatial layering and natural light and shadow, creating a fresh, natural yet slightly sexy summer afternoon atmosphere. The images have the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment, retaining slight noise and natural halos, presenting a lifestyle photography style",
