        {
          "id": "krea2-ca575496fba2beec768128b7",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣冷淡倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways against a metal railing, her soft light presenting a delicate sheen and layering, adding a sense of movement and realism. She wears a light beige short-sleeved knit top with a white turtleneck underneath. The fabric feels soft and fits the figure, presenting a simple yet comfortable everyday style. Her posture is relaxed, her body slightly leaning forward, arms naturally hanging down, elbows resting on the railing, her expression gentle and reserved, exuding a tranquil atmosphere. The background is a pure light gray-white wall with a clean and uncluttered element, creating a minimalist sense of space The foreground features metal railings and mesh barbed wire, which are dark gray with slight wear on the surface. The wire mesh structure is clear, with interlaced lines forming geometric patterns that enhance the depth and realistic texture of the composition. The middle ground is the main subject, occupying the main position. The composition uses a slightly tilted angle to enhance visual dynamics. The figure's head is slightly tilted, with light and shadow coming from the left front, creating soft and even light, like natural light on a cloudy day. The shadows transition naturally with a slight soft focus effect. The overall color palette is mainly cool gray and off-white. It creates a calm and fresh artistic atmosphere, with images featuring the graininess and low-saturation texture of film photography, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, emphasizing realism and timeliness. The details are rich, presenting a quiet, elegant, and story-rich everyday moment.",
