        {
          "id": "krea2-ca9814c3db62976bd5ae6773",
          "alias": "单女棕西装城市沉思坐持包",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an old stone steps, wearing a brown velvet blazer paired with a light plaid skirt and black stockings, and black patent Mary Jane shoes. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her expression slightly contemplative and lazy. She gently holds a red quilted handbag on the steps beside her. In the background are a heavily carved dark brown wooden door and a gray stone wall decorated with vertical strips. The overall composition centers on the figure, using a mid-angle perspective. The figure occupies the left of the main subject, forming the visual focal point. The blank space on the right side highlights the architectural structure, creating a tranquil atmosphere reminiscent of a retro urban street. The lighting is soft and even, resembling scattered light on cloudy days or afternoons. The tones are warm brown and gray-green, interwoven with delicate light and shadow outlining the folds of clothing and the texture of stone. The image presents a realistic texture reminiscent of everyday amateur camera photography, with slight graininess and low-saturation colors, as if capturing an unintentionally momentary moment of life. Full of artistic atmosphere and everyday beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
