        {
          "id": "krea2-efd03eed8590520522b3881a",
          "alias": "单女街道忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "Her right hand gently strokes her ankle, adjusting a black pointed high heel with metal clasps on the upper of the shoe. Beside her sits a black leather handbag, her head slightly lowered as she gazes at the shoes, her expression focused and calm. The background is an ancient building with beige stone exterior walls. The dark brown carved wooden door is thick and solemn, with a door number \"15\" and several nameplates hanging on the wall beside the door. The window frame is white. The building's facade features exquisite relief decorations, with rough stone steps bearing traces of time. The overall composition is positioned slightly to the right of the figure's center, forming a visual focal point. The middle view presents the scene, with clear stone steps and the leg lines of the figures in the foreground. The middle ground features the main figure and a handbag, while the background is the building facade and main door. Light and shadow come from soft natural light, which falls from the upper left, casting delicate shadows on the walls and steps to create a warm yet slightly gloomy autumn atmosphere. The color palette is mainly black, brown, and gray, with a realistic texture. It features a casual street style that feels like capturing moments on the street with a professional camera, presenting the independence and composure of urban women. The details are rich, the layers are distinct, and full of the spirit of life and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
