        {
          "id": "krea2-6ea67c619ee9dbe5b3d48fe7",
          "alias": "单女黑西装街道专注站立喝",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street, wearing a black leather blazer and a beige turtleneck knit sweater, paired with a black short skirt and black stockings, black ankle boots, holding a coffee cup with black and white stripes in her right hand, sipping lightly. Her left hand carries a small black handbag and a newspaper, leaning against a yellow metal rod, her expression focused and natural. The background is a blurred city street, with pedestrians passing by and shop windows. On the left side of the foreground, a person carrying a brown sports backpack appears in partial shots, composed from a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame, with yellow poles forming vertical guiding lines. The visual focus is on the woman, with soft natural daylight. The overall atmosphere presents a relaxed and fashionable vibe of urban daily life. The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with yellow and beige, giving it a realistic street style feel. The camera captures momentary movement, with rich details and clear layering, a slight film graininess and shallow depth of field, creating a casual yet refined lifestyle aesthetic",
