        {
          "id": "krea2-11f5ed87d4915fc9972c85ee",
          "alias": "单女城市自信持相机",
          "prompt": "Her makeup is exquisite, her posture confident and elegant. Her right leg steps forward, her body slightly turned to the side, displaying a dynamic beauty. In the background is a rough gray stone pavement with clear textures. In the center, the woman is the main figure with a brown vintage Beetle car. The front of the car is visible, reflecting the surrounding environment. In the background, beige stone buildings with classical decorative lines and wrought iron window bars are in the background On the left side, there is a streetlight pole with a clock and billboard. Pedestrians in the distance are blurred, and the street extends into the distance. The composition uses low-angle shots to highlight the proportions of the characters and the sense of spatial depth. The visual guide is from the foreground stone road to the center where people converge, then extends to the background buildings. Light and shadow come from the slanting warm golden sunlight, creating a contrast between light and shadow. The figures are clearly outlined, and the ground has obvious shadows. The overall atmosphere blends urban fashion with a retro street vibe. The image is delicate and the color saturation is moderate. It presents a style that combines the realism and artistry of everyday amateur camera photography",
