        {
          "id": "krea2-036c4c9a7901c2c5c35c586a",
          "alias": "单女短裙街道忧伤站立摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a zebra crosswalk on a city street, wearing a black puff-sleeve top and a finely textured plaid skirt, wearing a classic beret, presenting a casual and flowing pose. Her arms are outstretched, her body slightly tilted, as if capturing a moment of movement. Her expression is focused yet slightly melancholic. The overall look blends French elegance with modern street style. The foreground features a clear main figure, the middle is a blurred street environment, and the background features wrought iron fences and distant trees with blurred outlines, creating a distinct sense of space. The composition uses a center-shifted dynamic balance, with the figures occupying the main positions. Light and shadow are dominated by soft natural light, with moderate contrast between light and dark. The black-and-white images enhance the emotional atmosphere, creating a retro, artistic, and story-rich visual experience, reminiscent of street photography shot with vintage film cameras, featuring slight graininess and natural exposure, presenting authentic and warm moments of life",
