        {
          "id": "krea2-a1a1da02359a31fd03789ac7",
          "alias": "单女红短裤街道站立演奏",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a gray stone pavement on a city street, wearing a white long-sleeved top with vertical stripes, adorned with a red collar and cuffs. Her chest features a striking red letter pattern, paired with red shorts, red and white sneakers, and a red baseball cap. She is performing a difficult splits, raising her left leg high and holding her foot with her left hand, steadily supporting the ground with her right leg, leaning slightly forward, and letting her right hand hang naturally. Her overall posture is full of energy and movement. On the left side of the frame is a thick dark gray metal streetlight pole, with wear marks and fine scratches on its surface. The right background is a blurry city street, with distant outlines of trees, buildings, and parked electric bikes. Sunlight pours down from above, casting clear shadows on the ground. The light is bright and warm, presenting a soft texture reminiscent of afternoon or evening. The entire scene is shot from a low angle to highlight the dynamic beauty of the figures. The composition centers on the figure, using the streetlight pole as a visual guide to draw the gaze toward the main subject The background blur enhances spatial layering, with strong light and shadow contrasts and interwoven light and shadow, creating an artistic atmosphere full of youthful energy and street fashion. It feels like a real moment captured outdoors under natural light with a professional camera. The image is rich in detail, colors are vivid, and it has a strong visual impact and a sense of life. The overall style blends sports, fashion, and everyday street style elements, showcasing the personality and vitality of a generation",
