        {
          "id": "krea2-2a680f022260cead7a8d5160",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣室内沉思坐摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a light gray cement floor, leaning slightly back against a pure white wall, her posture elegant yet slightly lazy. She wears a simple gray high-neck long-sleeve knit sweater that fits her body perfectly, soft and delicate in texture. On her right chest is a tiny white embroidered lettering pattern. Her legs are crossed and curled, knees close to the ground, and a pair of bright red patent leather pointed heels are visible at the ankles. The smooth, reflective upper and slender heels create a strong visual contrast with the overall gray-white tone. She wears a pair of semi-transparent white lace tights, with lace patterns featuring classical Baroque scroll and spiral patterns. The texture is delicate and complex, and under the light, it presents a subtle sense of three-dimensionality and sheer layers, appearing natural and casual. She wears a classic pearl necklace made of evenly sized white round pearls strung together. The necklace forms an elegant curve around the neck, adding a touch of vintage luxury. Her makeup is exquisite, her expression calm and confident, her left hand naturally resting on her knee, fingers long. A simple silver ring is worn on the ring finger, with the right hand resting behind the back supporting the body. The background is a minimalist interior space, with smooth and clean walls without any decorations or clutter. The floor is made of matte gray cement or polished concrete, creating an open and simple environment. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying the main body in a slightly slanted diagonal pose extending from the lower left to the upper right, creating a dynamic balance. The figure's head is positioned near the upper center of the frame, with light and shadow from a soft diffused light source on the left. It may be natural light or softbox lighting, with light evenly spread over the figures, creating delicate shadow transitions. The back and arm edges have slight contour light, highlighting body curves. Details are clear without harsh shadows. The background wall shows subtle light and dark gradients from left to right, enhancing spatial depth. The center features rich character shapes and costume details The lace pantyhose's transparency and texture details are especially noticeable under the light. The wrinkles and body lines of the clothing are natural and smooth, with a pure and simple background, enhancing the subject's presence. The overall atmosphere is quiet, sophisticated, and modern, blending vintage elements with a contradictory aesthetic of contemporary aesthetics. The images present a realistic texture reminiscent of everyday amateur photography, as if shooting with a lightweight camera in an ordinary indoor environment, preserving subtle noise and realistic light and shadow, avoiding excessive embellishment, emphasizing authentic everyday moments. The color palette is mainly gray, white, and black, accented with bright red and pearls, creating a harmonious and dynamic color pairing. The overall composition is balanced and stable, with clear visual guidance, conveying an emotionally independent, confident, and slightly mysterious mood. The visuals possess strong artistic expression and emotional appeal, as if capturing a frozen cinematic moment, full of storytelling and fashionable flair",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
