          "id": "krea2-f241b8d3b2bc3193a6618185",
          "alias": "单女棕靴子沙发自信坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an orange suede single sofa, legs crossed, her posture relaxed and elegant. She wears a short-sleeved top with red and yellow floral patterns, the collar slightly open, revealing delicate collarbones and a thin chain necklace. Her fingers are painted bright yellow-green nail polish, gently holding a dark drink. The liquid in the glass is a rich amber color with a faint glow. She tilts her head slightly to gaze at the camera, creating a casual yet charming atmosphere. On her feet are brown suede high-heeled ankle boots, the heels slender, The instep features pleated designs, with the toes slightly exposed, presenting a fashionable open-toe style. The right knee is bent, the left leg rests on the right, with a long, smooth leg line. In the foreground, a close-up of her legs and feet occupies the main position at the bottom of the frame, creating a strong visual direction. The center is her body and the sofa. The orange sofa has a soft texture, rounded edges, and wide, comfortable armrests. On the sofa are casually placed a small black bag and a pair of sunglasses, rich in detail. In the background is a white coffee table, simple and simple On top sits a beer bottle labeled \"TUNA,\" with a clearly visible sticker on the bottle. Next to it is a potted green plant with broad leaves full of vitality. The wall behind is decorated with geometric patterns on a black background with gold patterns, exuding a strong exotic charm. In the corner, a round wall lamp emits a warm yellow glow. The light streams in from the left side, casting soft shadows on the floor and furniture surfaces. The overall light and shadow layers are distinct, dominated by warm tones, creating a cozy, comfortable, and slightly vintage indoor atmosphere. The composition is shot from a low angle Emphasizes the lines of the characters' legs and spatial depth. The aspect ratio is close to 16:9, with a slightly upward perspective to highlight the subject's confident posture. The entire scene feels like shooting with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, offering excellent depth control and color reproduction. It can be like capturing real moments casually indoors with a high-end smartphone, full of life atmosphere and artistic beauty. The image is delicate and authentic, with rich details. The atmosphere is relaxed and stylish",
