          "id": "krea2-2f119a970c4a40791f99761c",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜公寓沉思坐自拍",
          "prompt": "She wears a black fitted long-sleeve top made of material that fits her figure, making her look elegant and sexy. On the bottom, sheer black stockings with a tiny black bow pattern, the texture of the stockings is thin and translucent, faintly revealing the leg line. Her feet are bare, her right foot gently lifted, heels touching the ground, her posture relaxed yet elegant. The phone case features a black base with red cloud patterns, resembling an anime style. She wears a pair of black sunglasses on top of her head. The frames are simple and stylish, her fingers are painted light-colored nail polish, and there is a small tattoo on the back of her hand. Around her neck is a slender silver necklace with a small and delicate pendant. The overall look blends everyday casual and personalized fashion elements. She is facing herself in the mirror, her expression slightly contemplative and playful. The background is a clean and bright indoor environment, and the walls are light off-white The surface has fine textures. On the left, a window is blocked by white sheer curtains, allowing light to gently diffuse through the curtains, creating a uniform diffused glow. On the right is a set of modern, minimalist white furniture, including a TV cabinet or storage cabinet with wooden edges. Above the cabinet is a flat-screen TV with a closed screen, and dried flowers decorations beside it add a touch of life. The entire space is clean and tidy, with black, white, and gray tones as the main tones, paired with warm-toned wooden floors, creating a warm and comfortable home atmosphere. The composition uses a center-to-right perspective, with the figure positioned in the lower left of the frame, occupying the main visual position. The body is in a semi-seated posture, with legs crossed, knees bent, and arms naturally bent, forming smooth curves. The phone becomes the foreground focal point, then downward attention is drawn to the details of the legs and stockings. Light and shadow come from the natural light source on the left, softly illuminating the character's side and creating a subtle transition between light and shadow. The shadows are elegant and not abrupt, and the overall atmosphere is quiet and private, carrying a sense of realism from daily life and a subtle artistic beauty. It presents a personal expression and emotional expression in everyday selfie scenes. The images are high-definition, authentic in detail, and reproduce natural colors, as if shot with a professional camera. While retaining the casual and authentic texture of amateur equipment shooting, the composition is balanced and layered, the subject is prominent, the background is moderately blurred, and the visual guidance is clear, creating a quiet, intimate, and uniquely charming atmosphere",
