        {
          "id": "krea2-81c286ab9c984e3cf8c4787c",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫博物馆俏皮坐持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the center of a traditional Japanese tatami room, dressed in a pure white long-sleeved shirt and a black short skirt, sitting barefoot cross-legged in a relaxed posture. Her right hand gestures as if making a phone call, while her left hand gently supports the floor. Her expression is gentle yet slightly playful, her legs long and well-proportioned. Her overall look is simple, capable, yet approachable. Behind her stands a massive steampunk-style artwork, mainly in black, white, and gray, filled with complex mechanical devices, gears, pipes, steam engines, flying machines, The design blends insects with Eastern elements. The figures in the painting wear vintage clothing and hold various precision instruments. The background is filled with hand-drawn lines and technological symbols, rich in detail and full of imagination. The artwork is fixed on a wooden wall, flanked by black columns and rope railings, creating a sense of separation in the exhibition area. On the right side is a traditional wooden niche embedded with a brightly colored modern animation-style mural. The soft light casts soft light on the walls and floor, clearly showing the room's internal structure. Wooden beams and white walls form a typical Japanese architectural style. Tatami mats cover the entire floor, edged with dark green ribbons that are delicate and realistic. Light and shadow naturally enter from the left side, casting light and shadow on the floor to create a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition adopts a central symmetrical layout, with the main figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame, and the background painting occupying most of the upper space, creating a visual focal point in response. The foreground features clear tatami textures and details of the figures' feet. The middle shot is the spatial layer between the figures and the painting, while the background is the indoor wooden structure and another mural, enhancing the storytelling and interactivity of the image. The overall atmosphere blends traditional Japanese aesthetics with modern sci-fi art, presenting a cultural collision that transcends time and space. Like a chance encounter at an art exhibition, it captures extraordinary moments in ordinary life. Shot with a professional-grade camera, it offers high resolution, rich detail, accurate color reproduction, natural light and shadow transitions, and a cinematic texture and depth. It seems like a casual amateur camera capturing real scenes, yet it contains strong artistic appeal and narrative tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
