        {
          "id": "krea2-6ec38682d34d71a8eca469eb",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙沙发愤怒坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman in a burgundy velvet mini dress sits elegantly on an off-white plush single sofa. She wears black stockings and black pointed high heels, her legs crossed, striking a dignified yet charming pose. Her right hand rests lightly on her knee, while her left hangs naturally at her side, exuding a sense of calm and restraint. Around her neck is a wide white satin ribbon bow, adding a touch of freshness and vintage charm to the overall look. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the middle shot, presenting an asymmetrical and balanced beauty. The figure occupies about one-third of the space, forming a visual focal point. The foreground features a smooth white marble floor with delicate textures and light gray natural patterns, reflecting soft light and enhancing the sense of depth in the space. The background is a simple white wall with a warm yellow wall lamp installed on it. The light spreads in a circular shape, creating a warm halo effect and creating a cozy and private atmosphere. On the right side is a large floor-to-ceiling window covered with light white sheer curtains, allowing soft natural light to flow in, making the entire space bright but not glaring Light and shadow intertwine, with just the right contrast of light and shadow, highlighting the character's silhouette and the texture of the clothing. The overall color scheme is mainly white, burgundy, and black, paired with warm yellow light to create a harmonious and unified visual language. The composition adopts a slightly tilted perspective, extending from the lower left corner to the upper right, guiding the gaze to focus on the character. At the same time, the sofa's curves and leg lines form a dynamic visual guideline, enhancing the flow and layering of the image. The camera uses a medium shot with moderate focal length and well-controlled depth of field, making the character stand out clearly. The background is moderately blurred, preserving environmental details without overpowering the main focus. The overall atmosphere blends the sophistication of a modern city with the romantic charm of classical elegance, as if capturing a quiet afternoon. It possesses strong artistic appeal and a lifelike photographic quality, like a fashionable portrait taken with a professional camera or a beautiful moment unintentionally recorded in daily life. The images are full of storytelling and emotional tension, rich in detail, delicate light and shadow, and full yet restrained colors, presenting a sophisticated and authentic aesthetic experience",
