        {
          "id": "krea2-2aa3b53ddeeed1c6c5a0bd0c",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣户外站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in the woods, wearing a light gray ribbed knit sweater and matching pants. The sweater features a crew neck, with natural rolled edges at the cuffs, presenting a casual yet refined texture with a glossy finish. Her makeup is elegant, and she looks directly at the camera, her expression calm yet tinged with mystery. Her right hand gently grips her left arm, her posture elegant and relaxed. On her shoulder is a brown handbag with woven textures and plush decorations. The bag is made of rugged woven material paired with soft white plush stripes. This creates a rich texture contrast. The foreground shows her body outline and clothing details, while the background is a blurred forest environment. The trees are tall and upright, with thick trunks and clearly visible bark texture. The leaves are pale green with rich layers. Sunlight filters through the gaps to cast mottled light and shadow, creating a soft scattered light effect. The overall composition centers on the figure, using a mid-shot portrait composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of center of the frame, slightly turned to the side, head slightly raised, and the gaze is slightly above the camera, creating a condescending visual direction. Light shines from the front slightly above, enhancing the sense of depth. The background blur is well handled, and the large-aperture lens is used to create a clear depth effect, making the subject stand out clearly. The background blends dreamily into greenery, with gray, green, and brown as the main tones, warm and harmonious. The overall atmosphere is calm, elegant, and artistic, resembling a photographic piece from a fashion magazine or a moment captured by a professional camera in the early morning forest, offering a visual experience that combines sophistication and realism",
