        {
          "id": "krea2-2df9aeeaf89c0cf91101ae99",
          "alias": "单女高领衫户外站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of the gray cement railing of the plateau viewing platform. She wears a burgundy turtleneck knit sweater and a black short skirt, paired with matching suede boots and dark green over-the-knee socks. The overall look is simple yet stylish, with the main subject positioned slightly to the left of the middle frame, using the classic three-part composition. The figure occupies the left third of the composition, while the right side leaves ample space to showcase a grand background. The foreground features a rough-textured cement railing with fine graininess and weathering marks on the surface. The edge of the railing is slightly worn, forming strong lines of direction. The middle ground is the main subject, with clear body contours, natural clothing folds, soft light and shadow transitions, and high color saturation. The red sweater contrasts sharply with the blue sky. The background features rolling brown hills, with sparse yellow-green vegetation covering the slopes and distant mountains layered. The outline is blurred, with the sky occupying the upper half of the composition. Vast fluffy white cumulus clouds float in the deep blue sky. The layers of clouds are distinct, edges outlined by sunlight with golden edges. Light and shadow shine down from the upper right, creating bright highlights on the figures. At the same time, clear shadows are cast on the railing and ground, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality. The light is warm and soft, presenting the golden atmosphere of an afternoon. The overall color palette is mainly red, blue, and brown, with striking contrasts and harmonious unity. The visual guide line is formed by the horizontal extension of the guardrail and the lines of the figure's body, directing the gaze toward the distant mountains and sky. The image is filled with tranquility, freedom, and poetry, with the texture of high-end fashion photography while preserving the realism of outdoor travel photos. It feels like a documentary shot with a professional camera, capturing a moment of tranquility and vastness. The details are rich and layered, combining artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life",
