          "id": "krea2-a9e04ec39511e71529a53ebe",
          "alias": "单女粉T恤浴室自信站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of the bathroom mirror for a selfie. She wears a pink spaghetti camisole with delicate lace trim along the edges, a small bow decoration on the chest, and white lace-trimmed underwear on the lower half. The overall look appears both gentle and slightly sexy. In her left hand, she holds a light gold smartphone, with three cameras and a round magnetic charging ring on the back. She is taking a selfie facing the mirror, looking relaxed and confident, her body slightly turned to the camera, presenting a natural sideways posture. The background is a bathroom wall covered with beige tiles. The tile surface is smooth and has a subtle sheen, reflecting soft light. On the left, you can see a dark brown door or cabinet with metal handles on the door. Several pieces of clothing hang nearby, one blue and one black faintly visible. The entire scene is centered on the figure, presented through mirror reflection, creating a symmetrical yet asymmetrical visual balance. In the foreground, the main figure and phone are clearly visible, while in the middle is her body outline and part of her environment. The background is a blurred wall and clothing. The composition uses mirror reflections to stretch the space, enhancing the depth of the image. The light and shadow flow to her body lines, creating a soft and realistic atmosphere. Warm indoor lighting evenly illuminates the figures, creating delicate shadow transitions. The wrinkles of the clothes are clearly visible, and the overall tone is warm with a yellowish tone, creating a private, everyday, and slightly lazy atmosphere of life. The painting has a strong documentary feel and a realistic texture of everyday life. It feels as if the moment was casually taken with ordinary household equipment, without deliberate lighting or embellishment, preserving the original sense of presence. Details are rich but not exaggerated, color layers are natural, and transitions of light and shadow are smooth, presenting a quiet and intimate private moment. The entire image exudes subtle emotions of youth, freedom, and self-expression, bearing traces of modern social media while retaining the warmth and authenticity of personal life, evoking a sense of beauty and tranquility in the ordinary",
