        {
          "id": "krea2-ea883cc98ac372b167dab44c",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫办公室微笑倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sat in a black office chair, her body slightly leaning forward, her right hand gently resting on her waist, her left hand naturally resting at her thigh. She wore a pristine white long-sleeved shirt with a neat neckline paired with a deep red tie. She wore a high-waisted burgundy patent leather short skirt that hugged her figure and accentuated her curves. Her legs were pressed together, wearing matching stockings and high heels, her toes slightly raised, her posture elegant and confident. Her makeup was exquisite, revealing a radiant smile. She looked down at several pages of documents on the desk, the papers spread out with slightly wrinkled edges. The background is a dim indoor environment, with black sofa seats and gray walls in the background. The walls are decorated with metallic decorative strips, and the floor is cement, somewhat rough. The overall lighting is dim, with the main light source coming from the front, creating a contrast of light and shadow that highlights the main subject's contour. Shadows fall behind and sides, creating a sense of layering. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center of the frame, head slightly tilted, gaze downward, guiding viewers to focus on her expressions and movements. The documents and desk edges in the foreground are clearly visible. Enhances spatial depth. The middle ground features the full body of the person and part of their seat, with background blur treatment that makes the subject stand out. The overall atmosphere blends professionalism with privacy, combining the formal office vibe with a relaxed and humorous mood. The use of light and shadow is delicate, presenting a realistic everyday shooting feel, as if captured by an amateur camera in low-light conditions. The color tones are mainly red, white, and black, with strong contrast and strong visual impact. The image is full of vitality and personality, with rich details. It presents a sense of everyday life yet meticulously designed, with an overall style that blends fashion and casualness, as if snapped in an impromptu snapshot during a work break, capturing a captivating moment",
