        {
          "id": "krea2-fdcc1c3cd690c679e3dd0153",
          "alias": "单女粉T恤厨房俏皮坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden floor, leaning slightly forward, legs crossed in a relaxed pose. She holds up a white smartphone in her right hand for a selfie, with the phone camera pointed directly at herself, creating an intimate mirrored view. She wears a light pink thin-strap sports tank top, made of lightweight and form-fitting material that highlights her slender shoulder and collarbone lines. She pairs a high-waisted gray tight yoga pants with knee-length legs, and the fabric has good stretch and sheen. She presents a soft matte texture, wearing a pair of white ankle socks printed with red hearts and cherry patterns on the top, adding a playful and cute element to the overall look. Her left hand rests naturally near the knee, fingers are long and neatly trimmed, wearing a simple gold earring and a thin chain necklace. The details are exquisite yet understated. The background is a modern-style interior space, with an open kitchen area on the left featuring dark cabinets and a light wood grain countertop, with a black metal-framed storage rack hanging above. On the right side is a dark green velvet sofa, soft and thick. Next to it is a potted green potted plant with dense and lush leaves, full of vitality. The floor is covered with an off-white wool carpet with slightly plush edges, contrasting with the wooden floor. The entire scene is warm and soft, with natural light slanting in from outside casting long streaks of light and shadow on the walls and furniture, creating a peaceful and comfortable home atmosphere. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame. Occupying the main visual focus, the phone serves as a guiding tool. The foreground highlights the main subject and clothing details, the middle ground shows the layered structure of the home environment, and the background uses blur to enhance spatial depth. The overall color palette is mainly warm brown, gray, and green, accented with a few bright colors, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. Light and shadow shine in from the upper right, creating a contrast of light and shadow that enhances three-dimensionality and realism. The image presents a natural and authentic momentary beauty from daily life, as if shot with a regular home camera or phone. With slight noise and realistic camera distortion, it preserves the authentic texture of life documentation, without excessive filters, emphasizing the capture of genuine emotions and the poetic expression of daily life. The entire scene exudes a warm, comfortable, intimate, and lifelike artistic atmosphere, like a private photo shared by a friend, full of warmth and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
