        {
          "id": "krea2-17b51dab270c4e5c346b7e8a",
          "alias": "单女蓝礼服花园神秘躺手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a deep blue-green haute couture gown elegantly lies on her side on a floor covered with white sand. Her posture is composed and noble, exuding a serene and enchanting aura that adds softness and vitality. Her makeup is exquisite and layered, her skin fair and radiant, like the purest jade under the moonlight. She wears a necklace set with dazzling gemstones, and the necklace sparkles brilliantly against the dark gown. The gown features a strapless design, with the corset closely clinging to the upper body covered in shiny silver sequins that sparkle like stars under the light. The skirt is wide and voluminous, layered with silky fabric, presenting a rich sapphire blue tone. The sheen is soft and flowing, and the dress is adorned with three-dimensional floral decorations of the same color, crafted with delicate hand-stitching and beadwork chains, lifelike in form and smooth lines. It seems to grow from the hem of a skirt, adding a touch of romance and dreaminess. The background is a blurred natural landscape, with mottled green moss or plant traces scattered across the white sand, forming irregular patterns. In the upper left corner, a small cluster of withered grass leaves and a small red fruit can be faintly seen, adding a touch of wildness and vitality to the scene. The overall composition is shot from a top-down angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the lower right, occupying the main visual space. The skirt stretches outward, almost filling the entire frame. It creates a strong visual impact, with a balanced and dynamic composition. The colors are mainly deep blue, dark green, and white, with striking contrasts and harmonious unity. Light and shadow come from the upper left position, soft and even, while delicate shadows cast between the skirt folds enhance the sense of three-dimensionality and the authenticity of the materials. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and mysterious, like a princess awakening in a fairy tale dreaming or waiting for the prince deep in an ancient garden. The image has strong artistic appeal, combining the refined beauty of high-end fashion photography. It also carries a surrealist fantasy tone, as if captured with professional cinematic equipment in a single eternal moment in the morning mist. The image quality is delicate, details rich, and the colors saturation high yet realistic, creating a visual experience that is both luxurious and ethereal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
