        {
          "id": "krea2-45686a14aecf8ec3d7ab542e",
          "alias": "单女困倦倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a light white Hanfu, with semi-transparent fabric adorned with delicate pink floral embroidery. The sleeves are wide and flowing, and the fabric is as soft and light as clouds, presenting a faint, hazy beauty. She leans forward slightly, her posture elegant yet reserved, her head tilted to the side, her expression gentle and serene. There are also two long white ribbons and a pink tassel hanging from the bun, gently swaying in the breeze. The overall look is full of classical Eastern charm. The background is a blurred deep green forest, with rich leaf layers and dappled light and shadow, creating a tranquil and far-reaching forest atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the right of the main subject, the head slightly tilted, leaving a large negative space on the left side. The flowing ribbons form a visual extension line, enhancing the sense of dynamism and breathability, with soft and even lighting. It seems to be scattered light from cloudy days or under tree shade, with natural transitions between light and shadow, no strong shadows, highlighting the translucency of the subject's skin and the light texture of the clothing. The colors are mainly cool whites, soft pinks, and deep greens, paired with metallic gold and iridescent reflections from transparent bubbles, creating a subtle contrast. The overall atmosphere is serene and poetic, like an ancient-style photo painting, full of artistic atmosphere and emotional tension, while retaining the authenticity of everyday photography, like shooting with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens. The background presents a beautiful blur effect outside focus, with delicate image texture, moderate color saturation, and rich layers of light and shadow, conveying a gentle, serene, dreamy, and beautiful Eastern aesthetic",
