        {
          "id": "krea2-3f9a5b10ce0f4acd682c09e2",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫窗边俏皮倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman leans elegantly against a corner of the room, wearing a simple white long-sleeved shirt made of light and soft fabric. The collar is slightly open, revealing delicate collarbone lines. The sleeves hang down naturally, slightly cinched, adding a touch of sharpness and intellect. She pairs the lower half with a gray high-waisted, asymmetrical skirt with distinct layers. The design is short in front and long in the back, cleverly outlining the leg lines. The skirt drapes well and naturally folds with the posture. Black stockings wrap her long legs, giving a delicate and smooth texture. She wears a pair of black pointed stiletto heels with gold decorative lines on the upper. The heels are slender and upright, giving the overall look both modern and full of fashion. She leans sideways against a blue-green wall, which has a smooth texture and natural color transitions, creating a soft gradient of light and shadow. Her right hand gently rests on the wall, while her left hand rests naturally on her thigh. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, and her posture is elegant yet relaxed. The background is a bright indoor space, with white walls that are clean and simple. A large window is located on the right side of the frame, with a dark gray frame. The glass lets in soft natural light, and the outside light is bright but not overexposed, creating even, diffused light that illuminates the entire scene. The outline of a white chair can be faintly seen by the window, with smooth backrest lines that may be made of plastic or metal. The floor is covered with a light-colored wooden floor, with clear wood grain and slight reflection, enhancing the sense of openness in the space. The composition uses an oblique perspective, with the figure extending from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a diagonal guide and focusing the visual focus on the figure. At the same time, geometric lines on walls and windows enhance the structural sense of the image. The foreground highlights the main subject, the middle view showcases the interior details, and the background is adorned with simple window views and furniture to avoid overshadowing the main focus. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft. Natural light enters through the right window, casting gentle shadows on the walls and figures. The contrast of light and shadow is just right, creating a peaceful, comfortable, and lively everyday atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly blue-green, white, gray, and black, harmoniously unified and harmonious, combining a cool and calm feeling. It maintains a warm and approachable touch, with delicate image texture that feels like shooting with a professional camera, yet retains casual moments from daily life, presenting a realistic and refined aesthetic style with strong visual appeal and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
