        {
          "id": "krea2-2c5f2038b2e96a3bfa81eebf",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙俏皮坐持包",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the stone steps, wearing a pink, flowing long dress with a light hem that drapes across the steps. The skirt is made of lightweight chiffon material, creating soft pleats and layered effects. The shoulders are designed off-shoulder with wide ruffle trim. The sleeves are wide and feature lace details, adorned with wooden beads and plush poms, adding a touch of retro and playful charm. She wears light blue denim shorts underneath, with natural frayed edges at the hems, and a brown leather belt tied around her waist. The belt is fitted with metal studs and round metal clasps, giving it a strong yet refined look. Her hands gently hold the hem of her skirt, while her right hand carries a brown leather handbag. The bag is small and rounded, smooth on the surface, and the strap is long and slender. She wears a pair of black platform ankle boots with a glossy surface and a thick heel. The overall look blends softness with coolness. In the center of the necklace is a small gemstone, her expression calm yet slightly thoughtful. The background features blurred green plants and yellow stone walls. Sunlight pours down from above, creating soft shadows on her body. The light is bright and warm, creating a fresh and natural atmosphere. The composition centers on the figure, using medium shots to highlight the overall form and posture of the figures. The foreground shows the texture details of the stone steps, the middle ground is the complete image of the person, and the background is a blurred green plant and wall. The direction of light and shadow comes from an upward angle, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The overall tone of the composition is soft, the color coordination harmonious, full of romance and poetry. It is like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, capturing a moment from everyday life, full of artistic flair and a sense of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
