        {
          "id": "krea2-6928a17c389d17f9ca8c1762",
          "alias": "单女湿身粉长裤街道自信站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the middle of a city street, her posture elegant and confident, her body slightly turned to the camera, her right hand naturally hanging down holding a phone, wearing pink glossy skinny pants and a lace strapless top adorned with sparkling pearls, wearing transparent high-heeled sandals, showing off her long legs and graceful figure. In the foreground is a gray asphalt pavement, with clear white traffic markings and round manhole covers. In the middle is a woman, occupying the left central position. The background features a modern urban architectural complex, including office buildings with glass curtain walls, Residential buildings with brick walls and commercial buildings with white curved porches can be seen in the distance. The air conditioning units and greenery are visible in the distance. The sky is a clear blue without clouds, bright and warm lighting. Sunlight streams down from the upper right, casting clear shadows on the ground. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, making the figures appear taller and taller. The visual guide naturally leads the figure deeper into the frame through their gaze and body. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and fresh, with soft pink tones as the main color, contrasting with the gray-blue buildings and sky. It creates a blend of urban fashion and everyday life, presenting a professional studio-level texture while retaining the natural vibe of authentic street photography, as if taken with a high-end camera on a sunny afternoon, delivering strong visual impact and artistic beauty",
