        {
          "id": "krea2-65b7c624e9aceba1983e8fe2",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣沙发微笑持相机",
          "prompt": "She turns sideways to look back at the camera, wearing a faint, almost imperceptible smile. Her makeup is delicate and natural, radiating a healthy glow. She wears a red-and-white striped knit camisole with a halter-style neckline that highlights her neckline. The straps are slim, revealing parts of her shoulders and collarbones. She pairs loose blue denim overalls with wide legs, metal buckles and adjustable straps at the waist, making the overall look casual yet fashionable, with long fingers The right hand naturally rests on the armrest of the sofa, posture relaxed, body slightly tilted, presenting a casual, elegant dynamic beauty. The foreground is the main figure, occupying most of the space, clearly visible from chest to thigh. The composition uses medium to close shots, with an indoor background. The wall is light beige, slightly soft. A yellow jacket hangs on the wall, made of lightweight material with wrinkles. In the upper right corner is a white sheet of paper printed with blurred text or patterns. On the right side of the sofa's backrest, a yellow tape measure is visible, with clear edges The details are rich, adding a sense of life. The lighting throughout the scene is soft and warm, with the light source coming from the left front of the figure, creating a natural side lighting effect. The shadow transitions are delicate, creating a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. The tones are mainly warm yellow, off-white, and blue-gray, harmoniously unified, with balanced and layered composition. The background is well handled with blur, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. Overall, it presents a subtle beauty in everyday life, as if taken with a regular camera—authentic, natural, and full of life The image is delicate in texture, rich in details, with natural light and shadow transitions, moderate color saturation, and no excessive embellishment. It feels more like a relaxed and casual home portrait, conveying an atmosphere of youth, freedom, and tranquility",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
