        {
          "id": "krea2-e16160a5d1d0c4a967052589",
          "alias": "单女丝袜广场俏皮躺侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears lace tights with dark floral patterns on the lower body, and a pair of shiny burgundy square-toe Mary Jane shoes. The overall look is full of vintage and fashionable flair. Her hands are naturally placed at her sides, fingers slightly apart, her posture relaxed and elegant, her head slightly tilted, her makeup exquisite, and her expression slightly lazy and playful. On the left shoulder is a small black handbag, simple in body with a slender strap. The composition centers on the figure, arranged diagonally. The figure lies diagonally with legs extending upward, forming a visual guiding line. The stone steps extend from the bottom to the top, presenting clear layering and perspective. The stone steps are made of gray stone, with natural wear marks and fine cracks on the surface. The texture is rough but textured, while the background is a continuous stone staircase extending into the distance, creating a sense of spatial depth, with light coming from the upper side Natural daylight, soft and even, without strong shadows, with natural transitions of light and shadow, highlighting the sheen of the leather jacket and the delicate texture of lace. The overall atmosphere blends the everyday feel of urban streets with the refined beauty of artistic photography, presenting a lifestyle aesthetic that is both casual and designed. The color tones are mainly burgundy, black, and gray, with striking contrasts that are harmoniously unified. The visuals have strong visual impact and narrative quality, as if capturing a moment of privacy, combining the breath of life with cinematic compositional tension. Shot with a professional camera, high resolution, rich detail, well-controlled depth of field, slightly blurred backgrounds that highlight the subject, the overall style resembles street fashion blockbusters, combining realism with artistic expression. It simulates slight noise and natural lighting effects from amateur equipment shooting, enhancing the image's authenticity and approachability, creating an atmosphere that is both refined and warm, retaining the warmth of everyday life",
