        {
          "id": "krea2-30e257008fa3a937ed9c0da7",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣椅上困倦倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman sat on a black high-back gaming chair, wearing fine-rimmed glasses that reflected faint indoor light. She wore bright red lipstick, looking sexy and spirited. She wore an off-white knit camisole that fit her body perfectly, showing off graceful curves. The straps were slender, and the chest and waist were simple yet delicate, with a lace-trimmed bra faintly visible underneath. Around her neck was a thin chain necklace with a small red gemstone hanging from it, adding a splash of color. In her right hand, she held a light gold smartphone. The back of the phone clearly shows the dual camera module. The fingers are long, and a silver ring is worn on the ring finger. The posture is naturally relaxed, the body leans slightly forward, and the left hand hangs naturally on the leg. The background is a typical home gaming space. On the left is a large monitor displaying colorful fantasy scenes. A giant glowing mushroom floats in the deep blue night sky, creating a dreamy otherworldly atmosphere. Below the monitor is a black keyboard and mouse, scattered with miscellaneous items on the table, and on the right is the backrest of the gaming chair. With geometric grid patterns, the overall environment presents a style that blends modern technology with personal life. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center to the right to form a visual focal point. The camera angle slightly tilts upward to enhance the character's sense of depth and presence. The foreground highlights the main subject, the middle ground includes some computer equipment and seats, and the background is mainly a monitor screen, forming a distinctly layered spatial structure. Tracing back to the overall environment, it forms a complete viewing path. The lighting mainly comes from the warm tones on the left front, possibly desk lamps or ambient light. The light is soft and even, creating delicate shadow transitions. The background monitor emits a cool blue light, contrasting with the warm light in the background, enhancing the contrast and visual tension. The overall atmosphere combines the casual feel of daily life with the unique technological vibe of the digital age, presenting a private, authentic, and highly personalized selfie moment, as if relaxing late at night after enjoying gaming alone. The image texture is delicate The color saturation is moderate, the details rich, combining the realism of photography with a touch of artistic touch, creating a warm, intimate, and slightly mysterious atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
