          "id": "krea2-4ab94e34ad17e7825cb6408f",
          "alias": "单女粉旗袍花园严肃坐持伞",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by a stone bridge in a Jiangnan water town, wearing a light pink sleeveless qipao with a high neckline and a well-tailored cut. The fabric has a delicate texture and a soft linen texture, paired with a white lace shawl adorned with tassels and hollowed-out patterns that naturally drape over her arms and skirt, adding a touch of softness and vintage charm. She leans slightly to the side, gently holding a beige oil-paper umbrella with both hands. The umbrella is half open, the ribs clearly visible, and the handle is slender. The overall look is fresh and elegant, full of classical charm. In the foreground is the stone railing she sits, rough with clear texture and traces of time. On the railing rests an open book, its pages yellowed and its cover plain, hinting at an artistic and tranquil atmosphere. The middle ground is her body and surroundings, positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The background is a tranquil pond. A few emerald lotus leaves float on the water, reflecting the sky and surrounding scenery. In the distance stands a bluish-gray stone arch bridge, with a simple and rustic structure, smooth lines, and archway arches that harmonize with the water in a geometric composition. Behind the bridge, faint architectural outlines can be seen, possibly traditional residences or garden buildings, with gray-blue tones as the main tone, creating a tranquil and distant atmosphere. The entire scene uses shallow depth of field photography, with the subject clearly prominent, the background blurred naturally, and light and shadow coming from the right. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled light spots, creating a soft backlighting effect. The figure's outline is outlined by golden light, with delicate texture. The colors are mainly pink, white, gray, and green, warm and soft. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, poetic, and romantic, like a Jiangnan woman in an ink wash painting, full of Eastern aesthetic conception. The composition uses a three-part method, with the figures occupying the main position of the composition, leaving reasonable blank space, then flowing toward the background bridges and ponds, forming a smooth visual flow. The composition is layered and rich in detail. It combines the warmth of everyday life with the refinement and sophistication of artistic creation, as if shooting with an old film camera in the afternoon sunlight, preserving real light and texture, giving a nostalgic and warm feeling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
