          "id": "krea2-f23f712e1639162cae2405f6",
          "alias": "单女棕西装街道冷淡站立持书",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a deep brown tailored suit stands on a city street corner. She wears a uniquely designed short blazer, with the collar open to reveal a thin black camisole underneath. She pairs it with matching high-waisted shorts. The overall look is fashionable, sharp, and yet still sexy and charming. She wears vintage black-rimmed glasses that reflect the light and shadow of her surroundings. Her makeup is exquisite, her left hand gently holding the glasses, and her right hand holding a folded newspaper. On the newspaper are colorful pictures and text, and on her feet are black patent leather strap-on high heels. Her long legs look especially slender in the sunlight, her body slightly turned to the camera, her left leg crossed in front of her right, presenting an elegant posture. She leans against a black metal lamp post, whose smooth surface reflects lightly, forming a sharp contrast with the gray stone wall. The background is a building exterior made of large blocks of gray stone, with clear texture and neat joints. The wall feels rough and heavy, and on the left side is a rusty fire hydrant. The orange-yellow metal pipe forms a visual focal point with the surrounding cool tones. The ground is a sidewalk paved with gray square tiles, edged with a striking yellow curbstone. Next to it sits a black glossy leather handbag. The bag is simple and modern, with natural folds and reflections on the surface. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center. The lamp post serves as vertical lines to guide the view, forming a framed composition that enhances the sense of depth in the space. Light comes from the right, warm afternoon sunlight, gently casting shadows on the figures, casting clear shadows on the walls, floor, and objects, creating a three-dimensional layering of light and shadow, the overall atmosphere blends urban calm rationality with personal fashion personality. It combines the realistic everyday feel of street life with the artistic texture of a high-end fashion blockbuster. The colors are mainly earthy tones, with brown, gray, and black echoing each other. Yellow curbstones and orange fire hydrants serve as visual highlights. The visual tones are harmonious and unified, with rich details, presenting an independent and confident lifestyle of modern urban women, as if taken with a professional camera. It has a strong visual impact and a fashionable vibe",
