        {
          "id": "krea2-803c353f69e68e0a3e822f71",
          "alias": "单女灰外套城市愤怒坐注视",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle perspective, a woman sits inside a modern building's curved stone structure. She wears a soft gray plush jacket paired with a black cropped top and black shorts, sitting cross-legged with her hands naturally resting on the stone walls on either side. Her body leans slightly back, head slightly raised, and her expression is relaxed and confident, adding a touch of dynamism. Her makeup is exquisite, and she wears a thin chain necklace around her neck. The overall look is fashionable and distinctive, and she wears thick-soled black Martin boots with smooth, reflective surfaces. The heavy soles appear steady and powerful. The floor is made of gray paved stone slabs with clear texture and regular gaps. The stone structure is made of massive gray stones, rough and naturally grainy, presenting a cold and stern industrial style. The structure is arched and extends upward, forming a frame resembling a doorway or passage, framing the sky within. The sky is deep blue, dotted with a few thin wisps of white clouds. Light pours down from above, creating a natural transition of light and shadow, with outstanding light and shadow effects. The figure's outlines are even more vivid against the bright background. The composition employs strong symmetry and framing styles. The stone lines guide the gaze toward the center, creating a visual focal point. At the same time, the fisheye lens's wide-angle distortion effect creates slight bending at the edges, enhancing the sense of depth and drama in the space. The foreground features the ground and the figure's feet, rich in detail; the middle ground features the main figure and stone walls, with distinct layers; the background is the open sky and distant blurred architectural silhouettes, creating a sense of urban outdoor space The overall atmosphere blends the coldness of the city with the freedom of individual expression, combining the deliberate beauty of artistic photography with the realism of everyday street shooting. The color tones are mainly gray, black, and blue, with moderate saturation, strong but not glaring, and the images full of tension, conveying an independent, cool, and unrestrained attitude toward life. It feels like a moment captured by a street photographer in the afternoon sunlight with a portable camera—authentic and full of storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
