        {
          "id": "krea2-8b4080a5c37d14493394d1a7",
          "alias": "单女黑风衣车厢冷淡站立持花",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the edge of the subway platform, stepping out of a deep blue subway carriage. She wears a long black leather trench coat and a black beret, as if whispering softly or just breathing air. Her right hand tightly holds a large bouquet of white daisies, lush with flowers and green leaves, appearing fresh yet fragile. Her left hand gently rests on the metal railing by the door, her body leans forward slightly, her right leg steps out, while her left leg remains inside the carriage, presenting a dynamic sense of balance. The entire pose is full of storytelling and the beauty of capturing moments. The composition occupies the center-left position, forming a visual focal point. The middle ground features the open train doors and interior carriage, where beige seats, silver handrails, and warm lighting inside the carriage are visible. The lines extend backward, creating a sense of depth. The background is an arched metro station dome with soft curves at the top. The walls are light gray tiles, the floor is paved with gray floor tiles, and the yellow safety warning line runs along the platform edge, forming a strong guiding line. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot. This makes the characters appear tall and commanding, while also lengthening the spatial perspective and enhancing the dramatic tension of the scene. The light mainly comes from the warm yellow fluorescent lights inside the carriage, contrasting with the cool-toned ambient lighting on the platform, creating warm localized illumination. The shadow layers are rich, and the overall light and shadow atmosphere blends urban detachment with individual emotional warmth. The colors are mainly black, blue, and white, accented with yellow-orange lighting, creating a retro yet modern visual style. The image has a slight film graininess and natural camera distortion. It simulates real camera shooting effects, as if a medium format film camera is shooting handheld in low-light conditions. The focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, the background slightly blurred, and the subject is highlighted. The overall atmosphere feels both like an impromptu urban encounter and a private narrative about waiting and parting, full of poetry and cinematic feel. The images are rich in detail and distinct layers, possessing strong emotional appeal and artistic expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
