        {
          "id": "krea2-903a9fe4e550a51b8e7eb62e",
          "alias": "单女米衬衫车厢神秘站立注视",
          "prompt": "Inside a spacious subway carriage, a woman stands out with a striking pose, becoming the absolute focal point of the scene. She wears a loose beige-brown silk shirt dress, the fabric naturally draping to create smooth pleats. Her sleeves are casually rolled up to her elbows, revealing her slender arms and a simple silver bracelet on her wrist, slightly curled and slightly curled, exuding a calm yet mysterious aura. She grabs the metal armrest above her head with one hand, gently caresses her knee with the other, leans her body back slightly, and crosses her legs. One foot rests on the edge of the seat, the other dangling in the air. On one foot is a pair of black lace high-heeled sandals. The slender heels cast clear shadows on the ground, creating an overall posture both elegant and powerful, as if a moment deep in the city has been captured as an independent moment. In the foreground is a row of dark brown leather seats inside the cabin, with slight wear marks and reflections. The seat edges are clean, contrasting with the figure. On the left, a thick metal pillar runs through the frame, extending from the bottom to the roof. Its smooth surface reflects the light and shadow of the surrounding environment. The middle ground is the corridor space of the carriage, with a dark gray anti-slip material with slight reflection. In the distance, two closed light green doors can be seen, with metal edges on the door frames. The doors are fitted with transparent glass windows, and the view outside is blurry, faintly revealing the outline of the platform or tunnel. The top of the carriage is lined with long tube fluorescent tubes, emitting a warm yellowish glow. Some tubes produce slight halos and noise due to aging, creating a retro and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The ceiling and walls are light gray-white, covered with fine scratches and signs of use, showing the daily operation of this subway. The right side also has seats and handrails, but they are located farther away, presenting a reduced perspective effect. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, making the figures appear more upright and prominent, while also lengthening the spatial depth of the carriage. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, using diagonal composition to guide the gaze backward, enhancing dynamic balance. In terms of lighting and shadow, The main light source comes from the roof fluorescent lights, which shine diagonally from above, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on the figures. The chest, arms, and legs are illuminated, while the backlit areas leave delicate shadows that emphasize three-dimensionality. Meanwhile, the reflected light from the roof and walls forms strip-like bright spots on the floor, enhancing the sense of realism in the space. The overall atmosphere blends urban indifference with personal tenderness, combining industrialized cold texture with delicate humanistic care. The color tones are mainly warm brown, off-white, and gray-green. Complemented by cool metallic gray tones, the color scheme is harmoniously unified, creating a serene yet story-rich artistic atmosphere—like a street documentary shot late at night by an amateur photographer with an old-fashioned camera, with slight film graininess and imperfect exposure, yet making it feel even more real and moving",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
