        {
          "id": "krea2-2dcb7f2529011922b9de60f9",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜室内沉思坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a modern black leather chair, legs crossed and curled up in front of her, knees pressed against her chest, toes naturally hanging down. She wears a black short-sleeved top and black stockings, leans slightly back, gently wraps her arms around her calves, her posture elegant and relaxed, head slightly tilted, expression calm and focused, presenting a contemplative serene state. The background is pure white walls, simple and clean, without any decorations or distractions, and the floor is paved with marble tiles with natural textures. Light gray and white intertwine to reflect soft light. The chair's design has a retro-modern feel. The backrest and seat cushion are made of black leather with fine stitching along the edges. The four legs extend outward in a tapered shape, made of dark wood, with smooth and powerful lines. The overall composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center, occupying the main visual space and creating a strong visual focal point. The camera shoots upward from a slightly low angle, enhancing the character's presence and presence. The light and shadow come from the left. It gently and evenly illuminates the front and body curves of the figure, with a natural shadow transition on the right side. The strong contrast between light and shadow highlights three-dimensionality and texture. The entire composition is dominated by black, white, and gray, creating a simple, sophisticated, and artistic atmosphere, while also carrying a touch of casualness and realism from everyday life. It feels like a portrait shot with a professional camera in a quiet indoor environment, rich in detail, clear layering, full of storytelling and emotional tension. The image style blends fashion photography with human aesthetics, emphasizing the fluidity of form and the expression of body language. There are no unnecessary objects or text in the image; emotions and aesthetics are conveyed purely through the postures of the figures, environmental layout, and the interplay of light and shadow. The composition is balanced and full of tension. The foreground is the main body of the figure and chair, the middle is the junction between the floor and the wall, and the background is a clean white wall. The three form a clear spatial layer, extending along the body's curves to the legs and feet, forming a complete visual closed loop The overall atmosphere is tranquil and profound, combining the refinement of artistic photography with a natural, everyday vibe, as if capturing a fleeting inner monologue that lingers in memory",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
