        {
          "id": "krea2-c796bd30ba176ec60f22bef3",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道忧伤坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a street bench at night, naturally draped over her shoulders, her expression carrying a hint of mystery and confidence. She wears a black leather jacket with a smooth texture, sleeves slightly rolled up, revealing slender arms. She wears light-colored jeans, her posture relaxed and elegant, her body slightly leaning, one hand resting on the chair armrest, the other naturally hanging down, forming a tensiony diagonal composition. Her presence is the absolute subject of the painting, positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, occupying about one-third of the space. The visual focal point is the middle of the street paved with dark gray bricks, the surface smooth, the brick joints clearly visible, extending deep into the frame. On both sides of the street are blurred outlines of shops and buildings; on the right, a storefront glowing with warm yellow lights is faintly visible. At the entrance, a figure stands with his back to the camera, adding a touch of life. On the left are several vintage-style street lamps with white shades emitting a soft halo, while the background is a warm bokeh composed of countless hanging round bulbs of varying sizes. The colors transition from golden yellow to orange-red, hanging in an orderly fashion in the air, forming flowing light strips that create a dreamlike atmosphere. In the distance, purple and pink neon signs blur into soft patches of color, injecting a modern urban feel into the image. The overall composition uses a low-angle shot, with the camera slightly tilting up to enhance the aura. At the same time, shallow depth of field is used to completely blur the background, highlighting the main subject. The light mainly comes from decorative and street lights in the background, creating a combination of backlight and side lighting, with clear contours. It appears bright and spirited, with the overall color scheme mainly warm yellow and dark brown, accented by black, gray, and a touch of purple, creating a warm, romantic, and slightly melancholic nighttime atmosphere. The light and shadow contrast is strong, the transition between light and dark is natural, and the image has a film-like texture, rich details, and clear layering. It feels like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens, featuring slight graininess and color shifts, presenting an artistic style that blends vintage and modern, while preserving the authenticity of everyday street photography. It allows people to feel the tranquility and poetry of the nighttime streets",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
