        {
          "id": "krea2-9485b1f53faa576d10d0998d",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙椅上俏皮坐泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a Parisian-style wrought iron chair on a balcony. She wears a simple white spaghetti strap dress that reaches mid-thigh. The fabric is light and fits the figure, presenting soft pleats and natural drape, draped naturally over her shoulders. Her hands hold a delicate bouquet made of pale pink, cream white, and pale yellow roses. The petals are layered, and green leaves are scattered throughout, giving the place a vibrant life. She sits barefoot on the chair, The right leg is bent, the left leg naturally extended, the ankle relaxed, and the toes naturally extended, presenting a relaxed yet authentic posture. In front of it is a white cast-iron carved round table with intricate hollowed-out patterns. In the center sits a white plate containing two golden, crispy French croissants, their surface glossy, edges slightly caramelized, exuding a warm and inviting atmosphere. Beneath the table is a matching round shelf set against a typical Parisian architectural facade with a dark gray tiled roof. Multiple bay windows with white frames and black metal railings. The walls are beige, slightly mottled, revealing traces of time. The balcony railings are made of black wrought iron, carved with vine and leaf patterns, with smooth and elegant lines. The floor is made of cement, slightly damp, reflecting faint light. The overall shot is shot at a low angle, with the figure as the center of the composition, forming a visual focal point. The foreground highlights the figure and bouquet, the middle ground features tables, chairs, and food, and the background is a cluster of buildings with clear layers, then turns to the bread on the table. Finally, the distant buildings create a peaceful and lively atmosphere. The lighting is soft natural light in the early morning or evening, with sunlight pouring from the side and top, creating subtle shadows. This makes the figure's outline clear, the clothing texture delicate, and flowers and bread surfaces reflecting warmly. The overall tone leans warm, mainly off-white, light pink, and gray-brown, creating a cozy and romantic yet everyday scene. The image texture is close to real photography, with slight film graininess and natural noise, and the lens's edges slightly blurred. Enhancing the sense of spatial depth, the painting is filled with the poetic and relaxed charm of French living, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching morning moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
