        {
          "id": "krea2-e16c7023fbd6240cb92cb8a4",
          "alias": "单女红礼服节庆冷淡坐持书",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a vintage red-black gown sits indoors, wearing a red lace tight dress with fluffy black plush fabric on the shoulders and sleeves, creating a strong visual contrast. The skirt is short and delicate, accentuating the leg lines. She wears black lace fishnet stockings with intricate patterns that echo the overall look. On her feet are black strappy high heels, and a hat adorned with black feathers is adorned with pearl chains and metal rings. She wears large gold earrings and a multi-layered pearl necklace, a ring on her finger, holding a brown-covered book with a red spine, the pages slightly open. She poses dignified, her body slightly leaning forward, her expression cold and confident. The background is an indoor space decorated with festive elements, walls are a mix of beige and gray, decorated with white lines, and above is a mirror-framed niche. Inside, several bottles of wine, a black candlestick, red bow ornaments, white sculptures, and Christmas wreaths. The alcove edges are decorated with silver sequins. The floor is a dark wooden floor reflecting a faint sheen. The figure sits on a light gray fabric chair with a simple backrest, partially visible metal brackets. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, occupying the main visual space. The foreground shows the figure's body and the book in his hands, and the middle ground shows the posture and some environmental details. The background consists of niches and decorations, forming a clear spatial layer. Through her clothing details and hand movements, the design extends to the background decorations. Light and shadow come from soft, warm-toned side lighting, creating a warm yet slightly dramatic atmosphere. The natural shadows highlight three-dimensionality, presenting an artistic style of vintage luxury, elegance, mystery, and a touch of festival, much like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera in low-light conditions, with a strong cinematic feel and the atmosphere of a fashionable blockbuster",
