        {
          "id": "krea2-5349a79e7ecfb7706427dfe4",
          "alias": "单女毛衣冷淡侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a burgundy thin strap knit short top with white trim on the edges, forming a V-neck shape that highlights the neck line and collarbones. She wears light blue loose pants made of lightweight material with natural pleats. The waist is lined with black lining, and her hands gently tug at the waistband, forming a casual knot. On her wrist is a gold bracelet and a simple metal watch. Fingers are long, nails neatly trimmed, overall posture natural and relaxed, body slightly tilted to one side, head slightly tilted, creating a casual yet elegant feel. The foreground is where the main subject occupies most of the composition, from chest to knee fully presented. The middle is the transitional area between the figure and the background, including details of her arms, waist, and clothing. The background is a dense green shrub with layers of leaves, colors gradient from dark green to light green, some leaves emitting a soft sheen under the light. A natural blurred background is created. The composition uses a centered composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame. The depth of field effect blurs the background and highlights the subject. The lighting and shadows are natural light from above, with sunlight filtering through the gaps in the leaves. The shadows are delicate and even, creating a fresh and natural atmosphere full of summer vibes. The color tones are mainly green and red, paired with blue clothing to create a warm and cool contrast. The color saturation is moderate, and the texture feels realistic, as if shot with a professional camera. Yet it retains the relaxed feel of everyday life. The lens uses an 85mm prime portrait lens with an f/2.8 aperture, capturing delicate skin textures and clothing textures. The background bokeh is soft, presenting an authentic beauty that is both fashionable and close to everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
