        {
          "id": "krea2-f9b13325e6ba6266332db608",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔小巷忧伤倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways against a rough red brick wall, her head slightly tilted back. Smoke gently rises, drifting slowly in the air to form light white wisps. She wears a loose blue denim jacket over a light-colored top and dark pants, hands folded in front of her, her posture relaxed yet slightly detached, her expression thoughtful, as if immersed in her own world. On the left side of the painting is a towering red brick wall, with clear cracks visible, rough texture, illuminated by warm yellow lighting, presenting a rich vintage tone. On the right is a narrow alley extending into the distance, with damp ground reflecting light. The distant streetlights and building outlines appear faintly in the blur, creating a strong sense of depth and spatial layering. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the frame, leaving a large space on the right side to guide the gaze deeper into the alley. The contrast of light and shadow is strong, the left wall is clearly illuminated, and the smoke casts hazy outlines in the backlight. The overall atmosphere is calm, melancholic, and tinged with a hint of decadent beauty. The tones are mainly warm yellow and deep blue, with a striking contrast between warm and cool tones. It creates a unique sense of loneliness in the city's nighttime corners. The lens simulates film camera effects, with slight graininess and natural noise, slightly dark edges, moderate but layered color saturation, soft and directional lighting, artificial light from the upper left illuminating the subject, and the background light spots appear as circular bokeh, enhancing the artistic and cinematic feel of the image. The overall visual language conveys the loneliness and freedom of urban nightwalkers, as if taking a brief pause on a late-night street, full of storytelling and emotional tension. It is suitable for expressing the inner world of modern youth and the sense of detachment from urban life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
