        {
          "id": "krea2-18adfe70342e2d8367cfac91",
          "alias": "单女白T恤户外站立侧头",
          "prompt": "Low-angle downward view: Next, a woman stands on an outdoor wooden ladder. She wears a white tight-fitting short-sleeve T-shirt and a black high-waisted A-line skirt, paired with black stockings and black Martin boots. Her ankles show white socks, and she elegantly lifts one leg onto the ladder rail, lightly supporting the edge with the other hand. Her body leans back slightly, her head tilted back, presenting a free-spirited yet slightly lazy aura. The main focus is the person's entire body, fully presented from feet to head. In the foreground, the wooden ladder structure and her leg movements are clearly visible; in the middle ground, the figure's body outlines and clothing details; the background is a vast blue sky, with sparse deciduous trees and faint utility poles and wires in the distance. The composition uses a strong, low-angle low-angle shooting technique to make the figure appear tall and upright. The visual guide line extends diagonally from the ladder to the figure's body, finally converging at the sky, creating an upward dynamic effect. The light and shadow come from midday or afternoon sunlight, bright and even, with clear shadow transitions on the figure's body The clothing wrinkles naturally, the overall atmosphere is full of youthful energy and a sense of freedom and freedom. The color contrast is strong, with the blue sky as the base color. The black-and-white color scheme of the figures stands out, creating a strong visual impact. At the same time, it retains the realism and lived-in feel of everyday amateur equipment shooting, as if captured by chance on an ordinary spring day. The lens has a slight graininess and realistic exposure, presenting a film-like texture. The details are rich and layered, combining artistic beauty with the authenticity of life. It creates an imaging style that is both fashionable and close to everyday life",
