        {
          "id": "krea2-d966f74f57c0df07affe9769",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤海滩自信倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sat in a folding chair on the beach, wearing a light blue off-shoulder camisole and a loose gray-white long-sleeved sun-protective jacket. The sleeves of the jacket were casually rolled up to the elbows, revealing slender arms. Her right hand held a clear glass bottle of mineral water. Her fingers were long, nails painted dark polish, slightly bent as she gripped the bottle. She was looking at the camera, exuding a sense of relaxation and comfort. She sat on an outdoor folding chair with a wooden frame and black fabric surface, the chair's backrest slightly reclined and her body slightly leaning forward. Her posture is natural and comfortable. The foreground is a close-up of her half-body body, occupying the main part. Behind her is a small wooden table with a dark wine bottle, a glass cup, a vintage-style small oil lamp, a silver metal thermos, and some scattered items. A chain decoration hangs beside the table, with a vast beach and deep blue sea in the background. The water shows a gradient blue from near to far, from light blue to deep blue. There are slight ripples on the surface, and in the distance, a white cruise ship can be seen slowly sailing Further away are rolling green hills and coastline. The sky is clear and pale blue, with thin clouds and bright but not harsh sunlight. Above is an off-white sunshade, with simple patterns printed on the tarpaulin. A row of round metal cookware hangs along the edge as decoration, and string lights are scattered beneath the canopy, creating a cozy atmosphere. The entire scene is composed in a central style, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The visual layers are created by the extending elements of the tabletop and background. The middle scene features tables, chairs, and the lower body of the figure. The distant view features the sea and skyline, with soft and warm lighting effects. Sunlight streams down from the upper right, creating a bright but underexposed light that presents the unique warm tone of a summer afternoon. The tones are mainly blue, white, and beige, harmonious and unified. The image texture is delicate, with a strong sense of daily life and a sense of everyday life. It feels like a real scene shot with a regular camera or phone, with slight film graininess and slight motion blur, enhancing realism and documentary quality. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, full of the leisure and beauty of a summer vacation conveying a sense of tranquility, comfort, and the aesthetic of enjoying the present life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
