        {
          "id": "krea2-4212d83f69fcdb1e19688a3a",
          "alias": "单女背心冷淡喝",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman presents an unintentionally lazy vibe. She wears a sleeveless top with a white base and small blue floral patterns, with a collar decorated with delicate lace lace. The fabric looks soft and breathable, with a delicate texture. She tilts her head slightly, her gaze slightly away from the camera, as if gazing into the distance or lost in memories. In the foreground, a green straw can be seen extending from a coconut shell container below, hinting that she is drinking fresh coconut juice. This detail adds a sense of everyday life and a refreshing summer feeling. The background is a blurred green plant, possibly dense leaves or shrubs, creating a soft bokeh effect. The blur treatment highlights the main subject. The composition uses a centered composition, with the person positioned slightly above the center of the frame, the head occupying the main part of the frame, creating a visual focal point. The camera uses a large aperture (such as f/1.8 or f/2.0) to shoot with a strong depth of field, making the subject clear while the background is completely blurred. Light comes from above, warm natural daylight, creating mottled light and shadow. Highlights are bright and transparent, while shadows transition softly, creating the texture of morning or afternoon sunlight. The overall color scheme mainly features warm and cool contrasts, with a rich green background tone. The colors are harmoniously unified, creating a peaceful, fresh, and healing atmosphere, carrying a pastoral poetry and youthful nostalgia, as if capturing the gentlest moment of a summer afternoon. The photography style resembles film texture, with slight graininess and color shifts, simulating the realism of everyday handheld camera or mobile phone shooting while preserving artistic light and shadow layers. Emphasizing true details and emotional expression under natural light, there are no obvious artificial lighting marks in the image. All light and shadow come from ambient light, enhancing authenticity and immersion. The entire image conveys a tranquil, innocent, and leisurely state of life, allowing people to feel the slow flow of time and inner peace.",
