        {
          "id": "krea2-6356c5d2605594ac160586aa",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜街道忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "Standing on a beautifully decorated metal railing bridge, she turns sideways to look back at the camera, her left hand lightly resting on the green railing, right hand tucked at her waist, her posture elegant and confident. She wears black stockings and platform high-heeled ankle boots, her legs long and slender. The main subject of the frame is this woman, positioned slightly in the center on the right side, occupying the visual center. The railing surface looks somewhat worn, showing signs of age. Some areas show rust and peeling, contrasting with the figures. The middle view shows a wide river, its surface shimmering, reflecting the blue sky and the warm yellow tones of the buildings on both banks. The water flow is steady but slightly undulating. The riverbank is made of stone embankments, extending into the distance. In the distance, an arch bridge can be seen spanning the river, with a clear structure. Multi-story brick and stone buildings are neatly arranged, with elaborate facade decorations and orderly windows. Some exterior walls are light yellow or beige. With classical reliefs and eaves decorations, several modern cars parked or driving on the street, including red, silver, and dark gray vehicles, and pedestrians walking on the sidewalks, overall presenting the everyday atmosphere of urban life. The composition uses a third-division method, with the figure positioned on the right one-third, the gaze extending to the left, creating a sense of depth. Low-angle shots enhance the figure's proportions and grandeur, while highlighting the beauty of the bridge railings. The visual guide starts from the foreground railing, with the lighting and shadow atmosphere reflecting the soft light of dusk. Sunlight slanted from the upper right, creating a warm golden hue. The sky shows a gradient from pale blue to orange-yellow horizon, with the water reflecting the colors of the sky and buildings, creating rich layers of light and shadow. The overall tone is cool but accented by warm light, creating a tranquil and slightly melancholic urban poetic atmosphere. The image has a realistic camera texture, shot with full-frame cameras such as the Canon 5D Mark IV or Sony A7R IV, focal length 85mm, f/2.8 aperture, shutter speed 1/200 sec, ISO 400, with slight film graininess, retains natural noise and dynamic range, simulates natural exposure at sunset, with slight lens distortion and edge vignetting enhancing realism. The background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject. Overall, it presents an urban portrait style that combines fashion and everyday life, like a professional photographer capturing a city moment at dusk with high-end equipment. The image is delicate and full of storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
