        {
          "id": "krea2-c01d1005ff9dd0e2225e00ee",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙摄影棚忧伤展示",
          "prompt": "She wears a tailored deep red sailor collar top with a white bow at the neckline, black patchwork on the cuffs, and delicate white piping visible in the details. She pairs a black-and-white plaid pleated short skirt with a natural hem, showcasing youthful energy. On her feet, she wears burgundy over-the-knee socks with slightly curled cuffs revealing a white lining. She wears a pair of brown velvet ankle boots with slightly high heels, creating a harmonious and unified overall look full of Japanese campus aesthetics. Her fingers are long, her posture natural, and her expression is calm with a hint of melancholy and contemplation, as if conveying some hidden emotion. Her body is slightly turned to one side, presenting a graceful S-shaped curve. Her legs are long and her posture steady. The composition centers on the person, using full-body portraits, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center to leave a sense of space. The background is a uniform gradient of light gray. With no distractions or debris, the main subject's presence is emphasized. The lighting is soft and even, coming from the upper front to create a slight shadow transition, making the character's outline clear and three-dimensional. The light and shadow distribution is natural, creating a clean, pure, and slightly cool atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly deep red, black, and white, complemented by a gray background. The color contrast is strong but not jarring, creating a comfortable yet artistic visual experience. The image texture is delicate, as if professionally illuminated by studio lighting, giving it the texture of a high-quality photo work. At the same time, it retains the realism of everyday shooting, without excessive embellishment. Like official photos taken with mid-to-high-end cameras in studios, it emphasizes a blend of realism and artistry. The overall atmosphere is quiet and focused, conveying a youthful, independent, and slightly mysterious temperament, suitable for character design, cosplay displays, or fashion photo shoots",
