        {
          "id": "krea2-063defb7c29c76d201815d46",
          "alias": "单女户外困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman wearing a black Chinese-style stand-collar top with delicate dark textures. The delicate frog button design at the neckline is clearly visible, and the pleats on the fabric are naturally smooth, presenting a silky sheen. The petals are layered, the green leaves set off the look, giving a fresh and elegant look. Her right hand gently holds an off-white round folding fan. The edges of the fan surface have fine red decorative lines, with the ribs faintly visible. The center of the fan seems to have faint traces of calligraphy or patterns. The fan is slightly tilted, creating a visual sense of extension. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition, with the head slightly tilted, creating a warm and focused sense of communication. The details are rich: the middle frame includes her shoulders, arms, and the folding fan in her hand, while the background is completely blurred into a warm golden halo. Light falls from the upper left, creating a soft backlight effect, with the beam piercing through the air. Clear light spots and scattered particles are created, enveloping the entire scene in a dreamy warm yellow tone. The layers of light and shadow are rich, shadows transition naturally, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality and atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups to emphasize the characters' expressions and costume details, while using shallow depth of field to highlight the subject. The background blur is well handled, and the visual guiding line is formed by the direction of the person's gaze and the diagonal extension of the folding fan. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, full of Eastern classical charm, as if capturing a peaceful and beautiful moment at dusk. The color palette is dominated by black, white, and gold, complemented by soft warm yellows and pale pinks. The colors are harmonious and unified, resulting in a delicate image texture reminiscent of a professional camera outdoors under natural light. It features slight film graininess and soft out-of-focus imaging, presenting an imaging style that is both artistic and retains a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
