        {
          "id": "krea2-2564150093b13edd4ebc37b4",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫桌边坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden round table in a traditional French café on the streets of Paris. She wears a black turtleneck sweater, paired with white lace knee-high stockings and dark high heels. She elegantly lifts her right leg, knee bent, ankles crossed, and steadily supports a white porcelain teacup and saucer with her right hand. Her expression is calm and slightly detached, her makeup exquisite, and her overall look exudes a vintage fashion vibe. In the foreground is a warm, light-colored wooden tabletop with a white ceramic teapot handwritten by \"Maria.\" Next to it is a small black pouch and a metallic box. The center is the café's interior, featuring several wooden booths with red cushions, as well as neatly arranged wooden tables and chairs. Each table is placed with wine glasses and utensils. In the background is a huge blackboard menu with French dish names written in white chalk, neat and clear in handwriting. A vintage-style chandelier hangs from the ceiling, emitting a soft, warm yellow glow that illuminates the entire space. In the distance, there is another similar chandelier and a red pillar, creating a sense of depth. The floor is paved with geometric tiles alternating beige and brown, and the overall composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, forming a visual focal point. Through the tea set in the foreground, the figure and dining table in the center, and the blackboard and lighting in the background, the line of light and shadow is gradually advanced, guiding the gaze backward. The lighting and shadow effects are mainly warm tones, with delicate shadows, creating a cozy yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall image presents a fleeting beauty from everyday life, as if shot with an old film camera, with slight graininess and natural color distortion, simulating the texture of real photography. The tones are warm, contrast is moderate, details are rich, and even the gloss of the wooden tabletop is clearly visible. The blur in the background enhances the subject's prominence while preserving the realism of the environment. The overall atmosphere is both romantic and tranquil, like a movie screenshot capturing a Parisian afternoon. Full of storytelling and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
