        {
          "id": "krea2-6e8dfa957c2dff339f36256f",
          "alias": "单女黑外套城市忧伤坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a high stone railing, her body slightly leaning forward, her expression slightly melancholic and contemplative. She wears a black off-shoulder jacket over a white strapless top, white over-the-knee stockings, and a pair of black platform Mary Jane shoes. A hint of black lace peeks at her ankles, blending gothic style with everyday fashion elements, her posture elegant and relaxed, legs naturally crossed, one foot suspended in the air, the other firmly planted on the railing, exuding an unintentional sense of laziness. In the foreground is a rough-textured white stone wall. The surface is covered with traces of time and fine cracks. Some areas are mottled with moss, edges slightly damaged, giving a realistic texture and a strong sense of history. The middle view is an open cityscape, with buildings of varying heights visible in the distance, including modern apartment buildings and low-rise residential areas. The streets wind through the streets, vehicles pass sparsely, trees are scattered, and greenery dots the area. Nearby, several tall pine trees stand tall, their branches and leaves lush, forming a layered contrast with the background. The sky shows the soft tones of dusk, and the clouds are tinged with a pale pink. Light orange and gray-blue intertwine in gradient colors, with light slanting from the horizon to inject a warm yet slightly cool atmosphere into the entire composition. The composition uses a center-left main placement of the figure, who occupies the primary visual position but leaves enough space to show the background environment, creating a strong sense of depth. The camera angle slightly looks down, creating an interactive relationship between the figure and the cityscape, then turning toward the distant skyline, forming a natural flow of sight. The light and shadow are handled with delicate detail, with one side bright and the other slightly dark. It creates a three-dimensional silhouette, with wrinkles on clothing and stockings reflecting clearly and shadows softly transitioning. The direction of shadows on the ground and railing aligns with the direction of the ground, enhancing realism. The overall atmosphere is quiet, lonely, and tinged with a touch of artistic flair, as if capturing a moment of solitude in a city at dusk. The image has a slight film graininess and natural exposure bias, simulating amateur camera effects. Color saturation is relatively low, details are rich but not too sharp, presenting a realistic feel of everyday life, with moderate background blur. While highlighting the main subject, the environment is preserved, the composition is stable and full of tension, conveying a poetic and alienated feeling within the city",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
