        {
          "id": "krea2-de1a98e3567bab034ed09bad",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫桌边专注倚靠",
          "prompt": "The screen glares slightly. She wears a light blue short-sleeved shirt with vertical stripes, the collar slightly open, revealing a thin black necklace around her neck. The hem of the shirt is slightly loose, and the sleeves are short. The overall look is fresh and natural, full of summer vibes. Her posture is relaxed and elegant, her body leaning slightly forward, presenting a relaxed yet focused state. On the table in the foreground sits a small metal mesh basket. Inside were food wrapped in white wrapping paper with English text, possibly fries or fried foods. The wrappers were randomly stacked, the edges folded sharply, the basket structure clearly visible, the background was a wide seaside view, and in the distance was a calm blue sea. The water shimmered in the sunlight, and several small boats quietly floated on the water. The sky was a clear blue, with a few thin clouds drifting lightly by. Nearby, a dense green tree was lush, with lush leaves and rich layers, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. Branches extend from the top of the painting, partially blocking the sky and forming a natural green frame. Behind the tree, a faint coastal trail can be seen where pedestrians leisurely walk by. Beside the path are wooden railings and transparent glass railings. The overall environment is peaceful and comfortable, with bright and soft lighting. Sunlight filters through the leaves, creating a natural transition of light and shadow, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality and spatial depth. The sea view and trees in the background are appropriately blurred to highlight the main subject, while retaining enough detail to enhance the realism of the scene. The overall color scheme is mainly blue-green, complemented by warm yellow tones from sunlight, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The visual atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, as if capturing the most authentic moments of life on a summer afternoon. The image quality is close to everyday phone photography, with slight film graininess and natural color deviations. Exposure is moderate, highlights are underexposed, shadows retain detail, and the overall presentation feels like a lifestyle. The documentary and artistic style of the imagery feels like a photographer accidentally capturing beautiful moments in a seaside café, full of youthful energy and serene poetry",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
