        {
          "id": "krea2-d15aaa4d4f6b0728e7657320",
          "alias": "单女透视紫毛衣广场沉思奔跑",
          "prompt": "She wears a light purple knit sweater with a V-neck design and off-shoulder sleeves. The material is soft and fluffy, with clearly visible texture. She wears a white maid apron over it, which is sleeveless, with wide shoulder straps and ruffled edges. The waist is cinched and the skirt is A-shaped, with layers of ruffled hem at the hem. The overall look is sweet, cute, and slightly sexy. Her right hand rests naturally on her right knee, fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, painted with light-colored nail polish. Her legs are dressed in black sheer stockings, which are lightweight and have smooth, graceful leg lines. The background is a modern home kitchen. The off-white cabinet doors have horizontal striped textures, and above the cabinet is a gray range hood. On each side of the range hood is a round vent with a smooth surface. The control panel has several buttons, and below is the gas stove surface. On top are a stainless steel steamer and a black wok. The steamer lid is reflective, the stove surface is clean and tidy, and the rear wall is covered with light yellow square tiles with fine gaps. The floor is covered with square tiles in brown and beige tones. In the lower left corner, you can see a green-packaged pet supply box with the words \"MAGIC CAT\" on the box. The composition centers on the figure, using vertical shots. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center, slightly tilted with their head facing the camera, creating an intimate and interactive atmosphere. The foreground highlights the main subject, the middle frame includes some kitchen furniture and utensils, while the background presents a complete kitchen space. Light comes from the ceiling lighting, soft and even, with warm tones. The overall atmosphere is cozy and daily, as if capturing a real moment from home life. The image presents a realistic texture reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment, with rich details, clear layering, harmonious color matching, strong visual appeal and emotional resonance. The image is not overly embellished, preserving a natural, everyday state. It evokes a relaxed and joyful atmosphere of life, as if you can hear the faint sound of running water and the clinking of spatulas coming from the kitchen. The entire scene is filled with the warmth of life and everyday life. The characters' postures are naturally relaxed, their expressions friendly, giving off a girl-next-door feel, while also maintaining a sense of fashion and aesthetic taste, enhancing the sense of depth and realism. The overall scene resembles a still frame from a microfilm, capturing a beautiful moment in ordinary life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
