        {
          "id": "krea2-62f38dfdd8438cc1f2cdecab",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙镜前冷淡站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an indoor mirror for a selfie. She wears a form-fitting white pleated dress. The material is lightweight and translucent, giving a semi-transparent texture that clings closely to the body's curves, highlighting smooth body lines. The dress is covered with delicate horizontal pleated textures extending from the shoulders to the ankles, creating a natural layering of light and shadow. The back of the phone clearly displays the dual camera modules. Her left hand hangs naturally, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, and her hand posture relaxed and elegant. She stands before a large mirror, reflecting her full figure. The background is a soft beige curtain, thick and with vertical pleats. Light filters through the curtain gaps, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. On the right side of the curtain, a corner of a light-colored sofa can be faintly seen. The sofa fabric is soft, the surface smooth, and the overall color tone is uniform, mainly warm yellow and beige, creating a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. The composition uses a vertical proportion. The figure is center-left and occupies the main position in the frame, with the body forming an S-shaped curve and the head slightly tilted, creating a strong visual direction. Light comes from the left, illuminated by side lighting, soft and even, with natural shadow transitions. Light and shadow form interwoven stripes of light and shadow on the skirt, enhancing three-dimensionality and texture. The background blur is well handled to highlight the main subject while preserving environmental details. The overall image has a documentary feel of daily life, as if captured with a regular phone, but through careful composition and use of light and shadow, It gives the image an artistic aesthetic, with harmonious color combinations dominated by white, beige, and brown. The warm and cool contrast is moderate, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The details are rich, presenting a realistic and delicate visual experience. The overall style combines fashion and a sense of life, combining the intimacy of a private space with elegance and beauty",
