        {
          "id": "krea2-c5b2e26f159d9bec5ab7f07d",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市忧伤站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman in a black long dress stands on the streets of Paris, wearing a classic black beret, exuding a relaxed and relaxed urban fashion vibe. Her right hand holds two golden baguettes, while her left hand carries a black crocodile leather handbag. The black long dress features a unique design, with large hollowed-out designs on the back. The hem slits down to mid-thigh, revealing the long leg line. The overall look is elegant and modern. The foreground shows the woman's full-body image, occupying the left and central areas of the frame. Her posture is slightly turned sideways, her body slightly tilted, creating a dynamic beauty. The streets are lined with typical Parisian architecture, with beige exterior walls paired with dark iron balcony railings. The windows are neatly arranged, and some balconies are adorned with greenery, adding a touch of life. Several cars are parked on the street, including a black Renault sedan and several white vans. These vehicles are parked along both sides of the road, creating a daily scene of urban life. The middle view features the extending street and distant buildings, which gradually extend into the distance, creating a perspective effect, guiding the viewer deeper into the frame, the background features the towering Eiffel Tower, whose structure is clearly visible. Its metal frame stands out against the gray-white sky, and the tower's details are rich, presenting the refined beauty of the industrial age. The sky is cloudy, with thick clouds and soft and even lighting, without strong shadows, creating a tranquil yet slightly melancholic urban atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, highlighting the Eiffel Tower's grandeur and feminine elegance, while also extending the sense of depth along the street. This gives the image more spatial layers. Visual guidance starts with the woman in the foreground, then follows the extension of the street to the distant Eiffel Tower, forming a clear visual path. The light and shadow are handled delicately, with overall soft lighting without strong contrasts of light and shadow. Instead, subtle shadows on the building facade and folds of the figures' clothing convey a sense of depth. The colors are mainly black, white, and gray, accented with beige and golden bread, creating a harmonious warm and cool contrast. The overall atmosphere blends urban fashion, The romantic sentiment and the authentic texture of daily life seem like a street photography shot with a professional camera, with cinematic texture and storytelling. The images are full of French flair, conveying an elegant, casual, and lifelike Parisian aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
