        {
          "id": "krea2-cd63c136d6f9b7db485386f0",
          "alias": "单女粉外套城市神秘倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She presents a dynamic sense of flow, creating a mysterious and dynamic atmosphere. She wears a pink double-breasted coat with a simple yet elegant design, a well-fitted fit, and a slightly slit at the hem that reveals the long leg lines. The coat's material looks soft and textured, with soft colors that harmonize with the overall look. She wears a dark green glove on her left hand, made of smooth fabric that could be velvet or silk, forming a sharp contrast with the pink coat. In her right hand, she carries a brown woven handbag. Inside the bag are light blue items, possibly books or documents. The texture of the handbag is clearly visible, adding realism to the image. She wears a pair of silver high heels, the smooth upper reflecting a faint sheen, with a thin strap tied around her ankle, looking delicate and fashionable. Her expression is focused yet slightly cold, as if breathing or speaking. The background is a corner of a city street, flanked by buildings. The walls are gray stone, with fine textures and wear marks on the surface, showing the city's sense of weariness. On the right is a row of green plants. The potted plants are neatly arranged, and the leaves are lush, adding a touch of vitality to the scene. In the distance, you can see some blurred outlines of buildings and streetlights, their warm light illuminating part of the street. The sky appears grayish-white, possibly on cloudy days or early mornings. The light is soft and there is no strong shadow. The composition is shot from a low angle, with the camera shooting from the ground looking down, highlighting the figure's tall stature and dynamic posture. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, leaning slightly forward, with the right leg stepping forward and the left leg behind, creating a strong sense of movement The visual guide line extends from the figure's legs to the background street, directing the viewer's gaze into the distance. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by natural light, with light coming from above and in front, evenly illuminating the characters and environment without creating excessive shadows. The overall tone leans toward a cool tone, mainly gray, pink, and green, creating a fashionable urban atmosphere. The image has a strong visual impact while preserving the details and realism of daily life, as if it were a street fashion photo taken with professional photography equipment. capturing the momentary sense of movement and beauty",
