        {
          "id": "krea2-9a88231cf48b2e5bf27e60d9",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道微笑坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the stone steps by the city at night, her head slightly lowered, with a hint of shyness and contemplation. Her right hand is gently raised, fingers long, painted with black nail polish, as if hiding a smile or deep in thought. On her wrist is a simple silver watch, the dial clearly visible. The strap is a metal chain design, paired with a delicate silver necklace that hangs down on her chest. She wears a tight white short-sleeved T-shirt, the shirt fitting her body and accentuating her graceful curves. She wore ripped denim shorts with worn and torn edges, presenting a street-style look. Her legs were crossed, knees bent, and she wore black-and-white sneakers with intricate textures on the uppers, tied neatly, and white knee-high socks hugging her ankles, with slightly curled cuffs. The overall look was casual and fashionable. She sat on gray cement steps, rough and bearing the marks of time, with a bustling city night view in the background. In the distance, McDonald's yellow M logo can be seen glowing in the night. The exterior walls of surrounding buildings are illuminated by blue and purple neon lights, weaving together a dreamlike scene of light and shadow. Trees and streetlights line the streets, leaves gently swaying in the wind. In the distance, blurred figures of pedestrians and vehicles pass by, creating an atmosphere where urban noise and tranquility coexist. The composition uses medium shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left, body slightly tilted, forming a natural S-shaped curve that moves down to the legs and shoes. The composition is balanced and layered, with light mainly coming from surrounding neon and street lamps, creating a soft side glow. The background also produces rich color reflections and halo effects, while the shadowed areas appear deep and realistic. The overall tone is mainly cool, dominated by blue-violet tones, creating a sense of mystery and loneliness in modern urban nights. The strong contrast of light and shadow enhances the image's three-dimensionality and drama. The camera looks like it was shot with a phone or portable camera, with slight graininess and natural noise. It simulates the texture of everyday amateur equipment, with slightly unfocused visuals and perfectly balanced background blur that highlights the main subject. The overall atmosphere is both realistic and slightly artistic, as if capturing a moment of an ordinary girl taking a brief break in the busy city, combining youthful vitality with inner tranquility and reflection",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
