        {
          "id": "krea2-652e6ac6a02c0196e0574852",
          "alias": "单女白T恤泳池微笑倚靠演奏",
          "prompt": "A close-up of a woman's half-body looks especially vivid and natural, with a slight blush that looks like she just emerged from water, radiating a healthy glow. She wears a white camisole top with slender straps and a simple and elegant neckline, revealing her long neck and shoulder lines, with a playful and gentle smile. Looking directly at the camera, her overall posture is slightly turned to the side, with a slight forward lean, presenting a sense of closeness and dynamic beauty. The water droplet reflection enhances realism. The middle shot shows her bare shoulders and arms, with soft muscle lines. Light and shadow create a natural transition on the skin, the background is blurred, presenting soft green and white light spots, faintly visible leaf outlines and the sky, creating an outdoor natural atmosphere. The composition uses a center-to-right layout, with the figure occupying the main position. The shallow depth of field effect highlights the subject, making the background fully blend into a hazy environment. The light and shadow come from natural daylight, soft and even, without strong shadows. The overall atmosphere is fresh and natural, full of summer vibes, as if on a quiet afternoon or early morning. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled shadows. She has just finished playing in the water, standing by the lake or pool. A gentle breeze brings a touch of coolness, and the entire scene exudes youthful energy and pure beauty. The tones are mainly white, pale pink, and green, harmoniously unified, giving a sense of tranquility, comfort, and a touch of romance. It feels like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, yet retains the naturalness and spontaneity of daily life, like moments casually captured with a portable camera or phone. Filled with the breath of life and emotional warmth",
