        {
          "id": "krea2-15e71e84a0023b2496467c58",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙摄影棚微笑跳舞",
          "prompt": "The headpiece is inlaid with gold fine patterns and beads, adding a touch of liveliness and nobility. She wears a gentle smile, her makeup exquisite, and her overall appearance is sweet and elegant. She wears a flowing pink gauze long dress with layered hems, giving it a light texture. The transparent tulle fabric glows softly under the light, and the dress is embroidered with golden patterns. A golden chain is tied around the waist, adorned with yellow floral ornaments. Gold wrist guards and arm rings are worn on the shoulders and arms, with intricate and layered designs. The right hand holds a huge white feather fan, with a wide surface and fluffy, soft feathers, as light as clouds. The left hand gently strokes the fan handle, graceful posture, body slightly turned, left leg lifted, skirt hem lifted, showcasing graceful curves and movement. The background is a simple light gray tone, with soft transitions of light and shadow. On the right, faintly visible pale pink silk curtains or gauze curtains gently flutter in the wind, creating a dreamy, hazy atmosphere. Light streams diagonally from the left, creating a soft contrast of light and shadow, highlighting the main contour while leaving a faint shadow in the background. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right of the frame, presenting a dynamic pose. The overall color palette is mainly pink, white, and gold, accented with a touch of purple. The colors are harmoniously unified, full of romance and fairy-tale atmosphere, with delicate light and shadow handling. Emphasizing the luster of silk and the fluffy texture of feathers, the image possesses a strong artistic beauty and visual impact, as if capturing the moment of a fairy dancing gracefully. It is both classical and modern aesthetically. The overall atmosphere is warm and soft, full of poetry and fantasy, like a carefully drawn illustration or a high-quality portrait shot in a professional studio, presenting an artistic style that combines realism and surrealism",
