        {
          "id": "krea2-defd2a9d3f26baa95c424629",
          "alias": "单女黑风衣车厢蹲注视",
          "prompt": "A woman squats at the edge of a subway platform, dressed in a black leather trench coat, her posture relaxed yet full of tension. Her left hand rests naturally on the ground, and a simple ring is fastened on her finger. The overall look is full of urban fashion and mystery. In the background, a red-and-white subway train is speeding by, its body causing noticeable dynamic blur due to high-speed movement. The lights inside the windows form flowing light strips. It creates a strong sense of movement and the passage of time. The platform floor is paved with gray anti-slip tiles, with a yellow safety warning line along the edge. The clear lines extend deep into the frame, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. Above the platform, you can see a retro-style decorative ceiling with geometric patterns and warm yellow lighting. The light softly illuminates the entire scene, creating a warm golden lighting atmosphere. The figure is positioned slightly below the right side of the frame, using a low-angle downward angle to highlight its presence and visual impact. The composition uses diagonal train tracks and warning lines on the ground to guide the viewer's gaze from the foreground to the background train, creating a strong visual flow with strong light and shadow contrasts, presenting delicate transitions of light and shadow. The leather jacket surface reflects subtle luster, while the background gradually blends into warm tones of blending. The overall picture blends the coldness of the modern city with the warmth of personal emotion, creating a cinematic atmosphere that is both everyday and surreal, as if capturing a quiet moment of solitude in the bustling city. It has strong narrative and artistic appeal, similar to shooting with a full-frame camera paired with a large-aperture prime lens, simulating grainy texture and slight noise at high ISO to enhance realism and immediacy. The image colors are mainly warm yellow, brown, and black, rich in layers and full detail. It combines the refined control of professional photography with the natural randomness of amateur equipment, presenting an overall low-key and luxurious documentary aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
