        {
          "id": "krea2-b5a06b358b1879e230b7d9fc",
          "alias": "单女白T恤花园微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the stone steps of the tea garden, wearing an off-white woven straw hat with wide brims and delicate lace trim. She wears a white camisole and light blue denim shorts, legs slightly bent together, hands resting gently on her knees, leaning forward slightly, smiling gently at the camera. Her overall posture appears relaxed, natural, and slightly shy. The background is layers upon layers of lush green tea gardens, tea trees neatly trimmed, forming a regular green terrace that stretches to the distant hillside. The leaves gently sway in the breeze, presenting a rich sense of layering and depth. In the distance, tall trees and exposed rocks can be faintly seen. The sky is shaded by dense green leaves, emitting only soft, diffused light, which evenly illuminates the figures, creating a peaceful and fresh atmosphere. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center. In the foreground is a rough earth-yellow stone steps scattered with a few dead leaves. In the middle is the figure and nearby tea trees, and in the background is the gradually receding tea fields. This creates a strong visual guidance, extending deep into the background tea fields. The color scheme is mainly green, complemented by white clothing and beige straw hats. The tones are fresh and natural, the contrast is soft, and the light and shadow treatment is delicate. Overall, it presents a sense of realism like shooting with a regular camera in daily life, as if captured by chance on a sunny afternoon. The texture is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and soft color transitions, rich details, vivid and natural expressions, and a realistic and believable environment. It exudes a strong sense of everyday life and artistic flair, as if you can smell a faint tea aroma and the freshness of earth. The entire scene exudes tranquility, innocence, and the poetic beauty of summer countryside",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
