        {
          "id": "krea2-9f961bb002a061553a521dde",
          "alias": "单女白袜子山野困倦持包",
          "prompt": "On her leg rests a small light blue diamond plaid bag, adorned with white cloud and star patterns, paired with blue fur tassels and metal chains. She wears white platform shoes paired with white over-the-knee socks, elegant and relaxed, with a vast green hill as the background. The slope is densely vegetated, with winding paths and scattered visitors visible in the distance. The sky shows a gradient deep blue tone, transitioning from the gray-blue near the horizon to the deep night sky above. The light is soft and slightly cool, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and dreamy. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, forming a visual focal point. The middle ground features an extended wooden platform and mountain outline, while the background is an open natural landscape. The layers are distinct, the color contrast is strong but harmoniously unified, and the light and shadow come from natural daylight. Softly and evenly applied to the people and environment, it creates a tranquil, gentle, and slightly melancholic artistic atmosphere. It feels like a frame of everyday life taken from the mountaintop observation deck on a summer evening, offering the realism and artistic beauty of everyday photography. The lens simulates real camera effects, uses standard focal lengths, and controls slight depth of field, preserving background details while highlighting the subject. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, and overall it presents a fresh, pure, and sentimental visual style. Like a carefully crafted travel photo, it combines a realistic sense of documentary reality with a romantic artistic atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
