        {
          "id": "krea2-d0d80f8647a1b161f03251a2",
          "alias": "单女全裸白外套城市坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a rattan chair in an outdoor café, wearing an off-white tweed short jacket and a matching high-waisted skirt. The jacket is adorned with pearl buttons and delicate embroidery details, with delicate ruffle decorations on the cuffs and hem. The overall look is elegant and vintage, showcasing French sophistication and the refined temperament of urban women. The slightly curled look and delicate makeup are elegant, and gold tassel earrings add a touch of liveliness and luxury. Her right hand gently holds a glass of red wine, the wine gently swaying in the transparent glass. Her left hand casually rested on a white diamond-patterned chain bag beside her. The bag was small and delicate, with a metallic sheen on the chain. She crossed her legs and wore nude-colored stockings, looking relaxed yet dignified. In the background was an open-air café by the city street, with a black wavy sunshade extending from above, creating a soft shadow area. In the foreground was a black iron railing with geometric hollowed-out designs. Outside the railing was a gray tiled sidewalk, scattered with a few withered yellow leaves. In the middle was a quiet asphalt road, clean and tidy. In the distance, you can see shaded green trees with thick branches and yellow-green leaves. Sunlight filters through the canopy, casting dappled shadows. On the right side of the painting, pedestrians and vehicles can be faintly seen passing by. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered slightly to the left, naturally directing the gaze to the main subject. The foreground railing and sunshade form a framing composition, enhancing the sense of spatial layering. The light is bright natural daylight coming from the upper right. Highlighting the texture of the materials, the overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, blending the leisurely vibe of urban life with the independent elegance of women, presenting a sense of sophistication in real life. It resembles everyday street shots taken casually with a phone or camera, but the details are well handled, colors are harmoniously unified, with tones mainly of off-white, light brown, dark green, and gray-black, creating a comfortable and stylish visual experience. The background is moderately blurred, the focus is clearly on the subject, and the image has a cinematic film texture. A slight graininess combined with natural exposure control creates an imaging style that is both artistic and close to reality",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
