        {
          "id": "krea2-bf20b7e1ef3505bb2b320235",
          "alias": "单女毛衣床忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed covered with floral sheets. She wears a light-colored striped sweater and pajama pants printed with small floral patterns, wearing a white camisole underneath. Her posture is relaxed and affectionate, legs slightly bent, feet naturally resting on a wooden folding stool in front, toes slightly curled, presenting a lazy and authentic homely state. In the foreground, her feet and wooden stool are clearly visible, with rounded edges. The surface has a natural sheen, and in the background is a large window framed in warm brown. Soft natural light streams in outside, creating bright highlights indoors, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. By the window, a faint brown plush toy can be seen, adding a touch of life. On the right side is a white vertical electric fan with stationary blades and a simple casing. The fan's details are clearly visible and harmonize with the overall environment. The floral patterns on the bedsheets are mainly pink, yellow, and blue, with soft and evenly distributed colors. With a retro feel, the sweater's stripes are made up of light blue, pale pink, and off-white, with distinct layers. The material looks soft and comfortable. The overall composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center. Light and shadow enter through the left window, creating a soft side glow. At the same time, soft shadows are cast on the sheets and floor, creating a warm feeling of morning or afternoon sunlight streaming into the room. The main tones are warm white, light pink, and light blue, creating a cozy and healing atmosphere, full of the relaxed and innocent atmosphere of daily life. The texture of the painting is delicate. It feels as if shot with an ordinary home camera, retaining slight noise and natural exposure transitions without excessive retouching, realistically recreating a quiet and beautiful morning scene. The background is slightly blurred, highlighting the main character while maintaining the authenticity of the environment. The overall visual guidance is smooth, forming a natural emotional flow. The whole image exudes a quiet, comfortable, and slightly melancholic youthful beauty, making one feel gently wrapped in moments.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
