        {
          "id": "krea2-03273208e095b58749c08a85",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the sidewalk of a city street, wearing a long black coat with a black camisole underneath, black stockings, and high heels. Her posture is elegant and full of tension, her body slightly leaning forward. She holds an amber-colored wine in her right hand and gently touches a bottle of champagne on the ground with her left, her expression somewhat dreamy and contemplative. The beige exterior walls, arched windows, and balcony railings are clearly visible. The building's lines are neat, exuding a strong sense of history and urban atmosphere. A gray van is parked on the street, its simple body contrasting with the surrounding environment. The sidewalk is paved with gray stone bricks, edged with white curbstones. The road surface is smooth and the lighting is soft and even. The sky is grayish-white, indicating whether it is cloudy or evening. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and slightly melancholic. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, body in a diagonal posture, forming a visual guiding line that extends from the champagne bottle on the ground to the wine glass in the hand. Guiding the viewer's gaze to flow, the lighting and shadows are natural, without strong contrasts. The shadows are soft, highlighting the silhouettes and the texture of the clothing. The wrinkles of the coat and the sheen of the stockings are clearly visible in the dim light. The colors are mainly black, gray, and brown, with a unified and deep tone, creating an atmosphere where urban modernity and retro romance intertwine. The overall style combines artistry and everyday feel, as if taken with a professional camera for street photography, with strong realism, rich details, natural character movements, realistic scenes, and balanced composition. The visual layers are distinct: figures and champagne bottles in the foreground, streets and vehicles in the middle, and buildings in the background. The sense of space is strong, perspective is accurate, and the visuals have cinematic and storytelling qualities, as if capturing a fleeting emotional expression. The entire scene is quiet yet full of tension, conveying an image of an independent, free, and slightly lonely urban woman. The images present a high-quality cinematic texture, with exquisite details, harmonious colors, and delicate light and shadow handling, possessing strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
