        {
          "id": "krea2-0ee2476640ef176c1d127b68",
          "alias": "单女透视灰外套城市忧伤站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a fashionable urban style stands beside a city street with classical architectural features. She wears a loose-fitting, dark gray wool coat made of thick material with natural pleats and drapes. The collar is slightly open, revealing the black turtleneck underneath. The overall look is layered and textured, exuding an elegant yet cool temperament. She holds an open newspaper in her right hand, its content blurred but clearly visible with headlines and layout, and the edges of the paper slightly curled. She presents a realistic sense of everyday reading. Her left hand hangs naturally as she carries a black leather handbag. The handbag is smooth with delicate stitching patterns, simple yet refined. She wears black shorts paired with sheer stockings, which feature black vertical stripes extending from her thighs to her ankles. The lines are smooth and visually appealing. She wears black pointed stiletto heels with gold metal decorations on the toes, creating a striking contrast. She stands on the edge of the gray stone-paved sidewalk, with a slightly raised curb at her feet The body is slightly turned to the side, head turned to the left side of the painting, posture calm and confident. The windows are made of black wrought iron lattice with straight lines, and some windows let in warm yellow light from the interior, creating a contrast between light and shadow. In the middle of the scene, a slender metal column can be seen, possibly a streetlamp or signpost, with a circular base at the base. This enhances the realism and spatial depth of the scene. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle to highlight the figure's slender figure and presence. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, creating an asymmetrical balanced aesthetic. The foreground features the stone brick texture and curb edges with clear details. The middle ground shows the main subject and parts of the building, while the background shows the complete building facade and the faint outline of the street in the distance. The light and shadows come from diffused light from cloudy days, creating a soft and even overall lighting without strong shadows, creating a calm, restrained, and slightly melancholic atmosphere The color tones are mainly gray, black, and brown, with low saturation, presenting a retro texture reminiscent of film photography. The images lack obvious dynamic elements; all objects are static and orderly, as if frozen in a certain moment. The entire scene conveys a sense of loneliness and a fashionable attitude in a modern city. The images have highly realistic detail while retaining artistic composition and emotional expression, as if taken by a professional camera, authentically recreating the street fashion moment. It offers strong visual impact and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
