        {
          "id": "krea2-34130cb9588648a82256cffb",
          "alias": "单女紫礼服咖啡厅冷淡坐持书",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at an outdoor seat in a high-end French restaurant, wearing a uniquely designed light purple one-shoulder gown adorned with a huge bow and sparkling crystal accents on her shoulders. The skirt is short and delicate, paired with sheer lace-patterned knee-high stockings and rhinestone-studded bow high heels. She wears a matching headband, her makeup exquisite, and her posture elegant and confident. On her left wrist is a silver bracelet, with visible tattoo patterns on her arm. She is sitting at a round dining table covered with a white tablecloth, on which lies an open magazine. A bouquet of white flowers and a black metal base desk lamp softly illuminate the tabletop, creating a warm halo. The background reflects the restaurant's interior mirrors, illuminating dark curtains, chandeliers, murals, and the blurred dining area. Outside the window is a nighttime city streetscape, with flickering car lights and faint outlines of buildings in the distance. The entire scene contrasts between warm yellow tones and cool gray walls. The floor is made of dark stone bricks, chairs have black wooden frames and beige cushions, and the overall composition uses a medium perspective, with the figures positioned on the right side of the frame. The body is slightly tilted, looking directly at the camera. The light mainly comes from the desk lamp and the warm indoor glow, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The shadows are soft, the atmosphere is luxurious and private, carrying the romantic vibe of urban nightlife. The image texture is delicate, color saturation moderate, presenting a high-end fashion photography style while retaining the realism of everyday shooting. It feels like a professional camera capturing moments in low-light environments, offering strong visual appeal and emotional impact",
