        {
          "id": "krea2-34884c33d1ac030374306a3a",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣公寓微笑站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, wearing a pink knit camisole top and gray loose cargo pants. The top features a turtleneck design, delicate texture with obvious vertical texture, showcasing a soft texture and fitted tailoring. The hem is short, revealing a flat, firm belly. The abdominal lines are clearly visible, and the muscle contours are natural and smooth, presenting a healthy and balanced posture. She is standing sideways, her left hand raised behind her head, fingers slightly bent, her posture elegant and relaxed, with a hint of subtle smile, and her overall expression is natural and friendly. Full of the atmosphere of daily life, with a modern home environment in the background. On the left is a wooden dining table with a flat tabletop, on which sits a pink gift box and a white ceramic mug decorated with gold patterns. Next to it is a light green round mat with metal legs, simple and practical. On the right is a black TV cabinet, with a flat-screen TV placed above it. When the screen is closed, it reflects the light and shadows of the surroundings. Next to the TV cabinet is a transparent glass storage cabinet, with several colorful storage boxes neatly arranged inside, each in red, The pink color is predominant, creating an orderly and cozy atmosphere. In the distance, an open hanger hangs several pieces of clothing, including a white coat and a green bag, adding a touch of everyday detail. The ceiling is light gray, fitted with simple linear chandeliers. The soft lighting casts down from above, creating a uniform diffused light that illuminates the entire space. The light mainly comes from the front left, with natural shadow transitions and a strong sense of three-dimensionality. At the same time, slight reflections appear on the right wall and furniture surfaces, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot perspective, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, the body slightly tilted, and the head slightly tilted, creating a natural visual guide. The dining table and objects in the foreground enrich the layers of the image, the middle ground emphasizes the subject, and the background expands the sense of space through furniture and furnishings. The overall color palette is mainly warm gray, pink, and off-white, accented with a few bright colors. The colors are harmonious and unified, presenting a sense of privacy and realism in daily life, reminiscent of a home selfie taken with a regular camera or phone. With slight noise and film texture, the lighting and shadows are natural, without excessive embellishment, emphasizing authenticity and nature, conveying a relaxed and carefree lifestyle. The overall atmosphere is quiet, warm, and intimate, with a strong humanistic atmosphere and a sense of artistic living",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
