        {
          "id": "krea2-fd2e9f1fbe39cc489f39d908",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙婚礼坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a vintage rattan chair, wearing a pure white short-sleeved dress whose hem drapes lightly over the wooden chair. She leans slightly to the side, elegant and relaxed, her legs crossed, one foot naturally hanging down, barefoot on the warm wooden floor with her toes clearly visible, presenting an overall serene and slightly lazy temperament. In the foreground is her body and legs sitting on the chair, with two bouquets of flowers beside her—one of which is a pale blue hydrangea arranged in a transparent glass bottle, full and softly colored Another bouquet is a pink-orange rose, also placed in a glass bottle, with layers of petals and warm colors. In the center is the wooden rattan chair she sits on. The chair has a simple structure, with a surface made of woven rattan and a solid wood frame. The chair is surrounded by piles of books, with various English titles printed on the spines, such as \"Bride & Groom's Wedding,\" \"American Style,\" \"Satisfaction,\" and so on. These books are piled up haphazardly, Some stand upright, some laid horizontally, creating an environment full of knowledge. In the background is a row of tall wooden bookshelves, densely packed with various books. The spines come in a rich range of colors—brown, red, green, yellow, and more. Above the shelves are some vintage items, including various styles of clocks, including a round wall clock, a square desk clock, and an old-fashioned radio. Next to it are a few small bottles and a black telephone receiver, filling the space with a nostalgic atmosphere. The composition uses a center-to-left visual layout, with the figure positioned on the left side of the frame, while the books and decorations on the right form a symmetrical visual balance. Light streams diagonally from the upper right of the image, forming a bright beam of light. Sunlight casts long shadows on the wooden floor, creating a warm and soft atmosphere. The strong contrast between light and shadow and natural transitions highlights the subject's three-dimensionality and texture. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow and brown, complemented by white clothing and blue and pink flowers. The colors are harmonious and layered, with a warm and tranquil atmosphere, like a leisurely moment bathed in afternoon sunlight filling the study. The images have a strong sense of daily life and life, like a private portrait taken with a professional camera, yet retaining the naturalness and realism of amateur photography. The details are rich and the texture clear—from the wrinkles of the clothes to the texture of the pages, to the wood grain and rattan weaving marks on the floor, all are clearly visible, presenting an artistic, intellectual, yet gentle visual effect",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
