        {
          "id": "krea2-cc14d36abeeb12c9e07408fb",
          "alias": "单女街道忧伤倚靠喝",
          "prompt": "Her body leans slightly forward, legs crossed, and her right hand holds a folding umbrella with black and white patterns. Her posture is relaxed and full of storytelling. In the foreground is a dark brown wooden bench, with clearly visible wooden slats showing natural wear on the surface, with slight cracks and fading on the edges. The backrest and seat structure are clearly defined. The background is a typical urban landscape along the Thames in London. In the distance, you can see a cluster of white buildings across the river, including classical-style multi-story buildings and modern high-rises. A white boat is moored on the river, the sky is grayish-white, the clouds are thick, and the light softly diffuses, presenting the unique diffuse light effect of cloudy days. On the right stands a black cast iron vintage street lamp, with a glass shade and decorative metal carvings on top. The lamp post features intricate carved details, and beside it is a tree with sparse branches and leaves. Some green leaves extend in the upper right of the frame, with natural forms and mottled light and shadow. The composition features a figure centered to the right, occupying the center of the scene. The bench extends from the lower left corner to the middle right, forming a diagonal guiding line. The streetlights and tree trunks form vertical lines to enhance image stability. The direction of the characters' gaze communicates directly with the viewer, creating visual guidance. The overall color tone is mainly off-white, gray-brown, dark brown, and dark green, with low saturation, presenting a film-like texture with slight graininess and warm yellow tones. The light and shadow are soft and even, without strong shadows, creating a tranquil, nostalgic, and slightly melancholic urban atmosphere. It seems to capture a tranquil moment on an autumn afternoon on the streets of London. The images have the realism of everyday amateur equipment, rich in details but not forced, naturally composed and full of life and emotional tension, as if from a travel diary or an independent film, conveying the intertwining of loneliness, freedom, and city life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
