        {
          "id": "krea2-9b86f772e02dd19b436188fe",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣街道沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the metal fence in front of a red brick building. She wears a dark green long-sleeved knit sweater over a white Peter Pan-collar shirt, paired with a brown corduroy mini skirt, and paired with brown snakeskin tall boots with stiletto heels. Her body leans slightly to the side, her left leg bent and raised, knee close to her chest, toes touching the ground. The posture is elegant and full of movement. The background is a red brick wall and a window framed in a dark color. The edge of the window frame casts slight shadows, casting strip-like shadows on the metal fence. The floor is a gray cement sidewalk, with wooden flower boxes planted inside. Sunlight slants down from the upper right of the frame, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The light casts soft contour light on the figures, and delicate light and shadow changes appear in the folds of clothing. The entire scene presents a warm autumn afternoon atmosphere, composed using medium shots. The figure occupies the center left of the composition, with a gaze toward the right side, with a slightly contemplative expression. The metal fence extends from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a diagonal guiding line that draws the visual attention to the main subject. The red brick texture in the background is clearly visible, with mortar joints separating each brick, rich in detail. The foreground shows the lower half of the figure and part of the fence, the middle ground shows the full body and part of the building facade, and the background features a complete red brick wall and windows, with distinct layers. The colors are mainly warm tones, with green sweaters and brown boots. The skirt forms a harmonious complementary relationship, giving the overall image a strong everyday street style feel, as if shot with a lightweight full-frame camera. Using a standard lens with an aperture of f/2.8, ISO 100, shutter speed of 1/500 second, and focal length of 85mm, it captures the beauty of real-life moments. The image texture is delicate, retaining film-like graininess and natural color transitions. The light and shadow treatment is natural, without excessive sharpening or skin smoothing, presenting an unedited sense of realism. The composition is balanced and full of tension. The characters' postures are relaxed, expressions natural, and the background environment is authentic and believable, creating an artistic atmosphere of an urban street. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic, as if recording an ordinary yet beautiful moment of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
