        {
          "id": "krea2-18b90f629e711c5da1f1635e",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙山野冷淡站立演奏",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in flowing ancient-style Hanfu stands on an open lawn. She wears a wide-sleeved long dress in light blue and pure white tones. The fabric is light and translucent, with layers of sheer fabric fluttering like clouds in the breeze. The hem and cuffs are adorned with exquisite lace trim and embroidered patterns. Around her waist is a brocade belt adorned with pearls and tassels, outlining her slender waist. The overall look is elegant and gorgeous, full of Eastern classical charm. A pair of delicate white butterfly-shaped hairpins are pinned in her bun. Her right hand grips a slender short sword with a dark hilt, the blade gleaming coldly. Her left hand is raised high, sleeves unfolding as if performing some elegant martial art. Her posture is smooth and graceful, balancing power and beauty. In the foreground is a blooming field of white daisies, with dense flowers, pure white petals, golden centers, and lush green stems and leaves of varying heights. Some flowers are close to the frame, creating a natural depth blur effect. The background is a vast green grassland with dense leaves and rich layers. In the distance, you can see blurred tree outlines and faint utility poles. The sky appears in a soft warm yellow tone, with sunlight streaming down from the upper right, creating a warm backlight effect that outlines a bright silhouette and creates a dreamlike halo. The entire scene is bathed in the golden soft light of dusk, with interwoven light and shadow and sharp contrasts. It creates a strong sense of light direction while preserving delicate shadow transitions. The composition uses the center-left position of the main figure, with diagonal body lines guiding the viewer's gaze to create a dynamic visual flow. The daisies in the foreground and the green fields in the background form a distinctly layered spatial structure, the woman in the center becomes the absolute focal point, and the blurred background enhances the sense of depth in the composition. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, blending martial arts and pastoral poetry. It combines the heroic bearing of a martial arts heroine with innocence and romance. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, with blue, white, green, and yellow as the main tones. It presents a fresh and refined visual experience, like a perfect blend of freehand ink painting and modern photographic art. The image is delicate and richly detailed, combining the exquisite carving of traditional aesthetics with the authenticity of the natural environment. It seems to capture a momentarily frozen beautiful moment, evoking the leisurely mood of ancient poetry \"Picking chrysanthemums by the eastern fence, leisurely seeing the southern mountain,\" while also infusing the heroic ambition of \"sword qi spans thirty thousand li, one sword chills nineteen provinces.\" The entire image is full of storytelling and imaginative space. Like cinematic shots, it is full of dramatic tension yet maintains the intimacy of everyday shooting, like capturing real moments outdoors under natural light with a professional camera, yet it transcends ordinary photography and reaches the height of artistic creation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
