          "id": "krea2-8b39badbed4e869e72065f75",
          "alias": "单女黑外套车厢忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of the subway platform, wearing a long black coat, her expression slightly contemplative and distant. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly turned to the side, her head facing the camera, creating a visual relationship that is both intimate and distant. The main figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, occupying the central foreground area and becoming the visual focal point of the entire frame. Her outline is clearly visible under warm yellow lighting, forming a sharp contrast with the surrounding environment. The foreground is the dark platform floor paved with anti-slip stripes. Metallic warning lines are on the edges, and several subtle light and shadow reflections scattered across the ground suggest the source of light and spatial depth. In the middle is a yellow subway train passing by, with a noticeable dynamic blur effect caused by high-speed movement. The windows reflect the lights inside the carriage and the blurred figures of passengers, forming flowing light bands and layers of color. The train's movement trajectory runs from left to right across the image, enhancing the passage of time and spatial dynamics. The background features the arched ceiling and brick wall structure of the subway station. The walls are neatly arranged with light-colored small square tiles, presenting a retro and industrial texture. Multiple rows of recessed lighting fixtures are installed on the ceiling, emitting warm, soft yellow-white light. The light casts downward, creating even shadows and gradients on the floor and walls, creating a sense of closed but not oppressive space. The composition adopts a slightly slanted perspective, giving the scene more tension and dynamism. Figures and trains form a diagonal layout, guiding the gaze from the lower left corner to the upper right. At the same time, the platform lines in the foreground and the direction of train movement in the middle of the background are used to enhance the sense of depth. Visual guidance mainly relies on the gaze of the figures, the train's movement trajectory, and the convergence of platform lines. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward a warm dusk tone, dominated by yellow-orange tones, creating a nostalgic, tranquil, and slightly lonely urban daily atmosphere. The lighting is soft but not harsh, shadow transitions are natural, and details are rich. The entire image presents an effect reminiscent of a professional camera paired with a prime lens, featuring high resolution, Delicate texture rendering and realistic light and shadow layers are preserved while preserving real moments captured unintentionally in daily life. It feels as if shooting in low-light with a high-end smartphone or lightweight camera. The shutter speed is well controlled, freezing the clarity of the subject while capturing the dynamic blur of the train. The image texture closely resembles film graininess and color reproduction, presenting an urban realistic style that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
