        {
          "id": "krea2-f4d4347d344d2b6a67a2ef34",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤公寓忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors on a concrete curb, slightly lazy and distant. Her makeup is exquisite but not overly bright, and she wears small silver earrings on her earlobes, giving her a cool yet playful aura. She wears a light gray hooded sweatshirt with a fluffy light brown synthetic fur collar along the edges. The front of the sweatshirt features red, white, and blue stripes and repeated letters. She wears a black crew-neck T-shirt underneath and loose blue jeans with white graffiti-style patterns and ink-splash effects on the pant legs. The pants look soft and slightly aged. She crosses her legs, one foot on the ground, the other raised, wearing black flat sandals. Her body leans slightly forward, hands folded on her knees, looking relaxed and natural. The background is a corner of a city street, with a dark gray asphalt pavement scattered with some withered yellow leaves. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled shadows on the ground, forming a geometric pattern of alternating light and shadow. On the right is a blue and white lattice column with a cement base at the base. Next to it are low stone steps and soil, with a fallen yellow fruit on the ground. The foreground shows the lower half of the figure and part of the ground, the middle is the subject's whole body and surrounding environment, the background is an extending street and distant blurry tree shadows, with light from the upper left, soft and warm, presenting the texture of afternoon sunlight. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and everyday. It carries a youthful vibe and street fashion, with mainly gray, blue, and brown tones accented by warm yellow sunlight. The texture of the image feels authentic, as if shot with an old film camera, with slight graininess and color shifts. The details are rich, the layers distinct, the expressions natural, and the movements spontaneous, without any forced posing. The entire scene is filled with the atmosphere of life and fragmented urban life. Following her gaze into the depths of the frame, she is then drawn by the light and shadow on the ground and distant scenery. The composition is balanced, with reasonable blank space. While highlighting the main subject, it retains the authenticity of the environment, presenting an overall aesthetic style that is quiet, gentle, and slightly melancholic",
