        {
          "id": "krea2-7d2cd859bb6cdd8d69b1483c",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the door of a luxury SUV, wearing a dark gray baseball cap with a white letter \"R\" logo naturally draped over her shoulders, carrying a hint of laziness and confidence, presenting a natural pink color. The overall vibe combines street style and fashion. She wears a pink knitted crop top with delicate texture and subtle texture. The straps are black, exposing one shoulder for an asymmetrical design. She wears a loose white shirt with sleeves casually rolled up to the elbows and the hem open. She creates a casual and uninhibited look, wearing high-waisted black leather pants on the bottom. The smooth surface reflects a soft sheen, and a thin black belt around her waist highlights her slender waistline. Her right hand extends forward, palm open, fingers long, nails painted bright red, and her fingertips adorned with a small black ornament, as if inviting the audience to approach or pose interactively. Her left hand hangs naturally, holding a corner of a piece of clothing or fabric, her body slightly turned to the side, revealing graceful curves and contours. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, with the figure occupying the main subject, head positioned at the top third of the frame. The forward movement of the right hand forms a strong visual guiding line, drawing attention to the foreground. The background is an open outdoor natural environment, with rolling green hills in the distance and dense vegetation with distinct layers. Nearby is dry sandy ground with scattered wild grass. The sky is deep blue, almost cloudless, with bright sunshine and abundant light, presenting a warm golden tone. The overall lighting effect is soft and bright. This creates a clear contrast between light and dark, enhancing the sense of depth. The interior of the car doors is upholstered in orange leather, with a delicate texture and rich details. The window glass reflects blurred images of the sky and surrounding scenery, adding depth and realism to the image. The entire image presents a style of everyday street photography, as if shot with a regular phone, preserving slight noise, oversaturated colors, and traces of local overexposure, creating a realistic, natural, and everyday atmosphere while maintaining both fashion and artistic beauty. The overall color palette is pink, Black and white are the main colors, paired with the natural colors of blue skies and green fields, creating a striking contrast. The images are full of vitality and modern flair, conveying freedom, individuality, and the lifestyle attitude of urban youth",
