        {
          "id": "krea2-ab19876fe11aeea6bbc20a1b",
          "alias": "单女蓝高领衫摄影棚困倦站立出神",
          "prompt": "An elegant Eastern woman wore a light blue sleeveless turtleneck dress made of smooth silk fabric, featuring delicate wavy patterns and a soft sheen. The hem hugged her figure and outlined smooth curves. The shoulders and neck were surrounded by multiple pearl strings, with pearls of varying sizes arranged in an orderly fashion, some set with tiny crystals or diamonds, sparkling warmly and brilliantly under the light, forming a gorgeous necklace and strap design that added a natural and lively touch. Her left hand gently strokes her neck, her fingers slender and long. On her wrist is a silver metal watch with a white dial featuring Roman numeral hour markers and black hands. The strap is made of deep blue leather, with a simple yet classic design. The overall look combines nobility with modernity. The figure poses dignified and composed, slightly tilted, with her right hand naturally hanging in front of her and gently resting on her left arm, full of confidence and approachability. The background features an abstract gradient sky tone, transitioning from light blue to gray-white. The layers are distinct, and the misty-like texture creates an ethereal and dreamy atmosphere. Light comes from the front slightly above, creating delicate shadows and highlights. The overall composition uses a mid-field portrait, with the figure slightly centered to the right, occupying the main visual space. The shallow depth of field effect blurs the background, highlighting the main contour and clothing details. The colors are mainly cool tones, with blue, white, and gray intertwining to create a tranquil, pure, and sophisticated visual experience. The light and shadow distribution is balanced, emphasizing three-dimensionality and layering, giving the image a strong fashion blockbuster feel. It also infuses a touch of everyday photography with a sense of realism, as if shooting in a professional studio with a medium format camera. The lens focal length is about 85mm, aperture f/2.8, ISO 100, shutter speed 1/125 second, capturing a moment of tranquility and elegance. The overall atmosphere is both dreamy and authentic, combining artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life. It feels like a morning or dusk, sunlight filtering through mist onto the beach by the sea, a woman standing quietly, gazing into the distance, her thoughts drifting toward the future.",
          "description": "",
