        {
          "id": "krea2-3303fe50069460a910fad1ca",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔城市冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a metal railing outdoors, wearing a black spaghetti strap top and blue high-waisted jeans. The short design of the top reveals a slender waistline, adding a touch of casualness and movement. Her right hand rests lightly on the railing, her left hand hangs naturally, and she wears a simple ring on her wrist. A black-and-white chain bag is slung across her shoulder, decorated with dense studs or sequins, presenting a fashionable feel. Her expression is slightly cool and calm, her overall posture relaxed yet elegant, her body slightly turned to the side. A graceful S-shaped curve is formed, with a pure light blue sky as the background, almost no clouds, bright and soft lighting, sunlight streaming down from the upper right, creating a warm light and shadow effect in the morning or afternoon. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, occupying the main visual space. The railing extends diagonally to the lower right corner, enhancing spatial depth and visual guidance. The color scheme is simple yet layered, with the black top and blue jeans forming a classic contrast. The pale blue sky in the background provides a fresh and tranquil tone for the image. The overall atmosphere combines urban fashion with natural relaxation, as if captured on a city rooftop or viewing platform. The image is rich in detail and authentic, combining the superb production standards of professional photography with the unintentional beauty of everyday life. The light and shadow transitions naturally and the contrast between light and shadow is balanced. It highlights the three-dimensional nature of the figure and the details of the clothing materials, such as the texture of denim fabric, the soft pleats of camisole fabric, and the metallic sheen of chain bags. These elements together create a visual scene full of artistic flair and a sense of everyday life",
