        {
          "id": "krea2-dc538d7229890e5bd0f2429b",
          "alias": "单女白T恤城市愤怒坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the green golf course lawn, wearing a white sports tank top and high-waisted dark green tight pants, her posture relaxed and natural. Her legs are crossed, right leg in front and left leg behind, feet flat on the grass. The details of her bare feet are clearly visible, toes slightly bent, fingers lightly resting on the knee, ring finger wearing a simple silver ring. The head tilts slightly to the right, the neck lines are graceful and smooth, and the overall posture exudes a lazy yet confident beauty. In the background is a white Tempe brand golf cart, with a clean and modern body. The black steering wheel and seats are clearly visible, the roof is a white sunscreen, and the wheels are silver hubs paired with black tires. The cart is parked on the lawn, with a blue-green golf basket on the left ground containing several white golf balls. In the distance, a rolling green lawn stretches to the skyline, with a clear blue sky without clouds. It presents a clear summer afternoon scene, shot from a low angle. The camera shoots upward from the ground close to the grass, highlighting the details of the subject's legs and feet, as well as the body curve. The sports cart and background environment are incorporated into the frame, forming clear layers in the foreground, middle shot, and background. The foreground focuses on the person's feet and lower body, the middle is the torso and upper body, and the background features the ball cart, open lawn, and blue sky. The visual guidance starts from near to far, starting with the person's bare feet and extending to the sports cart and distant background in the background. The light and shadow come from the sun at noon, bright but not glaring, creating soft shadows. The sides of the figures receive even light, while the back and legs show natural transitions of light and shadow. The grass leaves appear in rich green layers under the sunlight, ranging from bright tender green to deep dark green. The interplay of light and shadow creates a warm and authentic outdoor atmosphere. The entire scene is filled with the fresh vibe of summer, combining the vitality of sporty and casual with a quiet, relaxed lifestyle aesthetic, like a real scene shot outdoors under natural light with a professional camera, rich in detail, with moderate color saturation and delicate image texture, it offers the intimacy of everyday photography and the aesthetic taste of artistic composition",
