        {
          "id": "krea2-1d2e2f5aef1ba07efd7fa14d",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套街道忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at a street corner in a city, wearing a deep blue long coat paired with a sequin skirt and white stockings, wearing beige high-heeled ankle boots and a deep blue wide-brimmed hat that gently flutters in the wind. She lowers her head, her expression slightly melancholic or contemplative, hands tucked into coat pockets, posture relaxed and natural, body slightly leaning forward, presenting a lazy yet elegant urban fashion sense. In the foreground is a black wrought iron fence, its complex geometric lines contrasting with the figure, the fence's shadow cast on the ground. This enhances the sense of layering in the composition. The middle ground features a female subject, whose clothing colors contrast sharply with the background. The deep blue coat and the shiny metallic sheen of the short skirt complement each other, creating a visual focal point. The background is a red brick building with weathered walls showing signs of time. The windows are neatly arranged, some of which emit faint indoor light. On the exterior of the building is a black fire escape ladder that winds upward, adding depth and industrial texture to the scene. The street floor is made of gray cement. Clear zebra crossings and slight wear marks are visible. Distant shop windows reflect the surrounding environment, and the glass faintly reflects the pale blue tones of the sky. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to emphasize the figure's slender figure and clothing outline, while incorporating vertical lines from the building into the frame to create a strong visual direction. The figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, leaving space on the right to showcase the extension of the building and street. The overall composition has a cinematic and narrative feel, with the lighting and shadow atmosphere presented as softly scattered light on cloudy or dusk days. Light pours in from the upper right, with consistent shadow directions that enhance the sense of depth. The overall tone leans toward coolness, dominated by blue, gray, and black, accented by the metallic sheen of short skirts and warm beige boots, creating a warm and cool contrast that creates a quiet, solitary, yet urban atmosphere. The details are rich, presenting a fleeting beauty captured in everyday life, reminiscent of real street photography taken with an amateur camera, with slight graininess and natural exposure control, authentic and full of artistic flair",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
