        {
          "id": "krea2-72a5d29a50a18eecb21acee1",
          "alias": "单女毛衣客厅冷淡倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a gray high-neck, sleeveless knit dress with clearly visible knit texture, soft and warm. The high neckline naturally drapes down. Her right hand gently strokes the edge of the neckline, fingers long and slender, body slightly turned to the side. The left shoulder and arm lines are smooth, posture elegant and natural. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right center, occupying most of the space. The foreground is a close-up of the upper body and hands, rich in detail. The middle shot is the outline of the person's body and part of the background. The background is an indoor environment, with a light gray or off-white wall surface, clean and simple, with blurred window frames and soft light filtering through. The overall composition uses close-ups, with light coming from the left window direction, creating soft side lighting. The shadow transitions are natural, the layers of light and shadow are rich, the atmosphere is warm and tranquil, carrying a subtle sense of daily life and life, as if filmed in an ordinary family's living room or bedroom, using a standard camera or mobile phone device without professional lighting. The lighting is natural and realistic, with mainly gray, white, and beige tones and subtle contrasts of warm and cool tones, creating a quiet, comfortable, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The overall image has strong approachability and emotional impact, allowing people to feel a simple yet beautiful moment of life. The style leans toward realistic photography but also carries a touch of artistic processing. The details are refined, colors harmonious, and composition is meticulous, presenting a beauty that is both realistic and idealized",
