        {
          "id": "krea2-e70818a41befda1f3c7145c3",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣户外沉思站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the outdoor lawn, looking fresh and natural. She wears a light blue knit cardigan, which is soft and delicate. The collar and cuffs feature delicate ribbed designs, and the buttons are white round buttons neatly arranged at the chest. Underneath, she wears an off-white dress with a light and flowing hem, made of cotton-linen blends with subtle textures. She carries a beige canvas bag on her right shoulder, with a thick, comfortable strap. She holds a silver thermos in her right hand, its surface smooth and reflective. The cup body is marked with blurred text and patterns. She wears a black thin string wristband on her wrist, her nails painted pale pink, her fingertips slender. She stands slightly to the side, her left hand gently holding the bandage, her body slightly leaning, full of warmth. The middle is a green grassy field where she stands, with grass leaves glowing in the sunlight, presenting a richly layered green tone. The background is blurred woods and sky, with faint tree outlines forming a soft gradient of green and pale yellow. The sky emits a faint warm light, and the overall composition uses a central composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with a visual guide extending from her line of sight to the camera, creating a warm and interactive atmosphere. The light comes from the upper right, representing slanting sunlight at dusk. The sunlight filters through the leaves, creating soft and layered light and shadow, creating a peaceful, warm, and healing atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly light blue, off-white, light green, and warm yellow, harmoniously and unified, with a distinct Japanese portrait style. The texture is delicate and realistic, as if a high-quality portrait was shot with a professional camera, while still preserving the natural and casual vibe of daily life, giving a dreamlike yet accessible gentle beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
