        {
          "id": "krea2-0e06210fd3deab8086b7edd4",
          "alias": "单女街道站立阅读",
          "prompt": "The overall look is simple yet stylish, standing slightly sideways, her left hand gently supporting her waist, and her right hand carrying a black quilted chain bag, exuding elegance and confidence. The background is a building with beige exterior walls, clearly marked by years on the walls, with some areas showing mottled gray-white primer. On the right side is a dark metal door frame. The door frame is decorated with a retro-style circular relief pattern. Above the door hangs a beige sign in golden cursive script that reads \"Zola Karlitation\" in elegant and smooth script. On the left is a glass window with a black frame, divided into several small squares that reflect blurred images of the street and pedestrians. The floor is paved with light gray square stone bricks with clear textures. Light streams down from the upper right, creating soft shadows and creating a warm afternoon atmosphere. The overall composition centers on the figures, using a centrally symmetrical layout. The figures are positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, with background elements symmetrically distributed. The visual guide lines are formed by the lines of the figures and the direction of the line of sight, with rich layers of light and shadow, natural contrasts of light and shadow, and warm-toned sunlight shining on the building's surface, giving the walls a delicate texture. At the same time, soft contour light is cast on the figures, highlighting their curves. The entire scene blends modern fashion with classical architectural aesthetics, presenting a refined urban street vibe It seems to capture an unintentional moment, combining the realism of daily life with artistic beauty. The camera uses a standard angle of view, with moderate depth of field, clear foreground, and slightly blurred background, enhancing the subject's prominence. The overall color scheme is dominated by black, white, and beige, accented with golden signboards, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The visuals are full of sophistication and storytelling, like classic scenes from a movie, allowing viewers to feel the tranquility of time and the independent charm of the characters",
