        {
          "id": "krea2-eba2e2244d80fac5a0d7bbdc",
          "alias": "单女棕连衣裙室内俏皮站立比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, wearing a brown dress with a unique design, a wide ruffled neckline, long sleeves with a slightly flared shape, and a matching bow belt at the waist. The hem drapes down naturally in an A-shape, reaching the middle of the thigh, presenting an elegant and playful style. Her body is slightly turned to the left side of the frame, left leg slightly bent, right leg straight, feet standing in a V-shape, right hand raised to chest. The palm is open, fingers naturally extended, left hand hangs naturally, arm relaxed, and the overall posture presents a dynamic balance, as if dancing or striking a dance pose. Both legs wear black stockings, which have a delicate texture and a smooth surface with a slight reflect. The leg lines are smooth, and the leg lines are smooth. The feet are black high heels with pointed toes, high heels, and a clean upper that harmonizes with the overall look. The background is a light beige wall with a smooth surface without obvious textures or decorations. On the right wall is a white power outlet. The sockets are a standard double-hole design, located at the lower right of the frame, near the floor. The floor is a wood panel, with clear wood grain and a light brown color. The flooring is arranged staggered, forming regular geometric patterns. Light comes from the left front of the frame, providing a soft source that evenly illuminates the subject. Shadows are weak, mainly concentrated behind the figure and on the floor, with natural transitions creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The composition uses medium shots, with the subject occupying most of the space. From head to feet, the entire structure is presented. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the composition, with a clear visual focus. The foreground shows the entire figure, the middle ground is the junction between the figure and the floor, and the background features walls and outlets, creating distinct layers. At the same time, hand movements and leg postures add dynamic energy to the image. The overall color scheme is mainly warm tones. The brown dress echoes the light beige walls and brown wooden floor, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, evoking a sense of everyday warmth. At the same time, it carries a touch of artistic expression, as if performing an impromptu dance at home, capturing beautiful moments in life. The images are rich in detail, the texture is realistic, the expressions are lively, movements are natural, and the lighting and shadow are delicate, presenting an overall warm, natural, and vibrant artistic effect",
