        {
          "id": "krea2-4d6e97bf66992c2884e44031",
          "alias": "单女白旗袍竹林媚态站立回眸",
          "prompt": "She wears a white modified qipao with a black ribbon at the collar, black ties on the chest and waist, and a slit that reaches her thighs, revealing her long legs. She wears black chunky heels, her posture elegant yet slightly provocative. The overall look blends Eastern classical aesthetics with modern sensual elements. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the left central position of the frame, slightly turning her body to the side, with her right leg bent and raised, and her left leg extended, forming a graceful S-shaped curve In the background is a window with a wooden grille, letting in soft natural light. By the window stands a tall, emerald bamboo tree with slender leaves, full of vitality. The indoor light is warm, and the main light source comes from the right window, creating a slanting light from right to left, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. On the left, a warm yellow lantern or lampshade can be faintly seen, emitting a soft orange glow that adds a cozy atmosphere to the scene. The sofa features a retro-style floral pattern, mainly in beige and brown. The texture is clear but not too jarring. The overall composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figures occupying most of the space. Background elements are reasonably distributed to create a sense of layering between front and back. The visual guiding lines are formed by the figure's body lines, the direction of the folding fan, and the vertical lines of the bamboo. The composition is balanced and full of tension, with warm tones as the main colors. The white qipao contrasts strongly with black ties and high heels, and the green of the bamboo leaves serves as the finishing touch, enhancing visual vitality. The overall atmosphere combines classical elegance with modern fashion. It resembles a carefully crafted artistic portrait, or a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera in a quiet room, featuring a slight film texture and natural noise, presenting a realistic and story-rich imaging style. The details are rich, light and shadow transitions are natural, the subjects' expressions are focused, and the scene arrangement is meticulously arranged, showcasing a strong cultural atmosphere and personal charm",
