        {
          "id": "krea2-120ae850f4d64e51963632b3",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙街道忧伤奔跑注视",
          "prompt": "She wore a deep blue velvet dress with delicate white lace trim at the neckline and hem, long-sleeved designs, and several gold buttons adorning the chest. The overall look was elegant and vintage, paired with black over-the-knee boots. The shaft hugged the leg lines, and the high heel tips were slender, exuding a cool yet fashionable aura. She leaned lazily against the chair, her right leg bent, left leg straight and tilted toward the ground, and her left hand gently clutching a beautifully decorated small handbag. The handbag's surface is inlaid with a gold metal chain and intricate carved patterns, appearing luxurious and refined. Its expression is slightly detached and contemplative, as if immersed in its own world. The background is a typical New York subway car's interior. The dark gray metal doors and walls show slight wear marks, and the signs above the doors display \"Sax Avenue\" and \"Special\" in simple, modern font. The door glass reflects faint light, and the floor is paved with gray-brown tiles arranged in a checkered pattern. Some of the squares are black, creating a visual contrast. Several newspapers are scattered across the floor, with the top one clearly showing The New York Times masthead and news photo. The paper is slightly wrinkled, adding a sense of life. A silver metal handrail runs down from the right side of the painting, positioned slightly to the right in front of the figure, forming a visual guide line that draws the gaze to the main subject. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure occupying the center-left position, body in a diagonal posture, breaking symmetry. Creating dynamic balance, the foreground rails and newspapers on the floor enhance spatial layering, the middle features figures and benches, and the background features doors and the interior structure of the cabin. The overall color scheme is mainly deep blue, dark red, and gray-brown, with soft and even light and shadow, highlighting the texture of materials, such as the soft sheen of velvet and the delicate texture of lace. The atmosphere is calm, urban, and slightly lonely, blending the aesthetics of high-end fashion with everyday life, presenting a unique style that lies between artistic photography and street realism. The lens uses an 85mm prime portrait lens, with a shallow depth effect that slightly blurs the background and highlights the main subject's outline. The visuals have a cinematic narrative and emotional tension, rich in detail, moderate color saturation, and a realistic texture, presenting an overall refined, cold, and story-rich visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
