        {
          "id": "krea2-706f0882a75f305cae8c6fe8",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣侧头",
          "prompt": "Her arms naturally fold in front of her, her hand posture relaxed, fingers long and naturally curved. She wears a loose light blue coarse knit sweater featuring classic ribbed knit patterns. The neckline is designed as a wide off-shoulder style, with obvious trimming details at the cuffs and hem. The overall fit is comfortable and relaxed. The knit texture of the sweater creates rich layers and dimension under the light. The background is a blurred outdoor scene, with blurred green plants and a faint white railing creating soft depth of field. Sunlight filters through leaves, casting dappled light and shadow, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses close-up shots, with the main figure occupying the main position, the head slightly tilted, and the body forming a slight S-shaped curve. Enhances the dynamic beauty of the image. Light comes from the right front, creating a soft side illumination. Shadows transition naturally, while the shadowed areas delicately outline the outlines. The overall color tone is mainly a fresh blue, harmoniously unified and harmonious, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere, as if capturing a moment of tranquility under the afternoon sun. Shot with professional-grade equipment, simulating the effect of an 85mm prime lens, with an aperture of f/1.8 for extreme background blur. The low-angle downward view highlights the character's temperament and rich image details. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, like a real portrait taken with a high-end camera in natural light, offering strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
