        {
          "id": "krea2-8a74f8107696049465db582f",
          "alias": "单女黑短裤城市愤怒行走脱衣",
          "prompt": "Her makeup is exquisite and layered, revealing confidence and composure. She wears a leopard print V-neck bodycon top with a fitted design that highlights her slender waist and graceful curves. The waist is tied with a matching leopard print belt, forming a natural bow decoration. She pairs black high-waisted shorts that hug the hips, showing off her perfect body proportions, and is topped with a black leather jacket. The shoulders and cuffs are adorned with fluffy black feather-patterned fur collars, adding a touch of luxury and wildness. In her right hand, she carries a classic black quilted chain bag. The body is small and exquisite, the metal chain shimmers faintly in the light. Her left hand hangs naturally, fingers slightly bent, and her nails are painted in light pink. Her posture is elegant and relaxed. Her legs are clad in black stockings, with smooth and slender leg lines that are not fully visible in the frame. The overall look is fashionable and avant-garde, full of urban feminine charm. The beige stone exterior walls have subtle textures and traces of time. The building facade is decorated with exquisite reliefs and geometric patterns. The door and window frames are made of dark metal, presenting a classic vintage style. At the entrance, there is a green awning printed with the words \"PEACE HOTEL\" in elegant vintage font. The upper part of the building is decorated with carved letters, rich in detail. The street surface is gray asphalt, with clearly visible white traffic markings, including the number \"2\" and arrow signs. There are low concrete curbstones by the roadside, and in the distance, several pedestrians are walking. The sky shows the typical gray-white tone of a cloudy day, with soft and even lighting without obvious shadows. The overall atmosphere is calm and modern. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned at the very center occupying the main visual space. The background buildings extend from both sides backward, creating a strong sense of perspective that guides the viewer to focus on the main subject. The foreground features streets and signposts, the middle ground features figures and the building's lower floors, the background features high-rise buildings and distant pedestrians. The light and shadow are evenly distributed, and the scattered light from cloudy days makes the whole scene bright but not glaring. The colors are mainly cool tones, with neutral tones like beige, gray-black, and dark brown forming the basic tone. The leopard print pattern provides a warm contrast between brown and black, while the black clothing and stockings enhance the overall dark texture. The overall scene presents an atmosphere that blends sophistication with everyday life, combining the professional feel of a fashion blockbuster. It retains the authenticity and spontaneity of street photography, as if captured by a regular camera in an accidental moment, with a lifelike documentary beauty. At the same time, delicate light and shadow handling and precise color matching create a strong visual impact and artistic atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
