        {
          "id": "krea2-4fa75239a74ac0e49e7d03a3",
          "alias": "单女绿高领衫城市害羞站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands before a soft, warm-toned background, wearing a dark green turtleneck short jacket. The jacket has a delicate velvet texture that glows gently under the light. Gold buttons accentuate the collar, creating a striking contrast. The cuffs and hem design are smooth and natural, with slight pleats, showcasing the garment's three-dimensional tailoring and draping effect. She crosses her arms over her chest, fingers long and slender, her posture elegant yet slightly shy, appearing voluminous and layered, carrying a touch of mystery and gentleness. The overall figure is long and well-proportioned, with legs straight and upright, and the lines of the legs are smooth and graceful, as if carefully sculpted. The foreground focuses on the main subject, with a mid-angle perspective. The figure occupies the left-central position, with the body slightly turned to the side, creating a sense of dynamic balance. The background is a pure light brown gradient wall with no cluttered elements, creating a minimalist yet sophisticated visual atmosphere. Light from the upper left softly and evenly falls on the figure, creating a natural transition of light and shadow, with shadows falling on the right side of the body and the floor. It enhances the sense of three-dimensionality and highlights contour details. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, like a soft beam of light in a room at dusk, creating a private, tranquil, and slightly artistic ambiance. The color scheme is mainly green, creating a harmonious and unified visual effect. The composition is simple yet dynamic, with the figures' postures complementing the environment, conveying the independent temperament and restrained beauty of modern urban women. It resembles a fashionable portrait shot in a professional studio, captured with a large-aperture prime lens and precise depth control The background is softly blurred, highlighting the subject while preserving the texture and details of authentic shooting. The image has a strong visual guiding effect, then follows the arm movements to the body's curves, ultimately settling within the overall form and atmosphere. The overall style combines realism and artistic expression, presenting a daily yet refined visual aesthetic, like high-quality portrait photography completed with a high-end camera in a professional lighting environment, emphasizing realistic light and shadow and delicate materials, filling the entire image with warmth and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
