        {
          "id": "krea2-bc9cc3919b965521b98194ae",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙门媚态跪交叠",
          "prompt": "She wore a bright red leather strapless dress with a tight design that outlined smooth curves. The waist featured pleated details, and the skirt was short and sharp. She paired it with bright pink stockings and a pair of red-orange gradient pointed heels. The edge of the stockings slightly showed at the ankles, giving the overall look a sense of fashion and modernity. Her posture was elegant and relaxed, legs crossed, one foot on the ground, the other gently raised, elbows resting on her knees, her expression thoughtful and seductive. As if waiting for someone or immersed in thoughts, the background is a typical Parisian street scene. Dark wooden door frames and glass windows are labeled \"CHOCOLAT VIENNOIS\" and \"INFUSIONS.\" Warm lighting and blurred interior furnishings can be faintly seen inside the window. On the left stands a white menu board with text printed but the details unclear. Around it are several round metal tabletops and rattan chairs. The woven patterns of the chairs are clearly visible, and the floor is a damp gray stone pavement. Reflecting faint light spots and shadows creates an atmosphere of clear skies after rain or evening. In the distance, faint pedestrian silhouettes and vehicle silhouettes appear on the street, adding a sense of life. The composition uses low-angle shots to highlight the leg lines and clothing colors, while the café sign and environment serve as the backdrop, creating visual layers. The foreground focuses on the people and the floor, while the middle is the tables, chairs, and the café entrance. The background extends deep into the street, with natural light from the right intertwining with the warm yellow lighting inside the café. It creates a soft contrast of light and shadow, with shadows falling on the figure's body and the ground, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color scheme is mainly red, pink, and orange, creating a strong contrast with the dark background and creating a rich urban romantic atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and detailed, as if shot with a professional camera, offering cinematic light and shadow effects and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
