        {
          "id": "krea2-4631ebe25f8cc2ad153c8122",
          "alias": "单女浴袍竹林站立持械",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in traditional Hanfu with blue-green gradients, wearing a wide-brimmed bamboo bamboo hat, stands slightly to the side, gently resting her left hand on the edge of the hat, and holding a blue-green long sword in her right hand. The hilt is wrapped in a white cloth strap, with a hint of teal-green tip at the end of the scabbard. Her overall posture is elegant yet slightly lazy, as if she has just returned from a journey through the martial world. The robe is made of coarse linen fabric, with natural wrinkles and traces of time The collar is decorated with white stripes, and a dark blue cloth belt is tied around the waist. The belt is adorned with fine red cords, and the sleeves are wide with irregular flicked edges, giving a rustic yet refined look. In the foreground, the woman occupies the left central position of the painting, her body slightly tilted, forming a gentle S-shaped curve. The background features blurred bamboo fences and stone walls, with bamboo poles arranged vertically, some illuminated by sunlight, showing a warm golden hue. The stone walls are made of irregular stone blocks, with a rough surface and gray-brown color. In the background, faint green plants and scattered leaves can be seen. The composition uses a medium close-up, with the characters occupying the main part of the frame. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, then extends to the long sword in hand, forming a clear visual path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly backlit, with sunlight slanting from the left, creating a golden halo on the figure's silhouette. The shadowed areas transition delicately, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The overall color palette is dominated by blue, green, brown, and yellow, harmoniously unified and full of classical Eastern aesthetic charm. The image quality is realistic, as if shot outdoors under natural light with a professional camera, featuring slight film graininess and lens halo effects. The details are rich and layered, presenting a realistic style that is both artistic and close to everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
