        {
          "id": "krea2-957d623892d59f85cf595786",
          "alias": "单女T恤商店媚态回眸",
          "prompt": "Her makeup is exquisite but not exaggerated, and looking directly at the camera exudes an unintentional sensuality and detachment. She wears a patchwork long-sleeve T-shirt, mainly off-white, with dark gray sleeves and shoulders, cartoon-style patterns and English text printed on the back. She pairs it with black high-waisted shorts that highlight her long legs, and her right hand naturally raised. Holding a silver soda can in her hand, her fingers slender, her nails neatly trimmed, wearing a minimalist ring. Her overall posture was relaxed and confident, her body slightly turned to the side, her head looking back at the camera, creating a dynamic moment full of tension. In the foreground was the door frame of a transparent glass refrigerated cabinet, reflecting the surrounding light and shadows and the reflections of people. The warm lighting inside illuminated the neatly arranged various drinks, including beer bottles, soda cans, juice boxes, and more. Price tags were posted on the shelves, such as \"39,\" \"48\", \"60\", some product packaging features Chinese and English labels, such as \"OTTO SCHNEEELU,\" \"UNREE LATE,\" \"Wind in the Mountains,\" etc. The details are rich: the background is a dim indoor space, with another row of refrigerated cabinets and shelves faintly visible behind. Warm yellow strip-shaped light tubes hang above, emitting soft light that forms bright bands in the darkness, creating the unique atmosphere of a late-night convenience store or tavern. The composition uses close-ups, The figure occupies the center right of the frame, with the refrigerator door frame serving as a visual framework, guiding the gaze to focus on the figure and the drink in their hands. The glass reflection and perspective are used to enhance the sense of spatial layering. The light mainly comes from the warm yellow lamps inside the refrigerator and the strip lights at the top, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The shadows are soft, while the background gradually transitions to darkness, highlighting the main subject. The overall color scheme is dominated by a contrast of warm and cool temperatures, with the warm light inside the cabinet sharply contrasting with the cool external environment. It creates an atmosphere where loneliness and tranquility coexist in urban nightlife. The visuals have a strong sense of everyday realism, as if captured by chance on the street, with slight graininess and low-light noise, simulating amateur camera effects. The lens focal length is moderate, and the viewpoint is slightly downcast, capturing the natural expressions and movements of the subjects. The overall atmosphere is both modern and nostalgic, full of youthful energy and the detached beauty of urban life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
