        {
          "id": "krea2-4a64cf95f68365801d46a436",
          "alias": "单女红高跟鞋城市忧伤倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "Her ankles are slightly bent, one foot on the ground and the other suspended in the air, hands gently caressing her calves. Her posture is elegant yet powerful, her body leaning forward and her head slightly tilted, creating a visual tension that is both intimate and distant. In the foreground, her long legs and striking red high heels occupy the lower part of the frame. The smooth, reflective upper surfaces contrast sharply with the dark stockings. In the middle is the mottled concrete wall she leans on, covered in cracks, peeling paint, and weathering marks. The edges of the walls show obvious wear and dents. The background is an abandoned multi-story apartment building, with grayish-white exterior walls. Most windows are broken or missing, some window frames rust and deform, balcony railings are broken, creating an overall strong sense of desolation and decay. The sky is gloomy and grayish-white. The lighting is soft and uniform but lacks layering, creating a stifling urban apocalyptic atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward view to highlight the main figure's upright posture and presence, while incorporating ruins into the frame to enhance the environmental narrative. The figure is positioned near the center on the right side, with plenty of space on the left to display the background buildings, creating visual balance and guidance. Projecting backward toward the desolate building clusters creates a clear visual path. Light and shadow come from diffused light on cloudy days, with an overall cool tone dominated by gray, black, and white. Red high heels become the only warm color focal point, creating a strong color contrast. The image feels delicate and authentic, with rich details—such as the texture of the stockings, the sheen of the shoe uppers, the rough texture of the walls, and the structural lines of distant buildings—all clearly visible. The overall atmosphere blends decadent aesthetics with fashionable beauty, blending the desolate loneliness of a wasteland world with individual independence and charm. It feels like a poetic allegory in a modern city, with cinematic narrative tension and artistic appeal. Like a real scene shot with a professional camera on a rainy morning, it features slight film graininess and natural motion blur, presenting an imaging style that balances everyday and surreal feeling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
