        {
          "id": "krea2-718d96b845ce4fd14f418f5e",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙窗边冷淡站立持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the window, wearing an off-white cotton-linen strapless dress with a naturally draped hem, with subtle wrinkles and textures on the fabric, presenting a rustic yet comfortable everyday feel, adding a touch of laziness and authenticity. She leans slightly to the side, with smooth shoulder lines and clearly visible collarbones, appearing transparent and textured under soft lighting. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with the figure occupying the main visual space, body slightly tilted, forming a natural S-shaped curve. The composition uses close-ups. The background features dark brown wooden window frames and glass windows, which divide the scene into geometric shapes. Outside the window are blurred city buildings and dense green leaves. The city's silhouette is faintly visible under the blue-gray sky, with leaves swaying in the wind and dappled light and shadow, creating a vibrant green atmosphere in the city. Light streams in diagonally from the right window, creating a strong backlight effect and distinct outline light, while the other side is naturally shadowed, creating a subtle contrast of light and shadow. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, and the atmosphere is tranquil and warm. It carries a sense of tranquility reminiscent of early morning or evening, with warm yellow and cool blue tones as the main tones, creating a contrast between cool and warm conditions. The interior walls are light beige, harmonizing with the colors of the figures' clothing. The green plants outside the window inject a natural vibe into the scene. The entire scene feels like an ordinary family room, without deliberate decoration, full of everyday life. The shooting style resembles everyday mobile phone photography, with slight noise and natural color deviations. The lens focal length is moderate, and the background is slightly blurred, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The composition is simple yet storytelling, and the light path extends to the scenery outside the window, creating a resonance between inside and outside. Overall, it presents a real, natural, private, and slightly artistic everyday moment, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching fragment of life",
