        {
          "id": "krea2-d3d86b0ecc478509187de142",
          "alias": "单女制服街道站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a crosswalk on a city street, wearing a school uniform with a light blue short-sleeved shirt and a dark blue plaid pleated skirt. The collar is tied with a delicate blue-black plaid bow. She slightly tilts her head toward the camera, her right hand naturally hanging down, holding a black handbag. On her wrist is a simple black strap bracelet, and on her left wrist is a smartwatch with a white strap. Her overall posture is elegant and relaxed, with a busy city street in the background, and a black SUV driving past the crosswalk. The wheels and body appear dynamically blurred, with other vehicles and pedestrians nearby, including a rider on an electric bike and a distant bus stop. Dense green trees line both sides of the road, their leaves reflecting a bright green in the sunlight. The sky is clear and the light is soft and bright, reflecting the natural daylight environment. The composition centers on the figure, using a mid-angle perspective. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the frame's height, with the head positioned at the top third of the frame, forming a stable visual center. On the left side of the foreground is an inverted traffic cone, its black-and-white color contrasting with the gray stone slabs on the ground. On the right side, three stacked yellow and red warning posts add realism and a sense of life. The middle features clear zebra crossings and moving vehicles, while the background features extended streets, trees, and distant architectural silhouettes. The blend of solid and void creates distinct layers, with natural light and shadow effects. Sunlight streams down from the upper right, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color scheme is fresh and bright, mainly blue and white, accented with green and gray. It creates an atmosphere blending youthful campus and urban life. The images have a strong sense of daily life and realism, as if taken with a regular mobile phone street photos, retaining slight noise and natural color transitions without excessive embellishment, highlighting the natural beauty of the subjects and the documentary nature of the scenes. Dynamic elements in the background, such as blurred traffic and pedestrians, further enhance the flow of time and the depth of space, presenting an overall unique beauty that blends quietness and bustle, like a city portrait capturing fleeting emotions.",
