        {
          "id": "krea2-ef10b4760a365537e2a51d16",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣广场自信站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the balcony railing, wearing a bright red V-neck knit cardigan with long sleeves that fit her figure. The front front is adorned with a few small buttons, and the fabric features a delicate knit texture and a soft sheen. She pairs a high-waisted black velvet long dress with a flowing hem, and the material gives off a faint matte finish under the light. At her waist, a wide black leather belt with gold metal buckles outlines a slender waistline. The overall look is elegant and layered, and her posture is naturally relaxed. Her left hand rests lightly on the carved iron railing, while her right hand hangs naturally. A small black square bag is slung across her shoulder. The bag is simple and neat, with sharp lines, contrasting with the soft clothing, naturally draped over her shoulders. Her makeup is exquisite, her expression calm and confident, and her earlobes are adorned with large gold earrings, adding a touch of vintage charm. In the foreground is a metal balcony railing, decorated with complex circular hollow patterns. Including a red apple and two green fruits, adding a touch of life and color to the scene. The center is a female subject, positioned slightly to the left of the frame, her body slightly tilted, head facing the camera. The composition uses a third-degree method: the figure occupies the left third of the frame, leaving space on the right to display the background environment, extending along her line of sight into the distance, creating an open sense of space. The background is a lush forest, with leaves showing rich green tones, some of which have yellowed, hinting at the scent of autumn. In the distance, the outlines of undulating hills and a wide body of water can be faintly seen. The calm water reflects the pale blue sky and the soft light and shadow of clouds. The sky appears pale grayish-white with a slight mist. The overall lighting is natural daylight, soft and even, without strong shadows. Sunlight shines from the upper right, creating delicate transitions of light and shadow in the folds of clothing. The direction of light and shadow is consistent, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall tone of the painting is warm and harmonious. The red top contrasts sharply with the green background, highlighting the main subject without appearing awkward. The atmosphere is tranquil and slightly artistic, like a leisurely afternoon moment. The composition is stable, the viewing angle is level and close to the usual camera angle, with slight lens distortion and a sense of realism. It feels as if a regular camera was used to capture the real environment. The image details are rich, from fabric textures to metal reflections to the subtle veins of leaves, all clearly visible. Overall, it presents a realistic style that combines fashion and a sense of life, like a carefully crafted artistic portrait. It also feels like a casual moment captured in daily life, full of story and warmth",
