        {
          "id": "krea2-03a2b0bd1a2222bc986ca504",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙户外微笑坐比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor wooden floor, wearing a light, flowing white sleeveless dress with a hem in soft pink and pale yellow gradients. The material looks like silk or chiffon, and as she moves, it falls naturally into elegant pleats. The hem of the skirt curls slightly, revealing light blue cloth shoes and beige lace socks at her ankles. She wears a sweet smile, looking straight at the camera, hands raised above her head, fingers making two V-sign gestures, and on her left wrist is a simple white bead necklace. Around her neck hangs a delicate silver necklace with a tiny pearl dangling from it. Her overall posture is relaxed and natural, full of youthful energy. In the foreground, the skirt hem and foot details scatter in front of her. On the right, several tall green plant leaves extend diagonally from the lower right corner, slender and glossy, presenting a natural growth posture. The background is a blurred brown wooden fence made of vertically arranged wooden strips, with clear wood grain that reveals a warm wood texture and soft and bright light. Natural light from the front left evenly shines on the figures, creating a fresh and warm atmosphere. The shadows are soft and there is no strong contrast. The entire scene is set outdoors during the day, with the composition using a center-to-right visual layout. The figure occupies the main position, with a slightly tilted body and a slight tilt of the head, interacting with the viewer to create strong visual guidance. The plants in the foreground and the wooden fence in the background together create a sense of layering. The depth of field is well controlled, making the figure stand out clearly, while the background is moderately blurred, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, with tones dominated by white, pink, green, and brown. The colors are harmonious and unified, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere that feels as realistic as everyday photography with a regular camera. It feels like capturing a sunny afternoon moment. The images are delicate and authentic, rich in detail, full of the spirit of life and youthful beauty, presenting an imaging style that is both artistic and natural",
