        {
          "id": "krea2-7d3f3e90b43f3125a98d7e26",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙门微笑站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, looking directly at the camera, her expression slightly gentle and smiling, presenting a natural pink tone. She wears round metal fine-framed glasses. The lenses are clear and transparent, reflecting the faint light from the surroundings, adding a touch of intellect and artistic flair. Her body is slightly turned to the right side of the frame, her left arm naturally hanging down, and her right hand gently resting on the door frame behind her. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, wearing a floral dress with a beige base featuring pink rose and green leaf patterns. The dress features a V-neck design. The neckline edges are decorated with ruffles and lace lace, and a thin bow of the same material is tied at the chest. The waist is cinched to outline a slender waistline. The long sleeves are made of semi-transparent tulle material, with wide and voluminous sleeves creating a romantic puff sleeve effect. The hem features multiple layers of ruffles, layered and gently fluttering in the breeze, presenting a soft texture and dynamic beauty. To the left of the background is a brightly colored wall with an abstract painting hanging on it, set against a large pink background. Dotted with several large pink flowers and blue dots, the lines are simple and bright, full of childlike fun and artistic flair. Below the painting is a white wall, and on the right is a vertical wooden decorative panel with wood grain textures, warm orange-brown in color. The surface is smooth with subtle wood grain details, and a dark gray vertical panel is interspersed in the middle, possibly part of a door or partition. The overall composition centers on the figure, positioned slightly to the left of the center of the painting, forming a visual focal point. The contrast between the figure and the background is striking, and the foreground highlights the main subject. The middle shots showcase clothing details and body postures, while the background enriches the layers through color and patterns. The composition uses close-ups, with the camera shooting slightly upward, enhancing the figure's height proportions and presence. The line of sight extends to body curves and clothing details, and finally, the color painting in the background draws you in. The lighting atmosphere is soft and even, with light coming from the upper front, with subtle and natural transitions without strong contrasts, creating a warm and comfortable indoor atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm tones, such as beige, pink, Colors like orange and brown echo each other, creating a warm and pleasant visual experience. The image texture is delicate and rich, as if shot with a high-resolution camera, yet retains the realism and lifestyle feel of everyday amateur equipment. It has a strong artistic and fashionable vibe, making it suitable for fashion photography, life documentation, or personal portrait creation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
