        {
          "id": "krea2-422e44fb2f86e67e1f35372a",
          "alias": "单女红西装街道自信站立",
          "prompt": "A female model dressed in an all-red suit stands on the zebra crosswalk in Moscow's Red Square. She wears a high-neck, long-sleeved red cropped jacket with a simple yet elegant design, slightly puffed sleeves, and a belt decorated with a gold chain at the waist, highlighting her slender waistline. She pairs a matching red pencil skirt and tight red stockings, paired with pointed high heels. The overall look is unified in color and visually striking. Her posture is confident and composed, hands folded in front of her, body slightly turned with her head facing the camera. Echoing the colors of the clothing, with a gentle breeze blowing, the foreground features a wide asphalt road and clear white crosswalk markings. The road surface has a slight reflection, showing the dampness of early morning or evening. In the middle of the frame, you can see gray metal traffic signal poles, no honking signs, pedestrian crossing signs, and some urban infrastructure. In the background, the magnificent panorama of St. Basil's Cathedral is layered, with layers of colorful onion domes interwoven with green, blue, orange, and red. The brick-red walls contrast sharply with the white decorative lines. The architecture is rich in detail, including arches, colonnades, and intricate geometric patterns. In front of the church are stone low walls and wrought iron railings, surrounded by lush green trees. The sky appears light blue with a few thin clouds, and the light is soft and warm, casting bright and even natural light over the entire scene. Sunlight streams in from the upper left, casting clear shadows on the ground and the figures. The clear layering of light and shadow creates a tranquil yet vibrant urban atmosphere. The composition is shot at a low angle, enhancing the figure's upright character and presence. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, using a diagonal pedestrian crossing to guide the viewer to the right toward the background buildings, creating a strong sense of depth. The color scheme is dominated by large areas of red, creating a harmonious visual dialogue with the colorful dome of the church in the background. The contrast of warmth and coolness highlights the main figures, blending fashion, culture, and urban life, presenting an artistic beauty that is both modern and rich in history. It feels like a high-quality fashion masterpiece shot by professional photography under natural light. It has a cinematic texture and narrative quality, with rich tones yet realism, exquisite details, and delicate light and shadow, presenting a dramatic moment that suddenly appears in everyday life, allowing people to feel the individual power and aesthetic expression within urban spaces",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
