        {
          "id": "krea2-e14610ec10f9dd7a570b338a",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙森林困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly under the hood of a bright red vintage American sedan. She wears a black lace spaghetti strap mini dress paired with black stockings and high-heeled sandals, glowing warmly in the sunset glow. She leans slightly to the side, her right hand naturally resting on her knee, her expression slightly contemplative and dreamy, exuding a lazy yet confident aura. Her makeup is exquisite, earrings are simple yet shimmering, her overall posture is relaxed and full of tension. Her body lines are smooth and graceful, echoing the curves of the car, with details clearly visible at the front. The red paint reflects a soft glow in the sunlight, with fine scratches and dust marks on the surface, reflecting a genuine usable feel. The car is parked on a lush green lawn, with wildflowers growing along the edges, dotted with pink and white flowers. In the middle is a vast green field, with grass leaves swaying in the wind, distant trees forming blurred lines, and a dense forest in the background. The leaves appear semi-transparent in the backlight, the sky is dyed golden yellow, and the sunset pours down from the upper right of the frame, with soft and directional light. This creates a clear contrast between light and shadow: the left side of the figure and vehicle is in shadow, while the right side is illuminated by golden sunlight, creating a strong transition between light and shadow. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the main roles of the person and vehicle, while also stretching the sense of spatial depth. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, while the vehicle occupies most of the right side, creating visual balance. The camera focuses on the person and the front of the car, with the background gradually blurring to create a shallow depth of field. The colors are mainly warm tones, with the red body, golden sunlight, The green lawn forms a harmonious and complementary relationship, with an overall atmosphere full of nostalgia and romance, as if capturing a tranquil moment at a summer evening. The image texture is delicate and richly detailed, presenting a film-like graininess and color gradation, with slight lens vignetting and natural halos, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a standard lens or captured by amateur equipment under natural light, exuding a lifelike artistic aesthetic. The image shows no obvious watermarks or post-processing marks, preserving the authentic texture of the original footage. The light and shadow transitions are natural, the color saturation is moderate, neither exaggerated nor bland. The overall style blends retro aesthetics with modern fashion elements, conveying a life attitude of freedom, independence, and poetry",
