        {
          "id": "krea2-27223af60ce056714d09869c",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫茶室坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the floor of a Japanese-style tatami room, wearing a white long-sleeved shirt with vertical stripes paired with a dark gray diamond patterned vest, paired with gray slim-fit leggings. She sits cross-legged, her right hand naturally resting on the floor to support her body, and her left hand resting lightly on her knee. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, wearing thin-rimmed glasses that exude a gentle and intellectual aura. Her nails are painted in blue and green, with exquisite details. The overall look blends academic style with modern fashion, with a light yellow tatami mat covering the entire scene in the foreground. The woven patterns are clearly visible, with geometric patterns alternating gold and brown along the edges. The center is the main area where the woman stands. On the left is a low rattan table with a red pottery teapot, a small wooden stove, a calligraphy scroll, and a pot of green plants. Beside it is an open book. On the right is a natural wood-colored desk with a blue-and-white porcelain vase painted with landscape and deer motifs and a small blue-glazed Buddha statue. The background is an off-white wall with a traditional Chinese scroll painting depicting the scene of immortals in clouds and mist. In the right corner of the painting stands a lush green plant, with dense branches and foliage, and mottled light and shadow. The composition is shot from a low angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, forming a visual focal point. The slanted lines of the tatami mat and the lines of the furniture guide the viewer's gaze, creating a sense of depth and spatial layering. Light comes from the upper left of the frame, creating delicate shadow transitions that emphasize three-dimensionality. At the same time, long shadows cast on the floor and walls enhance realism. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, full of fusion of Eastern Zen and modern lifestyle aesthetics. The color tones are mainly warm yellow, off-white, and gray-brown, harmoniously unified. The image texture resembles real scenes taken with a casual camera or phone, with slight film graininess and slight lens distortion. The details are rich but not overly sharpened, presenting a lifelike artistic beauty. It feels like a quiet moment recorded on an afternoon in a traditional tea room, combining everyday intimacy with a pursuit of beauty and inner peace",
