        {
          "id": "krea2-e7848a7ab701b3e8e0b4969d",
          "alias": "单女银礼服窗边困倦倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against a wooden windowsill, wearing a delicate silver sequin strapless gown. The shoulders and neckline are adorned with countless crystals and beads, shimmering with enchanting light. The material is light yet textured, and the tailored fit highlights her graceful curves, forming a sophisticated bun. She wears a complete set of diamond jewelry, including a necklace set with large diamonds. The chain clasp is designed in the classic lock shape, each diamond carefully cut, reflecting dazzling brilliance. The earrings are long drape-style designs strung with multiple layers of diamonds that gently sway with her movements. The ring is a ring set with a huge main stone, and the ring set is covered with tiny diamonds. The entire jewelry set exudes an aura of luxury. The foreground is the rough edge of a wooden windowsill, with obvious wear marks and peeling white paint, revealing the weariness of time. The middle is a full-body female figure, clearly visible from above the waist, composed in close-ups. The background is a blurred outdoor scene, with faint green trees and warm yellow light spots. This creates a beautiful bokeh effect, with a soft and dreamy ambiance. The light source comes from the front side, like warm afternoon sunlight, creating a blend of light and shadow. The overall composition presents an artistic style that is noble and elegant yet gentle and romantic. Like a carefully painted portrait, it possesses strong visual appeal and emotional appeal, as if capturing an eternally beautiful moment, full of storytelling and artistic beauty",
