        {
          "id": "krea2-aa2bc85a00a26e694c8fa33e",
          "alias": "单女短裙花园持相机",
          "prompt": "The petals curl slightly, giving a natural withered texture, echoing the pale yellow rose she gently holds. The petals are layered, their colors soft, as if gently swaying in the breeze. The overall makeup is exquisite but not overly heavy. The Hanfu is made of light pink satin fabric with delicate subtle patterns, wide and flowing sleeves, embroidered with exquisite floral patterns, including red peonies, Blue birds and green branches and leaves, with fine stitching and rich color layers, a white brocade belt tied at the waist adorned with gold patterns and tassels, the skirt hem light, gently lifted in the breeze. The composition centers on the figure, using medium shots and close-ups that occupy the main part of the composition. The background is blurred, presenting a blurred green vegetation that creates a profound sense of space. The light is soft and even, coming from the front and side, simulating natural light. The transition of light and shadow is natural, without strong shadows, creating an overall atmosphere of tranquility and elegance. Full of classical poetry, it feels as if you are in a Jiangnan garden or ancient-style courtyard. The color palette is mainly pink, white, and green, harmoniously unified. The image texture is delicate and lifelike, offering a high-resolution photography experience, while retaining hand-painted soft lines and color gradients, like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, and the background blurs like a thin mist. It highlights the three-dimensional and realistic nature of the main subject, presenting an artistic style that is tranquil, beautiful, and rich in Eastern charm, allowing people to feel the charm of traditional clothing culture and the gentle temperament of women",
