        {
          "id": "krea2-252482e5f7063812c231c1fe",
          "alias": "单女围巾城市沉思坐过肩",
          "prompt": "Her overall temperament is gentle and urban, wearing a loose black hooded sweatshirt made of seemingly soft and thick material, with slightly cinched cuffs and hem. Underneath, she wears an off-white, semi-transparent sheer scarf with a light and flowing texture, featuring natural pleats and tassel details at the edges, casually draped over her shoulders and neck, adding depth and softness On the bottom, she wears brown corduroy shorts with a simple and fitted shape, clearly visible fabric texture, fine woven patterns on the stockings, smooth leg lines, and a pair of platform sneakers in black, white, and gray tones. The upper features metallic decorations and the brand logo, black laces, thick soles with complex geometric structures, presenting a strong modern trendy style. The figure sits naturally, legs crossed and stacked, left leg in front and right leg behind, knees slightly bent, body slightly tilted against the wall behind her. The left hand rests naturally on the left knee, with an elegant and unpretentious posture. The foreground features the main subject occupying the center-left position of the composition, using a medium perspective to present the figure from head to knee. On the left side of the background is a multi-pane glass window with a black frame. The light outside is bright, creating a soft backlight effect. The window frame lines are clear, and the glass reflects a blurred outdoor scene. On the right wall hangs a mounted painting framed in light wood, featuring a black-and-white vintage poster printed with \"HOLLYWOOD.\" and other English letters and abstract patterns. Below is a small black square table, on which sits a leopard-print black leather handbag. The bag is smooth and reflective, with clear zippers and hardware details. The entire scene is set indoors, with off-white walls with a slightly mottled texture, and the floor is light wood with warm tones. The overall lighting comes from natural light from the left window, creating a soft side lighting. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, with delicate shadows that create a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition is balanced, with the figure centered slightly to the left. Background elements are reasonably distributed, extending along the line of sight to body posture and clothing details, then turning to posters and handbags in the background, creating rich visual layers. The colors are mainly black, white, beige, and brown, accented with leopard print and silver-gray. The overall tone is harmonious and unified, evoking both the warmth of everyday life and the artistic flair of fashionable photography. The image texture is realistic, as if shot with a regular camera, with slight graininess and natural exposure, presenting a realistic and lifelike image style. The composition is stable, and the focus is clear. The background is moderately blurred, highlighting the main character while preserving environmental details, conveying a laid-back, free-spirited urban woman who balances fashion and everyday life",
