        {
          "id": "krea2-4ae6d84a7ca0c774e0fd9bab",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙花园困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a pavilion in a Chinese garden, wearing a delicate Lolita-style dress with white as the main color scheme and soft pink embellishments. The upper body features a pleated strapless spaghetti strap, adorned with a pink bow on the chest. A matching lace neck loop is tied at the neckline, and a large pink bow is tied at the waist. The layered hem presents a fluffy A-line silhouette, with elegant floral patterns embroidered along the edges and golden lines outlining the edges, giving the whole look a sweet and elegant look. The background is a lush green forest, with leaves shining bright green in the sunlight. The light and shadows are mottled, and in the distance, ripples and floating lotus leaves can be faintly seen on the pond's surface. The pavilion's wooden column is on the left side of the frame, with a simple and rustic structure, and the composition adopts a central symmetrical layout. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The foreground is clear and prominent, the middle shot consists of the figure and pavilion, while the background is blurred, creating a strong sense of depth. The light is soft and even, coming from naturally diffused light, making the overall tone warm and fresh. The transitions between light and shadow are delicate, shadows are soft and unobtrusive, and the atmosphere is peaceful and dreamy, as if you are in a fairy-tale summer afternoon. The entire scene is filled with the gentle texture unique to Japanese photography, with moderate color saturation, mainly pale and green, harmoniously unified, rich in sentiment and romantic atmosphere, with delicate image texture as if shot with a professional camera, yet retaining the warmth of everyday life. It resembles a carefully arranged outdoor portrait work, with a rigorous yet lively composition and clear visual guidance. Through the subject's gestures and gaze, it directly interacts with the viewer, enhancing the sense of participation and immersion in the image, presenting an overall aesthetic that is tranquil, innocent, and slightly playful",
