        {
          "id": "krea2-31d41705f0808392ff9fd872",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙桌边沉思站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by an outdoor stone wall, wearing an elegant white spaghetti strap long dress. The hem drapes naturally, the fabric smooth and delicate, presenting a soft sheen. The shoulder lines are smooth, the neckline is simple and elegant, giving the whole look a pure and noble look. She wears a bright red knit cardigan over it. The fabric is soft, the sleeves slightly rolled up, buttons neatly arranged, and the strong color contrast creates a visual focal point. It naturally drapes over her shoulders, her makeup exquisite, and she holds a book with a yellow cover, its pages slightly opened. She seems to be reading or has just finished, gently holding a book with her left hand, her posture natural and relaxed. On her right shoulder is a small black bag slung across her right shoulder. The slender strap harmonizes with the overall outfit. The background is a rough beige stone wall, with clear texture and a rustic texture. On the right is a small white round table with several books. Beside it, green plant branches and leaves extend into the frame, the leaves blurring to create a sense of depth. Several green leaves are also blurred in the foreground, enhancing the sense of layering in the image. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly tilted, head slightly raised, creating an atmosphere of contemplation or immersion in reading. The lighting is soft and warm, like the dappled shadows of afternoon sunlight filtering through the leaves. The overall color palette is mainly warm tones, with white, red, beige, and green complementing each other, creating a cozy and tranquil atmosphere. Light and shadow shine from the left, emphasizing three-dimensionality, while background blur makes the subject stand out even more. It is as if inviting viewers to enter her inner world. The entire image carries a strong artistic atmosphere and a sense of everyday life, resembling a high-quality portrait taken with a professional camera, yet imbued with the casualness and realism of everyday life. The details are rich and emotionally rich, presenting a tranquil and beautiful moment, suitable for fashion photography, artistic portraits, or lifestyle content creation",
