          "alias": "单女女仆女仆装门戏谑倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a classic maid outfit: a black short skirt paired with a white ruffled apron and cuffs, a white lace bow tie around her neck. She leans against a beige wall, her left hand gently resting on the wall, her right hand naturally hanging down, wearing black pantyhose. Her right leg is slightly raised, toes touching the ground, presenting an elegant and playful pose. The main figure is the maid dressed as a maid, positioned slightly to the center of the frame, her body slightly turned and head slightly tilted, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. In the foreground is her body contour and posture. The middle ground features the wall she leans against and part of the door frame, with a dark brown wooden door and a light beige texture wall in the background. The floor is a warm-toned wooden floor with clear wood grain. The overall composition uses a three-part method, with the figure occupying the main visual area. Light softly shines from the front left, creating a warm and delicate light and shadow effect. Shadows naturally fall on the right wall and floor, highlighting the three-dimensional effect. The light source comes from the indoor ambient environment, possibly natural light near the window or warm lighting, giving the entire scene a cozy and homely atmosphere. The color palette is mainly black and white, complemented by warm brown wood and off-white walls. The colors are harmonious and unified, giving the image a strong sense of daily life and life. It feels like an amateur photo taken at home, yet still retains artistic beauty. The details are rich, the overall atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, full of sense and approachability. The composition is stable, and the visual guidance is natural, conveying a gentle, cute, and slightly teasing mood. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if taken with a high-megapixel camera or mobile phone, preserving slight noise and realistic light and shadow. It enhances realism and immersion",
