        {
          "id": "krea2-8bead6d9b5462035772ad713",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙摄影棚冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a black high-slit long dress stands sideways, her body slightly leaned back, her head turning back to gaze at the camera. Her right hand gently caresses her hips, while her left hand hangs naturally, her posture elegant and full of tension, exuding a blend of confidence and allure. The black long dress features a unique design, with a thin crossed ribbon structure at the back. The high slit extends from the top of the thigh to the waist, revealing the lines of her long legs. The skirt is wide and flowing, forming smooth pleats with her movements. The material resembles silk or satin, with a delicate sheen and drape. In the foreground, the figure occupies the main position in the frame, extending from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a strong visual guiding line. The composition uses a mid-shot close-up, with the figure's height ratio nearly filling the entire screen. The background features a dark gray hexagonal honeycomb wall with regular geometric patterns, presenting a strong modern industrial feel and spatial depth. The wall texture is clear and well-structured, with light streaming diagonally from the left, creating a contrast of light and shadow on the figure and the wall, highlighting contours and three-dimensionality. The shadowed sections transition naturally, and the overall light and shadow atmosphere is cool and cool. It carries the texture of high-end fashion photography, with mainly black and gray tones to create a mysterious, calm, and powerful visual effect. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens, with shallow depth of field blurring the background to make the subject stand out. The shooting angle is slightly lower, enhancing the visual height and aura of the subject. The overall composition is full and layered, combining the geometric beauty of modern architecture with the softness and strength of human curves. The color scheme is simple and restrained, emphasizing light and shadow changes and material expression. It presents a high-end fashion photography style that combines artistry and commercial appeal, reminiscent of meticulous lighting and composition from a professional studio, yet retaining realism and a sense of everyday life. It captures the model's most natural state like a genuine amateur device captured in its most natural state. The images are rich in detail, and the overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of tension, leaving a lasting impression",
