        {
          "id": "krea2-4e1e4a1e074eb3072b4a5987",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣公寓沉思站立持乐器",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways outdoors in a lush green environment, wearing a pair of fine-framed glasses. The lenses reflect softly, reflecting the surrounding light. Her expression is focused and slightly contemplative, presenting a natural sheen. She wears an off-white sleeveless knit tank top, simple and slim in style, highlighting her slender shoulder and collarbone lines. She pairs it with dark sports shorts with white stripes at the waistband. The overall outfit is casual, comfortable, and stylish. On her right shoulder is a black guitar bag with a rectangular body. Made of wear-resistant nylon fabric with a smooth and flat surface, the strap extends from the shoulder to the chest, with part of the top exposed, making it practical and professional. The left hand rests naturally on the bike handlebar, the right hand lightly grips the phone, fingers are long, nails neatly trimmed, and the handlebar is made of metal with slight wear marks reflecting a soft sheen. The handlebar is wrapped with red wires or ropes, adding a touch of life. The background is a blurred green plant with dense leaves, presenting different layers of emerald green tones. Dappled light and shadow create a hazy and tranquil atmosphere. In the distance, a few white spots of light can be faintly seen, like sunlight casting tiny halos through leaves. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, body slightly tilted, creating a natural sense of movement. The foreground shows parts of the bicycle frame and handlebars, with clean and smooth lines that echo the figure. The middle ground features the main figure and guitar bag, with clear details and sharp color contrasts. The background is completely blurred, highlighting the subject and drawing the viewer to the unknown space outside the frame, enhancing storytelling. The light and shadows come from natural daylight, soft and even, shining from the upper right side of the figure. The shadows are delicate and not jarring, with the overall color scheme mainly green and white, complemented by black and metallic gray. The colors are harmoniously unified, presenting a fresh, natural, and artistic atmosphere, as if capturing a brief rest of musicians in the park on an afternoon. It is full of youthful energy and artistic atmosphere, with the realistic texture of everyday amateur equipment. The camera parameters simulate the Canon EOS R5. 24-70mm f/2.8 lens, ISO 100, shutter speed 1/125 sec, aperture f/2.8, strong background blur, rich details without excessive sharpness, preserving film-like graininess and color fidelity. The overall style leans toward a blend of realism and romanticism, combining documentary feel with poetic charm, suitable for visual creations expressing themes such as youth, music, and dreams",
