        {
          "id": "krea2-40e9580140e72ec8192bddb8",
          "alias": "单女镜前温柔躺戏水",
          "prompt": "She lounged lazily on a simple wooden boat, her body reclining at an angle, legs slightly bent and raised, feet naturally extended, barefoot and light, calves smooth and graceful. Her fair skin looked gentle and jade-like under soft light. Her right hand rested gently on the boat's edge, her left hand naturally lowered, fingertips lightly touching the water, exuding an elegant and refined aura. As if stepping out of a classical painting, the small boat is made of deep brown old wood, with a surface marked by the marks of time and mottled textures. The edges are slightly rough, the hull slightly tilted, partially submerged in water. The water surface is as calm as a mirror, reflecting the green trees along the shore and the faint glow of the sky. The background is a hazy green vegetation, lush and layered. In the distance, faint tree shadows and ripples can be seen. On the left side of the foreground, several slender branches extend into the frame, dotted with tender green new leaves and a few yellowing autumn leaves. Add a touch of seasonal poetry. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the lower right of the frame, forming the visual focal point. Diagonal composition enhances the sense of movement. Light and shadow come from the upper left, with soft natural light shining on the figure, creating a warm golden halo. Subtle shadows are cast in the folds of clothing, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The water surface reflects faint light spots, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly teal, white, and brown, harmoniously unified with a vintage film texture. The scene presents a tranquil, distant, and poetic Eastern aesthetic conception, fresh and elegant like an ink painting, full of the gentle charm of a Jiangnan water town. The light is soft and layered, creating a tranquil moment in the morning or evening. The air seems to be filled with a faint floral fragrance and moist moisture. The entire scene seems frozen beyond time, evoking a sense of peace and beauty far from the hustle and bustle. The details are meticulously handled, showcasing a high level of artistic skill and cinematographic skill",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
