        {
          "id": "krea2-e2dfe302652f00d595fe64a4",
          "alias": "单女棕西装城市沉思坐持包（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the concrete steps of a city night, wearing a neatly tailored brown double-breasted blazer that reaches her knees with slightly rolled cuffs, showcasing a refined sense of urban fashion. Underneath, she wears a dark bodysuit that accentuates her long legs. She wears a pair of bright red patent leather high heels, their smooth, reflective uppers that strongly echo the color of the stockings and handbag. The handbag is made of delicate red leather with metal chain decorations, gently placed by her thigh, while her right hand is wearing a red glove. The fingers bend naturally, resting gently on the edge of the steps, while the left hand hangs naturally at the side of the leg. The posture is elegant and relaxed, fluttering gently in the breeze, carrying a hint of coolness and confidence. The makeup is clean and crisp, and the earrings are simple gold rings. The overall look is full of modernity and fashion tension. The background is a corner of a city street, with rough concrete steps with fine cracks and stains, presenting a realistic urban texture. On the left is a stainless steel handrail with clean and smooth lines, reflecting the faint light of the surroundings. Behind is the exterior wall of a building, with a light gray surface featuring vertical textures. A glass window lets in warm yellow light, and inside the window, you can faintly see the interior furnishings, creating a sense of life. Beneath the building is a wooden or metal grille-like barrier structure, adding spatial layers. The floor is made of cement tiles, grayish with some signs of wear in some areas. The entire scene is set at night, but not completely dark. Lighting from streetlights, interior lighting, and possibly camera flashes together create a light and shadow atmosphere. The light source mainly comes from the front right of the figure, creating a soft frontal illumination, while casting light shadows on the steps and ground to enhance the sense of depth. The stainless steel handrail on the left side reflects a cool metallic sheen, contrasting with the warm-toned indoor lighting. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned near the center on the right side of the frame, body in a diagonal posture, left leg straight, right leg bent, toes touching the ground, creating dynamic balance and visual flow. The foreground features steps and part of the ground, with the middle being the main body and handrail. The background features the building's facade and windows, with distinct layers. The overall color palette is mainly cool gray, accented with vivid red, creating a strong visual impact. The atmosphere combines urban calm and detachment with fashionable boldness and personality, as if capturing a chance encounter on the street. It carries the realism and artistic expression of everyday photography. Shot with a professional camera, high resolution, rich detail, natural clothing folds, smooth light and shadow transitions, moderate color saturation, and overall presenting a sophisticated documentary aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
