          "id": "krea2-8e5145d3f22aa39b8c0462ab",
          "alias": "单女白T恤窗边自信持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a white knitted camisole and light gray shorts, her figure slender and well-proportioned, legs long and straight. Barefoot on the warm reddish-brown wooden floor, her right leg stretched forward, left leg bent and gathered to form a graceful S-shaped curve. Sunlight streams in diagonally through the large window on the right, casting soft light spots through the red and white checkered curtains. The curtain material is light and flowing, adorned with ruffle trim. The interplay of light and shadow creates a dreamlike atmosphere. On the windowsill is a potted green plant with spreading leaves, looking vibrant under the light. The sofa cushion features floral patterns, fresh and elegant colors that harmonize with the overall environment. A white plush blanket is laid on top, topped with a pink cream cake, topped with fresh strawberries. The details are exquisite and enticing. The entire scene is warm and comfortable, full of life. The composition is slightly overlooked, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the left of the frame. The background blur highlights the main subject, with clear textures of carpets, cakes, and floors in the foreground. The middle features figures and sofas, while the background features windows, curtains, and plants. The layers are distinct and the direction of light and shadow is well-defined. The main light source comes from outside the right window, creating a strong contrast between light and dark. Highlights are bright and transparent, while shadows transition smoothly. The overall color palette is mainly white, light blue, and beige, accented with red plaid and green plants, creating a fresh and sweet visual experience. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if shot with a professional camera. Yet it retains the natural feel of daily life, with soft and layered lighting presenting a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The composition is balanced and stable, with the visual focus on the people while also considering the richness of environmental details. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, with a strong film-like texture and nostalgic mood, like a carefully composed private portrait, full of youthful energy and gentle charm",
