        {
          "id": "krea2-7945294fb17e525318860f49",
          "alias": "单女黑西装城市坐比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly in a half-squat position on a white plush carpet indoors. She wears a long black blazer layered with a white turtleneck shirt and a bow tie. She wears black stockings and shiny black pointed high heels. Her right hand is raised in a V-shape, fingers are long, and her nails are neatly trimmed. The overall look is fashionable, sharp, yet sweet. In the foreground, she closes up her lower body and feet, with delicate silk stockings and smooth leg lines. The high heels reflect clearly on the surface. The center features her full-body posture and details on her upper body. The jacket collar design is simple and neat, with a small label decoration on the left chest. In the background is a white metal shelf topped with several white ceramic flowerpots planted with green foliage plants, red geraniums, and yellow small flowers. The leaves vary in shape—some are broad and spreading, others slender and hanging. The pots are arranged in a staggered manner, creating a sense of layering. The background wall is light gray with fine textures, and the light is soft and even. Natural light or soft light from the upper front creates soft shadows that are not harsh. The overall color scheme is mainly black and white, accented with red-green colors, creating a fresh, elegant, and slightly urban atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with figures centered and background elements surrounding the surroundings to create a sense of envelopment. The composition is stable and full of tension, with natural transitions of light and shadow. Shadows form subtle shadows on the sides of the body and the ground, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall style combines everyday feel with artistry. It feels as if a high-quality portrait was shot with a professional camera paired with standard lenses, while preserving everyday scene details such as the soft folds of the carpet, the rustic texture of flowerpots, and the natural growth of plants, presenting a realistic and refined visual experience. The tones are warm and comfortable, the atmosphere relaxed and pleasant, combining the independence and confidence of modern women with a friendly and easygoing aura. It is suitable for fashion display, lifestyle sharing, or personal image documentation, without excessive embellishment. It preserves the original sense of authenticity and delicate texture",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
