        {
          "id": "krea2-4f25cb55b3db954aac38f2f7",
          "alias": "单女黑外套霓虹夜景神秘倚靠吸烟",
          "prompt": "She wears a black leather jacket and short skirt, platform boots, her posture low and relaxed, her body slightly leaning forward, holding a lit cigarette in her right hand. The smoke rises in curls, creating a lazy and mysterious atmosphere. Her expression is calm and slightly detached, presenting a soft golden sheen. The overall composition uses a low-angle upward shot to highlight the figure's outline and presence. The foreground is a rough cement floor scattered with fine fragments and cigarette butts, casting dark silhouettes on the ground. The background is a mottled red brick wall with clear texture. Some areas show graffiti marks and faded colors. A dim yellow streetlamp on the wall shines from above, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The halo diffuses into the air, producing obvious camera flares and graininess. In the distant alleys, blurry headlights and faint light sources can be seen, hinting at the continuation of city nightlife. The image tones tend to be cold, mainly dark green, dark gray, and warm yellow, forming localized highlights, while the rest is shadowed to enhance the drama. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling. It seems to capture a fleeting moment of reality for people on the urban fringees. The image texture resembles film photography, with slight noise and retro filter effects, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting. The details are rich and layered, with visual guidance from the light source above to the main subject, extending to the ground and background. The composition is balanced and full of tension, emphasizing themes of loneliness and independence. The overall style blends street realism with cinematic feel, presenting an aesthetic experience that is both everyday and surreal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
