        {
          "id": "krea2-bb47e7d0738639578304142d",
          "alias": "单女制服户外忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese high school girls' uniform stands outdoors at dusk. She wears a white short-sleeved shirt and a dark pleated skirt, with a red bow tied around her neckline. Her expression is slightly melancholic and contemplative, standing slightly to the side, her right hand gently holding her left wrist in front of her, her posture elegant and natural. The main figure is a full-body portrait occupying the center right, with clear outlines and details in the foreground, a blurred barbed wire fence behind her, and a vast, colorful sky in the background. The clouds are dyed by the sunset in a gradient of interwoven pinkish-purple and pale orange, rich in layers and soft light and shadow. The sky gradually transitions from warm tones near the horizon to cool blue above, creating a tranquil and dreamlike atmosphere. The composition uses a third-division method: the figure is positioned on the right third of the canvas, with the gaze facing left, creating visual guidance. The blank areas enhance the breath and storytelling of the image. Light comes from the slanting rear, combining backlight and side light during the golden moment, creating a soft halo at the edges of the figure's contours and highlighting the sense of depth. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm yet slightly melancholic, as if frozen in a moment of youthful memories. The image texture is delicate, with moderate color saturation, presenting a retro filter effect reminiscent of film photography, giving it the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The lens uses an 85mm portrait focal length, with a small aperture to blur the background and emphasize the subject, while preserving the detailed texture of the sky. The camera settings simulate the Canon EOS R5 paired with an RF 85mm f/1.2L lens, ISO 100, shutter speed 1/200 sec, The white balance leans toward warm tones, presenting images with high resolution, high dynamic range, and rich detail. The style blends Japanese photo, campus youth themes, and beautiful fantasy elements, with a slight oil painting texture and digital rendering traces, yet still realistic. The clothes wrinkle naturally, red bow ties and headbands seem to flutter in the breeze, and the background clouds in the sky are varied in shape, with distinct layers and smooth color transitions. The whole scene is full of poetry and emotional tension, like a silent poem of youth, evoking the afterglow after school, Unspoken words and quietly passing time create a tranquil and profound atmosphere, immersing one in that fleeting tenderness and melancholy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
