        {
          "id": "krea2-738c8b161176a1159418b362",
          "alias": "单女T恤户外自信站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a lush green environment, faintly glowing and looking fresh and natural. She wears a plaid camisole in light green, light blue, and beige. The fabric is thin and breathable, hugging the figure and showcasing graceful shoulder and collarbone lines. She pairs with washed blue denim shorts, which are slim-fitted. The waistband is simple, with a clearly visible back pocket and slightly rough edges at the hem, adding a casual feel. Her left hand rests gently on her waist, fingers long. Her right hand is naturally tucked into her pants pocket, and she wears a simple white smart wristband on her wrist. The details are authentic and believable. Her posture is relaxed and confident, her body slightly turned to the side, and her head looks back at the camera, creating an atmosphere that is both casual and interactive. The foreground is the main subject, occupying the center of the frame slightly to the right. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, presenting the figure from thigh to head in full detail. The background is a blurred green plant with lush branches and leaves, rich in layers, presenting varying shades of green. The blurring makes the subject stand out even more, creating a strong depth of field effect. Light and shadow come from natural light, softly and evenly casting on the figure. The shadows transition naturally, without harsh highlights or dark areas. Light shines from an upward angle, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color tone is fresh and natural, dominated by green, accented by colorful stripes on the clothing. The colors harmoniously unify and extend to the overall posture. The composition is balanced and dynamic, creating a peaceful, comfortable, and summery atmosphere, as if capturing a pleasant moment under the afternoon sun. Like shooting real outdoor scenes with a high-end portable camera, it exudes a strong sense of everyday quality and artistic beauty, while retaining the casualness and realism of everyday shooting. The details are rich, layered clearly, light and shadow are delicate, and color reproduction is highly accurate, presenting a warm and approachable visual experience",
