        {
          "id": "krea2-c8e3e7bc05fb47dcd567b662",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫沙发沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a modern-style brown leather single sofa, wearing a white sleeveless turtleneck shirt with black decorative details at the collar and shoulder straps. She pairs a black high-waisted mini skirt below, legs naturally crossed, posture elegant and relaxed. Her makeup is refined, and her expression is calm with a hint of mystery. Her left hand rests gently on the sofa armrest, while her right hand hangs naturally beside her thigh. On the floor at her feet rests a pair of black pointed high heels, their smooth, reflective surfaces giving off a high-end feel. The entire scene is set in a simple and bright indoor space, with pure white walls as the background. The walls are clean and tidy, featuring a minimalist design style. The floor is paved with polished gray tiles, reflecting a soft sheen and creating a clear reflection. The sofa is equipped with thick light gray cushions and cushions, made of soft and comfortable materials with smooth lines. The overall composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure occupying the left central position, body slightly turned and head facing the camera, creating a visual focal point. In the foreground are the woman's legs, feet, and high heels. The middle ground features the woman's body and sofa, while the background features a simple wall and partially visible door frame outlines. The composition is balanced and layered, extending along the body's curves to the legs and feet, finally landing on the reflection on the floor, forming a complete visual loop. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by natural light, with soft light streaming in from the left side. The shadows are soft but not harsh, creating a warm and realistic indoor environment. The overall color palette is dominated by black, white, and gray, with harmonious and unified color combinations, exuding a strong sense of modern fashion and artistic flair The image texture is delicate and richly detailed, as if shot by a professional camera, while preserving the casualness and realism of daily life. It presents an atmosphere that combines professional charm with intimate beauty. The composition is stable, proportions are harmonious, the postures of the characters are natural, the background is simple and not cluttered, highlighting the subject while maintaining the realism of the environment. The lighting and shadow treatment is exquisite, emphasizing the texture of materials and the depth of space, presenting an overall calm, elegant, and story-rich visual experience",
