          "id": "krea2-a7cb0a630817fa7b5ebda7cb",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫城市忧伤坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a light gray fabric bed, leaning slightly back, legs naturally extended, right leg folded over left, toes lightly touching the ground, posture elegant and relaxed. She wears a light blue long-sleeved shirt with a cross-strap neckline, the hem naturally draping down to her waist, paired with a beige high-waisted short skirt. The overall outfit is simple, sharp, yet soft, adding a touch of laziness. She wears a pair of slender silver earrings and a simple metal bracelet on her left wrist. Her fingers are long and her nails neatly trimmed. The right hand rests gently on the knee, palm facing down, fingertips naturally extended, with a slightly contemplative and detached expression. The background is a plain, light gray wall with an off-white woven ornament hanging from it, woven from multiple thin strings forming geometric patterns, adding a touch of handmade texture and warm atmosphere. The bed edge is a natural wood frame, with clear and visible grain, a slightly rough surface with natural wood grain and color variations, and the entire scene is soft and evenly lit. Natural light from the left side of the painting filters through curtains or windows into the interior, creating a subtle transition between light and shadow. The shadows are soft without strong contrasts, and the direction of light and shadow is consistent, creating a quiet, comfortable, and slightly intimate indoor atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, legs extending from the lower left to the upper right, forming a diagonal visual guideline. The woven hanging decorations and wooden bed frame in the background serve as decorative elements, balancing the composition and enriching the spatial layers. The foreground is the bedding made of gray fabric with delicate texture and slight wrinkles and creases. The middle ground shows the main subject, with clear details. The background is relatively blurred to highlight the subject. The overall color palette is mainly gray, blue, and off-white, harmoniously unified with a moderate contrast of warm and cool tones, creating a modern minimalist home environment. The image texture is authentic and natural, as if shot with a regular camera, with slight graininess and low saturation processing, simulating the realism of casual snapshots in daily life. The image does not pursue extreme sharpness. It retains a certain haze and gentleness, enhances emotional expression, and the overall atmosphere is quiet and restrained, full of everyday life. It is suitable for showcasing the daily life of urban women, conveying a calm, independent, and slightly melancholic mood",
