        {
          "id": "krea2-d8057dadf2f9b93de92ce991",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道忧伤行走注视",
          "prompt": "A short black tweed jacket paired with a white Peter Pan collar and ruffled skirt. The coat is finely accented with sequins, creating a subtle shimmering texture under dim natural light. She wears pure white stockings and black-and-white pointed high heels, holding a large white umbrella with gray edges and a Chanel brand umbrella in her right hand. The umbrella is clearly printed with the brand logo and double C logo, the handle is black, and she carries a black spherical chain bag in her left hand. The overall look is elegant and stylish, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. The body is slightly turned to the side, with the head raised and looking diagonally upward, creating a dynamic beauty. The beige stone walls and classical column structures form the background. The building facades feature dark window frames and decorative lines, while the street floor is made of gray cement. In the distance, blurred pedestrian silhouettes are seen walking, creating a sense of spatial depth. The composition uses a low-angle downward view to highlight the figure's slender figure and presence, while perspective lines guide the gaze deeper into the distance. Then, the geometric shape of the umbrella and the lines of the building converge downward, creating a strong visual focal point. The lighting and shadow atmosphere are soft and even, presenting diffused light effects on cloudy or misty days. Light shines from above and in front, making the figures' outlines clear and shadows soft, without strong contrast. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray, complemented by beige and light brown architectural tones, creating a sophisticated, refined, and slightly melancholic urban fashion vibe. The images have a professional studio-level texture while still retaining the authentic feel of street life. It feels as if shot by a high-end camera, with rich details, clear layers, and a sense of artistic flair and a sense of everyday realism",
