          "id": "krea2-a40d2bbd108a70c200fe4ce2",
          "alias": "单女微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "Her right hand rests lightly on the white railing, her left hand naturally lowered, her body slightly turned to the camera, wearing a gentle smile, looking straight ahead, slightly scattered messily over her shoulders and chest. Her overall posture is natural and relaxed, as if immersed in a musical world. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the center right of the frame, and the composition uses a three-part method. The figure is positioned in the right one-third, with space left on the left to create visual balance. The background features a blurred blue water surface and distant sky, presenting a soft gradient tone that creates a tranquil and open atmosphere. The middle ground features white metal railings with clean and smooth lines, creating contrast with the figure and enhancing the sense of layering in the image. The background blur treatment makes the subject stand out, with soft and even light and shadows. Light comes from the upper left, simulating natural light effects, with delicate shadows and natural clothing folds. The overall color palette is mainly cool tones. Blue and white dominate, creating a fresh, pure, and tranquil atmosphere. The image has a film-like texture, with slight graininess and low color saturation, imitating the style of everyday amateur cameras. Using Canon 5D Mark IV or Sony A7R series cameras, 85mm prime lens, f/1.8 aperture, ISO 200, shutter speed 1/125 sec, handheld shooting with slight motion blur, capturing momentary movement, wind blowing from the left adds movement, and the water surface in the background shimmers. The light blue reflected in the sky echoes the colors of the characters' clothing, creating a harmonious and unified visual effect. The overall image conveys themes of youth, campus, music, freedom, and dreams. It has a strong Japanese-style photo style, rich in detail, clear layering, harmonious colors, exquisite composition, natural light and shadow, full of storytelling and emotional tension. It is suitable as a mobile wallpaper or shared on social media, possessing high artistic appeal and viewing value",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
