        {
          "id": "krea2-70f147e886e505940e87a4c7",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙竹林坐出神",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways on an outdoor wooden bench, wearing a light beige wide-sleeved top paired with a blue-and-white floral long dress, a dark blue cloth belt tied around her waist, with white lace trim on the collar and cuffs. She wears a white floral headscarf with a blue background, a small white flower pinned in her bun. Her wrist is wrapped with the same blue and white cloth strip, with a blurred lake and distant mountains in the background. Nearby are tall green reeds and yellow irises, with blurred grass and bamboo poles in the foreground. The composition uses medium shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the frame, gazing toward the upper right. The light comes from the right, and the soft, warm backlight outlines the figure's outline, creating a hazy halo effect. The overall color palette is mainly soft blue, white, and beige, accented with green and gold, creating a tranquil and serene pastoral poetic atmosphere. The lens uses an 85mm prime portrait lens, with a shallow depth of field that highlights the subject and moderate color saturation. The details are clear and natural, presenting a realistic feeling of everyday photography with a portable camera or mobile phone, as if capturing a moment of early morning or dusk when a woman sits alone in the countryside, lost in thought. The image is full of the spirit of life and artistic sentiment, with natural transitions of light and shadow, rich layers, combining classical charm with modern freshness. The composition is simple yet full of tension, then lifts up to the sky, creating a tranquil atmosphere that transcends the mundane world",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
