        {
          "id": "krea2-9d0b9fab3ca87317274072d6",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫公园自信站立叉腰",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a stone-paved path in an outdoor park, wearing a loose white short-sleeved shirt printed with brightly colored cartoon patterns, including a puppy wearing a hat, a red apple, a blue star, a yellow sun, and a hand-drawn colorful tie pattern. The tie lines are bold and casual, presenting a graffiti-like artistic feel. The collar and cuffs feature light blue plaid patterns, contrasting and harmonizing with the overall pattern. She stands with her hands on her hips, leaning slightly forward, her posture relaxed and confident. She exudes youthful energy. She wears washed denim shorts on the lower half, with slightly worn hems adding a touch of casual charm. The background is a lush green park, with tall trees lush and foliage, trunks straight and upright, and dappled shadows casting dappled shadows on the ground and figures. Warm golden sunlight filters through the leaves, creating a tranquil and pleasant summer afternoon. In the distance, neatly trimmed green bushes and a red bench or fence can be faintly seen, adding a splash of color to the scene. The floor is paved with gray bricks, neatly arranged, with a bit of moss mixed in the gaps, showing traces of time and a natural atmosphere. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The camera slightly looks down, capturing her full figure from waist to above. The overall light and shadow effect is soft and layered, with light coming from diagonally above. It simulates natural afternoon light, with sunlight filtering through the gaps in the leaves forming dotted light spots, creating delicate transitions between light and dark. The shadowed areas blend naturally into the environment without excessive contrast. The color tones are mainly warm yellow and green, accented by bright colors like blue, red, and yellow on shirts. The color combinations are harmonious and full of childlike fun. The overall image presents a realistic and cozy atmosphere of everyday life, as if taken naturally with a regular phone or portable camera, preserving slight noise and imperfect details. It enhances realism and intimacy, extending to the background greenery and light shadows, creating a smooth viewing path. The entire image exudes youth, innocence, freedom, and the beauty of life, like a film photo capturing everyday moments, full of warmth and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
