        {
          "id": "krea2-f1627e491ce7bde3a0ab6948",
          "alias": "单女粉礼服摄影棚忧伤倚靠过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a light pink strapless gown, elegantly leaning against a beige wall. Her makeup was exquisite, her right hand gently touching the sheer sleeve over her shoulder, her left hand naturally folded over her chest, fingers long, wearing a simple ring. The dress was adorned with intricate pearl strings and lace patterns. The skirt was fluffy and light, made of multiple layers of tulle, presenting a dreamlike sense of layering. She wore shiny silver tassel earrings that sparkled softly under the soft light. On the left side of the painting was a golden carved frame, decorated with intricate patterns. The background features a wall with embossed lines, with the overall color scheme dominated by warm beige and pink-orange, creating a retro and romantic atmosphere. Light streams in from the right side, forming a bright beam that highlights the smooth texture of the skin, while casting soft shadows on the wall and frame. The overall scene presents a serene, noble, and slightly melancholic beauty. It feels as if capturing a moment of afternoon sunlight, like a high-quality portrait piece created in a professional studio using softboxes and reflectors, while preserving the realism of natural light and shadow. The camera uses a large-aperture prime lens for precise depth control, soft background blur, and a well-balanced color saturation. The effect is rich, textures are clear, and the overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, like a modern portrait from a classical oil painting, evoking a beautiful moment where time freezes",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
