        {
          "id": "krea2-a6e4c833787fba16e10fe30a",
          "alias": "单女棕外套浴室害羞坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a marble countertop in a luxurious bathroom, wearing a luxurious brown and gold gradient fox fur coat. Her fur is fluffy and soft, with distinct layers, presenting a natural sheen and texture. Her hands are gently folded over her chest, her posture elegant yet slightly shy, adding a touch of softness. She wears black stiletto heels with metal buckles at the ankles, paired with black stockings. Her legs are long and smooth, with legs crossed and stacked, looking calm and confident. Next to her is a black matte leather handbag, simple and classic in shape. With metal lock details, the background is a modern-style upscale bathroom. The walls and floor are paved with light-colored marble tiles with delicate and natural texture. The mirror reflects her silhouette, forming a symmetrical composition that enhances the sense of spatial depth. The wall is fitted with cylindrical frosted glass wall lamps, emitting warm and soft yellow-white light. Ceiling-embedded downlights provide even illumination, creating a warm and luxurious atmosphere. The composition centers on the figure, using a medium perspective to highlight the interaction between the figures and their environment. The foreground features a smooth dark gray marble countertop with natural striped texture, giving it a heavy texture. The middle ground features the main figure and a handbag, while the background features mirror-reflective images and lighting installations. The light mainly comes from wall lamps and the ceiling light source, creating a soft transition between light and dark. Shadows are concentrated below the figure and the edges of the countertop, adding a sense of depth. The overall color palette is mainly warm brown, off-white, and black, harmoniously unified to create a private, refined, fashionable, and slightly sexy atmosphere. It seems to capture a moment after a high-end social event, carrying a strong sense of artistry and a sense of life—like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, yet retaining the subtle realism of everyday life. The camera focuses on the details of the people and environment, emphasizing the expression of materials, light and shadow, and emotion, presenting an aesthetic that blends luxury and privacy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
