        {
          "id": "krea2-8f0040b78dc2634f230090d8",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a classical carved armchair, wearing an off-white satin strapless waist gown with a puffy skirt trimmed with delicate lace trim, paired with matching mesh gloves and a pearl necklace. She wears a lightweight lace veil, her makeup exquisite, her expression slightly lazy and mysterious, her posture elegant yet slightly provocative, legs crossed, one foot in white high heels and the other bare, creating a visual contrast. The main focus of the painting is prominent, with the composition centered slightly to the left, occupying most of the space and creating a strong visual focal point, foreground shows the figures and clothing details, including metal buckles on the waistband, lace edge textures, the glove mesh structure, and the contours of the feet. In the middle is a magnificent classical armchair with a high backrest and intricate gold carved decorations. The seat surface is covered with dark patterned fabric, giving a substantial texture. The chair's backrest and armrest form a curved frame, surrounding the figure. The background is the indoor environment, with white lace curtains on the left side softly illuminating the window frame, while the right side shows the outline of dark wooden furniture, with the wall in light gray-blue. The overall color tone leans toward warmth, with light and shadow coming from the rear window to create a soft backlighting effect. The halo creates a hazy glow on the veil, with delicate shadows. The overall atmosphere blends vintage, romance, and a touch of eerriety, resembling the image of a bride from an old-era film, with strong drama and artistic tension. The image was shot with an 85mm portrait lens, offering clear focal length, well-controlled depth, slightly blurred background, highlighting the main subject, and the composition is symmetrical without stiffness. The overall style combines realism and fantasy. It presents an image texture that is both everyday and surreal, similar to a professional photographer shooting with medium format cameras in indoor lighting. It also carries the graininess and color saturation of amateur film photography, with warm and slightly faded tones that simulate the vintage atmosphere of old photographs. The images are rich in detail, with natural transitions of light and shadow and distinct layers, presenting an overall aesthetic of tranquility, elegance, and a touch of melancholy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
