        {
          "id": "krea2-bbf4d67a14e10d99df6e5e4b",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫摄影棚媚态蹲侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman squats in a low posture in front of a solid-colored background, wearing a black turtleneck sleeveless tight dress. The fabric is smooth and slightly reflective, accentuating her body lines. Paired with black stockings and pointed high heels, the overall look is simple yet powerful. She leans slightly to the side, tilts her head slightly, wears delicate makeup, wears silver hoop earrings, rings on her fingers, nails painted dark nail polish, hands naturally resting on the floor, fingertips slightly spread, presenting a pose that is both elegant and provocative. The composition adopts a black-and-white photography style, with rich tonal layers. The transition naturally from light gray to deep black, with strong contrast between light and shadow. The light source comes from above and below, creating soft shadows that emphasize three-dimensionality. The background is a uniformly gradient gray tone, gradually deepening from top to bottom, creating a clean and focused visual space. The composition is centered slightly to the left, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame. Legs crossed, knees bent, feet and hands form a diagonal extension to enhance dynamic balance. The foreground highlights the subject, and the middle ground shows details of the lower body's contact with the ground. The background is clean and free of distractions, enhancing the material expression. The atmosphere is calm and mysterious, full of fashion and artistic tension. Overall, it presents a high-end studio shooting effect, as if a professional camera was used under well-controlled lighting. The image has a cinematic texture, clear details, moderate graininess, and a slight film texture. The composition is rigorous and proportions are harmonious, presenting a strong visual impact and emotional expression, conveying independence, confidence, and cool elegance. It is suitable for fashion magazine covers or art photography displays. The visual language is concise and powerful, full of modern aesthetic meaning",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
