        {
          "id": "krea2-aeb1647dd52aaef34e0c067c",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙镜前温柔坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a vintage-style attic room, wearing a black sleeveless tight dress. She is gazing down at the vinyl record in her hand, her fingers lightly touching the surface as if sensing the warmth of the music. Her right leg is slightly bent, her left leg straight, and she wears burgundy Mary Jane high heels with metal clasps on the upper and a slender ankle bracelet visible at the ankle. Her left hand rests gently on her knee, her nails painted dark polish, wearing a simple ring, her posture elegant and relaxed. The main subject is the woman with the vinyl record in her hand. In the foreground lie several vinyl records and several record covers. One cover faintly displays the word \"REY,\" another has a blurred portrait printed on it, and on the floor is a vinyl record with a clearly visible orange label. Next to it are several stacked books or magazines with slightly worn edges. In the background is a rattan dressing table with a light yellow surface, a wooden frame featuring vintage carved details, and a round-framed mirror placed on the countertop. The mirror frame is brass, reflecting a corner of the room and part of the woman's silhouette. Next to the mirror is a small candlestick with a white candle inserted. The candlelight is faint but warm, emitting a soft glow. Below the dressing table is a drawer with metal handles. On the right side is a set of white cabinets, above which sits a decorative photo frame. Inside the frame appear to be old photos or paintings, with a darker color and a nostalgic feel. The room's walls are gray-green, and the ceiling slopes, forming the attic's unique sloped ceiling structure. On the left wall, a white radiator is installed. Next to the radiator hangs a decorative wall hanging with green plant patterns. The floor is light gray wood with clear wood grain, and the overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow. Light streams in from the right window or source, creating a soft side glow, casting long shadows on the floor and furniture. The rich layers of light and shadow create a quiet and cozy atmosphere. The composition is shot at a low angle, with the person positioned on the right side of the frame, occupying the main visual space. Records and books in the foreground guide the gaze toward the center, while the dressing table and mirror in the middle create a stable structure of the image. The cabinets and wall decorations in the background add depth to the space, and the visual guide gradually extends from the records in the foreground to the movements of the woman's hands. Finally, the reflections and background details in the mirror form a circular visual path. The entire scene presents a retro, artistic, nostalgic, and slightly intimate atmosphere, like a quiet moment in an old movie, full of strong artistic atmosphere and the texture of life. It feels as if you were shot with an old film camera at dusk, with noticeable graininess, moderate color saturation, soft contrast, and slightly defocused edges, enhancing realism and the sense of time accumulation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
