        {
          "id": "krea2-b1c0c20b24bebd632e58ea21",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装霓虹夜景神秘坐吸烟",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the dark night, wearing a loose light blue plaid blazer. The fabric features delicate textures and soft pleats, with three neatly arranged black buttons at the cuffs. The hem of the coat hangs naturally, revealing her long legs and part of her knees. She sits on the floor in a half-squat position, leaning slightly forward, wearing several simple metal rings on her fingers and holding a lit cigarette. The smoke flickers faintly in the darkness, the lenses reflect faint light, and the overall makeup is clean and sharp. The background is completely swallowed by heavy black, with no details to discern. Only one or two blurry points of light can be faintly seen in the upper left, like the reflections of distant streetlights or neon lights, creating a deep and mysterious sense of space. The composition adopts a center-to-right visual layout, with the main figure occupying the main position, heads slightly tilted, and the direction of the gaze forming a subtle angle with the camera. The overall tone of the painting is mainly cool blue and deep black, with strong contrast between light and shadow, and the light source coming from the front left. At the same time, large shadows are created on the right side of the body and in the background, forming strong contrasts of light and shadow, enhancing three-dimensionality and drama. The image has a distinct film-like texture, obvious graininess, low color saturation, and slightly blurred edges, as if taken with an old-fashioned camera. The overall atmosphere is calm, detached, and filled with the loneliness of a city night, like a private image recording youthful rebellion and self-expression, capturing a moment of solitary existence beyond the noise, without unnecessary decoration. All elements serve to convey the characters' emotions and build the atmosphere, presenting a visual language that is both authentic and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
