        {
          "id": "krea2-c4bb3f7e3d9edaf14b7cd3b9",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣沙发冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a classic-style carved armchair, wearing a light gray V-neck knit dress with a slit that reveals her long, fair legs. Her shoulders and arms drape with a fluffy, soft white fur coat. The plush texture is delicate and luxurious, forming a strong contrast with the cool-toned clothing. Her makeup is exquisite, her posture elegant and relaxed, one hand resting lightly on her thigh, the other naturally hanging down, presenting an overall relaxed yet noble temperament. In the foreground is a close-up of her lower body and feet, barefoot on the dark wooden floor. Light and shadow create a soft transition of light and shadow on the legs. The middle scene fully presents her sitting posture. The armchair is made of dark solid wood with vintage metal rivet decorations. The chair's back is high and the lines smooth. On the left side of the background is a dark brown carved wooden cabinet with a glossy surface. On the cabinet sits a table lamp with an off-white pleated lampshade, the lamp base made of dark ceramic or glass, and beside it, a shiny golden velvet fabric casually layered. The wall is covered with vintage wallpaper featuring purple rose patterns, and two round picture frames hang on the wall. One of them is a classical portrait, while the other is partially obscured by plants. On the right is a large green plant with broad leaves in deep green and clearly visible veins. Light casts a warm and soft side light from the front left of the frame, casting deep shadows on the walls and furniture, creating strong contrasts of light and shadow and a sense of depth. The entire scene is shot from a low angle, with the figure as the center, using diagonal and curved lines to guide the view. The furniture and plants in the background form a distinctly layered spatial structure. The lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward a retro nostalgic cinematic feel, with warm tones that retain cool clothing details. Overall, it presents a private, tranquil, and artistic indoor photo shoot atmosphere, as if capturing an elegant moment forgotten by time. It resembles images taken with an old film camera under dim yellow lighting, with slight vignette at the edges to enhance visual focus. The color saturation is moderate, highlighting the subject's texture and emotional expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
