        {
          "id": "krea2-068e5c4144b36392c5882cbb",
          "alias": "单女黑外套摄影棚困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a long black coat stands on the streets of Paris, wearing black lace lingerie underneath, sheer black stockings, and high heels. Her posture is elegant and full of tension, her body slightly leaning to the side, her left leg stepping forward, right leg bent, her left hand gently resting on a black metal road post beside her, right hand naturally hanging down, fingers slightly bent, head slightly tilted back, expression dreamy yet sexy. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying the center slightly left. The lines have a strong sense of extension, creating a strong sense of depth and dynamic beauty. The lighting is soft and even, diffused from cloudy days, with delicate shadows. The colors are mainly black, white, and gray, accented with beige and blue. It creates a sophisticated and fashionable atmosphere, with delicate image texture combining professional studio and street photography styles, while retaining the realism of everyday shooting. The lens uses a medium focal length to simulate camera effects, with a moderate depth of field and a slightly blurred background that highlights the subject. Overall, it presents a cold yet captivating urban fashion vibe, as if capturing a fleeting moment of elegance and allure. The image details are rich and the texture clear, including the sheen of stockings, the wrinkles of coats, mottled marks on building walls, and the reflection of metal road posts. These elements together create a layered and story-rich scene, conveying an image of a modern woman who is independent, confident, and full of charm. The entire scene is both artistic and full of everyday life, like a real-life fashion shoot with a touch of casual street style. The light and shadow transitions are natural, the tones are steady and restrained, highlighting the silhouettes of the figures and the texture of the clothing. The composition cleverly uses architectural lines and character postures to create contrast, enhancing the visual impact. The text in the background not only provides location information but also adds authenticity and narrative value to the scene. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of tension, prompting imagination about what the woman has just experienced or where she is about to go. This is a photographic work that blends fashion, art, and everyday aesthetics, showcasing the unique charm of city streets and the perfect blend of female strength",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
