        {
          "id": "krea2-8db8c5a6054855b8aaffe4a6",
          "alias": "单女红礼服室内严肃站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a deep red velvet strapless gown, elegantly turning sideways to gaze at the camera. Her makeup was exquisite, and on her right shoulder draped a fluffy, soft white fur scarf with delicate texture and naturally curled edges, forming a strong contrast with the deep red gown. Her left hand gently held a string of red decorative branches adorned with warm yellow bulbs, with Chinese knots and red floral ornaments hanging from the branch, shimmering with a soft, warm glow. Her right hand held a small pink fan gently unfolded, her posture dignified and full of charm. She stands in an indoor scene full of festive atmosphere, with the foreground adorned with elaborate and ornate red floral decorations, including clusters of red roses and clusters of red berries. The background is a heavy, dark red velvet curtain, soft and naturally pleated. In the background, beige lace curtains with golden patterns can be faintly seen, emitting hazy light. The entire composition uses a diagonal third-division method, with the figure positioned slightly above the right of the frame, and the gaze directed to the lighting decorations on the left and floral details below, creating a strong sense of visual layering. The light and shadow come from the warm lighting on the left front, creating a delicate highlight transition, while the red velvet produces subtle glossy reflections. The lighting accents in the background make the overall atmosphere warmer and more romantic. The color scheme is rich red, complemented by white fur and gold decorative details, creating a luxurious and elegant yet festive festive atmosphere. The image has a cinematic texture, as if shot with a professional camera in low-light conditions, using a large-aperture lens to capture depth of field, presenting natural out-of-focus blur and delicate texture details. The tones are warm, with moderate saturation, preserving rich layers of light and shadow. The overall style blends traditional Eastern festival elements with modern fashion aesthetics, conveying a sense of nobility, romance, and a touch of nostalgia. It's as if a photographer is capturing precious moments on New Year's or wedding night for a noble lady in a private space. There are no unnecessary distractions in the frame; all objects revolve around the main subject, forming a harmonious and unified visual focal point. The composition is full but not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space. It gives a sense of tranquility and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
