        {
          "id": "krea2-bd4e551b9a6b68e96a003129",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫椅上温柔坐戏水",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench at an outdoor station, wearing a white long-sleeved shirt and a dark blue pleated skirt in a school uniform. She carries a dark blue canvas backpack over her shoulder, with gray straps draped across her chest and headphones hanging around her neck. She slightly turns to look back at the camera, full of youthful energy. The main focus is a close-up of a person: in the foreground are the rough textures of the wooden bench and part of the backpack edge. In the middle is the platform floor, billboards, and distant blurry silhouettes. The background shows the structure of the station's waiting shelter, with metal columns and ceilings forming geometric lines. The billboard features Japanese text and colorful patterns, with several pedestrians in the distance—some looking down at their phones, others standing and talking. The composition uses a low-angle shot, with the person occupying the right side of the frame to form a visual focal point. The shallow depth of field highlights the subject, the background is blurred, creating a sense of spatial layering. Light comes from the left front, gently bathing the figures, creating a warm golden halo and delicate shadow transitions. The overall tone leans warm, with the grainy texture and slight overexposure characteristic of film photography, and the color saturation is moderate. It presents a retro and nostalgic atmosphere, with interlacing light and shadow revealing the tranquility and beauty of everyday life, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment. The visuals have a strong sense of realism and emotional warmth, like real scenes captured with an old-fashioned film camera. The details are rich and natural, the composition balanced and storytelling, and the characters' postures are relaxed and natural, without any deliberate posing, revealing an unintentional innocence and beauty. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of life, like a precious youthful commemorative photo. It lets people feel the tenderness and nostalgia of the passage of time",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
