        {
          "id": "krea2-89542277fb721bb37731a253",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣沙发俏皮坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a gray fabric sofa, slightly tilting her head toward the camera, her expression playful and innocent, presenting a naturally cute pose, like the marks left after just finishing dessert, adding a touch of everyday playfulness. She wears a light blue thin-striped knit camisole with slender straps that fit her figure, showcasing graceful shoulder and neck lines and collarbone contours. She pairs a pure white high-waisted pleated skirt with a puffy, soft hem, and a light, flowing material that drapes gently. Her right hand is raised, The fingers are coated with white cream, the tips of the index and middle fingers are clearly visible, and the other hand is naturally placed at the side. The overall posture is relaxed and expressive. The background is a simple light gray wall with no unnecessary decoration, creating a clean and pure sense of space. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the image, fully presented from above the chest to below the knees, forming a visual focal point. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, with a slight tilt of the head, and the gaze meets the camera, creating a direct emotional exchange. The middle shots showcase the body's contours and the texture of the clothing, while the background is minimalist to highlight the subject. Light and shadow come from soft light sources on the front, without strong shadows, creating a warm and bright atmosphere that highlights skin texture. At the same time, subtle light and dark changes appear in the folds of the clothing, enhancing the sense of dimension. The overall color scheme is mainly light blue, white, and gray, with fresh and elegant colors full of youthful energy. The images have a sense of intimacy and realism in everyday life, as if captured casually with a regular phone or camera. With a slight film texture and natural noise, it presents a simple yet authentic aesthetic. The image details are rich, with creamy graininess and reflections handled very delicately. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, allowing people to feel relaxed and joyful moments of daily life. The composition is balanced and layered, extending to the full-body shape, creating a smooth viewing path, presenting an overall visual style that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
