        {
          "id": "krea2-59312b76334b0c19e87b10c2",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣商店微笑站立躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a supermarket shelf, naturally draped over her shoulders, looking pure and gentle, with a subtle smile that radiates a healthy glow. She wears a gray knit cardigan, loose and comfortable, with a round-neck neckline and a small black embroidery pattern on the chest, adding a touch of refinement. She wears a blue and white plaid shirt underneath, with cuffs peeking out from the cardigan for a distinct layered effect. She wears light blue jeans, which are fitted but not tight, showcasing youthful energy. On her right shoulder was a blue canvas bag printed with cartoon animal patterns, bright and lively in color. The strap was thick, thick, and sturdy. Below the bag hung a small charm with rich details. Her right hand gently reached for the products on the shelf, her fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, and her movements natural and relaxed, as if she were picking out her favorite items. On the shelves were neatly arranged white small pieces of food packaged in multiple layers of transparent plastic bags, with black text printed on the bags, clearly visible. These products were placed on wooden shelves. The shelf structure is simple and practical, with more shelves and product displays visible in the background. In the distance, the silhouettes of other customers are blurred. The entire scene is set in a spacious and bright indoor space, with multiple rows of industrial-style lighting fixtures installed on the ceiling. The lighting is bright and even, illuminating the entire shopping area. Exposed pipes and metal structures can also be seen above the ceiling, adding a modern and realistic feel to the space. The composition centers on the figures, using close-ups to capture their half-body forms. The figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, standing slightly to the side, with her head slightly turned toward the camera. Her gaze communicates directly with the audience, creating a warm and natural atmosphere. The foreground features the figure and some shelves, the middle ground shows extended shelves and product displays, and the background shows farther shelves and spatial structures. The layers are distinct, guiding the viewer's gaze to follow her movements as she explores the products. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from the ceiling, which is soft and even, without strong shadows, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is warm and everyday, full of everyday life. It resembles a real photo taken with a regular camera or phone, with a documentary and intimate feel. The tones are mainly gray, blue, and white, paired with the warm yellow tones of wooden shelves, creating a contrast of cool and warm tones. The image is both fresh and warm, rich in details and authentic in texture, presenting a beautiful moment in ordinary life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
