        {
          "id": "krea2-6153706f18176ffdf2ccaef6",
          "alias": "单女透视白毛衣书店忧伤站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the aisle of bookstore shelves, wearing a white knit cardigan and a deep blue high-waisted pleated skirt, paired with black pointed high heels paired with sheer stockings. Her overall look is elegant and modern. She lowers her head to gaze at the book in her hand, her expression focused and calm. Her right hand gently holds a book with a light-colored cover, her body slightly leaning against the metal bookshelf on the right side. Her left leg is slightly bent, her right leg upright, her posture natural and smooth, exuding an effortless beauty. Her makeup is exquisite. It reveals a hint of restrained melancholy and contemplation. In the foreground is her clear silhouette and clothing details, from the texture of the knit sweater to the pleats of the skirt. In the middle are bookshelves arranged neatly on both sides, while the left shelf holds various books, both paperback and hardcover. Some book covers are brightly colored in red, yellow, blue, etc. Below the shelves is a woven straw cushion, adding a touch of simplicity and warmth. The bookshelf on the right is also densely packed with books, with some spines facing outward, creating rich visual layering. The composition uses vertical shots, with figures positioned slightly to the left of the frame. The vertical lines formed by the shelves guide the gaze, creating a sense of depth and space. Light streams in from the upper left of the frame, creating a soft side glow, casting soft shadows on the shelves and floor. The contrast is strong but not abrupt. The background is the bookstore's wooden ceiling and walls, with warm tones and a slight grainy texture. It feels like a real scene shot with an amateur camera, with an overall quiet, artistic, and slightly intimate atmosphere, like a moment accidentally captured in a library corner on an afternoon. The image presents a poetic sense of everyday life, combining realism with artistic flair. It looks like a high-quality photo taken with a full-frame camera like the Canon 5D Mark IV or Sony A7R III at ISO 400 and f/2.8 aperture. The lens focal length is 35mm, providing slight wide-angle distortion and natural perspective. Color reproduction is realistic, details are rich, noise is well controlled, and the overall image is clean and crisp, with no unnecessary distractions. Only the core characters and environment are preserved, conveying a sense of tranquility and beauty immersed in the world of reading",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
