        {
          "id": "krea2-fcd5b23435dbf5a9d913f145",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙咖啡厅温柔坐回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in an orange leather booth in a Chinese restaurant, turning her head to look at the camera. Her right hand holds a pair of dark brown wooden chopsticks, her fingers long, and a light blue ring on her ring finger. She wears a white off-shoulder puff-sleeve dress made of lightweight, breathable material, with natural pleats, looking elegant and casual. Her posture is relaxed and lazy. On the glass table in front of her sits a steaming plate of noodles. Golden thin noodles paired with lush green vegetables, the broth is clear and bright, and beside her is a white porcelain bowl. Inside is half a bowl of soup and a small spoon. The bowl's edge is decorated with elegant patterns. On the table is a napkin printed with a menu. In the back right is an amber glass cup holding a light brown drink. The background is an off-white wall and a mosaic tile wall with brown and white tiles, edged with dark brown wooden frames. The overall spatial tone is warm and harmonious. The warm yellow lighting from the interior softly illuminates the figures and food, creating a cozy and comfortable dining atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups. The figure occupies the center-left position, forming a visual focal point. The foreground highlights the food and hand details, the middle shot shows the main subject and part of the dining table. The background is blurred to enhance spatial layering, forming a natural emotional flow. The transition of light and shadow is delicate and shadows are soft, presenting a vivid and warm moment from daily life, as if shot with an old but clear camera. It has slight film graininess and natural color shifts, making the image simple and intimate, full of life and humanistic warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
