        {
          "id": "krea2-39b104a777e2f7323e69dee0",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙山野微笑站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors on the green lawn, wearing a white floral spaghetti strap dress paired with a pink long-sleeved cardigan. The sleeves of the cardigan are decorated with delicate silver leaf embroidery, giving the whole look sweet and fresh, full of youthful energy, lively and natural. She wears a gentle, sweet smile, looks directly into the camera, conveying a warm and intimate feeling. Her right hand holds a red pen, while her left hand holds a white circular drawing board or notebook, elegantly displaying her creative state. The main focus is a close-up of the person. The composition uses a close-up portrait, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, body slightly turned to the left, head slightly turned toward the frame, forming a beautiful diagonal line composition. The foreground clearly highlights the details of the figure, the background is a blurred green grass and a distant pale blue sky, presenting a soft bokeh effect that enhances spatial layering. The middle ground is a vast lawn with vibrant, rich colors that harmoniously contrast with the pink and white of the figure's clothing. The background features a pale blue sky and faintly visible distant mountain outlines, creating an open and tranquil outdoor environment. The light comes from the upper right, soft natural light. The sunlight falls on the subject, creating a warm and bright highlight. The overall atmosphere is cozy and healing, full of the romantic atmosphere of spring sunshine. The main tones are pink, white, and green, paired with a pale blue sky, creating fresh and romantic colors. The image texture is delicate, with a grainy texture and realistic light and shadow like film photography, as if shot with a vintage camera. The lens is an 85mm prime lens with an f/1.8 aperture, creating a strong depth of field effect that highlights the subject and blurs the background, then spreading to the surrounding natural environment, forming a complete narrative chain. The overall style combines everyday life with an artistic touch, like beautiful moments recorded in daily life, yet also with the refined beauty of professional photography",
