        {
          "id": "krea2-0766f845bb6bc73beae44b7c",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣公寓沉思站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, her expression slightly relaxed and confident. Her overall posture is relaxed and tense, her body slightly turned to the side. Her left hand holds up a bottle of transparent glass drink, her right hand holding a small white packaging box, and a black leather shoulder bag slung across her shoulder. The strap is thin and naturally drapes, and she wears a loose off-white V-neck knit sweater made of soft and thick fabric, with clearly visible textures. The sleeves are wide and the hem naturally drapes down to partially cover the hem, paired with a dark green plaid short skirt. The plaid pattern is woven from dark green, light brown, and white lines. The skirt is tailored to fit well, above the knee, revealing long legs. On the feet, she wears a pair of pure white over-the-knee socks with flat cuffs that fit closely to the calves. On her feet are a pair of black glossy loafers with a classic shape, rounded toes, and a smooth, reflective upper that showcases a delicate leather texture. The figure stands on a wooden floor, which is dark brown with clear wood grain and a slight reflective surface. The background is a light beige wall, with a dark wooden door beside the wall and a heavy door panel. It features a vintage round door handle, with a potted green plant beside it. Its leaves are broad, dark green, and full of life. Next to it is a dark wooden desk or cabinet, neatly stacked with several books with white covers. On the right is a desk lamp with a dark metal base, a black lampshade, and a simple lamp structure. Next to it is a wooden chair with a dark brown backrest and armrest, smooth lines, and soft lighting throughout the scene. Natural light from the left streams in from outside the frame, creating a contrast between light and shadow. Light and shadow transitions are natural, with shadows falling on the right side of the figure and background objects, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses the center-left main figure, occupying the main position. Background elements are reasonably distributed with clear layers. The foreground features the figure and some furniture, the middle features desks, books, and plants, and the background features walls and doors. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, dark green, black, and brown. The color coordination is harmonious, full of the atmosphere of daily life, while also combining fashion and artistic beauty. The image details are rich and the texture is realistic. It feels as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains a sense of everyday realism, with a strong sense of immersion and storytelling",
