        {
          "id": "krea2-6d5455069e3b4ccd6a34a68d",
          "alias": "单女透视连衣裙浴室冷淡坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of a modern-style bathroom sink, wearing a long-sleeved dress with a deep green and gray plaid pattern. The V-neck design pairs with front buttons, the skirt reaches the knees, and the fabric is delicate with a subtle texture. The overall look is simple yet elegant, wearing fine-framed glasses that reflect soft light. Delicate gold hoop earrings hang from her earlobes. Her posture is relaxed and natural, with legs crossed, right leg in front and left leg behind. She wears black sheer stockings with black trim at the ankles. Her toes are slightly raised, revealing toes painted with deep red nail polish. On the floor beside her feet lies a pair of white plush slippers, fluffy and soft, creating a cozy home feel. The background is a beige tiled wall with white power outlets and a metal-framed mirror. The mirror reflects her back and parts of the environment. Another larger mirror reflects the sink, faucet, and a pot of greenery. The green leaves of the plants are placed on the sink, adding a touch of vitality to the cool-toned space. The composition centers on the figures, using a slightly overhead angle to highlight their postures and clothing details. The foreground features the edge of the washbasin and slippers, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background features walls, mirrors, and plants, extending to body lines and leg movements. The lighting comes from warm yellow indoor lighting, with the light source located at the upper left of the frame, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The overall color tone leans toward warmth, mainly beige, green, and black, accented with white and green. The scene has a realistic feel of everyday life, while also carrying a subtle artistic compositional aesthetic. It feels like a high-quality lifestyle photo taken with a professional camera, or like a real moment casually captured on a phone. The image details are rich, texture is authentic, and layered is distinct, presenting a quiet, private, and cozy private atmosphere",
