        {
          "id": "krea2-0f3774017f05105b25e39ea1",
          "alias": "单女棕高领衫街道冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of an escalator, wearing a deep brown turtleneck knit sweater and a matching suede skirt, paired with black knee-high boots. The overall look presents a warm and vintage earth tone, with a calm expression and a hint of detachment. Her hands gently rest on the edges of the metal armrests on both sides, her posture relaxed yet full of strength. Around her neck is a thick gold beaded necklace with a striking crescent pendant, a woven belt tied around her waist, and a woven bag adorned with tassel decorations slung across her body. The details are rich and full of bohemian charm. The main subject is positioned slightly below the center of the composition, occupying the visual focal point. In the foreground are the metal steps of an escalator and smooth stainless steel handrails, with the reflection clearly reflecting the outlines of the figures and the surrounding environment, creating strong line guidance. The middle ground features symmetrical escalator structures on both sides, extending backward to create a strong sense of perspective, guiding the gaze upward to converge on the blurred figures and city street entrances in the background. The background consists of brick walls, distant pedestrians, and faintly visible street scenes. The wall features a reddish-brown brick texture, with light streaming in from above, creating a contrast of light and shadow and creating a cold and austere atmosphere in the urban underground space. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, centering on the figures, with escalators on both sides forming guiding lines. Vertical lines also enhance the sense of depth in the image. The light and shadow come from natural light sources at the top, soft yet directional, while metal reflections appear on the escalator surface. This creates a contrast of warmth and coolness, blending urban indifference with individual warmth. It combines the refinement of a fashion blockbuster with the authentic texture of everyday life. It feels like a scene accidentally captured in a subway station or mall passage, with cinematic narrative tension and a documentary style. The colors are mainly brown, brown, and black, accented with metallic silver-gray and gold, creating clear layers and a striking texture. The visuals present a calm yet elegant aesthetic, as if shot with a professional camera in low-light conditions. Using a large-aperture lens to blur the background and preserve subject details, it also retains the graininess and natural transitions of film photography. The overall image resembles a high-end fashion display in a commercial advertisement or a real moment captured by a street photographer, conveying the self-expression and identity of independent women in the modern city. The details are rich, layered and full of storytelling and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
