        {
          "id": "krea2-51b9b28e728affc0294464e0",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔街道沉思坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an orange wooden chair, leaning slightly forward, her posture relaxed and full of tension. She wears a light blue denim shirt with sleeves casually rolled up to her elbows, revealing slender arms. The hem of the shirt hangs naturally and the neckline is slightly open, presenting a casual yet refined sense of fashion. She crosses her legs and wears black quilted fishnet stockings. The leg line looks long and sexy under the light, naturally draped over her shoulders. Her right hand gently rests on her left arm, while her left hand rests naturally on the edge of the chair. Her fingers are slightly bent, her expression thoughtful, as if gazing into the viewer's inner world. Her makeup is delicate and natural, blending street style with elegant temperament. The background is pure white walls and floors, clean and simple, with no distractions, highlighting the main subject. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, forming the visual center. The camera is slightly down, capturing the complete form from the waist up to the feet. The orange color of the chair contrasts with the character's denim blue and black socks, enhancing the layering and visual appeal of the image. Light and shadow come from the left, soft and even, creating a bright and warm atmosphere. The shadows delicately outline the character's outline and the folds of clothing, casting soft shadows on the floor to enhance the spatial three-dimensionality. The overall color scheme mainly uses warm and cool contrasts. The white background brings coolness, the orange chair injects warm vitality, and denim blue and black fishnet stockings give the scene a modern urban vibe. The image presents a minimalist yet distinctive sense of fashion, with a slight film texture, moderate graininess, and slightly low color saturation, preserving the texture of authentic shooting. It feels as if an old-fashioned film camera is being shot indoors under natural light, with a slightly blurred background that highlights the subject. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and storyful, resembling a casual street shot or a carefully planned fashion portrait, conveying a free, independent, and confident female strength. The composition is balanced, and the figures' postures are natural and smooth. The transitions between light and shadow are smooth, the details are rich, presenting an overall style that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
