        {
          "id": "krea2-0b162cd6a9a0dc5cb715291c",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道冷淡吸烟",
          "prompt": "A woman sat on a wooden folding chair by the street, wearing a long black velvet coat over a white shirt, black stockings, and a pair of red snakeskin high heels. Her posture was elegant and relaxed, legs crossed, right leg raised, toes lightly touching the ground, left hand holding a lit cigarette. Smoke curled up, she slightly tilted her head to gaze at the camera, wearing golden round earrings on her earlobes. The background was a city street at night, a glass window reflecting faint indoor light, with stickers and advertisement residues on the edge of the window frame. Next to it is a white door with metal handles, the walls are light gray tiles, and the floor is paved with stone pavement. The overall tone of the image is cool, presenting the grainy texture and slight overexposure characteristic of film photography. Light comes from the streetlamps or display windows on the right, creating a soft side glow, while the shadowed areas blend into the night, creating a sense of loneliness and detachment from urban nightlife. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, with the figure positioned on the right side and the left space reserved to highlight the ambiance. The visual guide extends from the high heels in the foreground to the full body of the figure in the middle shot, with strong but not abrupt light and shadow contrasts. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and storyful, as if capturing a brief yet authentic moment in a city night. It has a retro film-style cinematic feel and the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment, rich in details and distinct color layers, combining fashion with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
