        {
          "id": "krea2-60ac2a80b645aab508ab208c",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫客厅沉思坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sat in a dark brown leather armchair, wearing a loose white long-sleeved shirt with an open neckline revealing a deep V neckline and collarbone. The hem of the shirt was casually tucked into black high-waisted wide-leg pants, with a row of silver metal buttons or ornaments on the sides. She sat barefoot on the chair, legs naturally crossed, body slightly turned to the side, head tilted to the right and back, her expression slightly contemplative and lazy, wearing small earrings on her earlobes and a slender necklace, with light streaming in from the left. This creates a soft and layered effect of light and shadow, leaving clear shadow outlines on the background wall and floor. The foreground features a blurred white door frame or wall edge, forming a natural framing composition that guides the gaze to the main figure. In the middle is a vintage-style leather armchair she sits on, with natural wrinkles and signs of use, presenting a sense of age and texture. The background is a light gray wall hanging on it, with a black-and-white photographic or abstract artwork framed in a black frame. The content of the painting is vague but adds a touch of artistic flair. The entire scene is set indoors, possibly in a corner of a family living room or study. The floor is covered with dark wood flooring, with warm white, brown, and gray-black tones as the main tones, creating a peaceful, private, and lively atmosphere. The composition uses a third-section and framed approach, visually guiding the audience through the foreground door frame or wall edge, focusing the viewer's attention on the figure. The use of light and shadow emphasizes three-dimensionality and emotional expression, combining backlighting and side lighting. Highlighting the character's silhouette and clothing details creates a fleeting, unintentional beauty in daily life, as if shot at dusk with an old film camera, featuring a slight graininess and a warm-colored filter. The lens chooses a medium focal length, moderately blurring the background to enhance the subject's prominence. The overall image has a cinematic and storytelling feel, conveying a quiet, elegant, and slightly sexy atmosphere, like a private moment of afternoon sunlight streaming into the room. The figure's posture is natural relaxed and expressions genuine. There are no signs of deliberate staging, allowing people to feel the genuine warmth of life and the flow of emotion",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
