        {
          "id": "krea2-f2ab25f205954eb9f220135c",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣公园坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench in the park, her makeup clean and translucent, presenting a sense of everyday yet refined beauty. She wears a bright red long-sleeve V-neck knit sweater with a fitted design that perfectly outlines her curves. Several buttons on the chest are decorative and soft and fitting. She pairs her lower body with light blue high-waisted jeans. The fit highlights her leg lines. Her left hand rests gently on the bench armrest, while her right hand hangs naturally by her thigh. Her fingers are long and her nails are neatly trimmed. Wearing a pair of delicate white floral earrings and a thin chain necklace, adding a touch of elegance, she sits beside her a red woven handbag. The body uses a mesh weaving technique for a unique texture, with metal fasteners and brand labels on the bag. The colors echo the top, with a wide green lawn in the background. The grass looks vibrant in the sunlight, and in the distance, dense trees and blurred architectural outlines can be faintly seen. Light streams in from the right side, creating a soft backlight effect that casts a golden halo around the edges of the figure's silhouette The rich layers of light and shadow create a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition centers on the figure, using a mid-shot perspective where the figure occupies the main position. The lines of the bench extend from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a guiding line that enhances the depth of the image. The foreground features a bench and a handbag, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background is grass and trees. The layers are distinct and the color contrast is strong. The red top and green grass create a striking visual impact while harmoniously unified. The overall tone of the painting is warm and full of life. It feels like a real moment taken with an amateur camera or phone, with a slight graininess and natural transitions of light and shadow, presenting a casual yet aesthetically pleasing style of daily documentation. The details are rich, emotions genuine, and it makes you feel a relaxed and pleasant afternoon",
