        {
          "id": "krea2-369304a2e74a2a5b0682106a",
          "alias": "单女紫高领衫摄影棚神秘站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands before a deep black background, her body slightly turned and her head slightly tilted, adding a touch of naturalness and vitality. She wears a bright purple turtleneck down jacket, whose surface is smooth and has a noticeable sheen, presenting a silk-like texture. Under the light, it reflects a soft and layered glow. The jacket is full and well-padded, with smooth lines and a classic quilting design. The sleeves are printed with a white label reading \"BLACK GUN.\" She injects fashion and personality into the overall look, layered with a black knit top with a V-neck design that highlights the graceful lines of her neck and collarbone. The knit texture is delicate and clear, adding layers and texture to the garment. She wears black shorts that look simple and sharp, revealing her long legs. On her feet, she wears black knee-high boots with shafts that reach below the knees, creating a unified tone and style with the overall look. Her hands are naturally placed in front of her abdomen, fingers long, and she wears several simple silver rings. Details highlight refinement and taste. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame. The background is completely swallowed by darkness, with only a faint gray smoke lingering at the bottom and around the edges. The smoke floats lightly between the ground and the legs, creating a hazy and mysterious atmosphere. Light and shadow cast diagonally from the upper left, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, while deep shadows cast on the other side enhance the sense of three-dimensionality and drama. The light is soft yet directional, with the overall color scheme dominated by deep black and purplish-red The color saturation is moderate, with sharp contrasts of warm and cool tones, creating an atmosphere where the coolness and elegance of a modern city coexist. The visuals present a high-quality professional studio effect, as if shot with a high-end camera and large aperture lenses. The details are sharp and clear, depth control is precise, and the background blurs naturally. It feels like a scene carefully arranged by a photographer, capturing a moment full of storytelling. The entire frame combines the refinement of a fashion blockbuster with a touch of casualness and authenticity from everyday life. It feels as if these moments were accidentally captured on a late-night street or in a studio, full of a blend of artistic flair and everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
