        {
          "id": "krea2-ecb05dcb08f1165cc3af77f3",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the edge of a modern urban overpass, wearing a black sequin tight dress with long sleeves and a deep V-neck slit. The dress is covered with tiny silver or white glitter beads that sparkle in the sunlight, outlining graceful curves. Paired with black stockings, the surface faintly reveals subtle subtle patterns or dotted patterns, visually echoing the outfit. Wearing black pointed high heels, she poses gracefully and confidently. Her left hand gently supports a thick metal pillar, while her right hand hangs down, holding a round silver sequin clutch. The clutch is suspended by a thin chain that gently sways with movement. The makeup is exquisite, and the expression is calm yet full of tension. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, occupying about two-thirds of the frame's height. The body is slightly tilted, creating a dynamic balance. The background features rows of skyscrapers; on the left is a dark glass curtain wall building reflecting the sky and surroundings; on the right is a modern building with beige stone exterior walls. The lines are clean and sharp, with outlines of other high-rise buildings visible in the distance. The sky appears a clear pale blue without clouds, with bright and even lighting. It is natural light during noon or afternoon, with sunlight shining from the upper right, creating soft shadows. The left side of the figure and the ground are clearly projected, with clear contrast between light and shadow. The composition uses a low-angle downward perspective to enhance the character's presence and sense of spatial depth. In the center of the painting, a concrete platform extends into the distance, guiding the gaze deeper. There are cracks and wear marks on the ground. Adding realism and a sense of everyday life, the platform below is a parking lot or road area, where white parking lines and a white SUV can be seen moving away. In the lower left corner of the image, a bright red rose is placed wrapped in red wrapping paper. The petals are full and the colors intense, forming a strong contrast with the overall cool tones, making it one of the visual focal points. The overall atmosphere blends urban fashion, sophistication, and a touch of romance. It combines the refined texture of a commercial blockbuster with the casual authenticity of everyday street photography, as if captured by a professional photographer on a city street. Shot with a medium format camera, high-resolution details, well-controlled depth of field, slightly blurred backgrounds that highlight the subject, moderate color saturation, and realistic light and shadow transitions. The overall image is clean and crisp, with balanced composition and strong visual guidance. The characters' postures are relaxed, movements are natural and fluid, full of storytelling, presenting a cold yet charming urban woman image that combines strength and softness. The visuals are full of modernity and artistic flair, striking like movie posters",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
