        {
          "id": "krea2-38d4504c69c69b7d842a2e46",
          "alias": "单女白内衣室内站立持花",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a white indoor fireplace, dressed in a delicate white lace lingerie suit. The straps are delicate, and the lace trim on the chest is delicate and elegant, outlining her graceful curves. She stands slightly sideways, her left leg slightly bent, her right leg upright, and she wears bright red high heels. The smooth uppers reflect a gentle glow, creating a strong visual contrast with the overall understated tone. She holds a bouquet of blooming red roses and several white roses in both hands, with full blossoms, lush green leaves, distinct petals, and long stems. On the left side of the foreground is a woven rattan basket filled with white flowers and leafy plants. Next to the basket are several green plants growing from the ground, with broad leaves and clear veins. In the center is a white fireplace, above which are several glass jars, each filled with different types of flowers, such as pink flowers and green succulents. Gold decorative labels are affixed to the jars. Inside the fireplace are dried pine branches, several beige rattan spherical decorations, and a white candle. The wall behind the fireplace features a light beige brick texture, with a white carved decoration in classical style. On the right side, a few green leaves climb the wall. The background is pure white, simple and clean, without unnecessary elements. The composition features a figure centered slightly to the left, occupying the main position in the composition. The fireplace serves as the background frame, forming a stable visual structure. Plants and bouquets in the foreground add layers to the composition. Light and shadow come from the front left of the image, with soft and even lighting illuminating the front of the figure and parts of the fireplace, creating natural shadows and creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly white and beige, accented with red and green. The color combinations are harmonious, full of romance and warmth. The image is delicate and detailed, presenting a tranquil and poetic aesthetic of living. It feels like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, yet retains the warmth of everyday life, like a carefully arranged scene at home. It allows people to feel the real and beautiful moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
