        {
          "id": "krea2-f8e7fbb3bf6a8cbef1dbf2fc",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙沙发自信倚靠过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against the edge of a black leather sofa, wearing a simple white spaghetti strap dress that fits her figure and outlines smooth curves. On her feet are delicate white lace high heels, with hollowed-out designs and lace details on the upper. The pointed toe accentuates her long leg lines. Her legs are crossed and folded, one foot lightly draped over the other, looking relaxed and confident. She wears a deep red plush jacket draped over her shoulders, whose fluffy, soft texture contrasts sharply with the smooth leather. The coat drapes casually over the shoulders, revealing slender arms and collarbones. Around the neck is a multi-layered necklace, including a red bead chain and several silver chains, one of which carries a small star-shaped pendant. The background features a large abstract artwork framed in wood, with a canvas made of gray-white, dark gray, and beige blocks pieced together, with obvious textures and folds on the surface, creating a sense of depth and layering. The painting hangs on a light gray wall, which is clean and simple. The floor is paved with light-colored tiles that reflect soft light. The entire space is dimly lit, with the main light source coming from the front of the figure, creating warm side lighting. At the same time, a soft shadow is cast on the sofa, with natural transitions of light and shadow, creating a private and tasteful indoor atmosphere. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying the left central position, the body tilted diagonally. The painting in the background echoes the geometric lines of the sofa, enhancing the sense of depth in the painting. The overall color scheme is mainly black and white, accented with red and gold. The color combinations are harmonious and impactful, with delicate image texture and cinematic light and shadow effects, resembling a fashionable blockbuster shot with professional photography equipment. While preserving the realism of everyday scenes, it creates a unique visual experience that combines artistry with a sense of everyday life",
