        {
          "id": "krea2-9a3940cd14c9856af5dc0b6d",
          "alias": "单女白西装高塔站立指向",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle downward view, a woman dressed in an off-white vertical striped sailor suit stands on an outdoor platform among city skyscrapers, arms raised above her head, hands folded behind her head, body slightly leaned back, presenting a relaxed and relaxed posture. Her short-sleeved top has a light blue bow tied at the collar, two deep blue fine trims on the cuffs, and the lower part is paired with a matching vertical striped pleated skirt, with dark blue double stripes embellished along the hem The overall clothing style is fresh and sweet, full of youthful vitality. The foreground shows the figure occupying most of the space, fully presented from feet to head. The middle ground features a blurred cluster of city buildings behind the figures, with high-rise residential and commercial buildings scattered in a staggered manner with clean and modern lines. The background is a vast, bright blue sky dotted with large fluffy, pure white cumulus clouds. Sunlight pours down from above, creating a strong backlight effect. Light penetrates the clouds, outlining a soft halo on the figure's outline, while the shadowed areas appear soft and layered. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, emphasizing the figure's slender figure and upright posture. The visual guide is the character's upward arms and gaze pointing toward the sky, creating an open, free, and upward atmosphere. The colors are mainly fresh blue and white, complemented by beige and light gray. The overall tone is bright and transparent, with strong light and shadow contrasts but natural transitions, presenting a warm and tranquil summer afternoon feeling, as if capturing a moment of emptiness and enjoyment. The image texture is delicate and rich in detail, It has the texture of professional studio outdoor shooting, while retaining the realism and everyday atmosphere of handheld device shooting. It feels like a beautiful moment captured by chance encounter on the street. The overall image is full of youthfulness, vitality, gentleness, and healing power, conveying a relaxed attitude toward self-expression and inner freedom",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
