        {
          "id": "krea2-5361cc06266d2f3c3ca19a76",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙海滩困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A woman sat elegantly on a floating single chair with a modern white design, wearing a bright red velvet long-sleeve dress with a heart-shaped neckline and high waist, adorned with a shiny silver tassel belt at the waist. The skirt was voluminous and layered, and the long sleeves had cutouts at the wrists. The overall look was both sexy and luxurious. She wore a diamond-studded necklace and a pair of striking red earrings, her legs naturally crossed, and one foot gently stepped into the clear shallow water, with her toes clearly visible. Fine ripples appear on the water's surface, with a vast, calm blue ocean in the background. The water shows a gradient from light blue nearby to deep blue in the distance. The sky and sea merge into one, forming a soft horizontal line. The composition uses a central symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the composition. The white chair becomes the visual focal point, forming a strong contrast with the red clothing. The foreground is a shallow water area with crystal-clear shallow water, revealing the grain of sand and stones underwater. The middle ground shows the complete outlines of the woman and her seat, and the background is the boundless ocean and skyline. The light comes from natural daylight, soft and even. Sunlight streams down from the upper right, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The entire scene is filled with romance, luxury, and tranquility, like a dreamy seaside vacation moment. The photography style approaches professional fashion blockbusters, using a large aperture lens with well-controlled depth of field. The background blur treatment makes the subject stand out, the color saturation is high but not exaggerated, and the overall image is clean, refined, and artistic, with strong visual impact and emotional expression. It presents a surreal yet authentic aesthetic, like classic scenes from movies, making one imagine this is a fairy tale about love, freedom, and beauty. The visuals are rich in detail, from the texture of the clothing to the dynamic ripples of the water, all rendered with remarkable realism. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, and the tones are harmoniously unified, offering a visual experience that is both modern and timeless",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
