        {
          "id": "krea2-6adb7445bb475ddb6ed1400c",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔摄影棚忧伤坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an orange wooden chair, leaning slightly forward, her posture relaxed and full of tension. She wears a light blue denim shirt, with sleeves casually rolled up to her elbows, revealing slender arms. The hem of the shirt hangs naturally, and the neckline is slightly open, presenting a casual yet refined style. Her legs are crossed, wearing black quilted fishnet stockings. Her ankles are clearly defined, and the curve of her legs appears soft and layered in the light, naturally draped over her shoulders. It adds a touch of playfulness and sensibility, with a calm expression revealing a hint of melancholy and introspection. The overall posture presents a lazy, fragile, yet story-rich atmosphere. The foreground features her body and chair, with the composition centered on the figure occupying the main position. The orange of the chair contrasts sharply with the gray-white background. The middle is the chair's structure and her lower body, with the wooden grain of the chair clearly visible. The metal frame is simple and modern, and the details of her legs and fishnet stockings subtly change in light under the light. The background features a pure white wall, minimalist and clean, with no distractions to create a sense of openness and quiet space. On the left edge of the frame, a corner of a white object can be faintly seen, possibly a studio equipment or prop, but it does not fully enter the frame, so it does not disrupt the overall composition. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, making the scene more dynamic and unstable, enhancing emotional expression. The figure's body and chair form a diagonal line, guiding the gaze from the lower right corner to the upper left corner, creating a natural visual flow. At the same time, negative space is used to emphasize the presence of the figures. Light and shadow come from the right side of the frame, soft and even, simulating natural light or softbox effects. The direction of shadows is consistent, enhancing three-dimensionality and realism. The overall atmosphere is calm and restrained, with artistic and intimate vibes. The tones are mainly cool gray and warm orange, creating subtle contrasts that create a feeling that is both everyday and surreal. It feels like a fashionable amateur camera shoot, retaining slight noise and graininess. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, and the background blurs naturally. The subject is clear and sharp, the image possesses strong narrative and emotional tension, presenting a moment of youth, loneliness, and self-reflection, like a forgotten diary fragment—quiet and profound",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
