        {
          "id": "krea2-a9773cb7813008fa1f866813",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣摄影棚忧伤倚靠拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman leans elegantly against a pure white background wall in a half-squat pose. She wears an olive-green chunky knit sweater with a unique design, off-shoulder style, and sleeves naturally falling to mid-arm, presenting a relaxed, casual fashion vibe. The yarn texture is clearly visible, soft and layered to the touch. The hem of the sweater is slightly curled, hugging the body's curves and showing subtle pleats and dimension. She wears gray stockings, with smooth and delicate surfaces with a slight sheen, hugging the leg line. Outlining a smooth silhouette, she wears a pair of black high heels with pointed toe designs and gold metal decorations on the upper for a striking contrast, adding a touch of luxury. Her fingers are long, elbows rest on her knees, and her wrist wears a wide off-white bracelet made of ivory or jade, with a warm texture. On the other wrist, she wears multiple dark bracelets, gradients from dark green to black, with natural texture on the surface, creating a visual focal point. The expression is calm with a hint of melancholy, the overall posture relaxed yet powerful. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of center of the frame, body slightly tilted, head slightly tilted, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The background is a pure white wall with no debris, highlighting the main figure's form and details. The light is soft and even, coming from a slightly higher front position, creating a natural shadow transition that enhances the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is calm and sophisticated, combining fashion and artistry. The color palette is mainly neutral Olive green, gray, black, and white complement each other, creating a minimalist yet refined visual effect. It feels like a fashion shoot with professional studio equipment, or like moments casually captured in daily life. Realism and beauty coexist. The details are rich, from the knitted texture of sweaters to the reflections of stockings, and the texture of bracelets. Every detail is meticulously crafted, showcasing a high level of realism. The entire scene is filled with the independent temperament and elegance of modern urban women, leaving a lasting impression",
          "description": "",
