        {
          "id": "krea2-80105178dd3728e883b1ea0c",
          "alias": "单女白T恤公园坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the metal slide of a park slide, displaying delicate luster and layering, exuding youthful energy and tranquility. She wears a white camisole paired with light blue high-waisted wide-leg jeans. The pants are loose and comfortable, presenting natural pleats and fabric texture. On her feet are off-white sneakers with dark striped uppers, giving a casual and fashionable look. A black square bag is slung crossbody at her side, smooth and textured, with metal fasteners clearly visible. She leans slightly forward, One hand rests naturally on the edge of the slide, while the other rests lightly on the knee, presenting a relaxed and elegant posture. The overall composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, forming a visual focal point. The background features lush trees with thick and upright trunks, lush green leaves, and soft natural light filtering through the branches. In the distance is a calm lake, reflecting the sky and the scenery along the shore. On the opposite shore, a faint cluster of modern high-rise buildings can be seen, their outlines clear but somewhat blurred, creating an atmosphere where the city and nature blend harmoniously. The lighting is daytime natural light, soft and even, without strong shadows. Sunlight streams through the gaps in the leaves, creating mottled light and shadow on the figures, enhancing the sense of layering in the image. The overall color scheme is mainly blue-green, fresh and natural, with white and black elements accented for harmonious and non-awkward color contrast. The composition uses curved lines of a slide to guide the gaze, extending from foreground to mid-ground and then to the background, creating a good sense of spatial depth. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, with natural transitions between highlights and shadows, highlighting the skin texture and clothing texture. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and comfortable, full of everyday life, as if capturing a real summer afternoon scene. It carries the documentary feel and artistic beauty of everyday shooting, presenting a realistic and moving youthful portrait style, emphasizing the integration of natural beauty and environment, with rich and harmonious details",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
