        {
          "id": "krea2-8d408505259b76a03d22faa9",
          "alias": "单女西装酒店戏谑注视",
          "prompt": "She wore a tight fitted suit made of black lace and sheer tulle, with thin straps accentuating her graceful collarbones. The deep V design on her chest accentuated her full curves, and black garter belts and metal buttons on her waist and thighs. The overall look was sexy and refined, with a confident yet slightly alluring expression. She wore a simple gold necklace that added a touch of luxury. The background was a distant view of the Eiffel Tower in Paris, clearly visible through the large floor-to-ceiling windows. The tower's structural details were distinct, presenting a metallic texture and industrial aesthetics. Outside the window, the sky is slightly bright, presenting a mix of pale blue and gray-white tones of dawn or dusk. The distant outline of the city is faintly visible. The window frame is made of dark wood with vintage carved decorations. The indoor light is warm and soft, and the curtains are made of thick beige fabric with rich pleats, creating a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of center of the frame, body slightly turned to the side, left hand lightly resting on the armrest of the chair, right hand naturally resting by the leg, posture relaxed yet full of tension, with the foreground highlighting the subject. The middle ground depicts the interior environment and window frames, with the Eiffel Tower as the main visual focal point in the background, creating a sense of spatial layering. The perspective relationships are clear, the window edges guide the gaze into the distance, the composition is balanced and deep, with black, gray, and beige as the main tones, accented with gold and light blue. The overall tone is harmonious and unified, with delicate light and shadow treatment and moderate contrast, creating a private, romantic, and slightly luxurious atmosphere. It feels like a private moment in a high-end hotel room, with a strong cinematic feel and artistic photography quality. The image texture is close to that of high-resolution camera shooting, with clear details while retaining a certain soft-focus effect to enhance the dreamlike feel. The overall atmosphere is both everyday and surreal, like a classic scene from a modern urban romance film. It captures the poetic fusion of feminine charm and urban landmarks. The image conveys an independent, confident, elegant, and slightly teasing modern woman, extending along body lines to the legs and garter belts, ultimately attracting the Eiffel Tower outside the window, forming a complete visual flow with stable composition and smooth rhythm, suitable for fashion portraits, emotional themes, or urban life art creations, with high aesthetic value and narrative potential",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
