        {
          "id": "krea2-09ba33c4ea03e1215d3dc696",
          "alias": "单女透视灰外套街道沉思坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden high stool in a café, leaning slightly forward, legs crossed, right leg draped over left, exuding an elegant and confident posture. She wears a fluffy, soft gray long fur coat with fine and layered fur, presenting a natural transition of shades and sheen. She wears black tight shorts underneath, and black sheer stockings on her legs. The surface of the stockings has subtle textures and reflective effects, making them smooth and textured. On her feet are black pointed high heels with glossy material uppers. Reflecting the light and shadow of the surroundings, the heel is slender and sturdy, and the overall look is stylish and sexy, smoothly draped over the shoulders, with a calm expression and a hint of mystery. The background is a modern-style indoor café space, with a ceiling made of dark wood beams and multiple warm yellow recessed spotlights. The light softly casts into the space, creating a warm and cozy atmosphere. A white sign hangs on the wall, inscribed in black handwriting: \"BIL CED D ORKL - LLS K TERTO.\" DUTER IS-OFF\" fonts are casual yet artistic, with some letters blurred, adding a retro and street feel. The café's interior is simply decorated, featuring several square dining tables in natural wood tones and matching chairs. The tables and chairs are minimalist, with flat tabletops and rounded edges. The chairs are wooden cushions paired with black metal frames with smooth lines. The floor is covered with gray stone flooring with fine spots, reflecting faint light and enhancing the spatial three-dimensionality. In the distance, glass windows and door frames can be seen, with some natural light streaming in outside, contrasting with indoor lighting, the composition centers on the figure, using a mid-field perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the image, occupying the main visual space. The tables, chairs, and signboard in the background create a sense of depth, guiding the gaze backward. The tables and chairs in the foreground are partially blurred to highlight the main subject and add depth to the image. Light shines from above and from the side, creating a soft contrast of light and dark, natural shadows, and the background lighting creates halos and scattering effects, creating a warm yet slightly hazy atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, gray, and black, with moderate saturation, rich details, and a realistic texture. It feels as if a professional camera is shooting in real scenes, with a high sense of realism and artistic flair. The images blend urban fashion with everyday life, combining the refinement of commercial photography with the warmth of everyday life. The visual guidance is clear, the focus is precise, light and shadow transitions are natural, and the atmosphere is warm yet slightly cool, evoking a sense of modern female independence and autonomy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
