        {
          "id": "krea2-5019acfd4c81f3ce855048e5",
          "alias": "单女空姐西装机场沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A female flight attendant stands in a modern airport lobby, dressed in a fuchsia professional suit, including a fitted sleeveless vest and a high-waisted short skirt. Underneath, she wears a white long-sleeved shirt with vertical stripes and a deep blue scarf at the collar. Her overall look is professional and elegant, with exquisite makeup and a dignified posture. Her hands are folded in front, her left hand is adorned with a simple silver bracelet, and on her feet are black pointed high heels. The upper is made of transparent material, revealing her long, fair legs. Her body slightly turns to the side, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. In the foreground are the escalator's metal handrails and glass guardrails, with clear blue and white safety signs along the edges. The ground is paved with gray marble tiles, smooth and reflective, reflecting the people and surroundings. In the middle is a spacious and bright airport lobby with multiple silver-gray metal columns and glass curtain walls. In the distance, there are several self-service check-in machines and security gates. Above the background hangs a striking red sign with \"Arrivals\" in white letters, along with the plane's icon and arrow directions. Below the sign, there is the Chinese word \"Arrive.\" The entire space is well-lit, with recessed lights at the top providing even, soft cool white light, creating a clean and tidy modern atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-angle portrait perspective, with the figure positioned on the right side of the canvas occupying the main visual position. The left side leaves space to display the escalator and some architectural structures, creating a left-right balance. The gaze is guided from the foreground escalator to the figure, then extends to the background signs and the distant space, creating a strong sense of depth and delicate light and shadow effects. The figures have natural transitions between light and shadow, soft shadows that highlight three-dimensional contours. The overall atmosphere is both professional and rigorous, yet approachable, as if capturing a moment in daily work, with a realistic texture like shooting in a public space. The details are rich, color saturation moderate, and the tones mainly cool gray and rose red create a striking contrast. The images are full of life and professional charm, with a high degree of realism and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
