        {
          "id": "krea2-fa814f773ae08a1d5744d627",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔街道冷淡倚靠自拍",
          "prompt": "A female model appears in a dynamic pose with intense tension, wearing a remodeled blue denim jacket cleverly tailored into a short dress, revealing her long legs. She pairs it with white stockings and deep blue crocodile leather high heels, paired with orange-red platform sneakers, creating a strong visual contrast. She wears a black cylinder hat, her makeup is exquisite and dramatic, and her expression reveals a hint of provocation and confidence. Her left hand is clad in light gray gloves. Leaning lightly on a rough concrete pillar, the right hand hangs naturally, holding a small silver-gray handbag decorated with a metal chain. The overall design blends elements of street fashion and high fashion, full of avant-garde feel. The figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, with a leaning posture. The right leg is raised, knee bent, toes touching the ground, and the left leg stands upright for support, forming a distinct S-shaped curve. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying the main part of the scene, set against a city street background. The floor is paved with square stone bricks, and in the distance, you can see faint reddish-brown fences and gray walls. The walls show mottled marks, giving off a texture reminiscent of urban ruins. Light comes from the sides and above, soft and even, creating a natural lighting effect for early morning or evening. The tones are mainly cool blue-gray, accented with orange-red and white, enhancing the visual impact. The overall atmosphere combines the professionalism of a fashion magazine cover with the realism of street photography, as if capturing a moment of improvised artistic selfies. The image is delicate and richly detailed. It has a strong visual guiding effect, then extends along the leg lines into the background. The composition is balanced and dynamic, with distinct color layers and exquisite light and shadow handling, conveying a rebellious, free, and unrestrained youth cultural atmosphere, like a documentary-style work shot with an amateur camera—authentic and story-rich",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
