        {
          "id": "krea2-d7b8e2c8f16b6ceab8083ac5",
          "alias": "单女透视棕外套街道忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the open space of a city rooftop, her posture upright, turning sideways to look back at the camera, her head slightly tilted back, as if gazing at the sky or some invisible point in the distance. The jet-black color is smooth, gently swaying in the wind, adding a touch of dynamic beauty. She wears a black leather beret with a slightly slanted brim, injecting a touch of vintage and fashion into the overall look. She wears a fluffy brown faux fur coat with a delicate and soft plush texture, presenting a warm and luxurious visual effect. The jacket is loose and comfortable, with naturally draped cuffs forming soft pleated lines, layered with a black turtleneck that contrasts sharply with the outerwear, highlighting layering. The lower body wears a tight black glossy leather mini skirt, smooth as a mirror, reflecting the faint glow of the surroundings. The skirt design is simple and sharp, with one slit cleverly revealing long legs. Paired with sheer stockings, the legs appear slimmer and more proportionate. The overall clothing style blends street fashion with urban modern elements, showcasing strong personal charm. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. The body forms an S-shaped curve, with a slightly twisted waist, an elegant yet dynamic posture. In the foreground is a rough cement floor covered with fine cracks and mottled marks. The ground is scattered with debris, including an abandoned tire, several wooden boards, and scattered trash. These details enhance the scene's realism and sense of life. In the middle is a low concrete fence, with wear and stains on the fence surface and irregular edges, presenting a rugged industrial feel. Behind the fence is a cluster of city buildings, mostly gray-white with simple structures. The windows are neatly arranged, some buildings have air conditioning and outdoor units on top, and the outlines of distant high-rise buildings are blurred and shrouded in mist, creating a sense of spatial depth. The sky is gloomy, the clouds are thick and grayish-white, and the light is soft and even, with no clear direction—typical of cloudy diffuse light. The overall light and shadow atmosphere is calm and slightly melancholic, with cool gray tones as the main tones, forming a strong contrast with the characters' warm brown coats, highlighting the main figure. The composition uses a vertical frame, with the figures occupying the main position and background blurred. The focus is drawn to the figure, extending along the neck line to the back and legs, finally landing on the ground and distant buildings, forming a smooth visual path. The overall composition presents a blend of urban loneliness and modern female independence, combining the casual realism of daily life with the refinement and depth of artistic photography, like a street documentary shot with a professional camera, rich in cinematic and storytelling",
