        {
          "id": "krea2-b64d64d7b70531155c9daee8",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装沙发神秘倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman leans reclining on a vintage-style beige velvet sofa, her body in a lazy yet elegant reclining posture. Her makeup is exquisite, and her overall aura is both vintage and modern. She wears a deep navy blue blazer made of smooth wool or silk, with slightly rolled cuffs revealing slender wrists, and a white lace ruffled shirt underneath. The neckline and cuffs are decorated with intricate lace trim, layered and delicately textured. She wears a deep burgundy short skirt with a clean and sharp hem, forming a sharp contrast with the top. She crosses her legs, stacking her right leg over her left, wearing a pair of semi-transparent white lace tights. The lace pattern is delicate and exquisite, subtly showing the contours of her skin. On her feet are white pointed high heels with hollowed-out designs and metal buckle decorations. The heel is chunky, the sole is brown, and the sole has black anti-slip padding. Her left hand is casually placed on her chest, elbows bent, arms relaxed, body lines smooth and posture natural. The seat cushion and backrest are made of beige velvet with subtle textures, and the armrests and backrest edges are decorated with metal rivets, adding a vintage feel. The sofa rests on a floor paved with geometric tiles, gray-white with radiating star patterns. On the floor, there is also a colorful Persian-style carpet, its edges worn and bearing signs of age. In the background, you can see a half-open white door frame. The door has glass panes, and through the window you can see a blurry outdoor scene. Behind the door is a darker space, with faint outlines of furniture. The room is dimly lit, mainly from the left side of the image, possibly from soft lights or natural light from the window. The light shines from the front side, creating a gentle transition between light and dark, with shadows concentrated on the right side of the sofa and the floor. It creates a warm yet slightly mysterious atmosphere, with rich layers of light and shadow and warm tones, mainly beige, deep blue, burgundy, and white, accented with gold and gray-white. The composition uses a high-angle overhead view, with the figure occupying the left central position, body extending diagonally, guiding the gaze from head to foot to create strong visual movement. The foreground features the subject's legs and shoes, with clear details; the middle ground is the main figure and sofa; the background is the floor and door frame. The spatial layers are distinct, and visual guidance is through the figure's posture and gaze direction. The overall atmosphere blends vintage elegance, fashionable modernity with a sense of private tranquility, as if capturing a moment in an afternoon café or private residence. It has a strong cinematic feel and artistic photography style, like shooting with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens. The out-of-focus blur is soft, the image quality is delicate, and color saturation is moderate, presenting a premium film texture with slight graininess and natural exposure deviation, enhancing realism and nostalgia. The composition is balanced, proportions are coordinated, details are rich, and light and shadow treatment is exquisite. Filled with narrative and emotional tension, it conveys a gentle yet independent female charm",
