          "alias": "单女棕毛衣城市坐持花",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose brown chunky knit cardigan layered with a matching low-neck knit dress. The vertical stripes of the dress are clearly visible, the hem is cut asymmetrically, revealing her long leg lines. On her feet are a pair of minimalist metal high-heeled sandals, with a warm and fashionable overall look. In front of her is a small table with a round marble countertop, white and smooth, with gray textured edges. On the table sits a transparent glass vase holding a bouquet of white tulips and green flower stems, the flowers about to bloom, full of vitality. Next to it is a white porcelain plate holding a golden, crispy piece of bread and several slices of toasted toast. Beside the plate is a round yellow apple, adding a touch of fresh color. The table's black legs are tall and glossy, reflecting blurred images of the surroundings, creating subtle interplay of light and shadow. The background is a light beige wall, with a black-and-white wave pattern decorative painting hanging on it The design is simple and modern. On the right side is a black metal wall lamp with a conical shade, softly illuminating the space to create a warm atmosphere. The entire scene is illuminated from the sides and rear, simulating the combination of natural and artificial lighting. The main light source is warm-toned, projected from the right rear of the figure to enhance the sense of depth. The foreground features food and vases on the table as the main visual elements, the middle scene focuses on the female subject, and the background is extended through wall decorations and lighting fixtures. The composition uses a three-part method, with the figure positioned on the right side of the painting. The left side is reserved to display desktop details, creating visual balance. This extends to the background decorations and lighting, creating a smooth visual path. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, comfortable, and warm, full of life and artistic beauty. It feels like shooting everyday scenes with a professional camera paired with a large aperture, presenting a lazy yet refined urban lifestyle style. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and light and shadow transitions are natural, creating a strong sense of immersion and emotional resonance, making it suitable for showcasing feminine charm, Lifestyle or interior aesthetic themes",
