        {
          "id": "krea2-e1e7be4a357f05fc4c4c04eb",
          "alias": "单女全裸棕靴子城市媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an orange suede single sofa, legs crossed, her posture relaxed and elegant. She wears a short-sleeved top with red and yellow floral patterns, the neckline slightly lowered, revealing delicate collarbones and a thin chain necklace. She holds a dark beer in both hands, her fingers painted bright yellow nail polish, and on her left wrist several simple bracelets. Her expression is slightly contemplative and lazy, revealing an unintentional sensuality and composure. On her feet are a pair of light brown high-heeled nude boots, slender heels and slightly folded boot shafts. The open-toe design highlights the ankle line, with one foot lightly resting on the other, forming a graceful leg curve. A small white panty edge is visible at her left knee, adding a touch of casualness and realism. In the foreground, a close-up of her long legs and feet occupies the lower half of the frame, clearly focal point. In the center is the thick backrest and armrests of an orange sofa, soft and layered. To the right of the sofa is a low table with a white border, on which sits a beer bottle labeled \"TUNA,\" with a clear label. Next to it is a small black bag and a pair of sunglasses. The background is a dark gray wall decorated with complex yellow and black geometric patterns, exuding a strong vintage Arabian style. Green plants dot the corners of the walls, with broad leaves full of vitality. A round wall lamp hangs on the left wall, emitting a warm yellow glow that injects a cozy atmosphere into the entire space. Light streams through the window from the upper right, creating a soft side glow, casting soft shadows on the floor. The transition of light and shadow is natural, with overall tones of orange and brown Dark gray is the main color, accented with yellow lighting and green plants, creating a warm, comfortable atmosphere with a hint of urban nightlife. The composition uses low-angle shots, with the camera slightly tilted upward, highlighting the figure's proportions and posture aesthetics. The perspective focuses on the interaction between the person and their environment, emphasizing the casualness and artistic capture of everyday moments. The image presents a realistic texture reminiscent of amateur camera or mobile phone photography, with slight noise and natural depth of field effects. It feels like a snapshot of life captured in a café or bar corner, full of story and emotional warmth. The color saturation is moderate, contrast is soft, and details are rich. It combines the authenticity of life with visual aesthetic pursuits. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and private, allowing people to feel the leisurely and self-enjoyment of modern urban women.",
