        {
          "id": "krea2-c2e2e4701eb3561fbbdaa03b",
          "alias": "单女白外套城市自信站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a fashionable urban style stands beside a vintage orange classic sedan. She wears an off-white long double-breasted coat paired with a caramel turtleneck knit top and a deep green slim knit skirt. She wears brown pointed high heels, gently grips the door handle with her left hand and carries a brown leather briefcase in her right. Her posture is elegant and composed, her expression calm and confident, wearing thin-rimmed glasses and gold earrings. The overall look is refined and layered, with lush greenery and shrubs in the background, sunlight slanting down from the upper left. A soft transition of light and shadow forms on the surfaces of the figures and vehicles, with the body showing a warm metallic sheen. Where the tires touch the ground, there is a slight shadow, and in the distance, the outline of a light gray building can be faintly seen. The composition uses a medium shot from a portrait perspective: the figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, while the car occupies the right half, creating visual balance. The foreground features grass and low plants, the middle ground is the main body of the person and vehicle, and the background is dense vegetation and buildings. The light comes from the warm sun of the morning or evening, creating a nostalgic yet modern atmosphere. The color palette is dominated by earth tones, with off-white, caramel, deep green, and orange-brown echoing each other. The overall tone is harmonious and unified, with delicate light and shadow texture. The image has a grainy texture and natural exposure reminiscent of film photography, as if captured from a daily street shot or private life record, full of vitality and artistic beauty. The lens presents a 35mm film camera-like perspective, featuring a slight depth of field blur effect, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental details. The overall atmosphere is quiet and elegant, like a poetic moment frozen in an urban pastoral scene. Emphasizing the natural state and aesthetics of real-life scenes, without deliberate posing, it exudes a carefully designed sense of fashion everywhere. The composition is stable and the proportions harmonious. The overall image conveys an independent, intellectual, gentle, yet powerful feminine temperament, combining retro sentiment with modern aesthetics. It is suitable for fashion magazines, lifestyle sharing, or personal image display. It presents a visual experience that combines sophistication with approachability",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
