        {
          "id": "krea2-9348d9c8cbe0de56a389df2c",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫博物馆坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the center of a traditional Japanese tatami room, wearing a pure white long-sleeved shirt and a black short skirt, sitting cross-legged barefoot in a naturally relaxed posture. Her right hand gestures for a phone call, fingers slightly bent, leg lines long and proportionate, toes clearly visible, presenting a fleeting beauty in everyday life. Her body is positioned in the lower middle of the frame, occupying the visual center and creating a strong sense of subjectivity. In the foreground is a pale yellow tatami mat covering the entire floor, with clear texture and tightly woven fabric. Decorative strips with dark green geometric patterns on the edges extend from the bottom of the painting into the distance, guiding the viewer deeper. In the middle is a large artwork featuring a woman and her background. The painting is enormous, occupying nearly half the wall space, dominated by black, white, and gray tones, depicting a complex mechanical installation full of steampunk style. The painting includes gears, pipes, clocks, telescopes, robots, flying machines, and other elements. The figures operate machines in vintage clothing, with intricate and precise details, smooth and powerful lines, and rich compositional layers. It feels like a fantasy world where the future and past merge. At the top of the painting are Japanese calligraphy inscriptions such as \"Sketch Postscript,\" adding a cultural touch. The background is a typical Japanese interior, with wooden beams and columns clearly visible. The walls are white, and on the right side is a low wooden bed frame with a white mattress. Beside the bed hangs a brightly colored modern illustration. The figures in the painting are clearly outlined, forming a strong contrast with the black-and-white painting on the left, creating a spatial atmosphere where tradition and modernity coexist. The entire scene is brightly lit and even. Drawn from natural light or indoor lighting, the light source is soft with no obvious shadows. The overall color scheme is warm and comfortable. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with figures centered and paintings placed symmetrically. The railings and beds on both sides create visual balance. Visual guidance leads from the tatami patterns and decorative strips in the foreground to the figures and paintings in the center, then extends to the architectural structure in the background and another painting, creating a sense of depth. The light and shadow atmosphere is tranquil and peaceful, combining the casual feeling of daily life with the refined atmosphere of an art exhibition. The overall composition blends traditional Japanese aesthetics, steampunk art, and fragments of modern life, presenting a unique artistic conception that is both real and surreal. It feels like a casual pause captured in a creative and imaginative cultural space. The image texture is delicate and rich, with the clarity and depth of professional photography, while preserving the natural and authentic atmosphere of amateur equipment shooting, allowing people to feel an artistic expression close to life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
