        {
          "id": "krea2-d0219623f62e352ec8a81cfd",
          "alias": "单女粉衬衫书店微笑坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the steps in front of a wooden bookstore full of retro artistic vibe, smiling sweetly and looking directly at the camera. She wears a loose light pink shirt-style dress with sleeves slightly rolled up, revealing slender arms. She pairs white shorts and white knee-high socks below, and on her feet are delicate pink bow flats. Her posture is natural and relaxed, her hands gently propped behind her back, legs together, knees slightly bent, exuding youthful energy and gentle temperament. To her left is a lush pot of green palm plants. The leaves are broad and spreading, partially covering the left edge of the painting. Next to the plant is a metal storage box, on which is a green fabric mat printed with colorful cartoon patterns. On the cushion is a transparent glass vase holding a fresh bouquet made of purple bellflowers, white flowers, and green leaves. To the right is a small wooden side table with a photo frame and a glass bottle with white roses placed on the table. Next to it is a gray plush cushion casually placed on the steps, with the bookstore interior as the background. Through the open wooden door, you can see the neatly arranged books on the shelves. Between the shelves are sculptures, desk lamps, and greenery. Warm yellow light shines from fluorescent tubes and wall lamps on the ceiling, creating a cozy and comfortable reading atmosphere. The entire scene is bathed in sunlight, with dappled light and shadow scattered on the floor and figures, creating a contrasting effect of light and shadow. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with figures positioned in the center. Plants and bouquets in the foreground enrich the composition, while the middle scene is the area for figures and steps. The background extends into the bookstore's interior space, visually guiding the people from the plants and bouquets in the foreground to the figures, extending further into the bookstore. The overall color palette is dominated by warm wood tones, soft pinks, fresh greens, and bright sunlight, presenting a peaceful, healing, and vibrant everyday atmosphere. It seems to capture a leisurely moment bathed in afternoon sunlight, rich in aesthetics and artistic flair, while also carrying the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The lighting is naturally soft and the details rich. The color saturation is moderate, with a slight graininess and filmy texture in the image, enhancing realism and nostalgic atmosphere. The overall composition is balanced, layered clearly, and light and shadow transitions naturally, creating a quiet and warm urban corner with poetic charm.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
