        {
          "id": "krea2-0e5969e931a120a5a2cc7cbd",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服摄影棚微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a deep black gown sits sideways, elegantly turning back to gaze at the camera, adding a touch of laziness and allure. Her makeup is exquisite, with a gentle smile. Her overall aura is noble and elegant. The dress features a deep V-neck design with a backless cut that highlights the back line. The upper body is made of sheer tulle and black velvet, with a black ribbon at the waist that accentuates a slender waistline. The skirt is puffy and flowing, layered with layers of black tulle forming a full A-line silhouette. The hem of her dress is adorned with three-dimensional blue fabric floral decorations, rich in layers and delicate texture. Her right arm hangs naturally, and she wears a gold woven bracelet on her wrist, with dark nail polish on her fingers. Her posture is dignified yet lively. The background is an indoor setting, with a light beige wall, simple and elegant. On the right side is a white ceramic vase, smooth and rounded, with several dry branches bearing orange-red berries planted nearby. The branches stretch naturally and have a sparse shape, and on the left side, a small branch extends from the edge of the painting. The composition centers on the person, occupying most of the composition, using a mid-angle perspective. The lighting is soft and even, coming from the front slightly left, creating a warm and delicate light and shadow effect. The shadow transitions are natural, highlighting the character's outline and the texture of the clothing. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and artistic, resembling a high-end fashion photoshoot shot in a professional studio, yet retaining a sense of everyday warmth. The color palette is mainly black, gray, and white, accented with warm orange and gold. The colors are harmonious and unified, the image is rich in detail, and the texture is clear, presenting an aesthetic style that combines elegance and spontaneity, delicacy and naturalness, with strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
