        {
          "id": "krea2-aa99829066d5db0b92a835b1",
          "alias": "单女米风衣门忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a white double door, wearing a beige trench coat. The coat is open, revealing blue lace underwear and black stockings. Her hands rest on either side of the door frame, her posture naturally relaxed, her expression slightly contemplative and a hint of stubbornness. Her fingers are painted red nail polish, and the details of the trench coat are clearly visible, including double-breasted buttons, lapels, belts, and pockets. The door panels feature a classic four-compartment design, with slight wear and scratches on the surface. The walls are light grayish-white, rough in texture, bearing the marks of time. The overall setting is set indoors. The light comes from the front left, soft and even, creating an atmosphere of everyday privacy. The composition is centered and symmetrical, with the figure occupying the main subject. The background is simple and clean, with clear light and shadow layers, soft shadows that highlight the outlines of the figures and the texture of clothing. The overall style is realistic and natural, as if captured with a regular camera or phone, capturing a real life moment full of life and emotional tension. The image presents an effortless elegance and authenticity, as if capturing an ordinary yet story-filled moment. The painting does not deliberately beautify it, preserving the authentic texture of the environment. For example, the subtle scratches on the door and the uneven walls enhance the scene's realism. The wrinkles of the trench coat and the texture of the fabric are vividly expressed through light and shadow. The figures' postures are natural and unpretentious, giving a sense of intimacy and privacy. The entire scene exudes a quiet, calm, and slightly melancholic atmosphere, like the moment when afternoon sunlight streams through the window and is casually recorded. The color saturation is moderate, contrast is smooth, and details are rich. From the buttons on the trench coat to the patterns on the lace lingerie, everything is clearly recognizable. The overall visual effect is both everyday and artistic, like a portrait photograph drawn from the depths of life, capturing the most authentic side of the person. There is no exaggerated staging or excessive embellishment—only pure light and emotion flowing.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
