          "id": "krea2-3a8eebaa54c1aa638d9b2b77",
          "alias": "单女旗袍水边冷淡坐持扇",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a stone steps by the lake, wearing a sleeveless qipao with a light gray ink wash gradient. The fabric has a delicate silky sheen, with delicate frog buttons at the neckline and side slits. The skirt naturally drapes down to the ankles, showcasing elegant lines. She gently holds a white fan with a soft floral pattern in her right hand, the handle made of wood with tassels at the ends. She wears silver high-heeled sandals with tiny rhinestones on the uppers. It appears both classical and modern. The background is a calm lake surface with a faint glow, reflecting the sky and the green trees along the shore. In the distance, you can see the blurred outlines of willows and a small bridge. Above the foreground, lush green leaves extend diagonally from the upper left corner of the painting, forming a natural frame. On the right, a dense cluster of shrubs dots with several blooming white lilies. The petals are pure white, stamens pale yellow, and the stone steps are paved with rough bluestone slabs with clear grain and slightly mottled edges. The overall composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the painting. The light extends from the lake surface to the distance, with light coming from the upper right. Soft natural light shines on the figure, creating a warm backlit silhouette. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled shadows on the ground, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The colors are mainly cool tones, interwoven with gray-blue, cyan-green, and white, accented with warm yellow light spots, presenting an overall tranquil and far-reaching Eastern aesthetic. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, with slight film graininess and depth blur effects. It also preserves the natural realism typical of everyday handheld device shooting. The lake ripples in the background are delicate, the leaf veins are clear, details are rich, light and shadow transitions are soft, layered are distinct, and the overall atmosphere is tranquil and peaceful, full of poetry and a sense of life",
