        {
          "id": "krea2-30346828195ba55498f09a56",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤庭院困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a courtyard surrounded by tropical plants, wearing a light blue loose crewneck T-shirt with a \"ROUTE 66\" label on the cuff. She pairs a white pleated skirt below, her hands naturally folded in front of her, striking an elegant and relaxed posture. Behind her is a dense patch of green plants. Huge banana leaves stretch diagonally from the right side of the frame, some of which block the top of her head to form a natural sunshade. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled shadows on the ground and the figures. In the background, you can see a building with beige exterior walls, a roof made of dark gray tiles, white and blue window frames, low stone walls and scattered dead leaves and rubble beside the building. On the left wooden platform, a small, furry black animal is curled up in the shadows. The overall scene is filled with a tranquil and pleasant summer afternoon. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. Banana leaves serve as a visual guide extending from the upper right corner to the top of the figure's head, creating a strong visual focal point. The light comes from the upper left. Soft natural light effects are presented, with fresh and bright green as the main tones, accented by light blue, beige, white, and wood brown, creating a warm and vibrant pastoral atmosphere. The details in the image are rich, including the grain texture of leaves, the wrinkled texture of clothing, the wood grain of the ground, and the rough surface of stones, presenting a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, as if captured with a regular camera, with a slight film graininess and realistic light and shadow transitions, and a slightly warm tone. It enhances the lazy atmosphere of a summer afternoon. Distant trees and leaves sway gently in the breeze, bringing a sense of dynamism. The overall composition is layered: clear figures and nearby plants in the foreground, buildings and partial vegetation in the middle, and forests and sky in the background. The sense of space is strong, with natural contrasts of light and shadow. Highlights are bright and transparent, while shadow areas are deep and soft, creating a visual experience that is both realistic and slightly dreamy",
