        {
          "id": "krea2-ae73c970e5f847ee898127f4",
          "alias": "单女棕风衣街道忧伤站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an autumn afternoon on a city street, her overall temperament elegant yet slightly laid-back. She wears a loose brown leather long trench coat with a delicate sheen, a classic lapel design, and slightly rolled cuffs to reveal the white shirt sleeves underneath. The shirt is pure white with a clean cut and a naturally draped hem. She gently holds a black square handbag in both hands, the bag smooth and decorated with a green round metal clasp on the front, and her fingers painted deep red nail polish, matching the lipstick color. She wears black shorts and black stockings, her legs are long, and on her feet are high-top black leather boots. The surface of the boots has a slight reflective surface, giving a leather texture. Her body is slightly turned to the side, with her left leg in front and right leg behind, forming a natural stance. Her left hand gently supports the top of the bag, while her right hand rests naturally on the side of the bag. Her posture is calm and expressive. In the foreground, scattered withered yellow leaves on the ground, each with various shapes and slightly curled edges, some leaves are trampled or flattened, forming irregular piles. The ground is a gray asphalt pavement. There are white traffic markings above, with a street environment in the background. In the background, several parked cars can be seen, including a black sedan, a silver sedan, and a dark gray SUV. The outlines of these vehicles are clear but somewhat blurred. In the distance is a light gray building with vertical lines on the walls, neatly arranged windows, and a modern and minimalist architectural style. On the left side of the painting stands a thick dark green pillar, with some mottled marks on its surface—possibly a streetlight pole or billboard stand. Sunlight slants down from the upper right of the image, creating a warm golden glow At the same time, soft shadows are cast on the trench coat and the ground, with a clear contrast of light and shadow, creating a tranquil yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The background blur emphasizes the subject, and the camera angle slightly tilts upward to enhance the character's presence. The colors are mainly brown, white, and black, complemented by yellow fallen leaves and golden sunlight. The overall tone is harmonious and unified, with a strong autumn atmosphere. The image texture is similar to everyday amateur equipment shooting. With slight noise and realistic lighting and shadow details, it feels like a real street shot captured from a phone or portable camera, full of a sense of life and artistic atmosphere. The characters' expressions are natural, movements are fluid, and background elements are rich yet not cluttered, presenting a serene beauty where urban fashion and seasonal vibes blend together",
