        {
          "id": "krea2-1d2304ad75ce9cefe0359f1e",
          "alias": "单女西装城市自信持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a deep navy navy velvet lapel blazer paired with a matching high-waisted skirt. The overall look was elegant and vintage, showcasing refined urban fashion. Looking directly into the camera, she exuded a calm and composed aura. She wore a multi-layered pearl necklace wrapped around her neck, shining with a warm glow. The blazer featured a classic double-breasted design. Four gold buttons are neatly arranged, with crisp shoulder lines and smooth lines. The lapel is made of soft black velvet, creating a textured contrast with the fabric. The details of the cuffs and pockets are well handled, highlighting the craftsmanship of haute couture. She gently holds a matching coat in her left hand, with wide sleeves hanging naturally, creating a lazy and casual atmosphere. In her right hand, she carries a black leather handbag. The simple shape and sharp lines harmonize with the overall look. The background is an indoor environment, and the wall is painted in a warm beige tone. Behind the door, you can faintly see glass windows or mirrored reflections, adding depth to the space. Light softly streams in from the sides, creating a natural transition of light and shadow, while the shadowed areas appear deep and textured. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, slightly tilted to the side, presenting a graceful S-shaped curve. The overall atmosphere blends vintage, elegance, and modern urban vibes. The color palette mainly features deep blue, beige, and warm wood tones, creating a calm and noble visual impression. It feels as if captured in front of a sunny afternoon café or boutique window, with the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The slight noise and soft out-of-focus blur enhance the everyday atmosphere and artistic quality of the image",
