        {
          "id": "krea2-f1f689cf06573297c26248cf",
          "alias": "单女黑西装城市专注坐展示",
          "prompt": "She wore a black blazer paired with a white ruffled shirt and white over-the-knee stockings, paired with black patent leather pointed high heels. She elegantly sipped a light-colored drink from a transparent glass, her expression focused yet slightly lazy. Her makeup was clean and neat, and she wore a simple ring on her finger. Her hand movements were natural and smooth, showcasing the independence and composure of an urban woman. In the foreground was a round metal table with a dark green marble countertop, with legs of classical cast iron and carved patterns on the surface. On the table sits a glass cup filled with clean water and a white plate, with a small amount of food residue. Next to it are a pen and a folded tissue. The tabletop reflects the surrounding light and shadow, creating a delicate mirror effect. On the left chair hangs a black chain bag, smooth and slender. On the right is another similar table and chair, with a rattan backrest and beige woven cushion. The background is the deep green door frame of a café and large glass windows. Inside the window, you can see blurred interior furnishings and reflections of figures. Outside, the brick wall texture and green trees of the opposite building are reflected. The sky is grayish-blue, with heavy clouds and soft, even lighting. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of life. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the main subject positioned slightly to the center, naturally focusing on the figures. The depth of the foreground creates a sense of space. The foreground tables, chairs, and floor details are clear, the middle ground features prominent figures, and the background gradually blurs to enhance visual depth. Light and shadow come from diffused light on cloudy days. There are no strong shadows, only subtle reflections. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with beige and green, presenting an aesthetic style that blends vintage and modern. The image texture resembles high-quality camera shooting, with rich details and authentic colors. It creates a cinematic everyday candid atmosphere, as if capturing a leisurely afternoon moment, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
