          "id": "krea2-7f9b4aca0584a42015f3271a",
          "alias": "单女灰西装城市沉思坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a pure white floor, her body slightly tilted, legs crossed and naturally extended. Her left hand lightly touches a black patent leather pointed shoe, her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears a gray blazer paired with a dark gray low-neck dress underneath, revealing her collarbones and part of her chest. The overall look is simple and modern, full of urban fashion, smoothly draped over her shoulders. She wears silver geometric earrings on her earlobes and tiny rings on her fingers, adding a touch of detail. She wears a pair of pure white over-the-knee socks with flat, snug cuffs. In stark contrast to the black high heels, the black pointed Mary Jane shoes feature metal buckle decorations. The shoe surface is smooth and reflective, presenting a sophisticated sheen. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the painting, with gaze directed toward the upper right, as if gazing at a distant target or immersed in thoughts. The background is a pure white semi-transparent curtain, light and airy, with natural folds and light and shadow variations. Sunlight streams in from the left, creating a striped pattern of light and shadow on the curtain. These light and shadows are also projected onto the ground and the figure, creating a warm and gentle atmosphere. The light comes from the front left, belonging to natural light with a warm tone unique to early morning or afternoon. The light source is soft and clearly oriented, with shadows clear but not harsh. The overall composition uses a low-angle shot, with the camera slightly tilting to highlight the character's slender figure and leg lines, while enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The foreground is the person's legs and shoes, occupying the lower half of the frame. The visual focus is on the combination of white knee-high socks and black leather shoes. The middle ground features the torso and upper body, including clothing details and expressions. The background is a simple white curtain and floor, with no unnecessary elements interfering. The whole scene is clean and crisp, with gray, white, and black as the main tones, accented with a touch of metallic silver to form a classic black, white, and gray color scheme. The visual guide is from the black shoes in the foreground to the figure's legs, and finally the light and shadow textures on the curtain create a smooth visual flow. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, evoking a relaxed sense of everyday life. It retains the refinement and sophistication of professional photography. The overall style blends minimalism with modern fashion aesthetics, presenting a quiet, restrained, yet dynamic beauty. Like a carefully designed indoor portrait, it captures moments of female independence and confidence. The image texture is delicate and rich, suitable for high-end fashion brand promotion or personal artistic expression. It feels very realistic, as if shooting with a professional camera in natural light. It has a film texture and slight graininess, yet retains high-definition sharpness, balanced composition, and clear layering. The colors are harmoniously unified, conveying a gentle, calm, and slightly detached urban feminine temperament",
