          "id": "krea2-d9e7b9533e3c036a218c2e72",
          "alias": "单女全裸红西装街道坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a red tweed suit sits on the outdoor stairs. She wears a classic red Chanel-style tweed jacket with a double C metal badge and a matching short skirt. The overall look is refined and elegant. She wears a red plaid top hat with gold decorations, red-framed glasses, and exquisite makeup. In her left hand, she holds a small black bag with a purple plush pendant hanging from it. On her feet are a pair of shiny red pointed high heels with cross-shaped decorations on the toes. Crossing legs naturally on the steps, the legs are long and slender. Wearing nude-colored stockings, the background is a brown metal staircase structure, flanked by metal railings and cable-stayed steel cables. The walls are made of gray concrete, and the floor is dark brown cement steps. The light is soft and even, with natural light from cloudy days creating a low-key yet luxurious atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the figure's upright posture and fashionable temperament. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of center in the frame, with clear legs and shoes in the foreground. The middle shots feature the upper body and clothing details, while the background is stairs and walls, extending through body contours to legs and shoes, forming a smooth visual flow. The light and shadow are evenly distributed without strong contrasts, with red as the dominant color scheme, harmoniously paired with brown and gray, presenting an overall sense of high-end fashion. It feels like a professional fashion shoot on a city street, with strong visual impact and artistic expression. The image is delicate and detailed, It showcases the model's elegant posture and exquisite craftsmanship, while preserving the sense of everyday life. Like real outdoor photos taken with a high-end camera, it features real light and natural textures, with extremely high image clarity, every detail clearly visible, and the entire scene is full of modern urban fashion and personal charm",
