          "id": "krea2-dc5f94e62e361f9004085ce4",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙街道冷淡站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the middle of a city street at night, wearing a pink satin pleated tight dress with long sleeves featuring puffy puff sleeve details, gold accents on the shoulders, and a sparkling diamond necklace at the neckline, adding a touch of luxury. The natural draping drapes over her shoulders is exquisitely made, her expression confident yet slightly cool. She wears black stockings and black high heels, her legs long and straight, standing gracefully on the street. In the foreground, her full-body form occupies the center of the frame, with a medium perspective. On both sides are multi-story apartment buildings, with warm yellow exterior walls. The windows emit faint light, some open to see the interior scene. The streets are lined with various vehicles, including red sedans, silver SUVs, and white vans, forming a continuous parking strip. The streetlights emit a warm yellow glow, illuminating the entire street. The light casts down from above, creating soft halos and shadows on the ground, creating a strong contrast between light and shadow. It creates a tranquil nighttime atmosphere. The sky is pitch black, with no clouds and distant silhouettes of trees. The overall scene presents a realistic urban nightlife feel, with a stylish blockbuster texture. The color scheme is warm yellow, softly contrasting with the pink dress. Black stockings and high heels enhance the visual focus. The figures are centered, guiding the gaze into the distance. The street lines create a strong perspective effect, enhancing spatial depth. The light and shadow distribution is even but layered. It highlights the main contours and clothing details, creating an atmosphere that is both modern and slightly mysterious, like an unintentionally captured urban moment. It has the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, as if casually capturing a phone or portable camera on the street, retaining natural noise and slight motion blur, making the image feel more lively. The overall color tone is warm and authentic, full of storytelling, conveying an independent and confident feminine charm. The image details are rich, from the wrinkles and textures of clothing to the grainy texture of the floor, all clearly visible. It showcases delicate light and shadow changes and a realistic ambiance",
