        {
          "id": "krea2-1fb65f296250412bcce720f5",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫窗边温柔坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window in a café, her fingers long and painted with deep red nail polish, silver rings on her ring and middle fingers, and a metal chain bracelet on her wrist. She wears a blue off-shoulder blouse with fine stripes, topped with a gray chunky knit sweater. The sleeves of the sweater slide loosely down to her arms, revealing her shoulder lines. The overall look is fashionable yet relaxed. Her posture is relaxed and elegant, her body slightly turned to the camera and her head tilted slightly, creating an intimate and casual atmosphere. In the foreground is a clear female figure holding a coffee cup, with black brand lettering and Chinese logos on the cup. Details are clearly visible, and the background is presented through large glass windows to reveal the outdoor scene. Outside the window is a white building with circular windows and traditional decorative lines on the walls. Green plants and vegetation dot the building, with faint outlines of hills visible in the distance. The sky is pale blue with a few white clouds. Light streams in diagonally from outside, creating a bright but not harsh interior. The overall color palette mainly consists of blue-gray, white, and natural green. It presents a fresh and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying the main positions. The coffee cup serves as one of the visual focal points, forming an interactive relationship with the characters, guiding the gaze between people and objects. The background buildings and natural scenery serve as a backdrop, enhancing spatial layering and clear perspective relationships. The vertical lines of the window frames contrast with the geometric shapes of the building, enhancing the structural sense of the composition. Light and shadow come from natural light on the left, with moderate contrast and soft shadows distributed on the sides of the body and the folds of clothing. The overall atmosphere is warm and comfortable, as if capturing a real moment of a leisurely afternoon. It feels like photos taken with everyday hobby equipment, with authentic texture and a sense of life. The details are rich, color saturation is moderate, presenting a natural, authentic, and approachable visual experience",
