        {
          "id": "krea2-0e91c74bca9bc8bbdebf62f3",
          "alias": "单女橙外套摄影棚微笑站立",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a vibrant orange-yellow long plush coat stands gracefully and confidently against a pure light gray background. She slightly turns to glance back, wearing a radiant smile, exuding a vibe that is both fashionable and approachable. This contrasts sharply with the bright clothing. The coat's fluffy, heavy plush texture is clearly visible, with every fiber seeming to tremble under the light, presenting a warm and luxurious visual effect. She wears bright yellow gloves in matching tones, gently draping them over the coat, her hand posture naturally relaxed. The fingertips are slightly bent, revealing an unintentional sense of refinement. On the feet, she wears matching high heels and stockings, creating a highly unified color scheme that creates a strong visual impact. The composition uses medium portrait shots, with the figure occupying the main subject, fully presented from head to foot. The body is slightly tilted, with the left leg slightly bent and the right leg straight, forming a dynamically balanced stance. The foreground is the full-body image of the subject. Highlighting the details and overall styling of the clothing, the middle ground shows the figure's body contours and postures, while the background is a simple monochrome gradient gray, transitioning from light gray to slightly darker gray from top to bottom, with no distractions to make the subject stand out. Light comes from the front slightly above, softly illuminating the entire figure, while shadows concentrate on the ground, creating a subtle shadow that enhances the sense of three-dimensionality. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, and the plush surface reflects a subtle sheen, highlighting the material's softness and fluffiness. The overall atmosphere combines high-end fashion with a relaxed, pleasant vibe. The color tones are warm and harmonious, with moderate color saturation—neither exaggerated nor dull—suitable for high-end fashion magazines or advertising. The image style resembles professional studio shooting, using large-aperture lenses to capture the scene. The background is cleanly blurred, presenting extremely high clarity and texture. The composition is balanced, with the subject centered slightly to the left, leaving space on the right side to enhance breathability, which then extends to the feet, creating a smooth viewing path. Overall, it presents a modern, elegant, The vibrant artistic beauty feels like a stylish portrait meticulously crafted in a quiet photography studio using top-tier cameras and lighting equipment",
