        {
          "id": "krea2-c7d7af7cbe263c712c8b78ca",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣街道忧伤蹲伸展",
          "prompt": "A woman squats on a street corner at night in the city, dressed in a loose gray sweater and black short skirt, wearing shiny black leather shoes. Her expression is slightly melancholic and contemplative. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly leaning forward, hands casually resting on her knees. She presents a tranquil and story-filled moment. The main figure is positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the frame, occupying the visual center. In the foreground is the edge of a yellow roadside stone steps, rough and marked with mottled green moss. The stone steps create a clear height difference with the ground. This adds spatial layering. The middle ground is the street area where women stand, with a blurry city night scene in the background. In the distance to the right, a red double-decker bus is moving, its headlights stretching out long light trails to create a dynamic blur effect. Neon lights reflect on the vehicle, presenting flowing red light and shadow. On the left is a row of glass display windows that emit warm red light, with shelves or product outlines faintly visible inside. The window frames are made of dark metal, reflecting light from the surrounding environment. The overall composition is shot from a low angle. The camera is slightly tilted to give the figure a stronger sense of presence and enhance the sense of spatial depth. The stone steps in the foreground serve as a guiding line, guiding the gaze toward the main figure and extending into the background with flowing light tracks, forming a visual flow from near to far. The colors mainly feature warm and cool contrasts, with the main subject illuminated by red and blue dual-tone lighting—one side is a fiery red, the other a cool blue—creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, creating a lonely and mysterious atmosphere of urban nightlife. Light comes from multiple directions, including indoor light from the display window, The diffused light from streetlights and the reflected light from vehicle taillights together form a complex and rich lighting system. The shadows are soft yet clear, and the overall atmosphere combines the hustle and bustle of a modern city with inner tranquility. It has a film-like grainy texture and slight noise, simulating the realism of amateur equipment. The tones are dark but rich in detail, highlighting the dramatic lighting of nighttime streets. Long-exposure technology captures moving trajectories, turning the traffic in the background into flowing light strips, enhancing the sense of time passing. The entire scene is full of cinematic feel and narrative tension, as if freezing a forgotten moment, conveying a detached yet authentic urban emotion",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
