        {
          "id": "krea2-c50657b2792386119ccb0443",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙窗边忧伤倚靠回眸",
          "prompt": "A red-haired woman leans against an old white window frame. She wears an off-white vintage-style long-sleeved dress with a knee-length hem and matching belt at the waist. The dress is adorned with black round buttons, with ruffles and a row of black pearl decorations at the cuffs. The overall look is elegant and classic. Her right hand gently rests on the window frame, fingers slightly apart, and her left hand naturally rests at her waist. On her wrist is a delicate silver diamond-studded bracelet, and on her feet are black high-heeled open-toe sandals. She stands with her legs crossed, her posture calm and confident. The color is a warm reddish-brown. Looking directly into the camera, the expression is slightly contemplative and melancholic. The background is a blurry city street outside the window, with faintly visible parked vehicles and distant building silhouettes. The edges of the window frames are mottled and old, paint peeling away, revealing wood grain and signs of time. Below the windowsill is a stone or concrete structure with relief patterns, heavily weathered on the surface, showing a mix of gray-white and light brown. The floor is made of dark wooden boards with obvious gaps and a rough texture. The entire composition uses a medium shot. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with the body slightly turned to the side and head looking back, creating visual guidance. Light softly streams in through the left window, illuminating the side profile and part of the skirt, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The rich layers of light and shadow create a tranquil yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, gray-brown, and black, harmoniously coordinating and unified, with a strong film texture and cinematic feel, as if a portrait was taken with an old 35mm film camera. The image has a slight graininess and slight overexposure, enhancing realism and a sense of era. The details are meticulously handled, showcasing an unintentional beauty found in everyday life. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and story-rich, as if capturing a fleeting inner monologue",
