        {
          "id": "krea2-630daefb7faaa679e20d5664",
          "alias": "单女红礼服高塔坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a Parisian balcony, wearing a bright red spaghetti strap gown with elegant design, slender shoulder straps, and delicate bow decorations on the chest. The skirt drapes naturally, showcasing graceful lines and adding softness and vitality. The background is a blurred cityscape of Paris, with the Eiffel Tower clearly visible in the distance. Towering into the clouds, surrounded by a typical Parisian architectural complex, with rooftops arranged in an orderly manner, sunlight softly streaming into the scene. The sky shows a faint gradient of blue and white, with light streaming from the right. The overall tone of the painting is warm and layered, with a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the painting, slightly turning to the side, guiding the viewer toward the Eiffel Tower on the right, creating a visual sense of extension. In the foreground is a black metal balcony railing and a vintage-style rattan chair, with clear details. This enhances the sense of realism in the space. The middle shot is the main subject, with vivid colors and a visual focal point. The background is blurred through shallow depth of field, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. The entire image presents a cinematic texture, as if taken with professional photography equipment, featuring a strong artistic atmosphere and romantic mood, while also capturing the momentary beauty of carefully dressed up daily life. The lighting is soft and natural, and the color saturation is moderate. It creates a visual experience that is both noble and elegant yet full of life's vitality; the camera captures a quiet and story-filled moment, allowing people to feel the stagnation of time and the flow of emotions",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
