        {
          "id": "krea2-48c9ca1c46ddbccb91310e60",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of an outdoor tennis court, wearing a white short-sleeved T-shirt and white sports underwear, wearing an army green baseball cap. Her expression is somewhat lazy and calm, leaning forward, hands resting on the crossbar of the tennis net, knees bent, right leg slightly extended forward, presenting a relaxed yet dynamic posture. She wears black-and-white sneakers and white long socks with black stripes, her left foot on the ground, her right foot gently resting under the net, her posture natural and dynamic. On her left wrist, she wears a small metal bracelet that adds a touch of detail. The overall look is simple and modern, blending street fashion with sporty style. In the foreground is a clearly visible tennis net, densely covered with black mesh and a white vertical strip that holds it in place. The edge of the wire is slightly worn, showing signs of use. The racket is placed at an angle on the ground, facing up, with a black frame printed with a white \"W\" logo. The handle is partially exposed, and next to it is a green decorative strip. The racket is placed casually and realistically, as if it has just been put down. The background is a typical outdoor tennis court, a dark green hard court. The ground is flat but shows slight signs of aging. In the distance, you can see the red running track, along with an open parking lot and sparse trees. Further away, a gray sky with thick clouds and soft and even lighting, the entire scene is shrouded in a cloudy atmosphere, with no intense sunlight or shadows, giving a sense of quiet, tranquility, and even a touch of melancholy. The composition uses medium shots. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, occupying the visual center. Her body forms an S-shaped curve, forming a smooth movement from head to foot that guides the gaze along her figure. At the same time, the tennis net serves as a foreground element, running horizontally across the frame, dividing space and enhancing the sense of layering. The distance between the figure and the net is moderate, highlighting the main subject while preserving environmental information, which extends to the tennis racket and the ground, forming a complete visual loop. The lighting and shadow are delicate, and the overall lighting is diffused. Without obvious directional light sources, the transitions between light and shadow between people and objects are smooth, with shadows almost invisible, creating a hazy, soft texture. The colors are mainly cool tones, with white, green, gray, and black as the primary palette. The tones are unified and harmonious, accented with green lines on tennis rackets and black patterns on socks, adding visual interest. The overall atmosphere combines everyday and artistic feel, as if captured with an old film camera, with slight graininess and fading effects. Like a youth image frozen by time, it is filled with nostalgia and tranquility. The proportions are nearly square, the composition balanced, combining everyday details with attention to photographic aesthetics, conveying a private mood of urban youth during a brief rest on the sports field. It is neither forced nor ostentatious, yet contains rich narrative potential.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
