        {
          "id": "krea2-926bee25878c6c725a94d4f4",
          "alias": "单女红高领衫市场冷淡拥抱",
          "prompt": "She wore a bright red turtleneck sweater with a fluffy, soft texture that showcased a warm knit texture and natural pleats. The sleeves were puff-up designs, with smooth and elastic lines, hugging the arm contours and slightly bulging at the elbows, creating a gentle curve. The hem tapered at the waistline, outlining a slender waistline. Paired with off-white high-waisted skinny pants, the surface features delicate vertical stripes. The material is smooth and elastic, hugging the leg lines and highlighting the proportions of her long legs. The overall color contrast of the clothing is striking, with red and white creating a strong visual impact, creating a fashionable atmosphere that blends vitality and elegance. The figures pose confidently and composedly, hands resting lightly at their waists, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, painted with light pink or transparent nail polish. On the ring finger of the right hand, a simple metal ring is worn to add detail and texture, gently fluttering in the breeze. The makeup is exquisite, with an expression slightly cold and mysterious. The earrings are gold round earrings, simple yet textured, set against a white wall. Three decorative paintings hang on the wall. The left painting mainly features colorful small flower patterns, with flowers in a rich range of colors—pink, yellow, blue, purple, and more—densely arranged and full of childlike fun and vitality. The frame is black, with the words \"FLOWER MARKET\" printed at the top, the middle painting as a pink background, and several white daisies on top. The petals are layered and orange-yellow, and the lower part is also printed with \"FLOWER MARKET.\" The painting on the right is visible. The pattern is a white abstract figure on a pink background, possibly letters or symbols. The overall style is unified and has a retro pop art vibe. In the lower left corner of the painting is a green plant with broad leaves and a natural shape, adorned with a white lily nearby. The shape is lifelike, as if extending from the wall, adding a natural touch. In the lower right corner is a corner of the gray fabric sofa, with a blue cushion on the sofa made of soft material and stitched edges. The overall spatial layout is compact and orderly, and the composition uses a mid-shot portrait style. The figure is center-left, occupying the main position in the frame. The head is slightly tilted, creating direct visual contact with the viewer. Light and shadow come from the front left, with soft and even lighting without obvious shadows, and the colors are highly saturated. The red sweater appears brighter under the light, while the white pants reflect a slight sheen, enhancing the material's realism. The overall atmosphere is warm and comfortable, combining the casual feel of daily life with carefully arranged artistic beauty. The image texture is close to that of a phone or regular camera, with slight noise and motion blur. Simulating real-life snapshot moments, it creates a friendly, natural, and effortless documentary style, with warm and bright tones, full of youthful energy and the independent temperament of modern urban women",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
