          "id": "krea2-34d1c590c03cb1327b3717e3",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣室内冷淡站立交叠",
          "prompt": "She wore a loose off-white knit cardigan with lace-trimmed shorts underneath, her legs crossed—right leg on top and left leg below—wearing light-colored high heels adorned with bows. The thin straps at her ankles were tied into delicate bows, and at her feet stood a pair of black high heels, creating a contrast between color and material. In the foreground, her crossed legs and high heels are clearly visible, including the subtle wrinkles on her stockings and the sheen of the heels. The center is her main body, from knees to upper body. In the background is a reddish-brown upright piano, with the keys faintly visible. Several lit candles are placed on the windowsill above the piano, casting a warm glow in the dim indoor environment. Faint, cool-toned light filters through the window, creating a contrast between light and dark. The entire space is enveloped by warm yellow candlelight and cool blue window light, creating a private and tranquil atmosphere. The composition adopts a slightly tilted perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The left side is left blank to highlight the character's emotions. At the same time, the piano and window lines guide the gaze toward the figure. Light and shadow shine diagonally from the right, mainly from natural light outside the window and candlelight from inside, creating a soft side lighting effect that enhances the sense of three-dimensionality. The light and shadow layers on the legs and hands are rich. The ground reflects faint light spots, blending the loneliness of modern urban life with the romantic vibe of classical music, presenting a scene that is both everyday and artistic. It resembles a real scene shot with an amateur camera, preserving everyday details and imperfect light and shadow textures. The visuals are full of narrative, evoking the inner world of solitude late at night, capturing a fleeting emotional outpouring with strong visual guidance and emotional resonance",
