        {
          "id": "krea2-40b0cce95f46024dc9080e49",
          "alias": "单女白内衣摄影棚媚态坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a chair framed with a black metal frame, her body slightly leaned back, head tilted to the right, her expression confident yet slightly seductive. Around her neck is a slender silver necklace necklace, and a sun-shaped tattoo is clearly visible at her collarbone. She wears a white lace bra with delicate and intricate lace patterns and delicate ruffled edges. She wears high-waisted white lace panties and white pantying with the brand's logo pattern. The pantyhose are lightweight and transparent, with clear texture. Her leg lines are smooth and graceful. On her feet are a pair of bright red high heels with thick and sturdy heels. The upper features a simple single-strap design that echoes the color of the jacket. She wears an open red blazer over it. The jacket is sharply tailored, with defined shoulder lines and naturally draped sleeves. The overall look is full of fashion and visual impact. Her left hand rests gently on her thigh, fingers are long and painted with light gray nail polish. On her ring finger is a simple silver ring, while her right hand naturally rests on the armrest of the chair. The pose is relaxed yet elegant. The background is a light gray wall, covered with numerous black object photos. The photos feature female models in various poses—some sideways, some leaning down—with diverse compositions and retro styles. The photos are arranged in a staggered manner, creating the atmosphere of an art studio or studio. The left side of the frame is lighted softly, shining from the upper left to create a bright main light, casting light shadows on the wall and floor. The right side is in relative darkness, with strong contrast of light and shadow, creating a sense of depth and layering The ground has a light gray cement texture, smooth and flat, reflecting a slight reflection. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The camera shoots at a slightly lower angle to emphasize the person's height and presence. The foreground shows the woman's lower body and part of the chair, the middle ground is her upper body and the background wall, the background is a blurred photo wall extending along the body's curve to the legs and shoes, and finally, the background photo draws you in, forming a circular visual flow. The overall atmosphere blends modern fashion, Sexy charm and artistic atmosphere, mainly in red, white, and gray tones with sharp contrasts: red represents passion and strength, white symbolizes purity and refinement, gray provides a calm tone, delicate light and shadow processing, natural transitions between light and dark, giving it the feel of a professional studio while retaining the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, as if capturing moments under the light with an old-fashioned film camera. The image details are rich and the texture clear, presenting an aesthetic style that is both refined and slightly casual. It has strong visual appeal and emotional expression.",
