          "id": "krea2-e081d30d6de9fb502e0209a0",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙室内媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a dimly lit indoor setting, her overall aura elegant yet slightly mysterious. She wears a black single-shoulder long-sleeve top made of finely shimmering particles that shimmer like stars under the light. The dress is designed with a diagonal shoulder, revealing one shoulder and collarbone. The long sleeves hug the arm contours, highlighting the beauty of her body's curves. She wears black lace underwear with a sheer sheer texture, edged with white lace trim, contrasting with the darker clothes. Her legs are long and straight, She wears a delicate gold bracelet or accessory around her ankle, adding a touch of delicate detail. Her hands are gently placed above her thighs, fingers naturally bent, her posture relaxed yet elegant. Her body is slightly tilted, and her head is slightly tilted, creating a dynamic visual balance. In the foreground, the main figure occupies most of the composition, fully visible from above the waist to the top of the head. In the middle is a dark wall behind the figure, matte black with a smooth surface without obvious texture. On the right, a vertical shadow line divides the image. The left background area reveals a blurred interior structure, including a light gray square area and local reflections from the wooden floor below. The floor is made of dark wood panels arranged together, presenting a warm brown tone that reflects faint light. In the depths of the background, the outlines of door frames or passageways can be faintly seen. The overall environment is simple yet layered. The composition uses a center-right position of the figure, using the lines of their bodies to guide the gaze to the left, while the contrast of light and shadow enhances the subject's presence. A large blank area is left on the left side of the frame. This creates a visual breathing space, enhancing the tension and narrative power of the image. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly low-illumination, with the light source coming from the left side in front of the figure, creating soft frontal illumination. At the same time, deep shadows are cast on the sides and behind the body, creating strong contrasts of light and dark and highlighting material details. The overall color scheme blends cool black and warm brown, with black dominating the entire image, creating a private, quiet, and slightly sexy atmosphere. The image has a high artistic and cinematic feel, resembling a carefully arranged fashionable portrait photography work, using professional photography equipment, such as full-frame cameras paired with large-aperture prime lenses, with well-handled background blur, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. The overall style blends modern fashion, sensual aesthetics, and artistic photography techniques, presenting a visual experience that is both everyday and surreal",
