        {
          "id": "krea2-61acc3387d54e5eed461c6b1",
          "alias": "单女透视白外套摄影棚忧伤站立交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the open space of a city rooftop, wearing a fluffy, soft white plush jacket covered with black polka dot patterns of various sizes, creating a dotted-dog visual effect. The jacket's material is layered and three-dimensional, with naturally curled edges that look warm and luxurious. Underneath, she wears a dark-colored tight top, paired with a high-waisted black leather mini skirt with a unique hem design featuring a high slit on one side revealing long, straight legs. She pairs it with black sheer stockings and pointed stiletto ankle boots. The boots are smooth and reflective, the heels are long and upright, and the overall look is full of fashion and sexy charm. The natural drape adds a dynamic touch. On her head is a black leather beret, which fits the contour of her head and exudes a retro vibe. The earrings are small, delicate metal earrings that sparkle slightly. She stands sideways, her body slightly tilted, arms crossed over her chest, exuding elegance and confidence. The background is the city skyline, with distant architectural outlines blurred and varying heights, the sky gray and heavy clouds. It presents the soft, diffused light unique to cloudy days, evenly illuminating the figures without obvious shadows, creating a quiet and steady atmosphere. The foreground features a gray cement floor with fine cracks and wear marks, edged with low concrete railings. The railing surface is rough but feels authentic. The composition uses a mid-angle portrait style, with the subject positioned slightly to the left of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The body is tilted in a diagonal pose, creating a smooth visual flow. The background is blurred to highlight the subject and enhance the sense of spatial depth. The overall color palette is dominated by black, white, and gray, with strong but harmonious color contrasts. Light and shadow distribution are natural, with even lighting and clear details. The atmosphere is tranquil yet slightly melancholic, resembling a tranquil moment before an urban night. It carries a strong modern urban style and artistic expression. The image texture is delicate and detailed, like a high-quality fashion photo shot in a professional studio, or like a real moment captured by a street photographer, showcasing an unintentional beauty and personal expression in everyday life",
