        {
          "id": "krea2-7591a87d7edafb611bcbd1c0",
          "alias": "单女灰西装公园忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a low stone wall in a park, wearing a loose long gray suit jacket over a black top underneath, smooth dark gray stockings, and silver pointed high heels. She sits gracefully sideways, legs naturally folded and extended—right leg in front and left behind, toes slightly touching the ground, showing off her long leg lines. Her expression is slightly contemplative and detached. The overall look is simple yet full of urban fashion. The main subject is on the right side, occupying about two-thirds of the visual space. The foreground features clear road surfaces and scattered yellow leaves; the middle features figures and stone walls; the background features dense green trees and distant blurred fences and building silhouettes. The trees are tall and upright, with thick trunks and clearly visible bark grain. The dense leaves are bright green, forming a lush tree-lined avenue with winding paths extending into the distance, creating a sense of depth. The composition uses diagonal lines, with diagonal lines extending from the lower left to the upper right composed of the figures' legs and the road, enhancing the dynamic and visual tension of the image. At the same time, the perspective principle of 'near is large, far is smaller' is used to make the figure the visual focal point, while the background gradually blurs to highlight the subject. The lighting is diffused from cloudy days, soft and even, with no obvious shadows. The tones are mainly gray, green, and black, with an overall cool tone, creating a peaceful, cool, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The light and shadow are delicate, the clothes wrinkle naturally, the stockings have a slight reflection, and the metallic sheen of high heels shimmers in the dim light. The details are rich, the environment is realistic, as if shot with a daily camera, with slight noise and motion blur. It presents a sense of everyday life, with a slightly overhead camera angle capturing the entire figure and their surroundings. The composition is full but not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space. The entire scene is filled with the atmosphere of modern urban life, combining fashion and everyday vibes. It feels both like a carefully arranged street shot and a real, unintentionally captured moment. The atmosphere is tranquil and intriguing, with clear color layers and delicate texture The transitions between light and shadow are natural, presenting a sophisticated realistic aesthetic",
