        {
          "id": "krea2-1f29188f73c2264686f4d41f",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙废墟忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside a dilapidated abandoned building, wearing a classic black long-sleeve polka-dot dress with white polka dots evenly distributed on dark fabric. The neckline is a simple white Peter Pan design, with long sleeves that hug the arm lines. The slim fit of the dress outlines elegant curves. She sits cross-legged on the rough concrete floor, wearing a pair of off-white low-heeled square-toe leather shoes. The smooth, delicate texture contrasts softly with the pure white stockings. The fabric is light and translucent, naturally fitting the leg shape. presenting a retro yet refined everyday style of everyday wear. Fingers slightly bent, a lazy posture tinged with contemplation, left hand naturally resting on the ground supporting the body, full of confidence and mystery. The background is a mottled, peeling wall, with large areas of wall veneer peeling off, revealing the underlying plaster and brick structures. Some areas still bear faded blue paint marks, forming abstract textured patterns. The wall is uneven, with interlaced light and shadow, creating a strong sense of age and desolation. The floor is covered with gravel, dust, and tiny debris. There are slight cracks and damage along the edges, giving the overall environment the characteristics of industrial ruins forgotten by time. The composition uses a mid-shot close-up of the figure, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, body slightly tilted. The ground details in the foreground and the layers of the wall in the background enhance the sense of spatial depth. Light enters diagonally from the left side of the painting, creating a soft side light effect and natural shadow transitions. The dark areas fall on the right side of the body and background wall, enhancing the contrast between light and shadow. The overall color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with a touch of blue and red The color scheme is restrained yet full of tension, the atmosphere is tranquil yet slightly melancholic, as if frozen in an abandoned moment. The image texture is delicate and lifelike, with professional studio-level image quality, while retaining a grainy texture and natural noise similar to amateur film cameras. The lens simulates a 35mm full-frame camera, uses a large-aperture prime lens, offers precise depth control, soft background blur, sharp and sharp subjects, and slightly shaky edges to enhance visual focus. Overall, it presents an artistic portrait style that combines retro aesthetics with modern fashion",
