        {
          "id": "krea2-c3f561be7ab3dee64e467fe7",
          "alias": "单女灰西装广场微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the stone steps outside a city building, wearing a gentle smile and exuding an elegant and approachable aura. She wears a gray blazer with white lace decorations on the collar and cuffs, paired with a white shirt underneath. She wears a matching short skirt paired with black stockings and black pointed high heels. Her ankles have metal buckles, her left hand resting naturally on her knee, her right hand lightly resting on her left, her posture dignified and relaxed. A small black chain bag is slung across her shoulder, giving the overall look a refined and professional feel. The background is the exterior wall of a modern urban building, paved with large blocks of gray granite tiles with fine speckled texture. Two square black-framed luminous light boxes are embedded on the wall, emitting a soft warm yellow glow that contrasts with the surrounding cool-toned stone. The stone steps are made of dark gray granite, with slightly rough edges and a natural grainy texture. The shadows between steps enhance the three-dimensional effect. The figure is positioned slightly to the right in the center of the frame, with a slightly turned body and a slight tilt of the head, creating a dynamic sense of balance. The composition uses a low-angle downward perspective, making the figures appear more upright, while highlighting the vertical lines and spatial depth of the building. The foreground features clear stone steps and leg details, the middle ground shows the character's entire body and part of the wall, and the background extends along with geometric structures in the distance. The visual guide line is formed by the diagonal lines of the stone steps and vertical lines on the wall, naturally directing the gaze toward the subject. Light comes from above, slightly to the left, forming a soft, diffused glow, with shadows concentrated on the right and below, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and realism. The overall atmosphere blends urban calmness with the gentleness of characters, presenting a subtle sense of fashion in daily life. It feels like real photos taken outdoors on cloudy days with a professional camera, offering a high degree of realism and a sense of life. The image details are rich, with gray, black, and white as the main tones, accented by warm yellow lighting. The tones are harmonious and unified, with strong texture expressiveness. From the roughness of stone to the smoothness of stockings, from fabric folds to metallic reflections, everything is clearly visible. The overall image is full of storytelling. Like a fleeting moment on a busy urban afternoon, she combines the professionalism of a professional woman with a gentle, approachable personal charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
