          "id": "krea2-3932a0907a3389f99460a201",
          "alias": "单女透视白高领衫城市沉思坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a white turtleneck knit cropped top and gold sequin shorts sits sideways on an off-white leather sofa. Her right hand gently lifts a beige double-breasted blazer, while her left hand hangs naturally, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her expression is slightly contemplative and lazy, as if whispering. Her legs are long and straight, wearing black sheer stockings and leopard-print pointed heels. Her right leg is crossed over her left, her ankle lines are graceful, her feet slightly leaned forward, and the heels are high, showcasing a woman's unique curves. On her right hand is a gold ring Her fingers are slender, and she wears a red bracelet on her left wrist, adding a touch of brightness. Her shoulders and arms are smooth, her body slightly leaned back, presenting a confident yet casual posture. The background is a lavishly decorated indoor space, with a crystal chandelier hanging from the ceiling. The warm and soft light emits a golden glow that illuminates the entire room. The curtains are made of deep brown thick fabric with delicate pleats, creating a classical and luxurious atmosphere. Behind the sofa is a red upholstered chair with embroidered patterns. Next to it is a gold-carved edge table with glass vases adorned with red roses, colorful packaging boxes, and some small items, creating a strong sense of life. The floor is paved with light-colored polished tiles, reflecting the surrounding light and shadow to create a mirrored effect that enhances the sense of space. On the right side of the foreground is a small marble coffee table with pink trays, metal cups, and some miscellaneous items. The details are rich, and the composition centers on the figure, using a medium shot, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame, extending from the lower left corner to the upper right corner. Diagonal guidance is formed, with the visual focus focused on the woman's posture and clothing coordination. Light comes from the pendant lamp above and possible auxiliary light sources. The overall lighting is even and layered, with warm tones as the main theme, creating a cozy, private, and slightly luxurious indoor atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, and it feels realistic for everyday photography. It feels as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the casualness and realism of everyday scenes. The background blur is well handled to highlight the subject while preserving environmental details. Overall, it presents a refined lifestyle of a modern urban woman, combining fashion and everyday appeal. The image style is realistic and artistically beautiful, like a carefully composed photographic work capturing moments of people in private spaces, conveying a temperament that combines independence, confidence, and elegance",
