        {
          "id": "krea2-9be0167bc30500fe68c8a6da",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣公寓困倦倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman leans lazily and gracefully on a white flat surface, wearing a light blue hollow-out knit cardigan with a lightweight, fluffy texture as soft as clouds, layered with a black silk camisole that creates a striking color contrast that adds a touch of natural softness and spontaneity. She tilts her head slightly, looking directly at the camera with a gentle yet slightly dreamy expression. Her other hand is naturally placed in front of her, and on her middle finger is a cleverly designed gold ring. Her makeup is delicate and exquisite, presenting a fresh yet sexy temperament. The composition uses a low-angle shot to highlight the character's three-dimensionality and visual impact. The background is a blurred city skyline, with towering skyscrapers and glass curtain walls reflecting the faint glow of the sky. The architectural silhouettes are blurred to present a soft blue-gray tone, creating a modern urban feel and spatial layering. The sky appears grayish-white. The lighting is even and soft, like diffused light on cloudy days or early mornings, allowing the transition of light and shadow to be natural. There is no strong contrast between light and dark, creating a quiet yet slightly distant atmosphere. In composition, the figure occupies a slightly lower left side of the frame, with bodies extending diagonally to the cityscape in the background, creating a smooth visual flow. The overall color scheme is mainly cool tones, with light blue, black, white, and gray forming a harmonious color scheme, accented with gold and green accessories, creating subtle visual highlights. The image has a high-resolution texture The details are rich, the woven structure of the garments is clearly visible, while retaining the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. It feels like an ordinary afternoon, casually captured with a phone or camera. It feels like a carefully planned fashion shoot while carrying a warm, everyday atmosphere, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
