        {
          "id": "krea2-b0e0f8ff13be173bbb5f273c",
          "alias": "单女空姐蓝制服机场冷淡站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a deep blue flight attendant uniform stands at the entrance to the aircraft cabin door, naturally draped over her shoulders. Her makeup is exquisite, her right hand gently resting on the edge of the door, her left hand slightly open in a guiding gesture. She wears a tailored deep blue blazer with red trim at the collar and cuffs, paired with a pink shirt and a black-and-white polka dot bow tie. She wears a matching pencil skirt with red stripes on the sides and black stockings. The overall look is professional and elegant, with a close-up of the aircraft cabin door in the foreground. The white door panels are marked with prominent red arrow markings and bilingual bilingual operation signs. The metal handles are clearly visible. The center features a female subject, positioned slightly to the center on the right side of the frame, her body slightly turned to the side, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The background is inside the aircraft cabin, where you can see the extended aisle, overhead overhead compartment, embedded lighting strips, and distant seat contours. The warm yellow lighting contrasts with cool white light, creating a warm and professional atmosphere. The composition combines close-up shots with figures in the middle ground. Using the hatch as a visual framework, the viewer's gaze is directed toward the central figure, while the sense of spatial depth presents the cabin environment. Visual guidance starts from the red arrow in the upper left corner, followed by the operation instructions board. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from the LED strip at the top of the cabin, softly illuminating the subject and ensuring natural shadow transitions. The cabin door area produces slight highlights due to reflections, while the background is slightly dimmer, creating a sense of layering. The overall atmosphere blends professional rigor with the approachability of the characters. It presents a scene that is both realistic and artistically beautiful, as if captured by a professional camera in a simulated real shooting environment. It has the texture of everyday amateur equipment, with blue, white, and red as the main colors, accented by pink and black. The tones are harmonious and unified, the image is delicate, detailed, and full of storytelling and immersion",
