        {
          "id": "krea2-8fa6e1efacb79c41ba36e47c",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服图书馆俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a bright mustard-yellow velvet armchair, wearing a deep blue pinstriped school uniform jacket layered with a white collared shirt and black vest. A bright burgundy velvet bow tie is tied around her chest, with a red badge embroidered above the left breast pocket. The overall look blends vintage collegiate style with modern fashion. Wearing transparent glasses, she exudes confidence and a touch of playfulness. Her hands rest naturally on her knees, and her fingers are painted with black nail polish. She wears a ring on her left ring finger and her right index finger. Her legs are crossed, and she wears a pair of high-cut white knit stockings with black letter stripes at the cuff. On her feet are black pointed stiletto heels, with cross-laces and metal fasteners on the upper, giving the impression of being both elegant and distinctive. The background is a dark green bookshelf neatly arranged with books of various colors. Below the shelves are several woven storage baskets, and the floor is covered with a colorful Persian-style carpet, mainly in reddish-brown tones. The floor is covered with complex geometric and floral patterns, with dark wood flooring. Light softly streams in from the left side of the frame, creating a natural transition of light and shadow on the figures, creating a warm and layered effect of light and shadow. The entire scene is composed from a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The curved lines of the chair contrast with the straight structure of the bookshelf. The visual guiding lines are formed by the characters' postures, gaze directions, and the vertical lines of the bookshelf, creating an overall atmosphere that blends academic atmosphere. The fashionable texture and vintage atmosphere present a refined, elegant, and story-filled visual experience, as if captured in a private study or library corner. Using professional photography equipment, it retains a natural and authentic texture. The images possess high artistic expression and narrative value, with harmonious color coordination, rich details, and delicate light and shadow handling, highlighting the subject's three-dimensionality and spatial depth, creating a tranquil and captivating atmosphere",
