        {
          "id": "krea2-a0fada03b1831c3d4d34173d",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫街道困倦站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the stone steps by the river, her posture upright and elegant. She wears a simple white sleeveless turtleneck knit sweater, paired with a black polka-dot pencil skirt that reaches her knees. The lines are smooth and hugged to her figure, and she wears black patent leather pointed high heels, paired with black stockings and long black gloves. Her right hand gently rests on the brim of her hat, while her left hand hangs naturally as she grips a beige trench coat. Her posture is calm and confident, her expression calm with a hint of coldness. Like fashionable women stepping out of Paris in the 1950s and 60s, the foreground is the rough stone riverbank, with weathered marks and fine cracks on the surface. Under sunlight, it displays a warm brownish-yellow hue. In the middle is a wide river, gently rippling and reflecting the blue sky and the outlines of bridges. Several wild ducks and seagulls leisurely swim in the water, some lowering their heads to forage, some quietly floating, the water reflecting shimmering light, adding a lively atmosphere. The background is a magnificent classical stone bridge, with the bridge body composed of multiple arched structures. On both sides of the deck are decorative railings and vintage street lamps. The bridge towers rise high, topped with golden spires, appearing solemn and elegant against the backdrop of blue skies and white clouds. In the distance, the outlines of city buildings and green trees can be seen. The composition uses a classic three-part layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the frame, occupying the visual center. The bridge spans the back of the frame, creating a strong sense of depth and spatial layering, with a slightly upward view. Highlighting the figure's upright posture and the majestic momentum of the bridge, light and shadow come from the upper right. The sunlight is bright and soft, casting clear and delicate shadows over the entire scene. The right side of the figure is illuminated by sunlight, while the left side is in a subtle shadow transition. The sky appears a clear pale blue, with a few white clouds drifting lightly. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, full of urban poetry and nostalgia. The tones are mainly blue, white, black, and brown, with sharp contrast and harmonious unity. The texture of the image is close to film photography, with slight graininess and natural exposure. It's as if you're shooting with an old-fashioned film camera in the afternoon, capturing fleeting elegance and timelessness, creating a visual aesthetic that is both real and dreamy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
