        {
          "id": "krea2-e603bfffb07364fd3c9c6978",
          "alias": "单女透视银连衣裙城市沉思坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a modern-style indoor wooden floor, wearing a silver sequined tight mini dress that shimmers with delicate metallic luster under the lights, outlining her graceful figure. She wears black sheer stockings, her legs smooth and long, and silver pointed high heels with smooth, reflective surfaces that give off a metallic feel. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her body slightly leaning forward, legs crossed, knees bent, right leg in front and left leg behind, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The background is a spacious and bright indoor space, with a floor paved with light wood grain. The walls and partitions are made of glass and white panels, reflecting the surrounding environment. In the distance, you can see the simple outlines of the furniture, including chairs and tables. Several modern-style chandeliers and recessed downlights are installed on the ceiling. It emits a soft, even warm white light, with light shining down from above and the sides, creating a natural transition of light and shadow on the figure. The shadowed areas enhance the sense of depth. The overall composition uses a centered composition, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The foreground features clear floor textures and the lower half of the figure, the middle ground shows the person's whole body and the movement of holding a phone, and the background is a blurred indoor space. The shallow depth of field effect highlights the subject. The visual guide lines are guided by the person's posture and gaze direction to the phone screen, creating a fashionable, sexy, and vibrant atmosphere full of everyday life. The images have a strong modern urban feel and feminine charm. The main color tones are silver-gray, black, off-white, and wood, with cool and warm tones intertwined, rich light and shadow layers, and clear details. Overall, it presents a high-quality professional studio-level imaging effect, while preserving the realistic scene of everyday phone selfies. It feels like a private moment shot in a luxury apartment or a stylish studio, with images full of tension and beauty, evoking a sense of confidence, elegance, and the power of self-expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
