        {
          "id": "krea2-2094466ab027ff63ec6932c8",
          "alias": "单女紫制服忧伤站立持伞",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the rain, wearing a light purple short-sleeved school uniform shirt with a black bow tied at the collar, a blue Thai school emblem embroidered on the chest, and white headphones hanging around her neck. She holds a transparent umbrella covered with fine raindrops, with a white curved handle. The right hand grips the handle, while the left hand hangs naturally. Her posture is upright and her makeup is delicate and natural, presenting an overall youthful and pure temperament. The background is blurred green vegetation and gray stone steps, with blurred effects that highlight the subject, creating a shallow depth of field effect and a symmetrical centered composition. The figure occupies the center of the frame, with soft and even lighting, scattered from cloudy days without obvious shadows. The overall color tone is cool, mainly white, light purple, and black, accented with a green background. The light and shadow layers are rich but not intense, creating a quiet yet slightly melancholic atmosphere, like a quiet moment on a rainy campus. It carries the realism of everyday amateur equipment, with clear details and natural textures, such as clothing folds, raindrop reflections, and headphone materials, all realistically felt. The overall image has a cinematic texture. The graininess and color fidelity of film photography convey a blend of youthful nostalgia and modern campus life, like a classic scene in an art film, full of poetry and storytelling, evoking emotional themes of waiting, memories, or farewells in the rain. The images present a highly realistic style while retaining artistic aesthetic pursuits, suitable for portraits, emotional expression, or campus-themed creations",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
