        {
          "id": "krea2-be8b93128532948e6b03caf7",
          "alias": "单女透视白衬衫摄影棚媚态倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman leans gracefully and confidently on a black leather armchair. She wears a white short-sleeved shirt and a black high-waisted skirt, paired with sheer stockings and black pointed high heels. Her overall look exudes the sharpness and sensuality of a professional woman, with soft wavy curls. She wears black slim-rimmed glasses, looks at the camera with a calm yet thought-provoking expression, leans slightly forward, hands gently resting on the edge of the armchair, and her left fingers painted bright yellow nail polish. Adding a touch of brightness to the overall color scheme, her right leg stands straight while her left leg bends and extends backward, forming a graceful S-shaped curve that highlights the long lines of her legs and the fit of the clothing. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the middle shot, occupying the visual center. The foreground features a black-and-white checkerboard floor with strong geometric symmetry and spatial extension. The floor reflects the reflections of the figures and furniture, enhancing the realism and three-dimensionality of the scene. In the middle shot, besides the figures and armchairs, Some black border decorative details can also be seen. The background is a beige wall with crocodile leather texture, delicate and layered. This material is both modern and slightly retro, subtly echoing the character's fashionable outfit. The composition uses a slightly upward angle to emphasize the character's height advantage and upright posture. The diagonal body lines break conventional vertical compositions to create a dynamic and balanced visual effect, while leg lines and floor patterns guide the gaze downward. Finally, it converged at the tip of the high heels, forming a clear visual flow. Light and shadow came from the soft light source on the left side of the frame, with uniform and soft lighting without strong shadows. The wrinkles on clothing and reflections from stockings were well handled, creating an overall atmosphere that was both professional and private, resembling a carefully arranged indoor studio setting. It resembles professional portraits and moments of daily life, with an image style leaning toward realistic shooting rather than excessive rendering, simulating the natural capture of indoor environments by amateur photographers using standard lenses. It retains slight noise and realistic color transitions to enhance the sense of presence and everyday life. The main color palette is black, white, and gray, accented with a beige background and yellow nails. The contrast is sharp yet not abrupt, presenting an overall aesthetic of tranquility, refinement, and a hint of allure",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
