        {
          "id": "krea2-c514f51455aab3fef86cba76",
          "alias": "单女棕短裙沙发微笑坐展示",
          "prompt": "An elegant and confident woman sits on a modern-style rattan outdoor armchair. She wears a black lace long-sleeved top paired with a black inner layer, a high-waisted brown leather skirt, and leopard-print pointed heels. Her legs are naturally crossed, she wears black fishnet stockings and a leopard-print silk scarf around her neck. Her overall look is fashionable and full of personality, with a radiant smile and a composed posture. Her left hand rests lightly on the armrest of the chair, while her right hand rests naturally on her leg, showcasing the independence and charm of a city woman. The foreground features lush greenery and gray slate floors; the middle is a spacious terrace space with simple outdoor furniture and greenery. The background is the New York Manhattan skyline, with the Empire State Building clearly visible. In the distance, skyscrapers stand tall, the sky is deep blue, dotted with a few white clouds. The sun is bright, and light streams diagonally from the right side of the painting, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on the figures and objects. The overall composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, forming a visual focal point, and the cityscape in the background serves as a backdrop. This enhances the sense of space and depth in the image. The view is slightly overlooked, creating a sense of superiority from above. The colors are mainly black, brown, and green, accented with leopard print patterns to create a strong visual contrast. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and bright, with the texture of natural daylight. The image presents a high-end fashion blockbuster feel, as if shot with professional photography equipment for commercial advertisements. It has a strong visual impact and artistic beauty, while still retaining the intimacy of daily life. The details are rich and the layers are distinct. The overall atmosphere is both luxurious and authentic, like a moment frozen in time by an urban woman enjoying tranquil moments on her private terrace.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
