        {
          "id": "krea2-21c05f5179b25cbc3fd32abe",
          "alias": "单女床温柔躲藏",
          "prompt": "Her hands gently held a string of gorgeous golden beaded veils, made of fine metal chains and shiny round and diamond-shaped gold pieces, edged with delicate floral decorations. Some gold pieces reflected a warm amber sheen in the light, creating a faint, hazy beauty. Her left arm was adorned with a wide gold bracelet, A fine metal chain is wrapped around her wrist, and a black sheer cuff peeks out from the outside of her right shoulder. The overall look blends exotic flair with modern fashion elements. The bedsheet beneath her is pure white and fluffy, with natural pleats. On the right side, you can see a light gray pillow, set against a background of heavy dark gray-brown curtains. The texture is fine, and the vertical pleated lines enhance the sense of depth in the space. Light gently pours in from the left side of the painting, creating a warm side backlight effect that sharpens the figure's outline. The golden jewelry sparkles under the light, emitting tiny glimmers. At the same time, the black fabric on the bedsheet casts geometric projections of orange-red and blue through interplay of light and shadow, as if refracting from a distant light source, adding a touch of surreal artistic atmosphere to the composition. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main subject, head slightly tilted, body forming an S-curve, and the gaze meeting the viewer directly, enhancing intimacy and visual guidance. The foreground features dynamic golden veils and arm movements, the middle ground features the torso and clothing details, and the background consists of tranquil curtains and beds, with clear layers and black tones Gold and white as the main tones, accented with warm yellow, orange-red, blue-violet, and other light and shadow accents. The overall atmosphere is both intimate and luxurious, blending classical Eastern charm with modern artistic flair. Like a carefully arranged indoor portrait photography piece, full of storytelling and emotional tension, it seems to capture a fleeting whisper in a quiet night. The lighting is soft and dramatic, the tone is delicate, and the texture is authentic, as if taken with professional photography equipment. It features slight film grain and natural depth blur, creating an immersive visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
