        {
          "id": "krea2-88ee9a2acae5dbf785997cc8",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙摄影棚俏皮倚靠持书",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans on a brown leather bench, wearing a delicate white tweed short-sleeved dress with a slim cut and shiny silver buttons, adorned with delicate white flowers at the neckline. The overall look exudes a blend of French romance and modern fashion. Her makeup is delicate and natural, her right hand gently holding a white rose stem, her left hand casually resting on her knee, her posture relaxed and full of confidence. Her legs are long and straight, her right leg slightly bent, and her left leg extended. On her feet are black thin-strap high-heeled sandals, with graceful ankle lines. The overall composition centers on the figure, forming a visual focal point. In the foreground are pink balloons scattered on the ground, some of which are stacked and some scattered, creating a relaxed and joyful atmosphere. In the middle is a female figure and the brown leather bench she sits on. The chair's surface has natural textures and slight wear marks, showing the texture of use. The background is a light gray tiled wall, neatly arranged with clear gaps. Above hangs a large cluster of dense pink balloons, arranged in a semicircle that extends from the top of the frame to the middle shot, forming a soft curved background that enhances spatial layering. The entire scene is shot from a low angle, making the characters appear taller and more prominent. The composition uses a triangular structure, with the figures, bench, and balloons forming a stable visual frame. The balloons' distribution also forms flowing curves, drawing attention toward the center. In terms of lighting, the main light source comes from the front slightly left. Delicate shadow transitions are created, with clear wrinkles on clothing. The balloon's surface reflects a soft sheen, presenting subtle light and shadow changes. The background wall receives less light, creating contrast and enhancing three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, with a touch of festive joy. The colors are mainly white, pink, and brown, harmoniously unified to create a visual experience that is both sophisticated and approachable. It feels like capturing a moment in a private and refined indoor space, with the texture of a professional studio. Yet it retains the authenticity of occasional daily recordings, with rich details and high-resolution image quality. The overall style combines the refinement of fashion magazine magazines with the warmth of everyday scenes, evoking a quiet and beautiful emotional flow",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
