        {
          "id": "krea2-57273e51064fa923a016da1d",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙乡村自信坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors on a yellow and white plaid picnic mat, wearing a sleeveless dress with gray-white floral patterns on a black background. The neckline features a traditional Chinese stand collar, the tight hem outlines elegant curves, paired with light gray stockings. The overall look blends Eastern classical charm with modern fashion. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center foreground, composed using the rule of thirds, with the figure occupying about one-third of the right side. The left side is reserved to showcase the environment, with vast expanses of blooming yellow wildflowers and lush green grass in the background. In the distance, tall trees form a deep green forest belt. The sky is a soft pale blue with white clouds. The light comes from the afternoon slanting sunlight, warm and bright. Light and shadow fall from the upper left, casting soft shadows on the picnic mat, creating a peaceful and comfortable atmosphere. In the distance, you can faintly see the silhouettes of other visitors, adding a sense of life. The entire scene is filled with the freshness and comfort of a summer countryside, with yellow, green, and blue as the main colors Black and white are accented with a striking yet harmonious unity. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains a natural sense of everyday life. It has a slight film graininess and realistic light and shadow details, presenting a visual experience that is both artistic and close to reality. The composition is balanced, with visual guidance extending from the foreground grid mat to the central figures, then leading to the background of flower fields and forests, creating a rich sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, like a carefully crafted urban pastoral portrait. It captures moments of harmonious coexistence between humans and nature, presenting a serene yet vibrant beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
          "_classification": {
