        {
          "id": "krea2-0561f80bbb5f925ecdb3d3fd",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫城市忧伤站立招手",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the open space of a city rooftop, standing tall and wearing a black beret with a slightly lowered brim, adding a touch of mystery and elegance. Her right hand is gently raised, fingers spread wide, as if waving to the camera. Her makeup is exquisite yet natural, and her overall aura is both fashionable and approachable. She wears a black polka dot turtleneck sweater with a white base, layered with a fluffy, soft white fleece coat. The jacket is also adorned with black polka dot patterns, cleverly echoing the inner layer. On the bottom, she wore a black high-waisted leather mini skirt with a hem that hugged the figure. The side slit revealed her long legs, paired with black stockings and a pair of pointed stiletto ankle boots. The high heels highlighted her slender, straight legs. The overall look was both retro and modern, full of urban modernity. In the foreground was a rough cement floor with slight wear and scattered water stains. At the edges, a black waterproof tape was visible, adding realism. In the middle frame was the main figure, positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, her body slightly turned to the side. The posture is naturally relaxed, with both hands hanging down naturally and the right hand raised as a gesture. The composition follows standard portrait proportions, with the figures occupying about two-thirds of the frame's height, leaving enough space to showcase the environment and atmosphere. The background features distant city buildings, with blurred outlines and gray-blue tones. The buildings are varied in height, featuring residential buildings, office buildings, and chimneys. The sky is covered with heavy clouds, presenting a gloomy gray-white. The lighting is soft and even, with no strong contrast between light and shadow, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and slightly melancholic. Then, through clothing details leading to the ground and background, it creates an atmosphere of urban loneliness combined with personal charm. The light and shadow come from diffused natural light, with soft shadows and clear outlines. The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, cool yet warm. The overall style resembles professional fashion photography, with a strong sense of artistry and cinematic quality, while retaining the authentic details of daily shooting. It feels like capturing moments outdoors on a cloudy day with a high-end camera. The images are delicate and layered, conveying an independent confidence. A calm and composed urban woman image",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
