        {
          "id": "krea2-714373dd0abcc08e46963037",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙城市自信站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor path paved with stone paving, wearing a vibrant red silk spaghetti strap dress with a unique design, featuring cross-tie decorations on the back. The hem is short and flowing, and the fabric shows a soft sheen and delicate pleats under the light, naturally draping over her shoulders. She leans slightly to the camera with an elegant and confident posture, one hand gently caressing the hem while the other hangs naturally. Her body leans slightly, showcasing graceful curves and dynamic beauty. In the foreground are black metal railings on both sides of the path. The railing is made of horizontal wooden strips, with natural grain and warm brown tones contrasting with the black metal. Inside the railing are neatly trimmed green shrubs with dense leaves and clear edges. The middle view features a stone road extending into the distance, with irregular gray stones joined together. Moss or soil traces can be seen in the gaps. Dense trees line the road, with dense canopies and lush branches and leaves, presenting varying shades of green. In the distance, the outlines of city buildings can be faintly seen. The sky shows a light blue gradient from dusk to warm yellow, with soft lighting. Sunlight slants down from the upper right of the image, creating a warm backlight effect that produces distinct contour light and highlights. At the same time, long shadows are cast on the ground and railings, with interlaced light and shadow enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and depth in the image. The composition uses a classic guide line technique, with a path as a visual guide extending from foreground to background. The viewer's gaze is directed toward the main figure, who is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The overall atmosphere blends the tranquility of urban gardens with the modern feel of fashion. The color scheme mainly features red, green, and gray, with the red dress as the visual centerpiece, creating a strong contrast with the surrounding environment and creating a powerful visual impact. At the same time, it preserves the realism and sense of life under natural light, as if it were a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, possessing cinematic texture and artistic expression. Yet it retains the warmth and authenticity of everyday life. The entire scene is full of romance, elegance, and vitality, radiating a gentle and confident charm, as if frozen in a perfect moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
