        {
          "id": "krea2-11488feac1ecfed23cde53e9",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜俏皮站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "Dressed in a black sleeveless, fitted cropped top and black stockings, her posture is natural and relaxed. Her hands gently touch her waist, and she stands slightly sideways, showing off her elegant curves. She wears sunglasses on her head and a simple watch on her wrist. The overall look is simple yet fashionable. The foreground is a clear pool surface, reflecting the figure's silhouette and surrounding scenery. The gentle ripples create delicate light and shadow textures. In the center, she is the female subject, positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, her body slightly tilted, her expression calm and confident, with several tall olive trees in the background. The trunks are thick and covered with the marks of time, with lush branches and lush greenery. In the distance, neatly trimmed lawns and white building walls can be seen. The sky is clear and cloudless, with bright sunshine. Light shines from the upper right, casting clear and soft shadows on the ground and the figures. The composition combines central symmetry with the rule of thirds, with the figures occupying the main visual focus. The pool's edge forms horizontal lines to guide the view, while trees and buildings form vertical elements to enhance the sense of spatial depth. Visual guidance is guided through the posture of the figures, The pool reflection and the direction of light and shadow are created together, creating bright and warm lighting that presents a realistic summer afternoon atmosphere. The colors are mainly black, white, blue, and green, with sharp contrasts yet harmonious unity. The overall image has a strong sense of realism and a sense of life, as if shot with a professional camera on a sunny day. The details are rich, texture is realistic, with slight lens distortion and realistic exposure effects, presenting the natural texture of everyday amateur equipment. The tone is slightly warm yellow, simulating the white balance of real cameras, and the edges of the frame have slight vignetting. It enhances the sense of presence, creating an overall calm and cozy atmosphere, filled with the relaxed and joyful mood of a summer vacation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
