        {
          "id": "krea2-55141bf9ecde46bddd2954dd",
          "alias": "单女泳装户外沉思站立出神",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways in a sun-dappled citrus orchard, her soft silhouette gazing into the distance, her expression calm and slightly contemplative, as if whispering softly or listening intently. Her overall posture is elegant and relaxed, her body slightly twisted to form a graceful S-shaped curve, highlighting her slender neck and smooth back curve. She wears a black-and-white striped tight-fitting one-piece swimsuit with a simple yet fashionable design, with thin straps outlining the graceful curve of her collarbones and shoulders, and stripes extending from her chest to her waist. The visual effect is regular and rhythmic. The swimsuit fits her figure, highlighting her well-proportioned figure. Her hands are naturally folded in front of her, fingers slender and her posture is natural. The background is a dense citrus tree with lush branches and leaves, lush and green. Orange-yellow citrus fruits hang heavily on the branches, appearing full and enticing under the sunlight. Some fruits glow warmly under the light, while the leaves gently sway in the breeze, creating a dynamic blur effect that creates a vibrant pastoral atmosphere. The shot uses shallow depth of field, with the foreground subject clear and sharp, rich in detail, and natural light and shadow transitions. In the middle of the scene, tree trunks and branches extend diagonally, guiding the gaze upward, while the background gradually blurs into soft green and yellow light spots, creating a beautiful bokeh effect. The composition is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the character, using the rule of thirds to create a balanced and dynamic composition. Light comes from the upper left, creating a soft backlight effect that enhances the sense of depth. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and bright, full of summer atmosphere, with a natural green tone The contrast between orange-yellow and black-and-white stripes is both fresh and stylish. The image presents the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting, as if captured by a regular camera outdoors under natural light, with slight noise and true color reproduction. The lens focal length is moderate, presenting an angle similar to a 35mm or 50mm prime lens. The image has a strong narrative and emotional resonance, evoking a poetic moment where tranquility, freedom, and nature blend together",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
