        {
          "id": "krea2-745b94efb51819304b7e6192",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a vintage red scooter, wearing a light blue puff-sleeve dress with small orange-red floral patterns. The neckline and cuffs are decorated with white lace trim, and she wears a white sheer petticoat with fluffy ruffle sleeves. The overall look exudes mid-20th-century vintage elegance, wearing an off-white wide-brimmed headband, delicate pearl earrings, delicate makeup, and transparent polka dot lace gloves on her right hand, with long fingers and a light left hand resting on the motorcycle handlebars. The body leans slightly, with an elegant and relaxed posture. The background is a blurred outdoor street scene, presenting soft warm tones. The outlines of trees and buildings are faintly visible, creating a hazy sense of depth. In the foreground is a classic Italian-style scooter, with a bright red body, a white fuel tank and fenders, green decorative stripes below the front, circular silver frames, orange turn signals on both sides, round chrome mirrors, and black rubber handlebars, smooth and vintage lines. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, and the motorcycle occupying the lower half of the frame, forming a stable visual focus. The camera is shot from a slightly overhead angle, with background blur treatment that strengthens the sense of separation between subject and environment. Light comes from above, softly and evenly casting on the subject, creating a delicate transition of light and shadow, creating a warm and layered sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is romantic and nostalgic, as if immersed in the afternoon sunlight of an Italian town. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, accented with orange and green. Visually, it is both retro and fresh, with a delicate texture and a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography and a slight lens halo effect, presenting the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting while retaining the refinement and beauty of artistic portraiture",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
