        {
          "id": "krea2-47f7e85749b296c670aae9d3",
          "alias": "单女透视空姐灰西装机场冷淡展示",
          "prompt": "A female flight attendant sat in a gray seat beside the airplane aisle. She wore a dark gray suit jacket and a matching short skirt, wearing a white shirt underneath with a blue and red silk scarf. A small badge was pinned to her neckline. Her overall look was professional and elegant, hands folded in front of her, fingers lightly touching the collar, posture dignified and composed. She wore black sheer stockings and black pointed high heels, her legs long and straight, with her right leg slightly crossed over her left. It showcases smooth leg lines and the confident aura of a professional woman. The foreground is from the mid-body to the feet, occupying the main position at the bottom of the frame. The composition centers on the person, using a low-angle downward angle to highlight her proportions and presence. The background is a typical airplane cabin environment: on the left are striped fabric curtains and seat backs, on the right are silver-gray luggage racks and cabin wall structures, with a red \"OPEN\" sign and emergency exit sign visible above, along with a control panel, handles, and safety reminder signs. The details are rich but not cluttered, with clear spatial layers. The middle shot is her seat and the surrounding corridor area. The floor has a deep brown wood texture, reflecting soft light and creating a sense of realism. The entire scene is bright and even, with cool white light from the cabin ceiling mixed with natural light. The transitions are natural, shadows soft, without strong contrasts, creating a quiet and professional atmosphere, presenting a realistic moment of daily aviation service, as if taken with an amateur camera, with a sense of life and a slight grainy texture. The tone is cool but still warm, emphasizing the combination of professional dignity and personal charm. The composition is compact and dynamic, extending along the body lines to the legs, and finally landing on the high heels, forming a coherent visual path. The overall image is full of modernity and ritual, showcasing both the rigor of aviation work and the individual's elegance and confidence. It is suitable for daily records of professional women or aviation-themed daily life. The images are rich in detail and the materials are authentic, including the sheen of stockings and the pleats of suits. The reflection of leather shoes and the texture of metal parts—all elements work together to create a highly realistic and artistically beautiful scene",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
