          "id": "krea2-fe2d53401eb902a2cbdb6d88",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙广场自信坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden chair by the window indoors, looking directly at the camera, wearing pale pink lipstick. Her expression carries a hint of calmness and gentleness. She wears a square-neck dress with a white base and small pink and purple floral patterns. The dress is designed in an off-shoulder style, with puffy puff sleeves at the shoulders and a pleated waist at the chest. A thin string is tied around the waist, and the skirt hangs naturally. The overall style is fresh and sweet with a hint of vintage charm. Her hands are folded on her legs, fingers are long, and her nails are neatly trimmed and painted with light-colored nail polish. On her left hand, she wears a transparent crystal bead bracelet, and on her right ring finger, a simple gold ring. Her body leans slightly forward, her posture elegant and composed. In the background is a large floor-to-ceiling window, and outside the window is a lush bamboo grove. The bamboo stands tall and upright, its leaves lush green, creating rich layers under the sunlight. The distant sky is a deep blue, and the light is bright. Through the glass window, it enters the room, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. Dark gray semi-transparent curtains hang by the window, partially blocking the light. This creates a soft and textured interior light. On the left side of the painting, another similar wooden chair can be seen, with a woven backrest and a darker color, echoing the foreground. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. A window serves as a natural frame, framing the figure to enhance the depth of the scene. The foreground highlights the main subject, the middle ground displays the interior environment and furniture details, and the background uses blur to highlight the natural atmosphere of the bamboo forest, creating a tranquil, A comfortable and aesthetically rich atmosphere, with light slanting in from the right side, creating a warm side glow that creates soft shadow transitions that enhance three-dimensionality and make the figure stand out. The overall color palette mainly uses white, green, and brown, paired with soft natural light, creating a fresh, artistic, and romantic visual experience. The image has a strong sense of realism, as if taken with a professional camera for high-quality photos, yet retains a casual and authentic everyday life, like capturing a beautiful moment on a leisurely afternoon The entire scene is filled with tranquil poetry and gentle everyday beauty. The alternating light and shadow reveal a subtle sense of nostalgia, evoking a sense of tranquility and comfort surrounded by sunlight",
