          "id": "krea2-e03873de631f5d97f892e2d1",
          "alias": "单女黑连体衣城市忧伤坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a soft white long-plush carpet, wearing a black bodysuit and black stockings, paired with black pointed flats. She drapes a beige plush hooded jacket over her head, gently pulls the collar with both hands, and gazes down at the camera. Her expression is slightly melancholic and contemplative, presenting an overall restrained and fragile beauty. The main figure is positioned slightly to the right of the foreground, leaning slightly forward, crossing her legs and knees bent, forming an elegant and contracted sitting posture. In the background are two off-white woven rattan chairs arranged symmetrically. The left chair is fully visible, while the right chair is partially hidden by the figure. The surface of the rattan chair has clear texture and delicate woven structure, showcasing the texture of handcrafted craftsmanship. On the right side is a small wooden round stool with natural wood grain and a vintage atmosphere. The wall is light gray-brown with fine texture and mottled marks. The floor is a smooth light gray cement floor reflecting soft light. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right of the frame. The rattan chair serves as a background element to balance the image, creating a sense of spatial layering. This extends to the overall posture. Light and shadow come from the front left, creating a soft side light that produces a warm golden tone. Shadows cast on the right wall and floor enhance the three-dimensional effect, while the carpet edges create a gradient transition. The atmosphere is tranquil and emotional, carrying a sense of privacy, laziness, and a slightly detached modern urban lifestyle. The overall color palette mainly consists of off-white, light gray, and black, accented with warm beige plush tones. The colors are harmonious and unified, with rich details. Including the fluffy texture of the plush jacket, the semi-transparent sheen of the stockings, the woven texture of the rattan chair, and the fiber details of the carpet, the image has a high-resolution photographic texture, as if shot by a professional camera, yet retains the casualness and realism of everyday life. Like a moment captured with amateur equipment, it conveys a quiet, lonely, and self-protective emotional state. The composition is stable, perspective is accurate, and the foreground and background are clearly separated, creating a visual experience that is both intimate and distant",
