        {
          "id": "krea2-01206eee7e4f710af863a3f6",
          "alias": "单女外套广场沉思坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the edge of a dark wooden desk, leaning slightly back against a wall covered with intricate Baroque patterned wallpaper. Her expression is calm and slightly lazy, with a hint of lazy allure. Her right hand rests gently on her thigh, while her left hand hangs naturally at her side. She wears a loose leopard-print plush jacket made of soft and fluffy material, presenting a warm brownish-yellow tone that echoes the vintage patterns in the background. She wears dark clothing underneath and black stockings, legs crossed and elegantly stretched out on the tabletop. On the feet are high-heeled black patent leather shoes with pointed toes. The heels are slender and have a noticeable reflective texture. The gold brand logo faintly appears on the toe area. On the desk sits a small handbag with a golden metal frame. The bag is square-shaped, featuring curved handles and zipper details. The bag surface is smooth and reflects the surrounding light. The desk is designed in a classical style, with a flat and smooth surface with carved edges. The legs are thick and sturdy, presenting a deep reddish-brown solid wood texture. On the table, there are also some paper or envelope items scattered around, with slightly curled edges adding a touch of everyday life. On the right side of the painting is a white door with simple frame lines. The door handle is made of round metal, and on the wall beside the door is a gold-framed power switch panel. The entire scene is set indoors, with light coming from the front right. Soft warm yellow light streams in from the side, with the direction of light and shadow aligned, creating a private and cozy atmosphere. The wallpaper on the background wall is off-white as the background. Printed with symmetrical complex floral and swirling patterns, the patterns are repeatedly arranged, rich in layering and decoration. The overall color tone leans toward warmth, mainly brownish-yellow, off-white, and dark brown, with harmonious and unified colors. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned near the center on the left side of the canvas, occupying the main visual focus. The body posture is relaxed, with legs extended to the right, forming dynamic diagonal lines guiding the view. The desk serves as the foreground element, stabilizing the composition with its horizontal lines. The door and wall in the background form a deep space. This enhances the sense of space and three-dimensionality in the image, presenting an overall vibe that is both vintage and elegant yet modern, as if captured with an old-fashioned film camera. It features slight graininess and natural exposure control, moderate color saturation, soft contrast, rich details, and natural light and shadow transitions, creating a private, lazy, and story-filled atmosphere, like a quiet scene in a movie, capturing the real state of the characters relaxing at home. The overall image has strong visual appeal, combining artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life",
