          "id": "krea2-f1add8416f6f1834da8e20c1",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙酒店媚态坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a luxurious indoor staircase, her expression calm yet slightly seductive. Her overall aura is elegant and modern. She wears a fitted purple high-neck, long-sleeve dress with delicate pleats and sheen, hugging her curves and showcasing a graceful silhouette. The hem of the dress falls to mid-thigh, revealing her long legs. She pairs it with black stockings and black pointed stiletto heels. The heels are slender, and the ankles have metal buckles. Her right leg is bent and raised, her left leg straight, her right hand gently resting on the steps, and her left hand hanging naturally The posture is relaxed yet full of tension, with the body slightly leaning forward and the head slightly tilted, presenting a lazy yet confident posture. The staircase is made of dark stone with a fine grained texture. Each step edge is embedded with slender LED light strips, emitting a warm golden glow that illuminates the entire space. The light projects upward from below the steps, creating a soft transition of light and shadow that creates a luxurious and intimate atmosphere. The stair railing is made of black metal with vintage carved designs, smooth lines contrasting with the white walls The walls have simple decorative lines, and the ceiling is illuminated by warm lighting. The light reflects off the walls and staircase surfaces, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame. The stairs extend diagonally, guiding the gaze upward and inward, creating a strong visual direction. The foreground features clear figures and some steps, the middle ground features more steps and lighting, and the background features details of the wall and ceiling above the stairs. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with strong contrast between light and shadow. Golden lighting contrasts sharply with dark materials, creating an overall atmosphere that is warm, luxurious, mysterious, and modern. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, with slight film graininess and natural noise, simulating the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. It feels like capturing a fleeting moment in a nighttime scene of a high-end hotel or private residence. The images are full of storytelling and artistry, with warm yellow and purple tones as the main tones, accented by black and white, creating a harmonious visual unity where the characters and environment become one. presenting a beauty that is both real and surreal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
