        {
          "id": "krea2-c1797f036a7c6b794b4ab1fb",
          "alias": "单女咖啡厅坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a red wooden booth in a café, wearing a black lace long-sleeve top with off-shoulder straps, a white embroidered pattern on the chest, and a small Christmas wreath with a red bow. In the foreground is a reddish-brown wood-grain tabletop with a carefully plated meal, including a golden burger. Filled with fresh lettuce, tomato slices, and rich cheese, served with a small portion of fries and a few sliced cherry tomatoes. The edge of the plate is garnished with green herbs, and next to it is a white paper cup printed with \"Y.Y COFFEE SHOP,\" with a lid covered with transparent plastic film. The center is the café's interior, with a gray cement background wall, handwritten in white chalk with words like \"summer flowers\" and \"leaves.\" Vintage-style chandeliers hang on the wall. It emits a warm, soft yellow light. On the right side hangs a menu poster displaying illustrations of burgers, tacos, and snacks along with Chinese descriptions. In the distance, you can see air conditioning units, festive decorations, and some blurry shelf displays. The overall composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with figures in the center. Through the foreground tableware, food, and figures, visual guidance creates a strong sense of subjectivity and the sense of life. The lighting and shadow are mainly warm tones, emphasizing three-dimensionality, while soft shadows are cast on the tabletop to enhance spatial layering. The background lighting is relatively soft. This makes the subject stand out more, and the overall image presents an atmosphere that combines fashion and artistic flair in everyday life, as if shot by a regular phone or entry-level camera. It features slight noise and natural color saturation, rich in details without deliberate embellishment, creating a realistic and cozy street café scene that conveys a relaxed and pleasant afternoon atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
