        {
          "id": "krea2-b27dfde46d7bea0c59555f56",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜家中媚态躺交叠",
          "prompt": "Elegantly reclining on the gray fabric sofa, she gently holds a glass of deep red wine in her right hand, her left hand naturally resting on the armrest, legs crossed, right leg stretched forward, left leg bent. Her long, beautiful legs, wrapped in black stockings, look especially charming under the interplay of purple and blue lighting. At her feet, a pair of black patent leather high heels casually rest on the light wooden floor. The heels are slender, the smooth, reflective upper. In the background, the sofa backrest is placed with a pink heart-shaped throw pillow and an off-white knit cushion. On the wall hangs an abstract art painting, with a cool tone. Mainly blue and purple, it creates a tranquil atmosphere reminiscent of modern urban nightlife. The interior lighting is soft and layered, with a warm yellow beam shining from the left side, forming a bright halo on the wall that contrasts with the overall cool tones and highlights the character's silhouette. The light and shadow blend to create a delicate transition of light and shadow. The composition uses low-angle shots to highlight the sensuality and composure of the figure's posture. The visual guide extends from the high heels in the foreground to the character's legs, finally converging on the wine glass in her hand, forming a smooth visual path, carrying a touch of laziness and confidence, the overall image is full of fashion and privacy, as if capturing an elegant moment of solitude late at night. The details are rich, colors harmonious, and it exudes a strong cinematic texture and a sense of everyday life, like high-quality portraits taken with a professional camera in a home setting, showcasing an aesthetic style that is both everyday and surreal",
