        {
          "id": "krea2-3f28fc1ec7ca347a2dbfdca7",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙广场冷淡倚靠跳舞",
          "prompt": "She wears a black off-shoulder mini skirt with wide, flare-shaped sleeves, black stockings featuring polka dots, and black high heels. Her posture is elegant and full of tension, her body slightly leaning forward, arms spread like wings, head lowered, exuding a sense of tranquility and strength within movement. In the foreground are neatly arranged gray granite pillars, each with a rough surface and clear grain, and some pillars show slight wear marks on the tops. The stone pillars are connected by black metal railings, forming a path that guides the view. In the middle is a wide paved plaza, with the ground paved with light gray square tiles. Moss grows between the tiles, showing traces of time. In the distance, several parked cars and a classical-style streetlight can be seen. The lamp shades are made of glass, reflecting the hazy light from the gray sky. The background is a modern urban architectural complex, including multi-story office and residential buildings. The facades mainly feature glass curtain walls and concrete structures, with clean lines. Some buildings have antennas or equipment on top, with a uniform grayish-white sky and heavy clouds. The light is soft and diffuse without obvious shadows, creating a unique cold and austere atmosphere on cloudy days. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, making the figures appear taller and more prominent. The figures are positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The diagonal lines of the stone pillars and railings guide the viewer's gaze from the foreground to the middle and background, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. In terms of light and shadow, the overall lighting is naturally diffused, coming from above and in front. This makes the figures and stone pillars receive even light but lacks strong contrast. The shadows are thin and the tone is cool, mainly gray, black, and white, accented with a touch of metallic sheen and polka dot details on the stockings. The color saturation is low, presenting a visual effect that blends documentary realism with artistry. The entire scene conveys a sense of urban loneliness and surreal poetry, as if capturing a fleeting dance movement. It contains traces of daily life and a transcendent fantasy color, possessing strong visual impact and emotional appeal. Similar to high-quality fashion shots taken outdoors on cloudy days with professional cameras, the film preserves the authentic texture and randomness of street photography. The lens focuses on the relationship between the characters' actions and the environment, emphasizing spatial layout and dynamic balance. The images have clear layers, from nearby stone pillars to distant architectural clusters, each element serves to create the overall atmosphere. The details are rich, the light and shadow are delicate, the composition rigorous, presenting an artistic style that is calm and restrained yet full of inner tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
