        {
          "id": "krea2-0ee6909f3a5cf3fe22275a2f",
          "alias": "单女制服阳台沉思跪",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a Japanese collegiate school uniform, a white long-sleeved shirt paired with a deep blue sleeveless tank dress, a red bow tie tied on her chest, and a school badge with a badge on her left chest. She sat on a stone railing, her body slightly turned to the side, hands folded on her knees, her expression gentle yet slightly contemplative. On the right side was a balcony and railing, and in the foreground bloomed blooming pink flowers, which looked vibrant and vibrant in the sunlight. The middle shot is the green area between the figures and the building, while the distant view is a clear blue sky and architectural silhouette. The composition uses a three-part method, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the frame, forming the visual focal point. Light and shadow come from the left front, while the shadowed areas are soft, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly white, deep blue, and red, accented with pink flowers and beige buildings. The colors are harmonious and unified. The image has a strong Japanese portrait style, presenting the tranquility and beauty of a youthful campus. Professional photography equipment was used for shooting. The lens is an 85mm prime lens with an aperture of f/1.8, shutter speed of 1/200 second, ISO 100, capturing the soft natural light of early morning or afternoon. The image is rich in detail and delicate texture, with clear clothing folds and obvious background blur, highlighting the subject. The image layers are distinct and deep, and the overall atmosphere is warm, romantic, and full of youthful energy, as if capturing a quiet and beautiful moment",
