        {
          "id": "krea2-e38efc6d9d86f14abbfb485b",
          "alias": "单女紫连衣裙城市冷淡坐展示",
          "prompt": "She wears a light purple fitted short-sleeve dress with multiple round hollowed-out decorations on the chest and waist, showcasing a refined sense of fashion. The hem edges feature delicate tassel details, paired with semi-transparent light gray stockings printed with repeated white triangular patterns. On her feet are silver sequin high-heeled sandals inlaid with intricate crystal decorations that sparkle softly under the light. Her makeup is exquisite, and her left hand rests gently on her knee. Her right hand rests naturally on the sofa armrest, her posture relaxed yet dignified. On the small round table beside her sits a silver metallic handbag, adorned with the brand's signature metal chain and clasp. The overall design is luxurious and modern. The background is a simple light gray wall with smooth textures, creating a minimalist sense of space. Two fluffy white plush cushions stacked behind the sofa are soft and heavy, creating a warm contrast with the figures. The lighting throughout the scene is soft and even. Natural light or soft lighting from the front side creates natural shadow transitions. The main color tones are light purple, white, and silver, creating a cool and sophisticated visual atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, body slightly tilted, while the right side is left to display the handbag and leg lines, creating visual balance. The small round table and handbag on the left side of the foreground serve as decorative elements, enhancing the scene's realism and sense of life. The middle shot is the main subject and sofa area, occupying the main part of the frame. The background is clean and sharp, highlighting the main subject. The overall image presents a serene, elegant, and slightly detached image of a modern urban woman, as if it were an unintentional daily record in a private space, or like a carefully arranged fashion portrait. The light and shadow are delicate, layered and harmonious, with strong visual appeal and artistic expression. Shot with a professional camera, high resolution, 8K quality, realistic details, soft ambient light, low contrast, neutral tones, indoor scenes, and everyday outfits, Non-commercial advertising style, slight film graininess, simulates amateur photography equipment, with slight noise and dynamic range limitations, strong realism, quiet and restrained atmosphere, and subtle emotional expression, suitable for fashion lifestyle content creation",
