        {
          "id": "krea2-8221440641695b7703300aa0",
          "alias": "单女灰外套城市俏皮行走侧头",
          "prompt": "She slightly tilts her head toward the camera, showing a natural, soft pink hue, appearing both gentle and playful. She wears a long gray tweed coat with a loose cut, a black lapel, and a black V-neck knit sweater underneath. The fabric is delicate and layered, and the cuffs reveal a black shirt sleeve, adorned with three black buttons, with exquisite details. In her right hand, she holds an iced coffee, with a light brown drink in a transparent plastic cup, topped with a white milk cap and a white straw. Her fingers are painted bright red nail polish, contrasting sharply with her black clothes. Her left hand carries a large black nylon tote bag, with a smooth surface featuring a metal zipper and silver snap buttons. The lines are clean and sharp, giving the overall look a stylish and urban feel. She wears gold hoop earrings and a slender gold necklace, simple yet refined. The background is a building with a classical style, with facades made of light gray stone, decorated with exquisite reliefs and columnar structures. The balcony railings are designed with wrought iron, presenting elegant curved patterns. In the distance, blurred green trees and a soft sky can be seen. Light comes from above, the warm yellow sunlight of evening, penetrating the clouds and casting soft outline light on the figures. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space, heads slightly tilted, bodies angled 45 degrees toward the camera. It creates an atmosphere that is both intimate and distant. The perspective is slightly lower, enhancing the visual tension of the figures. The foreground features rough stone railings with clear textures and slightly worn edges, adding realism and a sense of life. The middle ground is the main subject and parts of the building, while the background gradually blurs to highlight the main subject. The colors are mainly gray, black, and brown, paired with warm sunlight tones to create a contrast of cool and warm. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, blending Japanese art with modern urban elements. The visual texture resembles professional camera shooting. Yet it retains the casualness and realism of daily life, with delicate light and shadow and natural noise. It's like capturing twilight with a full-frame camera like the Canon R5 or Sony A7R4. The lens focal length is about 85mm, aperture f/2.8, shutter speed 1/125 sec, ISO 200, capturing a moment of relaxation and composure. The image has strong narrative and emotional appeal, as if telling a gentle story about a city stroll or afternoon rest, full of poetry and warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
