        {
          "id": "krea2-18c6405bd3e679e8ab8279f7",
          "alias": "单女棕连衣裙酒廊冷淡站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully reclines on a green metal outdoor lounge chair, wearing a deep brown knitted long dress paired with a white silk scarf and red strappy high heels, her posture relaxed yet composed. Beside her is a simple white handbag, and her legs stretch out on another identical green lounge chair, creating a visually layered composition. In the foreground is a ground paved with fine gravel, sunlight casting clear shadows on the chair. In the middle is a tranquil pond, shimmering and reflecting the sky and distant fountains. At the center of the fountain stands a classical sculpture, with water jets shooting upward, shimmering in the sunlight. Scattered tourists sit on the shore resting, set against the backdrop of a typical Parisian architectural complex. Dense green trees surround the building and the pond, with blue skies and white clouds scattered throughout. The light is soft and warm, presenting the golden hues unique to afternoon sunlight. The overall shot uses a film-like texture with moderate color saturation. With a slight graininess and vintage tones, the camera focuses on the figure, the background naturally blurs, creating a shallow depth of field effect. The composition centers on the figure, using diagonal lines to enhance dynamism. The green lounge chair and brown skirt create a warm and cool contrast, echoing the greenery and architectural tones in the background. The view then turns to the city skyline, forming a smooth visual path. The light and shadow are evenly distributed, with side and backlight outlining the figure's outline, making the subject stand out more. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, romantic, and full of urban poetry. It seems to capture a moment slowed down by time, like a snapshot of life taken by chance, taken on a summer afternoon in Paris with an old film camera. It carries a strong sense of realism and artistic beauty, with rich but not chaotic details, harmonious tones, and a sense of leisure, refinement, and a touch of nostalgia",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
