        {
          "id": "krea2-00731de25cc29dfa26546241",
          "alias": "单女黑西装广场冷淡坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a black wide-shoulder blazer sits elegantly on the hood of a vintage classic off-white sedan, her makeup exquisite. Her right hand gently holds a small white square bag, while her left hand rests casually on the car. Her posture is calm and expressive, her legs crossed, wearing black stockings and black pointed high heels. Her ankle lines are smooth, and the overall look is simple yet sophisticated, presenting a blend of urban fashion and retro aesthetics. The silver chrome grille and round headlights are clearly visible, and the front is marked with the words \"BONNEVILLE.\" The license plate has a red background with white letters reading \"NEW MEXICO BONE-65,\" rich in details and a sense of age. The smooth surface of the car reflects the surrounding environment and sky, with the middle ground combining the female subject and the vehicle. The figure occupies the center slightly to the right of the frame, slightly tilted and facing the camera head, forming a visual focal point. Reflecting a blurred street scene and tree outlines, the steps are paved with gray stone bricks with clear layers. The composition uses the classic three-part layout, with figures and vehicles forming a stable triangular structure that guides the gaze from the lower left corner to the upper right. At the same time, the front lines and architectural columns create a sense of depth. Light comes from above, creating delicate shadow transitions and highlight reflections, highlighting the texture of materials—such as the pleats of suits, the sheen of stockings, and the cool sharpness of metal. The atmosphere blends vintage nostalgia with modern fashion. It feels like a carefully planned commercial photography event while also carrying the realism of everyday street photography, as if captured by a professional camera in the afternoon sunlight. The colors are mainly black, white, and off-white, accented with deep brown and metallic silver. The contrast is strong yet harmonious, presenting an artistic style that blends sophistication with everyday life, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
