        {
          "id": "krea2-14805c7118cf8f6ffa5a7dad",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣乡村微笑站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in an outdoor rural setting, smiling gently and looking directly at the camera, exuding a natural and friendly aura that adds a touch of liveliness and spontaneity. She wears a gray short-sleeved knit cardigan with delicate twisted knit patterns. The puff sleeves are vintage and elegant, with a white bow button on the front front. The hem is tapered to reveal a slender waistline, and underneath, light-colored clothing is subtly visible. The bottom is paired with dark gray high-waisted wide-leg pants. The pants are simple and neat, giving the overall look a fresh, artistic, and layered look. Her right hand gently rests on a small white square bag. The bag has a smooth texture and is adorned with gold bit clasp ornaments. The shoulder strap is white, slung across the body, and her hand posture is naturally relaxed. Her fingers are long and neatly trimmed. The background is a wide green lawn, the grass glowing with a soft yellow-green sheen in the sunlight. In the distance, a white wooden fence stretches across the background. The fence has simple lines extending horizontally, showing slight signs of age. Some wooden boards are slightly weathered and mottled. Behind the fence is a dense forest with thick foliage. The display is a shade of green with interlaced light and shadow, creating a tranquil and profound atmosphere. On the right side of the painting, part of a sheep's body can be faintly seen, bowing its head to grazing grass leaves, its posture serene, adding a pastoral touch to the scene. The composition centers on the figure, using a medium shot, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame. The line of sight is level with a background blending solid and void. The foreground features the figure and a nearby white fence, the middle ground is the lawn and the lower body of the person, and the background is the forest behind the fence and the outline of distant mountains, forming a stable and harmonious triangular structure. The light comes from the front left, representing the warm afternoon sun. The soft side light outlines the figures, with delicate shadow transitions. The overall tone is warm and yellowish, with moderate saturation and a quiet, cozy atmosphere, as if capturing a leisurely afternoon time, full of life and poetic beauty. The photography style resembles everyday handheld camera shooting, with slight film graininess and natural exposure. Colors are faithfully reproduced, details are rich, and the images have a strong sense of immersion and storytelling, as if recording an ordinary yet beautiful moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
