        {
          "id": "krea2-3f408d1f80af740e14b1ed82",
          "alias": "单女白外套雪地忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a snowy forest, wearing a thick off-white wool coat made of soft and fluffy texture, featuring a wide lapel and pockets. A matching belt tie at her waist gives off a warm and elegant look, draping smoothly over her shoulders and adding a touch of liveliness and gentleness. The color is fresh and soft, perfectly complementing the overall winter atmosphere. Around her neck is a thick knit scarf with a blue-green gradient pattern, with clear patterns. The colors transition from deep blue to emerald green, rich in layers, with fringed decorations along the edges that add a warm texture to the composition. She gently supports the tree trunk with both hands, her fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, looking directly into the camera, presenting a calm yet slightly melancholic expression. Her body is slightly tilted to one side, head slightly tilted, posture natural and relaxed, as if in a dialogue with nature. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, occupying the visual focal point. In the foreground is a sturdy pine trunk, with rough bark and clear grain, covered with mottled brown and gray cracks. A small amount of moss clings to the surface, showing traces of time. The right side of the trunk is partially obscured by figures, forming a natural obstruction relationship that enhances the sense of spatial depth. The background is a pine forest covered with thick snow, dense needles and lush branches and leaves. Some branches are bent by snow, giving them elegant shapes. Distant trees gradually blur, creating a blurred depth effect, creating a sense of distant space. The ground is covered with pure white snow, with smooth snow layers, occasional footprints or wind marks reflecting soft light. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure occupies the center of the composition, with the tree trunk serving as a vertical guiding line, enhancing visual stability and creating strong visual guidance. The pine branches in the foreground extend diagonally from the upper left into the frame, forming a natural frame structure that frames the main subject, increasing the sense of layering and compositional integrity of the composition. The light and shadow come from diffused light on cloudy days, creating uniform and soft light without strong shadows. The overall color palette is mainly cool, including white, blue, green, and brown, but the warm tones of the figures' clothing and scarves create subtle contrasts, balancing the chilly winter atmosphere. It creates a scene that is both cool and warm. The overall image presents a tranquil, poetic, and slightly artistic winter aesthetic, as if frozen by time, full of storytelling and emotional tension. Shot with an 85mm prime lens simulating the high-resolution detail of medium format cameras, the image has a slight film grain texture that enhances realism and artistic atmosphere. The overall style is similar to Japanese photographer Nobuyoshi Araki's photographic aesthetics, emphasizing intimate interaction and emotional expression between humans and nature, with moderate color saturation. Preserving realistic light and shadow details, highlighting the texture and warmth of the material, creating a dreamlike winter fairy tale scene",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
