        {
          "id": "krea2-46b9968c33268fdc61d688bb",
          "alias": "单女绿连衣裙室内自信坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a vintage-style indoor setting, wearing a light green plaid spaghetti strap dress paired with an off-white loose knit cardigan. Her makeup is elegant, exuding a calm and confident aura. She wears a pearl necklace and white earrings, showing taste in every detail. Her right hand rests lightly on a brown woven handbag beside her, while her left hand hangs naturally, her posture relaxed and composed. Her body leans slightly back against the wall, legs naturally extended, wearing bright yellow sandals with graceful ankle lines. The main focus is on this woman, whose contours are clear. In the foreground is a floor carpeted with geometric patterns, mainly blue-gray, beige, and orange-brown, presenting a vintage parquet design with delicate texture. The woven handbag is located in the lower left corner of the frame, with a clear rattan texture showing a natural brown tone. The center is where the woman sits, and the background is a light beige wooden wainscoting. Vertical lines add depth to the space. The upper wall is decorated with vintage wallpaper featuring bird and floral motifs, outlined in gray-black lines, giving it an elegant style. Above the painting hangs a beautifully mounted oil painting, framed in a golden carved wood. The artwork features still lifes and flowers, rich in color but slightly blurred, creating a strong artistic atmosphere. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with figures centered to form a visual focal point. The composition is balanced left and right, with a carpet and handbag in the foreground, figures and wainscoting in the middle ground, The background wallpaper and oil painting progress step by step, enhancing the spatial sense of three-dimensionality and depth. The visual guide leads from the woven package in the foreground to the figures, then extends to the decorative paintings in the background, forming a natural path for the line of sight. Light enters diagonally from the left side of the image, simulating natural light and dark effects and creating a soft transition between light and dark. The subtle shadows highlight the three-dimensionality, and the subtle light and shadow changes on the carpet and floor enhance realism. The overall light and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with tones mainly warm yellow, off-white, and light green, creating a nostalgic The warm and slightly artistic indoor scene features a texture close to everyday amateur camera photography, with a slight film graininess and a tendency for warm color saturation, as if capturing a tranquil moment of afternoon sunlight streaming into the room. The overall image presents a unique aesthetic that blends everyday life, artistry, and fashion, full of storytelling and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
