        {
          "id": "krea2-24bac3ceaa07b7bdd02922db",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市媚态倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a black satin V-neck long-sleeve dress leans elegantly against the metal railing. She turns sideways to look back at the camera, her left hand gently supporting her waist, while her right hand hangs naturally as she grips a small black clutch. Her tall figure is perfectly showcased through the fitted dress, which cuts down to mid-thigh. Paired with black stockings and pointed high heels, her long legs are crossed, one foot on the floor, and the other gracefully resting on the railing, presenting a powerful pose. In the foreground, gray floor tiles with diamond-shaped anti-slip patterns and silver stainless steel railings are simple and modern. The middle is a beige exterior facade, with details such as air conditioning units, drainage pipes, and windows on the walls. The background is lush green trees and parked vehicles in the distance. The sky is gray-blue, with thick clouds that emit a hint of light. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward view to highlight the figure's upright posture and presence. The figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, creating an asymmetrical visual balance, with light and shadow coming from the upper left. A soft transition of light and shadow is formed, with shadows falling on the left side of the figure and the floor, creating a sense of depth and authenticity. The overall atmosphere combines urban fashion with intimate sensuality. The color palette is mainly black, gray, and brown, accented with green and metallic sheen, presenting a sophisticated yet restrained visual aesthetic. Like a street fashion shoot taken at dusk with a professional camera, the lighting is delicate and natural, color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and layers are distinct, possessing strong artistic expression and emotional appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
