        {
          "id": "krea2-7c3879396e8ee5fc56d59b9a",
          "alias": "单女白外套城市忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a light-colored bench in the corner of the room. She wears an off-white tweed short jacket over a white turtleneck sweater, black lace mesh tights, and off-white knee-high boots with stiletto heels and zippers. The overall look blends vintage and modern elements. She wears an off-white quilted beret, gazing down at her phone, her fingers lightly touching the screen, her expression focused and slightly contemplative. Her left hand wears a black lace glove with a lace detail, while her right hand holds her phone. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly turned to the left side of the frame, head lowered, creating a quiet and intimate atmosphere. Beside her is a beige coat, casually draped on a bench, naturally pleated. Next to her is a low white cabinet with a green tray on top, holding two white paper cups and a small card. In the background, a black down jacket hangs against the wall, made of a fluffy and heavy material. The wall is light gray with a delicate texture, and the floor is a smooth light gray reflecting soft light. The entire space is simple yet restrained, The composition adopts a slightly top-down perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, forming the visual focus. The right side leaves space to display environmental details. The composition presents a layered blend of close-up and medium scenes. The foreground highlights the characters' clothing and movement details, while the middle ground shows everyday elements such as chairs, clothing, and desktop items. The background is made up of walls and hanging clothes to create a minimalist space. Light and shadow come from the upper right of the frame, creating a soft and even light and dark transition, with light shadows lightly cast on the legs and the ground. It creates a sense of spatial depth, with the overall color scheme mainly off-white, light gray, and black. The colors are harmonious and unified, creating a quiet, detached yet everyday atmosphere, as if capturing a brief moment of solitude in a corner of the city. The images have a strong documentary style, like real life clips shot with a regular camera, rich in details but not forced, presenting an unintentional beauty and the everyday fashion aesthetics of urban youth, emphasizing the interactive relationship between people and technology, while also using clothing coordination, Accessory selection and environment arrangement convey a personalized fashion attitude. The composition is balanced yet dynamic, lines are smooth, character postures are natural, and the scenes feel authentic and believable. The overall visual effect combines artistry with a sense of everyday life, evoking a gentle yet slightly melancholic urban mood",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
