        {
          "id": "krea2-5780d1185e7c026707bbe9b0",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤街道俏皮坐交叠",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle downward view, a woman sits on a lamp post on a city street. She wears a black vertical striped camisole jumpsuit, presenting a naturally fluffy and dynamic pose. Her right hand hangs naturally by her leg, with a simple ring on her finger. Her head is slightly tilted back, her expression relaxed yet slightly lazy, exuding a relaxed and carefree urban lifestyle. In the foreground, the woman occupies most of the space, her body slightly tilted, legs crossed—one resting on the lamppost and the other bent, forming a dynamic S-shaped curve. The middle ground depicts the urban street environment, including parts of a black car's body and wheels. The front is visible, with white building exteriors nearby. The windows are clearly visible, and the background is a clear blue sky. The sun is in the upper left corner, emitting dazzling light and creating a strong backlight effect. In the sky, there is also a red STOP traffic sign hanging diagonally from a lamp post, adding a touch of urban element to the image. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to emphasize the character's height and aura, while elongating the leg lines. This makes the overall visual impact more impactful. The figures are positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving space on the left to display the sky and buildings, creating an asymmetrical yet balanced composition. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and lively, with intense sunlight shining down from above, creating a sense of depth and enhancing the layering and dreamlike feel of the image. The overall color palette is mainly blue, white, and black, accented with red traffic signs. The color contrast is vivid and harmonious, and the image texture is close to everyday amateur photography, with a slight film graininess and natural exposure transitions. It feels like capturing a real-life moment casually captured with a phone or portable camera, capturing a moment of freedom and comfort on urban streets, full of youthful energy and fashionable atmosphere. The images show no obvious artificial touch-ups, preserving natural light and shadow changes and environmental details, allowing people to feel authentic life scenes and emotional expressions",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
