        {
          "id": "krea2-e8955d9b7844550251be2a2b",
          "alias": "单女米外套花园微笑坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench in a Chinese garden, naturally draped over her shoulders, adding a touch of laziness and gentleness. She wears a pair of vintage round metal fine-framed glasses, the lenses reflecting soft light and slightly open, revealing a mysterious smile. She wears a colorful strapless top with patterns resembling abstract landscape or oil painting styles, blending gradients of green, orange, and brown, layered with a light beige loose sheer jacket with puffy sleeves and a light, flowing material. She wears a pair of dark brown, high-waisted, slim-fit pants, giving the overall look a mix of modernity and Eastern charm. Her left hand gently holds a string of pale green jadeite beads, round and smooth, with a green tassel tied at the end. Her right hand holds a white paper fan, the fan surface spreading out into a semicircle, with the ribs clearly visible. Her posture is elegant and composed, with her body slightly tilted to the side and head slightly forward, creating an intimate yet slightly distant atmosphere. The foreground is the main figure, occupying the center right of the frame, and the composition uses the rule of thirds. The figure is positioned on the right one-third of the way, leaving space on the left to display the environment. The background features dense green trees and a faintly visible pond surface. Layers of leaves form rich green layers, some branches and leaves gently swaying in the wind. The background is blurred, presenting a soft bokeh effect. In the distance, the eaves of traditional buildings are faintly visible. Wooden railings stretch across the canvas, carved with delicate geometric patterns. The lines are smooth and the texture warm. Light and shadow slanting down from above create soft natural light, with shadows transitioning naturally The overall color scheme is dominated by green and earth tones, creating a tranquil and tranquil atmosphere. The images have a strong artistic and cinematic feel, as if captured from a quiet moment in an art film. Shot with professional equipment, such as full-frame cameras paired with large-aperture prime lenses, capture exquisite details and depth control. The images present a grainy texture similar to film and slight exposure overflow, enhancing realism and nostalgia. The overall atmosphere is quiet, elegant, and poetic, like a portrait where classical and modern blend together. Filled with storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
