        {
          "id": "krea2-163089f89139deda58efbd65",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙乡村冷淡坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors on a rock, wearing a white lace dress that is light and flowing, featuring delicate ruffle trim and fine pleats. The straps are slender, giving the whole style a sweet and fresh vibe, presenting a gentle Japanese vibe. She wears a light yellow straw hat with a wide brim and slightly rough edges, adorned with green stripes that add a touch of countryside. She holds a sliced bright red watermelon, its color bright and bright. The flesh is plump, the kernels are clearly visible, and the green skin contrasts sharply with the red flesh. She leans slightly, full of innocence and joy. The background is a blurred natural landscape: lush green vegetation, dense branches and leaves, sunlight filtering through the leaves, casting dappled light and shadow, creating a soft, hazy atmosphere. In the distance, faint rocks and shrubs are visible, layered but blurred to highlight the main figure. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, body slightly tilted, head slightly raised, creating visual interaction with the viewer The foreground features a rough texture on the rock surface with clear texture and gray-brown color, partially covered by shadows to enhance three-dimensionality. The middle ground features figures and watermelons, with vivid colors and rich details, becoming the focal point of the composition. The background mainly features large areas of green tones, with shallow depth of field effects to achieve blur, making the subject stand out more. Light comes from above at an angle, simulating natural daylight, soft and warm, creating delicate transitions between highlights and shadows. The direction of light and shadow is clear, enhancing the spatial sense and realism of the image. The overall color palette is white, green, Red is the main color, paired with natural warm yellow tones, creating a cool, tranquil, and pleasant summer atmosphere. The image has a strong film texture, moderate color saturation, and well-preserved details, presenting a realistic feel reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting. It feels like a vintage camera capturing moments of life. The overall image is clean and pure, free from unnecessary elements, balanced composition, and natural visual guidance, conveying a relaxed, joyful, and nature-inspired lifestyle aesthetic, suitable for expressing themes of youth, beauty, and innocence. It lets you feel the leisurely moments and simple happiness of a summer afternoon.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
