        {
          "id": "krea2-d16db9a88463b06fa943ae46",
          "alias": "单女全裸制服机场微笑坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A flight attendant dressed in an American Airlines uniform sits in the rear cabinet of the aircraft cabin. She wears a blue-and-white plaid short-sleeved shirt and a dark blue short skirt, with a dark blue silk scarf tied around her neck, a work badge on her chest, a multi-layered bracelet on her left wrist, smiling directly at the camera, holding a transparent plastic cup filled with yellow liquid in her right hand, her posture relaxed and confident, legs crossed, right leg draped over left, nude stockings and black pointed high heels, her ankles graceful, and the background is a typical airplane galley area. Several gray metal storage cabinets are neatly arranged. Some cabinet doors open to reveal orange cloth bags, blue storage boxes, bottled beverages, food packaging, and other items inside. Above them are silver-gray metal shelves and control panels. On the right side, you can see a white emergency exit sign with the red characters \"EXIT.\" The overall environment presents a realistic scene of aviation service work. The composition centers on the figure, using a medium perspective with the figure occupying the main position. The foreground is clearly layered, with the foreground showing the figure and the cup in her hand. The center frame features lockers and various equipment, with the background showing the cabin structure and details further away, extending to the surrounding environment. The light comes from inside the cabin, uniform and soft, with a cool tone. The metallic gray-white tones contrast with the blue-and-white plaid patterns on the characters' clothing, creating a professional, authentic, and slightly lifelike work atmosphere. The images have the realism of everyday amateur equipment, rich in detail, natural color reproduction, without excessive beautification or artistic processing, as if capturing real work moments It showcases the relaxed moments of flight attendants during breaks in flight. The overall visuals are both professional and approachable, conveying warmth and vitality in the ordinary",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
