        {
          "id": "krea2-fa19347fbae3f7999169cae6",
          "alias": "单女银泳装街道沉思倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a silver tape bikini top and black low-rise bikini pants, paired with black high-heeled pointed shoes adorned with metal studs. Her right hand grips the motorcycle handlebars, while her left hand hangs naturally at her side. She wears a minimalist bracelet on her wrist, leans slightly forward, and presents a confident and charming posture. The overall look is visually striking. The motorcycle features a classic Italian design, with a smooth, reflective body in a vivid orange-red hue. The front features round headlights and chrome bumpers, and the seat is made of black leather. Under the rear seat hangs a bunch of keys, with the words \"LOWRIDER\" printed on the bike. The background is a blurred outdoor environment, with faint green trees and gray ground. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center. The motorcycle extends from the lower left to the upper right to form a diagonal line, guiding the gaze through the main body and creating a strong sense of movement and spatial depth. Light comes from the upper right, creating soft natural illumination that creates delicate highlights on the skin and motorcycle surface. The shadowed sections transition naturally, and the overall atmosphere blends the lively summer street vibe with retro fashion. The tones are vivid yet harmonious, details are rich, and the layers of light and shadow are distinct. The images have a strong cinematic and photographic feel, as if taken by a professional photographer using medium format cameras on a sunny day, while preserving the realism and spontaneity of everyday snapshots, presenting a unique visual experience between artistic creation and authentic documentation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
