        {
          "id": "krea2-a6ce3ea2a9cfb8f250976e3b",
          "alias": "单女灰西装城市自信站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, naturally arched and flowing, looking directly at the camera and wearing bright red lipstick, appearing sexy and commanding. She wears a light gray double-breasted blazer, tailored but slightly loose. The V-neck design reveals the upper edge of the black bra underneath. The jacket's sleeves are wide, slightly rolled up, and the hem reaches the mid-thigh, creating a visual effect of a shorts suit. The waistline is smooth, and the overall look is fashionable and avant-garde, full of modern urban vibe. Her legs are long, She wore a pair of shiny mesh over-the-knee socks, their surfaces covered with fine silver sequins that reflected dazzling light under the lights. The cuffs were edged in black, clinging closely to the curve of her legs, completely covering the foot, making it impossible to see the details of the shoes. Her right hand rested gently at her waist, while her left hand naturally hung at her side. Her posture was confident and composed, with a slight turn to the side, revealing a graceful silhouette. In the background was a light beige curtain, soft in texture with subtle wrinkles and textures, and a string of tiny warm yellow LED lights hung along the edge of the curtain The lighting is soft and warm, creating a cozy and romantic atmosphere. On the right is a pure white wall, simple and clean; on the left is a deep blue suede sofa with delicate and soft material, with obvious indentations and light and shadow changes. The sofa's backrest is visible, with deep and heavy colors that contrast sharply with the figures' light-colored clothing. The floor is covered with a white plush carpet, fluffy and soft with irregular edges, creating a layered effect with the dark sofa. The overall composition centers on the figure, using vertical composition, with the figure occupying the main position. From head to feet, the entire view is presented, with well-distributed background elements. The foreground features the main subject, the middle ground includes the sofa, carpet, and some curtains, while the background is the space behind the wall and curtains. Light comes from the left side of the front, soft and even, with natural transitions of shadows without strong contrast. The overall atmosphere is warm and comfortable, blending fashion with a sense of everyday life. The color palette is mainly gray, white, and black, accented with red lipstick and gold lighting. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, with delicate light and shadow treatment highlighting texture and detail. The overall image presents a portrait style that reflects carefully dressed daily life, as if taken at home as a personal portrait. It is authentic and natural, yet artistically beautiful, with strong visual impact and emotional appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
