        {
          "id": "krea2-7e71e694c22aef97d0ba6e86",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫城市冷淡站立戏水",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the riverbank, wearing a white sleeveless turtleneck top and a black polka-dot skirt, paired with black stockings and shiny patent leather pointed high heels. She holds a camel coat in her left hand and lets her right hand hang naturally, striking an elegant and confident posture. Her makeup is delicate and natural, and her earrings are simple and understated. The overall look exudes a fashionable vibe of a retro urban woman. The bridge is built from white stone, structurally symmetrical, featuring multiple arched arches. The towers rise high, topped with golden spires, and the railings are adorned with classical-style street lamps. The details of the bridge are rich, showcasing a strong sense of history and architectural beauty. The river is a deep blue-green hue, with fine ripples on the surface, reflecting the sky, bridge, and surrounding scenery. Several grayish-white ducks or seagulls float on the water, swimming or resting, adding a sense of life to the scene. The sky is deep blue, and a few white clouds float lightly. Sunlight slanted in from the right, forming a warm golden halo that illuminates the outlines of figures and the sides of the bridge. The strong contrast of light and shadow creates a clear transition between light and dark. The ground is a riverside walkway paved with light gray stone slabs, with slight wear marks along the edges, giving it a realistic and rustic appearance. The composition uses a central perspective method, with the figures as the visual focal point and the bridge as a guide for depth, guiding the gaze into the distance and creating a strong sense of layering and spatial extension. The colors are mainly cool tones, such as blue, gray, and black. It creates a tranquil yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the natural feel of daily life. The lighting is soft and directional, shadows are sharp, and details are rich, presenting a high-end photographic aesthetic effect. At the same time, it retains the authenticity and warmth of life, like a traveler encountering an afternoon by the Seine River in Paris, capturing this story-filled urban landscape",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
