        {
          "id": "krea2-2fd218846bb014da905148b0",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙家中害羞坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a classic-style blue velvet sofa, wearing an elegant black satin off-shoulder mini dress. The dress is tailored to fit her figure, with a cinched waist and pleated design. The hem of the skirt spreads out in an A-shape, and the material glows softly under the light, appearing noble and refined. She slightly lowers her head, her expression focused yet slightly shy. Her right hand gently tugs at the black thin pantycoons on her right leg, while her left hand supports the hem of the skirt. Her movements are natural and smooth, presenting a private yet everyday moment. She wears a string of pearl bracelets on her wrist and a delicate pearl necklace around her neck, forming a classic contrast with the black dress. On her feet are black pointed high heels, the smooth, reflective upper surfaces complementing the pantycoons and dress. The sofa has a vintage carved wooden frame, with exquisitely carved armrests and backrests. The fabric has a deep blue base with fine white polka dot patterns. Several cushions are casually placed on the sofa, two orange, and two dark brown. The color contrast is vivid and harmonious, with a light beige wall as the background On the wall hangs an oval mirror with a golden frame. The intricately carved frame reflects part of the interior scene. On the right side is a window fitted with blinds, from which soft natural light filters in. Light filters through the blinds to form strips of light and shadow, falling onto the floor and figures. The floor is covered with herringbone wood with clear grain and warm colors. The overall environment presents a cozy, elegant, and slightly nostalgic home atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, slightly tilted. The gaze is directed to her leg movements, creating a focal point. In the foreground is her lower body and the pantyhose she is adjusting; in the middle is her upper body and sofa; in the background are walls, mirrors, and windows. The layers are clear and the sense of space is strong. The light mainly comes from the natural light from the right window, which is side lighting, while the other side creates soft shadows that enhance the sense of depth. Meanwhile, warm yellow lighting supplements the light source, making the overall tone warmer and the transition of light and shadow natural, creating a quiet and intimate atmosphere. It seems to capture a gentle, unintentional moment in daily life. The image texture is delicate and rich, with the feel of authentic photography—like a professional camera capturing a life portrait in a home setting. The image is full of storytelling and emotional warmth, presenting a sense of understated luxury and genuine intimacy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
