        {
          "id": "krea2-830ab37dcb1755d776b41ebd",
          "alias": "单女全裸西装街道坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden chair on a vintage-style balcony, her makeup exquisite, her expression calm and slightly lazy. Her left hand rests naturally on the chair back, her right hand resting on her leg, her body slightly leaning to the side, her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears a short blazer made of light green tweed, with black suede patchwork at the collar and cuffs, neatly arranged gold round buttons, and a black dress underneath. Her legs are clad in nude-colored stockings with fine dark polka dot patterns. Her right leg is bent, her left leg straight, and her foot is not in the frame. Beside him is a small round wooden table with clear wood grain. On the table sits a coffee paper cup with a white plastic lid, printed with a \"%\" mark. Next to it is a brown leather handbag, simple and elegant in shape, with the strap hanging naturally. The gray-white stone wall has a rough texture and shows signs of age. In the distance, you can see the balcony and greenery of another building. Sunlight slants from the right, creating a soft and warm light. The overall composition uses a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The small table and handbag form the foreground elements, enhancing spatial layering. The background building and railing extend a sense of depth, with a clear contrast of light and shadow. The warm yellow tones dominate, creating a peaceful and pleasant afternoon atmosphere. The tones are harmonious and unified, with rich details, giving the realism of casual daily photography. It feels like a street shot captured with a phone or portable camera, full of life and fashionable style. The overall composition presents a blend of retro and modern urban aesthetics. The characters' expressions are natural, the scenes are realistic, the transitions of light and shadow are delicate, the composition is balanced, and the design extends to the background buildings, creating a smooth flow of sightlines. The color scheme is fresh and elegant, with the green coat and brown bag creating a contrasting yet harmonious effect, creating an overall warm and comfortable atmosphere rich in storytelling",
