        {
          "id": "krea2-374fa84043c8cc74b42a250e",
          "alias": "单女橙西装办公室媚态坐书写",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in an office chair, exuding an elegant and slightly professional aura. She wears a light orange blazer over a black-and-white striped corset, black stockings and shiny black high heels. Her legs are crossed, her posture dignified yet slightly provocative. Her left hand rests gently on the wooden desk, while her right hand gently rests on the edge of her thigh, creating an atmosphere that is both professional and sexy. In the foreground is a close-up of her body and legs, clearly showing the texture of the stockings and the sheen of her high heels. In the middle is her brown leather office chair and part of the desktop. On the desk sits a tablet tablet with a blurry application screen, and next to it is a brochure printed with Japanese text and a map. The background is a typical office environment, including a light wood partition, blue-green Japanese posters hanging on the back wall, and faintly visible office furniture and greenery in the distance. The composition uses a slightly low-angle frontal view, placing the figure slightly to the left of the center of the frame, creating a sense of visual flow. Light comes from the front and sides, softly and evenly illuminating the subject, creating a bright and warm indoor atmosphere. The shadows transition naturally, with the overall color scheme dominated by warm tones. Black stockings and high heels create a strong contrast, enhancing visual tension. The image feels realistic to everyday amateur equipment, rich in details without excessive sharpening, retaining slight noise and natural light and shadow layers, as if capturing a real moment casually with a camera on an ordinary weekday afternoon. The entire scene presents a unique beauty woven with the refinement and privacy of urban professional women, combining professional rigor with personal charm. The atmosphere is warm yet stylish, as if you can hear keyboard typing and distant colleagues' whispers. Time stands still at that moment, and only the subtle communication between her and the camera unfolds silently",
