        {
          "id": "krea2-0c3fb5ccf9fa63119cb2ad38",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫街道冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a blue mailbox at the intersection of Fifth Avenue and East 41st Street in New York. She wears a black turtleneck sweater and deep blue wide-leg pants, black platform ankle boots, a brown beret, and sunglasses. Her posture lazily and confidently gazes at the sky, her left hand gently resting on her knee, her right hand naturally hanging down, her body slightly leaning back, presenting a casual yet fashionable street style. In the foreground is a huge blue metal post office with distinct rivet decorations and the U.S. Postal emblem. The top edge of the mailbox is clearly visible, creating a strong visual focal point. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, placing the person slightly to the right center of the frame to emphasize their central status. The mailbox is used as a foreground frame element to enhance spatial layering. The middle scene shows a busy city street, with a yellow taxi driving on a crosswalk with a \"T\" logo on the body. Next to it is a white bus with the words \"New York City\" on its body, and other vehicles weaving through the street. Including black SUVs and sedans, with clearly visible traffic signals and crosswalks. The background is a typical New York city skyline, filled with skyscrapers. Within it, you can see the classical architectural style of the New York Public Library, featuring white stone columns and arched porches. In the distance, modern skyscrapers like the Empire State Building can be faintly seen. The sky appears light blue with a slight mist, soft and bright light, reflecting the natural light of daytime. The overall atmosphere is full of urban energy and modernity, with natural lighting effects, and sunlight streaming down from the upper left. Shadows are soft and consistent in direction, with blue, black, and yellow as the main color tones. The blue mailbox echoes the sky, and the yellow taxi becomes a visual highlight. The overall tone is cool but warm, and the composition has a strong sense of depth and perspective. The street signs at the intersection \"Fifth Ave\" and \"East 41st St\" are clearly marked, adding realism to the scene. The image presents a lifestyle yet artistic street photography style, as if taken with a professional camera in high-resolution photos, rich in detail. The texture is authentic, combining the atmosphere of daily life with the exquisite beauty of a magazine cover. The camera feels strong, as if using a large-aperture prime lens, with a well-balanced background blur that highlights the main character and email. The overall image is full of storytelling and emotional tension, showcasing the self-expression and unique charm of urban women in the bustling metropolis",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
