        {
          "id": "krea2-bb521722b231101c624f223b",
          "alias": "单女灰西装冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits under the hood of a white vintage convertible, wearing a gray pinstripe suit with a neat and slightly loose fit. Her jacket features a double-breasted design, a belt made of the same material at the waist, and the pants are cropped straight-leg pants. Her posture is relaxed yet full of tension, with the main subject positioned slightly to the right of the foreground. Occupying the visual center, the background is a typical urban street, flanked by multi-story residential buildings. The exterior walls are mainly blue and beige, with neatly arranged windows. Some windows emit warm yellow light, creating an atmosphere of evening or dusk. Several cars are parked on the street, with a black SUV and a motorcycle faintly visible, adding realism and a sense of life to the scene. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, enhancing the aura and presence of the characters. At the same time, the vehicle and buildings present a sense of perspective and extension in the image. The body lines are smooth, the front grille is prominent, and the paint reflects a soft glow in dim light. The middle ground shows streets and parked vehicles, while the background features distant buildings and sparse trees. The sky is deep blue with a slight twilight gradation. In terms of lighting, the main light source comes from the left, possibly streetlights or street lamps. This creates a distinct side lighting effect, while the other side is in shadow, creating a strong contrast between light and dark. The car's surface also has delicate reflections. The overall atmosphere blends urban coldness, fashionable avant-garde, and a touch of nostalgic retro vibe. The tones are cool, but the warm colors accented by lipstick and background lighting create visual balance. The texture of the image resembles film photography, with slight graininess and color fading, reminiscent of street portraits shot with vintage cameras, full of artistic flair and storytelling. The entire scene is tranquil and full of tension, as if capturing a fleeting moment of urban life",
