        {
          "id": "krea2-7423319f20dd55a99896aee0",
          "alias": "单女衬衫沙发沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a brown leather sofa, her expression showing a hint of laziness and contemplation. Her right hand rests lightly on her knee, fingers long, while her left hand rests naturally on her thigh. On her wrist is a simple black wristband and a small ring. She wears a loose, light-colored shirt printed with blue cloud patterns, layered with an off-white base layer, and a black short skirt paired with black stockings, which feature subtle vertical stripes. The overall look is casual and layered, and she leans slightly forward. The posture is relaxed yet elegant. The background is a rough concrete wall with a natural beige tone, with fine grainy textures and irregular textures. On the right wall hangs a mounted abstract painting framed in light wood, with green and orange as the main tones, depicting blurred geometric shapes and lines. In the back right of the painting is a green cushion that contrasts with the sofa. The lighting throughout the scene is warm and soft, with the main light source coming from the left front of the figure, forming a golden warm glow with natural transitions between light and shadow, creating a quiet and intimate atmosphere. The composition uses medium shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, body slightly tilted, creating dynamic balance. The foreground is the leather surface of the sofa, with clear textures; the middle shot is the main subject; the background is the wall and paintings, with clear layers. Returning to the details of her body and hands, the lighting and shadow are warm and slightly nostalgic, as if a corner of the room at dusk. Light casts soft shadows on the wall, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. The overall image presents a sense of everyday realism, while also imbuing with artistic flair. It resembles film-like photos taken with a professional camera in low-light environments, with rich details, moderate color saturation, cinematic narrative, and serene everyday beauty",
