        {
          "id": "krea2-10f65ce1539a3b4dfc896e46",
          "alias": "单女棕外套废墟神秘站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city rooftop or abandoned building, wearing a brown faux fur short coat with black polka dot patterns. The jacket is plush and soft, with plush edges naturally draping down. The flush details at the cuffs and neckline are clearly visible. Underneath, she wears a black turtleneck base layer and a black high-waisted leather mini skirt. The skirt is smooth and glossy, with side slits revealing long legs. Paired with black stockings and black ankle boots, the overall look is fashionable, avant-garde, and full of urban flair. Her expression is somewhat mysterious and confident. Her right hand raises her index finger and points diagonally upward, her posture elegant and expressive. Her left hand hangs naturally at her side, fingers long and neatly trimmed. The background is a gray, overcast sky, with thick grayish-white clouds. In the distance, the city's buildings are blurred, including several red-brick residential buildings and modern high-rise buildings. The foreground is a cement-paved platform, scattered with dead leaves, rubble, and a small amount of trash. The edges feature low concrete walls and metal railings, with a mid-shot portrait composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, slightly turning the body and turning his head toward the camera, with a direct gaze to the viewer, creating a strong visual direction. The lighting is a soft, diffused light, evenly illuminated by natural light from cloudy days without obvious shadows, creating a cold and calm atmosphere. The colors are mainly gray, black, and brown, accented with warm brown leopard print patterns contrasting with black, creating a visual focal point. The overall image has a cinematic texture. It feels like a frame taken from an urban youth drama or fashion photo album, blending street fashion, retro, and modern elements, presenting a visual effect that is both everyday and artistic. It features a slight film graininess and realistic light and shadow layers, simulating outdoor natural light shooting with professional cameras like the Canon EOS R5 or Sony A7R IV. The lens has a focal length of about 85mm, f/2.8 aperture, shutter speed of 1/125 sec, ISO 400, and slight defocus at the edges. Enhances depth of field, creating an overall atmosphere that is calm, distant, and full of personal charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
