        {
          "id": "krea2-0982a35e79c629719f72b50b",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙博物馆沉思站立展示",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the gallery hall of an art museum, wearing a white spaghetti strap mini dress adorned with delicate gold embroidery, presenting a romantic and elegant style. The dress features a high-waisted design, decorated with a matching butterfly bow at the waist. The hem is structured with multiple layers of ruffles, light and voluminous, showcasing a sweet temperament. She wears a pair of transparent square-toe high-heeled sandals paired with light purple stockings. The overall look is both modern and retro, slightly curled and calm yet thoughtful. Her left hand is gently placed behind her back, while her right hand hangs naturally Her posture is elegant and natural. She wears a thin chain necklace and small earrings, adding a touch of sophistication. In the background is a large classical oil painting, framed in a magnificent golden carved frame. The scene depicts two men dressed in 19th-century military uniforms hunting outdoors—one wearing a dark coat, the other in an orange-red uniform. They sit on the grass, surrounded by prey and hunting rifles. In the distance, blurry fields and sky are predominantly brown, yellow, and gray, full of historical and narrative elements. This painting serves as the background, creating a strong visual contrast with the figures in the foreground, highlighting a dialogue between contemporary fashion and classical art. The exhibition hall walls are pure white, the floor has a gray cement texture, simple and clean, with no unnecessary decoration. Soft lighting from above creates a uniform and warm atmosphere. Light and shadow slanted down from above, creating a natural transition of light and shadow on the figures, while shadows fall on the floor and walls, adding depth to the space. The composition uses a center-left position of the figure, making the composition balanced without stiffness Figures occupy the main part of the composition, while the background painting occupies the upper half, forming a clear layered layout. At the same time, the details in the painting also attract attention, creating an interesting interactive relationship. The overall color palette is mainly white, off-white, pale purple, and gold, with a striking contrast of warm and cool tones. It combines a modern feel with classical charm, creating a tranquil and poetic atmosphere, as if capturing a fleeting burst of inspiration, like a high-quality photo taken with a professional camera, featuring delicate textures and realistic light and shadow textures. The visuals present a sense of everyday life, like a friend casually snapping photos of an art museum check-in, yet thanks to the careful arrangement of composition and atmosphere, they are especially moving, with rich details, clear layers, and full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
