        {
          "id": "krea2-59abb96e24c17e9cdb9d5606",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙摄影棚坐手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a modern-style black-and-white houndstooth fabric single sofa. She wears a white strappy dress with blue and pale purple gradient leaf patterns. The hem is asymmetrically designed, with a high slit on one side revealing her long legs. She wears a pair of white pointed high heels, decorated with gold straps and metal fasteners on the uppers. Around her neck is a delicate pearl necklace. Her makeup is elegant, her left hand gently resting on the knee, her right hand naturally resting on the sofa armrest, her body slightly leaning to the side. It presents an elegant posture. The foreground clearly shows the female subject and some sofa details; the middle ground shows the full outline of the sofa and the lower body of the figure; the background is a warm indoor environment; the wooden walls display a soft brownish-yellow tone; in the distance, a blurred cabinet or storage shelf can be faintly seen holding some items. The floor is covered with a gray carpet with geometric patterns, contrasting with the light wood floor. The composition uses a center-left visual layout, with the figure occupying the main position, and depth of field effects blurring the background. Highlighting the main subject, the light and shadow extend along the body's curves to the legs and shoes. The lighting and shadow atmosphere are warm and soft. The soft lighting from the left creates a comfortable and cozy indoor atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly white, blue, and brown, accented with black and gold, presenting a high-end and fashionable texture. The image has a strong sense of artistry and photographic beauty, resembling a fashionable photo shot in a professional studio, yet retaining the warmth of everyday life. Using high-quality cameras, the details are rich, colors are faithfully reproduced, and the focal length is moderate. The picture quality is delicate, with cinematic texture and layering",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
