        {
          "id": "krea2-e4942088014a2e9d912c256e",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙城市俏皮持相机",
          "prompt": "She wore a bright red leather strapless dress with a tight design that outlined smooth curves. The skirt was short and playful, revealing her long legs. She paired it with bright pink stockings and pointed red high heels. The toe of the shoes echoed the color of the dress, creating a bold and fashionable overall look. Her expression was thoughtful yet confident, and her makeup was exquisite, presenting a sense of independence and charm as an urban woman. In the foreground is her central figure, fully presented from feet to upper body, with leg lines extending to the lower left corner of the painting as a visual guide. The middle is the outdoor seating area of the café, with several classic French rattan chairs and round wooden tables arranged in staggered shape. The woven texture of the chairs is clearly visible, the table legs are made of metal, and some tables and chairs are placed casually, creating a relaxed feeling of everyday life. The background is a typical Parisian café, with black door frames and glass windows reflecting the street scene and lights. The windows feature The golden lettering of \"CHOCOLAT VIENNOIS\" and \"INFUSIONS\" is retro and elegant. Information signs are posted by the window, and warm yellow string lights hang nearby, emitting a soft glow. The street is a dark gray stone pavement, slightly worn and wet, giving it a realistic and lively feel. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame. The diagonal leg lines and body orientation guide the view, creating dynamic balance. The light and shadow come from natural light on the right and warm yellow light on the left. The light is soft yet layered, with natural shadow transitions. The overall atmosphere blends urban fashion, romantic mood, and the everyday vibes. The colors are mainly red, pink, black, and brown, with strong contrast yet harmony. The image texture is close to a fashionable photo shoot in a professional studio, while retaining the authentic details of street scenes, as if captured by a high-end camera at dusk, offering strong visual impact and artistic expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
