        {
          "id": "krea2-ef8686ee81c28b754601e331",
          "alias": "单女衬衫摄影棚沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "Her head tilts slightly back, her expression focused and slightly contemplative, forming a strong contrast with the overall cool tones and adding a touch of vintage elegance. She wears a white high-neck, sheer tulle shirt made of light and flowing material, with pleated details. The collar is crisp, the shoulder lines are smooth, and the sleeves hang naturally, presenting a simple yet sophisticated fashion sense. Her right hand gently strokes her raised right knee, fingers long and nails neatly trimmed, while her left hand supports her ankle. A pointed high heel patched from off-white and light brown is displayed on camera. The shoe design is classic, featuring metal buckles and stitching details. The heel is slender and sturdy, reflecting exquisite craftsmanship. The entire scene is composed in close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the frame, creating a strong visual focal point. The body forms an S-shaped curve, legs raised, creating tension that interweaves dynamic and static elements. The background is a gradient from dark gray to black, almost completely blurred, with no concrete objects or distractions. This makes the subject stand out more. Light comes from the front left, soft and focused, with rich layers of shadows that enhance the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and artistic, as if it were a carefully crafted fashion photographic work, with a strong cinematic feel and emotional expression. The color tone is cool, mainly black, white, and gray, accented with a few warm tones, creating a striking contrast that creates an aesthetic style that is both modern and nostalgic. There is a small explanatory area on the right edge of the frame, but it does not affect the overall visual integrity. The overall composition is compact. Focusing on character postures, clothing details, and accessory aesthetics, it conveys a low-key luxury, calm, and elegant fashion attitude. Like a moment captured in a quiet studio, it is full of storytelling and sensory impact, presenting the texture of a professional fashion magazine blockbuster. It combines the professional expressiveness of a model with the pursuit of beauty and self-expression in daily life. There are no unnecessary decorations or props in the image; everything serves the theme, emphasizing the unity of form and emotion, with delicate light and shadow handling. It creates a private and restrained atmosphere, as if sunlight pours in through the blinds on an afternoon, with the woman immersed alone in her own world, experiencing moments of beauty and freedom. The entire image is filled with poetry and philosophical reflection, prompting reflection on the deeper meanings of identity, gender, and aesthetics. It is not only a display of fashion but also a gaze and record of individual existence. Through minimalist backgrounds and precise lighting, the viewer's attention is fully focused on the figure itself, making it the absolute visual center. This technique is commonly used in high-end fashion photography, aiming to present the charm of designers' works in the purest way, while also demonstrating the photographer's deep understanding of composition, color, and emotional expression, ultimately presenting an artistic image that combines beauty, depth, and thoughtful depth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
