        {
          "id": "krea2-3363d95174810534c5792d46",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤",
          "prompt": "She wears a light gray knitted camisole with a cute black kitten embroidered on the chest. The straps are made of black suede with gold metal fasteners, draped from her shoulders to the chest, creating elegant lines. On her left hand is a bracelet strung from black and white beads. On her wrist, she wears a red thin string bracelet. Her hands are gracefully moved: her left hand is gently raised behind her head, fingers naturally extended, while her right hand is bent and placed in front of her chest, fingers lightly touching the neck. The overall composition centers on the figure, using medium to close shots, with blurred green plants and yellow flowers in the background, creating a soft bokeh effect. Light comes from the front side. Warm golden sunlight shines on the figures, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. The highlights are bright and natural, while the shadows are rich in layers, creating a peaceful, cozy, and vibrant atmosphere. The colors are mainly natural green, yellow, and gray-blue and black clothing tones, accented with gold accessories. The overall tone is harmonious and unified. Through light and shadow changes and color contrasts, the composition is balanced, the figures' postures are relaxed and natural, and the background blur is well handled, highlighting the main subject. The overall style combines artistic beauty with the warmth of everyday life, as if taking a natural photo shoot under the afternoon sun, capturing moments with professional equipment, yet still retaining the casualness and beauty of real life",
