        {
          "id": "krea2-42a412ff38615f6c026f2e1a",
          "alias": "单女白泳装公寓俏皮戏水",
          "prompt": "She wore a white short-sleeved top and a yellow bikini underwear, paired with light blue denim shorts. The hem of her pants had natural frayed edges, and a thin strap in the same color family was tied around her waist. The overall look was casual and fashionable. She wore light blue high-heeled sandals with thick and sturdy heels, metal clasps on the upper, and multiple layers of bracelets on her wrists, including silver metal chains and colorful woven cords, adding a touch of refinement. Her posture was elegant and confident, her body slightly turned to the side, and her right hand gently stroked her left wrist, conveying a relaxed and joyful mood The background is a clear blue swimming pool, the water shimmering in the sunlight. The pool edge is paved with white stone, smooth and flat. Next to it is a transparent glass railing with clean and modern lines. In the distance, rolling green mountains stretch softly, covered with sparse vegetation. Under the clear sky, it presents a faint blue-gray tone. Nearby, there is a stone wall made of irregular natural stones, with a rough surface that contrasts with the surrounding environment. The entire composition uses a medium shot. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the image, occupying the visual center. The background layers are distinct, from the foreground pool and ground to the center of the figure and stone wall, and then to the distant mountains, creating a clear sense of spatial depth. Light comes from the upper right, representing intense daylight illumination. Shadows are cast on the left side of the ground, with clear edges and moderate brightness, creating a bright and warm atmosphere. The colors are mainly blue, white, and yellow, creating a fresh and harmonious overall tone full of summer atmosphere. The painting has a strong visual guiding effect. The viewer's gaze is first drawn to the character, then extends along her body lines to the pool and distant mountains. The composition is balanced and rhythmic, as if capturing a moment from real life—like everyday footage shot with a professional camera, with slight lens distortion and natural noise, enhancing realism and immediacy. The overall style combines fashionable beauty with a sense of everyday life, presenting a relaxed and pleasant vacation atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
