        {
          "id": "krea2-2da94c88161fd16cbf849f44",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣街道沉思站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street, naturally wavy and curly, appearing smooth and textured. Her overall expression conveys a restrained gentleness and contemplation. She wears a beige knit cardigan with soft and thick texture with fine textures. The neckline and front are adorned with several dark buttons. She pairs it with matching high-waisted wide-leg pants in the same color. The pants are loose and comfortable, with smooth lines, creating a simple yet elegant look. She drapes a plaid scarf over her shoulders. The scarf features a classic plaid pattern in off-white, light brown, dark gray, and black, edged with deep blue piping. The tassels are richly detailed, with white tassels hanging naturally. With gentle movements, the scarf material looks thick and warm, with a plush texture. She crosses her arms over her chest, her posture slightly restrained, her hands wrapped in the scarf, creating a warm visual focal point. The background is blurred city buildings, with gray-toned walls and window structures faintly visible, presenting a modern urban minimalist geometry, with light coming from the sides and rear. Sunlight gently falls on the figure, creating a natural transition of light and shadow that highlights the subject's three-dimensionality. At the same time, subtle shadow layers are created in the folds of the scarf and clothing, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a shallow depth of field technique, with the subject clearly prominent, the background rendered delicately, the composition centered to the left, and the figure occupying the main position. The overall color palette is warm brown, off-white, and gray-black, harmoniously unified, presenting a subtle beauty found in everyday life. It's as if a professional camera combined with a large-aperture lens is capturing a moment in the afternoon sun. The image exudes authentic life and artistic flair, with natural light and shadow, rich details, and a warm and tranquil atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
