        {
          "id": "krea2-895a750381250923f368676e",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙街道媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman squatted beside a vintage red Beetle car, wearing a classic black-and-white polka dot dress with a well-tailored white collar and short-sleeved design, showcasing a strong 1950s American vintage style. She wore a black headpiece and exquisite makeup. Her right hand wore black lace gloves, her posture relaxed and seductive, while her left hand hung naturally and her body leaned slightly forward, creating an atmosphere that was both playful and slightly mysterious. She wore black high heels and black stockings, with smooth leg lines. Perfectly integrated with the overall design, the red Beetle sits on the left side of the frame. Its body is smooth and bright, reflecting the light and shadow of the surrounding environment. The wheels are gold five-spoke wheels paired with silver rims, with exquisite details. The door handles and rearview mirrors are clearly visible, the windows are transparent, faintly revealing the interior structure. The foreground features a rough cement floor with fine stones and textures, enhancing the scene's realism and sense of life. The middle shot focuses on women and cars, creating a strong visual focal point. The composition is shot from a low angle. This makes the figure stand out more and elongates the car's silhouette, enhancing the depth of the scene. The background is a hazy green forest with dense leaves, creating a natural blur effect and creating soft bokeh light spots, adding a tranquil and romantic atmosphere to the scene. The light comes from the upper right, simulating the warm natural afternoon glow. Sunlight filters through the leaves, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The overall color palette is mainly red, black, and white, accented with green and gold, creating a striking yet harmonious color contrast. The image carries a strong sense of nostalgia and artistic beauty, as if taken from an old movie, full of retro photography charm. The lens is medium format film, using an 85mm prime lens with an f/1.8 aperture, capturing delicate details and smooth focal length. Overall, it presents a realistic, natural, and story-rich visual style, like an amateur photographer casually capturing outdoor moments with a classic camera, preserving the chance and realism of everyday life. The image is rich in detail and clearly layered. It delivers both strong visual impact and delicate emotional expression. The composition follows the rule of thirds: the characters are positioned on the right side of the frame, while the car occupies the left half, with reasonable blank space, guiding the viewer's gaze from the car to the characters, creating a natural visual flow. The entire scene is filled with the poetic charm and retro aesthetic, exuding the unique atmosphere of mid-century American street culture. It feels as if soft jazz music echoes in the air, immersing viewers in memories of those beautiful times",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
