        {
          "id": "krea2-8da04384fd899d18a6a6f6e4",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣椅上站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in an indoor space filled with a retro nostalgia atmosphere. She wears a gray-and-white knit sweater vest paired with a dark plaid long-sleeve shirt and matching plaid pleated short skirt, and a pair of dark brown tall leather boots. The overall look presents a warm yet artistic autumn style. Her makeup is exquisite, her posture elegant with a hint of laziness, forming the absolute subject of the painting. She is positioned slightly to the left of the center, her body slightly turned to the side, her hands naturally hanging down, and her right hand lightly touching the armrest of a blue old wooden chair beside her. The left hand hangs naturally at his side, forming a stable visual center. The foreground is dominated by a gray carpet with mottled textures spread across the floor, with slight wear on the surface. At the edges, tiny debris and dust can be seen, enhancing the realism of the scene. On the left is a dark brown wooden round stool with conical legs and obvious scratches and signs of use. On the right is a woven rattan basket filled with green plants, with plump leaves and naturally hanging branches. Next to it stands a brightly colored picture book cover of \"Bambi.\" The deer in the painting is vivid and adorable, adding a touch of childlike fun and warmth. The center area features an old desk in blue and white tones, with a vintage green cash register, a metal kerosene lamp, several scattered books, and a white ceramic vase placed on the table. Inside the vase is a bouquet of green plants, lush with branches and leaves. On the desk is a fabric decoration printed with the words \"BLESS FAMILY.\" The background wall is light off-white, with a slightly mottled surface. In the distance, a yellow bus can be faintly seen. Below the photo is another small landscape painting. In the right rear is a tall old green cabinet with an open door, filled with books and miscellaneous items. The cabinet's surface is peeling paint, revealing a wooden base. A bare incandescent bulb hangs from the top, emitting warm yellow light. The entire composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered and elements evenly distributed on both sides. Creates a harmonious and stable sense of space. Visual guidance flows naturally through the direction of the characters' gaze, the direction of clothing, and the arrangement of surrounding objects. Returning to the foreground plants and picture books, a circular visual path is formed. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly in soft warm yellow tones. The light source comes from the chandelier in the upper right, creating a natural shadow transition. The left side is slightly darker to enhance the sense of depth. The objects in the background also create contrasts of light and dark depending on the angle, creating distinct spatial layers. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, nostalgic, warm, and full of life. It seems to capture a tranquil moment of afternoon sunlight streaming into the old house. The details are rich yet not chaotic, with unified and harmonious tones, presenting an artistic aesthetic that closely resonates with everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
