        {
          "id": "krea2-05dddf4477445db7c3567428",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装广场自信站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor stone-paved path, dressed in a delicate deep blue suit with a single row of three gold buttons. She wears a white turtleneck knit sweater underneath, and drapes a long black coat over it. The coat is made of thick material, loose-fitting, and drapes naturally. The cuffs and hem have slight pleats, giving the overall look a distinct layering and vintage elegance. She wears reddish-brown square-toe chunky heels with smooth uppers and metal clasp details, paired with black polka-dot stockings featuring dense, even black polka dot patterns. She carried a black leather handbag in her left hand. The bag was simple, with a slender, slightly curled and voluminous style, styled into a casual bun. A few stray strands fell naturally, her makeup exquisite, and her expression calm and confident. She stood before a wall with a rough beige texture. On the wall was a vintage-style wall lamp, made of glass with a brass frame and a rectangular shape. The lamp body slightly protruded from the wall. On the right was a light beige arched door with a transparent glass window, through which the interior furnishings and greenery could be faintly seen. The door frame had smooth lines. Below are simple rectangular decorative lines. The ground is paved with irregular gray stone bricks, with natural wear marks on the surface. A small amount of moss is mixed in the gaps. On the left edge is a patch of green grass, slender and brightly colored. The overall composition uses a medium portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center, body slightly tilted, head facing the camera to form a stable visual center. The background architectural elements contrast with the figure, enhancing the sense of space. The lighting is soft and even, coming from cloudy or scattered light without strong shadows. The color palette is deep blue, black, Mainly off-white, with vivid color contrasts that are not abrupt, and delicate light and shadow, creating a quiet, steady, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The overall image texture feels authentic, as if shot with a professional camera, with the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The details are rich and the layers clear, presenting a low-key luxurious urban fashion style. The composition is balanced, the subject is prominent, the background is moderately blurred, and the visual direction is natural, forming a coherent flow of sightlines. The overall atmosphere is calm and restrained yet uniquely charming, with harmonious and unified tones. The delicate handling of light and shadow presents an aesthetic that blends sophistication with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
