          "id": "krea2-2b53ba730bd1e5602f5a016f",
          "alias": "单女透视衬衫摄影棚忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in traditional Hanfu is presented in a low-angle low-angle downward shot. She slightly tilts her head and gazes into the distance, her expression calm yet slightly melancholic. She gently holds a black fan with a thin handle, made of transparent mesh fabric and edged with delicate black tassels. The fan is slanted behind her head, forming an elegant curved silhouette that echoes the lines of her head. Wearing a light teal sheer blouse with a deep blue embroidered strapless top underneath, the fabric is delicate and translucent, light and flowing. The hand posture is graceful, fingers long, and the fingertips gently touch the neck, as if feeling the breeze or deep thought. The overall composition is set against a pure pale blue sky, with clear clouds and even, soft colors, creating an ethereal and tranquil atmosphere. Light comes from the left of the top to simulate natural backlighting, making the figure's outline clear and shadows transitioning naturally, presenting a sense of three-dimensionality. To enhance realism and layering, the composition uses medium and close-up shots, focusing on the upper body and head of the subject, highlighting their expression and costume details. The composition emphasizes vertical lines and the contrast of circular elements. The curved fan harmoniously echoes the curve of the character's neck, reinforcing the central focus. The overall style blends Eastern classical aesthetics with the refined feel of modern photography, carrying a poetic sense of loneliness. The colors are mainly cool blue-white, complemented by garments of blue-green and deep blue, creating a cool and elegant visual tone. The image quality is delicate and high-resolution. It has a professional studio-level texture, while retaining slight film graininess and natural noise, making the images more realistic and artistic. It feels like a high-end camera capturing a moment outdoors at dusk, capturing the subtle interaction between the person and the environment. The entire scene is filled with tranquility, beauty, and a subtle melancholy, evoking a transcendent and otherworldly beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
