        {
          "id": "krea2-d487510faa66bcda0781e7a5",
          "alias": "单女黑外套车厢忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the platform of Moscow Metro's Avtovo station, wearing a long black coat and dark boots, exuding a calm and slightly melancholic aura. Her body leans slightly to the side of a magnificent decorative metal pillar, her posture relaxed yet elegant. Her left hand rests lightly on her knee, while her right hand hangs naturally at her side. Her presence contrasts sharply with the surrounding dynamics, making her the only clear subject in the painting. In the foreground is her distinct outline and details, while in the background is an orange-red metro train speeding by. A strong effect of motion blur is created, with the body lines stretched into flowing light strips, creating a visual impact with the white tiled walls and the \"Avtovo\" sign on the platform. In the middle section, the platform floor is paved with gray marble tiles with slight wear on the edges, suggesting it is a busy and historically rich public space. The metal column on the right is carved with intricate Baroque patterns, with a bronze sheen on the surface. The details are rich, enhancing the sense of depth and vintage atmosphere of the space. The composition adopts a center-to-right layout. The figures are positioned on the right side of the frame, with plenty of space on the left to express the train's dynamic dynamics, creating a dynamic contrast. The visual guide lines follow a blurred trajectory from left to right to converge on the figures, while the vertical lines of metal columns further enhance the stability of the image. The overall lighting presents warm tones, with light from the platform roof casting soft shadows on the ground and columns, slightly cool tones that create a subtle contrast with the warm ambient light, creating an atmosphere that is both realistic and cinematic. The entire scene seems to freeze in a moment of urban life, combining the realism of daily life with poetic solitude and tranquility. It looks like a photo taken with an old-fashioned film camera, with slightly grainy texture, low color saturation but rich layering, and slightly faded edges, presenting a retro photography feel. The lens is chosen at standard focal lengths similar to 35mm or 50mm, with a slightly top-down perspective capturing the interaction between the person and the environment, emphasizing the sense of spatial dimensionality and the passage of time. The overall atmosphere blends the city's noise with personal tranquility, conveying a sense of alienation and contemplation of individual existence in the modern city",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
