        {
          "id": "krea2-6a58e359db66d596da7d9e6e",
          "alias": "单女红西装街道自信站立注视",
          "prompt": "A female model dressed in an all-red suit stands on the zebra crosswalk in Moscow's Red Square. She wears a high-neck, long-sleeved red cropped jacket. The jacket's design is simple yet modern, with smooth shoulder lines and slightly cinched cuffs. A slim belt adorned with a gold chain at the waist highlights her slender waist. She pairs the lower half with a matching red pencil skirt and red stockings, paired with pointed high heels. The overall look is unified and powerful. Her posture is confident and composed, her legs slightly parted, hands folded in front of her, slightly lowering his head to gaze into the camera, his makeup exquisite and matching the colors of his clothing. The background is the iconic colorful onion dome of St. Basil's Cathedral, with a vibrant dome of red, green, blue, and yellow shining in the sunlight. The architectural details are rich, the brickwork textures are clearly visible, the walls display a warm orange-red hue, and the dome is inlaid with complex geometric patterns and religious symbols. In front of the church is a low stone wall, and behind it is an open plaza. On the right side of the image, several gray streetlight poles and traffic signals can be seen. One of the traffic lights is green, with a no-pedestrian traffic sign standing nearby, along with a yellow pedestrian crossing sign. In the distance, dense green trees dot the area, leaves gently sway in the breeze, the sky is deep blue, the clouds thin, the light bright and soft, and sunlight slanting down from the upper right, casting clear shadows on the ground and the figures, creating a strong contrast between light and dark. The entire scene is composed in a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The church in the background is presented at a slightly upward angle, enhancing the grandeur of the building. The zebra crossing in the foreground radiates into the depths of the frame, guiding the gaze to the figures and adding a sense of order to urban life. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and dramatic, sunlight makes the red costumes more vivid, and metal accessories reflect a faint sheen, creating a unique aesthetic where fashion and history blend together. The overall image has a delicate texture and high color saturation, embodying the style of high-end fashion photography. It feels as if a professional camera was used to shoot real scenes on a clear afternoon, with a slight film graininess and natural depth of field effect, presenting a sense of urban fashion that is both everyday and surreal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
