        {
          "id": "krea2-f173d0367abee84c1091279a",
          "alias": "单女白西装街道冷淡坐持镜",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a modern bench on a city street, wearing a loose-fitting off-white blazer with a delicate matte texture. The collar is slightly open, revealing the neckline, and she wears a simple dark top underneath. The overall look is sharp and elegant. Her legs are long and straight, she wears semi-transparent gray stockings, and a pair of pointed heels in the same color. The surface is smooth as a mirror, reflecting soft light. Her posture is calm and confident, one hand resting lightly on the edge of the bench, the other naturally letting down. Her body leans slightly, her makeup delicate and natural. In the foreground is a modern-style black metal bench with vertical striped textures, and the wooden cushions display warm natural wood tones. In the middle is a modern building cluster lining the street, with glass curtain walls reflecting the pale blue of the sky and the golden sunlight. The building lines are clean and sharp, with a strong geometric beauty. In the distance, blurred traffic and pedestrians can be seen. Several tall green plants are planted along the roadside, their leaves slender and upright, gently swaying in the breeze. The background is the expansive city skyline. Tall buildings stand tall with distinct layers, and the sky displays soft gradient colors from morning or evening, ranging from light blue to pale yellow, with interplay of light and shadow. The composition uses a low-angle downward view to highlight the figures' upright postures and the grandeur of the urban environment. The figures are positioned slightly to the left of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The right side leaves space for the architecture and plants, enhancing balance and depth. Light comes from the upper right, simulating an afternoon sunset, with warm golden light shining on the figures, outlining clear outlines. At the same time, long shadows are cast on the ground and building surfaces, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality and a temporal atmosphere. The contrast of light and shadow is sharp, highlights are bright and transparent, and shadow details are rich. The overall atmosphere blends the cold rationality of the city with the gentle intellect of the characters, presenting a modern urban woman's independent, confident, and elegant lifestyle. The image texture is close to professional studio shooting but retains the details and ambiance of real scenes. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, gray, black, and gold, accented with a touch of green. Harmonious and unified, it carries a sense of sophistication and artistic flair, yet retains the warmth of everyday life. It feels like a fleeting moment of beauty captured in an ordinary yet poetic corner of the city. The entire image is full of story and emotional tension, prompting one to imagine the identity and experiences of this woman—she may be a career elite just finishing an important meeting or a city traveler enjoying a moment of tranquility. Whatever the identity, her presence adds a touch of human warmth and softness to this concrete city. Every detail in the painting tells the story of the perfect fusion of modern life and personal charm. This fusion is neither abrupt nor forced, but flows naturally between light and shadow, like a silent poem—quiet and profound",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
