        {
          "id": "krea2-accb22cf60499bdf43e30ac3",
          "alias": "单女棕内衣摄影棚微笑倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman elegantly leans on a deep green leather stacked sofa, wearing a faint, almost imperceptible smile. Her overall aura is calm and captivating. She wears a light brown spaghetti-strap bra made of soft and fitting material, showing off smooth shoulder and neck lines and graceful bust contours. She wears white tights on the bottom, smooth and delicate in texture. She perfectly outlines the curves and muscles, wearing beige pointed high heels with pleated uppers. The slender heels present a vintage yet refined aesthetic. Her legs are crossed and extended, one leg stretched forward while the other bends backward, forming a dynamic S-shaped curve. The lines from knee to ankle are smooth and powerful, with the main subject positioned slightly to the left, occupying the visual center. The foreground is the floor and part of the sofa edge, the center is the main figure and sofa, and the background is a simple white wall. The walls have slight textures and seams, and on the left side, you can faintly see the corners of the white tiles. The floor has a gray cement texture, with a rough surface with fine scratches and stains, enhancing realism and industrial atmosphere. The composition uses a slightly slanted perspective, giving the image more dynamic and visual impact. The figures' body lines contrast with the horizontal layers of the sofa, while the space's blank space creates a sense of breathability, forming a subtle diagonal line that draws the viewer's gaze to flow. Light and shadow come from the soft natural light on the left side of the painting, providing even and warm light. Delicate shadow transitions are created, casting soft shadows on the sofa's recesses and floor, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, private, and slightly artistic. The tones are mainly earthy tones, with green, brown, and white harmonizing and unified. The color saturation is moderate, without excessive brightness or coldness, creating a subtle beauty in daily life. It feels like a private image shot in a quiet indoor corner, featuring the fine lighting and composition of a professional studio, yet still retaining the feel of life and authentic texture. It's like capturing a moment with a medium format camera paired with a standard prime lens: moderate shutter speed, low ISO, good noise control, clear and sharp images, rich details, refinement of commercial advertising while retaining the naturalness and purity of documentary photography",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
