        {
          "id": "krea2-237b8f05ef08f98fab999ca5",
          "alias": "单女黑内衣公寓俏皮躺侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman is elegantly reclining in a dark brown velvet armchair, wearing a black-and-white vintage polka dot lingerie set. The white base is accented with evenly sized black polka dots, and the strap design outlines her slender shoulders and collarbones. The cropped top reveals her flat stomach, paired with matching polka-dot high-waisted shorts. The overall look is full of mid-century vintage charm and a touch of playfulness. Her hands are adorned with exquisite white lace long gloves, with slender fingers and lace trim delicately snuggling her wrists. Her wrists are slightly bent, naturally resting on either side of the armchair, her posture calm and confident. Her legs are crossed, with her left leg stacked over her right. The lace pattern on her socks echoes the gloves, creating a visual unity. She wears a pair of shiny black platform Mary Jane shoes with smooth, reflective uppers. The square-toe design pairs with metal buckles, and the thick heel adds height proportion, enhancing the vintage woman's charm. The rounded pearls are distinct, perfectly matching the vintage style. Small pearl earrings are worn, echoing the necklace. The background is a dark wooden wall adorned with classical carved decorations. In the corner, a dark wooden cabinet is faintly visible, topped with several blurred ornaments. The floor is covered with dark brown wood with clear grain, and light casts a soft side light from the upper left side of the image, while natural shadows are cast on the right side and in the background, enhancing the sense of depth and spatial layering. The foreground features the main figure and an armchair, the middle is the part where the legs extend to the floor, and the background features wooden walls and furniture. The composition uses a center-shifted golden ratio layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, head slightly tilted, gazing with the viewer. Then, following the body lines down to the legs and shoes, returning to the overall look, the lighting atmosphere is warm and rich, with tones dominated by brown, white, and black, creating a nostalgic, elegant, and slightly sexy retro vibe. It feels like a frame taken from an old movie, rich in detail and authentic in texture, combining the refinement of high-end photography with natural traces of everyday amateur equipment. The overall image resembles a carefully composed film photograph, full of storytelling and artistic atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
