        {
          "id": "krea2-419ae4e0c217aea7637ec088",
          "alias": "单女围巾街道沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench by the indoor window, wearing a black hooded sweatshirt with wide cuffs and thick, soft material, presenting a lazy and casual street style. Underneath, she wears a beige, semi-transparent sheer scarf that drapes softly over her chest, adding a touch of softness and layering. She wears brown corduroy shorts with the legs naturally rolled up, revealing her slender leg lines. On her feet are platform sneakers in black, white, and gray with a patchwork of black, white, and gray, printed on the upper with the \"NY\" logo. The design is both retro and modern. Her overall outfit blends street trends with refined details, presenting a unique temperament that lies between casual and fashionable everyday looks. The window panes are sharp, letting in bright natural light, which softly illuminates the figures and creates a uniform transition between light and shadow. On the right wall hangs a framed poster featuring black-and-white patterns and text. The words \"HOLLYWOOD PARK\" are clearly visible, and below are English words like \"6215 SUNSET BOULEVARD.\" The font is bold and powerful, giving it a retro movie poster feel. In the lower right corner of the poster, you can faintly see the word \"GOOD.\" In the front right of the painting is a small platform framed with black metal, on which sits a leopard-print handbag. The main body is made of glossy black material, with a smooth and reflective surface, accented with brownish-yellow leopard print patterns. The gold zipper pull is small and exquisite, the bag is square and clean, and the overall composition adopts a slightly top-down perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the painting, with a diagonal posture and gaze directed toward the viewer, creating an intimate yet distant visual relationship. The foreground is the surface of a wooden bench, with the wood grain clearly visible. The color is light natural wood, with a warm texture and slightly worn edges, showing signs of use. The middle ground features the main subject and nearby objects, including handbags, posters, and some walls. The background is windows and a blurred space farther away. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by natural light, making the figure's outlines more prominent and enhancing the sense of depth and layering. The overall tone leans toward a cool tone, mainly black, white, gray, and beige, accented with a touch of leopard brownish-yellow and red. The color combination is restrained yet harmonious, presenting the overall composition with a sense of tranquility and contemplation. The slightly artistic atmosphere seems to capture a moment of tranquility under the afternoon sun, like real life moments captured with an old film camera. The slight graininess of the lens and the soft blur outside focus together create a warm and nostalgic visual texture. The composition is stable, the focus clear, and the details rich. From the textures of characters' clothing to the small objects in the environment, everything is full of narrative. The overall image combines the refinement of a fashion magazine with the casualness and authenticity of daily life, conveying an independence belonging to urban youth An aesthetic attitude of confidence and self-expression",
