        {
          "id": "krea2-5b0de59e2ab2072b8ea07ac1",
          "alias": "单女白短裙酒廊躺戏水",
          "prompt": "Her makeup is delicate and natural, and her overall temperament is fresh and sweet. She wears a loose gray hooded sweatshirt designed as an off-shoulder style, with wide sleeves and a black number \"8\" printed on the chest with the small print \"IP ft 202.\" The fabric looks soft and comfortable, with slight pleats. She pairs a white lace mini skirt with distinct layers, a light and flowing hem. Her right hand rests gently at her waist, while her left hand falls naturally, her posture relaxed and elegant. In the foreground is a clear half-body close-up, with the composition centered to the right, the figure occupying the main position. The background is lush greenery and several tall trees, lush with branches and leaves, dappled with light and shadow. In the distance, a modern-style swimming pool can be seen, its surface calm as a mirror, reflecting the sky and surrounding scenery. Several white lounge chairs are placed by the pool, with someone leisurely lying on them basking in the sun. Next to it is a bottle of mineral water resting on a wooden board. The entire scene presents a peaceful and cozy vacation atmosphere, with light coming from the upper part slightly to the left. It belongs to bright daylight, where sunlight filters through leaves to form soft light spots that fall on the figure and the ground. The shadows are clear but not harsh. The main colors are green, gray, and white, with fresh and natural tones, moderate saturation, and gentle contrast. The overall image has a strong sense of daily life and life, as if captured with a regular phone or camera, with a sense of authenticity and slight noise. The composition is stable, the background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject and creating a warm, relaxed atmosphere. The vibrant atmosphere of the afternoon conveys a sense of relaxation and enjoyment of life, like a private photo capturing pleasant moments during travel—both artistic and authentic.",
