        {
          "id": "krea2-2c5c0d248ae0fcd28492fe12",
          "alias": "单女全裸黑西装办公室媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a black-and-white plaid blazer and a white shirt sits at the edge of a dark wooden desk. Her black skirt paired with nude stockings and high heels sits gracefully sideways, legs crossed, left hand lightly resting on the table, right hand slightly raised to touch the hem of her skirt. Her makeup is exquisite, her expression confident yet slightly provocative. The background is a warm-toned indoor environment. On the left, you can see an old-fashioned beige rotary dial phone, beside it a file box and small items. Behind her is a dark brown wooden door with glass window frames. On the right, a bookshelf and desk lamp can be faintly seen. The overall space presents a mid-20th-century vintage office atmosphere. Light softly shines from the front left, creating a warm transition of shadows. The wooden furniture surfaces reflect a delicate sheen, the floor is a dark solid wood patchwork with clear grain, and the composition uses medium shots for close-ups. The figure occupies the center slightly to the right, with the body slightly tilted to form dynamic lines. The foreground highlights her posture and clothing details, while the middle frame showcases office elements. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, with rich light and shadow layers and natural contrast between light and shadow. The overall atmosphere blends vintage nostalgia with modern sensuality, offering a professional studio-level texture while retaining the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. It feels as if captured by a medium format film camera, with slight graininess and color saturation, presenting a private, elegant, and story-rich visual experience",
