        {
          "id": "krea2-e20fe96a808642ed67af40e7",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔城市冷淡倚靠",
          "prompt": "Her body leans slightly forward, hands folded on her knees, wearing a blue-black patterned spaghetti strap top that reveals a slender waistline. She pairs loose blue jeans with legs casually folded around the ankles. The overall look is fashionable and effortless, with the main focus positioned slightly to the right center, presenting a naturally relaxed posture. In the foreground is the soft fabric of the sofa and the silhouette of the figure. The middle frame shows the full figure of the figure and the sofa area where she sits. The background is a light-colored wall with two minimalist green-toned decorative paintings hanging on it, depicting abstract trees and figures. On the left side, a large mirror reflects part of the room, showing a white suitcase, clothes, and some household items. The mirror's edges have metal frames, and sunlight streams in from the right, casting clear strips of light and shadows on the walls and floor. The light is warm and soft, creating a peaceful afternoon atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures occupying the visual focal point. The contrast of light and shadow enhances the sense of spatial layering. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and warm, with a strong daylight texture. The overall image presents a genuine and natural beauty from everyday life, as if captured casually with a phone or regular camera. There is slight noise and color saturation, with warm yellow and blue tones as the main tones, creating a cool and warm contrast. The details are rich and the texture clear, and the overall image exudes a lazy, comfortable, and lifelike atmosphere. It is as if recording an ordinary yet beautiful afternoon. The figures' postures are natural, expressions genuine, without excessive embellishment, giving a sense of warmth and authenticity. The decorative paintings in the background add artistic flair to the scene, and the mirror's reflection adds depth and storytelling to the space. The entire scene resembles a corner of a modern urban living room, full of the authenticity and warmth of life",
