        {
          "id": "krea2-de86eb8209e3277a68223ded",
          "alias": "单女粉高领衫户外微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the seat of a golf cart, wearing a pink sleeveless turtleneck sports top paired with a white pleated mini skirt and white knee-high socks, paired with pink sneakers. Her overall look is fresh, sweet, and full of energy. She wears a white baseball cap and black sunglasses resting on the brim, looking fashionable and casual. She looks down at the camera with a faint smile, wearing a white golf glove printed with cartoon patterns on her left hand and a minimalist smartwatch on her right wrist, with fingers gently resting on her knee, her posture elegant and relaxed. She sits on a pink and white towel with blurred lettering patterns. In the background is a huge pile of gray rocks, whose surface is rough and uneven, covered with weathering marks, presenting natural textures and layers. On the left, part of the cart's structure is visible, including a metal frame and a black mesh storage basket. On the right, scattered stones and a few green plants are scattered. The sky is bright but slightly gloomy, with soft and even lighting without strong shadows, creating a peaceful and fresh outdoor atmosphere. The composition centers on the figure, using close-ups while retaining enough background information to convey the environment. Following her line of sight, it extends to the rocks in the background and the open space in the distance, creating a visual flow that echoes inside and out. The light and shadow are delicate, with clear folds and material details on the clothing. The patterns on gloves and the watch's reflections are authentic and natural. The overall color palette is mainly pink, white, and gray, harmoniously unified to create a feeling that is both modern and close to nature. The image texture resembles everyday amateur photography, with slight graininess and realistic color reproduction, as if casually recorded during a trip, capturing the beautiful moments where youth, leisure, and nature blend together",
