        {
          "id": "krea2-5a10da44a5678626f74f814e",
          "alias": "单女丝袜公寓媚态躺拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman is reclining on a huge round pink bed, her body slightly tilted, her head resting on a purple silk pillow. Her expression is slightly lazy and confident. She wears fine-rimmed glasses, adding a touch of casualness and elegance. She wears a deep burgundy tight-fitting long-sleeve top with delicate pleated textures that hugs her figure and outlines smooth curves. She pairs matching high-waisted stockings on the bottom, with legs long and well-proportioned, presenting an understated yet refined sensuality in the overall look. Her right hand gently holds a white pen-shaped object The left hand rests naturally at her side, her posture relaxed yet full of tension. In the foreground, a dark brown lace lingerie casually drapes over the left purple pillow, with clear edge details. The satin material glows gently under soft light. Several booklets printed with \"Vivienne Westwood\" are scattered across the bed. One book is opened, featuring handwritten notes and patterns, while the others are laid flat or half-folded. The paper feels authentic, and the text and illustrations are clearly distinguishable. The background is a pure light pink wall with a unified and soft tone, free from unnecessary decorations or distractions, creating a minimalist yet thoughtfully designed spatial atmosphere. The composition is shot from a top-down angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The curves of the circular bed echo the curves of the body, creating a harmonious geometric aesthetic. Light and shadow cast from above slightly to the right, creating soft and even light with almost no obvious shadows, highlighting the delicate texture of the skin and the details of the clothing folds. At the same time, subtle transitions of light and shadow are created at the edge of the bed and pillows, enhancing the sense of spatial layering. The colors are mainly pink, purple, and burgundy, with a harmonious contrast of warm and cool tones. The overall atmosphere is both dreamy and private, carrying a touch of romance and artistry from everyday life, as if shot with a professional camera in natural indoor light. The image texture is delicate, with rich details, offering strong visual appeal and emotional appeal",
