        {
          "id": "krea2-3f73382fd98b7b62bafde376",
          "alias": "单女米外套街道愤怒坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor concrete bench, head slightly lowered, her expression calm and reserved. She wears a beige-brown tweed coat with a thick and warm texture, the collar slightly open, revealing light-colored clothes underneath. Around her neck is a thick scarf with a yellow and white plaid pattern, bright but not glaring, contrasting with the overall cool tone. Her hands rest gently on her knees, fingers long, her posture natural relaxed, wearing white over-the-knee socks with smooth and delicate surfaces and smooth leg lines. On his feet were a pair of white thick-soled flats, with a simple and modern design with slightly thick soles. The bench was made of gray concrete, with a rough surface and edges showing signs of wear. A few withered yellow fallen leaves were scattered on top. The floor was covered with thick autumn leaves, ranging in color from golden yellow to dark brown. The leaves varied in shape—some curled, some intact. Some had been trampled, showing mottled textures and layers. The background was a gray-white brick wall, neatly arranged with clear gaps, and some graffiti on the walls. On the left is the white spray-painted lettering! On the right side is a black abstract graffiti pattern with bold and powerful lines, giving a casual street art feel. The overall composition is centered, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame, leaning slightly forward to form a stable visual center. The foreground features scattered leaves and the base of the bench, the middle is the main figure and bench, and the background is brick walls and graffiti. The layers are distinct and the sense of space is strong. The camera uses a mid-focal length perspective, slightly overlooking to create a sense of closeness and realism in daily life. The lighting is diffuse light on cloudy days. The texture is soft and even, with no strong shadows, natural transitions of light and shadow, and the overall atmosphere is quiet and slightly lonely, carrying the artistic vibe of urban streets. The color palette is mainly gray, brown, and white, with a yellow scarf as the visual focal point. The image texture is delicate, as if captured with a high-resolution camera in a real scene, with graininess and warmth like film photography, while retaining the clarity of digital imaging. The overall style leans toward realism, infused with a touch of youthful film romance and nostalgia, like a moment captured on an ordinary afternoon in a city corner, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
