        {
          "id": "krea2-d418490af6b6f914f58946db",
          "alias": "单女短裙高塔专注坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the stone steps of a classical building, turning sideways to the right side of the frame, her head slightly lowered, wearing black slim-rimmed glasses that reflect soft light. Her expression is calm and focused, dressed in a simple white short-sleeved top with a slightly open neckline revealing her collarbone. She pairs a light-colored high-waisted short skirt with floral patterns on the bottom. The skirt is light and complements her curves, and her legs are long and straight, with her right leg draped over her left, and she wears a pair of metallic stiletto sandals. The upper of her shoes was wrapped in silver decorative straps around her ankles, her toes pointing downward, her heels firmly planted on the steps. She was gently tugging at a pair of transparent stockings with both hands. Her fingers were slender, nails painted a pale pink polish, her movements delicate and composed. Her left hand rested on her knee, while her right hand pinched the edge of the stocking, as if adjusting or checking the fit. On the stone steps beside her, a stack of thick books was neatly stacked, the spines of various colors—from deep red to dark green to purple-brown. The covers showed obvious signs of wear, revealing the marks of years of flipping through them. The books are stacked in an irregular tower shape, with some pages slightly raised, appearing casual yet realistic. The background features two thick beige marble columns, smooth and finely textured. The columns are cylindrical with carved details at the base, extending upward beyond the frame, creating a strong sense of vertical lines. Behind the columns are blurred green vegetation and dark-toned space, creating a depth effect. The entire scene is bathed in natural outdoor light, with sunlight slanting down from the upper right, creating a natural transition of light and shadow, with clear but not harsh contrasts The warm yellow lighting gives the painting a retro and cozy atmosphere. The overall composition uses a three-part layout, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the right side, leaving a large negative space on the left side to highlight the subject and enhance visual balance. The foreground focuses on the lower body, feet, and books; the middle ground features the character's entire body and stone steps; the background features pillars and distant surroundings, creating clear layering. The camera is chosen from a mid-focal length, slightly overhead, giving the posture greater tension and showcasing the beauty of the leg lines. The colors of the painting include off-white, light gray, Brown-yellow is the main tone, accented with red, purple, and other book colors, creating a visual rhythm of interwoven warmth and coolness. The overall style combines everyday realism with artistic beauty, resembling photographs taken with a professional camera, with slight graininess and natural exposure, creating a quiet, intellectual, and slightly intimate atmosphere that evokes afternoon hours outside the library or artistic moments on city streets. The images are rich in detail, showcasing a high degree of realism and a sense of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
