          "id": "krea2-f02ed6fed70422e8524a26b0",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣摄影棚自信倚靠过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans on a deep green vintage single sofa, wearing a loose pink V-neck knit cardigan adorned with delicate green and gold sequin embroidery, presenting floral or plant shapes. The cardigan is casually open, revealing the black underwear and long legs. She wears black stockings, her right leg bent and raised, her left leg naturally extended, and the thin strap of black high heels visible at her ankle, naturally falling over her shoulders. Her makeup is exquisite, and she wears slender tassel earrings at her earlobes. The overall posture is lazy yet full of allure. In the foreground, a huge white flower (possibly a dahlia) occupies the lower right corner of the painting. The petals are layered and delicately textured, with a few emerald green leaves nearby. The floor is a warm, light-colored wooden parquet with clear texture. On the left side of the sofa lies a transparent high-heeled sandal, with black heels and metal decorations on the sole. The background is composed of dark and light-colored walls, which have a mirrored effect that reflects blurred silhouettes of the figures. The light-colored walls are divided by horizontal lines, creating a sense of spatial layering. The composition uses low-angle shots, with the figure extending from the left side to the right, forming a diagonal composition. The flowers in the foreground and sandals on the ground form a closed loop. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly warm tones, with the main light source coming from the right front of the figure, creating a clear contrast between light and shadow. The shadows are deep, highlighting three-dimensionality. The mirrored reflections in the background enhance spatial depth, giving the overall image a high-end fashion photography feel. It feels as if you're shooting in a professional studio using softboxes and fill lights, yet retaining the casual moments of everyday life. The tones are warm and full of atmosphere, with rich details and clear layering, delivering strong visual impact and artistic beauty. At the same time, there is a slight film graininess and natural depth blur, making the images more realistic and lifelike",
          "description": "",
