        {
          "id": "krea2-a11df491d524659b3ef6e446",
          "alias": "单女米外套市场沉思倚靠阅读",
          "prompt": "She wore a loose camel long coat with a delicate matte texture. The collar was slightly open, revealing a light beige fitted outfit underneath. The hem of the coat hung naturally and formed soft pleats as she sat. Her legs were crossed and folded—left leg on top and right leg below. She wore brown crocodile-patterned leather ankle boots with a shaft high to mid-calf and chunky heels. Her overall posture was elegant and relaxed, leaning slightly back in the chair, head slightly turned, and holding an open fashion magazine in both hands. The magazine cover is primarily black and white, printed with the words \"BAZAAR\" and portraits. The pages develop slight creases and curves as they are flipped, creating a realistic reading experience. The setting is a minimalist indoor space, with a pure white wall as the background and a flat and undecorated surface. The floor is light gray or white, with a faint reflective effect. In the corner, a small area of dark brown wooden floor can be seen, suggesting the extension of space. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the main subject on the right side of the painting, occupying about two-thirds of the space. The left side is blank to create visual balance, and the figures and chairs form diagonal lines to enhance the sense of movement. Light comes from the front left of the painting, providing soft diffused light that simulates natural or professional soft lighting. Shadows are concentrated on the right side of the body and the ground, with blurred edges, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly earth tones, including camel, beige, brown, White and gray, paired with a small amount of black text and patterns, create harmonious and unified colors. The layers of light and shadow are rich but not too strong, highlighting the contours and textures of the figures. The composition contains no unnecessary decorations, emphasizing the relationship between the people and their environment, conveying an atmosphere where urban fashion, quiet reflection, and lifestyle aesthetics coexist. The details are exquisite, and the overall style combines the sophistication of artistic photography with the warmth of everyday life, as if taken in a high-quality photo shoot in a private studio or at home, carrying a strong modernist aesthetic. It also retains the realism of amateur equipment shooting, such as slight noise, natural exposure control, and authentic tonal changes, making the entire scene both sophisticated and warm. Following her gaze to the magazine in her hand, the text and images on the pages attract attention, and finally returning to the overall form and posture of the person, forming a complete visual loop. The composition is stable and rhythmic, the background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject's presence, presenting an overall sense of tranquility and elegance. The slightly lazy modern female image, full of storytelling and emotional tension, seems to capture a private and authentic moment, making people imagine what she is reading and her inner thoughts at that moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
