        {
          "id": "krea2-8bd3eb07efd8dbea05d2f3ef",
          "alias": "单女黑外套商场冷淡站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an escalator in a mall, draped over her shoulders, making her stand out. She wears black sunglasses, adding a touch of mystery. She wears a black-and-white baseball jacket with off-white sleeves, black on the chest and back, and white stripes on the jacket. She pairs it with a black short skirt that is simple and neat. On her feet are black-and-white sneakers with star patterns on the upper and black over-the-knee socks. The socks have a delicate texture and the leg lines are clearly visible. She carries a white plush handbag in her left hand, adorned with a red bow. The overall look is fashionable and avant-garde, full of youthful energy. Her posture is confident and composed, her body slightly leaning, one hand naturally resting on her head and the other holding the bag, her expression cold yet resolute. The background is a modern mall interior, with a huge glass skylight on top supported by a metal frame forming a geometric grid structure. Sunlight streams through the glass, creating a mottled light and shadow effect that illuminates the entire space. On both sides of the escalator are transparent glass railings, with black handrails echoing the metal frame. The steps are dark with anti-slip texture, making the details clearly visible. From a distance, you can see other floors and shops in the mall, but the design is rather blurry, creating a sense of depth. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, highlighting the tall figure and aura of the figures. The escalator's lines guide the gaze upward, enhancing the sense of space and depth in the image. Light comes from the skylight above, presenting bright natural light. Shadows are soft and evenly distributed, with interlacing light and shadow creating a warm and transparent atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly cool tones, such as silver white, black, gray, and blue, accented with warm sunlight and the red on the handbag, creating a visual contrast that enhances the layering and appeal of the image. The image has a strong urban fashion vibe, with a touch of futurism and surrealism, as if taken from a movie scene, full of the rhythm and beauty of modern life. The images present a texture similar to professional camera shooting, with rich detail, high resolution, realistic color reproduction, sharp edges, and natural transitions of light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is both everyday and artistic, such as commercial advertisements or fashion portraits shot during the day with high-end photography equipment, capturing the personality expression of urban youth in public spaces and conveying a free, independent, and daring attitude toward self-expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
