        {
          "id": "krea2-db2a1c20ae6dd808629cb753",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙街道冷淡过肩",
          "prompt": "Her overall makeup is clean, neat, and fashionable. She wears a black leather strapless dress with a fitted upper body that highlights the curves of her bust. The waist uses a waist structure that outlines a slender waistline. The hem is a high-slit short skirt that reveals her long legs. The skirt fits the body with slight pleats and textures. The shoulder straps are metal chains draped crossbody over her shoulders, with noticeable glare links. Her left hand hangs naturally, and she wears a multi-layered bracelet on her wrist, made of metal, beaded strings, and leather, creating a rich range of styles. She wears black over-the-knee boots with a shaft that wraps around her calves, the upper smooth with clearly visible stitching along the edges. The background is a building facade composed of a red brick wall and white window frames. The bricks are neatly arranged, with varying shades and rough surfaces showing signs of wear. The windows are framed in white wood, with a partitioned design and transparent glass reflecting blurred images of the surrounding environment. On the right side is a white Roman column with grooved textures on the column. The base is made of stone, and the floor is cement or slab, slightly uneven. Light comes from the front left, which is soft daytime natural light. The sunlight on the figure creates a uniform transition between light and dark, while shadows fall to the right rear, giving clear but not stiff contours. The overall tone is cool, mainly black, white, gray, and brown, with moderate color saturation. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered and occupying the main part of the picture, while background elements serve as a backdrop, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The lens uses a standard focal length, with a slightly low viewpoint to highlight the height and posture of the subject. The depth of field is shallow, the foreground is clear, and the background is slightly blurred, creating a prominent subject effect. The overall atmosphere balances fashion and everyday vibes, as if casually photographed on the street, full of urban life atmosphere. The details are rich, and the light and shadow treatment is delicate, presenting a realistic and dynamic visual effect",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
