        {
          "id": "krea2-7105619a50643165c86e1be3",
          "alias": "单女白外套商店俏皮站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outside a café called FORM Karakoy. She wears a fluffy, soft white long-fur coat paired with a black tight dress underneath, a black pleated short skirt, pure white stockings, and classic black Mary Jane shoes. Thin straps are tied around her ankles, giving the overall look a vintage, elegant, and slightly playful sense of fashion. His left hand gently rests on the black metal frame backrest beside him, while his right hand hangs naturally, his posture relaxed and confident. In the foreground is a minimalist, modern-style metal chair with a backrest made of fine vertical strips, a black leather cushion, and a small round black tabletop next to it. The floor is paved with gray stone bricks, with clear texture and slightly worn edges, giving a realistic and everyday feel. In the center is the café's glass door and display window, with a dark metal frame with clean and powerful lines, and the glass is printed with \"FORM.\" The words \"Karakoy\" are elegant and smooth, with a wooden sign reading \"OPEN\" hanging below, along with \"FREEPLACE\" and \"WI-FI\" icons. Through the glass, you can see the warm lighting inside the store and the blurred outlines of tables and chairs. The background is a corner of a city street, with distant building facades in light beige, windows neatly arranged, some air conditioning units exposed, and on the right side are the silhouettes of tree branches and leaves, sparse and sparse, evoking the bleak atmosphere of autumn. The sky has a faint gray-blue tone, with soft and even lighting, like natural light on cloudy or dusk days. The entire shot is shot at a low angle, with the figure occupying the center-right position, creating a full-bodied and layered composition. The visual guide line extends from the chair in the lower left corner to the body, forming a stable triangular structure. The lighting atmosphere is tranquil and warm. The warm yellow indoor lighting contrasts with the cool-toned outdoor environment, creating a serene poetic urban atmosphere. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens. It offers a slight perspective compression effect, making the subject stand out more. The background blurs naturally, with black and white as the main color tones, accented with small amounts of brown, gray, and green. The overall tone is harmonious and unified, and the image texture is delicate, as if shot outdoors with a high-resolution camera under natural light. It has a slight film graininess and increased color saturation, presenting a delicate moment casually captured in daily life, full of storytelling and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
