        {
          "id": "krea2-5725db984fc63c6b4d38b5f5",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣街道困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a stone street in the city, wearing a light blue plush cropped cardigan with a lapel-style collar, neatly arranged buttons, and puffy, soft sleeves that give off a warm feel. She pairs her lower body with deep blue high-waisted wide-leg denim pants. The pants are loose and comfortable, and a black leather belt is tied at the waist. The metal buckle glimmers slightly in the sunlight. On her shoulder is a silver-gray glossy handbag, with clean and smooth lines. The overall look is casual and fashionable. She raises both hands above her head, fingers naturally bent. The posture is full of vitality and joy. Looking directly into the lens, sunlight pours in from the upper left of the frame, creating a soft backlighting effect. The light penetrates through the leaves, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The background is a typical urban street scene: on the left is a dark streetlight pole, on the right are red brick buildings and tree-lined streets, with white spherical decorative lights hanging from the trees, adding a festive touch. In the distance, you can see pedestrians and shop signs, but they are all blurred, creating a natural depth effect. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure is positioned slightly lower and center, occupying the main visual space. The upward extension of both arms guides the gaze toward the top, enhancing the sense of space and dynamism. The overall color scheme is dominated by blue, gray, and brown, with harmonious contrasts of warm and cool tones and rich layers of light and shadow. There are soft golden tones in the morning or evening tones and calm blue tones in the shadows, creating a relaxed, joyful, and vibrant everyday moment, as if capturing an ordinary yet precious moment of happiness. The image has a strong sense of immersion and emotional impact. Like real-life moments shot with a phone, it preserves natural details and imperfect realism, while also possessing artistic beauty, presenting a poetic atmosphere that lies between everyday life and ideals",
