        {
          "id": "krea2-15c8bff961e2afd423cbc75d",
          "alias": "单女黑连体衣城市忧伤倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a black bodysuit, paired with black stockings and high heels, gracefully leaning against the hood of a deep blue classic Mercedes-Benz SL-Class convertible. Her right hand rests lightly on the front of the car, her left hand hangs naturally, legs crossed, showing off her long leg lines, her expression calm and confident. The sky is overcast with clouds, and the light is soft and even, creating a quiet yet slightly melancholic atmosphere In the middle of the scene, a silver-gray modern sedan is parked in the rear, forming a sharp contrast with the classic sports car in the foreground. On the left side, vintage-style streetlights and blurred pedestrian shadows enhance the sense of realism. The composition uses a low-angle shot to highlight the central roles of the person and vehicle. The visual guide converges from the front headlights and body curves toward the center of the image, enhancing the focal effect. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, with faint light spots reflected on the paint surface, and slight shadows at the tire touching the ground, giving the overall tone a cool tone. Mainly blue, gray, and black, accented with orange turn signals for a touch of warmth. The image quality is lifelike, as if shot with a professional camera. The details are rich, from the logo to the license plate number is clearly distinguishable, presenting an imaging style that combines artistic beauty with everyday realism. It has strong visual impact and storytelling, as if capturing a fashionable moment unexpectedly on an urban afternoon",
