        {
          "id": "krea2-9cac4d0537f299524fd62aeb",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服城市媚态倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a light blue short-sleeved uniform shirt, paired with a black tie and a high-waisted black leather skirt. Her legs don black stockings and black pointed high heels, leaning gracefully and confidently against the edge of a dark brown wooden dining table. Her right hand rests lightly on the edge of the table, while her left hand rests naturally beside her thigh. Her expression is calm and slightly thoughtful. Her overall posture exudes a tension that blends professionalism and sensuality. In the foreground, she occupies a slightly left central position in the frame, with her leg lines smoothly extending downward, forming a strong visual guiding line. The middle view features a modern minimalist interior environment. The dark wooden dining table has a smooth, reflective surface, surrounded by modern dining chairs with white upholstered backrests. The background is a soft beige wall decorated with vertical lines. The floor is covered with a gray-and-white striped carpet with delicate texture. In the distance, a round white chandelier casts a warm, soft glow, casting light from above and from the sides, creating soft and layered shadows. The overall light and shadow atmosphere is warm and intimate. The composition is slightly angled upward to highlight the figure's height and presence. Geometric lines are formed by the edge of the dining table and the seat back, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The main color tones are blue, black, brown, and off-white, with a striking contrast of warm and cool yet harmonious unity. The image texture is delicate and lifelike, as if shot by professional photography under indoor lighting, presenting real light and material details. It has highly realistic artistic expression while preserving the atmosphere of daily life, creating a moment where urban professional women showcase their charm in a private space, full of storytelling and visual appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
