        {
          "id": "krea2-4d60f2aa1440a2a8a1d91057",
          "alias": "单女紫西装门忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a deep purple suit sits indoors, wearing a black turtleneck shirt and black stockings, paired with black high heels. Her legs are crossed and naturally stretched out on a carpet featuring blue and white geometric patterns. Her body leans slightly forward, head lowered, and her expression is slightly melancholic and contemplative, creating a relaxed yet elegant posture. Her right hand rests gently on her thigh, her left hand hangs naturally, fingers slightly bent, making the overall posture both relaxed and full of tension. In the foreground is a white bedsheet or sofa cushion. It occupies most of the upper left corner, forming a soft curved contour. On the right, a white door frame or wall edge cuts diagonally into the frame, creating a strong visual guide that draws the viewer's attention. The middle ground is a woman herself, positioned slightly to the right center of the frame. The carpet she sits on has delicate textures and gradient colors, ranging from light gray to pale blue to white stripes. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with faint walls, paintings, and some furniture outlines. The tones are mainly off-white, light gray, and warm yellow. It creates a warm and intimate sense of space. The composition uses a low-angle shot, with the figure looking up from below, making the figure appear more elongated and powerful. This also enhances the depth and spatial layers of the image. Light comes from the left window, creating a soft side illumination that creates a natural shadow transition. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and quiet, with a slight soft-focus effect, as if captured in the moment when afternoon sunlight streams through the curtains into the room. The overall image presents a quiet moment carefully captured in daily life. It carries a strong sense of artistry and storytelling, like a realistic style photographed with professional equipment, while retaining everyday details and realism. The tone is cool yet warm, emphasizing color contrast and harmonious unity. The deep purple suit paired with black stockings creates a strong visual impact, sharply contrasting with the soft surrounding environment and highlighting the character's presence. The entire scene seems frozen in a brief yet profound moment, evoking a complex emotional intertwining that embodies the professionalism and confidence of a professional woman, and also a deep inner vulnerability and softness. Every element in the painting is carefully arranged—from the tailoring of the clothing to the choice of pose, from the use of lighting to the composition of the composition—together constructing a visual narrative full of emotional tension and aesthetic depth. This image not only conveys the character's external appearance but also delves deeply into their inner psychological state. Through delicate light and shadow transitions and precise perspective choices, it creates an artistic expression that goes beyond ordinary portraits, prompting viewers to pause and gaze, pondering the stories and emotions behind them, ultimately forming a visual work that combines realistic texture with poetic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
