        {
          "id": "krea2-0486fe6e0fde5847169ae9f0",
          "alias": "单女牛仔庭院温柔站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in an outdoor courtyard, presenting a lazy yet vibrant vibe. She stands slightly to the side, her right hand tucked into her jeans pocket, wearing a few simple gold rings on her fingers. Her nails are neatly trimmed and painted with red polish, echoing the sweater color. She wears a loose-fitting V-neck red knit sweater with clearly visible yarn texture, soft and voluminous. She pairs it with blue high-waisted jeans, creating an overall look that is casual yet fashionable. In front of the building is a neatly trimmed wall of green shrubs, forming a natural hedge barrier. In the foreground is a black wrought iron railing with elegant curled patterns and smooth lines, exuding a classical aesthetic. Behind the railing, a small water feature or fountain edge can be faintly seen. The calm water surface reflects the surrounding scenery, and the composition uses medium to near ground close-ups, with the figure occupying the center to the right The head is slightly tilted, and the gaze is directed toward the camera, creating an intimate and relaxed atmosphere. The light comes from the upper left, belonging to soft, naturally diffused light, possibly on cloudy days or early morning/evening light. The sunlight is not harsh, shadows are soft, and there is no strong contrast between light and dark. The overall color palette is mainly warm red, green, and off-white, harmoniously unified. The red sweater becomes the visual focal point, forming a sharp contrast with the green plants. The layers of light and shadow are rich, the atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, full of French romantic vibe. It seems to capture a leisurely afternoon moment, with a film-like texture, moderate color saturation, clear details, and minimal noise. It looks like a professional camera shoot while preserving the natural feel of everyday life. Overall, it presents a sophisticated blend of fashion and lifestyle aesthetics. The composition is meticulous, using railings as foreground frames to guide the gaze to the main subject, while the buildings and greenery add depth and storytelling to the scene. The visual direction extends from the foreground iron railing toward the central figures. The transition to buildings and greenery in the background creates a good sense of spatial layering. The entire scene exudes a warm, comfortable, and slightly lazy atmosphere, like a carefully crafted artistic portrait or a record of beautiful moments in real life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
