        {
          "id": "krea2-d4012768a40d20f3d4605103",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫门冷淡坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman in a black turtleneck gown sits elegantly in the back seat of a luxury car. She wears a pair of black leather gloves, while her left hand is adorned with long lace gloves featuring mesh cutouts. Her wrist is adorned with a metal chain, showcasing exquisite fashion details. She wears classic double C logo earrings, highlighting her luxurious taste. She leans back on beige leather seats, with a warm brown fur collar visible on her shoulders, adding a touch of luxury to the overall look. The windows are half-open, and the silver-gray body edges are smooth, giving the cabin a spacious interior. The rear seats feature diamond pattern stitching, showcasing a high-end custom craftsmanship. The camera is filmed from an angle outside the car. capturing the harmonious composition between the profile's profile and the interior environment. The foreground features geometric lines formed by the door frame and glass edges, the middle ground features the female subject, her clothing, accessories, and interior furnishings, while the background is a blurred external environment. The flow of light and shadow on city streets can be faintly seen, with light coming from the front side, soft and layered. At the same time, subtle reflections form on the veil and leather, while the shadowed areas deepen the three-dimensionality and dramatic effect of the image. The overall color palette is dominated by black, white, and gray, creating a cool and elegant atmosphere. Elegant and full of storytelling atmosphere, like a tranquil moment in a film, combining the sophistication of a modern city with the romantic mood of a nostalgic era. The composition emphasizes symmetry and blank space, using window frames and character poses to create a triangular structure that enhances visual stability and sparks viewers' imagination of her inner world. The entire scene resembles a carefully crafted artistic portrait, combining the refinement of fashionable photography with the narrative tension of cinematic lenses, presenting a unique beauty that is both everyday and transcendent",
