        {
          "id": "krea2-00b0ba34ce96151c31d29417",
          "alias": "单女银连衣裙酒店沉思坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "Her makeup is delicate and natural, presenting a healthy glow. She wears a silver sequin tight dress with a low cut that highlights elegant curves. The hem hugs her figure, and the waist cinches outline a slender waistline. The dress is covered with fine shimmering beads, creating a flowing metallic texture under the light. The hem slightly parted, revealing long legs. She paired it with silver high-heeled sandals inlaid with dense glitter, with a thin ribbon wrapped around the ankle and a stiletto heel. The overall look is luxurious and feminine. She sits dignified, legs crossed, one foot lightly touching the steps, the other slightly extended, hands naturally folded on the knees, a posture relaxed yet elegant. The background is an indoor stairwell, with dark wood or black steps, each edged with white stripes. Beneath the steps are long striped LED strips, emitting a soft glow that illuminates the steps and the lower body of the figure. The walls are beige or light brown, slightly rough and bearing the marks of time. Above, a golden metal handrail runs across the frame, its surface smooth and reflective. The bracket fixed to the wall is bronze-colored, giving it a vintage feel. The staircase structure extends diagonally, forming a strong diagonal composition from the lower left to the upper right, guiding the gaze upward. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with a slightly turned body and head facing the camera, forming a visual focal point. The light mainly comes from the step light strip and ambient light, creating a warm and slightly mysterious atmosphere. Light and shadow intertwine, with obvious highlights reflecting the figures. Especially the sequin parts of the dress and shoes create a star-like sparkling effect. The background wall and handrails also have slight reflections, creating a three-dimensional spatial effect. The image uses a low-angle angle to enhance the character's presence and presence. The composition is full and layered, with the foreground showing the main figure and some steps, the middle ground extending the staircase and lighting area, and the background being the wall and handrail. The colors are warm yellow, silver-gray, and dark brown, harmoniously unified. The overall style combines fashion and lifestyle, as if in a high-end hotel, Authentic moments captured in theater or private club stairwells feature delicate image texture and rich details, featuring professional photography light control and color expression, while preserving the natural feel and authentic atmosphere of everyday shooting, presenting an elegant and composed urban nightlife",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
