        {
          "id": "krea2-7ce90b45675a8653a349dae7",
          "alias": "单女银连衣裙城市沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a silver-gray strapless dress with a slight metallic sheen, and the tailored fit outlines graceful curves. The straps are adorned with gold beads and metal accents, adding a touch of luxury. Her right hand holds a black smartphone, aiming at the mirror for a photo, while her left hand gently supports two large shopping bags, and a slender silver bracelet is strapped to her wrist The overall posture is natural and relaxed, as if having just completed a pleasant shopping experience. In the foreground are two huge beige paper bags printed with the \"miumiu\" brand logo. The texture of the bags is delicate, the edges neatly folded, and the body slightly bulges due to the stuff of items, occupying most of the space below the frame, creating a strong visual direction. The middle frame shows the woman's full-body reflection, standing in front of the mirror, her body slightly turned to one side, her left arm bent with smooth lines, and her right arm raised holding her phone, her posture elegant and genuine. The background is the interior of the shop, with light blue walls in a simple and modern tone. Multiple sets of recessed spotlights are installed on the ceiling, evenly distributed, creating a bright and sophisticated atmosphere. On the right is a row of white display shelves neatly displaying various leather shoes and boots, including brown ankle boots, yellow tassel shoes, black knee-high boots, and more. Each pair of shoes is neatly arranged. In the distance, on the left, a light blue fabric sofa chair can be seen, alongside other shelves and products. The reflection in the mirror is rich and complete. The composition centers on the figure, using a mirror-reflective perspective to create a symmetrical and layered visual effect. The shopping bags in the foreground and the figures in the middle and the background together create a sense of depth, guiding the gaze from the real objects in the foreground to the background space. The lighting atmosphere is bright and soft, with evenly distributed indoor lighting without strong shadows, creating a shopping scene that is both modern and cozy. The visuals have a documentary feel of everyday life, as if casually taken with a regular phone, with details that are authentic and natural. It retains the refined aesthetic of a fashion magazine, capturing a moment full of life yet taste. The entire image is filled with the independence and confidence of urban women, as well as their pursuit and enjoyment of a better life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
