        {
          "id": "krea2-84250181174b66caa1bb36ef",
          "alias": "单女蓝长裤酒吧俏皮站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in an indoor space filled with vintage country vibes. She wears a red and white striped short-sleeved top with a red collar trim, paired with deep blue high-waisted flared pants, and a pair of simple gold sandals. The overall look blends French vintage with modern casual style. Her makeup is exquisite, her expression calm and confident. Her left hand rests lightly on the wooden bar counter, while her right hand carries a beige woven handbag with clear texture. In the other hand, she carries a red canvas bag, adding a bright touch. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly tilted to the camera, showcasing elegant contours. In the foreground is a bar counter transformed from a log stump, retaining natural wood grain and rough texture. The edges are polished, and below is a brick base, solid and layered. Inside the bar is a wooden wine rack, with six neatly arranged circular grooves for storing bottles. On the counter are a heavy book, a woven basket, and a small green bowl and plate, with items arranged in an orderly manner. It creates a lively atmosphere. The middle ground features a female subject, positioned on the right side of the painting, occupying the visual center. The composition uses a third-level method, with the figure leaning to the right, leaving space on the left to display environmental details. The background is a bright kitchen area, with clean and tidy white walls. The ceiling is a wooden sloped ceiling, with beams and wooden panels showing warm brown tones. A brass chandelier hangs in the air, with a lampshade made of milky white glass spheres that emit soft light. On the wall hangs a beautifully mounted landscape painting. It depicts hazy coastal or pastoral landscapes, with a white door frame and partial furniture outlines visible in the distance, hinting at the extension of the space. The floor is paved with brown terracotta tiles, each with embossed patterns. The joints form geometric patterns, enhancing the vintage texture of the space. The entire scene is filled with natural light from the window direction, which streams in from the left rear, creating a soft backlighting effect that gives the figures a slight halo, while delicate shadow transitions appear on the floor and bar surface, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The colors are mainly earthy tones, including brown, beige, white, and deep blue, accented with red and green, creating a harmonious visual contrast. The image has a strong sense of everyday life and life, as if capturing a real moment from life, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera, with slight graininess and natural exposure control. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is shallow, the background is slightly blurred, highlighting the main subject. The composition is balanced and storytelling, presenting an overall warm and cozy atmosphere. A lazy yet stylish home aesthetic style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
