        {
          "id": "krea2-964342179ca256bdabd25645",
          "alias": "单女米衬衫公寓媚态倚靠持花",
          "prompt": "She wears a light beige loose short-sleeved shirt and high-waisted khaki shorts, paired with light yellow flat sandals. Her body leans slightly forward, her left hand gently gripping the handlebars, her right hand naturally hanging down, her posture elegant and relaxed, displaying an effortless sensuality and spontaneous beauty. Under the sunlight, she glows softly, her expression slightly contemplative, as if immersed in a quiet afternoon. The bicycle is a classic style, with a frame of dark gray metallic texture, wheel edges with fine spokes, and handlebars fitted with black leather handles. The front basket is filled with vibrant flowers—red, pink, yellow, purple, and blue flowers intertwined into a vibrant bouquet. The petals are full, and green leaves dot the space, making the blossoms especially vibrant. The basket is fixed in front of the handlebars, slightly tilted, adding a playful touch. The bicycle rests beside a black cast iron lamp post, whose surface is carved with exquisite embossed patterns. The floor is paved with light gray stone slabs. In the gaps, fine dust and gravel can be seen. The background is a blurred outdoor park scene, with faint distant stone railings, sculptural outlines, and dense trees, creating a tranquil and layered sense of space. The overall composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left on the right side of the frame, and the bicycle extending diagonally to the lower left to form a diagonal guide. The visual focus is on the interaction between the figure and the flower basket, with the foreground highlighting the details of the flower basket and lamp post, the middle shot focusing on the overall form of the figure and bicycle, and the background being blurred, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The light comes from the upper right, soft natural daylight, filtering through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. The figure's back and legs are illuminated by bright light, creating a natural contrast between light and shadow. The tones are mainly warm yellow and off-white, paired with the vivid colors of the bouquet, creating a harmonious and vibrant visual layer. The overall atmosphere of the painting is tranquil and romantic, full of life and artistic beauty, as if it were a documentary photo from the streets of 1970s Europe. It features the unique grainy texture and slight fading effect of film photography. The lens is shot with a standard prime lens of about 50mm and an aperture of f/2.8, capturing true, delicate details and a smooth transition in depth of field. There is slight vignetting at the edges, enhancing the nostalgic and cinematic feel. Overall, it presents a beautiful moment captured by chance in daily life, combining documentary realism with artistic aesthetic expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
