        {
          "id": "krea2-9939201dedc695821991d6db",
          "alias": "单女粉泳装厨房微笑坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden kitchen counter, wearing a bright pink spaghleaf swimsuit with slightly curled sleeves. She turns sideways to look back at the camera, revealing a faint smile. Her right hand gently holds a transparent glass cup, which seems to hold liquid. Her left hand gently supports the glass, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her legs are naturally crossed, one foot suspended in the air, the other lightly stepping on the edge of the white cabinet below. Her toes are painted with dark nail polish, with exquisite details, presenting an overall posture that is both casual and charming. In the foreground is her body and the glass cup in her hand. The composition is taken from a low angle and upward angle, highlighting the figure's slender figure and leg lines. On the left side of the painting is a white wall-mounted storage rack, neatly arranging several books, coffee cans, and some small household items. On the right is a small kitchen area, with white ceramic mugs hanging on metal hooks, and several bottled beverage and spice jars nearby. In the white drawer cabinet below the countertop, you can see an old-fashioned microwave, beside which sits a stack of white plates and a wooden storage box. Interior items are faintly visible, with a simple white wall background and light coming from the upper right, creating soft shadows that create a warm and bright atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly pink, white, and natural wood, with harmonious color combinations that are visually fresh and natural. The light and shadow transitions are delicate, presenting an unintentional beauty from everyday life, as if taken with a regular camera, with a slight film texture and graininess. The tone is slightly warm, emphasizing the authentic atmosphere and intimacy of life, with a composition full of layers. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with rich yet cluttered background elements, enhancing the realism and immersion of the scene. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and joyful, full of life charm and youthful vitality, as if capturing an ordinary yet beautiful moment, with strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
