        {
          "id": "krea2-d9df79372b2c033ffd0d7415",
          "alias": "单女白外套公寓冷淡倚靠交叠",
          "prompt": "She wore a fluffy, soft white long fur coat, with the coat open revealing light-colored lace tight pants underneath and white high heels. The overall look presented a luxurious yet cool modern feel. Her posture was elegant and composed, legs crossed, body slightly leaning forward, and her expression carried a hint of calm and detachment, adding softness and dynamism to the composition. In the foreground was a complete image of the woman, clearly visible from head to foot, her figure occupying the main visual center, creating a strong focal point effect. The middle shot features white round seats with smooth and flat surfaces, soft edges, and clean lines that echo the figure's contours. The background is a vertically arranged white strip wall, with these fine vertical strips extending from top to bottom, forming regular geometric patterns that enhance the sense of depth and modern design in the space. The floor is also pure white, blending seamlessly with the feature wall and seats, creating a minimalist, clean, and impurity-free indoor environment. The entire composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame The lines on the seat and background are symmetrically distributed, enhancing the visual stability and order. The viewing angle is slightly lower, capturing the figure from an upward angle, making it appear more upright and commanding. The light and shadow treatment is extremely delicate, with the light source coming from the upper front position, creating a soft and even frontal light. At the same time, slight shadows are cast under the seat and behind the figure, adding depth and spatial layering. The overall lighting is bright and pure, with almost no strong contrast, presenting a cool, white balance atmosphere. The color palette is dominated by white, forming a harmonious and unified color relationship. The overall image exudes a sophisticated, tranquil, and futuristic artistic atmosphere, as if shot in a sterile modern art space or a high-end fashion studio. The image texture is delicate and detailed, with the sophistication of professional commercial photography, while still maintaining the authenticity of everyday aesthetics. The overall atmosphere is calm and restrained, full of the detached beauty of modern cities, evoking minimalist design, high-end fashion runways, or luxury advertising campaigns, with no unnecessary decorations or distractions in the painting; all visual focus is on the figure themselves and their pure environment, emphasizing the individual's presence and stylistic expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
