        {
          "id": "krea2-a22e4233f56c60c060047bc8",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙博物馆站立注视",
          "prompt": "An elegant woman in a black backless dress stands in the center of the Emanuele II Gallery in Milan, Italy. She wears a wide-brimmed top hat adorned with black mesh and feather decorations, her right hand wearing a long black glove gently resting on the brim, while her left hand carries an off-white leather handbag with brown leather edges and metal fasteners. In the other, she pulls an off-white hard-shell suitcase of the same design, featuring a retractable pull rod and four universal wheels. The overall look is vintage and luxurious, and the woman wears black patent leather high heels. With a dignified posture, he turns sideways to look back at the camera, exuding a calm and fashionable aura. His makeup is exquisite, and in the foreground is a smooth marble floor paved with beige and blue grid geometric tiles, reflecting soft light. In the middle ground, the corridor is lined with shops in classical architectural style. The arched porch and carved columns are richly detailed, and the glass dome is made of countless transparent glass panels, forming a huge curved skylight. Natural light pours down from above, casting mottled shadows on the floor and building surfaces. In the background, blurred pedestrian silhouettes can be seen, either walking or pausing, creating an authentic urban atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with women as the visual focus. The depth lines of the corridor guide the gaze into the distance, creating a strong sense of perspective. The figures are positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right to showcase architectural structure and environmental details. Visual guidance uses horizontal, vertical, and diagonal rods to create multiple layers, enhancing the three-dimensional and dynamic sense of the image. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft. Diffused light from the dome evenly illuminates the entire scene, with delicate and natural shadow transitions, highlighting the texture of the materials, such as the luster of leather, the texture of stone, and the reflection of metal. The overall color palette mainly features off-white, brown, and black, accented by small blue squares on the floor. The color combination is harmonious and sophisticated, presenting an elegant atmosphere that combines a sense of history with modern fashion. The image has the texture of high-end commercial advertising photography while retaining the realism of everyday street photography, as if shot during prime time with a professional camera. It captured a moment full of stories in the city",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
