        {
          "id": "krea2-d0ede69568bc1ec09803317d",
          "alias": "单女棕西装广场自信站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under a stone-built arcade, wearing a dark brown tweed double-breasted suit. The top is a fitted short jacket with a lapel, neatly arranged double buttons, a cinched waist accentuating her figure, and a mid-length straight-cut skirt at the hem, reaching the middle of the calf. The overall look is elegant and sharp, paired with a beige pleated handbag slung over the shoulder. The body hangs naturally to form a soft curve, and the figure's posture is relaxed and natural. Her left hand rests lightly on the edge of the stone wall on the right, while her right hand hangs naturally at her side, fingers slightly bent. He wears light brown square-toe high heels, with a simple and unadorned upper, revealing his long leg lines that look slightly fluffy and messy. His neck lines are graceful, his expression calm and confident. The background is a rough gray-brown stone wall, with clear textures. The stones vary in size, with obvious gaps at the joints. The wall has an arched structure, and behind the right side is dense green plants, with lush branches and leaves, some of which extend to the center of the painting. The sky appears overcast with soft and even lighting. The overall composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The foreground shows the base of the stone wall and the ground, the middle ground shows the person's entire body and handbag, and the background features stone walls and greenery. The light and shadow come from naturally diffused light, with moderate contrast between light and shadow, soft shadows, and a quiet and steady atmosphere, exuding a retro artistic vibe. The color tones are mainly brown, gray, and green, with low saturation, creating a low-key, luxurious, and story-rich visual effect. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a professional camera. Rich in details and distinct layers, it has the texture of a high-end fashion blockbuster",
