        {
          "id": "krea2-7393eeb919ec6caeab4083bf",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫办公室沉思坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of a vintage-style reddish-brown wooden desk. She wears a light blue long-sleeved shirt with a gray knit vest and a black high-waisted mini skirt, paired with black stockings and black strappy high heels. Her legs are elegantly crossed, her left leg draped over her right, looking calm and confident. She is reading a book with a red hardcover in both hands, wearing black-rimmed glasses, her expression calm and slightly thoughtful. Her overall look presents an intellectual and sexy professional womanly temperament, with the main subject positioned slightly to the left center. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figures occupying most of the canvas to highlight their presence as visual focal points. The foreground features detailed tabletops, including a smooth reddish-brown leather tabletop, several stacked red books on the right, and part of a vintage telephone on the left. The background is a light beige wall with a beautifully framed landscape painting depicting wildflowers and grassy pastoral scenery. On the left side of the painting is a dark leather sofa topped with a red-and-green cushion. The floor is light brown wood with natural wood grain. Light softly streams in from the front left of the frame, creating a warm side lighting effect. Shadows are clearly cast on the walls and figures, creating a three-dimensional layering of light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and academic, with main tones of warm brown, off-white, gray-blue, and red. The color combinations are harmonious and unified, giving the image a delicate texture that feels like real photography and everyday amateur equipment, as if captured indoors under natural light with a regular camera. The camera slightly blurs the scene, enhancing its realism and sense of life. The textures and materials of the clothing appear natural, and the paper texture and metal bookmarks are clearly visible. The entire scene is full of storytelling, evoking the image of a quiet afternoon where she enjoys reading in the office. The composition is stable, the visual direction is natural, forming a smooth visual flow. The transitions of light and shadow are soft, the details rich, presenting an image style that combines artistic beauty with the realism of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
