        {
          "id": "krea2-dea23125a950a040adec127d",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣城市忧伤坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in fashionable urban style sits on the stone steps by the Seine in Paris. She wears a bright red beret, an off-white knit sweater, and a leopard-print long skirt. Her legs are crossed, black stockings wrap her long legs, and she wears dark high heels. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, holding an open Financial Times newspaper in her hands, creating a mysterious and serene atmosphere. The headline reads \"Merkei party's election setback.\" \"threatens to rock Berlin coalition\" is clearly visible, with a neat layout and rich illustrations, presenting a typical British newspaper layout. The edges of the newspaper are slightly curled, showing signs of being flipped through. The character wears a simple metal bracelet on his left wrist, and a delicate ring on his right ring finger. The details are rich and realistic. In the foreground, a transparent glass holds a pale amber-colored wine, the wine glistening softly under soft light. A few bright red cherry tomatoes are scattered beside the cup, and beside it sits a woven basket filled with cherry tomatoes. The edges of the basket are slightly worn, adding a touch of life. The background is the iconic Eiffel Tower, whose steel structure displays delicate grid patterns under the cloudy gray-white sky. The tower's body is partially hollowed to create a natural depth effect. Below the tower is a classical arch bridge made of gray-white stone, with a semicircular arch arch and faint figures of people and vehicles passing across the bridge. On the distant riverbank, faint outlines of buildings and some warm yellow lights are scattered, possibly from riverside cafés or restaurants. The light is soft and slightly cool, with the overall color scheme mainly gray, white, brown, and black. The red beret and tomato serve as visual focal points in the composition. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures positioned slightly below the center of the frame, newspapers occupying the upper half, and the Eiffel Tower as the backdrop extending from above, creating a strong perspective guide. The view naturally extends upward from the foreground wine glasses and tomatoes to the figures, then guided by newspapers to the arched structure of the tower, creating a smooth visual flow. The light and shadow come from diffuse light from cloudy days, resulting in uniform but slightly dim lighting without obvious directional shadows, creating a quiet, restrained, and slightly melancholic urban daily feel. The image texture is close to film photography, with slight graininess and a retro filter effect with low color saturation. The lens uses a 50mm standard prime with moderate focal length and well-controlled depth of field. This makes the subject clear and the background moderately blurred, enhancing spatial layering. The overall atmosphere blends the detachment and poetry of urban life, reflecting modern reading habits while also revealing the romantic everyday aesthetics of Paris. It feels like a moment of life captured unintentionally, resembling a professionally shot fashion photo or a real scene captured with an amateur camera, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
