        {
          "id": "krea2-6a27b755dcb8743332ded6b5",
          "alias": "单女棕T恤城市侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman appears in the frame at a low angle, looking upward, slightly tilting her head as if gazing at something distant and beautiful, presenting a natural and relaxed state that adds a touch of dynamism. She wears a brown-and-white striped short-sleeved T-shirt, made of lightweight fabric with clean lines. She holds a transparent glass jar in both hands, with a rounded body and metal clasps. Inside the jar is a clear liquid, possibly water or tea. At the bottom, a faint red pattern is visible, and her hand posture is natural, with long fingers. Nails painted light pink nail polish, with balconies or courtyards in urban residential areas in the background, white exterior walls of residential buildings behind, windows and air conditioning units clearly visible, architectural structures arranged in a staggered manner, and distant red railings and clothes racks as everyday details. In the upper left of the painting are dense green branches and leaves, slender and slender, sunlight filtering through the leaves, casting mottled light and shadows to create a natural light spot. The overall composition uses a low-angle upward shot, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right and the head extending upward, creating a sense of spatial depth. The foreground features a clear glass jar and close-up of hands, while the background features blurred city buildings and greenery. The contrast between solid and void is obvious, ultimately pointing to the sky above, forming a smooth visual path. The light comes directly from above, belonging to bright natural light. Sunlight filters through the leaves to create soft scattered light, creating natural transitions between highlights and shadows. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, gentle, and poetic, evoking a sense of daily leisure and capturing beautiful moments. The color tones are mainly warm white and light green, with moderate saturation. It presents a fresh and natural summer vibe, with image quality close to amateur camera or mobile phone shooting, with slight graininess and realistic lens distortion. The edges are slightly out of focus, but details retain authenticity. The overall image feels like a casual snapshot, capturing an ordinary yet touching moment, full of youthful energy and the warmth of life",
