        {
          "id": "krea2-9c383be75926f6fdfc3da5a8",
          "alias": "单女白束身衣摄影棚媚态侧头",
          "prompt": "She turned sideways to look back at the camera, her expression tinged with mystery and seduction. She wore a form-fitting white satin corset, adorned with gold metal buttons on the chest and waist, with slender shoulder straps and an open-back design. Highlighting the long spine and shoulder blade contours, paired with pink mesh fishnet pants on the bottom, the transparent mesh texture clearly visible, outlining the leg lines. On the hips, a fluffy, soft white plush rabbit tail naturally hangs behind the body. On the hands, white short sleeves with metal button details at the cuffs are lightly resting above the hips, creating an elegant yet dynamic pose. The overall look blends sweetness, sensuality, and fashion. The background is a pure light gray gradient wall with even, soft tones, free of any cluttered distractions. It creates a clean and simple visual space, with light coming from the left side of the front, using professional studio lighting methods. The main light is soft and even, supplemented by auxiliary light to supplement shadows, making the subject full of light and a slight creamy sheen. The satin-like reflection on the clothing contrasts with the mesh material's translucency effect, creating a natural transition of light and shadow with rich layering. The composition is mainly center-oriented, with the figure occupying the center-right position, body forming an S-curve, head slightly tilted back and turned toward the camera, gaze directly at the audience, background blurred, Highlighting the subject and enhancing visual focus, the overall atmosphere is quiet and refined, combining artistic flair with commercial photography style. The colors are mainly white, light gray, and pink, cool and harmonious, conveying a visual experience where dreamy and innocent elements intertwine under modern urban aesthetics. It feels like a model capturing a moment at a high-end fashion photo shoot using a professional camera and lighting equipment. The images are rich in detail, realistic in texture, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
