        {
          "id": "krea2-915804d70e5e80496cef4347",
          "alias": "单女毛衣城市冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a modern escalator, wearing a slim long-sleeve knit sweater in emerald green, paired with a black high-waisted pleated short skirt, and shiny patent leather pointed heels paired with black stockings. The overall look is elegant and fashionable, with subtle curls and layers. The main figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame. At the visual center, the foreground features the escalator steps and metal structure. The steps are dark gray with fine anti-slip textures, orange safety warning strips along the edges, and the handrails are made of transparent tempered glass, reflecting the light and shadow of the surroundings. The middle features a woman's body and part of the escalator structure. The background is a simple indoor space, with light gray walls. Multiple recessed circular spotlights on the ceiling emit soft warm white light, creating a warm and modern atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot. This makes the figure appear more elongated and upright, with a strong sense of line extension. The escalator's diagonal lines converge from the bottom of the frame toward the center, creating a strong visual guide that draws the gaze toward the character and enhances the sense of depth in the space. The lighting mainly comes from spotlights and ambient light at the top, creating a uniform and soft illumination. There are subtle highlights and shadows on the figure, highlighting the texture of the clothing and the three-dimensional appearance of the body. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, carrying a sense of everyday urban beauty. The color palette mainly consists of cool gray, green, and black. Accented with warm light, the color contrast is vivid and harmonious, creating images with strong visual tension and artistic feel, as if taken with a professional camera. The photos are rich in detail and clarity, presenting a refined lifestyle aesthetic style while preserving the authenticity and intimacy of everyday scenes, like a moment casually captured by a photographer in a mall or office building, full of story and emotional warmth",
