        {
          "id": "krea2-25f46feccd42b132f95f9220",
          "alias": "单女白旗袍庭院困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a white lace qipao with a stand-up collar and delicate frog buttons. The three-faced cuffs were cinched, and the skirt fit her figure to outline elegant curves. She turned sideways to gaze at the camera, wearing green heart-shaped earrings and pearl studs that complemented her charm. Around her neck hung a jade-green necklace with deep green tassels hanging from the end, gently swaying with her body. Her overall temperament was gentle and elegant, with a blurred outdoor courtyard background. The bamboo grille walls feature a warm brown tone, with distinct layers and lush greenery. The leaves glow softly under the sunlight, with faint pink flowers scattered in the distance. The floor is paved with stone paths and grass growing along the edges. The frame is shot with a shallow depth of field, with a clear focus on the subjects. The background blurs to form circular light spots and color transitions. Light comes from the upper right side, and the natural, soft side light outlines the figures. The lace texture of the clothing is clearly visible, and the interplay of light and shadow creates a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The composition centers on the figure positioned slightly to the left center, leaving space on the right to guide the gaze, creating visual balance. The overall color scheme is fresh and bright, dominated by off-white, emerald green, soft pink, and dark brown, harmoniously unified, presenting a poetic scene where classical Eastern beauty blends with modern fashion. It seems to capture a quiet and beautiful moment in a Jiangnan garden. The image texture is delicate, with a grainy texture and color saturation reminiscent of film photography, while preserving the clarity of digital images. It presents a realism and artistry similar to high-end camera shooting. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with an f/1.8 aperture, simulating real shooting effects, highlighting the subject and creating a dreamy background blur. The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, full of life and cultural beauty",
