        {
          "id": "krea2-071ea5bf8e0fb5ffd94314a4",
          "alias": "单女金短裙街道站立",
          "prompt": "On a city street as night falls, a woman stands in the middle of the street. She wears a black fitted long-sleeve top and a yellow-black plaid pleated mini skirt, paired with a dark brown lambswool collar pilot jacket, black stockings, and a black handbag in her right hand. The overall look blends vintage and modern fashion elements, full of the unique charm of urban women. In the foreground, she occupies the left central position, her body slightly turned to the side, one leg slightly bent. On both sides are tall classical buildings, with walls made of gray stone. The windows are arranged in rectangular shapes, some of which emit warm yellow light. The right building's exterior is beige, featuring exquisite decorative lines and balcony structures. In the distance, a faint glow of neon signs can be seen. A black convertible sports car parks behind it on the right, its taillights on, and the red beam stands out in the darkness. The car reflects the surrounding lights, giving it a metallic texture. The street surface is a dark asphalt pavement, with clear white traffic markings and red-and-white speed bumps. Several power lines cross the air, forming geometric lines. The composition uses a centered composition, with the main figure centered slightly to the left. Using perspective, the street extends into the distance, creating a strong sense of depth. The body lines extend down to the legs, then turn to the vehicles and buildings in the background, creating a coherent visual path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly warm yellow, with streetlights and internal lights projected onto the figures. Soft contour light is formed, while subtle shadow layers are created to enhance three-dimensionality. The illuminated parts of the background buildings show warm tones, while the unlit areas blend into the night, creating a contrast between light and dark. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling, as if capturing a fleeting yet touching moment in a city at night. The images have a strong cinematic and artistic feel, like street photos taken by professional photographers in low-light environments with high-resolution cameras. The details are rich, color saturation is moderate, and textures are clear. It retains both realism and a touch of dreaminess, as if it comes from an independent modern urban film setting",
