        {
          "id": "krea2-68ec53019c7ac96784bf336a",
          "alias": "单女风衣高塔忧伤坐持包",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a glossy burgundy long trench coat sits gracefully on the stone railing in front of the Eiffel Tower in Paris, her posture calm and confident. Her long legs are wrapped in black stockings, and she is wearing pointed heels in the same color. Beside her is a red quilted handbag. The overall look is fashionable and full of urban charm. The main figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, occupying the visual center and forming a strong focal point. In the foreground is a rough-textured gray stone railing, with signs of aging and fine cracks. On the right side, there is a black cast iron carved railing whose complex curled patterns contrast with modern architecture. In the middle are streets and pedestrians, with several cars parked by the roadside, including a silver SUV and a black sedan. In the distance, bare tree branches intertwine, presenting a bleak atmosphere of late winter and early spring. The background features the iconic Eiffel Tower, mainly metal structures extending from the base to the sky. The tower's details are clearly visible, surrounded by typical Parisian architectural complexes, with beige exterior walls. French window frames and roof decorations enrich the city's texture. The sky is covered with grayish-white clouds, with warm yellow light shining through, creating a soft yet slightly melancholic atmosphere at dusk. The composition uses a vertical frame, with the main subject centered slightly to the left. The Eiffel Tower serves as a vertical guide line, enhancing spatial depth and creating a natural visual flow. Light and shadow come from above, bringing three-dimensional light and shadow layers to figures and buildings. The trench coat's surface reflects a delicate sheen, highlighting the texture of the material. The overall color palette is mainly red, gray, and brown, with moderate saturation, combining sophistication with realism. The image style blends fashion photography and street style aesthetics, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the casualness and authenticity of everyday life. The cinematic visual language simulates 50mm prime lens capture, with slight depth of field blurring the background to emphasize subject clarity. The edges of the frame are slightly vignetted to enhance the vintage film texture. The overall atmosphere is both romantic and calm, conveying the elegant temperament of an urban woman who is independent and self-reliant, wandering through the world's capital, as if on a chilly afternoon. She stands alone at the intersection of history and modernity, lighting up the gray tones of Paris with a red outfit. Time freezes in that moment, emotions flow silently, like a carefully chosen travel portrait, carrying the pursuit of beauty and yearning for freedom",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
