        {
          "id": "krea2-9af369df15f631f1fb3d5028",
          "alias": "单女粉衬衫卧室媚态倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sat on a bed in the bedroom, naturally resting on her shoulders. She wore pale pink lipstick, her expression tinged with a hint of laziness and thoughtfulness. She slightly lowered her head to gaze at her hands—her fingers long, nails neatly trimmed and painted with pink gradient nails. On her left wrist, she wore a slender silver bracelet, and on her arm were several small black tattoos, including a fish shape and some symbols. She wore a light pink long-sleeved shirt with an open collar, The sleeves are rolled up to the elbows, layered over a black spaghetti strap dress. The skirt is short in design, revealing beige lace knee-high socks on the thighs. The lace pattern is delicate and delicate, with ruffled edges. She crosses her legs, bends her right leg, knee close to her chest, and gently rests her right hand on her left knee. Her body leans forward slightly, her posture elegant and relaxed. The background is a cozy bedroom environment, with white sheets spread out on the mattress with subtle wrinkles. The headboard and backrest are made of white wood with horizontal stripes, and a mirror hangs on the wall behind. The mirror reflects a corner of the room, faintly showing a string of warm yellow string lights. The light is soft and warm, creating a hazy halo effect. On the right wall corner, there is a white radiator, mainly in white, beige, and black tones. The light comes from the left, presenting a soft side lighting effect. The light source may be a window or desk lamp, with rich layering of light and shadow, soft shadows, highlighting skin texture and clothing texture. The composition uses a medium close-up, with the figure occupying the left center of the frame, arranged diagonally to create a sense of visual flow. The overall atmosphere is quiet and private, full of life and a sense of everyday life, as if shot with a regular camera or mobile phone. There is slight noise and realistic details, moderate color saturation, not exaggeration, emphasizing realism and intimacy. The images present a modern urban woman's home state, combining professionalism with softness and sensuality. The overall style leans toward realism, focusing on detail and emotional expression. The images are clean and tidy, without unnecessary decoration, focusing on the natural state of the subjects and their surroundings",
