          "id": "krea2-4ea07ed29f028436f3bb797b",
          "alias": "单女泳装俏皮站立侧头",
          "prompt": "Her arms are smooth, shoulders and back curves graceful, and the bikini design is simple yet sexy. The blue and white stripes harmonize with the blue court in the background. She wears white sneakers, one foot slightly raised, showing a natural standing posture. In the foreground is a clearly visible black tennis net. The mesh lines are fine and textured, with white trimming and a striking contrast with the blue ground. In the middle is a female subject, positioned slightly to the right of the frame, her body arranged diagonally with her head slightly tilted, creating a lazy and confident atmosphere. The background is a vast blue tennis court, with a bright blue-blue ground painted with white borders and red corners. The lines are straight and clear, extending into the distance, creating a strong sense of geometry and spatial depth. The entire scene unfolds under bright daylight, with light shining from above to the left. This makes the outlines and body details of the figures clearly visible, with soft shadows cast on the ground and the net, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The light and shadow distribution is even, with the overall tone dominated by blue, creating a fresh, energetic, and slightly retro summer atmosphere. The images have a slight film graininess and warm color shifts, simulating the effects of vintage camera shooting. The edges have slight vignetting, enhancing nostalgia and artistry. Observing her expressions and movements up close, the visual guide is guided upward from the foreground net, forming a natural visual flow. The overall image is full of youthful energy and fashion, resembling a carefully planned fashion portrait or a real-life snapshot casually taken with a phone, capturing the blend of sport and leisure, personality and aesthetics. The visuals are layered, from the foreground mesh to the figures in the middle and then to the court in the background, with clear spatial relationships and moderate color saturation with a slight fading effect. This makes the overall style more artistic and lifelike, with soft yet intense lighting, highlighting the character's outlines and emotional expression, conveying a relaxed, confident, and bold summer attitude",
