        {
          "id": "krea2-b683afb6609fc26597ebe540",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙厨房冷淡坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden kitchen countertop, wearing a blue-and-white floral off-shoulder dress with a hem casually draped to her knees, revealing black lace lingerie and smooth black stockings underneath. Her legs are naturally crossed, one foot hanging in the air, elegant and relaxed, naturally draped over her shoulders. She wears a pair of glasses with pink rims, holding a heavy book with a dark brown cover and gold characters \"HOB 35\" on the spine, and a white ceramic cup in her right hand holding a light-colored drink, possibly coffee or tea She slightly lowered her head, her expression calm, as if immersed in a world of reading. The background was a modern-style kitchen, with light blue walls and white cabinets above. The cabinet doors had black metal handles, and on the right wall hung a black metal storage rack holding two transparent glass cups and a black cookware. Below the pots hung a frying pan and kitchenware, with a warm natural wood surface. On the left was a stainless steel double-sink sink with silver metal faucets, and beside it sat a transparent glass jar. The jar contains a white powdery substance, possibly sugar or salt. Behind the wall, there is a beige cushion that women lean on, adding comfort. The floor is paved with geometric tiles, arranged in blue, brown, and white in triangular and diamond shapes, creating a retro yet modern visual effect. On the right countertop is a pot of green succulents and a colorful small potted cactus, injecting vitality and interest into the composition. The overall composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center and body slightly tilted. Light comes from the left, with soft natural light streaming in through windows or light sources, creating delicate shadow transitions and a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with cool tones predominantly in color schemes. The contrast between the blue walls and the warm-toned wooden countertop enhances visual tension. The overall image presents a scene that combines artistic flair and intimate beauty in daily life, reminiscent of high-resolution photos taken with a professional camera. The details are clear, texture is realistic, and it has strong artistic appeal and a sense of everyday life",
