        {
          "id": "krea2-ad637ed9eb33ddc0558d0360",
          "alias": "单女黑外套城市自信站立",
          "prompt": "She wears a black tweed double-breasted jacket over a black turtleneck sweater underneath, and a delicate metal chain necklace around her neck. The overall look is elegant and fashionable. Her legs are crossed, and she wears black stockings and loafers adorned with black tassels. Her right hand gently caresses her left knee, while her left hand rests naturally on her thigh. Her nails are painted red polish, giving her a refined and detailed look. Her posture is relaxed and confident, with a blurred green lawn and distant stone walled buildings in the background, sunlight streaming diagonally from the left side of the frame. A soft and warm light and shadow effect is created, creating a natural sense of three-dimensionality and texture. The foreground features a clear stone bench edge, with rough textures and wear marks that enhance realism. Next to the bench is a black leather handbag with gold metal fasteners, adding a touch of luxury. The middle ground shows the woman's body and lower body, with the composition centered on the figure. The slightly tilted angle gives the composition more dynamic and visually guiding the image. The background blur treatment makes the main subject stand out, and the overall color scheme is dominated by black, white, and gray. The green grass and the warm yellow of sunlight create a striking contrast, with rich and harmonious color layers. The direction of light and shadow is clear, coming from the upper left, casting long shadows that enhance spatial depth and sense of time. The entire scene presents a fashionable urban street photography atmosphere, as if captured on an autumn afternoon, capturing everyday moments with both a sense of life and artistic beauty. Shot with a professional camera, 85mm focal length, f/2.8 aperture, shutter speed 1/125 sec, ISO 100. The image presents a visual effect of high resolution, low noise, moderate color saturation, and natural contrast. The composition uses the rule of thirds: the character is positioned slightly to the right of the image, leaving space on the left side for visual guidance, while maintaining balance. The overall image is full of modernity and sophistication, giving a visual experience that is both realistic and slightly idealistic",
