        {
          "id": "krea2-65deeed3d7ddcab3747de971",
          "alias": "单女白内衣摄影棚媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "Dressed in a delicate white lace lingerie set with sheer sheer shawls and feather decorations, she wears a golden crown and gazes dreamily at the camera. The overall look blends luxury and dreaminess. She wears high-waisted lace panties and white over-the-knee socks, paired with gold stiletto sandals, striking an elegant and confident posture. Her hands rest naturally on the armrest, her left hand gently caresses the hem of her skirt, and her right leg slightly crossed over her left, forming a soft S-shaped curve. In the foreground, scattered pieces of white fabric and another small golden crown are scattered. It hints at a ritual or symbolic scene. In the left background is a giant brown teddy bear doll, its head partially visible, adding a touch of playfulness and contrast. In the middle is a pink velvet chair with smooth curves on the backrest and slender, stable metal legs, reflecting warm light. On the right, a faint black bracket structure can be seen, possibly a photography lamp stand or furniture component. The background wall is in warm orange tones, creating a soft and layered transition of light and shadow. Natural light from the ceiling slants in from the upper left of the image. Light and shadow effects interplay between the ground and the figures. Sunlight streams through the windows, creating clear shadow outlines that enhance the spatial sense of depth. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures centered prominently. Through clothing details, accessories, and posture, it conveys a noble yet slightly rebellious temperament. The colors are mainly white, pink, and gold, complemented by a warm orange background contrasting with the dark brown teddy bear. The overall atmosphere combines fairy-tale-like dreaminess with real-life intimate sensuality, with delicate use of light and shadow. Shadows are gently laid on the sides of the body and the floor, creating a strong sense of depth and texture. The visuals resemble professional studio shoots but reflect the realism of everyday home environments, as if shot with a medium format camera paired with a softbox, while retaining slight noise and realistic light and shadow changes. It has a strong artistic atmosphere and storytelling, as if capturing a moment of power, identity, and self-expression. The entire scene is reinterpreted like the princess image from the film \"Little Red Riding Hood.\" It combines fairy tale elements with modern aesthetics, presenting a surreal yet life-close visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
