        {
          "id": "krea2-2e8b3f781f810e0e07516b4d",
          "alias": "单女毛衣窗边自信坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window on a white bedside, adding a touch of laziness and casualness. She holds an open book in both hands, her fingers painted bright red nail polish, gently resting on the pages, her posture elegant and composed. She wears a deep blue high-neck, V-neck long-sleeve knit dress with vertical ribbed textures that hugs her figure, and the waist ties create natural pleats. One side of the skirt slits down to mid-thigh, revealing long legs. The overall look is both intellectual and sexy. The background is a bright indoor environment, with clean white walls. On the right is a window framed with a white window frame. On the windowsill are transparent glass cups and green plants, with broad, vibrant green leaves naturally hanging down. Outside the window, faint light and shadows can be seen. Below the windowsill is an art book with the words \"Post-Impressionism\" printed on the cover. When the pages are opened, there is a woven straw bag beside it. The entire scene is lighted softly and evenly, coming from natural light outside the window, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body forming an S-curve, legs crossed, right hand holding a book, left hand naturally hanging down, then turning toward the leg lines, creating a visual flow. The foreground highlights the main subject and clothing details, the middle shot includes books, windowsill items, and some background elements, while the background is mainly blurred greenery and the window view to enhance spatial layering, with light and shadow direction from the left. Soft shadows are formed, highlighting the silhouettes and texture of the clothing. The overall color palette is mainly blue, white, and green, harmoniously unified and harmonious, creating a quiet and elegant atmosphere full of artistic vibes, as if capturing the tranquil moments of afternoon reading. The image texture is delicate and authentic, with the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The details are rich, the transitions of light and shadow are natural, presenting a lifelike artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
