        {
          "id": "krea2-6c20b82ddf6eab1e44a48e7d",
          "alias": "单女黑背心窗边困倦倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "Her body leans slightly forward, her head lowered, exuding a restrained and calm temperament. The black sleeveless top outlines the smooth shoulder and back lines, with a cut-out design on the back adding a touch of sexiness and refinement. She wears a high-waisted, fitted short skirt with delicate horizontal stripes in a warm brown tone. The fitting cut accentuates the hip curves and leg lines. She wears black stiletto sandals with long, straight heels, featuring hollow-out designs and metal clasps accentuating the top. The overall look is both fashionable and powerful, sliding from the shoulders down to the back. Under the light, it glows softly. One hand rests gently on her knee, fingers long, and her nails are painted red, adding a splash of color to the overall look. The other hand hangs naturally at her side, her posture relaxed yet dignified. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with faint wooden railings and window structures. The window frame is light wood, with clean lines that let in bright natural light. Light streams in from outside the window, creating a soft backlighting effect and a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The foreground features light-colored tiles or flooring, reflecting faint light and shadow to enhance the sense of depth in the space. The composition uses a medium close-up perspective, with the figure occupying the center to the right, body forming an S-curve. The visual guide line extends from her head to her ankles, creating a smooth movement. The camera slightly looks down, capturing the complete form of her lower body while preserving details of the upper body. The light and shadow are handled with delicate detail, with light sources coming from the left and behind. Soft shadow transitions are formed, presenting natural gloss. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject while maintaining a sense of realism. The overall color palette is mainly warm brown, black, and white, harmoniously unified and unified. The image is full of artistry and a sense of life, as if a high-quality portrait was taken with professional photography in natural light, with a strong fashion magazine style while also carrying a touch of privacy and authenticity from everyday life",
          "description": "",
