        {
          "id": "krea2-04267210f71fa8b5549a0b8d",
          "alias": "单女透视红西装霓虹夜景自信行走",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a bright red plaid blazer walks through the bustling city streets. She wears a black bodysuit underneath, sheer stockings, and orange-red high heels. Her steps are elegant and confident, paired with oversized sunglasses and exaggerated gold earrings, perfectly blending fashion and personality. Her posture is full of strength, her body slightly leaning forward, arms swinging naturally, as if moving freely through a crowd. In the foreground, blurred figures and vehicles create a dynamic blur, creating a strong sense of sportiness and speed. The middle shot is a clear female subject, positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, becoming the visual focal point. The background is a cityscape filled with skyscrapers. The outlines of buildings create flowing lines of light and shadow due to long exposures. Neon signs and advertising screens flicker with red and blue halos on both sides of the street, while distant traffic and pedestrians are blurred into colorful light bands. The composition uses low-angle downward shots to highlight the figures' upright figures and presence, while wide-angle shots stretch the sense of space, creating a sharp contrast between the figures and the urban environment. Visual guidance naturally guides the viewer's direction of movement and body posture toward the right side of the frame. At the same time, light tracks and blurred elements in the background enhance the depth and dynamism of the image. The lighting and shadow atmosphere presents a warm tone reminiscent of dusk. Sunlight streams through gaps in the buildings, casting soft golden spots on the ground and the figures. The overall lighting is bright and layered, creating a vibrant and passionate urban lifestyle. The visual style combines the characteristics of fashion photography and street art, offering strong visual impact and a modern feel. The texture is delicate, colors are highly saturated, and details are rich, resembling real scenes shot with a professional camera, with slight film graininess and natural depth transitions. The entire image is full of storytelling, capturing moments when urban women maintain themselves and move forward independently amid the noise, conveying themes of freedom, confidence, and charm. Suitable for fashion magazine covers or urban life-themed artistic creations, the images contain no watermarks or logos, purely expressing urban aesthetics and personal style through a pure visual language",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
