        {
          "id": "krea2-96f27325890127bcf23340ea",
          "alias": "单女白围巾害羞倚靠阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman, as the main subject, naturally drapes over her shoulders and chest, revealing a serene yet slightly shy smile. She wears a white lace lace scarf that gently wraps her head, with exquisite embroidered edges adding a touch of vintage elegance. She wears a loose purple plush knit sweater with an off-shoulder design that reveals one shoulder, and the sleeves are soft and voluminous. The overall look blends modern fashion with classical charm. The nails are painted with white or silver nail designs, with a naturally relaxed posture and a slightly leaning body, leaning against a dark brown wooden railing. The railing surface bears clear wood grain patterns and the marks left by time. The background is a typical traditional architectural cluster in southwest China, with roofs covered in gray tiles and upturned eaves. The structure is simple and elegant, with walls made of blue bricks, some of which bear mottled marks, showing the depth of history. In the distance, multi-story buildings can be seen arranged in an orderly manner. One building has a red sign on its exterior that reads: \" Words like \"Fresh Flower Season\" are displayed on the shelves below, with English signs like \"AMDLOGY\" nearby, hinting that this is a commercial district. The sky is deep blue, white clouds gather, and the sun is bright. Light pours in from above and sides, creating delicate transitions in the shadows to create a warm and bright atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, placing the figure slightly to the right of the frame. The wooden eaves in the foreground form a framed composition, with beams and columns guiding the viewer's attention to the subject. The architectural clusters in the background and the sky create a distinct sense of depth, with visual guidance extending from the eaves in the foreground down to the figures. Light and shadow mainly come from natural daylight, oriented toward the upper left and forming natural shadows on the right, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, purple, blue, and taupe, harmoniously unified, combining a retro artistic style with a modern lifestyle. The scene presents a fleeting beauty captured in daily life, as if on a quiet afternoon in an ancient town. A realistic and storytelling photo casually taken with a phone carries a strong sense of everyday life and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
