        {
          "id": "krea2-a9a88dfc9a5620d2482fb88d",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫街道冷淡坐注视（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bench by the street, her makeup exquisite, carrying a hint of confidence and laziness. Her right hand rests gently on her left knee, fingers long, painted bright red nail polish, while her left hand rests naturally on her thigh, her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears a black turtleneck knit sweater with a tight cut that accentuates her slender waist and full curves. Over it is a heavy gray plush coat that is fluffy and soft, presenting a natural plush texture. The wide sleeves casually drape down the sides of the body, creating a rich sense of layering. She wears a black silk skirt with slightly pleated hems that drape naturally as she sits. Her legs are clad in a pair of transparent black printed stockings, covered with repeated \"J'ADORE\" lettering, clear and neatly arranged, creating a visual effect that blends fashion and personality. She wears black high heels with slim heels and smooth lines. The entire look is dominated by black, paired with a gray coat and red nails, creating a strong color contrast. The background is a corner of a city street. The floor is paved with black-and-white checkered tiles, with some areas showing signs of wear and looking somewhat dated. Next to it is a glass display window that reflects indoor lighting and blurred shelf outlines. Inside the window, some product displays can be faintly seen. On the right side is a woven basket, adding a touch of everyday life. In the left background is a wooden table and a black box covered with stickers. The patterns on the box are scattered and richly detailed, adding a sense of urban life to the scene. The overall composition uses a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with a slightly sideways body facing the camera and head facing the viewer, creating direct visual communication. The light comes slightly from the front slightly above, soft and even, with slight shadows that enhance the sense of depth. The glass reflections in the background and indoor lighting create a warm atmosphere. The tones are mainly cool gray and black, accented with red nails and warm yellow lighting, creating a contrast between warm and cool tones. The transition of light and shadow is natural, and the overall atmosphere is both fashionable and everyday, as if on an ordinary city afternoon. Street portraits taken with an ordinary phone or portable camera are realistic, natural, and full of artistic flair. The images have strong visual guidance, then follow her gaze and body lines to the stockings and high heels on her legs, and finally spread to the background details. The composition is stable, layered, and colors harmoniously unified, showcasing the independence and charm of a modern urban woman",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
