        {
          "id": "krea2-dbd042e733771331cadec45b",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装城市冷淡坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a stone railing in a classical building somewhere in Paris. She wears a light blue suit with a well-matched jacket and short skirt, paired with a white strapless top underneath, showcasing an elegant and fashionable urban style. She wears a beige beret and gazes down at the ground. Her posture is relaxed yet dignified, her legs crossed, wearing black stockings and black loafers with gold buckles. Her left hand rests gently on the stone railing, her right hand hangs naturally, and beside her lies a small black handbag, casually draped over the railing. In the foreground is a rough-textured stone railing, carved with classic capitals and curved decorations. The grain is clearly visible, presenting a sense of weight accumulated by time. In the middle is the female subject, positioned slightly to the right of the center of the painting, her body slightly tilted, creating a dynamic balance. The background features the Eiffel Tower under a clear blue sky. The tower's structure is clear, the metal frame gleams with a cool gray sheen in the sunlight, the tower stands tall, pointing straight to the sky, surrounded by several typical Parisian Haussmann-style buildings, with beige exterior walls and neatly arranged windows. Some rooftops are made of red tiles, with rich architectural details and trees scattered throughout. The leaves are golden and orange-red, hinting at autumn. Light streams from the upper left, creating a soft backlighting effect that creates a faint halo at the edges of the figures' silhouettes. The layered light and shadow create a warm and bright atmosphere. The sky is a washed blue, with only a few fine strands of cloud. In the distance, a white flight trail left by an airplane adds a touch of modernity. The composition uses the golden ratio ratio, with the figure occupying the visual center. The Eiffel Tower, as an iconic element, is positioned slightly to the left at the rear, creating a sense of depth from front to back. Stone railings run across the lower part of the frame, serving as a stabilizing base. The colors are mainly blue, beige, and warm yellow, creating harmonious contrasts and visual comfort. Overall, it presents an imaging style that combines artistic beauty with everyday realism. It feels as if a high-resolution camera was shooting during the day, with slight noise to simulate real photographic quality. The images are full of storytelling and emotional tension, evoking travel experiences, dreams, and poetic moments of urban life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
