        {
          "id": "krea2-b1ec06acea1576c280ca38e0",
          "alias": "单女灰衬衫高塔冷淡倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "Her overall temperament is elegant and modern. She wears a gray-white long-sleeved shirt with vertical stripes featuring a unique design, an asymmetrical asymmetrical shoulder neckline, loose sleeves with pleated details, creating a casual yet fashionable look. She pairs a dark gray high-waisted skirt with smooth lines and delicate textures, and her right leg is slightly bent. Knees raised, body leaning forward, right hand gently resting on the windowsill, left hand naturally resting on thigh, posture relaxed yet full of tension, as if gazing at the viewer. The background is a blurred city skyline, distant skyscrapers faintly visible in the mist, the sky presents a gradient of pale blue and white blending, light streaming in from outside the window creating a soft backlight effect, creating an ethereal and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure occupying the left side of the painting and a large space on the right to highlight the openness of the background, visual guidance is formed by the subject's gaze and body orientation. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the sides and rear, forming a distinct contour light that separates the subject from the background. The shadow transitions naturally and richly layered. The overall color scheme is mainly cool-toned, with low-saturation tones such as gray, white, and blue creating a simple yet sophisticated visual tone, enhancing the refinement of the image. The shooting angle is slightly overhead, making the figure appear more elongated. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject's clarity. The entire image presents a serene, elegant, and slightly detached image of a city woman, like a classic shot in an art film, combining realism and artistic beauty. It is as if a professional camera captured a moment at dawn or dusk. The image is delicate and detailed, combining the casual nature of daily life with studio-level light and shadow control, conveying a restrained yet powerful aura that is unforgettable",
