        {
          "id": "krea2-a47b461f48c2d77ad2df7f0b",
          "alias": "单女旗袍公园注视",
          "prompt": "The qipao is tailored to fit with short sleeves, high collar frog buttons, and golden floral patterns extending along the shoulders, chest, waist, and hem, showcasing exquisite traditional craftsmanship. The fabric is smooth, with a silky sheen and pleated details. Her hands naturally fold in front of her, her posture dignified, her body slightly turned to the side, revealing graceful curves. In the foreground are several blooming pink cherry blossoms, with light petals and slightly yellow stamens. The branches stretch out naturally, partially obscuring the edges of the painting to create a soft framing effect. The middle ground shows the woman's clear outline, while the background is a blurred cherry blossom forest. The layers of pink flower seas are layered, with the blurred treatment creating a dreamlike sense of depth. The tree branches are dark brown, crisscrossing and crisscrossing. A faintly visible light stone path winds forward on the ground. The overall composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly center-left. The guide line is formed by branches in the foreground and a small path in the background, guiding the gaze toward the main subject. The light and shadow come from soft, diffused light, resembling natural light in the early morning or evening. Light falls from the upper left, with soft shadows that are not abrupt. The overall color palette is dominated by black, gold, and pink, with sharp contrasts yet harmonious unity, creating a tranquil, gentle, and poetic Eastern aesthetic atmosphere. The image texture is close to that of high-resolution camera shooting, with slight film graininess and realistic lens depth of field. The color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and layers are distinct. It is like a true portrait taken with professional photography equipment in Spring Park, combining artistry and a sense of daily life, presenting an aesthetic that is both classical and modern",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
