        {
          "id": "krea2-946d8edb17ce6f0e97563bdf",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙床沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed covered with beige sheets, wearing an elegant white satin off-shoulder dress. The tight design outlines a slender waistline, with wide white ribbons adorning the cuffs. She wears a delicate pearl necklace, her posture graceful yet slightly contemplative, exuding a serene confidence and gentleness. She wears white high heels adorned with sparkling rhinestone decorations, a silver chain detail at the ankle, and her legs covered with semi-transparent lace stockings with delicate texture. Revealing the soft texture of her skin, she leans slightly forward, her right arm supporting her side, her left leg bent, and her right leg extended, forming a relaxed and dynamic sitting posture. The background is a white wall with rough texture, its surface showing irregular textures like hand-painted plaster, adding layers and artistic flair to the space. Several beige and white pillows are placed at the head of the bed, with bedding casually stacked in one corner, creating natural folds and undulations, creating a lazy yet authentic home atmosphere. The overall composition centers on the figure, shot in the middle shot, with the figure occupying the main position. The background is simple yet detailed, and the light comes from the left side of the frame, soft and even, like natural light streaming through the curtains in the morning, illuminating the silhouette and the sheen of the clothing. At the same time, soft shadows are cast on the walls and bedding to enhance the sense of depth. The transition of light and shadow is natural, with tones mainly of white, beige, and light gray, creating a pure, warm, and slightly retro visual experience. The entire scene has a strong cinematic and cinematic feel. It feels like an intimate portrait shot indoors with a professional camera, with a slightly blurred background that highlights the subject. The color saturation is moderate, and the overall atmosphere is peaceful, elegant, and full of storytelling. It feels like a moment frozen between self-reflection and inner monologue. The image contains no unnecessary decoration; all elements serve to express the characters' emotions, presenting an aesthetic style where sophisticated fashion and everyday intimacy intertwine",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
