        {
          "id": "krea2-874e57961f64f112cefc81f7",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣城市沉思坐持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an indoor wooden bench, wearing a beige knit dress paired with a gray plaid blazer. Black stockings wrap her long legs, and she wears gray velvet chunky heels. She holds her phone in her right hand, focusing intently at the screen, while her left hand rests naturally at her side, striking an elegant and composed pose. Beside her is a brown leather handbag. The background is the junction of a warm-toned wooden wall and a light-colored textured wall. The floor is paved with off-white marble tiles, providing soft and even lighting that creates a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The overall composition uses a medium perspective. The figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, with the lower left corner emphasizing the leg lines. The light and shadow layers are distinct, with earth tones as the main tone—gray, brown, and beige harmoniously unified—presenting the tranquil moments of urban women's daily lives, as if taking a brief break while waiting in a hotel lobby or high-end club. The camera captures a moment of tranquility in the busy life of modern women, with a realistic texture reminiscent of professional camera shots, while preserving the natural feel of everyday scenes. The visuals have strong narrative value and visual tension. Although the characters' expressions are hidden by masks, body language conveys focus and contemplation. The overall atmosphere is quiet and story-rich, with compositions cleverly using spatial division and color contrast to enhance visual appeal. The background is simple and does not overshadow the main subject, with delicate light and shadow transitions and clear material details, such as the sheen of stockings, the texture of coats, the suede texture of shoes, and the reflection of phone screens, creating a refined yet lifelike sense of fashion. It feels as if a photographer has captured urban life scenes under natural light with professional equipment, authentic and artistically moving",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
