        {
          "id": "krea2-f6a2b677fc4b3e2649c012ad",
          "alias": "单女制服公寓媚态坐",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style female student uniform, a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a gray knit vest and a dark pleated short skirt, with a blue-and-white striped tie at the collar and a delicate school emblem pinned to her chest. She sits on a modern sofa with deep blue velvet texture, legs elegantly crossed, right leg resting on the sofa backrest, left leg resting flat on the cushion, posture relaxed yet slightly provocative, her expression calm yet revealing a hint of coolness and detachment. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, forming a visual focal point. The foreground features parts of the sofa and the figure's legs, highlighting body lines and clothing details. The middle ground shows the entire figure and the sofa as a whole. The background features a huge floor-to-ceiling window, and outside the window is the city skyline at dusk. Tall buildings stand tall, lights dot the skyline, and the glass reflects warm indoor light with cool outdoor lighting. The window frame divides the scene into multiple geometric zones, enhancing spatial layering. A potted green plant is dotted by the right window, adding a sense of life. The floor is covered with a light gray carpet with fine textures, creating soft lighting throughout the scene. The main light source is a mix of twilight outside the window and warm yellow indoor lighting, creating a quiet yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The low-angle shooting makes the subject appear more elongated and presentable, while the camera tilts slightly to create a sense of dynamism. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure occupies the left side of the frame, leaving space on the right to showcase the cityscape, creating a sense of vertical depth. The colors are mainly cool tones, with blue, gray, and black as the main tones. White shirts and ties serve as bright accents, green plants add a touch of vitality, and the transition of light and shadow is natural. Soft shadows, the reflections on the window glass contrast with the warm indoor lighting, presenting a tranquil moment before urban nightfall, as if capturing the intertwining moment of youth and solitude. The image texture is delicate and rich, combining photographic realism with artistic atmosphere, like a storytelling portrait taken with a professional camera at dusk, full of modernity and emotional tension",
