        {
          "id": "krea2-fb5e071f430a74edcb716989",
          "alias": "单女黑衬衫摄影棚媚态站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a simple and bright indoor space, wearing a loose long black-and-white vertical striped shirt. The shirt is not fully buttoned, naturally revealing a black lace bra and lace-trimmed underwear underneath. The hem slit down to mid-thigh, creating a subtle sensuality and casualness, adding a touch of laziness and authenticity. She crosses her arms over her chest, lightly rests her left hand on her right, leans slightly to the side, and steps forward with her left leg, presenting a relaxed and confident posture with a subtle emotional expression. She wears a slender gold necklace around her neck, tiny pearl earrings, and a pair of leopard-print high-heeled sandals with stiletto heels featuring hollowed-out and lace details. The overall look blends fashion, sexiness, and everyday vibes. The foreground features a wooden floor with clearly visible wood grain and a warm light brown color. The floor surface shows slight wear and fine scratches, enhancing realism and a sense of life. The center is the main subject, positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with her body forming an S-shaped curve. The composition uses the natural posture of the human body to create visual flow. The background is a pure white wall, on which regular geometric shadows formed by windows or grilles are cast. These shadows are composed of vertical and horizontal lines, forming a grid-like pattern of alternating light and shadow. The interplay of light and shadow enhances the spatial layering and modern feel of the image. The light comes from the left, providing soft natural light with moderate intensity and natural shadow transitions. At the same time, a clear but not overly strong projection is formed on the wall, creating an overall atmosphere that is bright, clean, and minimalist, featuring a minimalist style while also containing a touch of privacy and intimacy. The composition combines central symmetry and asymmetry, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame but not completely centered, leaving a blank area on the right to create visual balance. Visual guidance is achieved through the characters' postures, clothing slits and the extension of light and shadow. The lighting atmosphere is cool yet textured, with a white background and warm floor creating a warm contrast, highlighting the character's contours and colors. The overall image presents the refined feel of professional studio photography, yet retains the casualness and authenticity of everyday life. It feels like a portrait shot with a high-end camera paired with a standard lens in natural light, possessing high artistic and aesthetic value",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
