        {
          "id": "krea2-de5e103b772e1529eccc3a0b",
          "alias": "单女蓝短裤街道微笑蹲比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman squats in front of a brick wall by the street, wearing round slim-rimmed glasses, smiling at the camera. Her right hand makes a V-shaped gesture pointing to the graffiti wall behind her, while her left hand gently rests on her knee. She wears a loose dark blue sweatshirt and matching shorts, paired with black stockings. Her posture is natural and relaxed, her expression warm and lively. Her body leans slightly, forming a dynamic S-shaped curve that showcases youthful energy and approachability. Against the backdrop is a red brick wall painted with graffiti of classic Tom and Jerry characters from the \"Tom and Jerry\" cartoon. Tom ran with an exaggerated expression, while Jerry the mouse playfully chuckled nearby. The colors were bright, the lines bold and powerful, full of childlike fun and street art. Beneath the graffiti were mottled stone steps and scattered dead leaves. The floor was paved with irregular colored tiles, looking somewhat dated but full of lively life. Above the wall was a café sign with white letters on a blue background reading \"Cafe Cake Handmade,\" and a yellow warning sign next to it reading \"Do not touch my flowers or plants\" with cartoon patterns. Various small dolls and decorations are placed on the windowsill. The red and green shade canopy faintly appears in the background. A red wooden door is on the right side of the painting, with a slightly worn door frame that reveals traces of time. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the lower right corner of the painting. The gaze naturally shifts to the graffiti wall on the left, forming a visual focal point. The lighting is soft natural light, like diffused light on cloudy days or early mornings. The shadows are slight, the color saturation is moderate, creating a warm, authentic, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The tones are red, gray, Blue is the main color, accented with bright colors like yellow, green, and orange from the graffiti, adding depth to the image. The texture is close to everyday phone photography, with slight noise and natural depth effects. The camera tilts slightly downward, capturing moments of interaction between the person and the environment, presenting a relaxed, cheerful, and lively street documentary style, as if you were taking a casual stop to capture those ordinary yet interesting moments in the city's corners",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
