        {
          "id": "krea2-dac9f9fa296d3829e8e4aa63",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙城市冷淡站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a mirror taking a selfie, her expression radiating a hint of coolness and confidence. Her right arm is covered with intricate tattoos, including flowers, feathers, and abstract lines. Her left arm is partially visible. She wears a black sleeveless, cropped top with side slits at the hem, paired with a black short skirt and black stockings. She wears brown high heels, and in her right hand she holds a silver smartphone for a mirrored selfie. The phone's camera module is clearly visible, her left hand hangs naturally, body slightly tilted, and her right leg raised and bent. Toes touch the ground, presenting an elegant and relaxed posture. In the foreground is a dark wood-textured door frame edge, composed diagonally, occupying most of the right side of the painting, forming a strong visual guiding line that draws the gaze toward the subject in the mirror. The reflection reflects the indoor environment, with a modern-style room in the background, where a glass door or partition can be seen. Behind the door is another space, with faint details of walls and ceiling. On the left are hangers and hanging clothes, and the floor is paved with light-colored tiles, creating soft and warm lighting. Indoor lighting creates a private and cozy atmosphere. The overall composition uses diagonal lines, with mirror reflections adding layers and depth to the image. Light and shadow are distributed naturally, shadows are soft, and the background is slightly dark, highlighting the main subject. The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with warm yellow lighting, creating a sense of fashion and privacy in urban nightlife. The image has the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment, with slight noise and color distortion, as if captured casually with a phone. It captures the true state of the figures in their private spaces, creating an overall atmosphere that is both sexy and tinged with a hint of decadent beauty, full of the independence and individuality of modern urban women. The images are rich in detail, and the composition cleverly uses mirror reflections and door frame structures to create a sense of voyeurism and spatial illusion. The visual guide extends from the foreground door frame to the subject in the mirror, forming a complete visual loop. Light and shadow transitions naturally, warm light contrasts with cool tones, enhancing the emotional tension of the image. Overall, it presents a unique style that lies between artistic photography and life documentation, combining the compositional beauty of professional imaging with the authenticity and spontaneity of everyday shooting",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
