        {
          "id": "krea2-5f2cdddec5f926408a9275ab",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙街道忧伤行走比耶",
          "prompt": "She wears a beige short work dress with a cross-strap neckline, revealing her collarbone and part of her chest. The chest straps form an elegant V-shaped cutout, and the sleeves are three-quarter length with button details. The hem reaches mid-thigh, and the fabric texture is similar to matte cotton-linen or lightweight leather, with slight pleats and natural drape. Her left hand gently strokes the chest strap. In her right hand, she carries a gray Hermès platinum bag made of lychee-patterned leather, with gold hardware that has a soft sheen. The lid features a signature H-shaped clasp and padlock decoration, and the strap is a double-shoulder strap design. She wears multiple layers of bracelets on her wrist, including a thin chain set with sapphire and a woven metal bracelet. White flower-shaped earrings, a slender necklace around her neck, and a simple round metal pendant. Her nails are neatly trimmed and painted with light-colored nail polish, giving her a relaxed and elegant posture. The body is slightly angled to the side, the head tilted slightly. In the foreground is a floor paved with square stone bricks. The bricks are gray and white, with clear textures and regular gaps. The ground is scattered with fine dust and water stains reflecting light. On the left is an orange plastic bag containing food, possibly bread or pastries, with black text and patterns on the bag. The background is a typical Parisian-style architectural complex, beige walls, symmetrically arranged arched windows with dark window frames, some windows emitting warm yellow light, and the roof covered with dark gray tiles chimneys and antennas are scattered throughout, and the building facade is beautifully carved. In the distance, you can see several vintage-style black street lamps, with glass covers. The lamp poles are thick and decorated with intricate patterns. Other pedestrians pass vaguely across the square—some resting on the steps, others strolling. On the right side of the painting is a huge abstract sculpture, its surface reddish-brown and irregular in shape, resembling carved rock. The sky is a gloomy gray-blue, with thick clouds but faint light shining from the edges, creating a gentle atmosphere before dusk. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The background buildings are symmetrically distributed, forming a stable frame structure. The stone pavement road in the foreground and the streetlamp post on the left guide the gaze toward the figure. There is a clear depth of field relationship between the figure and the background, with the background slightly blurred, highlighting the clarity of the subject. Light and shadow come from the upper left, naturally diffused light, with soft shadows and no strong contrast. There are subtle changes in light and shadow in the folds of clothing, and the overall color palette is mainly beige, gray, and brown, accented with a touch of gold and blue, creating an atmosphere where urban fashion and classical aesthetics blend together. The image has a high-resolution sense of realism, rich details, moderate color saturation, and authentic texture, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retaining a sense of everyday life. It captures the natural state of modern urban women strolling down the streets. The images are full of storytelling, featuring both luxurious elements like luxury handbags and everyday items like food packaging, forming a strong contrast that conveys a lifestyle attitude that combines refinement and casualness. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, tinged with a touch of melancholy romance, like a shot from a movie capturing the beauty and loneliness of this moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
