        {
          "id": "krea2-bda719676146ddbd0b168e8d",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙街道俏皮倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She wore an off-white sleeveless dress with vertical stripes, adorned with small black floral embroidery patterns on the hem. The pleated design added layers and dimension, and she wore a white camisole underneath with a small black button at the neckline. The overall look was fresh, sweet, and fashionable. On her left wrist is a delicate silver bracelet inlaid with sparkling crystals or gemstones, adding a touch of elegance. She wears a pair of black platform loafers with smooth and shiny tops, forming a striking contrast to the overall look. White ankle socks reveal a playful touch to the look. Next to her is a white quilted handbag printed with pink letters, with a light pink strap. The bag is full and crisp, with exquisite details. In the background is a coffee shop with a wooden doorframe. The glass door is labeled with \"TAKE OUT\" and a menu of coffee drinks, including English logos such as ESPRESSO, AMERICANO, LATTE, CAPPUCCINO, MOCHA, MACCHIATO, etc. Next to the door is a vintage-style wall lamp made of round metal that emits a warm, soft glow. Through the glass door, you can see some of the store's furnishings and reflections outside the window. On the right glass window is a promotional poster. It features food pictures and written descriptions, surrounded by several pots of green plants, their leaves lush and green. One pot is blooming with small pink flowers, adding vitality and color to the scene. The ground is a gray asphalt pavement with a rough texture and slight wear along the edges. In the distance, you can see the outlines of city buildings, and the street environment is authentic and natural. The composition is shot from a low angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, leaning slightly forward and in a relaxed posture. The gaze and camera create a subtle interaction, with the foreground showing the figure and the handbag. The middle frame features the café's storefront and greenery, with streets and buildings in the background. The layers are distinct, and the light and shadow come from natural daylight, soft and even. Illuminated from the upper right creates a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly off-white, light gray, and green, accented with pink and black. The harmonious color combination presents a real and beautiful moment from everyday life, as if casually taken with a regular phone, full of youthful energy and warmth. The texture of the image is close to real photography. With a slight graininess and natural depth effect, the background blur is just right, highlighting the main subject. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, like afternoon sunlight shining on the streets and alleys, capturing an ordinary yet touching moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
