        {
          "id": "krea2-291760bf1b600e6ab2018c49",
          "alias": "单女米T恤公园自信站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the tree-lined path in the park, wearing a beige knitted camisole and loose brown wide-leg pants. A white shoulder bag is slung across her shoulder, her right hand gently supporting a gray lamp post decorated with Greek meander patterns. Her left hand hangs naturally at her side, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her makeup is exquisite, and her overall temperament is gentle and confident. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with the figure occupying about one-third of the frame. The body is slightly angled to the frame, presenting a natural dynamic beauty. The middle frame features winding asphalt paths and lush lawns. Several tall palm trees stand tall, their trunks straight. Their leaves glow emerald green in the sunlight, and their shadows cast dappled shadows on the ground and grass, creating a dynamic effect of light and shadow. In the distance, several pedestrians are walking or exercising—a man and woman walking side by side, while another is jogging alone. The background is a vast green field and the blurry outline of a lake and bridges in the distance. The sky is pale blue, the light soft, and sunlight slanting from the right, creating a warm golden hue. The entire scene is bathed in the gentle afternoon light The composition uses a third-division method, with the main subject positioned at the left golden ratio point. The lamp post acts as a vertical line to guide the view, creating a sense of depth. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with sunlight filtering through the gaps in the leaves, creating delicate light spots and soft shadows. The colors are mainly earth tones, with beige, brown, green, and gray harmonizing and unified. The tones are warm, with a slight retro filter texture, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. The image features slight graininess and natural exposure, with slight vignetting at the edges of the frame, enhancing the nostalgic atmosphere. The overall visual guidance is clear, progressing step by step from the figures in the foreground to the trees in the middle and then to the distant background, creating a leisurely, comfortable, and lifelike everyday scene, as if capturing an ordinary yet beautiful afternoon—strong realism, rich in detail, full of humanistic warmth and artistic style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
