        {
          "id": "krea2-a2d1e725e15f4b1ed91209f9",
          "alias": "单女黑连体衣城市自信坐注视",
          "prompt": "She wore a black lace hollow-out jumpsuit with a bold and avant-garde design. Large geometric cutouts on the chest and waist accentuated the skirt and perfectly curved figure. The lace texture was delicate and layered, giving the whole look a sense of sexiness and fashion. She wore a slender silver necklace and black high-heeled sandals encrusted with diamonds. The upper was wrapped with multiple sparkling metal bands, and her ankles were adorned with sparkling diamonds. Her legs were long and straight, elegantly crossed, and her right hand rested lightly on the edge of the stone steps behind her. The left hand naturally rests beside the thigh, head slightly turned, makeup exquisite, background an outdoor courtyard at night, gray cement walls simple and plain, with a string of warm yellow small bulbs hanging on the wall, soft and cozy light forming dotted light spots scattered in the darkness, creating a cozy and romantic atmosphere. The floor is paved with cobblestones of various sizes, rough and natural texture, contrasting with the smooth stone steps. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying the main position, sitting diagonally, with leg lines extending to the foreground. Guiding the gaze upward from the feet, forming a visual flow, the camera uses a low-angle downward shot to enhance the character's upright posture and presence. The light mainly comes from the warm light slightly to the left above, creating a soft transition between light and dark. Shadows naturally cast on the sides of the body and stone steps, highlighting three-dimensional contours. The background is blurred, making the subject stand out more. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with warm yellow lighting, creating a sense of privacy and sophistication in urban nightlife. The image has a strong visual impact. At the same time, it preserves the authentic texture of everyday shooting, as if capturing a moment outdoors at night with professional portrait photography equipment. The light and shadow are delicate, details rich, the atmosphere is strong, and full of artistic beauty and modern fashion",
