        {
          "id": "krea2-2e6dfdc5ea21896dd50571b1",
          "alias": "单女公寓自信坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "Wearing a wide-brimmed straw hat in the same color scheme, she sits elegantly on a vintage-style white scooter. Her right hand gently strokes the edge of the hat, while her left hand hangs naturally, her posture relaxed and confident. On her feet are white flat shoes adorned with tassels, her legs long and crossed, showing off her charming leg lines. Beside her is a beige canvas handbag, adorned with a bouquet of pure white roses. The flowers are full, and green leaves dot the room, adding a touch of freshness and romance. In the background is Prada's flagship store on Via Montenapoleone in Milan, Italy. Exquisite products are displayed in the windows, and the streets are paved with stone pavements. The sunlight is bright, with interplay of light and shadow, creating a strong visual effect of light and shadow. The sky is a clear blue without clouds, with light shining down from the upper right, casting clear shadows on the figures, motorcycles, and the ground. The overall picture is vibrant and harmonious, with warm tones as the main theme. It creates a luxurious, fashionable, and vibrant urban atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned near the center on the right side of the frame, the motorcycle occupying the main foreground space, and the background buildings arranged symmetrically, guiding the gaze into the distance. The visual focus is on the woman, who highlights the subject through light and shadow changes and color coordination, presenting a high-quality, cinematic fashionable street style that seems to capture a leisurely moment under the afternoon sun, combining the vibrancy of the modern city. It retains personal charm and artistic beauty, with rich details in the visuals—from clothing materials to architectural textures, all clearly visible. Overall, it presents a refined, elegant, romantic, and slightly nostalgic Italian style, like a classic shot in a fashion blockbuster, allowing people to feel the beauty and freedom of life.",
