        {
          "id": "krea2-e66a5f0de2fb72bb58d15e8a",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫椅上忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench, leaning slightly back against the mottled white wall. She wears an off-white long-sleeved shirt with a blue and white plaid lining at the collar, a dark gray knit vest dress, and a matching short skirt. The overall look blends preppy style with modern simplicity. Her hands are folded on her knees, fingers long, natural. Legs are together and straight, ankles slightly bent, feet naturally relaxed, posture dignified yet relaxed. The bench is made of dark brown wood, with black cushions on the surface. The backrest is made of vertical wooden planks, with simple yet textured lines. On the right side of the background stands a light-colored wooden ladder with clear structure, crossbars and vertical rods arranged in a staggered manner. The walls show signs of age, with peeling paint and fine cracks, creating a retro and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The floor is covered with light-colored wood and partially covered by a circular beige carpet. The edges are soft and fluffy, and the lighting throughout the scene is soft and even. Natural light from the left side of the painting filters through windows or openings, creating a warm side lighting effect that enhances three-dimensionality and layering. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, gray-brown, and light brown, harmoniously unified to create a peaceful, warm, and slightly artistic indoor environment. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, body in a diagonal posture, creating a visual flow. The wooden stairs and wall textures in the background provide rich detailed layering. At the same time, it does not overshadow the main subject, highlighting the subject's presence. The overall image feels realistic like everyday photography, as if shot with a regular camera, with slight film graininess and natural exposure transitions. The light and shadow transitions are soft, without excessive sharpening or embellishment, presenting an artistic style that is lifelike, simple, yet aesthetically pleasing. The atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and slightly melancholic, like a quiet afternoon, evoking a serene beauty slowed down by time",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
