        {
          "id": "krea2-b107a2952da1320853ae17f5",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服图书馆自信坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the wooden floor of the library, wearing a dark blue school uniform jacket and a short skirt, paired with black stockings. She turns sideways and gazes at the camera. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her hands gently resting behind her back, her body slightly leaning back, exuding an effortless beauty. In the foreground is her clear back contour and leg lines, with dark clothing creating a striking contrast with the light carpet. In the middle is a room filled with tall bookshelves, neatly arranged with various books, spines of different colors, creating a strong atmosphere of knowledge. The hands stand still, as if time has frozen at this moment. On the right side is a large window, with sunlight slanting in from outside, casting soft spots on the floor and carpet. The light is warm and bright, adding a tranquil touch to the space. The background is composed of layered bookframes that extend deep into the frame, creating a strong sense of depth. The composition is shot at a low angle, making the main subject stand out even more. At the same time, diagonal composition guides the viewer's gaze from the lower left floor to the window at the upper right. The visual direction is natural and smooth, with delicate light and shadow effects. Sunlight streams through the window lattice, creating a warm and nostalgic atmosphere. The overall scene presents a quiet, intellectual yet slightly artistic everyday scene, as if capturing a moment of afternoon reading. The tones are warm yellow and deep blue, harmonious and unified, rich in detail, and authentic texture. It looks as if shot with an old film camera under natural light, featuring slight graininess and soft out-of-focus blur, enhancing the photo's realism and artistic appeal",
