        {
          "id": "krea2-1fde32e63bdff996d1ea1bd4",
          "alias": "单女全裸粉短裤摄影棚微笑坐跳舞",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in an elegant cross-legged pose in front of a solid-color gradient background, her body stretched and relaxed, exuding flexibility and confidence. She wears a loose off-white long-sleeve top with an off-shoulder neckline. The naturally draped sleeves create soft lines with her body. She pairs a pair of bright pink shorts with a striking and harmonious color contrast. Her legs are clad in nude-colored stockings, delicate and smooth in texture, complementing the overall look with a glossy glow. She wears a gentle smile and looks directly at the camera. It conveys a warm and composed atmosphere. Both hands are stretched out to the sides, palms facing downward, arm lines are smooth, and the posture is relaxed and powerful, as if performing a quiet dance or yoga practice. The entire composition is centered and symmetrical, with the figure positioned at the very center, occupying the visual center. In the foreground is her complete body contours and postures—clear and complete, rich in detail, and distinct layers. The background features a gradient of soft pink and light purple from the upper left to the lower right, with natural color transitions that create a dreamy and tranquil atmosphere. The light and shadows are even and soft, with no obvious shadows. The overall lighting is bright and not glaring, with warm and soft tones full of modernity and artistic flair. The image presents a minimalist aesthetic style, clean and crisp, with clear visual guidance, stable and balanced composition, and harmonious color combinations. It is both fashionable and retains a sense of life. It feels like a professional studio photo shoot, yet carries the relaxed and realistic feel of everyday life. Using a high-resolution camera and large-aperture lens for capture, details are sharp and clear, with moderate blur outside focus. The background is well rendered with blurred to highlight the main subject, creating an overall atmosphere that is warm, tranquil, and comfortable, like a tranquil portrait in a modern city, full of youthful energy and inner strength, evoking a healthy, confident, and positive attitude toward life. The image conveys a deep aesthetic that transcends appearances, combining artistic expression with resonance and resonance with everyday life experiences",
