        {
          "id": "krea2-f419b86d4b849c6151b1051d",
          "alias": "单女黑连体衣街道倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A female character dressed in a black bodysuit presents as a catwoman figure. She wears long black gloves, her arms naturally extended, holding a long black whip that hangs in an arc on the ground, forming a smooth curve. Her legs are clad in mesh stockings and black high heels, one leg elegantly raised, knees bent, toes touching the ground, a sexy and tense posture, body slightly leaned back. Leaning against a rough beige cement wall, the texture is clearly visible, showing mottled traces of time and irregular textures. There are slight stains and moss growth in the corners. The floor is a gray-brown cement with a slightly damp surface, scattered with a few dead leaves and fine stones. On the right side of the background, there is a window with metal railings with a dark brown frame. The railings are vertically arranged, adding a touch of industrial and closed feel. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left, occupying the visual center. The body lines guide the gaze from top to bottom, while the curved whip creates a dynamic visual direction, creating a balanced aesthetic combining symmetry and asymmetry. Light comes from the upper right, soft and slightly shadowed, creating warm tones for afternoon or dusk, highlighting muscle lines and clothing fold details. The shadowed areas deepen the sense of three-dimensionality and layering, blending vintage, sexy, dark, and street realism styles, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a prime lens for film-like quality. It features cinematic composition and color tone, with slight graininess and color shifts at the edges, simulating noise and film characteristics from real photography, enhancing realism and artistic atmosphere. The colors are mainly black, brown, and gray, with strong contrast yet harmony, making the subject stand out. The entire scene is tranquil and storytelling, as if telling a secret moment hidden in a corner of the city. The image presents the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, yet still lacking artistic depth and visual impact",
