        {
          "id": "krea2-9417fc483f367cac11c90918",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙竹林微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways on a wooden bench, wearing a pristine white high-neck, long-sleeved tight dress. The skirt fits her figure and outlines smooth and graceful curves. The hem is made of semi-transparent material and adorned with delicate white lace patterns, subtly revealing the texture of her skin. The overall look is elegant and full of Eastern charm, draping gently over her shoulders and back, slightly curled. She wears a gentle smile, her makeup is refined and natural, and her overall temperament is gentle and charming. Her right hand gently holds a finely woven bamboo basket. The basket is oval-shaped, with clearly visible surface textures. The weaving is finely crafted, presenting a natural brownish-yellow tone. Her left hand rests naturally on the basket's edge, fingers long, and her ring finger wears a simple silver ring. Her body leans back slightly, her back straight, and her head tilted slightly, presenting a relaxed and confident posture. The background is an indoor space full of vintage atmosphere, with walls built of dark bricks that display irregular textures and layers. Some areas show signs of age. On the wall hangs a painting or menu mounted in a wooden frame. The edges of the frame are somewhat worn, and the interior content is blurry but conveys an artistic atmosphere. On the right side is a wooden window with exquisite carvings and traditional window design. Through the glass, you can see outdoor light streaming in, creating a soft effect of light and shadow. By the window stands a small wooden cabinet with several decorative items or books, rich in details and adding a sense of life. The entire scene is dominated by warm tones, with light projected from the left side of the frame. Soft side lighting is formed, while natural shadow transitions appear on the other side. The rich layers of light and shadow create a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure occupying the center-left position, body forming an S-curve to highlight their elegant demeanor. The foreground features the lower body and bamboo basket, the middle ground is the main body and some furniture, and the background features walls, windows, and decorations, creating a clear sense of spatial depth. Visual guidance is realized through the figure's posture and gaze direction, forming a flowing visual path. The overall image exudes a strong sense of artistic beauty and a sense of everyday life, as if it were a carefully crafted photographic work capturing moments of tranquility and beauty in daily life. Using professional photography equipment, the lens focuses on the subject, the background is moderately blurred, preserving environmental details while highlighting the subject. The color saturation is moderate, contrast is gentle, and the image is clean and tidy, full of realism and warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
