          "id": "krea2-1da272858446cedf964e6a44",
          "alias": "单女全裸米高领衫城市自信坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the off-white leather seats of a luxury business vehicle, wearing a beige turtleneck sweater and a long beige coat featuring LV's classic monogram pattern. She wears a brown beret, with exquisite makeup, elegant and confident posture, legs crossed, wearing a pair of glossy nude patent leather boots. The boot shaft reaches her thighs, with her toes slightly raised, presenting a lazy yet luxurious fashion vibe. Her left hand rests lightly on the armrest or the edge of the console, and she wears a silver bracelet on her wrist. Next to it is a chain-shaped bag in the same color scheme, with a harmonious and unified design, full of sophistication and modern urban vibe. The cabin is spacious, with seats featuring diamond-patterned stitching for a delicate texture. The center console and door panels are finished in dark brown wood, paired with soft warm-toned LED ambient light strips, creating a cozy and intimate seating environment. The windows are covered with louvered blinds, allowing faint outlines of city buildings to be seen outside. Light streams through the windows into the cabin, creating a contrast of light and shadow that highlights the main subject. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, occupying the visual focal point. The foreground shows her legs and boots, the middle is her body and seat, and the background shows the interior structure of the carriage and the view outside the window. Light and shadow enter diagonally from the right window, creating a soft side glow, while light shadows are cast on the seats and floor to enhance the sense of three-dimensionality and depth. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, light brown, and nude, complemented by dark brown wood elements and metallic details. The colors are harmonious and unified, creating a sense of understated luxury. The comfortable and pleasant atmosphere seems to capture a tranquil moment in high-end travel, with a strong fashion blockbuster feel while retaining the realism of everyday shooting. The lens uses a standard wide-angle angle for close-up shots, highlighting the details and temperament of the subject. The background blur is well handled, making the subject stand out even more. The overall image presents a visual effect that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life",
