        {
          "id": "krea2-6838a4dcd97949fe4b7e6638",
          "alias": "单女黑西装摄影棚困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "An elegant female model wore a black silk blazer layered with a black bodycon underneath, sitting at the center of an off-white leather sofa, legs crossed and stretched out, her posture relaxed yet confident, head slightly tilted back, expression slightly contemplative and dreamy, creating a dynamic beauty. She gently held a black crocodile print handbag in her right hand, with a gold-edged metallic edge. The bag's texture was clear and the details exquisite, her left hand casually resting on her thigh, fingers long, wearing a simple ring. The overall look showcases the independence and charm of modern urban women. Black stockings wrap her long legs, and she wears high-heeled pointed patent leather shoes. The smooth, reflective uppers and smooth lines highlight the leg curves. The sofa is made of light beige genuine leather with delicate pleats and stitching. The backrest is full and thick, providing comfortable support. The background is a simple wall in pure white or very light gray, free of cluttered elements, highlighting the main character and clothing details. The overall composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying the center-left position. The body extends diagonally, creating visual guidance. From the shoes in the lower left corner to the head in the upper right corner, the line of sight flows naturally, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The camera angle is slightly overhead, capturing a complete image from the whole body up to above the knees. Light comes from the front left, soft and even, creating a contrast of light and shadow, with natural shadow transitions. The background wall and floor show a slight gradient, with a soft shadow at the bottom to enhance realism. The overall atmosphere is calm and restrained yet sexy, with mainly black and white, accented by off-white and gold. The color layers are rich but not complicated, with delicate light and shadow treatment, highlighting the texture of materials such as silk's smoothness, leather's sheen, stockings' transparency, and metallic coolness. The images have a high-end fashion photography style, reminiscent of professional magazine coverage, while retaining the natural feel of everyday shooting. It feels as if an amateur photographer is shooting in a studio environment with a medium format camera or high-end digital SLR. The lens focuses on the subject, the background is moderately blurred, and details are clear, presenting an overall modern aesthetic that combines artistry with a sense of everyday life, with balanced composition. The proportions are harmonious, the visual guidance is clear, and the atmosphere of light and shadow is unified, conveying a tranquil, confident, elegant, and slightly mysterious temperament",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
