          "id": "krea2-d0b02c3fea8b6fa72eff63d5",
          "alias": "单女米风衣电梯冷淡站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an elevator mirror taking a selfie. Her left hand holds a black smartphone with the Apple logo clearly visible on the back, facing the mirror for a photo. Her right hand holds a pair of black sunglasses and a large brown leather handbag. The handbag design is simple and elegant, featuring metal fasteners and wide shoulder straps. The bag features delicate leather texture. She wears a loose camel long trench coat made of soft wool or suede, featuring a classic lapel and double-breasted design. Underneath, he wears a dark gray turtleneck knit sweater, a black short skirt, and black stockings. The overall style is elegant and everyday. The elevator interior is small but full of modern feel. The surrounding walls are made of smooth stainless steel panels, reflecting bright light and images of the figures, creating a complex interplay of light and shadow. Multiple circular recessed lights are installed on the ceiling, emitting a warm white halo. Some of the light reflects slight halos and starbursts, enhancing the atmosphere of the scene. The elevator doors are tightly shut. There is a slender gap in the door gap, with a faint control panel and floor indicator light visible above the door. On the right side, there is a vertical metal handrail extending from the ground to the top, adding depth to the space. On the left wall, a yellow-bordered notice or poster is affixed, printed with text and icons, but the content is blurry. The floor is paved with light-colored tiles, and in the corner is a dark gray anti-slip mat. The entire scene is interwoven with a cool metallic texture and warm, human-centered colors. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with diagonal lines formed by the phone and arm guiding the viewer's gaze. The vertical and horizontal lines in the background intersect, creating a strong geometric aesthetic. Light and shadow cast down from above, while elongated light strips and reflective stripes appear on the metal wall. The overall atmosphere combines the everyday feel of urban life with a touch of solitude and tranquility, as if capturing a poetic hidden beauty in an ordinary moment. The image is rich in detail and distinct layers, with a dominant palette of warm brown, gray-black, and silver-white, creating a strong contrast of cool and warm tones. It presents a realistic and emotionally charged visual experience, like a casual moment captured on a regular phone in daily life, yet surprisingly full of artistic flair and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
