        {
          "id": "krea2-3f1f9060893ea1821861818e",
          "alias": "单女黑内衣城市自信坐摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white high stool, her body slightly leaning forward, exuding a confident yet slightly alluring expression. Her overall posture is elegant and full of tension. Her right hand rests gently on her knee, her left hand hangs naturally, fingers painted with black nail polish, adding a touch of refinement. She wears a black lace-trimmed bra and black transparent stockings with star patterns. The star patterns on the stockings are evenly distributed, extending from the thighs to the ankles, creating a fashionable and sexy atmosphere. She sits on a modern-style white high stool. The base of the stool is made of metal, reflecting the light and shadow of the surrounding environment. The background is a simple and bright interior space, with a light gray wall. On the left is an abstract art painting featuring circles and line elements, mainly black, white, and gray. The frame is white, and beside it is a bouquet of purple flowers arranged in a white vase, adding a touch of soft hue. On the right is a large mirror framed in white, reflecting parts of the room, including another bouquet of purple flowers and leaves of green plants. The floor is covered with light-colored wooden flooring The texture is clear, the entire scene is softly lit, illuminated by natural light or soft light from the left side of the front, with natural shadow transitions. The furniture and decorations in the background display clean and crisp lines. The overall composition adopts a central composition: the figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, with the body in a diagonal pose and legs extended, creating visual guidance that attracts the audience's attention. The foreground features the lower body and stockings details, the middle ground is her upper body and high stool, and the background features walls, paintings, mirrors, and plants, with distinct layering. The sense of space is strong, with delicate light and shadow effects, and soft shadows distributed on the sides of the body and the floor, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. The overall image presents the lifestyle aesthetic of modern urban women, combining fashion with a sense of everyday life. It feels like a set of everyday photos taken at home, captured with professional equipment, yet retaining realism and intimacy. The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with a touch of purple and green. The color coordination is harmonious and unified, with delicate texture and rich details. It has strong visual appeal and emotional expression",
