        {
          "id": "krea2-6409eb4a668a1f32110b953b",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙节庆俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits gracefully on the edge of a dark velvet sofa, wearing a burgundy velvet asymmetrical long dress with a naturally flowing hem, outlining smooth curves. Paired with black stockings and shiny high heels, the overall look is noble and sexy. She leans slightly to the side, lightly holding a stack of red envelopes in her left hand and draping her right hand over a white plush sleeve. Her makeup is exquisite, earrings are delicately accentuated, and the main focus of the painting highlights the posture and details of the clothing. On the left side of the foreground is a cluster of bright red flower branches, dense and winding. Below sits a hollowed-out red cylindrical candlestick, with faint golden decorations inside. A few red berries are scattered nearby. On the right stands a red vertical Spring Festival couplet, inscribed in large gold characters \"Joyful Prosperity,\" with traditional patterns along the edges. Next to the couplet is a red cloth bag with the same golden pattern. In the center is a classical-style dark brown velvet sofa with a high backrest and diamond embossing patterns. The seat cushion is covered with dark fabric embroidered with intricate gold thread patterns, and a piece printed with \"Kangle\" casually placed on the sofa The red cloth bag with the character 'Zi' is set against a heavy dark red velvet curtain background, rich in pleats and delicate texture. On both sides are beige sheer curtains with subtle patterns, allowing soft light to shine through. In the distance, wall decorations and metal frames are faintly visible. The composition uses the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center, forming a visual focal point. The floral branches and Spring Festival couplets in the foreground guide the viewer's gaze toward the figure, while symmetrical decorative elements on the left enhance the stability of the image. Light and shadow come from the soft warm light on the left, creating a contrast of light and shadow, with shadows falling on the right side of the body and behind the sofa. It creates a three-dimensional effect, with a slight backlighting effect at the curtain background, making the silhouette clearer. The overall atmosphere is luxurious and elegant, full of festive cheer. The color palette is mainly red, complemented by gold, dark brown, and black, creating a warm and rich visual effect. The image presents a unique aesthetic that blends traditional Eastern festive elements with modern fashion aesthetics. It feels like a high-quality artistic portrait shot in a carefully arranged private space, with cinematic texture and sophistication, rich details, and distinct layers. The colors are rich yet harmonious, presenting an atmosphere that is both solemn and romantic",
