        {
          "id": "krea2-92ac8d18ccd1b0dab6918489",
          "alias": "单女透视黑毛衣车厢神秘站立注视",
          "prompt": "A tall woman stands in the vintage, luxurious train carriage aisle, wearing a black long-sleeve tight knit top with delicate ribbed details at the collar and cuffs, showcasing an elegant silhouette. She pairs with low-rise shorts adorned with gold sequins, with delicate metallic edges creating a strong visual contrast with the black top. She wears black pointed high heels, the smooth, mirror-like surface reflecting the surrounding light and shadow. The slender ankle line looks especially elongated under the sheer stockings. Her makeup was exquisite, and she wore a long string of pearls that hung from her neck to her chest. As her body swayed slightly, the pearls shimmered softly under the light. Her right hand gently rested on the wooden cabinet door on the left, her posture calm and confident. Her left hand hung naturally at her side, and a gold bracelet was worn on her wrist, adding a touch of luxury. The entire scene was set inside a luxury train, with walls made of dark solid wood with smooth surfaces and delicate wood grain patterns. The door and window frames were decorated with gilded metal. Above the cabinet doors is a round mirror framed in gold, reflecting parts of the person's image and enhancing the sense of depth in the space. The floor is paved with black-and-white mosaic tiles with neat patterns. The central area shows signs of wear, revealing signs of age. Warm yellow downlights are installed on the curved ceiling, softly illuminating the surroundings and creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. The overall composition centers on the figures. By utilizing the narrow space of the carriage, a strong perspective effect is created, guiding the gaze to extend deeper. The windows in the background emit a faint external halo, hinting that the train is moving. However, the view outside is blurry, highlighting the sense of enclosure and the central role of the figures. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with the main light source coming from the warm light from the ceiling, while light shadows are cast on the wooden walls and floor, adding realism and depth to the image. The overall color palette is mainly dark brown, black, and gold, creating a retro, The luxurious yet slightly mysterious atmosphere presents a cinematic texture, as if taken from a classic old movie, with strong artistic appeal and narrative power",
