          "alias": "单女室内持相机",
          "prompt": "Several decorative paintings hang on the walls, one depicting a woman in ancient costume, another with floral patterns. The wall is decorated with carved wood panels, and on the right side, some gold ornaments are visible. The floor is covered with a gray carpet, and the overall lighting is soft and warm. Low-angle shots highlight the main subject, with a clear foreground. In the middle shot, people and furniture are blurred, and light and shadow enter diagonally from the left, creating a contrast of light and shadow that creates a warm and elegant atmosphere. The image exudes a strong blend of classical and modern beauty, as if photographed with a professional camera under indoor lighting. The details are rich, texture delicate, and color layers distinct, presenting a serene and enchanting artistic feel",
