        {
          "id": "krea2-454b1bfb07b06d842b4ab4c6",
          "alias": "单女短裙城市俏皮站立展示",
          "prompt": "She gently lifts the hem of her skirt with both hands, creating a striking contrast between white lace trim and black fabric, showcasing a blend of elegance and playfulness. The overall look blends the sweetness of Lolita style with the cute elements of maid roles. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The composition uses the classic three-part method, with a relaxed and natural posture, a slight forward posture, a slightly bent left leg, and an upright leg. A stable triangular structure is formed, with a modern urban glass curtain wall in the background, reflecting soft skylight and creating a blurred effect of light and shadow. The architectural lines extend vertically, enhancing the depth of the composition. The foreground is a gray stone paved ground with clear texture and neat edges. The middle is the main figure, while the background is a blurred glass curtain wall and faintly visible green plants, creating a distinct sense of spatial depth. Light comes from the upper right, presenting warm afternoon sunlight, with golden halos shining on the figures. Soft contour light is formed, with shadows falling on the left side of the ground, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color scheme is mainly black and white, accented with warm yellow sunlight and green plants, creating a tranquil and cozy atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, with rich details—from the lace texture to the shoe's sheen—all clearly visible, giving it strong visual appeal and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
