        {
          "id": "krea2-68899e0aa5f462b0b7d4f113",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫健身房冷淡坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a black high-backed esports chair inside the esports gym, wearing a white slim-fit shirt paired with a red tie and a dark short skirt. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, legs crossed, right leg resting on the edge of the computer desk in front, foot slightly raised, showing off her long leg line. The overall look blends the youthful vibe of student uniforms with the fashionable vibe of modern esports culture. In the foreground, she occupies the center of the frame, clearly prominent. The main body details are rich, from the shirt's folds and tie's shine to the texture of the stockings, all clearly visible. The middle frame shows multiple neatly arranged computer devices, each equipped with a monitor, keyboard, mouse, and headphones in front of each computer. A transparent dust cover covers the top of some screens, and the tabletop edges feature red and white decorative stripes. The background shows the interior environment of the esports arena. The walls are dark gray, topped with circular LED light strips emitting soft blue cool light, creating a high-tech atmosphere. In the distance, you can see more empty gaming chairs and some blurry display boards or advertising screens. The sense of spatial depth is obvious, and the composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure is positioned at the center of the composition, forming a visual focal point. Using chairs and figures in the foreground, computer equipment in the background, and venue space in the background to advance step by step, guiding the gaze backward to create a strong perspective effect. At the same time, the diagonal posture of the figures contrasts with the horizontally placed table, adding dynamic energy to the scene. Light and shadow mainly come from embedded spotlights on the ceiling and blue LED strips in the background. The light source is evenly distributed but slightly cool-toned, bright and clear, with soft shadows, and obvious projections on chairs and floors. It enhances the sense of three-dimensionality, giving the overall atmosphere both the technological feel of modern urban life and the vibrant energy of a relaxed atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, and the color saturation is moderate, presenting a realistic feeling of amateur shooting in daily life. It's as if a regular camera is capturing a moment in a real scene, preserving environmental details and natural light transitions, making you feel as if you're there, full of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
