        {
          "id": "krea2-7a13ed1910befa1e437010e2",
          "alias": "单女白外套城市冷淡持相机",
          "prompt": "She wore a fluffy, soft white plush jacket, the jacket revealing a black lace underneath and black fishnet stockings with intricate patterns. Her legs were crossed and slightly leaned forward, and she wore black pointed high heels. She looked directly at the camera, her overall makeup delicate and natural. In the foreground, her lower body and hands were gently placed on the spread-out white plush jacket. Her fingers were long and her nails neatly trimmed, with a beautifully decorated white wall in the background The walls feature typical French Rococo-style relief decorative lines, smooth and gorgeous, with rich details. On the right, you can see part of a marble fireplace. The fireplace's surface has a natural gray texture and a warm texture. The floor is a deep brown herringbone patterned wood floor, with clear wood grain and warm, heavy wood. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical style, with the figure centered, creating a strong visual guide that directs the line of sight. Light and shadow come from the left side of the painting, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The shadows fall on the right wall and floor, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The lighting is warm and yellowish, creating a cozy and intimate atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly white, black, and brown, creating a warm and cool contrast that highlights the subject. The image has a high artistic and fashionable feel, while also carrying the realism of everyday photography, as if shot with a professional camera or a high-end smartphone. The details are rich, the layers are distinct, the image quality is clear, and color reproduction is high, presenting a sophisticated fashion photography style, reminiscent of a magazine cover or brand promotional campaign, full of the independence and charm of modern urban women",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
