        {
          "id": "krea2-ef3982b5e09e3636bc54363a",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣街道冷淡行走躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman walks with her back to the camera on the sidewalk of a city street. She wears a deep blue long-sleeved knit sweater and a white pleated mini skirt, white sneakers, and a brown woven shoulder bag slung at her side. Her body leans slightly forward, and her right leg steps forward, her posture naturally relaxed, as if heading toward a destination. Sunlight shines on her back and arms, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. The frame captures the momentary movement of her walk, presenting an unintentional elegance and vitality in daily life. In the foreground is a sidewalk paved with hexagonal stone bricks. The texture is clear, edges slightly worn. The center is a gray asphalt road with slight reflections. Several cars are parked by the roadside, including a white van and several black sedans. The background is a towering urban complex. Beige and taupe exterior walls feature vintage-style windows and decorative lines. Some buildings have terrace structures on top, with green trees peeking out from gaps between buildings. The branches and leaves are lush, the sky is clear and cloudless, and the lighting is bright and abundant. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame. Gaze is directed to the right front, creating a sense of depth and spatial layering. Light and shadow come from directly above to the right, with strong sunlight casting clear shadows on the ground and buildings. The colors mainly contrast warm and cool, with a deep blue sweater and white skirt forming a striking contrast. The overall atmosphere is full of freshness and vitality of urban life, like real street photos taken with an amateur camera, featuring natural graininess and slight overexposure. The details are rich and the texture is authentic, presenting a casual yet vivid street aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
