        {
          "id": "krea2-167fb9ae9c3014a24e975d07",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣街道站立交叠",
          "prompt": "She wears a dark green thick knit cardigan paired with a black slip dress underneath, legs crossed. The overall look is simple yet layered. In front of her is a small white round table, on which is a set of exquisite blue-and-white patterned bone china teacups and saucers, each holding light-colored drinks. Next to it is a plate of colorful macarons, including pink, yellow, and green, set against a typical Parisian street scene. Pedestrians and vehicles can be faintly seen on the street, while distant buildings have blurred French signs. The sky is grayish-white, with soft and even lighting. Through the large glass windows, natural diffuse light flows indoors, creating a close-up composition. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the left side, while the right side leaves ample space to display the street view outside the window, creating a visual balance and sense of extension. The background is slightly blurred. It creates a shallow depth of field effect, highlighting the main subject while preserving environmental information. Light and shadow shine from the upper left, making the textures of the clothes clearly visible. The café's interior is simple and bright, with white walls, tables, and chairs, contrasting with the warm outdoor tones. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, as if capturing a lazy afternoon moment. It has a strong sense of daily life and authentic texture, as if shot with a medium format film camera, with slight graininess and natural exposure. The tone is warm and yellowish, presenting a vintage and delicate imaging style. There is a slight vignetting at the edges of the painting to enhance visual focus. The composition emphasizes asymmetrical balance, using window frames as natural frames to guide the gaze from the foreground figures to distant buildings, creating a sense of depth and enhancing storytelling and immersion. The color palette is mainly green, white, and beige, accented with bright macarons, creating harmony and vitality. The overall composition conveys a quiet urban poetry and a subtle expression of personal emotions, as if time stands still at this moment, allowing people to feel the beauty of life and inner peace",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
