        {
          "id": "krea2-c944bbf723fd892de8a2302c",
          "alias": "单女全裸蓝西装机场微笑站立",
          "prompt": "Standing in the airplane cabin kitchen, she turned sideways and glanced back with a smile. Her makeup was exquisite, exuding professional elegance and warmth. She wore a well-fitted blue blazer and short skirt, paired with black high heels and nude-colored stockings, presenting the typical professional image of a flight attendant. Her hands rested gently on the edge of the stainless steel console, her posture naturally relaxed, as if taking a brief break or preparing for service. In the foreground were several aircraft labeled \"CA 777\" and \"LW 777\" The metal food carts with the characters bear signs of use and label stickers on the surface, rich in detail and authentic texture. In the center, there is a stainless steel control counter and aviation kitchen equipment such as coffee machines and ovens in the rear. The equipment panel has buttons, displays, and control knobs, with a simple and practical design full of industrial feel. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, with the figure positioned on the right side of the canvas, body forming an S-shaped curve, creating a visually dynamic beauty and a sense of spatial depth. Light and shadow come from the ceiling with embedded lighting, providing uniform and soft light, with subtle but layered shadows, highlighting the cool texture of the metal surface and the smooth touch of the fabric. The overall atmosphere blends professional rigor with personal affinity, presenting a realistic moment captured in daily work. The color tones are mainly blue, silver-gray, and off-white, harmoniously unified. With slight warm-tone lighting, it creates a cozy and professional cabin environment. The image has a realistic feel similar to amateur camera shooting, with slight graininess and low light noise, simulating the natural effects of handheld shooting. The lens is chosen for a medium focal length, close to the real human perspective, with a slightly blurred background that highlights the main subject, while retaining enough environmental information to enhance immersion. The overall image conveys a quiet and focused professional life segment, combining artistic flair with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
