        {
          "id": "krea2-ce70e299fa1bed97b781c9cc",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣广场冷淡倚靠交叠",
          "prompt": "She wears a red knit cardigan over a white turtleneck base layer, a gray blazer over it, a silver sequin mini skirt paired with light gray stockings and silver square-toe Mary Jane shoes. Her left hand rests naturally on her leg, while her right hand gently holds a black leather handbag at her side. Her body leans slightly to the side, legs crossed in an elegant pose. The background is the magnificent classical architecture of Flinders Street Station in Melbourne, Australia. The pink sandstone exterior is paired with a green copper dome, and above the arched porch hangs the sign \"FINDERS STREET STATION.\" a green vintage tram with number 35 is parked at the intersection, with \"PARIS\" printed on its body and route information. The street features a blend of modern high-rise buildings and traditional architecture. The sky shows a pale blue tone at dusk, with soft and slightly cool lighting. Sunlight slants from the upper right of the frame, creating a natural shadow transition. The overall composition is shot from a low angle. The foreground highlights the main subject, the middle ground shows details of the tram and streets, and the background explains the urban environment. The layers of light and shadow are rich, the atmosphere is tranquil and full of urban life, offering both realism and artistic beauty reminiscent of everyday street photography. The image texture is delicate and color coordination, presenting a warm yet slightly nostalgic urban daily scene, as if capturing an ordinary yet beautiful moment. The overall style blends fashion, culture, and urban scenery, creating a visual experience that is both authentic and full of storytelling",
