        {
          "id": "krea2-510121626828a7e5e6190add",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装城市冷淡坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman sits half-squatting at the edge of an indoor marble step, leaning slightly forward, her head slightly raised, her expression calm yet somewhat detached, with a fluffy texture, presenting an urban fashionable cool aura. She wears a blue-and-white vertical striped suit with long-sleeved designs and a wide white lapel at the collar. The lines are clean and sharp, the body hugs the figure, showing off a slender silhouette. The lower part is paired with a matching striped short skirt with a slit that reveals the leg line. On her feet, she wears black platform Mary Jane shoes with smooth uppers, featuring metal buckles and paired with white over-the-knee socks printed with the brand logo, the cuff fitting closely to the calf. The overall look is both retro and modern, full of fashionable tension. The background is a light gray wall with a smooth and undecorated surface. Below are black-and-white marble steps with natural texture and smooth lines. The floor is also paved with marble tiles, reflecting a soft sheen. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure occupying the left central position, the body in a diagonal posture creating dynamic balance. The foreground shows the lower half of the figure and shoes. Details are clearly visible. The middle shot features the upper body and clothing of the figure, with distinct layers. The background is walls and steps, with blurred effects highlighting the subject. The movement follows the neck, shoulders, and arms to the legs and shoes, forming a smooth visual path. Light and shadow come from the left, soft and even, illuminating the front and side. The subtle shadows create a three-dimensional effect. The overall atmosphere is quiet and artistic, with blue and white accented by black and white, creating a clean and crisp look with strong visual impact. The image texture is delicate. It feels like shooting with a professional camera, while still retaining the casual feel of everyday life—like a photographer capturing fashionable moments at home. The lens is a 50mm prime lens, aperture f/2.8, ISO sensitivity 100, exposure compensation +0.3, slightly high color saturation, moderate contrast, good sharpness, rich details, and no obvious noise, presenting high-quality photography. The overall style blends modern fashion, retro elements, and everyday portraits, combining the refinement of a commercial blockbuster. Yet still full of everyday life, making it suitable for fashion magazines or social media displays",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
