        {
          "id": "krea2-8482af63d11753ac4ffca89a",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫室内媚态坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a black leather office chair in a modern office, wearing a white cropped shirt and high-waisted black leather shorts, paired with black pointed high heels adorned with metal studs. Her legs are elegantly crossed, right leg in front and left leg behind, relaxed and confident. Her left hand rests naturally on the armrest, her right hand rests gently on her thigh, head slightly tilted, and her expression is slightly charming and composed. The overall look highlights the professionalism and sexy charm of a professional woman. The foreground is the main subject, occupying the central left of the frame, fully presented from above the waist to below the knees. The middle features black office chairs, some desk edges, and gray carpets on the floor. The chair design is simple and modern, featuring a metal base and rollers. The desk is made of dark wood or imitation wood with a smooth surface. The background is a modern office environment, with large glass curtain walls and louvered windows, providing soft light outside. The ceiling inside is fitted with long strip LED light strips and recessed downlights, providing uniform and bright lighting that creates a clean and tidy office atmosphere. In the distance, computer monitors can be seen, Office equipment such as file racks is blurred, and the composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the figure's proportions and presence. The left side of the frame has more blank space, creating visual balance. The figure's body slightly turns sideways, and the leg lines extend to the lower right corner to guide the flow of the gaze. The light and shadow come from a combination of ceiling lighting and natural light outside the window. The main light sources come from above and in front, with soft shadows and strong three-dimensionality. The glass in the background reflects indoor lighting and outdoor scenes, adding spatial layering. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray. The contrast between a white shirt and black leather clothing creates a strong visual impact. The atmosphere combines modern workplace professionalism with intimate sensuality. The image texture is delicate and detailed, presenting a high-end studio-level portrait effect. At the same time, it carries the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting, as if captured in a real office environment. It has strong artistic appeal and narrative quality, suitable for visual expression in fashion, beauty, and workplace themes. The overall image is full of tension and beauty. It combines the refinement of commercial photography with a sense of everyday warmth",
