        {
          "id": "krea2-c67fd6823cffab85c96b4206",
          "alias": "单女黑连体衣城市冷淡注视",
          "prompt": "She wore a delicate black lace bodysuit with intricate lace patterns covering the entire body, presenting an elegant and sexy silhouette. The neckline was designed with a deep V and cutout details, accentuating the curves of her bust. The waist and hips were clearly outlined by a tight cut, and the shorts were also made of lace with ruffle trim, adding a touch of softness and romance. Her right hand gently stroked her neck, while her left hand let it hang naturally. She wore a simple silver bracelet on her wrist and slung a small off-white leather handbag across her shoulder. The bag is smooth and rounded, featuring a slender metal chain. On the feet are light gold stiletto high-heeled sandals, with crossed metal straps on the upper and exposed toe design making the ankle line longer. The overall look is both luxurious and everyday. The figure's posture is confident and composed, with a gentle expression tinged with mystery. The background is a modern-style indoor corridor, with walls on both sides in deep green or dark green, smooth surfaces and a heavy texture. Recessed wall lamps emit a soft, warm yellow light. The lighting is arranged linearly and evenly distributed on both sides of the corridor, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. At the far end, a window or glass door can be faintly seen, emitting a cool blue light that creates a contrast of warmth and coolness, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. The floor is paved with large blocks of white marble tiles, with natural texture and neat edges, reflecting the light and shadow of the surroundings and enhancing the realism and texture of the image. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the image, occupying the main visual focal point, and the body slightly tilted. A natural S-shaped curve is formed, guiding the gaze from the head to the legs, enhancing dynamic beauty. The foreground features the lower body and feet, clearly prominent; the middle features the subject's full body and handbag, rich in detail. The background gradually blurs, highlighting the main subject while preserving environmental information. Perspective lines converge from both sides of the corridor into depth, enhancing spatial depth. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from wall lamps on both sides, creating soft side lighting, while the other side is in slight shadow, creating a three-dimensional effect. At the same time, there are obvious light spots and reflections on the ground, enhancing the realism of the scene. The overall atmosphere blends modern urban fashion with the tranquility of private spaces. The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with warm yellow and cool blue, creating a high-end, elegant, and slightly sexy artistic ambiance. The image texture is delicate and detailed, as if shot with professional photography equipment, yet still retains a natural, everyday feel. It has strong visual impact and emotional appeal, making it suitable for fashion portraits, lifestyle displays, or high-end brand promotions. Overall, she presents a refined yet approachable image of a modern woman",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
