        {
          "id": "krea2-eb41b3d4eb0fbd67a69ab1cb",
          "alias": "单女空姐蓝制服机场温柔坐",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a deep blue flight attendant uniform sits upright on a black leather sofa. She wears a tailored deep blue blazer, with a badge featuring a white airplane pattern on her left chest. On her chest is a work ID printed with a colorful logo and text, which hangs around her neck via a strap. Her legs are crossed, wearing sheer black stockings, black high heels, and her right hand hangs naturally at her side, fingers gently resting on the sofa armrest. The posture is elegant and relaxed, with a warm dark red wall in the background. By the wall stands a beige floor lamp, with soft warm yellow light shining through the shade, illuminating the entire space and creating a cozy and intimate atmosphere. On the right side is a light gray curtain partially covering the window, and the floor is covered with a dark carpet with abstract patterns. The pattern consists of gray-white lines, presenting a minimalist yet modern design feel. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right, body slightly leaning forward and head slightly lowered. The overall light and shadow come from the left side of the desk lamp combined with ambient lighting. The light is soft and layered, with natural shadow transitions, highlighting the character's silhouette and the texture of the clothing. The color scheme is dark blue, black, red, and brown, paired with warm yellow lighting, creating a quiet, professional, and slightly intimate indoor scene. The image has the realism of everyday amateur equipment, with clear details without deliberate embellishment, preserving a lifelike texture and authentic atmosphere. The image is full of storytelling. It seems to capture a moment of tranquility during a break between work for a flight attendant, conveying the gentleness and fatigue behind the profession. The composition is compact but not crowded, the main focus is prominent, the background is simple, and the visual focus is on the expressions and postures of the characters. The overall atmosphere is quiet, warm, and authentic, imbued with a strong sense of life and humanistic care",
