        {
          "id": "krea2-6936032db56f299f68b93f6b",
          "alias": "单女灰上衣机场微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits under the departure corridor outside the modern airport terminal, smiling brightly and showing her neat, white teeth. Her makeup is delicate and natural, giving her a fresh, sweet, and fashionable overall vibe. She wears a loose light gray hooded sweatshirt over a black top and dark gray wide-leg pants. In her left hand, she carries a bright yellow chain bag with a diamond pattern and a clearly visible metallic double G logo. Her right hand holds a phone with light blue nail art, leaning naturally and effortlessly against a white suitcase. The body slightly turns to the side, head turned toward the camera, with a background of highly modern airport buildings. A massive curved white steel structure supports a wave-shaped glass curtain wall, reflecting the blue sky, white clouds, and distant scenery. The glass also reflects the silhouette of the aircraft on the tarmac. The sky is a clear blue, dotted with a few fluffy white clouds. The sunlight is bright but not glaring, with soft light casting on the figures and buildings, creating a warm golden tone. The ground is paved with gray cement with anti-slip stripes, and in the distance, some green vegetation and airport signage can be seen The composition uses low-angle downward shots to highlight the grand lines of the building and the elegant posture of the figures. The main subject is on the right side of the frame, while the left side leaves ample space to showcase the extended architectural structure, creating a strong perspective effect that guides the gaze into the distance. The contrast of light and shadow is striking, with natural transitions between light and shadow, creating an atmosphere that is both everyday and artistically beautiful. The overall color palette is mainly blue, gray, and white, accented with yellow bags as visual focal points. The texture of the image is realistic and delicate, as if taken with a professional camera for high-quality photos. At the same time, it retains everyday details and a sense of realism, presenting a youthful, free-spirited travel atmosphere. The composition is balanced and dynamic, colors harmoniously unified, light and shadow layers are rich, the atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, and it has strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
