        {
          "id": "krea2-ddf91279351f596495b84b82",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫街道站立阅读（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways in front of a Parisian street café. She wears a black turtleneck knit sweater and a black cropped jacket, paired with white quilted lace knee-high stockings, paired with burgundy square-toed low-heeled mules, a small leather handbag in matching tones slung over her shoulder, a black beret, and vintage black-rimmed glasses. She looks gracefully toward the street corner, leaning slightly forward, gently supporting the doorframe with her right hand, as if preparing to push the door open or just step out. The main focus is the profile of the person. From head to toe, the entire design highlights its fashionable style and French temperament. In the foreground is a gray stone paved walkway, with clear floor textures and slight wear along the edges. In the middle is a deep red wooden door frame and wall, with a black sign above reading \"Spécialités de Pains\" in white classical serif font, flanked by decorative patterns. The door frame has clean and strong lines, presenting a warm reddish-brown tone, with warm yellow lighting shining through the café in the background. The blurred interior furnishings are faintly visible, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The composition uses vertical composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right, forming an asymmetrical yet balanced visual structure. The lines of door frames and signboards guide the gaze toward the figure, which is visually drawn by the sharp contrast between the figure's figure, clothing color, and the color of the handbag and shoes, attracting attention. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and warm, mainly using natural light at dusk, with light streaming diagonally from the right side, creating a delicate transition of light and shadow on the figure. The shadowed areas blend into the environment, with a warm overall tone and a strong film texture. The color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and the visuals have a strong cinematic and everyday atmosphere, as if captured from an art film, presenting a daily yet refined urban aesthetic, like real street scenes shot with an old camera, full of story and a sense of the times",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
