        {
          "id": "krea2-e51ae1fe31daaf7c6e105a7d",
          "alias": "单女旗袍竹林站立",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a modified qipao with deep blue gradient ink bamboo leaf patterns, standing in the stone corridor of a classical Chinese courtyard. The qipao features a traditional stand-collar frog button, with short sleeves elegantly tailored to the figure. The hem reaches mid-calf, and the fabric is delicate, smooth, and slightly glossy. The bamboo leaf pattern is rendered with expressive brushstrokes, transitioning from deep blue to light gray to create a natural sense of ink layering. The overall composition is centered and symmetrical, with the figure occupying the main position. The background is typical Jiangnan garden architecture, with dark brown wooden window lattices and carved railings clearly visible. The window lattices are arranged in geometric patterns, with a blue-gray tiled roof and green outlines faintly visible behind. In the foreground is a floor paved with square stone slabs, with light streaming diagonally from the upper left, creating a soft contrast of light and shadow. The left side of the figure is illuminated by sunlight, while the right side is slightly shadowed, creating a three-dimensional light and shadow effect Distant scenes are blurred to highlight the main figures. The overall color palette is mainly blue, gray, and brown, blending traditional Eastern aesthetics. The atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, resembling a tranquil ink painting, rich in cultural heritage and poetic beauty. The details are rich, textures are clear, and color transitions are natural, presenting a fashionable atmosphere that is both classical and modern. The composition is stable and balanced, while background elements enhance spatial depth. The use of light and shadow is delicate, creating a warm and refreshing afternoon atmosphere. Like high-quality portraits shot with a professional camera under natural light, it features slight film graininess and realistic light and shadow textures. The overall style combines artistry with a sense of everyday life, as if capturing a moment of quiet standing in an ancient pavilion at dawn or dusk, full of storytelling and contemporary charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
