        {
          "id": "krea2-69fbbd02e8aacf22e1beb494",
          "alias": "单女透视蓝连体衣摄影棚沉思坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the indoor floor, her makeup exquisite, her expression slightly contemplative and alluring. She wears a deep blue tight bodysuit, smooth and hugging her body, outlining a slender waistline and long legs. She pairs it with black sheer stockings, whose surface has a slight reflective surface, presenting a delicate texture and sheen. Her legs are crossed, with the right leg in front and left leg behind, toes slightly turned inward. She wears black ankle socks with the cuff just covering her ankles. The overall design is simple yet charming. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition, occupying the main visual focus. The foreground is a floor covered with black-and-white striped carpets, arranged diagonally with fine black dashed lines, creating a strong geometric pattern. The carpet material is soft, with slightly curled edges to convey a realistic tactile feel. The center features a white sofa with a simple and modern backrest and cushion, made of fabric or leather, with a smooth surface and white pillows. To the right of the sofa is a gray-and-white geometric patterned blanket. The carpet features repeated patterns composed of triangles and diamonds, with soft colors that harmonize with the overall tone. The background is a light gray wall with a flat and undecorated surface. Light enters from the left, creating soft shadows with natural transitions, while the right side is in semi-shadow, creating a sense of depth and spatial layering. The light source comes from outside the window or side window, simulating natural light effects and making the entire scene bright and cozy. The composition is shot at a low angle, with the camera slightly tilted to enhance the visual height and presence of the subjects. At the same time, diagonal carpet stripes guide the gaze toward the figure, creating a dynamic visual flow. The heads and bodies are tilted at a certain angle, breaking vertical symmetry and adding dynamism to the image. The colors are mainly cool tones, with deep blue, black, white, and gray as the main tones, creating subtle contrasts. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and slightly artistic, as if capturing a moment in daily life or like a carefully arranged studio piece, combining everyday feel with aesthetic appeal. The images are rich in detail and textures are clear. From the sheen of stockings to the woven marks on carpets, and even the fabric folds on sofas, every detail reflects a realistic texture. The light and shadow are handled with delicate details, shadow edges are soft, and there is no stiff cut, creating an overall tranquil and captivating atmosphere. It's suitable for expressing feminine charm, fashion aesthetics, or lifestyle photo themes, with strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
