        {
          "id": "krea2-f63d0c16c19a750c33e0514e",
          "alias": "单女白T恤摄影棚沉思站立举手",
          "prompt": "A woman stands among tropical plants, wearing a white cherry-patterned camisole and light blue jeans. She stands sideways, her right hand raised to touch the huge banana leaf above, her left hand naturally resting on her waist, her posture elegant and relaxed, her expression slightly contemplative and gentle. Her earlobes wear delicate silver studs, a simple silver bracelet on her wrist, and her nails painted red. The overall look is fresh and natural, full of summer vibes. In the foreground are several huge emerald green banana leaves, their edges slightly curled. The surface features natural textures and subtle water droplet reflections. Some leaves are illuminated by sunlight to display bright yellow-green tones. The leaves extend diagonally from the top to the center, forming a natural arched frame that guides the viewer to focus on the figure. The middle ground features dense tropical vegetation, including various shades of green shrubs and trees. The leaves are layered, some appear semi-transparent due to backlighting. The background is a clear blue sky, dotted with a few thin white clouds, with light shining down from above and sides. Soft diffused light is created, shadows transition naturally, and the light and shadow create a contrast of light and shadow on the banana leaves, highlighting their three-dimensionality. The composition uses low-angle downward shots, making the figure appear tall and upright. The banana leaves form a visual guiding line, creating a sense of openness and expansiveness. The overall atmosphere is fresh and bright, full of vitality and energy. The color scheme is mainly green, accented with white, blue, and red, creating a harmonious unity with strong visual appeal. The image texture is close to professional studio outdoor shooting, shot with a large-aperture lens. The background is blurred naturally, details are clear, and light and shadow are handled delicately, presenting an effect reminiscent of high-end commercial portrait photography, while preserving the authenticity and lively atmosphere of the outdoor natural environment, as if capturing the most beautiful moment of a summer afternoon",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
