        {
          "id": "krea2-da4dfce54a7f0a564953f86a",
          "alias": "单女透视白连衣裙门展示",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a lightweight white sheer dress with an A-line hem, a thin waistband design that corresponds to the waist, and the short-sleeved sleeves with a sheer texture. The neckline and cuffs were decorated with exquisite lace trim, creating an elegant and romantic overall look. The background was a weathered concrete wall with obvious water stains and weathered textures, presenting a texture of interwoven gray-white and deep gray. On the left, a row of dark wooden structures can be seen, possibly part of a door or window frame, forming vertical lines in the composition. Sunlight pours in from the upper right, creating bright highlights on the figures, while casting clear shadows on the floor and walls. The strong contrast of light and shadow creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. Light passes through the sheer skirt, creating a semi-transparent soft glow effect that softens the figure's outline. The entire composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure occupying the left central position, the body extending diagonally. The wall and wooden structures in the background form a simple geometric framework, enhancing the sense of space and depth in the image. The overall color palette is mainly white, beige, light gray, and wood tones, with soft and unified colors and natural transitions of light and shadow, creating a fresh, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic everyday atmosphere. It feels like a real moment captured by an ordinary camera in the afternoon sunlight, with a strong sense of documentary and everyday life. The details are rich, showcasing a delicate texture and realism, and the overall style combines artistic beauty with the warmth of everyday life, giving people a warm and beautiful feeling.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
