        {
          "id": "krea2-a43c9b180821c0ca4cadda2a",
          "alias": "单女舞者灰T恤城市冷淡站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "A female ballet dancer wore a gray tight tank top and a light teal gauze skirt, pink stockings wrapped around her long legs, and pink pointe shoes. She elegantly lifted her right leg high over a white dance barre, while her left leg stood upright supporting her body, her posture relaxed and full of tension. She turned sideways to look back at the camera, holding a silver beverage can. The metal bottle reflected a soft sheen, and small earrings on her earlobes made the overall look both professional and fashionable. In the foreground was a clearly visible white dance barretum. Its smooth surface and rounded edges create a delicate texture under the light. The barre extends diagonally from the lower left corner to the middle right of the frame, forming a strong visual guide that draws the viewer's body and movements. The center is the dancer's main subject, positioned on the right side of the canvas, her body slightly leaning back, her back smooth and her arms naturally hanging down, and her other hand gently gripping the barre, showcasing the unique flexibility and strength of a ballet dancer. The background is a spacious and bright dance studio, with a clean and tidy light gray wooden floor reflecting a soft glow. The walls are pure white, with recessed downlights installed above. The evenly distributed light sources create a bright and cozy atmosphere. In the distance, several glass doors and mirrors can be seen. The mirrors reflect scenes from other indoor areas, including air conditioning units, corridors, and some blurred signage, adding depth to the space. The ceiling is light gray-white with simple geometric line decorations. The overall environment is modern and minimalist, full of artistic atmosphere. The composition uses an asymmetrical layout: dancers occupy the right side of the frame, while the left side leaves a large negative space to create visual balance. At the same time, the diagonal lines on the bars enhance the sense of movement, guiding the viewer's attention to the movements and expressions of the characters. Light and shadow come from multiple round spotlights above, providing soft and even lighting without strong shadows, making the character outlines clear. The wrinkles in clothing and the texture of stockings are richly detailed, creating an overall atmosphere that is both professional and relaxed, blending the realism of daily practice with the beauty of artistic expression. It seems to capture a moment between training, combining the rigor of a professional dancer with a casual and intimate sense of everyday life. The color palette of the painting is gray, white, and pink, Dominated by green tones, with harmonious contrasts of warm and cool tones, creating a fresh and tranquil yet vibrant visual experience. The photography style resembles high-resolution professional portrait photography, using a large-aperture lens with a slight background blur that highlights the subject while preserving sufficient environmental information, presenting the texture of a real scene. The overall image has high artistic appeal and storytelling, like a portrait of contemporary urban youth life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
