        {
          "id": "krea2-20b0bed7ac56d061561f984f",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙椅上自信坐持书",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a classic-style wooden chair, wearing a long pink plush dress with a high neckline. The sleeves are long and fit the arm lines, with the hem naturally dragging to the floor, creating elegant pleats and layers. The material presents a fluffy, soft touch and delicate texture details. She crosses her legs, one foot gently resting on the floor, the other slightly raised, her posture relaxed and expressive, her hands crossed in front of her abdomen, holding a small clutch in the same color scheme. The overall look exudes a sense of sophistication and fashion, with a calm and reserved expression that exudes a calm and confident temperament. The background is a light green wall with subtle textures and soft transitions of light and shadow. On the left, you can see part of the white fireplace edge; on the right side is a white double door with clean and orderly door frames. Bright natural light streams in from the upper right corner, creating a soft contrast of light and shadow, casting subtle shadows on the figures and walls. The floor is a warm light brown wood with clear and natural wood grain. The entire space's color tones are harmoniously unified, creating a tranquil, elegant, and slightly retro atmosphere. The composition centers on the figure, using a medium perspective where the figures occupy the main positions in the frame, while the chairs extend diagonally, enhancing the sense of depth in the scene. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, highlighting the main contour. At the same time, soft gradient shadows are formed at the skirt hem and the floor, creating an overall quiet and sophisticated atmosphere, resembling a magazine cover shoot. It has the texture and artistic flair of professional photography, presenting a refined and A restrained yet gentle modern fashion aesthetic, with warm tones, moderate saturation, rich details, and clear layering, showcasing a high level of visual completion and aesthetic style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
