          "id": "krea2-98d37d27f39c6a8c29ae4e3c",
          "alias": "单女米外套城市冷淡坐比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the stone steps by the Seine River in Paris, wearing a beige long coat paired with a white shirt and a deep blue polka dot bow tie, wearing a bright red beret. She is intently reading an open fashion magazine, gently grasping the edge of the magazine in her hand, her posture elegant and relaxed. Black polka-dot stockings wrap her long legs, and she wears black platform Martin boots with gold V-shaped metal buckles. The boots are vintage and textured, and on her left ring finger is a simple ring, and on her wrist is a silver bracelet. The overall design blends French romance with modern fashion. In the background, the Eiffel Tower soars into the clouds, its metal structure gleaming with a cool gray sheen in the sunlight. The details of the tower are clearly visible, the sky is a deep blue as if washed, dotted with a few fluffy white clouds. On the left, lush green trees stretch out, their branches and leaves gently swaying in the breeze. In the distance, the river surface shimmers, reflecting the blue sky and the silhouettes of the buildings. An arched bridge spans the river, connecting both banks. In the foreground, rough concrete stone steps are visible. The surface bears mottled marks and fine particles left by time. Light falls from the upper right, creating a soft side glow, casting natural shadows on the ground. The rich layering of light and shadow creates a warm and bright daytime atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, highlighting the main subject while visually extending the Eiffel Tower to guide the gaze upward, creating a strong sense of depth. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, with a slight forward lean body for dynamic balance. The magazine cover features a capital letter \"F\" as one of the visual focal points. Capturing viewers' attention, the overall color scheme is mainly warm tones. The red hat contrasts sharply with the beige coat, while green leaves and the blue sky provide a cool tone. The colors are harmoniously unified, presenting a daily yet slightly refined urban life atmosphere, as if capturing a real moment of city walking. Using professional photography equipment, the lens has a slight depth of field effect, the background is slightly blurred, enhancing the subject's prominence while retaining enough details. The image texture is delicate, and the overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling. Like a classic street style captured in a Parisian afternoon",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
