        {
          "id": "krea2-3e4f4b83cec2ad029820690f",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣高塔神秘站立注视",
          "prompt": "As night falls, the city's lights spread out like a galaxy on the distant horizon. The silhouettes of skyscrapers appear faintly beneath the deep blue sky, countless dots of light weave into a dazzling sea of light. Neon and streetlights complement each other, creating a bustling yet mysterious urban atmosphere. The clouds in the sky are heavy, presenting a gradient of deep gray and dark blue, with the edges tinted by city lights with a faint orange-yellow halo, adding a touch of mystery. In the foreground, a woman stands sideways on a modern-style rooftop terrace. She wore a form-fitting light beige knit mini dress with a fully open back, revealing a graceful spine and shoulder blades. The dress was made of delicate and soft material, with slight pleats. She wore a pair of gold stiletto sandals adorned with metal chains on the upper and thin strings tied around her ankles. The overall look was both sexy and elegant. Her posture was naturally relaxed, with her body slightly tilted. The left hand gently touches the waist, the right hand hangs down. The middle view is the terrace's leisure area, featuring several sets of modern minimalist white upholstered sofas paired with black marble tabletops. Warm yellow floor lamps hang above the sofas, emitting soft light and illuminating the surrounding area. The floor is paved with dark polished tiles, reflecting the surrounding light and creating a contrasting effect of light and shadow. Near the edge is an embedded water feature pool, with LED light strips at the bottom, emitting a pale green glow that sparkles gently with the breeze. A few green plant leaves float on the water's surface, with a few low tropical plants scattered nearby, adding a touch of vitality. The composition uses a third-section layout: the figure is positioned in the left third of the frame, facing right, but the head turns and the gaze meets the viewer's, creating a strong visual guidance. The cityscape in the background extends from left to right, occupying most of the space and creating a sense of expansive space. The sky occupies the upper half, lowering the horizon and enhancing the sense of depth. The slightly lower perspective makes the figure appear tall and upright. It also highlights the city's grand scale. The lighting mainly comes from ambient and artificial lighting, including warm yellow lights on the terrace, cool white lights in the distance, and green light sources at the bottom of the pool, creating a contrast of warm and cool conditions. The figures receive even lighting, soft shadows, and no harsh edges. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, creating a quiet and romantic atmosphere, as if a private moment belonging to a city night, full of modernity and fashion. The image quality is close to high-end photography equipment, with clear details, moderate color saturation, and good noise control presenting a visual effect that is both realistic and slightly artistic, with the overall color scheme mainly dark blue and black, accented by warm yellow, off-white, golden brown, and green light, creating a warm yet calm nighttime atmosphere. The image conveys an emotion of independence, confidence, elegance, and a touch of detachment, like an urban woman seeking a moment of tranquility amid the noise to enjoy her own highlight moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
