        {
          "id": "krea2-28ae60df7dc163152cb39ad0",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装室内温柔坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white bedsheet in a hotel room, wearing a deep blue fitted suit jacket and a matching short skirt, with a white V-neck undershirt underneath. She turns sideways to look back at the camera, her left hand gently resting on the bed to support her body, her right leg bent and folded over her left, both legs long and straight, wearing sheer black stockings. Under the light, her skin appears delicate and translucent. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with a mid-angle perspective. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the space, with the background set in a simple indoor environment. Beige walls feature warm orange-yellow ambient lighting projected from the left, creating a soft gradient glow on the wall. On the right, dark gray curtains block the windows. A spherical woven lampshade is placed on the nightstand, emitting a hazy warm white light to create a cozy and intimate nighttime atmosphere. The bed is tidy, the white sheets have natural folds, and in the distance, the outlines of the sofa and cushions can be seen. The overall light and shadow distribution presents a typical indoor artificial lighting effect. The main light source is the left wall lamp and the right desk lamp, providing soft and even lighting. Shadow transitions are natural, and the fabric material shows a silky sheen and fabric texture. The surface of the stockings reflects a faint highlight, enhancing realism. The color palette is mainly blue, white, and gray, complemented by warm yellow-orange tones, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The visual guide line naturally extends from the figure's posture to the focal point of view. The composition is stable and layered. Close-ups highlight character details and clothing texture, while the middle shots show the environmental layout. The background blur treatment makes the subject stand out more. The overall style combines the professionalism of a professional woman with the relaxed atmosphere of a private space. It seems to capture the tranquil moments of solitude after work, with the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The camera specs simulate the high-resolution sensor performance of the Canon EOS R5 or Sony A7R IV, ISO 400, shutter speed 1/60 sec, aperture f/2.8, focal length 85mm, slight graininess and natural noise preserved, slight vignette at the edges of the frame, enhancing the retro film texture, wide dynamic range, rich highlights and shadow details, overall presenting a lifelike, A realistic and emotionally charged visual atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
