        {
          "id": "krea2-2c34625b25fa458da6446740",
          "alias": "单女空姐蓝制服摄影棚自信坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a dark blue flight attendant uniform sits gracefully on a row of black, modern chairs. She wears a beret in the same color and a red and blue silk scarf at her collar. The red gloves contrast sharply with the uniform. She crosses her arms over her chest and crosses her legs, exuding a dignified and confident posture, exuding professionalism and composure. Her makeup is exquisite, black stockings wrap her long legs, and she wears black high heels. The overall look perfectly embodies the professional image of an aviation service worker, with neatly arranged black plastic chairs in the foreground, clean lines and smooth surfaces reflect soft light. The middle ground is the main subject, positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, with her body slightly leaning forward and her head slightly tilted, creating a sense of dynamic balance. The background is a pure white wall, clean and simple, with clear shadows cast on the wall, adding depth and three-dimensionality to the space. The floor is paved with black-and-white checkerboard tiles, with geometric patterns extending to the edges, enhancing visual rhythm and order. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered. The chairs on both sides are symmetrically arranged to form a stable visual structure, while light and shadow contrast highlights the contours of the figures. The visual guide starts with the foreground chair and naturally transitions to the figure in the middle shot. Light and shadow come from the left side of the frame, creating soft side lighting, while the other side presents natural shadows, enhancing the sense of depth and texture. The overall atmosphere combines professional rigor and standardization with feminine softness and charm, presenting a modern, minimalist, and sophisticated fashion sense, as if filmed in a professional studio. Using softboxes and reflectors to control the light, it creates a uniform and layered illumination effect. The image details are rich, the color scheme harmonious, and the four main tones—black, white, blue, and red—complement each other, creating a strong visual impact. For example, the uniform's crispness, the glossy glove, and the folds of the scarf create a quiet and focused feeling, like waiting in an airport waiting for a flight to take off, full of anticipation and hope, as if you can hear the distant roar of an airplane engine. Feel the excitement and thrill of the journey about to begin",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
