        {
          "id": "krea2-4ba5a978c036d35d09274a8c",
          "alias": "单女蓝旗袍竹林冷淡倚靠持扇",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a light blue gradient silk qipao. The upper half of the qipao featured a high collar and sleeveless design, with a pearl button accented at the neckline. The hem gradually unfolded from the waist, presenting a smooth mermaid shape. The fabric shimmered softly under the light, with subtle subtle patterns faintly visible. The overall cut hugged the figure, outlining elegant curves. She held a black bamboo fan, with a dark base and densely covered with fine golden Chinese characters. The fan ribs are light yellow wood with slightly curved edges. She gently grips the fan handle with both hands, her fingers long, her nails painted light pink, and wears an orange-red beaded bracelet on her wrist, adding a bright touch. She wears black lace high-heeled sandals with hollowed-out uppers and fine ribbons at the ankles. She leans gracefully against the window, her body slightly tilted, right leg bent and raised, toes touching the ground, left leg upright for support. In the foreground is a dark brown wooden window frame and sill, with clear wood grain. The weathered lacquer and the marks left by time give it a rustic texture. The window frame is sturdy and the lines are simple. In the middle ground, the female subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition. Her body and the window form a stable triangular composition. Through the window, the background reveals a hazy green forest, with layers of trees and distinct distinct distances. The sky appears grayish-white, with soft and diffused light creating a tranquil and distant atmosphere. The entire composition uses vertical composition, with figures occupying most of the space and light and shadows coming from natural light outside the window. Softly sprinkled over the figures, creating contrasts of light and shadow, highlighting the silhouette and garment texture. Shadows fall on the indoor floor and walls, enhancing the sense of depth. The colors are mainly cool tones, with blue, gray, and green echoing each other. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, like a classical oil painting or a snapshot of daily life captured with an old film camera. It carries a strong artistic atmosphere and nostalgic mood, as if capturing an afternoon forgotten by time. The light and shadow are dreamlike and enchanting, the characters' expressions serene, as if merging with nature",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
