        {
          "id": "krea2-98090718532ef38edf63a6eb",
          "alias": "单女黑连体衣摄影棚害羞",
          "prompt": "She wears a black lace bodysuit with intricate and exquisite lace patterns and wavy edges. Her chest and waist feature three-dimensional embroidered floral patterns. The slender shoulder straps accentuate her neckline, clearly showing her collarbone. Below her left shoulder is a faint tattoo mark. Her hands are folded in front of her abdomen, her right hand gently caresses her left wrist, her posture elegant yet slightly shy. On her right arm, she wears a black lace bracelet with a slender wrist line. She wears black mesh stockings on her legs, with black satin bows on her upper thighs. Her ankles are not fully visible, and the background is a dark gray or black wall with simple geometric patchwork lines, presenting a modern panel structure. On the left side is a dark brown leather sofa with natural wrinkles and reflective textures. At the back right is a golden hexagonal decorative frame, reflecting some light. The overall space is dim but layered, with the light source coming from the left front of the figure, creating a soft side backlight effect. Highlights body curves and skin texture, with shadows falling on the wall and sofa behind, creating a strong contrast between light and dark. The composition centers on the person, shot at a slight tilt, using the rule of thirds, with the characters occupying the main position, forming a closed visual loop. The overall atmosphere is private, sexy, elegant, and full of artistic flair. The color scheme is mainly black, accented with deep brown and gold. The tones are unified and harmonious, details rich, and the texture feels realistic, as if professional photography equipment was used in a studio. The lighting is precisely arranged. Emphasizing the main contours and texture details while preserving subtle light and shadow changes in the environment, it presents a high-end fashion photo style with strong visual impact and emotional expression. The image is highly clear and detailed is finely handled, presenting an aesthetic that balances sensuality and restraint overall, much like classic shots in a movie scene, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
