        {
          "id": "krea2-413bdda620e8f9d453ea9db9",
          "alias": "单女灰丝袜摄影棚严肃倚靠展示",
          "prompt": "She wore a soft light pink long-sleeved top with fabric that naturally draped to form delicate pleats. The neckline was simple and rounded, and the sleeves hugged the arm lines, presenting an overall lazy yet sophisticated everyday vibe, adding a touch of casualness and gentleness. She wore a pair of exaggerated black geometric earrings, giving the look a unique and modern feel that injected a strong visual focal point into the entire look. She wore dark gray stockings with fine shimmering grains, the material sparkling slightly under the light, revealing a low-key luxury feel. On her feet are a pair of avant-garde black-and-white color-blocked high-heeled sandals, with thin straps wrapping around the ankles, silver metal clasps, and slender heels showcasing exquisite craftsmanship. Her body leans slightly backward, her left hand naturally resting on the armrest of the chair, her right hand gently resting on her thigh, her legs long and straight stretched forward, and her right leg slightly bent, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The entire pose is both relaxed and full of tension. The background is a pure white wall and floor, with no unnecessary decorations or clutter, creating a minimalist sense of space. The composition uses a medium perspective The figure occupies about two-thirds of the left side of the frame, leaving a large blank space on the right to create a strong visual balance and sense of breathability. The camera is positioned slightly below the subject's line of sight, capturing the full contour from the side, highlighting the leg lines and clothing details. Light from the front left softly and evenly falls on the figure, creating a natural shadow transition that enhances the sense of depth and realism. The overall atmosphere is calm, restrained, yet still stylish, as if in a professional studio, yet retains the casualness and comfort of daily life, with white tones Pink and black are the main colors, with simple yet sophisticated color combinations without excessive rendering, presenting a clean and crisp aesthetic style. The images have a strong modern urban feel, blending the tranquility and contemplative temperament of artistic photography, as if telling a story about self-expression, identity, and fashion attitude. There are no unnecessary elements in the image; every detail serves the presentation of the main subject. The composition is precise, the layers are distinct, the foreground is clear and prominent, the middle shot transitions naturally, and the background is open and simple. Extending along the body's curves to the legs and shoes, it ultimately settles in a spacious negative space, guiding the audience to think and make associations. The overall effect resembles a commercial commercial or fashion shoot shot with a professional camera, combining artistry and practicality, strong realism, rich details, and delicate light and shadow treatment, presenting a beauty that transcends everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
