        {
          "id": "krea2-b135087352561f0ac954b56d",
          "alias": "单女白内衣窗边沉思倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "Wearing white lace-trimmed lingerie and underwear, with white stockings trimmed with ruffles, she leans naturally and relaxedly against the window frame, her right hand hanging at her side, and several small tattoos visible on her arm. Her expression is slightly contemplative and distant, her body slightly turned to the side, revealing soft curves. The main subject is this woman, whose posture is elegant yet slightly lazy, creating a private and tranquil atmosphere. In the foreground, her body and legs occupy most of the left side of the frame, with smooth leg lines and slightly bent knees. The details of the sock pleats at the ankle are clearly visible. To the right of the middle ground is a wooden easel with a completed oil painting on top. The painting is a still life, depicting a white vase with several pale pink roses in a vase, with two orange fruits and a beige fabric placed beside it. The painting style is realistic and rich in brushstroke texture, mainly dark brown, dark green, and warm yellow, contrasting with the surroundings. The background features bright windows, with white curtains half-drawn, letting in soft natural light, while outside light diffuses in. Illuminating the entire room, the walls are light beige with slightly mottled marks, revealing a retro atmosphere. Some old radiators on the floor are faintly visible, with slight wear on the surface, adding realism to the scene. The composition uses an oblique layout, with figures extending from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a visual guiding line. The easel and painting are on the right side, balancing the center of gravity and directing the gaze from the figure to the painting, enhancing narrative quality. Light and shadow mainly come from the left window, creating soft side lighting, with shadows falling on the right wall and easel. It enhances the sense of three-dimensionality, with an overall warm color palette dominated by off-white, light brown, and cream yellow, creating a nostalgic and cozy atmosphere. The image has a film texture, with obvious graininess, moderate color saturation, and a slight fading effect, resembling an old family album photo. The lens is a medium prime prime lens that simulates everyday amateur camera shooting, with a shallow depth of field and a slightly blurred background that highlights the subject. The overall style blends artistic portraiture, life documentary, and retro aesthetics, presenting a tranquil These intimate and story-filled moments seem to capture the artist's true state during a creative break. The images are rich in detail and layered, possessing both strong visual appeal and profound emotional expression, making them suitable for themes where female self-awareness intertwines with artistic creation and daily life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
