        {
          "id": "krea2-9314800b6b3823d0705e630f",
          "alias": "单女黑泳装广场媚态倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "Dressed in a black bikini with white floral patterns, she gracefully leans against a stone pillar in classical architecture, radiating a soft golden sheen. She wears a delicate pearl necklace that adds a touch of vintage elegance. Her body leans slightly, her left hand resting lightly on the pillar, her right hand naturally hanging down, her posture relaxed and full of tension, showcasing healthy and graceful curves. The floor is paved with square stone slabs, reflecting soft light and creating a strong sense of depth through perspective. The composition uses a medium close-up, with the figure occupying the center to the right. The lines of the columns guide the viewer's gaze deeper, creating a sense of spatial layering. Natural light from the sides softly illuminates the figures, creating a contrast of light and shadow. It resembles a fashionable portrait shot with professional studio lighting combined with natural light, featuring cinematic-quality image quality and film quality. The color palette mainly uses warm yellow and off-white, accented with black and white contrasts, presenting an elegant yet modern visual aesthetic. The details are rich, and the stone pillars and floor in the background retain authentic material details. The overall style blends the solemnity of classical architecture with the sensual charm of modern women, creating a visual experience that is both noble and approachable",
