        {
          "id": "krea2-36fe53ab93035d3a6f724f4f",
          "alias": "单女黑旗袍花园忧伤坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a stone railing in a Chinese garden, wearing a black sleeveless qipao with red trim that naturally falls over her shoulders. Her makeup is exquisite, revealing a gentle yet slightly sorrowful expression. On her wrist, she wears a white jade bracelet and a string of beads. Her posture is elegant, her body slightly tilted, leaning against a dark wooden column. The background is a traditional building with white walls and gray tiles, and exquisite openwork window lattices are embedded on the walls. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled light and shadow on the walls, creating a pattern of interwoven light and shadow. The ground is paved with gray brick paths, and in the distance, lush shrubs and rockery can be seen. The overall composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figures positioned slightly to the right, while the left side leaves a large space to showcase architectural details and light and shadow changes. Light streams diagonally from the upper left, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow that creates a soft and layered light and shadow effect, while the shadowed areas appear in a cool gray-blue tone. This enhances the sense of three-dimensionality and depth in the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and leisurely, full of classical Eastern charm, like a freehand ink painting or a tranquil moment in an art film. The lens simulates the Canon 5D Mark IV paired with an 85mm f/1.2 prime lens, using a large aperture to blur the background and highlight the subject while preserving environmental details. The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with red and brown. The tone is warm and restrained, with a film-like texture, resulting in delicate and realistic images. Like a real scene shot with a professional camera in the afternoon sunlight, it features slight graininess and natural motion blur, creating a visual experience that is both artistic and everyday",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
