        {
          "id": "krea2-ae08c7b1887cb456b5158598",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣广场坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors on a wooden swing, wearing a gray knit cardigan paired with a white collared shirt and red bow tie. Her overall posture is natural and relaxed, as if enjoying a moment of tranquility in the sunlight. The swing is suspended by thick metal chains, the wooden seat looks slightly worn, its surface bearing traces of time, and the background is a mottled gray-white wall. The walls show obvious signs of weathering and peeling. On the wall, there is a red-framed window and a dark doorway. Next to the door is a blurry green signage, and the floor is paved with light gray square tiles. Some areas are illuminated by sunlight forming bright spots, while others are in shadow, presenting a gentle transition between light and shadow. Light comes from the upper right of the painting, representing warm afternoon sun. Sunlight penetrates the air to create a slight halo effect, casting clear diagonal shadows on the ground and the swing. The composition uses a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the image, with swing chains extending from the top to the bottom, forming a vertical guiding line. The background architectural elements are blurred to highlight the main figure. The foreground features tile textures and some swing structures, while the middle scene focuses on the figures and swings. The background has a hazy texture, with gray, white, and brown as the main tones, accented with a touch of red and green. The overall tone is warm and soft, with natural light and shadow contrast, creating a quiet and cozy campus daily atmosphere. The texture is delicate and authentic. Like shooting with a high-resolution camera on a clear afternoon, it features slight film graininess and natural noise, rich details and clear layering. The vertical lines of the chain enhance image stability, presenting an overall style that is youthful, tranquil, nostalgic, and full of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
