        {
          "id": "krea2-4a7212f33c081f984134ad4a",
          "alias": "单女紫背心沙发俏皮躺侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways on a gray fabric sofa on an outdoor terrace, wearing a set of deep purple tight sweatpants and a light purple lace-up sports vest with pleated design. She slightly tilts her head to the upper right, as if whispering softly or feeling the warmth of the sunlight. Her posture is relaxed and graceful, her body curves perfectly matching the sofa's curve, creating a lazy and cozy atmosphere. In the foreground are several orange cushions on the sofa, some of which have fine mesh textures, with sunlight slanting down from the upper left of the frame. Clear strip-like shadows are cast onto the orange cushion, creating a contrasting effect of light and shadow. These shadows extend to the woman's body and the sofa surface, enhancing the sense of layering in the space. The middle is the sofa area where the woman is present. The sofa surface is made of light gray fabric with delicate texture and slight stitching details along the edges. The sofa frame is made of metal and partially obscured. In the background, you can see a large clay flowerpot planted with lush green shrubs. Behind the pot is another set of outdoor furniture. This includes a beige woven chair and some black-and-white striped cushions, orange cushions. In the distance, a lush wall of greenery with dense branches and leaves creates rich color layers. The floor is paved with reddish-brown bricks arranged in a herringbone pattern, with clear brick joints. The overall composition adopts a high-angle top-down view, with the figure positioned slightly to the lower left of the frame, with the gaze guided to the upper right, forming a diagonal composition that enhances the dynamic and visual extension of the image. The lighting is natural afternoon light, warm and soft, with strong directionality and a striking contrast of light and shadow. The sharp edges of shadows highlight the three-dimensionality of the objects. The entire scene is bathed in golden sunlight, creating a peaceful, comfortable, and lively summer afternoon atmosphere. The main color palette is warm tones, with orange, brown, purple, and green forming a harmonious complementary relationship. The color saturation is moderate, texture is realistic, and details are rich, presenting a beautiful moment captured unintentionally in daily life, as if taken with a regular phone, retaining slight noise and authentic light and shadow transitions. Without excessive embellishment, emphasizing naturalness and authenticity, the overall composition is full of artistic flair and the aesthetics of life, evoking feelings of relaxation, freedom, and joy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
