        {
          "id": "krea2-d795896a6e6dca9cc998f5fb",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙森林困倦侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears an off-white woven straw hat with a wide brim decorated with lace trim. She wears a teal spaghetti strap dress with pearls strung along the shoulder line and back, creating a unique decorative effect. The dress's tailoring fits the figure, highlighting slender shoulder lines and graceful silhouettes. The maple leaf's veins are clearly visible, with vibrant and full colors that contrast sharply with the surrounding environment. The foreground features a figure as the main subject, while the background is a blurred outdoor natural scene, presenting rich green tones and warm yellow light spots. The leaves create bokeh under sunlight, forming a dreamy halo and layered effect, while the middle ground connects the foreground and background. Showing the environment of the subject, you can see some blurred outlines of tree trunks and branches, hinting that this is a forest or park scene. The composition uses close-up shots, with the person positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, head slightly tilted, body in a sideways posture, gazing toward the camera, creating a good visual guide. Light streams diagonally from the right side of the frame, a typical backlight or side backlight shoot. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, making the figure more three-dimensional. The contrast between light and shadow is strong but the transition is natural, creating a warm overall atmosphere. Tranquil and poetic, with warm yellow and green tones as the main tones, accented by teal and orange-red. The color combinations are harmonious and pleasing, the image texture is delicate and detailed, with a strong sense of artistry and cinematic style. It feels like a carefully composed film photograph with slight graininess and the unique color saturation of film, presenting a realistic and romantic everyday shooting atmosphere. It's like capturing a moment with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the main subject. The overall image conveys a leisurely, pleasant, fresh, and natural feeling of an autumn afternoon",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
