        {
          "id": "krea2-f3b8d003b164ff961917f258",
          "alias": "单女粉T恤窗边愤怒持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sat by the window, wearing a light pink camisole pajama. The hem of her skirt was adorned with fine vertical stripes, and the edges of the cuffs and collar were slightly loose, giving off a relaxed homely feel. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with faint reflections on wooden window frames and glass. Light streaming through leaves or blinds casts tiny shadows on the walls and figures, creating a tranquil and warm atmosphere. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, body slightly tilted, head slightly lowered, forming a natural visual guideline. The foreground clearly shows the main subject, the middle ground is the windowsill behind her and some interior furnishings, and the background is blurred to highlight the subject. The color palette is mainly warm yellow and pale pink, with soft and layered lighting. Sunlight streams through the glass, creating a clear contrast between light and shadow. The shadowed areas are deep and soft, while the highlights are bright but not glaring. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and serene, full of life and poetic beauty, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment. The image has a slight film graininess and vintage tones, simulating the effects of vintage camera shooting. The color saturation is moderate with a slight fade, enhancing nostalgia. The depth of field is relatively shallow, and the background blur is obvious. It creates an intimate and private sense of space, presenting an overall everyday aesthetic style that is gentle, lazy, tranquil, and slightly melancholic, like a tranquil scene in an art film, making one feel time frozen in this moment and emotions flowing through light and shadow",
          "description": "",
