        {
          "id": "krea2-ae2feae4d5c1401e22f1ec63",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣广场沉思站立展示",
          "prompt": "A female model wearing a gray high-neck long-sleeve knit top and a black textured mini skirt stands in a dimly lit indoor space. Her posture is elegant and confident, her body slightly turned to the camera, head slightly raised, her expression calm yet somewhat detached. Her hands hang naturally down, fingers are long, and she wears a slender ring on her left ring finger. The overall look is modern and fashionable, with the main subject of the image being this woman. Occupying the left central position of the composition, the composition uses a vertical elongated frame, with the figure running almost from feet to head throughout the entire frame, creating a strong visual extension. In the foreground is a smooth, reflective dark floor with fine scratches and water stains on the surface, reflecting the contours of the legs and the faint glow of distant light, creating a mirror effect. The middle ground shows the full female figure, clearly visible from ankles to chest. The high-waisted short skirt clings closely to the hips, highlighting body curves. A wide-brimmed metallic belt with square buckles is tied around the waist This enhances the overall ruggedness of the design. The background is a deep black curtain or wall, with slight wrinkles and textures, presenting a stage curtain-like texture. On the left, a bright spotlight shines from the ground, with light passing through the dust in the air, forming soft halos and radiating beams that illuminate parts of the ground and the woman's lower body. At the same time, gradient light and shadow layers are projected onto the screen, giving the scene a sense of depth. The ceiling structure in the sky area is faintly visible, composed of metal beams and suspended fixtures. Showcasing industrial-style design elements, the overall color palette is mainly black, gray, and white, complemented by metallic silver and the gloss of glossy black high heels. The colors are cool yet unified, with strong contrast between light and shadow. The transitions between light and shadow are delicate, with the light source coming from the lower left, creating a combination of backlight and side lighting, creating a mysterious, sophisticated, and slightly cold atmosphere. The overall image has the texture of a professional studio shoot, reminiscent of a high-end fashion magazine cover or backstage capture of a fashion show. The large-aperture prime lens was used for shooting, and the background blur is handled well Emphasizing the main details, the composition is stable and full of tension. The visual guide leads from ground reflections and light trajectories toward the figures, conveying a calm, independent, and overall commanding aura. The entire image combines artistry with commercial aesthetics, full of the strength and charm of modern urban women",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
