        {
          "id": "krea2-ee06117a2354af37e71fc0f8",
          "alias": "单女金毛衣床愤怒躺持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman lies relaxed on a bed covered with a warm yellow diamond knit blanket. She wears a white short-sleeved shirt and round metallic glasses, her expression slightly lazy and playful. She holds a Nintendo Switch console in both hands, with the red and blue Joy-Con controllers clearly visible. Her legs are bent and raised, feet pointing upward, and her bare feet visually extend in the frame, creating a casual yet intimate atmosphere. Beneath her lies a thick yellow woven texture pillow. The pillow surface displays delicate vertical striped texture. The bedsheet is soft off-white with light pink pleated edges. In the background is a fabric backrest with green and white checkered patterns. Next to it is a light-colored chest of drawers, with drawers featuring simple round wooden handles, creating a warm and harmonious overall tone. On the right side of the bed, several whole oranges and peeled orange petals are scattered beside the bed. The orange petals are placed on a white tray with blurred English letters printed on the edges. On the left side of the picture is a pale pink plush cushion. Adding softness to the space, the composition uses a low-angle overhead angle. The figure is positioned slightly below the center of the frame, with the body extending diagonally from the lower left to the upper right, creating a natural visual direction. The foreground features clear game consoles and hand details, the middle ground is the main body and pillow, and the background is the bedside, wardrobe, and wall, with distinct layering. Light and shadow come from the left side, creating subtle shadow transitions. The overall lighting is bright but not glaring, with warm yellow, off-white, and light brown as the main tones, accented by green plaid and orange fruits. It creates a warm and comfortable family atmosphere, with delicate and realistic image quality, as if shot by a professional camera, while preserving the casual and intimate feel of daily life. It has a strong home atmosphere and youthful energy, full of everyday details and emotional warmth, presenting a peaceful and joyful leisure moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
