        {
          "id": "krea2-17bbd987d7f94f244ad6c2c9",
          "alias": "单女棕高领衫街道愤怒坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a pink bench outdoors, wearing a dark brown turtleneck knit sweater with clearly visible texture and a soft, thick texture. Three small red embroidery decorations adorn the chest, adding a delicate bright touch to the overall look. She pairs the lower half with a matching short skirt, smooth and slightly glossy, presenting elegant tailoring lines. Her legs are long, with a slender ankle slightly peeking out at her ankles. Her posture is natural and relaxed, her hands resting lightly on her knees, her body slightly tilted, and her head slightly turned toward the camera. It appears approachable and composed, adding a touch of softness and casualness. Beside it sits a small burgundy handbag. The smooth body and metal fasteners glow slightly in the sunlight, with lush tropical plants in the background. The leaves are broad and deep green, with some edges tinged with yellow. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled light and shadow, forming a band of light and shadow on the ground and the figures. The light is soft and warm, presenting a golden tone for afternoon or evening. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying the center-left position. The body contours form a diagonal line with the bench, with the line of sight extending from the lower right corner to the upper left, creating a natural and smooth visual direction. In the foreground, the bench's pink seat cushion and backrest are accented with black and white geometric patterns. In the middle frame, the main figure and handbag are present. The background features blurred greenery and faintly visible architectural structures in the distance, creating a well-defined sense of spatial layering. The overall light and shadow contrast is strong but not excessive, with delicate transitions in the shadows. The highlight areas are bright but not glaring, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere full of life and fashion. It resembles a daily street photo taken with a professional camera, with a realistic texture and artistic beauty. The colors are harmonious and unified, with brown, pink, green, and red as the main tones, complemented by warm yellow sunlight, creating a comfortable and pleasant visual experience. The details are rich, and all elements together form a warm and emotional tranquil scene, as if frozen in a leisurely afternoon, evoking a low-key yet elegant lifestyle aesthetic",
          "description": "",
