        {
          "id": "krea2-2fbbb26391337320e7bebf9d",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙户外忧伤坐持书",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors beside a stone pillar, wearing a light, flowing pink floral dress printed with elegant blue, yellow, and light green floral patterns, presenting a soft watercolor grading effect. The neckline is round neck, the sleeves are short-sleeved, the waist naturally cinched, and the skirt hangs loosely. The overall style is fresh and sweet, carrying a retro artistic vibe. She leans against a rough gray stone pillar, her body slightly tilted, her head lightly curled on the surface of the pillar, holding an open book in both hands, its pages slightly yellowed The spine is slightly worn, fingertips gently resting on the edge of the pages, posture relaxed and focused, with a hint of contemplation and tranquility. Her expression is calm yet tinged with a hint of melancholy and poetry. In the foreground is her body and the book in her hands, occupying most of the left side of the frame. In the middle is the stone pillar she leans on. The stone pillar's surface is rough and clear, its color grayish-brown, bearing the marks of aging. The right edge of the pillar is clearly visible, and the background is a blurred outdoor environment, lush with greenery. The blurred leaves and light spots create a soft bokeh effect. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating mottled shadows that create a warm and hazy atmosphere. Light streams diagonally from the upper left, creating a natural transition between light and dark. The shadowed areas are delicate and soft, without strong contrast. The overall color palette is mainly warm white, pale pink, light blue, and beige, with harmonious and unified color combinations. The image has a strong film feel, with slight graininess and moderately low color saturation, presenting a nostalgic and fresh visual texture. The composition uses a left-centered third-section layout, with the figure positioned on the left side of the frame. The stone pillar occupies the right side, creating visual balance and an emotional focal point. The background blur enhances the prominence of the subject, creating a sense of depth and space. The light and shadow atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, as if capturing a moment in the tranquil afternoon. The entire scene is filled with the breath of life and artistic beauty, like film photos taken with an old camera, recording a gentle youthful memory. The details are rich and layered, combining the simplicity of daily life with a strong artistic sentiment. The colors are gentle and dreamlike, and the flow of light and shadow is poetic presenting an aesthetic that is both authentic and transcendent",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
