        {
          "id": "krea2-a7805f034e6b222bd1842134",
          "alias": "单女金睡裙床温柔躺侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side on a soft white bedsheet, slightly tilting her head toward the camera with a hint of laziness and serenity. Her fingers are long and slender, her posture natural and relaxed. She wears a light yellow polka-dot spaghetti strap nightdress. The lightweight fabric reveals the delicate texture of her skin. Sunlight streams in from the right, making the highlights bright and warm, while the shadows reveal delicate layering. On the left side of the painting sits an open vintage art book, with the cover and inner pages covered in delicate floral patterns and classical decorative elements, the pages slightly curled. Add a touch of time. The background features pillows and light-colored bedding embroidered with beige florals, with warm yellow and cream white as the main color schemes, creating a cozy and cozy home atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main position, the head slightly tilted, and light coming from the upper right, creating a strong contrast between light and shadow. The details of the album in the foreground are clearly visible, while the middle ground shows the movements of the figures and their hands. The pillows and bedding in the background appear slightly blurred, and the shallow depth of field effect enhances the sense of spatial depth. The entire scene is full of life atmosphere and artistic ambiance, as if capturing the most intimate and tranquil moment of morning sunlight. The photography style resembles everyday amateur equipment, retaining natural noise and slight overexposure, making the images more realistic and warm. The tones are warm, color saturation moderate, and light and shadow transitions naturally, emphasizing the fusion of light and shadow with the emotions of the subjects, presenting a quiet, healing, and poetic visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
