        {
          "id": "krea2-48ecb69191e182c356cca4b4",
          "alias": "单女透视衬衫摄影棚冷淡站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a leopard print long-sleeve shirt and black shorts stands in a modern, minimalist indoor setting. She wears sheer stockings and black high-heeled sandals, carries a small black leather handbag in her left hand, and lets her right hand hang naturally, turning her body slightly to the camera, her head facing forward. Her expression is confident yet slightly cool, her makeup is exquisite, and her earrings are silver geometric long earrings. The overall look is full of fashion and sophistication. Her leopard print shirt is made of semi-transparent material, with a hem that is short in front and long in the back, and a thin black leather belt tied around her waist. Highlighting a slender waist, the cuffs and collar are uniquely designed with slit details, paired with leopard-print over-the-knee knee-high socks and black stockings for a layered effect. The background is an off-white wall separated by black metal framed glass, with a black-and-white art photo hanging on the wall. The outline of a figure is faintly visible, and the floor is paved with light-colored tiles reflecting soft light. The spatial layout is simple yet stylish, with a centrally symmetrical composition, with the main subject positioned slightly to the left of the center, the entire figure appearing in the frame, occupying the main part of the frame. The visual guide naturally extends from the figure's posture to the leg lines, emphasizing slender proportions. Light and shadow come from embedded spotlights in the ceiling mixing with ambient light to create a uniform and soft illumination effect. The light source shines from the front above, revealing the texture and material details of the clothing. Shadows are softly cast on the floor and walls, creating a warm and sophisticated atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly brown, black, and off-white, with harmonious and unified color combinations. The image texture is delicate, with professional studio-level lighting control and color fidelity. It presents the elegance and confidence of an urban elite woman, while retaining the realism and sense of everyday life from daily shooting. It feels like a fashionable portrait shot with a professional camera in a high-end hotel lobby or private club. The camera captures dynamic moments of the subject, with a slightly blurred background highlighting the subject. The overall image is clean and crisp, free of unnecessary distractions, conveying a modern aesthetic style that is calm, rational, yet sexy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
