        {
          "id": "krea2-b86d7b464d217925b77aa071",
          "alias": "单女金连衣裙户外忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a natural setting, looking directly at the camera, slightly open, her expression carrying a hint of mystery and gentleness. Her shoulders and arms are bare, and she wears a yellow slip dress with bright colors, contrasting sharply with the surrounding green plants. She holds a bouquet of blooming yellow roses, the flowers full and petals layered in layers, the color shifting from pale yellow to orange-yellow, with a faint red spot in the center. The flowers look especially vibrant in the sunlight, with dense green leaves in the foreground, broad and rounded edges. The veins are clearly visible, with some leaves covering the lower and left sides of the frame, creating a natural framing effect. The middle shot shows the upper body of a woman, her body slightly turned to one side, her head facing the camera with an elegant posture. The background is blurred greenery and trees, with light filtering through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. In the distance, some white architectural outlines can be faintly seen, but due to the blurring treatment, they appear soft and hazy. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame. Yellow flowers and green leaves create rich layers in the foreground and middle ground, creating an immersive viewing experience. The lighting atmosphere is warm and soft, with sunlight slanting down from above, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. At the same time, a faint glow is reflected on the flowers. The overall color palette is dominated by green and yellow, harmonious and full of vitality. The image is rich in summer atmosphere, as if shot on a sunny afternoon. Using a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens such as the 85mm f/1.4 or 50mm f/ 1.8, achieves a shallow depth of field effect, making the subject clear and prominent, with a completely blurred background, simulating the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The lens captures detailed textures under natural light, presenting a film-like texture with moderate color saturation, slight graininess, and warm tone shifts, enhancing the nostalgic and romantic atmosphere. The overall image is full of vitality and poetry, like a tranquil and captivating portrait of nature, allowing people to feel the harmonious coexistence of humans and nature. The composition is compact but not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space. With a clear visual focus, it conveys a tranquil, beautiful, and slightly melancholic emotional tone, making it suitable for art photography, emotional expression, or fashion portrait creation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
