        {
          "id": "krea2-98e7b017603393f4af10fca7",
          "alias": "单女短裙沉思倚靠持伞",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a pale yellow traditional Hanfu with wide flowing sleeves, the fabric as thin as cicada wings, gently fluttering in the breeze, forming soft pleats and smooth lines. She holds a white oil-paper umbrella, its surface simple and elegant, the handle made of light wood, topped with exquisite metal decoration. She leans slightly under the umbrella, adding a touch of liveliness and softness, with a hint of thoughtful expression, as if about to whisper. Her overall posture is elegant and reserved, like a fairy stepping out of an ancient painting. In the foreground, the woman occupies the center slightly to the left of the painting. The composition uses close-ups to highlight the expressions and details of the clothing. The background is a dark, blurred forest or courtyard, with light and shadow filtering through the gaps in the leaves, forming mottled light spots and soft halos that create a dreamlike atmosphere. In the middle shot, faint greenery and tree shadows can be seen, enhancing spatial layering. The distant background is completely blurred, leaving only the dark outlines and bokeh spots to make the subject stand out more, then extending to the flowing skirt. The visual direction flows naturally and smoothly, with light and shadow coming from the sides and back, creating a backlighting effect. The silhouette of the figure is surrounded by a soft halo, with bright edges of clothing appearing in the edges, creating a sense of three-dimensionality and transparency. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and distant, infused with classical poetry and Zen charm, as if immersed in a secluded paradise far from the hustle and bustle. The color tones are mainly warm yellow and deep green, with striking contrast yet harmonious unity. The color saturation is moderate, presenting a warm and hazy texture, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. It has slight graininess and natural exposure deviation. The lens focal length is close to 50mm, with a shallow depth of field. The background is clearly blurred, and the overall style combines Eastern aesthetics with modern photographic art, combining traditional charm with a sense of fashion, like a flowing ink painting, full of poetry and imagination",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
