        {
          "id": "krea2-60beaf201aeaf1f651e662a1",
          "alias": "单女和服城市冷淡持相机",
          "prompt": "Her right hand gently holds a burning firework stick, sparks flying, her left hand naturally hanging down, sleeves slightly raised, and the wide sleeves of the kimono flutter gently in the breeze, forming elegant curves. Her posture is dignified and composed, her body slightly turned to the camera, showing graceful contours. In the foreground, bright, twinkling fireworks create a strong visual focal point. Light points scatter warm golden light. The middle ground is a deep blue sea surface, shimmering with shimmering waves and delicate ripples. As night deepens, ripples appear, and distant city lights transform into blurred patches of light in the hazy night, creating a beautiful bokeh effect. The background shows faintly visible city silhouettes on the skyline, with neon halos intertwining into warm orange-yellow clusters that sharply contrast with the cool-toned seawater. The composition uses a centered composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the composition, with the subject clearly prominent. The background blur enhances spatial layering, and the distant lights flow into the distance, forming a smooth visual path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly warm tones, with the golden glow of fireworks echoing the orange-red flowers on the kimono, creating a cozy and romantic festive atmosphere. At the same time, the cool blue tones of the evening sky balance the overall colors, making the scene both warm and tranquil. The light comes from the fireworks themselves and reflections from distant cities, creating a combination of backlight and side lighting. The contours are sharp, the wrinkles of the clothes are clearly visible, and the entire image presents a realistic feel reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting, as if casually captured outdoors at night with a regular camera. There is slight noise and natural depth of field transitions. The lens has a slight halo, color saturation is moderate, and it does not appear overly retouched. The overall style combines traditional Japanese aesthetics with modern poetry, conveying a nostalgic summer festival-like atmosphere and capturing youthful moments",
