          "prompt": "An elegant woman wearing a black V-neck long-sleeve dress stands before a deep blue velvet background, her body slightly turned to the camera, head turned forward, presenting a healthy deep brown glow that glows delicately under the light. Her makeup is exquisite and natural, wearing a pair of sheer black stockings, her legs long and smooth, feet bare, standing together, left leg slightly bent and right leg straight, posture elegant yet full of tension. The earrings sparkle gently in the light, adding a touch of vitality. The background is thick deep blue velvet fabric with delicate pleated textures. The light and shadow create a soft transition of light and shadow on the fabric, creating a luxurious and mysterious atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the composition, with a body forming an S-shaped curve. From head to foot, a graceful visual movement is formed, highlighting the overall aesthetic appeal of the figure. Light comes from the front left, with the main light source soft and focused, illuminating both the front and side. At the same time, clear shadows are cast on the background, with soft edges that enhance spatial layering. The contrast between light and shadow is strong but not glaring, creating a dramatic lighting effect. The overall color scheme is mainly deep blue and black, creating a warm and cool contrast that makes the subject stand out more. The atmosphere is tranquil and noble, with a cinematic narrative quality, as if capturing a private and story-filled moment. The images are rich in detail and authentically textured, as if shot with a professional camera. They offer high resolution and depth, presenting an artistic photographic texture while retaining the natural feel of everyday amateur equipment, such as slight noise and realistic light and shadow transitions, making it feel as if a precious frame was captured by a photographer in a quiet indoor 