          "id": "krea2-80286c6e7123cf2fa44d7370",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫户外俏皮站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under the sunlight, adding a touch of vitality and gentleness, radiating a healthy glow. She wears a pristine white stand-collar shirt with pleated cuffs, the fabric soft in texture, and sunlight filtering through the leaves onto her body, creating a mottled effect of light and shadow. Her fingers are slender and her posture elegant, while her left hand holds a transparent glass cup, which reflects soft light. The background features blurred green plants and blooming white flowers, possibly cherry or pear blossoms. Petals gently sway in the wind, creating a hazy and romantic atmosphere. The entire scene uses shallow depth of field techniques, with the background blurred very naturally. The composition uses a centered composition: the person is positioned slightly to the left center, with the head slightly tilted and gazing upward to the right, creating a visual guide. The light comes from an upward angle, simulating warm afternoon sunlight. The light is soft and layered, with moderate contrast between light and shadow. The shadowed areas show delicate transitions, with the overall color scheme mainly white and green, accented with pale pink petals. The colors are fresh and natural, full of vitality. The image presents a sense of tranquility, beauty, and a touch of dreaminess, as if capturing a fleeting youthful memory. It has a strong Japanese photo style while also carrying a sense of everyday life. It looks like a real scene casually taken with a regular camera or phone. However, through clever use of light and shadow and compositional design, the image is endowed with a unique artistic beauty. The shutter speed is fast, capturing static beauty in motion. Exposure control is precise, highlights are not overexposed, shadows retain details, overall image clarity is high, details are rich, color reproduction is accurate, saturation is moderate, without excessive embellishment, maintaining a natural texture. The atmosphere is relaxed and joyful, allowing one to feel the breath of spring and the beauty of youth, as if you can hear birds chirping and the breeze rustling through leaves. The entire scene is full of vitality and hope, making people stop and admire it.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
