        {
          "id": "krea2-9de0af9d1415032a37fbac46",
          "alias": "单女白睡裙卧室沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed by the window, wearing an off-white silk spaghetti strap nightdress with a natural hem. Her contours are soft. She wears white lace-trimmed over-the-knee stockings, with delicate lace patterns clearly visible at the cuff. Her leg posture is naturally relaxed, and her knees are slightly bent. Her feet are partially covered by bedsheets, with a bright window in the background. The window frame is white, with a bit of moisture or dust on the glass, letting in the blurred green plants and light outside. The curtains are made of white sheer fabric, lightly hanging by the window and gently swaying in the breeze. Sunlight streams in from outside, casting mottled shadows on her body, sheets, and floor. The edges of light and shadow are soft, with natural transitions between light and shadow. Below the windowsill is a black diamond-patterned radiator, whose geometric pattern contrasts with the soft light, enhancing the layering of the image. The entire scene is set in a cozy bedroom, with light pink or beige sheets of soft texture with slight wrinkles. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space, sitting sideways, their heads slightly turned toward the camera but not looking directly, creating a private and tranquil atmosphere that draws the viewer's attention outside the window. At the same time, the figures' postures and clothing details evoke an emotional resonance. The overall color palette is mainly warm white, off-white, and light pink, accented with black and green, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with the texture of morning or afternoon sunlight. The image presents a tranquil, gentle, and slightly nostalgic everyday feel, as if shot with an old film camera, with slight graininess and natural exposure shift. The lens focal length is moderate and the depth of field is shallow, with clear foreground figures and natural background blur. The overall image has a strong artistic sense and emotional tension, like a story-filled indoor portrait capturing a moment of tranquility and contemplation in the character's inner world",
          "description": "",
