        {
          "id": "krea2-0d040c2e953d57d0d50f7e8b",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙街道冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the stone steps of a city street at night, looking directly at the camera, exuding a relaxed yet sexy aura. She wears a black strapless mini dress that fits her body and accentuates her graceful curves. The shoulders and cuffs are adorned with fluffy black fur, adding a touch of luxury and warmth. Her legs are crossed and slightly bent, wearing sheer black stockings, black stiletto sandals, and fine laces at the ankles. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her fingers long, and she wears a slender gold bracelet on her wrist She wears a simple silver necklace around her neck, and beside her sits a classic black quilted chain bag. The bag is small and delicate, with metal fasteners that reflect slightly under the light. Beside it, there's a black plush jacket casually draped over the steps. The background is a warm yellow stone wall, built from neatly arranged square stone blocks. The surface looks slightly rough, bearing the marks of time. Above the wall are several parallel dark lines, possibly from the building's structure or drainage channels. In the distance, a window can be faintly seen letting in soft light. The ground is a dark gray asphalt pavement with concrete steps at the edges, presenting the overall tranquil atmosphere of an urban nightscape. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, slightly tilted to form a natural diagonal line for guidance, creating strong visual coherence. Light and shadow come from the warm yellow streetlamp on the right, softly illuminating the figure and creating a contrast of light and shadow. The side of the body and shadows blend into the night, the background wall is also dyed golden by warm light, while the left floor reflects a faint cool blue light, creating subtle color contrasts that evoke a hazy beauty on city streets after dusk. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling, as if capturing an unintentional moment. It combines the sophistication of urban fashion with a touch of solitude and contemplation. The image texture is delicate, the tones warm yet layered, and the details rich, presenting an artistic sense carefully captured in everyday life, like street photography taken with a professional camera—authentic and deeply moving",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
