        {
          "id": "krea2-2014b1853521fe8d775b5d1b",
          "alias": "单女室内俏皮坐吃",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman, as if she wants to bite into one of them, her expression tinged with playfulness and innocence. Her hands are long and fair, her fingers lightly pinching cherry tomatoes with natural ease. In the foreground is a table covered with an off-white hollowed-out knitted tablecloth, with clear texture and a warm and soft texture. A few cherry tomatoes are scattered on the tabletop, and in the center sits a light-colored round plate filled with plump, round red cherry tomatoes. The tomato surface is smooth and glossy, reflecting soft light. The background is blurred, presenting a warm yellow indoor environment. The outlines of wooden furniture and blurred light and shadow are faintly visible, creating a cozy and cozy home atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, the head slightly tilted, and the gaze directed toward the camera, creating strong visual guidance. The degree of blurring between background and foreground gradually increases, highlighting the subject. Light comes from the front and side, creating a natural transition of light and shadow, with rich layers of shadow. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with warm yellow and red as the main tones, harmoniously unified. The visuals present a sense of artistic life, as if captured with a casual camera, with a film texture and slight graininess. The lens focal length is about 85mm, with an aperture of about f/1.8, creating an extremely shallow depth of field. The image details are rich, the overall atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, full of life and sentiment, as if capturing an ordinary yet beautiful everyday moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
