        {
          "id": "krea2-3cfe4d7f133562f6e18b19de",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙浴缸愤怒阅读",
          "prompt": "The water surface is calm and slightly murky, presenting a hazy texture. Many bright red strawberries float on the water, some with green leaf stalks scattered around and above her, forming a natural accent. She wears a white spaghetti strap dress with red strawberry patterns printed on the skirt. Echoing the floating strawberries, the dress's straps are narrow and outlined, outlining a slender shoulder line. The overall posture is relaxed and expressive. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly above the center of the frame, head slightly tilted back, gazing directly at the viewer, creating strong visual guidance, along with floating strawberries and foam. The middle is the edge of the bathtub and the water surface, with the background being the inner wall of the bathtub and a blurred area further away. Due to the influence of water mist and foam, The background details are toned down, creating a sense of enclosed and intimate space. The lighting is soft and even, and the diffused light from above makes the entire scene bright and not glaring, with no obvious shadows. The layers of light and shadow are rich, and the water surface reflects a faint glow, enhancing realism. White represents cleanliness and purity, red symbolizes passion and allure. The contrast among these three is sharp yet harmonious, creating an overall atmosphere that is both sweet and slightly sexy, full of sentiment and dreaminess. It feels like a private moment from daily life, yet carefully designed. It presents an artistic aesthetic, with delicate image texture and slight noise like film photography, simulating the real effects of amateur camera or mobile phone shots, while preserving high-resolution details. It feels like flipping through a page in a private photo book, full of storytelling and emotional tension. The composition is simple yet powerful, with a clear focus. Every element serves the characters' expressions and movements, conveying a quiet, gentle, and slightly teasing mood. There are no unnecessary decorations in the frame. Using only simple props and environments to construct complete story scenes, it evokes themes of youth, love, privacy, and self-expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
