        {
          "id": "krea2-0e76ec5e15eb96c9d5a03a59",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣窗边冷淡躺注视",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways on a wooden tabletop, resting her head on her crossed hands, her body slightly leaning forward, presenting a lazy and relaxed posture. She wears an off-white coarse knit sweater with clearly visible textures, thick and warm stitching, natural rolled edges at the cuffs and neckline, and the material looks fluffy and soft under soft light. On the left side of the painting near the foreground sits an iced coffee. The cup is a transparent plastic cup with a rounded body, a white plastic lid, and a black straw inserted diagonally into the cup. The liquid inside the cup is light brown, with a slight foam layer on the surface. Water droplets condense on the cup's wall, highlighting the drink's cool texture. The background is the indoor environment, the wall is light beige, and behind the wall is a blurred wooden shelf for storage. Several blurry photo frames or decorations are placed on the shelf, but due to the shallow depth of field, these objects are completely out of focus, forming soft light spots. The overall background blur is handled very naturally, creating a sense of spatial depth. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the image, the head positioned slightly to the upper right, and the gaze facing the lower left. The composition ratio is close to 5:4, with the overall tone of the painting mainly warm yellow. Light streams in from the right side, simulating afternoon sunlight filtering through the window into the room. The light source is soft and directional, creating subtle transitions in shadows. The layers of light and shadow are rich, the atmosphere is tranquil and warm. The overall image presents a quiet moment in daily life, as if capturing a leisurely afternoon. The image texture is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and color shifts. The lens looks like a medium format camera paired with a standard prime lens, with background and foreground edges gradually blurring, creating a natural bokeh effect. The overall image is full of life and emotional warmth, with stable composition. Clear visual guidance, and the use of lighting enhances the three-dimensionality and emotional expression of the image. The overall atmosphere is both authentic and artistic, like an old photo from a family album, recording ordinary yet precious moments of daily life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
