          "id": "krea2-a65839ece0b78b6af52588d5",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣广场自信站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an indoor wooden staircase, wearing a white sleeveless knit tank top and a gray pleated mini skirt, paired with black square-heeled open-toe high heels. Her left hand gently grips the stair railing, her body slightly turned to the side, right leg in front and left leg behind, forming a graceful leg line. Her overall posture is naturally relaxed and full of youthful energy. The subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, shot from a low angle from above, highlighting her slender figure and elegant temperament. The foreground features wooden steps and white railings, composed of slender white columns and light-colored wooden handrails, presenting a clean and modern design style. The middle ground features a full-body female figure, with white walls as the backdrop. Square skylights let in bright, soft natural light. The ceiling is white with fine textures, evenly casting light on the figures, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The background is a simple indoor space, with pure white walls and ceilings without unnecessary decoration, creating a clean and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses low-angle downward shots to make the figure appear taller. At the same time, the slanting staircase lines guide the gaze upward, enhancing the sense of depth in the image. The visual guide starts from the steps at the bottom and moves up the stairs to the characters' legs, forming a smooth visual path. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the skylight above, creating scattered light from the top, making the overall lighting soft and even. The shadows are delicate and natural, without strong contrasts, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The color tones are mainly white, gray, and woody brown. Paired with black shoes as a touch, the colors are harmoniously unified, presenting a scene that is fresh, everyday, and full of life. It feels like a real moment shot at home with a regular camera, with a slight film texture and natural noise, enhancing realism and intimacy. The details are rich, presenting a simple yet beautiful youthful memory. The overall atmosphere is quiet and warm, as if time has stopped at this moment, recording the purest everyday beauty.",
