          "id": "krea2-09fdf0dbea26b143c8f995d0",
          "alias": "单女白袜子卧室忧伤躺拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman is reclining on a bed in the bedroom, her body relaxed and reclining in a relaxed posture. Her legs are raised high and lean against the window. She wears white knee-high socks that naturally fold around her ankles, giving off a soft and fluffy texture with a slight airy feel. She wears a white thin camisole made of lightweight and breathable material, hugging the body without being tight. She pairs it with light blue denim shorts, the pant legs slightly rolled up, revealing the slender calf line. In her right hand, she holds a lit cigarette, with smoke slowly rising from the butt. A soft trail of white smoke drifts through the air. The left wrist is wrapped in a white bandage, with slightly wrinkled edges, adding a sense of everyday detail and authenticity. The expression reveals laziness and contemplation, and the overall posture is natural and casual, as if just awakening from sleep or taking a short rest. The bed is a blue-and-white striped sheet, clear and rhythmic, with subtle wrinkles on the surface, showing signs of use. One side of the bed is near the window, where soft natural light streams in, slanting in from the left. This creates a contrast of light and shadow, with natural transitions of light and shadow, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The background is a white wall covered with various papers, including handwritten notes, printed documents, menu-style paper slips, and a poster featuring a cocktail glass design. The paper is casually secured with green tape and arranged in an orderly manner. Some edges are slightly curled, with indistinct text on them, enhancing the space's realism and privacy. In the corners, white wooden wainscoting panels are visible, with delicate grain and warm colors. It enhances the vintage atmosphere of the room. In the lower left corner of the painting is a potted greenery, with lush green leaves and full shape, clear edges, and distinct veins, injecting a touch of vitality and energy into the cool-toned space. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, head slightly tilted, creating direct communication with the viewer. Both legs extend upward to the upper left corner of the painting, forming a diagonal composition that guides visual flow. The foreground features bedsheets and greenery, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background is walls and paper, creating distinct layers. It has a strong sense of depth, with the overall tone mainly consisting of gray-white, light blue, and beige, with harmonious and unified colors. The light and shadow come from the natural light outside the left window, soft and even, without strong shadows, creating a peaceful atmosphere of early morning or afternoon. The overall image presents a sense of privacy and artistic emotional expression from daily life, with a grainy texture and slight noise reminiscent of film photography, simulating amateur camera shooting. The tone is slightly cool, with a slight fade and retro filter style. The overall atmosphere is quiet, lazy, and slightly melancholic. Full of youthful confusion and the breath of freedom, it is like an unedited photo of life document—authentic and full of storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
