          "id": "krea2-3c8fab7a741acf8b0977d4a8",
          "alias": "单女黑西装城市沉思坐持书",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a black bench against the wall indoors, her body slightly turned to the side. Her right leg gracefully rests on her left, her toes touching the ground, her posture calm and confident. Her left hand gently strokes her thigh, while her right hand holds a newspaper printed with words and pictures. Her expression is slightly detached and contemplative, her makeup exquisite, and her overall aura is cold yet approachable. She wears a black suit jacket that is worn openly, with long legs wrapped in black stockings below, and black pointed high heels on the feet, the smooth, reflective upper surface. The slender heel with metallic decorative details exudes a strong sense of fashion and the sharp charm of an urban woman. In the foreground is a close-up of her long legs and feet, with smooth leg lines. The surface of the stockings has a delicate sheen texture, and under the light, subtle shadow transitions appear. The middle is her upper body and sitting posture. The suit jacket is sharply tailored, with three buttons visible at the cuffs. The background is an exposed red brick wall, neatly arranged but slightly mottled. The wall colors range from light brown to deep red, with rough and realistic textures. On the wall hangs a framed poster or artwork with the English title \"Have you ever heard of 'SAY TOUCHÉ?'\" along with a written description about coffee, fashion, and lifestyle, with the caption \"Your journey begins now I wish you happy!\" A small illustration is attached next to the gallery exhibition scene. On the right side of the image is the junction between the white wall and the brick wall. The floor is made of gray terrazzo, dotted with black and white gravel particles, giving it a vintage and textured feel. A slender light strip runs along the edge of the floor, emitting a soft white glow, illuminating part of the ground and reflecting off the stockings and shoe uppers, forming a bright band of light. The composition is angled slightly upward, with the figure positioned on the right side, occupying the main visual space, while the left side leaves enough negative space to balance the composition. At the same time, the text and environmental details in the background are emphasized, extending to the poster content in the background, and finally returning to her leg lines and high heels, forming a complete viewing path. The lighting atmosphere leans toward indoor warm-toned lighting, with the light source coming from the upper left for soft shadows and a strong sense of three-dimensionality. Ground light strips provide partial fill light, enhancing the layering and modern feel of the image. The overall color palette is mainly black, gray, and brown, creating a low-key, luxurious, and highly artistic urban living scene. It feels as if you were shooting a real moment in an independent café or art space, giving the impression of everyday amateur equipment. The photo texture is similar to a phone or small camera shooting straight out, preserving slight noise and natural color reproduction, without excessive retouching, presenting an authentic and story-rich visual style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
