          "id": "krea2-e6d9de7f14113e798d1bc775",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫雪地忧伤站立持伞",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a snowy winter street, wearing an off-white turtleneck knit sweater with clearly visible patterns, loose sleeves naturally hanging down. She gently holds a transparent umbrella covered with fine snowflakes, with a faint frame visible and a black handle, contrasting with the overall tone. Looking directly at the camera, she exudes a touch of gentleness and tranquility. She wears a pair of long gold earrings, with pearl decorations at the ends that sway gently with movement, adding a touch of elegance. The background is a blurry snowy street, the distant outlines of buildings blur, creating a shallow depth of field effect. Snowflakes drift slowly down from the air, some forming spots of light in front of the frame, enhancing the sense of layering and dynamism in the image. The foreground is a partial close-up of a transparent umbrella, with fine water droplets condensed at the edge of the umbrella surface. The middle shot is the main subject, rich in detail and delicate expression. The background features hazy snowy fields and blurry street scenes, with soft lighting and a cool blue-and-white tone. Light comes from above without obvious shadows, creating a quiet, pure, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The entire scene resembles a winter portrait—both artistic and full of life, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large aperture, capturing the gentlest moments of winter. The image quality is delicate, colors are true, and details are rich, presenting a clean, cool, yet warm visual experience",
