        {
          "id": "krea2-bf426b2fc2014aee2f143250",
          "alias": "单女白外套雪地冷淡坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a warm, comfortable indoor white plush single sofa, wearing a fluffy, soft long white plush coat that naturally drapes over her shoulders, revealing one shoulder and delicate collarbone. She slightly turns to look back at the camera, revealing a natural, tender pink hue. Her legs are crossed and gently draped over the edge of the sofa, wearing a pair of semi-transparent light pink tights. The socks are dotted with fine sequins, faintly visible in the light, creating a subtle sheen. Her ankles are slender, The feet naturally relax, the overall posture elegant and relaxed, as if immersed in the tranquility of a winter afternoon. In the foreground, the soft texture of the sofa forms an intimate visual relationship with the contours of the figures. In the background is a huge floor-to-ceiling window. Outside the window is a vast, boundless snow-capped mountain landscape. The snow-capped peaks rise majestically, covered in thick snow, reflecting a soft silvery glow under the sunlight. At the foot of the mountain, sparse withered trees and wooden fences can be seen. In the distance, a few low buildings are faintly visible. The sky is a deep blue and clear, without a single cloud. Light streams in diagonally from the window, illuminating the entire room. The interior is bright and even, casting gentle shadows on the floor and furniture surfaces. The layers of light and shadow are rich, and the composition combines close-ups with distant shots. The figure is positioned slightly in the center on the right side of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The snow-capped mountains outside the window serve as the backdrop extending to the upper left of the frame, creating a strong sense of depth. The window frame is natural wood, simple and natural, echoing the warm tones of the interior. Next to the sofa on the left is a matching round plush footstool. Its surface is also covered with thick white plush matching the sofa's material. The overall space atmosphere is warm, comfortable, and modern. The main colors are white, beige, and light pink, paired with cool tones of blue sky and snowy land, creating a warm contrast that enhances visual tension. The lighting is soft and bright, featuring natural light characteristics typical of early morning or afternoon. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and comfortable, full of the romantic mood of a winter vacation. The photography style resembles high-resolution daily life documentation, shot with professional cameras. However, it retains a slight film texture and realistic details, emphasizing realism and delicate textures. The image features a slight depth effect, clear characters, and a slightly blurred background that highlights the subject, while maintaining complete environmental information. The overall composition is balanced, with a slightly low viewpoint to stay close to the subject's line of sight, enhancing immersion and intimacy. The image presents a style that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, as if captured from a traveler's phone or camera, capturing the gentlest winter moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
