        {
          "id": "krea2-0023b29df7b3abdc92d2781c",
          "alias": "单女米和服室内俏皮坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a traditional Japanese indoor setting, wearing a light beige kimono with elegant floral patterns. The kimono fabric has a silky smoothness and natural sheen, wide and flowing sleeves, and the hem of the skirt naturally drapes over the tatami. The floral patterns on the kimono are mainly pink, purple, and green, with delicate and smooth lines, showcasing the exquisite craftsmanship of traditional Japanese textiles. She slightly lowers her head, her fingers long, and her nails painted deep red. Her expression blends shyness and playfulness. She sits barefoot cross-legged on a wooden chair, her ankles slender, toes naturally extended, posture relaxed and natural. The chair is made of natural wood, with a simple and rustic design. The curved backrest fits the curves of the body. Beside it, another similarly styled wooden chair can be seen. The background is a dark brown wooden wall made of horizontally joined wooden panels, with clear and natural grain and a rustic texture. The floor is covered with light gray tatami mats with fine woven edges, creating a soft and warm lighting for the entire space. Natural light from the front side streams through the window lattice, creating a soft transition of shadows and a tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly tilted. The foreground highlights the main figure and kimono details, while the center features seats and part of the floor. The background is defined by wooden walls to create a sense of space. Visual guidance begins with the characters' hand movements, with warm tones dominated by off-white, light brown, light green, and dark wood, creating rich layers without clutter. The overall image presents a realistic moment captured in daily life, as if it were a private image taken with a regular camera. It features slight film graininess and natural exposure deviations, with a slightly retro filter tone that enhances nostalgia and a sense of everyday life. The atmosphere is tranquil and warm, full of Eastern aesthetic conception, while retaining the rough texture and imperfect details of real shooting, such as slight focus blur, subtle noise, and ambient reflections, making the scene more believable and immersive",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
