        {
          "id": "krea2-037bbb898a9d13cf40266daf",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔摄影棚侧头",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman, with a natural blush that creates a lazy and natural beauty. She wears a light blue washed denim jacket, with clearly visible textures. The buttons and metal zipper details are exquisite, the cuffs slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists. Her hands are elegantly folded over her chest, fingers long, painted with black nail polish. Each finger is adorned with several exquisitely designed silver rings, some set with sparkling crystals or small gemstones, creating a richly layered visual focal point. Gazing directly at the camera, It exudes a subtle sense of confidence and composure. The background is pure white with no distractions, highlighting the main subject. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the person positioned slightly to the right of center of the frame, the head slightly tilted, forming a graceful S-shaped line. The lighting is soft and even, with natural light coming from the left in front, and the transition of shadows is natural, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and fresh, with a slight soft-focus effect, as if shot under professional studio lighting or a high-end camera, presenting a clean and A fashionable and artistic visual style, with delicate texture and moderate color saturation, forming harmonious contrasts. The details are rich, from the wrinkles of denim fabric to the ring's reflection, all clearly distinguishable. The overall composition is balanced, with visual guidance natural. Then, following the arrangement of fingers and rings, it finally settles on a harmonious unity of the overall form. This portrait embodies modern urban aesthetics and a sense of high-end fashion, seemingly crafted by a professional photographer, while preserving unintentional natural moments from daily life. It gives people a genuine and captivating charm",
