        {
          "id": "krea2-9ad3a7a3f9e52ca17c461197",
          "alias": "单女外套窗边倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways against an antique wooden window frame, her head slightly lowered, her expression calm and tinged with worry, adding a touch of gentleness and laziness. She wears a traditional Chinese jacket in light tones, with delicate texture and clean and smooth lines. The cuffs hang naturally, and her hand rests gently on the beam of the carved wooden window. Her fingers are long, her posture elegant and relaxed. The main subject is positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the painting, creating a sense of visual balance. In the foreground is a dark classical wooden window frame. It is carved with exquisite geometric and traditional motifs, with clear lines and realistic textures. Some areas are slightly weathered by time, enhancing the sense of history and authenticity. The middle ground shows the woman's body outline and the profile of her head. Light streams through the window from the right, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The background is blurred, presenting blurred green plants and distant architectural outlines, creating a hazy and profound sense of space. The composition uses a third-division method, with the figure occupying the left third of the frame. The right half of the space is reserved for depicting the environment and light and shadow, while window frames serve as natural frame structures to guide the viewer's gaze on the figures. Visual guidance is formed by the light outside the window and the lines of the window lattice, with light slanting in from the right side, leaving delicate transitions in the shadows. The lighting atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with warm yellow and brown tones as the main tones, complemented by light gray-white tones of the figures' clothing, creating an overall vintage film photography texture, with slight graininess and color shifts. It feels like an image taken with an old-fashioned camera, with a 50mm prime lens and an aperture set around f/1.8, giving the background a natural bokeh effect. The background and foreground gradually blur, enhancing depth. The overall image conveys a subtlety and poetry in Eastern aesthetics, combining the casual feeling of daily life with artistic pursuit. It's like an afternoon when sunlight streams through the old window lattice onto a woman's body, time seems to stand still, and thoughts drift far away. The entire scene is filled with a faint sense of nostalgia and a gentle sense of loneliness",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
