        {
          "id": "krea2-91ee31ab80ceaffbc78337f4",
          "alias": "单女米风衣桌边忧伤坐喝",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a warm indoor café, adding a touch of laziness and casualness. She wears vintage-style gold-rimmed fine-framed glasses, the lenses reflecting faintly, reflecting the blurred outlines of her surroundings. She is looking down, sipping an iced drink from a cup with a white straw. Her tongue lightly touches the straw, her movements natural and smooth, full of a sense of life. She wears a loose khaki trench coat layered with a dark gray knit sweater underneath. The texture is delicate and the pleats natural, showcasing the authentic texture of everyday wear. Her blush blends softly. Overall, it presents a fresh and elegant feel. In the foreground is a chilled drink served in a transparent glass cup, with ice cubes clearly visible. The liquid is pale amber, and the straw is inserted diagonally from the rim, forming a diagonal line guiding the view. In the middle frame, the female figure is the main figure, occupying the main position. Her head is slightly tilted, her posture relaxed, the background blurred, and you can faintly see wooden bookshelves, displayed books, and some blurry posters or flyers. One piece of red paper is printed with the words \"WaxPro.\" Hinting at this is a place full of artistic atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups with slightly lowered angles to create an intimate and private atmosphere, forming a complete visual flow. Light and shadow come from the warm yellow light source on the left, possibly from the café's wall lamp or table lamp, creating a natural transition between light and dark. The shadowed areas are delicate and layered, with a warm overall tone with a slight film graininess and fading effect, simulating the texture of vintage film cameras. The edges of the frame have slight dark corners, enhancing the nostalgic atmosphere. The color palette is mainly brown, beige, and warm orange, forming a harmonious and unified visual system. The details are rich, presenting a quiet, warm, and slightly melancholic everyday moment, as if capturing an ordinary yet precious fragment of life. It has a strong cinematic feel and storytelling, like the tranquil scenes in a youth art film, evoking coffee moments under the afternoon sun and those delicate emotions about growth, loneliness, and self-reflection",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
