        {
          "id": "krea2-c72c40b656db8cf50770bc4e",
          "alias": "单女黑短裤城市冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a concrete low wall beneath a city overpass, wearing a leopard-print strapless top and black shorts, paired with black stockings and platform Martin boots. Her overall look blends punk and fashion elements, showcasing a cool yet slightly rebellious urban vibe. Her makeup is exquisite, full of confidence and tension. On her left wrist, she wears a multi-layered metal bracelet and chain accessories, while her right arm also features a metal ring decoration. Her hands are folded on her knees, presenting a relaxed yet powerful pose. The background features gray-white metal railings and distant blurry outlines of city buildings. The sky appears in a pale blue tone, with soft lighting that presents a natural light environment of dusk or early morning. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the lower right of the frame, body slightly tilted, head facing the camera for a strong visual direction. The left side leaves ample space to highlight the relationship between the subject and the environment. The foreground features rough concrete walls and floors, with clear details and tiny cracks and stains, enhancing realism. The middle ground features vertical lines formed by the figure and railing, while the background is gradually blurred silhouettes of high-rise buildings, creating a distinct sense of spatial layering. Light and shadow shine from the upper left, with shadows concentrated on the right side of the body and the ground, highlighting the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere combines the realism of everyday street life with the refinement of artistic photography, as if shot outdoors with a professional camera. The image has a slight film grain texture, moderate color saturation, clear but not overly strong contrast, and a tone that balances warm and cool tones. It retains the calmness of the city while incorporating the warmth and personality of the characters. The composition is stable and dynamic, with a relaxed posture and direct gaze, guiding the audience to focus on her expressions and costume details. The entire scene presents the freedom and independence spirit of modern urban youth, as if recording a fleeting moment of life, yet transcending ordinary street photography, possessing cinematic narrative and visual impact",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
