        {
          "id": "krea2-5030a2806c9e634801f66b54",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙办公室沉思坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a black ergonomic office chair, wearing a white spaghetti strap mini dress and silver high heels. She elegantly turns sideways facing the computer screen, her left hand resting lightly on her knee, her right hand operating the mouse. Her expression is focused and slightly contemplative, as if pondering or waiting. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the middle frame, composed using a third-hand ratio: the figure occupies the right third of the frame, while the left side is reserved for displaying the desktop and wall decorations, creating visual balance. The foreground features a wooden desktop, Black monitor, keyboard, mouse, and some cables. On the tabletop is a white small speaker and desk lamp, with clean lines and clear details. In the middle is the female figure and office chair. The chair backrest is relatively high, with a headrest, made of black leather for a delicate texture. The background is white walls and large windows, with light wood frames and semi-transparent white sheer curtains that let in soft natural light. Two natural wood shelves are installed on the wall, displaying multiple black-and-white and color framed photos and small green potted plants. An open notebook and some daily miscellaneous items create a warm personal space. Outside the window, you can faintly see the outlines of green plants, increasing depth of field. The composition angle is slightly lower, shooting from the front of the subject diagonally above and below, highlighting the figure's form and environmental layers. Then returning to the desktop device, creating a circular flow. Light and shadow come from the right window, soft and even, presenting a warm morning or afternoon sunshine effect. The shadows are delicate, mainly concentrated on the left side of the figure and under the chair, while the table and floor reflect a faint sheen. The colors are mainly white, off-white, light gray, and natural wood tones, accented with black and silver. The overall tone is fresh and bright, with a slight contrast of warm and cool tones, creating a modern, minimalist yet lively-oriented home office scene. The image quality is close to high-resolution camera shooting, with rich details and sharp edges, slight film graininess, and a realistic lens depth effect. The images are filled with the tranquil beauty of daily life and a hint of solitude, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
