        {
          "id": "krea2-4f7411d041f158c02bd584d6",
          "alias": "单女忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman gazes up at the sky in the rain, slightly tilting her head, her right shoulder exposed, skin delicate and smooth. The background is a blurred outline of green mountains. In the distance, the mountains are shrouded in mist, showing a hazy blue-green hue. Nearby raindrops are clearly visible, tracing fine diagonal lines in the air. The entire scene uses shallow depth of field, with the main figure clearly prominent, the background completely blurred, and the composition using a three-part method. The figure is positioned slightly above the left of the frame, with the head facing upward to the right, forming a visual guide line. The light is naturally scattered. The diffused light from the sky is soft and even, with no obvious shadows. The overall tone is cool, creating a quiet, poetic, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The texture of the image is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and color fading. Raindrops form tiny spots in front of the lens, enhancing the sense of space and realism. The overall image is full of cinematic feel, like a quiet rainy afternoon, capturing the moment where people and nature merge. The composition is simple yet full of tension. It conveys a sense of tranquility, contemplation, and closeness to nature. The color saturation is low but rich in layering, details are delicate, and the edges of the frame have slight vignetting to enhance the focal point. The overall atmosphere is both everyday and dreamy, as if captured in the rain with an old film camera—real and moving",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
