        {
          "id": "krea2-694a6527e0f83905958f26b9",
          "alias": "单女粉外套卧室俏皮坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed in the bedroom, exuding an elegant yet slightly playful aura. She wears a pink plaid short jacket paired with a matching skirt. The jacket is open, revealing a white lace bra underneath. The lace pattern is delicate and delicate, with curly edges that outline graceful curves. Her legs are long, and she wears white over-the-knee stockings, which are thin and translucent, creating a striking contrast with the pink outfit. Her legs are smooth, and the overall look is fashionable and full of femininity, set against a simple bedroom setting. The bed is covered with light purple sheets with white piping trim along the edges. Behind the bed is a gray curtain, made of semi-transparent material that lets in faint light outside, creating a hazy atmosphere. The overall color palette of the room is mainly soft pinkish-purple-gray, with light coming from the front slightly left, presenting a warm side lighting effect. The transitions between light and shadow are natural, with soft shadows that are not abrupt. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait style, with the figure slightly centered slightly to the right, occupying the main part of the frame. Legs crossed and naturally extended, one arm gently resting on the edge of the bed, the other hand resting on the thigh, creating a stable visual balance. The foreground shows the bed surface and the lower body of the subject, the middle ground shows details of the subject's full body and upper body, and the background features curtains and walls. The layers are distinct and the sense of space is strong. The overall scene has a strong sense of daily life and life, as if it were a real scene shot with a regular camera or phone, rather than a professional studio shoot. This realism enhances the audience's immersion. The lighting is soft and even, with no strong contrast, and the color tone is warm and comfortable, suitable for social media sharing or personal photo shows, the images present a modern urban woman's intimate moments at home, combining fashion with a sense of warmth. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, with pink and white complementing each other, accented with pearl necklaces and gold earrings, adding a touch of luxury. The entire scene preserves the casualness of daily life, while carefully matched clothing and lighting treatments enhance the artistic beauty, creating an atmosphere that is gentle, confident, elegant, and slightly sexy. It gives a sense of a relaxed and joyful attitude toward life and a spirit of free self-expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
