        {
          "id": "krea2-a46280c2e3956ef8a7349641",
          "alias": "单女花园温柔站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands among blooming roses, wearing a short-sleeved top with a pink background and white polka dot pattern. The collar is slightly open, revealing the collarbone line. Her overall posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly turned to the side, and her head tilted slightly, as if poking her head out from among the flowers. The main figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center, with several bright pink roses in the foreground. The petals are layered, full, and rounded, with rich colors and subtle gradients. The edges of the flowers are slightly blurred, creating a soft blurred effect. This creates a faint, elusive visual layering. Green leaves intersperse throughout, with clear veins and varying shades—some shining in sunlight, others in shadow. The middle ground features the upper body of the figure and surrounding green leaves and flowers, while the background is dense shrubs with interwoven branches and leaves, presenting rich green tones such as deep green, dark green, and yellow-green. Some areas emit a bright sheen under the light. The overall background is treated with blur treatment to highlight the main subject, and the composition uses close-up shots. Using the flowers in the foreground as a natural frame forms a frame-style composition, creating an intimate and intimate atmosphere. Light and shadow come from the upper right side, belonging to natural light. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. At the same time, highlights are created on clothing and petals, and the leaves in the background also create contrasts of light and shadow, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, with a texture reminiscent of vintage film photography. The tones are warm, saturation is moderate, and the color combinations are harmonious, mainly pink and green. Dotted with yellow light spots, it creates the tranquility and beauty of a summer afternoon garden. The image has slight graininess and color shifts, simulating the effects of vintage cameras. The details are rich and layered, with both delicate depictions of the characters' expressions and vivid recreation of the environment. Overall, it presents a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, like a vibrant photo casually captured with a lightweight film camera, full of youthful energy and poetic life",
