        {
          "id": "krea2-85d4a57ddf5f947c5abd3ff7",
          "alias": "单女制服车厢害羞坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese high school girls' uniform sits inside the train carriage, appearing gentle and charming. She wears a dark blue blazer over a white shirt, wearing a red and blue striped tie that hangs loosely over her chest. The gray plaid pleated skirt paired with white stockings elegantly crosses her legs, fingers slender and long, her expression calm yet slightly shy. She sits on a deep blue cushioned seat with delicate textures and circular stitching decorations, with a blurred view outside the window as the background. Through the car window, you can see the outlines of distant city buildings and the pale blue hues of the sky. Light streams in diagonally through the left window, creating a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the center to the right of the frame, body slightly angled to the camera, head slightly tilted, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The center frame shows her upper body and some legs, while the background is completely blurred, presenting a shallow depth of field. The overall color palette mainly features a warm and cool contrast, with blue and gray uniforms harmoniously balanced by the warm sunlight The layers of light and shadow are rich, transitioning naturally from bright highlights to soft shadows. The image texture is delicate, as if taken with a professional camera, with a film-like feel. It has a high degree of realism and artistic beauty, with slight graininess and low-saturation color treatment, creating a nostalgic yet modern youthful atmosphere. The entire scene seems to freeze in an ordinary yet beautiful everyday moment, conveying a quiet, innocent, and slightly melancholic mood",
