        {
          "id": "krea2-7d08215410945387ccb58b6a",
          "alias": "单女白外套雪地忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the snowy winter landscape, showing her neat, white teeth. She wears a fluffy, soft white plush coat with a thick velvet collar and cuffs, and a light blue scarf underneath. The scarf is light and soft, with natural tassel details along the edges. The scarf casually wraps around her neck, creating a soft, cool contrast with the white coat. Her posture is slightly tilted, her body slightly tilted, one hand gently raised as if about to brush off the snowflakes falling on her shoulder, while the other is hidden in her sleeve. The overall movement is natural and relaxed, as if enjoying the sudden snowfall. The foreground is a clear main figure, occupying the center-left position of the frame. The background is a wooden cabin covered in heavy snow, with heavy snow on the roof. The wooden structure grain is faintly visible, surrounded by blurry shadows of cedar trees, with branches covered in snow. The sky is grayish-white and hazy, with large snowflakes continuously falling from above, creating a dynamic feeling of continuous snowfall. The entire scene is enveloped in a tranquil white tone, with soft and even light, diffused from cloudy days, with no obvious shadows. The colors are mainly cool tones, with white, light blue, and gray as the main tones. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds, with the main subject located near the golden ratio point on the left side of the frame. The background blur emphasizes the subject, and the large-aperture lens is shot with an extremely shallow depth of field, making the background completely blur into soft patches of color. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, with a slight mist and air-penetrating effect. The overall scene presents a pure, gentle, and slightly melancholic winter poetry, as if taken from an art film. It features the grainy texture of film photography and a tendency toward low-saturation tones, like a moment captured by an amateur camera in real snow. It preserves the atmosphere of life and nature, while delicate light and shadow control and color matching create a beauty beyond the ordinary. Every falling snowflake in the frame is captured, adding a sense of time flow and spatial layering. The overall style combines realism and artistry, combining the warmth of everyday life with a surreal dreamlike atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
