        {
          "id": "krea2-0742d45ef8cc4918e181fec1",
          "alias": "单女衬衫沉思持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman is shown from a low-angle downward angle. She is wearing a retro-style pilot helmet. The main body of the helmet is off-white, with brown leather edges and straps. Above the helmet is a pair of large-framed goggles, made of antique bronze metal frames. The lenses are transparent and slightly reflective, with red, white, and blue stripes visible on the temples. The helmet's brown leather strap hangs down from both sides, with a red plastic clip at the end of the right strap, and the left strap adjusts and hangs naturally over the shoulder. She wears a light-colored shirt with a blue lining at the collar, her right hand gently resting on the side of her helmet. Her fingers are long, her posture natural and relaxed, looking directly at the camera. Overall, she presents a youthful yet slightly nostalgic aura. The background is a vast blue sky, with several fluffy, pure white clouds floating in the sky. The clouds are evenly distributed and layered, with light coming from the upper front, creating a soft frontal illumination. The shadow transitions naturally enhance the sense of depth. The overall tone of the scene is fresh and bright, with blue and white as the main tones. Brown and red elements are accented to create a tranquil and hopeful atmosphere. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical style, with the figures positioned in the center of the frame and the head occupying the main visual space, creating a strong visual focal point. The background extends with an open sky, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The lines of the goggles and the curved structure of the helmet also provide guidance. The overall image has a cinematic texture, as if taken from a youth-themed film, while also carrying the realism of everyday smartphone shooting. It feels like a moment casually captured with ordinary equipment, but through careful composition and lighting handling, it presents an artistic beauty. The image details are rich, color saturation is moderate, and contrast is soft, presenting an overall warm, healing, and story-rich visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
