        {
          "id": "krea2-964da61f7aa76d54809b0957",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣床躺",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side on a soft white bedsheet, her head resting on a pure white pillow. She wears a thick brown sweater whose knit texture is clearly visible, presenting a warm and fluffy texture that adds a touch of laziness and spontaneity. The entire composition centers on the person, using close-ups that occupy most of the space. The head is positioned in the upper left of the painting, and the body extends to the lower right, forming a natural diagonal line that highlights the subject's delicate texture and expression. The center frame shows her arms and part of the body contour. and a sweater covering the body, with simple white bedding and a light wood headboard as the background, creating a clean and tranquil bedroom environment. Light comes from the left side of the frame, with soft natural light streaming in from outside the window. The transition of light and shadow is natural, with subtle contrasts of light and shadow, while shadows create a soft transition along the neck and hairline. The overall atmosphere is warm, comfortable, and tranquil, with a sense of daily home life and privacy. The color palette is mainly warm brown, off-white, and light wood, harmoniously unified to present a lazy and cozy afternoon atmosphere. The photography style is similar to using a full-frame camera paired with a large-aperture lens, with a shallow depth of field and a natural background blur. The images have a strong visual guiding effect, as if you can feel her inner calm and joy. The overall image resembles a slice from a daily microfilm, capturing the most authentic and touching moments in ordinary days, full of emotional warmth and artistic beauty. It is suitable for creating images that express themes of relaxation, healing, and warmth, while retaining the authenticity and intimacy of everyday photography without excessive embellishment. Like a warm moment captured by chance, yet filled with meticulously crafted beauty, the composition uses diagonal and curved lines to create dynamic balance, the figure's posture is naturally relaxed, the sweater folds and the bedsheet texture add layers and richness to the detail, presenting an overall serene and vibrant aesthetic experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
