        {
          "id": "krea2-bba5c66db6d883bf0cb53a07",
          "alias": "单女灰西装冷淡注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a gray blazer made of wool or blend, with subtle textures. There are three black buttons at the cuffs, and she wears a high-collared red knit sweater underneath, wrapped in a thick red scarf The edges of the scarf are decorated with tassels, soft and fluffy, and the background is a blurry blue-toned snowy scene. Snowflakes flutter down from the sky, each piece clearly visible, showing different shapes and sizes. Some appear large in the foreground, while others blur as spots of light in the distance. The overall background is blurred, creating a strong depth of field effect. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, head slightly turned to the right, and gaze directly at the camera, creating an intimate sense of communication. The shallow depth of field completely blurs the background, highlighting the subject. The light is soft and even, like diffused light on a cloudy day. The light source comes from a slightly higher front position, with soft shadows without obvious hard shadows. The layering of light and shadow is rich, highlighting three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, carrying a poetic and warm feeling of winter. The color palette is mainly cool blue, forming a strong color contrast with the red scarf, enhancing visual impact. The image texture is delicate, as if it were a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera. Yet it retains the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, with rich details, minimal noise, moderate color saturation, and a realistic and artistic imaging style",
