        {
          "id": "krea2-5fd5521ebe8cd943e0b637f3",
          "alias": "单女白内衣门温柔躺拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side on a soft white sheet, her body slightly curled, her head resting on the back of her left hand, while her right hand is gently sliding a plump, juicy red cherry into her mouth. She wears a loose white long-sleeve top, made of lightweight and transparent material, faintly revealing the white lace lingerie underneath. The fabric hugs her body and outlines her natural curves. Her lower body is clad in white lace panties, revealing long, fair legs that glow gently under soft light. Adding a touch of elegance, the foreground features a white porcelain plate filled with fresh cherries. Each cherries are round and plump, with a sparkling sheen on the surface. Some cherries have short, green stems, and the edges of the plate are slightly tilted. Several cherries are scattered outside the plate, creating natural layering with the folds on the sheets. The middle is the woman's body and posture, centered on her as the visual focal point. In the background is a dark brown wooden wardrobe, with two round black metal handles on the door. The wood grain is clearly visible, and the texture is natural and smooth presenting a warm and substantial texture. Above the wardrobe is an open storage compartment with a dark interior tone, blending seamlessly with the overall environment and creating a quiet and private atmosphere. Light streams in from the left side of the frame, like natural morning or evening light, soft and directional, creating a contrast between light and shadow. The shadows transition naturally, casting subtle contours on the sheets, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color tone leans warm, mainly in white, beige, dark brown, and cherry red, with a harmonious and unified color scheme. It creates a peaceful, warm, and slightly intimate home atmosphere. The composition uses low-angle shots, with the view close to the bed, making viewers feel as if they are right in the scene, enhancing immersion. The visual guide starts with the cherry plate in the foreground and extends to the wooden furniture in the background, forming a natural visual path. The image presents a film texture, with slight graininess and slightly lower color saturation, simulating the effect of everyday amateur camera photography. The overall image is full of life's atmosphere. It combines artistic beauty with authenticity, like a private photo capturing moments of daily life, conveying a relaxed, comfortable, and enjoyable mood. The details are rich, layered clearly, light and shadow delicate, and the atmosphere is rich, allowing people to feel a gentle yet genuine intimate moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
