        {
          "id": "krea2-d358b6e02b3c27c33d1d0f93",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤森林困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands quietly in a dense forest, her head slightly tilted back. The veins along the edges of the leaves are clearly visible, and sunlight filters through the gaps between the leaves, creating a soft and layered contrast of light and shadow. She wears a light gray camisole with thin straps that outline graceful shoulder lines, as if immersed in the tranquility of nature. In the foreground is the leaf she holds—plump, rounded, brightly colored, with slightly curled edges, showing its natural growth. The middle ground is her upper body, fully presented from shoulders to head, with a relaxed and elegant posture. The background features layers of green plants, including ferns, shrubs, and tall trees. The leaves vary in shape—some broad and spreading, others slender like needles. The varying shades of green intertwine into a hazy greenery, creating a deep and mysterious forest atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving space on the left to highlight light and shadow effects and environmental details. The overall composition is diagonal. Light streams in diagonally from the upper left, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow that creates a warm and gentle atmosphere. The visual guide starts from the leaves, creating a warm and tranquil lighting atmosphere. The sunlight passing through the leaves creates light spots like stage spotlights, adding a dreamy texture to the entire image. The colors are mainly natural green and warm yellow, paired with cool tones of the subjects' skin, creating a harmonious contrast of warm and cool tones. The overall image presents a realistic feeling of everyday amateur equipment shooting, as if captured with an old-fashioned film camera. The camera carries a slight graininess and a retro texture with low color saturation. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the main character while retaining sufficient environmental information, giving the image both depth and realism.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
