        {
          "id": "krea2-5265723e798815b0e0de2c49",
          "alias": "单女米风衣街道忧伤站立持伞",
          "prompt": "In the rainy street scene, a woman stands slightly to the right of the center with a black umbrella. She wears a beige trench coat with a black shirt underneath, her overall posture somewhat solitary yet elegant. Her left hand holds the handle of the umbrella, while her right hand is tucked into the pocket of the coat. The collar and shoulder lines of the coat are clear, and the material presents the texture of waterproof fabric with a slight reflective sheen. The umbrella features a classic black adhesive fabric with a distinct rib structure, covered with fine droplets. Raindrops continuously slide down the edge, forming a hazy, dynamic trajectory in the air. On the left side of the foreground, a blurry dark shadow partially obscures it possibly another pedestrian or photographer, creating the impression of a real street encounter. The background is a blurred city street, with faint and blurred architectural outlines, streetlights, and shop signs. Warm yellow light shines through, contrasting with the cool-toned rain. The slippery ground reflects the surrounding light and shadow, enhancing spatial depth. The composition uses a center-shift style, with the figure occupying the main visual focus. The shallow depth of field highlights the subject, the background is completely blurred, creating a strong sense of layering between front and back, and the perspective is slightly angled upward. This makes the figure appear upright and full of storytelling. Light comes from the upper right side, representing natural dusk light, creating a backlight edge halo. At the same time, raindrops and umbrella surfaces produce dotted highlights, creating a warm and melancholic atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly cool gray-blue, dotted with warm yellow light spots. The color saturation is moderate, contrast is low but details are rich, and the image is full of cinematic and poetic feel, as if capturing a moment of urban loneliness. It has the grainy texture and slight noise of film photography. It simulates the realism of everyday phone or portable camera shooting. The lens focal length is about 50mm, with a slower shutter speed to capture the motion blur of falling raindrops. Exposure compensation is slightly increased to avoid overly dark shadows. The overall atmosphere is quiet, calm, and slightly melancholic, like a silent poem evoking youthful memories or encounters on a rainy night. The image details are exquisite, presenting an aesthetic style that is both realistic and dreamy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
