        {
          "id": "krea2-8bc9c4677f29a47e30d4fd0a",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙森林忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an old wooden windowsill, her body slightly leaning forward, head lowered, her expression calm and slightly melancholic. She wears a white lace short-sleeved dress with a pale yellow cotton hem, delicate lace patterns covering her arms and chest, and ruffled cuffs on her legs. Her legs are crossed, barefoot on the windowsill, toes naturally extended. Light streams in from outside, casting soft shadows on her legs and skirt. The windowsill surface is rough, with mottled paint peeling marks, giving off a texture of time The window frame is made of white wood, with some worn edges. The glass has fine mesh patterns, like old-fashioned screens or insect screens. Through the glass, you can see the lush green forest outside. The leaves form bright patches in the sunlight, blurring into bokeh effects and creating a dreamy atmosphere. A bouquet of fresh flowers in a transparent glass vase is placed on the right side of the windowsill. The flowers are mainly light orange and pale yellow, mixed with some green leaves. The branches curve naturally, appearing full of vitality. The entire composition uses a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, occupying the main visual space, but leaving a large window and background space on the left to create visual balance and a sense of breathing. The camera slightly looks down, capturing the figure's downward posture and foot details, enhancing immersion and intimacy. The light comes from the natural light on the right, a warm afternoon slanting sunlight that penetrates leaves and glass, casting a soft golden halo indoors, while leaving faint shadows on the walls and windowsills. The contrast is gentle, without strong contrast between light and dark, and the overall tone leans toward warm yellow It has a retro film feel, with moderate color saturation and a slightly faded effect, reminiscent of an old photograph. The green trees in the background contrast with the flowers in the foreground, enriching the layers of the image while enhancing the tranquil, nostalgic, and poetic atmosphere. The image has a strong narrative quality, as if freezing a quiet afternoon, full of life and artistic flair, like a daily moment taken with an old-fashioned camera. The image quality is delicate, details rich, with the focus clearly on the subject, and the background moderately blurred to highlight the subject Overall, it presents a gentle, tranquil, and slightly melancholic aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
