        {
          "id": "krea2-facc8f70850de6d444a615dd",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫室内忧伤注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a white short-sleeved shirt and a deep blue pleated skirt in a sailor uniform appears at the center of the frame, turning sideways to glance back. She gently twists her body, the hem of her skirt naturally unfolding with movement, creating a soft curve that showcases a dynamic beauty of youthful vitality. Her right arm hangs naturally, while her left hand seems to hold something but is hidden. The overall posture is full of dynamism and vitality. The foreground is the main subject, occupying the main position in the composition. The composition uses close-ups, placing the figure at the visual center, with the background set in a dim indoor environment. Several indistinct paintings or posters hang on the walls. One appears to be a portrait of a person, while another features colorful patterns. Although these background elements are out of focus, they create a retro and artistic atmosphere. The wall is darker, presenting a mix of dark brown and dark green, with limited but layered space. The middle ground is the slightly blurred wall and hanging painting area behind the figures. The shallow depth of field renders the main subject more prominent, while the background is further blurred, creating a visual progression from near to far. In composition, diagonal body lines and head direction guide the gaze to create a strong visual flow and emotional connection. The skirt's curve and arm extension form a diagonal structure, enhancing tension. Light and shadow from the left create soft side lighting, producing delicate transitions of light and shadow and enhancing three-dimensionality. Light filters or semi-transparent materials or filters present a cool blue-green tone, with an overall darker tone and a noticeable grainy texture. It feels like an old-fashioned film camera shoot, with images filled with uniform noise and slight chromatic aberration, simulating the texture of real film. This graininess not only doesn't diminish clarity but actually enhances the nostalgic atmosphere. The overall light and shadow contrast is moderate, avoiding overexposure or dead blacks, maintaining rich detail layers. The atmosphere presents a private, tranquil, and slightly mysterious everyday feel, like a moment captured in an old café or art studio, like an inadvertent snapshot. It also carries a carefully crafted artistic flair, with images filled with the excitement of youth and gentle melancholy, evoking summer evening campus life or late-night street encounters. The overall style blends Japanese gravure, film aesthetics, and cinematic storytelling, creating a hazy yet authentic visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
