        {
          "id": "krea2-5f34252b33433ebeebf4588e",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "She lowers her head slightly, her expression gentle yet slightly melancholic, as if lost in some kind of thought. The flowers are delicate and delicate, with layers of petals and delicate patterns clearly visible. She wears a pure white sleeveless lace blouse with delicate hollow-out patterns at the collar and cuffs, making the material light and breathable. It fits the body shape and presents a soft texture. Light slants down from the upper left of the frame, creating a warm backlighting effect and creating a hazy and dreamy atmosphere. The background is blurred green plants and trees, with blurred light spots scattered like bokeh, presenting the mottled light and shadows of summer afternoon sunlight filtering through leaves. The concrete wall is rough and uneven, with cracks and moss traces left by time. The color is grayish-brown with a faint blue-green tone, enhancing the retro and realistic feel of the scene. The composition uses close-ups. The figure occupies the left two-thirds of the frame, with her head slightly tilted, and her gaze downward to the flower in her hand, forming a visual focal point. The foreground highlights the details of the figure and flowers, the middle ground is her body and part of the wall, while the background is completely blurred. The shallow depth of field is used to emphasize the subject, with the direction of light and shadow being side backlight. The light source comes from the upper left, softly outlining the figure's outline. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and light green, blending off-white, light gray, and teal to create a tranquil, poetic, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The image texture is close to film photography, with slight graininess and color shifts, simulating the effects of vintage cameras. The lens is a 50mm prime portrait lens with an f/1.8 aperture. The overall style combines Japanese art with film aesthetics, conveying youthfulness, tranquility, gentleness, and fleeting beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
