        {
          "id": "krea2-fd7a45d6644517a7427eb6e8",
          "alias": "单女米外套霓虹夜景忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "Her expression is calm yet slightly melancholic, showing a natural rosy tone. She retains only a clear base makeup and a faint blush, giving her an overall fresh and calm aura. She wears a loose beige coat layered with a white collared shirt and a gray-black striped knit sweater. The outfit has clear layers and texture, with smooth shoulder lines and clean cuffs and hem. Her hands are in her coat pockets, her posture relaxed yet dignified. Wearing simple round earrings adds a touch of refinement to the overall look. In the foreground, you can see faint raindrops or water droplets falling onto the lens, creating hazy light spots and blurred traces, enhancing the image's realism and atmosphere. The background is a blurred city nightscape, with colorful neon lights scattered in circles and ovals, featuring blue, yellow, red, and white halos. These spots vary in size and rich layers, creating a strong depth effect, with distant architectural silhouettes faintly visible. The street headlights and streetlights intertwine into flowing light and shadow, enveloping the entire scene in a damp night, with a slightly cool air in the air. The composition uses a centered composition, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, creating a strong visual guidance. The shallow depth of field makes the subject stand out clearly, the background completely blurred, enhancing the character's presence. The light mainly comes from the neon and streetlights in the background, shining from the sides and behind, creating a soft contour glow, while subtle shadow transitions appear on the coat, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall lighting and shadows lean toward cool tones, mainly blue-purple tones, accented with warm yellow-orange light sources, creating a contrast of cool and warm tones and creating a unique sense of loneliness and romance at city nights. The image has a slight film graininess and low-saturation color processing, simulating amateur camera shooting and adding realism and a nostalgic feel. The lens focal length is set around 85mm, simulating portrait photography angles. The background light spots present natural bokeh, and some light is refracted by rainwater causing fine light spots and halos. This enhances the dreamlike feel and emotional tension of the image. The overall atmosphere is quiet and storyful, as if capturing a tranquil moment in a city night. The characters' expressions seem both to wait for someone and to recall something, giving a thoughtful feeling. There are no obvious movements in the painting, yet it is filled with inner emotional fluctuations. The composition is rigorous yet casual, and the interplay of light and shadow conveys a complex emotion of both detachment and tenderness in modern urban life. The overall style combines realism and artistic flair. It combines the refined details of AI-generated images with the natural texture of everyday photography",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
