        {
          "id": "krea2-1fb835889777e84ef3f02630",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣愤怒倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman appears in the frame at an angle, her body slightly leaning forward and her head lowered, adding a sense of movement and naturalness. Looking directly into the camera, it seems as if she is silently communicating with the viewer, presenting a temperament that is both relaxed and slightly mysterious. She wears a red ribbed knit long-sleeve inner layer, with the vivid red creating a strong visual focal point throughout the frame. Over it, she wears a black semi-transparent jacket with intricate floral patterns. The pattern is exquisite and layered, and the material is lightweight, revealing the outline of the inner garment. Creating rich visual depth, her right hand gently rests on the white railing, fingers naturally bent, her posture elegant and casual. The railing runs vertically across the right side of the painting, forming a guiding line that draws the viewer's attention to the main subject. The background is a blurred sea and sky, the water shows a clear blue-green hue, shimmering with waves. In the distance, the silhouette of a ship can be faintly seen. The sky is pale blue with almost no clouds, indicating clear weather and bright light. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot, making the figure stand out even more. At the same time, it enhances the sense of depth in the space. The foreground features a clear white railing with rich details and sharp edges; the middle ground is the main subject at the focal point; the background is blurred to create a soft bokeh effect, highlighting the subject. Light and shadow come from the upper right, with bright sunlight, creating a natural transition between highlights and shadows. The light is soft but not glaring, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color contrast is strong, with complementary tones of red and blue creating a strong visual impact, while maintaining harmony and unity. The composition is asymmetrical but balanced The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving a blank space on the right to enhance breathability. The visual guide starts from the railing, evoking emotional resonance. The overall style combines everyday realism with artistic beauty, as if captured with an amateur camera, full of life and poetic moments. The image texture is delicate, details rich, and color saturation is moderate, presenting a fresh, natural, gentle yet slightly rebellious youthful vibe, suitable for expressing themes of freedom, individuality, and inner world",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
