        {
          "id": "krea2-a9dd9bb5790b6182e7c3c2e8",
          "alias": "单女蓝和服竹林冷淡倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a dark blue kimono printed with golden crane patterns, wide and flowing sleeves, white piping on the collar and edges, and a colorful wide obi embroidered with intricate floral and geometric patterns. Two golden knots hang from the ends of the belt, naturally draped around the waist. The hem of the kimono reveals a light underlining patterned with fine wave or cloud patterns. She is turning sideways to look back at the camera, her right hand gently resting on a bamboo railing. Her fingers are long, her posture elegant and natural. Her body leans slightly forward, her left shoulder resting on the railing, her head slightly turned toward the camera, forming a gentle S-shaped curve. The background is a blurred outdoor scene, sunlight filtering through the leaves casting dappled shadows, presenting a warm golden hue. In the distance, bamboo groves and greenery can be faintly seen. In the foreground is a railing made of thick bamboo poles, with clear bamboo texture and a natural brownish-yellow color. The railing lines extend diagonally from the lower right corner of the frame into the middle of the frame, guiding the gaze to focus on the figures. The composition uses the rule of thirds: the figure is positioned on the right side of the canvas, with plenty of space left on the left to highlight the ambiance. At the same time, shallow depth of field effects blur the background into soft light spots, creating a dreamlike visual experience. Light comes from the upper right of the painting, representing a warm-toned afternoon sunshine. The sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating soft highlights and shadows on the figures. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, creating a quiet and cozy atmosphere with a strong sense of traditional Japanese aesthetics. The main colors of the painting are blue, gold, and yellow. The contrast of warm and cool is striking yet harmonious, with moderate color saturation—neither overly flashy nor dull—presenting a retro film feel, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, with slight graininess and natural color shifts. The overall image has strong artistic appeal, like a tranquil poetic Eastern painting, full of Zen and romantic sentiment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
