        {
          "id": "krea2-5429a03d1124c710d3bd8956",
          "alias": "单女镜前媚态演奏",
          "prompt": "She wears a high-necked, long-sleeved, tight-fitting black glossy garment. The surface is smooth as a mirror, reflecting the light and colors of the surroundings, creating flowing light and shadow effects. The garment has a strong sheen and reflective properties, highlighting the smooth and curvaceous body lines. Looking directly at the camera, Her expression carries a hint of laziness and allure, revealing confidence and composure. Her left hand rests gently at her waist, her right hand hangs naturally, her arm lines graceful, and a small tattoo on her wrist adds a touch of personality. The background is a warm-toned indoor space, with walls in light beige or cream tones, giving a delicate texture. On the right side, there is a window with a white frame, from which soft natural light streams in. The light streams in from the side, creating a contrast of light and shadow on the figure, highlighting the contours and three-dimensionality. On the left, a wooden door panel can be faintly seen. The texture is clear, the colors warm and harmonious with the overall environment. The composition uses a medium and close-up perspective, with the characters occupying the main position. The slightly tilted body posture creates a dynamic aesthetic, while diagonal light and shadows enhance the depth of the image. The foreground clearly presents the subject, the middle ground includes folds and transitions of clothing and light and shadow, while the background is relatively blurred, highlighting the subject while preserving the ambiance. The lighting and shadow tone is mainly warm yellow, with light sources coming from the sides and rear, creating a backlighting effect. The soft glow around the edges of the figure's contours creates a private, tranquil, and slightly sensual atmosphere. The overall image texture is delicate, with moderate color saturation, exuding a sense of sophistication and artistic flair. It feels as if professional photography equipment is carefully illuminated indoors, combining realism with aesthetic expression. The visual style blends modern fashion, role-playing, and realistic photography elements, presenting a visual experience that is both everyday and surreal",
