        {
          "id": "krea2-c6fd41df9ead57fd521e53aa",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤床害羞躺",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side on a soft white bedsheet, wearing a loose light gray short-sleeved T-shirt and orange-pink pleated shorts. Her hands are folded over her chest, fingers gently touching the hem of her clothes. Her expression is slightly shy and contemplative, presenting a natural and relaxed state. Her head is slightly tilted, and the background is a simple bedroom environment. White pillows and cushions are neatly arranged, with a small pink throw pillow and a gray-blue pillow adding a touch of color. The edges of the wooden bed frame are clearly visible, revealing a warm natural wood texture. The entire composition is shot from a top-down angle, centered on the figure, forming a visual focal point. The figure is positioned slightly to the lower right of the frame, leaving space on the left and above, creating a sense of breathing and spatial extension. The foreground features a spread white bedsheet with delicate texture and natural folds; the middle is the main subject, with a relaxed and realistic posture; the background consists of pillows, headboards, and parts of the wall, with clear but not cluttered layers. Light softly falls from the upper left of the frame, presenting the warm natural light effect of early morning or afternoon, with smooth transitions between light and shadow. There is light shadowing, with the overall tone mainly white, light gray, and orange pink, paired with warm yellow tones to create a peaceful, cozy, and healing atmosphere. The image has a sense of intimacy and privacy in daily life, as if capturing a quiet morning or afternoon moment. Shot with professional photography equipment, it offers high resolution, rich detail, and high color fidelity. The image is clean and transparent without unnecessary distractions, with balanced composition, natural visual guidance, and emotional resonance. The image has a slight film texture and moderate graininess. The color tone is slightly warm, enhancing nostalgia and authenticity. The overall style leans toward Japanese lifestyle aesthetics, emphasizing authenticity, naturalness, and comfort, conveying a quiet, gentle, and vibrant everyday beauty",
