        {
          "id": "krea2-5d8cfbc5747abef5dc8c9d6b",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙森林忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands before an old wooden window, her body slightly tilted, her right hand gently resting on the frame, her left hand naturally hanging down, her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears a white lace long dress adorned with exquisite embroidery, with clearly visible lace cuffs and collar details, exuding a touch of vintage and romantic charm. Her expression carries a faint melancholy and contemplation, as if recalling something. Outside the window is a dense green forest, sunlight filtering through the leaves casting dappled shadows, creating soft patches of light. It creates a peaceful and poetic atmosphere. The overall tone of the painting is warm, mainly yellow-green with a slight film texture, presenting a retro filter effect. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space, highlighting the main subject while preserving the natural background environment. The wooden window frame is pale yellow, with obvious wear marks and peeling paint on the surface, adding a sense of age and realism. The foreground features vertical lines of the window frame and some glass reflections, while the background features blurred green leaves and sky, creating distinct layers. Extending along her line of sight to the natural scenery outside the window, light streams in from the right side, creating a soft side glow, casting subtle shadows on the curtains and walls. The delicate contrast of light and shadow enhances the sense of three-dimensionality and space. The entire scene presents a tranquil, nostalgic, and story-rich atmosphere, as if capturing a moment forgotten by time, like everyday moments shot with an old film camera, full of life and artistic beauty",
