        {
          "id": "krea2-d0c9f374097c7cfdda74bff0",
          "alias": "单女外套街道自信坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a stone steps beside a city street, wearing a fluffy, soft leopard-print plush jacket layered with dark tight-fitting clothes underneath. She wears a leopard-print long skirt and pointed high heels. Her overall look is fashionable and full of wild charm, slightly curled and confident and relaxed. Her left hand holds a phone with the screen showing the time, while her right hand gently pinches a golden maple leaf. The leaf's edges are clear and the veins distinct, as if it has just fallen from a tree. Beside her is a black handbag, simple and smooth, Next to it is a coffee paper cup printed with a percent sign, with a beige body and a black lid. The overall composition centers on the person, shot from a slightly overhead angle. The figure occupies the left-central position in the frame, crossing legs gracefully—right leg in front, left leg behind, forming a natural visual guideline. The background is a light gray building exterior wall with horizontal texture decorations. The windows have deep red frames, with blurred glass reflections. On the right is a sturdy tree with white trunks and mottled peeling marks. The bark is rough, branches stretch upward, and in the distance, another person in a pink top and white long skirt can be vaguely seen standing behind the tree, part of their body covered, creating a realistic everyday street feel. The ground is paved with gray stone bricks, with withered yellow leaves scattered between the gaps, ranging in color from light yellow to deep brown, each in different shapes—some intact, some broken—adding to the autumn atmosphere. On the right side of the painting is an asphalt road with white traffic markings on the surface, clear lines contrasting with the stone steps, with light and shadow coming from the diffuse light of a cloudy day. Soft and even, without strong shadows, but the contours and material details of objects can be clearly distinguished. The overall color tone leans toward warm gray, mainly brown, beige, and black, accented with orange-yellow fallen leaves and red window frames. The colors are harmonious and unified, presenting an atmosphere of urban street casual and refinement, as if capturing an ordinary yet story-filled moment. It has strong visual narrative and a sense of life, like a real street scene casually taken with a regular camera or phone, with slight graininess and natural exposure control. Emphasizing realism rather than excessive beautification, the composition is balanced and layered. The foreground features coffee cups and fallen leaves, the middle ground is the main figure, and the background features buildings and trees. The sense of space is rich, and the overall style blends fashion, nature, and everyday life, conveying an independent, confident, and composed attitude toward a modern urban woman's independent, confident, and composed lifestyle",
