        {
          "id": "krea2-9f4422525bcbb48be3d32ffb",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣公寓冷淡站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, adding a touch of softness. She wears round metallic slim-rimmed glasses, the lenses reflecting softly, looking straight into the camera, looking both calm and a touch of mystery. Her makeup is delicate and natural, and her overall temperament is both cool and gentle. She wears a gray sleeveless knit top with delicate texture, showing natural pleats and a fitted cut. The tight design highlights her curves, and the hem is slightly tapered, revealing a flat belly. She wears a thin chain necklace around her neck, and the pendant is small and delicate, adding a touch of detail to the overall look. Her posture is naturally relaxed, her body slightly turned to the side, shoulders stretched out, and arms hanging naturally at her sides. The foreground is the main subject, occupying most of the space. The composition uses a central composition: the figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center, with her head slightly tilted, directing the gaze directly to the viewer, creating a strong visual guidance. The middle ground features a light beige wall behind the figure, which is flat but somewhat aged. On the wall, there is a square switch panel with simple patterns or graffiti marks, adding realism and a sense of life to the scene. The background is clean and simple, without unnecessary decorations or distracting elements, highlighting the subject's presence. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with the light source coming from the right front of the figure, creating uniform frontal lighting. Shadows are softly distributed on the right and rear sides of the body, creating a sense of depth and layering. The light tone is warm with a slight yellow tint, simulating indoor lighting effects, enhancing the warm and comfortable atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly gray, white, and beige, with harmonious and unified colors. The edges of the frame are slightly blurred to highlight the theme. The overall style leans toward everyday portraits or life photography, giving it a sense of realism and approachability. At the same time, it incorporates artistic aesthetic pursuits, presenting a quiet, reserved, and highly personalized atmosphere. It was as if capturing a moment when you unintentionally revealed your true self—the image was delicate and rich, showcasing superb visual expressiveness",
