        {
          "id": "krea2-2c2cc3eeafd6308eb1c162ec",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙摄影棚倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a light champagne-colored strapless tight mini dress, elegantly leaning on a vintage brown leather armchair. Her body forms an S-shaped curve, her right leg bent and raised, wearing black stiletto heels, while her left leg stretches out naturally, exuding seduction and tension. She slightly tilts her head to look back at the camera, her right hand gently resting on the window frame, while her left hand hangs naturally, fingers long. The light and shadow create a contrast of light and shadow on her, creating a three-dimensional effect. In the foreground is a dark brown classic-style armchair with obvious button decorations and slight wear marks on the seat. It shows the texture of years of accumulation. The right side of the chair is partially obstructed, creating a visual guide. The middle ground is the wall, with grayish-white vintage patterns and textured wallpaper. The walls are covered with various music album covers and vinyl records, including albums by artists like Mariah Carey. The colors are rich but not cluttered. One vinyl record has a particularly striking red label, and next to it is an old gramophone with a trumpet-shaped metal shell that has a bronze sheen, placed on a small wooden table. The background is a large window framed with dark brown wood. The curtains are made of deep purple velvet, heavy and textured. Outside, you can faintly see green trees and the silhouettes of buildings. Light enters through the left window, creating a warm side glow that illuminates the figures and the interior space. The overall lighting is soft and layered, creating a nostalgic, private, and romantic atmosphere. The composition uses a diagonal perspective, with the figures occupying the center to the right, creating a visual focal point. The gramophone and record are distributed as decorative elements on the right side, balancing the composition. The floor is paved with blue-and-white geometric tiles with vintage patterns. The edges are slightly worn, adding a sense of realism. The overall color palette is mainly warm brown, gray-white, and purplish-red, with harmonious colors. Light and shadow shine from the upper left, creating soft shadows and highlights that highlight the contours of the figures and the texture of objects. The visuals have a strong cinematic and artistic atmosphere, as if they were high-quality works shot in a professional studio, while preserving the details and warmth of daily life, allowing viewers to experience an immersive nostalgic time, like quietly listening to old songs on a quiet afternoon and reminiscing about beautiful moments from the past. The images present a highly realistic style, rich in detail, clear textures, and natural transitions of light and shadow, with strong visual impact and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
