        {
          "id": "krea2-6e2b50458edef1c2a7b4215a",
          "alias": "单女白T恤浴室忧伤倚靠书写",
          "prompt": "A woman sat on the bathroom floor paved with blue and white tiles. She wore a loose white short-sleeved T-shirt and light-colored shorts, her legs slightly bent, her body leaning slightly back against the wall, holding a round wooden tray with several slices of bright yellow lemon. Light slanted in through the left window, which had a dark brown frame. On the windowsill sat a pot of withered yellow green plants, whose leaves had dried and curled, while on the other windowsill, lush green ferns hung down The leaves are slender and dense, with a background of blue and white tiled walls. The lower half is deep blue, the upper half light blue. The floor is also tiled, making it appear somewhat damp. On the left side of the floor lies a heavy book, its pages yellowed, the writing blurred, and the spine slightly raised, as if it had just been flipped through. The entire scene presents a tranquil, lonely, and poetic atmosphere. The color palette is mainly cool blue, mixed with warm yellow lemons and sunlight, creating a striking contrast with strong light and shadow effects. Backlit shooting makes the contours of the figures clear, the background slightly blurred, highlighting the subject. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. In the foreground, scattered books and plant branches and leaves; in the middle ground, the character and tray; in the background, windows and walls, with distinct layers. The visual guide leads from the book in the lower left corner to the character, extending outside the window, creating a sense of momentary time stop. The overall style is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and vintage tones. The lens mimics vintage camera shooting with moderate focal length, with shallow depth of field and low color saturation, but the lemon's yellow is exceptionally vivid, forming a visual highlight. Light comes from the slanting sun in the early morning or evening, blending warm and cool tones to create a strong contrast between light and dark. The overall composition conveys a quiet, introspective, and slightly melancholic everyday aesthetic, as if it were a private memory from an ordinary afternoon. It has a cinematic narrative texture, stable composition, reasonable blank space, rich details, and is full of the atmosphere of life and artistic tension, presenting a sense of authenticity and surreal beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
