        {
          "id": "krea2-d10c5e5e232b0568f13b1f4c",
          "alias": "单女绿外套城市俏皮站立躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the black metal railing of a city pedestrian bridge, adding a touch of laziness and casualness. She wears a beige knitted cropped top that reveals her slender waistline, layered with a loose light green quilted jacket with a distinct cross-shaped stitching pattern. The lining is dark blue denim, with orange-yellow piping trim on the collar and cuffs, creating a rich and stylish look. She pairs a high-waisted beige short skirt in the same color scheme, with a clean and sharp hem. The overall look presents a casual yet fashionable urban style. She leans relaxedly against the railing, one foot slightly raised, wearing a pair of beige thick-soled plush slippers. White socks peek out from the cuffs, and her ankles are gracefully shaped. Her hands are naturally open, palms facing outward, as if embracing the city's atmosphere. Her expression is confident yet slightly playful. The background is a typical Chinese city streetscape. On the left is a modern glass curtain wall building reflecting the sky and surroundings, with \"Toyota International\" hanging on the exterior wall with a red signboard and the English sign \"ACTIVE CELL\" below. On the right is an old residential building, with mottled walls showing signs of time. In the distance, you can see some low rooftops and utility poles. On the street, there are blurred vehicles and pedestrians, a few bicycles parked by the roadside, and several red and white traffic cones scattered across the ground. The whole scene is full of life and realism. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center, body slightly tilted, creating dynamic balance. The railing extends from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a strong diagonal guiding line that draws the viewer's attention to the subject, while also enhancing the spatial depth of the composition. The architectural and street details in the background are rich but not cluttered. Through appropriate blurring, the main subject stands out more. Light comes from the upper right, representing the warm sun of early morning or evening. The sunlight falls on the figure, creating a soft outline glow. The wrinkles of clothing are clearly visible, and the shadowed areas transition naturally, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and light green. Red and blue elements dotted the building create harmonious and unified colors. The image texture is close to real photos taken with everyday leisure equipment, featuring slight graininess and natural noise, preserving the texture of film photography. The interplay of light and shadow reveals an unintentional lifestyle aesthetic, capturing the unique charm that urban youth exude in their ordinary days. The images convey a free, independent, and vibrant image of modern urban women, both fashionable and approachable, as if capturing a fleeting moment of youth and beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
