        {
          "id": "krea2-7dce3bdcdf76dcf5dae2d73a",
          "alias": "单女外套害羞坐注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a dark jacket and a bright yellow plaid scarf underneath. The warm tones of the scarf contrast sharply with the surrounding withered yellow reeds. She wears a black ring on her finger, her expression slightly shy and contemplative. The middle frame clearly outlines the woman's seated posture. She is half-crouched among the reeds, her body slightly leaning forward, her posture relaxed and natural. The background is a wide wild hillside, covered with dry vegetation. The distant hills have soft outlines, appearing peaceful and distant under the pale blue sky. The sky shows gradient colors at sunrise or sunset, transitioning from light blue to soft pink-orange. The light is warm and gentle, and the backlight from the side and rear creates a golden halo around the figure's silhouette, creating a sense of three-dimensionality. The overall composition uses a central composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, using the reeds in the foreground as a visual guide to guide the gaze through the blurred foreground and focus on the subject. The image has a strong sense of depth, clear layering, and a warm and nostalgic lighting atmosphere, filled with the quiet poetry of an autumn evening. It features the grainy texture and slight overexposure characteristic of film photography, with moderate color saturation, mainly warm yellow tones, complemented by a cool blue sky for contrast, presenting a realistic feel reminiscent of everyday amateur camera shooting, as if using the Canon EOS 5D Mark In the moment captured at dusk with the Sony A7 series full-frame camera, large-aperture lenses such as 50mm f/1.8 or 85mm f/1.4 are used to achieve a shallow depth of field. The details are rich, the background and foreground naturally blur, creating a dreamy, hazy beauty. The entire scene is filled with an atmosphere of solitude, tranquility, and self-dialogue, allowing one to feel the moment of harmony between humans and nature, as if time has frozen at this moment, recording a personal gentle moment",
