        {
          "id": "krea2-2fd4577ba7391ecbe91179d4",
          "alias": "单女桌边困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways at a light blue checkered tile table, slightly tilting her head up to gaze at the upper left of the frame. Her expression is focused and slightly contemplative. Her right hand is gently raised, her posture natural and elegant, as if savoring a moment of tranquility and beauty. She wears a black lace cuff top, with delicate patterns on the edges faintly visible under soft light, adding a touch of vintage and tenderness. In the foreground is a bouquet of dried flowers set in a transparent glass vase, including off-white reeds, withered yellow flower balls, and slender branches. They are arranged in a staggered manner, with some branches and leaves extending to the left side of the canvas, forming a natural frame structure. The blurred background presents a warm brownish-yellow tone, faintly revealing the outlines of the interior furnishings, creating a hazy yet cozy atmosphere. The overall composition adopts a close-up perspective: the figure is on the right side of the frame, with the head slightly tilted, guiding the viewer toward the upper left. Dried flowers serve as the foreground element occupying the left side of the image, creating visual balance and layering. Light streams in diagonally from the upper right. Delicate transitions of highlights and shadows are created, while subtle reflections appear on the table and vases, enhancing the sense of realism in the space. The background blur makes the subject stand out, the depth of field is shallow, and the background gradually blurs, creating a dreamy sense of depth. The colors are mainly warm yellow, off-white, black, and light blue, with harmonious tones and just the right balance of warm and cool tones. This not only preserves the warmth of daily life but also gives the image an artistically tranquil beauty. The entire scene looks like it was casually shot with an old film camera. The color expression, with a slight graininess and low saturation, seems to capture a gentle moment of afternoon sunlight, with soft light and shadow, a tranquil atmosphere, full of artistic flair and poetic life",
