        {
          "id": "krea2-2c2c64a6c7155b9c4c3d3c95",
          "alias": "单女米风衣街道忧伤倚靠过肩",
          "prompt": "A close-up half-length portrait of a woman shows a natural pink hue. Looking directly into the camera yet seemingly gazing into the distance, it reveals a calm and reserved emotion, adding a touch of casualness and vitality. She wears a beige trench coat, with a dark brown strap slung over her shoulder. Around her neck is a thick plaid scarf woven in green, blue, and red into a classic Scottish plaid pattern, edged with frayed edges, giving a warm and vintage feel. The scarf tightly wraps around the neck, creating a cozy feeling in winter. She wears a small pearl earring that sparkles softly under soft light, adding a delicate detail to the overall look and occupying the main position in the composition. The composition uses close-ups to highlight the expressions and details of the figures. The middle ground gradually blurs, faintly revealing the blurred railing structure and the outline of city buildings in the distance. The background is completely blurred, presenting soft warm tones of light and shadow, possibly the dusk sky or the reflection of buildings, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with a film photography texture. The tone leans toward warmth, with a slight retro filter effect. The color saturation is moderate, presenting a realistic and delicate visual experience. The camera uses a large-aperture lens with an extremely shallow depth of field, making the subject clear and prominent, with the background completely blurred. In composition, the subject is slightly tilted, the head tilts slightly, and the gaze meets the lens, creating a strong visual guide that attracts the viewer's attention. The overall image is full of life and artistic beauty. Like capturing a moment on a city street with an old film camera, it carries a strong documentary style and emotional warmth. The footage shows no signs of deliberate staging, more like a casual snapshot capturing the most authentic and natural state of the subject. The image is rich in detail and clear textures—from the woven texture of the scarf to the folds of the trench coat, all are clearly visible. At the same time, the appropriate graininess and slight exposure deviation are preserved, enhancing realism and nostalgia. The entire scene feels like an evening in late autumn or early winter, with a gentle breeze blowing. The sunlight is soft, and the figures stand quietly at bridgeheads or street corners. Though the surroundings are not clear, one can sense the coexistence of the city's noise and tranquility, creating a poetic moment in the city. The images convey a gentle, calm, and slightly melancholic mood, evoking youth, growth, and memories. This atmosphere is both everyday and story-rich, like an unfinished cinematic shot waiting for the audience to fill the space for imagination.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
