        {
          "id": "krea2-509da2c0faddf87ddba38dd8",
          "alias": "单女T恤门俏皮坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A girl sits in front of a light gray indoor wall, pinned with a pink rectangular hairpin. She tilts her head slightly, as if gazing at something, or lost in a fleeting thought. Her calm expression reveals a hint of youthful confusion and innocence. She wears a short-sleeved T-shirt with a pink and white patchwork, with a soft pink collar and sleeves, and the classic Hello Kitty cartoon print printed on her chest Kitty wore a pink bow with a small halo above her head, looking cute and playful. Her T-shirt was loose and comfortable, with the hem casually tucked into dark blue denim shorts. The edges of the shorts had slight wear and pleats, presenting a casual feel for everyday wear. Her legs were together, knees slightly bent, and her hands naturally resting on her thighs. Her posture was relaxed yet upright, her body slightly leaned forward, head slightly tilted, and the overall body lines smooth and natural. The composition centered on the figure, captured with medium shots, which occupied about two-thirds of the frame. The background is a simple light gray wall, flat and unadorned, with only a slender horizontal line in the upper right, possibly a wall crevice or decorative strip, creating a minimalist sense of space. Light comes from the front left of the painting, soft and even, forming a natural transition of shadows that enhances the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is calm and warm, carrying a sense of relaxation from daily life and the tranquil beauty of youth. The color tones are mainly soft pink, white, and gray, harmoniously and unified, visually fresh and clean, with no unnecessary distractions. The visuals focus on the emotional expression and everyday state of the characters, with stable composition and a level view, making viewers feel as if they are observing a real moment of a girl next door. The texture is close to everyday photos taken with a regular phone, with slight noise and natural color reproduction. Without pursuing extreme clarity, it retains a sense of everyday life, presenting a simple yet touching youthful atmosphere, allowing people to feel the gentleness and beauty in everyday life",
          "description": "",
