        {
          "id": "krea2-eb43653374188cef3bfaf047",
          "alias": "单女米T恤床微笑跪持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels in the soft indoor light, wearing a light beige lace-trimmed camisole and light blue denim shorts, squatting naturally and relaxedly on the edge of the bed. Her hands gently pull open the white sheer curtains hanging on both sides, as if poking her head out from a private shelter, revealing a gentle yet subtle smile. The overall scene presents a lazy yet pure home atmosphere. In the foreground are two light, flowing white sheer curtains, delicate and soft, with subtle wrinkles and light and shadow variations. Extending from the left and right sides toward the center, forming a natural frame structure that frames the main figure in the center. The middle is the bedding area where she is located. The bedsheet is a delicate off-white or light gray, with a fluffy and soft texture. By the bedside, some everyday details can be faintly seen, such as a corner of a pillow or the outline of clothing. The background is a blurred yet cozy bedroom environment. The walls are light-toned, possibly off-white or light gray. In the distance, you can see the outline of a simple nightstand or decoration, but all are blurred to highlight the main subject. The composition adopts a classic central symmetrical layout, with the figures centered and the sheer curtain forming a visual guiding line, creating a strong sense of depth and layering. At the same time, the shallow depth of field effect softly blurs both the foreground and background, enhancing the dreamy and intimate feel of the image. Light comes from the left or front of the image, providing soft natural light that may pass through the windows to create uniform and warm illumination. The shadowed areas transition naturally, without harsh contrasts of light and dark. The overall color palette mainly consists of white, off-white, light gray, and light blue, creating a fresh and intimate atmosphere. A pure and tranquil visual experience, with a light and shadow atmosphere like morning sunlight filtering through a thin veil, soft and hazy, carrying a serene and gentle poetic beauty. The image texture is delicate and authentic, as if using a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens to capture a moment in life. It combines the refinement of artistic photography with the warmth and authenticity of daily life. The details are rich yet restrained, presenting an aesthetic style that lies between realism and idealization, neither exaggerated nor distorted. It evokes a sense of quiet beauty and inner emotional flow",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
