        {
          "id": "krea2-7b7343bb8ff1c389b146739e",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙咖啡厅忧伤坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a vintage-style red bench, wearing a red and white plaid spaghetti strap dress with deep red ruffles, paired with white lace-up sneakers. Her expression is slightly melancholic and contemplative. Her right hand holds an old-fashioned red rotary dial telephone, with the cord spiraling down and connected to a landline beside the chair. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, legs crossed, her posture relaxed and lazy. The background is a pure white wall and a large area of red wall decoration. A circular red decoration hangs on the wall, resembling a vintage telephone receiver or decorative tray. The floor is paved with beige and light brown checkered tiles. On the right chair is a pizza takeout box printed with \"MY FAVORITE PIZZA\" and a glass bottled drink. The overall composition uses red as the main color, creating a strong visual impact. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered slightly to the left, forming a stable and balanced visual structure. The foreground highlights the main subject and telephone details. The middle shots showcase seats, telephones, and some environmental elements. The background is simple and clean, reinforcing the theme. The lighting is soft and even, shadows are delicate, and the color saturation is high but not excessive, presenting a nostalgic film texture with slight graininess and fading effects, as if captured with an old camera. The light and shadow layers are rich, the transition between light and shadow is natural, and the atmosphere is tranquil with a touch of loneliness. The overall style blends retro aesthetics with modern youthful energy, combining the nostalgic charm of a 1960s American fast food restaurant with freshness and fashion. The images are full of storytelling and emotional tension, like a private photo frozen by time, recording the flow of emotions on a quiet afternoon",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
