        {
          "id": "krea2-0ce29bcf0b88e3a0ebc59eff",
          "alias": "单女沙发俏皮坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a beige fabric armchair by the window indoors. She wears a loose white hooded sweatshirt, with sleeves casually rolled up to the elbows, revealing slender arms. The hem of the sweatshirt hangs naturally, faintly revealing the light pink inner layer. The overall look is casual and casual. Her legs are crossed and layered, with the right leg on top and left leg below. The side of the shoe features a gold brand logo, adding a touch of refinement. She gently strokes the back of her head with both hands, fingers slightly bent. The ends are dyed deep blue, making her look both fashionable and distinctive. She tilts her head slightly back toward the camera, her posture relaxed and elegant, leaning slightly back against the wooden chair back. The wooden frame of the chair is a warm brown with clean and smooth lines, and the background features a large floor-to-ceiling window. Outside the window is a partial view of the modern architectural complex, with gray tiled roofs and multi-layer glass windows. The architectural style blends traditional and modern elements, with a bright gray-white sky and soft and even lighting. The entire composition centers on the figures, using a medium perspective where the figures occupy about two-thirds of the frame, creating a comfortable, lazy, and lively atmosphere. On the left side of the foreground is a round wooden corner table, smooth with rounded edges, adding depth to the space. Light and shadow stream in diagonally from the right window, creating a soft side glow, while casting soft shadows on the walls and floor to enhance the sense of depth. The overall color scheme is mainly white, beige, and wood, accented with blue and gold bright colors. The visual harmony and unity create a delicate image texture, as if shot with a professional camera. It offers high resolution and realistic detail, while preserving the natural feel of daily life, presenting a home scene that is both stylish and cozy, full of youthful energy and artistic beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
