        {
          "id": "krea2-99402879bcf496b3323e42da",
          "alias": "单女蓝和服摄影棚忧伤持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a dark blue kimono embroidered with white floral patterns. The collar and cuffs revealed a light-colored patterned kimono underneath, printed with exquisite blue-and-white butterfly and vine patterns. At her waist was a golden cord belt. Looking directly at the camera, her makeup was fresh and natural. Her hands gently held a blooming white lotus flower with layers of petals, pure white and flawless. Her hand posture was elegant, fingertips slightly curved, as if caring for a treasure. The foreground features the main subject, occupying the center-left position of the composition. The composition uses close-ups, with the middle showing the torso and parts of the kimono. The background is a pure black curtain scattered with countless fine golden spots, resembling stardust or raindrops drifting in the night sky. Under the lighting, it creates a dreamlike bokeh effect. Light slanting from the upper right, creating strong backlight and side backlight, producing bright halos and highlights, enhancing the sense of depth. The strong contrast of light and shadow creates a warm and mysterious atmosphere. The overall color palette is deep blue, white, Gold is the main color, with harmonious unity. The lotus in the hand extends to the bottom of the frame, creating a stable visual flow. The image texture is delicate, the clothing textures are clearly visible, and the background blur is well handled, presenting a tranquil, poetic, and slightly melancholic Eastern aesthetic with the texture of a professional studio. The lighting is precise to emphasize the main contours and emotional expression. The overall style combines artistry and storytelling, like a carefully composed portrait or a moment frozen in tranquility and beautiful times. The image is filled with romance and Zen charm, immersing viewers in this gentle and profound beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
