        {
          "id": "krea2-471f8436f4756532434c6570",
          "alias": "单女米睡裙床困倦躺",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways on a soft bed, wearing a delicate beige lace nightgown. The sheer sheer sleeves are adorned with delicate lace trim, and the cutout design at the neckline and chest exudes an elegant vintage style, adding a touch of laziness and gentleness. She slightly raises one hand, revealing a thoughtful expression. The background is a warm indoor environment, with large floral patterns printed on the bedsheet, mainly in pink, red, and green tones. The flowers are full and soft, complementing the overall palette. The white pillow accentuates the character's outline, making the subject stand out even more. The overall composition presents a hazy and dreamy atmosphere. Light softly pours in from the sides, creating a warm golden tone that creates a sense of tranquility at dawn or dusk, enhancing three-dimensionality and layering. The air seems to be filled with a faint mist, making the entire scene appear more surreal and poetic. The composition adopts a top-down angle, placing the figure slightly to the left center of the frame, leaving space on the right side for the line of sight to naturally extend. At the same time, floral patterns on the bedsheets guide visual flow, forming a balanced yet varied visual structure. The lace garments in the foreground have clear details and rich textures, contrasting with the blurred floral patterns in the background and enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow and off-white, accented with soft pink and green, creating a warm, romantic, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. This color choice not only highlights the character's soft temperament but also strengthens the overall harmony of the composition. The photographic style resembles shooting with vintage film cameras, featuring a slight graininess and soft out-of-focus effects, as if capturing a private and tranquil moment. The images have a strong narrative quality, evoking a quiet afternoon or the moment just waking from a dream. That lazy, relaxed, and slightly melancholic mood is perfectly captured. The entire scene exudes an artistic, vintage, and story-rich beauty, like a carefully composed oil painting with both realistic details and surreal atmosphere. It draws people in, letting you feel the gentleness and tranquility of a private space",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
