        {
          "id": "krea2-15e0ba1338df0c2796c804d6",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙桌边俏皮倚靠",
          "prompt": "She wears a white ruffled off-shoulder dress with pleated designs and fluffy sleeves. The hem is short and loose, revealing her long legs. She wears a pair of white over-the-knee knit socks with delicate lace trim at the cuff. On her feet are red Mary Jane shoes tied around the ankles, giving her a slightly playful and slightly lazy expression. Her body leans slightly forward, her left leg bent and her right leg straight. The left hand rests near the knee, surrounded by various snacks, including a plate of fresh strawberries, a sliced pomegranate, a pack of M&M's chocolate chips, a can of red drinks, a box of Skittles, a chocolate bar, and some colorful candies. These foods are casually placed on a tiled floor with green and yellow geometric patterns, set against a background of light gray cabinets with golden round handles on the doors, and above the cabinet is a beige countertop with a green jar and some vague items. Light shines from the left, creating soft shadows on the figures, creating a warm and sweet atmosphere. The tones are mainly white, red, green, and light gray, with a mid-shot perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with a slightly tilted body posture adding movement. The foreground features scattered food and floor patterns, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background features simple cabinets and walls. The soft and layered lighting creates a relaxed and pleasant moment in daily life, as if resting at home in the afternoon, full of youthful energy and sweetness, the entire scene presents a retro yet modern style, with a slight film texture and warm tones, evoking a genuine and intimate sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
