        {
          "id": "krea2-fc810f7b12df4e32d0251e3a",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙街道坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sat in the driver's seat of an old car, wearing a deep red velvet off-shoulder long dress adorned with several delicate silver snowflake-shaped decorative buttons. Over her shoulders hung a thick deep red fur shawl, and she wore a matching fur hat in the same color scheme. Her hands wore matching red velvet gloves, naturally resting on her thighs, sitting apart. Her knees reveal fair skin, and she wears high-top black patent leather boots. The boots are wrapped with thick metal chains, forming a complex cross pattern on the boot surface, giving the car a luxurious yet strong sense of industrial and restraint. The interior is mainly painted in deep red, with seats, door panels, and dashboard all made of red leather, giving a delicate texture with slight signs of age. The window edges are framed in black plastic, and through the window you can see a city street covered in snow. In the distance are several gray multi-story residential buildings with simple and practical architectural styles, neatly arranged windows, and a glooour sky showing the unique gray-white tones of winter. The ground is covered in snow, with a few bare trees scattered along both sides of the street. The overall environment feels bleak and desolate. The foreground features the front seats and steering wheel of the car. The middle ground is the main subject, while the background is the snowy landscape and architectural clusters outside the window. The layers are distinct, and returning to the figure forms a closed-loop visual loop. Light and shadow come from the diffused light from the overcast outside, soft and even, without strong shadows, yet the outline and folded details of clothing are clearly outlined. The overall atmosphere blends luxury, coldness, loneliness, and rebellion, combining the refined beauty of fashion photography with a certain postmodern urban absurdity and detachment. The painting is dominated by large areas of red. It stands in stark contrast to the monotonous gray-white exterior, highlighting the character's presence and emotional tension, as if capturing a surreal moment in an ordinary everyday scene, like a real life shot with an old film camera. It retains slight graininess and authentic texture, while carefully arranged costumes and props enhance the depth and storytelling of artistic expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
