        {
          "id": "krea2-f25b93f9e9056141762debbc",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙森林俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands deep in a sun-dappled forest, looking fresh and lively, radiating a healthy glow, as if gazing at something beautiful in the distance, revealing a calm yet slightly contemplative expression. She wears a floral dress with green and white intertwined floral patterns, an off-shoulder neckline, wide sleeves decorated with ruffles, and as she moves gently, the green pattern blends with the surroundings, creating a harmonious and unified visual effect. She gently holds a cluster of lush green grapes in her right hand, Grape grapes are round and round, with sparkling droplets on the surface, shimmering with an enticing luster under the sunlight, as if freshly picked from vines, carrying the morning dew and natural fragrance. The foreground is the main subject, occupying the main position of the composition. Her posture is slightly tilted, head slightly raised, creating an upward visual direction. The middle is a blurred green vegetation, with layers of leaves showing varying shades of green. Some leaves glow brightly under sunlight, while the background is a more blurred outline of the forest. Light and shadow intertwine, creating a soft bokeh effect. Light streams streams through the gaps in the leaves, forming golden beams of light and shadow, while also creating a contrast of light and shadow on her, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and layering. The overall composition uses a third-division method: the figure is positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the frame, leaving space on the right for the gaze to extend, creating a sense of expansive space and guiding viewers to the unknown space at the upper right of the image. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and bright, filled with the tranquility and poetry of a summer afternoon, with green as the main color tone. This creates a fresh and natural visual experience. The entire image looks as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera, featuring a slight graininess and soft tonal transitions, as if capturing a beautiful moment moments that have been unintentionally captured, full of life and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
