        {
          "id": "krea2-c2291a063db40583d8101ffd",
          "alias": "单女紫和服婚礼自信站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a deep purple traditional kimono with delicate geometric patterns, presenting a silky sheen and texture. The collar edges are trimmed with orange-red piping, adding a warm color contrast. She slung a delicate Japanese-style cloth bag across her shoulder, embroidered with hexagonal honeycomb patterns. Each hexagon is filled with vibrant floral patterns, with white lines on a black background outlining intricate details. Showcasing the exquisite craftsmanship of traditional craftsmanship, her right hand gently grips a slender umbrella handle with a black handle and white wrapped strap. The umbrella body is unextended, only part of the handle exposed, creating a subtle sense of ceremony. The background is a typical Japanese machiya building, with a dark gray tiled roof and wooden lattice window lattices forming a distinctly layered facade. The walls are built with dark bricks and stone, giving a rough and rustic texture. On the right stands a vertical wooden signboard engraved with the four calligraphic characters \"Chajia Ichimatsu,\" with bold and powerful strokes, exuding a strong cultural atmosphere. The ground is paved with bluestone slabs, with some moss and fallen leaves mixed in the gaps. Sunlight slants down from the upper left of the canvas, casting mottled shadows on the ground, illuminating the outlines and folds of clothing, creating a visual effect of alternating light and shadow. The light is soft yet penetrating, creating a peaceful and warm afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right, body three-quarters of the body, head slightly turned toward the frame, creating a tranquil gaze, with the foreground clearly showing the subject. The middle frame extends to the buildings and signboards, while the background is slightly blurred, highlighting the main subject while preserving environmental information. The overall color scheme is mainly deep purple, ink gray, and brown, accented with orange-red and yellow-white. The colors are harmonious and unified, with natural transitions of light and shadow, creating an aesthetic atmosphere that is both classical and modern. The painting strongly reflects Japanese aesthetic characteristics, blending traditional clothing, architectural elements, and natural lighting effects, presenting a poetic moment from everyday life that seems to capture a summer afternoon. A gentle moment captured by a woman strolling through an old street alley is a blend of realism and artistry, like high-quality photos taken with a professional camera in natural light. The details are rich, layered and full of narrative and emotional tension. The overall atmosphere is quiet, steady, and elegant, radiating the restrained beauty of Eastern aesthetics",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
