        {
          "id": "krea2-989ce7144cb6ae6f31023e3a",
          "alias": "单女困倦持相机",
          "prompt": "A soft contrast of light and shadow is formed, with light slanting down from the upper left, creating a dreamy and poetic atmosphere. In the foreground, a large number of blooming yellow mimosa flowers and green leaves naturally surround the composition. Some flowers are clearly visible, while others, due to depth of field, are blurred into a warm yellow halo, forming a natural frame that enhances the layering and visual guidance of the scene. The middle is the upper body outline of the woman, dressed in a garment with floral patterns. The colors echo the flowers in the background, but details are blurred to highlight the main subject. The background is a blend of blurred green plants and a pale blue sky, creating a soft gradient effect that further highlights the brightness and vividness of the foreground. The composition uses a central composition, naturally surrounded by flowers and leaves, creating a strong visual focal point. At the same time, shallow depth of field effects blur the background and some foreground elements, highlighting the main subject and creating a warm and soft light and shadow atmosphere. The dotted light spots and flowing shadows formed by sunlight penetrating the leaves add dynamism and vitality to the image. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and green, creating a bright, vibrant spring afternoon atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with moderate color saturation, combining natural realism with a touch of artistic filtering. It feels like shooting with an old film camera, with slight graininess and soft color transitions, giving a nostalgic and cozy feeling. The whole scene seems frozen in a quiet afternoon. A gentle breeze blows, floral fragrance fills the air, and harmony between people and nature fills the air with poetry and romance. The images present a beauty that is both real and transcendent, as if stepping out of a tranquil dream",
