        {
          "id": "krea2-4a0fc18c34d3a5ecc04e4440",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙害羞坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a sea of blooming purple flowers, appearing natural and lazy, revealing a gentle yet slightly shy smile, as if engaging in a silent dialogue with the viewer. She wears a white lace-trimmed dress, with delicate lace details clearly visible at the neckline and cuffs. The dress fits her body perfectly, showing elegant curves. She hugs her knees with her arms, leans slightly forward, and rests her head gently on her arms. Her posture is relaxed and comfortable, exuding a serene beauty. In the foreground is a large patch of indistinct purple flowers, with petals densely packed. It presents a dreamlike blur effect, forming soft light spots and color transitions, creating a strong sense of depth and layering. The middle ground features a woman as the main subject, positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition. Her outline is clear, creating natural obstruction and blending. The background is an endless field of purple flowers stretching into the distance, forming a dreamlike purple ocean. The flower clusters rise and fall with rich layers, while the distant flowers gradually blur, forming gradient color blocks that enhance the sense of spatial depth. The composition uses the classic center composition technique. Placing the figure in the visual focal point and using blurred flowers in the foreground as a frame, the overall composition is symmetrical and balanced. However, the posture and tilt of the head break perfect symmetry, adding a sense of dynamism and realism. The visual guide starts with the blurred clusters of flowers in the foreground, naturally transitioning along the flow of light and color to the figures in the middle of the background, then extending to the vast flower fields in the background, forming a smooth visual path. The atmosphere of light and shadow is warm and soft, with light coming from above, like golden afternoon sunlight filtering through the clouds. The entire image is coated with a hazy warm tone, making it stand out from the background. The shadows are soft and there are no abrupt shadows. The overall color palette is mainly light purple, white, and light green, complemented by golden tones from sunlight, creating a romantic, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with a slight film graininess, simulating the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. The color saturation is moderate, not exaggerated, preserving natural light and shadow transitions and color transitions. The overall style leans toward a blend of Japanese photography and pastoral poetry, combining the refinement of artistic photography with the warmth and authenticity of everyday life. It seems to capture a beautiful moment that is unintentionally captured, evoking the breath of spring and the tenderness of youth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
