        {
          "id": "krea2-927dc842671e061e00c8e3f5",
          "alias": "单女黑手套沙发坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the right side of a beige fabric sofa, her body slightly leaned back, arms crossed on the sofa backrest. Her left hand wears a black knitted long glove, while her right hand naturally rests on her left. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her expression calm yet revealing a subtle sense of detachment. She wears a black sleeveless tight dress with smooth, hugging the body, outlining a slender waistline and long limbs. Her legs are clad in dark stockings. The overall look is simple yet textured. The sofa is light beige with classic button decorations, made of soft and thick material. Warm fabric textures are presented, with a simple white wall as the background. On the left, a faint golden pillar can be seen, possibly part of a floor lamp or decorative rod. The spatial layout is clean and neat, with no unnecessary clutter. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, the body extending diagonally, creating a dynamic balance. Passing through arms and torso, it finally lands on the lines of the legs, creating a smooth visual flow. Light comes from the front left of the painting, softly and evenly illuminating the figures. It creates a warm and bright atmosphere, with subtle shadows and natural transitions, highlighting the outlines and details of the clothing. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and beige, accented with a touch of gold. The colors are harmonious and unified, giving a sense of sophistication and modernity. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the warmth of everyday life. It's like capturing real moments casually at home with ordinary equipment. The layers of light and shadow are rich, details are clear, background blur is appropriate, and the subject is highlighted. The composition is stable yet varied. Overall, it presents a tranquil, gentle, and slightly fashionable atmosphere, making it suitable for fashion photo shoots or lifestyle aesthetic creations",
          "description": "",
