        {
          "id": "krea2-4058803d4c17a583d417a1a9",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the fields at dusk, wearing a thick off-white coarse knit sweater. The sweater's texture is clearly visible in the dim light, giving off a warm and rustic feel. She leans slightly to the side, her left hand naturally lowered, and her right hand raises an old-fashioned kerosene lamp high. The lamp body is made of dark metal, with a vintage glass cover and metal handle. The flame inside burns steadily, emitting a soft and bright orange-yellow glow. This beam of light becomes the strongest source in the painting, creating a striking contrast of light and shadow, as if just about to speak or just finishing speaking. The background is a gradient twilight sky, gradually transitioning from pale purple near the horizon to deep blue above, creating a peaceful and mysterious atmosphere. Tall wild grass or reeds sway gently in the breeze, their outlines faintly visible in the darkness, creating a sense of layering between foreground and middle ground. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, making the figures appear more upright and commanding. At the same time, it enhances the dramatic effect of the image. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left, leaving space on the right side to balance the visual focus. The direction of light and shadow comes from the kerosene lamp, creating strong backlight and side lighting, while the other half falls into shadow, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow and a sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color scheme is dominated by cool blue and warm yellow, forming a classic contrast of warm and cool tones that enhance visual impact. The image presents a tranquil, lonely, and poetic atmosphere, as if recording a nighttime escape from the city's noise. As if shot with an old film camera, it has slight graininess and natural underexposure, simulating the texture of real photography. The details are rich, color saturation is moderate yet layered, emphasizing the flow of light and shadow and the realism of the environment, creating a visual experience that is both everyday and surreal. It feels as if time has frozen in this moment, with only that lamp burning alone in the darkness, guarding her fleeting tranquility",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
