        {
          "id": "krea2-308d7f59290df9bf8cf224a4",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服室内困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "The ends are slightly fluffy, as if sunlight is shining through, presenting a delicate texture. She wears a blue-and-white sailor uniform with three white stripes at the neckline. The fabric looks soft and comfortable, and the overall look is simple yet full of youthful energy. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition, with the head slightly tilted. This creates an intimate and direct visual exchange, with clear details, faintly visible pores and tiny freckles, revealing authentic human features and enhancing three-dimensionality. The middle frame extends to her shoulders and part of her torso, with the folds and textures of clothing naturally undulating under light and shadow. The background is a deep dark tone, almost completely blurred, creating a strong depth of field effect that makes the subject stand out more. In the background, some blurred halos and scattered light spots can be faintly seen, resembling soft light effects created by light sources from behind. This adds a dreamy atmosphere to the image. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space. Using low-angle downward shots, while diagonal compositional guiding lines guide the gaze deeper into the frame. Visual guidance mainly depends on the direction of the light and the posture of the characters. A warm side backlight shines from the upper left, creating a bright highlight area, while the other side is in shadow, with strong contrast between light and dark, soft and directional lighting, simulating indoor lighting or natural light at dusk. It creates a warm, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and deep blue, harmoniously matched, warm yet calm. The light and shadow transitions are natural, without rigid boundaries. The image is full of delicate light and shadow layers, with smooth gradients from bright to dark areas, providing an immersive visual experience. The visual style combines artistic and everyday elements, as if photographed indoors with a professional camera, yet retains the rustic and realistic feel of amateur equipment. Like an untouched photograph capturing a quiet moment, the overall atmosphere is serene and warm, full of youthful poetry and hazy beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
