        {
          "id": "krea2-c02a23ff471ca7f11a4ae1f5",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙桌边沉思坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of a white workbench, her body slightly leaning forward, presenting a state of contemplation and work. She wears a form-fitting gray high-neck, long-sleeve dress that reaches the middle of her thighs, outlining her long legs. She pairs it with black stockings and black suede flats. The overall look is simple yet professional, with exquisite makeup. Her left hand rests naturally on the desk, her posture elegant and confident. On the workbench sits a silver laptop facing her, with the keyboard area visible. Nearby, several design drawings or documents are scattered, featuring color charts and lines. In the upper left corner is a color sample booklet with yellowed edges, showing signs of use. On the table is a yellow pencil with the tip pointing upward, and the background is a pure, light gray-blue gradient wall with no decoration, creating a minimalist sense of interior space. The lighting is soft and even, coming from the upper front, creating a natural shadow transition. The wrinkles of the clothes and the texture of the stockings are clearly visible, with rich layers of light and shadow. The composition uses a medium perspective. The figure occupies the center to the right, in a diagonal pose, with legs crossed and extending to the left side, forming a visual guide line that enhances the sense of movement and depth. The foreground features a white workbench and table leg structure, with clear details made of wood or imitation wood with a simple A-shaped bracket design. The middle is the main figure and some desktop items, while the background is a clean solid-colored wall without unnecessary interference. The overall atmosphere is quiet, professional, and modern, carrying the everyday vibe of a designer or creative worker, with gray tones Mainly in white and black, accented with a touch of color, creating a visually balanced and harmonious look with delicate image texture, as if shot by a professional camera, but retaining slight film graininess and realistic ambient lighting effects. It presents a realistic style that is both artistic and close to life, with strong narrative and emotional expression. It is suitable for photographic works depicting professional women, creative work scenes, or fashionable lifestyle themes",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
