        {
          "id": "krea2-a2aa21d44e16015fd5e6e313",
          "alias": "单女白外套雪地忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways in a snowy winter forest, adding a touch of vitality and naturalness. She wears an off-white loose coat with a slightly open collar, revealing the outline of her dark inner garment. Around her neck is a thick, warm camel cashmere scarf, soft and fluffy, with a delicate texture and covered with specks of snow. The overall composition centers on the figure, using medium shots. The figures occupy about two-thirds of the composition, with their heads slightly tilted and gazing downward, creating an introspective, gentle, and story-rich atmosphere. The background is a hazy blue-toned snowy forest, with tall pine trees covered in thick snow. The outlines of the branches blur into soft blue-white patches, creating a shallow depth effect that makes the subject stand out. The sky shows a gradient from pale blue to white, with soft and even lighting, like diffused light on a cloudy or early morning day without obvious shadows. The overall tone is mainly cool blue, accented by warm-colored scarves. This creates a visual balance of color and emotional tension. Snowflakes continuously drift down from the sky, some clearly visible, some blurred, enhancing the sense of dynamism and realism. The overall style combines the characteristics of artistic photography and fashion portraits, creating a sense of sophistication and a cinematic narrative atmosphere It seems to capture a moment of poetic moments, with soft and delicate light and shadow, rich layers, and clear details, expressing a pure, quiet, and slightly lonely winter aesthetic. Like a carefully composed film photograph, with a slight grainy texture and natural exposure control, it presents delicate images similar to medium format cameras, emphasizing realism and emotional expression. The composition emphasizes breathing and blank space, with the figure's posture naturally relaxed, as if merging with the environment, conveying the subtle connection between humans and nature. It draws viewers into their inner world, with an overall atmosphere that is tranquil, cool, and beautiful, full of poetry and emotional appeal. It is suitable for magazine covers, personal art photos, or emotional visual creations",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
