        {
          "id": "krea2-fad47a6b36e1d69e0a35ede0",
          "alias": "男女黑西装厨房冷淡坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a black, modern-style chair, wearing a finely tailored black suit with long sleeves featuring ruffled trim, a black ribbon at the neckline, a black short skirt and sheer black stockings, and a pair of high-heeled pointed shoes with red soles. The overall look is elegant and powerful, naturally draped over her shoulders. Her makeup is refined, her expression cold yet confident, her right hand gently touching her chest, fingers long, nails painted with white nails, her posture calm and expressive, body slightly leaning forward, legs crossed The left leg is in front and the right leg behind, forming graceful lines. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the center-left position of the frame. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure entering from above the knee. The background is a minimalist modern interior space, with pure white walls and a gray cement floor. On the right side is a small black round table, on which sits a white marble sculpture depicting a man with his head bowed in thought. His posture is restrained, with delicate detail. On the wall hangs a large black-and-white artwork depicting an abstract human figure, presenting a flowing texture. On the left, part of the kitchen area is visible, featuring white cabinets and appliances. The overall environment is clean and tidy, with black, white, and gray as the main color scheme, creating a space that blends minimalism with a sense of luxury. Light comes from the front side, soft and directional, with shadows concentrated behind the body and on the floor, enhancing the sense of depth. The contrast between light and shadow is strong but not excessive, maintaining the delicate texture of the composition. The composition is balanced, with figures centered slightly to the left, and sculptures and paintings distributed as visual balance points on the right, creating a left-right echo. Emphasizing its presence and emotional expression, the overall atmosphere is calm, restrained, and slightly mysterious, like a fashionable portrait in a private studio, yet still retaining the casualness and authenticity of everyday life. It is like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera in natural indoor light, with the lens focusing on the subject, the background slightly blurred, highlighting the subject, moderate color saturation, rich details, natural clothing folds, and realistic material expression, including the semi-transparent texture of the stockings and the sheen of the suit fabric. The entire visuals present an aesthetic style that blends fashion, art, and everyday life, combining the professionalism of a commercial blockbuster with a warm, everyday atmosphere. Like a carefully planned personal showcase, it records a quiet moment of self-expression. The composition is stable, the layers distinct, the visual guidance smooth, the use of light and shadow precise, and the atmosphere well-crafted, delivering a strong visual impact and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
