        {
          "id": "krea2-ae1b8b8834e252e769fe5a29",
          "alias": "单女粉睡裙床困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed covered with soft white sheets, wearing a light pink silk nightdress with exquisite design. The upper part features a crossed bow strap, with lace cutouts on the chest. The waist and sides are adorned with delicate lace trim, the skirt is light and flowing, slightly revealing the leg lines. The overall look is elegant and slightly sexy, naturally draped over the shoulders. She wears a slender gold necklace with a small round pendant. She wears a simple pair of pearl earrings on her earlobes, her makeup exquisite, and her expression is gentle yet tinged with allure. Her body leans slightly back, one hand gently propped behind her back, the other naturally resting on her leg, her posture relaxed and full of tension. In the foreground is the bed surface and part of her lower body. The sheets are rich in folds and gives off a soft sheen. A pink cushion is faintly visible at the headboard, edged with ruffles. Light streams in through the large window behind her, creating a soft backlighting effect. The window frame is clearly visible, and the curtains are made of white sheer fabric. With good light transmission, sunlight filters through the curtain and casts mottled shadows. The background is a blurry view outside the window, with faint outlines of green plants visible, creating a hazy outdoor atmosphere. The composition uses a center, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center. The shallow depth of field highlights the subject, and the background is blurred to enhance spatial layering. Meanwhile, the folds of the bedsheet and the direction of light also provide guidance. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, mainly in warm yellow tones. Sunlight streams in from the left, highlighting the luster of silk and the texture of the skin The overall atmosphere is romantic, private, and poetic, as if capturing a tranquil moment in the lazy early morning or afternoon. It has a strong artistic sense and cinematic texture, while retaining the realism of everyday photography with a phone or camera. The details are rich, colors harmoniously unified, with tones leaning toward pinkish-white and warm yellow, creating a gentle and dreamy visual experience",
