        {
          "id": "krea2-09a9649c602cd93d5dc19475",
          "alias": "单女白T恤小径俏皮站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands before a dark wooden vertical striped background, exuding a calm and joyful mood. She wears a simple white spaghetti-strap camisole top, with slender straps outlining a graceful shoulder and neck line. She holds a transparent glass teacup in both hands, the cup shaped smoothly with a small handle. Inside the cup is a plump, bright red strawberry, covered with tiny seeds, vividly colored, with green leaves dotted throughout, looking full of vitality. Her fingers are slender, and her nails are neatly trimmed. On the left ring finger, a simple silver ring is worn, and the hand poses are natural. The main focus is on the interaction between the figure and the teacup, with a clear teacup and strawberry in the foreground. The details are rich, and the reflection and refraction effects of the transparent glass are obvious. Light passes through the cup wall to create a soft highlight, and the red of the strawberry stands out against the cool background. The middle is the upper body of the figure, from the chest up to the head, with a dark green or dark green wooden wall in the background, vertical wood grain clearly visible, and the surface slightly rough. There are natural textures and subtle scratches that create a rustic and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a centered technique, with the figure centered to form a visual focal point. At the same time, the contrast of light and shadow enhances the sense of three-dimensionality. On the left, slanted warm yellow sunlight enters from outside the frame, forming a bright beam with soft edges, producing slight halos and scattering effects, filling the overall scene with warmth. The shadowed areas display deep cool tones, creating a warm and cool contrast that forms a natural visual path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by soft side backlighting, with sunlight slanting from the upper left, highlighting the contours and three-dimensionality. The overall tone is cool with a retro film texture, with moderate color saturation. The red strawberries become the strongest color highlight in the image, forming a sharp contrast with the cool green background. There is also slight graininess and slight overexposure, simulating the effects of vintage camera photography, enhancing realism and nostalgia. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, gentle, and healing, carrying a touch of artistic and everyday poetry. It is as if capturing the most ordinary yet touching moment of afternoon sunlight; the images are rich in detail, layered, and possess strong emotional expression and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
