        {
          "id": "krea2-35b4d95965984c87ae869c3e",
          "alias": "单女森林沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "deep within the forest, a woman stands sideways, wearing a simple light gray short-sleeved top. The fabric is light and soft, with subtle pleats and drapes. The sleeves are slightly loose, gently swaying in the breeze, drifting with the wind, adding a touch of laziness and rebellion. She carries a thoughtful expression, as if you can feel the rise and fall of her breath. Her body leans forward slightly, her head slightly tilted back, forming a gentle S-shaped curve. Her posture is natural and unpretentious, as if in a conversation with her surroundings. In the foreground, A bright orange-red beam of light slanted down from the upper right of the frame, cutting through the darkness like a lightsaber. The beam's edges are blurred and soft, with subtle halos and scattering effects inside, creating a texture similar to lens halos. This beam forms a strong color contrast with the blue spots in the background, enhancing the visual tension of the image. At the same time, the beam passes through gaps in the branches, partially obscuring the figure's outline and creating a richly layered interplay of light and shadow. In the middle shot, the tree branches crisscross, twisted and rugged, with rough bark. The texture is clearly visible, with slender branches extending in a radial pattern. Some branches are adorned with sparse dead leaves or vines, forming silhouettes against a dark background, adding depth and mystery to the composition. In the distance, the background is a dense forest. Due to the shallow depth of field, the background gradually blurs, presenting large areas of black and dark brown tones, dotted with several round or oval blue light spots. These spots are bokeh effects created by sunlight filtering through the leaves, varying in size and distributed in a well-arranged manner, with some edges being soft. Some have faint starlight, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The entire composition adopts an asymmetrical left-centered layout, with the figure positioned on the left side of the frame and the gaze facing right, forming a smooth visual flow. At the same time, there is a lot of blank space at the top of the image, enhancing the sense of openness and ethereal feel. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from the upper right of the image, combining backlight and side backlight, making the character's outline outlined by a golden edge of light, creating a natural transition between light and shadow, and the light creating a distinct Tyndall effect in the air. You can see the fine dust particles in the beam path, enhancing realism and immersion. The overall color scheme mainly features warm and cool contrasts, with a deep blue-black background, while the foreground and main area are illuminated by warm orange-yellow light, creating a strong emotional contrast. It conveys a sense of loneliness and contemplation, while also embodying hope and vitality. The entire image has a strong artistic photography style, as if shot by a full-frame camera paired with a large-aperture prime lens, using slow shutters or long exposures to capture the path of light. It also uses manual focus and high ISO settings to retain film-like graininess and natural noise, presenting a realistic image that is both technical and warm, full of poetry and philosophical thought, evoking the intimate relationship between youth, growth, self-exploration, and nature.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
