        {
          "id": "krea2-24e4765da1e83886aa22a53c",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣床俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed covered with a soft white knit blanket, wearing a loose white chunky knit cardigan with a white lace strapless top underneath, white shorts, and thick white knit socks that reach the knees. The overall look is simple yet warm, full of feeling. In the foreground is her seated lower body and a pair of high-calf knit socks, with the cuffs folded at the ankles, creating natural folds and layers. Next to them are white plush slippers with beige wooden soles. The surface of the slippers is soft and fluffy, with clear details. The center is the main part of her upper body and entire body, with the white cardigan's texture clearly visible. The zipper is slightly undone, revealing lace details on the inner layer. Her shoulders are graceful, her collarbones well-defined, and in the background is a huge, cute teddy bear with a light brown plush texture. On the right is a white cushion decorated with buttons, with delicate stitching and three-dimensional lace along the edges, adding layers to the composition. The bedsheet is made of white knitted fabric, dotted with tiny colorful dots such as red, blue, yellow, and green, adding a lively touch to the pure white tone. The composition combines close-up and middle shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, and the teddy bear occupying the left. This creates visual balance, using the characters' gaze to guide the audience's attention. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and bright, with natural light from the front slightly left, evenly illuminating the characters and scenes without strong shadows, creating a warm and comfortable indoor environment. The overall color palette is mainly white, off-white, and light brown, pure and soft with rich textures, including plush fabrics, knits, lace, and other materials with delicate expression, giving the scene a warm everyday feel. It feels like real-life moments captured with a regular home camera or phone, with slight film graininess and real exposure, emphasizing authenticity rather than excessive embellishment. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, sweet, and healing, full of youthful energy and home comfort",
