          "id": "krea2-344139b35970d98e842ef27a",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣街道沉思站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a sidewalk on a city street, wearing a light blue short-sleeved knit top and a pink floral high-waisted skirt. The hem gently lifts in the wind, presenting dynamic pleats and flow. She wears beige stiletto sandals, striking a natural and elegant pose. Her left hand gently holds an off-white canvas bag printed with the word \"DOVE,\" while her right hand hangs naturally and is slightly raised. The overall aura is fresh and sweet. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center, with a medium perspective in the composition, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the height. The background is a modern urban street scene. On the right side stands a black convertible sports car, its smooth body reflective and exquisitely designed wheels. In the distance, a white sedan can be seen driving by. The background building features reddish-brown brick walls, with multiple layers of windows neatly arranged. Some windows reflect the sky's light. Green trees are planted in front of the buildings, their leaves shining bright green in the sunlight. The street floor is paved with gray square stone bricks, with clear gaps and interlaced light and shadow. Sunlight slants down from the upper right, casting soft shadows on the ground and on the figures. The contrast of light and shadow is striking, creating a transition between light and shadow and creating a warm and bright afternoon atmosphere. The sky is clear, slightly tinged with light blue, with no clouds. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, light blue, pink, and off-white, with harmonious and unified colors. The image has a strong sense of daily life and life, as if shot with a regular camera or phone, with slight film graininess and natural color distortion. The overall style leans toward Japanese photo shoots, emphasizing realism and delicate textures, capturing fleeting natural beauty. The details are rich, layered distinctly, light and shadow are delicate, clothing textures are clear, background blur is appropriate, and the main subject is highlighted. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, full of youthful energy and the romantic vibe of urban life",
