        {
          "id": "krea2-aa090892b168f4d8863544c9",
          "alias": "单女紫毛衣雪地困倦站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a winter snowy landscape, wearing a soft light purple coarse knit sweater with clearly visible texture, presenting a warm and comfortable feel. Her long sleeves hang naturally, revealing gray knit gloves at the wrist, covered with a thin layer of snowflakes. She slightly tilts her head back, as if softly wishing or marveling at the falling snowflakes, vivid and real. She raises her right hand, palm facing upward, gently lifting a handful of snow. The snowflakes scatter and dance in the air, forming sparkling trails. Some snowflakes glow faintly white under the light, while others, blurred by movement, appear as soft, dynamic shadows, creating a light and ethereal atmosphere. The background is streets and building silhouettes covered in thick snow. The lines of buildings are simple and modern, windows and eaves are piled with white snow, and the overall scene is shallow and deep blurred, presenting a hazy blue-purple hue. The contrast between the figures in the foreground and cool is that the sky is gray and hazy, with snowflakes falling continuously, enveloping the entire scene in a tranquil, In the dreamy and slightly melancholic blue, cool-toned light and shadows come from diffused light on cloudy days, soft and even, with no obvious shadows. However, through high-contrast color processing with a slight cool-toned filter, the overall image appears cooler and pureer. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, gazing upward to the left, creating a sense of visual flow. The foreground features many scattered snowflakes, some of which form slight out-of-focus light spots in front of the lens, enhancing spatial layering. The middle shot is the main subject, rich in detail. The background completely blends into the blurry snowy landscape, creating a strong contrast in front and back depth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, like a moment frozen by time, full of the unique romance and innocence of winter. It seems to capture a person's childlike innocence and the beauty of nature in the snow. Using professional photography equipment, such as a full-frame camera paired with a large-aperture prime lens, it captures delicate light and shadow changes and rich color layers. The image has a cinematic texture with moderate color saturation, dominated by cool blue. Accented with warm pink sweaters creates a harmonious contrast of cool and warm tones, highlighting the main subject while preserving authentic snow scene details. The overall style combines artistry with a sense of everyday life, featuring a carefully designed aesthetic composition while maintaining a sense of authenticity and intimacy in everyday life",
          "description": "",
