        {
          "id": "krea2-d04e342a77c20d640b06314d",
          "alias": "单女棕外套雪地忧伤倚靠过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman holding a transparent umbrella on a snowy winter day, looking directly at the camera. She wears a warm brown coat made of thick and soft material, with light snow on the shoulders and cuffs. An off-white knitted scarf loosely wraps around her neck, with fine woven patterns along the edges. Part of the scarf drapes over her shoulders, covered with scattered snowflakes. Her posture is slightly turned to the side, body leaning forward, holding the umbrella in her left hand. The umbrella surface is transparent and the edges are clearly visible, the umbrella's ribs are faintly discernible, creating a small shelter space beneath the umbrella. Snowflakes drift slowly from the sky, presenting a realistic and natural dynamic feel. The background is a blurry white snowy scene, with the outlines of snow-covered trees faintly visible in the distance. The overall composition uses shallow depth of field, with the background blurred into soft white light spots. The composition centers on the person centered to the right, leaving space on the left to extend the line of sight and create visual balance. The lighting is a soft, diffused light from a cloudy sky with no strong shadows. The overall color palette is mainly cool white and warm brown, creating a warm and cool contrast. It creates a quiet yet slightly lonely atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with the graininess of film photography and slight color shifts, as if shot with an old camera. It has the rustic feel of everyday amateur equipment, while retaining the refinement and emotional expression of artistic portraiture. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with figures standing out clearly in the foreground. The middle ground features falling snowflakes and parts under the umbrella, while the background is a hazy snowy field and distant trees. The umbrella's curve and the direction of the scarf extend around the frame, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil, gentle, and slightly poetic. It seems to capture a moment of loneliness and beauty, suitable for image creation that expresses winter emotions or artistic themes",
