        {
          "id": "krea2-b84810515be6d8fb83f4955a",
          "alias": "单女白外套雪地俏皮站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the snow, arms spread wide and naturally falling over her shoulders, slightly tilting her head back to look at the camera, revealing her white teeth. Her overall posture is relaxed and cheerful, as if embracing the winter sunshine. She wears an off-white loose wool coat layered with a white sweatshirt printed with the word \"COLLEGE,\" and a bright red thick knit scarf around her neck. The scarf is fluffy and thick with tassels at the ends, creating a strong visual contrast with the cool-toned snowy scene. She wears a beige vertical striped long skirt below. Over it, a khaki trench coat is draped casually over the shoulders, the belt hangs naturally, and light-colored boots are worn. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, with the figure occupying the main position. The background is a snow-covered hillside and sparse pine forests. In the distance, the mountains rise and fall, the sky is clear and cloudless, the sun is bright, and light shines from the upper right, casting soft shadows on the snow. The layers of light and shadow are rich. The foreground is a snow-covered ground, with a smooth surface but with slight textures and footprints. The middle shot features the figure and nearby snowy fields, with distant mountains, trees, several utility poles, and a corner of a white building in the background. The composition uses low-angle shots to enhance the character's sense of depth and presence, then spreads outward to the snowy mountains and forests, creating a sense of open space. The colors are mainly cool tones, with the blue sky, white snow, and the warm red scarf of the characters forming a striking contrast. The overall atmosphere is bright and cheerful, full of the fresh air and youthful energy of winter. The image texture is delicate and rich, giving it the feel of authentic photography. It feels as if you were shooting with a professional camera on a clear winter day. The lens has a slight film graininess and natural halo, presenting a beautiful moment from everyday life that you might not notice beforehand. The lighting is soft and clear, tonal transitions are natural, color saturation is moderate, neither exaggerated nor dim, and the overall image is clean and transparent, full of life and artistic beauty, giving a feeling of warmth, freedom, and happiness—like a ray of sunshine captured in the cold winter, allowing people to feel the beauty and hope of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
