          "alias": "单女白T恤床叛逆躺",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side on a soft bed, exuding a lazy yet slightly rebellious youthful vibe, revealing a thoughtful expression, as if immersed in some tranquil thought. She wears a white spaghetti-strap camisole with soft and natural shoulder lines, her overall posture relaxed and graceful, presenting an effortless beauty. The tomato surface is smooth and rounded, with a natural sheen and distinct stem. Another tomato rests on the edge of the pillow. The three tomatoes create a visual echo and sense of rhythm. The composition uses close-ups to highlight the subtle relationship between people and objects. The middle ground shows her shoulders, arms, and part of her body contours. The background features blurred striped curtains and blue plaid fabric. The orange and white vertical striped curtains present warm tones under the light, while the blue plaid fabric brings a touch of calm contrast. The background blur enhances spatial layering, making the subject stand out more. The composition is arranged diagonally. The figure extends from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a diagonal line guiding the view. The tomato placement also creates a visual triangle structure, enhancing image stability. Light comes from the left, creating a contrast of light and shadow, with natural transitions of light and shadow, creating a warm atmosphere of morning or afternoon sunlight filtering through the window screen. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and orange, paired with cool green and blue tones, creating a visual effect that blends warmth and coolness. The image texture is delicate, with a slight graininess and a film-like retro filter, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera It retains the warmth and realism of film photography, emphasizing poetic moments overlooked in daily life. The entire scene is full of life atmosphere yet still artistic, conveying a tranquil, gentle, and slightly humorous everyday aesthetic. The composition is compact but not crowded, the elements cleverly laid out, combining narrative and visual impact. The colors are harmonious and unified, with delicate and rich light and shadow, creating a space that is both intimate and open, allowing people to feel the unique charm of ordinary moments",
