        {
          "id": "krea2-477a8503dd0b919583f6d3d1",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙庭院忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways outdoors in a natural setting, wearing a light beige loose long-sleeve dress with a naturally draped hem, delicate pleated texture and subtle texture. The neckline is simple, with elastic details at the shoulders, and a waist tie forming a soft waistline. The overall look presents a gentle and lazy Eastern aesthetic style, adding a touch of liveliness and casualness. Her expression is calm yet tinged with a hint of melancholy and contemplation, with a natural blush. In her right hand, she gently carries a delicately woven rattan basket. The basket is cylindrical with clear grain, and the wooden handle feels authentic. The left hand hangs naturally, the posture relaxed, the body slightly leaned back, and the head looks back at the camera, gently gazing at the viewer, creating a quiet and interactive atmosphere. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of center of the composition, using a mid-shot portrait composition. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the height of the frame, with blurred deep green vegetation. The layers of tree branches and leaves are rich, with mottled light and shadow, presenting a soft bokeh effect. Light streams diagonally from the upper left, forming a warm backlit contour. Golden halos glow around the edges, and the overall lighting is even and layered. The tones are mainly warm yellow, off-white, and gray-green, with low saturation, creating a nostalgic, tranquil, and slightly poetic atmosphere. The image has a film-like grainy texture and slight overexposure, as if frozen in a moment shot with an old-fashioned camera. The viewing angle is horizontally with slight downward view, the background depth is noticeably blurred, highlighting the subject and creating a balanced and harmonious composition, forming a smooth visual flow. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and full of life. Like the moment the afternoon sunlight pours into the courtyard, one can feel the slow flow of time and inner peace",
