        {
          "id": "krea2-9db88b78b5bac53b505f0633",
          "alias": "单女短裙摄影棚自信倚靠手持物",
          "prompt": "Her body leans slightly to the right, her right hand gently caresses her swollen belly, while her left hand holds up a black-and-white ultrasound photo of the fetus. Her overall posture is elegant and composed, showcasing the brilliance of motherhood and the hope of life. The composition uses a medium-length portrait, with the figure occupying the left central position to form a visual focal point. The body lines are smooth and graceful, with full and rounded curves. The hem of the skirt closely follows the figure, outlining the curve of the baby bump. The knit texture is clearly visible, featuring fine vertical stripes and subtle pleats. The dress is adorned with irregular black abstract patterns, adding artistic and design flair. The foreground is a close-up of the pregnant woman's upper body and hands, highlighting her expressions, movements, and the ultrasonic images in her hands. The middle ground presents the entire body, highlighting the beauty and strength of pregnancy. The background is a pure light gray-brown gradient wall with no distractions, creating a simple and tranquil atmosphere with balanced and stable composition. Turning to the right hand and ultrasound image, a natural visual flow is formed. Light and shadow come from the front left side, softly and evenly illuminating the subject. Shadow transitions are smooth, with subtle shadow layers on the neck and collarbone. The abdomen and arms have rich light and shadow variations, highlighting skin texture and clothing texture. The overall lighting is warm and soft, colors harmonious and unified, creating a warm, tranquil, and loving atmosphere, as if recording a precious and intimate moment, with the texture of a professional studio shoot. At the same time, it preserves authentic emotional warmth and the breath of life, with slightly blurred backgrounds to enhance the subject's prominence. The overall composition is clean and tidy, without unnecessary decoration, emphasizing the characters' emotional expression and life themes, conveying hopes and care for new life, as well as the sacredness and beauty of the mother's role, presenting a mathematical style that is both modern and classic, combining artistic beauty with emotional depth",
