        {
          "id": "krea2-0832a6688dec0e543fc3857b",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫摄影棚冷淡站立展示",
          "prompt": "A woman presents a bust portrait, wearing a loose white shirt with delicate texture, slight pleats and natural drape. Several pearl buttons adorn the cuffs, adding delicate details. The collar of the shirt is slightly open, revealing the neck line. The overall look is simple yet stylish, appearing casual and layered. Her right hand is raised, fingers long, and her nails are painted with black and white geometric nail designs, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, with light shining in from the side. At the same time, warm orange-yellow highlights appear on the backs of the hands and fingertips. This contrast of cool and warm tones enhances the dramatic tension of the image. The background is a pure light gray wall with no unnecessary elements, highlighting the main subject. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving a blank space on the right to create a sense of breathing and visual balance. The angle of view slightly tilts upward, making the figure appear more upright. The head is slightly tilted, the posture is natural and unforced, with a slight soft-focus effect, as if professionally photographed with lighting. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere leans towards minimalism and modern art styles. The lighting has strong directionality, presenting a studio-like lighting effect while retaining the texture of authentic shooting. There are no unnecessary decorations or distractions; all focus is on the characters' expressions, postures, and light interactions, presenting an overall quiet, restrained, and emotionally charged artistic atmosphere. Like a photographic piece from a high-end fashion magazine, it combines a sense of everyday life with sophistication. It feels as if a medium-format film camera was used to shoot indoors with natural and artificial fill lighting, capturing a fleeting inner world. The image is delicate and layered, featuring precise digital post-processing control and the graininess and warmth of film photography, conveying an emotional tone of loneliness, contemplation, and self-reflection. It seems to tell a story about identity, expression, and concealment, with rigorous composition, meticulous lighting and shadow, and harmonious color unity, showcasing a restrained yet elegant aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
