        {
          "id": "krea2-d935e18c5ecc1c69e8d1223b",
          "alias": "单女紫毛衣雪地微笑站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a snowy winter street, naturally draped over her shoulders, looking especially lively. She wears a pair of white plush earmuffs, which are soft and fluffy, complementing her warm smile. She shows off her neat, white teeth, full of smile and tenderness. She wears a light purple coarse knit sweater with clearly visible texture, presenting a classic twisted pattern with delicate trim at the neckline and cuffs. The overall look is both warm and textured. Her body is slightly turned to the camera, and her head is slightly turned. forming an elegant half-body pose, as if silently communicating with the viewer. The background is a blurred snowy landscape, with the distant silhouettes of snow-covered buildings faintly visible. The rooftops are covered with thick white snow, windows and door frames appear faintly in cool tones, creating a peaceful and dreamlike atmosphere. Fine snowflakes continuously fall from the sky, each one clearly visible, slowly rotating and dancing in the air, adding a sense of dynamism and layering to the scene. The entire scene is enveloped in soft blue and white tones. The light comes from diffused light from cloudy days, evenly spreading over the characters and surroundings without strong shadows, making the image clean and pure. The composition is positioned slightly to the right of the center, with a shallow depth effect blurring the background. The snowflake particles in the front are clearly distinguishable, adding depth and realism to the image. Visual guidance starts with the characters' smiles, forming a natural sight path. The delicate handling of light and shadow enhances the sense of three-dimensionality, creating an overall warm and romantic atmosphere with a touch of winter tranquility and poetry. It feels as if a fleeting beautiful memory has been captured, as if shot with an old film camera, with slight graininess and soft color transitions, presenting a sense of realism and the atmosphere of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The images are full of emotional warmth, allowing people to feel the purest joy and beauty of winter",
