        {
          "id": "krea2-5787269634dac531358f1791",
          "alias": "单女白T恤沙发坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden floor, slightly tilting her head toward the camera. She wears a simple white V-neck short-sleeve T-shirt and gray sports shorts, sitting barefoot cross-legged in a relaxed and natural posture. In her right hand, she holds a bottle of Starbucks ready-to-drink coffee. The transparent bottle reveals the coffee liquid and brand logo inside. Her fingers gently grip the bottle, while her left hand rests softly on her right knee. Her body leans forward slightly, presenting a casual yet elegant posture. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, and the composition uses a medium perspective The figure occupies the main part of the composition, with the background showing the indoor home environment. On the right is a blue fabric sofa with clean and modern lines, soft and comfortable material. Behind it is a potted green plant with lush leaves and bright colors, adding a touch of vitality to the scene. The walls are light-colored with slight texture, and the light is soft and even. Natural light from the left streams through the window into the room, creating a warm light and shadow effect. The overall color palette is mainly white, blue, green, and wood tones, creating a fresh and tranquil atmosphere with natural light and shadow transitions. The background blur is well handled, making the subject stand out more. The visual guidance focuses on the person and the coffee bottle in their hands. The entire scene exudes the warmth of everyday life and the refined beauty of artistic photography. It feels like shooting with an entry-level mirrorless camera, using a large-aperture lens to capture real moments of life. The image quality is delicate, details rich, color fidelity is high, and it is full of the atmosphere and warmth of everyday life, allowing people to feel relaxed and comfortable at home",
