        {
          "id": "krea2-047f0d44144f504b3665dc0d",
          "alias": "单女蓝和服窗边忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a traditional Japanese room, dressed in a blue-and-white kimono yukata with delicate floral patterns and geometric stripes, presenting an elegant Eastern aesthetic. She sits cross-legged, her posture natural and relaxed, hands gently resting on her knees, head slightly lowered to gaze ahead, her expression gentle and serene, tinged with a hint of melancholy and contemplation, adding softness and spontaneity. Light streams in diagonally through the left window, passing through the wooden lattice window (shoji), creating soft light and shadow patterns and contrasting light and shadow. It highlights the delicate texture of the skin and the details of the garment's folds. In the foreground is a white bedsheet or tatami mat spread on the floor, soft and slightly wrinkled, creating a sense of layering with the figure. The middle ground features a female subject, occupying the left central position. The composition uses a third-division method, with the figure slightly tilted and the body forming an S-curve, enhancing visual dynamism. The background is a typical Japanese indoor environment, with wooden walls and sliding doors clearly visible. The light-colored shoji paper emits a hazy light, creating a tranquil and far-reaching spatial feel. The overall color scheme is warm yellow White and deep blue are the main colors, harmoniously unified and full of life and artistic beauty. The lens uses a mid-focus angle, simulating amateur camera effects. The slight graininess and natural exposure control make the image more realistic. Light and shadow cast from the upper left, creating soft shadow transitions that highlight three-dimensional contours. The atmosphere is warm and tranquil, as if capturing a private moment in the early morning or afternoon, infused with nostalgia and poetry. The composition is simple yet rich in detail, then turning to the background light and shadow space to create a smooth visual flow Overall, it presents a subtle elegance and tranquil beauty found in everyday life, reminiscent of real scenes shot with an old film camera, preserving its original texture and warmth",
