        {
          "id": "krea2-38a0eb5e3ae7f3fa71e0f6ce",
          "alias": "单女金连衣裙户外忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors on the grass, wearing a light yellow silk slip dress adorned with delicate embroidery. The fabric is light and soft, subtly revealing the glow of her skin. The hem naturally falls to the ground, creating a soft layering effect with the grass and adding a touch of laziness and privacy. She lowers her head, her expression calm and slightly melancholic, as if lost in her own thoughts. Her hands are folded on her knees, fingers slender and long, nails neatly trimmed, and her hand posture relaxed naturally, presenting a reserved gentleness. On the left side of the frame, a cluster of light green hydrangea branches and leaves extends into the frame. The leaves are rounded and full, with fresh and natural colors. The branches curve naturally, creating a semi-covered, semi-covered, and poetic atmosphere. The background is a blurred dark green grassland and faintly visible wooden or stone floors. The blurring makes the subject stand out, and the composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space and a slightly overhead view. It emphasizes the posture and emotional expression of the figures. The plants in the foreground visually balance and interact with the figures. The light and shadows are soft and even, like natural light on cloudy or evening days. The light shines from above, highlighting the texture and contours of the skin. The overall color palette is mainly cool green and warm yellow, creating a quiet, cool, and slightly warm atmosphere. The image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and color shifts that enhance realism and nostalgia. The shooting equipment resembles a full-frame camera paired with a prime lens. With precise depth control, natural background blur, and rich details, the entire image conveys an atmosphere of solitude, contemplation, and harmony between nature and people, as if a private moment frozen by time, full of storytelling and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
