        {
          "id": "krea2-337f5c7ad7ae94ea9bea5c31",
          "alias": "单女黑长裤屋顶忧伤坐回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the corner of a wooden pavilion, wearing a loose black short-sleeved top and black-and-white plaid pants. Her legs are slightly bent, her body leaning slightly back against the dark wooden railing. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, while her right hand rests gently on the beam behind her. Her posture is relaxed yet slightly lazy. She turns her head to look back at the camera, as if she is about to speak or has just finished speaking. The overall composition uses close-ups: the figure occupies the right two-thirds of the frame, with her head slightly tilted, creating a subtle interaction between her gaze and the viewer. In the foreground, a blurred wooden structure is visible. This includes a sturdy dark brown pillar and a horizontal railing that partially obscures the figure's body, enhancing the sense of spatial layering. The middle ground is the main subject, clearly prominent. The background is a blurred dense forest, with layers of green vegetation. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled light spots, creating a beautiful bokeh effect. The tree shadows sway, creating a peaceful and vibrant atmosphere. The sky is faintly visible, with a pale blue hue. Light streams in from the upper right, forming a warm golden beam, while leaving deep shadows on the other side. The strong contrast of light and shadow highlights three-dimensionality and texture. The overall tone of the scene is warm, dominated by natural light, with a slight film graininess and vintage tones, presenting a realistic moment casually captured in daily life, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. The lens slightly defocus and edge halos, with a dark roof structure in the upper left corner of the frame, adding a sense of enclosure and privacy. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and slightly melancholic, full of life and poetic beauty. The composition cleverly uses framed elements. For example, wooden beams and railings form natural frames, with a clear visual center and harmonious color combinations. Low-saturation colors like black, white, gray, green, and brown intertwine to create a rustic yet sophisticated visual experience. The details are rich, from the textures of clothing to the veins of plants, all clearly visible but not overly sharp, maintaining a soft visual impression. Overall, it presents a realistic, natural, and story-rich visual style, like a casual snapshot of life, recording a moment of tranquility and reflection in the afternoon sunlight",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
