        {
          "id": "krea2-f60bb8c9338e8662ef2f9a79",
          "alias": "单女白T恤城市忧伤坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a brown leather curved armchair, her body slightly leaned back, her left hand resting under her head, her right hand naturally resting on her left arm. Her posture is lazy and relaxed, her expression gentle and calm, wearing a white sleeveless tight tank top and light-colored shorts. The clothes fit her body perfectly, showcasing natural curves. The overall look is simple yet elegant, with the main subject positioned slightly to the right center, occupying the visual center. In the foreground is the curved contour of the chair and part of the legs covering it, creating a natural framing effect. The background is a blurred green forest outside the window. Sunlight filters through the leaves into the room, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. The window frame is a deep green, echoing the green background and creating a tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space, highlighting the main subject while retaining some environmental information. The view is slightly overlooked, enhancing intimacy and immersion. Light enters through the left window, creating a soft side light. The shadow transitions naturally and layeredly, creating a warm and soft light and shadow atmosphere with the texture of morning or afternoon sunlight. The overall color palette is warm yellow and brown White and green are the main colors, harmoniously unified. The image has a strong sense of daily life and life, as if captured casually on a quiet afternoon with a regular camera. The moment is authentic and natural, without excessive embellishment, presenting a rustic beauty. The image details are rich, the clothing wrinkles naturally, the leather texture lifelike, the leaf blur outside the window is delicately handled, and the background blur is moderate, maintaining the presence of the environment without disturbing the subject. The overall image is filled with poetic and tranquil atmosphere. Like a snapshot of modern urban life, it captures the most authentic and relaxed state of the characters, conveying a leisurely and carefree attitude toward life. The photography style leans toward documentary aesthetics, emphasizing the authenticity of moments and the emotional expression. The composition is simple yet layered, and the use of light and shadow is skillful, creating a warm and moving image. The entire scene seems frozen by time, frozen in this tranquil moment, allowing one to feel a subtle melancholy and beautiful mood. The images present a sophisticated everyday aesthetic. It is both artistic and intimate, as if captured as a precious memory taken on an ordinary day",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
