        {
          "id": "krea2-ff56b0674ff6850de534505b",
          "alias": "多人毛衣桌边忧伤倚靠",
          "prompt": "The knit texture of a blue turtleneck sweater is clearly visible, with the cuffs snuggling against the wrist, creating a warm and comfortable feel. On the left side of the painting, a vintage-style desk lamp partially blocks the mirror. The lampshade is in a warm yellow tone, with soft light shining through inside, forming a bright halo that injects a warm atmosphere into the entire scene. The window frame edges are clearly visible, and outside is a blurred natural light, faintly reflecting the cool-toned daylight, contrasting with the warm indoor light. The background bookshelf has a blurred outline, with several books and some old items placed on it, creating a quiet and lively corner of a study or café. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space, heads slightly tilted, forming a natural visual flow. The light and shadow are handled delicately, with the main light source coming from the upper left desk lamp mixed with natural light outside the window, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall tone leans toward a cool tone, mainly blue-gray, but the lamp area is warm yellow-orange, creating a contrast between cool and warm. It creates a quiet, introspective, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The images have the texture of film photography, with obvious graininess, moderate color saturation, and rich but not overly sharp details, as if captured with an old-fashioned camera. The lens focal length is precisely controlled, the subject is clear while the background is naturally blurred, emphasizing emotional expression and inner exploration. The overall style combines artistry with a sense of life, like a moment of quiet reflection in a café on an afternoon—authentic and moving",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
