        {
          "id": "krea2-e1b039a02c621dd38b8c6672",
          "alias": "单女黑袜子沙发俏皮倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman lounges leisurely on a white fabric sofa, legs raised high against the window, toes touching, wearing black over-the-knee socks and black shorts, revealing her long legs. She wears a loose beige knit sweater with sleeves casually rolled up to her elbows, featuring natural cutouts on the shoulders, showcasing a laid-back and relaxed style. She holds a vintage silver film camera, the lens slightly directed at herself, carrying a playful and serene expression. The overall pose presents a moment that is both everyday and artistic. The foreground is the main part of her body, occupying the left center from head to knee. The composition uses a high-angle overhead view to create an intimate and slightly intimate visual experience. The middle is the white fabric surface of the sofa, with subtle diamond texture, soft and comfortable. On the right is a small orange-yellow ukulele with a distinct wood sheen and clearly visible strings, adding a touch of artistic flair. On the left is a corner of the blue curtain. The texture is light and naturally folded, emitting soft light. The background is a bright window. The view outside is blurry, but soft natural light pours in, creating a warm backlight effect. This creates a soft glow around the edges of the figure's outline. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward a Japanese photo style, with warm white, beige, and light blue as the main tones, accented by black and orange-yellow. The colors are harmoniously unified, with light entering from the upper right, creating a natural transition between light and shadow. The shadows are soft, casting soft shadows on the sofa and floor. It enhances spatial three-dimensionality, with a balanced yet dynamic composition throughout the composition. Using low-angle shooting to reinforce the subject's presence, it creates a peaceful, gentle, and slightly nostalgic everyday atmosphere, as if capturing a private moment under the afternoon sun, full of life and youthful beauty. It is suitable as a photographic work in film photography style, featuring strong narrative and emotional resonance, rich details, and realistic material expression, including the knit texture of sweaters and the matte texture of long socks. The reflection of the camera's metal parts and the warm luster of the wooden instruments present an authentic and warm visual aesthetic overall",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
