        {
          "id": "krea2-a3e4d37e303ef2bdc537dc3c",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙户外站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors on a sunny day, wearing a light beige dress adorned with white lace trim, a loose white puff-sleeve top, and a headscarf with elegant floral patterns. Her hands are folded over her chest, fingers gently touching, her posture elegant yet restrained. She stands in a vast field, with a pure blue sky and drifting white clouds in the background, and in the distance, the blurred outlines of green hills can be faintly seen. The sky shows a bright blue gradient, with fluffy white clouds and ample yet soft sunlight. Light shines down from above and in front, creating a fresh and bright overall tone, dominated by blue, white, and green, creating a fresh, refined, tranquil, and far-reaching summer pastoral atmosphere. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, head slightly tilted, and gaze downward, forming a visual guiding line. The foreground highlights the main subject, the middle ground shows parts of the fields and sky, and the background blur enhances spatial layering. The lens is an 85mm prime lens with an f/1.8 aperture, achieving a shallow depth of field effect. This makes the subject stand out clearly, the background soft and blurred, the light and shadows natural, sunlight filtering through clouds creating soft diffused light, and shadow edges soft. Overall, it presents a film-like texture, with moderate color saturation and low contrast, a slight graininess, and a retro filter effect. It's like shooting with an old film camera on a sunny afternoon, capturing a moment of genuine emotion unintentionally. The image is full of poetry and nostalgia. Like a tranquil oil painting, or like a precious old photo recording youthful years, it is rich in artistic beauty and the atmosphere of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
