        {
          "id": "krea2-b7db5ca7522a5800831a8789",
          "alias": "单女透视黑连衣裙客厅坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the steps of a vintage wooden staircase, wearing a cleverly designed black off-shoulder dress. The dress's tailoring fits the figure, with one shoulder naturally sliding down to reveal a graceful collarbone. The pleated design on the chest adds layers and an elegant aura. The long sleeves are made of puffy black plush material, creating a textured contrast with the smooth skirt. The overall look is both sexy and noble. She wears black patent leather high heels with gold metal accents on the toes, and the sharp shape outlines her long legs. Paired with sheer stockings, her legs appear slimmer and more glossy. She wears exaggerated gold earrings and a gorgeometric necklace around her neck. The pendant is a complex geometric shape that glows softly. One hand rests gently on her knee, the other hangs naturally. She wears a simple bracelet on her wrist, her posture relaxed yet full of tension. The background is a dark wooden staircase. The stair railings are carved with classical patterns, each railing showing the texture of time. The wood grain is clearly visible, with colors gradient from light brown to dark brown, creating a warm and profound atmosphere. The staircase extends upward, disappearing into the dim depth, enhancing the depth of the scene. The floor is also wooden, matching the staircase's material. The patchwork wood panels have interwoven textures, with slightly worn surfaces that exude a rustic atmosphere. Light comes from the left front, evenly illuminating the figures. At the same time, light shadows are cast on the stairs and floor, adding a sense of depth. The transitions between light and shadow are natural, with moderate contrast between light and shadow, without strong glare or dead black. The overall color scheme is mainly dark brown and black, accented with bright gold jewelry to create a visual focal point. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame. The foreground features her legs and high heels, occupying a large space below the frame. The middle ground is her upper body and part of the stairs, while the background features upward stairs and blurred walls. This creates a spatial layer from near to far, with visual guidance extending backward along the staircase's diagonal lines and the contours of the figures, enhancing the depth of the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and luxurious, tinged with mystery and allure, as if capturing a private and precious moment—like a fashion shot with a professional camera, yet retaining the casual feel of daily life. It feels like a real scene accidentally captured in the living room of an old villa. The image is rich in detail, realistic in texture, harmonious in light and shadow, full of artistic flair and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
