        {
          "id": "krea2-f8f1215ab33bba9646c1013c",
          "alias": "单女外套雪地忧伤出神",
          "prompt": "She wears a dark navy collar jacket with white stripes on the cuffs, layered with a white turtleneck sweater. Her hands gently pull up the collar of the sweater, as if resisting the cold, gazing into the distance, as if softly confiding her feelings. The foreground is a close-up of the figure's half-body profile, with a close-up focus and background blur to present a warm golden tone. Sunlight pours in from the sides and back, creating a soft backlight effect that passes through the falling snowflakes, forming dots of light in the air, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. In the middle of the scene, blurred outlines of snowy fields and trees can be faintly seen, while distant buildings or mountains appear faintly in the warm light, enhancing the sense of spatial layering. The overall color palette mainly features a warm and cool contrast, with a black coat and white scarf creating a strong visual contrast. At the same time, the warm sunlight and golden halo achieve color balance. The direction of light and shadow is side backlight, with the light source coming from the upper right, creating a soft halo along the edges of the figure's contours, creating a sense of three-dimensionality and depth. The scattered snowflake particles in the frame are clearly visible, some suspended in the air, adding realism and dynamism. In composition, the figures are slightly tilted, heads slightly tilted, and the gaze is directed toward the left front of the frame, creating visual flow. The left side has more blank space, enhancing breathability, while the right side is dominated by the figures, creating an asymmetrical yet harmonious layout. The overall atmosphere is quiet yet slightly lonely, full of poetry and storytelling, like a gentle moment accidentally captured on a winter afternoon, with the texture of film photography. It has a slight graininess and natural color shift, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting. The lens focal length is about 85mm, shooting with a large aperture. The background blur is obvious, the depth of field is shallow, and the subject is highlighted. The image shows no excessive retouching, preserving natural light and shadow changes and environmental details, presenting an overall winter aesthetic that is tranquil, warm, yet slightly melancholic. Like a freeze-frame shot in a movie, it inevitably invites imagination about the story behind it. The lighting is soft but not harsh, and the tones are warm. It creates a blend of nostalgia and warmth, as if time has stopped at this moment, with only snowflakes quietly falling. The woman gazes into the distance, her thoughts swirling, and the entire scene is full of narrative and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
