        {
          "id": "krea2-3c8a98cb9ebd488d36497f2e",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙街道坐持相机",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle downward view, a woman sits on the street corner of a city. She wears an off-white pleated spaghetti strap dress, facing the camera directly, wearing a slender silver necklace around her neck and holding a light brown paper coffee cup. She sits relaxed, legs extended, wearing white mid-calf socks and a pair of vintage-style platform shoes with striped uppers. In the foreground, her legs and the coffee cup in her hand occupy most of the space below, creating a strong visual direction. In the middle shot, the female figure is the main subject. She is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the painting, her body slightly leaning forward, holding a coffee cup in her right hand. The background is a typical Japanese city streetscape, with gray cement walls bearing mottled marks, and yellow circular markers pasted on the walls. In the distance, multi-story residential buildings can be seen. The exterior walls are white and light gray, windows are neatly arranged, and some balconies are drying clothes. The intertwined power lines in the sky and blue sky and white clouds form complex lines. The sky is a deep blue, dotted with fluffy white clouds. Sunlight pours down from above, creating bright and soft light that creates a natural transition of shadows. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and authentic, presenting a fleeting beauty in everyday life. The composition uses fisheye lens effects, with slight edge distortion enhancing the sense of space. The colors are mainly warm tones, with off-white, light brown, gray-white, and sky blue complementing each other, creating a relaxed and pleasant afternoon atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and rich, resembling a real-life scene shot with an ordinary phone, with a strong sense of documentary and life atmosphere, while preserving the characters' youthful energy and gentle temperament. The visuals are full of storytelling. It evokes a brief moment of urban rest, capturing poetic moments in ordinary daily life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
