        {
          "id": "krea2-28896926418fae1010c42ff9",
          "alias": "单女城市沉思站立喝",
          "prompt": "Inside the dimly lit cinema, a woman sat alone on a red theater seat. She wore a fitted black high-neck long-sleeved top, her head slightly lowered, as if sipping something, exuding a quiet, contemplative yet slightly detached mood. Her left hand rested gently on her lap, her posture relaxed yet tinged with a hint of loneliness. Seat number \"9\" was clearly visible, with an empty seat number \"8\" beside it, surrounded by neatly arranged red cushioned seats. The seats had fine mesh textures, with lights streaming in from above. Creating a warm and hazy light and shadow effect, the seats in the background gradually blur, creating a strong depth blur that makes the main figure stand out more. The entire composition presents a warm orange tone, with light like the afterglow of dusk, painting the space a gentle golden red. The clear seat details in the foreground contrast sharply with the gradually blurred seats behind. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is tranquil yet full of storytelling, as if capturing a brief moment of personal tranquility before or after a film screening. The overall image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and color shifts, simulating the effect of everyday amateur camera shooting. It is realistic yet artistic, with warm but not exaggerated tones, rich and layered details, creating a common yet resonant aesthetic of urban loneliness, as if you can hear faint sounds from a theater and the faint noise of moving air. The entire scene is filled with nostalgia and poetic contemplation, like a movie still capturing ordinary moments, making one imagine she has just finished watching a movie or is waiting for the next scene to begin. Time freezes at this moment, emotions settle in this moment, and the visuals contain no unnecessary decorations—only the simplest environment and most genuine expressions, conveying a subtle yet profound emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
