        {
          "id": "krea2-11c575796f0b55efb22167df",
          "alias": "单女白礼服摄影棚困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in an elegant white gown stands on the sunny grass outdoors. She wears a light, flowing light blue tulle wide-brimmed hat with a slightly slanted brim, adorned with delicate pleats and bow details, presenting a romantic French vintage style. Turning sideways to look back at the camera, she wears a cleverly designed white two-piece gown, with a cropped top featuring ruffled cuffs and pearl floral decorations on the shoulders. A matching ribbon bow is tied at the waist, and the hem is a high-waisted, voluminous long dress The dress is made of smooth satin, presenting an elegant A-line silhouette. The hem edges feature sheer layers of tulle for added lightness. On her left wrist, she wears a watch with a silver metal strap. The dial is a simple round design, while her right hand rests naturally on the side of the dress. Her fingers are long and her nails are neatly trimmed. The background is a blurred green forest, with sunlight filtering through the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect in the image. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the character's elegant posture and the three-dimensional silhouette of the clothing. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the image, with light coming from the upper left. The soft natural light creates a contrast of light and shadow on the figure, emphasizing the texture and three-dimensional structure of the clothing. The shadow areas transition delicately, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The colors are mainly white, light blue, and green, with fresh and pure tones full of spring. The overall composition presents a serene, elegant, and slightly dreamy artistic beauty. It feels like a professional studio outdoor shoot, with the texture of a high-end fashion blockbuster while preserving the authenticity and lifestyle of the natural environment. The details are rich, layered distinctly, light and shadow are meticulous, and color combinations are harmoniously unified, presenting a feminine charm that is both luxurious and fresh",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
