        {
          "id": "krea2-1e05b5930d66634a1444a730",
          "alias": "单女家中注视",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman adds a touch of laziness and casualness, with a natural blush and a few freckles. Looking directly into the lens, a bright red cherry tomato is held in her mouth, with its stems and leaves clearly visible. Another cluster of cherry tomatoes hangs down from her chest, extending along her collarbone and chest contours to form a natural decorative chain. These cherry tomatoes are full in color, smooth with a faint water droplet reflection, looking fresh and tempting. She crosses her arms over her chest, fingers long, nails painted with light-colored nail polish. On the right ring finger, she wears a simple silver ring, her hand movements naturally relaxed, as if gently holding these fruits. The main subject is positioned slightly above the center of the composition, with a compact and layered composition. In the foreground, dense clusters of cherry tomatoes and some arms, and in the background are blurred dark wood grain walls or furniture, with warm wood grain details, creating a vintage and cozy atmosphere. Light comes from above, creating a natural transition of light and shadow, while shadows form subtle layers along the hairline, neck, and shoulders, with the direction of light and shadow aligned, enhancing the sense of depth and realism. The image uses shallow depth of field shooting techniques, with well-handled background blur to highlight the visual center of the subject. The composition uses the curve of a tomato string and the curve of the arm to guide the gaze toward the center. The overall atmosphere blends the casual nature of daily life with the refinement of artistic photography, as if it were a private and authentic home shoot. Using a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens presents a cinematic texture and delicate color reproduction, the image has strong visual appeal. It resembles a carefully arranged portrait while retaining the warmth and intimacy of everyday life. The color saturation is moderate, contrast is soft, details are rich, layers are distinct, and it is full of vitality and sensory impact",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
