        {
          "id": "krea2-65650cb14ae811ae0837bbf3",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫泳池俏皮站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by an outdoor pool, wearing a white short-sleeved polo shirt with blue collar and buttons. There is a small green badge on the left chest, dark blue pants, brown backpacks on her shoulders, and a blue one-touch coffee cup printed with the word \"GBE\" in her right hand. The lid is black, with a tech-inspired swirl pattern on the cup. The left hand naturally hangs at his side, with a blurred blue-and-white pool edge and architectural structure in the background. The water surface shimmers softly, and in the distance, a stepped pool structure and white walls can be seen. The overall composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame. The light comes from the upper front, creating a bright and transparent atmosphere. The transitions between light and shadow are delicate, shadows are soft, and the colors are mainly white, blue, and brown, with a fresh and clean tone, presenting an overall relaxed, joyful, and vibrant everyday scene. It feels like campus moments captured with a regular phone or consumer-grade camera, exuding a realistic sense of life and a warm humanistic atmosphere. The details are rich, the background blur is well handled, highlighting the main characters and creating depth of field and spatial layering. The entire scene is filled with a youthful, sunny, and positive atmosphere, allowing people to feel the beauty and hope in ordinary life",
