        {
          "id": "krea2-c93962f54a17bdd085366bcb",
          "alias": "单女米外套高塔沉思站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor stone steps, wearing a beige long plush coat with a soft and fluffy texture and sheen. The coat reaches the ankles, with wide sleeves with obvious pleats, giving off a warm and luxurious look. Underneath, she wears a brown fitted knit strapless dress that fits her body and shows elegant curves. Her right leg is slightly raised, and she wears black high-heeled boots. The boots have metallic reflective sheen and wear marks, and the heels are slim, giving the whole look stylish and avant-garde, naturally draping over her shoulders. Her makeup is exquisite, her expression confident and composed, her posture relaxed yet full of tension. Her left hand rests lightly on her coat, her right hand naturally hanging down, carrying a black leather handbag. The bag is simple and smooth, with Tokyo Tower in the background. The orange-red steel frame stands out against the blue sky, and the details of the tower are clearly visible. Surrounded by dense trees, the leaves show autumn golden and reddish-brown tones, some branches are exposed, the sky is deep blue, dotted with a few wisps of white clouds, and the light is bright and soft, with sunlight streaming in from the right. This creates a natural effect of light and shadow. To the left of the figure, there is a shadow transition. The stone steps are paved with gray stone, with a slightly rough surface and slight wear marks. The edges of the steps are neat, contrasting with the figure's legs. The foreground is the main figure, occupying the center-left position of the composition. The middle ground features stone steps and railings, made of silver-white metal and extending in an arc, forming geometric lines with the steps. The background features Tokyo Tower and forests, with distinct layers. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the figure's height and presence, while incorporating Tokyo Tower into the frame. This forms a visual focal point: the figure's body is slightly tilted, creating dynamic balance, then ascending back to the tower body to create a cyclical visual path. The overall atmosphere blends urban fashion with natural autumn scenery, combining modernity with warmth and invitement. The color palette is mainly warm tones, interwoven with beige, brown, orange-red, and gold, paired with cool blue skies and gray stone steps, creating a striking contrast. The light and shadow are handled delicately, with natural transitions between light and shadow, creating a realistic and artistic everyday shooting effect. It's as if you're shooting a moment outdoors with a professional camera—the image is lifelike, detailed, and delivers strong visual impact and emotional expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
