        {
          "id": "krea2-52b35f50df27537e78f361d3",
          "alias": "单女烟火微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors as night falls, wearing a loose, light-colored cotton-linen top. The fabric drapes naturally, the cuffs are slightly rolled up, presenting a casual yet lazy everyday vibe, adding softness and vitality. She holds two burning fireworks sticks in both hands, sparks flying, golden sparks tracing bright trails in the darkness, forming warm and dynamic points of light. Her expression is calm and slightly mysterious, as if immersed in the romance and beauty of the moment. In the foreground is the firework stick she holds. Sparks danced in the air, forming spots of light like stars. Some sparks even landed on the back of her hand and clothes, leaving brief and warm traces of light and shadow. Under the warm glow of the fireworks, they shimmered softly. The light shone from the front left, with a deep night sky as the background, almost completely black. Only in the distance could faintly see faint, blurry orange-red lights—possibly neon lights on city buildings or streets. These lights appeared as soft circular light spots in bokeh, creating a layered blend of reality and illusion. The composition uses a slightly slanted third-division layout. The figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, with their heads slightly turned, creating a subtle communication between the gaze and the viewer. The fireworks stick is positioned at the upper left, guiding the visual outward extension while balancing the center of gravity. The overall composition has a strong sense of dynamism and emotional tension. The visual guidance begins with the glow of the fireworks and ends on that gentle smile. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by warm tones, with the golden and orange-red glow of the fireworks as the core light sources of the painting, creating a distinct backlighting effect. The surrounding environment is shrouded in deep shadows with strong contrasts, creating a dreamy, tranquil, and slightly melancholic poetic atmosphere. The image has slight film graininess and color shifts, simulating the effect of vintage camera shooting. The tone is slightly warm, saturation moderate, preserving authentic light and shadow transitions and detailed layers. Overall, it presents a realistic feel of everyday amateur equipment shooting, as if captured on an ordinary night with a phone or portable camera, full of life and emotional warmth. The image does not pursue extreme clarity. Instead, it emphasizes emotional expression and atmosphere creation, using natural lighting effects under low light conditions and random spark movements to construct scenes that are both realistic and artistically appealing",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
