        {
          "id": "krea2-7eb37fade095ce1214fdbfb0",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣花园演奏",
          "prompt": "Above her head rests a bright red, plump tomato, as if playing a fun balance game. The scene is full of childlike fun and the atmosphere of everyday life. She wears an off-white knit sweater with delicate diamond-shaped knit patterns on the cuffs and shoulders, soft and warm. The background is a faint patch of green plants, with a few faint leaves and branches faintly visible, creating the atmosphere of an outdoor garden or courtyard. In the distance, there are also dark wooden structures, possibly a corner of a fence or cottage. In the foreground, a few scattered tomatoes and green leaves appear, some of which are out of focus, creating a natural depth of field effect. The composition uses close-up shots, with the figure occupying the left center of the composition, head slightly tilted, creating direct communication with the viewer. The tomato, as one of the visual focal points, is placed above the head, becoming the most striking element in the painting and echoing the tomato in the foreground, enhancing the overall interest and unity. The lighting is soft and even From the front slightly above, it resembles diffused light on a cloudy day, without strong shadows, with a slight sheen. The background blur is well handled. When shooting with a large aperture lens, other parts gradually blur to highlight the subject. The colors are mainly warm tones, with off-white, meat pink, and tomato red harmoniously contrasting with the green background. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of the poetry of everyday life, giving a sense of amateur camera realism, as if a friend casually captured a relaxed moment. The image texture is delicate but not overly embellished. It retains a slight grainy texture and natural color reproduction, allowing people to feel a warm, authentic, and artistic lifestyle aesthetic",
