        {
          "id": "krea2-cd5ab2d6854beffeb0272b65",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套户外困倦倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman adds a touch of casualness and vitality. She wears a light blue wool coat, thick and warm, with the cuffs revealing a white inner layer. On her shoulders is a soft, fluffy off-white knitted scarf wrapped around her neck. The scarf's texture is clearly visible, showing natural folds and light changes. In the foreground, a hand wearing gray knit gloves gently raises it, fingers slightly bent, as if about to touch or lightly grasp something. The glove surface has fine knit patterns, with edges slightly worn and wear. There are traces of everyday life, with the background being a blurry snowy field or winter outdoor environment. Light pours in from the upper right, creating a soft backlighting effect. Sunlight penetrates the fine dust in the air, creating a hazy and dreamy atmosphere. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the frame, heads slightly tilted, gazing toward the camera. The background blur is handled very cleanly, preserving only a faint cool tone of the sky and snowy outlines, reinforcing the subject's visual center. The colors mainly use warm and cool contrasts. The cool blue-gray tones and warm golden intertwine, creating a strong visual tension. The rich layers of light and shadow enhance the sense of depth and realism. The overall image presents a tranquil, warm, and slightly melancholic winter atmosphere, as if capturing a fleeting inner monologue. It has a cinematic texture and the graininess of film photography. The lens uses a large aperture prime shot, with an extremely shallow depth of field that highlights the main details while preserving a certain ambiance. The tone leans warm yet cool, leaning toward an artistic and realistic style. Combining everyday life and artistry, it feels like a genuine moment casually captured with an old camera, full of storytelling and emotional resonance",
