        {
          "id": "krea2-5299603ab60448beb7358cad",
          "alias": "单女持相机",
          "prompt": "Sunlight pours down from the upper left of the frame, the flowers are delicate and dripping, petals layered and the stamens clearly visible, adding a touch of romance and poetry. She wears white clothes, with the edge of her collar faintly visible. The background is a blurred cherry blossom forest, with pink and white petals spreading like mist, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The foreground clearly shows cherry blossom branches and flowers, while the background is a blurred cherry blossom forest and sky. The composition uses close-ups. The figure occupies the main position in the frame, presenting an overall warm and tranquil spring atmosphere. The lighting effects are natural and soft, with sunlight filtering through the leaves creating mottled shadows, enhancing the layering and realism of the image. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, creating a fresh and refined visual experience, as if capturing a tranquil and beautiful moment. The overall style has the delicate texture of Japanese photography, with slight film graininess and natural overexposure, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting. The lens is a 50mm prime portrait lens with a small aperture that highlights the subject. The background is heavily blurred, and the edges of the frame are slightly out of focus, enhancing the hazy beauty. The overall atmosphere is quiet and poetic, evoking the vitality and innocence of spring. The image is full of vitality and gentle emotion, as if you can hear the rustling of the wind through the cherry trees and the faint chirping of birds in the distance. Amidst the interplay of light and shadow, time seems to freeze, leaving behind eternal beautiful moments",
