        {
          "id": "krea2-9cbebc6e75bdba47e57882a9",
          "alias": "单女灰围巾雪地忧伤持相机",
          "prompt": "She wore a fluffy, soft light brown plush hat with slightly curled brims. Sunlight slanted in from the upper right, creating soft highlights and delicate shadow layers on the plush surface. The texture of the hat's plush was clearly visible, with every fiber seeming to gently tremble in the breeze, making her look especially cool and real. She wore a thick, dark gray coarse wool scarf, layer upon layer wrapping around her neck. The fabric texture is clearly visible, presenting a rugged yet warm texture. The scarf edges have fine rough edges and wear marks, adding a sense of everyday life and authenticity. She wears a vintage-style knit jacket with ethnic patterns revealed at the collar, mainly in brown, red, and blue. The patterns are complex and rhythmic, and the overall outfit conveys a warm and poetic winter street vibe. The background is blurred, presenting a blurred cool-toned snowy scene, with distant tree outlines and falling snowflakes faintly visible. Creating a spacious and tranquil winter atmosphere, the composition uses close-ups. The figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, leaving a large blank space on the right to create a visual sense of breathing and spatial extension. The camera angle slightly tilts upward to enhance the character's elegant temperament and sense of depth in the image. Light comes from the upper right, creating a strong side backlight effect. The character's outline is outlined by golden light, creating a dreamlike halo and light spot. The contrast between light and shadow is strong but not abrupt, making the overall atmosphere warm and melancholic, evoking the warmth of winter sunlight. It carries a touch of loneliness and tranquility, as if a moment frozen on a cold morning. The image is full of storytelling and artistic beauty, like a movie shot with an old film camera, with a grainy texture and slight overexposure, enhancing the nostalgia and authenticity feel. The tones are mainly warm yellow, gray-blue, and dark brown, with a striking contrast of warm and cool tones, creating a strong visual impact. The entire scene resembles a quiet winter afternoon, with the characters immersed in their own worlds, isolated from the outside world. The visuals convey a gentle yet detached emotion. Details are rich and layered—from the plush texture to the texture of the garment, from the changes of light and shadow to the emotional expression of the characters, every element is meticulously designed to create a scene full of poetry and emotion",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
