        {
          "id": "krea2-3186298fb136f4dbe7a411e5",
          "alias": "单女透视短裙摄影棚自信站立手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a corner of the room, wearing a black base with red floral patterns and a midriff-style midriff top and a high-waisted skirt. The top features a sleeveless high collar with large cutouts at the chest to accentuate her cleavage. The waist is tied with a matching patterned thin strap. The bottom is a high-waisted fitted short skirt with slits on the skirt, paired with black sheer stockings and black pointed high heels. The ankle area shows details of the heel. Her right hand gently rests on the left wall, while her left hand hangs naturally at her side, her body slightly tilted, and her head slightly turned to the side. The expression is confident yet slightly alluring, with an overall elegant and dynamic posture. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the middle shot, occupying the primary visual space. The foreground shows the lower body from the figure to the feet, the background is a simple light gray wall with dark baseboards, and the floor is covered with beige tiles. Light comes from the front left, creating soft shadows cast on the wall. The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a warm yet slightly dramatic atmosphere. The composition features the figure standing slightly to the center, with corner lines guiding the viewer and enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The visual focus is on the upper body and clothing details, with black and red as the main color tones, strong contrast, highlighting the refinement and texture of the clothing patterns. The overall image has the delicate texture of professional studio shooting, while also carrying the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The tone is warm, details rich, and light and shadow layers are distinct, presenting a unique beauty that blends modern fashion with traditional elements",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
