        {
          "id": "krea2-ee97f35b8bfdf3fb0722c025",
          "alias": "单女礼服婚礼俏皮坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a bed covered with bright red bedding, dressed in a luxurious and exquisite traditional Chinese wedding dress. The upper part is a short jacket with a stand-collar and a slanted collar, and the lower half is a long skirt. The entire outfit is based on vivid red, embroidered with phoenixes and auspicious cloud patterns embroidered with gold and silver threads. The golden phoenixes come alive on the fabric, feathers are layered distinctly, and silver threads outline auspicious cloud patterns. Three-dimensional embroidery is visible in the details, and the surface of the garment shows a delicate sheen under the light. Her hands rest naturally on the red bedsheets on either side, her posture dignified and elegant. In the foreground is the red bed she sits, with rich folds and light and shadow forming interwoven patterns of light and shadow. The middle is the main figure, occupying the center of the composition. The composition uses close-ups, with the indoor background showing the wooden headboard and light-colored walls. The wall is decorated with a red \"double happiness\" character, hinting at a wedding scene. On the left nightstand are small items like a black telephone, with the overall color scheme mainly red and gold, creating a festive and lively atmosphere. Light enters from the right side of the frame, creating a soft side glow. Shadows fall on the left side of the body and the bed, with natural transitions creating a warm and layered visual effect. The overall image is full of Eastern aesthetic charm, preserving the cultural connotations of traditional wedding customs while showcasing the refined texture of modern photography, as if a wedding portrait was taken by a professional photographer with a high-end camera. It possesses strong artistic appeal and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
