        {
          "id": "krea2-580fff3b425f88c01f487d3e",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣雪地微笑站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a snowy winter street, appearing especially cool and pure. She wears an off-white coarse knit sweater with clearly visible patterns, fringed decorations at the cuffs and hem, and a gray turtleneck sweater underneath for rich layering. Her posture is to turn sideways and glance back, carrying a gentle smile. The overall temperament is elegant and natural. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right center, occupying the main visual space. The background is a snow-covered street, with distant building outlines blurred to create a soft blurred effect. The sky is grayish-white. Snowflakes flutter down, some creating slight motion blur in front of the frame, enhancing the realism and dynamic beauty of the image. The middle shot features snowy fields around the figures and faintly visible roadside railings, with yellow and black stripes adding a touch of everyday life to the scene. The background is a hazy white world, with building outlines faintly visible, but details are obscured by snow mist, creating a peaceful yet slightly lonely atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups combined with shallow depth of field, with the background completely blurred to highlight the subject. At the same time, the posture of the figure looking back creates visual guidance, enhancing the storytelling of the scene. The light and shadows are soft and even, and diffuse light from cloudy days envelops the entire scene in cool tones, with a faint reflection that appears gentle and jade-like. The snowy light reflects light, enhancing the overall brightness but without creating strong contrasts, maintaining harmony and unity. The colors are mainly white, gray, and black, forming a classic and sophisticated cool palette. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, beautiful, and slightly melancholic, as if capturing the gentlest moment of a winter afternoon It is like a daily image taken with an amateur camera—authentic and unforced, full of the spirit of life and emotional warmth. It has a film-like graininess and slight overexposure, giving the image a sense of age and artistry. It feels like an old photo unearthed from the depths of memory, recording a moment about winter, about waiting, and about tenderness",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
