        {
          "id": "krea2-dca13e860198bd8b4b7da5de",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣车厢忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside a subway carriage, her finger lightly touching the screen, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. She wears an off-white knit sweater with deep green and black geometric patterns. The sweater's texture is clearly visible, and the loose fit brings a warm and comfortable visual feeling. She wears several simple silver rings on her left wrist, a thin ring on her right ring finger, and a black backpack strap slung across her right shoulder, forming a natural line division. The foreground is the middle part of her body, occupying the center of the scene. The composition uses close-up shots with blurred backgrounds to present a blurred interior of the carriage. You can see the metal handrails, door edges, and the silhouettes of other passengers in the distance. They are sitting or standing, each with different postures but all out of focus, creating a strong sense of depth and spatial layering. The light comes from the fluorescent lamps at the top of the carriage, presenting a soft, even cool white tone, mixed with faint natural light streaming in from outside the window, making the overall lighting cool but still delicate. The main color palette is gray-white, deep green, and black. The color saturation is low, with a slight graininess and film texture, as if captured with an old-fashioned camera. The composition is slightly tilted, adding a touch of everyday instability. The visual guide lines are formed by the character's downward posture and the direction of the phone screen, while the metal handrails and door structure in the background form intersecting lines, enhancing the sense of order and urban rhythm. The entire scene is filled with a quiet, lonely, and everyday atmosphere, as if capturing a brief moment of self-reflection on an ordinary person's commute The image has a strong documentary style and emotional resonance, evoking those overlooked ordinary moments in city life. The image texture is close to 35mm film photography, with slight noise and color fading, like a frame of truth unearthed from old times, full of nostalgia and tenderness. The lens is a standard prime lens with a focal length of about 50mm and an f/2.8 aperture, simulating real camera shooting. The background gradually blurs, presenting a shallow depth of field cinematic feel. The overall atmosphere is quiet and restrained. It combines the rush of modern urban life with the poetic charm of individuals seeking moments of tranquility amid the noise. The images are not over-embellished, preserving the original authenticity and sense of life, like an unfiltered street photo capturing the most authentic moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
