        {
          "id": "krea2-3af06d4b96d13e950cc0036d",
          "alias": "单女透视高跟鞋酒店神秘坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a corner where the dark wooden wall panels meet the light wooden floor, leaning slightly forward, legs crossed and overlapping—right leg on top and left leg below—knees naturally bent, toes touching the ground. The slender heels of black high heels stand firmly on the ground, with faint sheen of sheer stockings visible at the ankles. Her right hand gently rests on her right knee, fingers long and slightly bent, while her left hand hangs naturally at her side, close to the ground. On her wrist is a watch with a silver metal strap, the dial clearly visible. She wore a red lace spaghetti strap bodysuit with delicate lace patterns at the neckline and shoulder straps. The waist hugged her figure, highlighting her slender waistline. The chest area looked slightly fuller, and the red fabric had a delicate texture. She wore a black mini skirt whose hem contrasted with the upper thighs, giving her legs a smooth and graceful line. She wore semi-transparent black stockings on her thighs, which were smooth and elastic, subtly revealing the contours of her skin. The inner thighs had red tiebacks that echoed the color of the top, giving the overall look a sexy and elegant look The expression is calm and confident. The background is a dark brown vertical striped wooden panel, with clear wood grain and slight wear and scratches on the surface, presenting a retro and steady texture. The floor is light brown spliced wood with natural and smooth wood grain, with some areas showing slight reflections. On the left edge, a small tile with geometric patterns can be seen, alternating in off-white and gray colors. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, body in a diagonal posture, head slightly turned toward the camera, creating a strong visual direction. The light comes from the front right of the subject, casting light shadows on the walls and floor, creating a warm and slightly mysterious atmosphere. The transitions are natural, with balanced contrast between light and shadow, highlighting the main silhouette and clothing details. The overall color palette is mainly deep brown, black, and red, with high saturation yet a sense of realism. The image has a strong fashion photography style, resembling a photo taken in a high-end hotel corridor or private club, with professional lighting and camera quality. At the same time, it preserves the authentic moments captured by chance in daily life, with rich image details, clear layers, and full of artistic flair and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
