        {
          "id": "krea2-0a842f53c8100e04853d23d5",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤公寓害羞坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, positioned slightly forward in the center of the frame, leaning slightly forward. Her hands gently tug at the straps of her gray camisole with fingers naturally intertwined in front of her chest. Her posture appears both casual and slightly shy, adding a touch of laziness and authenticity. Her expression is calm and focused, revealing a reserved confidence and composure. She wears a form-fitting gray short camisole with a delicate texture showing slight texture and wrinkles. She pairs it with dark pants, making the overall look simple and everyday. In the background is a modern-style interior space. Behind it is a row of open bookshelves with black metal frames. Several books are neatly arranged on the shelves, some arranged vertically, some stacked horizontally. The book covers come in various colors—white, yellow, blue, etc.—adding layers and a sense of life to the space. The bookshelf structure is simple and crisp, with clear lines that contrast with the wall. The wall is light gray-white, with a flat surface without decoration, further highlighting the main figure. Behind her is a mesh office chair, with the backrest visible The material is breathable grid, suggesting this is a work or study area. Light comes from the front left position, soft and even, without strong shadows, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly neutral, with harmonious and unified color coordination. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure occupying the main part of the composition, making the visual focal point clear. The foreground features the upper body and hand movements, rich in detail. The middle ground features bookshelves and some furniture, while the background features walls and distant objects. The layers are distinct and the light and shadow treatment is delicate. The transition between light and shadow is smooth, with no glaring glare. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and full of everyday life, as if capturing an ordinary yet authentic moment. It has a strong sense of documentary and emotional resonance. The image presents a realistic texture similar to a phone selfie, with slight noise and natural lens distortion, enhancing the sense of presence and intimacy. It looks like it was shot with everyday equipment, with slightly blurred edges to simulate the depth of field effect during close-up shots. All these elements together form a daily portrait full of warmth and storytelling, combining artistic beauty with the authenticity and simplicity of life",
