        {
          "id": "krea2-762239d442b4a765998490b6",
          "alias": "单女灰外套雪地微笑倚靠跳舞",
          "prompt": "A girl sat on an outdoor swing, wearing a light gray thick coat covered with a thin layer of snowflakes, making her look especially warm and soft. Around her neck was a thick white plush scarf, one end of which hung over her chest and covered with tiny snow droplets, adding a touch of winter warmth, making her look moist and glossy. She wore round black-rimmed glasses, with some mist and water droplets on the lenses. Reflecting the marks of just entering the room from the cold outdoors or lingering in the snow for a long time, looking directly into the camera with a faint smile, as if enjoying this peaceful snowy day. Her right hand gently rests on her lap, her left hand naturally resting at her side, fingers slightly bent, as if ready to grasp something or just casually relaxing. Her body leans slightly forward, head tilted slightly, giving a sense of closeness and naturalness. The background is a blurry snowy scene, with distant outlines of trees and buildings visible. But all are covered by thick snow, appearing hazy and mysterious. Dense snowflakes fall from the sky, each clearly visible, spinning and dancing in the air, forming a dynamic scene. The light is soft and even, and natural light from above filters through the clouds, illuminating the entire scene. The snow appears in a bright white tone while preserving the layering of the shadows. The composition uses a central composition, placing the girl in the center of the frame and immediately drawing the viewer's attention to her In the foreground, the swing chains are clearly visible, extending from the top to connect to the girl's seat. These chains are also covered with snowflakes, adding realism and detail to the scene. The middle section shows the girl's body and her surroundings, including the swing she sits on and the surrounding snowy landscape. The background is a blurred snowy landscape, emphasizing the main subject through depth of field. In terms of visual guidance, her expressions and posture guide the viewer's emotional engagement, while falling snowflakes form flowing lines in the frame. Guiding the gaze in all directions, the overall light and shadow atmosphere leans toward a cool tone, mainly white and gray, creating a tranquil and pure winter atmosphere. However, the girl's warm smile and the color of her clothes bring a touch of warmth, creating a contrast of cool and warm that enhances the emotional tension of the image. The entire image is filled with poetry and romance, as if freezing the most beautiful moments of winter, allowing one to feel the stillness of time and peace of mind",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
