        {
          "id": "krea2-1d45cc398c34f242e64c2422",
          "alias": "单女绿连衣裙楼梯冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a dimly lit indoor stairwell, wearing a vintage-style light green lace dress with pleats and ruffles, a black bow at the neckline, and short puff sleeves, presenting an overall Gothic Lolita elegance and decadence. She wears a white lace headdress adorned with fine metal rings and tassels, appearing both delicate and slightly eerie. Her makeup is heavy, her expression cold and mysterious, her right arm bent, resting on the green staircase railing beside her Her body leans slightly forward, her left leg slightly bent, her right hand gently stroking her thigh, her posture full of tension. Her legs are dressed in translucent off-white vertical striped stockings, and on her feet are high-heeled patent leather shoes. The heels are slender and long, presenting a classic pointed design. Her legs are long and slender, with faint shadows at the knees. She has several small tattoos on her arms, with blurred but faint patterns, resembling letters or symbols. The entire composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right in the center of the frame. On the left is a green staircase structure, with white stair steps. The edges have a metallic texture. On the right side is a heavy white door panel with scratches and stains on the surface. White handles are installed above, the background wall is grayish-white, with obvious cracks and mottled marks. The ceiling has exposed pipes and wiring, as well as a damaged round light fixture. The floor is gray cement, reflecting faint light. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is cool tones, with the light source coming from the front slightly left, creating a soft side light. The shadows fall on the wall and floor behind, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. The composition uses stairs and door frames to form a frame, guiding the gaze to focus on the main subject, while also creating a closed, oppressive, yet dramatic visual tension. The main color tones are gray-green, off-white, and black, with low color saturation, presenting a low-contrast retro texture, as if shot on film with an old camera, with slight graininess and noise. The overall atmosphere blends decadent aesthetics, gothic style, and the absurdity of everyday life, like a frozen moment in a movie. It records a forgotten private memory with strong narrative and emotional impact",
