        {
          "id": "krea2-0f509e3c8da97d5a16b526f0",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫城市冷淡站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, wearing a black turtleneck, tight short-sleeve top and a gray pencil mini skirt, showcasing her slender figure and elegant curves, adding a touch of softness and casualness, exuding a calm and confident temperament. Her right hand hangs naturally, gently holding a pair of fine-framed metal glasses. On her wrist is a simple and exquisite metal bracelet, her nails painted light gray or gray-blue, showing taste in every detail. The background is a modern-style indoor space. The walls are light gray or off-white, and there are recessed downlights on the ceiling, softly and evenly casting light evenly over the figures, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. In the middle section, you can see blurred furniture outlines, such as a corner of a sofa or chair, which is darker in color, possibly made of dark fabric or leather. On the right edge, a glowing light source can be faintly seen, like the reflection from a TV screen or desk lamp, creating a subtle ambient lighting effect. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, making the figure appear more upright and powerful, while also elongating the body lines. Enhances visual impact. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with a slightly tilted head, a relaxed yet dignified posture. The foreground is a close-up of the torso and hands, clearly highlighting the texture of the clothing and movement details. The middle shot extends to the furniture and walls in the background, with distinct layers, while the background is further blurred, presenting a clean yet spacious environment. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly cool, with soft and directional lighting that enhances the sense of depth and skin texture. The shadows are well handled without being too stiff. The overall color tone leans toward a cool tone, mainly black, gray, and white, creating a calm, sophisticated, and slightly detached urban feel. The image texture is delicate, as if shot by a professional camera, offering cinematic quality and color performance. The details are rich and the realism of everyday photography is as if shooting in natural indoor light with a medium format or high-end full-frame camera. Paired with a large aperture lens, it achieves a shallow depth of field. The overall image is full of artistic atmosphere and modern aesthetics, combining the refinement of a fashion blockbuster. It retains a sense of closeness and authenticity, with a quiet and restrained atmosphere, and the characters' emotions subtle yet powerful, as if waiting for a moment. The entire scene is enveloped by a serene and mysterious tension, ultimately falling on the waistline and the glasses in the hand, forming a smooth visual path that guides viewers to deeply experience the characters' inner temperament and sense of story",
