        {
          "id": "krea2-e105433e014c815c50795dee",
          "alias": "单女T恤户外微笑站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a lush green environment, dressed in a pure white summer casual outfit. She wears a simple V-neck short-sleeved T-shirt with a small black pattern on the chest, and a layered white ruffled mini skirt with lace trim details. The overall look is fresh, sweet, and stylish. Her hands gently support a beige woven straw hat, with naturally hanging grass tassels at the edge. The wide brim provides a bit of sun protection. She adds a touch of pastoral charm, with slightly reddish ends that look healthy and glossy. She wears a gentle smile, looking directly into the camera, exuding a friendly and natural temperament. On her left wrist, she wears a delicate silver bracelet, while on her right wrist a black thin cord bracelet and a wooden beaded bracelet. The details reflect personality and taste. The background is a dense green plant with layers of leaves displaying rich shades of light and dark. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting dappled light and shadow, creating a soft halo effect. The ground is covered with lush green lawns, with a few fallen leaves scattered throughout, the composition using a mid-field portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, body slightly tilted, head facing the camera, creating a natural visual guide. Light comes from above, representing a warm afternoon sun, creating delicate transitions between highlights and shadows, creating a warm, tranquil, and vibrant atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly white and green, with sharp contrast yet harmonious unity. The tone is fresh and bright, with a strong summer atmosphere, and the image texture is delicate and authentic. It feels as if shot with a professional camera under natural light, presenting high definition, rich detail, and natural color reproduction, while retaining slight film graininess and soft out-of-focus blur, enhancing the artistic and realistic feel of the image. The composition follows the golden ratio, with the main subject highlighted and the background moderately blurred, emphasizing character expressions and clothing details. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, conveying a youthful vitality, natural beauty, and a tranquil and comfortable lifestyle aesthetic",
