        {
          "id": "krea2-2676e142dc4e4d2c400430b7",
          "alias": "单女和服街道注视",
          "prompt": "Her right hand is raised, making a relaxed and casual victory gesture. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, and her movements are natural and unpretentious. The outer layer of the kimono is light blue, embroidered with delicate blue-and-white geometric checks. The cuffs and collar are adorned with deep blue chrysanthemum patterns, exquisite and elegant, lined with off-white. With golden lines outlining a fan shape and geometric patterns, she wears a wide blue belt at her waist, edged with gold piping. Above the belt is a fine silver-gray cord knot, forming elegant decorative pleats. She carries a huge kimono bag, made of off-white silk, embroidered with golden diamond and wave patterns, giving it a heavy and luxurious texture. The top of the bag is fluffy and full, showing soft pleated layers. The entire composition centers on the figure, shot in a medium shot. The figure occupies most of the composition, with the body slightly tilted to one side, head turned toward the camera, creating a dynamic visual balance. The background is a typical Japanese wooden building, with walls made of vertically arranged wooden planks in a warm brown color. The roof is covered with traditional gray tiles, layered with clearly visible edges. In the distance, the windows reflect soft light, making the overall environment quiet and rustic. The floor is a smooth cement pavement, and in the lower left corner, a small gray bird can be faintly seen looking down to feed. Add a touch of life. The sky is light blue, clouds thin, and the light is natural daylight. Sunlight streams in from the right, creating a natural transition of light and shadow, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly blue, white, and gold, paired with a brown wood background. The colors are harmoniously unified, combining the elegant beauty of traditional kimono with the relaxed feel of modern life. The composition has a strong visual guidance, then follows her gaze and gestures to the architectural details in the background. The composition is stable yet dynamic. It feels like a real street photo taken with everyday amateur equipment. The camera specs are set to Canon EOS R5, ISO 200, shutter speed 1/640 sec, aperture f/2.8, focal length 50mm. Handheld shooting, slight motion blur and natural noise add realism. The lighting is soft, with no overexposure or loss of shadows, presenting an overall warm, nostalgic, and everyday aesthetic full of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
