        {
          "id": "krea2-550b772591bd2ed8cbe31628",
          "alias": "单女衬衫厨房微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden high stool in the kitchen, gazing at the camera with a gentle smile, revealing her neat, white teeth, appearing both friendly and slightly shy. She wears an off-white coral fleece loungewear, with a soft, fluffy fabric that is clearly visible. The cuffs and pant legs are adorned with dark gray cartoon patterns. The zipper of the shirt is slightly open, revealing her collarbones and neck line. Her arms are hugged over her knees, hands folded in front of her, legs curled up beneath her, barefoot on the stool, toes naturally extended. The overall posture is relaxed and comfortable, presenting a lazy and cozy atmosphere of home life. The foreground is the main part of her body, occupying the center from waist to head. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left, forming the visual focal point. The background is a modern minimalist kitchen environment, with light-colored open shelves holding glass jars, books, and some household items. On the right, a black microwave oven or oven can be faintly seen, with a pink countertop adding a soft touch. The wall surface is dark gray, with a rough cement or matte texture that contrasts with the warm-toned indoor lighting. The light softly enters from the left, simulating natural morning or evening light. The light source is warm and even, creating subtle shadow transitions that enhance the sense of three-dimensionality and create a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The layers of light and shadow are rich, the edges of shadows are soft, without strong contrast, highlighting the subject while maintaining a blurred background. The shallow depth of field effect blurs the background and enhances attention to the subject. The composition uses the classic third-division method, with the figure positioned on the left one-third of the time, facing the camera. The overall image is full of life, with warm yellow and off-white tones as the main tones, complemented by a touch of pink and dark gray, creating a comfortable, comfortable, and everyday sense of realism. It feels like a private moment shot with a regular camera or phone, with slight film graininess and soft noise, enhancing authenticity and warmth. The details are refined but not overly sharp, preserving a natural soft focus effect. The overall atmosphere is quiet and warm. It conveys a simple and pure sense of happiness and belonging, like a beautiful moment in an ordinary day being captured",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
