        {
          "id": "krea2-19a144f65734681000b442e6",
          "alias": "单女衬衫忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman, her head slightly tilted, her posture naturally relaxed, wearing a shirt with intricate floral patterns. The colors are mainly deep red, black, and white, with intricate and layered patterns. In the foreground, a few small pink flowers and slender green branches extend diagonally from the right side of the painting, forming a semi-transparent visual barrier cast with mottled shadows. The background is a blurry light blue wall, presenting a soft gradient effect. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center-left position. The contrast of light and shadow is strong, with light shining diagonally from the upper right, creating a sense of three-dimensionality and drama, forming irregular geometric shapes that add mystery and artistic atmosphere to the image. The composition uses plant elements in the foreground as visual guidance, creating a warm and retro tone with a slight graininess and filmy texture, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. The color saturation is moderate yet lively, the transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a quiet and poetic atmosphere. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject while preserving a sense of space. Overall, it presents a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, like intimate images taken with amateur equipment—authentic and emotional, rich in detail, with clear layers, combining fashion with a sense of everyday life. The interplay of light, shadow, and color creates a gentle yet slightly melancholic mood, as if telling a story about youth, love, or self-exploration",
