        {
          "id": "krea2-7488a78e3cfd9d5d73ce0a73",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫冷淡持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose light blue shirt with a slightly open collar and sleeves casually rolled up to her elbows, revealing slender arms. Her right hand is raised, fingers lightly touching the wall, nails painted red, a small silver ring on her ring finger, and her left hand hangs naturally. The folds and interplay of light and shadow create a rich sense of layering. Underneath, she wears a white knitted camisole with lace trim on the back, a smooth waistline and a slight belly reveal, showcasing youthful energy and health. She wears light blue jeans below, with metal buttons and stitching details clearly visible at the waistband. The overall look is simple yet stylish. The background is a solid-colored deep teal wall with subtle textures and mottled marks. Sunlight streams in from the left side of the frame, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The beam passes through the dust in the air, presenting a warm golden tone. The shadowed areas appear deep and textured, with close-up shots occupying the main position. The head is positioned slightly to the upper left, and the body extends diagonally, creating a dynamic sense of balance. The overall atmosphere is calm and warm, carrying the lazy and cozy feeling unique to a summer afternoon. The color palette mainly uses warm and cool contrasts, with blue clothing creating a striking contrast with the warm sunlight, enhancing the visual impact. The use of light and shadow is very delicate, featuring both sharp edge light and soft scattered light. It creates a realistic and artistic photographic effect, as if taken with an old film camera, with slight graininess and color shifts, adding a retro texture and a sense of everyday life. The entire image is filled with youthful energy and gentle strength, evoking a sense of tranquil beauty and inner peace",
