        {
          "id": "krea2-44b731b5079ec261a6abb32f",
          "alias": "单女金T恤椅上愤怒倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a light yellow camisole with small floral patterns on the bottom, paired with matching plaid shorts. Her legs are naturally crossed, barefoot on the chair's footrest, her posture relaxed and elegant. Her fingernails are painted a light pink nail polish, with exquisite details. In the foreground is the wooden armrests and soft fabric cushions, with the woman as the main figure in the center, and behind her is a wooden storage rack. On top are neatly arranged white teapots, stacked towels, and several boxes of snacks. One box is labeled \"Crunchy,\" with a can of drink and several whole oranges nearby. The background features light-colored cabinets and a window with soft sunlight. The light outside is bright but not glaring, filling the space with a cozy homely atmosphere. The composition uses a slightly top-down perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The curves of the rocking chair and the lines of the figure's body shape guide the gaze toward the center. Light and shadow come from the right window, creating a natural sidelight effect that creates a warm and bright atmosphere. The shadows delicately outline the outlines of objects, with the overall color scheme mainly warm yellow and beige, accented with orange and green, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The image presents a tranquil beauty of daily life, as if capturing a lazy afternoon. The image texture is delicate, with a grainy texture and slight film tones of real photography, simulating the effect of shooting with a medium format film camera. The lens focal length is moderate and depth of field is well controlled. The background is slightly blurred, highlighting the main subject while retaining environmental details. The overall style leans toward Japanese photoshoots, emphasizing a sense of realism and emotional warmth in everyday life, carrying a subtle artistic vibe and sentiment. The image is not overly embellished, maintaining a natural state as if recording an ordinary yet beautiful moment",
