        {
          "id": "krea2-26dda0fb8534e2ce47802e54",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣小径站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways beneath a golden ginkgo tree, her head slightly raised. She wears an off-white thick knit sweater with a plaid scarf at the collar. Her right hand gently holds a ginkgo leaf, its edges slightly curled and veins clearly visible. The leaves appear semi-transparent in the sunlight, as if containing the warmth and poetry of autumn. The figure is positioned slightly in the center right of the composition, forming an asymmetrical composition that creates a natural and casual beauty. In the foreground, blurred ginkgo leaves and slender branches appear nearby. The blur treatment focuses the focus on the figure. The background is a large cluster of dense ginkgo leaves, layered and layered, presenting a bright golden yellow under sunlight. Some leaves transmit light, forming soft light spots. In the distance, the outlines of trees and the pale blue sky are faintly visible. The overall background is highly blurred, highlighting the main subject. Light slanting down from above creates a backlit effect. Sunlight penetrates through the gaps between the leaves, making the texture of clothing clearly visible. The warm yellow tone dominates the entire composition, with moderate color saturation, and the tone is warm and harmonious. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, enhancing the character's elegance and spatial depth. The visual guide leads from the leaf lines in the foreground to the figure, extending to the canopy overhead, forming a natural visual path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is tranquil and healing, full of autumn poetry and romance. The image has a slight film graininess and lens glow, simulating the realistic texture of everyday amateur camera shooting. The overall style combines artistry with a sense of life, like a gentle moment captured unintentionally. It allows people to feel the beauty and tranquility amid the changing seasons",
