        {
          "id": "krea2-3b8b541787294bef4c362cac",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣森林俏皮站立吃",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways outdoors under natural light, ready to bite into it, revealing a hint of playfulness and calmness. Her left hand hangs naturally, holding a semi-transparent white plastic bag. She wears a loose white sleeveless knit vest with fine woven straps and dark underneath, creating a color contrast. The background is blurred green plants and mottled sunlight filtering through leaves to form circular light spots, creating a typical bokeh effect. Light streams diagonally down from the upper right of the frame. At the same time, light shadows are cast on the left side of the body and neck, creating a sense of depth. The overall tone is cool with a slight blue-green tone, reminiscent of a film camera texture. The image has a distinct shallow depth of field, the main subject is sharp and clear, the background is completely blurred, and the composition uses close-ups. The figure occupies most of the frame, with the head slightly tilted, creating direct communication with the viewer, emphasizing the moment's privacy and the sense of life. The light and shadow layers are rich, the transition between light and shadow is natural, and the atmosphere is calm and gentle. It carries a poetic quality captured in everyday life, as if captured by chance in the forest in the afternoon with an old-fashioned film camera. The film is full of grainy grain and slight noise, with low color saturation and a slightly retro color reproduction. Overall, it presents a nostalgic yet fresh imaging style, like a frozen summer memory. Pores and fine freckles are clearly visible, adding realism. The tomato surface is smooth, reflecting a soft sheen, details are lifelike, and the entire image conveys a quiet, The atmosphere is pure and slightly artistic, as if time has frozen in this moment, with only breath and a gentle breeze flowing. The composition is balanced, with the figures slightly positioned to the right, leaving space in the upper left for light and background to extend naturally, creating a visual sense of breathing. The direction of light and shadow is clear, with the light source coming from the rear diagonally, producing subtle contour light that makes the character's profile stand out even more. The light spots in the background vary in size, are rounded and evenly distributed, enhancing the depth and dreamlike feel of the image, presenting an overall cinematic-quality cinematic texture. Like the quiet scenes in a youth-themed film, full of storytelling, the characters' postures are relaxed, with no signs of deliberate staging, making them look more natural. Their clothing is simple and plain, fitting everyday scenes. Although the background is blurry, it is recognizable as dense woods or courtyards. The greenery is lush, the environment is fresh, and the overall visuals are clean and tidy, free from unnecessary elements. The focus is on the interaction between characters and food, conveying a cherishing of ordinary moments. The color scheme is harmonious, mainly white, black, red, and green, forming a classic and timeless visual combination, Light and shadow combined with color create a beauty that is both real and transcendent, as if the artist is meticulously composing yet unpretentiously improvised work",
          "description": "",
