        {
          "id": "krea2-4996f069978d249db48842fd",
          "alias": "单女上衣侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose white lace top, with delicate pleats at the collar and cuffs. The fabric is light and breathable, gently fluttering in the wind. In the foreground, large patches of blurred green plant leaves are clear, with faint vein patterns, some of them out-of-focus to create a soft bokeh effect. The leaves display a bright teal hue under sunlight, with mottled light and shadow. The middle is the woman's head and shoulders, who tilts her head slightly, elegant and reserved. The background blurs into a soft patch of light, with the outlines of trees and the shadows of the ground faintly visible. The overall composition uses a center-to-right approach, with the figure occupying the main position but leaving ample negative space, creating a tranquil and ethereal atmosphere. The visual guide starts from the green leaves in the foreground, forming a natural visual path, with light coming from diagonally above. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. The contrast between light and shadow is strong, with bright highlights and clear highlights, while the shadows are soft and delicate. The overall color scheme is mainly white and green, complemented by warm yellow halos, creating a fresh, natural, and tranquil summer afternoon atmosphere. The images have the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and color overflow, as if captured with an old-fashioned camera. The lens captures the dynamic beauty of sunlight filtering through the leaves, and the interplay of light and shadow reveals a poetic tranquility and gentleness The entire scene is like a story-filled artistic photography piece, combining authentic life with a touch of romantic fantasy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
