        {
          "id": "krea2-b2821fb78779a0d61e14c825",
          "alias": "单女绿泳装窗边愤怒站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the window indoors, her body slightly turned to the camera, her head looking back. Her expression carries a hint of calm and contemplation, adding a touch of softness and casualness. She wears an olive green tight-fitting swimsuit, with delicate textures and tiny highlights that fit her figure and outline graceful curves. The back features a crossed thin shoulder strap, with clean yet modern lines. Her right hand rests gently on the window frame, fingers long, naturally drawn, and under the sunlight, a soft warm tone appears. Light and shadow create contrasts of light and shadow on the arms and waist, highlighting the body's three-dimensionality and muscle lines. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, extending from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a diagonal visual guiding line. The foreground is a white window frame edge, slightly rough with slight wear marks. Below the window frame is a wooden windowsill with natural wood grain and fine scratches, adding realism and a sense of life. The middle ground is the main subject, and the background is a dim indoor space. Bookshelves, books, bottles, jars, and other miscellaneous items can be faintly seen. Some items are blurry and out of focus, creating a shallow depth of field effect that makes the figure stand out. The overall light comes from outside the left window, with strong sunlight filtering through creating a clear contrast of light and shadow, while the other side is in shadow, creating a dramatic distribution of light and shadow. The light and shadow texture is delicate, with highlights that are bright but not glaring. The shadow transitions naturally, creating a quiet and intimate atmosphere, carrying a genuine beauty casually captured in daily life, as if captured with a regular camera in natural light, without excessive embellishment, retaining the original texture and warmth. The color palette mainly features warm and cool contrasts, with white window frames and wooden elements bringing neutral tones, presenting an overall atmosphere that is quiet, restrained, and full of vitality. The composition is balanced and full of tension, with clear visual guidance and distinct layers, combining artistic flair with a sense of life. Like a photographic work recording real moments, rich in details and emotionally rich, it resonates with viewers",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
