        {
          "id": "krea2-3ea77b9fdc7ee815126e5069",
          "alias": "单女制服公园站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style school uniform stands on a sunny park path. She wears a deep blue long-sleeve knit cardigan paired with a plaid pleated mini skirt. The skirt is woven in blue, white, yellow, and brown tones into a classic checkered pattern, presenting the vibrant vibe of a youthful campus. She slightly turns to look back, revealing a unique innocence and shyness. The background is a blurry autumn forest, golden leaves shimmering warmly in the sunlight, and the shadows of the trees dapple on the gray asphalt road, creating a soft interplay of light and shadow. In the distance, faint shadows of other pedestrians can be seen, but these are blurred to emphasize the main figure's presence. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the right side, body slightly tilted, posture naturally relaxed, left hand gently holding the backpack strap, right hand naturally hanging down. Overall, it presents a casual yet elegant dynamic beauty. Light comes from the front left, while soft shadows are formed on the right, enhancing the sense of depth and realism. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and blue, creating a warm and warm contrast that creates a cozy, tranquil, and vibrant atmosphere. The camera focuses on the subject, with a clear bokeh effect in the background, highlighting the subject while preserving the realism of the environment. The image texture is delicate, with moderate color saturation, offering sharpness and layering similar to professional camera shooting. It also preserves the natural feel and atmosphere of handheld device shooting in daily life, as if capturing a moment strolling the streets after school in the afternoon. It combines the refined beauty of artistic photography with the intimacy and authenticity of everyday life. The composition is balanced and harmonious, flowing into the autumn background to form a smooth viewing path.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
