        {
          "id": "krea2-772055fe053cf872d583364a",
          "alias": "单女白T恤床沉思倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman leans against the edge of the bed, her body relaxed on a pile of white pillows, hands crossed behind her head, her posture lazy and natural. She wears a short white T-shirt with green lettering on the chest, light blue loose jeans, and a loose belt hanging casually. Her overall outfit is simple and casual, presenting a relaxed sense of everyday life. Her expression is slightly contemplative, as if enjoying a moment of tranquility. Sunlight streams in through the side window, forming a bright beam of light in the room, outlining clear contours and delicate layers of light and shadow The bed is tidy, with white sheets and pillows contrasting with the dark wall. Next to the bed is an off-white plush carpet, soft and fluffy. A light blue hat is casually placed on the carpet, adding a touch of everyday life. In the background, you can faintly see the outline of a black piece of furniture—possibly a TV cabinet or bookshelf with books or magazines on top. The overall tone of the space is dark, mainly dark green and black, creating a quiet and intimate atmosphere. The composition is shot from a low angle, with the figure occupying the left center of the frame. The body extends diagonally, creating a sense of visual flow. Light and shadow are the core elements of the composition, with strong contrast of light and shadow highlighting the subject. The sunlight-lit areas are warm and bright, while the shadowed areas are deep and dark, creating a dramatic effect. The overall atmosphere feels like a real-life snapshot, with the grainy texture and color tendencies unique to film photography, as if an old camera has captured this moment under the afternoon sun. The tones are warm, saturation is moderate, details are rich, and the image is full of storytelling and emotional tension. It was as if I could hear the gentle breeze outside the window, feeling the laziness and comfort that filled the air",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
