        {
          "id": "krea2-0a013f41642156f8b5381a8b",
          "alias": "单女蓝和服竹林忧伤倚靠出神",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a deep blue kimono, with bright orange-red lining visible at the shoulders and neckline. A wide orange-red webbing was tied around her waist, adorned with white patterns and gold geometric patterns. The kimono fabric featured delicate dark textures, presenting the elegance and refinement of traditional Japanese attire. She sat cross-legged on the wooden floor, her body slightly leaning forward, her posture naturally relaxed yet slightly lazy, adding a touch of softness and spontaneity. Her expression was thoughtful, as if gazing into the distance, or quietly reminiscing about the past. The foreground features blurred green plant leaves and the edge of a white ceramic vessel, creating a sense of everyday life. The middle is the female subject, occupying the left central position and forming a visual focal point. The background features typical traditional Japanese architectural elements: on the left is a light green lattice paper window that emits soft light; on the right is a dark brown wooden sliding door with clear wood grain patterns. The white gauze curtain on the door faintly reveals bamboo silhouettes, adding an oriental charm to the composition. The figure sits at an angle, legs extended, forming a diagonal line extending from the lower right corner to the upper left. At the same time, spatial layering is used to organically blend foreground, middle ground, and background, visually guiding the transition from the foreground plants to the figure, then extending to the background architectural structure, creating a complete visual flow. The light and shadow atmosphere is soft and layered, with natural light streaming through the paper window creating a subtle backlighting effect, gently outlining the figure's outline. The color saturation is moderate, mainly in cool tones. The sharp contrast between blue-green and orange-red is balanced by the use of warm light and shadow, presenting an overall tranquil, gentle, and slightly melancholic vintage film feel. The tones are warm, with a slight grainy texture and slight underexposure, resembling images shot with vintage cameras. The details are rich, full of storytelling and artistic flair, and the image conveys a sense of tranquility, introspection, and poetic living",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
