        {
          "id": "krea2-81cec78f6630b13aaa238738",
          "alias": "单女绿外套街道沉思注视",
          "prompt": "Her expression reveals a hint of contemplation and anticipation. She wears a loose army green work jacket, the sleeves slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists. Her right hand holds the receiver, while her left hand is faintly visible in the lower right corner of the frame, seemingly operating another device or instrument. The background is a blurry city streetscape, and through the glass window, the outlines of green trees and buildings can be seen. The light outside the window is soft, presenting a warm golden hue. Sunlight streams in from the side, intertwining light and shadow to create a tranquil and nostalgic atmosphere. The overall tone of the image is cool, mainly green, gray, and beige, with slight film graininess and color shifts, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. The composition uses close-ups, with the characters occupying most of the image. The gaze is directly at the lens, creating a strong visual guide. The foreground features a clear subject, while the middle ground is the window and reflected light and shadow. The background is a blurred cityscape with distinct layers and slight vignetting at the edges, enhancing the vintage texture of the photo. Overall, it presents a moment captured in everyday life, like a street portrait taken with amateur equipment, full of storytelling and emotional tension. The light and shadow are delicate, the details rich, and the space is both realistic and artistic, creating a narrative space that is both intimate and open, making one wonder who she is talking to and what she is truly thinking",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
          "_classification": {
            "binding": "8f7c68d64a61e05c1fd5788d34b5960536fc97945b160a954917ca1bae8499a0",
