        {
          "id": "krea2-eb0f6708c8f3a5a03d299b7c",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙门严肃坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a tatami mat in a traditional Japanese room, wearing a white sleeveless loose top and a red floral long dress. The hem is decorated with delicate lace trim, her ankles exposed, and she leans naturally and relaxedly sideways beside a wooden sliding doorframe, her expression calm and reserved, as if lost in her own thoughts. Her right hand gently rests on the floor supporting her body, her fingers slender, creating a subtle transition of light and shadow. The background is a typical Japanese interior, with a light wood grain sliding door and lattice window frames clearly visible, and the door frame lines clean and sharp. Through the translucent paper window, you can see faint natural light outside. In the distance, you can faintly see the blurred outline of another room and the warm light reflected from the floor. The overall spatial layout presents the tranquil atmosphere of traditional Japanese-style architecture. In the foreground, yellow tatami mats cover the bottom of the entire frame, with delicate textures and layers. The middle ground centers on the figure, whose body curves contrast geometrically with the door frame structure. The composition adopts a slightly slanted perspective, creating a sense of everyday life and documentary visual experience. On the right side of the frame, a large blank area is left to enhance the sense of spatial expansiveness. Following the line of sight to the window, it returns to her lowered hand movements, forming a complete observation path. Light and shadow come from the natural light source on the left, and the soft, diffused light makes the entire scene feel warm and realistic. There are no strong shadows, highlighting the tranquil texture of everyday life. The main tones are warm yellow, off-white, and red-brown, unified and harmonious, with a slight film graininess and retro filter effect, simulating the texture of amateur camera shooting. The camera presents a slight shallow depth of field, with a natural background that highlights the main figure. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and tinged with nostalgia, like a moment frozen by afternoon sunlight slanting into an old house, capturing the true state of youth alone in a traditional setting. The details are rich but not cluttered, with every material clearly visible—from fabric folds to wood grain to the woven marks on tatami mats—together constructing a visual world full of life and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
