        {
          "id": "krea2-845b33f5553f53945fbee103",
          "alias": "单女粉旗袍椅上困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways on a wooden chair outdoors, wearing a light pink sleeveless Chinese qipao with a stand-up collar. The fabric has a delicate texture and natural pleats, presenting a cotton-linen texture. Light creates a soft transition of light and shadow on the fabric, creating a warm and moist touch. She tilts her head slightly, her expression calm and thoughtful. Her right hand gently holds a blooming white peony, its petals layered with a faint pink glow along the edges. The flower stem is slender and gently held by fingers, with neatly trimmed nails coated with transparent or light-colored nail polish, appearing clean and elegant. Under the backlight, it emits a soft sheen, as if reflecting distant scenery. The background is dense green plants and blooming white flowers, densely hanging from the branches, forming a hazy sea of flowers. The blurring effect creates a soft bokeh effect, with dappled light and shadow scattered across the figures, creating a layered light and shadow. Sunlight streams in diagonally from the upper left of the frame. Golden beams of light are formed, casting deep shadows on the right side of the body and in the background, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The composition uses the rule of thirds: the figure is on the right side of the painting, with the head facing left, and the line of sight extends beyond the frame. In the foreground, a cluster of blooming white flowers is in the upper left corner, slightly out of focus, creating a natural framing effect. In the middle ground, the main figure and the peony flower in their hands occupy the central area of the painting, rich in detail. The background is blurred green leaves and flowers, with clear layering. The visual guide begins with the flower clusters in the foreground. Ultimately, it points in the direction she gazes, forming a smooth visual path. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, full of Eastern aesthetics. The light and shadow are soft and warm, with pink, white, and green tones as the main tones, complemented by a touch of shadow, creating a dreamy spring afternoon feeling. It seems to capture a moment of tranquility and beauty. The image has the texture of film photography, with moderate color saturation and slight graininess, featuring a retro filter effect, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. The lens is a 50mm prime portrait lens, aperture f/1.8, shutter speed 1/200 sec, ISO 100, capturing true details and emotional expression under natural light. The overall image presents an artistic, gentle, and slightly nostalgic vibe, like a static movie scene, allowing one to feel the slow flow of time and inner peace",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
