        {
          "id": "krea2-162ef2226e53aa27f5d028a2",
          "alias": "单女白外套户外俏皮倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman leans slightly to the side under the warm autumn sun, revealing a genuine sense of texture and dynamism. She wears an off-white coat with the collar slightly open, revealing the white inner layer. The shoulder lines are smooth and natural, the material appears soft with slight pleats, and the cuffs have clear stitching details. Her right hand gently holds a green and black plaid scarf, with red and yellow fine stripes interwoven to create a classic Scottish plaid pattern. The scarf is thick with subtle textures and woven textures on the surface. Her left hand naturally gripped a corner of the scarf, her fingers long, her nails neatly trimmed, her hand movements relaxed and natural, as if unconsciously adjusting the scarf's position, revealing white teeth with a touch of playfulness and gentleness. The light and shadow transitioned naturally, with bright and soft highlights and delicate transitions in the shadows, creating a warm atmosphere. The background was a blurry autumn forest, with leaves showing rich shades of red, orange, yellow, and other warm tones, with rich color layers. The blur effect creates a soft bokeh effect in the background, with speckled light and light like sunlight filtering through leaves, creating mottled light and shadow. The foreground occupies the main position of the figure, with close-up shots. The heads are slightly tilted, and the body is diagonally curved, adding dynamic energy and creating a visual focal point. The camera angle is slightly lower, and the downward angle highlights the person's affinity and three-dimensionality. Using a large aperture lens results in extremely shallow depth of field, with a completely blurred background that highlights the subject. The overall color tone of the image is warm and harmonious, with warm yellow as the main tone. Accented with green, red, and black, the lighting atmosphere is warm and tranquil, as if capturing the most beautiful moment of an autumn afternoon. The image has a strong film texture, fine graininess, moderate color saturation, soft contrast, and rich details. The overall style combines artistry with the warmth of everyday life, like a high-quality portrait shot done outdoors under natural light using professional photography equipment, while preserving the casualness and nature of real life, conveying a warm, healing, and vibrant mood",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
