        {
          "id": "krea2-96f628ea1c0cd990a5ad6392",
          "alias": "单女蓝围巾忧伤",
          "prompt": "She appears smooth and textured, presenting a natural and relaxed state. She wears a deep blue knitted scarf with a thick and soft texture with clearly visible texture and slightly flickered edges, adding authenticity and warmth. The scarf wraps around her neck layer by layer, creating soft pleats and shadows, echoing her black coat and creating a warm winter atmosphere. The background is a blurry snowy or icy surface, presenting a cool-toned gray-white tone, with fine graininess and slight reflections. In the distance, hazy outlines of the scene can be faintly visible, but all are blurred to emphasize the main character's presence. The entire composition uses shallow depth of field photography, with the background completely out of focus, creating a soft bokeh effect. The composition uses the rule of thirds, placing the character on the right side of the frame while leaving a large blank space on the left, enhancing visual breathing and storytelling, generating strong narrative tension The light and shadow come from the upper left, soft natural light, possibly diffused light from cloudy days or early mornings, without obvious hard shadows. The overall color scheme is mainly cool blue and gray-white, accented by the deep blue of the scarf, creating a calm, cool, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. There are no unnecessary decorations or elements in the image; the minimalist style highlights the emotional expression of the characters. The lens uses a medium telephoto lens that simulates professional photography angles, bringing a natural sense of perspective compression and delicate skin texture expression, with rich image details. Overall, the film presents a style that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, as if captured in a moment on a cold winter day, recording the characters' deep thoughts and emotions. It has a strong cinematic and poetic atmosphere, like a quiet scene in an art film, inviting people to explore the story behind her. The visuals give a sense of quietness, restraint, gentleness, and depth, as if time has stopped at this moment, with only her breath and thoughts flowing silently",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
