        {
          "id": "krea2-bac426380c444da2125910d0",
          "alias": "单女白外套雪地微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in front of a lavishly decorated white Christmas tree, wearing a fluffy, soft white plush coat made of delicate and cloud-like lightness. The sleeves are wide and drape, giving off a warm and comfortable feel. Underneath, she wears a pale yellow spaghetti strap dress that reveals her shoulder lines, adding a touch of elegance and sexiness. It naturally drapes over her shoulders, adding a touch of tenderness. Her fingers are long and slender, Her posture was lazy and relaxed, looking directly at the camera with a faint smile, revealing a calm and contentment emotion. Beside her was a white gift box tied with a bright red ribbon. The ribbon was richly pleated with soft luster, forming a striking contrast with the overall cool tones and creating a festive atmosphere. In the background was a huge white Christmas tree, its trunk covered in thick imitation snow, with golden and silver round ornaments hanging from the branches and leaves, which reflected a warm glow under the lights. The silver sphere shimmers with cool light spots, with clear layers and rich details. The interlaced branches form a complex geometric structure that enhances the sense of depth in the image. The entire scene is bathed in soft warm light, with the light source coming from the left front, simulating natural daylight or indoor fill lighting, creating delicate transitions between highlights and shadows, emphasizing the texture and three-dimensionality of the plush material. At the same time, subtle reflections are created on the edge of the gift box and the Christmas tree, enhancing realism. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main part of the composition. Located slightly to the right of the visual center, with the head slightly tilted, the foreground features a gift box and red ribbon, which not only balance the composition but also guide the viewer's gaze. The middle ground features the main figure and part of the Christmas tree, while the background is a complete Christmas tree. The shallow depth of field renders the background slightly blurred, highlighting the main subject and creating a sense of spatial layering. The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, full of festive joy and anticipation. The color tones are mainly white, gold, and red, with a strong contrast of warm and cool tones, preserving the chilly feeling of winter. Infused with the festive atmosphere, the visuals deliver strong visual impact and emotional appeal, as if capturing a tranquil and beautiful winter moment. It resembles a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, featuring a slight film texture and natural noise, clear details, moderate color saturation, and natural light and shadow transitions, presenting a refined and authentic artistic beauty",
