        {
          "id": "krea2-08103b17f7c7878b4f71433c",
          "alias": "单女床严肃躺",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her back in a relaxed posture on a bed covered with white sheets and pillows. On her left ring finger is a small silver ring that displays a natural pink tone with a slight blush. The overall posture appears both intimate and approachable. The foreground is a partial close-up of her body, including the contours of her arms, chest, and legs. The folds of the white sheet naturally spread below the frame, forming a soft texture transition. The middle shot is her upper body and head, with white pillows and bedside areas in the background. Light softly pours down from above or sides, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The entire scene uses a high-angle overhead view, with a simple yet layered composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The lighting and shadow effects are delicate and shadows soft, without strong contrast, highlighting the texture of the skin and the folds of the clothing, accented with a faint warm yellow glow. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, comfortable, and slightly intimate. It seems to capture a moment of waking up in the morning or taking an afternoon nap, with the texture and realism of everyday life. Like a photographic work taken with an old film camera under natural light, the edges of the frame are slightly blurred, with slight graininess and color shifts, enhancing the retro and nostalgic mood. The image presents an unrefined, authentic beauty, emphasizing the subject's natural state and the rustic atmosphere of the environment. The composition is compact but not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space, conveying a quiet, introspective emotional experience",
