        {
          "id": "krea2-95437ebfc03038f65ab4d3e8",
          "alias": "单女红外套室内俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a warm indoor setting, wearing a vibrant red long coat. The coat is thick and soft, presenting a delicate wool texture. The deep red color appears especially rich and layered under the warm light. The coat's double-breasted design is classic and elegant, with delicate stitching details on the cuffs and pockets. The collar is slightly open to reveal the black turtleneck sweater underneath. The sweater's texture is clearly visible, forming a sharp contrast with the outer coat. She wears a matching red beret that hugs the contour of the head and is made of soft fabric The surface is slightly glossy, with the brim slightly slanted, adding a playful touch. She gently holds an off-white long scarf in both hands. The scarf is soft and fluffy, with fine tassel trim. The scarf is casually draped over her chest, with both ends naturally hanging down, giving a warm touch. Her overall makeup is fresh and natural. In the background is a beautifully decorated Christmas tree, adorned with small golden and brown spherical ornaments, dotted with twinkling white string lights. The soft and warm lighting creates a festive atmosphere. The trunk is covered with a thin layer of white powder, simulating snow accumulation. Light-colored ribbons are wrapped between the branches, adding a romantic atmosphere. Behind the Christmas tree is a blue-gray window frame structure, arranged in a regular pattern. The glass reflects warm light from inside, creating a hazy light effect. The distant background is blurred, and a round chandelier hanging faintly visible, emitting a soft yellow-white glow and forming beautiful light spots. There are also other indistinct furnishings in the space, such as wooden furniture and wine bottles, but all are blurred to highlight the main figures. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, naturally focusing on her. The foreground shows the figure and a nearby Christmas tree, the middle ground shows the entire body and part of the Christmas tree, and the background is a blurred indoor environment. She slightly turns sideways, while hand movements guide the gaze to the scarf and chest area. The light and shadows come from warm yellow indoor lighting, with the main light coming from the front right, creating a natural shadow transition. The light highlights the surface of the red coat, highlighting its texture. The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, full of festive joy. The color palette is mainly red, white, and gold, complemented by warm yellow tones, creating a winter scene that is both fashionable and inviting. The images have the realism of everyday amateur equipment, with slight noise and soft depth of field effects enhancing realism. The color saturation is moderate and not overly exaggerated, presenting a lifelike aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
