        {
          "id": "krea2-16cd8d7f8679e4ca4ceaf019",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣城市困倦躺指向",
          "prompt": "A woman is reclining on a dark gray fabric sofa, wearing a loose light gray knit sweater with sleeves casually rolled up to her elbows, revealing her slender arms and wrists wearing a simple silver bracelet. Her makeup is exquisite but slightly tired. When she looks at the camera, she reveals a hint of melancholy and contemplation, adding a touch of mystery and storytelling. Her right hand gently holds a white tissue, while her left hand rests naturally on the armrest of the sofa, her posture lazy and relaxed, as if she has just experienced a fluctuation of emotions. In the foreground is a wooden coffee table. The surface has slight texture and reflection, and on it sits an unopened bottle of red wine. The label is blurry but clearly made of dark glass. Next to it is a tall wine glass with a small amount of deep red wine remaining. Another transparent wine glass is upside down on the table, with obvious wine stains at the bottom, forming irregular dark red spots. On the right side of the table sits an open silver laptop, its screen glowing faintly blue and the keyboard clearly visible, suggesting it might have just finished work or been alone late at night. The background is a simple indoor environment, with walls in light gray or off-white, featuring decorative lines or wall panels. A round clock hangs on the wall, with the hands pointing to around eight o'clock. The overall lighting is dim, mainly from the soft warm light on the left or in front of the image, possibly a desk lamp or floor lamp. Light shines from the side, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. Shadows are concentrated behind the sofa and beside the figure's body, enhancing the sense of spatial layering. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, and a wine bottle in the foreground, The wine glass and computer form a visual guiding line, while blurring the background is slightly blurred to highlight the main subject. The overall color palette is mainly gray, brown, and warm yellow, accented with deep red wine accents, creating a quiet, lonely, and slightly decadent urban nightlife atmosphere. The visual texture resembles professional studio shooting but retains the details and realism of daily life, presenting a cinematic narrative style that seems to capture a woman facing her inner emotions alone late at night, possessing strong artistic appeal and emotional resonance",
