        {
          "id": "krea2-386e6308736dbbb6648e50d0",
          "alias": "单女白T恤咖啡厅微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a restaurant on a Japanese street. She wears a white short-sleeved T-shirt printed with the word \"PUCC,\" paired with a high-waisted skirt with an abstract wave-patterned purple-blue-white pattern. The hem flares slightly, showing smooth lines. She carries a small pink square bag crossbody over her shoulder, with a metal chain strap. The bag is compact and delicate with a double C logo, and she wears off-white open-toe high-heeled sandals with moderate heels. The overall look is fashionable yet everyday, with a gentle smile and staring directly at the camera. The posture is relaxed and confident, the body slightly turned to one side, left hand naturally lowered, right hand lightly clenched at the side. In the background is a wall with rough white texture, with a black square lamp hanging on it. On the left is a striking red vertical signboard with large white characters in Japanese characters \"영업decorative character\" written in bold and powerful lettering. Below is a low brick wall and a dark gray gravel pavement on the floor. On the right stands a wooden frame menu display board with pictures of several dishes. This includes a steaming bowl of ramen noodles and a plate of rice bowls. The composition centers on the characters, shot in medium shots, with the figures occupying about two-thirds of the frame, fully visible from feet to head. The camera slightly tilts down to enhance proportions and presence. The foreground features the gravel texture of the ground and the white base supporting rods; the middle ground features the main figure, a red signboard, and a menu sign; the background features walls and architectural structures, with strong color contrasts. Red and white form visual focal points, while the purple short skirt and pink bag stand out in a cool-toned environment. The light and shadow come from natural daylight, with soft and even lighting without obvious shadows. The overall atmosphere is bright and fresh, evoking the everyday feel and life of urban streets. It feels like a real street scene casually captured with a regular phone or portable camera. It is both visually striking and warm, down-to-earth vibes. It is full of the vitality and elegance of modern urban women, presenting a relaxed and carefree lifestyle. The overall style closely resembles documentary photography. Combining fashion sense with approachability",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
