        {
          "id": "krea2-05681c2ce77e02096ad30181",
          "alias": "单女白背心公寓忧伤躺",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side on a soft bed, her body slightly curled up, her head resting on a white pillow, adding a touch of laziness and authenticity. She wears a loose white sleeveless top, the fabric naturally pleated by the movements of her body. The texture of the garment is delicate, with subtle textured details that showcase the breathability and comfort of cotton-linen material. She wears black underwear, with the edges clearly visible, forming a sharp contrast with the white garment and highlighting the smoothness and naturalness of her body lines. Her left hand rests gently on the pillow, fingers long The posture is relaxed, with a hint of contemplation or melancholy. Small earrings reflect a faint metallic sheen, adding a touch of refined detail to the overall look. The bed surface is covered with striped sheets with fine texture, with colors alternating between light gray and white. The folds of the bedding are naturally distributed, showing signs of use and creating a lived-in atmosphere. The background is a simple interior wall with warm tones. The color is beige or light grayish-brown, the wall is flat with no obvious decoration, and only the outline of the headboard is faintly visible in the upper left corner. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the subject occupying about two-thirds of the left side of the frame. The body extends from left to right, with the head close to the upper left corner to form the visual center. The right side has more blank space, enhancing the sense of space and breathing. The camera angle is slightly overhead, close to level view, making the figure appear more intimate and immersive. Light comes from the front left of the frame, classified as soft lighting, possibly natural light filtering through curtains The light source is soft and even, without strong shadows. The shadowed areas transition naturally, presenting a healthy glow. The overall light and shadow layers are rich but not abrupt, with a warm gray tone as the main tone, creating a quiet, private, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The overall style leans toward everyday photography or life portraits, emphasizing realism and emotional expression, as if capturing a quiet moment in the morning or afternoon. It evokes a gentle, restrained, and slightly lonely aesthetic conception. The image details are finely handled, color fidelity is high, and noise control is well controlled simulates the effect of professional cameras shooting in low-light environments, while retaining a certain graininess to enhance realism and artistic quality",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
