        {
          "id": "krea2-ca034d19b5d158ca34112961",
          "alias": "单女女仆女仆装沙发坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a classic maid outfit, wearing a white ruffled maid hat and vintage black-rimmed glasses. The lenses reflected softly in the room, sitting on a brown leather sofa chair, leaning slightly forward, holding a bright red apple in both hands. The apple had a smooth surface reflecting a delicate sheen, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, gently holding the apple to reveal white teeth. Her maid outfit was mainly black and white, with a black dress paired with a white ruffled collar and cuffs. A white apron is tied at the chest, the hem naturally draping down to create soft pleats. White knee-high stockings wrap her slender legs, and lace trim is faintly visible at the ankles. The overall look is delicate and elegant. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with wooden furniture outlines and soft warm lighting creating a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. The foreground highlights the subject and the apple in their hand; the middle shot shows their sitting posture and clothing details; the background is blurred to highlight the subject. Light and shadow project diagonally from the left, creating a soft contrast of light and dark. Delicate shadows are created in the folds of clothing, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color tone leans warm, mainly brown, white, and black. The red apple becomes the visual focal point, creating a sharp contrast with the surrounding environment. The image has a slight film graininess and shallow depth of field, simulating the realistic texture of everyday amateur camera shooting. The lens focal length is moderate and the focus is clear The background blurs nature, creating a quiet, private, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere, as if capturing an ordinary yet poetic moment. The overall style combines Japanese photo and lifestyle aesthetics, with a strong artistic atmosphere and authenticity",
