        {
          "id": "krea2-0765a43883dc9e3715dc6544",
          "alias": "单女白T恤家中温柔躺侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side on soft white bedding, slightly tilting her head back to gaze at the camera, as if waking from sleep or immersed in a moment of tranquility. Her arms are naturally resting in front of her, fingers gently intertwined, wearing a loose white T-shirt with natural folds that hug the curves of the body. The overall posture is relaxed and genuine, presenting an effortless sense of everyday life. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, with the head and upper body occupying the main visual space. The background is soft white bedding and pillows, with the fabric texture clearly visible. The folds naturally stack, creating a rich sense of layering. Light streams in diagonally from the left side of the frame, presenting warm morning or afternoon sunlight. Golden beams of light pass through the curtain gaps, soft and directional, creating a quiet and cozy atmosphere. The foreground features a white quilt and pillow close to the lens, rich in detail, with obvious indentations and fibrous textures. The middle ground features the main subject, whose outline is clear, while the background gradually blurs, leaving only the blurred bedding outline to highlight the subject. The composition uses a low-angle overhead view. Enhancing intimacy and immersion, visual guidance guides the viewer's gaze from the direction of the light source, extending to the texture details of the hands and bedding. The overall color palette is mainly warm white, complemented by soft beige tones, creating harmonious and unified colors. The transitions between light and shadow are natural, without harsh shadows, creating a quiet, comfortable, and intimate home atmosphere that seems to capture a lazy moment in the early morning or afternoon. The image texture is similar to shooting with a full-frame camera paired with a large-aperture lens, featuring slight film graininess and natural exposure control. It presents a sense of everyday realism, while also embodying the aesthetic style of artistic photography. It emphasizes dramatic light and shadow and emotional expression. The overall style leans toward Japanese photoshoots or literary styles, focusing on detail and emotional conveyance. The composition is simple yet layered, and the atmosphere is tranquil and thought-provoking, allowing people to feel a poetic and gentle touch in ordinary life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
