        {
          "id": "krea2-4f062a452a79edb34319d9ad",
          "alias": "单女紫内衣窗边沉思跪",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on a warm wooden floor, wearing a black-and-white striped long-sleeve top and purple underwear, presenting a daily yet intimate home atmosphere. Her expression is slightly lazy and contemplative, wearing a black collar around her neck that adds a touch of personal detail. She leans slightly forward, hands resting on the floor, her posture relaxed yet full of tension, creating a quiet yet subtle sense of movement. On the left side of the painting is an old-fashioned metal fan with clearly visible blades, and the fan stand features a vintage wrought iron design. Beside it, a woven basket and some blurry household items can be vaguely seen. In the background is a dark brown wooden drawer cabinet, with obvious wood grain and signs of use. The drawer handles are made of metal, giving off a texture marked by the passage of time. Above the cabinet are several small items, including green packaging boxes and some books or magazines, adding a touch of life. The room is filled with light from the upper left window, softly streaming into the room and creating a bright transition of light and shadow. The floor is dappled with light and shadow. Reflecting warm orange-yellow tones while preserving delicate shadow layering, the composition uses a low-angle shooting close to the ground, making the figures stand out more and have visual impact. The foreground features clear wood floor textures and hand details, the middle ground features the main body along with fans and baskets, while the background features drawer cabinets and parts of the walls. The spatial layers are distinct, extending along body lines to hands and floor, ultimately supported by fans and background furniture, forming a complete visual closed loop. The overall atmosphere blends the casual nature of daily life with the sophistication of artistic photography. It feels like a moment captured by private documentation, or like a carefully designed set design. The colors are mainly warm tones, with black-and-white stripes contrasting sharply with purple underwear, while the brownish-yellow wooden furniture and the orange-red floors complement each other, enhancing the overall harmony of the image. The use of light and shadow is natural and unforced, emphasizing the changes in lighting in the real environment, creating a quiet, private, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere, as if time has stopped at this moment. It allows people to feel a poetic and beautiful quality found in ordinary life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
