        {
          "id": "krea2-42b51ddf45204c093faac939",
          "alias": "单女粉和服乡村忧伤站立出神",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a pink kimono stands in the center of a golden rapeseed flower field. Her kimono is embroidered with exquisite cherry blossom patterns, her sleeves fluttering as if swayed by the breeze, her posture elegant yet slightly melancholic, as if lost in thought or waiting for something. Her figure stands out both small and prominent in the vast fields. In the foreground is a vast expanse of blooming rapeseed flowers, dense and blurred, creating a soft blurred effect that presents warm lemon yellow and orange-yellow tones. The petals are rich in layers, light and shadow intertwine, creating a dreamlike visual experience. The middle ground features undulating fields, with low vegetation covering the ground. The color shifts naturally from green to brown, transitioning naturally. The figure stands on a small mound of earth, slightly elevated above the surroundings, forming a visual focal point. The background is the continuous snow-capped mountain range, with peaks towering into the clouds. The summit is covered in white snow, with clear outlines against the clear blue sky. The mountain body displays a blue-gray tone, creating a warm and cool contrast with the pale blue sky. The overall composition uses a low-angle shot, using rapeseed flowers in the foreground as a natural frame. Guiding the gaze through the blurred flower clusters to focus on the figure in the middle of the scene, creating a strong sense of depth and spatial layering. The composition is diagonal, with the figure positioned slightly in the center on the right side, leaving a wide blank space on the left to enhance visual balance. Light comes from the upper left, bright but not glaring, gently casting shadows and highlights on the figures and flowers. The color saturation is moderate, dominated by yellow, pink, and blue. Yellow represents vitality and hope, pink symbolizes gentleness and beauty, and blue conveys tranquility and distant horizons. The overall atmosphere blends the tranquility and poetry of Japanese aesthetics, combining the rustic charm of rural life with surreal romantic fantasies. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, with clear details and faithful color reproduction, while retaining a certain film and grainy texture, presenting a high-end cinematic style. The composition is highly narrative, as if telling a story about spring, longing, and nature. The light and shadow are handled delicately, with just the right contrast between light and shadow. While highlighting the main subject, the background remains intact. The overall composition is filled with poetry and Zen, evoking a sense of serene beauty in harmony between humans and nature. The tones are warm and layered, from the bright yellow in the foreground to the soft pink in the middle and then to the cool blue-gray in the background. The color transitions are natural and smooth, with clear visual guidance. Extending to the distant snow-capped mountains, forming a complete visual path, the entire scene is filled with the unique freshness of spring. The air is clear, the sunlight warm, and a gentle breeze seems to rustle like a sea of flowers. Smelling the blend of earth and floral scents, the painting is static yet full of vitality, presenting a beautiful mood that transcends the ordinary",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
