        {
          "id": "krea2-460dde543cbf32d57f677f83",
          "alias": "单女毛衣户外持相机",
          "prompt": "The elastic design at the cuffs and neckline ensures the garment fits the figure, giving the overall look warm and soft. She holds a golden maple leaf, its edges slightly withered but with clear veins. The overall temperament is fresh and refined. The main subject is in the foreground, with the figure occupying most of the space. The composition uses close-ups. The figure's head is slightly tilted, and the body is slightly angled to the camera, creating a natural sense of dynamism. The background features blurred green plants and scattered sunlight, creating a soft blur effect. Light shines down from the upper left of the frame, creating a warm backlight that produces beautiful halos and light spots, highlighting three-dimensionality and texture. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, blended with soft green and gold, creating a peaceful and cozy autumn afternoon atmosphere. Guided by light and color, the composition is balanced and layered. The foreground features clear and prominent figures, the middle shots feature rich sweater textures and maple leaf details, and the background blur enhances the sense of space and depth. The overall image looks like it was shot with a professional camera, yet still carries the natural texture of everyday hobbyist equipment, as if captured outdoors with a phone or regular camera, full of life and artistic beauty",
