        {
          "id": "krea2-035ba8435e798fc5feabc573",
          "alias": "单女毛衣厨房忧伤躺注视",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways on the kitchen windowsill, her body stretched out, legs naturally bent and raised, feet pointing upward, presenting a lazy and relaxed posture. She wears a loose light green long-sleeved top casually rolled up to her elbows, revealing slender arms. Her lower half is a pair of colorful knit shorts, woven from warm tones of orange, yellow, blue, and white, with cutout patterns along the edges, adding a touch of vintage and handmade charm. Her expression is natural and full of storytelling. The foreground is the main part of her body, clearly visible from waist to legs. Her arms rest on the countertop, fingers gently touch the edge of the sink. The background is a bright window, with faint green trees outside. Sunlight streams through the blinds into the room, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. The window frame is white, the blinds warm brown, and the wood texture is distinct. On the right windowsill sits a transparent glass vase filled with blooming yellow daisies. The flowers are lush and the leaves are fresh, injecting vitality and energy into the entire scene. The composition uses a medium angle of view, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the left of the frame. The body lines guide the gaze to the right toward the vase and the view outside the window, creating visual balance and flow. The light mainly comes from outside the right window, which is natural daylight, soft and warm, creating the atmosphere of afternoon sunshine. Shadows are delicately distributed on the figure's back and the edge of the windowsill, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall tone leans toward warmth, mainly yellow, green, and brown, with a slight film graininess and retro filter effect, making it look like a photo taken with an old-fashioned camera. It carries a strong nostalgic atmosphere and a sense of everyday aesthetics, with rich details in the visuals. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, warm, and slightly melancholic, like a real moment on an ordinary afternoon, full of poetry and emotional warmth from everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
