        {
          "id": "krea2-95e24fd9c9463576c0f8b69a",
          "alias": "单女粉和服公园忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a pale pink kimono stands beneath a blooming cherry tree, slightly tilting her head, exuding a serene yet slightly detached aura. Her right hand rests gently over her chest, fingers naturally bent, as if adjusting her collar or concealing inner turmoil. The silk texture of the kimono glows with a warm luster under soft light, and the red floral lining at the cuff edges adds a touch of traditional Japanese beauty. The background is lush cherry blossom branches, with white and pale pink flowers blooming densely, forming a hazy sea of flowers. The branches are thick and covered in moss, showing the marks of time and the wildness of nature. The sky is veiled by flower shadows, presenting a soft grayish-white tone. In the middle of the ground, blurred greenery and distant building silhouettes can be seen, suggesting this is a park or courtyard setting. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying the left center of the composition, head slightly tilted, creating a visual tension of looking up and being gazed upon. In the foreground, nearby cherry blossom branches and petals are partially blurred, enhancing the layering and depth of the image, then returning to her slightly drooping gesture. This forms a closed emotional flow, with soft and even light and shadow, like diffused light on a cloudy day or early morning, without strong shadows, giving the entire image a peaceful, poetic, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The color palette is mainly pink-white, complemented by greenish and gray-brown, creating a harmonious and unified color. The overall style combines Eastern aesthetics with the delicate texture of modern photography, resembling film images shot with a professional camera, with slight graininess and natural color temperature, while preserving the realism of moments unnoticed in daily life. Like a chance encounter in a spring photo shoot, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
