        {
          "id": "krea2-ee40a18da653b6f6a7d235b6",
          "alias": "单女外套公园沉思坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a park bench, wearing a short tweed jacket woven from black and white. The jacket's surface features delicate woven textures and a slight reflective texture. She wears a dark tight tank top underneath and light gray stockings. Her legs are smooth and natural, and she wears a pair of white pointed high heels. The uppers are smooth and slightly glossy, creating an elegant and fashionable overall look. The slightly curled drapes drape over her shoulders, her expression tinged with contemplation. She leans forward slightly, her right hand gently resting on the edge of the bench, and her left hand naturally resting at her leg. The posture is relaxed yet dignified. The bench is made of wood, with natural wood grain and slight wear on the surface. The metal bracket shows slight rust, adding a touch of vintage charm. The background is dense green pine trees and shrubs, with rich layers of leaves and interlaced light and shadow. Sunlight filters through the branches and leaves, casting mottled light spots to create a soft scattered effect. The floor is paved with gray bricks, with a few weeds growing in the gaps. On the right side of the painting, a small path stretches into the distance, gradually blurring the distant scenery to create a good sense of depth. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space at the upper right to display the environment, forming a diagonal visual line. The light comes from the upper left, which is natural daylight. It is bright and soft, with clear but not harsh shadows. The overall atmosphere is calm and warm, full of the everyday beauty of urban leisure life. The image has the texture of a real shot, as if captured by a professional camera. The details are rich, color saturation is moderate, contrast is natural, and the overall image presents a low-key sense of sophistication and a sense of artistic life in everyday life",
