        {
          "id": "krea2-537629791c775ec197015ce6",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙摄影棚俏皮蹲摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman appears in a half-squat pose, her body slightly leaning forward and her head slightly turned to the side, adding a touch of spontaneity and softness. She wears a white off-shoulder dress with a unique design, featuring wide ruffled edges on the shoulders and long pleated sleeves. The fabric is light and flowing, presenting delicate textures and layers. The dress fits the body perfectly, with a cinched waist highlighting a slender waistline. The hem drapes naturally with smooth lines, creating an overall look that is both elegant and playful. She wears a silver chain necklace. The necklace is adorned with a small pendant, and the earrings are designed with long tassels and inlaid with sparkling crystals, gently swaying with movement. The fingers are painted a pale pink nail polish, with long fingertips. The left hand rests naturally on the knee, a simple ring is worn on the wrist, and on the feet are a pair of transparent high heels with slim heels and transparent uppers, revealing the toes and ankles. The shoe design is very modern, with the overall look fashionable and full of personality. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, and the composition was shot in a medium shot. The background is a pure gray gradient, transitioning from dark gray to light gray from top to bottom, creating a clean yet sophisticated visual effect. The lighting is soft and even, with the main light source coming from the front slightly left, creating a natural shadow transition. The light and shadow create a contrast between light and shadow on the figures, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. At the same time, the gray tones of the background contrast strongly with the white clothing, making the subject stand out even more. The overall atmosphere of the scene is tranquil and elegant, with a cool and refined aesthetic, as if filming in a professional studio using professional lighting equipment. Yet it retains a sense of realism. The images present a refined artistic style, while retaining the natural texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray, simple yet layered, with a balanced overall composition and clear visual guidance. Attention is paid to the details of her clothing and accessories, making the whole scene full of modernity and fashion, giving a fresh and refined feeling",
