        {
          "id": "krea2-9be1a1f23557400a075b8865",
          "alias": "单女白和服雪地严肃站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a delicate white lace kimono, with a stand-up collar elegantly outlining her slender neck. The delicate floral embroidery on the kimono glows softly in the sunlight, and layers of lace trim on the cuffs and collar create a classical and romantic feel. A pure white camellia flower is pinned in her bun, with petals spreading out in layers, creating a gentle contrast with her skin and adding a touch of vitality and naturalness. She lowers her gaze slightly, as if lost in some kind of thought, with the figure as the main subject in the foreground occupying the left central position of the composition, using a close-up perspective from medium to close. The background is the majestic and magnificent Mount Fuji, whose summit is covered in pure white snow. Against the backdrop of blue sky and white clouds, it appears especially pure. The mountain's contours are clear, clouds swirl along the mountainside, and interwoven light and shadow create a richly layered visual effect. The middle view is a quiet rural road, clean and tidy, flanked by traditional Japanese buildings. Red brick walls and gray tiled roofs complement each other, with utility poles and modern streetlights interspersed throughout, creating a scene where tradition and modernity blend together. In the distance, several tourists can be seen strolling or taking photos. Their blurred silhouettes add a sense of life to the scene but do not overshadow the main focus. The composition uses a classic three-part layout: the figures are positioned at the left golden ratio, naturally leading the gaze to the open space on the right. At the same time, Mount Fuji serves as the main background axis, extending from the upper left corner to the upper right, forming a stable diagonal guide. The visual focus is on the spatial relationship between the figures and the peaks, with light and shadow coming from the sun slightly west of noon, bright and directional. Shadows fall behind her and on the ground, enhancing the sense of depth. The sky appears a clear blue, clouds fluffy and white, partially blocking the sunlight, casting dappled shadows over Mount Fuji. The overall atmosphere blends tranquility, poetry, and everyday realism, combining the solemnity of traditional aesthetics with the relaxedness and naturalness of modern life. The tones are mainly cool white, light gray, and blue, harmoniously unified. The image looks as if shot by a high-resolution full-frame camera, focusing on the subject, with well-controlled depth of field and moderate background blur. Details are richly preserved, presenting a texture reminiscent of professional photography, with slight film graininess and natural exposure, creating a style of daily documentation that is both realistic and slightly artistic, like a traveler casually capturing a moment with a phone or portable camera, full of warmth and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
