        {
          "id": "krea2-f1f6ead5f76b5270765eb907",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙户外沉思站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under natural light, wearing a light blue spaghetti strap dress with a light hem that drapes lightly in front of her. The material is soft with subtle pleats, presenting a casual yet elegant texture that appears soft yet layered, carrying a touch of tenderness and contemplation, as if immersed in a world of books. She holds an open book in both hands, with a botanical illustration of red flowers printed on the pages and the English title \"TREASURES of the World's Most.\" \"Beautiful Flowers\"—the edges of the pages are slightly yellowed, revealing traces of time. Her posture is naturally relaxed, her body slightly tilted to the camera, her shoulders smooth and her arms hanging naturally, her hand movements delicate, fingers slender, fingertips lightly touching the pages, showing focus and tranquility while reading. The foreground figure occupies the center-left position of the frame, the composition uses classic third-division method, with the gaze slightly tilted to the right, creating a subtle visual guide. The background is a blurred green vegetation. Under sunlight, the leaves display mottled light and shadow effects, forming numerous circular and oval bokeh spots of varying sizes, with colors gradient from light green to bright white, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. Light slants down from the upper right of the image, creating a soft backlight effect that makes the subject stand out from the background. The shadowed areas maintain delicate layering, with an even overall light and shadow distribution without harsh contrasts, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The colors are mainly blue, green, and white. The blue dress pairs harmoniously with the green background in cool tones, accented with red flowers on the pages to become a visual focal point and enhance the color tension of the image. The composition is simple yet storytelling, using shallow depth of field to highlight the subject. The background blur is well handled, preserving environmental information while avoiding distractions. The lens is similar to a 50mm prime portrait lens, delivering realistic and delicate imaging effects that simulate the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting, emphasizing film texture and slight graininess, making the image more lifelike. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, artistic, and romantic, as if capturing an ordinary yet beautiful moment, like a leisurely summer afternoon in memory. The scene is full of poetry and tenderness, allowing readers to feel the tranquility of reading and inner peace",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
