        {
          "id": "krea2-08df3a4f2857559044553eb0",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫公寓微笑张开双腿",
          "prompt": "A Korean female student wore a white long-sleeved shirt paired with a black V-neck knit tank top and a black-and-white plaid short skirt, white socks, and black flat shoes. She sat on a wooden high stool at the front of the classroom, legs spread wide, arms raised above her head, palms facing forward, and a radiant smile as she looked straight at the camera, exuding youthful energy and confident, slightly curled up. Her surroundings were typical of a Korean middle school classroom, with a huge green blackboard behind her. The blackboard surface shows slight wear marks and white chalk scratches. On the right side of the blackboard are Korean characters such as \"ジャン\" and \"02\"; on the left, handwritten numbers like \"13 points\" and \"96%\" are visible. Above the blackboard hangs a framed South Korean flag (Taegukgi), with a light wood border and clear patterns. The wall below the blackboard is a soft light pink, with a white power outlet and a small wooden cabinet on the wall. On top of the cabinet are blue erasers and chalk cases. The floor is covered with gray tiles with fine spots. The overall lighting comes from fluorescent lights at the top of the classroom, presenting a uniform and slightly cool indoor lighting effect. The light shines slightly from the front above, creating soft shadows on the characters' bodies and the floor. The composition centers on the characters, using a medium perspective where the characters occupy the main part of the frame, while background elements fully present the classroom's characteristics, creating a relaxed, lively, and authentic campus atmosphere. The image quality is close to everyday amateur equipment shooting, with slight noise and a sense of realism. The color saturation is moderate, light and shadow transitions are natural, details are rich, and the overall style combines documentary and artistic flair, as if capturing an ordinary yet vibrant campus moment, conveying the freedom, unrestrainedness, and optimistic spirit of youth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
