        {
          "id": "krea2-2772facdb2d05b8ac6826b04",
          "alias": "单女粉礼服窗边困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways by the soft window light, wearing a delicate pink lace strapless gown with delicate white lace embroidery and layered pink tulle. The shoulders are decorated with fluffy ruffled pleats, presenting a romantic and elegant courtly style. The pendant is a tiny round gemstone, adding a touch of understated luxury. She slightly lowers her head and gazes into a certain direction outside the lens, as if about to whisper softly. The overall posture presents a dynamic beauty within staticism. The foreground features the main figure occupying the main visual space, while the background is a bright white curtain that emits soft, diffused light, creating large highlights that create a dreamy, hazy atmosphere. In the middle shot, the figure's body outline and clothing details are visible, with delicate transitions of light and shadow on the skin. The background blur treatment makes the character stand out more. The composition uses a center-right golden ratio layout, with the figure's head positioned at the upper left of the frame, creating a natural visual flow. The overall color scheme is mainly pink-white, paired with warm golden halos, creating a sweet, pure, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. Light streams in diagonally through the right window, creating a soft backlighting effect. The edges are outlined by the halo to create a clear and dreamy effect. The overall light and shadow distribution shows a natural gradient without harsh contrasts, creating a quiet and poetic atmosphere, as if capturing a tranquil moment at dawn or dusk. The image texture is delicate, with moderate color saturation—neither too flashy nor too dull. It offers the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting while retaining the refinement and beauty of artistic photography, presenting an overall image that is gentle, innocent, and slightly mature, making it suitable for imagery depicting themes of youth, love, or dreams",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
