        {
          "id": "krea2-47788bce46b5fd5e42dc475e",
          "alias": "单女绿连衣裙窗边温柔坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the windowsill, wearing a light green sleeveless dress with a naturally draped hem, light and soft in texture, showing cotton-linen texture and folds. She gently holds a bouquet of colorful daisies and cosmos, with flowers mainly orange, pink, and red. The petals are distinct in layers, stamens are clearly visible, and the stems are slender, placed in a transparent glass bottle. The bottle is simple, with reflections of light in the water. She is barefoot and wears white cotton socks, her ankles slightly bent, her posture relaxed and natural, her body turned to the camera with her head slightly tilted. It creates an intimate and intimate atmosphere. Outside the window, faint green plants and trees appear. Sunlight streams through the wooden window frame into the room, creating soft light spots and warm golden tones. A few red leaves dot the edge of the windowsill, adding an autumn atmosphere. The floor is made of dark wood panels, rough in texture and clear texture. A pine cone rests quietly on the floor, rich in detail. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center to the right. The window acts as a natural frame, guiding the gaze to the figure and the bouquet, with light streaming diagonally from the left. It creates contrasts of light and dark, soft shadows, and background blur to make the subject stand out. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, light green, and pink-orange, creating a peaceful, cozy, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The image has a film-like texture, with slight graininess and moderate color saturation, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. It carries the casual and realistic feel of daily life. The light and shadow are soft and airy, as if you can feel the warmth of sunlight and the gentle breeze brushing through the leaves. The whole scene is full of poetry and a sense of life. It seems to freeze a quiet afternoon moment, immersing people in this tenderness and beauty",
