        {
          "id": "krea2-1e6c0b223051c933d9a55713",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙室内专注坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the soft indoor light, radiating a hint of innocence and curiosity. The surface of the bread is golden and slightly charred, while the inside is soft and white. She carefully holds the bread with both hands, her fingers slender and long, moving gently and focused. She wears a light beige puff-sleeve dress with small red floral patterns on the base, with delicate pleats at the neckline and a purplish-red button accented on the chest. The overall look is sweet and vintage, with the main subject positioned slightly to the left of the center, head slightly tilted, gazing directly at the camera. It creates a warm and authentic sense of interaction, with rich details. The middle ground shows her upper body and some arms, the background is a simple light gray-white wall, with slightly warm-toned light streaming in from the right side, and a slight shadow on the left wall, enhancing the spatial dimension. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the frame. The perspective is slightly lower, highlighting the details of the characters' expressions and movements, forming a natural cycle. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, presenting a tranquil feeling like afternoon sunlight shining indoors. The light comes from the right front, serving as side lighting, which makes the contours of the subjects clear. The overall tone is warm, mainly off-white, light brown, pale pink, and pale yellow, with harmonious colors that create a nostalgic film photography feel. It feels like everyday moments shot with an old film camera, with slight graininess and low color saturation. The image style blends Japanese photo with retro artistic vibes, combining the warmth of everyday life with artistic beauty. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, healing, and authentic. It lets people feel the simplest joys of ordinary life, like a quiet and beautiful afternoon with a cup of hot tea and a piece of bread",
          "description": "",
