        {
          "id": "krea2-32b3298da27858a8000ddb4d",
          "alias": "单女和服庭院困倦侧头",
          "prompt": "Her makeup is exquisite and layered, with a faint shimmer. Her skin is fair and delicate, radiating a healthy glow that creates a three-dimensional effect. She turns sideways and looks back at the camera, as if silently communicating with the viewer. The kimono fabric displays delicate textures and subtle luster. The red appears especially warm and rich under sunlight. The edges of the sleeves reveal a white base fabric lined with elegant patterns, rich in detail. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space, the head slightly tilted, and the body forming an S-shaped curve, enhancing the dynamic beauty. The background is typical Japanese architecture: wooden houses with dark gray tiled roofs and slightly raised eaves. The walls alternate between light beige and dark brown, with some areas shaded to add depth to the space. The floor is paved with irregular stone slabs Some moss grows between the cracks in the rocks, showing traces of time. In the distance, green trees and shrubs can be faintly seen, with their branches casting mottled shadows in the sunlight. Light shines diagonally from the upper right of the image, creating a strong backlight effect. The sunlight's halo above the image creates dazzling star-like spots, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, natural transitions between light and shadow, and a tranquil and solemn atmosphere. It is full of Eastern aesthetic conception, with warm red as the main color palette, complemented by white, dark brown, and green, creating a harmonious and unified color effect. The painting has a strong visual impact. yet still expresses delicate emotions, as if capturing a moment in a tranquil moment, like shooting with an old film camera, with slight graininess and natural color shifts. The lens slightly defocused, making the foreground clear and the background slightly blurred, enhancing the subject's prominence. The overall style blends classical and modern elements, blending the charm of traditional kimono culture with contemporary aesthetics, creating an atmosphere that is both real and dreamy, as if coming from a summer afternoon with just the right sunlight and gentle breeze and clouds. The woman stood quietly in the courtyard, waiting for an unfinished story.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
