        {
          "id": "krea2-a6dd13b31db739fcc7acc50d",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套街道冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside a black cast iron lamp post on a city street. She wears a fluffy, soft light blue faux fur coat. The coat's texture is delicate and layered, presenting a soft gray-blue tone. The sleeves are wide and full, naturally draping down her posture, creating a warm and luxurious visual effect. She pairs it with neat black shorts that reveal long, straight legs. On her feet, she wears black lace-up high heels, with crossed upper designs that outline the ankle line, striking a balance between elegance and sexiness. Her makeup is exquisite, In the right hand, a cup of transparent plastic beverage is gently held. The liquid is clear, with a straw inserted at an angle. The overall design blends fashion and everyday elements, full of the independent temperament of urban women. In the foreground is a thick black cast iron lamp post, its surface marked by the marks of time and peeling white lacquer skin. The top of the lamp post extends above the image, forming strong vertical lines that guide the viewer. Around the base of the lamp post are several irregular gray stone pavement surfaces with slight wear along the edges. On the right side is a row of black metal isolation posts. Thick iron chains connect the edges to form a semi-enclosed border. The middle features wide sidewalks and roads, with the ground paved with dark gray square stone bricks with neat gaps. In the distance, you can see a building with a beige exterior wall. The wall is smooth but somewhat old, and a prominent billboard hangs on it, printed with the English phrase \"The book is Valuable for everyone\" and a book pattern. The font is clear, the background is light blue gradient, and above the building, you can faintly see the sign with the character \"decorative character\" (decorative character). This suggests that this may be a bookstore or cultural venue, with dense green trees planted in front of the building. The leaves are deep green and dense, with lush branches partially obscuring the top of the building. The background features a distant street and blurred pedestrian silhouettes, with figures weaving through the distance, but details blurred to highlight the main figure. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the painting, with the body slightly tilted. The right leg is raised and rests on the lamppost, while the left leg supports itself and stands upright, forming a dynamic S-shaped curve. The head is slightly tilted, creating a strong visual direction. The buildings and trees in the background form a symmetrical framework, enhancing the stability of the image. At the same time, the lines of lamp posts and chains guide the viewer's gaze toward the figures. The light and shadow come from diffused light from cloudy days, which is evenly soft and even, with no obvious shadows. The coat's fuzzy texture appears fluffier and more three-dimensional under the soft light. The overall atmosphere is calm and slightly cool, presenting a tranquil urban street beauty, as if capturing an unintentional moment. It is both lively and artistic, with the main tones being blue, gray, and black. Accented with a touch of green and beige, the colors are harmonious and unified, creating a calm, restrained yet stylish and sophisticated visual experience. The image texture closely resembles the real scenes shot with handheld cameras, retaining slight noise and natural color transitions, and featuring a documentary-style aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
