        {
          "id": "krea2-f4f2cc26253498f1253390f9",
          "alias": "单女白连体衣广场忧伤坐摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a vintage-style wooden floor, wearing a white short-sleeved puff-sleeve jumpsuit paired with light pink stockings and gray knit knee-high stockings. The overall pose presents a quiet yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. In the foreground, a bright red apple rests on the wooden floor, flanked by several transparent glass candlesticks. On the right side is a bouquet of pink and deep red roses. The background features a vintage wallpaper with a blue-green fan-shaped pattern. On the left side is a classical carved wooden cabinet, above which is a gold-framed oval oil portrait, and below is a smaller square framed painting. The composition is taken from a low angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, forming the visual center. Using apples and candlesticks in the foreground, figures and bouquets in the center, and furniture and wallpaper in the background create rich layering, then focus upward on the decorative elements in the background. The lighting is soft and directional, with the main light source coming from the front left of the frame, creating a warm and slightly nostalgic effect of light and shadow. The shadows are delicate and natural, while subtle transitions of light and shadow appear on the sides of the body and in the folds of clothing. The overall color palette is mainly warm brown, off-white, and gray-pink, accented with bright red and deep green. The color combination is harmonious and unified, creating a cinematic feel reminiscent of old times. The image texture is delicate and rich, with a film-like graininess and slight overexposure edges. It feels as if an old film camera was used to shoot it in natural indoor light, filled with storytelling and artistic atmosphere. It resembles a carefully composed classical portrait or a quiet moment in an art film. The overall atmosphere is quiet and poetic, evoking a gentle loneliness and a longing for beautiful things",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
