        {
          "id": "krea2-21f122e0919bf55c15f48634",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫街道忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street at dusk, wearing round metal-framed glasses that reflect soft warm light. Her expression is relaxed and natural, dressed in a black turtleneck down jacket with a raised collar that wraps around her neck. The fabric shows delicate pleats and a matte texture. The overall look is simple yet warm. She is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, her body slightly turned and her head turned toward the camera, creating a subtle posture that is both intimate and distant. The details are rich, and the background is a blurred city streetscape. In the distance, you can see traffic flowing by, vehicle lights forming warm circular light spots in the blur, red traffic signals faintly visible, and the outlines of buildings on both sides of the street blurred, creating a hazy urban nighttime atmosphere. In the middle ground, the streets and sidewalks are visible, with reflective moisture or snow marks on the ground, hinting at cold weather. Low guardrails or road posts by the roadside are dyed golden by the sunset, contrasting with the cool-toned street. The composition uses a center-to-right third-section layout, with figures occupying the main position and background blur to highlight the subject. While preserving environmental information, the light and shadow flow extend to the background. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly warm yellow, with slanted light from sunsets or streetlights illuminating the right side of the figure, creating a distinct side lighting effect. The shadows transition naturally, creating a gentle and tranquil dusk atmosphere. The overall image has a grainy texture and slight overexposure reminiscent of film photography, with moderate color saturation and a vintage film tone tone, as if capturing everyday moments with an old-fashioned camera, capturing a quiet, contemplative moment in urban life. Full of life and cultural warmth, the visuals have a strong narrative quality, evoking themes of loneliness, freedom, youth, or urban drifting. The overall style combines documentary quality with artistic beauty, like a quiet scene in a film. Time seems to freeze at this moment, with a strong contrast between blurred backgrounds and clear foreground, enhancing spatial depth. Slight vignetting at the edges further emphasizes the focus on the characters. The color scheme mainly consists of black, brown, orange, and yellow. Complemented by blue and gray tones in the background, the stark contrast of warmth and cold highlights the complex emotions of a winter evening where chill and warmth coexist. The entire image presents a quiet, introspective, slightly melancholic yet vibrant atmosphere, like a silent poem recording an ordinary yet moving moment in the city",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
