        {
          "id": "krea2-ccedfc55a122be3e00e44d3f",
          "alias": "单女金和服花园严肃侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a yellow kimono with pink and white floral patterns. She gently scoops clear water with a wooden ladle in her right hand, while her left palm rises to catch the tiny droplets slowly flowing from the ladle. The droplets glisten in the sunlight, seemingly carrying a sense of ritual and serene everyday poetry. The main subject is positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the composition, with a naturally relaxed posture, body slightly leaned forward, head slightly tilted, forming a soft diagonal dynamic that creates a focused and gentle atmosphere. The foreground clearly shows hand movements and water flow details. The water droplets appear semi-transparent under the light, with faint highlights at the edges. The background is blurred, with faint green plants and wooden structures visible, possibly the outline of a Japanese garden or shrine entrance. Light and shadow come from the upper right side, creating a warm backlight effect with delicate halos and soft-focus edges. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, pale pink, and light green, with harmonious and unified colors. The composition strongly reflects Japanese aesthetic characteristics, and the composition uses a three-part layout. The figure occupies the left half, leaving blank space on the right, guiding the gaze to focus on the character's movement, then moving upward to the background space, enhancing the depth of the image. The overall image presents a realistic and emotionally charged moment like a cinematic lens, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, featuring a slight film grain texture and a slight depth of field transition. At the same time, it retains the subtle beauty found in daily life, with images full of Eastern Zen and a sense of everyday life, like a precious frame accidentally captured by a photographer on a quiet summer afternoon—both artistic and authentic in life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
