        {
          "id": "krea2-8c7171f83d9de5de4b2c3183",
          "alias": "单女全裸米高领衫城市自信坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the off-white leather seats of a luxury business vehicle, wearing a beige turtleneck sweater and a long beige coat featuring LV's classic monogram pattern. She wears a brown beret, her makeup exquisite, and her posture elegant and confident. Her legs are crossed, and she wears a pair of highly glossy nude patent leather boots. The boot shaft reaches her thighs, reflecting the surrounding light and creating a strong sense of texture and visual impact. Her left hand rests lightly on the edge of the console nearby, and on her wrist is a watch with a silver metal strap Next to it is a chain bag in the same color scheme, creating a harmonious and unified overall look full of high-end fashion. The interior space is spacious, with seats designed with diamond-patterned stitching and premium leather, edges trimmed with black piping. The details are meticulously crafted, and both the dashboard and door panels are covered in soft beige leather. Equipped with modern electronics and hidden storage spaces, the windows are fitted with louvered blinds, and the outlines of city buildings are faintly visible outside. Light streams in diagonally through the windows, creating a soft lighting effect inside. The floor is covered with gray woven carpets. The texture is clear, and the interior of the cabin is dominated by off-white, light brown, and gray-black, creating a luxurious, comfortable, and private atmosphere. The camera is shot at a low angle, pushing inward from the side of the door, positioning the person slightly to the right of the center of the frame. The lines of the seats guide the viewer's gaze and highlight the main subject. The roof control panel and sound system in the background are rich but not overpowering. The lighting comes from a mix of roof LED strips and natural light from the windows, creating a uniform and layered illumination with soft shadows. The overall scene presents a snapshot of the daily life of modern urban elites, as if captured inside a car with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens. It has a strong cinematic feel and magazine magazine texture, while retaining a touch of casual and authentic everyday life. It feels as if you have just finished a high-end event or are preparing to head to your next destination. The atmosphere is tranquil yet full of tension, with harmonious and warm colors, rich details, natural light and shadow transitions, and a stable yet dynamic composition, conveying a low-key, luxurious, independent, and confident feminine charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
