        {
          "id": "krea2-47ce66e009356ed3b3deaad0",
          "alias": "单女衬衫床坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed covered with checkered sheets, wearing a loose light-colored plaid shirt and a gray tank top, shorts on the bottom, and white long socks. Her legs are naturally crossed, her posture relaxed and lazy, and her overall temperament is fresh and sweet. The main subject is the woman, positioned slightly to the left of the center, her body slightly turned and her head facing the camera, creating a warm visual exchange. The foreground shows the bed and part of her body. The sheets feature a checkered pattern of off-white and brown with clear and visible texture, and a soft texture Beside the bed sits a black electronic keyboard, with some keys and sheet music faintly visible. Next to it is an open book or magazine printed with pictures of food, adding a touch of everyday life. The middle shot includes the bedside area behind her, a small wooden table with an off-white lampshade on top, a black lamp base, a yarn ball and a yellow packaging bag beside it. Behind the table hangs several photos against the wall, including portraits of people but blurry, creating a sense of memory and privacy. On the right side is a wooden guitar leaning against the wall. The body is dark brown, the neck is slender, and the headstock has a tuning knob. The background is the room's wall, which is covered with brown and beige checkered wallpaper, giving it a retro feel. There is a white baseboard in the corner, and on the right side is a window that lets in soft natural light. The light streams in diagonally from outside, illuminating the entire room and making the scene bright and warm. The composition combines close-ups with the environment, with the figure occupying the main position, but the surrounding environment is rich in details and distinct layers. The view is slightly overhead to enhance the sense of space, while extending to surrounding objects and background. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by warm tones. Sunlight filters through the window onto the floor and bed, creating a soft transition between light and shadow. The shadowed areas are lighter, and the overall lighting is even, without strong contrasts, creating a peaceful, cozy, and slightly nostalgic everyday atmosphere. It feels like a leisurely moment with afternoon sunlight filling the room. The whole scene is filled with the breath of life and the tranquility of youth, like a real-life moment captured with a regular camera. The visuals are realistic and natural, with rich details and storytelling. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, mainly using low-saturation colors like off-white, brown, and light gray, emphasizing comfort and tranquility. The lens effect is similar to medium format film photography, with slight graininess and soft out-of-focus effects. The background is moderately blurred, and the focus is clearly on the subjects. Overall, it presents an artistic, healing, everyday, and slightly romantic style, like a gentle poem about youth and life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
