        {
          "id": "krea2-8b5b1ce87cde08204f78208f",
          "alias": "单女室内忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman presents a healthy glow, revealing a quiet yet slightly melancholic expression. She wears a white strapless top made of light, soft material with pleats. The neckline edges are decorated with delicate lace trim, and a thin black string is tied into a bow at the chest, creating a striking contrast. The overall look is simple yet tinged with a touch of retro and sexy. The background is a light gray square tiled wall, neatly arranged with clear gaps. Light streams in diagonally from the upper right of the frame, creating a soft transition between light and dark. Creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the characters occupying most of the frame. The head is slightly tilted, with rich layers of light and shadow. Highlights are bright but not glaring, shadows are delicate and soft. The overall color palette is mainly white, light gray, and black, with a balanced contrast of warm and cool tones. The image texture is realistic, as if shot with a professional camera in natural indoor light, with slight film graininess and soft out-of-focus blur. The lens is chosen for medium to long focal length, making the subject stand out and the background moderately blurred. It enhances the sense of spatial depth, with exquisite detail processing, presenting a tranquil, private, and artistically rich everyday moment, like a snapshot captured by a photographer, full of emotional tension and aesthetic conception",
