        {
          "id": "krea2-2a8851f9c22743e1d8bb3a14",
          "alias": "单女上衣神秘手持物",
          "prompt": "The leaves vary in shape—some are full and rounded, others have slightly curled edges, showing varying shades of green. She wears a loose black top with wide sleeves, and the material looks soft and wrinkled. The neckline is slightly open, revealing the collarbone and neck lines. The right hand gently supports the head, fingers long, elegant and relaxed, while the left hand holds a large green leaf, with clear veins as if just plucked from a tree. The overall design is simple yet stylish. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center, with close-up shots. The middle ground shows the shoulder and upper body outlines, while the background features blurred green plants and dark shadow areas, creating a strong contrast of depth of field between front and back. The leaves and branches in the background blur into soft patches of color, creating a tranquil and mysterious atmosphere. The transition between light and shadow is smooth, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color tone is dominated by black, green, and brown, with moderate color saturation and harmonious contrasts of warm and cool tones, giving a fresh, natural, and slightly artistic feel. The scene is tranquil and poetic, full of youthful vitality and natural spirituality. The photography style is similar to everyday amateur equipment, with strong realism and rich details, free of excessive retouching, preserving the natural state of everyday life. The lens is a medium-focus prime with an aperture of about f/1.8, achieving a shallow depth of field effect, making the subject clear and prominent, the background completely blurred, while maintaining high image quality and detail reproduction. Overall, it presents a visual experience that is both artistic and realistic in everyday life",
