        {
          "id": "krea2-57d98e6a2bb1cdb7726b3088",
          "alias": "单女制服图书馆忧伤坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a vintage-style wooden chair, wearing a dark school uniform jacket paired with a white shirt and black pleated skirt. She wears black leather shoes and white mid-calf socks, with a white headband on her head. She holds an open book in both hands, her body slightly leaning forward, her expression focused yet tinged with melancholy, creating a quiet and contemplative atmosphere. In the foreground, her legs and feet are close-up, black leather shoes contrast sharply with white socks, and the lines of her calves are smooth and natural. In the center, she shows her upper body posture and the book in her hand, the pages slightly curled. The yellowed edges hint at an old book that has been frequently flipped through. The background is an indoor space full of nostalgia, with a blurred dark sofa outline on the left and a wooden bookshelf on the right side neatly arranged with various books. Some spines are brightly colored, adding a touch of everyday life. On the small round table next to it sits a pair of glasses framed in metal, reflecting faint light. The window is located at the back left of the frame, with sunlight slanting in from outside, casting warm spots on the floor. The light is soft and layered, The entire scene presents a typical Japanese campus or library atmosphere, with composition combining close-ups and medium shots. The figure occupies the center-right position, forming a visual focal point. Low-angle shots enhance the character's three-dimensionality and presence, then extend along her posture to the book in her hand and the details in the background. The light and shadow are delicate to create rich texture and depth. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and brown, with a slight film graininess and low color saturation. It simulates the texture of old photos, as if shot with a classic 35mm film camera. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting, further enhancing the retro nostalgia atmosphere and enhancing realism and immersion. The entire image presents a quiet, restrained, yet story-rich beauty, like a frozen moment in a movie, evoking fragments of youthful years about reading, reflection, and growth, full of poetry and philosophical reflection",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
