        {
          "id": "krea2-26ff3d1462227bff138e62b1",
          "alias": "单女制服楼梯俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a school uniform with a white short-sleeved shirt and a blue-and-white plaid pleated skirt, paired with dark long socks and brown leather shoes. She carries a brown backpack, her right hand resting on the metal railing of the concrete stairs, standing slightly sideways on the outdoor concrete stairs. Her posture is natural and relaxed, her expression gentle and serene, showing youthful innocence and vitality. The left shoulder bag strap is clearly visible, and a cute cartoon charm hangs on the side of the backpack. Adding a touch of playfulness, she stands on a staircase made of rough concrete. The surface of the steps is covered with mottled marks and fine cracks left by time, with slight wear and weathering on the edges. The metal handrails are grayish-brown, with rust and scratches on the surface, presenting a realistic texture that comes from long exposure to nature. The background is a vast, clear blue sky, a pure pale blue with not a single cloud in sight. The sunlight is bright and soft, and light pours down from the upper right of the frame, creating a warm and bright natural lighting effect. Shadows are gently cast on the stairs and floor, creating a sense of three-dimensionality and spatial layering. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward view, placing the figure slightly to the right of the frame. The diagonal line structure of the staircase guides the gaze upward, enhancing visual depth. The foreground features local details and handrails of the staircase, the middle ground features the main subject and the stair landing, and the background is the open sky, creating a clean and bright spatial layout. The color scheme is mainly fresh blue and white, supplemented by neutral tones such as gray and brown, creating a fresh and natural atmosphere Full of summer atmosphere, it conveys a tranquil, innocent, and slightly nostalgic campus life vibe, as if capturing the most authentic youthful moments of an ordinary afternoon. The images present high resolution, delicate textures, realistic light and shadow, and natural color reproduction, with a strong realistic style and documentary feel. It resembles everyday scenes shot with a professional camera, yet retains the film-like warmth and slight graininess, allowing people to feel the passage of time and the preciousness of memory",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
