        {
          "id": "krea2-db1be3a74d523101785ba90f",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙图书馆沉思坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the wooden floor of a library or study, wearing a light, flowing white long dress. The material is as soft as cotton and linen, with delicate lace trim decorating the neckline and cuffs. The hem naturally drapes down to the floor, creating soft pleats. She sits cross-legged barefoot, feet slightly apart, toes naturally extended, posture relaxed, hands gently resting on knees, fingers long. She wears round glasses with slightly reflective lenses, frames made of light gold metal, looking directly at the camera. Her expression was gentle yet tinged with contemplation and a sense of detachment. Behind her stood a tall white bookshelf neatly arranged with a large number of books. The spines were mainly off-white, light gray, and pale yellow, with some spines slightly worn to show signs of time. The books varied in size and thickness—some upright, some slanted—creating a realistic and rich reading space. In the center of the shelf stood a vertical white pillar, printed with black Japanese characters: \"Her Dictionary ni Mutsumu wa Nai.\" The font is simple and modern, contrasting with the overall atmosphere. In the foreground, several books are scattered. One open book lies flat on the ground, its pages yellowed and edges slightly curled. Next to it is a book with a blue cover with a blurred pattern, and another thick book leans diagonally against the bottom of the bookshelf. These details enhance the realism and sense of life in the scene. The entire composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The bookshelf extends backward from both sides, forming a symmetrical frame structure. Guiding the gaze to focus on the figures, the layered bookshelves in the background create a strong sense of depth. Light and shadow come from the left side of the image, soft natural light streams through the window, while the right side creates a natural shadow transition. The light is warm and hazy, creating a quiet, cozy, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly low-saturation colors such as white, beige, and light gray, complemented by the warm brown of the wooden floor and the slight yellow of the books. The tones are unified and harmonious, and the image texture is delicate, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. It features a slight graininess and a soft out-of-focus blur effect. The lens is a 50mm prime lens with an f/1.8 aperture, creating a shallow depth of field effect that highlights the subject. The background is slightly blurred, but details remain discernible. The overall composition is balanced, the visual guidance is clear, evoking emotional resonance. The images present a serene, artistic, and poetic everyday beauty, as if capturing a moment frozen by time, full of storytelling and philosophical meaning",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
