        {
          "id": "krea2-bc20fbf16876c02916f1e2f5",
          "alias": "单女毛衣街道自信坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor step, wearing a burgundy knit cardigan and a red and white striped mini skirt, paired with white over-the-knee socks and bright red Mary Jane shoes. The overall look exudes a retro collegiate fashion vibe. On her right wrist, she wears a black smartwatch and tiny pearl earrings. Her expression is calm yet tinged with thought. Her legs are crossed, her left leg in front and right leg behind, her body slightly turned to the side, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, shot at a low angle to highlight the leg lines and clothing details. The foreground features gray stone steps and the ground, the middle ground shows the entire body and some steps, and the background features wooden doors and glass windows. The glass windows reflect blurred architectural outlines and the sky, creating a sense of spatial layering. Light comes from the upper left, soft and even, forming natural shadow transitions that emphasize three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is calm and artistic, carrying a sense of warmth and harmony in daily life. The color tone is warm and harmonious, and the color saturation is moderate. The details are rich and the texture is realistic, as if shot with a professional camera. It offers high resolution and cinematic quality, presenting the realistic feel of everyday amateur equipment shooting without losing artistic beauty. The composition is balanced, extending along body lines to the feet and finally landing on architectural elements in the background, forming a complete visual loop. The overall image is full of storytelling, evoking youthful campus life or everyday street photography scenes. The style blends vintage and modernity, combining the innocence of academic style with the fashionable vibe of modern urban fashion. The color palette is mainly red, white, and brown, accented with black accents. The color combinations are harmonious and layered, with delicate light and shadow treatment highlighting the texture of materials, such as the texture of knitwear, the smoothness of stockings, the reflection of leather shoes, and the warmth of wood. The background is moderately blurred, making the subject stand out while preserving environmental information. Overall, it presents a quiet and elegant atmosphere, like a carefully composed street photography piece, full of life and artistic appeal",
