          "id": "krea2-9d4b44034894b5cb7e8c3b2f",
          "alias": "单女学生制服室内害羞坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a corner paved with small white checkered tiles. She wears a typical Japanese schoolgirl uniform, including a light pink long-sleeved shirt, a gray V-neck knit vest, and a dark gray pleated short skirt. The neckline is tied with a dark tie with fine stripes. The overall look is clean and neat, yet youthful in tone, smooth and textured. She sits sideways, leaning slightly forward, her right hand gently brushing her neck, fingers naturally bent, her posture elegant yet slightly shy, as if lost in some kind of memory or reverie. Her legs are slightly crossed after being together, exposing her feet. The lines are smooth, and her toes are naturally extended. A faint shadow can be seen at the right ankle, and the sole of her foot forms a slight crease where it touches the ground, showing the true weight of her body. She sits on a soft cushion with a plaid pattern of beige and light brown, with slightly curled edges and a soft material with fine fabric textures, adding a touch of homely warmth to the scene. Next to her is a pair of burgundy high heels, their surfaces smooth. The shoe has a velvety texture, with a slender and slender heel, the toe pointing outward to the outside of the frame. The lining is white, and the soles of the heels are faintly visible with metal anti-slip studs. This contrasts with her current barefoot state, hinting that she has just taken them off or is about to put them on, adding narrative and everyday details. The background features a simple white checkered tile wall and floor, with evenly spaced gaps in light gray. The vertical and horizontal geometric structures between the walls and the floor enhance the sense of depth and order in the space. Light softly pours in from the upper left of the image, simulating natural or indoor lighting effects. The direction of the light source is clear, while the right side creates a natural transition of shadows. The rich layers of light and shadow highlight the three-dimensional effect of the figure's outlines and the folds of clothing, while casting soft shadows on the floor and walls to enhance the realism of the scene. The composition combines close-ups and middle shots, with the figure occupying the left central position of the image. The viewer's gaze guides the viewer toward the blank area on the right side of the image, creating a strong sense of visual extension and imaginative space. The overall color palette is mainly white, gray, and pink, accented with burgundy high heels as the visual focal point. The harmonious color coordination creates a quiet, gentle, and slightly intimate atmosphere. The image details are exquisite, presenting a high-resolution photographic texture that feels as if a professional camera is shooting in low-light environments. The shallow depth of field effect captured through the large-aperture lens highlights the subject and the background blurs naturally, while retaining sufficient environmental information to enhance the spatial realism. The entire image has a strong sense of daily life and life. Like a casual snapshot, yet filled with meticulously crafted artistic beauty, it evokes a quiet youthful mood and subtle emotional tension. The lighting and shadows are soft, the atmosphere tranquil, the composition stable, the details rich, and the visual appeal and emotional resonance high",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
