        {
          "id": "krea2-b5e22f25c17357d215e6cf5b",
          "alias": "单女乡村倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a light-colored, loose cotton-linen top and a wide-brimmed grass-woven sun hat. The brim edges curled naturally, giving off a rustic countryside feel. She leaned slightly, as if gazing into a gentle moment in the distance. Her skin was fair and delicate, glowing with a healthy glow under soft natural light. In her arms, she held a bouquet of colorful wildflowers. The flowers are mainly daisies, interspersed with small flowers in blue, yellow, pink, and purple. The petals are distinctly layered, the stamens are golden, and green leaves are set in between. The bouquet is placed in a woven basket, partially visible. The basket is made of natural rattan or bamboo strips, with clear textures and rich details. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, heads slightly tilted, forming a natural visual guideline. The direction of the gaze directs the viewer's attention to the space outside the frame, creating an immersive viewing experience. The background is a blurred green vegetation, presenting a bokeh effect. The blur is well handled, with clear layers and a clear contrast between near and far. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating mottled light and shadow. The light spots are round or oval, varying in size, soft and warm, typical of afternoon oblique light. The tones lean toward a blend of warm yellow and green, creating an overall atmosphere that is peaceful, serene, and poetic, as if you are on a summer country path. The air is fresh, the breeze gently blows, full of life and artistic flair. The image has the texture of film photography. Color saturation is moderate, contrast is low, and rich details are preserved. Highlights are not overexposed, shadows are not dull, presenting a natural transition between light and dark. The overall composition is balanced, the main subject stands out, the bouquet in the foreground echoes the figures, the middle shots have clear outlines, and the background blur enhances spatial depth. The interplay of light and shadow conveys a tranquil beauty. The overall style blends everyday documentary with artistic rendering, as if captured with an old-fashioned film camera on a sunny afternoon. With slight graininess and color overflow, it simulates the texture of real shooting. The images convey youth, freedom, romance, and a love for nature, with sincere and subtle emotions that make one pause and reflect",
