        {
          "id": "krea2-d2b272c43785197f2e5c901c",
          "alias": "单女粉西装海滩愤怒站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under a clear blue sky, wearing a light pink beret and a pair of black fine-rimmed round glasses that reflect soft sunlight. Her expression carries a hint of contemplation and gentleness. Her left hand holds a pink harmonica. The body is small and exquisite, with white keys adorned with black keys. The body has a subtle metallic texture and brand logo, and the surface is smooth with a slight reflective sheen. She wears a pink blazer made of fine cotton or blended fabric, with natural pleats and light and shadow variations. The cuffs are decorated with gold buttons, and the collar is slightly open to reveal the light-colored inner garment. The overall look presents a sweet yet slightly retro collegiate style. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition, with the figure occupying most of the space, creating a strong visual focal point. The background is a pure, cloudless blue sky, with high color saturation but not overly glaring. The sky gradually shifts from deep blue at the top to light blue at the bottom, creating a sense of open space. In the distance, a blurred outline of the sky can be seen, possibly from the seaside or suburbs. Light comes from the upper left, representing bright natural daylight. Sunlight passes through particles in the air, forming a soft halo that creates clear contrasts of light and dark and a sense of three-dimensionality. The shadowed areas transition smoothly, with highlights appearing on the accordion's metal keys and glass lenses to enhance realism. The overall color palette is dominated by pink and blue, creating a warm and cool contrast. The pink tones are warm and gentle The blue tones are fresh and tranquil, with harmonious and unified color combinations. The visual atmosphere is relaxed, cheerful, and full of youthful energy, giving a sense of realism comparable to everyday amateur equipment shooting. It feels like capturing a moment outdoors with a regular camera or phone. The background is moderately blurred, highlighting the main subject while preserving environmental information. The composition is simple yet detailed, and the image follows her posture and the instrument in her hand to the edge of the frame, forming a complete visual loop. The overall image texture is delicate, with slight film graininess and motion blur, enhancing the documentary feel and everyday life, presenting a style that is both artistic and close to everyday life",
