        {
          "id": "krea2-bd59a4338cb5006966a851e3",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣街道俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors in a café or street stall, appearing casual and lively. She wears a pair of fine-framed round glasses, the lenses reflecting faintly and transparently, reflecting the blurred light and shadow of her surroundings. Her expression is focused and calm, appearing relaxed. She wears a thick beige knit sweater, with a coarse scarf of the same color wrapped around her neck. The scarf wraps around her neck and shoulders in layers, soft and fluffy, warm to the touch. She holds a golden piece of bread in both hands, its surface crispy with obvious layers and cracks The edges are slightly scorched yellow, looking like they just came out of the oven. The fingers are long, nails neatly trimmed, and the gentle movement of holding a bun seems to be savoring this brief moment. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, heads slightly tilted, gazes downward, forming a visual guiding line. The background is blurred, presenting blurred green plants and dark architectural outlines, possibly trees by the street or shop signs. The lighting in the background is soft and the tone is cool, contrasting with the warm tones in the foreground. It creates a warm and quiet atmosphere on winter or autumn afternoons. The overall composition centers on the character, using shallow depth of field to highlight the subject, while the background is blurred into soft color blocks to enhance the sense of layering in the image. Light comes from the upper side, simulating natural light, with sunlight filtering through clouds, creating a natural transition of light and shadow, creating a warm and textured visual effect. The colors are mainly warm brown, beige, and gray-green, with a retro film tone with slight graininess and color shift, presenting an effect similar to vintage camera shooting. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, Gentle, healing, as if capturing an ordinary yet life-filled moment, allowing people to feel the subtle beauty and satisfaction found in everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
