          "id": "krea2-f18c9523936b59b87f1bae3f",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣街道忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "Low-angle downward view: Next, a woman stands at an autumn street corner. She wears a thick brown knit sweater, her sleeves slightly rolled up to reveal her slender wrists. Her hands are folded and gently clasped in front of her chest, her posture naturally relaxed with a hint of shyness and contemplation. Her dark plaid pleated skirt paired with a light gray tasseled scarf with the ends of the scarf hanging down to her waist creates a soft visual layer. Her black backpack is slung diagonally behind her, with the strap outlining clean lines on her shoulders. Her expression is gentle yet slightly thoughtful, with a background of blurred city streets. Golden autumn leaves form warm patches of light under the cool-toned sky, tree shadows sway, distant building outlines blur, and warm yellow streetlights scattered into dotted halos, creating a dreamlike depth effect. The overall tone of the painting leans toward coolness, mainly blue-gray, forming a sharp contrast with the warm brown and golden tones of the figures' clothing. Light and shadow fall from the upper right, with delicate transitions in the shadows highlighting three-dimensionality. On the left side of the foreground, dark architectural structures form a diagonal frame that guides the gaze to focus on the subject, with the composition using asymmetrical balance. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving plenty of negative space to enhance loneliness and breathability. The background blur is excellent, bokeh presents circular light spots and soft color transitions, emphasizing the subject while giving the image a cinematic texture. The lens simulates a 35mm prime portrait lens, with a large f/1.8 aperture creating an extremely shallow depth of field, capturing real life moments as if casually captured with a portable camera. It retains slight noise and film graininess, making the image warmer and more documentary. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic. Like an afternoon frozen by time, the city's noise fades away at this moment, leaving only a gentle dialogue with the autumn colors. The lighting is natural and full of storytelling, details are rich but not cluttered, and colors harmoniously unified, conveying a peaceful, warm, yet slightly melancholic everyday aesthetic. It is as if you can hear the rustling of leaves in the wind and the faint sound of traffic in the distance. The entire scene resembles a carefully composed street photography piece, combining artistic flair with the texture of real life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
