        {
          "id": "krea2-066a5c9767e015cff9ba4c1f",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤摄影棚微笑站立手持物",
          "prompt": "A pregnant woman stands sideways, her body slightly leaning forward, her right hand gently holding a pair of white shoes, while her left hand hangs naturally, her posture elegant and gentle. She wears a black sleeveless tank top and black denim shorts, revealing her rounded baby bump. The belly line is soft and full, showing the health of late pregnancy. Her dark and radiant skin carries a smile full of happiness and anticipation, revealing inner joy and peace. In the foreground are her upper body and hands, her movements delicate and fingers long. Gently holding the pair of shoes symbolizing new life, the white shoes have a simple design with bow decorations and a soft texture. The middle frame shows her entire body outline, from chest to knees, with smooth lines and a well-proportioned posture. The background is a pure light gray wall with even tones and no unnecessary elements, creating a minimalist yet focused visual space. The composition uses a medium portrait style, with the figure on the right side of the frame and the left side blank to create visual balance. At the same time, negative space is used to highlight the subject and enhance the sense of breath in the composition. The slightly tilted body and head angles of the figures bring a sense of movement. Light and shadow come from the front left, with soft and even lighting, creating a studio lighting effect. The main light is soft, shadows transition naturally, and subtle highlights are formed on the abdomen and arms, highlighting skin texture. The background wall features subtle gradient shadows, enhancing the spatial depth. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and full of hope. The color palette is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with a touch of white to create a clean and pure visual impression. The image has a strong artistic sense and emotional tension. Like works taken by a professional photography studio, yet still authentic and full of life, it seems to capture the gentlest moments of a mother's pregnancy. The images are rich in detail, layered, and harmoniously unified in color, conveying themes of maternal love, anticipation, and the miracle of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
