        {
          "id": "krea2-2b912b6f44557d041066c1eb",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣广场自信站立持镜",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a mirror in the indoor corridor, wearing bright red lipstick, exuding a confident yet laid-back aura. She wears an off-white chunky knit sweater with slightly loose sleeves revealing her slender wrists. She pairs a brown plaid midi skirt with a high-waisted design, woven from varying shades of brown and black lines. The hem is A-shaped, with a slit on one side revealing black knee-high socks underneath. She wears a pair of shiny black square-heeled ankle boots with high heels and sharp lines. She carries a black suede backpack with the strap draped across her chest. The overall look is vintage yet fashionable, with a natural posture. Her right leg is slightly raised, her toes touching the ground, presenting a casual yet elegant dynamic feel. In the foreground is her full-body image, occupying the main position of the composition. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, with a slightly tilted body forming a natural visual guiding line. The background is the indoor environment, the walls are light beige, the door frame edges are white, and on the right side is a decorative mirror with a circular metal frame. The mirror reflects part of the interior. In front of the mirror is a deep gray entryway cabinet with several bottles of transparent glass bottles of perfume or personal care products. Next to it is a wall lamp with a white cylindrical shade and a metallic body that emits a warm yellow light. The floor is paved with smooth marble tiles in a brownish tone, with clear reflections that reflect figures and furniture. In the lower right corner of the painting sits a pair of bright red low-heeled leather shoes, contrasting with the overall tone. The composition is layered and the main subject stands out. The background features clear figures, the middle includes entryway cabinets, mirrors, and wall lamps, while the background features doors and walls. The space feels strong, with light and shadow coming from the right wall lamp and possibly the top light source, creating soft side lighting. Shadows transition naturally, creating a warm and intimate home atmosphere. The overall style blends casual everyday outfits with artistic photographic beauty, as if shooting casually with a regular camera at home, preserving the authentic atmosphere of life. At the same time, careful lighting and composition enhance visual appeal, with warm tones mainly brown Off-white, black, and red echo each other, creating a harmonious visual rhythm. The composition is highly narrative, conveying a relaxed, detail-oriented attitude toward modern women's lifestyle. The overall atmosphere is both everyday and tasteful, like a street portrait capturing a fleeting moment, but with carefully arranged aesthetic intent, allowing viewers to feel an effortless beauty.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
