        {
          "id": "krea2-dce39f946b530620fda206de",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫庭院沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways in a sunlit courtyard, slightly tilting her head up to the sky, her expression calm and slightly thoughtful. She wears an off-white turtleneck knit sweater, layered with a light brown coarse knit sweater. The sweater is thick and warm, presenting a natural knit texture and a subtle plush texture. Her right hand rests gently on her shoulder, fingers lightly touching the shoulder of the sweater. On the back of her hand is a simple gold ring, with a piece of black fabric visible at her wrist. The top is adorned with small white floral patterns. She wears a light red lipstick, which looks crystal clear in the backlight, as if feeling the warmth of the sunlight or contemplating a moment. Light shines from behind her, creating a strong backlight effect, while a soft shadow transition forms in front of her body. The background is a corner of a Chinese courtyard, and on the left stands a standing wooden plaque with golden Chinese characters \"Tanxiao\" and an illustration of a Buddha statue. The edges are decorated with traditional meandering patterns. Below the plaque is a section of blue-gray stone steps. Beside the stone steps stands a seated stone Buddha, with a simple design and surface showing signs of aging. On the right side is a lush tree with deep green leaves, some branches interlaced and stretching. Beneath the tree sits a large ceramic flowerpot, dark brown with a rough texture. The ground is paved with gray stone slabs, with clear gaps between them. The overall tone is cool, contrasting sharply with the warm sunlight on the foreground. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main subject, slightly tilted to the right. The upper left corner is reserved to display background elements, with a viewpoint of level and slightly low angle, highlighting the character's elegant posture and the layers of light and shadow, creating a tranquil, leisurely, and slightly Zen-like atmosphere. The entire scene presents a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, like a real-life scene casually taken with a phone or regular camera, full of a strong sense of life and authentic texture. The colors mainly include warm yellow, off-white, brown, dark green, and gray-blue, with harmonious tones, natural light and shadow transitions, and rich details. The overall atmosphere of the painting is warm and serene, full of poetry, as if time has frozen in this moment, evoking a sense of inner peace away from the noise and a gentle longing for a beautiful life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
