        {
          "id": "krea2-0d6585739ec24b0f496df078",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙站立比耶",
          "prompt": "She wears an off-white dress made of lightweight chiffon fabric with delicate pleated textures. The dress is adorned with small blue floral patterns, vividly shaped and surrounded by green leaf decorations. The neckline is V-shaped and edged with lace trim. On her chest is a huge white satin bow. The bow is soft and layered, with puff-sleeve styles and cinched cuffs. The overall look is sweet and cute. She stands slightly sideways, her left hand naturally hanging down, and her right hand gently lifts the hem of her skirt. The hem rises slightly with movement, showing smooth lines and movement. The background is blurred green plants and white flowers, creating a soft bokeh effect. The foreground features clear figures and a blurred flower cluster and green leaves, while the background completely blurs into a hazy patch of light. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, with the gaze slightly tilted toward the lens, creating a friendly visual direction. The light is soft natural light, coming from an upward angle and evenly casting on the figure, creating warm highlights and delicate shadow transitions. The rich layers of light and shadow create a fresh and bright atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, light blue, and light green, harmoniously unified and full of dreamlike and romantic atmosphere. The image has strong visual appeal. It is as if capturing a tranquil and beautiful moment, with exquisite details that present an artistic beauty that is both authentic and transcendent, as if taken with professional photography equipment, while preserving the natural and authentic texture and warmth of everyday life",
