        {
          "id": "krea2-4abe5fcc32b3263ea8d7ddd1",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙广场站立持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under soft indoor lighting, wearing a black square-neck puff-sleeve dress with delicate vertical pleats. The material has a silky texture and subtle sheen, appearing both elegant and a hint of laziness. She wears simple silver earrings and a thin chain necklace, with a small blue gemstone pendant that sparkles gently in the light. Her right hand holds a beige-colored old-fashioned rotary dial telephone, while her left hand supports the phone base, whose surface looks slightly worn. With a matte texture marked by the passage of time, the telephone cord hangs in a spiral shape, connecting the receiver to the base, forming a smooth arc as if about to speak or just ending a call. The overall posture presents a tranquil and storytelling moment. The foreground features the main subject and telephone equipment, occupying the center-left position of the composition. The composition uses close-ups to highlight the characters' expressions and movement details. The middle ground is a soft indoor space, with a hazy white curtain in the background. The fabric is light and flowing, creating layers of folds and changes in light and shadow. Behind the curtain, natural light can be faintly seen streaming through the window, creating a warm backlight effect that creates a soft silhouette. In the background, a corner of a bookshelf and some books are faintly visible, adding a sense of life and authenticity. The overall color palette is mainly warm white, beige, and black, harmoniously unified with natural light and shadow transitions. Light enters diagonally from the right window, creating side backlighting, while the other side is enveloped in soft shadows, enhancing three-dimensionality and layering. The atmosphere is tranquil and nostalgic, as if capturing a private moment that transcends time and space. The visuals have a cinematic texture and artistic feel, as if coming from a retro-style art film scene, while preserving the subtle realism of everyday life. The lens uses standard portrait focal lengths and shallow depth of field to blur the background and highlight the subject. The camera is set to simulate the graininess and low contrast of film photography, creating a warm yet slightly faded visual effect, presenting an overall quiet, gentle, and narrative aesthetic atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
