        {
          "id": "krea2-a9789ddc351ac953bb6319d8",
          "alias": "单女粉衬衫沙发坐持书",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a plaid fabric sofa, looking casual yet refined. She wears vintage round black-rimmed glasses, with lenses reflecting slightly, presenting a relaxed and engaged state. Her right hand grips the game controller tightly, while her left hand gently supports it. On her wrist is a simple metal watch with a strap dial. The dial is small and details are clearly visible. She wears a light pink long-sleeved shirt with a slightly open collar and neatly buttoned to the second button. She pairs it with deep blue loose jeans, the pant legs naturally folded around the ankles. Her bare feet are exposed, toes naturally extended, her posture lazy yet genuine. The sofa features a classic beige and brown plaid pattern, delicate texture and soft texture. On the left side of the sofa are several books with yellowed covers and an open comic book, alongside a bag of orange-packaged snacks. The brand logo is faintly visible, and near her right leg is a bottle of transparent plastic Coca-Cola with a red label, the lid bright red, and the liquid inside is dark brown, reflecting a soft sheen. Electronic devices scattered along the floor or sofa edges, including a vintage tape player in red and black, several black headphone cables wrapped together, and a small red remote control or gaming accessory. These items are arranged in a staggered manner, creating a cluttered sense of everyday life. The background is a pure white wall, flat and unadorned. Light softly streams in from the left side of the frame, creating a warm side glow, while the other side features natural shadow transitions. The layers of light and shadow are rich, creating a cozy and cozy atmosphere. Everyday yet slightly nostalgic, the composition uses a medium shot angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The cat is positioned in the left rear as a decorative element. The entire scene layout is compact and not crowded, with warm tones dominated by warm tones such as pink, brown, beige, orange, and deep blue contrasting, while preserving natural color saturation without excessive processing. The image has a slight film graininess, simulating vintage camera shooting effects to enhance realism and the spirit of the times. The lens uses a standard focal length with a flat perspective, without obvious tilts or exaggerated angles, highlighting authentic moments of everyday life. The visual guidance starts with phones, drinks, and small objects in the foreground, gradually leading to the main subject, then extends to the cat and books in the background, forming a layered structure from near to far. The overall style blends Japanese portraiture, home life, and nostalgic technology elements, conveying a sense of tranquility. A comfortable and personally enjoyable lifestyle",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
