        {
          "id": "krea2-ee4a333d99d0a22f56e18db1",
          "alias": "单女上衣小径忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman appears in the frame from a tilted angle, creating a dynamic and natural aesthetic. She wears a simple white top with a slightly open neckline revealing her neckline, paired with a dark skirt with fine white spots. The overall style is fresh and slightly retro. She tightly holds a yellowed newspaper, which unfolds diagonally across the frame. The text and blurred images on the paper are clearly visible, presenting a nostalgic texture. The yellow tone contrasts with the cool tones of the background. Enhances visual layering: the figure is positioned slightly to the left of the painting, with their heads slightly tilted, adding a gentle touch of color and highlighting three-dimensionality. Light shines down from the upper right, creating a soft backlighting effect. The composition uses a diagonal style, with the newspaper's diagonal line echoing the character's body lines, guiding the gaze from the lower left corner to the upper right corner, forming a flowing visual path. The foreground features the newspaper and some arms, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background is a blurred green plant and a deep blue sky or wall. It presents a shallow depth of field effect, making the subject stand out more. The blurred light spots (bokeh) in the background enrich the image layers and enhance the dreamlike feel. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, as if capturing a moment of afternoon sunlight. The light and shadow are soft, the tones warm yet calm, combining the casual feel of daily life with the refinement and calmness of artistic photography. The images show the grainy texture and slight color shifts characteristic of film photography, simulating the effects of vintage camera shooting, with natural noise and slight overexposure preserved in the details. This makes the painting feel more realistic and warm, the composition full of tension, and the figures' postures naturally relaxed, as if frozen in time. The entire scene exudes a serene, nostalgic, and slightly melancholic artistic atmosphere, evoking those unintentional moments of youth. The overall composition is highly narrative, as if telling a story about time, memory, and self-reflection",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
