        {
          "id": "krea2-573217678e0c1e27a4dc5001",
          "alias": "单女毛衣草地忧伤倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "She slightly tilts her head to gaze into the distance, with soft halos at the edges, presenting a serene yet slightly melancholic expression. Her shoulders are draped with a coarse sweater, with clearly visible weaves. The colors are a mix of reddish-brown and beige, with rough yet warm textures reminiscent of handwoven texture. The background is a blurred outdoor scene, presenting a vast area of warm yellow tones, like fields or grasslands at dusk. Light falls from the upper left of the frame, creating a strong backlighting effect, producing bright halos and soft-focused light spots, outlining the main silhouette with golden light, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the right side of the frame, leaving a large area of blurred space on the left to enhance visual guidance. The line of sight naturally extends into the distance, creating a profound sense of space. The overall tone of the image leans toward warmth, mainly golden and orange-red, complemented by soft shadows and highlights. The light and shadow layers are rich, the contrast is moderate, creating a warm yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The background is completely blurred, highlighting the subject. The large aperture is used for shooting, with extremely shallow depth of field, simulating the effect of professional photography equipment. At the same time, a certain graininess and slight film texture are retained, making the images more realistic and artistic. The overall style combines cinematic and poetic feel, as if capturing a fleeting inner monologue, conveying emotions intertwined with loneliness, tranquility, and hope. The image shows no obvious movement, yet is full of inner tension. The characters seem immersed in their own world, feeling the gentle soothing of the sunset. The entire scene is filled with a quiet yet profound beauty, rich in layers and warmth like an oil painting, with light penetrating from behind. The silhouettes of the figures glow, creating a sacred halo effect that enhances emotional expression. The overall composition is simple yet powerful, and through careful arrangement of light, shadow, color, and details, it creates an artistic conception that is both everyday and extraordinary",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
