        {
          "id": "krea2-92c778c69f55ac9c99e568c2",
          "alias": "单女红外套椅上微笑坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bench in the indoor corridor, wearing a bright red coat with a fluffy, soft white fur collar wrapped around the neckline. Under the warm light, the fur collar reveals a delicate plush texture and natural layering. The coat's fabric has subtle textures and pleats, showing the texture and drape of real clothing, revealing a quiet yet subtle smile. The overall posture is relaxed and natural, with the body slightly leaning to the side, arms hugging the knees, presenting a restrained yet warm posture. The foreground figure occupies the main position in the composition. The composition uses close-ups, placing the figure slightly to the lower left of the frame to form a visual focal point. The background is an interior space of a modern building. The ceiling is made up of interlaced wooden beams, which display a natural brown texture and sheen. The spacing and light and shadow changes between the beams create a strong sense of depth and geometric beauty. Multiple round warm yellow lights hang from the ceiling, providing soft and even light. Some lights form distinct circular light spots in the frame, creating a dreamy bokeh effect. In the background, structural elements such as glass partitions and metal handrails can be faintly seen. These details are blurred, forming blurred lines and color blocks that enhance the spatial layering of the composition. The overall color palette is dominated by warm orange-yellow and soft blue tones, creating a contrast of cool and warm tones and creating a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. Light shines from above and in front, highlighting three-dimensionality and texture, while the background lights flicker in the darkness, adding mystery and artistic flair to the composition. The composition uses diagonal and guiding lines to design the composition The wooden beam extends from the top of the frame into the distance, creating a strong perspective effect that guides the gaze deeper into the distance. At the same time, the figure's posture and head direction provide subtle visual guidance. The overall image presents a cinematic texture, as if a high-quality portrait work shot with professional photography equipment, possessing strong artistic appeal and emotional expression. The details are rich, the layers of light and shadow are distinct, and the color scheme is harmonious. It combines the cold and stern feel of a modern city with warm humanistic care. It presents a tranquil, elegant, and story-rich atmosphere, like a carefully composed portrait that captures moments of the characters' inner worlds",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
