        {
          "id": "krea2-dd49750195f209c4f81f8887",
          "alias": "单女外套户外忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under the sunlight, appearing lively and natural, with a touch of tenderness and contemplation. Looking directly at the camera, she exudes a subtle melancholy and reserved temperament. She wears small earrings—two small ring-shaped earrings on one earlobe, and a flower-shaped earring on the other. The details are rich and exquisite. She wears a light gray, thick woolen coat with a delicate and soft texture, wide cuffs and a slightly open neckline revealing a white turtleneck sweater underneath. The knit texture of the sweater is clearly visible, warm and comfortable. Her hands are folded over her chest, her fingers long. On her right ring finger is a ring set with blue-green gemstones, and on her left index finger is a simple silver ring. Her hand movements are natural, as if gently stroking or slightly curling up the scarf. The scarf features a plaid pattern, made from blue, white, pink, and orange colors, with long tassels alternating in orange, blue, and white. With each movement, the tassels add a touch of movement. The background features a blurred wooden fence arranged in vertical strips, with a warm brown color. The surface shows natural wood grain and mottled marks. Some areas are brightly warm when sunlight hits, while others are shadowed, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The background is very softly blurred, highlighting the main subject. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space, heads slightly tilted and bodies slightly leaning forward, creating an intimate and intimate feeling. Light comes from the front side. It's a warm afternoon sunshine, with sunlight shining on the left side of the figure and forming natural shadows on the right. The transitions are delicate, enhancing the sense of depth and layering. The overall atmosphere is quiet and cozy, carrying a poetic touch of everyday life, as if capturing a quiet afternoon moment. The image texture is realistic, with the graininess of film photography and slight overexposure. The color saturation is moderate, the tone is warm, and it has a slight retro filter style, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. With slight noise and color shifts, the image feels more alive and artistically appealing. There are no unnecessary decorations or distractions; every detail serves the emotional expression of the figures and the creation of the atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
