        {
          "id": "krea2-bbe9b1ae967963f1c022810e",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors on a blue metal railing, wearing a loose white linen shirt with slightly rolled-up sleeves, a black tank top underneath, and brown high-waisted shorts. The overall look is casual and natural, full of summer vibes. The slightly curled and slightly messy look adds a touch of spontaneity and liveliness. She wears a bright smile, showing her white, neat teeth. Her body is slightly turned to the camera, her left hand naturally resting on the railing, fingers long, nails painted with light nail polish, and her right hand gently resting near her knee. The posture is relaxed and elegant, with a clear, cloudless blue sky in the background. The colors are pure and bright, and in the distance, you can see blurred outlines of city buildings and a few white streetlight poles or bridge structures, presenting a sense of openness at the edge of the city. In the upper left of the painting, there is a small yellow number \"1\" as a marker. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure occupying the left central position, forming a visual focal point. The railing extends from the lower left corner to the lower right, forming a diagonal guiding line that enhances the depth and dynamism of the image. The light comes from the upper and lower front, representing intense natural daylight. The sunlight evenly falls on the figures, with clear but not harsh shadows, highlighting texture. The overall color scheme mainly features a contrast of warm and cool tones. The cool blue of the sky harmoniously complements the warm white and brown of the characters' clothing, creating a fresh, bright, and warm atmosphere. The image has a strong sense of daily life and life, as if captured casually with a portable camera on a sunny afternoon, with a slight film graininess and realistic exposure. It presents a simple yet authentic aesthetic, with balanced compositions yet tension, and visual guidance flowing naturally, together creating a scene full of vitality and happiness. The overall style combines the refinement of fashion magazine shoots with the casual vibe of street photography, conveying a relaxed, free, and positive attitude toward life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
