        {
          "id": "krea2-82b826871347312c9d75dc24",
          "alias": "单女黑外套车厢忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a dim underground passage or subway platform, wearing a thick black leather jacket with sharp shoulder lines and clearly visible zipper details. She looks directly at the camera, as if she has just walked through the rain, her breathing slightly rapid. The main figure occupies the center of the composition, slightly to the right, with the head slightly tilted, creating a dynamic visual balance. The foreground is a close-up of the upper body, with a clear focal point The background is blurred, presenting blurred lines and light spots. At the top are parallel fluorescent tubes, emitting cool white light and creating a strong contrast of light and dark on the ceiling. The elongated strips of light extend deep into the frame, creating a sense of depth and spatial pressure. In the background, faint column structures and walls, along with scattered circular halos, may be distant light sources or reflective objects. These elements together create an industrial environment full of urban feel, with the composition using a low-angle downward shot. It enhances the presence and momentum of the characters, while using shallow depth of field to highlight the subject, creating a clear separation between the character and the background, becoming the emotional core of the entire image. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by high contrast, creating a strong contrast between light and shadow. The black, white, and gray layers are rich, details are full, and the overall tone is cool and restrained, exuding a strong cinematic and documentary style. The image texture resembles film grain, with natural slight noise at the edges, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting, as if capturing a moment on a damp night with an old rangefinder camera. It captures a lonely yet stubborn soul in the city, with calm and complex emotions. It carries both the alienation of the modern city and the inner struggles and strength of individuals. The entire image presents a poetic decadent beauty, like an old photograph forgotten by time, recording an ordinary yet profound moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
