        {
          "id": "krea2-4972a8885a530338ef78825b",
          "alias": "单女高领衫公园坐持杯",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench in an outdoor park, her overall aura both natural and slightly artistic. She wears a loose turtleneck green sweater, made of fluffy and soft material, presenting a warm color layer of olive green and pale yellow. The knit texture is clearly visible, sleeves slightly rolled up to reveal slender wrists, and she wears a red and black plaid pleated skirt with a naturally draped hem, creating a striking color contrast with the sweater. Her right hand gently holds a paper coffee cup with a white lid. The cup body is printed with a blurred patterned text. The left hand rests casually on the bench armrest, slightly leaning to the side, posture relaxed and elegant. The background is a corner of a city park, behind which is a neatly trimmed green lawn. Several bare deciduous trees stand among them, their branches intertwined, casting dappled shadows in the sunlight. In the distance are multi-story residential buildings, with beige exterior walls paired with neatly arranged windows. The architectural style is modern and minimalist, exuding the atmosphere of urban life. On the left edge of the image, a bicycle wheel can be faintly seen. Add a touch of everyday detail to the scene. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, occupying the main visual space. The background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. Light comes from above, creating a gentle afternoon sun, creating a transition between warm highlights and natural shadows. The direction of light and shadow is clear, creating a peaceful and comfortable atmosphere. The overall color tone is warm, mainly yellow-green and brown, accented with red, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The image quality resembles everyday phone shooting or regular camera recording, with slight graininess and realistic exposure control, without any signs of over-retouching, as if capturing a real and cozy street moment. The lens is chosen close to standard focal length, with moderate depth of field, natural background blur, and clear visual guidance, making the first thing you notice is the subject's expression and clothing details. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, full of the laziness and warmth of an autumn afternoon, like a frozen slow-paced city time, radiating the poetry and beauty of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
