        {
          "id": "krea2-c5ef4e2ac3f1fb3b7c22363a",
          "alias": "单女米围巾雪地忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "It carries a hint of melancholy and gentleness, radiating a healthy sheen. She wears a pair of exquisite pearl earrings, made of two white pearls of varying sizes, strung together. Below, metallic star-shaped or petal-shaped decorations hang down. The design is vintage and elegant, reflecting a soft glow. She wears a light beige lambswool scarf with a thick, soft texture and a fine velvet texture. The layers are distinct, wrapping around the neck to create a warm wrap. The edges of the scarf hang naturally, gently rising and falling with the body. Beneath the scarf, a brown-yellow knit sweater is visible, with clear texture and a warm coarse knit texture. Worn over it is a light gray or gray-pink down jacket. The jacket is smooth and slightly reflective, with clear details at the collar and cuffs. The outfit is harmonious and unified, presenting a warm atmosphere on a winter street. The figure is positioned on the left side of the frame, with the head slightly tilted and the body in a three-quarters side-to-side posture. The composition uses close-ups, with city streets at night as the background, covered in blurry light spots. On the right side, there is a string of bright warm yellow circular light dots, creating a strong bokeh effect. The light spots vary in size and have soft edges, presenting a dreamy out-of-focus imaging. On the left side, cool blue and purple light spots contrast with the warm yellow light, creating a visual tension where warm and cool intertwine. The background blur is handled very naturally, with rounded light spots and softer edges, without obvious noise or clutter. The entire background presents an atmosphere of both bustling and tranquil city nightscapes. The composition uses a third-division method, with the main figure positioned in the left third of the frame, leaving space on the right side to extend light and sightlines, creating a sense of breathing and narrative, guiding the viewer's gaze to flow. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the warm yellow light on the right, creating a natural transition between light and dark. Cool light spots in the background provide ambient light, enhancing spatial depth and color gradation. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, carrying the romantic vibe of an urban nightscape. The color palette mainly features warm yellow, off-white, and gray-pink, accented with cool blue-purple tones, creating a cozy yet slightly lonely winter night atmosphere. The image features high-resolution detail and a lens feel similar to professional portrait photography. Using a large-aperture prime lens with a focal length of about 85mm, f/1.8 aperture, moderate shutter speed, and low ISO control, it presents clean image quality and rich details. The image style combines artistic beauty with everyday realism, as if capturing a moment on a high-end camera on a street at night. It captures a quiet, story-filled moment, with an overall atmosphere that is peaceful, gentle, and slightly poetic, evoking thoughts of the chaotic thoughts on a winter night returning home or longing for someone far away. The visuals contain no unnecessary distractions, focusing entirely on the characters' emotions and the interaction of light and shadow, presenting a subtle yet profound aesthetic expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
