        {
          "id": "krea2-32937289af114314eac9d180",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣街道冷淡站立喝",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways on a city street corner, appearing both casual and refined. She wears a pair of fine-framed round glasses that reflect soft light, adding a touch of intellect and artistry. She wears an off-white chunky knit sweater with clearly visible textures, warm and soft. The collar of the sweater reveals a plaid shirt underneath, woven from shades of red, blue, and brown, adding layers and a vintage charm to the overall look. She is holding a black-and-white paper coffee cup in her right hand, with the note \"\" With the words \"SLOW,\" she slightly tilts her head back, sipping coffee, her expression focused and relaxed, as if immersed in a moment of tranquility. Her posture is naturally relaxed, her arm lines smooth, hand details clear, nails neatly trimmed, presenting a sense of everyday life realism. The main subject is positioned slightly in the center left, composed using a third-level method, with the figure occupying the main part of the painting but leaving space on the right to enhance breathability. The background is a blurred urban building facade, with light gray walls and black window frames forming a clean geometric outline. In the distance, warm yellow lights can be faintly seen, creating a dusk or evening atmosphere. The background blur is well handled, focusing entirely on the figure. In the foreground is the person's body and coffee cup, while the background is the outline of the street and buildings. The layers are distinct, extending along her line of sight to the coffee cup, then turning to the background light and shadow, forming a natural visual path. The light comes from the front side, soft and even, like diffused light on a cloudy day or the setting sun at dawn/evening, while leaving subtle transitions in the shadows. The contrast between light and shadow is not strong but rich, with a sense of texture. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and slightly nostalgic. The color palette mainly features warm and cool contrasts, with neutral colors like off-white, gray, black, and brown as the main tone. The color of a plaid shirt is accented to create a scene that feels both everyday and artistic. The image has a slight film graininess and slight vignetting, simulating the texture of amateur camera photography. The lens focal length is moderate and the depth of field is relatively shallow, highlighting the subject. The background is naturally blurred, and the overall style is close to documentary photography or everyday life. It conveys a slow-paced aesthetic that embraces contemporary urban life. The composition is stable without stiffness, the characters move naturally, expressions are delicate, and the entire scene is filled with warmth and storytelling, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment",
