        {
          "id": "krea2-feee557c7ce9f2c0ee3b248f",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙摄影棚忧伤坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a warm wooden floor, wearing a black dress with a white rabbit pattern, layered with a soft, fluffy white plush cardigan. The cardigan is casually draped over her shoulders, her right hand gently clutching a corner of the cardigan with a natural, relaxed posture with a hint of laziness. She leans slightly to the side, legs crossed, one foot naturally extended, the other bent and closed, toes pointing to the right side of the frame, presenting a relaxed yet elegant sitting posture that adds a touch of playfulness and liveliness, looking directly at the camera. Her expression is gentle yet tinged with shyness and contemplation, as if gazing into some distant memory. The overall makeup is clean and natural, with a simple indoor environment in the background. The light gray walls contrast warmly with the wooden floor, and on the left, a vintage patterned fabric sofa or cushion can be faintly seen, adding a touch of homely warmth to the image. Light streams in diagonally through the window at the upper right of the frame, creating a soft natural beam that creates a peaceful and warm afternoon atmosphere. The composition is shot from a low angle. The figure occupies the center left of the frame, with a slightly tilted body forming a smooth visual flow. The overall image presents a Japanese-style portrait style, with warm white, beige, light gray, and black as the main color palette. The color combinations are harmonious and unified, full of life and artistic beauty. The image texture is delicate and detailed, featuring studio-like refined lighting and shadow while preserving the realism of everyday moments. It feels like a high-quality personal portrait shot with a professional camera, yet still retains the warmth and casual feel of home video The entire scene is filled with a tranquil, gentle, and slightly melancholic artistic atmosphere, allowing people to feel the beauty of youth and the passage of time. The images present high-resolution clarity, with every detail vividly rendered. From the fiber texture of the plush cardigan to the wood grain of the wooden floor, everything is carefully depicted. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, shadows are soft, and there are no rigid boundaries, creating an immersive visual experience. The overall balance and stability of the composition not only highlight the beauty of the main characters but also fully showcase the atmosphere and storytelling of the environment It gives the illusion of touching warmth, like a quiet afternoon when sunlight filters through the curtains into the corner of the room, capturing this brief yet precious moment. Such images not only have strong visual appeal but also contain profound emotional expression, inspiring viewers to admire and fall into longing and memories of a better life",
          "description": "",
