        {
          "id": "krea2-01fa46facec75e6f0fb780fb",
          "alias": "单女白T恤博物馆冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "Her overall aura is elegant and composed, wearing a loose, pure white round-neck short-sleeve T-shirt made of lightweight, breathable material that presents natural pleats and drapes. She pairs it with light khaki high-waisted wide-leg pants with a clean and neat cut, slightly rolled-up hem revealing the ankle. The overall style is simple, comfortable, and full of design. Around her neck is a slender silver chain necklace. The pendant is small and delicate, adding a touch of detail beauty. Her hands hang naturally at her sides, her posture relaxed. The main subject is positioned slightly below the center of the composition, forming a visual focal point. The foreground is clearly visible from the lower body to the waist, while the background is a massive glass dome structure, made up of countless intersecting white metal frames, forming a complex network of geometric lines. These lines converge from the edges toward the center, creating a strong perspective effect. At the center of the dome is a circular skylight, letting in bright natural light. Light creates soft reflections and shadows on the white structure, creating a transparent and ethereal atmosphere. The middle ground is the space between the figures and the dome, where you can see other structural elements inside the building, such as supporting columns, railings, and distant blurred lighting, enhancing the sense of depth. The entire scene is set in a spacious and bright indoor hall or exhibition hall, with a flat and smooth floor in light gray tones, harmonizing with the overall cool environment. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, making the figures appear upright and commanding. At the same time, it highlights the dome's grandeur and architectural aesthetics, then extends downward along its body, guiding the gaze upward through the radiating lines in the background, finally focusing on the dome's central light source. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by natural light, evenly filtering from the skylight at the top, creating a soft, diffused light with moderate contrast of light and dark to avoid strong shadows. The overall tone leans toward a cool tone, mainly white, light gray, off-white, and light khaki, creating a quiet, pure, modern yet slightly detached atmosphere, with a delicate texture in the image. The details are rich, as if taken with a professional camera, while preserving the unintentional moments of everyday life—like real moments recorded with amateur equipment. With subtle film graininess and subtle transitions in color gradation, it presents a unique beauty that is both artistic and lifelike. All these elements together create a space full of modernity and humanistic atmosphere, conveying a tranquil, independent, and hopeful mood",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
