        {
          "id": "krea2-b6917c262db9ec7c1dbd3240",
          "alias": "单女黑外套窗边忧伤站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the withered grass by the sea, wearing a thick black pilot jacket over a white turtleneck sweater, carrying a black leather backpack over her shoulder, black gloves in her right hand, and holding a cup of coffee in a brown paper cup with a black lid and transparent plastic window. She turns sideways to look back at the camera, her makeup natural, and small gold earrings. Her overall posture is relaxed and casual, with a vast sky in the background, thick and grayish-white clouds, and a faint blue ocean visible below. In the distance, there is a row of low, red-roofed buildings, surrounded by green vegetation. In the foreground is a vast expanse of withered golden wild grass, with slender leaves swaying in the wind. The middle features the female figure and part of the grass, while the background is the sky, ocean, and distant buildings. The composition uses a third-part rule slightly to the center, with the figure occupying the right third of the frame. The view extends from the grass in the lower left corner to the figure in the upper right, forming a natural visual guideline. The light and shadow come from diffused light from a cloudy day, soft and even, with no obvious shadows. The overall color palette leans toward coolness, mainly gray-blue, beige, black, and brown, creating a tranquil and slightly melancholic autumn atmosphere. The image texture is realistic, as if shot with everyday amateur equipment, with slight graininess and natural color noise. The lens presents a slight shallow depth of field, soft background blur, rich details, and the overall image exudes a sense of life and artistic beauty, like a moment captured unintentionally, conveying a leisurely yet slightly lonely poetic mood",
