        {
          "id": "krea2-aa851ed224c5e4afbf2b7e02",
          "alias": "单女和服竹林忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a traditional kimono, her white outer robe embroidered with elegant pink butterflies and floral patterns, and a gorgeous wide red belt tied around her waist, adorned with golden waves and delicate floral embroidery. The overall outfit exudes a strong sense of Japanese aesthetics. She sits on a tatami mat covered with bamboo mats, her posture naturally relaxed, her head slightly lowered to gaze ahead. Though slightly messy, she adds a touch of casualness and authenticity, revealing a calm yet slightly melancholic mood. The natural colors create a warm and gentle texture. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, with the body slightly tilted and the head slightly turned to the side. The gaze guides the viewer to focus on her expression and mood. In the foreground is her wide sleeves and skirt hem, with rich pleats and distinct layers. Light streams diagonally from the right, creating bright highlights on the garment surface contrasting with deep shadows, highlighting the fabric's soft texture and three-dimensional form. In the middle is the bamboo mat she sits on, with clear and visible grain, fine weaving, and a natural light brownish-yellow color. The white and red kimono form a harmonious color scheme, while the background is pure black with no distractions. The minimalist background makes the subject stand out more and strengthens the visual focus. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the frame, creating a strong sense of intimacy and immersion. The camera angle is slightly overhead, making the figure appear smaller and more fragile. Light and shadow come from the sides and rear, creating a backlit effect. The edges are outlined by soft halos, enhancing three-dimensionality and layering, creating a tranquil overall atmosphere Gentle yet tinged with a hint of loneliness, it seems to capture the moment of afternoon sunlight streaming through the window frame, like a poetic moment frozen in time. The tones are mainly warm white, pink, and gold-red, complemented by a deep black background. The contrast is sharp yet harmonious. The image is full of the aesthetic of Japanese wabi-sabi, combining the elegance of traditional attire with the delicate texture of modern photography. It feels like a daily moment shot with an old film camera, with slight graininess and soft out-of-focus blur. The lens shows slight bokeh and natural underexposure. It creates a nostalgic and authentic visual style, with the overall image resembling a tranquil Eastern portrait, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
