          "id": "krea2-1d974664900d5454fc30f894",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙广场冷淡坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a vintage-style chair on the balcony, wearing a black short-sleeved top and a black mini skirt, with white mid-calf socks and black platform sneakers. She is sitting sideways on a beige leather chair, leaning slightly back, raising her right leg, resting her ankle on the black metal railing, holding an open book in her left hand and gently supporting the pages with her right. She glances back at the camera, with this woman as the main subject. Her posture is natural and relaxed, full of youthful energy and artistic vibes. In the foreground is the chair she sits on. The chair features a distinctly vintage design, with a curved U-shaped metal frame and a silvery sheen on the surface. The seat and backrest are made of beige or light brown leather with stitched edges, and the backrest is accented with green lines. The chair's structure is clear and detailed, with a black metal balcony railing in the middle of the balcony. The railing is made of vertical thin strips forming a neat grid, with clean and powerful lines extending to both sides of the frame. Above the railing are the legs and feet of a woman, whose movements break the static composition. It adds dynamism to the scene. The background is a blurred group of buildings, showing a white exterior building with arched and square windows on the walls. The window frames are dark tones, and the architectural style is simple and modern. Nearby are parts of the outlines of other buildings, with red or gray roofs. In the background, some green plants climb the walls, with lush branches and leaves, showing natural growth. Some leaves are slightly yellowish, hinting at seasonal changes. The overall background is blurred, creating a sense of depth of view. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, heads facing right. The gaze looks back at the camera to form a focal point, with legs extending upward, guiding the gaze from foreground to middle ground and then to background, enhancing spatial sense. The composition has an asymmetrical aesthetic, using postures and lines to create dynamic balance. The gaze starts from the pages, passes through hands, and extends to the legs, forming a smooth visual path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and even, with light coming from cloudy or scattered environments without strong direct sunlight, resulting in an overall cool tone, mainly gray-white, beige, and black, with a hint of light blue tones, creating a peaceful, cool, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The image texture is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and low color saturation, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, with the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The overall image conveys a leisurely, relaxed, and artistic lifestyle, as if freezing a moment of afternoon reading, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
