        {
          "id": "krea2-057b0255d192f05116c3b0ee",
          "alias": "单女粉衬衫广场自信站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under natural light, appearing casual and natural, with a fresh and refined temperament. She wears a pink short-sleeved shirt with a slightly open neckline, and the front is adorned with delicate embroidered floral patterns. A flower composed of red petals and pink flower cores, with small orange flowers and green leaves below. The shirt is lightweight and breathable, with fine pleats and textures on the surface, giving a cotton-linen texture. The sleeves are short with neat edges, and the buttons at the chest are neatly arranged, with some buttons undone. The neck and collarbone lines are shown, with a blurred outdoor natural scene in the background. The sky appears in soft tones of light blue and white, with faint outlines of green vegetation in the distance, but these are blurred to create a shallow depth of field. The foreground features clear and prominent figures, the middle is a blurred transitional area of nature, and the background is completely blurred into a hazy hue. The composition uses a centered technique, with the figure centered and the head slightly tilted, looking directly at the camera, creating an intimate and direct visual communication. The overall proportions of the image are close to square, matching the common portrait photography format. Light and shadow come from natural daylight, soft and even. When illuminated from the front and above, shadows are subtle and soft, without strong contrast, highlighting the delicate texture of the skin. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, warm, and slightly nostalgic. The tones are mainly pink, light green, and light blue, with moderate color saturation, a slight grainy film texture, and a retro filter effect. It feels like shooting with an old-fashioned film camera. The focal length is about 85mm, aperture f/ 2.0, shutter speed 1/125 second, ISO 200, capturing authentic moments under the summer afternoon sun. The image is rich in detail and layered, leaning toward artistic photography or youthful imagery, offering the realism of everyday handheld camera photography while also showcasing artistic beauty. The image contains no watermarks or text marks, retaining only pure visual language, conveying a sense of tranquility, innocence, and the accumulation of time, evoking an ordinary yet precious moment in youthful memories",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
