        {
          "id": "krea2-a4840b5ca898f1b30754c90c",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙咖啡厅愤怒站立躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the window of a Mexican restaurant by the street, seemingly lost in thought or speaking softly. She wears a short-sleeved dress with a blue and white gradient, the hem naturally draping down, made of light and flowing material. Her right hand gently rests on the window frame, her body slightly leaning against the windowsill, her posture relaxed and full of storytelling. In the foreground is the restaurant's white window frame and part of the red exterior wall. On the frame, the black capital letters \"MEXICAN\" are clearly visible, with bold and powerful characters and slight wear marks on the edges, showing the marks of time. The window glass reflects the blurred street scene and pedestrian outlines around it, enhancing the layering and realism of the image. The middle ground is the street environment behind the woman, where you can see the distant walls of red brick buildings, some hanging decorations, and blurry shop signs. There are shadows of pedestrians on the street, but the details are blurred to highlight the main figure. The background is deeper into the alleys, with green leaves peeking through the gaps, sunlight casting dappled light and shadow on the ground. The overall composition uses a three-part method. The figure is positioned in the right third of the frame, with the gaze facing the left front. The left side is left with plenty of space to display windows and text, creating visual balance. Using shallow depth of field, the background and foreground gradually blur, creating a strong sense of depth and focus. Light comes from the upper right, belonging to natural daylight, soft and warm. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves to form dotted light spots, producing delicate transitions between highlights and shadows. The contrast between light and shadow is clear but not glaring, presenting a lazy afternoon atmosphere. The color palette is mainly warm yellow and blue. The blue dress contrasts warmly with the green plants in the background, enhancing the visual impact. The overall scene is full of life and cinematic feel, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment. It feels like a documentary-style photo taken on the street with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens. It has a film texture and slight graininess, with moderate color saturation, preserving original light and shadow details and authentic texture, giving a sense of tranquility, nostalgia, and a touch of artistry. It is as if one can hear the distant bustle of the city and the gentle chimes of wind chimes. The entire scene is filled with the warmth and poetry of everyday life, making one imagine what the girl has just experienced or who is waiting for her. The scene is tranquil yet full of narrative, the composition rigorous yet natural, and every element perfectly serves the theme, creating a visual experience that is both real and dreamlike",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
