        {
          "id": "krea2-d4b98471f4ca63be9f5d88fc",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服家中微笑持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman is wearing a dark blue sailor uniform, with a white scarf and cuff details clearly visible. She is facing the camera with a gentle and sweet smile, carrying a touch of playfulness and approachability. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, occupying most of the composition. The background features warm light wood walls and blinds, arranged horizontally. Light filters through the gaps to create soft light and shadow stripes. Above the wall, a small white basketball hoop model and a red ball can be faintly seen, adding a touch of everyday life and playfulness to the scene. The overall environment presents a Japanese-style campus or home interior atmosphere. The middle ground is a transitional area between wooden cabinets and walls, rich in detail but not overpowering the main focus. The background is dominated by clean wall and furniture contours, creating a clean and tidy spatial feel. The composition uses close-ups with a slightly tilted perspective, adding a casual everyday feel. At the same time, the two \"frame\" structures formed by the hands cleverly enhance focus on the subject. Light and shadow come from the front and sides, with delicate and natural shadows without strong contrast. The overall color tone is warm and comfortable, with blue, white, and wood tones as the main tones, creating a tranquil and cozy atmosphere. The image texture is realistic and delicate, reminiscent of everyday moments shot with a regular camera, with slight film graininess and slight motion blur, simulating the realism of amateur equipment shooting. The lens focal length is moderate and the depth of field is shallow, making the subject clear and prominent while the background appears slightly blurred. Overall, it presents a friendly, natural, and vibrant youthful photo style",
