        {
          "id": "krea2-12eb8d1670524506b0108ded",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣街道害羞站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a warm night scene, wearing a bright red knit sweater with puff sleeves. The cuffs and neckline feature delicate ribbed textures, and the soft knit fabric looks especially smooth under the light. Her hands are folded over her chest, fingers slightly bent, as if gently stroking her own arms, creating a gentle yet slightly shy posture. She carries a faint, subtle smile, giving her a fresh and natural aura. Full of youthful energy, the foreground features some blurred green plant branches and leaves, with leaf edges blurred to form soft outlines. This contrasts with the light spots in the background, enhancing the sense of layering in the composition. The middle ground shows the full-body image of this woman, positioned slightly to the left of the center, slightly tilted body, head facing the camera, naturally relaxed. The background is a dreamlike scene composed of countless circular light spots, varying in size, mainly warm yellow and white, with some spots showing slight color gradation. For example, holiday lights or decorative lights on Christmas trees are completely blurred under shallow depth of field, creating beautiful bokeh. The entire background presents a hazy and romantic atmosphere. The composition uses a centered technique, with figures centered to highlight the main subject, while branches and leaves in the foreground serve as framing elements to guide the viewer's gaze onto the figures. The visual direction starts with the blurred green leaves in the foreground, gradually transitions to the figures in the middle of the background, and finally settles on the background light spots, forming a complete visual path. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the upper front Shadow transitions are natural, without harsh contrasts of light and dark. The light spots in the background provide ambient light, adding a warm tone to the image. The overall lighting is warm, creating a cozy, tranquil, and slightly dreamy atmosphere. The color scheme is dominated by red and warm yellow. The red sweater stands out against the warm background, while the green plants in the foreground harmonize, making the colors rich but not cluttered. The overall style combines the realism of everyday photography with the beauty of artistic creation. It feels like a winter night on a street, shot with a professional camera and a wide-aperture lens, preserving the details and warmth of real life, while carefully arranging light, shadow, and color to give the scene a poetic tranquility and beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
