        {
          "id": "krea2-4974fa01a2dd912cb92d0922",
          "alias": "单女全裸蓝牛仔椅上忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a yellow bench outdoors, appearing gentle and natural, with a faint melancholy and tenderness. She wears natural nude pink lipstick, revealing an effortless sweetness. She wears a blue denim jacket with unique quilted stitching on the jacket, giving off a vintage and vintage texture. There are slight wear and fading marks on the cuffs and collar. She wears a black inner layer and a bright red short skirt below. The contrast is strong and visually impactful. Her right hand is raised, elbow resting on her knee. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, wearing a black wristband and a striking red geometric earring. The unique design adds a splash of color to the overall look. The background is a blurred outdoor environment, with faint green plants and light-colored architectural structures. The blurring creates a shallow depth of field effect, highlighting the main figure. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, the head slightly tilted, body leaning forward, forming a natural diagonal line guide. The light and shadow are soft and warm, creating a delicate transition between light and shadow. The shadowed areas are soft and unobtrusive, with overall lighting as warm as afternoon sunlight. The main tones are warm yellow, paired with blue denim and red skirts. The color layers are rich but not chaotic, creating a tranquil yet story-rich atmosphere, as if capturing a tranquil moment with a sense of life and youthful beauty. The image details are clear, textures authentic, and the overall style combines fashion and everyday appeal. It feels like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, yet retains the natural spontaneity of amateur photography, full of artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
