        {
          "id": "krea2-64d23f8b71d3d9ac6d424b7b",
          "alias": "单女城市忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a dimly lit café or bar, slightly tilting her head to gaze into a certain direction outside the frame, her expression slightly contemplative and gentle. She wears a light yellow short-sleeved top made of light and soft material, with naturally smooth shoulder lines. Her right hand holds a black straw, gently inserting it into a pink drink in a tall glass before her, while her left hand rests naturally on the wooden tabletop, her fingers long and slender. The cup is filled with ice cubes and pink liquid, topped with a slice of orange and a small cranberry. A transparent glass cup is placed on a white paper coaster, its body reflecting soft light around it. The wooden tabletop displays a warm brownish-yellow tone, with clear wood grain on the surface. Sunlight streams in from the right, casting mottled shadows on the tabletop, forming a geometric pattern of interwoven light and shadow. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with several warm yellow round chandeliers faintly visible hanging from the ceiling. The light creates beautiful light spots in the blur, and in the distance, there are blurred column-like structures and dark walls. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the person positioned on the left side of the frame, body slightly tilted, gaze directed to the upper right, creating a quiet, private, and story-rich spatial atmosphere. The color palette mainly uses warm yellow and cool blue, creating a subtle contrast between warm and cool tones. Light mainly comes from the sides and rear, with soft glow penetrating the air, creating a faint halo around the outline edges to enhance realism. The entire scene is filled with the delicate texture of Japanese portrait photography, as if shot with an old film camera, with slight graininess and color shifts The background gradually blurs, highlighting the main subject while preserving environmental information. The image has a strong visual guiding effect, then follows her gaze beyond the frame, returning to the details of the drinks in the foreground. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is peaceful and warm, as if time has stood still at this moment, conveying a lonely yet beautiful everyday moment. The air is filled with a faint coffee aroma and the fresh scent of citrus fruits. The overall image presents a low-saturation, high-contrast cinematic tone, like a quiet fragment of a youth art film. It delicately captures a small yet touching moment in urban life",
          "description": "",
