        {
          "id": "krea2-20676fcc368ca606c2e538a6",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣海滩俏皮坐持食物",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a cozy café, as if silently communicating with the audience. She wears an off-white loose knit cardigan layered with a light blue floral shirt, the collar and cuffs showing the edges of the white shirt, creating clear layers, making her look both warm and elegant. Her right hand holds a wooden fork, on which a small piece of golden muffin is sprinkled with fine powdered sugar and garnished with a lump of pure white cream. The food looks soft and fluffy, giving off an enticing aroma. On a wooden tray in front of him was a stack of thick muffins, caramel on the surface with slightly charred edges, clearly visible in soft texture. Next to it was a small pile of fresh cream and a few pieces of fruit, filling the scene with a sense of life and sweetness. The background was the café's interior, with light beige walls with subtle textures. A vintage-style green chandelier hung on the wall, emitting a soft warm light that illuminated the entire space. On the wall was a wooden shelf displaying several small red and blue model cars adding a touch of childlike playfulness. The orange fabric sofa seat at the back has rounded lines and soft material, giving a comfortable feeling. In the right corner of the wall, there is a decorative wooden sign with the words \"BEACH\" written on it. Nearby are several blurry decorations such as shells and small dolls, creating a relaxed and casual atmosphere. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned at the very center, her fork and food in the foreground, rich in detail, and her body and the muffin tray on the table in the middle frame. The background features the café's furnishings and wall decorations, with clear layers. The light and shadows come from the warm yellow light slightly to the left above, creating a soft and even atmosphere. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and full of the beauty of daily life. The tones are mainly off-white, light brown, and orange-yellow, creating a comfortable and pleasant visual experience. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with an old film camera, with slight graininess and natural exposure transitions, giving a realistic, inviting, and slightly nostalgic visual style. The background is slightly blurred. It highlights the details of the main characters and food, enhancing the depth and focus effect of the image. The overall composition is balanced, the visual guidance is smooth, and from the characters' expressions to the food in their hands to the decorative elements in the background, a coherent viewing path is formed, creating a peaceful and beautiful afternoon scene",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
