        {
          "id": "krea2-0f15931278d933da7a0c3d12",
          "alias": "单女白外套街道微笑站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of golden lighting decorations in the night, wearing a fluffy, soft white long coat with a slight sheen. The collar and cuffs feature delicate pleats, making her look both warm and fashionable. She wears a gentle smile, looking directly at the camera, exuding a natural and friendly aura. She holds a transparent plastic cup filled with light green drinks, with a straw inserted in the cup. The cup body is slightly blurred, presenting a casual feeling of everyday life. The figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame, with the body slightly turned and the head turned toward the camera, creating a relaxed yet approachable posture. The background is a Christmas or holiday decoration tree made up of countless tiny golden bulbs, densely arranged to form a dazzling light spot, presenting a beautiful bokeh effect. The light spots vary in size, with colors gradient from bright yellow to warm orange, creating a dreamy atmosphere. The background blur is handled very softly. This makes the main figure stand out more. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the characters occupying about two-thirds of the frame, leaving enough space to showcase the background light and shadow layers. The overall composition is balanced and visually guided. The light mainly comes from the golden background lighting, which is backlit. The front of the figure provides slight fill light, while retaining soft shadow transitions. The light and shadow contrast is strong but not abrupt. The overall color scheme is mainly warm gold, complemented by the purity of the white coat, creating a sharp contrast that creates a cozy and romantic atmosphere. The festive nighttime atmosphere features delicate texture and rich details, combining the sophistication of artistic photography with the everyday warmth of everyday life. It feels like capturing a realistic moment casually on the street with a lightweight camera. The background blurs naturally, depth of field is precisely controlled, presenting professional-grade photography effects. The overall image exudes a unique charm where youthful vitality and gentle tranquility intertwine, allowing people to feel the warmth and beauty of winter nights",
