        {
          "id": "krea2-74ad361c76870216e17015e1",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙小径困倦坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors in a lush greenery, adding a touch of liveliness and casualness. She wears a light blue strap dress with pink, yellow, and purple floral patterns. The material is light and breathable, presenting natural pleats and drapes. The hem flares slightly to reveal elegant lines. The surface of the cup reflected the light and shadows of the surroundings, making it crystal clear. Its calm expression contained subtle emotional fluctuations, as if gently kissed by sunlight. The background was dense green vines, with leaves layered in layers, varying shades of green weaving together to form a natural barrier. Some leaf edges were illuminated by light, creating a semi-transparent texture. The ground was faintly visible with some dead leaves and soil. This increases the realism and layering of the scene. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, leaving a rich green background on the left as a visual extension, creating a balanced yet dynamic layout. The figure's head is slightly tilted, creating direct visual communication with the viewer, enhancing interactivity and emotional tension. The foreground highlights the main subject and the glass cup in hand, the middle ground shows her body and skirt, and the background is blurred greenery. The shallow depth of field effect makes the subject clear while the background is blurred. It creates a strong sense of depth, extending into the background greenery to form a smooth observation path. Light and shadow come from above, resembling the soft sunlight of evening or dawn. The light filters through the leaves, creating a warm golden highlight. The natural contrast of light and shadow highlights the three-dimensionality, making the overall atmosphere tranquil and poetic, full of the lazy mood of a summer afternoon, as if time stands still at this moment. The color palette mainly features warm and cool contrasts, with the blue dress forming a striking contrast with the warm sunlight. The green background further enhances the fresh and natural feel. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, like a high-quality portrait shot outdoors with a professional camera. It has a film texture and slight graininess, moderate color saturation, rich details, and natural light and shadow transitions, providing a realistic and dreamy visual experience",
