        {
          "id": "krea2-52e90240595567f7f39c8474",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣摄影棚坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a sofa by the window, wearing an off-white long cardigan with a red floral pattern, paired with a white knitted short-sleeved top underneath. Loose beige trousers on the bottom. The overall look is simple yet gentle, with delicate ruffle decorations on the cuffs and collar, presenting a Japanese artistic style. Her left hand rests naturally on her lap, and she wears a silver watch with a black strap on her wrist. Her posture is relaxed and elegant, her body slightly leaning against a red woven blanket embroidered with geometric patterns. The colors are bright and contrast with the background. The sofa is made of deep green fabric material, with a slightly aged surface and a sense of age. In the background is an old wood-framed window with peeling paint along the edge. On the windowsill is a transparent glass fish tank and a small crystal ball. Inside the fish tank seem to be aquatic plants and small fish. Inside the crystal ball are green plants. Outside the window, you can faintly see the outlines of green plants. The wall has a gray-blue cement texture with patchy marks in some areas. Light streams in from the left window, creating a soft natural glow. The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot shot, with the figure positioned on the left side of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The right side leaves some space to display the red carpet and background details. The window serves as a natural light source to guide the viewer's gaze, highlighting the main subject. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, red, and blue-gray, with harmonious color combinations that convey a sense of life and artistic flair, presenting a tranquil moment in daily life, as if on a quiet afternoon. The captured frame is a realistic and emotionally rich image, with a texture reminiscent of film photography in a professional studio, featuring slight graininess and soft out-of-focus blur, enhancing realism and artistic atmosphere while preserving the details and warmth of the interior environment, evoking a subtle sense of nostalgia and a gentle aesthetic of everyday life",
