        {
          "id": "krea2-db8721fb287b2065e933807d",
          "alias": "单女旗袍庭院困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a Chinese qipao with a light gray background and blue butterfly patterns, paired with a deep purple knit cardigan. The stand collar design and frog buttons were clearly visible. The qipao fabric had a delicate watercolor gradient, with butterfly patterns arranged naturally and rich in color layers, presenting a warm classical charm. Her overall posture was dignified and elegant, her body slightly turned to the camera and her head slightly tilted, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The foreground features the main figure occupying the center-left side of the frame, with a medium to close-up composition. The background is a blurred outdoor natural environment, presenting a warm yellow-green tone. Blurred tree outlines and mottled light and shadow intertwine to create a soft bokeh effect. Light streams diagonally from the right, creating warm or side backlighting, producing distinct halos and soft focus effects. The light source comes from low-angle sunlight in the early morning or evening, with warm tones and golden tones running throughout the composition. The light and shadow transitions naturally and the contrast between light and shadow is soft. The composition is balanced and stable, the subject stands out, and the background is well blurred, creating a quiet, warm, and poetic atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with a grainy texture and color saturation reminiscent of film photography, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. There is slight noise and color shift, presenting a retro nostalgic style. The overall color palette is mainly gray-blue, purple, and warm yellow, harmonious and unified, with soft light and shadow. The atmosphere is tranquil and peaceful, like a courtyard bathed in afternoon sunlight, where a person quietly gazes into the distance, carrying a faint sense of longing and beauty. The scene is filled with Eastern aesthetics, blending the cultural heritage of traditional clothing with modern pursuit of life's beauty. The composition is exquisite, layered and skillful, creating a visual experience that is both real and dreamy. It is as if you can hear the gentle breeze rustling the leaves and feel the gentle flow of time. The entire image exudes a quiet yet enduring beauty. It makes one stop and gaze, immersed in this peaceful and beautiful moment",
