        {
          "id": "krea2-a53726985511a1e062183100",
          "alias": "单女橙外套广场冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a loose orange-yellow long coat stands in the city's riverside square. The coat is thick and warm, presenting a soft wool texture. The collar is naturally open, and the waist ties form an elegant bow shape. Underneath, she wears a black turtleneck dress with the hem slightly exposed. The overall look is simple yet layered. Her makeup is exquisite, and her right hand lightly carries a black handbag. The body is clean and neat, with smooth lines. Wearing black pointed high heels, she poses calmly and confidently, with her left hand tucked into the coat pocket and her body slightly turned to the side. She displays a casual yet stylish urban feminine temperament. Behind her is a wide river, its surface shimmering, reflecting the warm light of dusk. In the distance, willows sway gently, their branches drooping, some of them golden by the sunset, creating a soft contrast with the gray-blue sky. Across the river is a dense cluster of high-rise residential buildings, with facades alternating gray-white and light brown. The neatly arranged windows reveal the city's order and modern atmosphere. On the left side of the frame, a Shiba Inu stands with its back to the camera. It wears a black leash that quietly watches ahead, adding a touch of life and fun to the scene. The foreground is a gray-paved plaza floor, with neatly arranged stone slabs and clearly visible gaps. In the lower right corner, a thick black column extends vertically to the edge of the painting, forming a visual guide that draws the gaze to the main figure. The composition uses a three-part layout: the figure is positioned near the center on the right, leaving enough space on the left to accommodate the background elements. This creates visual balance, while using the perspective of near and far to enhance spatial depth. Light and shadow come from the setting sun in the west, soft and warm. Illuminated from the upper right, it creates a unique tranquil atmosphere at dusk. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and orange, contrasting with the cool gray-blue background to highlight the subject. The image has a grainy texture and slight overexposure effect reminiscent of film photography, simulating the realism of everyday mobile photography. Color saturation is moderate, details are rich, depth of field is shallow, and the background is slightly blurred. Focusing on the moment of interaction between the character and the dog, the entire scene presents a peaceful and beautiful everyday scene of urban life, full of aesthetics and humanistic warmth, as if captured on a real autumn evening while strolling in a city park",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
