        {
          "id": "krea2-34dde18b6b7af7f99e98256f",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣公园坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench in an outdoor park, looking relaxed and relaxed, wearing a thick olive-green coarse knit sweater with clearly visible yarn texture, presenting a warm and fluffy texture. She pairs a red and black striped skirt below, with striking contrasting colors that are harmonious. The overall look is full of autumn warmth and a sense of life. The figure is positioned slightly to the right in the center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The background is a blurred urban residential area, and the beige multi-story apartment buildings appear soft and tranquil under the sunlight. A few bare trees stand on the lawn, their branches intertwined, revealing a sense of seasonal change. The ground is a mottled grass and dirt path, with dappled light and shadow. In the distance, parked vehicles and low fences can be faintly seen. The composition combines close-ups with medium scenes, emphasizing the subject with shallow depth of field. The background blur enhances spatial layering, with light coming from the sides and rear, belonging to the golden evening sunshine, soft and warm, forming beautiful contour light and creating delicate light and shadow changes on the sweater's surface. It creates a quiet, warm, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The overall color tone is warm, dominated by yellow-green, orange, and brown, with a slight film texture and graininess, reminiscent of everyday moments taken with an old-fashioned camera. On the right side of the frame, part of a white coffee cup is visible, hinting at a leisurely afternoon. There are faint digital watermark marks on the wooden panel in the lower left corner, but they do not affect the overall visual experience. The whole scene is filled with real life details and emotional warmth, like a casual diary of youth. It combines artistic beauty with resonance with everyday life, conveying a quiet, comfortable, and healing emotional experience",
