        {
          "id": "krea2-3b77463b63b74a9218d683aa",
          "alias": "单女棕连衣裙城市困倦站立持包",
          "prompt": "An elegant woman stands in the soft indoor light, her makeup delicate and layered, showcasing a mature and charming aura. She wears a hugging beige short-sleeve top with a light and subtle sheen, outlining smooth shoulder and waist lines. She pairs a high-waisted brown silky long dress with an A-shaped hem, featuring pleated details at the waist that accentuate the waistline and add a sense of flow. The hem length and mid-calf sway naturally as she walks, creating a harmonious and unified look. The colors are warm and steady. In her left hand, she carries a small leather bag in the same color scheme. The body is compact and delicate, adorned with metal fasteners and chain decorations. Her right hand hangs naturally, fingers are long, with dark nail art painted in dark colors. She wears light-colored thin-strap high-heeled sandals with wrapped uppers that highlight foot lines. The overall outfit is both fashionable and comfortable. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of center in the frame, slightly turned to the side, with her head facing the camera in a calm and composed posture. The background is a full white semi-transparent sheer curtain, light and flowing, gently swaying in the breeze. A soft transition of light and shadow is formed. Behind the sheer curtain, a faint pale gray wall or structure can be seen. The floor is a gray cement floor with subtle textures and reflections, creating a clean and layered space. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure occupying the main subject. The sheer curtain extends from both sides to the center, forming a natural frame structure that guides the viewer to focus on the entire figure. The middle ground covers the waist to thighs, with the skirt flowing naturally. The background is dominated by blurred sheer curtains, creating a hazy and dreamy visual effect. Light and shadow come from the left side, simulating natural or soft lighting. The light is soft and even, with no obvious hard shadows. The left side of the body is brighter, while the right side forms subtle shadow transitions that highlight three-dimensional contours. At the same time, there is a slight reflection on the skirt hem and the floor, enhancing realism. The overall atmosphere is serene and elegant, full of the intellect and charm of modern urban women. The color palette is mainly earth tones, blending warm brown, off-white, and gray tones to create a warm and sophisticated visual experience. The image has a delicate texture reminiscent of film photography, with moderate color saturation. The contrast is mild, the details rich, presenting a sophisticated fashion moment casually captured in daily life, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens. The blur outside of focus is natural, depth of field control is precise, preserving the clarity of the subject and the hazy beauty of the background. The overall style leans toward a lifestyle-oriented fashion blockbuster, combining artistic beauty with authentic texture",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
