        {
          "id": "krea2-ebd4fae13716893671914716",
          "alias": "单女透视粉毛衣城市坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a smooth black marble tabletop, her body slightly turned to the side, her head turning back to gaze at the camera, exuding elegance and confidence. She wears a light pink off-shoulder knit top with a fitted design that outlines smooth curves. She pairs white shorts with long, well-proportioned legs, and sheer stockings that naturally extend her toes. The overall look is fashionable and full of sexy charm. Her makeup is exquisite, and a simple pearl necklace around her neck adds a touch of nobility. In the foreground, her sitting posture is clearly visible. The body occupies the center right of the frame, with the arm naturally resting on the knee and the other hand gently caressing the thigh. The posture is relaxed yet tense. The middle part of the frame is a reflection in the mirror, presenting the contour of her back, symmetrically echoing the front. The mirror reflection enhances the sense of depth and visual layering of the space. The background is a modern-style indoor environment, with vertical striped wood finishes featuring delicate texture and warm and soft tones. The left wall is illuminated with warm yellow lighting, creating a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. The overall composition centers on the figure. Using mirror symmetry and perspective to construct a three-dimensional space, guiding the gaze from the foreground figures into the background, the lighting effect is prominent. The main light source comes from the left front, with natural shadow transitions, highlighting skin texture and fabric fold details. Light reflects off black countertops and mirrors, enhancing the realism of the materials. The overall atmosphere blends modern urban refinement with the laziness of private spaces, presenting a scene that combines artistic beauty with a sense of daily life. The images have the texture of professional photography, with colors harmoniously unified. The saturation is moderate, and the contrast is natural, as if shooting with a high-end camera in low-light conditions. It features a slight film graininess and realistic light and shadow transitions, creating a visual experience that is both everyday and sophisticated",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
