          "id": "krea2-1e1040df4842a0a3770ab11b",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫椅上沉思坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a vintage-style study, wearing a simple white sleeveless shirt with a slightly open neckline revealing her slender collarbones and shoulder lines. She wears a pair of round metal glasses with thin frames, the lenses reflecting soft light, her expression slightly contemplative and gentle. She holds an open book in both hands, its pages yellowed and edges slightly worn. Her fingertips gently touch the paper, as if immersed in a world of reading. Her body turns slightly, shoulders relaxed, her posture elegant and relaxed, her right hand supporting the bottom of the book. The left hand rests on the pages of a book, moving naturally and smoothly. In the background is a row of tall, dark wooden bookshelves, neatly arranged with various books. The covers come in various colors, including green, blue, and off-white. Some books look somewhat dated, with blurred spines, creating a strong atmosphere of knowledge. Behind the shelves is a warm orange-yellow wall with a slightly weathered texture, adding a hint of time. On the right side is a classic wooden chair with exquisitely carved backrests, cushions made of light-colored fabric printed with elegant floral patterns, harmonizing with the overall environment. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center to create a visual focal point. Details of books and hands in the foreground guide the viewer's gaze, while the depth of the bookshelf in the background enhances spatial layering. Light and shadow come from natural light on the left, filtering through the window to create a soft side light effect and a delicate transition between light and shadow. Shadows fall on the body and bookshelf on the right, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, supplemented by neutral colors such as white, brown, and deep blue, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The image features slight film graininess and slight color shift, simulating real camera shooting and presenting the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment. The lens is a standard prime lens with a focal length of about 50mm and an aperture of f/2.8, achieving a clear subject and moderately blurred background. This highlights the subject while preserving environmental information. The overall image is full of artistic and everyday life, conveying the preciousness and beauty of quiet reading time",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
