        {
          "id": "krea2-14f03d76eb040e8635b683b1",
          "alias": "单女米外套街道困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a street at night, wearing a beige wool coat paired with a white turtleneck knit top and a dark plaid dress. Her hands gently pull up the collar of her coat, slightly raising her head to gaze upward, her expression calm and focused, as if drawn to the scene before her. The background is a tree-shaped decoration formed by hazy warm yellow lights, with countless points of light creating a dreamy bokeh effect in the night sky, presenting circular light spots. The halo is soft and warm, with rich layers, gradually blurring from foreground to background, creating a strong sense of depth. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the lower left of the frame, occupying about one-third of the space. A large amount of blank space above is left to highlight the light and shadow world of the background. The visual guide line extends from the character's line of sight deep into the background, creating a warm and romantic atmosphere full of festive atmosphere. The light mainly comes from the warm yellow lighting in the background, creating a backlighting effect. The outlines are clear, the contrast of light and shadow is striking, and the transition between light and dark is natural. The colors are mainly warm tones, interwoven with gold, off-white, brown, and dark gray, creating a warm and comfortable visual experience. The image texture is delicate and detail-rich, offering the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. It simulates real photography scenes, using medium or full-frame cameras paired with prime lenses, aperture around f/1.8, moderate shutter speed, and low ISO to ensure pure images, natural background blur, and clear subjects. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, as if capturing a quiet moment on a winter night street, conveying a longing and emotion for beautiful things",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
