        {
          "id": "krea2-8dc20a0f2cd04dab4c9c0be0",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤广场沉思坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an indoor wooden floor, leaning slightly forward, legs crossed, right hand gently resting on the frames of glasses, her expression natural and thoughtful, presenting a casual and genuine posture. She wears a gray crew-neck T-shirt with a white base shirt underneath, loose black wide-leg pants, and white low-top canvas shoes. Her outfit is simple and casual, with a small dark blue leather square bag slung over her shoulder. The bag is smooth and shiny, with delicate metal fasteners. On her wrist is a slender gold bracelet and a watch with a black strap. The details are rich but not cluttered, and the overall look is clean and neat, yet still full of life. The space she is in is a narrow corridor or foyer, with beige walls with a slight vintage texture. The walls are slightly weathered, revealing signs of age. On the left is a half-open white wooden door, behind which you can faintly see hanging clothes and a blurred interior space. On the right is a light green wall and a closed door with metal handles. Soft light is reflected. The floor is a deep brown wooden floor with clear and natural wood grain, slightly worn on the surface, showing the texture of long-term use. Light enters diagonally from the upper left of the image, creating a warm side light, casting soft shadows on the floor and walls. The transition of light and shadow is natural, creating a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. The foreground shows part of the floor and a white sock or cloth bag casually placed on the floor, adding realism and a sense of life. The middle ground features the main subject and her clothing accessories, while the background is a simple indoor environment. Through blur treatment, the main subjects are emphasized. The overall color scheme is warm yellow, gray, black, and white, with harmonious and unified color combinations, full of the delicacy and restraint of a Japanese photo style. The overall scene presents a fleeting beauty from everyday life, as if capturing the afternoon sunlight streaming into the room. The quiet moment when the girl rests at the door is filled with a strong sense of life and artistic ambiance. The lighting is soft and layered, the tone warm but not harsh. The overall image looks like a high-quality photo taken with a professional camera, rich in detail and authentic texture, yet retaining the naturalness and intimacy of amateur photography. The composition is compact and breathable, the expressions are genuine and natural, without signs of excessive staging, conveying a relaxed and comfortable mood. The entire scene is quiet and full of storytelling. It inevitably makes one imagine she has just finished a journey or is preparing to set off somewhere, the scene full of narrative and immersion",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
