        {
          "id": "krea2-1e6e376bdf1179f411e5b0c2",
          "alias": "单女和服高塔冷淡站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a traditional kimono stands on a city rooftop or viewing platform at night. She slightly turns to the side and smiles back, appearing vivid and authentic. Her kimono is dark on the base, embroidered with large blue and white floral patterns and small pink flowers. Delicate geometric patterns are visible at the cuffs, and a piece of red fabric drapes over her shoulders—possibly a corner of a coat or scarf—adds a warm color contrast. In the foreground, her body occupies the right side of the frame, her head slightly tilted, forming a natural diagonal composition. The line of sight meets the camera, creating a strong visual guiding effect. The middle shot features a blurred metal railing running across the lower part of the frame, separating the subject from the background and hinting at the spatial sense of the environment. The background is a blurred city nightscape, with distant skyscrapers scattered like stars, presenting warm yellow and white light spots. Some light sources form soft circular halos due to lens out-of-focus imagery, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The overall composition uses close-ups, using shallow depth of field to highlight the subject, and the background is completely blurred. Enhances the sense of layering in the image. Light comes from the left side in front, possibly with handheld flash or fill lights, giving the figure a strong sense of depth. The shadows transition naturally, without harsh shadows. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, carrying a romantic urban nightlife vibe. The color palette is mainly deep blue and black, paired with blue, white, and pink on the kimono and warm yellow lighting in the background, creating a warm and cool contrast. This not only highlights the details of the clothing but also creates a quiet and cozy night, with a delicate texture in the image. It feels like shooting with a professional camera, but retains slight film graininess and natural noise, simulating the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with an aperture of f/1.8, moderate shutter speed, and slightly high ISO to suit night scenes. Overall, it presents an imaging style that combines artistry with a sense of everyday life—like a private photo capturing beautiful moments, full of story and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
