        {
          "id": "krea2-0d61da7f861113fc8d246b09",
          "alias": "单女绿外套节庆困倦站立",
          "prompt": "She wears a light green loose wool coat, thick and soft, with a subtle plush texture. The neckline is slightly open, revealing the edge of the white turtleneck sweater underneath. Around her neck is an off-white knitted scarf, which is fluffy and soft. Layer upon layer wraps around the neck and chest, creating a warm layered effect. The scarf's texture is clearly visible, presenting a handwoven texture. On her right shoulder hangs a light brown leather shoulder bag diagonally. The strap is thin and harmonious, harmonizing with the overall tone. In the background is a huge Christmas tree, covered with dense colored lights, mainly white, red, and blue, forming large, blurred circular light spots—the so-called \"bokeh\" effect. These spots vary in size, with interplay of light and shadow, bright and layered colors. It creates a dreamy and warm festive atmosphere. The foreground features clear and sharp figures with rich details. The middle shot is the transitional area between the figure and the background. Although it is blurred, some blurred architectural structures and ground reflections can still be faintly seen. The background is completely blurred into a flowing world of light and shadow. The composition uses the classic center composition, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame. Following her hand movements and the lines of the scarf, the overall form is extended, presenting a strong front-back depth contrast, shot with a wide aperture lens. This creates a highly blurred background, making the subject stand out and the visual guidance clear. The light comes from the colorful background lighting, combining backlight and side backlighting, enveloping the figure's outline in a soft halo without obvious shadows. The overall lighting is soft and warm, with a contrast of warm and cool tones. The light green coat and off-white scarf in the foreground are cool tones, forming a striking contrast with the warm red, white, and blue lighting in the background, creating an atmosphere that is both calm and warm. The entire scene is filled with the romantic atmosphere of a winter festival. It feels as if you've captured a quiet and beautiful moment, like a real night scene shot with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture prime lens. It has a cinematic texture and the unique graininess and color saturation of film. The image has slight noise and color temperature shifts, enhancing realism and a sense of life. It's like casually taking photos with a phone or portable camera in daily life, preserving natural imperfections and imperfections while making them even more authentic and moving",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
