        {
          "id": "krea2-1b1c8b8742544fa2419aa63c",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣街道忧伤站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under natural light, wearing a deep blue chunky knit sweater with a V-neck design that reveals her slender collarbones and neck line. The sweater's texture is clearly visible, presenting a warm and rustic feel. The sleeves are slightly rolled up, adding a touch of casual and lazy charm, making her look lively and natural. She wears a black knit hat with a wide brim made of thick thread and a fine grainy texture. The side of the hat is decorated with a small bow, adding a touch of vintage elegance to the overall look. She carries an off-white canvas crossbody bag with a wide and comfortable shoulder strap. The bag is simple and unadorned, with her hand gently resting on the strap. Her posture is relaxed and natural, with a hint of contemplation and restraint, presenting a natural pink tone that creates a three-dimensional effect. The background is a blurred green plant and branch, with sunlight filtering through the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. The warm gold and teal tones intertwine, and the blur treatment makes the subject stand out. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame. The body is slightly turned to the side, with the head facing the camera, creating a visual relationship that is both intimate and distant. In the foreground, a few green leaves and small branches hang down from above, with some leaf edges tinged yellow, carrying a bleak autumn atmosphere that enhances the layering and realism of the image. Light comes from the side and back, either backlit or side-lit, softly outlining the figure's outline. The shadows are delicate and not abrupt, creating an overall atmosphere that is peaceful, gentle, and slightly artistic. The color scheme is mainly blue-green, accented by warm yellow sunlight. This creates a contrast of cool and warm temperatures, visually creating a sense of both coolness and warmth. The image texture is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and a retro filter effect with low color saturation, as if the photos were developed from vintage cameras, evoking a sense of nostalgia and time-sensitivity. The lens is a 50mm prime lens, with well-controlled shallow depth of field, completely blurred backgrounds, highlighting the subject. The entire image is full of life, like a casual snapshot on an autumn afternoon street — realistic, natural, and unpretentious. It conveys a quiet youth and a subtle melancholic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
