        {
          "id": "krea2-d4896bd0233ba60cf5b196ac",
          "alias": "单女白制服街道忧伤行走",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a white sailor-collar school uniform jacket with a black-and-white plaid shirt underneath, a black leather backpack slung across her shoulder. Her hands are gently adjusting the backpack's straps. Her fingers are slender, her movements natural and gentle. Looking directly at the camera, her expression is calm yet tinged with a hint of melancholy and youth. The background is an outdoor nighttime scene, with blurred halos and blurred outlines of trees creating a hazy atmosphere. A beam of warm yellow light shines from the front left, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. deep shadows are left on the right and in the back, with the overall composition using close-ups. The figures occupy most of the frame, with slightly tilted postures creating a sense of dynamism. The head is slightly turned to the side, creating direct communication with the viewer. The background blur emphasizes the subject, and the schoolbag and hand movements in the foreground enhance realism. The color palette is mainly warm yellow and dark, with strong contrasts of warm and cool tones, creating a tranquil, nostalgic, and story-rich atmosphere, as if capturing the moment of walking alone on the street after school, with a film-like texture, slight graininess and natural underexposure lead to shadow details, simulating amateur camera shooting effects. The background is completely out of focus, presenting soft light spots and lines. The overall image has a cinematic narrative quality, with delicate light and shadow layers and emotional expression, conveying the loneliness of adolescence, the subtle state of reflection and growth, like a freeze-frame shot in a youth art film, full of poetic and realistic intertwining beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
