        {
          "id": "krea2-8ff49c4e6db31749b3e36995",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔窗边站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by an indoor doorframe, naturally draped over her shoulders. Her left hand gently holds a white paper cup, her right hand carries a brown leather handbag, and she wears a loose blue denim shirt. The collar is slightly open, revealing a minimalist necklace to reveal her collarbones and neck. She pairs it with high-waisted brown corduroy wide-leg pants. The pants are smooth and natural, creating an overall look that is both vintage and elegant, yet relaxed. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body leaning slightly against the white doorframe, exuding a lazy and casual vibe. In the foreground is part of a dark wooden dining table, with a plate of pine cones and dried flowers arranged on it. In the lower right corner is a bouquet of yellow and white daffodils, clearly visible with branches and leaves spreading. The background is the interior space. On the left is a dark brown wooden cabinet topped with a golden decorative box. The wall is a combination of light beige and white wainscoting, and on the right is a window with white window lattice. The window frame has simple lines, and through the glass, you can faintly see the outdoor scene. Light streams in from outside, creating a soft effect of light and shadow. The overall color palette is warm and soft, mainly blue, brown, beige, and white, creating a peaceful and comfortable home atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The door frame serves as a natural frame to guide the view, focusing the visual focus on the person. Meanwhile, flowers and tabletop items in the foreground add depth to the image. Light and shadow shine from the upper right, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The soft shadows highlight the character's outline and the materiality of clothing, creating an overall warm and healing atmosphere. It feels as if capturing a leisurely afternoon moment, with the texture of authentic daily photography, as if capturing beautiful moments casually with a camera. The details are rich but not chaotic, the colors harmonious and unified, full of the vitality of life and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
