        {
          "id": "krea2-df7ee77ca82b4c2f34848b57",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫困倦持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a white long-sleeved shirt paired with a dark blue tank top in a school uniform, with a delicate silver badge on her chest. Her right hand was gently raised, fingers long and slender, nails neatly trimmed, showing a natural pale pink. Her body turned slightly to the left of the frame, while her head turned toward the camera, her posture naturally relaxed. Full of youthful energy and innocence, the background is a blurred outdoor natural environment, presenting a soft green tone. Faint outlines of trees and grass can be faintly seen, creating a tranquil campus atmosphere. The middle ground is a shallow depth of field area behind the figures, with mottled light and shadow. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating soft light spots and interlaced light and shadow effects. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space in a diagonal composition extending from the lower left to the upper right, using shallow depth of field to highlight the subject. The background blur enhances spatial layering. The light comes from the upper right, belonging to soft natural light, presenting a warm golden yellow tone. The natural transition of shadows enhances the texture of the skin. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, with a nostalgic film texture. The color saturation is moderate, the tone is warm, and there is a slight retro filter effect, presenting a hazy and dreamy feel. It feels like a summer afternoon photo taken on campus, full of youthful energy and poetic beauty, with the realism of everyday amateur equipment. At the same time, it retains the delicacy and refinement of artistic photography, with rich details, clear layering, and harmonious light and shadow, providing a peaceful, warm, and beautiful visual experience",
          "description": "",
