          "id": "krea2-106d0086996530007c5e5d6f",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of a city street, wearing a loose white long-sleeved shirt and gray high-waisted pants. The fabric drapes naturally, presenting soft folds and shifting light and shadow, gently fluttering in the wind. Her overall posture is relaxed and elegant, as if capturing a tranquil everyday moment in an instant. She is positioned slightly at the center on the right side of the frame, her body slightly turned and her head facing the camera, creating a visual tension that is both intimate and distant. In the foreground are blurred street edges and curbs, while the ground is a dark gray asphalt pavement. Reflecting dappled light, the middle scene is a street extending into the distance, flanked by lush trees and dense branches and leaves. Sunlight streams through the gaps in the leaves, forming numerous circular light spots and soft halos. The background is a row of modern buildings, with facades in light beige or grayish-white. The windows are neatly arranged, some windows let in indoor light, and in the distance, you can see traffic signals and streetlight poles, but all are blurred. The composition uses the classic three-third, with the main subject positioned in the right third, using the street's lines to guide the gaze to the figures. At the same time, the open space on the left enhances the breathability and storytelling of the image. Light and shadow come from the upper right, the sun approaches the horizon, emitting a warm golden glow. The backlighting effect makes the figure's silhouette glow, and the shadow transitions naturally. The overall atmosphere is warm and nostalgic, tinged with a subtle melancholy and contemplative mood. The tones are mainly warm yellow, off-white, and gray-green, with moderate saturation and low contrast, presenting a film-like texture. The image details are rich, with background and foreground gradually blurring, creating a strong depth of field effect, as if shot with a large aperture lens. The overall style combines artistry with a sense of everyday life, reminiscent of a real scene captured at dusk with a professional camera paired with a prime lens. The cinematic narrative evokes moments of tranquility and inner monologue in the city",
