        {
          "id": "krea2-6b160d4089543af0af51e974",
          "alias": "单女米风衣街道愤怒站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a brick sidewalk on a city street, wearing a long beige trench coat paired with dark green pants and black leather shoes. A small dark blue bag slung over her shoulder, her right hand making a victory gesture, her body slightly turning sideways, presenting a casual and playful posture, as if silently communicating with the viewer. In the foreground is a sidewalk paved with reddish-brown bricks, with clear cracks visible, a slight reflection on the ground, showing signs of dampness or freshly swept surfaces. On the left is a row of dark brown metal railings. The railing is covered with lush green vines, with layers of leaves overlapping, some branches extending beyond the fence, forming a natural green barrier. On the right is another row of black metal railings, with clean lines that create a sense of symmetry with the left. In the distance, the background is a typical Japanese cityscape, with mostly low-rise residential buildings. The exterior walls are mainly off-white, light gray, and pale pink, the roof is sloped, and utility poles and wires are interwoven, adding details to urban life. The sky is shaded by trees, revealing only a few white clouds, with soft light. Sunlight pours down from the upper left of the painting, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The figures and railings cast long shadows, which extend along the brick texture, enhancing spatial depth. The overall composition uses the figure positioned slightly to the right center, with guiding lines formed by roads and railings to direct the gaze to the figure. Meanwhile, the railings on both sides form a frame structure that highlights the main subject. The colors are mainly warm tones, with beige trench coats, red brick floors, green vines, and light-colored buildings complementing each other, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere with rich layers of light and shadow. Highlights are bright but not glaring, shadows transition delicately, and the overall image presents a poetic beauty of everyday life, as if captured casually with an old film camera. It has slight graininess and fading effects, a slightly vintage tone, and slightly blurred edges, like a gentle and free street moment captured on a sunny afternoon. The whole scene is full of life and cultural warmth, allowing people to feel the beauty and authenticity of ordinary moments in the city",
