        {
          "id": "krea2-6580bba5539d6b25626c1e81",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服舞台冷淡注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a dark blue school uniform jacket with a white collared shirt and a gray plaid tie underneath. The overall vibe is fresh and sweet, full of youthful energy. The middle ground features a blurred green plant background with distinct layers and natural leaf shapes. The colors transition from light green to dark green, forming a soft gradient of color blocks. The background blur is well handled, presenting a bokeh effect. The dotted light spots suggest sunlight filtering through the gaps in the leaves, with interwoven light and shadow creating a warm and gentle atmosphere. The light comes from the right front of the figure, representing natural daylight. The shadow transitions are delicate without harsh edges. The overall color palette is mainly blue, white, and green, paired with warm yellow tones to create a contrast of warm and cool tones, creating a visually harmonious and unified look. The composition is simple yet layered, with the main subject prominent. The background blur is just right, not overshadowing the main focus. The lens uses an 85mm prime lens with an f/1.8 aperture to achieve a shallow depth of field effect, capturing delicate skin textures and clothing textures. The camera settings simulate the high-resolution sensor performance of the Canon R5 or Sony A7R IV, preserving rich detail. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shooting outdoors with a professional camera in natural light, while also combining the realism and everyday atmosphere of amateur equipment shooting. The lighting is soft, color reproduction is high, and details are rich. The characters' expressions are natural and relaxed, as if frozen in a fleeting moment of encounter on campus. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and warm, filled with nostalgic youthful memories, allowing one to feel a quiet and beautiful passage of time. The images present a realistic style that combines artistic beauty with close to real life. The tones are fresh and natural, the transitions of light and shadow are smooth, and the details are meticulously detailed. It is as if you can hear the gentle breeze rustling the leaves and feel the warmth of sunlight. The whole scene is full of vitality and storytelling, making one stop and gaze in resonance.",
