        {
          "id": "krea2-ba35f7b7205498bb9c5d8fb8",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫窗边忧伤持手机",
          "prompt": "She wore a loose white shirt paired with a light gray striped lace camisole underneath. The sleeves of the shirt were rolled up to the elbows, giving off a casual and comfortable look. She sat by the window, her body slightly turned to the side, hands folded over her lap, holding a small phone in her hand. Her expression was focused and calm, and sunlight streamed in diagonally through the window, warm and slightly golden, creating a lazy afternoon atmosphere. The interior of the cabin is old yet cozy. The red seats have obvious textures and wear marks, showing signs of age. The window glass has some reflections and blurring, and the scenery outside is blurred, showing a blurred green and brown hue, suggesting the vehicle is moving. The foreground is the edge of the nearby red seats, slightly out of focus, creating depth of field. The middle ground features a female subject, clear and prominent. The composition uses a third-level method, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, leaving space on the left to show the view outside the window. The background features a blurred exterior view and interior structure, including the doors, armrests, and another row of seats. The overall composition is balanced and layered, with natural light and shadow from the side. The light is soft and even, with no strong contrast, creating a quiet, nostalgic, and slightly lonely atmosphere. The colors are mainly warm tones, with red seats contrasting sharply with white clothing, blending soft tones such as off-white, light gray, and light blue. The image texture is delicate with a slight graininess, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera, with a retro filter effect The lens is a 50mm prime lens, simulating real photography perspectives and capturing the emotions of people and environmental details. The images present a fleeting beauty from everyday life, combining artistic flair with a sense of everyday life. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and slightly detached, like a private moment forgotten in time",
