        {
          "id": "krea2-76bf61b00647bd7ab9aaba47",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜教室沉思持相机",
          "prompt": "She wore black stockings and black leather shoes. The smooth, reflective surface of the shoes showed a delicate texture. Her posture was relaxed and elegant, as if she had just finished a class or was deep in thought. On the white wall hangs a dark green blackboard, with a simple border decoration above it. Next to it is a white storage cabinet with glass window panels, faintly revealing books and items inside. On the left side of the classroom is a large window with semi-transparent white sheer curtains. Sunlight streams through the curtains, creating a soft, diffused light that evenly illuminates the entire space, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The floor is light-colored wood with clear grain and a slight sheen. The desk is a traditional wooden tabletop with a metal bracket. Several neatly stacked books are placed on the tabletop, mainly in white and blue. Text is faintly visible on the spine. The chair features a matching wooden backrest and metal frame design. The seat surface shows slight wear and signs of daily use. The foreground features the figure and desk, while the middle ground includes other empty desks and chairs and part of the wall. The background extends to the blackboard and locker areas, creating a clear sense of spatial layering. Following arm and leg lines, it finally extends to the blackboard and windows in the background, creating a smooth visual path. The light mainly comes from natural light from the left window, which is soft and directional, creating a natural shadow transition between the right side of the figure and the background, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color palette is mainly white, beige, black, and green, with a clean yet harmonious color scheme, presenting a clean, quiet, and slightly nostalgic campus atmosphere. The images are rich in detail, from the wrinkles of clothing, the translucent texture of stockings, the reflections of leather shoes, to the texture of the desktop and the wood grain on the floor, all clearly distinguishable. The images are full of a sense of life while retaining the refinement of artistic photography, as if shot with a high-resolution full-frame camera in natural daylight, captured with a standard focal length lens. The depth of field is moderate, the background slightly blurred but still remains sharp, presenting an authentic and emotionally rich moment record, like a student portrait taken by chance but full of storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
