        {
          "id": "krea2-559b0f8b36024a910c98b63d",
          "alias": "单女透视衬衫纯色背景冷淡坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in front of a pure white background, wearing a burgundy long-sleeved shirt with delicate ruffles on the collar and cuffs. A deep blue ribbon bow is tied at the chest, adding a sweet collegiate vibe. She wears a black-and-white plaid pleated mini skirt with a natural hem, blending youthful energy with vintage charm. She wears black sheer stockings, legs crossed and slightly stretched, toes pointing upward, with clear foot details, presenting an elegant yet slightly lazy pose. It exudes a subtle gentleness and confidence. The overall composition uses medium shots, with the figure occupying the main position, the body slightly tilted, and the head slightly tilted, forming a natural visual guide line that extends from the lower left corner to the upper right, creating a relaxed and balanced visual aesthetic. The foreground features the legs and feet, with clear stocking textures and toe details enhancing realism. The middle shot is the torso and upper body, where the folds and material details of the clothing appear delicate and vivid under soft lighting. The background is a simple pure white wall. The surface has a slight texture, providing a clean and crisp visual space for the image, avoiding distractions and making the subject stand out. Light comes from the front above, softly and evenly casting on the subject, creating a natural transition of shadows. The overall atmosphere is calm, fresh, and slightly artistic, as if capturing real life moments in a quiet indoor corner with a regular camera or phone. It has the rustic and realistic feel of everyday amateur photography, presenting a low-saturation yet harmonious color tone. The contrast between warm burgundy and cool deep blue and black-and-white checkered patterns makes the entire composition both artistic and full of everyday life. The composition is stable and full of tension, with relaxed and natural poses without forced posing, conveying a relaxed and carefree mood. The minimalist background treatment focuses the viewer's attention entirely on the figure itself, creating a tranquil and thought-provoking visual experience. The overall style combines realism and aesthetics, combining innocence and sweetness with feminine calmness and restraint. presenting a unique beauty that lies between everyday life and art",
