        {
          "id": "krea2-1a0b4ee5c3fefde29c9db5ee",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙镜前沉思站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an indoor mirror for a selfie. She wears a deep red V-neck spaghetti strap dress that fits her figure perfectly, showcasing elegant curves. The slender straps outline her collarbones and neck. The overall look is simple yet sexy, rich in layers, adding a touch of laziness and casual beauty. Her makeup is exquisite, her expression confident and composed, and her right hand holds her phone high for a selfie. The phone has a white case with gray polka dots, her fingers painted red nail polish, and she wears a gold ring and earrings. Held in the left hand is a bouquet of pink and black flowers, including pink buttercups and pale pink gentian grass. The petals are layered, the stems are slender, and the blossoms have a natural posture, with some petals slightly drooping, presenting an effortless beauty. The background is a cozy indoor space, with light beige walls. Above hangs a black cylindrical chandelier. The lampshade is simple and modern, with soft lighting. In the background, you can see a wooden chair and a small round table, with a blue-and-white striped carpet on the floor. Next to it is a pair of high heels in pink and gold, with shiny uppers and slender heels. The overall setting is refined and lifelike. The composition uses a mirror-reflective perspective, with the figure positioned on the right side, occupying the main visual space. The bouquet stands out in the left foreground, creating visual balance. Light and shadow come from the left, soft and even, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The tones are mainly red, pink, and beige, accented with black and gold, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The overall style combines the casual feel of daily life with the artistry of fashionable photography. It feels like a real moment captured with amateur equipment, featuring a strong personal style and emotional expression. The images are full of youthful energy and self-appreciation, rich in details and delicate texture, combining the warmth of real life with the beauty of artistic creation",
