        {
          "id": "krea2-731391fad1a1ff960fd17c59",
          "alias": "单女灰衬衫街道忧伤站立持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a night street, carrying a hint of thoughtful gentleness and tranquility, showing a natural soft pink hue. Her temperament is gentle yet slightly melancholic. She wears a light gray collared shirt, thin and breathable, with fine textures and pleats on the shoulders. On her left chest is a small circular pattern decoration, with sleeves slightly rolled up to reveal slender arms. Her right hand holds a white smartphone, with multiple camera modules and brand logos on the back. Her fingers are long and her nails neatly trimmed. In her left hand, she held a white instant imaging camera. The surface of the camera was smooth, the lens section clearly visible, and the body was printed with the word \"Polaroid.\" She was gently pressing the shutter button, as if recording a moment. Her posture was naturally relaxed, her body slightly tilted, shoulders relaxed, arms naturally hanging down, and her whole body exuding an effortless elegance. The composition used close-ups, creating an asymmetrical yet balanced visual structure, with a blurry city night scene in the background. Shop signs lining the streets flash with colorful neon lights, red, white, and green halos intertwining to create a soft bokeh effect. In the distance, you can see blurry figures of pedestrians and vehicle silhouettes. Streetlights and billboards emit a warm yellow glow, illuminating the damp ground and reflecting specks of light, creating a hazy and hazy atmosphere. The sky is bathed in a soft orange-red by city lights, contrasting with the dark night sky. Light and shadow shine diagonally from the right, creating a three-dimensional effect of interplay of light and shadow. The lighting is soft and layered, with delicate transitions in shadows without harsh boundaries. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, supplemented by cool gray and light purple tones, creating a cozy yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The image has a strong film texture, moderate color saturation, rich details, and minimal noise, presenting a realistic feel reminiscent of amateur photography equipment. The composition uses shallow depth of field to highlight the subject, with well-handled background blur, extending along her line of sight to distant lighting, forming an invisible visual path. The overall composition is full of storytelling, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment of life, imbued with a strong urban nightlife atmosphere and the warmth of youthful memories",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
