        {
          "id": "krea2-c5a29289645d99f3baea18fe",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫楼梯冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a light gray staircase, wearing a white long-sleeved shirt and a dark blue pleated skirt, paired with black stockings and a deep blue bow tie, presenting a typical Japanese schoolgirl uniform style. Her hands are naturally folded over her knees, her left hand gently resting on her right leg, fingers naturally extended, and her right hand lightly touching the ground, her posture relaxed and elegant. The background is a simple indoor space, with light gray walls, and the steps made of smooth, light-colored stone or concrete. The edges are decorated with metal strips, forming regular geometric lines. Light softly enters from the left side of the image, creating a natural contrast of light and dark. The other side is in soft shadows, creating a sense of depth and depth. Light and shadow cast clear contour shadows on the staircase surface, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly tilted, head slightly lowered, gazing straight ahead, creating a visual focal point. The background staircase lines extend backward, guiding the gaze deeper into the frame. It creates a strong perspective effect, with an overall atmosphere that is quiet, restrained, and slightly artistic. The color palette mainly uses cool gray and black-and-white, accented with deep blue, giving a clean and restrained look. The lighting is soft and even, with no strong contrast, presenting a realistic feeling of everyday life, as if captured by chance in a school corridor or inside a public building. The details are rich, the image is high-resolution and finely textured, presenting a texture similar to professional camera photography, while retaining slight graininess and natural noise. It simulates the realism of amateur equipment shooting, with overall balanced and harmonious images, combining artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life. The composition is stable, colors are coordinated, and light and shadow transitions are natural, conveying a quiet, gentle, and slightly youthful mood",
