        {
          "id": "krea2-9dff11530f34f23921856ba2",
          "alias": "单女学生制服摄影棚冷淡自拍",
          "prompt": "She wore a typical Japanese high school girl uniform, including a white long-sleeve shirt and a light blue V-neck knit tank top. The vest collar was trimmed with red and white stripes, paired with a dark blue plaid pleated short skirt, white over-the-knee socks, and a pair of simple white sneakers. The overall look was youthful yet elegant. She leaned slightly to the side, legs crossed, holding a white smartphone in her left hand while facing the mirror for a selfie. The screen was clearly visible, reflecting the lower half of her body and the pleated details of her skirt. This creates a symmetrical and visually interesting composition. The wood grain grain on the edges of the frame is clearly visible, adding a touch of warmth to the image. The background is a pure light gray wall with no unnecessary decoration or distractions, creating a minimalist atmosphere. The light comes from the left front, a soft, diffused glow that evenly illuminates the subject. The shadow transitions naturally without harsh contrasts, creating a bright and fresh lighting atmosphere with a clean and tranquil everyday feel. The composition uses a centered composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with a frame that naturally guides the gaze to focus on the subject. The mirror reflection enhances the sense of depth and layering in the space. The foreground features the frame and the woman's legs and feet, the middle is the woman's upper body and phone, and the background is a simple wall. The overall color scheme is mainly cool tones, with white, light blue, deep blue, and gold intertwined, creating a visual impression that is both cool and warm. The tones are harmonious and unified, with rich but not cluttered details. It has a strong studio-like feel, as if shooting with a professional camera inside the studio. The lighting is precisely controlled, noise is extremely low, image resolution is high, and details are sharp. The overall atmosphere feels like a casual selfie from everyday life, yet also carries a carefully designed artistic touch. It looks like a photo shoot straight out of a fashion magazine or advertising campaign, full of youthful energy and modern aesthetics",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
