        {
          "id": "krea2-0187bccbcc9f04df8c1db53f",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣公园微笑倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman sat on the grass in a park, leaning against the trunk of a sturdy old tree. She wore an olive-green knit sweater with clearly visible patterns, and the woven patterns on the sleeves featured intricate knots. The turtleneck naturally wrapped around her neck. She wore a dark top underneath and light blue jeans, her legs slightly bent and her body leaning forward, appearing natural and casual. She wore round metal-framed glasses, transparent lenses reflecting soft light and revealing a faint smile. The overall posture is relaxed and natural. The background is a blurred park scene, with green lawns and a few trees in the distance. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled shadows that create soft light spots. The sky appears pale blue with a hint of white clouds. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned in the center, her body and surrounding grass in the middle, and blurred trees and sky in the background. The atmosphere of light and shadow is warm and soft, with light shining from the sides, creating natural shadows and highlights. The overall tone is warm and peaceful It offers a comfortable and cozy feeling, with a film-like texture, moderate color saturation, rich details, and clear layering, as if capturing everyday moments with an old-fashioned camera, full of life and artistic flair",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
