        {
          "id": "krea2-5fe9894cf8134b9ee84be5d2",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道微笑站立招手",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a white short-sleeved shirt and black striped tie paired with black shorts stands beside the metal railing of a city pedestrian bridge. Her right hand is raised high, gently waving her hand showing her white teeth. She stands slightly to the side, leaning slightly forward, her posture relaxed and natural, as if greeting someone far away. The overall scene exudes a youthful campus atmosphere, with a clear figure in the foreground and a silver-gray metal railing in the center. The railing is made of vertical metal strips, with clean and modern lines. The background is a blurred urban architectural complex, including multi-story overpasses, concrete walls, and glass curtain walls in the distance. The architectural outlines are outlined by soft light to create hazy silhouettes. The sky is a warm yellow tone at dusk, with a warm tone and a vintage film texture. Light and shadow shine from the upper right, casting soft shadows on the left side of the body and behind the railing, creating a three-dimensional spatial effect. The composition adopts a golden ratio layout slightly to the left center, with the figures occupying the main positions. The gaze naturally follows her smile and waving gestures. The geometric lines in the background extend into the distance, enhancing the depth of the image. The visual guide lines converge along the railing and the direction of the person's arm to the right side of the frame, creating a dynamic flow. The overall atmosphere is warm and nostalgic, as if capturing an unintentional moment in daily life, full of strong life atmosphere and documentary feel. It is like real street photography taken with an old camera. The slight noise and graininess of the lens add authenticity, and the color saturation is moderate, with warm yellow and taupe brown as the main tones, creating a gentle yet slightly melancholic atmosphere, as if recording a simple yet precious farewell moment in youth. The vertical arrangement of Japanese text in the background adds a touch of exotic charm and storytelling to the image. The overall composition is balanced and layered, with rich details and natural light and shadow transitions, presenting a tranquil yet vibrant urban youth image",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
