        {
          "id": "krea2-9d9b6d0c8c794ba837ee1d1e",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙椅上自信坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a vintage-style green leather bench, wearing a light-colored sleeveless dress with vertical stripes. The dress is white with fine light purple and light pink stripes, featuring a V-neck design paired with a row of delicate white buttons on the front. A thin belt made of matching fabric is tied around the waist, outlining a slender waistline. The skirt naturally falls to the ankles, presenting an elegant A-line silhouette. She wears round beige earrings, simple yet delicate. She sits sideways, her right hand lightly resting on the edge of the bench, her left hand naturally resting on her knee, looking relaxed and composed. On her feet are bright pink wedge-heeled sandals with cross-lace designs, wooden chunky heels, and hollowed-out toe shapes. The colors are vivid and contrast with the overall soft tone, leaving her calm and serene demeanor. The background is the indoor environment. The left wall features a two-tone design, with the upper half in light gray-white and the lower half in dark ink green, creating a delicate texture. On the right, you can see a window. Soft natural light filters in, and the curtains are made of off-white sheer fabric, with dappled light and shadow scattering on the walls and floor. The floor is paved with black-and-white geometric tiles, with clear lines and a sense of order. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure occupying the left center of the frame, the body slightly tilted, forming a natural visual guideline. Light comes from the right window, with soft shadows creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color palette is dominated by low-saturation pink, white, green, and brown, with harmonious and unified colors full of summer freshness and delicate texture, rich in detail, presenting a subtle beauty found in daily life, as if a fashionable portrait shot with a professional camera, or a quiet moment in life records, with slight film graininess and natural color distortion, enhancing realism and artistic atmosphere. The overall atmosphere is warm, healing, and artistic, with a strong Japanese magazine photography style. The composition is balanced, the subject is prominent, the background is simple and not cluttered, and the visual focus is on the posture and expressions of the subjects. The layers of light and shadow are distinct, and details are rich. It presents a quiet and beautiful glimpse of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
