        {
          "id": "krea2-840e6f539e06b443f5e89be3",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙街道冷淡坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden table in an outdoor café, wearing a light blue vertical striped dress with white ruffles at the collar and cuffs. The skirt reaches her knees, showcasing a fresh and sweet style. Her left hand rests naturally on her thigh, her posture elegant and relaxed. She wears off-white thin-strap high-heeled sandals, her ankles slender, her left leg slightly bent, toes lightly touching the ground, while her right leg stretches out naturally with knees slightly bent, forming a dynamically balanced sitting posture. On the table sits a green cold drink with a green straw inserted into it, and beside it is a transparent glass lid. The overall composition centers on the figure, using a medium perspective. The figure is positioned about one-third of the right side of the frame, guiding viewers to look to the right, creating an atmosphere of waiting or imagination. In the foreground is a wooden tabletop and metal legs, which are somewhat rough, with natural wood grain and signs of use. Under the table is a black metal bracket structure for stable support. On the left is a folding chair with a gray-and-white geometric pattern cushion on the surface The chair backrest and legs are made of silver-gray metallic material, simple and modern. The background features a blue-green double-leaf glass door with a matching frame in the same color. The door is marked with a clear sign reading \"Cafe & Brunch Since 2009\" in clear font, with patterns of coffee, bread, eggs, and other foods below, and Korean text beside it. Inside, you can faintly see the interior furnishings, including hanging warm yellow chandeliers and curtains. The curtains are made of light beige diamond-patterned fabric, semi-transparent and softly illuminated. The glass on both sides of the door reflects a blurred street scene, adding depth to the space. The overall color scheme is mainly blue-green, paired with light blue dresses, off-white accessories, and warm yellow lighting, creating a contrast of cool and warm tones. Light and shadow come from the upper right, with sunlight softly shining on the figures. The delicate shadows cast on the blue door panels and floor, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The image texture is authentic and natural, as if shot with a professional camera, but retains slight film graininess and color gradation. The lens focal length is moderate, the background slightly blurred, highlighting the subject, balanced composition, reasonable blank space, and smooth visual guidance. Overall, it presents a Japanese-style artistic and fresh healing everyday street style, full of life atmosphere and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
