        {
          "id": "krea2-31f518b7ebc80253dc07bfe3",
          "alias": "单女橙西装摄影棚媚态倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways against a pure white wall, adding a touch of laziness and casualness. She wears a pair of round metal-framed sunglasses, with lenses in a warm orange gradient reflecting soft light. The frames are slender and delicate, slightly open, revealing an effortless sensuality and gentleness. She wears a light orange blazer with subtle textures, the shoulder line naturally flowing, and the collar slightly open, revealing a minimalist inner design. The overall design blends modern fashion with a retro charm. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, with a slightly tilted body and head slightly turned toward the camera, creating a visual tension that is both distant and intimate. The foreground centers on the figure, while the background is a large area of pure white wall, with no decoration or distractions, making the subject stand out. The composition uses the classic rule of third, with the figure occupying the right third of the frame, leaving plenty of negative space to enhance the sense of breath and artistry, while using subtle changes in light and shadow to guide the viewer's gaze. The light source comes from the upper left, creating a soft side light that produces clear contour light and enhances the sense of depth. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and clean, with a slight highlight overflow effect, simulating professional studio lighting while retaining a natural feel. The tones are mainly warm white, light orange, and brown, harmoniously unified to create a fresh, tranquil, and slightly artistic visual experience. The image texture is delicate, the clothing wrinkles naturally, and the overall style combines the refinement of commercial advertising with the warmth of everyday shooting. It's as if you're shooting with a high-end full-frame camera paired with a large-aperture prime lens in natural indoor light. The image features a slight grainy film texture and a soft depth transition, presenting a cinematic portrait texture while retaining a touch of everyday casualness and authenticity, allowing viewers to feel a power and calm beauty in tranquility",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
