        {
          "id": "krea2-1d6bb1a869db770f314e293d",
          "alias": "单女制服教室沉思坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a classic Japanese sailor uniform sits on a metal-framed desk and chair in the classroom, wearing a pair of black fine-rimmed glasses. Her right hand gently rests on the edge of the glasses, while her left hand hangs naturally down, holding a white pen shaft. Her posture is elegant yet slightly lazy, her expression revealing a faint sense of detachment and reserved contemplation. Her sailor suit is a white short-sleeved top with blue and white striped collars, a red bow tied at the chest, a deep blue pleated skirt below, paired with black stockings and shiny brown leather shoes, her legs crossed and folded. Her knees are slightly bent, and the texture of stockings is revealed at the ankles. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the painting, forming a visual focal point. The foreground shows the upper body and part of her legs, clearly visible. In the middle is the desk and chairs she sits on, along with several rows of empty desks around her. The desk is light gray, the chairs have off-white seats and silver metal frames, and the background is a bright classroom interior. Large windows on both sides let in soft natural light, with white window frames. The view outside is blurry, presenting a hazy effect of light and shadow, while distant desks and chairs gradually blur, creating a sense of spatial depth. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with figures centered. The overall composition has clear layers, with a natural transition from foreground to background. Visual guidance lines are formed by the figures' postures and sightlines. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by soft natural light, which enters from the sides and back, creating a slight backlighting effect that creates a faint halo around the edges of the figures' contours. The overall tone is cool, mainly white, blue, gray, and brown, creating a quiet, cool, and slightly artistic campus atmosphere. The image has a strong sense of everyday life and realism, as if taken impromptu with a regular camera, with slight graininess and natural color distortion. The details are rich, the sheen and texture of the stockings are clearly visible, and the glasses reflect faint ambient light. The entire scene is full of life, as if capturing a quiet moment after school in the afternoon. The image conveys a sense of youthful loneliness and introspective emotions, blending the innocence of student days with a hint of human maturity and calmness. Overall, it presents a unique style that combines artistic beauty with everyday authenticity",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
