        {
          "id": "krea2-815e5514a471db9eefa45e06",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣卧室坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bedroom bed, looking relaxed yet layered. She wears a pink V-neck knit dress with long sleeves that fit the figure, accentuating elegant curves. The hem naturally falls to mid-calf, and the fabric features delicate textures and a soft sheen. She wears a delicate gold necklace, with a simple yet exquisite pendant that adds a touch of understated luxury. Her left hand rests gently on the white bedding. Her right hand rests on an open book, its pages gently turning, hinting at just finishing reading or preparing to begin. An off-white blanket casually drapes over her legs, soft and fluffy, with naturally hanging edges, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. She sits on a large bed covered with white sheets, which are flat but slightly wrinkled, giving a realistic and everyday feel. The headboard is a dark wooden headboard, carved with classical lines and decorations, exuding a retro charm. The background wall is light beige wallpaper with subtle textures, presenting soft warm tones. On the left side, you can see an open wardrobe with several dark-colored pieces hanging inside. The wooden hangers are neatly arranged, adding a sense of life to the space. The entire composition uses a medium shot, with the person positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly angled to the camera, creating a natural visual direction. The camera's angle is slightly lower, simulating the everyday feeling of handheld shooting. Light comes from the front right of the frame, with soft natural light streaming in from the window, casting delicate shadows on the sheets and blanket, creating a natural transition between light and shadow. It creates a tranquil atmosphere in the early morning or evening, with the overall color palette mainly consisting of pink, white, beige, and brown. The colors are harmonious and unified, full of warmth and tranquility. The images are rich in details and authentic in texture, combining the beauty of artistic photography with the warmth and authenticity of daily life. It presents a lazy, comfortable, private, and slightly artistic indoor scene, as if capturing a quiet afternoon and evoking a gentle and relaxed mood",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
