        {
          "id": "krea2-12d112aaf736fcb9a4e13e44",
          "alias": "单女白外套街道忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "In the rainy night on a city street, a woman stands on a city street. She wears a thick off-white down jacket with a high collar, layered with a dark turtleneck sweater underneath. The shoulders and chest of the jacket have obvious quilted patterns, small metal buttons adorn the cuffs, and a delicate silver brooch pinned to her left shoulder, adding a touch of elegance and personality. The look is moist and soft, standing out under the dim yellow light. The overall atmosphere is cool and full of storytelling, with a close-up of the figure in the foreground, occupying most of the composition. The middle ground is a blurry street environment, with raindrops forming fine diagonal lines in the air. The ground reflects the warm yellow glow of streetlights, distant vehicle lights and the outlines of buildings along the street can be seen. The background is a blurred city nightscape, with a warm orange-yellow halo enveloping the entire scene, creating a hazy and romantic atmosphere. The composition uses a central composition with figures centered, while shallow depth of field effects blur the background to highlight the subject. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the streetlights slightly behind the right side, creating a soft side backlight. At the same time, a warm halo appears in the background behind her, with raindrops appearing as tiny points of light under the light, adding layers and dynamism to the image. The overall atmosphere is quiet, lonely, yet poetic, as if capturing a fleeting emotional expression in a city night. The main tones are warm yellow, paired with cool blues and grays, creating a striking contrast that enhances the emotional tension of the image. The image texture resembles professional camera shooting but retains slight film graininess and natural noise, simulating the texture of real photography. The edges are slightly out of focus, enhancing the sense of presence, presenting an overall realism reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting, while also featuring an art film-like aesthetic, allowing people to feel the gentleness and fragility of the city, as well as the unique tranquility and contemplation of rainy nights",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
