        {
          "id": "krea2-25ff2a21e98d8e8a5dfc7234",
          "alias": "单女绿外套桌边冷淡倚靠",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose army green work jacket with dark clothes underneath, paired with a black-and-white plaid long skirt with distinct layers. On her feet are gray New Balance sneakers, and a black wristband on her wrist. The overall look is casual and distinctive. Her body leans slightly to the side, leaning against a wooden table. On the table are a glass teapot and a white tissue box, with a brush holder and a small potted plant nearby. In the background is a large window. The window frame is light green, and the light outside is soft and bright, creating a natural backlighting effect. On the windowsill is a potted green plant with finely broken leaves. The wall surface bears mottled blue paint marks, with a rough texture that gives a sense of age. In the foreground is a yellow chair backrest with woven texture, made of rattan or straw, with warm colors that contrast with the overall tone. The floor is covered with a carpet with geometric patterns, mainly red, brown, and yellow, with complex but not chaotic patterns. The light throughout the space comes from the right window, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The shadows transition delicately, with light and shadow creating a tranquil, lazy afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the center left of the frame, leaving space on the right side to extend the view outside the window, enhancing the sense of space. Returning to the objects on the table and the details of the environment, the overall tone of the image is cool yet warm. Green, blue, and brown interweave, creating an artistic, nostalgic, and comfortable everyday feel, as if casually taken with an old film camera, full of life and realism, with rich image details. The texture is clear, visible from the wrinkles of the fabric to the wear on the floor. The overall atmosphere is quiet and healing, like an ordinary yet beautiful afternoon captured in the lens",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
