        {
          "id": "krea2-48610d1612a1941740082ed4",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫寺庙持相机",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman adds a touch of laziness and casualness. She wears a pair of round metal fine-framed glasses, with transparent lenses and light gold frames with slender edges. The temple arms are minimalist, appearing intellectual and gentle. Looking directly at the camera, the colors are natural, showing a subtle pink. She wears a blue and white vertical striped shirt with fine and even stripes, blue as the main tone, with white and deep blue lines interlacing. This creates a visual sense of layering. The shirt features a V-neck design with pleated details at the collar, a white button on the chest, and long-sleeved sleeves slightly cinched. The material appears to be cotton or linen, with a soft texture and clear texture. The wrinkles naturally form with body movement, enhancing the realism of the image. The composition uses a centered composition: the figure is centered, with the head positioned slightly above the center and the chest cropped down. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with light shining from the left to create a soft side lighting effect. The light and shadow transitions are natural, creating a sense of depth. The background is blurred, and you can faintly see light-colored walls and some blurred lines—possibly the outlines of windows or door frames—but they don't interfere with the subject. The overall atmosphere is quiet and warm, with harmonious color combinations that evoke a sense of everyday intimacy. The image presents a natural, realistic, and artistic style, as if a high-quality portrait was shot with a professional camera in natural light, while retaining the casual and realistic feel of everyday snapshots. The lighting is soft and the contrast is moderate. Rich in detail, natural expressions of the figures, and a clean yet aesthetically pleasing composition, the overall image is filled with tranquility, gentleness, and intellectual temperament, conveying a quiet and introspective atmosphere, as if capturing an ordinary yet story-filled moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
