          "id": "krea2-554932b9c7ee1a378e7cfd4b",
          "alias": "单女湿身小巷忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a rain-soaked city alley, her expression revealing a quiet contemplation and a subtle sense of detachment. She wears an off-white ruffled puff-sleeve top, with delicate pleated designs on the collar and cuffs. The material is light and breathable, subtly revealing the texture of her skin. Her arms are crossed over her chest, her right hand holding a small book or notebook with a dark background and green plant patterns, a thin silver chain bracelet on her left wrist, and a simple metal necklace around her neck. The overall look is fresh and artistic. Full of youthful energy, the foreground features several thick black cables running diagonally from the lower right corner of the painting, forming strong lines that guide the viewer's gaze toward the figures. The background features weathered concrete structures, with a slanted cement eaves or the base of a skybridge above. The surface is covered with traces of age, cracks, stains, and cobwebs. On the left, you can see part of the yellow brick wall, which is heavily weathered, showing a texture of interwoven gray-yellow and brown. Fine raindrops fall from the sky, captured by light as clearly visible white dots. It creates a hazy and moist atmosphere. The entire scene is set in soft natural light on cloudy days or early mornings, with light coming from the front left. The shadows are soft, and the folds of clothing create subtle transitions between light and dark. The background is dark, creating a sharp contrast. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the left, the head slightly tilted back, elegant and natural. The diagonal lines of the building and the diagonal cables enhance the dynamic sense of movement and spatial depth. The visual guide is formed by the cables in the foreground and the posture of the figures. At the same time, the dynamic blur effect of raindrops adds depth and realism to the image. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm yet slightly melancholic, with mainly off-white, gray-brown, and dark brown tones, accented with a touch of green and black, presenting a nostalgic, tranquil, and story-rich everyday moment. It feels like a street photo shot on a rainy day with an old film camera, featuring slight graininess and a low-saturation color texture. The edges of the frame are slightly darkened, enhancing the visual focus on the subject. The details are rich but not cluttered; every element serves to create an immersive moment of solitude in the rain, combining artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, much like the delicate emotional expression in the film \"Love Letter,\" allowing people to feel the slow flow of time and the calm and solitude of the heart",
