          "id": "krea2-3d7e3d8302c8ecfa9fc85431",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙车库忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the asphalt road of a city parking lot, her expression calm yet slightly detached. Her head is slightly lowered, her body leaning forward slightly, legs bent, one foot on the ground, the other lifted, toes touching the ground. She wears a pair of black platform square-toe shoes adorned with metal chains, exposing the white sock edges at the ankles. She wears a loose dress with a light blue sole printed with fine deep blue floral patterns. The sleeves are wide, the hem naturally drapes, and the pleats are rich, presenting a relaxed, relaxed feel. Her left hand rests gently on her knee, fingers naturally extended, while her right hand rests on her other leg. Her posture is relaxed yet elegant. The background is a gray asphalt road with orange parking lines and green plastic barriers. In the distance, yellow and silver metal guardrails can be seen, giving the overall environment a plain and everyday feel. The composition uses a low-angle shot, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The foreground features a clear ground and lower body, while the middle ground features the main body and some ground details. The background features blurred parking facilities and road structures, creating a distinct sense of spatial layering. The lighting is soft and even, like natural light on cloudy or evening days. The shadows are not obvious, and the colors are mainly cool tones, with blue, white, and gray as the main tone, accented with orange-yellow lines to enhance visual contrast. The overall atmosphere of the scene is quiet, calm, and slightly melancholic, as if capturing a moment overlooked in urban life. It has the authentic texture of documentary photography while also carrying the aesthetic style of a fashion magazine. The images are rich in detail. From the rough grains on the floor, you can clearly see the texture of the fabric. The makeup is delicate but not overly embellished. The earrings are small silver rings, and a slender necklace is worn around the neck. The overall look is simple yet stylish. In composition, the floor lines guide the gaze toward the figure, while the figure's posture and gaze create an interactive feel, as if conversing with the viewer. The light and shadow are handled delicately, without strong contrasts of light and shadow, maintaining a sense of peace and realism in the image, presenting an overall sense of everyday life. The artistic visual style, like street photos taken casually with an amateur camera, is full of storytelling and emotional tension, allowing viewers to feel the loneliness and self-expression of modern urban youth. The images contain no unnecessary distractions, focusing on the relationship between the characters and their environment, conveying a serene yet profound aesthetic experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
