        {
          "id": "krea2-0e30206fb14d69dd2a1c4d55",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣窗边站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the indoor window, exuding an elegant yet slightly sexy aura. She wears a dark gray sleeveless knit top crafted with vertical striped ribbed knitting, giving it a thick and warm texture. A small gold button on the chest is a decorative touch, paired with a white high-waisted skirt that is light and flowing, made of soft, smooth material with a slight sheen. She gently lifts the hem of the skirt with both hands, revealing the black stockings underneath. The stockings cling to her leg lines make her legs look long and straight, and her fingers are long and slender. The nails are painted a light red polish, adding a touch of refinement. On the left side of the painting is a white gauze curtain that lets in soft natural light. Light streams in from outside, creating a bright and shadowy effect. In the right background, there is an off-white floor lamp with a cylindrical shade and a slender lamp post. The overall design is simple and modern, with light gray walls in soft tones and a faint floor visible. The overall spatial layout is simple and warm, with a mid-shot portrait shot. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, with the body slightly turned and the head slightly tilted. This forms a visual focal point: the foreground shows her lifting the skirt hem and hand movements, the middle frame shows her full-body posture and clothing details, and the background is a simple indoor environment including curtains, floor lamps, and walls, with clear layering. The visual guide starts with the skirt movement in the foreground, passes through the figure's body, and light comes from the left window, belonging to natural light, soft and even, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The shadowed areas transition delicately without strong contrasts. The overall color scheme is mainly gray-white, accented with black and gold, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The images present a fleeting beauty captured in everyday life, as if they were real scenes casually taken at home with a regular camera. They convey a genuine sense of life and artistry, rich in detail, natural light and shadow, balanced composition, a warm and tranquil atmosphere, full of feminine charm and privacy",
