        {
          "id": "krea2-b502a1124c2591f7ef120fea",
          "alias": "单女红高领衫摄影棚神秘坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in front of a pure white background, wearing a black baseball cap embroidered with white \"BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY INC.\" The brim is slightly lowered, giving off a casual yet mysterious vibe, adding a touch of softness and casualness. She wears a bright red turtleneck knit sweater, with clear texture. The coarse knit creates a warm and solid visual effect under soft lighting. The turtleneck wraps around the neck, showcasing winter warmth. She casually drapes a light blue denim jacket over her left shoulder. The fabric is slightly pleated, and the sleeves hang naturally, creating irregular layers. This adds dynamism and a sense of everyday life to the scene. The entire composition centers on the figure, with a compact and dynamic composition. The main subject occupies most of the space, using medium and close-up shots to highlight her expression and clothing details. The background is a pure, light gray-white wall with no clutter or decoration, creating a minimalist visual space. This draws the audience's attention entirely to the figure. Light and shadow come from the front slightly left, with soft and even lighting without strong shadows. The red sweater presents rich color layers under the light, transitioning naturally from bright red to dark red. The denim jacket reflects a faint, cool-toned sheen, creating a sharp contrast with the warm-colored sweater and enhancing the color tension of the image. The overall atmosphere is warm, comfortable, and full of youthful energy, as if capturing a tranquil moment of afternoon sunlight. It has the warmth of everyday life and the refined beauty of fashion magazines. The image presents a professional studio-like effect, while retaining slight film graininess and natural noise. It simulates the realistic texture of medium format or high-end digital cameras shot at low ISO, with moderate color saturation without excessive exaggeration, emphasizing a balance between realism and artistry. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting effects to enhance the sense of center focus. The overall style blends Japanese fashion, street casual, and modern minimalism, presenting a low-key yet sophisticated aesthetic. The composition features a slight tilt, with bodies forming an S-shaped curve, adding movement and visual appeal. The direction of light and shadow is clear, with the light source positioned to the left front of the figure, creating soft side lighting. The transition between shadowed areas is smooth, creating a three-dimensional and realistic skin texture. The overall color palette is mainly red, blue, and black, with harmonious and striking color combinations. It conveys a warm, confident, independent, yet gentle feminine temperament. The details are rich, from the knit texture of sweaters to the brushed edges of denim, and even the embroidered lettering on hats. Every detail stands up to scrutiny, reflecting a high level of craftsmanship. The overall impression is like the inside pages of a high-quality fashion magazine—both artistic and close to everyday life, evoking a genuine and beautiful moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
