        {
          "id": "krea2-e3f947e4704a5c459c2cfb57",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣庭院愤怒站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a traditional wooden window frame, turning sideways toward the window, her head slightly raised, her expression calm and slightly contemplative, as if sensing a certain breath in the air or about to whisper something. She wears an off-white knit cardigan with clearly visible yarn texture, dark round buttons, sleeves naturally hanging, right hand gently extended, palm open upward, fingers slightly bent, posture gentle yet poetic, as if catching invisible wind or raindrops; left hand not in the frame, body slightly leaning forward, leaning against the window frame, Her reflection is cast on the glass beside her, creating a visual effect of intertwining reality and void, contrasting with the real figure and enhancing the layering and dreamlike feel of the image. In the foreground is a rugged dark wooden window frame, with clearly visible wood grain and metal hinge details bearing the marks of time. The window pane is in a traditional geometric style, with some areas showing slight wear and mottling, creating a nostalgic atmosphere. The middle ground shows the woman's body and arms, positioned at the focal point. Light streams in from the right, creating a soft transition of light and shadow, with light and shadow outlining her outline. Highlighting its three-dimensional effect, the background is a blurred outdoor scene, faintly showing a large tree with lush branches and leaves, lush and green. Under the light, the leaves display different layers of green—some bright like jade, some deep like ink green. The trunks are thick and naturally formed, and the background also shows some architectural structural outlines, possibly part of a courtyard or old house. The walls are grayish-white, with mottled marks, and the floor is paved with stone slabs or cement in cool tones. The overall background is deeply blurred, creating a bokeh effect that highlights the main subject. The composition uses a vertical strip, with the figure positioned about one-third on the left side of the frame, leaving a large space on the right for the line of sight to extend, creating an open visual guide that enhances depth and storytelling. The viewing angle is slightly lower, close to level and slightly higher, making the character appear elegant and approachable. Visual guidance is formed by the direction of the person's gaze, gestures, and window frame lines forming an invisible diagonal extending from the lower left corner to the upper right corner, guiding the viewer to focus on the outside world. At the same time, the reflection path of the reflection enhances this guidance. The lighting atmosphere mainly features warm and cool contrasts, with the main light source coming from the right side, soft natural light, possibly the slanting sun in the early morning or evening. The light is warm but not glaring, creating golden highlights on the figures. The window frames and background retain cooler blue-gray tones, creating a visual tension where warmth and cool intertwine. The shadows are delicate and naturally transitioned, without harsh edges. The overall atmosphere is quiet, serene, slightly melancholic, and philosophical, like a moment frozen by time. Full of artistic vibe and a sense of everyday life, the image texture is similar to film photography, with slight graininess, moderate color saturation, and a cool tone. However, some subjects are accented with warm tones, presenting a retro filter-like visual style. The lens is a mid-focal length prime lens that simulates camera shooting effects, with precise depth control, clear subjects, and excessively blurred backgrounds, presenting natural optical bokeh. The image details are rich, including knit textures, wood grain, glass reflections, and leaf contours, all clearly distinguishable. Overall, it presents a style that combines the realism and artistry of everyday amateur equipment shooting, as if crafted by a photographer who loves life, capturing an ordinary yet moving moment",
