          "id": "krea2-e042e7a96477b91c69a0f88b",
          "alias": "单女灰连衣裙街道站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a balcony of a red brick building, naturally draped over her shoulders. Her makeup is delicate yet restrained, exuding a lazy and charming aura. She wears a dark gray knitted strapless dress with a fitted design that highlights a slender waistline and graceful body curves. The dress has delicate textures, vertical stripes that visually extend the body, and a black leather belt with a gold metal clasp at her waist adds a touch of vintage and refinement to the overall look. In her left hand, she carries a large black canvas handbag. The bag body is simple and elegant, with slight wrinkles and signs of use. The top of the bag has two large handles, with a round metal badge decoration on the side. The right hand rests casually on a black iron railing, and on the wrist is a gold fine chain bracelet that reflects a faint glow. In her other hand, she holds a dark jacket, which looks like wool or wool, naturally draped over her arm. The bricks are neatly arranged but somewhat aged, with some signs of weathering in the gaps. Above the wall are white stone window frames and blinds. When the windows are closed, faint light filters through the interior. On the left is a glass window with vertical blinds, made of dark brown wood, contrasting with the red bricks. The balcony railing is made of black cast iron carved with intricate patterns, giving it a classical aesthetic. The composition uses a central left-leaning figure as the main figure, who occupies the main position before returning to body lines, creating a smooth visual flow. The camera angles slightly upward, making the figure appear more upright and elegant. The light and shadow come from the upper side, soft natural light, possibly scattered light from cloudy or evening days. The light evenly spreads over the subject without strong shadows, enhancing the sense of depth. The brick walls and railings in the background are also affected by the light, presenting rich color layers. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and full of life, as if capturing a moment from everyday street life. The tones are mainly warm brown and gray-black, creating a retro, An urban fashion style that's both artistic and modern, with delicate and authentic image quality, as if shot with a high-resolution professional camera. The details are rich and layered, while preserving natural imperfections and authenticity, allowing people to feel a subtle elegance and casual beauty",
