        {
          "id": "krea2-06cdfeed84ea549a5fd9c04e",
          "alias": "单女白背心街道忧伤倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman squatted on a damp street after the rain, wearing a white sleeveless top and light blue denim shorts, paired with a pair of cream-white platform boots. She gently held an orange-red trumpet creeper flower, with a transparent umbrella leaning at her side. The handle was black, and the umbrella was slightly tilted, presenting an effortlessly elegant posture. Her posture was relaxed and natural, her legs slightly bent, body leaning forward as if she had just picked a flower from a crowd of flowers. The background was a slightly mottled off-white wall. On the wall is a gray square tile area. Above the ceiling climbs dense trumpet creeper vines, with orange-red flowers blooming densely in layers. Against the backdrop of green leaves, the area appears vibrant and vibrant. Some petals have already withered, scattered on the damp ground, forming clusters of colorful fallen leaves. The ground is a dark gray cement pavement, glowing faintly from the rain, reflecting the soft reflections of the surrounding environment. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures positioned slightly below the center of the painting, forming a visual focal point. The upper flower wall echoes the fallen flowers below, enhancing the sense of layering in the composition. The overall composition is full but not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space. The light is soft and even, like natural light on a cloudy day or after rain. There is no strong contrast between light and shadow, but delicate transitions between light and shadow are preserved, creating a peaceful, gentle, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The color palette is mainly warm orange and cool gray-white, creating a harmonious contrast of warm and cool tones that highlight the subject while enhancing the artistic feel of the painting. The entire scene resembles a poetic street photography work, with a slight film texture, moderate color saturation, rich details, and slightly soft-focus edges, as if captured with an old camera. It is realistic and full of life's atmosphere. The frame contains no unnecessary decorations, conveying a tranquil beauty through simple elements combined, allowing visitors to feel a moment of peace and beauty in the garden after the rain",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
