        {
          "id": "krea2-2e26754bd951846a2eaa558c",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣桌边忧伤倚靠",
          "prompt": "Her posture is relaxed yet full of inner emotion. She wears a deep blue ribbed knit sweater with clearly visible cuff texture, made of soft and thick material, presenting a warm texture. The foreground is a close-up of her half-body and occupies the main composition. On the left is a table lamp with a warm yellow lampshade. The lampshade is conical, emitting soft light inside, creating a contrast between the warm light source and the cool tones of the background. The background is a blurred indoor environment. The outline of the bookshelf is faintly visible, with books and some items placed on it, but details are blurred to create a sense of spatial depth. The window is located behind the left of the character, letting in natural light. Light streams in diagonally from outside, casting light shadows on the table and clothing. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, with natural transitions between light and shadow. The composition uses a medium shot, with a slightly upward angle to highlight the characters' expressions and emotions. The composition leans toward the right with a blank space, the background is moderately blurred, maintaining some environmental information without interfering with the subject. The color scheme is mainly cool blue Warm yellow lighting accents create a contrast of cool and warm tones, creating a quiet, artistic, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The image has a slight film graininess, simulating real camera effects. The tone leans toward vintage and has low saturation, enhancing the sense of nostalgia. The overall style resembles movie stills or independent photography, capturing a quiet everyday moment and conveying a sense of introspection, gentleness, loneliness, and beauty. It feels as if time has frozen in this moment, the characters immersed in their own world, and everything around them becomes blurry and distant. This atmosphere evokes a poetic tranquility and complex inner emotions. The images present delicate textures and rich details, each carefully depicted. The visual guide begins with the warm light of the desk lamp, forming a complete emotional thread. The entire scene resembles a carefully composed portrait, both artistic and full of everyday life, as if casually captured at dusk with an old-fashioned film camera, full of storytelling and emotional impact",
          "description": "",
