        {
          "id": "krea2-cccfb755229842e1cd857d4b",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙海滩忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the seaside at dusk, radiating a natural, healthy glow. She wears a white strappy dress with blue floral patterns, slender straps revealing one shoulder. Over it, she casually drapes a bright royal blue blazer. The material has a slight sheen, the sleeves hang naturally, and the neckline is open, creating a striking color contrast. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly turned to the side, one hand gently tucked into her pocket, the other naturally hanging down. The overall look is simple yet layered. The background is a deep blue night sky with a blurred outline of the sea, showing a gradient from deep blue to jet black. In the distance, a faint halo can be seen on the horizon, and the seawater ripples quietly in the dim light. The overall tone of the painting is cool, dominated by blue, creating a tranquil yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, head slightly tilted, creating strong visual guidance. Light comes from the front slightly to the right, with soft backlighting outlining the figure's outline and enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The shadows transition naturally without harsh boundaries. The overall light and shadow distribution is even and layered, giving the image a film texture with slight graininess and color shifts, reminiscent of vintage images shot with an old camera. The lens is a 50mm prime portrait lens with an f/1.8 aperture, blurring the background to highlight the subject. The depth of field is well controlled, with a clear foreground and gradually blurred background, enhancing spatial depth. Color saturation is moderate, with a deep blue tone that is not harsh or glaring. White clothing looks especially pure against a cool background The overall image conveys a quiet, reserved, and artistic temperament, as if capturing an unintentionally heart-fluttering moment, full of storytelling and emotional tension. Like a quiet scene in a film, it makes one want to explore her inner world. The image details are rich, textures are realistic and natural, and light and shadow changes are delicate, creating a visual experience that is both real and dreamy. The overall style combines the intimacy of everyday life with the aesthetic height of artistic photography, presenting a gentle yet resilient female strength",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
