        {
          "id": "krea2-f99ae23a735658ff219502a6",
          "alias": "单女棕外套街道忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a green metal railing by the city street, wearing a loose brown corduroy long coat over a white striped shirt, dark blue jeans, black ankle boots, a beige bucket hat with clear woven patterns, round glasses, and a slightly contemplative expression gazing toward the upper left of the frame, hands folded on her knees, a relaxed and elegant posture. The overall look presents a retro artistic street style, with her body slightly angled to the camera, creating a natural dynamic balance. In the foreground is a damp asphalt pavement and a striking white traffic marking. The green guardrail extends diagonally to the lower right of the frame, visually guiding the characters. In the middle is a tall concrete retaining wall, covered with traces of time. The rough texture and mottled moss look textured under cloudy light. The wall is a deep gray-brown with irregular water stains and weathering marks. The background is a dense green tree with lush branches and leaves, forming a dense green barrier. The sky is shaded by leaves, and the light is soft and even. The entire shot was shot from a low angle, with a layered composition. The person is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, using the rule of thirds to create a sense of open space. The colors are mainly earth tones, with brown, beige, deep blue, and green harmoniously unified. The light and shadows are scattered on cloudy days without strong contrast, with soft shadows and rich details. The atmosphere is quiet yet slightly melancholic, as if capturing a tranquil moment in a city corner. It has a strong Japanese magazine photography style, with delicate texture and moderate graininess. The imaging effect of a simulated film camera features a cool yet warm tone, with an overall atmosphere that is quiet, detached, and full of storytelling. It resembles a daily record from the edge of the city—authentic and poetic. The image details are rich, from the folds of clothing to the reflections on the ground, all clearly visible. The composition is rigorous yet casual, with a naturally smooth visual guide. From the fence lines in the foreground to the figures, then upward to the trees and sky in the background, forming a complete visual flow and presenting an aesthetic conception that is both everyday and artistic. It seemed to freeze an ordinary yet profound moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
