        {
          "id": "krea2-fda95d800e771fc3a6b62ab9",
          "alias": "单女风衣窗边困倦坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window, sunlight streaming in from the right, creating a warm backlight effect that presents a soft golden-brown sheen and a tranquil and dreamy atmosphere. She wears fine-rimmed glasses, the lenses reflecting faint light, her expression calm and immersed, as if completely immersed in a world of words. She wears a light-colored trench coat with a white shirt underneath, the collar slightly open, revealing a slender neckline. The fabric of the trench coat appears light and textured under the light, with naturally smooth pleats at the cuffs and shoulders. It adds a sense of casualness and authenticity. She holds a heavy book in both hands, the pages slightly yellowed, the paper texture clearly visible, and the handwriting densely packed, showing it is a rich reading material. The edges of the pages are slightly worn, suggesting it has been repeatedly flipped through. The background is an indoor environment, the walls are light gray or off-white, with a slightly mottled texture. A faint air vent or socket can be seen on the wall, and beside it is a blue door frame or partition. The cool colors contrast with the warm-toned lighting, enhancing the layering of the image. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, heads slightly tilted, and gazes downward, forming a natural visual guideline. At the same time, the outline outlined by sunlight is drawn in, with extremely delicate light and shadow treatment. The main light source comes from the right rear, creating a strong contour light. Light passes through the window, producing obvious beams and scattering effects. The air seems to be floating with fine dust, enhancing realism and immersion. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, complemented by a few cool blue background elements to create a warm and cool contrast, creating a tranquil, A warm and slightly artistic atmosphere, the image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and moderate color saturation—not too bright—preserving natural light and shadow transitions. The background is slightly blurred to highlight the subject, the composition is asymmetrical but balanced, using lighting and the posture of the characters to form a visual focal point, presenting a moment captured in daily life, like a spontaneous shoot, with the realism of amateur equipment while also full of poetry and emotion, conveying the peace and focus that reading brings. It was as if time stood still at this moment, with only sunlight, pages, and breathing flowing",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
