        {
          "id": "krea2-579a2ce1010774105d54a461",
          "alias": "单女米风衣城市忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits with her back to the camera on the steep stone steps, wearing a beige long trench coat paired with a white lace mini skirt and black leather shoes. Her left hand gently grips the hem of the coat, her right leg bent and suspended in the air, her toes lightly tapping the steps. Her posture is lazy and relaxed, as if gazing at the distant cityscape. Her figure is elongated and projected onto the cement floor paved with yellow paved paving bricks underfoot, forming a clear and dynamic silhouette. In the foreground are two square cement pillars, topped with green plaques featuring pink floral patterns. Next to the left pillar is a low metal railing and dense green shrubs; on the right are light gray brick walls and neatly trimmed spherical greenery. In the middle is a winding downward slope, flanked by clusters of Japanese-style residential buildings. The roofs are mostly gray tiles, and the walls are mainly white and light brown. Some houses have wooden balconies and clothes racks, dotted with tall trees with lush branches and leaves. One has a round crown, another slender, and utility poles stand on the left side of the painting, with multiple black wires crisscrossing the landscape. Stretching like a network to the sky, the background is layered with urban skylines. In the distance, tall buildings stand tall, their silhouettes faintly visible in the mist. Further away are rolling mountains. The sky appears pale blue, with sparse and white fluffy clouds. Sunlight streams in from the upper left, creating a warm and bright backlight effect. Light penetrates the clouds and falls on figures, buildings, and vegetation, producing soft contour light and delicate shadow transitions. The overall tone is cool but tinged with a warm yellow halo, creating a quiet yet slightly melancholic afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame. The viewer's gaze gradually extends from the foreground details to the mid-ground streets and the distant city, creating a strong sense of depth. The visual focus is on the characters, whose posture and light and shadow together form the emotional center of the image. The overall style is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and natural color fading, presenting poetic moments captured unintentionally in daily life, as if shot with an old film camera. Full of the breath of life and nostalgia, the images are rich in detail, layered, and have strong contrasts of light and shadow. It combines the trivial realities of urban life with a romantic mood of solitude and contemplation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
