        {
          "id": "krea2-3888651ebf9e86696031c452",
          "alias": "单女粉衬衫桌边沉思坐指向",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a cozy café, wearing a soft pale pink cotton shirt with naturally draped fabric, sleeves slightly rolled up, presenting a casual yet refined everyday vibe. She is gazing down at the dessert in front of her, her expression thoughtful. Her left hand gently holds a small metal spoon, while her right hand rests lightly on the table. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed. In front of her was a tall glass dessert cup, filled with layers of strawberry cream cake. The base was filled with rich chocolate sauce, with fresh cream and sliced strawberries in the middle. The top was piled high with plump, juicy red strawberries, and the surface was adorned with a few mint leaves, its colors bright and tempting. The dessert cup was placed on a white lace-edged plate, with fine embossed patterns on the edges. Next to it was a small white porcelain cup holding dark black coffee, smooth with a faint steam rising from the rim, and a silver fork beside it The tabletop is covered with pure white linen, soft in texture and naturally wrinkled. In the lower right corner of the painting is a blooming red carnation, with layers of petals and rich colors. The stems are slender and slender, complemented by green leaves, adding a touch of romance to the entire scene. The background is a blurry indoor environment, with warm yellow lights streaming in from afar, forming a soft halo. In the background, you can faintly see the outlines of brown leather sofas and wooden furniture. The overall depth of field is shallow, with the focus on the figures and desserts. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure is centered slightly to the left, with the dessert point at the visual center. The flowers in the foreground contrast sharply with the blurred background to guide the gaze toward the subject. The use of light and shadow is extremely delicate, with the main light source coming from the front left, creating a soft side light and natural shadow transitions. The warm-toned lighting in the background creates a warm, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly pink, white, brown, and red, harmoniously unified to present a tranquil moment that is both lifelike and artistically beautiful, as if captured with an old-fashioned film camera. With slight graininess and natural exposure deviation, the image enhances realism and emotional warmth. The images are filled with the poetry and gentleness of everyday life, evoking a sense of peace and satisfaction slowed by time",
