        {
          "id": "krea2-a6fff4efd251b048e72c9867",
          "alias": "单女红T恤街道俏皮站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the middle of a sunny street, wearing a bright red T-shirt printed with \"TAMALAPA HIGH\" and a simple badge pattern. She pairs beige high-waisted wide-leg pants with a metal buckle at the waistband. The overall look is casual and full of energy, showing off her white teeth. Her hands are raised high, her left hand making a V sign, and her right hand spreading her five fingers as if embracing the sky. Her body leans slightly, presenting a free-spirited posture. A black shoulder bag slung across her shoulder is a wide and thick strap, made of canvas or nylon. She wears a pair of pearl earrings, adding a touch of refinement. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, making the figure appear taller and more prominent, while enhancing the visual impact. The middle section features the street surface and roadside traffic facilities, where you can see the gray cement pavement, with clear tire marks and fine cracks on the surface. A metal rod stands by the roadside with traffic lights and signs installed. One sign reads \"OFFICE\" and \"AGE,\" another yellow sign reads \"Café,\" with a cityscape under blue skies and white clouds. In the distance, several tall palm trees glow with leaves that glow in the sunlight. Further away, some blurry outlines of buildings and parked vehicles, including a blue sedan and a large white truck, illuminated by intense sunlight, Light pours down from the upper right, creating a striking contrast of light and shadow that presents a warm golden tone. The left side is enveloped in soft shadows, adding a sense of depth. The shadows cast on the ground, with clear lines extending to the figures' feet. The sky is a clear blue and cloudless, with highly saturated colors that give a fresh and open feeling. The overall tone of the painting is bright, mainly red, beige, and blue, complemented by green and gray, creating a relaxed and joyful summer afternoon atmosphere. The visual guide is naturally led by the characters' smiles and gestures to the sky extending further into the distant street scene, forming an open visual circulation with delicate image texture and rich details, like outdoor portraits shot with a professional camera, full of vibrant life and artistic beauty, as if capturing a real and beautiful moment, full of youthful vitality and passion for life",
