        {
          "id": "krea2-b47484fdafd23a3c974e0c57",
          "alias": "单女绿高领衫城市站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of the exterior wall of a city building, wearing a deep green turtleneck knit sweater with a tight cut that perfectly outlines a slender waistline and a flowing figure. Long sleeves hug the arm lines, the fabric features delicate ribbed textures and a subtle sheen, with rich and calm colors like a touch of green in winter; The lower half is paired with a brown high-waisted skirt made of thick wool or coarse woven fabric. The hem is A-shaped and naturally drapes down to mid-calf. One side of the skirt features a patchwork design, with colors gradient from light brown to dark brown, creating a subtle visual layer. A black leather belt with delicate metal buckles adds a touch of vintage feel; She slung a brown top-grain cowhide handbag across her right shoulder. The bag was full and crisp, with neat edges, and the leather surface had natural wrinkles and luster, giving it a warm feel and the marks of time. On the right is a glass window fitted with blinds. The blades are neatly arranged, some slightly tilted, reflecting the indoors' hazy light and shadow. Sunlight streams in from the right, golden rays fall on the figures, creating a soft contrast of light and shadow. The left wall casts clear silhouettes of figures, intertwining light and shadow to create a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait shot, with the subject positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right to showcase background details. The angle is slightly lower than the level view, highlighting the character's slender figure and overall aesthetic design. The foreground features the main body and handbag, the middle ground is the lower body and the hem, and the background is the wall and window, with clear layering. Then the handbag and background create a natural flow of sight. The light and shadow come from the afternoon sunset, warm and soft with a warm yellow tone, creating a quiet and elegant overall atmosphere. Filled with the intellectual charm and lifestyle of urban women, it resembles a real street scene casually captured with a regular phone—authentic and natural, rich in detail, rich in storytelling and artistic beauty",
