        {
          "id": "krea2-1aed1f35614ec19bfff83bdd",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙山野站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under natural light, wearing a light beige woven straw hat with a wide brim and slightly rough edges, presenting a natural fiber texture and handwoven texture details. She wears a white lace dress with delicate ruffle trim on the neckline and cuffs. The fabric is light and breathable, featuring delicate embossed patterns and a semi-transparent texture, with delicate embroidery patterns on the chest, adding a touch of vintage elegance. In her right hand, she holds a bouquet of blooming white daisies. The flowers are dense and delicate, with flawless white petals, a bright yellow stamen, and a few emerald green leaves on the branches. The overall composition centers on the figure, using close-up shots and blurred backgrounds to present a blurred lake surface and distant mountain outlines. The lake water has a faint blue-green hue, the surface calm like a mirror, reflecting the faint glow of the sky. The mountain is covered with sparse vegetation, with a grayish-green hue. The pale blue gradient blends with the sky, revealing a small patch of clouds in the sky, presenting a soft milky white. The overall lighting is natural daylight, with the light source coming from the upper left and light shadows on the right, creating a sense of depth and layering. The main color tones are warm white, light yellow, and light blue, with moderate saturation, a slight film texture and graininess, simulating everyday amateur camera shooting and emphasizing realism and a sense of life. The composition uses a three-division method, with the subject's head positioned at the upper left corner of the frame, and the gaze facing the right front. forming a visual guiding line. Looking toward the distant background enhances the depth of the image. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, gentle, and nostalgic, as if capturing a beautiful moment on a summer afternoon, full of youthful energy and poetic beauty. The lens focal length is set to 85mm, aperture f/1.8, shutter speed 1/200 sec, ISO 100, classic portrait simulation setup, highlighting the subject clarity and background blur while preserving natural environmental details, with slight vignetting at the edges. Adding a retro film style creates an overall sense of realism similar to shooting with a phone or small digital camera. Without excessive retouching, the character images become more authentic and believable, with natural light and shadow transitions. Highlights are not overexposed, and shadows still show details, resulting in a visually comfortable and artistically appealing look",
