        {
          "id": "krea2-1acc6c4c63e7d98299db1763",
          "alias": "单女湿身白T恤海滩站立泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a rocky beach by the sea, wearing a loose white short-sleeve T-shirt with a black brand logo printed on the chest. She pairs it with blue denim shorts and a pair of thick-soled beige casual shoes. White stockings are rolled up high to reveal her ankles. The overall look is simple yet full of summer vibes. Her posture is natural and relaxed, one arm crossed over her chest, the other slightly raised. Lightly tapping the toes on a damp rock, it reveals a casual, yet elegant dynamic beauty. In the foreground are brown rocks of various sizes, covered in moss and shells, some soaked by seawater, their surfaces glowing with a moist sheen. Between the crevices, tiny waves crash continuously, splashing white water that winds through the rocks, forming a transparent thin layer of water that reflects the blurred outlines of the sky and figures. In the middle is a calm blue sea, the water crystal clear to the bottom, shimmering with light. On the distant sea horizon, there is a small island, on which several low buildings can be faintly seen. The sky shows a faint blue gradient, transitioning from the bright sky blue above to the soft gray-white near the horizon. The overall light is natural middaylight, with sunlight streaming down from the upper right, casting soft shadows on the figures. The layers of light and shadow are distinct, casting varying shades on the rock surface to enhance the three-dimensional effect of the composition. The composition uses a slightly slanted third-section layout, with the figure positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the frame. The body extends diagonally, with the right leg raised upward, guiding the gaze from the rocks in the lower left corner to the sky in the upper right, creating a visual effect that balances movement and balance. The sea and sky in the background occupy the upper half of the composition, creating a contrast between the open space and the dense rocks in the foreground, highlighting the subject's presence. Then, through her raised legs and extended arms, the gaze is guided through the entire frame, finally landing on distant islands and the skyline. The overall atmosphere is fresh and natural, carrying a strong summer seaside vibe. It looks like an outdoor portrait shot with a professional camera, but the details are handled like the real moments captured by everyday amateur equipment. The color saturation is moderate, the tones are warm, the light and shadow are realistic, and the texture is delicate, giving a truly immersive experience. The entire image exudes a blend of youthful vitality and serene beauty, combining the refined composition of artistic photography with a genuine sense of everyday life, as if freezing an ordinary yet precious afternoon moment.",
