        {
          "id": "krea2-958148b595d7f048c49d1fa6",
          "alias": "单女外套街道站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the outdoor street, wearing a dark loose coat over a light gray hooded sweatshirt with the hat on her head. The overall look is simple and comfortable, as if she has just finished a walk or stepped out of a quiet corner. The background is a typical Japanese residential street paved with reddish-brown asphalt edged with white markings, and on the right side is a low concrete wall and barbed wire fence. On the left is an orange metal pillar, with several yellowed old posters and stickers pasted on its surface. Some have peeled off, showing traces of time. In the distance, several Japanese-style residential buildings can be seen, with sloped roofs, light-colored exterior walls, neatly arranged windows, surrounded by green trees and shrubs. The leaves display the unique golden and pink hues of autumn. Sunlight pours down from the upper right of the painting, creating a soft backlight effect. The light penetrates the fine dust in the air, creating a warm and hazy atmosphere. The figures are outlined by the light with faint silhouettes. The wrinkles on the clothing are clearly visible, the jacket material looks thick and warm, the sweatshirt is soft and fluffy, and the details are rich. The composition uses a left-centered visual layout, with the characters occupying the main position but leaving enough space to display the surrounding environment, enhancing the realism and immersion of the scene. The grid structure of the chain-style fence in the foreground is clearly visible, contrasting with the figures and enhancing the sense of layering in the image. The middle ground features extended streets and roadside facilities, guiding the gaze into the distance. The houses, trees, and utility poles in the background are arranged in a staggered manner. It adds a sense of spatial depth, with the overall color scheme mainly warm yellow and gray-blue, featuring a slight film graininess and retro filter effects, simulating the texture of vintage camera shooting. The direction of light and shadow is clear, with sunlight shining from the sides and rear, creating soft shadows and highlights, creating a peaceful, peaceful, and slightly nostalgic mood. The images lack dramatic tension but convey a tranquil everyday beauty through delicate light and shadow changes and everyday details, as if capturing the most authentic and moving moment of an ordinary afternoon. The entire image presents a texture reminiscent of amateur photography equipment, with slight noise and color shifts, allowing one to feel the warmth and warmth of real life. The composition is stable, and the viewing angle is level to the point, like a casual photo taken by a friend—neither forced nor distant, full of the breath of life and humanistic care, gradually spreading to the surrounding environment, finally landing on the distant street scene and sky, forming a complete narrative loop. The overall atmosphere is warm and quiet, with a hint of autumn bleakness and gentleness, like a silent poem. It records the most precious moments of ordinary days.",
