        {
          "id": "krea2-4ef54d18ac8b36fdf88bac1f",
          "alias": "单女制服车厢忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside an old wooden carriage, dressed in a classic Japanese sailor uniform. Her white long-sleeved shirt pairs a deep blue navy collar with double white stripes, a black satin bow tied at her chest, and a small blue badge embroidered on her left breast pocket. Underneath, she wears a clean and youthful look, wearing fine-rimmed round glasses that reflect soft light. Her expression is calm yet tinged with a hint of melancholy and contemplation. Her hands are naturally folded on her knees, her posture dignified yet slightly reserved. The background features vintage wooden seats and window structures, with clearly visible deep brown wood grain. Some wood surfaces show age-worn mottled marks and slight wear. The window frame edges are old, and metal parts show slight rust, giving off a nostalgic industrial feel. In the distance, blurred stepped seats or compartment partitions present a deep blue-green tone, creating a warm and cool contrast with the foreground. The entire composition uses a medium shot, with the figure centered to the right, occupying the main visual center, and the window edges serving as natural vertical guiding lines. Draw your gaze toward the subject, while the horizontal lines of the background echo the straight posture of the figure, enhancing the stability and depth of the image. Light enters diagonally from the left window, creating a soft sidelight effect that creates strong contrast and three-dimensional layering. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, highlights are bright but not glaring, shadow areas are deep but not completely dark. The overall color scheme is mainly cool, with white, deep blue, and gray-black as the main color palette, accented with a few red badge details. The color saturation is moderate, with a slight retro filter effect, The visual atmosphere is quiet, restrained, and full of storytelling, as if capturing a moment of loneliness, like waiting for memories on a train about to depart. It has a strong Japanese youth film texture. The lens uses a 35mm standard prime lens to simulate professional camera imaging, with moderate background blur, well-controlled depth, delicate image quality, and rich details, presenting a sense of realism and life that is reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The overall style combines artistry and documentary quality, conveying a sense of tranquility, A gentle yet slightly detached youthful aesthetic",
