          "id": "krea2-98eafdfb770cb7655b573123",
          "alias": "单女紫毛衣椅上冷淡坐持包",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a vintage-style wooden chair, her makeup exquisite, her overall posture relaxed and elegant. Her arms are crossed over her chest, exuding a subtle sense of fashion. She wears a loose purple chunky knit sweater with clearly visible texture, presenting a warm and substantial texture. She wears a white three-dimensional pleated long dress with layered hems, naturally draped and rich in detail. On her feet are bright purple pointed high heels, which echo the sweater's color and highlight a strong visual focal point. To her left was a small dark wooden table, on which sat a cloth bag printed with a red rose pattern. Next to it was a small white plate holding a cut cake, exuding the tempting aroma of dessert. On the left side of the table was a potted green plant, lush with branches and leaves, adding a touch of vitality. The background was a mottled brick wall with obvious signs of age. Some areas showed a concrete base, presenting a rough yet textured texture. In the upper left corner, a few white candles could be faintly seen. Injecting a soft, warm atmosphere into the scene, the floor is made of gray cement with fine cracks and irregular wear marks, enhancing the sense of realism and life in the space. The entire composition uses a middle shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, forming a stable visual focus. The foreground features the figures and chairs, while the middle includes tables, cakes, plants, and some walls. The background features a complete brick wall and decorative elements in the corners. The composition is balanced and layered, with light coming from the front and side. Soft natural light or indoor lighting falls from the upper left, with consistent shadow directions that enhance the sense of depth. At the same time, subtle reflections appear on the desk and floor, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The main tones are purple, white, brown, and gray, harmoniously and unified, creating a balance of cool and warm while maintaining harmony. Overall, it presents an unintentional aesthetic moment from everyday life, as if taken with a regular camera—authentic without force, full of life atmosphere and artistic flair, with rich details. From the knitted texture of sweaters to the three-dimensional folds of lace skirts, to the rough texture of brick walls and subtle scratches on the floor, every detail stands up to scrutiny. The lighting and shadow are natural, without excessive sharpening or exaggerated post-processing, presenting a realistic feel reminiscent of shooting with a phone or entry-level camera. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and warm, like a casual photo taken in an afternoon café. It combines the fashion of the characters with the rustic authenticity of the environment, creating a photographic work that combines artistic beauty with everyday warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
