        {
          "id": "krea2-b13a5cd44e6dc549298623cb",
          "alias": "单女白制服街道忧伤坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A girl sits outdoors on a low concrete wall, wearing a white short-sleeved school uniform shirt and black shorts. The shirt collar and cuffs are decorated with two dark stripes, wearing beige sneakers and white socks, carrying a light brown canvas backpack. She lowers her head slightly to the side, her expression calm and slightly melancholic. Her hands rest naturally on her knees, her body leans slightly forward, her posture relaxed yet tinged with contemplation. The main subject is on the right, occupying about one-third of the space, with an asymmetrical composition in balance. The figure is near the visual golden ratio point. The foreground is the rough edge of a concrete wall with a clear texture, with fine cracks and weathering marks on the surface. The middle ground is dense green shrubs with rich leaf layers, with colors transitioning naturally from dark green to light green. Some leaves glow softly under sunlight. In the distance, a blurred outline of an industrial area is visible, with multiple towering chimneys and pipeline structures faintly visible. The sky appears pale blue with a slight haze, and several slender wires crossing the upper part of the painting to form clean line elements. The overall composition has a strong sense of depth, progressing from the nearby wall and the plants in the middle to the industrial buildings in the distance. The visual guide is from the physical wall in the foreground to the figures, then extends to the blurred scene in the background, creating a natural flow of sightlines. Light and shadow come from the upper right, soft and warm, presenting diffused light effects in the afternoon or evening. The shadows are soft and lack strong contrasts, and the overall atmosphere is quiet with a hint of detachment. The color tone is cool but warm, mainly blue, white, green, and brown, with moderate color saturation. It has a vintage film texture, rich details in the image, and realistic textures. Wrinkles on clothes, the woven feel of backpack straps, and signs of floor wear are all clearly visible. The overall style resembles everyday amateur photography, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, with slight graininess and slight overexposure, creating a poetic atmosphere of youthful nostalgia and quiet reflection. There are no obvious artificial traces in the image; everything naturally blends together, like a moment frozen in life, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
