        {
          "id": "krea2-8ae4b67e01122e9e9c24611e",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫车厢忧伤站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the open doors of a retro-style beige and dark brown tram or light rail train. She wears a white turtleneck tie-up shirt over a light beige loose knit cardigan, a gray plaid knee-length skirt, white sneakers paired with black ankle socks, hands naturally hanging in front, and gently holding a black vintage film camera in her right hand. The word \"MINOLTA\" is clearly visible on the strap, and her expression carries a hint of contemplation and detachment, making her posture quiet and focused. The composition centers on the figure, using a medium perspective. The figure occupies the left central position of the frame, with the body slightly turning to the right, creating a subtle dynamic balance. In the foreground is the edge of the tram door and the body surface. On the left side of the car, a small colorful promotional sticker is affixed to the body. Next to the right door, there is a vertical oval Japanese sign with white letters on a green background reading \"One-Man Entrance,\" meaning \"Single Driver Entrance.\" Inside the door, you can see the seats, red handrails, and a suspended circular handle. Through the car window, you can see the blurred outdoor green vegetation and tree reflections. The background is a blurred outdoor natural environment, presenting soft autumn tones. The light comes from the side—warm afternoon sunlight streaming in from the front left of the figure. At the same time, soft shadows are cast on the edge of the door and body, creating a soft yet layered effect of light and shadow. The overall color saturation is low, with a vintage blend of warm yellow and gray-green, with a slight grainy texture and film effect, reminiscent of everyday moments captured with an old-fashioned camera. The atmosphere is tranquil and nostalgic, full of artistic vibe and a sense of life. The door frame forms a natural framed composition, enhancing the prominence of the main subject. Overall, it presents a serene, authentic, and slightly melancholic everyday aesthetic, as if capturing a moment of pause during a journey, time frozen in that moment, and the image is full of story and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
