        {
          "id": "krea2-16bfcaa1d62a0403f7631223",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫城市微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside the barbed wire fence of an outdoor tennis court, wearing a loose white long-sleeved shirt with a naturally draped hem and slightly puffed sleeves, presenting a casual and comfortable everyday feel. She pairs dark pants with a simple yet modern look, appearing both fresh and graceful. She leans slightly to the side, her body facing the left side of the frame, her head turned toward the camera, carrying a faint, almost subtle smile, as if silently communicating with the viewer. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait. The figures occupy about two-thirds of the composition, forming the visual focal point. The barbed wire runs diagonally across the background, extending from the upper left corner to the lower right, creating a strong geometric sense of lines that enhance the spatial depth of the composition. The mesh structure of the barbed wire is clearly visible, with some edges showing rust and wear marks, adding a sense of authentic life. The background features blurred green trees and distant sports fields. The shallow depth of field effect makes the subject stand out more while preserving the realism of the environment. Light comes from the upper right side. It belongs to soft natural light, possibly afternoon sunlight. The sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a contrast of light and dark, while on the other side, soft shadows are formed, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color palette is mainly white, black, and green. The white shirt looks especially bright in the sunlight, forming a sharp contrast with the dark pants. The green background tones bring a fresh and natural atmosphere. The overall composition presents a tranquil, gentle, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The light and shadow transitions are natural, the color saturation is moderate, without excessive rendering, giving a sense of authenticity. A simple yet lifelike feel, the composition uses diagonal guiding lines. The slanted lines on the wire mesh not only divide the image but also guide the viewer from the foreground to the background, ultimately focusing on the figure to create a dynamic balance. At the same time, the posture and direction of the person's gaze further reinforce this visual guidance. The overall image has a strong everyday photography style, as if shot with a regular camera or phone, retaining slight noise and natural color reproduction. It does not pursue perfect retouching but emphasizes momentary realism and emotional capture The overall atmosphere is quiet and restrained, evoking both the detachment of urban life and a subtle gentleness and composure, like a tranquil moment captured by chance on an ordinary afternoon.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
