        {
          "id": "krea2-5b97fc23bbccdcf4544eb464",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫书店专注站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the entrance of a vintage-style bookstore. She wears a black turtleneck, a fitted cropped top and a beige plaid knee-length pencil skirt, black pointed stiletto heels, tiny earrings, and a necklace. On her left wrist, she wears a white bracelet. She holds her phone in both hands and looks down at the screen, her posture relaxed and elegant. Her body leans slightly against a rough concrete pillar, presenting the overall sense of fashion and the casual vibe of everyday life of an urban artsy youth. In the foreground is a clear full-body portrait occupying the center of the painting slightly to the right. The composition uses a medium perspective, presenting the characters from head to ankle completely. The background is the bookstore's interior space. On the left shelves, various books are neatly arranged, some stacked on the ground forming small hills. Above the shelves hangs a string of warm yellow light bulbs, creating a cozy and gentle atmosphere. On the right wall is a sign reading \"Store Disinfected\" and several beautifully framed paintings. One wooden sign labeled \"7887\" hangs vertically on the wall, its weathered surface revealing a cement texture and traces of time. The floor is paved with dark gray stone tiles, and the entrance is adorned with a richly colored, intricately patterned Persian carpet. The edges are slightly rolled up to add a sense of life. The lighting for the entire scene mainly comes from indoor lighting and string lighting. Warm halos fill the air, creating a soft transition of light and shadow. Shadows are concentrated on the sides of the body and the floor, creating a realistic and natural three-dimensional effect. At the end of the distant passage, a green emergency exit indicator light can be faintly seen, injecting a touch of modern elements into the composition. The composition uses door frames as natural frames. The viewer's gaze is directed toward the main figures, while the extended sense of the corridor deepens spatial layers. The visual guide is formed by the characters' standing positions, the texture of the carpet, and the direction of the bookshelf arrangement, forming a stable triangular structure. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with slight graininess and low-saturation colors, simulating amateur camera photography. It feels like everyday moments casually recorded at night with ordinary digital devices, presenting an urban artistic daily scene that combines artistic beauty with authentic texture. The images are rich in detail but not cluttered, with unified and harmonious tones, full of storytelling and immersion",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
