        {
          "id": "krea2-6c6b8ac524e28134beec6b0c",
          "alias": "单女绿T恤窗边冷淡倚靠持书",
          "prompt": "A close-up of a woman's half-body adds a touch of laziness and casualness. She wears round tortoiseshell glasses, the lenses reflecting faint light, giving off a vintage yet artistic look. Her right hand gently rests on the temples of the glasses, fingers long, nails painted with pale pink polish, and a silver metal pen pointed downward, the tip gleaming with a cold metallic sheen in the light. She wears a light green crew-neck T-shirt made of soft, close-fitting material, presenting a comfortable yet everyday feel. The folds of the fabric naturally spread across the shoulders and arms, adding realism and a sense of life to the scene. In the foreground, her raised arm and the posture of holding the brush form a subtle visual guiding line. The middle is her upper body, fully presented from shoulder to head. The composition centers on the figure, slightly leaning toward the right side of the frame, leaving blank space on the left to create a sense of breathing and visual balance. The background is a pure pale white wall, with no cluttered elements, clean and concise, highlighting the main subject. At the same time, large areas of blank space enhance the tranquil atmosphere of the image. Light and shadow come from the upper right of the frame, simulating natural window lighting. The light is soft and even, without strong shadows, creating a warm and fresh Japanese-style photo style. The colors are mainly light green, off-white, and brown, with warm tones and moderate saturation, presenting a gentle feel A healing visual experience. The overall atmosphere of the painting is tranquil and full of storytelling, as if capturing a private moment when the afternoon sunlight pours into the room, while a girl is thinking or preparing to write about a moment of inspiration. The image details are rich but not complicated, emphasizing authenticity and emotional expression. It is suitable for magazine covers, personal photo books, or promotional posters with artistic themes. It features a slight film graininess and natural exposure transitions, enhancing the retro and everyday texture. The composition is compact but not crowded, with a clear visual focus. All elements serve to convey the characters' emotions and create the atmosphere of the environment",
