        {
          "id": "krea2-f74592526d06bdcc6c655610",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙海滩冷淡站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the stone railing by the sea, turning to look back at the camera. Her overall posture is relaxed and natural, full of youthful energy and a sense of life. She wears an off-white loose short-sleeved top made of light and breathable material, with a slightly flowing hem. She pairs it with a black high-waisted short skirt that is simple and neat. Over her shoulder, she carries a colorful knit bag crossbody, with stripes in purple, orange, yellow, and blue interwoven for rich layering. With an ethnic texture, the straps are deep purple, creating a harmonious contrast with the body. Her legs are long, and she wears a pair of color-striped socks with a patchwork design. The socks are made up of multiple pieces of different colors and patterns—green, red, blue, black, and white—presenting a mixed-style fashion vibe. On her feet are a pair of thick-soled sneakers with a white upper accented with gray and light brown details. The thick soles combine comfort with a trendy feel. The background is a vast ocean, with deep blue water sparkling in the water. In the distance, several jagged rocks stand abruptly in the sea, rugged in shape, their surfaces covered with weathering marks. The sky appears pale gray-blue, the clouds are thin, and the light is soft and even. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and open. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned on the left side of the painting, slightly tilted body, and gaze to the right, forming a visual guide. At the same time, the sea and distant mountains are incorporated into the right space, enhancing the depth of the composition. In the foreground is a rough stone railing with clear texture, presenting a natural brownish tone, adding texture and realism to the image The middle shot is the main subject, forming a clear spatial layer with the background. The background is the vast boundary between sea and sky, with a clear distant horizon that stretches the visual length. The light and shadow come from natural daylight, shining from the upper right, making the right side of the figure clearly illuminated. The shadows gently cast on the left leg and the ground, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall tone is cool but still warm, creating a quiet, leisurely, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The image has a realistic feel of everyday life, as if captured in a moment captured with a regular camera or phone. With a slight film graininess and natural color saturation, it emphasizes authenticity rather than excessive embellishment, presenting an overall aesthetic of youthfulness, freedom, and spontaneity, allowing people to feel the comfort and inner peace of mind while strolling along the seaside",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
