        {
          "id": "krea2-8053fb2b62a60371f3379bf7",
          "alias": "单女外套窗边忧伤持相机",
          "prompt": "Her expression carries a hint of calm and gentleness, with a hint of transparency. She wears a dark plaid tweed jacket paired with a white turtleneck underneath. Around her neck is a thick, soft magenta knit scarf with a clear texture. The cuffs reveal red knit gloves made of the same material, and her hands steadily hold a classic silver-black film camera. The camera body has a metallic sheen, with obvious reflections on the lens and rich details. It presents the mechanical texture and vintage feel unique to vintage cameras. The overall composition uses close-ups, with people occupying most of the frame, and the camera prominently serving as the foreground subject. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with a cool gray tone and faint outlines of walls or window frames, creating a strong depth of field effect. The blurred background enhances the subject's three-dimensionality and focus, with light coming from the front and side, creating a natural shadow transition. The rich layering of light and shadow creates a warm and quiet atmosphere, with an overall warm tone. Using a red scarf as the visual focal point, contrasting with the cool gray background to highlight the character's presence, the image has a strong film texture, with slight graininess and moderate color saturation, presenting a nostalgic, artistic, and slightly melancholic mood, as if recording an ordinary yet precious moment. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, like a real photo uncovered from an old album, radiating warmth and emotion accumulated over time",
