        {
          "id": "krea2-f7267c9ef3f3e993b2f178d8",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫室内微笑站立",
          "prompt": "A woman sat in a warm indoor setting, wearing an off-white plush beret. The edges of the hat were soft and fluffy, presenting a natural fuzzy texture. She appeared layered and glossy, with a hint of curiosity and shyness. Looking directly into the camera, she revealed a calm and sweet smile. She wore a white shirt with a lace-trimmed collar, a delicate collar, wide cuffs, and light, flowing material, layered with a dark vest with vintage patterns. The vest is adorned with fine sequins or embroidered patterns, sparkling gently under the light. Her right hand is gently raised, fingers slender and long, fingertips lightly touching the brim of the hat, the posture elegant and natural, as if tidying the hat or a casual gesture. The entire composition centers on the figure, using close-ups and background blur to create a soft depth effect. In the background, a wooden window frame can be faintly seen, with warm natural light streaming in outside, creating mottled light and shadow. The frame's lines are simple, and the color is light wood. Harmonizing with the overall color scheme, the right side of the background features a blurred outline of a plant, possibly a dandelion or a feathery plant, whose white fuzz faintly appears in the light, adding a touch of dreaminess. The foreground figure occupies the main position in the composition, with a balanced and visually guiding composition. Returning to the overall posture, it forms a smooth visual path. Light comes from the sides and rear, forming a soft warm yellow tone that simulates afternoon sunlight streaming through the window into the room, enhancing the sense of depth. The light spots in the background appear as circular or oval bokeh of varying sizes and evenly distributed to create a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly warm tones, paired with a small amount of dark clothing for contrast, making the subject stand out more. The image texture is delicate with a slight soft-focus effect, as if taken with professional photography equipment, yet retaining the warmth of daily life. The image presents a Japanese-style photo style, combining sweetness, gentleness, and artistic vibes. It was as if an old film camera had captured a quiet afternoon moment, filled with nostalgia and poetry. The entire scene was tranquil and beautiful, evoking a sense of serene happiness.",
