        {
          "id": "krea2-66b131d6bc034d29d3472465",
          "alias": "单女白外套街道冷淡站立吃",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a street snack stall, slightly lowering her head to bite into a piece of golden fried food. The bread has a crispy crust with a glossy oil, while the inside is soft and fluffy, wrapped in a white tissue. Her left hand is tucked into the pocket of her off-white down jacket. The jacket is thick and fluffy, with a folded neckline revealing the collar and cuffs of a beige knit sweater underneath. The sweater's texture is clearly visible, with fine knitting patterns. She wears light-colored jeans, her body slightly turned to the left side of the frame, her head tilted slightly, and her expression is somewhat lazy and content. The background is a typical Japanese street snack shop, with wooden door frames and dark walls forming the main structure. Several brightly colored posters hang on the walls, their designs blurry but recognizable as food advertisements. On the right hangs an orange-yellow fabric sign printed with the Japanese characters \"decorative characterき\" (decorative characterき). The font is bold and strong, with slightly worn edges. The floor is made of cement or stone slab, slightly mottled, and the overall lighting is soft and cool, like natural light on a cloudy or evening day. The sunlight shines from above, casting a faint shadow. The surface of the down jacket has subtle reflections, highlighting its fluffy texture. The composition uses medium shots, with the figure occupying the center-left position, leaving space on the right side to show background details. The camera angle is slightly overlooked, creating a casual everyday atmosphere. The colors are mainly warm yellow, off-white, and brown, accented with orange-red and deep black. The tones are warm and realistic, with the grainy texture and slight underexposure characteristic of film cameras. The light and shadow transitions are natural, the background slightly blurred, highlighting the subject, and the overall image presents a nostalgic, life-oriented, The microfilm-like everyday moments seem to freeze on an ordinary yet warm afternoon, capturing the simplest joy between people and food. The atmosphere is tranquil and intimate, like street clips casually captured with an old film camera, full of story and warmth",
