        {
          "id": "krea2-72fcb05f31f1d8eed4423adc",
          "alias": "单女灰外套街道冷淡站立喝",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside a metal retractable door on a city street. She wears a dark gray wool coat over a white turtleneck knit sweater, with a brown leather shoulder strap slung across her shoulder. In her right hand, she holds a box of blue-and-white cardboard drinks, gently sipping with a straw. Her left hand rests gently on the metal door frame, her body slightly leaning in a relaxed and natural posture. The background is blurred green trees and faintly visible street vehicles, creating a hazy urban life atmosphere. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame. Occupying the main visual space, the left side leaves a large negative space to highlight the subject, creating a strong visual direction. Light comes from the upper left, with warm golden sunlight filtering through the leaves and falling on the figure, creating a soft backlit contour and delicate transitions of light and shadow. The overall tone is cool but carries a warm yellow glow, presenting a film-like retro filter effect. The image has moderate color saturation, rich details, and clear layering, exuding a strong sense of daily life and artistic flair, as if captured with an old-fashioned film camera during street photography. It captures a quiet and authentic moment of urban life. The background blur is well handled to highlight the main subject, while preserving environmental information and enhancing the realism of the scene. The entire scene is filled with a tranquil atmosphere, conveying a gentle, contemplative mood, like a girl casually taking a sip of a drink while waiting for a bus on an autumn afternoon, briefly pausing in a corner of this bustling city, feeling a moment of tranquility and self-companionship",
