        {
          "id": "krea2-a27d1b8fa6e293af7ee75945",
          "alias": "单女室内冷淡侧头",
          "prompt": "She tilts her head slightly, as if about to taste or ponder. Her right hand gently holds a small piece of green apple, her fingers long, her nails painted with light-colored nail polish. In the foreground is a transparent glass fish tank filled with clear water. A few green apples soak in it, the water ripples gently, reflecting green spots and blurred reflections. The edge of the tank is rounded, the glass is transparent, the water is clear, and the background blurs into a soft blue-gray tone. Bookshelves, books, and blurred interior furnishings are faintly visible. Light streams in from the left, sunlight filters through windows or curtains. A distinct Tyndall effect is created, with tiny dust particles floating in the air, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the right side of the frame, heads slightly tilted, guiding the viewer to look toward the upper left. The fish tank is positioned slightly to the right below the frame, creating visual balance. The layers of light and shadow are rich, the shadows transition naturally, and the colors are mainly cool green and warm yellow, creating a striking contrast. The image texture is delicate, with the graininess of film photography and slight overexposure, presenting an overall tranquility. The gentle yet slightly artistic everyday scenes seem like moments captured with an old camera, full of life and poetic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
