        {
          "id": "krea2-d5db7388d171f94c2b8bae8e",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙走廊忧伤倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "deep within an ancient wooden corridor by the sea, a woman in a simple long dress leans slightly, gazing tenderly at a black-and-white cat. Her expression is focused and peaceful, as if holding food or a toy in her hand, silently communicating with the cat. Her figure is enveloped by the shadows of the corridor, forming a soft silhouette. She wears an off-white loose top paired with a taupe long skirt, the hem naturally hanging down to her ankles, a thin string tied around her waist, and a vintage camera slung across her shoulder, with the camera pointing downward. As if she had just finished a shoot or was about to capture this moment, she wore dark leather shoes with slightly worn uppers, revealing traces of daily life. On the left side of the frame is a row of neatly arranged wooden benches, with weathered patterns on the chair surfaces and slightly rough edges, presenting a naturally weathered texture. On the right are wooden walls and railings, simple and rustic in structure. The top beams are made of dark wood, with obvious wood grain and slight cracks, showing the building's sense of age. The entire corridor is shaped like a narrow rectangular frame, guiding the gaze toward the distant, expansive sea view. In the middle ground, the black-and-white tabby cat stands on the ground, its front paws slightly raised, looking up at the woman. Its tail hangs naturally, and its posture is full of curiosity and anticipation. The ground in the foreground is the corridor floor, paved with gray cement, with slightly uneven surfaces and fine stains, enhancing the sense of realism and life. The middle ground is the interaction area between the woman and the cat. The background is the vast, boundless sea, with a pale blue-gray hue and shimmering waves. In the distance, the skyline is blurred, with the rolling outlines of the mountains faintly visible. The sky is grayish-white, the clouds are heavy, and the light is evenly soft. The overall atmosphere presents a serene, ethereal, and slightly melancholic poetic beauty. The composition uses a classic framed style, using the corridor door frame as a natural frame, placing the main figures and animals slightly to the right of the center of the painting, creating a visual focal point. At the same time, the bench on the left and the railing on the right form symmetrical guiding lines to enhance the stability and depth of the image. Light and shadow come from natural outdoor light and shine in from the distant direction of the sea level, creating a backlighting effect that makes the outlines of the woman and cat more clear. The indoor area is in relatively dark shadows, with strong contrast of light and shadow, creating a strong dramatic tension. The light is soft and diffuse, without obvious directional hard shadows. The overall color palette mainly consists of cool gray, light blue, off-white, and dark brown, with low color saturation. It presents a grainy texture and faded texture reminiscent of film photography, like an old photograph, adding a sense of nostalgia and the passage of time. The image possesses high artistic appeal, resembling both a documentary-style photographic work and a narrative sense of a cinematic scene, conveying the pure emotional connection between humans and animals, as well as the fleeting beauty of tranquility and solitude born at the intersection of nature and humanity. The entire image exudes the restraint, restraint, and poetry characteristic of Japanese literary aesthetics. It was as if you could hear the gentle sound of waves lapping on the shore and the gentle breeze brushing over the wooden planks, immersing you in a slow-moving fragment of time",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
