        {
          "id": "krea2-6f72f2291a6d21675257b515",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣书店倚靠阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sat beside a wooden bookshelf in a bookstore, wearing round-framed glasses, exuding a fresh and natural aura. She wore a dark brown sweater over a beige turtleneck sweater, with a thick off-white knit scarf draped over her shoulders, looking warm and comfortable. Her legs were curled up, and she wore off-white slouch socks that hung loosely above her ankles. On her feet were light brown Birkenstock shoes, holding an open book in both hands, the pages gently flipping. The book cover features hand-drawn patterns and text, seemingly related to glasses. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, and the background is the inside of the bookstore. On the right is a tall black metal bookshelf neatly arranged with various books. The spines are colorful in red, blue, orange, and more. On the left is a wooden bookshelf stacked with several stacks of books, one labeled \"B3,\" with the edges clearly visible. The floor is gray tiles reflecting soft light, and in the foreground is a blurred wooden pillar partially blocking the view, creating a natural framing effect. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, slightly leaning in posture and relaxed and natural. The visual guide starts from the pillar in the foreground and finally extends to the bookshelf in the background, forming a smooth visual path. The lighting comes from warm yellow indoor lighting, soft and even, creating a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. The background is slightly blurred, highlighting the main figure. The overall color palette is mainly warm brown, off-white, and gray-black, with harmonious and unified color combinations, giving the image a delicate texture. The details are rich, with a strong sense of everyday life and life, as if capturing a quiet moment of reading. The images present a realistic and natural photographic style, with slight film graininess and soft out-of-focus imaging, enhancing the layering and artistic feel of the images. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, warm, and healing, allowing readers to feel the peace and beauty brought by reading",
