        {
          "id": "krea2-e7bdcaa604a72053705c2c74",
          "alias": "单女制服教室害羞坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style sailor uniform sits on the classroom steps, exuding a youthful yet slightly shy aura. She wears an off-white sailor jacket with a deep brown bow at the collar, white striped decorations on the cuffs, black stockings and black leather shoes on the lower half, legs elegantly crossed and raised, one foot resting on the armrest of the desk and chair in front, the other naturally hanging down, her posture relaxed and expressive. Her hands rest gently on her knees, holding a deep brown fabric backpack with a delicate texture. With slight wrinkles, the background is a typical tiered classroom environment. Rows of wooden desks and chairs are neatly arranged, with light yellow wooden structures and black plastic backrests. The tabletop is smooth and flat, gradually narrowing as the space stretches, creating a strong sense of perspective. The seats in the distance are empty, creating a quiet and deserted atmosphere. The walls are light beige with soft and even lighting. Sunlight from the left side casts soft shadows on the floor and seats, creating rich layers of light and shadow. The composition is shot at a low angle, with the camera slightly tilted. This enhances the dynamic and visual impact of the composition. The figure is positioned slightly in the center on the right side, with ample space in the upper left corner to guide the gaze backward and highlight spatial depth. The foreground clearly presents the details of the figure's legs, feet, and backpack, while the middle shot focuses on the main subject and nearby desks and chairs. The background gradually blurs, using a shallow depth of field effect to highlight the subject while preserving environmental information. The colors are mainly warm tones, interwoven with off-white, light yellow, dark brown, and black, creating a harmonious and unified visual effect. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and warm, as if capturing a tranquil moment after school. The images are full of the atmosphere of everyday life while maintaining artistic beauty, resembling real scenes shot with a regular camera under natural light. It has a realistic and lifelike texture, rich details, natural light and shadow, and clever composition, conveying nostalgic feelings of youth, innocence, and campus days",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
