        {
          "id": "krea2-fe4e720e3488d4c32854a8d0",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔广场自信倚靠",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose blue denim jacket with a vintage style, wide and slightly pleated sleeves, metal buttons and stitching on the collar clearly visible, and a black velvet-textured square-neck top that fits her figure tightly, showing elegant curves. She wears high-waisted blue jeans with a slim fit and a black leather belt at the waist. Her belt buckle is a silver metal ring design, looking sharp and fashionable. Her right hand rests gently on the stone railing, her left hand tucked into her pocket, her body slightly leaning to the side, her posture relaxed and confident. On her left wrist, she wears a small bracelet, simple round earrings, and a slender gold necklace around her neck. The overall look is layered, full of urban street vibe. In the foreground is a rough gray stone railing, with weathered marks and fine cracks left by time, giving it a realistic texture and rounded edges. Some areas are illuminated by sunlight, creating bright highlights and contrasting light and shadow. The middle ground features a female subject, occupying the left central position of the composition. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure's head is positioned at the upper third of the frame, while the body extends downward, maintaining a stable visual center. The background is a blurred urban architectural cluster, with mostly red tiles and light-colored walls. In the distance, a beige high-rise building can be seen. The structure is orderly and windows neatly arranged. The lighting is soft and even, reflecting the natural daytime environment. The light source comes from the front right, forming natural shadows on the left. The transitions between light and shadow are delicate, creating a warm and realistic atmosphere. The overall tone of the image is mainly blue, brown, and gray, with moderate color saturation and a slight film texture, presenting a retro filter effect. It feels as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. The edges of the frame are slightly darkened, enhancing visual focus. The composition has a strong narrative and sense of life, with a slightly top-down perspective that brings the audience closer. It creates a strong emotional connection, with an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and full of storytelling, like a chance encounter on a city rooftop in the afternoon. It combines the casual feeling of daily life with artistic beauty. The images present a style that strikes between realism and cinematic feel, rich in detail, natural light and shadow, harmonious colors, and full of youth and freedom",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
