        {
          "id": "krea2-039879fd6c3cd5fcdf9c36c3",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤街道沉思坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors in front of a red cylindrical object, wearing a black beret with white stitching and \"Furima\" embroidered on the edge. She slightly tilts her head to look to the left side of the frame, presenting a realistic and vivid texture. She wears a blue short-sleeved T-shirt with orange patchwork on the collar and cuffs, a small round badge pattern on the chest, light-colored jeans, slightly leaning forward, arms naturally resting on the knees, a relaxed and casual posture, with a close-up of her upper body in the foreground. Occupying the main position of the composition, the middle ground features two stacked red cylinders behind her, smooth and slightly reflective. One cylinder is printed with large black numbers \"5\" and \"8\", the other has a blurred black bird pattern, with a background of blurred building walls and some shadowed areas, with a warm tone. The overall composition combines close-up of the figure with geometric elements in the middle ground. The figure is on the left side of the painting, leaving space on the right for the red cylinder in the background, creating visual balance and tension. The camera is shot from a slightly top-down angle, using a shallow depth of field to blur the background and enhance the subject's prominence. Light comes from above, naturally daylight, soft and bright. The direction of light and shadow creates a warm and layered atmosphere. The overall color palette is dominated by blue, orange, and red, with moderate saturation but strong contrast. Especially the collision between the blue T-shirt and orange details and the red background creates a strong visual impact, presenting the image with a texture reminiscent of vintage film photography. It has a slight graininess and a slight fading effect, as if taken with an old-fashioned camera on a sunny afternoon. At the top of the frame is a yellow banner with the Japanese word \"decorative characterそばにdecorative characterた\" written on it, adding a narrative and artistic touch to the image. The overall atmosphere is relaxed, everyday, yet full of youthful energy, like a snapshot taken from a magazine or street photography collection. It captures a casual, authentic, and slightly fashionable lifestyle, with a strong Japanese aesthetic style. Rich in detail and full of storytelling.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
