        {
          "id": "krea2-2763bac428fe0c488fe16467",
          "alias": "单女白T恤霓虹夜景忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "As night falls, the bustling city streets are illuminated by neon lights. The colorful lights weave together in the darkness into a dreamlike world of light and shadow. The main figure is a woman, standing in the middle of the street, her back to the camera and slightly turning to look back. She wears a white short-sleeved T-shirt paired with a black spaghetti strap dress. The pleats of the dress are clearly visible, giving her an elegant and simple look. Her hands are naturally clasped in front of her, and a delicate bracelet is worn on her wrist, adding a touch of refinement. Her posture is calm and relaxed. As if enjoying a moment of tranquility amid the noise, the foreground features some blurry green branches and leaves, their leaves showing varying shades of green under the dim light. Some leaf edges are tinted red and yellow by neon lights, creating soft outline light that adds layers and a natural atmosphere to the scene. The middle ground shows buildings and pedestrians lining the street. The exterior walls of buildings glow with warm yellow and orange under the lights, and the windows shimmer with scattered lights, faintly revealing the shadows of indoor activities. Several pedestrians hurriedly pass by on the street, their silhouettes blurred due to the shallow depth of field, creating a dynamic blur effect. A white sedan is parked by the roadside, its headlights off, its body reflecting the surrounding neon lights. The composition uses a center-to-right third-section layout, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, gazing upward to the left. The visual guide line consists of the characters' gaze, body posture, and the direction of the street, forming a smooth diagonal path. The background is densely packed neon signs, and at the very top is a huge The English letter sign \"DOTONBORI\" is outlined in blue and red neon lights, with the large orange Japanese characters \"decorative character\" next to it. The font is bold and powerful, full of modern feel. Other signs, such as purple, yellow, and white lights, are arranged in a staggered manner, creating strong color contrasts and a sense of rhythm. The distant architectural silhouettes are faintly visible under the lights, creating a sense of depth and depth. The overall composition uses shallow depth of field to highlight the main subject, while the background lighting is presented in a bokeh format, creating beautiful light spots that enhance the artistic quality of the image. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by warm tones, with strong contrasts of neon red, yellow, blue, and purple, creating a city night scene that is both lively and slightly lonely. The light mainly comes from the surrounding neon signs and streetlights, creating a delicate texture. The shadowed areas are softer without rigid boundaries. The overall light and shadow transition is natural, presenting a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography, with slight noise and retro tones, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. It creates a realistic and immersive visual experience, with moderately high color saturation, highlighting the vibrancy of neon and the depth of the night. The overall atmosphere combines the bustling and vibrant city with the tranquility and reflection of individuals seeking their own space amid the noise. The images are rich in detail, and every light in the background is clearly distinguishable in shape and color changes. The composition is balanced and dynamic, the visual guidance flows naturally and smoothly, the light and shadow layers are distinct, and the color combinations are harmonious and full of tension, presenting a story-filled portrait of a city night scene. Like a classic shot in a movie, capturing the eternity of a moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
