        {
          "id": "krea2-b570fccbfeee2323941f1aa8",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫广场沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under natural light, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a deep blue knit vest. The neckline is slightly open, presenting a minimalist youthful campus style. Looking directly at the camera, her expression is calm and slightly contemplative, revealing a quiet and reserved temperament. Her right hand holds a silver-gray smartphone, with a circular camera module on the back. The four black lenses are symmetrically distributed, edged with metallic ring decorations. The phone's case is smooth and reflective, with clear details. On the wrist is a delicate watch with a light purple dial featuring a gold frame and a white strap. The strap material looks like leather or high-end synthetic material, and the hands and scales are clearly legible, complementing the overall look. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with the body slightly angled to the camera and the head facing the viewer, creating a strong visual focal point. The foreground centers on the main subject, with the hand and phone occupying the lower left corner of the frame. In composition, the subject's gaze guidance and the movement of holding a phone create an interactive and narrative feel. The middle ground features the torso and some arms, with rich texture details on the clothing. The knitted vest's woven structure is clearly visible, the white shirt's folds and shadows transition naturally, the background is blurred, and green plant leaves form soft bokeh spots under sunlight. The colors are mainly shades of green in different layers, dotted with a few pink flowers. The blurred background enhances the sense of spatial depth, making the subject stand out more. Light comes from an upward angle, simulating natural daylight effects to create subtle highlights and shadows. The direction of shadows is consistent, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and fresh, full of the feeling of a summer afternoon. The color palette mainly features a contrast of warm and cool tones, with clothing colors leaning toward cool tones and lush green backgrounds, creating a peaceful and comfortable visual experience. The composition uses close-up shots to emphasize the characters' expressions and details, while retaining some environmental information. The composition is close to a square shape, the visual center is stable, and shallow depth of field technology achieves clear subject clarity. The blurred background enhances artistic expression, and the overall style combines everyday realism with photographic beauty. It feels as if shot with a professional camera, yet still retains the feel of everyday life. It's like a casual street snapshot, capturing a quiet moment of youth. The image details are rich, and even the reflections of phone and watch materials are meticulously detailed, presenting a highly realistic texture. The overall atmosphere is warm, pure, and full of storytelling, evoking fond memories of student days, with natural light and shadow transitions. The colors are harmoniously unified and have strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
