        {
          "id": "krea2-69630a51494057aadc28503c",
          "alias": "单女白T恤小径微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a metal ladder frame, her body slightly leaned back. She wears a bright smile, wearing a white short-sleeved T-shirt and khaki work shorts, black sandals, and orange-red mid-calf socks. She holds the ladder in her right hand and a woven straw hat in her left, her posture natural and relaxed, as if embracing the sunshine and breeze. The main subject is this youthful woman, whose movements and expressions convey a sense of freedom and joy. In the foreground, the structural lines of the metal ladder stand are clear and geometrical. Extending from the lower left corner to the center of the painting, it forms a strong visual guide line that draws the gaze toward the figure. The middle shot depicts the woman's entire body, positioned slightly to the left of the painting, with her body in a diagonal posture, enhancing the image's dynamism and tension. The background is a vast, boundless blue sky, with a pure gradient of blue and almost no clouds, creating an open, tranquil, and slightly dreamlike atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the figure's upright posture and the vastness of the sky, while giving the painting a sense of upward growth. Visual guidance is formed by the lines of the ladder, the posture of the figures, and the movement trajectory of the straw hat, forming a smooth visual path. From the lower left corner to the upper right, bright daylight shines from directly above, with soft and subtle shadows. The overall lighting is clean and transparent, presenting the warm and fresh texture of a summer afternoon. The color scheme is mainly blue, white, and khaki, accented with orange-red socks as visual highlights, creating harmony and layering. The entire scene exudes a beautiful moment from everyday life, as if casually captured with an old film camera. It has a slight graininess and vintage tones, allowing people to feel the gentleness of time and the poetry of life. The rich details enhance realism and immersion, creating a relaxed and cheerful atmosphere full of youthful energy, like a private image capturing beautiful summer moments, combining artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
