        {
          "id": "krea2-935e99759e725758a6bd21bd",
          "alias": "单女黑内衣家中自信站立过肩",
          "prompt": "She wore a white short-sleeved top with a black lace bra underneath, a high-waisted white pleated mini skirt, black tights, and a pair of signature white high heels with red soles. The overall look presented a refined and sexy sense of fashion, draped over her shoulders, with exquisite makeup and a confident yet slightly alluring expression. Her body turned slightly, one hand gently stroked the hem of the dress, the other naturally hanging down, her legs graceful—one foot on the white sofa, the other standing upright, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The background is a simple light gray wall, with a pot of dried flowers on the left side decorated with off-white and light brown flowers and slender branches arranged in a transparent glass vase. On the right is a modern-style white sofa with soft cushions. The sofa legs are made of metal, and the floor is smooth light-colored tiles reflecting soft light. The entire composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, occupying the main visual focus. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, and natural light from the left side is softly and evenly cast on the figure, creating delicate shadow transitions that create a bright and fresh atmosphere. The color palette is mainly white, accented with black, gold, and red. The color contrasts are sharp yet harmoniously unified, and the image has strong visual guidance, especially the leg lines and high heel details, presenting an overall high-fashion photography feel. It also preserves the realism and intimacy of everyday shooting, as if captured in a warm and comfortable home environment. The image is rich in detail, highly realistic and artistically expressive",
