        {
          "id": "krea2-df79bba7dd81841cdfb025da",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔城市自信坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a red metal high stool, relaxed and confident, her body slightly turned to the side, her left hand naturally resting on her knee, while her right hand gently grips the handle of a brown leather shoulder bag. The bag is simple and vintage, featuring a slim shoulder strap and metal fasteners, presenting an overall casual yet refined urban fashion vibe. She wears a loose-fitting light blue washed denim jacket with a classic lapel design, clearly visible front buttons, slightly rolled cuffs, and a burgundy V-neck knit vest underneath with delicate knit texture. The colors are warm and rich. The lower half is paired with matching dark blue denim shorts, with a black belt and metal buckle visible at the waistband. The overall outfit has clear layering and harmonious colors, adding a touch of laziness and charm. The makeup is exquisite, and two thin chain necklaces are worn around the neck, one thick and one thin, simple yet detailed. On the feet are burgundy square-toe high-heeled sandals with an open-toe design. The heel height is moderate, with smooth lines that complement the overall look. The background is a mottled brick wall built from dark gray bricks. The texture is rough, with obvious signs of aging in the gaps. Several yellowed old posters are pasted on the wall, printed with blurred Chinese characters and patterns. The tones are warm and have a sense of age. On the right side hangs a mounted ink painting, featuring abstract depictions of landscapes or trees. The ink tones are well-balanced, creating a strong cultural atmosphere. The floor is paved with dark gray square tiles, neatly arranged, with slightly worn edges. The lighting throughout the scene is soft, with warm yellow light from the sides illuminating the main subject, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. Shadows are concentrated behind the figure and on the ground, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The interplay of light and shadow highlights the character's outline and clothing texture. The overall color palette of the painting is mainly warm yellow, deep gray, burgundy, and denim blue, creating a retro, nostalgic, and modern atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The red stool serves as a visual focal point, creating a strong color contrast that guides the gaze to the person themselves. The foreground bag and leg lines form the visual guiding line, and although the background elements are rich, they do not overshadow the main focus, maintaining a sense of depth and layering in the image, the overall style combines the realism of everyday street photography with the aesthetic of artistic photography, as if capturing a fleeting moment in a city alley with an old-fashioned film camera, capturing a touching moment where youth, individuality, and the breath of life intertwine",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
