        {
          "id": "krea2-af8f1ed6cb7c5c3ffe83942c",
          "alias": "单女灰衬衫街道冷淡倚靠指向",
          "prompt": "She wears a light gray shirt with a slightly open collar, appearing casual yet elegant. The background is the inside of the bus, with red leather seats showing a noticeable texture, with stitching details along the edges. The car window glass reflects her reflection, which is slightly blurred, presenting a hazy beauty. Outside the window are blurred green plants and city streets. Light filters through the leaves into the car, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. Sunlight streams in from the right side, creating slight reflections and highlights on the window glass, creating a soft atmosphere of early morning or evening. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly in the center left of the frame, body slightly tilted, head close to the window, and the viewer's gaze guiding the viewer to look outside. This creates a sense of visual extension. The foreground features part of the red seat backrest, occupying the lower third of the image, providing spatial layering. The middle ground features the main subject, her phone, and the reflection on the car window. The reflection contrasts with the real person in a mirrored image, enhancing the narrative of the image. The background is a blurred view outside the window, including green trees, architectural silhouettes, and flowing light and shadow. The blur emphasizes the subject, and the composition follows a diagonal trend, extending from the lower left seat to the upper right window, creating dynamic balance. Visual guidance uses the person's gaze and window reflections to point to the outside world, evoking viewers' associations with travel, memories, or inner worlds. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by warm tones, blending the softness of natural light with the warmth of indoor lighting, presenting a tranquil, private, and emotionally resonant everyday moment. The texture of the image is close to film photography, with slight graininess and low color saturation. The tone leans toward a retro cool tone while preserving the delicate luster of skin and metal parts. The overall style combines artistry with a sense of everyday life, like street documentary footage shot with an old-fashioned camera, capturing an ordinary yet story-filled travel moment. The footage contains no unnecessary decorations, focusing mainly on the characters, headphones, phones, seats, and car windows, emphasizing authenticity and emotional expression. Every detail serves to create an immersive atmosphere of solitude and tranquility, allowing people to feel the subtle relationship between individuals and their environment in modern urban life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
