        {
          "id": "krea2-825b8ac5f8af813a6aa98fab",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫公寓冷淡躺摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways on a soft bed, wearing an off-white turtleneck knit sweater with loose, comfortable sleeves. She wears light-colored shorts below, her legs long and straight, barefoot relaxed on the dark gray sheet, toes naturally stretched, appearing lazy and genuine. She is covered with a colorful plaid blanket, with blue, green, orange, and gray stripes interwoven for a thick and warm feel. The blanket is casually draped over her legs and chest, some of which hang by the bed, adding a touch of everyday life. Her head rests on a fluffy, soft pink plush pillow, with a dense plush surface and a delicate touch. The background is a dark green bedside padded material, thick with subtle textures, contrasting with the white sheet. The sheet is flat and clean, with slight wrinkles at the edges, showing genuine signs of use. In the lower left corner of the image, part of a brown leather handbag appears. The body is smooth, and the metal fasteners reflect a faint glow, hinting at everyday details. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center-right position. The body is in an oblique pose, with legs extending from the lower left corner to the center of the frame, forming a visual guiding line. The overall composition is balanced and layered, with light from the left side of the painting softly and evenly onto the figures, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The transition of light and shadow is natural, shadows are soft, and the color palette is mainly warm tones. Soft colors such as white, beige, pink, and brown blend together, accented by cool-toned stripes from the blanket to create a visual contrast. The entire scene is filled with a cozy and intimate feeling of home. It seems to capture a tranquil moment when afternoon sunlight pours into the room. The image has a strong sense of everyday realism, like private photos taken with a regular camera, rich in detail, realistic texture, with slight film grain and natural noise, presenting an unrefined, rustic beauty. The atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, allowing people to feel a quiet companionship and warmth",
          "description": "",
