        {
          "id": "krea2-479d374d40687b7aa604135f",
          "alias": "单女红外套街道严肃蹲注视",
          "prompt": "A woman squats in a spacious indoor space, wearing a bright red sporty jacket with a distinct sheen and slight reflectivity, presenting the texture of premium nylon or polyester. The cuffs and hem of the coat have elastic designs, naturally creating pleats and tightness. Underneath, she wears a pink top with a slightly exposed neckline, adding softness and layering. The left shoulder of the jacket is patched with deep blue mesh fabric, creating a striking color contrast and adding visual interest. She wore a red and black geometric patterned short skirt, with a dense black diamond or grid pattern, presenting a strong modern and street-style vibe, creating a casual and lazy vibe. She wore fine-framed round glasses with transparent and colorless lenses and metallic frames, giving her an intellectual and fashionable look. Her legs were bent in a squat position, knees slightly bent, and black high heels with plush uppers and slender heels at the ankles, highlighting the lines of her legs. She lowers her head and gazes into the camera, echoing the main color scheme of her clothing to form a visual focal point. The foreground is a smooth gray cement floor with fine textures and water stains reflecting light, reflecting the lower body and shoes of the figure, enhancing realism and spatial depth. The middle ground is the main subject, occupying a slightly lower center position, with a low yet powerful posture, the body slightly leaning forward, hands naturally placed near the knees, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, and a pure, pale gray-white wall in the background. With no decoration or details, the design is minimalist to almost abstract, creating a strong visual contrast. The composition uses a vertical rectangular proportion, with the figure centered and lower, leaving a wide blank space above, creating a visual tension that \"stands tall and upright.\" This visual tension then spreads out to the sky, creating a quiet and grand mood. The light comes from the upper front, soft and even, with almost no obvious shadows. The clothing colors are highly saturated but not overly harsh. The overall light and shadow present a low-key and high-profile style, with smooth transitions between light and shadow, creating a clean, calm, and modern atmosphere. The color palette is mainly red, black, and gray, complemented by pink and white, creating a strong contrast yet harmonious unity. The overall image exudes an urban fashion, independence, confidence, and artistic vibe, as if shot in an abandoned warehouse or studio, using a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens to capture the moment's stillness and tension. The background is well blurred, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. The overall atmosphere is cold yet warm, resembling a carefully planned fashion shoot. It also feels like a real, unintentionally captured moment in daily life, possessing strong visual impact and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
