        {
          "id": "krea2-46be07c6a38ab26237a20414",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤室内俏皮坐持食物",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a dimly lit indoor setting, her expression slightly lazy and curious, seemingly preparing to taste the food in her hand. Her overall demeanor is fresh and natural. She wears a light blue Adidas sports T-shirt with black stripes on the cuffs and neckline, and a clear Adidas clover logo on the chest. The fabric is soft, presenting a casual everyday style. In her right hand, she holds a grilled chicken wing skewer. The surface of the wing is crispy and glossy, showing an enticing golden and dark brown grill mark, with firm meat. The fat glimmers slightly under the light, making it especially delicious. On the left side sits a black corrugated paper cup filled with red sauce, possibly chili sauce or dipping sauce. The rim of the cup is slightly dipped in sauce, and beside it is a small wooden spoon with the handle extending diagonally into the cup. The texture of the cup is clearly visible. The entire composition centers on the person, using close-ups that occupy most of the space. The head and upper body are fully visible, with the body slightly angled to the camera for a slight sense of movement. The background is a dark gray wall. On the wall, faintly visible are the blurred white English letters \"BE IN.\" The font style is retro with a slightly worn look, creating the atmosphere of a street night market or snack stall. The light mainly comes from the left front, soft and focused, forming warm highlights that enhance the sense of three-dimensionality. The transitions between light and shadow are delicate without strong contrasts, and the overall color tone leans toward warmth, mainly yellow, brown, and gray, highlighting the enticing colors of the food and the approachability of the figures. The overall composition presents an improvisational feeling of everyday life. It looks like a street photo casually taken with a phone, with slight noise and a film-like texture. The lens is slightly blurred, the background is moderately blurred, creating a shallow depth of field effect. The scene extends down to the chicken wings in your hand and the sauce in your cup. The whole scene is full of life and authenticity, as if you can smell the aroma of barbecue and feel the lively atmosphere of street food at night. The composition is compact, colors harmonious and unified, and details rich, combining artistic beauty with everyday authenticity and warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
