        {
          "id": "krea2-db737f2f0b74a742cc38ee31",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙森林害羞站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a sun-dappled pine forest, adding a touch of liveliness and casualness, with a gentle yet slightly shy smile that presents a natural pink tone. She wears a white lace dress made of light and soft material, featuring delicate three-dimensional patterns and pleats. The sleeves are puff-sleeved, looking elegant and romantic. She carries a small brown leather bag across her shoulder, with a slender strap and a compact and practical body, adding a touch of vintage charm to the overall look. She turns sideways to look back at the camera, her body slightly tilted. The posture is natural and relaxed, as if you have inadvertently captured a moment of beauty. The background is a towering pine forest, with straight trunks and deep colors. Part of the lower part is painted white, creating a striking contrast. The leaves are dense, showing a rich green. Under sunlight, light and shadow intertwine in a mottled pattern. The ground is dotted with light spots, interwoven with shadows, creating a rich sense of layering. In the distance, a vast grassland can be faintly seen, lush and green, the sky deep blue, with a few wisps of white clouds visible. The entire scene is filled with a tranquil and harmonious atmosphere. The composition uses a center-right central placement of the main figure, occupying the main position but leaving enough space to show the surrounding environment. The angle slightly tilts upward, highlighting the tall trees and the petite figures, while also enhancing the sense of spatial depth in the composition. It ultimately blends into the background trees, with light and shadow coming from the upper right. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a soft backlighting effect that gives the edges of the figures a golden halo, enhancing the sense of depth and realism. The overall color scheme mainly features a warm and cool contrast, with the sky and tree shadows showing a cool blue tone, while sunlight, skin, and clothing lean toward warm off-white and pale yellow, creating a fresh and cozy atmosphere. The image has a slight film graininess, moderate color saturation, and a slight retro filter, resembling a life shot with an old-fashioned camera, evoking a nostalgic and authentic everyday beauty. The lens focal length approaches 35mm, with well-controlled depth of field; foreground figures are sharp and clear, while the background gradually blurs. While highlighting the main subject, the overall image preserves the authenticity of the environment. The entire image conveys a tranquil, beautiful, and vibrant natural atmosphere, allowing people to feel the coolness and pure charm of the forest on a summer afternoon",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
