        {
          "id": "krea2-f429fc53e4635f1ecef3cf04",
          "alias": "单女橙毛衣城市冷淡站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the balcony railing of a red brick building. She wears a warm orange-brown off-shoulder knit top, with wide shoulders exposing one side. The long sleeves drape naturally, the knit texture is clearly visible, presenting delicate vertical striped textures. She wears an off-white high-waisted pencil midi skirt that fits the body perfectly, made of smooth and lustrous material. The overall look is elegant and layered, naturally draped over her shoulders. Her makeup is exquisite, her expression confident and composed. Her left hand rests gently on her waist, while her right hand carries a brown leather tote bag. The bag body is soft with metal clasps, fingers painted red nail polish matching the lipstick color. The background is a vintage-style red brick wall with neatly arranged bricks and clear seams, with slight weathering marks on the surface, adding a sense of history. On the right is a dark gray glass window framed with a light blue reflection of the sky. The balcony railing is made of light gray stone carved with simple decorative lines, giving a solid texture. On the railing is a cup of coffee, wrapped in a white heat-resistant sleeve on the paper cup, with a black lid on top. The overall composition adopts a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with a slightly turned body and head facing the camera, forming a visual focal point. Light comes from the upper right, with soft natural light streaming in from outside, and shadows transitioning naturally, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The background is slightly blurred to highlight the subject, with warm tones dominated—orange-brown, off-white, and red brick tones harmoniously unified. A few cool elements such as windows and sky are added to enhance contrast. The interplay of light and shadow presents a tranquil urban beauty, as if capturing a leisurely moment under the afternoon sun. The entire scene is filled with the poetry and fashion vibe of everyday life, like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera—rich in detail, authentic texture, and a warm and sophisticated atmosphere",
