        {
          "id": "krea2-9ee694763620a6e987a24d3a",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫广场忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a retro-style café, wearing a white stand-collar long-sleeve shirt with a blue floral pattern. The sleeves are decorated with ruffles, appearing gentle and artistic. Her expression is slightly contemplative and tinged with melancholy, as if waiting for or reminiscing about something. In the foreground is a deep brown wooden tabletop, smooth and clearly reflective, with a delicate bone china tea set on top. This includes a teacup with floral patterns and a matching saucer, holding dark coffee or black tea. Next to it is a blue-and-white porcelain plate with a square yellow cake on top. The cake's surface is flat, looking like a sponge cake or cheesecake. Next to it is a transparent glass cup filled with white tissues, a white ceramic sugar jar with a small spherical handle on the lid, and a green leaf pattern on the jar. There is also a small white milk jug, and on the left, a black metal lamp is lit up. The lampshade is made of frosted glass, emitting a warm orange-yellow glow. The middle frame is the café's interior, with light brown walls adorned with multiple paintings and decorations, including a large landscape painting, several portraits, and some sculptural ornaments such as animal statues and masks. The ceiling features built-in downlights and central air conditioning. In the distance, you can see an old TV with its screen off, surrounded by piles of books and miscellaneous items. In the background, there are other seats and red upholstered seats. It creates a crowded yet cozy atmosphere. The composition uses a center-right center with the main figure positioned slightly to the right, head slightly tilted, and gaze to the right, forming a visual guiding line. The foreground desk lamp and desktop items form a diagonal layout, enhancing the sense of layering in the image. The light mainly comes from the warm yellow source of the left desk lamp, creating soft shadows and highlights. The background is in a darker environment, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and nostalgic, with the overall color palette mainly warm yellow, brown, and off-white Dotted with blue and green details, it gives a quiet, comfortable, and slightly retro everyday feel. The image has a slight film graininess and low-saturation color grading, simulating amateur camera shooting. It's as if you casually took moments of life with an old digital or film camera, capturing a tranquil afternoon in urban life, full of emotional warmth and the atmosphere of everyday life",
          "description": "",
