          "id": "krea2-cbf35082e32b54d55712aca8",
          "alias": "单女米风衣广场微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands inside a half-open vintage wooden checkered doorframe, wearing a gentle and serene smile, leaning slightly to the doorframe. Her left hand hangs naturally as she gently holds an off-white canvas handbag, while her right hand carries a small black leather square bag cross-slung over her shoulder. On her wrist is a simple silver dial watch. She wears a light khaki cropped trench coat with a white lace cutout V-neck top underneath, loose deep blue denim wide-leg pants, and bright red flat shoes. The overall design presents a casual yet refined urban artistic style. In the foreground is a clear, full-body portrait of herself. The middle features a heavy dark brown wooden door, metal handles and lock details on the door frame, green vines hanging on the right wall, and withered wood decorations and blue flowerpots below. In the background, a pale blue wall and another door faintly visible in the distance. Light streams in from outside creating a soft backlight effect, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, using a door frame as a natural frame structure to focus the gaze on the subject. This extends to the shopping bag in hand and the red shoes underfoot, creating a color echo. The use of light and shadow is natural and realistic, presenting the soft scattered light created by daytime outdoor light passing through the door gap. The overall color scheme is dominated by blue, brown, white, and green, accented with red as the visual focal point. The image feels delicate and lifelike, as if captured with a high-resolution camera, full of vibrant life and artistic beauty. With a slight film graininess and a natural depth blur effect, it reveals an effortless elegance and spontaneous beauty",
