          "id": "krea2-5ca651ab7d32c377aa48f908",
          "alias": "单女毛衣街道俏皮站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at an outdoor street corner, presenting a playful yet lazy demeanor. She wears a loose chunky knit sweater in a warm reddish-brown tone, with clearly visible weaves. The cuffs and hem are decorated with tassels, and she wears a light beige, high-waisted pleated long dress underneath. The skirt is light and flowing, reaching the ankles and showing elegant lines. Around her neck is a thick gray scarf adorned with a fluffy pom-ball decoration, adding a touch of cuteness. She carries a small yellow square bag with a simple body. The metal fasteners reflect a soft sheen, and she wears a pair of black ankle boots with a vintage design featuring zipper details and dark socks. The overall look is rich in layers and full of autumn and winter warmth. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with a slightly tilted body. The left leg is in front and right leg behind, walking in a posture. The right hand hangs naturally, while the left hand gently grips the backpack strap, creating a relaxed and dynamic posture. The foreground is a rough cement floor with fine cracks and dust, and faint shadows transitioning along the edges. The middle ground is the spatial environment in which the figure lives. On the left is a mottled gray brick wall, covered with traces of time, with some peeling and stains. On the wall is a reddish-brown wooden lattice window frame, arranged in a diamond shape. On the right is a pale blue corrugated metal panel railing, with rust and wear on the fence's surface, slightly faded in color, but the texture is authentic. The background is a blurred architectural structure, with faint white walls and window outlines. Above, dense green leaves and branches stretch down, their leaves showing a bright yellow-green hue under sunlight. Some leaf edges glow with golden light, and light and shadow pass through the gaps between the leaves, casting dappled light spots and soft shadows. The light comes from above, representing the warm afternoon sun, with a warm tone that creates a peaceful and comfortable atmosphere. The composition uses a three-part method, with the figures occupying the main visual area of the painting. Background elements serve as a contrast while maintaining sufficient spatial awareness. The body lines extend to the leg movements, and the color contrast in the background draws the viewer, creating a natural viewing path. The overall image has a strong sense of everyday life and life, as if captured in a street scene shot with a regular camera. It is authentic and unpretentious, with harmonious color combinations and a warm tone complemented by a cool background to enhance visual tension. The image texture is delicate and detailed, with everything from clothing textures to floor particles clearly distinguishable. The transition of light and shadow is natural, and the balance of light and shadow is well-balanced, presenting a warm, tranquil, and youthful urban living scene. It features a strong artistic photography style and a realistic sense of everyday documentation,",
