          "id": "krea2-fc95c6442acd645d058de98d",
          "alias": "单女米衬衫公园坐持食物",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a park bench, wearing a beige short-sleeved shirt and deep purple wide-leg pants, paired with golden strappy high heels. She sits gracefully sideways, holding an ice cream cone in her right hand and savoring it. Her makeup is delicate but not exaggerated. The background is a sunny outdoor park environment, lush with greenery, dotted with trees, shrubs, and flowers. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled light and shadow, creating a soft contrast of light and shadow. The bench is made of wood with metal armrests. The surface has natural textures and wear marks, and beside it is a black leather handbag and some miscellaneous items. The ground is a gray pavement with clear shadow casting. The overall composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame as the main focal point. The left side leaves space to display the background environment, and the lines of the bench guide the viewer from the foreground to the center, creating a sense of depth. Light comes from the upper left, creating a strong side lighting effect that sharpens the character's outline, while the shadowed areas display a warm golden tone. It stands in stark contrast to the bright exposed surface, with warm tones dominating beige, brown, green, and gold echoing each other, creating a tranquil and pleasant summer afternoon atmosphere. The images feature the grainy texture and slight overexposure characteristic of film photography, simulating the realistic texture of everyday amateur camera shooting, emphasizing portrait capture under natural light, highlighting fashion and beauty in everyday scenes. The details are rich and layered, combining the elegant temperament of urban women with a casual, casual everyday vibe. The overall style leans toward Japanese-style photography. Full of gentleness and healing, it is suitable for fashion magazines or lifestyle content creation",
