        {
          "id": "krea2-33e9d23c660e60da6542d98f",
          "alias": "单女制服门害羞倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a Japanese-style sailor uniform, a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a deep blue navy collar decorated with two white stripes at the neckline, and a deep blue bow tied around her chest. She wears round metal-framed glasses with transparent and slightly reflective lenses. Her right hand gently rests on the edge of the frame, with the indoor environment in the background. The walls are off-white, and on the left is a vertical wooden door frame or partition in light brown. Light shines from the right side, creating a soft side effect with shadows naturally transitioning to the other side. Creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the frame, the head slightly tilted, and the gaze and camera creating a subtle interaction, highlighting its pure and cute temperament. The tone is soft and unified, with a hint of warm yellow tones. The light and shadow layers are rich but not too strong, presenting a genuine and natural texture from daily life. It feels like a private moment taken with a regular phone, full of life and intimacy. The image details are clear, and the overall style leans toward a youthful campus vibe, combining vibe with scholarly air. It conveys a quiet, gentle, and slightly shy emotional atmosphere, as if capturing a genuine moment revealed unintentionally, allowing people to feel a beauty and purity close to life",
