        {
          "id": "krea2-82c8674bf51a82b3a85cf217",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣雪地困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sat in the center of the artificial snow-covered ground, wearing a loose white knitted off-shoulder sweater dress with puffy and soft sleeves and clearly visible patterns. The hem of the sweater naturally draped down into pleats, revealing her long legs. She leaned slightly to the side, making a delicate heart-shaped gesture with her hands on her chest. In the background was a beautifully decorated Christmas tree. The tree is adorned with golden and pink round colorful balls, and the branches and leaves are covered in a thin white velvet mist, making them look especially white. Behind the tree, a faint red and white striped decorative band can be seen, adding a warm festive atmosphere. On the left and right sides of the painting is a gift box wrapped in white wrapping paper, tied with brown ribbons. On the right side of the gift box is a red ribbon, contrasting with the overall tone. The ground is made of black-and-white geometric tiles, with some areas covered in thick white velvet, making it feel as if you are in the snowfield. The entire scene uses a medium shot composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, body slightly tilted, head slightly raised, gaze meeting the camera. The white fuzz in the foreground and falling glitter particles add spatial layering. The middle shot features the main subject and nearby gift boxes, while the background features a Christmas tree and blurred decorative details. The blurring makes the subject stand out, the lighting is soft and even, with soft light from the front slightly above. The shadows are delicate and there is no strong contrast, creating a warm and tranquil indoor atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly white, accented with gold, pink, and brown. The color combinations are harmonious and warm, with natural transitions of light and shadow, presenting a serene and romantic holiday atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with slight film graininess and soft out-of-focus blur, as if shot with professional photography equipment, yet retaining the warmth of everyday life. The images are filled with fairy-tale-like dreamy colors, conveying strong holiday blessings and love",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
