        {
          "id": "krea2-7bd507f4e23a39a567452075",
          "alias": "单女黑旗袍庭院沉思站立",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a modified black velvet qipao embroidered with dark floral patterns, a high collar with frog details, and a collarbone line exposed. The shoulders were sleeveless, off-shoulder tailoring, and the tailored design outlined elegant curves. She wore a string of pearls, round and pure white, forming a striking contrast with the black qipao. Her posture was elegant and composed, her expression calm yet slightly thoughtful. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the middle shot, with the body slightly turned to the side, the left arm raised to the chest, hand movements natural and smooth. The background is a blurred green forest, with leaves appearing as soft light spots in the sunlight, creating a bokeh blur. On the left, a section of stone railing can be seen, its surface covered with traces of time, rough texture, and a grayish-brown color. On the right is part of a wooden bench with clear wood panel grain. The overall composition uses a three-part layout, with the figure occupying the main visual center, and light slanting in from the upper left. It creates a soft backlighting effect, with natural shadow transitions and rich layering of light and shadow, creating a quiet and poetic atmosphere. The color palette is mainly black, white, and green, accented with gold and gray. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, giving the image the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and soft focal length, as if shot with a professional camera. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with an f/1.8 aperture for a shallow depth of field. The overall style blends classical Eastern charm with modern fashionable aesthetics, conveying a subtle and restrained Eastern aesthetic. The scene is full of storytelling, like a quiet afternoon frozen in a courtyard, time seemingly standing still, the atmosphere serene and far-reaching, combining the cultural heritage of traditional attire with contemporary aesthetic refinement and elegance",
