        {
          "id": "krea2-00cc30b2f5c1114ea5e4d624",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣街道冷淡脱衣",
          "prompt": "Her makeup is natural and soft, and her expression exudes a lazy yet confident aura. She wears a light blue V-neck knit cardigan made of soft and delicate material, presenting a light sheer texture. The hem is irregular, with one side slightly upturned, creating an asymmetrical design. The front front has a row of white buttons neatly arranged, but the bottom few buttons are unbuttoned, revealing a small patch of skin on her abdomen, adding a touch of sexiness and casualness. The inner layer is a dark-colored tight top, contrasting with the outer cardigan. She wears high-waisted dark blue jeans, tailored to the shape, highlighting a slender waistline and long legs. In her left hand, she carries a woven handbag. The body is made of natural straw material, decorated with green plants. Details show rattan textures and handwoven marks. The strap is made of off-white thick cord, giving the overall style a simple yet pastoral vibe. Her right hand hangs naturally, fingers gently gripping the handle, her posture relaxed yet elegant. Around her neck is a pearl necklace with a round, lustrous bead, adorned in the center by a small gold pendant. Her earrings are long tassel earrings, with a silver metal chain hanging down to her shoulder, sparkling gently with her movement. The background is a simple off-white wall, with a closed white door on the right side of the door handle. The door handle is made of silver metal, with a black label above the door reading \"LINEN ROOM.\" The font is clear and orderly, with subtle textures and light and shadow variations on the wall. The floor is made of light gray tiles. White baseboards are at the edges, and light comes from the left side of the frame, softly and evenly casting light and shadow on the subject, creating a natural transition between light and shadow. Shadows are concentrated on the right side and background wall, creating a three-dimensional spatial effect. The overall composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the person positioned slightly on the left side of the frame, leaving space on the right side to enhance visual balance. The camera is slightly tilted to highlight the height proportions, with the background slightly blurred to emphasize the subject. The color scheme is mainly cool tones, creating an overall atmosphere that is quiet, gentle, and slightly artistic. It feels as if afternoon sunlight streaming through the window freezes in a moment, with a delicate and realistic texture, like everyday street photos taken with a professional camera in natural light. It has a sense of everyday authenticity and a fashion magazine-like aesthetic, with soft light and shadow and rich details, presenting an image of an urban woman who is both everyday and refined",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
