        {
          "id": "krea2-16d1d79770ae76e3e456687e",
          "alias": "单女棕外套广场坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors on a gray stone floor, wearing a loose brown leather jacket paired with a dark silk shirt with vintage floral patterns. She wears a matching short skirt below, blending vintage and modern fashion. The overall look is casually tucked atop her head, adding a touch of laziness and ease. She slightly lowers her head to look at the camera, creating a sharp contrast with the overall darker tones. She wears gold round earrings and a delicate gold necklace. At her side sat a black quilted suede handbag, adorned with a gold chain shoulder strap and brand logo. The bag exuded a premium feel, and her posture was relaxed and natural, legs crossed, one hand gently resting on her knee, the other naturally hanging down. In the background, you could see a partial silhouette of a light-colored car. The body lines were simple, the ground paved with large square stone slabs, clearly visible gaps, and sunlight streaming in from above, casting soft shadows on the floor and figures, creating a warm golden hue. It creates a tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses a high-angle overhead view, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly tilted, and gaze directed toward the lower right. The visual focus is on the overall shape and detailed coordination of the figures. The light and shadow layers are rich, the contrast between light and shadow is pronounced, and the shadows are delicate and soft, highlighting the glossy feel of the leather jacket and the texture of the silk shirt. The overall color palette is mainly earth tones, including brown, beige, gray, and black, accented with red and gold. The color scheme is harmonious and layered, and the visuals have a strong everyday street style that feels like a genuine moment captured by a regular camera on the street, while still maintaining artistic flair and refined aesthetic taste. The cars and cobblestone roads in the background serve as environmental elements, providing a genuine sense of space and a sense of daily life. The entire scene is filled with the relaxed and elegant atmosphere of urban life, conveying a casual yet stylish attitude toward life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
