        {
          "id": "krea2-b2b405f81edf0b2036f66d11",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服街道自信站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a street full of everyday life in Japan. She wears a light blue short-sleeved school uniform shirt with a blue-and-white striped neckline, a small red badge pinned to her chest, and black knee-length shorts and white sneakers. Her makeup is exquisite but not exaggerated, her right hand stretched forward, holding a transparent plastic bottle of drink with a green label on the bottle. Her left hand hangs naturally, and a large-capacity black handbag is slung over her shoulder. On the bag hangs a small pink doll pendant and a metal chain decoration. Her posture is relaxed and confident, her body slightly turned to the side, creating a dynamic sense of balance. In the foreground is the street's metal manhole cover and some floor textures, clearly visible. In the middle is the street space where the girl stands. On both sides are typical Japanese-style buildings, with mottled walls and windows of varying sizes. Vintage-style lantern-style street lamps hang from utility poles, softly lit. Greenery dots the street, and signs and billboards with Japanese characters stand by the roadside, one of which reads The word \"Coffee\" is set in the background, with a street extending into the distance. In the distance, there are blurred figures of pedestrians—some walking, some talking—and buildings gradually blur, creating a natural depth effect. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame, and the visual focus on the girl. The street's perspective lines guide the gaze deeper into the distance, creating a sense of depth. At the same time, the manhole cover in the foreground and the layered relationship between the figure and background in the middle ground enhance the sense of space, creating a warm and soft lighting atmosphere. Sunlight pours in from above, creating bright highlights and delicate shadow transitions. The overall tone is warm, tinged with golden tones of dusk or dusk. The air seems to be filled with a faint laziness and tranquility. The whole scene presents a subtle beauty from everyday life, like a casual snapshot taken with a regular camera, full of authenticity and the atmosphere of life. The details are rich—from the folds of the clothes to the material of the backpack, from the texture of the floor to the lettering on the distant sign, everything is clearly legible. It creates an atmosphere that is both artistic and close to life, as if you can hear soft music from street shops and the whispers of passersby, immersing you in the city's gentle moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
