        {
          "id": "krea2-fd977187ad93959766cf9cdb",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙户外微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors on a sunny summer day, standing against a bright blue sky. A few thin wisps of white clouds drift in the sky, the sunlight is strong and clear, creating a strong natural light effect. The light shines from above and in front, creating a warm and fresh atmosphere that looks natural and lively. She wears a sleeveless dress with a light blue base featuring small white floral patterns. The neckline is slightly low, revealing her collarbones and part of the shoulder line. The fabric looks light and breathable, suitable for summer wear. Her right hand is raised, fingers long. Her nails are neatly trimmed, and she holds up a freshly cut slice of watermelon above her head. The watermelon rind is dark green with black stripes, the flesh is bright red and juicy, and the edges are covered with a thin layer of white flesh. She wears a subtle smile, her expression naturally relaxed, revealing the comfort and joy of summer. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the scene, the head slightly tilted, and the body slightly tilted. This creates a natural sense of dynamism. The angle is slightly upward, highlighting the outline of the subject and the vast sky in the background. The two create an interesting contrast and echo: the vivid red of the watermelon contrasts with the blue sky and the light blue floral dress, creating a warm and cool contrast that enhances color layering. In terms of lighting and shadow, soft shadows are created on the neck, inner arms, and the edges of the hairline, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall image presents a fresh, natural, and everyday photography style full of everyday life, as if captured with a regular digital camera or mobile phone. It has a slight graininess and authentic texture, without excessive embellishment, conveying a relaxed, pleasant, and leisurely summer atmosphere. The main color tones are blue and red, with moderate color saturation—neither too flashy nor too dull. The overall composition is balanced, the main subject is prominent, the background is simple, and the visual focus is clear, creating a peaceful and beautiful summer afternoon scene",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
