        {
          "id": "krea2-9d950b93efce2e448b0e1dc3",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔街道忧伤倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She appears casual and full of life, presenting a thoughtful and serene demeanor. She wears a blue denim jacket with subtle wear and stitching on the surface, showcasing a vintage texture. Underneath, she wears a black turtleneck sweater with a hint of red clothing at the collar, creating a color contrast. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the composition, heads slightly tilted, and the viewer's gaze guiding them outward, creating a sense of visual extension. The background is completely blurred, presenting soft green and warm yellow tones. Faintly visible blurred architectural outlines and plant forms create an outdoor natural atmosphere. Light and shadow come from the front and sides, soft and warm, like natural light at dusk, creating a subtle transition of light and shadow with a slight sheen, highlighting healthy and natural skin texture. The overall tone leans toward warmth, using brown, Beige and light green are the main colors, creating a nostalgic, gentle, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The image has the texture of film photography, with delicate graininess, moderate color saturation, and soft contrast, as if captured with an old camera. It captures a quiet and emotionally rich moment in daily life. The background bokeh is natural and layered, extending beyond the frame to spark viewers' imagination about the story. The entire image is full of life atmosphere and artistic beauty, like a casual street snap. It also resembles a carefully composed portrait work, conveying a quiet, restrained, and story-filled youthful atmosphere",
