        {
          "id": "krea2-e63e80d337f77fb126b3c0f0",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫椅上坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a metal bench by the lake, dressed in an off-white loose shirt and a brown pleated skirt. Her posture is relaxed and elegant, her body slightly tilted toward the camera, revealing an effortless beauty. In the foreground, dense green leaves hang down from above, forming a natural framework. Some branches and leaves cover the figure above her head, creating a feeling of being embraced by nature. The details of the branches and leaves are clearly visible, with the edges of the leaves glowing with a soft sheen. The middle ground presents the complete posture of the woman seated, leaning against a silver metal railing that reflects a faint light. The background is a wide, calm lake with a gray-blue hue, shimmering with waves. In the distance, water and sky meet, and a blurred outline of the shore is faintly visible. The composition uses a three-part layout, with the figure positioned slightly above the right side of the painting. The left side leaves ample space to depict the lake and sky, while branches above form visual guiding lines. The overall composition is balanced and layered, with a slightly overhead view enhancing the scene's realism and immersion. Light and shadow come from the upper right, with sunlight filtering through the leaves and falling on the figures, creating a mottled effect. Delicate shadow transitions appear in the folds of clothing. The overall color tone is warm and soft, mainly off-white, brown, light green, and gray-blue. The color combinations are harmonious and unified, creating a quiet, artistic, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere The image quality is close to shooting with a Canon 5D Mark IV or Sony A7R III full-frame camera, paired with a 35mm prime lens to simulate real shooting effects. It features slight film graininess and natural dynamic range, precise depth control, natural background blur, and highlights the subject while preserving environmental details. The overall style resembles slow-paced scenes in Japanese photo shoots or art films, full of life and poetry, as if capturing the gentlest moment of an ordinary afternoon. There are no obvious traces of artificial intervention in the frame; all elements appear natural and authentic, like everyday moments casually captured with a regular camera, yet they contain profound emotional expression and aesthetic pursuits",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
