        {
          "id": "krea2-b0a42414aaa87199639a9f54",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙摄影棚忧伤注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a white spaghetti strap dress with straps strung together by strings of pearls, draping over her collarbone and shoulders, creating elegant decorative lines that create a calm yet slightly melancholic mood. There are subtle highlights and shadows, and the overall light and shadow treatment is soft and three-dimensional. The background is pure white pleated fabric, soft in texture, presenting natural wave-like textures and light and shadow variations. The composition uses a very close-up perspective. The figure's head occupies a slightly upper center of the frame, with the gaze facing the viewer directly, creating strong visual guidance. Light shines from above slightly to the left, creating a subtle contrast between light and dark. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and dreamy, as if capturing a private moment, with the texture of professional studio photography while preserving the authentic and delicate touch of daily life. The colors are mainly white, black, gold, and red, creating a warm and sophisticated visual tone. The background is naturally blurred, and the depth of field effect is obvious. This enhances the prominence of the subject, presenting the entire image with a genuine beauty that is both artistic and close to everyday life",
