        {
          "id": "krea2-b596e3c6299d6450d41580ca",
          "alias": "单女金毛衣庭院自信站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in an outdoor courtyard, her makeup elegant, exuding a serene and confident aura. She wears a light yellow vertical striped knit long dress that fits her figure and shows elegant curves. She wears a loose dark brown wool coat with a thick texture, and the cuffs and hem hang naturally, presenting a relaxed and casual style. She carries a brown leather handbag in her left hand. The bag is simple and elegant, with smooth lines, the shoulder strap hanging naturally, and the right hand gently supporting the body, her posture relaxed and natural. On her feet is a pair of gray pointed high heels, smooth uppers that harmonize with the overall look. Around her neck is a thin chain necklace, with a golden geometric pendant that is simple yet exquisite, small round earrings add a touch of vitality. She stands beside a withered tree, whose trunk is thick and bark rough, branches and leaves sparse; most of the leaves have turned yellow and fallen off, leaving only a few brown leaves hanging on the branches, gently swaying in the wind. The ground is covered with thick fallen leaves, ranging in color from light brown to dark brown. Layer upon layer, with clear textures, some fallen leaves are trampled and deformed, scattered between the bricks and stones. In the background is a low wall made of red bricks, the bricks neatly arranged, though the edges are slightly mottled. The wall surface bears traces of white paint, partially peeling off, revealing the original texture of the bricks. Behind the wall is a white wall, smooth but with slight stains and water marks, appearing somewhat old. On the right side, a white pipe is vertically fixed to the wall, connecting to the ground. Beside it, a small cluster of green plants grows from the cracks in the bricks, full of life. The entire scene is brightly lit, with sunlight streaming in from the upper left, creating a soft effect of light and shadow that presents warm tones. The right side is in a slight shadow, enhancing the sense of depth. Leaves cast fine shadows on the ground, intertwining with fallen leaves to create rich visual layers. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned at the very center occupying the main visual space. The background elements are symmetrically distributed, and the red brick walls and trees on both sides form a frame structure that guides the viewer to focus on the subject. The fallen leaves in the foreground and the figures, trees, and walls in the middle create a clear sense of spatial depth. The visual guidance flows naturally and smoothly, with fallen leaves extending upward from the ground to the entire figure's body, then extending into the distance through the architectural structure in the background, creating a peaceful, warm, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall color palette mainly features warm yellow, brown, and off-white, harmoniously unified with a strong autumn atmosphere. The light and shadow transitions are natural, and the details are rich, resembling a high-quality portrait photo taken with a professional camera. At the same time, it preserves the casualness and realism of everyday life, presenting a visual style that combines artistic beauty with the warmth of everyday life",
