        {
          "id": "krea2-0173a43a9f3365589c6b7360",
          "alias": "单女粉衬衫街道忧伤倚靠持食物",
          "prompt": "A woman leans against a weathered stone wall, exuding a faint sense of melancholy and contemplation. She wears a pink-white plaid shirt with a slightly open collar and sleeves rolled up to her elbows. She wears a black long skirt below, her right hand gently clutching the strap of her black backpack, while her left hand hangs naturally, her body slightly tilted, her head resting lightly on the wall. Her posture is relaxed yet tinged with a hint of laziness. The overall atmosphere is fresh and restrained. The foreground features rough gray brick walls, some of which are constructed from irregular stones. The surface shows obvious weathering marks and moss spots, with clear textures. The left edge is covered with dense green plants, with leaves small and dense, displaying a bright emerald green. Branches and leaves hang down from the upper left corner of the painting, forming a natural framing composition. Sunlight filters through the leaves onto the figures and walls, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. The middle scene shows a narrow street paved with asphalt, yellow traffic markings on the surface, and in the distance, a red-and-white traffic cone placed by the roadside. The background is blurred, and the white wall is faintly visible The blurred greenery and distant trees create a shallow depth of field effect. The entire shot is shot from a low angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left. The composition is asymmetrical but balanced. The visual guide line extends from the plant in the lower left corner to the character, then follows her line of sight toward the sky at the upper right. The light comes from the upper right, representing bright natural light. The sunlight passes through the leaves to form soft light spots, casting delicate shadows on the walls. The contrast is strong but the transition is natural, creating an overall atmosphere that is peaceful and warm. It carries a casual feeling of everyday life and a nostalgic youthful vibe, with warm yellow and green tones as the main tones, moderate color saturation, and a slight retro film texture. The images are rich in detail and layered, offering strong visual appeal and emotional resonance, as if capturing an ordinary yet story-filled moment, like snapshots of life casually taken with an old film camera under the afternoon sun—authentic and moving",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
