        {
          "id": "krea2-b2315e42e5191c84eb652c02",
          "alias": "单女棕外套小径忧伤坐书写",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor stone steps, wearing a dark brown coat over a gray knit cardigan and a white shirt. Around her neck is a thick beige knitted scarf, one end casually draped over her shoulder. Her expression is calm and slightly thoughtful, holding a pen while writing a letter or notebook, while the other hand holds paper, her posture natural relaxed. She wears plaid pants, her overall look warm and comfortable, with soft tones. The main focus is a close-up of the person, with the composition focusing on the middle shot. The figure occupies most of the space, with the head slightly tilted. This creates a visual sense of extension. The foreground shows the character's body and the pen and paper in their hands, with clear details including clothing textures, finger movements, and the moment the pen tip touches the paper. The middle ground is the upper body and part of the legs. The background is blurred, presenting a light gray-white tone, possibly a hazy view of the sky or distant scenery, creating a spacious and tranquil atmosphere. Light comes from the front and sides, soft and even, like natural light in the morning or evening. The warm yellow tones render the entire composition, with delicate shadows and rich layers. The overall lighting effect is warm and realistic, with earth tones as the main color, including brown, beige, gray, light gray-white, and other low-saturation shades. Paired with plaid patterns for added visual interest, the image texture is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and soft focus, reminiscent of an old-fashioned camera and a retro artistic vibe. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with an f/1.8 aperture, creating a shallow depth of field effect, making the subject clear and the background blurred. The composition uses a third-division method, with the subject positioned slightly to the right of the frame. The left side is left to enhance breathability, extending beyond the frame of sight and then back to hand movements, forming a circular viewing path. The overall atmosphere is quiet, contemplative, gentle, and slightly melancholic, with a strong cinematic feel and storytelling, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment of life, like everyday moments captured through a documentary lens—authentic and unpretentious, full of life and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
