        {
          "id": "krea2-e6bc5e9df1f3b307ca458072",
          "alias": "单女车内沉思坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the driver's seat of a white sedan, her body slightly peeking out the window, her head resting on the edge of the window, her expression gentle yet slightly contemplative. She wears a light purple short-sleeved top with a dark fine-trimmed neckline, slender fingers, her left arm resting on the window frame, a small gold bracelet on her wrist, and red round earrings. Sunlight streams in from the right, cherry blossom branches stretch into the frame, with pink and white flowers and tender green leaves dotting the upper left and right corners. This forms a natural frame, with a clear blue sky in the background, and the blurred outlines of green trees visible in the distance. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, highlighting the elegant posture of the figures and the vastness of the sky. The foreground features blooming cherry blossom branches, the middle features women and the car window, and the background is blue sky and distant trees. The visual guide line is composed of cherry blossom branches and the edge of the car window. The light is bright and soft, presenting a warm spring afternoon atmosphere. The overall color palette is fresh and natural, mainly pink, blue, white, and green. It creates a peaceful and beautiful everyday moment, as if capturing a leisurely spring afternoon. A woman enjoys the breeze and floral fragrance inside the car. The scene is full of youthful energy and poetic life, like a real scene shot with a regular phone, with slight lens distortion and color saturation, making it feel authentic and approachable. The details are rich, from the texture of petals to the reflections on the car windows. The light and shadow transitions are natural, shadows soft, and the entire scene is filled with the vitality and energy of spring. It gives people a sense of simple and pure beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
