        {
          "id": "krea2-e3ad77a18e5ec5121fd5ed93",
          "alias": "单女绿外套街道冷淡站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street corner, wearing round slim-rimmed glasses that reflect soft light, presenting a reserved yet intellectual temperament. She wears a deep green thick wool coat with a delicate texture and a subtle sheen. The buttons are made of dark metallic material to coordinate with the coat's color. Underneath, she wears a white turtleneck sweater that reveals a section of the collar edge, adding layers. Around her neck is a gray-green knitted scarf, fluffy and soft, layered around the neck. The texture is warm and comfortable. Her right hand wears a brown knitted glove, with the back of her hand clearly visible. Her fingers are naturally bent, seemingly ready to put her hand into her pocket or lightly touch clothes. She carries a black backpack on her shoulder, with simple and practical straps that straddle her shoulders. The overall design is simple yet full of everyday life. The background is a blurred city building wall, built from dark brown bricks in a regular geometric arrangement. Between the brick joints, subtle shadows create a sense of three-dimensionality and depth. Above the wall, some outlines of windows or door frames can be faintly seen, but due to the shallow depth of field, they are blurred, creating a soft bokeh effect. On the left side of the painting, there is a vertical shadow line, possibly from the edge of the building or the shadows cast by columns, enhancing the spatial structure. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure occupying the main position, the head slightly tilted, and the viewer's gaze directing them toward the upper right of the frame, creating a visual extension. The background gradually blurs, highlighting the main subject. Light comes from the front left of the image, belonging to soft natural light. Perhaps the diffuse light on cloudy or evening days without strong shadows enhances the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is quiet and warm, with cool but approachable tones. Green, gray, and brown are the main tones, harmoniously matched to create a quiet everyday moment in urban life, as if capturing an ordinary yet story-filled moment. The image has the texture of film photography, with fine graininess, moderate color saturation, and a slight retro filter effect, presenting a genuine and natural aesthetic of life. Like street candid shots taken with an old-fashioned camera, full of humanistic care and warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
