        {
          "id": "krea2-c6f3fb05a7fd930501f1bedb",
          "alias": "单女米风衣面包店站立吃",
          "prompt": "A woman sat by the window, wearing gold-rimmed round glasses, biting into a puff pastry sprinkled with powdered sugar. The bread was topped with a large chunk of pure white cream. Her right hand held the bread, her fingers long, a simple silver ring on her ring finger, and a white paper bag with the red letters \"Simplicity makes what's important\" in her left hand. She wore a beige trench coat with a white T-shirt underneath, the neckline slightly exposed. The collar and shoulder lines of the trench coat are clearly visible. The background is a light gray brick wall and a glass window. Outside, you can faintly see green trees. Several strips of colored tape—green, blue, and pink—are applied casually on the window glass, showing a casual impression. Light naturally streams in from the left, creating a warm transition of light and shadow. The overall tone of the image is warm, with a slight graininess and low-saturation texture, as if captured with an old camera. The composition uses close-ups, with the people occupying most of the frame. The gaze and the viewer communicate directly; in the foreground, details of bread and hands stand out; in the middle shot, the upper body and some clothing of the figure are highlighted; the brick walls and windows in the background are blurred to create a shallow depth of field effect. The color scheme mainly consists of beige, white, and brown, accented with bright colored tape. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and comfortable, full of the everyday life and youthful energy, as if capturing an ordinary yet warm afternoon. The images have a strong sense of documentary and realism. Like snapshots of everyday life casually taken in a café or bakery, carrying a subtle sense of nostalgia and delicate emotional expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
