        {
          "id": "krea2-e90cc3c96d7a5692bdbebfab",
          "alias": "单女灰西装街道沉思倚靠躲藏",
          "prompt": "She reveals a hint of calmness and thoughtfulness, with a naturally soft pink hue. She wears a dark gray blazer over a white shirt, with slightly peeking cuffs. A faint corner of a dark tie or bow tie is visible at the collar. Her fingers are long and slender, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light pink polish. The skin on the back of her hand and wrist is smooth, with soft highlights and shadows on the back. The black backpack she leans against has a delicate texture with a slight matte texture. The zipper details are clearly visible. The background is a warm wooden wall with a gradient from light brown to orange-yellow. The wood grain is naturally delicate, and the slightly blurred background creates a shallow depth of field effect, making the subject stand out. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, the head slightly tilted, forming a natural visual flow. Light comes from the upper left of the image, soft natural light, like afternoon sunlight streaming through the window into the room, creating even and gentle illumination, with smooth transitions in the shadows. It enhances three-dimensionality and airiness, creating a warm and tranquil lighting atmosphere, full of the cozy vibe of daily life. It seems to capture an ordinary yet touching moment. The image has strong narrative and emotional tension, like shooting with an old film camera. The slight lens shakes to create realistic graininess and slight exposure deviation, simulating the texture of real photography equipment. The edges of the frame are slightly darkened to enhance the retro feel and focus, presenting an overall style that blends everyday life, documentary, and artistic beauty, as if a photographer pressing the shutter during a chance encounter on the street captures this quiet and beautiful youthful memory",
