        {
          "id": "krea2-798244d33802590c5c6f98e2",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔庭院困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a vintage-style interior space, wearing a blue denim spaghetti strap long dress paired with a red knit cardigan, paired with red patent leather high heels. The overall look presents an elegant yet slightly nostalgic French vibe. Her makeup is exquisite, her expression serene yet slightly thoughtful, her left hand lightly resting on a stone pillar, while her right hand carries a brown leather shoulder bag, her posture calm and natural. The main figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, her body slightly turned to form a graceful S-shaped curve. In the foreground is a floor paved with colorful geometric parquet tiles, with the bricks in warm brown tones Mainly ochre and dark brown, with clear and visible textures. Some areas appear slightly lustrous due to light reflection. The middle ground is the woman's spatial environment. The tones are soft and hazy, resembling a classical oil painting. On the right, several wooden chairs and a small round table are visible. The chair backs are woven with woven rattan, and the smooth and reflective tabletop creates the atmosphere of a café or courtyard resting area. The composition uses a center-offset layout, with the figures occupying the main visual focal point of the composition. At the same time, stone columns are used as vertical lines to guide the viewer's gaze, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. The murals in the background and furniture together create a richly layered scene, which then flows back from the body's curves to the floor, forming a circular circulation. Light and shadow come from the left side of the image, soft natural light streams through the arched structure, while the right side presents delicate shadow transitions. The overall lighting is even yet layered, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The color scheme is mainly blue, red, and brown, with a blue denim skirt bringing a fresh texture. The red top and shoes create a strong visual contrast yet harmoniously unified. The brown floor echoes the background mural, creating a warm and rich color tone full of life and artistic flair. The details are rich, including the texture of the knit cardigan, the wrinkles of denim fabric, the stitching of the leather bag, the reflection of high heels, and the subtle wear marks on floor tiles. These elements together enhance realism and immersion, blending the leisure of daily life with the refined beauty of artistic photography, as if a professional camera's film-style shot, with a slight graininess and soft focus outside, presenting a visual experience that is both realistic and dreamy",
