        {
          "id": "krea2-c1cba3a127815fd66dcac25a",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔城市冷淡站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the indoor dining table, exuding a casual yet refined beauty. She wears a delicate gold necklace around her neck and simple round earrings, exuding a fashionable urban vibe. She wears a loose blue denim dress with a slightly open neckline revealing her collarbones, featuring classic double pockets on the chest, neatly arranged buttons, slightly rolled sleeves revealing slender arms, and a brown belt tied around her waist. The belt buckle is a vintage-style metal square buckle. Adding a touch of strength and sharpness to the overall look, her right hand rests on the edge of the table, her left hand carries a black cloth bag, her posture relaxed and confident. In the foreground is a dark wooden dining table, smooth with clear wood grain. Various items are placed on the table, including a bottle of orange LAMMINA orange juice with a transparent bottle revealing orange liquid and brand logo. Next to it is a green glass bottle of soda water with a white label and bubble pattern, and a bottle of transparent glass bottled mineral water. The bottle has a label and a silver cap. On the table sits a sliced orange, plump and juicy, showing a bright orange-yellow color. Next to it is a whole orange, bright in color and smooth on the surface, with a few orange peels scattered along the edge of the plate. Next to it is an open book or menu with a light yellow cover printed with blurred text. The background is a cozy indoor environment, the walls are beige with a slightly textured surface, and the ceiling is white, equipped with recessed downlights and air conditioning vents. On the right is a light wood-colored double-door wardrobe with a simple and flat door. On the left, the frame of a black TV can be faintly seen. Behind it is a wooden chair with a vertical strip design. The overall layout is compact and lifelike, with a center-symmetrical composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, facing the camera directly, creating strong visual guidance. Fruits and drinks in the foreground form a layered relationship with the figure, enhancing the depth of the image. Light comes from the indoor ceiling light and possible side window sources, resulting in soft and even lighting, with no obvious shadows, creating a warm and comfortable home atmosphere. The colors are mainly blue, brown, and orange, with a striking contrast between cool and warm. Blue denim and orange fruit create a visual echo, with harmonious tones, natural light and shadow transitions, rich details, and authentic texture. The visuals present a blend of relaxed and fashionable everyday life, rich in lifestyle and artistic aesthetics, as if captured from an art film or a real life clip captured by an amateur camera. With a slight film graininess and low-saturation tones, it simulates real photography effects, emphasizing the authenticity of scenes and emotional expression. The overall atmosphere is calm, elegant, and slightly lazy, making it suitable for showcasing the daily life and personal charm of modern urban women",
