          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street, looking especially lively and natural. She wears a gentle smile, exuding a gentle and confident aura. She wears a tailored black blazer, made of soft and textured material, layered with an off-white turtleneck knit top. The layers are distinct, simple yet elegant. On her left shoulder is a brown leather shoulder bag with a thin strap, creating a harmonious contrast with the coat. Her right hand gently holds a light gray wool scarf, casually draped over her arm. She adds a touch of lazy and casual charm. Her body is slightly turned and her head tilts slightly, as if silently communicating with the viewer. The composition uses a medium-shot portrait style, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The background is a blurry city streetscape, with faint outlines of buildings and distant vehicle lights presenting a soft bokeh effect. The light comes from above, belonging to warm afternoon sunlight. The sunlight passes through the fine dust in the air, forming a distinct beam of light that produces beautiful contour light. This makes the figure stand out from the background, with natural transitions of light and shadow, moderate contrast between light and shadow, and soft shadows, creating a peaceful and beautiful atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow and brown, paired with black and off-white, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The image has a strong cinematic and film-like feel, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a wide-aperture lens. The lens captures a real and moving moment, full of life and artistic beauty. The details are rich, the background blur is well handled, and the main character is highlighted, while preserving the authenticity of the environment, the overall composition is balanced, the visuals guide nature, and then follow her posture and gaze to the surrounding environment, giving a sense of 