        {
          "id": "krea2-b58373be373d5aad264aca48",
          "alias": "单女黑风衣忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a railway signal pole beside the tracks. She wears a long black trench coat with vertical stripes over a white shirt, white mid-calf socks, and black leather shoes. Her body leans slightly forward, head lowered, as if telling a forgotten story. In the foreground is a clear railway signal device, its surface somewhat dated. There are signs of rust and wear, with a strong metallic texture. The top is a circular structure with the number \"22\" embedded in the center, and below is a thick white cement column. The surface of the column bears the mottled marks left by time, surrounded by gray stones of various sizes, covering the entire ground to create a rough yet authentic texture. The middle scene features two parallel rails extending into the distance, made of dark steel rails and sleepers, extending diagonally along the canvas and gradually disappearing beneath the distant hills. On both sides of the tracks are barren wild grass and withered vegetation. Some plants have withered, presenting the bleak atmosphere of autumn and winter. The background is a rolling hillside covered with sparse trees, most of the leaves have withered, and the branches intertwine to form a harmonious silhouette. The sky shows a faint gray-blue tone, with thin clouds and soft and diffuse light, without strong direct sunlight. The overall tone leans toward coolness, mainly gray, black, and brown, creating a tranquil and even slightly lonely atmosphere. The composition adopts a left-centered visual layout, with the figure positioned on the left side of the painting as the main visual focus. Signal poles serve as guiding elements to draw the viewer's gaze toward the figures. At the same time, the lines of the railway track extend from the foreground to the middle ground, creating a strong perspective effect that enhances the sense of spatial depth. The figure's posture subtly echoes the direction of the track. The visual guide line is formed by the signal post, tracks, and the character's line of sight, extending further to the distant mountains in the background. The light and shadow are delicate, with the light source coming from the side and top, close to the diffused light of dusk or early morning. The shadows are soft, and the stripes on the trench coat change in brightness depending on the angle of the light, enhancing the sense of depth. The metal surface of the signal pole reflects a faint sheen, while the gravel floor shows different layers of light and shadow under the light. The overall light and shadow atmosphere is quiet and cool, with a cinematic narrative and film texture. The image presents a casual photography style, similar to shooting with medium format or vintage film cameras, with a slight graininess and a warm color tone. The tone is slightly retro, as if recording a moment forgotten by time. The composition is rigorous and restrained, full of artistic tension, conveying a sense of youth, The emotions of loneliness and memories intertwine, the overall atmosphere is both real and dreamy, like an old photograph preserved for many years, carrying unspoken feelings and traces of time",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
