        {
          "id": "krea2-66c750030c237238a449f608",
          "alias": "单女米风衣忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside a café, wearing round black-rimmed glasses with slightly reflective lenses, looking directly at the camera. Her fingers are long, and a simple gold ring on her ring finger harmonizes with the overall tone. She wears a beige trench coat with double buttons on the cuffs, revealing a dark green printed shirt underneath. The pattern is faintly visible, giving a retro feel. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the foreground, with a close-up composition. The figure occupies most of the space, and the background is blurred. The interior environment is blurred: on the left are wooden walls and some blurred decorations, on the right is the outline of green plants, and in the distance, a faint green light can be seen. The light is soft and slightly warm, with natural shadow transitions, creating a quiet and contemplative atmosphere. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, color saturation is moderate, with a slight film texture and graininess, as if taken with an old-fashioned camera. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting effects to enhance visual focus, with a tone leaning toward vintage brown tones. Combining the delicacy and artistic flair of Japanese photography, the background may be unclear but perceptible, such as tables, chairs, paintings on walls, or menus. Through shallow depth of field, these are blurred into soft color blocks, filling the entire composition with the tranquil beauty of everyday life, conveying a gentle, restrained, and slightly melancholic mood. The composition is balanced yet lively, as if immersed in one's own world. The details of the surrounding environment are deliberately faded to highlight the subject's emotional expression. The overall visual language is simple yet highly moving. Like a real moment captured when the afternoon sunlight slants into a café, it is highly narrative and artistic, with delicate texture, harmonious color coordination, precise use of light and shadow, presenting an aesthetic that is both warm and profound, like a frozen moment under a movie lens, inviting people to explore her inner story",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
