        {
          "id": "krea2-065331356f11c2f3b458c7d1",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫严肃持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a pure white short-sleeved shirt with delicate vertical texture and slight pleats. The cuffs are slightly cinched, and the shoulder lines are smooth. The overall look is simple and fresh. Her right hand gently strokes near the hairline, fingers are long, her posture natural and relaxed, full of warmth and vitality. The composition uses medium to close shots. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the left side of the frame, with a slightly tilted head and body forming an S-shaped curve, creating a beautiful visual flow. The background is a blurred green plant, presenting a bokeh effect. The leaves are rich in layers, and the colors transition naturally from light green to dark green. The light and shadows are mottled, and sunlight filters through the gaps between the leaves onto the figure, creating soft highlights and shadows. The light comes from the front left, belonging to natural daylight, with warm tones. The overall atmosphere is calm, healing, and full of youthful energy. The image has the texture of film photography. The slight graininess and low color saturation present a realistic everyday shooting feel. The lens has a longer focal length, shallow depth of field, strong background blur, and highlights the subject. The composition utilizes negative space and blank space, leaving plenty of blank space on the right side to enhance the sense of breath in the image. The overall color palette is mainly white and green, accented by warm yellow sunlight, creating a harmonious contrast of cool and warm tones, creating a quiet and lively summer afternoon atmosphere, as if captured casually with an old-fashioned film camera. It is full of the atmosphere of life and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
