        {
          "id": "krea2-1f479be0c7a54fc26087c97b",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden high stool in a traditional Japanese izakaya, wearing a white lace camisole and a brown plaid pleated mini skirt, her expression slightly contemplative and expectant. Her right hand gently rests on the wooden-framed glass window, while her left hand is slightly clenched into a fist in front of her. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her body slightly turned to the side, presenting a soft S-shaped curve that creates a tranquil and story-filled atmosphere. In the foreground is a glass window covered in raindrops, with water droplets slowly sliding down the glass, creating blurred light spots and reflections. The window frame is made of dark wood. Divided into several small squares, enhancing the geometric layering of the composition. The middle ground features a female subject, positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame. Light streams in diagonally through the window from the left, creating soft shadow transitions on the background walls and tabletops. The background is the dimly lit interior of an izakaya, with paper lanterns and signs inscribed with Japanese on the walls. The red and white lanterns emit a warm yellow glow, illuminating the surroundings and creating a cozy and nostalgic Japanese street atmosphere. In the distance, you can faintly see the bar, sake bottles, and menu signs. The details are rich but not overshadowed. The composition uses a three-part layout: the figures occupy the right side of the frame, while the left side leaves ample space for windows and lighting on rainy nights, creating visual balance and breathability. The windows serve as natural frames, guiding the viewer's gaze toward the figures. The dynamic effects of raindrops enhance the texture and realism of the image. Light and shadow mainly use warm tones, with lanterns and indoor lighting sources creating strong contrasts of light and dark, highlighting the contours and skin textures. The background gradually blurs, producing a shallow depth of field effect. This makes the subject stand out even more. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and slightly melancholic, like the mood of waiting for someone to return on a rainy night. The image features the grainy texture and slight color shifts of film photography, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting. Overall, it presents a poetic moment casually captured in daily life, with a strong artistic cinematic feel and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
