        {
          "id": "krea2-8b0a228bbbf00838a4cb7dfd",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙沙发倚靠阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sat on a plaid fabric sofa, exuding a gentle and charming aura. She wore a white spaghetti strap slip dress that revealed her slender neck and collarbones, gracefully leaning against the armrest, gently holding an open magazine in her left hand. The cover featured a fluffy brown teddy bear, with the words \"Adventures of Simples the Bear\" and the author \"Vicky Stapley\" printed on the pages. Sunlight streams in from the left side of the frame, warm and bright, presenting a golden tone that creates a lazy and cozy afternoon atmosphere. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with the silhouette of another piece of clothing or fabric faintly visible. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main position. The shallow depth of field effect blurs the background to highlight the subject, with side backlighting and mainly warm yellow and beige tones. Paired with the brown tones of the plaid sofa, the overall visual experience is warm and comfortable, full of life and artistic flair. It feels like a real scene shot with a medium format film camera under natural light, featuring a slight grainy texture and authentic color reproduction. Natural halos and slight lens flare at the edges enhance the sense of presence and realism. The subject's expressions are natural and relaxed, and the movements are casual and unpretentious, like a moment accidentally captured while quietly reading at home. The whole picture is full of storytelling and emotional warmth. Like a precious image recording everyday life, it allows people to feel the tranquility and beauty of time",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
