        {
          "id": "krea2-2960ca8240797eb7fc2e2c8c",
          "alias": "单女桌边俏皮坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden table in a café, looking relaxed and joyful. The sleeves are slightly rolled up, appearing casual and elegant. Her body leans forward slightly, her posture relaxed. On the table sits a white paper cup coffee with a black lid, beside which is a small white dish. Inside is a golden puff pastry bread and a small white sugar cube. The background is the café's bar area, and behind it is a blackboard menu. Various drink names and prices are written in white chalk, such as latte, cappuccino, apple cake, etc. The font is clear but somewhat casual. Below the blackboard are neatly arranged glass bottles and metal containers, some of which contain liquids or seasonings. The bar counter surface has a gray cement texture with a slightly rough texture, and a white cylindrical object hangs on the right wall. It may be a thermos or decorations. The overall environment is simple and modern, with gray and white tones as the main tones, accented by dark blackboards and bright floral patterns. The composition uses a medium shot perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, interacting with the viewer. The foreground highlights food and hand details, the middle shot shows the main subject and tabletop objects, and the background explains the scene. The lighting is soft and bright, combining natural light from the left with warm indoor light to create a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The transition of light and shadow is natural, and shadows are delicate. The background is slightly blurred, enhancing the sense of spatial layering, presenting a relaxed and pleasant moment in daily life, as if captured with a lightweight camera. It combines authenticity with artistic beauty, harmonious color coordination, and follows gestures leading to food, then extending to the background menu and bar counter, creating a smooth viewing path. The image is full of life's atmosphere, conveying feelings of tranquility, enjoyment, and satisfaction. It is suitable for fashion magazines, lifestyle photography, or social media content, with a fresh and natural style. It combines documentary and aesthetic value",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
