        {
          "id": "krea2-c9cee96dad1f0e5cf7259d33",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙街道沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor stone bench, wearing a light blue short-sleeved dress with dark green trim on the collar and cuffs. One side of the skirt slits reveals the leg line, and she wears black platform ankle boots. The overall look blends preppy style with modern street vibes, her expression slightly lazy and contemplative, her posture relaxed yet graceful. Her body is slightly turned to the side, one hand resting gently on the edge of the bench, the other naturally resting between her legs. Sunlight pours in from the upper right of the frame, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on her body. presenting a tranquil yet story-rich atmosphere. In the foreground is her seated lower body and boots, rich in detail, with obvious reflection and clear texture. In the middle is her complete body and a stone bench, made of gray stone, with rough and time-worn carvings, and simple carvings. The pillars on both sides are decorated with traditional stone carvings, and the background is a blurry courtyard with lush palm trees and other tropical plants. In the distance stands a red brick building with weathered walls and neatly arranged windows. Some walls show peeling, revealing a sense of history and a sense of life. The composition uses a three-part layout: the figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame, with more blank space on the left side, creating visual balance. The red column in the foreground is used as a framing element to enhance depth and guide the gaze to the subject. The camera angle is slightly lowered, presenting a low-angle effect that highlights the figure's upright figure. The lighting is bright daylight, with moderate color saturation, mainly cool tones, complemented by warm buildings and floor shadows. It creates a fresh yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall image has a strong sense of everyday documentary, as if shot with a regular camera in the afternoon, featuring slight film graininess and natural exposure. The tones are authentic, details rich, and the transitions of light and shadow are natural, without excessive embellishment, presenting a lifelike, authentic, and artistically beautiful imaging style",
