          "id": "krea2-d64ef442a63ab598b35b92b4",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫城市媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "Her body is slightly turned to the camera, her head naturally turned to one side, and the ends are slightly curled, adding softness and movement. She wears a form-fitting black turtleneck knit top. The fabric is delicate and the texture is clearly visible, perfectly outlining her figure with graceful curves. The cuffs are decorated with tiny metal buttons, adding a touch of refinement to the overall look. She pairs a dark blue short skirt with a clean and sharp hem and a slight sheen that naturally drapes down as she sits, forming soft pleats. Her legs are clad in black mesh tights The sock surface features a uniform diamond-shaped mesh texture, showing off the skin's contours yet remaining sexy. On her feet are classic black patent leather high heels, with slender and straight heels, a pointed toe, and a bright red accent on the sole's edge. This is the brand's signature design element. The left foot is gently lifted, the toes touch the ground, and the right foot firmly touches the ground. The posture is elegant and full of tension. Her hand naturally rests on her thigh, fingers are long, nails neatly trimmed, and the overall movement is smooth and expressive. The composition uses a medium perspective. The figure occupies the main position in the composition, fully visible from above the knees to the head. The body forms an S-shaped curve, with legs extending crossed, forming a visual guiding line. The background is the indoor environment, with a white door positioned slightly to the left behind the figure. The door has silver handles and a keyhole, with simple door frame lines. The glass window lattice brings in the indoors with blurred outdoor light. Outside, the outlines of trees and soft natural light are faintly visible, creating a quiet and intimate atmosphere. The floor is light-colored wood, with clear and natural wood grain. Reflecting faint light and shadow, the wall is off-white with a unified tone and no unnecessary decoration, making the figure stand out more. Light comes from the left window, belonging to natural light, soft and even. At the same time, soft shadows cast on the floor and chairs, creating a natural transition and rich layering. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, carrying a subtle beauty from everyday life. It feels like a fashionable portrait taken with a professional camera, or like a casual snapshot between friends. The colors are mainly black, white, blue, and gold. The contrast is striking yet harmonious, with exquisite detail handling, authentic texture, and balanced composition, offering strong visual appeal. It is suitable for fashion photography, lifestyle displays, or personal image documentation. Overall, it presents a modern urban woman's independence and confidence, combining sensuality with intellectual temperament. The image is clean and crisp, with no unnecessary distractions. All the focus is on the person themselves, highlighting their charm and personality. The use of light and color enhances the sense of depth and three-dimensionality in the space. It creates a visual experience that is both realistic and slightly artistic",
