        {
          "id": "krea2-b6494f94cc191579324d11c9",
          "alias": "单女灰连衣裙广场站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a modern, minimalist interior space, wearing a light gray fitted slip dress with thin straps. The dress features thin straps and three white buttons on the chest. The waist is naturally cinched to outline a slender waistline. The hem and mid-thigh are made of fabric with a delicate knit texture and a subtle sheen. Black stockings wrap her long legs, and her feet are naturally relaxed. One foot is slightly raised, showing elegant leg lines. The overall posture is both dignified and approachable. She stands in front of a beige fabric single sofa, which features a curved backrest and wooden legs. Its structure is simple yet feels warm. Behind the sofa is a background area formed by a light-colored wall and a dark door frame. On the right, a tall green palm plant is placed in a dark gray square flowerpot, its leaves spreading naturally, adding vitality and layers to the scene. In the background, you can see an orange vertical striped wooden partition wall, whose vertical lines enhance the sense of depth and modern design. The floor is paved with large light gray tiles. The surface is smooth and flat, reflecting soft ambient light. The entire scene is illuminated from the front sides, creating a uniform and soft diffused light effect. The light source simulates natural window light, with natural shadow transitions to create a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with figures positioned slightly centered to the left, guiding the gaze to the subject. The foreground focuses on the figure and sofa, while the middle scene extends to plants and walls. The background is created by partitions and door frames to create spatial depth, with clear direction of light and shadow, entering diagonally from the left. Subtle shadows are cast onto the figure's body and furniture, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is mainly gray, beige, brown, and green, with harmonious and unified colors. The image is filled with the comfort and fashion of modern homes, delivering professional studio-level image quality while retaining the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The details are rich, the light and shadow are delicate, and the atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, as if capturing a moment of afternoon sunlight streaming indoors, presenting a lifestyle yet artistic aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
