        {
          "id": "krea2-53b0b499dd57cf551e0f9103",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣城市愤怒倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "Her body leans slightly forward, presenting a relaxed and relaxed posture. She presents a relaxed and casual look. She wears a beige knit sweater with black leopard print patterns. The sweater features a crew neck, ribbed trims on the cuffs and hem, with delicate texture and clearly visible knit craftsmanship. The sweater cut is slightly loose but fits the figure, presenting a comfortable and casual style. She pairs it with light blue high-waisted denim shorts. The shorts feature a classic five-pocket design, with a row of silver buttons on the front. The pant legs are flammed, exposing the ankles. The material has a distinct denim texture and slight wash marks, adding a retro feel. She wears black tights with a tight texture and fine vertical stripes on the surface, forming a sharp contrast with the denim shorts. The overall look is fashionable and layered. The background is a modern-style interior space, with smooth light marble tiles on the floor reflecting the surrounding light and shadow. The walls are made of warm wood tones or imitation wood veneer, presenting vertical strip textures with fine grille structures that create a sense of depth. On the right side, there is a metallic vertical line, possibly a door frame or decorative partition. On the left is a dark glass or mirror structure that reflects blurred architectural contours and light, with soft warm yellow lighting accented in the background. The light source comes from above or behind, creating uniform diffused light that softly illuminates the subject, with natural shadow transitions. The overall lighting is warm and the tone is cozy and comfortable. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The head is slightly raised, parallel to the viewer's gaze. The foreground is the full-body figure, clear and prominent. The middle ground includes her lower body, hand movements, shorts, and legs. The background is composed of walls and floor, with blur treatment to enhance spatial sense and depth of field. The visual guide line extends from the subject's line of sight to the vertical lines in the background, forming a vertical direction. At the same time, the body's contours form a stable horizontal structure. The lighting atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with soft light that is not glaring, creating a sense of everyday elegance in urban life. The image texture is realistic and details rich, as if shot with a professional camera in low-light environments. Using a large-aperture lens to capture the subject, the background blur effect is obvious, color reproduction is accurate, and saturation is moderate. It features a slight film graininess and faint noise, simulating the texture of real photography, presenting a style that combines fashion and everyday life. The images are full of the independent charm and composed temperament of modern urban women",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
