        {
          "id": "krea2-2799145f6a0d44a412e3692c",
          "alias": "单女黑外套广场困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in an exotic indoor space, with a faint blush of rosy glow. Her expression is calm yet tinged with a hint of contemplation and detachment. She wears a loose black coat paired with a white turtleneck underneath. The jacket features striking white geometric patchwork and dark striped decorations, and a fabric strap printed with red Chinese characters is slung across her shoulder. The overall look is simple yet modern. Her posture is slightly turned to the side, her head slightly tilted, revealing elegant contours. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the center of the painting slightly to the right The composition uses a low-angle downward view, making the figures appear more upright and visually impactful. The background is a complex structural space built from transparent glass or acrylic materials, with numerous colorful square lanterns or boxes hanging inside, mainly in orange, yellow, and blue colors. Some lanterns have faint Chinese characters or patterns on their surfaces. Under the light, these objects create rich reflections and refractions, creating a mesmerizing interplay of light and shadow. deep in the background, a huge red vertical bar can be seen. Gold or white Chinese characters are written on it, adding a strong cultural atmosphere. The entire scene is bathed in intense natural light, which pours down from the glass skylight above, creating a bright blue-toned sky background. Sunlight softly scatters between the glass surface and objects, creating a striking contrast between warm and cool in the scene, creating a dreamy and slightly futuristic spatial atmosphere. Vertical structures on the left and right sides of the painting extend into the distance, forming strong perspective lines that guide the gaze to the figures. At the same time, it enhances the sense of depth and three-dimensionality in the space. The overall color palette is mainly blue, white, and black, accented with warm orange-yellow and vivid red. The color layers are rich but not chaotic, the composition is full but not crowded, details are exquisite, light and shadow treatment is delicate, and the atmosphere is tranquil and storyful, as if capturing a poetic moment. It possesses strong artistic appeal and visual appeal, like high-quality portraits taken with a professional camera, yet retains the natural texture and realism of everyday photography. There is slight lens distortion and noise at the edges of the frame, simulating real camera shooting and enhancing realism and immediacy",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
