        {
          "id": "krea2-82407cd768f2dfbe97c2287d",
          "alias": "单女街道忧伤倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "On a city street as night falls, a woman leans against a mottled graffiti wall. She slightly tilts her head to gaze at the camera, as if whispering a secret. The interplay of light and shadow outlines her graceful contours. The focus is on this woman, her posture relaxed and natural, her body slightly leaning, shoulders relaxed, arms hanging naturally, presenting an effortless elegance and rich details. The middle shot features a colorful graffiti wall. The walls are covered with abstract patterns and colors, with blue-green tones interwoven with orange-red light spots, creating a strong visual contrast. The graffiti strokes are bold and powerful, full of street art vibes. The background is a blurry city nightscape, with distant streetlights, car headlights, and neon lights flickering in the darkness, forming soft light spots. The taillights of vehicles trail long strips of light, creating a flowing effect of light and shadow. The entire scene is composed using the classic three-part method: the figures are on the right side of the frame, leaving space on the left to show the street's extension. At the same time, diagonal wall lines guide the viewer's gaze, enhancing the sense of depth in the image and forming an implicit visual path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere mainly features warm and cool contrasts: one side of the figure is illuminated by warm orange-yellow light, while the other side is in shadow, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow that highlights the character's three-dimensionality. The blue tones in the background complement the warm light in the foreground, creating a sense of depth and layering in the image. The overall light comes from artificial sources on the sides, such as street lamps or neon lights, creating a cinematic dramatic light and shadow effect. The image tone is relatively cool, but warm light spots add accents in some areas, creating visual focal points. The image has a distinct shallow depth of field, with a clear foreground and blurred background, highlighting the subject. The lens uses a large-aperture prime lens to simulate the image texture of professional photography. The overall style blends urban street photography with cinematic aesthetics, presenting a daily moment that is both realistic and artistically filtered, as if capturing a poetic moment unexpectedly encountered on an ordinary night. There are no signs of deliberate staging. Yet it is filled with storytelling and emotional tension, like a still frame from an independent film, capturing a lonely yet beautiful soul in the city, seeking its own peaceful corner amid the noise and silence",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
