        {
          "id": "krea2-3a744f179808b2f95a323cb8",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装桌边微笑倚靠交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a dark blue double-breasted school blazer, paired with a white shirt and a red tie with a black star-patterned pattern. She wore a pleated short skirt in the same color, leaning sideways against the edge of a light gray vintage-style dressing table. Her left hand gently rested on the table, while her right hand naturally let down and gently lifted the hem. Her posture was elegant and slightly playful, her expression calm with a subtle smile. The overall look was a typical Japanese schoolgirl uniform, with a classical mirror with carved borders in the background. Her silhouette and interior furnishings are faintly reflected in the mirror. On the dressing table are white woven baskets, several tall white candles, transparent glass containers, and a white, slender-necked vase filled with pink roses and red carnations. The flowers are softly colored, and green leaves are scattered throughout, creating a warm and romantic atmosphere. The walls are a delicate gray-blue with a delicate texture, and light softly streams in from the left side of the painting, creating a uniform and warm diffused light that illuminates the main figure and the foreground objects. The light and shadow transition is natural, without harsh shadows, and the overall color palette is blue, White and red are the main colors, complemented by beige gray and soft pastel floral colors, creating a harmonious and layered visual effect. The composition uses a center-right position of the character, with horizontal lines from the dressing table guiding the gaze. Mirror reflections increase spatial depth, with slightly tilted bodies and crossed legs creating dynamic balance. The visual guide naturally extends from the figure's posture to the vase and mirror in the background, enhancing the depth of the image. The entire scene feels like an indoor portrait shot with a professional camera paired with a softbox. Yet it retains the realism of everyday everyday footage captured with ordinary equipment. The images are rich in detail, realistic in texture, and the atmosphere is peaceful and beautiful, like a quiet afternoon frozen in this moment, full of youthful energy and gentle charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
