        {
          "id": "krea2-aa1e5bd7684709c4299c8528",
          "alias": "单女白T恤船上俏皮倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a white sleeveless tank top and light blue high-waisted shorts, with white trim on the edges, showcasing a youthful and energetic summer style. She wears oversized sunglasses that reflect faint light. She slightly lowers her head to look at the camera, her posture relaxed and dynamic. Her left hand rests gently on the handlebars, her right hand naturally hangs down, and her body leans slightly forward, presenting a dynamic balance while riding. There is a small tattoo on the outside of her left thigh, adding a touch of personality to the overall look. The bicycle body has a dark gray metallic texture, with the \"ALSO\" logo printed on the frame. The handlebar features a silver curved handlebar design, and the wheels have white tires with black spokes. The chain and transmission system are clearly visible and exquisitely detailed. The foreground shows the lower body and part of the woman's torso, focusing on the interaction between the figure and the vehicle. The middle ground shows a calm blue sea and a moored yacht. In the background is a large white sailing ship with a clear hull structure, the mast towering into the sky, and in the distance, a blurred outline of a dock and green vegetation. The sky appears light blue with a slight cloud, and the overall lighting is bright and soft. Sunlight streams down from the upper right, creating rich layers of light and shadow and creating a warm and tranquil summer afternoon atmosphere. The shot uses a low-angle angle to emphasize the figure's lines and the visual impact of the bicycle. The composition uses diagonal lines to guide the gaze, extending from the front wheel of the bicycle to the back, creating a smooth visual flow. Paired with metallic gray and black, the tones are fresh and harmonious, giving a strong summer seaside vibe and a delicate image texture. It looks like film photos taken with a professional camera, featuring slight graininess and natural color shifts, simulating real photography while preserving the cleanliness and precision of digitally generated images. The overall atmosphere blends the casual feel of daily life with the refined beauty of artistic photography, conveying a free, comfortable, and vibrant urban leisure lifestyle",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
