        {
          "id": "krea2-b8513cc66531a569db51c5c7",
          "alias": "单女蓝和服户外俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under an outdoor pavilion, wearing a dark blue kimono-style jacket with light gray underneath. The cuffs and neckline reveal soft gray fabric. The overall look is simple yet rich in traditional Japanese charm. She turns to look back at the camera, her expression slightly playful and calm, holding a handbag with a pink woven texture. The bag uses fine diamond weaving craftsmanship, presenting a three-dimensional geometric beauty. The cover is a solid color, paired with gold metal fasteners and a circular handle. The details exude a sense of sophistication. Her posture is naturally relaxed, her arm gently raised, and she places the bag in front of her chest, as if showcasing this beloved accessory. In the foreground is dense tropical plants, with huge green leaves layered in layers, veins clearly visible, some edges slightly curled and glistening with a moist sheen, as if freshly moistened by rain. The leaves are broad and spreading, some split into palms, others slender like swords. They extend from both sides of the frame to the center, forming a natural frame structure. The middle ground is where the woman stands, the background is a blurred green vegetation, with interwoven branches and leaves, dappled light and shadow, faintly revealing the wooden structure of a pavilion. The dark brown beams and columns are clearly outlined, with the top partially blocking the sky, allowing light to gently fall onto the figures. The composition uses the classic three-part layout: the figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with the gaze facing right, but the head turns toward the frame, creating visual tension. At the same time, large green leaves occupy the right side of the painting, creating a rich sense of layering. There is a certain contrast between the plants in the foreground and the figures. The shallow depth of field effect highlights the main subject, while the background gradually blurs, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The bag serves as a color highlight to attract attention, and its position is right near the golden ratio point of the composition, enhancing the overall aesthetic. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and tranquil. Light comes from the upper left side, scattering mottled light spots through the gaps in the leaves, creating a natural contrast of light and shadow. The background light is weak, presenting a hazy blue-green tone. The overall tone leans toward a warm and cool balance, dominated by green, creating a fresh, tranquil, and slightly artistic atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with a slight film graininess and retro filter effects, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. The edges of the frame are slightly darkened, further enhancing nostalgia and artistic feel. Overall, it presents a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, combining vitality with aesthetic pursuit",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
