        {
          "id": "krea2-a7bbb057fc6d593a6ca0a034",
          "alias": "单女米高领衫窗边困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window, adding a touch of laziness and gentleness. She wears a beige turtleneck sweater with a soft and fluffy texture, featuring a warm knit texture. Over it is a thin coat with blue and yellow checkered patterns. The plaid pattern is clear but not out of place, and the colors are soft, forming a warm color layer with the inner layer. She gently holds a white paper cup in her right hand. The cup is simple and without patterns, her hand posture naturally relaxed, fingers slender, nails neatly trimmed. She slightly tilts her head, It feels as if gazing into some distant place outside the window, or immersed in your own thoughts. The whole body is slightly tilted, shoulders relaxed, posture elegant and comfortable. The foreground is a close-up of the upper body of the subject, occupying most of the composition. The composition uses close-ups, leaving space on the right to guide the gaze forward. The background is a blurred outdoor scene, through which one can see the hazy sky and distant silhouettes. Light enters from the left, creating a soft backlight effect and creating a golden halo around the edges of the figure. It creates a dreamy atmosphere, with light and shadow mainly coming from the natural light source on the left. The light is soft and directional, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow and beige, accented by blue and pale purple checkered patterns. The color combination is harmonious and warm, filling the image with a cozy, tranquil, and healing feeling. The lens uses a large aperture for shooting, resulting in a shallow depth of field and a completely blurred background, highlighting the subject. The composition is compact, creating an intimate and intimate atmosphere. The lighting and shadow are warm and soft, with the texture of morning or afternoon sunlight. Overall, it presents a kind of unintentionally beautiful moment in daily life, like a warm moment casually captured with a lightweight camera. The footage shows no deliberate staged shots, yet is filled with genuine emotional expression and a sense of everyday life. The details are rich and layered, combining artistic flair with a sense of intimacy, as if one can feel the warmth and tranquility within those tranquil moments",
