        {
          "id": "krea2-4aba1201f9841593fd619780",
          "alias": "单女户外冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "The overall look is simple yet elegant. She stands slightly to the side, gently supporting a blue-purple hydrangea with her left hand, her right hand naturally hanging down and lightly touching her left arm, her posture relaxed and calm, her expression calm yet tinged with a hint of mystery. It feels as if there is a silent communication with the viewer. The background is dense hydrangeas and lush green leaves, mainly blue and purple, interspersed with a few pale yellow and white hydrangeas. The layers are rich, the color transitions naturally, the green leaves are broad and dense, veins are clearly visible, and the edges are slightly curled, presenting a vibrant state. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical style, with the figure positioned at the very center of the composition, surrounded by hydrangeas from all sides to the center, creating a strong visual focus. In the foreground are several hydrangeas in the foreground, with delicate petals and clear texture. The middle ground features the main subject, rich in detail, while the background is layered with flowers and leaves, creating a rich sense of spatial depth. The light and shadow come from soft natural light, shining from above to the left, with soft shadows and no strong contrast. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and romantic, with a strong summer vibe. The color palette is mainly cool, with blue and green dominating, creating a cool and fresh visual sensation that breaks monotony and adds vitality. The image texture is delicate and detailed, as if shot with a professional camera. Yet it retains the natural feel of daily life, possessing the beauty of artistic photography. Similar to how a photographer uses a Canon 5D Mark IV paired with a 24-70mm f/2.8 lens outdoors in natural light, using low-angle downward shots to highlight the interaction between people and flowers, emphasizing the harmonious beauty between people and nature. The overall image presents a tranquil, poetic, and vibrant atmosphere, like a pastoral painting in a modern city—fashionable yet authentic in nature",
