        {
          "id": "krea2-af9b0108e483a7596c10f3c4",
          "alias": "单女蓝连体衣摄影棚媚态站立演奏",
          "prompt": "She wore a light blue sequin jumpsuit with a high-waisted design. The material shimmered delicately under the light, with smooth lines at the chest and waist that hugged her figure, highlighting her full curves. The sides of the dress featured fine string ties, adding a touch of sensuality and detail. Her legs are dressed in semi-transparent pink fishnet stockings, with clear texture that covers everything from thighs to ankles, creating a striking contrast with the bodysuit. On her feet are a pair of pure white pointed high heels with moderate heel height, a simple and elegant look that adds a sense of maturity and fashion to the overall look. Around her neck is a matching bow tie, slightly loose, adding a touch of casualness and liveliness. Her fingers are long, and she wears a white wide-brimmed sleeve at her wrist, with delicate silver buttons trimmed at the cuffs. Her right hand hangs naturally, her posture relaxed and confident. She stands inside a pure white studio, with clean white walls and floors as the background. On the ceiling, you can see a few simple metal brackets and lighting fixtures, but they don't interfere with the main subject. The entire space is clean and bright, creating a minimalist modern feel. Light comes from the upper front, softly and evenly casting on the figure without obvious shadows, highlighting the garment's glossy texture and three-dimensional body contours, while creating delicate high-gloss reflections on the garment surface, enhancing visual layering. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure standing in the center, fully framed, proportionally balanced, and viewed at level level, emphasizing the overall image and posture of the figure. The colors in the painting are mainly cool tones, with light blue, white, and pink forming a harmonious visual pairing, both fresh and dreamy. The light and shadow are handled with delicate detail, with natural transitions between light and shadow. The blank background not only expands the sense of space in the painting but also makes the characters stand out, creating a strong visual guide. The overall atmosphere combines fairy-tale romantic fantasy with modern fashion refinement, as if a fairy or stage performer from a future world showcases its unique charm in a pure space. It combines the fun of role-playing with authentic human emotional expression. The image is tranquil and full of tension, like a carefully photographed artistic portrait. It captures a fleeting moment of elegance and confidence, leaving a lasting impression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
