        {
          "id": "krea2-aac344af6936dc1932b6845e",
          "alias": "单女黑内衣镜前沉思站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of an indoor mirror for a selfie, adding a touch of casual beauty. She wears a black tight sports bra with a unique design, featuring cutouts and thin ribbons to highlight her long figure. She pairs it with matching high-waisted leggings in the same color, creating a simple yet fashionable overall look. In her right hand, she holds a dark gray smartphone, with the camera module on the back clearly visible. Her posture is naturally relaxed, and on her wrist is a delicate silver bracelet that reflects a faint glow. Her expression is focused yet slightly contemplative. The background is a large mirror, reflecting part of the room. You can see the light-colored walls and a closed door. The floor is wooden, with warm tones that feel cozy and comfortable. Below the mirror, a pair of black-and-white sneakers and another pair of black shoes are scattered on the floor, adding a sense of everyday life. The composition is centered, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center, their bodies slightly tilted, forming a natural S-shaped curve. Light comes from the front, softly and evenly illuminating the figures and environment, creating a sense of everyday life. A realistic and slightly intimate atmosphere, with mainly black, white, and gray tones complemented by warm yellow tones from the wooden floor, creating distinct visual layers. The foreground features people and phones, the middle ground mirrors and their reflections, and the background walls and doors. The sense of space is clear, with natural transitions of light and shadow without strong shadows. The overall atmosphere is quiet and modern, as if capturing an ordinary yet confident moment. The images are rich in detail and authentic, combining fashion with the authenticity and warmth of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
