        {
          "id": "krea2-dcd8fa57466e4c1b78b59c69",
          "alias": "单女白内衣公寓坐",
          "prompt": "The ends are slightly voluminous, presenting a healthy and vibrant state, with a natural arc. She wears a white sports bra made of high-stretch knit fabric with subtle horizontal textures, a U-shaped neckline, a zipper decoration in the center, and the \"alo\" brand logo printed on the chest Repeatedly arranged on the belt, the font is simple and modern, the color is black, contrasting with the white clothes. Her abdomen is flat and firm, with faint muscle lines visible, showing a good figure. She wears off-white loose sweatpants with wide and comfortable legs, a drawstring design at the waist, and a tight hem made of soft material that drapes slightly. She sits cross-legged on the bed, leaning slightly forward, with arms naturally relaxed at her sides, hand posture natural, nails neatly trimmed, painted with transparent or light-colored nail polish. The background features a large bed covered with white sheets and quilts. The headboard is upholstered in off-white, with regular diamond-shaped stitching patterns on the surface. The texture is delicate, and the bed is soft with natural folds. On the left side of the bed is a warm yellow desk lamp, softly illuminating from the side, creating a warm light and shadow effect. The overall color scheme is mainly white and off-white, creating a clean, tranquil, and cozy atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot, with the person positioned slightly above the center of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The camera angle is slightly upright, highlighting the figure's figure and temperament. The foreground shows the bed and lower body, the middle is the upper body and part of the headboard, and the background is the wall and headboard. The layers are distinct, extending along the line of sight to the body lines, then returning to the overall environment. Light and shadow come from the desk lamp on the left, creating a soft side glow, while the left side has slight shadows that enhance the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and comfortable, as if sunlight streaming through the curtains into the room at dawn or dusk, or a home moment under the nighttime lights. The image texture is authentic and natural, with rich details and harmonious colors, presenting a relaxed yet aesthetically pleasing lifestyle in daily life. The photography style resembles everyday street photography or fashion bloggers' daily sharing, using a regular camera or mobile phone, with slight noise and natural exposure control, emphasizing realism and approachability without excessive retouching, preserving original light and texture",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
