        {
          "id": "krea2-b08151e17fbf83665e8941ec",
          "alias": "单女礼服客厅坐泼洒",
          "prompt": "An elegant woman sits upright on a modern minimalist living room sofa, wearing a delicate champagne-colored strapless gown. The upper part of the dress is made of lightweight tulle, with flowing ruffle decorations on the shoulders, presenting a romantic courtly style. The chest is adorned with delicate pleats and layered tulle bows, creating a soft yet layered visual effect. The dress is made of dense golden sequins, which shimmer with warm light as the light refracts like a river of stars pouring down the hem. The lower half features a multi-layered sheer mesh long dress, layered across the floor, forming a wide trailing tail. The hem edges curl slightly, adding a touch of liveliness and grace. Her legs are long and straight, naturally folded. She wears white high-heeled sandals adorned with sheer bows, echoing the gown style. The overall look is both luxurious and light, with fresh and natural makeup that exudes confidence and composure. In the background is a light gray fabric sofa, soft and finely textured. Several off-white cushions are placed on the sofa, one of which has a yellow lining exposed at the edge, adding a touch of warmth to the scene. Behind the sofa is a huge floor-to-ceiling window with bright light outside, creating a strong backlighting effect that softly outlines the figure's outline while producing slight halos and scattering, enhancing the dreamlike atmosphere. The composition centers on the figure, using a mid-angle perspective, with the figure occupying the main position, the body slightly tilted to one side, and the head slightly tilted, presenting elegant curves and posture. The foreground features scattered skirt hems and foot details, the middle ground shows the figure's entire body and parts of the sofa, and the background features blurred window frames and outdoor scenes. By controlling depth of field, the main body is highlighted, extending smoothly down to the legs and shoes, returning to the glamorous details of the overall garment. The light and shadow are handled with delicate detail, with the main light source coming from natural light outside the right window, creating a soft side light. At the same time, dotted reflections are created on the sequins of the dress, enhancing texture and dynamism. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and noble, with a strong fashion blockbuster feel. It feels like an indoor portrait shot with professional photography equipment, with the main colors of champagne, off-white, and light gray, accented with a touch of gold and yellow, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme that is both everyday and full of ritual",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
