        {
          "id": "krea2-fc7c7e54f9768ecbb7eb8efd",
          "alias": "单女白外套车内忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose white plush coat with a collar revealing the dark brown underneath. Her hands are folded on the gray metal armrests in front of her, fingers are long, nails neatly trimmed, and the edges of the sleeves are visible at her wrists. She slightly tilts her head, looking straight ahead. Her expression is slightly thoughtful, with an overall calmness tinged with a hint of melancholy and composure. The background is a blurry interior of the carriage, with soft natural light streaming through the window. The scenery outside blurs into a hazy shadow, with faint outlines of city streets and distant vehicles visible. The seats inside the carriage are made of light gray plastic, with curved armrests that are smooth and slightly reflective. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center-left position, head slightly tilted. The line of sight and camera create a subtle interaction. The left side of the frame leaves a large space, while the right side is occupied by the window and armrest, creating visual balance and guidance. The background shows a clear bokeh effect, with cool tones predominantly blending gray-blue, pale white, and warm brown, creating a quiet, detached, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. Light comes from the sides and above, soft and even, without strong shadows, highlighting three-dimensionality. The overall tone is cool with a slight film texture, fine graininess, and moderate color saturation. It presents a retro cinematic style, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. The lens focal length is about 50mm, aperture f/1.8, exposure is normal, shutter speed is moderate, and there are no obvious post-processing marks in the footage, preserving the natural feel of original photography. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, lonely, and gentle, full of the poetry of everyday life and a faint youthful vibe. It feels like a frozen commute moment, recording the deep reflections of city dwellers",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
