        {
          "id": "krea2-d128520720bd3284d33d575f",
          "alias": "单女街道冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "She wears black sunglasses on top of her head, with temples resting on her head. She firmly holds a silver retro-style mirrorless camera with the lens pointing forward, clearly showing the details of the body. She stands slightly to the side, her body slightly tilted. Her left hand rests on the railing, her right hand holding a camera, her posture elegant and relaxed, forming a striking contrast with the overall cool color scheme. She wears a delicate gold necklace, and the pendant is a simple round design, adding a touch of refinement. In the foreground is a black metal mesh railing with diamond-shaped perforated patterns, giving it a strong sense of texture. The middle shot features a female subject, occupying the main position. The composition uses a close-up portrait in the middle shot, with the figure fully presented from the waist upward. The background is a blurred city skyline, with several high-rise buildings faintly visible in the distance. The sky is pale grayish-white, with soft and even light, like scattered light in the morning or evening. The overall atmosphere is tranquil with a slight sense of urban detachment. The light and shadow come from the upper front, with light shadows and no strong contrast. The colors are mainly white and black, accented with red lipstick and gold necklaces. The camera serves as one of the visual focal points, hinting at the photography theme. The entire scene presents a sense of moments captured in everyday life, as if taken with amateur equipment, capturing real street scenes with a sense of life and artistic beauty. The lens uses an 85mm prime portrait lens, with a shallow depth of field effect that highlights the subject. The background is naturally blurred, and the edges of the frame are slightly darkened to enhance the sense of center focus. The overall tone is cool but still warm, conveying a quiet, independent, and confident feminine temperament. The composition is balanced, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, leaving space on the left side to extend the gaze into the background city, creating a sense of openness. The details are rich, and the image is realistic and delicate.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
