        {
          "id": "krea2-cecccbd42d4a2cd6925c41e1",
          "alias": "单女红高领衫雪地冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the snow, wearing a red turtleneck knit sweater and a plaid pleated mini skirt. She stands sideways, her posture elegant and natural. Her right hand gently lifts the hem of her skirt, revealing her long legs. The overall look is fresh and sweet, with a hint of youthful energy. The background is a hillside covered in thick snow, with two towering power towers and dense forests visible in the distance. The sky is clear and cloudless, with bright sunshine. Light shines from the upper right, casting soft shadows on the snow. The sweater's texture is clearly visible, and the plaid skirt's pattern is layered. The snowy surface has slight undulations and light and shadow changes. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the frame, leaving space on the right to showcase the open snowy landscape and distant views. The foreground is a vast expanse of pure white snow, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background features a power tower and forest, creating a strong contrast of depth between front and back. The visual guide line extends from the character's line of sight into the distance, enhancing the sense of space and depth in the composition. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and warm, with the golden glow of winter sunlight shining on the snow contrasting sharply with the cool-toned snowy landscape. It creates a poetic beauty that is both cool and warm, as if a moment frozen on a cold afternoon. The camera captures a daily portrait full of everyday life, shot with a professional camera, offering excellent image quality and detail expression. Color saturation is moderate, contrast is natural, and the image is clean and crisp without unnecessary distractions, presenting a realistic yet slightly artistic style. The lighting is soft yet layered, shadow transitions are smooth, the contours of the subjects are clear, and the wrinkles of clothing and the texture of the snow are all clearly visible The entire scene gives off a sense of tranquility, purity, and hope, like a touch of warmth in winter, allowing people to feel the beauty and gentleness of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
