        {
          "id": "krea2-c5ff7746d4e760efd3c3278b",
          "alias": "单女制服城市过肩",
          "prompt": "A female model wore a school uniform style of a white shirt and a blue-and-white plaid pleated skirt, paired with a dark blue hoodie casually draped over her shoulders. She sat sideways on the edge of the open trunk of a light blue new energy vehicle, her left hand holding the inside of the tailgate, right leg bent and toes touching the ground, her posture elegant and dynamic. The overall look blended youthful campus vibes with modern technology. The car is a compact electric sedan with a futuristic design, featuring a metallic light blue paint and smooth rear lines. The taillights feature a through-type LED design, and when lit, they appear as red light strips. The trunk interior is spacious and tidy, with visible interior details. The rear is marked \"M03,\" set against the backdrop of a large auto show hall. The tall industrial-style ceiling structure is clearly visible, filled with lighting fixtures and booth brackets. In the distance, a blurry display panel features blue glowing text and patterns, with other visitors' silhouettes faintly visible. The composition centers on the people, using a medium perspective, with the figures occupying the main positions. As an important element in the front of the car, its opened trunk forms a natural frame structure that guides the gaze to focus on the subject. The background blur emphasizes the subject, and the shallow depth of field effect enhances spatial layering. Light comes from multiple sets of professional lighting equipment at the top of the showroom, creating a uniform and soft top glow. Meanwhile, the taillights provide localized warm light sources, creating a contrasting atmosphere of light and shadow. The overall color scheme is dominated by blue, supplemented by white, gray, and black, creating a fresh and bright visual effect that retains a technological feel. The images present a realistic texture reminiscent of everyday shooting, as if captured by amateur photography equipment. Slight noise and natural exposure transitions enhance the sense of presence, the composition is balanced and stable, with natural interaction between people and vehicles. The booth elements in the background are rich but not cluttered, creating an overall atmosphere that combines futuristic and youthful energy, full of urban fashion flair, suitable for automotive brand promotion or youth culture-themed displays",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
