        {
          "id": "krea2-3457e197ffbde58d618e8d84",
          "alias": "单女红高跟鞋城市沉思注视",
          "prompt": "The hem is light and flowing, showing natural pleats. The length reaches the knees, highlighting her long legs. She wears a pair of bright red high heels, with smooth, reflective uppers and stiletto heels highlighting her graceful posture. Her expression is calm and slightly thoughtful, holding a bouquet of pale pink and white flowers. The bouquet is set off by green leaves, giving a fresh and natural look. She carries a small black chain bag on her shoulder. The bag body is small and exquisite, with a metallic sheen on the chain. The foreground features a street-paved stone pavement, with clear light and shadow changes on the ground. Her shadow is elongated and projected onto the ground, intertwining with the surrounding shadows to create an interesting visual layer. In the center is a large black flower box, with golden \"JR\" lettering printed on its surface. Inside the flower box are lush greenery and blooming red flowers. Above the flower box hang down from vines, with lush branches and leaves. A few clusters of red flowers are dotted with them, adding a touch of vitality and romance. The windows are neatly arranged, some with black wrought iron railings. In the distance, you can see classic-style street lamps with glass covers, exuding a retro charm. The sky is a clear blue with no clouds. Sunlight streams down from the upper right, creating a bright and warm light that creates a strong contrast of light and shadow. The figures cast clear shadows on the ground and create a sense of three-dimensionality and spatial depth. The composition uses a three-part method, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the right side of the frame, body slightly turned and head turned to the left, with the gaze extending beyond the frame. The left side has more blank space, creating a sense of balance and highlighting the main subject. The overall color scheme is harmonious, with off-white, red, green, and blue as the main tones. The warm and bright tones are full of the atmosphere of summer afternoon life. The lighting effects are delicate and realistic, with sunlight filtering through leaves creating mottled light and shadow on the ground, enhancing the scene's realism and atmosphere. The overall composition presents an elegant Quiet yet full of urban romance, everyday moments resemble a street photography work shot with a professional camera, featuring a film texture and slight graininess. The lens focuses on the subject's entire body, with a slightly blurred background to highlight the subject. Slight vignetting at the edges of the frame enhances cinematic feel and artistic atmosphere. The overall style blends fashion photography with lifestyle aesthetics, conveying a gentle, composed, and tasteful modern female image",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
