        {
          "id": "krea2-f73b93f8dab28bd24b47ab2a",
          "alias": "单女蓝高领衫泳池愤怒倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a deep blue turtleneck swimsuit, gracefully leaning against the edge of the infinity pool. Her skin glows healthily under the sunlight, and she wears a simple silver necklace around her neck. The swimsuit design is bold, with a deep V-neck accentuating graceful curves. Her chest is full and perky, her waist slender, and her overall body proportions are perfect, presenting a healthy and sexy aesthetic. Her environment is an infinity pool atop a high-rise building. The water is crystal clear, the pool walls paved with blue-green tiles, shimmering and reflecting the sky and surrounding scenery. In the middle is Dubai's iconic skyscraper complex, with numerous supertall buildings, including the Burj Khalifa, standing neatly along the coastline. The complex features glass curtain walls that reflect soft sunlight. Displays silver-gray, light blue, and white tones. Some buildings feature unique spire designs on top, set against the vast Arabian Gulf waters. The sea displays a gradient of emerald green and blue, dotted with several artificial islands. The most striking is the outline of Palm Island, surrounded by dense residential and commercial buildings. The city's architecture stretches to the distant horizon, with a slightly misty sky showing a transition between pale blue and gray-white. The clouds are sparse, and the light is bright but not glaring, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and luxurious. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying the lower left of the frame, the body extending diagonally to create dynamic balance. The edge lines of the infinity pool extend from the lower left corner to the upper right, creating a strong sense of perspective. The city skyline in the background is arranged in the upper middle of the frame, forming a distinctly layered spatial structure. The pool surface contrasts with the figure's body, while the building cluster in the middle and the bay in the distance together create a sense of expansive space. Light and shadow come from the west side of noon, with sunlight streaming down from the upper right. At the same time, light shadows are cast along the pool's edges and the sides of the buildings, creating a sense of depth. The water's reflections are clear, enhancing realism. The overall color scheme is mainly blue, from the deep blue of the swimsuits to the pool's blue-green, then the light blue of the sky and ocean, forming a harmonious and unified color scheme. Complemented by the cool gray of the building and the warm yellow tones of the ground, it enhances visual richness. The image is full of modern urban fashion and the comfort of vacation life, with a high-end photographic quality, as if shot with a professional full-frame camera. Using a large-aperture lens to capture delicate depth of field effects, with a focal length of about 85mm, f/2.8 aperture, shutter speed of 1/125 sec, ISO 100, automatic white balance adjustment, rich image details, clear textures, realistic water droplet transparency and reflection, and a warm and relaxed overall atmosphere, conveying a fusion of high-end lifestyle aesthetics and personal charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
