        {
          "id": "krea2-5b9b1859232649e38a0ebd5e",
          "alias": "单女霓虹夜景沉思倚靠",
          "prompt": "Her expression is calm and thoughtful, her hands lightly resting on the handles of the suitcase, her posture elegant and relaxed, her body slightly leaning forward, presenting a quiet sense of waiting. In the foreground, the edges of blurred dark objects may be architectural structures or obstructions, forming a natural frame composition. In the middle is a clear female figure and the red suitcase. The suitcase is made of bright red hardshell material, featuring metal pull rods and wheels, echoing the colors of the characters' clothing. The background is a city street at night, with towering buildings and soft lighting. Distant building outlines are blurred, and neon and streetlights form circular light spots of varying sizes, presenting a typical shallow depth of field blur effect. The overall color tone leans warm, mainly orange-yellow and dark red, creating a cozy and slightly nostalgic urban night atmosphere. The composition uses low-angle downward shots to highlight the characters, with foreground occlusion and mid-field focusing, The background blur creates a strong sense of layering, with visual guidance moving from the blurred foreground area into the clear subject in the middle ground, then extending to the background bokeh light points, creating a visual flow from near to far. Light and shadow mainly come from surrounding streetlights and internal building sources, creating a delicate transition between light and shadow. The shadows naturally blend into the environment without forced contrast. The overall atmosphere blends the leisure of daily life with the refinement of artistic photography, as if capturing a traveler's brief pause. It combines the texture of real shooting with cinematic narrative quality simulates slight noise and film graininess at high ISO performance in professional cameras, enhancing realism while preserving detail clarity. It presents the natural light and shadow effects of amateur cameras using full-frame cameras like the Canon EOS R5 or Sony A7R IV handheld shooting at night. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with an f/1.8 aperture, achieving extreme background blur. There are no watermarks or text marks in the frame, conveying emotion solely through color, composition, and light and shadow. It conveys a subtle emotion about departure and return, like a city nightwalker seeking a moment of tranquility amid the noise, filled with poetic loneliness and anticipation. The overall style combines the aesthetic qualities of Japanese photoshoot and Western street photography, blending everyday life with artistic tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
