        {
          "id": "krea2-7ef1dcea424e67a1bfab00bd",
          "alias": "单女毛衣小径坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a light gray carpet, her body slightly turned to the camera, sitting cross-legged in a naturally relaxed posture. She wears a loose knit sweater with white underwear and black horizontal stripes, featuring prominent stripes on the sleeves and hem. She wears a white crew-neck base shirt underneath, and a black pleated mini skirt paired with black stockings. Her feet are bare, and her toes are clearly visible. She holds a blue vintage film camera in her right hand, with the word \"Kodak\" printed on it. Her left hand rests gently on her knee, fingers naturally bent, her posture elegant but not pretentious. In the background is a simple light beige fabric sofa with soft lines, a smooth surface without wrinkles, and beside it sits a black matte shoulder bag, compact with a slender strap, placed at an angle on the carpet. Next to it is an open book or magazine, with slightly curled edges, hinting at the marks of just reading. The entire scene is indoors, with pure white walls, clean and unadorned, and a spacious and quiet space. Light softly streams in from the left side of the image, forming a uniform diffused glow that illuminates the subject and the surrounding environment. The transition of light and shadow is natural, without strong shadows, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The foreground shows her legs and feet, clearly visible; the middle view shows her upper body and the movements of the handheld camera; the background features elements of daily life such as sofas, backpacks, and books. The layers are distinct, forming a coherent visual path. The colors are mainly black, white, and gray, accented with blue cameras and black accessories, creating a striking yet harmonious unity. The overall atmosphere is warm, artistic, and full of life, as if capturing a moment of daily life, like real photos taken with an old camera. It has a slight grainy texture and film texture, with a slightly warm yellow tone, rich details but not overly sharp, presenting a rustic and authentic beauty. The images convey a tranquil sense of youthful memories, allowing people to experience the joy of photography and the beauty of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
