        {
          "id": "krea2-0ad6893240eb2bc744c86a79",
          "alias": "单女制服教室害羞持镜",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style school uniform wears an off-white knit cardigan, paired with a white shirt and a black bow tie. She wears a dark plaid pleated skirt below. Her overall look is youthful and neat, with a slightly shy and contemplative expression, and her movements are natural and graceful, as if preparing to welcome a new day or recalling an important moment. On the left side of the painting is her reflection in the mirror, creating a semi-transparent blur effect that enhances the sense of space and realism. In the foreground is her clear frontal image, occupying the center of the scene. The middle view is the classroom's interior, where wooden desks and chairs are neatly arranged, the tabletop is smooth and the lines are simple, and the background is a bright window, letting in soft natural light to create a warm backlighting effect. The window frame divides the light into geometric shapes, creating a tranquil atmosphere. The entire scene is enveloped in a faint warm yellow tone, with light and shadow streaming in from outside, highlighting three-dimensionality and texture. The composition uses a symmetrical layout, with the figure centered and mirrored reflections creating visual balance. Shooting with a large aperture lens and shallow depth of field blurs the background. Highlights the main subject while retaining some classroom elements as environmental clues. The colors are mainly off-white, light brown, dark gray, and black, paired with warm sunshine tones, creating a fresh, nostalgic, and slightly melancholic Japanese campus atmosphere. The images have a film-like texture, slight graininess, and color shifts, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting. The lighting is soft and not glaring, emphasizing the beauty of everyday moments, presenting an overall image style that is tranquil, gentle, and full of youthful energy. It seemed to capture an ordinary yet touching moment of an ordinary student tidying up their appearance alone after school",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
