        {
          "id": "krea2-7a79e41645852ee1a2fea29e",
          "alias": "单女红泳装浴室媚态坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in front of a modern-style bathroom mirror, wearing a bright red one-piece swimsuit. The camera module on the back of the phone is clearly visible, with the screen showing 9:02. The person is positioned slightly to the left in the center of the foreground, slightly tilted, with her right leg bent and raised, knee close to her chest. Her posture is elegant and confident, with makeup refined but not exaggerated. The overall look exudes a blend of fashion and sensuality. The background features a wall covered with white marble-textured tiles, with gray patterns winding and interlacing, giving it a premium feel. On the right is a glass shower with a black frame, equipped with circular LED light rings and a black ceiling shower, softly illuminating the entire space. Below the mirror is a horizontally extended white countertop, with evenly embedded LED light strips along the edges that emit cool white light, providing the main light source for the scene while enhancing the space's modern and technological feel. Above the countertop is a black square installation. It may be a smart sensor or control panel, with well-handled details. The composition uses a symmetrical layout, with the subject centered slightly to the left, forming a visual focal point. The mirror reflection fully presents the environmental structure, adding depth and layering to the image. Light shines from above and at the bottom of the countertop, creating soft shadows and strong three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is clean, bright, and modern, with a touch of privacy and everyday life, as if you could casually capture a real-life moment in a home bathroom with a high-end smartphone. It has a strong sense of everyday realism and artistic beauty, with mainly white, gray, and red tones that create sharp contrasts, strong visual impact, and rich details. From the tiny cracks on tiles to the metallic sheen of a phone and the texture of human skin, everything is rendered with great delicacy, creating an atmosphere that is both intimate and fashionable. The images convey a self-expression, confident, and independent attitude toward life, like a carefully composed yet authentic social media photo. It captures moments of contemporary urban youth expressing their self-image in private spaces, brimming with modern aesthetics and personal charm.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
