        {
          "id": "krea2-bfa1c951364a34716c700296",
          "alias": "单女黑外套小巷忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a narrow and deep alley, wearing a loose long black coat with thick fabric and subtle textures. The cuffs are slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists. Her hands are tucked into her coat pockets, her posture relaxed yet slightly detached, appearing natural and unforced. Her expression is calm yet tinged with a hint of melancholy and contemplation, as if pondering something. In the shadows, a delicate texture is presented. The overall temperament is quiet and restrained, like a serene portrait in the city, with a close-up of her body in the foreground, occupying the right side of the painting from the waist upward, forming a visual focal point. The background is a deep, long-extending old alley, flanked on both sides by weathered walls and wooden structures. The walls are covered with traces of time, with parts of the walls peeling away revealing brick and stone. Above, interlaced wires and pipes hang intricately in the air, creating a chaotic beauty where industry and life intertwine. At the end of the distant alley, faint architectural outlines and a half-open door can be seen. Light streams down from above the alley, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. Several beams of golden sunlight pass through the gaps and cast on the floor and walls, creating warm and layered light spots. Light and shadow cut like blades in the dark alley, creating dramatic visual tension. The composition uses the classic three-part method: the figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, leaving a large negative space on the left to guide the gaze deeper. At the same time, the see-through lines of the alley are used to enhance the sense of spatial depth, creating a strong visual guidance. The light mainly comes from the upper right, creating a side backlight effect that outlines the edges of the figure with bright outline light. It enhances three-dimensionality and avoids overexposure. The background is in deep shadows, details gradually blur, creating a blurred depth of field that highlights the subject. The overall color scheme is mainly dark gray, ink black, and brown, accented by warm yellow sunlight. The strong contrast between hot and cool colors creates a lonely, tranquil, and story-rich atmosphere. The image texture is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and retro tones, simulating the texture of medium format cameras or 35mm film shooting. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens. With an aperture of f1.8, it creates a shallow depth of field effect. The overall image has a cinematic narrative quality, like a momentarily frozen urban poetic fragment, conveying a modern aesthetic of solitude as people seek inner peace amid the hustle and bustle of the city",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
