        {
          "id": "krea2-5813f09caf5ade51565bdc35",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣沙发沉思坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the edge of a light-colored fabric sofa, her body slightly turned to the right side of the frame, legs naturally folded and hanging down, presenting an elegant and relaxed posture. She wears a dark brown ribbed knit short cardigan with white buttons on the collar, black high-waisted shorts, transparent stockings, and gray pointed flats. Her right hand gently holds a transparent glass wine glass filled with clear liquid, while her left hand holds a transparent glass mineral water bottle with a silver cap. On her wrist, she wears a thin black wristband that naturally falls over her shoulder The expression is slightly contemplative and serene, and the overall posture exudes a restrained laziness. In the foreground is the soft backrest of the sofa and the smooth cushion surface, with light creating gentle ripples and shadows on the fabric. In the middle is the main figure and the two glass vessels they hold. The glass is translucent, reflecting subtle light spots from the surrounding environment. The background is a simple indoor space, the walls are light gray-white, and hanging is an abstract art painting showing a blurred black-and-white contrast of a portrait. The floor is covered with a black-and-white geometric carpet. The pattern consists of continuous curves with a modern feel. The composition adopts a slightly top-down perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the frame, forming the visual center. The right side space is reserved to enhance the sense of balance. The lines of the figure's legs guide the line of the figure from the lower left corner to the upper right, creating a dynamic sense of flow. Light and shadow come from the front left of the image, creating soft side lighting. Shadows are concentrated behind the sofa and on the floor, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and spatial depth. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and full of everyday life. The color palette mainly blends neutral warm and cool tones, with brown, black, gray, and white complementing each other, creating an unintentional beauty in daily life. It feels like a private moment taken with a regular camera—authentic and natural, without excessive embellishment, yet full of artistic tension. The image details are rich, from the sheen of stockings to the reflections of glass, as well as fabric textures and carpet patterns, all clearly visible, presenting a high-resolution texture expression. The overall style leans toward a fusion of realism and modern minimalist aesthetics, balancing everyday life and aesthetics. It conveys a sense of tranquility and self-reflection for urban women during solitary moments.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
