        {
          "id": "krea2-0b3c0fadecc0ab37e3569a30",
          "alias": "单女米衬衫室内忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She slightly tilts her head back to gaze out the window, as if gazing into some unknown distant scene, adding a touch of laziness and casualness. She wears a loose light beige shirt with a slightly open neckline revealing a slender neck and collarbones. Her overall posture is elegant and relaxed. The main subject is positioned slightly in the center of the left side, with a close-up composition that is not fully filled, leaving some breathing room. In the foreground, a layer of blurred glass reflections and water droplets forms a hazy visual barrier, as if shot through a damp window glass. Water stains and mottled light on the glass add depth and realism to the image, while also creating a subtle atmosphere of isolation yet closeness. Light streams in from the right side, with a hint of pink, making it warm and full of life. The background is blurred, faintly revealing greenery and blurred architectural outlines outside. Light filters through the leaves and casts dappled shadows, creating a bokeh effect. This enhances the sense of spatial depth in the composition. The entire scene is set in an indoor environment, possibly by the window of a café or cabin. The composition adopts an asymmetrical layout, with the main subject slightly tilted, breaking conventional symmetrical beauty and bringing a dynamic balance. The visual guiding lines are formed by the woman's gestures and the direction of the gaze, forming a smooth arc that guides the viewer's attention step by step. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly warm white, with soft and even lighting without strong contrasts of light and shadow, creating a sense of tranquility and warmth. The slightly melancholic afternoon vibe has a soft, elegant overall tone with a slight vintage film texture. Color saturation is low but retains rich layering of detail. There are some natural noise points and slight overexposure areas in the frame, simulating the realism of everyday camera shooting. The lens focal length is 85mm prime with an aperture set to f/1.8, achieving an extremely shallow depth of field, completely blurring the background and highlighting the subject, while preserving tiny water droplets and reflection details on the foreground glass. The shooting angle is slightly upright. It enhances the three-dimensionality and emotional tension of the characters, blending Japanese photo shoots, artistic tranquility, and everyday documentary elements, presenting a gentle, restrained, and story-rich visual language. It is suitable for expressing themes such as youth, loneliness, contemplation, or nostalgia. The image texture is delicate, the transitions of light and shadow are natural, and it has strong artistic appeal and immersive viewing experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
