        {
          "id": "krea2-4bcf573bd59222dd61ed5f5b",
          "alias": "单女橙连衣裙水边冷淡站立手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a tranquil lakeside, wearing an orange off-shoulder ruffled dress. The fabric is light and flowing, with a waist design that is elastic and the hem hangs naturally. One side lifts slightly to reveal the long lines of her legs. Her expression is focused and calm, her hands hanging naturally—one gently holding the hem of the skirt, the other hanging at her side. Her posture is elegant and relaxed. She stands at the edge of a thick tree trunk or wooden stump, her body slightly tilted, forming a natural S-shaped curve. The background is a dense green forest, tall and upright. The branches and leaves are lush, sunlight filtering through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled shadows. The lake water is crystal clear, with fine ripples on the surface, reflecting the sky and surrounding greenery. Along the shore, lush aquatic plants such as reeds and cattails sway gently in the wind. Light streams in from the upper left of the painting, creating a soft backlighting effect. The figure's outline is outlined by a golden halo, creating a sense of three-dimensionality. The overall composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly in the center on the right side of the painting, while the left side is left with ample space to display the lake and the distant forest, creating visual balance The foreground features water and some plants, the middle features figures and nearby tree trunks, and the background features deep forests and distant mountain silhouettes. The clear layers enhance the spatial sense and storytelling of the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, carrying the lazy mood of a summer afternoon. The colors are mainly warm orange and fresh green, with harmonious contrasts of cool and warm tones and natural transitions of light and shadow. The image has a cinematic texture, as if capturing a fleeting moment of natural beauty. The details are rich and realistic, like outdoor portraits taken with professional photography equipment. At the same time, it preserves a natural, everyday state, allowing people to feel a peaceful blend of youth and nature",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
