        {
          "id": "krea2-bb181a754c810c8c7f76f844",
          "alias": "单女白T恤地牢愤怒站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a tree-lined path, standing sideways, slightly lowering her head to gaze at the smartwatch on her wrist. Her expression is focused and calm, adding a touch of laziness and naturalness. She wears a simple white sleeveless tank top and light-colored denim shorts, paired with brown lace-up canvas shoes, and carries a bright yellow backpack. The backpack's color stands out against the green background. Her left hand grips the handlebars of a bicycle, while her right hand operates the watch, her posture relaxed and genuine. Beside him parked was a white road bike. The frame was slender, the wheels light, and the rear seat had a red taillight and black mudguard. A small metal bottle cage hung on the bike, rich in detail and full of life. In the background was a dense forest, sunlight filtering through layers of leaves, casting mottled light and shadows, forming soft and layered light spots. The shadows cast long shadows on the ground, creating a quiet and warm afternoon atmosphere. The entire path was paved with gray cement, clean and tidy. On both sides are lush vegetation, with faint shadows and tree outlines in the distance, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the left side, body slightly tilted, forming a natural visual guiding line. From the movements of the figure's hands to the bicycle and the depth of the background, the viewer's gaze is drawn to explore into the distance. Light comes from the upper right, typical natural daylight—bright but not glaring, presenting a soft golden tone. At the same time, clear shadows are cast on the ground and bicycle, with sharp light and shadow contrasts, highlighting three-dimensionality and texture. The overall color scheme is dominated by green, paired with white, yellow, and brown, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme that creates a fresh, natural, and leisurely summer atmosphere. The image has a strong sense of realism and life, as if captured with a regular camera or phone, with slight lens distortion and natural noise. Without excessive retouching, it preserves authentic graininess and color transitions, giving a sense of familiarity and authenticity. It feels close to everyday life, with balanced and dynamic composition. The foreground features clear figures and bicycles, the middle shot's path and light gradients are natural, and the background trees are well rendered with blur, creating a good depth of field. The entire composition conveys a slow-paced lifestyle, full of youth, freedom, and tranquility, like a brief pause, capturing moments of contemplation and relaxation during cycling. The visual guidance is smooth, emotional expression is delicate, and the atmosphere is warm and poetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
