          "id": "krea2-5c617ec8aee74e9daf0c604c",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣桥冷淡站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the metal railing of a city overpass, wearing a light blue plush knit cardigan adorned with a row of pearl buttons, paired with a white knit vest and blue jeans, tied with a black belt at the waist. The overall look is fresh and natural, with a touch of artistic flair. Her right hand gently holds the handle of a pink shopping bag, while her left hand gently tugs at the collar. Her posture is casual yet elegant, exuding an effortless beauty. The background is blurred green trees and a distant stairway, with sunlight streaming down from above. A soft backlight effect is created in the composition, with light filtering through the gaps in the leaves, creating a warm and hazy atmosphere. The sky displays a faint grayish-white tone, contrasting with the surrounding environment. On the left, a dark utility pole and vines entwined around it can be seen; on the right is a concrete pedestrian bridge wall with mottled marks and graffiti. The ground is cement with clearly visible grain, and the composition uses a centered composition. This creates a strong visual focal point. The bright pink shopping bag in the foreground contrasts sharply with the cool-toned clothing, becoming a visual highlight. The middle shot centers on the figure, with the background gradually blurring to highlight the main subject. The distant view extends to the distant stairs and dense greenery, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from above, creating a soft top light. The shadows are delicate, with subtle highlights transitioning around the shoulders and neck. The plush texture of the clothing appears especially soft and fluffy under the light. The overall color palette leans warm, mainly off-white, light blue, and pink, accented with green and gray, creating a peaceful, gentle, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The image has a slight film graininess and color shift, simulating the authentic texture of everyday amateur photography. The lens uses an 85mm prime portrait lens with a small aperture, presenting beautiful bokeh effects in the background. The overall style leans toward Japanese photography, full of life and artistic beauty, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment",
