        {
          "id": "krea2-17abaa320817cfabfb36c807",
          "alias": "单女米外套街道忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a damp asphalt pavement, looking at the camera with a hint of laziness and playfulness, exuding a gentle and confident expression. She wears a light beige lightweight jacket made of light and flowing material, with black zippers and detailed decorations. She wears a white fitted sports tank top with black trim at the neckline. She wears bright orange-red loose sweatpants, with the cuff of the pant legs tied with a matching cord to create natural pleats. On his feet, he wears a pair of white platform sneakers, with the upper covered in colorful graffiti-style patterns, interwoven in green, yellow, and red tones. The soles are green, giving the whole look a stylish and dynamic vibe, full of street fashion vibes. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, sitting with legs bent, body slightly leaned forward, and head slightly lowered, creating a very approachable visual impression. The foreground is a damp, reflective gray road surface with a rough texture, visible fine particles and water stains. The center is the main figure, and the background is a rounded gray stone platform. The surface has natural textures, with blurred white road markings extending into the distance. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure occupying the main position. The perspective of near and far is emphasized, while the tilt adds dynamism. Through hand movements and clothing details, the movement extends to the ground and background elements, creating a smooth flow of vision. The light is soft and even, like natural light on a cloudy or early morning day, without strong shadows, making the figure's outline clear and colors faithful. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is tranquil yet slightly melancholic, with the overall color scheme dominated by gray, white, orange, and green, creating a vivid contrast of warm and cool tones, creating an atmosphere where everyday life and artistic vibe coexist on urban streets. The image texture is delicate, with slight film graininess and realistic camera noise, simulating professional photography effects. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, characters are sharp and clear, and the background is moderately blurred, enhancing spatial layering. Overall, it presents a modern youth image that combines the vibe of daily life with aesthetic aesthetics. It seems to capture an ordinary yet touching moment, allowing people to feel the freedom and freedom of youth",
