        {
          "id": "krea2-8c66f005f25fed9d225f3ef0",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙屋顶沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a traditional Japanese tiled roof, her expression revealing a subtle detachment and contemplative temperament. She wears a blue floral spaghetti strap dress with patterns composed of delicate yellow and white flowers. The fabric is light and flowing, with slightly pleated hems that reveal a natural crease texture. The slender straps outline the collarbones, and she sits cross-legged, knees slightly bent, hands naturally resting on the knees or gently resting on the tiles, her posture relaxed yet elegant. On her feet are classic white canvas shoes. The shoelaces are tied into a standard bow, with slight wear on the upper showing a realistic everyday feel. The tiles are dark gray, with a weathered texture that shows the erosion of time. The edges are slightly rough, neatly arranged but with slight undulation, forming wavy geometric lines. The background is an old concrete wall covered with weathering and moss spots, with a grayish-brown color and a rough texture. On the left side is a white metal grille window with a straight frame and clear grid structure, emitting bright light and creating a strong contrast between light and dark. The overall composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame. The line of sight meets the camera's gaze, creating direct emotional exchange. The foreground features nearby tile details with clear textures, the middle ground features the main figure and part of the roof, and the background features walls and windows. The layers are distinct and the sense of space is strong. Light comes from the upper left, representing natural light. Sunlight casts strip-like shadows through the grille, creating a soft transition between highlights and shadows. The contrast is sharp but not abrupt, creating a warm and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly blue, gray, and white, accented with yellow and white floral patterns, creating a harmonious and unified color. The image has the grainy texture and slight color shifts of film photography, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, presenting a retro documentary style. The visual path extends along the line of sight to the body and surrounding environment, returning to the texture details of the tiles, forming a circular visual path. The overall atmosphere is quiet and serene, with a touch of solitude and poetry, as if capturing deep emotions in an ordinary moment, full of life and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
