        {
          "id": "krea2-8f1bef8df728af9557ca4de2",
          "alias": "单女白内衣街道媚态倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman leans confidently against the front of a vintage brown Chevrolet, dressed in a white short-sleeved tight top and high-waisted white underwear, showcasing a slender and curvy figure. Her left arm hangs naturally, her hand lightly touches the front of the car, her right leg bent and lifted to step on the bumper, and she wears high-top riding boots with black-and-white spotted cowhide texture. The boots have a classic design with a Western style, with obvious wear marks and a leather texture on the shaft. She is also holding a black wide-brimmed hat with a slightly slanted brim. The overall posture is full of power and sensual tension. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with the car occupying nearly half of the left side. The body is brown, with slight scratches and signs of age. The chrome grille and headlight details are clearly visible, the license plate displays \"217,\" and the front end lines are smooth, showing features of 1960s American muscle cars. The background is a winding country road with gray asphalt and white solid lines along the edges. The road extends into the distance, with several modern vehicles parked on the right. Including SUVs and sedans, creating a contrast between old and new. Along the roadside are dense green trees and shrubs, with lush branches and foliage forming a natural barrier. In the distance, utility poles and sparse hill outlines can be seen. The sky is grayish-white, clouds are thick, and the light is soft and even, presenting diffuse light effects on cloudy or misty days. The composition uses a low-angle shooting angle to enhance the visual pressure and presence of the characters. The character and car form a strong geometric diagonal relationship, then turn toward the front of the car to create a dynamic sense of flow. The colors are mainly earth tones, with brown, white, black, and green forming a harmonious yet restrained palette. The light and shadow are delicate, shadows are soft, and the surface reflects naturally, creating a retro film photography texture. It feels like shooting outdoors with an old 35mm film camera, with slight graininess and fading effects. The tone is slightly warm and saturated, blending everyday street vibes with artistic portraiture, conveying a free, rebellious, vintage, and sexy female image. The footage isn't deliberately staged; instead, it feels like a capture of real moments from real life, with the realism and warmth of amateur equipment, as if it comes from a photographer's hidden travel diary. Every detail carries stories and emotions, making it unforgettable",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
