        {
          "id": "krea2-2fc5b57cfb51b60decd9ef7b",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫办公室严肃坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a black leather office chair, her body slightly turned to the camera, her right hand lightly resting on the chair's backrest, her left hand naturally resting on the wooden tabletop. She wears a pristine white long-sleeved shirt with a slightly open collar and cascading cuffs. The hem of the shirt is tucked into a fitted gray pencil mini skirt, which reaches just below the thighs, outlining a long, well-proportioned leg line. Her legs are crossed and stacked, with the left leg on top and right leg below. Her ankles are naturally curved, wearing sheer black stockings, with her toes slightly raised. The overall posture is relaxed yet dignified. The background is a simple, pure white wall with a flat surface without any decoration, with even, soft lighting and rich layering of light and shadow. On the right side of the painting, a slight shadow is cast on the wall, enhancing the spatial sense of depth. In the foreground is a corner of the wooden tabletop, with clear wood grain and smooth rounded edges, echoing the curved armrests of the black chair. In the middle is the female subject and office chair. The chair's backrest is tall and full, the cushion thick, and the armrests are made of dark brown solid wood with a smooth shape. The legs are metal frames with adjustable air pressure rods, making the structure clearly visible. The background is a clean white wall with no cluttered elements, making the subject stand out. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, shot from low angles upward to enhance the visual impact of the figures while maintaining the image's balance. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving a blank space on the right to create a sense of breathing. The visual guide line is the curve of the body's body and arms and leg extensions, guiding the gaze from the head down to the feet, creating a flowing visual path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is quiet and professional, with a cool and austere feel of a modern office. The overall color scheme is dominated by black, white, and gray, accented with warm wood tones. The color coordination is harmonious and unified, resulting in a delicate image texture that feels like shooting with a high-end camera, while retaining the realism of everyday amateur equipment, such as slight noise, soft out-of-focus blur, and natural exposure control, presenting an artistic style that is both refined and close to everyday life. Set in a minimalist indoor office environment, possibly a private office or small studio, the overall atmosphere is quiet, focused, and slightly private, suitable for expressing the independence, confidence, and inner charm of professional women",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
