        {
          "id": "krea2-42ab71817e67b6d573caebac",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙城市忧伤站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways atop a mountaintop, her expression revealing a calmness and faint melancholy. Her body leans slightly forward, as if listening to the wind or pondering something. She is draped in a thick plaid blanket, mainly in red, blue, off-white, and dark brown, featuring classic Scottish plaid patterns with tassel trim. The blanket naturally drapes over her shoulders and back, gently swaying in the breeze, revealing a soft texture and warm embrace. She wears a light-colored long dress with a light texture, It stands in stark contrast to the heavy blanket, highlighting a visual tension where warmth and cool intertwine. In the foreground are blurred wild grasses and low vegetation, with leaves scattered and displaying layers of deep green and brown under the dim light. Some plant stems and flower spikes are outlined softly by the backlight, adding a touch of natural wildness and authenticity to the scene. The middle ground features rolling mountains, layer upon layer extending into the distance. The mountain silhouettes appear hazy and profound at dusk, with colors gradually transitioning from deep green to gray-blue from near to far, finally merging into the skyline. This creates a strong sense of depth, with a vast sky in the background and rich color layers, ranging from warm orange and pink near the horizon to pale purple and light blue above, creating a gentle and tranquil atmosphere unique to dusk. The composition uses the rule of thirds: the figure is positioned on the left third of the painting, facing right, with the gaze directed toward a wide distant view, creating a balanced and dynamic visual structure. At the same time, the use of spatial blank space and progressive layers makes the composition more breathable and expansive. Visual guidance creates an emotional extension and imaginative space through the postures of the figures and the direction of the gaze. The overall light and shadow atmosphere is soft and delicate. The sun is close to the horizon, and the light is warm but weak, marking the end of the golden hour. The outlines are clear, and the shadows transition naturally without strong contrast. The folds of the blanket show subtle changes in light and shadow, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and material expression. The color transitions in the sky are smooth, the clouds are thin and almost invisible, further reinforcing the purity of the image. The overall atmosphere is quiet, solitary, yet poetic, conveying a tranquil state of harmony with nature, as if time has frozen in this moment. It is suitable for professional photography equipment, such as full-frame cameras paired with large-aperture prime lenses, capturing delicate colors and depth of field effects while maintaining low ISO to reduce noise, enhancing the cleanliness and texture of the image. The cinematic composition and color treatment resemble the tranquil scenes of an art film, allowing people to feel moments of contemplation and beauty in everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
