        {
          "id": "krea2-23de716c2995625f209994b3",
          "alias": "单女绿围巾街道忧伤注视",
          "prompt": "She lowers her head slightly, exuding a lazy and serene beauty with a natural sheen. Her eyelids are lowered, and a faint melancholy and contemplation shines in her gaze, as if recalling or contemplating something. She appears layered and textured. Around her neck is an olive-green scarf, made of soft cotton-linen fabric, with natural pleats and a calm color, adding a touch of artistic flair. The background is completely blurred, presenting a warm orange-yellow tone, with faint shadows and architectural silhouettes faintly visible. Like the afternoon light on a city street or a corner of a park, it creates a hazy and poetic atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the characters occupying most of the space. The shallow depth of field effect highlights the subject, allowing the background to fully blend into a soft halo, creating a smooth visual path. Light and shadow come from the side slightly above, while soft warm light shines from the left. The shadowed areas transition naturally, presenting a warm texture. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and olive green, harmoniously unified and reminiscent of vintage film photography. The image has a slight graininess and slightly low-saturation analog camera effect, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. The lens is slightly out of focus, enhancing realism and the sense of life. The image presents a quiet, restrained, and slightly melancholic everyday moment, like a gentle encounter on a street at dusk. Full of storytelling and emotional tension, it is suitable for expressing themes such as youth, loneliness, memories, or inner monologue. The overall style combines artistry and documentary, resembling a carefully composed portrait. Or like a frame of reality casually captured in everyday life",
