        {
          "id": "krea2-9273ec6d3b03c4934cb2a034",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套椅上冷淡躺",
          "prompt": "A woman is lying on her side, leaning against a deep green stone tabletop. She wears a loose bright blue jacket paired with a white shirt underneath, the collar clearly visible. The cuffs reveal black-and-white plaid lining details. Her body stretches diagonally from the left side of the painting to the right, her arms bent in a gentle arc, her hand posture naturally relaxed, fingers long, fingertips lightly touching the tabletop. The overall composition presents an asymmetrical and balanced beauty. In the foreground, her bent upper body and arms occupy the main visual area of the painting. In the background, you can see a window with a black metal frame. The lines of the frame are simple and sharp, and through the glass, you can faintly see the blurred green plants and natural light outside. Behind it is a rough stone wall with clear stone textures and a grayish-brown color, with weathered marks left by the passage of time. At the edge of the wall, a white pipe runs vertically. This adds a sense of realism and a sense of everyday life to the scene. In the middle shot, a light-colored rattan chair stands behind a woman. The chair's backrest is rounded, and the weaving is finely woven, echoing the spatial layers of the figures. The entire composition uses close-up shots, with well-handled background blur to highlight the subject while preserving detailed environmental information. The light comes from the upper right, soft natural light, filtering through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect on the table and figures. The distribution of light and shadow is uneven, with some areas bright and warm. In some places, the shadows enhance the three-dimensionality and layering of the image. The overall color palette is dominated by blue, green, and gray, with harmonious and unified color schemes. The cool tones emit a hint of warm light, creating a quiet, artistic, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. It feels like she pauses briefly in a quiet corner on a sunny afternoon day. The image is full of everyday texture and emotional tension, as if shot with an old film camera, with slight graininess and realistic exposure control. It presents a simple yet captivating aesthetic style",
