        {
          "id": "krea2-31d17640a7a6231d4d2537a6",
          "alias": "单女毛衣海滩站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under the sunlight at the seaside pier, wearing a burgundy sleeveless knit top and a deep blue lace long dress. She leans slightly to the side, her right hand gently resting on the black mooring post, her overall posture elegant and relaxed. The background is calm seawater, distant wooden piers, and a staggered cluster of Japanese-style buildings. The sky is clear and deep blue, with sunlight streaming down from the upper right, creating a warm golden halo. The light reflects delicately on the water surface and the building, creating a peaceful and pleasant summer afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses a medium portrait, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the left side, leaving space on the right to showcase a wide sea view and distant views. The visual guide naturally extends from the figure's posture to distant docks and houses, creating a sense of depth. The foreground features rough stone slabs and metal railings, the middle ground features the main figure and mooring posts, and the background features water, a pier, and buildings. The layers are distinct, with warm tones as the main color. Wine red and deep blue create a warm contrast, creating a harmonious and unified overall tone with delicate light and shadow texture. It presents a realistic and artistic moment from everyday life, as if photographed in a film style under natural light with a professional camera, featuring slight graininess and soft depth of field. The edges of the frame are slightly overexposed and shadow details preserved, enhancing realism. The composition is balanced and breathable, and the subject's expression is natural and unpretentious, presenting a relaxed and carefree everyday beauty. The overall atmosphere is warm, fresh, tranquil, and full of vitality",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
