        {
          "id": "krea2-3102f65fb42b806bdd8c0a88",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣摄影棚媚态持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a tight, bright pink high-neck sleeveless knit dress. The skirt featured delicate vertical ribbed textures, perfectly fitting her figure and outlining smooth curves. The lines from the chest to the hips transitioned naturally and with tension. The short skirt hem perfectly showcased her long legs, making the overall look both sexy and elegant. She leaned forward slightly, hands resting lightly above her knees, her posture relaxed yet slightly provocative. The metallic texture shimmers gently under the light, adding layers of detail. The background is a minimalist pure white wall and floor, creating a spacious and clean space with no unnecessary decoration. The light comes from soft, even natural light or professional studio lighting in front, creating a bright and transparent visual effect. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, and a slightly upward angle enhances height proportions and three-dimensionality. The composition centers on the figure, with ample blank space to highlight the subject's presence. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, with soft shadow transitions presenting a healthy glow. The folds of the clothing naturally change as the body curves, emphasizing the authenticity of the material. The overall atmosphere combines modern fashion with intimate sexiness, as if a carefully planned model photo shoot in a professional studio, while retaining the authentic and delicate texture of everyday photography with high-end cameras or smartphones. The color tone is dominated by bright pink, forming a strong contrast with the cool white background. The visual impact is strong, with moderate color saturation that is not exaggerated, maintaining natural harmony. There are no watermarks or markers in the image. Focusing solely on the person and their environment, the composition is stable and balanced, with a clear and sharp foreground, smooth mid-shot transitions, and a simple blurred background. It feels like a moment captured by professional equipment in a quiet indoor space, authentic and full of charm. Precise control of light and color makes the entire image appear sophisticated yet warm. Details are rich yet not cluttered; every detail is carefully arranged, reflecting the ultimate pursuit of aesthetics, ultimately resulting in a high-quality image that is both visually appealing and emotionally expressive",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
