        {
          "id": "krea2-7f875fc17b7d617569079461",
          "alias": "单女衬衫城市自信坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a modern-style gray leather single sofa, wearing a black high-neck, glossy shirt and black trousers. The overall look is simple yet textured, with the shirt's cuffs slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists. She pairs it with a silver thin chain necklace, adding a touch of refinement. She wears pale pink glasses with frames that reflect soft light, fingers naturally bent, and her posture elegant and composed. Her right leg drapes over her left, black sheer ankle socks, toes clearly visible, and nails painted in light pink. The leg lines are smooth, creating a relaxed yet stylish home atmosphere, gentle and casual. The background is a simple white wall, with a lush fiddle fig in the corner. Its broad green leaves layer upon layer, full of vitality, injecting a natural atmosphere into the scene. The floor is paved with large white marble tiles with delicate gray textures, reflecting a soft glow. Behind the sofa, another corner of a light gray sofa can be faintly seen, along with a white power outlet on the wall, with realistic details. This enhances the sense of realism in life. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, body slightly tilted, forming a natural visual guiding line. Light and shadow come from the natural light source on the left, soft and even, without strong contrast, creating a warm and peaceful atmosphere in the morning or afternoon. The shadows are light and transitioning naturally, highlighting the character's outline and the folded details of clothing. The overall color palette is mainly black, gray, and white, accented with the lush green of plants and pink nails. The colors are harmonious and unified, presenting a daily aesthetic of urban life The image texture is delicate, as if shot by a professional camera, but retains slight noise and subtle imperfections from real environments, such as floor seams, wall textures, and plant leaf veins, making the images more realistic and immersive, as if capturing a genuine moment of a quiet afternoon, conveying a reserved, calm, and comfortable lifestyle attitude",
