          "id": "krea2-577c066ca26d0cd0d03aaf0e",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服户外忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A Japanese high school girl sits on outdoor concrete steps, wearing a light blue sailor uniform with a deep blue bow at the collar. White stripes adorn the cuffs and collar. The fabric has a light cotton texture, the skirt hangs naturally with slight pleats, making it look real and down-to-earth. Looking directly at the camera, her expression is calm with a hint of melancholy and contemplation. Her right hand rests naturally on her knee, her posture relaxed and natural, legs together, wearing white knee-high socks with slightly fluffy tops. The black leather shoes have smooth surfaces that reflect faint light, recreating the typical style of Japanese school uniforms. The background features a wide stretch of gray granite steps, rough with natural spotted textures. On both sides are simple white walls with metal handrails with smooth silver-gray lines extending deep into the frame. In the distance, faint outlines of city buildings can be faintly seen. The sky is bright, pale blue, with sunlight streaming down from above, creating a soft, diffused light that evenly illuminates the figures The layers of light and shadow are rich, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and everyday. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, occupying the visual center. The lines of the steps extend backward, creating a strong sense of perspective that guides the gaze to focus on the figure. The foreground features clear steps and foot details, the middle ground is the main body and some steps, and the background gradually blurs to highlight the subject. The colors are mainly cool tones, with blue, white, and gray harmoniously unified to create a fresh and clean feel. The image has a slight grainy film texture. It simulates the authentic texture of amateur camera photography while preserving natural exposure and color saturation, presenting an overall youthful campus realistic style, like a quiet moment accidentally captured on an afternoon, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
