        {
          "id": "krea2-4e9eec3b641ef4720c141098",
          "alias": "单女制服商店站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style sailor uniform stands in the supermarket's refrigerated section, wearing a pair of round, fine-rimmed glasses, slightly tilting her head. She leans over the glass door of a refrigerator, gently resting her right hand on the edge of the cabinet, while her left hand carries a white canvas bag with black Chinese characters and the English word \"UN\" on it. She wears a light blue short-sleeved sailor suit with pink and dark blue stripes on the collar and cuffs, a white shirt underneath, and a pleated skirt in the same color below. The overall look is fresh and sweet, full of youthful energy, and her posture is natural and relaxed. It was as if you were photographed while selecting products. In the foreground was a transparent glass door of a refrigerated cabinet, reflecting the light and shadow of the surroundings. Inside, various packaged foods and drinks were neatly arranged, colorful but slightly blurred. The middle ground showed most of the woman's body, clearly visible from waist to head. The background was the inside of the supermarket, with various products displayed on the shelves on both sides. Blue and white signs and promotional posters hung above, and industrial-style lighting tubes and ducts were installed on the ceiling, providing bright and even lighting. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, with the figure occupying the left central position, the body extending diagonally, forming a visual guide that creates a realistic and vivid atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and detailed, resembling everyday photos taken with a regular phone, with slight noise and natural shadow transitions, presenting an overall life-like, documentary feel. It combines youthful cuteness with the real daily shopping scene. The light and shadow are soft, the layers are distinct, the background is moderately blurred, and the subject is highlighted. The images are full of storytelling, evoking beautiful moments in ordinary life",
