        {
          "id": "krea2-70e48d16fd0df3cb98c6f7b9",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣微笑持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears an off-white knit cardigan with delicate texture and clearly visible texture, paired with a white crew-neck T-shirt underneath. Looking toward the upper left of the frame, she exudes a calm and focused expression, accompanied by a faint smile that appears gentle and calm. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, heads slightly tilted, forming an elegant diagonal posture. The background is a blurry city street scene composed of warm yellow and gray-brown tones, presenting a distinct bokeh effect. Faint architectural outlines and some circular light spots are visible, creating a strong visual layering of solid and void contrasts. The details are rich. The middle ground is a soft background blur area containing blurred street elements and light and shadow changes, while the background fully integrates light spots and color transitions with light focus. It enhances the sense of spatial depth. The overall composition follows the rule of thirds, with the subject positioned near the golden ratio point, creating visual flow. Light comes from the front left of the frame, forming a soft side backlight, which outlines the edges of the figures with a golden halo. The shadowed transitions are smooth, without awkward boundaries. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and healing, with tones dominated by warm yellow, off-white, and light brown, creating a tranquil afternoon sunlight atmosphere. The texture of the image is similar to film photography. The retro style, with a slight graininess and low color saturation, feels like shooting with an old-fashioned camera. The lens is slightly distorted, bringing a sense of authentic life. Overall, it presents a daily yet poetic moment, capturing a quiet moment of an ordinary girl listening to music on the street. There are no obvious artificial traces in the frame; all elements blend naturally, conveying a subtle sense of nostalgia and the beauty of youth, as if time has frozen in this moment, allowing people to feel the gentleness and beauty of ordinary life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
