        {
          "id": "krea2-a01d30070e41882893ad58d6",
          "alias": "单女黑女仆装摄影棚神秘坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits gracefully at the center of the frame, dressed in a delicate black-and-white maid outfit. The white stand collar and ruffles on the chest create a soft layering effect. The black satin waist tightens the waistline, highlighting her slender figure. The black long-sleeved shawl naturally drapes down the sides, the skirt slightly flares up, revealing fair legs and pure white over-the-knee stockings. She wears simple white high heels. The overall look is both vintage and modern, blending sense of professionalism and a simple white headband. She wears a simple white headband with her head slightly tilted, creating a calm and reserved temperament. She sits on a pure white circular platform, leaning slightly forward, with her hands naturally resting on her thighs, her posture dignified yet relaxed. The entire scene background is a minimalist light gray gradient, transitioning from bright gray-white from top to bottom to pure white on the floor. The space is clean and pure, with no unnecessary decorations or distractions. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered and a clear visual focus. The camera captures the entire body from a mid-angle angle, emphasizing clothing details and human proportions. Light comes from a softbox slightly above the front, evenly illuminating the subject and avoiding harsh shadows. The waist and legs have slight shadow transitions to enhance depth. The subtle contrast between background and ground makes the subject stand out. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, pure, and slightly mysterious. The color scheme is mainly black and white, creating visual balance. The light and shadow are soft and have the texture of professional studio shooting, as if shooting under a constant light source with a high-end camera and a large aperture lens. It presents clarity and detail reminiscent of commercial portrait photography, with a slight film graininess and natural depth blur, simulating real camera imaging and creating a visual experience that combines the documentary and artistic feel of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The overall image is clean and crisp, full of fashion and youthful charm, like a carefully designed portrait work, combining idol style refinement with a sense of everyday warmth",
