        {
          "id": "krea2-1bc80a72f1d0eff9cafd9d66",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙城市冷淡躺",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side on a bed covered with pure white sheets, wearing a bright blue tight dress. The dress is tailored to fit her figure, outlining smooth curves. The neckline is simple yet elegant, and the sleeveless style highlights the long arm lines. Her arms stretch out naturally, one hand resting lightly on the edge of a white pillow, the other relaxed at her side. On her wrist, she wears a delicate silver watch, black stockings wrapping her legs, presenting a smooth and delicate texture. Her legs naturally overlap, with her toes slightly raised. The overall look is full of modern urban women's fashionable vibe. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the middle shot, with the figure occupying the primary visual space. The composition adopts a diagonal angle, extending from one corner of the bed to the other to form a dynamic diagonal guide. In the foreground is the white quilt and pillow on the bed, with a soft and fluffy texture that contrasts sharply with the figure's tight clothing. The bedsheet wrinkles naturally, and light and shadow create a soft transition of light and shadow on the fabric surface. The middle scene shows the female body outline, and the blue dress stands out especially under warm-toned lighting. The background features dark walls and a wooden headboard, creating a quiet and intimate atmosphere. A black suitcase or storage bag printed with cartoon patterns is placed beside the bed, adding a sense of life. The overall lighting comes from a warm yellow indoor source, possibly from the bedside lamp or the main room lamp. Light shines from the upper right and creates natural shadows on the sheets and background. The light layers are rich, creating a cozy yet slightly lazy atmosphere, with a slight everyday photography texture, as if shot with a regular camera, preserving real details and slight noise. The lens has a moderate focal length, focusing on the subject. The background is slightly blurred to enhance spatial depth. The colors are mainly blue, white, and black, accented with warm yellow tones. The contrast between warm and cool is strong but harmonious and unified. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, conveying a relaxed, comfortable, and pleasant home atmosphere. The composition is balanced and full of tension, extending along the body's curves to the legs and finally landing on the bed and background elements, forming a complete visual pathway with exquisite detail handling. Overall, it presents a realistic aesthetic that is both fashionable and close to everyday life",
