        {
          "id": "krea2-6822b8ab589336f976f97990",
          "alias": "单女短裙海滩站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the stone steps by the sea, wearing a dark brown asymmetrical one-shoulder cropped top and a high-waisted pleated mini skirt. Her overall look is fashionable and elegant, with a hint of waves. She wears a simple necklace and bracelet, with white nail polish on her fingers. On her feet are beige Chloé sandals printed with the brand logo. Her posture is natural, her body slightly turned to the side, one hand gently resting on the hem of the skirt, the other naturally hanging down, showing off her long leg lines. In the foreground is a step paved with hexagonal stone slabs, which are light grayish-white with a slightly rough surface. Next to it is a low wall built with irregular stone blocks, mainly beige and light brown, with clear texture and natural texture. In the middle is a wide sandy beach, fine and pale yellow, extending to the coastline. The sea water crashes against the black reef on the shore, stirring up white waves. In the distance, the sea surface is calm, merging with the sky. The background is the vast ocean and pale blue sky, which gradually shifts from light blue at the horizon to deep blue above. There are almost no clouds; the light comes from the left side of the painting, the warm glow at dusk. The sunlight gently falls on the figures, forming natural shadows, casting long shadows on the stone steps and walls. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical style, with the figure positioned at the very center of the painting, occupying the main visual focus. The gaze is directed toward the figure, with the sea-sky line in the background and the stone steps extending into the distance, enhancing the sense of space and depth in the painting. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with the soft tones unique to dusk. The overall image presents a relaxed and pleasant vacation atmosphere, with harmonious color combinations dominated by brown, blue, and beige, creating a comfortable and artistic visual effect. It resembles a high-quality portrait taken with a professional camera, featuring strong film texture and delicate details. The overall image presents a fleeting beauty captured casually from daily life, like a snapshot of real life taken by chance on the beach, full of vitality and emotional warmth",
