        {
          "id": "krea2-dfb92716234354787a362805",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫森林微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors under natural light, appearing lively and natural, with a subtle smile and a gentle yet slightly shy expression. She wears a white collared shirt with a crisp and neat collar, paired with a light green suspender dress. The dress appears to be made of cotton-linen fabric with natural pleats and textures. The straps are orange leather, delicate in texture and subtly contrasting with the overall color scheme. At her chest is a floral scarf printed with yellow and pink floral patterns, tied in a bow style that hangs down her chest. Add a touch of sweetness and vintage charm. She wears small, delicate earrings with a faint metallic sheen, creating a fresh and artistic look full of youthful vitality. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, with her head slightly tilted, gazing directly at the camera, as if silently communicating with the viewer. The foreground is clear and prominent, while the middle ground features the figures and parts of the background. The background is blurred, presenting soft warm light spots, with blurred green and golden tones intertwining, resembling the light and shadow effects in an autumn forest or park. The light spots vary in size and are naturally distributed, creating a dreamy bokeh atmosphere. The composition uses the classic center composition, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame, leaving appropriate space around the area to focus on the expressions and postures. The shallow depth of field effect enhances the separation between the subject and background, extending to scarves and clothing details. Light and shadow come from the upper right, providing soft and even lighting, typical of side backlighting. Sunlight streams through gaps in leaves, enhancing three-dimensionality and layering, while the shadow transitions smoothly. Without strong contrasts, the overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, like a tranquil afternoon sun. The colors are mainly warm tones, with white, light green, orange, yellow, pink, and other colors harmoniously combined, creating a warm, comfortable, and healing visual experience. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the warmth of everyday life. It has a strong film shooting style, with slight graininess and color saturation that simulates real camera imaging effects. Overall, it presents an artistic beauty reminiscent of youthful portraits, while also retaining the authenticity of everyday records, allowing people to feel a simple and pure beauty",
