        {
          "id": "krea2-a2f48d3bf8312f6bfd240a94",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣室内忧伤坐喝",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways in a warm indoor setting, appearing casual and gentle. Under the soft warm light, she glows with a healthy glow, focusing intently at the drink in front of her. Her expression is calm and contemplative, and the lenses reflect faint light, adding a touch of intellect and artistry. She wears an off-white coarse knit sweater, with clearly visible texture and a three-dimensional woven pattern. The cuffs and neckline feature delicate ribbed designs, giving the overall texture soft and comfortable. She gently holds a cup of iced coffee in a transparent plastic cup in her right hand. The cup contains light brown coffee liquid, topped with a thin layer of milk foam and a black straw. She is gently sipping with the straw, her movements elegant and natural. The cup rests on a wooden tabletop, with clear grain and grain running parallel to the bottom of the frame, presenting a warm natural wood hue. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with soft walls and blurred furniture outlines, creating a quiet and intimate atmosphere. The entire scene is dominated by warm yellow tones, with light slanting in from the right. A soft backlighting effect is created, with sunlight passing through the fine dust in the air, producing a pronounced Tyndall effect. The edges of the figure's silhouette emit a golden halo, with rich layers of light and shadow and delicate contrast between light and shadow. The middle scene depicts drinks and tabletops, while the background is completely blurred. The composition uses a third-division method, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the right side of the frame, with the gaze directed toward the lower left, forming a smooth visual flow. The overall scene presents a lazy and leisurely afternoon feeling, as if time itself stands still, full of the breath of life and emotional warmth The tone is warm and soft, with moderate saturation and natural color transitions, featuring a slight film graininess and vintage filter effect, simulating the texture of real camera shooting. The lens is an 85mm prime portrait lens with a small aperture, precise depth control, highlighting the subject while preserving a certain environmental atmosphere. The overall image has strong narrative and emotional appeal, capturing an ordinary yet touching moment like a movie lens, conveying a rare tranquility and self-reflection in urban life. The visual style combines characteristics of Japanese portraits and lifestyle photography, combining artistic beauty with a sense of everyday authenticity. The details are exquisitely handled, and the use of light and shadow is skillful, creating a warm, healing, and slightly melancholic atmosphere that evokes youth, memories, and inner monologues. The entire scene feels like something straight out of a slow-paced art film, with every element serving emotional expression rather than mere technical piling",
