        {
          "id": "krea2-58a3f7b14fb6ffbd44bf5ec2",
          "alias": "单女白外套公园忧伤坐戏水",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bench in an outdoor park, wearing an off-white sailor jacket with a dark brown bow at the collar, a white crew-neck T-shirt underneath, a dark brown pleated short skirt and black stockings, and black leather shoes. Her posture is natural relaxed, legs crossed, right hand gently resting on the edge of the bench, left hand naturally resting beside her knees. Her expression is slightly calm and gentle, her makeup exquisite but not exaggerated. Her overall temperament is both youthful and energetic with a hint of melancholy. The background is an urban park, with faint high-rise buildings visible in the distance. The sky is pale blue, with soft and bright light, resembling autumn afternoon sunshine. The floor is paved with gray hexagonal tiles, and the bench is made of orange wooden boards and black metal frames. Next to it is a similar empty bench, with several withered yellow maple leaves scattered on the ground. One of the larger yellow leaves is located in the lower right corner of the foreground, adding a sense of seasonality and layering to the image. The composition is shot at a low angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left, forming the visual focal point. The bench's diagonal line extends from the lower left corner to the upper right corner. Guiding the gaze to focus on the figures, it creates a dynamic visual flow. The middle ground is an open square with a flat surface with slight reflection, showing a moist or smooth texture. The buildings and trees in the background are blurred to create a shallow depth effect, highlighting the main figure. Light and shadow come from the upper right, gently bathing the figure, creating a warm golden highlight that enhances the sense of three-dimensionality. The shadow transitions are delicate without strong contrast, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil and slightly nostalgic, with tones of warm yellow and off-white dark brown and gray-blue dominate, with harmonious and unified colors. The image has a strong sense of everyday life and life, as if casually captured with a regular camera in a real environment. It features slight film graininess and natural exposure control, presenting an unretouched, authentic beauty. The details are rich, from the texture of stockings to the shine of shoes to the veins of leaves, all clearly visible. The overall image is full of youthful energy and poetic moments of urban life, evoking campus time or a simple yet precious afternoon clip",
