        {
          "id": "krea2-4e3d907ab3a4e4b769de00da",
          "alias": "单女透视蓝连衣裙城市困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a light, flowing light blue sheer dress with sheer sleeves featuring ruffled edges, looking both elegant and romantic. Her posture is natural and relaxed, her fingers slender, her makeup fresh and natural, and her overall temperament fresh and sweet. She sits at a small white round table with a cup of takeout coffee and a paper cup covered with a white plastic lid. Next to her is a smartphone with a black screen and a white phone case with a simple body. In the corner of the table is a black diamond-patterned chain bag decorated with a metal logo. The background is a bright floor-to-ceiling window, with lush greenery outside, faintly revealing plant outlines. Light streams in diagonally from the right window, creating a soft backlight effect and a dreamy halo. The window frame is white with clean lines, and the inner wall is light gray. Below is a row of corrugated metal panels that give off an industrial feel. In the left background, you can see a wooden bar counter and a green glass vase with several green plants inside. On the back wall hangs a blurry painting. The overall environment is warm and comfortable, with a close-up composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, slightly tilted, and the viewer's gaze interacts. The foreground features a table and coffee cup, while the middle ground is the main subject. The background layers are distinct, and the transition of light and shadow is natural. The light mainly comes from the upper right, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The shadows are soft, and the color tone is mainly cool, blending blue, white, gray, and other cool tones, accented with warm yellow sunlight, giving the painting both a cool and warm feel. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and healing, as if capturing a lazy afternoon moment, full of life and artistic beauty. It has the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting, with slight graininess and natural exposure control, making the images more approachable and realistic. The composition is balanced, flowing into the greenery outside the window, forming a smooth viewing path. The overall image is clean and tidy, rich in detail, and harmonious in color, presenting a gentle and tranquil everyday aesthetic of modern urban life",
