        {
          "id": "krea2-d15f76adaf8ecad2a985bd45",
          "alias": "单女金外套椅上沉思坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a vintage brown leather cushioned stool, wearing a yellow plaid jacket and skinny pants in matching colors, presenting a warm and harmonious visual tone. She holds a bouquet of bright yellow tulips in her right hand and a red old-fashioned rotary dial phone receiver in her left, her expression slightly contemplative and gentle. Her makeup is delicate but not heavy, her overall posture elegant and relaxed, legs crossed, right leg in front and left leg behind, body slightly leaning to the side, creating a dynamic beauty within stillness. In the foreground is the yellow tulip and red telephone receiver in her hand, fresh and full of flowers. The green leaves spread out naturally, the earpiece has smooth lines, and the connecting lines hang down in a spiral shape, creating visual guidance. In the middle is the dark brown leather stool she sits, with natural wrinkles and textures on the surface, and the edges showing signs of use. On the right is a small light-colored side table with a green desk lamp on the tabletop. The lampshade is semi-transparent matte material, emitting soft light. Below, you can see black knobs and switches, and beside it sits a red vintage landline phone with clearly visible buttons. The body design is classic and nostalgic. In the left corner is a tall snake plant with upright leaves and dark green stripes along the edges. Placed in a yellow ceramic pot, it adds vitality and a natural atmosphere. The background is a pure yellow wall with uniform and moderate saturation. Parallel light spots formed by blinds cast onto the wall, creating interplay of light and shadow with strong contrast of light and shadow. Sunlight streams in from the right side, casting strip-like shadows on the wall and floor, enhancing the sense of depth and temporal atmosphere. The floor is paved with green and white geometric tiles, with patterns that are repeated and symmetrical. With a retro decorative style, the composition is centered and slightly left, with the figure occupying the main visual position. Close-up shots are used, with a slightly upward perspective to highlight the main subject while preserving details of the surrounding environment. The color scheme is warm yellow as the main tone, paired with accents such as orange-red, emerald green, and dark brown, creating a rich and harmonious color layer. Light and shadow come from natural light sources from the sides and rear, creating a soft backlighting effect that makes the edges of the figures glow and enhance the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is warm and nostalgic, full of life and artistic quality. It feels as if capturing a tranquil moment, with the realism and delicate texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The image is clear, detailed, and accurate in color reproduction, presenting a genuine and emotionally rich visual expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
