        {
          "id": "krea2-4ee6da82e3198c9d3692f08c",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙户外站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in the sunlight, slightly tilting her head toward the camera, with a hint of gentleness and curiosity, presenting a natural, soft pink hue. She wears a loose light pink dress with puff sleeves, ruffled on the shoulders, and layered hems creating soft pleats. The material is light and breathable, gently flowing with her movements. Her left hand is raised, fingers gently touching the green leaves hanging from above. On her wrist is a luxurious watch with a silver strap and dial set with sparkling gemstones. The dial design is intricate and exquisite, reflecting sunlight. The background features a wooden fence made of vertical wooden planks, with a natural light brown color and clearly visible surface grain. Some areas are illuminated by sunlight, presenting warm golden tones, while others are shaded to create contrasts of light and shadow. Behind the fence, some blurred green plants can be faintly seen, adding depth and a natural atmosphere to the image. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, head slightly tilted, body forming an S-shaped curve, creating an elegant dynamic aesthetic. In the background, several lush green leaves with clear edges and distinct veins interact with the characters' hands and arms, guiding the gaze upward. The middle ground features the main figure and part of the fence, while the background features blurred wooden fences and plants, creating a clear depth of field effect. The visual guide starts from the green leaves in the foreground, creating a bright and warm lighting atmosphere. Sunlight streams in diagonally from the upper right, creating a soft backlight effect that enhances the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is mainly pink, green, and brown. The color scheme is harmonious and warm, full of summer freshness and vitality. The image presents a beautiful moment from everyday life, as if captured casually with an old film camera. It features slight graininess and natural color transitions, creating a realistic and emotionally rich atmosphere. The wood grain in the background and the light penetration are rich in detail, making the entire scene both realistic and artistic",
