        {
          "id": "krea2-a4540380d5c8a0918cec5444",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣摄影棚严肃站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a blue and white chunky knit cardigan with clearly visible yarn texture, presenting a warm and textured visual effect. Underneath the cardigan is a plaid camisole layer. The gray-toned bottom and top create a harmonious color transition, blending vintage and modern elements. She tightly holds a black professional microphone in her right hand. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered and the head slightly tilted, creating a warm yet solemn visual impression. In the foreground, the microphone and part of her arm stand out, while the background is a pure, light pink gradient wall, with no cluttered elements obstructing the view. This makes the main subject stand out even more. Light and shadow come from the front and above, with soft and even lighting without obvious shadows. The highlights are natural, and the woven textures of the clothes appear rich in layers under the light. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and full of artistic flair, as if filmed in a quiet studio or backstage of a small performance. It has a slight film texture, with a warm tone, well-preserved details, and a clean and tidy image without unnecessary decorations, highlighting the character's own charm and emotional expression. The entire scene gives a sense of realism, The natural, life-close feeling feels like shooting with a mid-range camera paired with a standard lens. The image quality is clear but not overly sharp, preserving the slight noise and color reproduction found in everyday photography, enhancing realism and approachability. At the same time, precise lighting and composition give the images a cinematic and storytelling feel, as if singing or words might play out at any moment, making you want to hear her voice. This is a portrait work that blends fashion, music, and personal charm, combining artistic beauty. while still retaining the authenticity and warmth of life",
