        {
          "id": "krea2-05f50055f03f5c102b46d282",
          "alias": "单女灰高领衫街道微笑站立出神",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a cozy café, standing sideways, her head slightly raised, wearing a gentle smile, as if gazing into the distance or immersed in some beautiful thought, adding a touch of softness and spontaneity. She wears an off-white beret with a slightly slanted brim, looking playful and artistic. She wears delicate gold earrings that sparkle softly under the soft light. She wears a gray turtleneck knit sweater with classic Nordic geometric patterns, layered with a thick gray wool coat. The coat is delicately textured with clear texture, with simple yet practical cuff and pocket designs. With the right hand tucked into the coat pocket, the posture is relaxed and natural. Wearing white casual pants below, the overall outfit is layered and harmoniously unified. In the background is a dark green glass door, with handwritten English words like \"Coffee,\" \"Cookie,\" and \"Chill\" pasted on the door, along with simple coffee cup and cookie designs. The font is casual and carefree, full of a lively atmosphere. The door frame edges are red brick walls, with a rough texture. In stark contrast to the glass door, a decorative Christmas wreath hangs beside the right door, made of pine branches, red berries, and small lights, creating a festive atmosphere. Light shines from the front left, soft natural light, warm but not harsh, with natural shadow transitions. The coat's folds have slight shadows, enhancing the three-dimensional effect. The overall light and shadow present the unique tranquility and warmth of a winter afternoon. The composition uses a three-part method, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the painting. The text and decorations in the background enrich the details. But it doesn't overshadow the main focus. The overall color palette is mainly gray, white, green, and red. The color combination is calm yet vibrant, and the atmosphere in the image is peaceful, healing, and slightly nostalgic. It captures the beautiful moments of everyday life, like street photos taken casually with a regular camera, preserving the authentic texture and warmth of life. The lens uses an 85mm prime portrait lens, with a shallow depth of field effect that makes the foreground people stand out clearly, while the background is slightly blurred, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. Overall, the image presents a warm, comfortable, The story-rich visual experience makes you feel as if you can hear the sound of coffee machines operating and footsteps from afar, making you want to step into this little shop, order a hot drink, and enjoy a moment of peace.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
