        {
          "id": "krea2-1d106db6b5e4d65656e494b7",
          "alias": "单女白短裤室内沉思坐指向",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a light-colored wooden floor, leaning slightly back against the off-white textured wall. Her overall posture is relaxed and natural, her hands gently resting on either side of her knees, fingers long, nails painted with dark gray nails. The sleeves are wide, the hem slightly puffy, revealing the edge of her white shorts underneath. Her legs are dressed in black stockings, smooth and slightly reflective. Her right leg is bent, her left leg straight, and her toes pointing toward the right side of the frame. The foot details are clearly visible, with slightly wrinkled stockings at the ankles, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The entire scene is soft and evenly lit, with natural light or soft light coming from the upper front, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The background is a simple light beige wall with a subtle fabric texture and no decorations, highlighting the main subject. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly above and center, occupying the main part of the frame. The perspective is slightly downward to emphasize the leg lines and clothing details, extending downward along the line of sight to the hands, legs, and feet. It creates a smooth vertical flow with evenly distributed light and shadow, soft shadows, and no strong contrasts. The overall color scheme is mainly gray, black, and white, with harmonious and unified colors, presenting a realistic and refined beauty found in daily life. It feels like a realistic style photo taken with a regular camera or phone, featuring slight film grain and natural noise to enhance realism. The image is highly immersive, as if you can feel the temperature of the air and the tranquility of the environment, presenting a lazy, comfortable, yet elegant moment of life. The images are rich in detail, from the knitted texture of sweaters to the glossy reflections of stockings. Every detail is carefully depicted, creating a visual experience that is both intimate and open, making people want to get closer and feel that quiet yet gentle energy. The overall atmosphere is warm, calm, and full of life, like an ordinary moment of afternoon sunlight streaming into the room, yet made especially moving by the presence of the characters",
