        {
          "id": "krea2-10c2500248ac3dbc4a947fa1",
          "alias": "单女西装车厢忧伤阅读",
          "prompt": "Her right hand firmly supports the bottom of the phone, her left hand gently supports her side, her fingers long and slender, her nails neatly trimmed, wearing a burgundy suit jacket adorned with gold buttons, a white shirt and a red-and-white striped tie underneath, an off-white knit sweater peeking through the cuffs, and a blue-and-white plaid pleated skirt. The skirt is slightly lifted, revealing smooth, well-proportioned thighs. The right leg is bent and raised, and black over-the-knee socks are worn at the ankle, paired with brown leather shoes. The camera focuses on the subject, using a medium shot. The person is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, their body slightly tilted, legs crossed in an elegant S-shaped curve. The background is a blurred car window and interior cabin, with soft natural light streaming in outside, creating a warm backlighting effect. The light streams in from the right side, creating a tranquil yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The foreground features clear figures, the middle ground features seats and parts of the carriage structure, and the background features blurred views outside the window and the interior walls of the carriage. The composition uses a shallow depth of field effect to highlight the subject, with rich light and shadow layers and warm tones. The overall image presents a realistic yet artistic moment from daily life, as if capturing a quiet afternoon. It has a strong sense of realism and emotional tension, like high-quality photos taken with a professional camera, rich in detail, high color fidelity, and delicate texture. It carries both the innocence of youth and the loneliness and reflection of urban life. The overall composition is balanced and harmonious, full of storytelling, making people imagine what she is reading or immersed in her own world. Although the surroundings are blurry, you can feel the slight movement of the train. The entire scene is filled with elements of modern Japanese campus culture, while also incorporating contemporary lifestyles, presenting a beauty that is both ordinary and unique",
