        {
          "id": "krea2-2377136acb1344d2e457258c",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙雪地冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A tall, well-proportioned woman stands in front of the wooden balcony of the Snow Mountain Resort. She wears a form-fitting black deep V-neck slip dress that perfectly outlines her graceful curves and full bust. The hem naturally falls to her ankles, revealing an elegant and sexy silhouette. Her hands are gently raised, revealing a natural sheen and texture, full of confidence and allure. Around her neck is a delicate gold necklace, adding a touch of luxury, with the magnificent snow mountain scenery in the background. In the distance, rolling mountain peaks are covered in thick snow, appearing especially pure under the clear blue sky. Nearby, a snow-covered pine forest stands tall, with branches covered in snow, creating a tranquil and cool winter atmosphere. The wooden balcony railing is dark brown and sturdy, with a natural wood grain texture. A beige blanket with geometric patterns on the edge adds a touch of life. On the right stands a vintage-style black streetlamp with a white glass lamp in elegant design. The overall composition uses a center composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The foreground features the balcony railing and some blankets, the middle ground is the female subject and the surrounding environment, and the background features distant mountains and forests. The layers are distinct and the sense of space is strong. Light comes from the right in front, with bright sunshine and a clear blue sky without clouds. Sunlight shines on the figure, creating soft shadows that highlight body lines and the materiality of clothing. The contrast of light and shadow is striking, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly cool tones, with blue, White and black intertwine to create a strong visual impact. At the same time, warm sunlight and wood elements bring a touch of warmth, making the image both cool and approachable. The image is highly realistic, with rich details, realistic clothing folds, realistic snow reflections, clear tree details, and smooth transitions of light and shadow, as if shot with a professional camera. Using an 85mm prime lens with a large aperture of f/1.8, it creates a shallow depth of field effect. The background blur is soft, highlighting the subject, with moderate color saturation and a slight cinematic color grading, enhancing the artistic expression of the image, presenting an overall high-fashion photography style, combining natural beauty with the charm of the figures, like a carefully composed magazine cover photo",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
