        {
          "id": "krea2-a5b10ffb95af62ee68d5a32e",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙户外蹲注视",
          "prompt": "A woman squats on an outdoor stone platform, wearing a pure white Lolita-style dress adorned with delicate lace trim and ruffle designs. The neckline and cuffs feature delicate pleated details, presenting a soft and sweet visual effect. She leans slightly to the side, appearing especially pure and charming. On her left ring finger is a simple silver ring that reflects gently in the sunlight. The background is a clear blue sky and white clouds, the sky presenting a bright blue. Several fluffy white clouds float among them, creating an open and tranquil atmosphere. On the left side of the painting is a thick wooden railing, covered with weathered textures and mottled marks. Lush green vines are wrapped around it, with broad, glossy leaves. Some vines climb along the railing, forming a natural green barrier. A teal-green net-like safety rope hangs on the railing, with the knots clearly visible. It adds a touch of life and realism to the scene. In the distance, the undulating outlines of hills and vegetation cover the scene, presenting varying shades of green. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, slightly tilted, with an elegant and natural posture. The vines and railing in the foreground form a framed composition, guiding the gaze to focus on the subject. The middle ground shows the spatial relationship between the figure, railing, and vines, with clear layers. The background features a vast sky and distant mountains, providing ample breathing room. The light comes from directly above, slightly to the left, representing intense natural daylight. The shadows are soft, the highlights are bright but not overexposed, and the wrinkles and texture of the clothing are clearly visible under the light. At the same time, soft shadows cast on the floor and railings enhance the three-dimensional effect. The overall color palette is mainly white, green, and blue, with harmonious color coordination. The white dress stands out against the blue sky and green plants, creating a fresh, pure, and vibrant summer atmosphere. The overall image presents a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, as if taken with a regular camera or phone, featuring slight depth blur and realistic light and shadow transitions, without excessive embellishment, preserving natural texture and details, conveying a sense of tranquility, gentleness, and a touch of sentimentality",
