        {
          "id": "krea2-cd4ecd9f28be3d57cf5f3c90",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣沙发俏皮跪持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on a bright white carpet indoors, wearing a loose black-and-white striped sweater and a black layered mini skirt, paired with black stockings. She is holding a vintage-style silver digital camera, the lens pointed at herself. Her overall posture is natural, relaxed, and slightly playful, presenting a casual and authentic atmosphere of everyday life. Her body leans slightly forward, right knee on the ground, left knee bent for support, both hands holding the camera up to her chest, sweater sleeves naturally hanging down, revealing slender wrists. In the background is a simple white wall and a modern-style curved white sofa. The sofa's lines are soft and smooth. On the right side by the window is a small round white side table, with several books neatly stacked on it. Next to it is a white coffee cup with a brand logo. The window is fitted with blinds, and sunlight filters through the gaps, forming parallel beams of light that slanting into the room, casting clear stripes of light on the walls and floor, creating a warm and tranquil afternoon lighting effect. On the left floor, a black backpack and an open book are casually placed. The slightly curled pages add a sense of life. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, their bodies forming a slight S-curve for a dynamic visual balance. The foreground features the main figure and objects on the floor, the middle ground features the sofa, side table, and lower body of the person, while the background features walls and windows. The layers are distinct and the space feels very spacious. The light and shadow lines on the right also guide the view, with natural light dominating the overall lighting. Soft and even, side light from the right window creates delicate transitions between light and shadow at the outlines of people and the folds of clothing. The shadows are moderately shaded without strong contrast, creating a warm, comfortable, clean, and tidy home atmosphere. The main colors are black, white, and gray, accented with a touch of brown and beige. The overall tone is harmonious and unified, with a strong modern minimalist aesthetic. The image quality is similar to high-resolution phones or professional mirrorless cameras, with clear details and well-controlled noise, presenting a realistic sense of life documentation. It seems to capture an ordinary yet warm moment; the entire scene is quiet and full of storytelling, evoking a sense of ease and closeness to life",
