        {
          "id": "krea2-932bc95bccbc624c999e531c",
          "alias": "单女灰连衣裙沙发沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a gray-black thin-strap dress with subtle textures and patterns. The fitted design highlights her slender figure and graceful curves. She sits gracefully on the edge of the sofa, legs slightly crossed, toes lightly touching the sofa cushion. Her barefoot posture adds a touch of casualness and authenticity. Her hands rest naturally on her knees, fingers gently intertwined, her expression tinged with contemplation and tenderness. The background is a simple interior wall with an off-white upper part and a horizontal light blue decorative band in the center. The colors are soft and layered, with delicate textures and subtle texture, creating a quiet and comfortable living atmosphere. Light softly streams in from the left side of the painting, creating a natural transition between light and dark. At the same time, a soft shadow is cast on the sofa, with clear direction of light and shadow that enhances the spatial sense of depth. The overall composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, occupying the visual focal point. The curved lines of the sofa and the pleated details of the backrest are clearly visible. The leather surface is smooth and naturally glossy, reflecting a soft glow. The horizontal lines of the background wall contrast with the vertical posture of the figures, guiding the gaze to focus on the subject. The painting uses warm tones, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. Meanwhile, the light blue and off-white backgrounds bring a touch of coolness and tranquility. The overall atmosphere is serene and authentic, as if capturing an unintentional moment in everyday life. The image presents a texture reminiscent of home photography or personal portraits, with slight film graininess and natural noise. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, the foreground sofa and people are sharp, the background slightly blurred, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. The lighting is soft and even, without strong contrast, suitable for expressing the true state and emotional expression of the subject. The overall style is simple yet artistic, combining a sense of life with aesthetic value",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
