        {
          "id": "krea2-378e0ff3a14414ec7459b531",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣雪地微笑躺注视",
          "prompt": "A woman lying on the thick snow looks natural and vivid, carrying a hint of winter chill and lively energy, as if smiling, adding authenticity and a winter atmosphere. She wears a thick white knit sweater with wide cuffs, soft and puffy material, and a delicate ribbed neckline. She wears an off-white thick threaded scarf decorated with light brown and gray geometric patterns, with clear stitches and a warm texture. A few snowflakes also fall on the back of her hand, her arm lines are soft, and her posture is natural and relaxed. The entire composition centers on the figure, with a top-down perspective placing the figure slightly below the center of the frame, creating an intimate and immersive perspective. The details are rich: the middle is her body and part of the snow, while the background is a vast expanse of snow. The snow surface is flat and gently undulating, presenting a delicate graininess and reflective effect. Light comes from above, soft and even, like diffused light on a cloudy or early morning. The overall color palette is mainly cool tones, including white, light gray, Light blue forms the main tone, with off-white and light brown clothing creating a warm contrast. The light and shadow transitions are natural, with subtle shadows and no strong contrast, creating a peaceful, pure, and gentle atmosphere. The image has a high level of detail expression, blending the realism of everyday shooting with the beauty of artistic photography, with the texture of film photography. The color saturation is moderate, with a slight retro filter effect, as if capturing a winter moment by chance, full of life and poetry. The lens is either wide-angle or standard, with a moderate focal length. The shallow depth of field highlights the main subject, the background is moderately blurred, and the composition is balanced. Through her gaze, she forms an emotional connection with the audience. The overall composition is tranquil and storytelling, like a gentle poem about winter, conveying warmth and innocence in the cold.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
