        {
          "id": "krea2-df98aac19b28788a32a74289",
          "alias": "单女白T恤忧伤倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways against a blue wooden railing, wearing a white short-sleeved T-shirt over an off-white knit vest, with a deep blue plaid scarf tied around her neck. She carries a black backpack over her shoulder, slightly tilting her head to gaze at the sky, as if gazing into a beautiful moment in the distance. Her arms rest naturally on the railing, elbows slightly bent, her posture relaxed and natural. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the composition, with the figure occupying the main visual focus, and the background being blurred green vegetation and distant outlines of buildings. A soft bokeh effect is presented, with the sky showing a dusk tone of light blue and pale yellow intertwined. The light is soft and warm, and the light and shadow flow naturally from the upper right, creating a peaceful yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly cool tones, with blue and green echoing each other, creating a harmonious contrast of warm and cool tones. The foreground railing has obvious textured details, with clear wood grain and slight wear marks on the edges, enhancing realism. The middle ground features the figures and their surroundings, with well-handled background blur. While highlighting the main subject, it retains a sense of spatial layering. The composition uses a three-part method, with the characters' heads positioned at the top third of the frame, creating a sense of visual flow. The entire scene presents a youthful campus vibe with a subtle artistic atmosphere, as if taken from a Japanese film. The effect is shot with an amateur camera. The lens slightly shakes and is slightly out of focus, with slight noise and vignetting at the edges, enhancing realism and a sense of everyday life. The lighting and shadows are soft, without strong contrasts, and the overall atmosphere is quiet and gentle. Full of hope, like a lonely walk after school in the evening, the air filled with a cool evening breeze, leaves rustling, and the faint sound of cars drifted from afar. But at this moment, the world belonged only to her. Time seemed to stand still, immersed in her own thoughts, recalling a small event that had just happened or dreaming of the coming future. The image captured an ordinary yet touching everyday moment, full of poetry and warmth, like a silent poem quietly telling the story of youth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
