        {
          "id": "krea2-9b88fc04a1e1b34d50e4e360",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道冷淡站立摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at a crosswalk on a city street, wearing a loose black long coat with a blue and white printed shirt underneath. The neckline is slightly open, revealing the neckline. She crosses her arms over her chest, her right hand tucked into the coat pocket, and a white handbag slung across her left wrist. The strap is slung across her shoulder, mainly in simple white, adorned with delicate metal clasps and brand logos. The overall look is simple yet layered. Wearing small pearl earrings on the earlobes adds a touch of elegance. The background is modern city buildings, the glass curtain wall reflects the pale blue tones of the sky, above is a metal sunshade, and in the distance, faint traffic lights with yellow warning lights can be seen. At the building entrance, there is a blue signage. The ground is a gray cement pavement, with a clear white zebra crossing across the frame. On the right side, there is a sidewalk edge paved with yellow paved bricks. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the characters positioned at the very center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The foreground features full-body portraits of the person, the middle features zebra crossings and some sidewalks, the background features building facades and the sky, and the perspective is taken from a level perspective. The lighting is soft and even, with scattered light from cloudy days. The shadows are soft and unobtrusive, with black, white, and gray as the main tones, accented with blue and yellow, creating a warm and cool contrast, creating a sense of calm and detachment in urban life. The overall atmosphere is quiet and modern, as if capturing a daily moment, with a slight film texture and graininess, simulating amateur camera shooting. The image features slight noise and color shifts, enhancing realism and a sense of life. The tone is slightly cooler, saturation is moderate, contrast is low, highlighting the true light and shadow changes in the environment. The figures' poses are natural and relaxed, without deliberate posing. The background blur is well handled to make the subject stand out while retaining sufficient environmental information. The composition is rigorous yet casual. Through black-and-white contrast in clothing and geometric lines in the background, a visual focal point is formed, presenting an urban woman image that balances fashion and everyday life. Full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
