        {
          "id": "krea2-b7b9701536eca438ae69ee36",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙公园沉思坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the stone steps of the Hogwarts Magical World theme park, wearing a deep blue collegiate dress paired with a white puff-sleeve shirt and a black bow tie. She holds a slender wooden wand, sitting gracefully sideways, her expression focused and slightly contemplative. On her gray stockings, fine speck patterns faintly visible. The background is typical Hogwarts-style architecture, with gray-white stone walls and steep rooftops complementing each other. The windows are pointed arches, framed with dark brown wood. A circular Owl Post Office logo hangs on the wall. Below is a row of small green-fronted shops, with a sign reading \"OWL POST\" above the entrance. The overall environment is filled with a fairy-tale-like magical atmosphere. The sky is pale blue, clouds are thin, and the lighting is soft and even, creating the effect of natural afternoon light. The composition uses medium shots. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, occupying the main subject. The layered buildings in the background create a sense of depth. The visual guide naturally extends from the figures' postures and gaze directions to the distant building complex. The light and shadow are delicately distributed, with faint shadows reflected on walls and floors, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color scheme is mainly deep blue, gray-white, and dark green, accented by warm yellow lighting, creating a contrast of cool and warm tones, creating a scene that is both realistic and dreamlike, as if it came from a carefully planned magical themed photography. It has a strong cinematic texture and immersive experience, with rich image details—from the folds of clothing to the textures of buildings—all clearly visible, presenting a high-precision realistic style while retaining the realism of everyday shooting. For example, a professional camera took photos of tourists during the day, with moderate focal length, a slight level view and slightly overhead shots, and slight vignetting at the edges to enhance the sense of center focus. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and mysterious, blending the youthful vibe of campus life with the romantic fantasy of a magical world. It makes you feel as if you are immersed in the fantasy world of Harry Potter",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
