        {
          "id": "krea2-92b5093120bfe8463a96406c",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套街道冷淡坐喝",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor metal high stool, leaning slightly back against a gray brick wall, gazing at the camera and sipping a green drink from a transparent plastic cup through a straw. Her left hand holds the cup, while her right hand hangs naturally. She wears a dark blue baseball jacket with an asymmetrical design. The shoulders and sleeves are made of white fabric with red heart patterns and lettering embroidery. The jacket is left open to reveal a black camisole underneath, and she wears shorts with long leg lines, paired with off-white mid-calf socks. The socks are decorated with blue and white stripes, and on the feet are a pair of white platform sneakers with light blue star patterns and the brand logo. The overall look is full of youthful energy and street style. The background is a modern architectural outdoor scene, with white concrete walls on the left and gray brick walls on the right. On the wall is an old window with slightly weathered frames. The sky is clear and deep blue, the sun shining brightly, with light shining down from the upper right, casting soft shadows on the figures, with a clear contrast between light and shadow. Creating a warm and bright atmosphere, the composition uses a medium shot perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the image, with a body in an oblique pose and a slight tilt of the head, interacting with the viewer. The foreground is the main subject, the middle ground includes the metal stool she sits on and part of the floor, while the background features building walls and distant blurred environmental elements. The composition has a strong sense of layering and spatial depth, with cool tones dominated by blue, gray, and white, accented with red and green to create a striking contrast. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot by a professional camera, yet retains the casualness and naturalness of daily life, presenting a relaxed state of urban youth. The lighting is finely handled, highlights and shadows transition naturally, and the clothing textures are clearly visible. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and comfortable, carrying a youthful and fashionable vibe, like a daily portrait from a city street—highly realistic, rich in detail, rich in storytelling, and suitable for expressing a generation's lifestyle and aesthetic attitude",
