        {
          "id": "krea2-c73e367bd3ac86a21b5ce88c",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣椅上俏皮坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a simple wooden high chair, wearing an off-white knit sweater paired with a brown lambswool cardigan, a dark blue denim skirt, white mid-calf socks, and a pair of black patent leather loafers. Her body leans forward slightly, legs naturally crossed, toes lightly touching the ground. Her overall posture presents a lazy yet elegant sense of everyday life, with the main subject positioned in the lower left of the composition, forming the visual focal point. The figures occupy about one-third of the canvas, with a simple light gray wall background with a subtle grainy texture that creates a soft texture. Light softly enters from the left, creating a natural transition between light and dark, while the left side is surrounded by soft shadows. The layers of light and shadow are rich and delicate. The overall color palette is mainly warm brown, off-white, deep blue, and olive green, with harmonious and unified color combinations that present a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The image has a slight film-like texture. There is a slight grain noise and slight exposure shift, as if captured with an old-fashioned film camera. The composition uses the classic three-part method: the subject is placed in the lower left corner, leaving plenty of negative space in the upper right to enhance the breathability and narrative quality of the image. Her hand movements and body posture also guide the gaze down to the details of the shoes. The overall image is full of life and artistic vibes, like a quiet afternoon casually captured at home, with no signs of deliberate staging. Yet it exudes a unique artistic beauty. The scenes are simple yet full of storytelling, the composition is balanced yet lively, the lighting and shadows are soft and realistic, and the colors are warm yet restrained. The entire scene resembles an old photograph carrying memories of time, combining the intimacy of modern daily life with the aesthetic charm of retro photography",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
