        {
          "id": "krea2-2833a37941f68c2cf8401fde",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙忧伤持书",
          "prompt": "She wore a retro-style beige dress paired with a white Peter Pan collar and a black knit cardigan. The left chest of the cardigan was embroidered with the letter \"CH,\" evoking the nostalgia of 1950s American campuses. Her legs were naturally crossed, her right hand gently supporting an open book with a green cover. The pages gently turned, her left hand supporting the lower part of the book. Her calm expression revealed a subtle melancholy and focus, adding a touch of dynamic beauty. Beside her was a light green vintage bicycle parked with smooth frame lines. The seat is made of dark brown leather, the wheels have white sidewalls, and the handlebars and frame details are clearly visible. In the background is an American-style house with light-colored exterior walls, rectangular windows and dark frames. In front of the building are neatly trimmed hedges and dense shrubs, some leaves glistening softly under the sunlight. A few withered yellow leaves are scattered on the ground, paved with cement, and the edges connect to the grass. The grass has scattered dead leaves and tiny weeds, and sunlight pours in from the upper right of the painting, creating a warm golden glow. At the same time, soft shadows are cast on the ground and bicycle, with a clear but not intense contrast of light and shadow, creating a tranquil and slightly nostalgic afternoon atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, body slightly tilted, head facing the camera, and the bicycle occupying the left side of the frame, creating visual balance. The foreground features the ground and some grass, the middle ground features the figure and bicycle, and the background features houses and greenery. The layers are distinct, and the overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, beige, light green, and dark brown, with harmonious and unified colors. It has the texture and graininess of film photography, with images showing slight overexposure and low saturation, simulating the everyday amateur style of vintage camera shooting. It feels like capturing a real moment with a classic film camera. The background is naturally blurred, highlighting the subject's emotional expression. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and full of storytelling, like a youthful memory frozen on a summer afternoon, full of artistic and nostalgic charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
