        {
          "id": "krea2-801b3b1ec1b19f0963f53e56",
          "alias": "单女红高领衫公园微笑坐摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench in an outdoor park, wearing a red turtleneck tight knit top paired with a black leather mini skirt and black over-the-knee boots. Black stockings wrap her long legs, making her look fashionable and full of urban flair. She wears a gentle smile, poses gracefully and naturally, leans slightly to the side, her left hand resting gently on the bench, right leg stretched forward, and left leg bent, showing graceful leg lines. She sits on a modern-style bench made of wooden boards and metal frames, with slightly worn surfaces showing signs of age. The background is a lush green park environment, with dense trees and shrubs forming a soft green layer. In the distance, the outlines of tree trunks and branches can be faintly seen. On the left side, there is a metal structural column that presents an industrial design feel. The ground is paved with gray bricks, neatly joined. Some areas have slight reflections, and natural daylight comes from above, softly and evenly casting on people and scenery, creating delicate shadow transitions. The direction of light and shadow is clear, highlighting the three-dimensional effect of the figures. The overall atmosphere is calm and warm, with moderate color saturation. The red top contrasts sharply with the green background, enhancing visual impact. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, leaving space on the left to showcase background elements. The foreground features benches and the floor, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background features vegetation and architectural structures, extending to body lines and leg movements, finally landing in the natural setting. The image has a strong sense of everyday life and life, as if captured with a regular camera, with rich details and authentic texture, including clothing textures and leather sheen, Metallic rust and subtle veins of plant leaves create a photography style that combines artistic beauty with everyday authenticity. The tones are warm and soft, rich in layers, creating a relaxed and pleasant afternoon atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
