        {
          "id": "krea2-31543a97cf3e8dc7212e9191",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服户外冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a deep blue school uniform jacket and a plaid pleated skirt stands on the outdoor stone steps, looking directly at the camera. Her right hand gently lifts the hem of her skirt, revealing her long, fair legs. On her feet are black ankle socks, her posture natural and elegant, full of youthful energy. The background is an upward stone staircase, flanked by metal railings and blurred outlines of trees and buildings. In the distance, you can see a traditional Japanese roof structure. Sunlight pours in from the upper left of the frame, creating a soft backlight effect. The light passes through tiny particles in the air, creating a distinct Tyndall effect. Fine dust or moisture floats in the air, clearly visible under the light, presenting dreamlike spots of light and halos. The overall composition adopts a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame. The lines of the stone steps converge into the distance, creating a strong sense of perspective and depth, guiding the gaze from the foreground figures into the background. The contrast of light and shadow is striking, and long shadows cast on the stone steps create a tranquil atmosphere of early morning or evening. The color palette mainly features warm and cool contrasts. The deep blue school uniform contrasts sharply with the warm golden sunlight, the background is slightly blurred, highlighting the main character. The overall visual focus is on the character, conveying a youthful, fresh, warm, and slightly artistic scene of daily campus life. It feels like an ordinary afternoon after school, with the sun shining and a gentle breeze. The girl stands alone on the steps, enjoying a moment of tranquility and beauty. The whole scene is full of realism and the atmosphere of life, like a moment captured by a regular camera in natural light. Without excessive embellishment, it preserves the original texture and details, allowing people to feel a poetic and moving feeling found in the ordinary",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
