        {
          "id": "krea2-b1d0fd9697e2415a6d206abe",
          "alias": "单女粉和服窗边忧伤坐比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a traditional Japanese indoor space, wearing a pink floral kimono with a white V-shaped neckline, paired with a matching wide-sleeved robe and a deep brown wide belt at her waist. The overall outfit exudes a gentle Eastern aesthetic. The kimono material features delicate pleats and a sheen, giving it a silky texture. Her posture is naturally relaxed, legs crossed, body slightly leaning forward, right hand lightly resting on her knee, left hand naturally hanging at her side, slightly messy draped over her shoulders, expression tinged with melancholy and contemplation. In the foreground is a dark wooden furniture edge, with natural wood grain and slight wear on the surface. Next to it sits a small ceramic vase adorned with several orange-red flowers. The petals are full and the branches and leaves slender. The middle ground features a female subject, occupying the main position. The background consists of two screens: the left screen has a deep blue background painted with golden landscape patterns with smooth lines and clear layers. The right screen has a beige background decorated with elegant floral patterns. The flowers show a gradient of pink and white, with greenish leaves. The composition uses a close-up perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The frame structure formed by the screen guides the gaze to the figure, while also creating a sense of depth and spatial layering. Light enters obliquely from the upper left of the image, simulating natural window lighting and creating a warm golden shade. The main light source is soft and even, producing delicate shadow transitions. The background screen receives weak light, creating contrast and enhancing the sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, blending traditional Eastern aesthetics with modern photographic aesthetics. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, featuring pink, Beige, deep blue, and brown are the main colors, accented with orange-red accents, creating a warm, nostalgic, and slightly melancholic mood. The image features high-resolution detail expression and a realistic texture, as if shot with professional photography equipment, while preserving a natural sense of everyday life. The lens presents a slight depth of field, the background slightly blurred to highlight the subject, and the overall composition emphasizes balance and blank space, conveying a restrained yet elegant artistic temperament",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
