        {
          "id": "krea2-b2f1d08ee0e0bf7f1d93c33d",
          "alias": "单女全裸米风衣城市冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a streetlamp in the city, wearing a beige trench coat with a classic design: the collar, double breasts, belt cinch, and shoulder details are clearly visible. The material has a delicate matte texture, resembling high-quality nylon or cotton blends. The hem of the trench coat is slightly cinched, highlighting her slender waistline. Underneath, black shorts reveal long, straight legs, and nude pointed high heels. The upper surfaces are smooth as mirrors, reflecting soft light. Her left hand is tucked into the pocket of her trench coat. In her right hand, she held an open newspaper, with blurry text and images on its pages. She turned slightly, her expression cold and confident, wearing a pair of exquisite gold earrings with tassel-style designs. With her subtle movements, she wore a leopard-print silk scarf around her neck, which naturally hung over her chest, adding a touch of wildness and fashion. Her makeup was exquisite, and her overall temperament was elegant with a touch of urban coolness. In the foreground, a black leather handbag rested on the ground, its smooth lines Equipped with metal zippers and chain decorations, the cover hangs a string of plush ornaments in light brown color, soft and fluffy in texture. The floor is paved with gray square tiles with regular gaps, slightly worn on the surface, showing signs of daily use. The streetlight pole is made of black metal, with mottled marks left by time. The top of the lamp post is connected by a slender electrical wire, with a modern glass curtain wall reflecting the outlines of the surrounding tall buildings and the gray-blue tones of the sky. In the distance, you can see a partial structure of a high-rise building. The exterior walls are alternating white and gray, windows are neatly arranged, and the glass reflects the green branches and leaves of the trees. On the right side of the painting stands a lush green tree, its dense leaves gently swaying in the wind. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the painting, the body slightly tilted to create dynamic balance. The streetlight pole extends from the bottom to the upper middle of the painting, serving as a visual guide and directing the gaze to the main subject. The glass curtain wall in the background and the architectural lines create a strong vertical and horizontal contrast, enhancing the sense of spatial depth in the image. The light and shadow come from diffused light from cloudy days, with uniform and soft lighting without strong shadows. The folds of the trench coat show subtle light and shadow changes, creating a three-dimensional effect. The overall atmosphere is calm, modern, and urban, with a slight cinematic and fashionable blockbuster feel. The color tones are mainly neutral, interwoven with beige, black, gray, and green, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The edges of the frame have slight film graininess and slight lens distortion, simulating real camera shooting effects. The background blur is well handled, making the subject stand out more, and the overall image presents a style of everyday street photography that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
