          "id": "krea2-db3104f67089804a489580b0",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫椅上害羞坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a classic-style chair framed in light wood, wearing a loose white shirt with a slightly open collar and sleeves rolled up to her elbows, presenting a relaxed and elegant posture. Her legs are crossed, wearing black stockings, with ankles naturally hanging down, her posture relaxed and attractive. Her right hand gently supports a pair of transparent, fine-rimmed glasses, fingers lightly touching the temples. Her overall expression appears serene and slightly shy, showing a healthy deep brown. The background is a wall with horizontal blinds, which are off-white Light filters through the gaps into the room, creating soft stripes of light and shadow. On the right is a white curtain, thin and transparent, emitting a hazy glow. On the left is a small round white table, smooth with rounded edges, harmonizing with the overall environment. The overall color scheme is mainly white and light wood, creating a bright, clean, and cozy atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, slightly tilted body and head slightly tilted, creating a natural visual guide. The background blur is well handled. It highlights the clarity of the subject, with light coming from the side, soft and even, without strong shadows. The clothing wrinkles naturally, and the surface of the stockings reflects a slight sheen, enhancing the material's sense of realism. The overall image presents a subtle beauty from everyday life, as if shot with a high-resolution camera or phone in natural light, with a slight film texture and low-contrast color grading. The tone is warm to mild, saturation is moderate, details are rich, and layers are distinct. The image has a strong realist style. It blends the freshness and artistic flair of Japanese photography, with a clean yet design-oriented composition, reasonable blank space, visual comfort, and a quiet, intimate atmosphere. It feels like capturing a quiet afternoon sunlight filling the room, where the subject and environment merge to convey a gentle, intellectual, and slightly intimate everyday aesthetic experience",
