        {
          "id": "krea2-a29cf15b41ec5be5804af554",
          "alias": "单女透视黑外套城市冷淡坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a gray cushioned bench, wearing a high-quality black long leather jacket. The coat is smooth and has a noticeable sheen, featuring delicate leather texture and natural pleats. The collar is wide and crisp, the cuffs are simple and neat, the double-breasted front of the coat is clearly visible, the hem is irregularly cut with a slight slit on one side, revealing the black tight dress underneath and her long legs. She crosses her legs, folding her right leg over her left, striking an elegant and confident posture. Her fingers are slightly curved, wearing delicate white pearl earrings that naturally fall over her shoulders, giving her a calm and charming expression. She wears black pointed stiletto heels decorated with metal chains and rivet details. The heels are slender, and the ankles show the delicate texture of sheer stockings. The leg lines are smooth and graceful, and the overall look is fashionable and avant-garde, exuding the cool and elegant aura of modern urban women. Next to her is a classic black quilted handbag, adorned with a gold metal chain and brand logo. The bag is compact and delicate, Harmonizing with the overall style, the background is a light gray wall with a delicate texture and a slight graininess. The floor is made of dark gray cement, with a smooth but slightly reflective surface. The light is soft and even, coming from the left side of the painting, creating a natural transition between light and dark. Light casts light shadows on the right side of the figure and under the bench, creating a rich light and shadow layer, creating a quiet yet sophisticated atmosphere. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly tilted, head slightly turned. At the same time, the leg lines extend to the lower right corner of the frame, creating a dynamic visual balance. The overall color scheme is dominated by black, white, and gray, with strong contrast that highlights the subject's mystery and fashion sense. The atmosphere is calm, restrained, yet sexy, with strong visual impact and artistic expression. It resembles a fashion shoot shot in a professional studio or a street fashion moment captured spontaneously in daily life, combining refinement and casualness to present a low-key luxury aesthetic",
