        {
          "id": "krea2-1c6b0485bcec22c32f706e0a",
          "alias": "单女白制服街道俏皮坐喝",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a green wooden chair, wearing a white short-sleeved school uniform shirt with a deep blue collar and striped cuffs, paired with dark blue sports shorts. She is drinking a transparent glass bottle of beverage with an orange label on the bottle, her expression natural and lively. She gently grips the bottle with both hands, rests her left hand naturally on her knee, and her posture relaxes and relaxes, presenting an overall youthful vibe. In the foreground, the main figure is clearly visible, while in the middle are stacks of old books, with spines of various colors—white, yellow, green, blue, and more. Some books are tied with blue ribbons, with stacks of books staggered in height, creating a rich sense of layering. The background is an old bookstore entrance, with a weathered door frame and worn-out walls. On the left stands a black-and-white sign with blurred Chinese characters. On the right wall hangs a blackboard with paper pasted on it, faintly revealing text and QR codes. Next to it hangs a blue-gray checkered cloth umbrella. Further away, shelves are filled with books, messy yet realistic. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, facing the camera. This creates a strong visual guide. The camera shoots from a slightly overhead angle, capturing the upper body and surrounding environment. The depth of field is shallow, the figure is clear and prominent, and the background is blurred to create a sense of spatial depth. The lighting is soft natural light from the front left, with sunlight filtering through the street and soft shadows. The overall tone leans toward a warm yellow with a vintage film texture, moderate color saturation, and a slight overexposure effect, enhancing the summer afternoon atmosphere. The overall image presents a nostalgic, cozy, and everyday life atmosphere. It seems to capture the moment of an ordinary student idly sitting in front of a small street shop after school, with a strong documentary style and emotional warmth. It is like a real-life scene accidentally captured on the street with an old-fashioned film camera. The details are rich, the emotions are full, and the story is full of storytelling, evoking those simple and beautiful moments of youth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
