        {
          "id": "krea2-7cc3034d78756b8af514613e",
          "alias": "单女白外套桥严肃站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the metal railing of a city overpass, wearing an off-white coarse knitted wool coat with a thick and fluffy texture featuring obvious woven textures and natural pleats. The collar is slightly open, revealing the dark underwear. The chest pocket is clearly visible, with simple yet practical lines. The cuffs have a slight rolled edge, adding a touch of casual and laid-back charm. In a soft contrast with the white, the scarf is casually draped over her shoulders, naturally falling over her chest, creating a warm and comfortable visual impression that appears fresh and natural. She smiles, exuding gentle and friendly feelings, leaning casually against the silver-gray metal railing, hands gently resting on it, body slightly tilted toward the camera, presenting a relaxed and natural posture. The background is a cluster of city buildings, and in the distance, modern buildings with glass curtain walls can be seen, reflecting the light from the sky. The architectural outlines are clear but slightly blurred. This creates a certain depth of field. Trees dot the front of the building, and the leaves display autumn yellow-green tones, adding a sense of seasonality. The ground is a gray cement pavement, with green and white tactile paving bricks beside it. The details are realistic and lifelike. The overall composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure on the right side, occupying about two-thirds of the space, and leaving a lot of blank space on the left to create visual balance. The foreground railing extends diagonally from the lower left corner to the center of the painting, forming a guiding line that directs the gaze to the main subject. At the same time, it enhances the sense of spatial depth. The middle ground features figures and railings, while the background features buildings and trees, with clear layering. Light and shadow come from the upper right, with sunlight softly shining on the figures, creating natural highlights. The coat's surface shows delicate light and shadow changes under the light, with soft shadows. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and warm, full of the atmosphere of everyday life. The main color tones are off-white, light blue, and gray-green, harmoniously unified to present a clean, fresh, and comfortable feel. The image has a slight film texture and natural graininess. The exposure is slightly overexposed, with the sky showing a bright pale blue. The overall style closely resembles everyday phone photography, authentic and warm, as if capturing an ordinary yet beautiful moment",
