        {
          "id": "krea2-a06d5525e8a38f1ab43fa1d4",
          "alias": "单女黑连体衣街道俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a tight black long-sleeve jumpsuit with delicate vertical ribbed patterns. Three circular cutouts of varying sizes are arranged on the chest from top to bottom, revealing the edges of the white undergarment and part of her skin, highlighting her curves and sense of fashion. Her left hand gently strokes her neck, while her right hand hangs naturally as she carries a black leather handbag. On her feet, she wears high-calf black crocodile boots. The overall look is modern and avant-garde, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, occupying the main visual focus, with an elegant and confident posture. The background is a bustling city nightscape, with tall buildings lining both sides of the street. On the left stands a modern building brightly lit, with glass curtain walls reflecting warm yellow lights. The window displays Christmas trees and other festive decorations. Above is the \"US Bank\" sign, and in the distance, the \"Dayton Way\" sign is clearly visible. Pedestrians come and go, some taking photos and walking, creating a lived-in street atmosphere. The pavement is paved with irregular stone bricks, presenting geometric patterns of varying shades. The streetlights emit a soft, warm yellow glow that illuminates the entire scene. The traffic lights turn red, and several tall streetlights cast bright light, creating a typical nighttime urban lighting effect. In the distance, palm trees are sharply outlined in the night, adding a California flair. The composition centers on the figure, with the foreground slab guiding the gaze toward the subject. The middle ground shows crowds and street details, while the background shows layers of architecture and distant light sources. The contrast of light and shadow is strong, with the main subject evenly illuminated by lights from both the front and sides. The wrinkles of clothing are clearly visible, and shadows transition naturally. The overall atmosphere blends the hustle and bustle of the city with a calm personal temperament. It combines the lively vibrancy of a commercial street with individual charm. The colors are mainly black, yellow, and gray, accented with a touch of red and green, creating a warm and dynamic visual effect. The image has a realistic photographic texture, as if captured on the street with a regular camera or phone. It retains slight noise and natural motion blur, enhancing the realism of everyday documentary. The details are rich, from the material textures of the characters' clothing to the reflective spots on the ground, all clearly distinguishable. The composition is stable and narrative-rich. The visual guide lines guide the viewer's gaze through the lines of the ground, the extension of roads, and the light paths toward the central figure, presenting an overall urban nightscape style that combines fashionable beauty with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
