        {
          "id": "krea2-1f606a67a5027c85a54ddbbb",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫摄影棚俏皮坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits half-seated, leaning against a white pillow. She wears a pure white short-sleeved shirt with a delicate silver badge pinned to the collar. A blue and white plaid tie is casually tied at her chest, paired with a dark blue denim mini skirt with irregular frayed edges. Underneath, she wears a ruffled mini skirt made of blue and white plaid and white lace. The layering is clear and full of youthful energy. Her makeup is refined and natural, arms crossed over her chest, and her left hand lightly rests on her left leg, striking an elegant yet playful pose. The background is composed of bright orange and blue geometric blocks, creating a strong color contrast. The orange wall occupies most of the scene, while the blue blocks are irregularly distributed in the upper left and lower right corners, creating a highly modern visual space. The white pillow serves as the central element, positioned slightly to the left behind the figure, creating a sharp contrast with the orange background and enhancing the sense of layering in the composition. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center-left position, head slightly tilted, creating direct visual contact with the viewer. Light comes from the front left, softly and evenly illuminating the subject. The shadows transition naturally, creating a bright and vibrant lighting atmosphere. The color saturation is high, and the strong contrast between orange and blue gives the image a powerful visual impact, while preserving delicate texture and realism. It feels as if you were shooting in a carefully arranged indoor studio, using professional lighting equipment to create a clean and crisp light effect, yet retaining a sense of everyday life—like a real scene shot with a casual camera or mobile phone. With slight noise and natural color deviations, the entire image is both artistically beautiful and close to real life, presenting a youthful, individualistic fashion style. The overall color tone is warm and bright, full of vitality and hope, giving a fresh and energetic visual impression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
