        {
          "id": "krea2-0596d44a355eda9d03669c94",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫城市忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle downward view, a woman stands on a rooftop or high platform, slightly tilting her head up at the sky, her expression calm yet slightly melancholic. She wears a simple white short-sleeved shirt, light fabric, clean and sharp lines. The background is a pale blue gradient dusk sky, thin clouds, soft light, presenting a cool-toned blue-purple atmosphere unique to evening. In the left background, an old-fashioned TV antenna and satellite receiver appear blurred in a blurred shape. The antenna has a Y-shaped structure, a slender metal rod, and a satellite pot shaped like a circle. The surface appears somewhat aged, both in a state of defocus, creating a natural depth effect. The composition uses an asymmetrical layout, with the figure on the right, occupying about one-third of the space, leaving a large amount of sky as a visual extension to enhance the sense of space and loneliness. The overall color scheme is mainly cool blue, creating a quiet, detached, and poetic atmosphere. Light and shadow scatter from the sky, soft and even, without strong shadows. The edges of buildings in the background are faintly visible, possibly from metal railings or walls on the roof, with clean lines. Further enhancing the realism of everyday urban scenes, the shooting style resembles an amateur camera or phone shooting straight out, with slight graininess and natural noise. The camera tilts slightly to add movement and a sense of life. The overall image conveys a sense of youthful confusion, contemplation of the future, and the inner peace and loneliness of people on the fringes of the city. It is as if, on an ordinary evening, she stands alone at a high place, gazing into the distance, her thoughts drifting away with the wind, and time slowing down and profoundly in that moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
