        {
          "id": "krea2-723a0f972985d4cf3cf08d46",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣室内沉思站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a public indoor space with a profile profile, shimmering faintly under soft light. The lenses reflect the blurred light and shadows of the surroundings. She wears a beige vertically striped knit cardigan with a matching fitted base layer underneath, paired with high-waisted black shorts with clean and sharp lines. She slung a black leather shoulder bag across the chest, with metal zippers and buckles clearly visible. On her wrist, she wears a multi-layered silver chain bracelet that adds a touch of refinement. Her posture is natural and relaxed, with her body slightly leaning forward. The expression is focused and slightly contemplative, with a blurred background of an airport or station hall. White railings and metal handrails form the foreground elements. Distant crowds blur into blurred outlines—some wearing white tops, others black hats and masks. The overall scene is filled with the atmosphere of daily commuting. The composition uses medium shots in close-ups, with the figures occupying about two-thirds of the right side, leaving space on the left for visual balance. The background blur highlights the subject, with light coming from above and in front, and delicate transitions of shadows, creating a warm and friendly tone. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and authentic, as if capturing an unintentional moment, infused with a sense of life and documentary. The image texture is close to that of amateur cameras, with slight noise and natural focus providing a sense of realism. The color saturation is moderate, leaning toward warm tones, emphasizing the aesthetics of everyday life and authenticity. The composition is guided, then turning to a distant blurred background forms a flowing visual path. The layers of light and shadow are rich but not exaggerated, highlighting the three-dimensionality of the characters and the texture details of the clothing, presenting an overall sense of tranquility. An elegant and life-oriented artistic atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
