        {
          "id": "krea2-c65ef5c9662e6f16e48d9bf1",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands before a vintage wooden-framed mirror, wearing a pristine white lace wedding dress with elegant shoulders that reveal collarbones and shoulder lines. The lace trim of the wedding dress creates delicate textures and layers under soft light, forming a delicate bun. Looking directly into the camera seems to gaze at the viewer, with a thoughtful expression, slightly lowering her head and gazing at herself in the mirror, forming a self-examination perspective. The entire scene is dominated by warm orange-yellow tones, with soft light streaming in from the left side. On the wood-grain background, soft shadows are cast, creating a quiet and cozy atmosphere. The wooden frame of the mirror bears traces of time, with a slightly rough surface and slight wear on the edges, adding realism and a nostalgic feel. The background is a dark brown wooden wall with clearly visible grain, and vertical wood grain lines enhance the sense of depth in the space. The composition uses a diagonal layout, with the main figure positioned at the upper left of the frame. The reflection occupies the center's slightly left position, while the side profile extends to the lower right, creating a visual balance and flow. The camera uses close-up shots, with a slightly blurred background to highlight the subject's details and emotional expression. The light comes from a warm light source, possibly natural dusk or indoor warm lighting. The shadows are soft and transitions naturally, creating an overall atmosphere that is both romantic and tinged with calmness and introspection, as if capturing a private and precious moment. The texture of the image is similar to film photography. With a slight graininess and low-saturation vintage tones, it creates a nostalgic, gentle, and story-rich visual experience. The composition cleverly utilizes mirrors' reflective properties to weave reality and illusion, guiding the viewer's gaze back and forth between inside and outside the mirror, enhancing the narrative and artistic tension of the image. Overall, it presents a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, like a casual moment captured with an old camera, full of vitality and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
