        {
          "id": "krea2-d8d06e24ad68d16fa7b124d4",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣室内忧伤蹲",
          "prompt": "A woman squats on a light-colored wooden floor, wearing a loose gray knit sweater and black stockings. She lowers her head slightly, her overall posture naturally relaxed and approachable. Her left hand rests naturally on the floor to support her body, her nails painted in light pink with exquisite detail. The sweater material shows a delicate knit texture, with clear ribbed designs on the cuffs and collar. A small gold brooch is pinned to her chest, adding a touch of elegance. The background is a white wooden wall with mottled marks, the paint peeling off the wall. The wood grain and old marks below are exposed, creating a retro, nostalgic, and slightly industrial feel. The light softly and evenly shines from the front slightly left, creating a natural transition of shadows. At the same time, subtle light and shadow changes appear on the sweater surface, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall composition uses a medium shot close-up, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, body forming an S-shaped curve, legs bent, knees close to the ground, forming a stable visual center. The foreground is a clean white floor with a slight reflective effect, and the middle ground is the main subject. The background is weathered wooden walls, with clear layers and a strong sense of space. The main color palette is gray-white, accented with black and gold, creating a harmonious contrast of warm and cool tones. The atmosphere is quiet, warm, and slightly artistic, as if shooting in a private indoor space. Using everyday amateur cameras or mobile devices, the lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, and the background is slightly blurred, highlighting the subject. The overall image feels realistic and lifelike, without excessive embellishment, preserving natural details and texture. Like a casual photo taken between friends, full of warmth and intimacy, with no unnecessary decorations or distracting elements, the focus entirely on the expressions, postures, and clothing details. Through subtle use of light, shadow, and color, it creates a quiet, comfortable, and slightly melancholic everyday beauty, allowing people to feel a poetic moment in ordinary life. Then, as her gestures and body lines extend to the background wall, a smooth visual path is formed, the composition balanced yet dynamic, combining a static calm. There is also a dynamic sense of breathing, as if time freezes at this moment, leaving behind a gentle and genuine moment.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
