        {
          "id": "krea2-b984909398eea6b65631c89d",
          "alias": "单女制服桥忧伤坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a Japanese-style sailor uniform, a white long-sleeved top with a deep blue collar and cuff trim, a red bow tied at the chest, a dark blue pleated short skirt, black patent leather loafers, and over-the-knee white socks. She sits on a concrete bridge railing, legs naturally crossed, left hand resting on the railing, her posture elegant yet slightly lazy, her expression calm yet tinged with contemplation and a faint melancholy, naturally falling over her shoulders. Sunlight streams in from the right side of the frame, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on her, with a wide body of water in the background The water surface shimmers, with faint city outlines and trees visible in the distance. The sky is pale blue, dotted with a few white clouds. The overall composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned to the right. The left side leaves plenty of space to show the open water and sky, creating visual balance. The bridge railing extends from the lower left to the upper right, forming a guiding line that draws the gaze to the main figure. In the foreground is a rough concrete railing surface bearing traces of age and fine cracks. Light and shadow cast clear shadows on the wall, enhancing the sense of depth. The middle frame features people and railings, while the background features a gradient blurred lake, buildings on the opposite bank, and distant mountains. The layers are distinct, with cool tones dominated by white, blue, and gray. The red bow is the visual focal point, and the lighting is natural daylight, soft and directional, creating a tranquil yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall style combines everyday realism with artistic beauty, as if captured with an amateur camera. The image texture is delicate, with rich details, and a slight graininess and film-like feel. It presents a serene poetic atmosphere amid the passage of youth, as if capturing a moment of solitary gaze into the distance in an afternoon. The entire scene is full of storytelling and emotional tension, evoking campus life, growing memories, or some unfinished expectations. The composition is stable and breathable, with interplay of light and shadow conveying a complex blend of tenderness and detachment. The tones are harmoniously unified, combining youthful vitality with calm restraint and restraint. The overall composition resembles a carefully composed film photograph, capturing the purity and beauty of that particular moment",
          "description": "",
