        {
          "id": "krea2-1ee47f10e9426886f0bcb0f3",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at a city street corner, slightly tilting her head up to gaze at the sky. She wears a pair of bright red bow earrings, adding a splash of color to the overall look. She wears a white T-shirt with orange and blue patterns printed on the chest, with vintage wavy lines along the edges. The T-shirt material looks soft and comfortable, and a deep blue denim shoulder strap is slung across her shoulder. The strap is wide and sturdy, The metal fasteners reflect a faint sheen. She stands beside a tree-lined street, overhead with dense leaves. Sunlight filters through the gaps, casting mottled light and shadow, forming countless bright spots. These spots float dreamily in the frame, creating a warm and dreamlike atmosphere. The background is blurred city buildings, and the shop signs are faintly visible. One red sign bears indistinct Chinese characters. The building's exterior walls are light gray, the windows and balconies are clearly structured, but the details are blurred, and the entire background presents a slight bokeh effect. This makes the subject stand out more. The composition uses a low-angle shot, with the subject positioned slightly to the left of the frame, head facing upward to the right, and the line of sight extending to the top of the frame, forming a strong visual guiding line. This composition not only enhances the sense of space in the image, but also highlights the character's upward posture and inner emotional expression. The light comes from directly above, belonging to natural light with moderate intensity, providing enough brightness to illuminate the subject without overexposing or shadowing. At the same time, a light shadow is cast on the neck and shoulders, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with a grainy texture and color saturation characteristic of film photography. The tones are mainly green, white, orange, and blue. Green comes from leaves, white from the sky and T-shirts, orange from patterns and earrings, blue from hats and straps. These colors echo each other, forming a harmonious and unified visual system. The overall image presents a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, as if it were a casual street shoot using amateur equipment. For example, film cameras or vintage digital cameras have a focal length of about 50mm, apertures set to f/2.8, and moderate shutter speeds, capturing quiet moments in motion. The image texture is delicate, color layers rich, and possess strong artistic appeal and a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
