        {
          "id": "krea2-60632ea0554a07353e0ed4dc",
          "alias": "单女白袜子公园俏皮倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "Her overall posture is relaxed and natural: her left hand grips the rope tightly, her right hand raises the bar above the crossbar, her body leans slightly forward, legs bent, right leg raised, feet stepping on the rope net, wearing white long socks and black leather shoes. Her school uniform is a white short-sleeved top with a deep blue bow tie and striped cuffs, and a dark blue pleated skirt that gently flutters in the wind. The background is a blurred green tree and gray-white sky. A soft bokeh effect is presented. In the foreground, a clear beige thick hemp rope woven into a grid-like climbing structure with fine texture and uniform thickness forms a regular checkered pattern. Some ropes extend from the edges of the frame, creating a strong visual framework. In the middle shot, the girl is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the rope net, her body intertwined with the rope net, creating a rich sense of layering. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered, and the rope net serving as a guiding line directing the viewer toward the subject, while the lines of the rope net are used to divide the view. It creates a geometric aesthetic and emphasizes a positive and uplifting spirit. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft natural light, with light coming slightly from the front slightly above, without strong shadows. The sky appears pale gray, suggesting cloudy or thin cloudy weather. The overall color scheme is mainly blue-white, paired with warm beige cords and a green background, creating a fresh, youthful, and healthy campus atmosphere. The images have the realism of everyday amateur equipment, as if casually captured with a regular camera in a park or school playground, with a slight shallow depth of field effect The background is naturally blurred, with moderate color saturation that is not exaggerated, preserving subtle noise and light transitions from the real environment. The overall style combines realism with artistic beauty, conveying a sunny, lively, and carefree youthful charm. The scene is tranquil yet full of vitality, with a rigorous yet lively composition. Every detail serves the theme and presents a vibrant snapshot of campus life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
