        {
          "id": "krea2-a40a8dd535a801ad6b40d9ba",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙窗边微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a bright indoor window, wearing a light, flowing white long-sleeve dress. The dress features a multi-layered pleated design, cinched at the waist, and adorned with thin ribbons. The hem naturally flares out in an A-shape, showcasing an elegant silhouette and a sense of dynamism. The semi-transparent fabric creates a soft texture and subtle light and shadow changes under the light. She wears a gentle smile, turning back to look at the camera. Her left hand is gently raised, fingers slightly bent, her posture naturally relaxed, her right hand naturally hanging down, her body slightly turned to the side, and her right leg lifted forward. The toes touch the ground, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The overall posture is full of youthful energy and sweetness. The background features a glass window with diamond-shaped grids, and outside the window is a blurred outdoor scene. The wooden floor and green plants are faintly visible, creating a peaceful and comfortable atmosphere. The painting mainly features white and light tones, with light streaming in diagonally through the window, creating a soft backlighting effect. The figure's outlines are clear, clothing details rich, and the transition of light and shadow is natural. The overall composition uses a vertical composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. Using window frames as visual guidance enhances spatial layering: the foreground and the lower body of the person, the middle ground the full body and window frame, and the background the blurred scenery outside the window. By controlling depth of field, the main subject is highlighted, creating a clean, fresh, and dreamlike visual experience. The overall image presents a beautiful moment captured in daily life, as if captured with a regular camera, with a strong sense of realism and life. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, with white as the main tone, supplemented by pale pink, beige, and light gray. It creates a warm and gentle atmosphere, with delicate light and shadow handling—highlights are bright but not glaring, shadows are soft and natural, details are rich, and the entire scene is filled with poetic beauty, evoking a sense of tranquility and beauty in everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
