        {
          "id": "krea2-7474ddd87a54ce7c60b42a0c",
          "alias": "单女外套烟火神秘跳舞",
          "prompt": "Under the deep night sky, she held two burning fireworks sticks high, sparks flying everywhere, dazzling like stars, as if gazing into the wonders of the universe's depths. A warm orange-yellow halo emanated from the fireworks, creating a striking contrast of light and shadow. She wore a thick, dark coat, the collar slightly raised, revealing a light-colored inner garment at the cuffs, adding a touch of layering. The background was a pure deep blue night sky, without a single cloud, making it especially peaceful and vast. In the distance, a faint circular light patch could be seen. It could be streetlights or the moon, adding a mysterious atmosphere to the scene. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, placing the figure in the lower right of the frame, leaving plenty of space above for fireworks and starry skies, creating an upward-extending visual tension. In the foreground is a burning firework stick, whose bright light and dancing sparks become the absolute focal point of the scene, guiding the viewer's gaze upward, gently wrapped in warm light, forming a strong contrast with the cool-toned background. The background is a deep night sky, clean and crisp, with no distractions. This further enhances the subject's presence. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and romantic, blending the festive joy with a touch of serene poetry. The color scheme features cool blue and warm yellow tones, forming a classic complementary color contrast that enhances visual impact. The image presents the grainy texture and slight noise characteristic of film photography, simulating the realism of everyday handheld device shooting. The lens is chosen for wide-angle or standard angles, with a slightly blurred background that highlights the subject. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life. It seems to capture the most touching moment of an ordinary night, like a slow-motion freeze in a movie, capturing the eternal beauty of the passage of time. It lets you feel the immense light in tiny things and the instinctive longing for hope and beauty. The entire scene is filled with a quiet and heartfelt sense of loneliness, yet it is not lacking in warmth and strength, like a lamp lit in the darkness, illuminating the soft corners of the heart.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
