        {
          "id": "krea2-9d047a744b362c10aff584c5",
          "alias": "单女白外套微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a colorful ribbon background, wearing a warm smile and showing neat, white teeth, appearing healthy and energetic. She wears a loose white jacket printed with abstract colorful patterns that echo the ribbons in the background. Underneath, she wears a pink turtleneck shirt with faint patterns at the collar. Her posture is slightly turned sideways, head tilted slightly, facing the camera, as if engaging in intimate communication with the audience. In the foreground, several colorful ribbons or paper ribbons stretch diagonally from the lower right corner to the upper left corner. These ribbons come in a variety of colors, including red, yellow, blue, green, purple, etc. They flutter in the wind, creating a dynamic blur effect that adds dynamism and layering to the image. The middle shot is the main subject, positioned slightly to the left of the center, her body slightly tilted, head turned toward the camera, full of youthful energy. Her shoulders and arms are partially covered by the ribbons, but the details of the clothing can still be clearly seen. The background is a dreamlike space woven from countless colorful ribbons, densely suspended in the air, forming a vibrant visual wall. The colors are bright and transitions smoothly, presenting a flowing beauty. The composition uses close-ups and shallow depth effects to blur the background and highlight the main subject. The overall scene presents a light, cheerful, and hopeful atmosphere that attracts viewers' attention. Light comes from the front above, making the contours clear and shadows soft, without strong contrasts. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and warm. Sunlight filters through the ribbons and casts dappled light spots, creating a festive and joyful atmosphere. The entire image carries a strong artistic and everyday atmosphere, as if capturing a real and beautiful moment. It feels like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, yet still with the authentic texture of daily record. The color saturation is high but not exaggerated, maintaining a natural visual effect. The edges of the frame have a slight vignetting effect, enhancing the prominence of the central subject. The overall style is fresh and sweet. Full of youthful energy, it evokes a sense of uplifting energy, as if immersed in a feast of color, with every detail brimming with vitality and emotional expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
