        {
          "id": "krea2-e5d96ecedbbb610b89fab62d",
          "alias": "单女透视连衣裙摄影棚神秘倚靠指向",
          "prompt": "A woman leans gracefully and confidently against the edge of a light gray wood-textured door frame. She wears a deep blue high-neck, sleeveless tight dress with a short gray-purple hem that outlines smooth curves. White pinstripes adorn the shoulders and chest, adding a touch of professionalism and fashion, exuding a mysterious and captivating aura. Her left hand gently rests on the doorframe, her right hand hangs naturally, and she wears a simple ring on her wrist, with a work badge with a red tag hanging around her neck. Hinting at her possible background, she has long legs, wears black sheer stockings, and a pair of shiny black pointed high heels with striking red soles creating a strong visual contrast. Her posture presents a dynamic beauty of one leg bent and the other straight, with a slight tilt to the side, highlighting a graceful waistline and leg lines. The foreground is the main figure, occupying the center-left position of the composition, using a medium angle to highlight the proportions and details of the posture. The middle ground features the wooden door panel she leans on and the beige vertical pleated curtain on the right. The curtain is smooth in texture with a silky sheen, reflecting soft warm tones under the light. The floor is covered with a dark brown striped carpet, with clear texture and distinct layers, enhancing the sense of depth in the space. The background is a simple indoor environment, with walls in light gray or off-white, clean and neat without unnecessary decoration, focusing entirely on the figure. The overall composition uses vertical lines formed by the door frame to contrast with the diagonal curves of the figures, creating a strong visual guiding effect. Light projects from the upper left side, simulating the lighting setup of a professional studio. The main light source is soft and focused, illuminating the front and sides of the figure, while casting clear and delicate shadows on the door panels and floor to enhance the sense of depth. The shadows point to the lower right, echoing the figure's posture and creating a warm and slightly intimate atmosphere. The colors are mainly cool blue-purple tones, paired with warm yellow curtains and lighting, creating a contrast of warm and cool and enhancing the visual impact of the image. The overall atmosphere combines modern urban feel with artistry, like a carefully crafted commercial portrait work, or like a real, everyday moment captured. Full of storytelling and emotional tension, the image quality is high-definition, details are rich, clothing wrinkles look natural, stockings are just rightly transparent, and high heels reflect strongly to reflect the authenticity of the materials. Camera specs are set to 85mm prime lens, f/2.8 large aperture, shallow depth of field, natural background blur, sharp and clear subjects, and shooting angles slightly upward. Emphasizing the upright posture and aura of the characters, the overall style blends fashionable portraits with everyday scenes, presenting a visual language that is both professional and approachable, with high artistic expression and emotional appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
