        {
          "id": "krea2-a936e0369b7983b9126215e8",
          "alias": "单女棕高领衫城市注视",
          "prompt": "Her overall aura is elegant and urban. She wears a dark brown turtleneck tight knit sweater with delicate material and clearly visible texture, outlining her slender silhouette. She pairs a plaid A-line short skirt with a houndstooth pattern interwoven in beige and brown, giving off a vintage vibe. The front of the dress is decorated with a row of dark brown buttons, and the left side has a square pocket. The design is simple yet detailed. She wears black stockings, her legs are smooth, and on her feet are brown velvet ankle boots with moderate heels, giving off a warm feel. Her right hand holds a transparent umbrella with black ribs and handles. The canopy is fully unfolded, and the transparent material makes the background faintly visible, creating a sense of visual transparency. Her posture is naturally relaxed, her body slightly turned to the camera, and her left hand hangs naturally at her side, adding a sense of realism. The road is made of gray cement, with some gravel and fallen leaves on the surface, and slight wear on the edges, presenting the authentic texture of everyday street scenes The middle shot is the main subject, positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. The composition uses a third-division method, with the figure occupying the main space but maintaining a certain sense of breath. The background is a light green glass display window, with slight reflections and wrinkles that reflect the blurred surroundings. On the right side of the window is a white paper printed with the words \"LOWE\" and some small text explanations. The font is simple and modern, and below is a white tiled wall, with neatly arranged bricks, clear gaps, and uniform colors, creating a soft overall tone that creates a tranquil atmosphere The sky does not appear directly, but judging by the lighting, it is cloudy or evening. The light is soft and diffuse, with no obvious shadows. Light and shadow shine directly in front, casting faint shadows on the ground. The overall colors are mainly warm brown, off-white, black, and green, with harmonious tones that evoke the warmth of autumn and winter. The composition is stable, the viewing angle is level enough, highlighting the main subject while preserving environmental details. The geometric lines of the transparent umbrella guide the gaze upward, then back down to the entire figure, forming a complete visual loop. The images present a sense of everyday urban street aesthetics, combining fashion with a sense of everyday life. It feels as if they were taken with a professional camera, yet retains a natural and authentic texture. The images are delicate, layered, and transitions of light and shadow are natural, full of artistic and storytelling elements",
