        {
          "id": "krea2-ab131d7b4e49cb017e003f3b",
          "alias": "单女毛衣微笑倚靠持相机",
          "prompt": "Her white, neat teeth are revealed, her smile full of infectious charm, evoking genuine joy. She wears a colorful knit sweater with patterns woven from green, red, brown, and white, presenting a classic Nordic style. The sweater's texture is clearly visible, with fine stitching and a warm texture. Underneath, a simple white crew-neck T-shirt creates a sense of layering. Both hands tightly grip several burning firework sticks, sparks flying, and bright lights trace graceful trajectories in the darkness, twinkling with starlight, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. In the foreground, there are blurry spots of light and flying sparks, varying in size and shape—some round, others star-shaped. They float in front of the camera like scattered stars in the night sky. This adds dynamism and mystery to the scene. The center is a full-body portrait of the woman, positioned slightly to the left of the center, leaning slightly forward and with a naturally relaxed posture. The background is a deep night sky and the hazy outline of a city in the distance. Several street lamps emit a soft yellow glow, forming a warm halo that contrasts with the cool tones in the foreground. In the distance, blurred silhouettes of trees and intertwined branches add depth to the composition. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the main figure centered and the light sources and spots symmetrically distributed on both sides. This creates visual balance, while using shallow depth of field effects to blur the background and highlight the main subject. In terms of light and shadow, the main light sources come from the firework sticks in the woman's hands and the street lamp in the background. The light shines from the front and sides, creating contrasts of light and shadow, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and making it look more lively. The street lamps in the background provide auxiliary lighting, filling the entire scene with warm tones. The overall atmosphere is cozy and romantic, with a strong festive atmosphere, as if on a winter night people are celebrating the New Year or a special occasion. The images are filled with hope and beauty, evoking those simple yet precious moments. This feeling of everyday amateur equipment shooting is expressed through subtle noise and natural light transitions, authentic yet aesthetically pleasing, rich in detail, emotionally rich, and immersive",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
