        {
          "id": "krea2-201b8250af8e029aaa209d1a",
          "alias": "单女女仆黑外套花园神秘持相机",
          "prompt": "The overall look was elegant and slightly mysterious. She stood slightly to the side, her expression tinged with tenderness and shyness. Her hands carefully held a white tray containing several golden pastries and a white paper cup. Her outfit was richly detailed: a black sheer long-sleeved coat with intricate lace trim on the cuffs and collar. Underneath, she wears a black velvet high-neck dress adorned with several pearl buttons on the chest. The hem unfolds in an A-shape, with ruffled hems. A wide black satin belt is tied around the waist, and two slender straps hang down the waist, connecting the black lace garter straps and over-the-knee stockings. The cuff is also exquisitely embroidered with lace, and the leg lines are faintly visible beneath the semi-transparent fabric, creating a visual contrast that is both sexy and dignified. The foreground is centered on the figure, occupying most of the composition. Highlighting the details and posture of her clothing, the middle is her environment, with a blurred background that can be identified as a greenhouse or indoor garden filled with greenery. Wooden window frames and glass reflect soft natural light, several tall green plants have unfurled leaves, and their branches hang naturally, adding a touch of vitality and tranquility. Light streams in diagonally from the right, creating a soft backlight effect, creating a faint halo at the edges of the figure's silhouette. The clear layering of light and shadow enhances the sense of three-dimensionality and atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly deep black, supplemented by light gray, Off-white and emerald green, with strong color contrast yet harmony, the composition uses a center-left position of the figure, using depth of field to blur the background to highlight the subject and guide the viewer's attention to the expressions, movements, and costume details, forming a smooth emotional flow path. The atmosphere is tranquil yet slightly private, as if capturing the moment of a maid quietly serving in the garden under the afternoon sun, presenting an overall visual style that combines artistic beauty with everyday life. It features slight noise and realism similar to amateur camera shooting, with natural image texture, clear details, and rich storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
