        {
          "id": "krea2-840606679ab9104a886611ef",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤俏皮倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "She tilts her head slightly, seemingly calling out or breathing softly, her expression tinged with laziness and curiosity. The brim of her hat is slightly worn, printed with blue and white patterns resembling hand-drawn abstract patterns. The upper half is shrouded in shadow, while the lower half is clearly visible under soft light, radiating a natural reddish sheen, appearing moist and real, presenting a natural pink tone with a playful touch, yet conveying a sense of focus or surprise. She wore a light blue lace camisole with thin straps and soft fabric that hugged her curves. The lace edges featured delicate hollow-out patterns, rich in detail. The neck line was smooth, collarbones faintly visible, and her overall posture relaxed and natural, as if captured in a private moment on a summer afternoon. The composition used a very close-up perspective, with the figure occupying most of the space. The background was blurred, presenting a blurred gradient of white and pale blue, possibly from light streaming through windows or reflections from the wall. It creates a bright and pure atmosphere. The middle frame shows her shoulders, neck, and upper chest, while the background is a completely unfocused environment, enhancing the subject's prominence. The composition is asymmetrical: the figure's head leans to the right, the hat extends diagonally from the upper left corner to the lower right, forming a dynamic diagonal line that then extends down to the shoulders. Light and shadow come from the left side, while light and shadow on the right side create faint shadows, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall color tone mainly uses warm and cool contrasts, with a slight film texture and fine graininess, and moderate color saturation. With a slight retro filter effect, it feels like shooting with an old-fashioned camera, exuding the simplicity of everyday amateur equipment. There are no obvious artificial traces in the image; all elements appear natural and authentic. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, conveying a sense of youthfulness, freedom, and spontaneity, as if time has frozen in this moment, recording the most genuine and casual moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
