        {
          "id": "krea2-8765e8b568ce9dfaf1650675",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道倚靠侧头（2）",
          "prompt": "She wears a white short-sleeved T-shirt with lace cutouts on the sleeves, showcasing exquisite textured details. The hem of the T-shirt is slightly tied around the waist, highlighting a slender waistline. She pairs with pink plaid high-waisted shorts with four black buttons on the front as decoration. The overall look is simple, fresh, and stylish, with her legs together. Knees slightly bent, hands naturally resting on thighs, body slightly leaning forward, head tilted to the right, as if interacting warmly with the viewer. The background is a clear blue sky, dotted with a few fluffy white clouds. In the distance, faint outlines of port buildings and some industrial facilities can be seen. Green barbed wire fences span the frame, with some areas featuring rusted metal rods, adding a sense of life and authenticity. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, making the main subject appear more prominent and three-dimensional. The figure occupies a slightly left central position, forming a visual focal point. The barbed wire in the background and distant scenery form a distinctly layered spatial structure. In terms of light and shadow, intense sunlight shines down from above, with clear but not harsh shadows. The overall lighting is abundant and natural, creating a warm and bright summer atmosphere. The colors are mainly blue, white, and pink, complemented by green and metallic gray. The tones are fresh and bright, full of youthful energy. The entire scene presents a beautiful moment from everyday life that happens unexpectedly. It feels like street photos taken casually with a regular camera, full of sunshine, freedom, and joy, allowing people to feel the tranquility and comfort of a summer afternoon. The details are rich, from the subject's expression, clothing textures to the background environmental elements, all clearly visible. The overall composition is balanced, the visual guidance is natural and smooth, providing a relaxed and enjoyable viewing experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
