        {
          "id": "krea2-98b479858eb0914337c27b08",
          "alias": "单女黑外套公园沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside a wooden bench in the park, showing her neat, white teeth, radiating youthful energy and joy. Her body leans slightly forward, her head tilted to one side, her posture relaxed and natural, as if interacting with the camera or being amused in a moment, showing a casual yet elegant aura. She wears a black leather jacket with a smooth texture and a slight reflective finish. The lapel design is simple and neat, with metal buttons on the collar, and she wears a blue-and-white plaid shirt underneath, with clearly visible cuffs and neckline. The plaid pattern is classic and retro, with denim shorts revealing long, well-proportioned legs. The overall style is casual yet fashionable. The background is a blurred park landscape, with tall trees in the distance with straight trunks and lush foliage, forming a green barrier. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled shadows, creating a soft and warm atmosphere. The ground is covered with green grass and fallen leaves, with faintly visible winding paths. The shot uses a shallow depth of field, with the main figure clearly highlighted and the background rendered with delicate blur. Creating bokeh effects, the wooden bench is positioned below the foreground, with a slightly aged surface and clear grain visible and wear marks on the edges, adding realism and a sense of life. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, making the figure appear more upright and drawing closer to the viewer, enhancing immersion. The visual guide extends from the bench to the figure's body, with light and shadow coming from the sides and rear, forming a soft contour light and natural shadow transitions. The overall tone leans toward coolness, mainly pale gray and green, but warm sunlight is interspersed to create a contrast between cool and warm tones. It creates a peaceful and cozy afternoon atmosphere, with delicate image texture and moderate color saturation, featuring the graininess and layering of film photography. It feels as if you were shooting with an old-fashioned camera, capturing a beautiful moment by accident. The overall atmosphere is both everyday and artistic, conveying a relaxed, joyful, and free attitude toward life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
