        {
          "id": "krea2-cd29fc6aa7067bff0cb82d8e",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙沙发自信坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits elegantly on a deep blue velvet buttoned sofa, wearing a form-fitting black sleeveless dress with feather embellishments, paired with black stockings and black pointed high heels. The overall look is simple yet textured, with exquisite makeup, black nail polish, and a delicate ring on her finger. Her posture is calm and confident, her left hand resting gently on her knee, right hand slightly bent, elbow resting on the armrest, exuding a lazy yet charming aura. The background is a light gray wall. On the wall hangs an abstract art painting dominated by red and black, framed in wood, adding a touch of modern artistic flair. The floor is covered with beige geometric tiles reflecting a warm glow. Light softly streams in from the sides, creating a bright and cozy indoor atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure centered slightly to the left, and the leg lines extending below the frame, creating visual guidance that highlights body proportions and posture beauty. The light and shadow are evenly distributed, with delicate and natural shadows. The overall color palette is dominated by black, blue, and beige. The contrast is striking yet harmonious, presenting a blend of sophistication and everyday life, as if a fashionable portrait shot indoors with a professional camera—rich in detail, authentic texture, and possessing strong visual impact and artistic appeal",
