        {
          "id": "krea2-929a29cc8c3aa87234b0c1d7",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫窗边冷淡倚靠",
          "prompt": "She wears a bright royal blue loose shirt with delicate texture, slightly pleated and glossy. The cuffs and shoulders have smooth and natural lines, and the hem is casually tucked into dark green high-waisted pants. The color contrast is vivid and harmonious, making the overall look simple yet modern. The figure is positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the frame, with the body slightly tilted and head turned toward the camera, creating a visually striking focal point. The foreground is a close-up of the upper body of the figure, occupying most of the composition. The middle shot features a row of dark brown wooden cabinets behind it, with clear surface grain and a warm wood texture. The cabinet doors feature classical carved decorations and metal handles, adding a touch of retro charm. On the right side of the background, soft natural light faintly filters through, and the light from outside creates a transition of light and shadow indoors, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition combines close-up shots with the middle ground environment, with the figures occupying the main subject and background elements as a backdrop. This creates a clear spatial relationship between front and back, then extends to the lower right through the flowing lines of blue clothing, finally being supported by the vertical lines of the wooden cabinet, creating a dynamic balance. The lighting and shadows mainly use side backlighting, with the light source coming from the right window, softly outlining the figure's outline. The shadowed areas show delicate transitions, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall tone leans toward warmth, with blue-green and brownish tones creating a warm and cool contrast, highlighting the fresh temperament of the figures while blending the cozy home environment. The painting atmosphere is quiet, Intimate yet slightly artistic, like an unintentional snapshot, capturing real moments in life. It has strong narrative and emotional tension, as if you can hear breathing and subtle sounds. The background is moderately blurred, preserving some cabinet details without interfering with the subject, drawing the audience's attention to the emotional expression of the characters. The overall style lies between fashion photography and everyday documentary, combining artistic beauty with a sense of life authenticity, like a frame taken with an old film camera under the afternoon sun. The image quality has a slightly grainy texture and slight overexposure, enhancing nostalgia and realism",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
