        {
          "id": "krea2-d86e0e4260b19a2522c2f0e7",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙浴室站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a modern-style bathroom mirror for a selfie. She wears a form-fitting pink fitted spaghetti strap dress with delicate pleated textures, creating a soft sheen under the light. The neckline is designed in a deep V-shape, highlighting the graceful lines of her neck and bust. The front features a blurred gray letter pattern, creating an overall look that is simple yet feminine, with clear layers. The back of the phone clearly displays the Apple logo and triple camera module. The case has a matte finish, and the hand posture is natural. The fingers are long and the nails are neatly trimmed. The left hand gently rests on the thigh, the body slightly turns to the side, showing an elegant S-shaped curve. The background is a dark marble-textured wall, smooth with subtle natural patterns. The wall features an embedded black shelf with a white shell ornament, a black aroma lamp, and some small items. On the right side is a mirror reflecting part of the space. The mirror reflects a metallic shower fixture and some interior furnishings. On the lower left, a faint white bathtub edge can be seen. The entire scene is illuminated by warm-toned lights from the top and sides, creating a warm and soft atmosphere. Light and shadow create natural transitions of light and shadow on the figures. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The phone serves as a foreground element to interact with the figure, while the furniture and decorations in the background add rich layers. The overall image exudes a strong sense of daily life and life, as if captured with a regular mobile phone, while also possessing a certain artistic aesthetic. The color tones are mainly pink, black, and warm yellow, harmoniously and unified. The image texture is delicate and detailed, conveying a private, comfortable, and relaxing home atmosphere. The images capture the natural moments of modern urban women expressing themselves and recording life in their private spaces, full of authenticity and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
