        {
          "id": "krea2-be29d3370175fca5bd2b7361",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫床忧伤坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed covered with white sheets, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt and a gray pleated skirt, paired with white tights. Her expression is neutral with a faint sense of melancholy. Her body leans slightly back, her hands naturally resting at her sides to support herself, legs crossed and stretched forward, knees bent, posture relaxed yet dignified. The overall composition centers on the figure, occupying the main position of the composition, using a medium perspective to present the figure from head to knee completely, with a simple indoor setting in the background. Pure white walls and translucent white curtains form a clean background. On the right side, a white cushion leans against the wall, with the edge of the window frame faintly visible. Soft natural light streams in outside, evenly illuminating the figures and creating a gentle transition between light and shadow without strong shadows. The direction of light and shadow comes from the front left, with the overall tone mainly white, light gray, and pale pink, creating a pure, quiet, and slightly cool atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a high-resolution camera, with slight film graininess and realistic light and shadow layers. The background is slightly blurred to highlight the subject, the composition is balanced, and there is ample blank space. The overall style is simple, realistic, and artistic, with the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting. At the same time, it maintains professional photography control of light and shadow and color harmony, presenting a quiet, restrained, and story-rich moment, as if capturing a gentle moment overlooked in ordinary life",
