        {
          "id": "krea2-bca766596378827ec5857628",
          "alias": "单女浴袍沙发忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a classical-style dark wooden armchair, wearing a short-sleeved robe with a red base and small white floral patterns. The fabric is thin and breathable, naturally draped to form soft pleats. The collar is slightly open, revealing the collarbones. The overall look is comfortable, casual, yet elegant, and her expression reveals a sense of quiet contemplation and a subtle melancholy. Her legs are crossed, her right leg bent and raised, the sole gently resting on her left knee, barefoot with natural toes, her posture relaxed yet dignified. Her hands are naturally placed between her knees and thighs, fingers are long, and her movements are smooth and natural. The foreground is the main part of her sitting posture, occupying the center to the right of the frame. The composition uses a medium perspective, presenting the figure fully from the waist up to the feet. The background features a large window, and the curtains are white semi-transparent sheer curtains. Sunlight streams in from outside, creating a soft backlight effect. Light penetrates the curtain, creating delicate layers of light and shadow. The window frame is made of dark metal, and on the right side, you can see some dark brown heavy fabric curtains, adding depth to the space. On the left side is a round carved wooden table with a golden yellow surface with exquisitely carved edges and elegantly curved legs. The surface reflects a smooth texture, and the floor is covered with a dark gray checkered carpet with clear texture, echoing the black-and-white geometric patterns on the chair cushions. The overall color scheme mainly features warm red, off-white, and dark brown, creating a cozy yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The composition uses the classic three-part method: the figure is positioned on the right one-third, with the gaze directed toward the left blank area to create visual balance. The light and shadow mainly come from natural light in the upper left. The light source is soft and directional, with the figure's outline outlined in a bright halo. The folds of clothing create contrast between light and dark under the light, enhancing the texture. The curtains and walls in the background show a gradient transition from bright gray to pure white, with blur treatment making the subject stand out. The overall image has a film-like grainy texture and slight color shift, simulating vintage camera shooting effects. The tone is warm and saturated, with rich but not overly sharp details, presenting a fleeting beauty in everyday life. It is as if on a morning or afternoon, sunlight streams through the curtains into the room, and the woman sits alone in a chair, lost in her thoughts. The entire scene is filled with tranquility, privacy, and poetry. The image conveys a gentle, restrained, and slightly melancholic mood, like an old photo forgotten in a drawer, carrying traces of time and the warmth of memory",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
