        {
          "id": "krea2-380f7ee49ff1539d8f11a7a3",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣街道忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the concrete steps at a city street corner, wearing a loose dark gray sweater and black pants, wearing a pair of white sneakers. Her expression is calm and reserved, her body slightly leaning forward, hands naturally resting on her knees. Her posture is relaxed yet tinged with a hint of detachment. Her figure is sharply cut by side light, creating a sharp contrast of light and shadow. Sunlight on the left side shines in from above, casting clear geometric shadows on the rough concrete wall. The wall is mottled and old, cracked in many places, and locally peeling reveals gray-white and light brown underlayers The right wall displays a blue-gray tone with faded graffiti marks, giving the overall texture a rough yet timed feel. Behind the figure are the building's metal columns, with rust and weathering on the surface. In the background, a corner of the street can be faintly seen. Yellow traffic signs extend into the distance, with blurred shop signs and greenery nearby. The composition uses a golden ratio slightly to the left center, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center, forming a visual focal point. Light shines from the upper left, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The shadowed areas create a sense of deep space. The foreground is the edge of the steps where the figures sit, made of dark concrete, echoing the wall behind. The middle is the space between the figures and the wall, with interlacing light and shadow and rich layers. The background is a gradually blurred street environment, enhancing the sense of depth in the image. The overall color palette is mainly cool gray, dark brown, and white, accented with a touch of blue and yellow. The atmosphere is tranquil yet slightly melancholic, with a documentary photography texture, as if capturing a moment of everyday life. For example, using an old camera or phone to casually shoot in the afternoon sunlight, the image has a slight graininess and film texture, low color saturation, complete detail preservation, natural light and shadow transitions, no excessive embellishment, presenting a realistic, simple, and story-rich street aesthetic. The composition is stable, the angle is level with a slight downward shot, enhancing immersion. The visual guide is guided from the strong light on the left to the character, then through shadows and lines extending to the background, creating a smooth flow of sight. The overall style blends urban realism with emotional expression. It combines a sense of everyday life with artistic flair, like a private diary fragment from the street",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
