        {
          "id": "krea2-c031643692194e1d7473d33a",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫森林忧伤站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways in a dense green forest, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt and a deep blue suspender dress, her posture elegant and serene. Her right hand gently holds a transparent umbrella, the canopy slightly tilted, the ribs clearly visible, and the handle white. The overall design is simple yet poetic, her head slightly tilted back, her expression focused and slightly contemplative, as if feeling the fresh air after rain or listening to the rustling of leaves, presenting a serene beauty. Her body leans slightly forward, her waist lines smooth, The hem of the skirt naturally falls to the ankles, blending seamlessly with the surroundings. The foreground is the main subject, occupying about one-third of the left side of the frame. The composition uses the rule of thirds, with the figure near the golden ratio point, forming a visual focal point. The middle ground features layers of green leaves, their branches interlacing, slender and palm-shaped. The colors transition naturally from tender green to deep green, with mottled light and shadow. Some leaves are shimmered by sunlight, creating a semi-transparent texture. The background is a distant blurred canopy, with the blurred effect enhancing the sense of spatial depth. It creates a hazy and profound atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly green, complemented by the blue-and-white contrast of the characters' clothing, resulting in harmonious and unified colors. Light and shadow come from the upper left, with soft and even lighting without strong shadows, creating a scattered light effect reminiscent of early morning or cloudy days. The air seems to be filled with moist moisture, making the entire scene fresh and tranquil. The composition uses vertical lines of trees to echo the figures' body lines, while the curved contours of transparent umbrellas break the monotony of straight lines, enhancing the dynamic beauty of the composition The visual guide line is formed by the direction of the character's gaze and the angle of the umbrella, then looking back at the character, forming a cyclical viewing path. The atmosphere presents an artistic, tranquil, and slightly melancholic poetic feeling, much like slow-motion scenes in a film, capturing the subtle emotional exchange between humans and nature. It has strong artistic appeal and emotional resonance. The overall style is similar to Japanese gravure photography, emphasizing detail and emotional expression, using a large-aperture lens for precise depth control, with background blur as soft as a dream. The image is delicate in texture, with moderate color saturation, preserving real light and shadow layers, presenting a film-like warm graininess and slight vignetting, as if taken by chance with an old-fashioned film camera in a park after rain, full of poetry and philosophical reflection in everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
