        {
          "id": "krea2-fae109d43ab61934745fdb2f",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫俏皮躺",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her side on the grass covered with a white wool-trimmed blanket. She wears an off-white turtleneck knit sweater and a black short skirt, her legs bent and raised, wearing dark stockings. Her ankles are naturally crossed, her posture relaxed and lazy. Under the soft light, she appears especially transparent, the sweater's texture clearly visible, and the fine knitted stitches create a warm texture under the light and shadow. The background is a blurry autumn forest. Golden and orange-red intertwined leaves glow warmly under the sunlight, creating a dreamlike bokeh. Bright light streams through the treetops, with warm yellow and soft white tones as the main tones, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly poetic atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the frame, body extending diagonally, enhancing visual dynamism and spatial layering. The foreground features grass and scattered dead leaves, rich in detail, with clear outlines and edges. The middle shots are figures and blankets, with their postures natural and lively, full of life. The background is blurred to highlight the main subject while preserving the color and atmosphere of the environment. Light and shadow come from diagonal top, with soft backlighting outlining the figures. The shadows transition naturally, and the overall lighting is warm and bright, like a ray of sunlight piercing through the forest on an autumn afternoon, creating a quiet, comfortable, and emotionally rich scene. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, with slight film graininess and natural color shifts. It simulates the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. The lens is a mid-focal length prime lens with precise depth control, the background is naturally blurred, presenting an overall documentary-style portrait aesthetic. The image contains no unnecessary decorations or distractions, focusing on capturing the harmonious relationship between the person and the natural environment, conveying a simple and beautiful moment of life. The image has high detail expression, balanced composition, smooth visual guidance, and then extends along the body's lines to the autumn background colors, making the entire scene full of narrative. It seems to tell a story about autumn, youth, and tranquility",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
