        {
          "id": "krea2-56b651f2d0f98438ec05c139",
          "alias": "单女灰制服舞台严肃倚靠",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a gray school uniform, a white shirt, and a striped tie. She wore a gray suit jacket with white trim, a shield-shaped school emblem printed with the word \"UP\" on her left chest, and a gray pleated skirt below. Her left hand was raised high, forcefully pulling open the heavy red curtain, while her right hand hung naturally at her side, her body slightly leaning, her posture elegant and full of movement. It feels as if you are making your stage or about to perform. The background is a deep red velvet curtain, delicate in texture, rich in folds, and interwoven light and shadow, creating a dramatic atmosphere. Light shines from the front right, creating a soft transition between light and shadow, while casting soft shadows on the screen enhances the sense of space and three-dimensionality. The overall composition uses a medium-angle shot, with the figure occupying the center-left position, creating a strong color contrast. The red curtain contrasts sharply with the gray school uniform, highlighting the main subject. It also creates a warm and solemn stage atmosphere. The visuals have strong visual impact and narrative quality, as if capturing a moment full of hope and dreams. The photography style resembles professional studio shoots but retains a slight film texture and natural noise, making the images more realistic and artistic. The lens is a standard 50mm prime lens with an f/2.8 aperture, creating a shallow depth of field effect. The background is moderately blurred, enhancing the subject's prominence. The overall atmosphere is warm, bright, and positive. It combines the innocence of campus with the ritualistic feel of a stage, as if recording a moment of blossoming at a crucial moment in life. The details are rich, from the texture of the school uniforms to the folds of the curtain, all clearly visible, presenting a refined and authentic aesthetic",
          "description": "",
