        {
          "id": "krea2-c1cc3c11cd2fb74c00063350",
          "alias": "单女白T恤城市冷淡倚靠持包",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose white T-shirt with abstract orange and black patterns on the chest, paired with dark blue denim shorts, and white sneakers with black laces and thick rubber texture on the soles, looking both casual and comfortable. She carries a dark blue canvas crossbody bag, The shoulder strap slung across her chest, the bag slightly bulging, seemingly holding daily necessities. She held a yellow and black traffic cone with both hands, leaning slightly forward, knees bent, her posture relaxed yet dynamic, as if she had just stopped and was ready to move forward. Her left hand gently rested on the cone, while her right hand naturally hung down, fingers bent slightly. The overall movement was smooth and natural, full of life. In the foreground was a striking yellow and black striped traffic cone, with the words \"No Parking\" and a circular no-parking sign printed on the cone. The surface of the cone is slightly worn, showing real signs of urban use. The traffic cone stands on the gray asphalt pavement, with clear white markings along the edge. Next to it are blue-and-white sidewalk tiles, arranged neatly in a wavy pattern with delicate texture. In the middle is a narrow street, flanked by buildings of various styles. On the right is a row of modern shops, with predominantly white exterior walls. At the entrance is a wooden table and a high stool, and beside it is a potted greenery, adding a touch of vitality to the otherwise cold and hard building. Above the shop hung several vintage-style neon signs. One emitted alternating red and blue lights, while the other had gold letters on a black background, faintly visible with the word \"NOTE.\" On the far left was an old residential building, with weathered walls and windows of varying sizes—some hanging clothes to dry, some with advertising posters. The rooftop was cluttered with clutter, creating a chaotic yet realistic atmosphere. The streets were empty, with only a few parked cars faintly visible. The background was a grayish-white sky, thin clouds, and soft lighting. The entire scene is enveloped in a faint warm yellow tone, as if the afternoon sunlight filters through the mist. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, placing the figure slightly to the left of the center. The traffic cone serves as a visual guiding element, extending upward from the bottom to draw the attention to the figure, creating a strong perspective effect. The street extends into the distance, creating a profound sense of space. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and nostalgic, with sunlight slanting down from the upper right, casting soft shadows on the figure. The folds and details of the fabric are clearly visible, while the reflections and shadows on the floor enhance the sense of depth. The overall color tone leans toward a vintage film style, with moderate color saturation and a slight faded look, presenting a hazy yet poetic beauty. The images are filled with the atmosphere of everyday life and youthful vitality, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment, like casually pressing a shutter with an old-fashioned camera to capture the most authentic moment in a corner of the city",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
