        {
          "id": "krea2-88c0fb364113fb51a7a7e4b5",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤城市冷淡站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an escalator, her body slightly turned to the side, glancing back at the camera with a calm and confident expression. She wears a deep blue spaghleaf camisole crop top made of lightweight, translucent material, subtly revealing her skin contours. She pairs a pair of high-waisted gray washed denim leggings that fit her body and outline smooth curves. The legs reach mid-calf, with clear seam lines. The back pocket design is simple, giving the overall look a stylish and modern feel. She wears silver metallic ultra-high-heeled sandals. The heel is slender and sharp, with hollowed-out and decorative details. The ankle is secured with a thin strap, giving it an elegant yet avant-garde look. Her left hand rests gently on the glass handrail, her arm lines graceful, while her right hand hangs naturally at her side, relaxed and full of tension. The escalator's metal steps are arranged in a stepped pattern, with fine textures on the surface and yellow safety warning strips along the edges. On both sides are transparent glass guardrails and stainless steel handrails, reflecting the surrounding environment and the person's image. In the background, you can see the mall's interior space, with blurred figures moving in the distance. On the ceiling, linear LED light strips emit soft, cool white light, evenly casting light and shadow to create a sense of modernity and order in urban commercial spaces. The building structure mainly features metal frames, glass curtain walls, and concrete walls, with a cool color tone dominated by gray, silver, and blue. The overall atmosphere is clean and crisp, full of a sense of technology intertwined with everyday life. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the characters' height and body proportions, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The escalator's diagonal lines extend from the lower left to the upper right, guiding the gaze upward and focusing on the figure. The vertical lines and geometric structures in the background enhance the depth and stability of the image. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from linear lighting above, ensuring even lighting in the front of the figure, while shadows are concentrated behind the body and below the stairs, creating a natural three-dimensional layer. The glass railing reflects the surrounding lights and shadows, increasing the complexity and realism of the image. The overall color scheme is mainly cool, creating a subtle contrast of warm and cool tones. The image texture is delicate and richly detailed, such as the polished texture of denim fabric, the reflection of metal surfaces, and the gloss of the upper surfaces, all clearly visible, presenting professional-level photography-level clarity and realism, while preserving the authentic atmosphere of everyday life. It feels like a high-end camera capturing a moment in a mall, combining artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
