        {
          "id": "krea2-4cb3be1704783cd00e71bc41",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套微笑持相机",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a woman wearing a light blue wool coat, paired with an off-white knit beret and a thick white cashmere scarf. Looking directly at the camera, it seems to tell a silent story, with a faint smile. The overall expression is calm and restrained, with a background of vast snowy fields or ice fields, pure white merging with the sky. The sky shows a pale blue gradient, transitioning from light blue above to soft gray-white below. The clouds are thin, and light falls softly like a thin veil. Sunlight slants in from the upper left of the image, creating warm side backlight and soft contour light that enhances the sense of three-dimensionality and layering. There is plenty of blank space, highlighting the subject and sparking associations. The overall color scheme mainly features warm and cool contrasts, with light blue and off-white as the main tones, dotted with warm light It creates a cool yet gentle winter aesthetic, with delicate light and shadow and realistic texture, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retaining the natural feel of daily life. It's like capturing a moment of tranquility in the snow. The image has a slight film graininess and soft depth blur, the background is blurry yet dreamy, and the overall atmosphere is tranquil, pure, and slightly poetic, conveying a beauty in solitude and inner peace",
