        {
          "id": "krea2-c22d95abdd4dead28359b3aa",
          "alias": "单女护士护士服医院冷淡蹲",
          "prompt": "A female nurse wore a pure white short-sleeved nurse uniform, a white nurse's cap with a red cross emblem, and a black stethoscope hanging around her neck. She sat half-squatting on the hospital ward floor, legs bent together, toes touching the ground, her posture elegant and natural, full of warmth and professionalism. Her right hand rested gently on her knee, her left hand hanging naturally, wearing pure white pantyhose and simple white wedge sandals, the upper decorated with a small bow. The overall look was clean, neat, and yet soft. The background is a typical hospital ward environment. On the right is a medical bed with blue sheets, made of metal, with some details clearly visible. On the left stands an infusion rack with infusion bags and tubes hanging from it. The equipment structure is authentic and credible. In the distance, bright natural light streams through large windows. Outside, you can faintly see the blurred outlines of city buildings and distant mountains. The sky is clear with soft and even light. The window frames are white, and the glass reflects faint light and shadow. The interior walls are light gray, and the floor is smooth with light-colored tiles. Clear lines of light and shadow are reflected. The curtains are light blue, lightweight, and gently floating, creating a quiet and peaceful atmosphere. The entire composition uses medium shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly turned and head facing the camera to form a stable visual center. The foreground is a shadow of the ground and some close-ups of feet. The middle ground is the main figure, hospital beds, IV stations, and other medical equipment. The background is the window and outdoor scene, with clear layers and clear perspective relationships. Light streams in diagonally from the upper right. A soft transition of light and shadow is created on the ground and figures, with consistent lighting and shadow directions to create a warm and peaceful atmosphere in the morning or afternoon. The tones are mainly white, light blue, and gray-white, with a harmonious contrast of warm and cool tones. The overall image is clean and fresh, full of life and professional aesthetics, with the authentic texture of everyday amateur camera photography. The details are rich, the light and shadow natural, the composition balanced, and the visual guidance flows smoothly, presenting a gentle, professional, and healing everyday scene, as if capturing a moment of warmth for nurses during work breaks. The image texture is delicate, color reproduction is faithful, with a slight film graininess and soft depth of field effect. The background is moderately blurred to enhance the subject's prominence, creating an overall warm and tranquil atmosphere that allows people to feel the ordinary beauty and human brilliance of medical work",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
