        {
          "id": "krea2-fc6611decc615e9b55022384",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔咖啡厅温柔坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden floor, her body slightly leaning forward, legs crossed, hands naturally resting on her knees, her posture relaxed and elegant. She wears a loose white plush knitted off-shoulder cropped top that reveals a slender waistline. She pairs it with light blue high-waisted jeans, the pant legs slightly rolled up, creating a natural pleat. The overall makeup is delicate and natural, with the main subject positioned slightly to the left center, occupying the visual center. On the left side of the foreground is a bottle of dark red wine, with a clearly visible label on the bottle. Nearby, several old books and a white ceramic mug are scattered, with slight wear marks on the rim. On the right is a metal mesh storage rack filled with snack boxes and small items. The background wall is white, covered with lace-patterned wallpaper. Decorative pendants hang on the wall, including golden pine cones, red Christmas tree ornaments, and a retro-style \"CAFE\" poster. In the upper right is a sunflower painting, warm and bright in color. The entire scene is filled with a sense of life and a festive atmosphere, and the composition is shot in a medium shot. The figure is centered, with objects arranged in an orderly manner around the frame, creating a rich sense of layering. The line of sight extends to the movements of the hands and the details of the surrounding environment. Light comes from the front left of the frame, softly and evenly casting on the figure, creating a warm and comfortable indoor atmosphere. The shadows are subtle and natural, emphasizing three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is mainly white, beige, and light blue, accented with warm yellow and red to enhance the coziness. The transitions between light and shadow are delicate and the texture realistic, as if taken with an amateur camera for an improvised life photo. It features a slight grainy film texture and a tendency toward low-saturation colors, with a slight retro filter effect that simulates the texture of real photography. The background is slightly blurred, making the subject stand out more while retaining the readability of environmental details. Overall, it presents a quiet, intimate, and aesthetically rich home atmosphere. The image has a sense of depth and space, clear foregrounds, natural transitions in mid-shots, moderately blurred distant shots, balanced composition, harmonious color unity, and a gentle visual rhythm, conveying a relaxed lifestyle and a gentle, healing emotional experience",
