        {
          "id": "krea2-a26bafdb891446bbd7cdc4e4",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙咖啡厅自信站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the white railing of an outdoor restaurant, her expression slightly confident and composed. She wears a uniquely designed white spaghetti strap dress, with a cross-strap crop top design. The chest is decorated with laces, and the sides of the waist have slits at the waist. The skirt is short and fitted, showing off her long legs. She wears a pair of white thin-strap high-heeled sandals, leaning gracefully against the railing. Her right hand gently rests on the chair back, her body slightly turning to the side, presenting graceful curves. In the foreground is a gray stone floor with clear textures and soft reflections. The railing is white, printed with golden \"Garden\" lettering in elegant style. The center is the restaurant's outdoor seating area, with several dining tables covered with white tablecloths and rattan chairs. Above, a large dark blue sunshade is set up. The umbrella surface is flat, the edges clear, and the background is street-side shops. Inside the glass display window are clothes displayed, and next to it is a palm tree trunk wrapped in lights, its leaves dense and green. In the distance, a few pedestrians are faintly visible. The overall environment is bright and open, with plenty of light. Sunlight pours down from the upper left of the frame, creating soft shadows. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, with tones dominated by white, gray, blue, and green, creating a fresh, modern, and fashionable atmosphere. The composition uses a centered right main figure, with the figure occupying the main position. The lines of the fence and ground extend into the distance, enhancing the sense of space. The overall image has the authentic texture of everyday photography, as if shot with a professional camera, but retains slight graininess and natural color saturation. It presents a visual effect that is both lifelike and artistically beautiful, with rich details, clear layering, harmonious light and shadow, a relaxed and pleasant atmosphere, and full of urban life",
