          "id": "krea2-bc2e599a15981286200c14a4",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜城市沉思坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of a white desk, her body slightly leaning back, legs crossed and naturally hanging down, feet relaxed beneath the table, wearing black stockings and a black short skirt. Her upper body is a semi-transparent white shirt with an open collar and naturally flowing sleeves. Her overall posture appears both casual and slightly deliberately elegant, with a neutral yet contemplative expression. Her left hand gently rests on her right knee, fingers bent naturally, while her right hand rests softly behind her to support herself. In the background is a curtain with gray-white floral patterns, thin and translucent. It creates a soft, hazy atmosphere. On the left is a closed black computer monitor that reflects blurry images of the surroundings. Next to it stand several books placed vertically, with black, white, and orange covers, clear English titles on the spine, and on the desk is an adjustable black metal lamp. The lampshade is conical, the lamp arm flexibly curved, and the lamp head casts soft light downward. The entire scene is dominated by cool tones, with white and gray as the main tones, and black elements as accents, creating a sense of visual layering. The composition uses a diagonal layout slightly to the right center, with the figure occupying the main position. Lines extending from left to right guide the view, the foreground is the desk surface and some legs, the middle ground is the main figure, desk lamp, and computer, and the background is curtains and walls, creating a clear spatial depth. Light and shadow come from natural light on the left and the desk lamp working together to create a soft shadow transition. The direction of the light source is clear but not too strong, while retaining some layers of shadow. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and slightly laid-back from everyday life. It's as if capturing a moment of quiet afternoon solitude. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, presenting a realism similar to amateur photography equipment. It features slight graininess and low contrast treatment, enhancing realism and a sense of life. Details are rich but not overly sharpened, highlighting natural light and shadow and material expressions, such as the sheen of stockings, the semi-transparent texture of shirts, the cold and hard reflections of metal desk lamps, and the wrinkled textures of curtain fabrics. The composition is stable without stiffness, with a slightly lower viewing angle. This makes the figures appear more approachable and present, and the overall composition conveys an aesthetic of tranquility, gentleness, and a touch of modern urban women's daily life",
