        {
          "id": "krea2-411b562175121c29c2988d13",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣桌边沉思坐持杯",
          "prompt": "She wore a loose white knit sweater made of delicate material with clearly visible textures, black cross-strapped cuffs, and a slight sliding shoulder strap revealing a black thin strap strap underneath. Around her neck was a black suede collar with a shiny snowflake-shaped silver pendant hanging from it, adding a touch of mystery. She gently holds a red paper coffee cup in her right hand. The surface of the cup has fine embossing, the lid is black, and the cup is stamped with a blurred white brand logo. Her left hand rests naturally on her thigh, her posture relaxed and elegant. She wears a dark gray plaid mini skirt, which is thick and heavy, with neat plaid lines and a moderate hem length that reveals her long legs. The leg lines are smooth, the right leg slightly bent, the left leg naturally straight, and the body slightly turned to the left side of the frame, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. She sits at a dark brown wooden table. The surface is smooth and slightly reflective, with metal trim at the corners and edges, giving it a sturdy and vintage feel. Above the table sits a book with a red cover, its spine facing outward and partially covered. Next to it is a brown leather handbag, the strap slung across her chest. The body is small and exquisite, with rich details. In the background is a wide glass window, outside which is a blurry autumn scene. The trees display a gradient of golden, orange-red, and brown, with leaves swaying in the wind. A few raindrops can be faintly seen clinging to the glass, forming fine water marks. The window frame is made of metal with a darker color, blending seamlessly with the indoor environment. A red bow decoration hangs on the windowsill, possibly a holiday or souvenir, adding a splash of brightness to the scene. The lighting throughout the scene is soft, with natural light from outside the window streaming through the glass and creating a warm backlight effect. The outlines of the figures are softly outlined, with natural transitions of light and shadow, creating a quiet, cozy, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot perspective, with the figure occupying the main subject, slightly tilted to the right, leaving space on the left to showcase the view outside the window, creating visual balance. The foreground features the table and part of the body, the middle ground shows the person's entire body and coffee cup, and the background is the outside view and window structure. The layers are distinct, extending along her line of sight to the window, then back to the coffee cup in her hand, forming a closed-loop observation path. The images present a fleeting, unintentional beauty in everyday life, as if taken with a professional camera in a realistic style, yet retaining the unique delicacy and dreaminess of anime characters, with strong artistic expression and emotional appeal",
