          "id": "krea2-3de3171590618831170cf6c6",
          "alias": "单女白制服窗边坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by a bright indoor window, wearing a white short-sleeved school uniform shirt paired with a deep red bow tie and black pleated skirt. Her long legs are wrapped in black stockings, with the edge of her stockings slightly visible at her ankles. Black-rimmed round glasses reflect soft light, presenting a typical Japanese schoolgirl style. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, occupying the visual center, with a close-up composition. The background features large areas of pure white walls and horizontal striped blinds. Sunlight filters through the blinds, casting regular alternating light and shadow patterns on the wall and floor, creating rhythmic geometric lines that create a clean, minimalist atmosphere full of modern feel. In the lower right corner of the foreground, a cluster of white flowers and green leaves can be faintly seen, adding a touch of life and color accents. The overall color scheme is dominated by white, with light coming from the left window direction, creating soft natural light. The shadow transitions are delicate and the texture is clear. The image has a slight grainy film texture and a slight overexposure, resembling a real scene shot with a regular digital camera. It carries the casualness and realism of daily life, while retaining a certain degree of artistry and beauty. The figures appear calm and emotionally restrained. The overall atmosphere is quiet, gentle, and slightly artistic. The spatial perspective is clearly defined, with distinct foreground and background layers, extending along hand movements to the leg lines. Ultimately, the light and shadow structure in the background attracts the audience. The composition is stable and balanced, color saturation is moderate, and details are rich but not chaotic, presenting a visual style that combines everyday life with aesthetic appeal",
