          "id": "krea2-c74b3c460a4cbbe5a8ca0659",
          "alias": "单女衬衫广场戏谑坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a pure white curved corner, her body slightly leaned back, arms raised above her head and crossed behind her head, presenting a relaxed yet slightly teasing pose. She wears a loose long-sleeved shirt in an off-white background printed with red rose patterns, the neckline slightly exposed to reveal her collarbone. She pairs a black high-waisted tight leather mini skirt that hugs the curves of her hips, her legs long and straight forward, wearing dark gray stockings on her feet, with a small tattoo on her right knee. The overall look blends vintage and modern fashion. Her makeup is exquisite, and her calm expression carries a hint of allure, creating a gentle yet sexy temperament. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the center right of the frame, with legs extending from the lower left corner to the center, forming a strong visual guiding line. The middle is the simple white wall and floor junction, paved with light brown square tiles with clearly visible textures. The wall is clean and free of unnecessary decoration, with only a round rattan frame hanging on the right side of the background, with a radial edge structure. Add a touch of Japanese Zen and natural atmosphere. The composition is shot from a slightly top-down angle, with the figure's posture stretched out and body contours echoing the curve of the wall, creating a harmonious geometric aesthetic. Light comes from the left side of the frame, creating delicate shadow transitions that enhance the sense of three-dimensionality. The direction of light and shadow is clear, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The overall color scheme is mainly white, accented with red flowers to create a visual focal point. The black clothing and stockings create a strong contrast, enhancing the sense of layering. The image texture is delicate, and the clothing wrinkles are natural. The details are rich, as if shot with professional photography equipment, but retains slight film graininess and realistic exposure, presenting a natural realism like shooting with a high-end camera or phone in daily life. The overall atmosphere is both elegant and full of tension, with a high-end fashion blockbuster aesthetic while maintaining a sense of everyday warmth. The color saturation is moderate, the contrast is gentle, highlighting the main subject while maintaining simplicity, balanced composition, smooth visual guidance, and even the rattan mirror in the background. This forms a complete visual loop, with the entire scene quiet and storytelling, as if capturing a fleeting moment of a private moment, full of artistic flair and emotional expression",
          "description": "",
