        {
          "id": "krea2-cfb24af6fcf1251dc281d4ac",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫室内温柔坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a brown vintage leather armchair, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a black suspa-strap dress, with a red bow tie at the chest. The skirt is pleated, and the overall look resembles a Japanese school uniform. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, legs crossed, wearing white stockings, feet slightly raised, her posture elegant and relaxed. The background is pure white, simple and clean, highlighting the main subject. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame. The body is slightly tilted, and the head is slightly tilted, forming a natural visual guide line that creates an intimate and subtle atmosphere. The lighting is soft and even, coming from the front and above, creating a subtle shadow transition. The overall color scheme is mainly black and white, accented with a red bow tie as a visual focal point, adding a touch of vitality. The leather chair's surface features obvious stitching and metal rivet decorations, giving it a realistic texture. The edges show slight wear marks to enhance the sense of life. The seatbacks are high, providing comfortable support. The figure's sitting posture is natural, the body slightly leaning, and the arms relaxed, presenting the authentic state of everyday shooting, with delicate light and shadow processing, soft reflections in stockings, natural folds in clothing, and distinct layers. The overall image has the texture of a professional studio shoot while still maintaining the warmth of everyday life. It feels as if you are capturing a moment with a regular camera in a bright indoor environment, preserving slight noise and true color reproduction, emphasizing realism rather than excessive embellishment. The composition is balanced, the subject is prominent, the background is minimalist, and the visual guidance is clear, forming a coherent viewing path. The overall atmosphere is quiet, Gentle yet slightly youthful, it suits the expression of innocence and restraint. The images are full of storytelling, as if one can sense her thoughts and emotions at that moment. The tones are warm, contrasts are moderate, details are rich, and the transitions of light and shadow are natural, without strong contrasts of light and shadow, maintaining overall harmony and unity. The scene is simple and not monotonous, conveying profound emotional expression through simple elements combined. The images present a refined yet everyday aesthetic style, as if capturing beautiful moments in life unintentionally",
