        {
          "id": "krea2-9139a099c9e43278ebb9f924",
          "alias": "单女透视黑毛衣城市害羞坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a metal drainage cover at the edge of a city sidewalk, wearing a black long-sleeved sweater with soft and fluffy texture, showing a warm knit texture. The dark yarn glows slightly in the sunlight, and the cuffs and collar have natural rolled details that contrast with her bare legs. She wears black sheer stockings, her feet naturally relaxed, barefoot on the gray cement floor, toes slightly bent with natural curls, appearing smooth and full of life. She sits sideways, knees together. The other hand rests naturally on the knee, fingers long, posture relaxed and natural, looking directly at the camera, revealing a warm yet slightly shy emotion. The background is a corner of a city street, with a white metal mesh railing extending from the left side to the right rear of the frame, forming neat geometric lines. Behind the railing, faint architectural outlines and blue billboards can be faintly seen, adding layers to the space. The floor is paved with gray cement bricks with clear gaps, and the drainage gutter covers have regular long holes that reflect light and create delicate textures. Sunlight slanted down from the upper right of the painting, casting soft shadows on the figures and the ground. The interplay of light and shadow creates a warm and tranquil afternoon atmosphere. The overall composition adopts a slightly tilted perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, body in a diagonal posture guiding the gaze to the lower right. The guardrail lines in the background provide visual guidance, while the depth of field effect is used to clarify the foreground and blur the background, highlighting the subject. The colors are mainly black, gray, and white, accentuated by the golden sunlight and the warm tones of the subject's skin. The overall atmosphere is warm and natural, full of life's vibe, like a real moment captured with a daily camera. It has a documentary and realistic feel, with delicate texture and rich details, natural transitions of light and shadow, presenting a quiet and beautiful moment of urban life",
