        {
          "id": "krea2-bd339435a655b8a2616d64bb",
          "alias": "单女透视黑西装城市冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the window of a high-rise building, her expression slightly cool and confident, her makeup refined and natural. She wears a loose black blazer with a neat cut and wide, voluminous sleeves. Underneath, she wears a black lace low-cut lingerie that reveals part of her chest and waist. She wears black shorts paired with black sheer stockings, showing long and balanced legs. On her feet are black platform high-heeled sandals decorated with pearl bows, making her look both sexy and fashionable. In her left hand, she carries a black leather handbag with a gold metal logo. The design is simple yet sophisticated, with a slightly forward-leaning body, one hand in the pocket of a suit, the other naturally hanging down, an elegant and relaxed posture. The background is the city's evening streets, with elevated railway tracks and trains visible outside the window. In the distance, modern buildings cluster with blue rippled roofs. Vehicles move along the streets, streetlights and billboards emit a warm yellow glow, and the sky shows a pale purple gradient at dusk. The light is soft, blending urban modernity with the fashionable character of the characters. The composition adopts a slightly top-down angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The buildings and roads in the background create a sense of depth, guiding the gaze from the foreground to the distance. In terms of lighting and shadow, the indoor lighting contrasts with the outdoor twilight, with clear contours and soft shadows, emphasizing a sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color scheme is dominated by black, gray, and blue, accented with warm yellow light sources, creating a calm and charming urban nightscape atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and rich, combining the realism of everyday shooting. It also carries an artistic aesthetic, as if captured from a movie or a fashion magazine, full of storytelling and visual tension",
