        {
          "id": "krea2-ec77fe98b30f1127d4c4c406",
          "alias": "单女城市冷淡坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a blue bus seat, slightly tilting her head up to gaze into the distance. She wears a light blue short-sleeved top with white piping at the collar and cuffs, giving her a fresh and clean look. In the foreground, the blurred blue plastic seat backrest and orange armrest form a soft, blurred silhouette. A distinct spatial relationship with the main figure creates a distinct spatial layer, glowing with a healthy sheen. The background is the outdoor scene seen through the car window, presenting a hazy green vegetation and the silhouette of several white vehicles. A large aperture blur creates a bokeh effect, creating a quiet and leisurely atmosphere. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is placed slightly in the center on the left side of the frame, leaving space on the right side to enhance visual extension. The edge of the seat in the foreground serves as a visual frame, increasing depth and realism in the image. The light and shadow come from natural daylight, soft and bright. The light source is positioned to the right front of the subject, with natural shadow transitions without harsh dark areas. The overall color scheme is mainly a fresh blue-green tone, creating a warm and cool contrast. This not only highlights the pure temperament of the characters but also highlights poetic moments in urban life. The image has a slight film graininess and slight lens distortion, simulating the realistic texture of handheld camera shooting, with slight overexposure and slightly warm color tendencies, mimicking everyday smartphone or handheld camera snapshots. Emphasizing a sense of everyday scenes and spontaneous emotional capture, the overall atmosphere is quiet, warm, and full of hope. It feels like a sunny afternoon, where she sits alone on a bus, gazing at the flowing scenery outside the window, her heart surging with love and anticipation for life. The entire scene presents a cinematic narrative quality, like a silent monologue recording extraordinary emotions in ordinary moments. The details are rich yet restrained, combining artistic beauty with genuine warmth",
