        {
          "id": "krea2-ac875454d2d59e3c7140bc48",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙废墟冷淡站立展示",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under the corridor of an abandoned industrial building, wearing a light blue long-sleeved top paired with a black-and-white checkerboard skirt, dark over-the-knee socks, and black high heels. Her posture is elegant and natural, her body slightly turned to the side, her right hand gently caressing the hem of her skirt, her left hand naturally hanging down, showcasing youthful energy and a sense of fashion. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the center of the painting slightly to the right, while the center features concrete corridor columns and metal trusses, with rugged industrial-style lines forming a geometric framework. The background features mottled white cement walls and bright sunlight streaming in from afar, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the figure's slender figure and sense of spatial depth. The figures and architectural structure form a visual guiding line, with light slanting from the upper left into the corridor, creating a warm golden backlight. Fine light and shadows scatter between the floor and brick gaps, blending nostalgic industrial style with modern fashion, with a slight film grain texture. The colors mainly contrast warm and cool, interwoven with blue-gray and warm yellow. It creates tranquil and story-rich everyday scenes, as if capturing a moment of afternoon sunlight, presenting a texture reminiscent of amateur camera photography. The details are rich and layered, the characters' expressions natural, movements smooth, the environment authentic and believable, possessing strong visual appeal and artistic appeal",
