        {
          "id": "krea2-790cdbcdbd25e13307f0e67d",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣椅上自信坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a chair covered in white tulle, wearing an off-white knitted long-sleeve sweater paired with a khaki high-waisted mini skirt and black stockings. Her legs are crossed, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her makeup is exquisite but not exaggerated, and light streams in through the left window, creating a soft side glow. The background is a white wall and a window with vertical blinds. The curtains are semi-transparent, letting in bright natural light. Creating a warm and pure indoor environment, a wooden picture frame leans diagonally at the rear right side, adding a touch of artistic flair to the space. The foreground is a flowing white sheer fabric, partially covering the chair and the lower body of the figure, adding layers and a dreamlike feel. The middle ground is the main subject, composed at a slightly top-down angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right side to balance the visuals. The light and shadow effects are soft and layered, with the light source coming from the left front, creating a natural shadow transition. The overall tone is white, Beige and khaki are the main colors, accented with black stockings for contrast, creating a fresh, gentle, and slightly artistic everyday photo style. The images have a slight film texture, moderate color saturation, clear details, and soft edges, as if taken early in the morning with an old 35mm film camera. Capturing a quiet and beautiful moment, the composition emphasizes harmony between the person and the environment, creating an overall atmosphere that is tranquil, warm, and authentic, like a private photo recording moments of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
