        {
          "id": "krea2-2fe599b00ff9ee2917806c88",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙公园专注坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench in an outdoor park, wearing a light pink sleeveless dress with a simple and elegant cut, hugging her figure yet still flowing. The hem naturally drapes down to her thighs, revealing her long, fair legs. On her feet are beige thin-strap high-heeled sandals, whose slender heels complement the overall look. She is focused as she gently sips a drink from a white paper cup, which has a black lid and straw. She tilts her head slightly back, her movements natural and smooth, as if immersed in a moment of tranquility. Next to her sits a small yellow handbag, with a smooth surface, soft material, and warm color, creating a gentle contrast with the pink dress. The bench is supported by a dark metal frame, with light brown wood panels with natural texture and slight wear on the surface, showing a used texture. The background is a green belt on the edge of the city, with dense lavender groves and tall ornamental grass nearby. The leaves are slender, gently swaying in the wind. In the distance, several low-rise residential buildings can be seen, with blue tiled roofs and beige walls. The architectural style is modern and simple. The sky is a clear blue, with a few wisps of white clouds drifting lightly by. Sunlight pours in from the upper right, casting clear and soft shadows on the ground and the figures. The layered light and shadow are distinct, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The composition uses a three-part method: the main subject is positioned slightly in the center on the right side of the painting, with the line of sight extending to the left, leaving a large space on the left side to enhance the sense of balance. The foreground features a sidewalk paved with gray square bricks, with neat edges and clear tile joints. The middle ground features benches and figures, while the background gradually blurs. It highlights the subject while showcasing environmental details, guiding the viewer's attention to the woman's act of drinking coffee. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and pleasant, full of the vibe of summer afternoon life, as if capturing rare leisurely moments in urban life. The image presents a sense of realism in everyday photography, similar to amateur camera or mobile phone shooting. The color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and the transitions of light and shadow are natural, without excessive embellishment, preserving the texture and warmth of the real scene. The overall image gives a gentle, tranquil, and slightly artistic feel. It was as if you could hear the breeze rustling through the grass and the faint sounds of the city in the distance, capturing an ordinary yet touching moment of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
