        {
          "id": "krea2-c755d5fb1f53effe0e6d0de2",
          "alias": "单女米T恤广场冷淡倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "She wears a beige tight-fitting short-sleeved T-shirt whose fabric hugs her figure, showing off her natural curves. The texture and folds of the fabric are clearly visible under the light, the neckline is simple and rounded, and the sleeve length is moderate. The overall look is simple yet modern. She wears a slender silver necklace with a small and delicate chain link, adding a touch of understated fashion. She wears light blue high-waisted jeans with a loose and comfortable fit. The legs are straight or slightly flared, with natural holes at the knees and a natural edge finish. She is gently tugging at the hem of her T-shirt with both hands, her movements natural and relaxed, as if adjusting her clothes. Her body leans slightly, left hand on her waist, right hand gently lifting the hem, elegant and unpretentious. The background is a typical kitchen corner, with white square bricks paving the wall, the joints neat and even, presenting a clean and tidy texture. On the left is a vintage-style off-white refrigerator with a smooth surface, metal handles, and a round knob. The brand logo is faintly visible on the door. The refrigerator has a flat top with smooth edges. On the right is a stainless steel shelf or workbench, on which is a stack of white paper cups and plastic bottles. The items are neatly arranged, partially obscured but with clear details. The countertop reflects the surrounding light, adding realism to the scene. In the lower right corner of the image, there is a purple halo. Backlight or lighting effects from certain electronic devices inject a touch of mystery into the overall cool-toned image. The composition uses a mid-shot perspective, with the figure occupying the center-left position, body slightly tilted, forming a natural visual guide line with smooth line of sight. The foreground is the main subject, the middle shot includes a refrigerator, shelves, and some walls, while the background features tiled walls and blurred kitchen elements. The layers are distinct and the sense of space is strong. Light comes from the upper front, softly and evenly casting on the figures, with natural shadow transitions. There is no strong contrast, creating a warm atmosphere of everyday life. The overall color scheme is mainly off-white, light blue, and gray-white, complemented by cool metallic tones and purple accents. The color coordination is harmonious and unified, giving the image a strong sense of documentary and everyday life, as if captured casually with a regular phone or portable camera. The details are rich, texture lifelike, light and shadow delicate, and the atmosphere is quiet and authentic, full of contemporary urban youth aesthetics. It is suitable for showcasing women's everyday outfits and personal expression. The overall image presents a balanced aesthetic between professional photography and amateur documentation, maintaining both realism and artistic visual appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
