        {
          "id": "krea2-7c6234b7d259807082b040d5",
          "alias": "单女毛衣城市冷淡站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a natural setting, naturally draped over her shoulders, exuding a serene and approachable aura. She wears a light green high-neck, short-sleeved knit top with clearly visible texture, featuring delicate vertical stripes. The sleeves are short flared sleeves, adding a touch of elegance and vintage charm. She pairs a high-waisted black-and-white plaid mini skirt with a tweed or similar fabric, featuring distinct woven patterns and intricate plaid patterns. The tailored fit highlights her curves. The overall style is simple yet refined, full of urban fashion. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, slightly tilted body, hands naturally placed behind her back, looking relaxed and confident. The foreground is a dense green meadow with slender, bright blades interspersed with small white wildflowers like clover or dandelion. The petite flowers dot the lush grass, adding vitality and layering to the scene. The middle section features even more lush vegetation, including low shrubs and a few tender green shoots. The plants have natural forms, with interlaced branches and leaves creating rich visual details. The background is a dense forest, tall and upright trees with lush canopies displaying varying shades of green. A traditional Japanese wooden structure can be faintly seen in the woods, possibly a corner of a shrine or tea room. The roof is covered with dark gray tiles, the eaves slightly raised, and the wooden walls are slightly weathered, revealing traces of time. The building is half-concealed by trees, creating a secluded and tranquil atmosphere. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout. The character, as the visual focal point, is positioned near the golden ratio point. Using depth control to blur the foreground and background, highlighting the subject while maintaining the realism of the environment. The perspective is slightly upward, enhancing the character's uprightness and presence. In terms of lighting and shadow, the lighting is soft and even, like diffused light on cloudy or early morning days. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. The shadows are soft and lack strong contrasts, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The colors are dominated by green, with rich layers ranging from light green to dark green. Paired with the light green and black-and-white plaid patterns of the characters' clothing, a harmonious contrast of warm and cool tones is formed. The overall tone is fresh and natural, with a slight film texture, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting and graininess, enhancing nostalgia and realism. The entire scene conveys a leisurely, peaceful, and nature-like lifestyle, like a carefully composed outdoor portrait that combines artistic beauty with a sense of realism",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
