        {
          "id": "krea2-6f384aa880f9408365409c5a",
          "alias": "单女制服教室愤怒持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style high school girls' uniform sat on a classroom desk and chair. She wore a white short-sleeved sailor uniform with a bright red scarf tied around the neckline, the ends of the scarf hanging naturally, trimmed with gray stripes along the sleeves. She wore a light gray pleated skirt below, the hem slightly lifted, revealing dark blue over-the-knee socks and one foot, while the other foot was raised and resting on the desk. Her makeup was exquisite, and her expression was slightly cold yet tinged with gentleness. The overall look recreates the typical image of a Japanese schoolgirl. In the foreground, her legs occupy the lower right corner of the frame, forming a strong visual guide that extends from the lower left corner to the upper right, drawing the viewer's attention to the main subject. The background is a typical Japanese classroom environment, with beige walls and neatly arranged wooden desks and chairs. Behind is a row of bookshelves, with soft natural light streaming through the windows. The light outside is bright but not glaring, creating a warm backlighting effect. Sunlight streams in from the right side, casting delicate transitions of light and shadow on the figure. It creates a tranquil atmosphere in the morning or afternoon, with a low-angle downward perspective to enhance the visual height and presence of the subject. The shallow depth of field highlights the subject, with warm tones as the main color. White, gray, red, and deep blue create harmonious contrasts, creating a youthful and campus atmosphere. The light and shadow are soft, and details are rich, presenting a genuine beauty that is casually captured in daily life. It feels like a photo shot with a professional camera, offering strong visual impact and artistic expression. while preserving the texture and warmth of real scenes",
