        {
          "id": "krea2-2af020a9bff6c24e2aa21167",
          "alias": "单女灰西装公园沉思坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a green metallic park bench, wearing a gray suit jacket and a matching short skirt, a light blue shirt underneath, brown thin-strap high heels, legs crossed, elegant and relaxed, her expression slightly contemplative and composed, creating a casual yet refined atmosphere. Beside her sits on another green bench with a beige leather handbag. The bag has clean lines and metal fasteners, presenting a sense of luxury. In the foreground, the floor is paved with light-colored stone slabs, sunlight casting clear shadows on the chair, intertwining light and shadow. The texture is distinct. In the middle is the calm pool water, with fine ripples on the surface, reflecting fountains, trees, and distant buildings. In the center of the pool stands a classic-style fountain gushing upward, with splashes shimmering in the sunlight. The surrounding green trees provide shade and lush leaves, forming a soft green barrier. The sky is clear, with faint clouds peeking through the pale blue tones. The light is warm golden afternoon sunlight, shining from the upper right, creating a delicate transition of light and shadow. The direction of shadows is consistent, enhancing the sense of spatial depth in the composition. The composition uses the classic three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the frame, with the right side left blank for placing a handbag and another empty chair, creating visual balance. The foreground shadow lines guide the gaze toward the figures, while the background fountains and buildings serve as extension elements, stretching the vertical space of the painting. The overall color palette mainly uses warm and cool contrasts. Green seats and blue water surfaces bring a sense of freshness, while the gray and brown costumes blend harmoniously with the warm yellow sunlight in the background. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is both realistic and cinematic, reminiscent of retro street shots shot with a film camera, with slight graininess and natural color overflow. The lens uses a medium focal length, moderately blurring the background to highlight the main contours and details, while preserving environmental information. Full of the atmosphere of life and artistic style",
