          "prompt": "A woman sits on a low concrete wall outdoors, wearing a white double-breasted blazer and a light-colored plaid pleated skirt, paired with white tights and black loafers. Her right hand gently holds a transparent plastic cup, which seems to hold a drink. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, her body slightly leaning forward, legs crossed, right leg stretched forward, toes touching the ground, left leg bent, posture relaxed and elegant. The background is a dusk reed thicket, golden reeds swaying in the warm breeze, creating a soft blurred effect, with distant tree outlines blurred. The sky shows a warm orange-yellow gradient, with light pouring down from the upper left of the frame, creating a backlit effect and creating a dreamlike halo. The overall composition uses the rule of thirds: the figure is positioned slightly in the center on the right side of the painting. The foreground is a rough concrete wall with clear texture, the middle is the main subject and some reeds, and the background is blurred vegetation and the sky. The layers of light and shadow are rich, warm tones dominate, and the atmosphere is warm and tranquil. It features a Japanese photo style, with delicate texture and moderate color saturation. It presents a kind of unintentionally beautiful moments in daily life, as if shot with an amateur camera, with slight film graininess and natural overexposure, emphasizing realism and the atmosphere of life. The composition is reasonable and blank, the visual focus is on the characters, the background blurs to highlight the subject, and the overall image is full of youthful energy and poetic beauty. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, details are rich, and it is both artistic and authentic",
