        {
          "id": "krea2-2c1aac8b7673e414cfabc272",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤城市困倦站立举手",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside a vintage white car, wearing a light gray tie-dye T-shirt with a simple black triangular brand logo printed on the chest. She pairs a dark blue high-waisted short skirt with white stripes on the skirt sides, white sneakers, and a casual yet fashionable look, slightly wavy. She wears small round earrings, gracefully leaning against the front of the car, her left hand gently touching the edge of the roof, her right hand raised close to her neck, her expression slightly contemplative and dreamy, as if gazing into the distance or lost in some kind of thought. Her body leans slightly, The crossed legs showcase slender lines and natural body beauty. The car is a classic vintage model, with an off-white body and slightly aged surfaces with minor scratches and signs of age. The round headlights are clearly visible, the chrome grille and bumper reflect soft light, and the front end shows slight wear, adding realism. The background is an open outdoor scene, with gray asphalt pavement with fine cracks and weeds growing. In the distance, faint green vegetation and low shrubs appear. The sky is pale blue, with thin and evenly distributed clouds The lighting is soft, the overall tone is cool, mainly blue and gray, creating a tranquil and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned on the left side of the frame, occupying the main visual focus. The car extends from left to right, forming a stable visual guiding line. The figure and car form a triangular composition to enhance the sense of stability. The foreground highlights the details of the figure and car, the middle ground shows the ground and vegetation, the background is blurred to stretch spatial layers, then turns to the distant sky, creating a smooth flow of sight, with light and shadow coming from the side and above. Emphasizing three-dimensionality, the overall atmosphere combines everyday life with artistic flair, as if captured with a regular camera at dusk. It has a film-like texture, moderate color saturation, rich details, and images full of storytelling and emotional tension, presenting a youthful, free, and slightly nostalgic urban street style",
