          "id": "krea2-5bc43daf771ef8bb7d8db8de",
          "alias": "单女蓝泳装摄影棚微笑倚靠",
          "prompt": "A voluptuous woman wears a deep blue satin bikini, elegantly leaning against a white wall. Her hands rest gently on the wall, her body slightly leaning to the side, revealing natural, smooth curves and a healthy, full figure. She wears a gentle and confident smile, looking directly at the camera, exuding a relaxed and comfortable everyday vibe. She wears beige platform high-heeled sandals with slim heels, creating a harmonious visual balance with the overall look. In the background is a glass window with a yellow border, through which the shadow lines of the blinds can be seen. Reflecting soft light and a blurred indoor scene, the window is adorned with golden 3D lettering \"Amities bakes studio.\" The font is rounded and vintage, exuding a warm and welcoming atmosphere. The wall surface is slightly rough, with subtle textures and mottled marks. In the lower left corner is a black sign printed with \"coffee,\" hinting at a cozy little shop that blends coffee and roasting. The floor is gray cement, with a few wild grasses stubbornly growing through the gaps, adding a touch of natural and casual charm. The composition uses a mid-shot perspective, with the figure occupying the center-right position, forming a stable visual focus. The foreground is simple and highlights the main subject. The mid-shot consists of characters and walls forming the main narrative space. The background provides environmental clues through window reflections and textual information. Light and shadow come from natural daylight, softly and evenly casting on the figures, creating a warm and bright daytime atmosphere. Light shines diagonally from the right, creating subtle shadows on the left side of the figure, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and realism. The overall color palette is mainly white, deep blue, and gold, with harmonious and unified colors. Extending along the body's curves to the legs, then returning to background text and environmental details, forming a complete viewing path, the images present a subtle beauty from everyday life, as if captured with a regular camera, full of life and artistic texture, with strong visual appeal and emotional resonance",
