          "prompt": "A woman squats on an outdoor stone pavement, wearing a loose light purple short-sleeved T-shirt and dark blue denim shorts, paired with black platform leather shoes. She leans slightly to the side, arms crossed over the black metal railing, and wears a red thin cord bracelet on her right wrist. Her posture is relaxed yet tinged with a hint of laziness. Her body leans slightly forward, knees bent, calves together, presenting a casual yet elegant squatting posture. The background is dense green shrubs and tall trees, with layers of leaves and dappled light and shadow, faintly visible in the distance. The overall environment resembles a corner of a city park or courtyard. On the left side of the foreground, a thick black metal pillar protrudes, forming a strong visual guide that draws the viewer's gaze toward the subject. The middle ground is the main area formed by the figure and railing, which extends diagonally, adding depth and movement to the scene. The background is blurred, lush but details are blurred, creating a soft depth effect. The composition uses a low-angle shot, slightly looking upward at the person to enhance their presence and approachability. At the same time, the front column and the central figures form a layered front and back, giving the scene a three-dimensional feel. The lighting is naturally scattered, possibly soft daylight from cloudy days or shaded trees. The overall tone leans toward coolness, dominated by green and purple, creating a fresh and tranquil atmosphere. The light and shadow are evenly distributed without strong contrasts, the clothing wrinkles naturally, the denim fabric texture is clearly visible, the metal railing surface has a slight reflection, and the floor slab has distinct gaps with fine wear marks. The overall image presents a realistic moment casually captured from daily life, like a casual snapshot taken with a regular camera. It is rich in life atmosphere and youthful energy, with moderate color 