        {
          "id": "krea2-f42426c504ceafb49a149313",
          "alias": "单女蓝和服沉思侧头",
          "prompt": "A low-angle downward view of a woman in a natural moment under a clear blue sky, wearing a light blue kimono outer jacket paired with a white lining. The fabric is light and flowing, with clearly visible details at the neckline and cuffs. The kimono's folds and drapes are vividly portrayed, sunlight streaming down, creating soft highlights and shadows on the fabric. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with a slightly tilted body, head tilted back to the left, teeth white and neat, and her right hand gently holding two orange-red fruits, likely oranges or cherry tomatoes. The surface of the fruit is smooth and reflective, with vivid and saturated colors. The left hand hangs naturally and does not fully appear in the frame. The background is a vast, boundless pale blue sky, dotted with a few thin wisps of white clouds. The clouds are light and fluffy, with rich gradients in the sky. The transition from deep blue at the top to light blue at the bottom is natural. In the upper left corner of the image, a red and white traffic sign is diagonally inserted. The blue triangular sign has a white pattern, with distinct red and white stripes on the pole. The sign is slightly tilted, adding a touch of everyday life to the scene. The composition uses a diagonal layout, extending from the upper left to the lower right. The visual guide is guided from the marker pole toward the figure and then to the sky, creating a dynamic balance. Light and shadow come from strong daylight directly above, creating a distinct backlighting effect. The figure's outline is outlined as a bright halo, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is warm and bright, full of summer vibes. It features the grainy texture and slight overexposure characteristic of film photography. The tone is warm, saturation moderate, and colors are restored to a true and natural state. The image has both a sense of everyday realism and artistic poetic beauty. It seems to capture an ordinary yet precious moment. The lens simulates 35mm film shooting, using a large aperture f/1.8 to create a shallow depth of field. The foreground blurs highlight the subject, the background sky is pure and simple, the composition is full of tension, and the colors are harmoniously unified. Overall, it presents a fresh, free, and joyful visual experience, like a film portrait recording youth and sunshine, full of storytelling and emotional warmth",
