          "id": "krea2-ad1fe56fd4a59d950ab3e24e",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣楼梯沉思站立持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears an off-white short-sleeved knit top and a matching high-waisted pleated short skirt, standing barefoot on the mottled iron steps. Her hands hang down naturally, gently touching the hem, her expression tinged with contemplation and longing. Her overall posture is elegant and relaxed. The background is a vast, bright pale blue sky, dotted with a few thin wisps of white clouds. The metal railings are grayish-white with obvious rust and weathering marks, extending upward from both sides of the frame to form guiding lines. The surface of the stair steps is covered with orange-red rust and uneven wear patterns, with sunlight slanting down from the upper right, creating a clear contrast of light and shadow on the figure's body, skirt hem, and metal structure. The warm and soft lighting presents the unique golden tone of a daytime afternoon. The overall composition uses a diagonal staircase structure to create a strong sense of depth and visual guidance. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the composition, occupying the main center of the middle shot. The foreground features nearby stair steps and railing details, the middle ground is the character's entire body and the staircase section where it stands. The background features a wide sky and faintly visible green tree outlines in the distance. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with soft transitions at the edges of shadows The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, carrying a subtle sense of nostalgia and youthfulness, as if capturing a forgotten moment in daily life. The texture of the image is close to film photography, characterized by slight graininess and low color saturation. The tones are mainly off-white, light gray, blue-white, and rust-red, with a sharp contrast of warm and cool but harmonious unity. The lens uses wide-angle or standard prime lenses, with moderate background blur to highlight the subject while preserving environmental information. The composition is balanced and full of tension. The visual guide starts from the staircase lines below, converging upward to the figure's head, and finally extending to the sky, conveying a sense of hope and freedom. The overall style combines documentary and artistic qualities, like a real life snippet accidentally recorded on a summer afternoon with an old camera. The details are authentic and believable, the emotional expression is subtle and profound, and the image contains no unnecessary decoration, constructing a complete emotional world through light, shadow, color, and spatial relationships",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
