        {
          "id": "krea2-fa6cd59267173a4a4784fb68",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣沙发俏皮坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a dark brown leather armchair, wearing a loose light blue chunky knit sweater with classic twisted knit patterns. The cuffs and hem feature a natural ribbed trim design, and she wears a white shirt with a slightly exposed collar. She wears a dark blue pleated mini skirt, her legs crossed and wrapped in black stockings, black high heels, and a pair of round metal glasses with clear and transparent lenses. Her right hand lightly touches the edge of the frame, her fingers painted bright red nail polish, and she wears a black beret. The brim is slightly slanted, creating a playful yet artistic temperament. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with a slightly sideways body facing the camera, expressing a contemplative and calm expression. The overall posture is relaxed and natural. The background is a simple light gray wall with slight wrinkles, soft and even lighting, and soft shadows that are soft and not harsh. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying most of the main space. The chair's contour lines are clear, and the curved armrests and backrest enhance the sense of layering. The foreground features the upper body and some legs The middle shot features complete sitting postures and seats, with a pure wall in the background. Following the line of sight, hand movements and clothing details extend downward, leading down to the legs and shoes, forming a smooth visual path. The lighting atmosphere is tranquil and warm, with blue, white, black, and brown as the main tones, harmoniously unified to present a warm and comfortable home scene in daily life. The overall style leans toward realistic, lifelike photography, as if shooting with a professional camera paired with standard lenses. With a slight film graininess and natural exposure control, the image is clean and crisp, without unnecessary elements distraction, highlighting the main subject and conveying a tranquil, intellectual, and slightly lazy afternoon atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
