        {
          "id": "krea2-05d09502ccec6f709d97261f",
          "alias": "单女黑西装广场持包",
          "prompt": "A woman squatted by the glass window of a city elevated station, wearing a black suit jacket with an open neckline revealing a black lace underneath. She wore black stockings and black platform sandals adorned with pearl bows, her right hand naturally resting beside her knee. She slung a small black leather square bag across her shoulder, adorned with gold metal clasps. Her overall posture was elegant and fashionable, with a city transportation hub at dusk in the background. The multi-level elevated tracks crisscross the tracks, trains traverse the tracks, and the distant building lights gradually brighten. The sky appears in a dusk interwoven with orange-red and deep blue. Glass windows reflect indoor light and outdoor street scenes, creating a visual layer of reality and illusion. The foreground features the main figures, the middle ground features glass windows and the platform structure outside, and the background extends into the city skyline. The composition uses a low-angle downward view to highlight the figures' figures and presence, while window frames serve as natural frames to guide the viewer's focus on the figures. The light and shadow come from a blend of natural evening light and artificial urban lighting. The soft backlighting outlines the figures, while the warm-toned sunset glow streams through the window, creating a cozy and enchanting atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with moderate color saturation, presenting a fusion of urban fashion and daily life. It feels like a real moment casually taken on the street with a phone, preserving slight noise and authentic environmental details, creating a strong sense of immersion and a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
