        {
          "id": "krea2-5436a9f4bf6b66c3fced6365",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙窗边忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a worn wooden windowsill, wearing a black-and-white plaid long-sleeved dress that reaches her knees, with a thin black belt tied around her waist. She holds an open book in both hands, and in her left hand a red and yellow apple. She leans slightly to the side, her expression gentle and focused, her bare feet hanging in the air, her ankles gracefully outlined, right leg bent, left leg naturally hanging down, posture elegant and relaxed, makeup exquisite but not exaggerated, overall presenting a vintage yet artistic vibe. In the background is an old double-leaf wooden window frame, the window frame lacquered and peeling. The edges are rough, the glass is somewhat blurry, but bright natural light filters through. Light streams in from the window, creating a soft backlighting effect. Below the windowsill is a mottled gray-white wall with obvious cracks and peeling plaster, presenting a texture weathered by time. On the right side is a simple wooden table, old with scratches and wear. Several stacked old books are placed on the table, their spines dark in color. Beside them are two red apples, echoing the apples in hand. The entire space feels simple and tranquil, with a medium perspective in the composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the painting, with the body extending diagonally. The gaze is directed to the window and tabletop on the right, creating a sense of balance and flow. Light and shadow come from the left window, with natural light as the main source, creating soft highlights and shadows. The clothing textures are clearly visible, and the background is slightly dim, highlighting the subject. The atmosphere is warm and nostalgic, as if capturing a tranquil afternoon, full of poetry and life. The color palette is mainly warm yellow, paired with cool black, white, and gray, creating a warm yet slightly melancholic visual impression. The images have the texture of film photography, rich in detail, clear layering, with slight graininess and soft out-of-focus blur, presenting an authentic, natural, and storytelling artistic style, like a moment captured with an old-fashioned camera, capturing a quiet and beautiful moment of daily life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
