        {
          "id": "krea2-cd9fce4d79f0e3c33e848818",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道沉思坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the back seat of a car, her expression gentle yet slightly contemplative, looking directly at the camera, presenting a naturally soft pink hue. She wears a black plush jacket with a soft texture and a slight sheen, layered with a light gray scarf made of lightweight material with fine tassels at the edges, casually draped over her shoulders. One hand gently pinches one corner of the scarf, the other naturally rests on her leg, and on her wrist is a simple silver bracelet. Her fingers are long and neatly trimmed, and beneath her is a white leather seat. The seat surface is smooth with fine textures, the seatbelt crosses the body diagonally, forming a dark line. Next to it sits a shopping bag printed with the Celine brand logo. The bag is off-white, with repeated patterns, brown leather handles, and a relaxed posture. The body is slightly tilted to the camera, and the head tilts slightly, showing an elegant silhouette. Outside the window is a blurry rainy scene, with fine water droplets scattered across the glass. The distant street is faintly visible, and the light filtering through the rain creates a soft, hazy atmosphere. The interior is mainly gray-white. The door panels and dashboard are dark gray, with stitching decorations in the details. The overall atmosphere is quiet and private. The composition uses close-ups, with the main figures occupying the main position, forming a diagonal extension from the upper left corner to the lower right. The light and shadows come from natural light outside the car, soft and even, without strong shadows, creating a sense of casual moments in daily life. It feels like a real-life scene casually taken with a phone or portable camera. The realism is strong, the tone is cool, and the overall image is full of life and fashion. It presents a tranquil moment for urban women riding in a rainy day",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
