        {
          "id": "krea2-fc10b8e5394d407f46a14030",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤广场微笑侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman presents an effortless softness and authenticity, carrying a hint of shyness and calmness, revealing a gentle smile and a healthy glow. The overall temperament is fresh and natural. She wears a blue knitted camisole with a square neckline, a wide shoulder strap, and a clear vertical ribbed texture in a soft blue-green tone. The texture is warm and layered. Her right hand is gently raised, her movements natural and relaxed, her posture elegant yet reserved. The composition centers on the figure. Using medium and close-up shots, the figure occupies most of the frame, with the head slightly tilted. The background is a bright white wall or curtain, with light entering from the right to create soft side lighting. The light source comes from natural light outside the window, uniform and warm, creating the atmosphere of morning or afternoon sunlight streaming indoors. The background is blurred, presenting a pure light tone with no obvious debris interference, highlighting the main subject. The clothing texture is clearly distinguishable. The middle shot includes her arms and shoulders, with smooth and natural lines and soft transitions between light and shadow. The background is completely blurred, creating a shallow depth of field effect that enhances the sense of depth and focus of the main subject. The overall composition is simple yet layered, and through contrasting light and dark and harmonious colors, it creates a tranquil, warm, and slightly intimate atmosphere. The color palette mainly uses warm and cool contrasts, while soft yellow halos are incorporated, giving the overall image a cool yet warm feel. Light and shadow distribution are natural, with delicate shadows, making the entire scene feel as if shot with a professional camera in indoor natural light. Using a large-aperture lens to achieve a shallow depth of field effect, the image quality is delicate and richly detailed, full of the spirit of life and artistic beauty, presenting a beautiful moment from everyday life that seems like a photographer capturing a real and moving image, evoking a sense of quiet, gentle, and pure power",
