        {
          "id": "krea2-174a2b7322b1490c894f4251",
          "alias": "单女白外套街道俏皮站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street, wearing a white quilted cotton jacket with a high collar and black horn buttons and metal clasps, paired with a green long skirt underneath. The overall look is warm and fashionable. She wears a light blue beret with a slightly slanted brim, adding a touch of playfulness and elegance, appearing lively and natural. Around her neck is a thick striped scarf made from soft tones such as light gray, blue-gray, and dark brown, with a noticeable plush texture. The scarf is casually draped over her shoulders, creating a cozy winter feel. Her makeup is exquisite, Looking directly at the camera, her expression shows a hint of calm and thoughtfulness. Her body is slightly turned to the right side of the frame, her head slightly turned toward the lens, creating a dynamic sense of balance. In the foreground, a gray metal railing extends from the lower left corner to the center of the frame. The smooth surface reflects faint ambient light, adding spatial layers to the image. The background is a blurry city street, and in the distance, a modern-style building can be seen. Its streamlined structure is alternating white and gray. The lines are simple and futuristic. Several cars are parked beneath the building, including a clear white SUV. The body is clean, with distinct wheels and windows. There are zebra crossings on the street, and the road surface is made of dark gray asphalt with fine texture. Next to it are orange traffic cones and streetlight poles. The lamp poles are slender, with lights on top but not lit. The sky is grayish-white, with heavy clouds and soft, even light, reflecting diffused light on cloudy or early morning/evening days. The whole scene presents a visual effect of warm and cool contrasts. The character's white coat and light blue hat echo the cool tones of the background, while the warm stripes on the scarf add a touch of warmth. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, the head positioned in the upper right corner, and the camera angle slightly lower than the head-to-head view, making the character appear more approachable. The light and shadows are soft, without strong contrast between light and dark, with light shadows and light light mainly coming from the front left. The folds of the clothing have slight shadows, emphasizing a three-dimensional effect. The overall atmosphere is quiet, everyday, and slightly artistic. It feels like real street photography scenes shot with a regular camera or smartphone, with a slight film texture and natural noise. The color saturation is moderate, not overly vibrant, preserving details and textures from real life. The background blur is well handled, and the use of a large-aperture lens effect makes the subject stand out clearly. The background presents soft bokeh that enhances the depth of the image. The overall color tone is mainly cool, accented with warm elements to create a peaceful and gentle winter street atmosphere. The image has strong narrative power. It evokes an ordinary yet story-filled moment, as if time has frozen in this moment, recording a touch of warmth in urban life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
