        {
          "id": "krea2-579d29cb13f80f291f94c069",
          "alias": "单女制服公园坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese-style high school girl uniform sits on a park bench. She wears a white stand-collar shirt with a red bow tie, a dark blue knit cardigan over it, a gray pleated short skirt, white over-the-knee socks, and dark brown loafers. Her legs are naturally crossed, her posture elegant and relaxed. She is intently reading an open book, her fingers gently caressing the pages, her expression calm and immersed, showing a quiet focus. In the foreground are her body and the book in her hands, and in the middle is a wooden bench and her long legs. The background is a brilliant autumn forest, with golden, orange-red, and deep red maple leaves layered in layers, appearing especially vivid against the blue sky. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled shadows. The ground is covered with fallen leaves, creating a rich autumn atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the main subject while showcasing the vast sky and dense tree canopy. The figure is positioned on the right side of the frame, with ample space left on the left to create visual balance. Light and shadow come from the upper right, creating warm contour light. The shadowed areas transition delicately, with the overall tone in warm yellow Orange-red and deep blue are the main colors, creating a peaceful, warm, and slightly nostalgic autumn afternoon atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a professional camera, with a cinematic film texture. The details are rich, the layers are distinct, the color saturation is moderate, with a slight graininess and natural depth blur, presenting a blend of realism and artistic beauty reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment shooting",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
