        {
          "id": "krea2-eacf637875fc303151bff440",
          "alias": "单女白T恤窗边严肃持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a simple white crew-neck T-shirt made of soft and comfortable material, with smooth shoulder lines and subtle pleated details on the fabric, adding authenticity. On her right shoulder is an off-white plush jacket, soft and fluffy, with fine plush texture. The warm and soft color contrasts harmoniously with the white T-shirt, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame. The head slightly turns toward the lens, radiating a healthy glow. The overall makeup is light and natural, highlighting natural beauty. The background is a pure light gray-blue wall with a smooth surface without any decoration, with even and soft colors with a slight gradient. From top to bottom, it deepens slightly, creating a sense of spatial depth. On the right side of the image, a bright natural light streams in from a window or light source, forming a clear band of light, while on the left, a soft shadow transition is created. The contrast is sharp but not abrupt, and the light is warm and gentle. It presents natural lighting effects in the early morning or evening, with an overall close-up shot, with the figure occupying the main position and ample blank space, giving a peaceful and serene visual impression. The composition is simple yet layered, with the main subject prominent. The middle ground features details of her shoulders and plush coat, while the background features a clean wall and light effects. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with a contrast of cool and warm tones, creating a fresh, gentle, and slightly artistic everyday aesthetic style, as if on a quiet afternoon. Sunlight streams through the window lattice, casting a corner of the room, capturing an ordinary yet touching moment. The entire scene has a strong film texture and a sense of everyday life, like everyday photos taken with an old camera, full of authenticity and warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
