        {
          "id": "krea2-d19284f819a1f5da33c3a420",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫俏皮坐自拍",
          "prompt": "From a high-angle overhead view, a woman sits on a yellow carousel seat, wearing a white long-sleeved shirt paired with a dark brown apron and an orange-yellow inner layer, wearing black leather shoes that reveal her white teeth. Her right hand holds a vintage-style blue film camera, the lens pointed at herself, as if taking a selfie or recording the moment. Her left hand naturally rests on the red metal railing, her body slightly leaning forward, her posture relaxed and vivid. The main subject is positioned slightly lower in the center, creating a strong visual focal point. In the foreground are bright yellow seats and red metal structures, vivid and playful. In the middle is a full-body portrait of the figure, presented from head to toe. The background is a huge circular concrete structure, possibly part of a slide or amusement ride. The surface is rough, bearing the marks of time, presenting a grayish-white tone. The ground is sandy with a brownish-yellow color, scattered with tiny stones and debris. The overall environment appears simple yet authentic. The figures and carousel form a geometric composition, with circular edge lines guiding the gaze toward the center. Shadows cast diagonally from the upper left, projecting onto the ground and structure, forming long, sharp shadow lines that enhance spatial depth and three-dimensionality. The contrast of light and shadow is strong, the sunlight is bright, and warm tones run through the entire image. Golden light shines on the figures, making the clothing colors more saturated. The yellow seats are illuminated by sunlight, presenting a warm bright yellow, while the shadowed areas show deep shadows, creating a striking contrast between light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is warm, nostalgic, and full of life, featuring the grainy texture and slight overexposure characteristic of film photography. The tones are warm and have a touch of retro filters, as if capturing an ordinary yet precious everyday moment. The images are rich in detail and layered, containing both innocent childhood memories and the freedom and joy of youth, as if time stands still in this moment, leaving behind a fragment of growth and beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
