        {
          "id": "krea2-54fa8da10447486ed0b7a6d2",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫海滩俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A Japanese high school girl dressed in a white short-sleeved shirt and a gray pleated skirt stands on a concrete seaside embankment. Her left hand is raised in a waving gesture, while her right hand hangs naturally and gently tugs at the striped tie draped across her chest. The end of the tie hangs casually near her abdomen, her body leans slightly forward, her left leg bent, right leg extended back, toes touching the ground, forming a dynamic pose. Her overall posture is lively yet youthful. She wears black loafers and white long socks, the edges slightly curled. The ankle area is clearly visible. The foreground is a rough gray concrete embankment surface, covered with fine stones and wear marks, presenting a realistic sense of everyday life. The middle ground features a vast sandy beach and shimmering blue sea. The water glistens with delicate silver in the sunlight, distant waves gently lap the shore, forming white foam. A few scattered rocks and the low breakwater structure are faintly visible. The background is a vast blue sky, clear and cloudless, with only a few thin white clouds scattered throughout. Sunlight pours down from the upper right of the frame. Soft and even natural light is created, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality while illuminating the sea and beach, creating a warm and bright summer atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, making the characters appear more upright and visually impactful. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with an inclined body forming a diagonal composition that guides the gaze from the ground to the sky, enhancing the dynamic feel of the image. The boundary between the sea level and sky in the background crosses the center of the image, forming a stable horizontal line that balances the overall visual structure, with blue, white, and gray as the main color tones. The blue sky echoes the ocean, with white shirts and socks bringing a fresh feel, while gray skirts and concrete embankments add a calm tone. The overall tone is harmonious and unified, with natural light and shadow transitions and rich details, presenting a realistic moment captured in daily life. It feels like youthful portraits taken with a regular camera or phone, with slight graininess and natural exposure. Without excessive refinement, it instead appears more authentic and approachable. The images convey the freedom, joy, and youthful vitality of the summer seaside. The whole scene was filled with the breath of life and emotional warmth, allowing people to feel the beauty of youth and carefree times",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
