        {
          "id": "krea2-7d381d9b037fbdf327ea9485",
          "alias": "单女米高领衫办公室神秘坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in an office chair, her body slightly turned to the camera, her left hand resting on the desk. Her posture is naturally relaxed with a touch of lazy elegance. She wears a beige sleeveless turtleneck top paired with a dark gray short skirt and black stockings, black high heels, and a purple-red knit sweater casually draped over her shoulders. The overall look is simple yet layered, as if she is about to speak or has just finished speaking, exuding a friendly yet slightly mysterious aura. In the foreground is a corner of a gray-white metallic office desk, which is smooth and flat. The edges are clean and sharp, with slight reflection at the desk corners, suggesting a soft indoor lighting environment. The middle features a female figure and an office chair. The chair is modern minimalist style, with gray cushioned backrest and seat. The metal bracket structure is clearly visible, and the wheel details are also subtly presented. The background features light gray walls and several large windows, with soft natural light streaming in to create a uniform, diffused lighting effect. The window frame lines are clean, and the glass reflects the indoor blurred light and shadows. The space feels open but not empty, and the composition adopts a diagonal angle. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right side to enhance visual extension. At the same time, the table edges and leg lines guide the viewer's gaze, creating a natural visual flow path. The figure's head is slightly tilted, becoming the focal point of the scene. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with the main light source coming from the left window, creating a soft side light illumination. The shadow transitions are natural, and the wrinkles of clothing and stockings show subtle light and shadow changes under the light. The overall color palette is mainly neutral gray, off-white, and dark gray, accented with a touch of purple-red. The color scheme is harmonious yet still highlights, giving the image the realism of everyday photography, as if shot with a regular camera. There is slight film graininess and natural noise, moderate focal length, well-controlled depth of field, and a slight blur background that highlights the subject, while preserving enough environmental information to create a private moment in an urban office. It combines the professional vibe of a professional woman with a relaxed sense of everyday life. The overall image is full of artistic beauty, blending realism with a fashionable atmosphere. It seems to capture the tranquility and tenderness of a quiet afternoon moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
