        {
          "id": "krea2-02d241508d180ebd0aadc7b6",
          "alias": "单女长裤广场微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She wore a burgundy fashion outfit. On the upper body, she wore a boldly designed mesh long-sleeve cropped top with a diamond-shaped mesh structure. The high neck design paired with a large chest slit revealed part of the chest contour. The sleeves were three-quarter sleeves, which fit the body very well and showed smooth lines. On the lower half, she wore high-waisted leggings in the same color family, made of well-elastic material that perfectly outlined the curves of her hips and legs. On her feet were black high-heeled sandals with thin straps and pointed toe designs. Her heel is high with decorative bow details. In her right hand, she carries a small black handbag. The body is square, with delicate textures on the surface. The top is fitted with a metal handle, giving the overall look a refined and sexy look. Her posture is elegant and confident, her left hand gently tugging at the edge of her shirt, her expression slightly smiling, presenting a soft golden sheen. The background is a blurred city street, flanked by green trees and buildings. The leaves glow in the sunlight, and the distant building walls are lighter in color, possibly white or beige. Light shines diagonally from the left side of the frame, creating a soft side effect, while the left side is in slight shadow, creating a three-dimensional layering of light and shadow. The floor slabs reflect a faint sheen, and some areas appear darker due to dampness. The overall composition centers on the figure, shot in a medium shot, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame's height, with the head slightly tilted, creating direct visual contact with the viewer. The background blur treatment makes the subject stand out more, with burgundy as the main color, paired with black accessories and a green background for a striking contrast. The lighting atmosphere is warm and bright, like a clear afternoon, with sunlight filtering through leaves casting dappled shadows. The entire scene is full of urban fashion vibes, while preserving a sense of realism casually captured in daily life. It's like a casual street photo taken with a professional camera. The lens focal length is moderate and depth of field is well controlled, highlighting the details of the person while preserving the ambiance. The image texture is delicate, with high color saturation but not exaggerated, presenting a high-end and natural visual effect",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
