        {
          "id": "krea2-0d204dde24f790b3fc664d26",
          "alias": "单女透视黑西装城市持包",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a tailored black blazer and a matching mini skirt, layered with a white shirt and a black bow tie. Gold buttons adorned the suit, her hands gently resting on the shoulders of her jacket, exuding elegance and confidence. Her left hand held a black leather handbag with a gold clasp, and deep purple pointed high heels with metallic uppers paired with sheer stockings. The overall look was sharp and refined, with fresh makeup. The background was inside a modern mall, and the ceiling was fitted with circular and strip-shaped recessed lighting. The floor is made of white tiles and black marble, with pedestrians faintly visible in the distance. The space is bright and spacious, with soft and even lighting, creating an urban business atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, body slightly turned to the side, head facing the camera to form a visual focal point. The foreground clearly highlights the subject, the middle ground presents environmental details, background blur is treated, and shallow depth of field effect enhances layering. Light and shadow shine from above, with the leg lines outlined smoothly and three-dimensionally by the light. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray. Accented with gold and purple, the contrast is striking yet harmonious, the image texture is delicate, presenting a professional, fashionable, and modern commercial photography style, much like a high-quality portrait shot indoors with a high-end camera. It has a strong visual guidance, a calm and elegant atmosphere, and a touch of urban female independence and confidence, as if capturing a moment of workplace elites in a busy city—realistic, richly detailed, full of storytelling and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
