        {
          "id": "krea2-4ba7d7a71a39d0feb56dae71",
          "alias": "单女蓝高领衫办公室俏皮奔跑",
          "prompt": "She wore a light blue sleeveless turtleneck cropped top and beige ripped denim shorts, white sneakers, and her hands resting lightly on the gray metal-framed podium. Her body leaned slightly to the side, her posture natural relaxed, exuding youthful energy and confidence. The look was slightly puffy, with a gentle expression tinged with playfulness. Around her neck was a thin chain necklace, and her belly button was exposed. The overall look was casual and fashionable, with a blackboard written on the words \"Water Weaving\" in the background. Next to it is a poster showing the anatomy of the male reproductive system. On the right side of the image, you can see a black office chair, a pen holder, and plant decorations. The floor is made of smooth gray tiles, reflecting the reflections of the figures and furniture. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The podium runs across the bottom of the frame to form a stable baseline. The blackboard and poster form vertical elements in the background, creating a sense of layering between front and back. The light comes from the upper front, uniform and soft, simulating indoor daylight lighting, with subtle and natural shadows. The overall atmosphere is bright and fresh, blending the everyday and relaxed atmosphere of an academic environment. The colors are mainly blue, gray, and white, accented with beige and green, creating a harmonious and unified tone that presents a realistic, lifelike, and artistically textured scene. It feels like high-quality teaching photos taken with a professional camera, rich in detail, natural transitions of light and shadow, and well-integrated people and environment, creating a visual experience that is both professional and approachable",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
