        {
          "id": "krea2-c6198fea2b71ff5f5d3db8d9",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫窗边忧伤坐出神",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window, her body slightly leaning forward, knees curled up over her chest, her head gently resting on her knees, displaying a faint silver-gray sheen. She wears a loose white cotton shirt with a slightly open collar, clearly showing the folds and texture of the fabric. The sleeves are casually rolled up to the elbows, and the arms naturally rest on the knees, as if lost in thought or reminiscing about something. The overall expression is calm but contains complex layers of emotion. In the foreground, her upper body and legs occupy most of the space, and the composition uses close-ups. Place the figure slightly to the right center of the frame, creating a visual focal point. The background is a blurred indoor environment, where you can see the edge of a window and the faint sky and architectural outline outside. Light from outside the window streams in from the left, forming a bright band of light, while on the other side a soft shadow is created. The contrast is strong but not abrupt, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The light presents the warm yellow tone typical of early morning or evening, with a slight film graininess and slight overexposure. This makes the entire scene look like a real photo taken with a vintage film camera, with tones mainly off-white, light gray, and pale yellow. The color saturation is low, presenting a nostalgic, gentle, and slightly melancholic aesthetic. There are no unnecessary decorations or distractions, maintaining a minimalist composition that highlights the emotional expression of the characters and the tranquility of the scene. The overall visual guide starts from the light source in the upper left and then moves downward to the curled legs, forming a natural visual flow. Emphasizing the characters' loneliness and self-envelopment, the composition uses a combination of slanted and curved lines to enhance the dynamic balance of the composition. At the same time, shallow depth of field treatment blurs the background, further highlighting the subject. The overall composition exudes a fleeting beauty captured unintentionally from daily life, as if someone is sitting alone by the window on a quiet afternoon or dusk, letting their thoughts drift away. That genuine and simple beauty carries a faint youthful melancholy and uncertainty about the future, full of storytelling. It makes one want to explore her inner world; the images are rich in detail, all showing a high degree of realism and delicacy. The overall atmosphere is warm, quiet, and slightly melancholic, like a silent poem recording a silent yet profound moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
