        {
          "id": "krea2-154772a809b73e25792e1455",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤衣帽间微笑坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the dressing room, wearing a blue and white striped short-sleeve T-shirt with a small red heart pattern on the chest, paired with matching striped shorts, sitting barefoot on a chair framed with a black metal frame, legs naturally crossed, right leg resting on the left, posture relaxed and casual, hands gently resting on the chair with a gentle smile, a friendly and natural expression, light makeup, and an overall fresh and sweet temperament. In the foreground is her body and chair, which has a black metal frame and brown leather cushions trimmed with wooden edges, and the center is the dressing table The countertop is made of black glass, reflecting the surrounding environment and lighting. On the countertop sits a black professional DSLR camera equipped with a large-aperture lens. Nearby, cosmetics, bottles, and a red packaging box are scattered. On the left side of the background is a white mannequin partially visible. Next to the model are some cardboard boxes and miscellaneous items. On the right is a large makeup mirror, surrounded by multiple round bulbs that emit bright, warm yellow light that illuminates the entire space and other details of the room. The floor is covered with a gray carpet. The atmosphere is somewhat cluttered, with some shooting equipment and cables in the corners. The overall composition uses a central composition, with the figure centered and occupying the main position. The reflection from the mirror creates visual extension, increasing the sense of space. The lighting atmosphere is mainly warm yellow, with the circular lamp from the makeup mirror providing the main light source, creating soft frontal lighting, while also producing slight shadows and highlights, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. The tone is on the cool side, but the lighting creates a warm contrast, highlighting the subject. The overall style feels realistic for everyday amateur photography. It feels like a photographer or blogger taking moments while resting backstage, infused with a sense of life and casual beauty. The image texture is authentic, details are rich, colors are natural, and there is no excessive embellishment, presenting a simple yet authentic visual effect, like daily records taken with a regular camera or phone, full of intimacy and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
