        {
          "id": "krea2-d7c53997b78a3520331091c7",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫俏皮持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a white long-sleeved shirt paired with a deep blue scarf and pleated skirt, with white stripes at the collar and cuffs. She wears black tights on the lower half, and classic black leather shoes. At this moment, she is lowering her head to adjust the laces on her right foot, her left hand gently resting on her knee, her posture elegant yet genuine. Beside her is a black canvas backpack, slung across her shoulder, with some straps hanging down to the floor The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, with a composition combining close-up and middle shots. The figures occupy about two-thirds of the space, creating a strong visual focal point. The background is a typical Japanese residential entrance. On the right is a half-open dark brown wooden door, behind which bright natural light filters out, creating a soft backlighting effect. On the left is a light-colored wooden shoe cabinet with several pairs of shoes arranged in clear layers. The floor is covered with gray tiles, and the edges show the outline of a tatami mat. The entire space is warm and softly lit. The main light source comes from outside the door, slanting in from the right side, creating delicate transitions of light and shadow on the floor and the figure. The outlines are clear and shadows soft, creating a peaceful, everyday, yet lively atmosphere. The colors are mainly blue and white, complemented by warm yellow wood and calm black tones, creating a harmonious contrast and overall presenting a documentary-style photographic texture, as if taken with a regular camera or mobile phone, with slight film graininess and natural depth blur. The door frame and shoe cabinet in the background have clean and sharp lines and balanced composition, then follow her movements to the details of her feet, forming a complete visual flow. The whole image is filled with the everyday feel of youthful campus life—both like a carefully staged photo and a captured ordinary moment, radiating a subtle nostalgia and a warm sense of life. The image is not over-embellished, retaining authentic texture and details, allowing people to feel an aesthetic close to life, like a quiet moment on a morning when preparing to head out for school. Time seems to freeze at this moment, with light and color intertwining to create a daily life full of stories",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
