        {
          "id": "krea2-515f58af1306d6968b1eb846",
          "alias": "单女全裸粉西装街道忧伤坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a light pink suit over a white silk shirt, arms crossed over her chest, sitting elegantly on a stone railing of a classical building. Her makeup was elegant, and her overall look was simple yet fashionable. She sat with her legs together, her toes lightly touching the ground, wearing nude high heels, her posture composed and dignified, with a brown leather handbag beside her. The bag is classic with metal fasteners and handles, giving it a premium feel. The body surface features natural leather texture and exquisite details. The stone columns are thick and heavy, with clean and powerful lines. The top features a simple decorative eave and a large glass window framed with dark metal. Inside the window, a blurred city street scene and light are reflected, faintly revealing vehicle silhouettes and architectural reflections. Light outside the window enters diagonally from the upper right, creating a soft backlighting effect that creates a warm and hazy atmosphere. The overall tone of the painting is a mix of cool gray and warm pink, with strong light and shadow contrasts and natural transitions between light and shadow. The foreground features a stone railing carved with classical column-style patterns, smooth lines and rich details. The middle ground features the main figure and the handbag, occupying the main position. The composition uses a three-part method, with the figure positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the frame. The visual focus is stable, guiding the gaze to the right toward the window and distant spaces. The background features the building facade and glass windows, with clear layers and a strong sense of depth. The overall composition is balanced and artistic, with light and shadow coming from the afternoon sunset. The light is soft and directional, illuminated from the upper right, creating a contrasting texture of light and shadow on the stone pillars and walls, creating a tranquil, elegant, and slightly melancholic urban atmosphere. The image presents a film-like texture, with moderate color saturation and low contrast, with slight graininess and fading effects, resembling an old photograph with a narrative feel reminiscent of a vintage film. The lens uses a mid-focus angle, with clear focus and a slightly blurred background that highlights the subject. Slight vignetting at the edges enhances focus, creating an overall quiet and restrained atmosphere full of storytelling, like a moment frozen on a city street, capturing moments of tranquility and self-reflection among urban women in busy lives. The images convey a modern woman's independent, confident, and composed attitude toward life, combining fashion with humanistic warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
