        {
          "id": "krea2-d0825f809e983dd61b46f55d",
          "alias": "单女绿泳装公寓温柔跪",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on a dark patterned carpet, wearing a vibrant fluorescent green one-shoulder swimsuit. The swimsuit design is simple yet curvy, with a V-neck and thin straps outlining an elegant neck and chest contour. Slits on both sides of the waist highlight the smooth beauty of the legs. Her expression is slightly calm and a touch of mystery. Her hands naturally rest behind her knees to support her body, legs together, feet flat on the ground, posture dignified yet full of tension. In the foreground, her body and swimsuit are vividly colored, occupying the center of the scene. The texture is delicate and the edges blurred. In the background is a dark wooden piece of furniture, possibly a bedside or sofa, with carved details on the surface. The color is dark, creating a strong contrast with the bright swimsuit. In the distance, a window can be faintly seen, letting in soft natural light. Outside, the greenery is hazy, and light filters through the blinds, casting mottled shadows inside. The overall composition adopts a centrally symmetrical style, with the figure centered, using color contrast, The contrast of light and shadow and spatial layers creates a strong visual impact. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and slightly nostalgic. The main light source comes from the front left, simulating natural light. Shadows are soft, while the background shadows are heavier, highlighting the subject. The overall color tone is mainly dark brown, dark green, and fluorescent green, with high color saturation but natural transitions. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, while retaining slight film graininess and dynamic range, presenting a style that is both artistic and realistic for everyday amateur equipment. The images are full of storytelling and emotional tension, like a carefully arranged intimate portrait capturing moments when the characters showcase their charm in a tranquil setting",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
