        {
          "id": "krea2-28aa4350c613d8a7fd18f230",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫城市俏皮站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a wide outdoor stone steps, wearing a white long-sleeved shirt and a deep blue pleated skirt, black high heels, and a beige handbag slung over her shoulder. Her right hand is gently raised, seemingly about to step forward, while her left leg is slightly bent, presenting a dynamic balance. The overall look is simple yet refined, with steps in a citywide public space as the background, flanked by metal railings. In the distance, the glass curtain wall of a modern building reflects sunlight, surrounded by greenery and trees, creating a fresh touch of nature in the city. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center. The stairs extend backward to form strong perspective lines, guiding the gaze upward to converge into the distance. The repeated structure of the steps enhances the sense of spatial depth. At the same time, the figures' postures break symmetry, creating a vivid visual rhythm. The light is natural daylight, with sunlight shining from above and below, creating a soft contrast of light and dark. Shadows fall on the steps, creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality and delicate light and shadow transitions. The overall color palette is mainly gray, white, blue, and brown, with harmonious and unified colors that evoke a warm afternoon atmosphere. The image texture is close to real photography, with rich details. The lens uses a standard angle of view, moderate focal length, well-controlled depth of field, clear figures in the foreground, slightly blurred background, highlighting the subject, and creating a layered composition. The foreground features figures and nearby steps, the middle ground features continuous steps and railings, and the background features buildings and greenery. The lines of the steps also reinforce this direction. The overall image conveys a relaxed, joyful, and hopeful atmosphere of life, as if capturing a beautiful moment of everyday life. It has a strong sense of realism and artistic appeal, like high-quality portraits taken with a professional camera on sunny days. The image quality is delicate, colors are faithfully reproduced, and the light and shadows are natural, presenting an urban fashion style that is both lifelike and aesthetically pleasing",
          "description": "",
