        {
          "id": "krea2-141ed8de877f7826f2dc97e0",
          "alias": "单女透视蓝连衣裙公园忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden outdoor step, wearing a dark blue short-sleeved dress with a slightly draped fabric that naturally covers her thighs. The hem of the skirt flares slightly, revealing her legs clad in black sheer stockings. On her feet are simple black flats with semi-transparent designs on the uppers, faintly revealing the outline of her toes. The overall look is both elegant and carries a touch of casual and everyday charm. Her hands are folded on her knees, fingers long, and her nails neatly trimmed. It displays a natural pink sheen, posture dignified and relaxed, body slightly leaning forward, head slightly tilted, carrying a faint melancholy and contemplation, as if recalling or waiting for something, revealing a gentle yet restrained mood. The background is layered with old wooden steps, the surface yellowed and mottled from years of wind and sun, some edges slightly worn, with tiny dead leaves and dust mixed in the gaps. On the left side of the steps is a rough stone wall, covered with moss and green spots, It shows a damp environment and the erosion of time. On the right steps, a few withered fallen leaves scatter in a brownish-yellow color, irregularly shaped, adding a touch of autumn and desolation to the scene. The entire scene is set in a quiet outdoor corner, possibly beside a park, courtyard, or ancient path. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The camera shoots from a slightly overhead angle, making the figure stand out more while preserving the spatial sense of the surrounding environment. The foreground clearly shows the main figure and nearby steps; the middle is a staircase extending into the distance; the background gradually blurs, creating a strong sense of depth and spatial layering. The light comes from natural light, which should be on cloudy or evening days. The sunlight is soft and even, without obvious shadows, but with a slightly cool tone, making the overall atmosphere feel peaceful and somewhat lonely. The colors are mainly dark blue, gray-brown, and dark purple, accented with a touch of green and brown. The overall tone leans toward coolness, enhancing the sense of calm and nostalgia. The image quality closely resembles the real scenes shot outdoors in a professional studio, featuring slight film graininess and natural noise, simulating real camera imaging effects, emphasizing real lighting and environmental details, and creating an artistic, retro, and story-rich atmosphere—like an old photo forgotten in time, capturing an ordinary yet touching moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
