        {
          "id": "krea2-fcc810cfedd4d1c458debb6c",
          "alias": "单女透视蓝衬衫公寓俏皮坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an off-white fabric sofa, naturally draped over her shoulders, looking directly at the camera, exuding youthful energy and confidence. She wears a light blue loose shirt with light, flowing fabric, a black bow at the collar, sleeves slightly rolled up to reveal slender wrists, a black short skirt and dark sheer stockings, black flat shoes, sitting cross-legged with elegant and natural posture, long fingers, smooth and expressive movements, the overall look fresh and sweet yet fashionable, set against a simple indoor setting The walls are pure white with simple line decorations, creating a clean and bright sense of space. The sofa is soft and comfortable, with natural folds and light and shadow changes on the surface, enhancing realism. Light comes from the front right, softly and evenly illuminating the figure, creating a natural transition of light and shadow, with subtle shadows and smooth transitions. The overall atmosphere is warm and tranquil, full of everyday life. The tones are mainly light blue, black, and off-white, harmoniously unified and giving a fresh and elegant feeling, as if photographing real scenes at home. It has a strong sense of familiarity and immersion. The image details are rich, and the light and shadow treatment is delicate, presenting a warm and authentic home atmosphere. It resembles everyday photos taken with a regular camera or phone, retaining natural noise and slight blurred edges, enhancing realism and intimacy. The overall composition is balanced. The visual focus is clear, conveying a relaxed and joyful mood, allowing people to feel the beauty of youth and the comfort of life",
