        {
          "id": "krea2-61c8af3eecf86c9265e1e034",
          "alias": "单女森林愤怒躺",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways among dense green plants, her expression calm and slightly contemplative, as if in a silent dialogue with nature. Under the mottled light and shadow, she reveals a natural sheen, as if about to lightly sniff the cluster of pale blue flowers beside her. This flower grows on the left side of the foreground, composed of several tiny blue-purple blossoms. The petals are delicate, surrounded by lush green leaves. The leaves are rounded, with clear edges and distinct veins. Some are illuminated by sunlight, showing a bright yellow-green, while the rest are hidden in the shadows. This creates a rich sense of layering. The background features dense green plants layered in layers, with leaves of varying sizes and shapes—some broad and spreading, others slender and curled—interwoven and overlapping to create a deep and closed forest feel. Light filters through the gaps between the leaves from above and sides, forming soft beams of light that enhance the image's three-dimensionality and mysterious atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the right side with a slightly tilted head, while the blue flowers on the left serve as one of the visual focal points. It forms a resonance with the figures, with an overall composition that is asymmetrical yet balanced, full of natural flowing beauty. The camera angle is close to level with a slight downward angle, as if shooting from a low position or close to the ground, creating an immersive experience. The image tones are dominated by rich green, mixed with warm yellow tones from sunlight. Blue flowers serve as the finishing touch, bringing a touch of cool contrast. The color saturation is moderate, with a slight grainy film texture and retro filter effects, giving the image a texture reminiscent of vintage camera shooting. The light and shadow treatment is delicate; highlights are bright but not glaring, shadow areas are deep but retain details. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and poetic, as if capturing the quietest moment of a summer afternoon, like a casual snapshot of life taken with an amateur film camera, full of chance and realism. The edges of the frame are slightly blurred, simulating the effect of out-of-focus and enhancing spatial depth. Distant green leaves gradually blur, further highlighting the subject. The entire scene exudes a nostalgic, dreamy, and lifelike atmosphere. It feels as if time has frozen at this moment, allowing one to feel the purest connection between humans and nature.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
