        {
          "id": "krea2-1a5db0726dc4df9ce0cee974",
          "alias": "单女全裸白毛衣室内俏皮坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a warm indoor setting, wearing an off-white chunky knit sweater with clearly visible knit patterns. The cuffs and shoulders feature classic twisted patterns, paired with a white ruffled shirt underneath. She wears a dark floral dress, giving off a vintage yet comfortable everyday vibe. The headscarf features geometric and wavy patterns in soft orange, blue, and brown tones, adding a touch of playfulness and laziness. She steadily holds a black Canon FTb film camera on the camera body The \"Canon\" logo is clearly recognizable. The lens is a standard focal length prime lens reflecting the faint light from the surroundings. The camera strap is made of brown leather, naturally draped over her arms and chest. Her fingers are long, nails painted light gold or nude nail polish. Her left ring finger wears a simple silver ring, and her right index finger also has a delicate ring. The main subject of the frame is positioned slightly below the center. The composition centers on the figure, using medium and close-up shots to highlight their actions and emotional expression. In the foreground is her camera and part of her arm, while the background is blurred to create a soft bokeh effect. In the background, you can faintly see a wooden bar or table, with faint warm yellow lights in the background—possibly chandeliers or wall lamps—streaming in from above and sides, creating a warm diffuse light that creates a peaceful and cozy atmosphere. The overall lighting is soft, with warm tones dominated by off-white, light brown, and orange-yellow. Paired with dark camera and clothing details, a contrasting yet harmonious visual layer is formed. The image has a strong sense of everyday documentary, like real life clips shot with amateur equipment, with slight film texture and graininess. The tone is slightly overexposed but still retains detail, with the background completely out of focus, creating a shallow depth of field effect that enhances the subject's prominence. The entire image conveys a love for photography, observation of life, and tranquil moments immersed in creation, full of artistic and nostalgic atmosphere. It was like a precious photo capturing ordinary and beautiful moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
