        {
          "id": "krea2-b2a3f456a2b287fc5831068e",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫街道站立比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street at night, wearing a blue long-sleeved shirt with vertical stripes. The shirt is made of cotton or blend, with delicate textures and slight pleats. The neckline is open, revealing the collarbone and neck line. There are several white buttons on the chest, one of which is undone to form a subtle V-shaped opening. The waist is designed to be slim, highlighting a slender waistline and full bust curve. The sleeves reach the wrists, with slightly rolled cuffs, paired with dark gray or black high-waisted pants. The overall look is simple yet stylish. Her left hand was tucked into her pants pocket, while her right hand carried a large deep blue canvas bag with brown leather straps. The surface of the bag had slight reflections and shadows, highlighting its texture. She wore a pair of round metal earrings, with a small necklace hanging. The background was a magnificent classical building, possibly a Roman Colosseum or similar Roman-style structure. The exterior walls were built from massive stones, with weathered surfaces marked by time, and multi-layered arches arranged neatly. Inside each archway, warm yellow light shines through, illuminating the interior space of the building. Above the arches are carved decorations, and in some arches, you can see blurry figures or exhibits. In front of the building is a wide street with smooth surfaces and traces of vehicles. In the distance, pedestrians are walking, with streetlights and traffic signs along the roadside. On the right side is a section of black metal railing, shaped vertically like a strip that reflects surrounding light. The composition is centered, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center, occupying the main visual space. The background buildings are symmetrical and layered, gradually blurring from foreground to background, creating a strong sense of depth. The lighting atmosphere is mainly warm yellow, with light from inside the building and streetlights creating a soft halo in the night sky, but the surrounding environment is slightly dim, creating contrast between light and dark. Light shines down from the upper right, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall tone leans toward vintage and warm, with a film photography texture. The image has slight noise and graininess, simulating the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The camera view is slightly overhead. The camera has a moderate focal length, a shallow depth of field, and a noticeable background blur, highlighting the main subject. The overall image presents a sense of tranquility and elegance in an urban nightscape, combining the weight of historic buildings with the modern life of the characters. The composition is balanced, colors harmonious, details rich, and full of storytelling and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
