        {
          "id": "krea2-cd33bb19b72d005559a88679",
          "alias": "单女全裸黑短裙椅上沉思坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "Paired with a black short skirt and nude stockings, she sits in a rattan rocking chair, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her left hand gently holds a blue-covered book in front of her chest, while her right hand rests naturally on her knee, showing a thoughtful and imaginative expression. Her expression is calm yet tinged with a hint of thoughtful tenderness. Her legs are crossed, left leg in front and right leg behind, with her toes slightly raised, showing off her long, well-proportioned leg lines. Her overall posture is both dignified and relaxed. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the center right of the frame, and the composition uses a medium perspective. Highlighting the interaction between characters and their environment, the background features two rows of tall wooden bookshelves neatly arranged with various books. The spines come in a rich variety of colors, including blue, red, white, and purple. Some book titles are visible, and small potted plants and decorations are placed on the shelves, adding a touch of life. On the right shelf is a small green potted plant with lush branches and leaves, injecting natural vitality into the picture. On top of the left shelf are photo frames, folders, and some small items, rich in detail. The floor is covered with a dark gray carpet, soft and textured. Contrasting with the bright indoor lighting, it creates a warm and comfortable reading atmosphere. In the middle of the frame, the figure's sitting posture and the rocking chair are fully structured. The rattan chair surface has clear texture, the armrests and backrest are simple yet textured, and beneath the chair is a metal support structure, stable and modern. The figure is draped in a light gray knitted blanket with pink geometric edges, casually draped over the chair backrest, adding a touch of homely warmth. The movement then follows the body posture to the leg lines, finally returning to the book in hand, forming a circular visual flow Light and shadow come from the left side of the image, creating transitions between light and shadow. The shadows fall on the bookshelf and floor, creating distinct layers. The overall atmosphere is quiet, artistic, and slightly intellectual, presenting a serene moment filled with the scholarly atmosphere of everyday life. The image feels realistic and lifelike, resembling everyday moments captured with a regular camera, yet with exquisite detail handling, harmonious color coordination, and balanced composition, presenting a visual effect that combines artistic beauty with realism. It is suitable for expressing the elegant temperament of an educated woman and the tranquil reflection of her inner world",
