        {
          "id": "krea2-319f0906abcf1a2c4d414771",
          "alias": "单女蓝连体衣摄影棚温柔站立展示",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a pure white background, her body slightly leaning forward, head lowered, and her left hand naturally resting on her waist. Her posture is elegant yet restrained, as if adjusting her clothes or checking how they're worn. She wears a blue-green gradient short-sleeved bodysuit. The upper part is made of semi-transparent mesh fabric, creating a soft, hazy texture, while the lower half is made of opaque smooth fabric that fits closely to the curves of the body, showcasing smooth lines. The texture is delicate, with a slight sheen that perfectly outlines the legs. The overall design is simple yet modern, with a full-body portrait in a mid-shot shot. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, forming a stable visual center. The camera captures from a slightly overhead angle, enhancing the body's slenderness and dynamic beauty. The background is pure and flawless white, with no debris or distractions, creating a minimalist visual space. Light and shadow come from a soft light source slightly to the left in front, with uniform and soft lighting with almost no obvious shadows, only faint shadows cast on the ground. Highlights the three-dimensional contours of the subject and the details of the clothing. The colors are mainly blue-green, beige, and white, with harmonious and unified tones and subtle warmth contrasts. The overall atmosphere is quiet, professional, and slightly intimate, reminiscent of a commercial product shoot in a studio. It is highly realistic and artistic, with clean and crisp images and rich details, suitable for fashion, lingerie, or apparel advertising. The style leans toward high-end couture and modern aesthetics, with clear and sharp image textures, natural fabric folds, and the translucent effect of the stockings is realistic and believable. The entire scene presents a calm and restrained aesthetic, combining the affinity of everyday life with the sophistication of professional photography. It feels like real photos taken with a high-end DSLR under professional lighting, rather than AI-generated virtual images, emphasizing the real physical attributes and visual details, creating a strong sense of immersion and trust for the audience",
