        {
          "id": "krea2-15f93c1be6eb7bada5230b5f",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服街道微笑站立招手",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a deep blue sailor uniform stands on the street in a traditional Japanese residential area, smiling brightly. She turns back and waves to the camera, her left hand naturally lowered, her right hand raised in a friendly gesture. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, and her sailor jacket is deep navy blue, with white stripes on the collar and cuffs. A red bow is tied at the chest, and the skirt is designed with high-waisted pleats. The fabric is delicate and presents natural pleated layers, paired with black over-the-knee socks, with her feet hidden from the frame. She carries a backpack in the same color scheme, with the strap slung across her right shoulder. The body features a metal zipper detail, and the overall clothing is well-tailored, with smooth lines. The character's posture is relaxed and natural, with a slightly turned body and head turned toward the camera, exuding youthful energy. The foreground is a gray asphalt road with fine graininess and reflections, with no obvious debris on the surface. The middle ground is the main subject, occupying the left central position of the frame. The composition uses a third-division method, with the figure positioned in the left third and gazing to the right. The background is a typical Japanese traditional machiya building, mostly two-story structures. The roof is made of dark gray tiles, the eaves are slightly raised, and the walls are mainly beige and light brown. Some windows are fitted with wooden grilles, and there are narrow street spaces between the buildings. In the distance, utility poles and wires spanning the air can be seen. The background is blurred, making the main body stand out and creating a shallow depth of field effect. Light comes from the upper right, a soft natural evening light. The sunlight is warm yellow, shining from the right side of the figure and creating natural shadows on the left side of the body. The transition between light and shadow is smooth, the sky shows a gradient of pale pink and light blue, thin clouds, and the overall atmosphere is calm and warm, full of life. The color palette mainly features a contrast of warm and cool tones. The deep blue of the sailor suit forms a visual balance with the warm background tones. The color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and white teeth are shown. The entire scene seems to capture a moment of a girl greeting a passerby on her way home after school. The composition is stable, the angle slightly lower, enhancing the character's presence. The visual guide is directed toward the audience through the characters' gaze and gestures. This creates an interactive feel, with slight vignetting at the edges of the frame to enhance the center's focus, presenting a real and beautiful moment from everyday life, with strong narrative and emotional resonance, like high-quality portraits shot with a professional camera, yet retaining the authenticity and intimacy of street photography",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
