        {
          "id": "krea2-71bad3eb8ecd7c249d9fcb0f",
          "alias": "单女红短裙床严肃坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white bed, her body slightly tilted, legs gracefully stretched to one side, presenting a relaxed and dynamic posture. She wears a black long-sleeved top and a bright red short skirt, paired with black stockings. Her overall look is simple yet visually striking, with exquisite makeup and a calm and confident expression, exuding a calm and serene aura. Her right hand rests gently at her waist, while her left hand hangs naturally. Her fingers are long, her posture composed. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. In the foreground are pure white sheets and some bed edges, soft in texture with slight wrinkles on the surface, presenting a realistic sense of life. In the middle is the woman's body and posture, with the white iron headboard and bookshelf behind her. The iron headboard is exquisitely designed, featuring curled patterns and smooth lines. The bookshelf is a white multi-layer structure with empty interiors, and the background is bright windows and light gray curtains. The outside light is abundant, creating a soft, diffused glow. The entire scene is mainly white, creating a clean, bright, and minimalist atmosphere. The composition uses a diagonal layout, with the woman's legs extending from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a strong visual guiding line. At the same time, her posture and the direction of the gaze create a subtle balance, enhancing the stability of the composition. On the left side of the painting is a brick wall with clear texture and a light gray-brown color, contrasting with the white wall and adding spatial layering. On the right side is a floor-to-ceiling window, with curtains hanging softly and gently swaying in the wind, adding a sense of dynamism. The light and shadows come from natural light outside the window, soft and even, without strong shadows. Details are clearly visible, the overall atmosphere is peaceful, comfortable, and modern, carrying a sense of realism from everyday life, as if captured with a regular camera at home. The images have high expressiveness of detail, and the materials are authentic, including the sheen of stockings, fabric textures, and metallic reflections. The color scheme is harmonious, with red and black contrasts highlighting the subject. The white background is pure, the composition is rigorous, the perspective is level and slightly downward, making the characters appear more three-dimensional. The overall image presents a blend of everyday life and artistry. It combines the documentary quality of photography with the refined aesthetic of aesthetics, with warm yet stern tones that create a quiet yet captivating visual experience",
