        {
          "id": "krea2-3279ceb5c823881524948a62",
          "alias": "单女制服户外媚态持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a Japanese-style sailor uniform: a white long-sleeved top with a deep blue collar and striped cuffs, and a blue-and-white plaid pleated skirt. She gently lifted the hem with her right hand, revealing black fishnet stockings and lace-trimmed shorts underneath. The overall look was full of youthful energy and a touch of playfulness, presenting a temperament that was both innocent and slightly provocative. She stood in front of a metal railing outdoors, with a clear blue sky and a few sparse white clouds in the background. In the distance, the silhouettes of modern buildings were faintly visible, and sunlight shone down from above. A soft backlighting effect is created, giving the edges of the subject a faint halo. The light is bright and even, and the composition uses a low-angle downward shot to enhance the slenderness and visual impact of the figure. The foreground features a clear subject, the middle ground features blurred railings and the sky, and the background is a blurred cityscape, creating a strong depth of field. The fresh and bright contrast of light and shadow creates a warm and tranquil summer afternoon atmosphere, presenting an overall texture reminiscent of everyday life photography. It feels like a moment captured outdoors with a regular camera, with slight graininess and realistic environmental details. These elements together create a scene rich in life and artistic beauty, allowing people to feel the beauty and freedom of youth.",
