        {
          "id": "krea2-700bddd378d1e07b00d1a20b",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤公寓忧伤坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the edge of the windowsill, her right hand naturally resting on her knee, her posture relaxed and elegant. She wears a loose light blue short-sleeved T-shirt, with a faint neckline peeking out of her pale purple underwear. She wears light-colored shorts, legs crossed, and blue and white plaid socks with her toes pointing outward. The overall look is fresh and natural, full of the atmosphere of everyday life, appearing both innocent and slightly lazy. The background is a bright floor-to-ceiling window, and outside the window is a blurry city building, with sunlight streaming through the glass into the room. A soft backlighting effect creates a faint halo of light on the figure's silhouette. The window frame is made of white metal, simple and modern. The windowsill is made of light gray stone with a smooth and flat surface. The floor is covered with light beige wood flooring with clear and natural texture. Light enters through the right window, casting long shadows on the floor and creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a medium angle angle, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly turned to the right, head slightly raised, guiding the viewer toward the upper right of the frame. This creates a sense of visual extension: the foreground is the lower body and feet, the middle is the upper body and windowsill, and the background is the blurred cityscape outside the window. The layers are distinct, the contrast of light and shadow is strong, and the highlight areas are concentrated behind the figure and outside the window, creating a strong backlighting effect. The front is in darker shadows, highlighting three-dimensionality and contour lines. The overall color palette is mainly light blue, off-white, and light gray, with soft and unified colors with a slight cool tone, creating a quiet, healing, A slightly melancholic afternoon feel, with delicate image texture and rich details, as if shot with a professional camera, featuring film-like graininess and natural exposure control. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, background blur is natural, subject is clear and prominent, and the overall atmosphere is warm and comfortable, full of life energy, like a daily record from a private album—authentic and moving",
