        {
          "id": "krea2-1571cdd9dc195bcbd7fbe604",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙屋顶沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor stone railing, adding a touch of laziness and casualness. Under the warm sunlight, she glows softly, her expression calm and focused. She wears a white off-shoulder dress with a simple and elegant design, featuring ruffled puff sleeves at the shoulders. The neckline is off-shoulder with pleated details, and a thin bow cord is tied at the chest. The waist is cinched to outline a slender waistline. The hem reaches the mid-thigh, the fabric is soft and fitting, presenting natural pleats and light effects. Around her neck is a pearl necklace. The bead necklace is round and white, paired with a petite pendant, adding a touch of vintage and refinement to the overall look. Her hands rest lightly on the stone railing, fingers long, her posture relaxed and natural, her body slightly turned to the side, forming a graceful curve. The foreground features a rough beige stone railing, with natural textures and traces of time, and the edges slightly worn down. On the right, a slender tree branch extends into the frame, dotted with tender green leaves that appear semi-transparent under sunlight, while the background is a blurred natural and architectural landscape In the distance, you can see lush trees and shrubs, mainly green, mixed with hints of brownish-yellow and ochre. In the distance, you can faintly see the clusters of coastal city buildings. The rooftops are arranged in a harmonious manner, mostly in light gray, off-white, and light red, distributed along the mountains and water. The lower right reveals a small patch of blue sea or lake, shimmering and reflecting the light from the sky. The entire shot uses shallow depth of field, with the focus clearly on the subject, the background gradually blurring, creating a soft bokeh effect. The composition uses a three-part layout. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with the viewer's gaze guiding them toward the space outside, creating an open and imaginative atmosphere. Light comes from above, representing the warm afternoon sun, creating a layered light and shadow. The highlights are bright and transparent, while the shadows transition naturally. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, light gray, and green, harmoniously unified and full of the tranquility and gentleness of a summer afternoon. The image has a strong film texture, moderate color saturation, soft contrast, and rich detail retention. It feels as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, with a slight graininess and lens flare, creating a nostalgic, romantic, and story-rich visual experience. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, elegant, with a touch of artistry and solitude, like a frozen moment in a movie, capturing the beauty and contemplation as time passes.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
