        {
          "id": "krea2-75f520cc6b2bbdaa7a7aca55",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙街道沉思站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a high city street with a sideways glance, her makeup delicate and natural, and she smiles slightly at the camera. Her head tilts slightly, showing off the elegant lines and contours of her neck. She wears a black gothic outfit, with a mesh long sleeve decorated with lace on top. The mesh features a diamond-shaped plaid pattern, transparent and layered. The arm is adorned with black leather straps and metal buckles throughout, offering rich design details. The back is heavily hollowed out, exposing skin and highlighting sexiness and fashion. The waist and shoulders feature intricate strap structures, paired with a high-waisted black glossy leather mini skirt. The surface is smooth and reflective, presenting a strong sheen texture. The hem edges are decorated with tassels or plush decorations. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the foreground, leaning slightly forward, one hand lightly resting on the blue railing. His fingers are long, his nails neatly trimmed, and his posture relaxed and natural. The exterior walls are mainly gray-white and brown, with dense windows and staggered air conditioning units. Numerous shop signs line the street, neon lights and Chinese signage are interwoven, with clearly visible words like \"MK STAR HOTEL.\" Some signs have yellowed and faded, revealing traces of time. The street floor is made of gray cement, marked with yellow double solid lines and traffic signs. Pedestrians cross in the distance, vehicles park by the roadside, and a white sedan and a van can be faintly seen. Green trees peek out from gaps between buildings, their branches and leaves gently swaying in the breeze. The sky is blocked by buildings, appearing cloudy or cloudy. The light is soft and even, without strong shadows. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is diffused daylight, creating a sense of everyday urban realism. The composition uses close-ups combined with environmental narration, with the characters occupying the main visual center. The background is blurred to highlight the main subject, while retaining sufficient environmental information to enhance immersion. This then extends along body curves to clothing details, and then guides the gaze into the distance through street extensions in the background, creating a visual rhythm that combines movement and stillness. The color palette is mainly black, gray, and brown. Green plants and a few colorful signboards are used as accents, creating sharp but not awkward color contrasts. The overall atmosphere combines the everyday vibe of daily life with the fantasy colors of role-playing, presenting a fantastical moment that suddenly appears on a real street, as if a cosplayer is improvised in a city corner. The image texture is close to the style of mixing professional cameras and mobile phones, with clear details and minimal noise, giving it a realistic film feel and a sense of everyday life. It felt like a street art moment accidentally captured on an afternoon, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
