        {
          "id": "krea2-3bd6abfc1cfa6e93d195d79e",
          "alias": "单女制服教室站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a Japanese-style sailor uniform, a white stand-collar shirt trimmed with black trim and a deep blue pleated short skirt, tied in a delicate deep blue velvet bow at her chest. She sits at a wooden desk in the classroom, slightly tilting her head to look at the camera. Her right hand gently rests on the edge of the desk, while her left hand hangs naturally, her fingers long and fair. Her overall posture is elegant and relaxed. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the foreground, occupying the main visual space. The background is a typical Japanese classroom environment, and on the left side, rows of empty white desks and chairs can be seen. In the distance, soft natural light filters through the window, and outside you can faintly see the outlines of buildings and the sky. At the rear right is a green blackboard, with white fluorescent tubes and air vents installed on the ceiling. Light streams in diagonally from the upper left, with the overall color scheme mainly white, deep blue, and wood tones, creating a fresh and tranquil campus atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with people occupying most of the frame. The background blur highlights the main subject, and the view is slightly overhead to enhance intimacy and immersion. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with soft highlights and delicate shadows, presenting a warm afternoon sunshine effect. The overall image exudes a documentary feel of everyday life and youthful energy, as if captured by chance during a quiet moment after school. Shot with a professional camera, 135mm prime lens, f/2.8 large aperture, low-angle top-angle shot, simulating real camera imaging effects, clear details, high color fidelity, realistic texture, slight film graininess and natural noise, presenting an imaging style that combines artistic beauty with real life",
