        {
          "id": "krea2-5b1c867026491a47f393ddfc",
          "alias": "单女湿身黑连衣裙沙漠神秘站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in gorgeous exotic attire stands before the desolate yet magnificent coastal landscape. She wears an exquisite golden crown set with blue-green gemstones that hangs down to her waist. She wears a black strapless top adorned with metallic armor and tassels on her shoulders, with gold chains and accessories adorning her chest and waist. She wears a high-slit black long dress with a wide, flowing hem, The material is light and translucent, with orange-red flame-like patterns. When gently lifted in the wind, it reveals the lines of her long legs. She wears a golden tassel ankle at her ankle, standing barefoot on a huge, dark withered tree. The surface of the wood is covered with rough grain and cracks, as if it has been tempered by countless years. She slightly turns to look back at the camera, her left hand extended forward, fingers long, wearing a golden bracelet and ring, her posture elegant and full of power. In the foreground is a decayed tree trunk lying horizontally, its dark brown wood grain clearly visible. Some parts are soaked by seawater, reflecting a faint sheen. In the middle of the scene, the female subject stands atop a withered tree, her body slightly tilted, her skirt unfolding back, forming a graceful arc. The background is layered yellow-brown rock cliffs, the rock layers showing natural wavy patterns, as if carved by wind and sand. In the distance, the pale blue sky contrasts sharply with the ground. The overall composition uses a third-level method, with the figure positioned slightly in the middle right of the painting. The line of sight extends from the withered tree in the foreground to the figure. Moving up to the background rocks and sky, it creates a sense of depth. Light and shadow come from the upper left, soft natural light spills over the figures, gold jewelry sparkles warmly under the light, shadows fall on rocks and ground, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The atmosphere is tranquil and mysterious, carrying an epic exotic beauty, as if you are in an ancient legendary desert oasis or a lost civilization. The color palette is mainly earthy tones, paired with black, gold, and blue, creating a strong visual contrast and rich visual details. From the folds of clothing to the texture of the rocks, everything is clearly visible, creating a strong artistic appeal while preserving the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment. The lighting is natural, the color saturation is moderate, and there is no excessive embellishment, presenting a realistic and storytelling visual style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
