          "id": "krea2-d6485a7e84024a1c2076e21f",
          "alias": "单女城市坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the outdoor stone steps, appearing natural and casual. She wears a black round-neck long-sleeved top made of soft and comfortable material, with subtle pleats and textures. The shoulder lines are smooth, and the cuffs are slightly cinched. The overall look is simple yet textured. The stone steps behind her are made of rough concrete or weathered stone, with surfaces covered in mottled marks from the passage of time. The color is grayish-brown, with occasional pale yellow spots and shadows intertwined, creating a rich sense of layering. The edges of the stone steps are slightly worn but details are realistic. The background is a blurred architectural structure, with faint metal railings, wooden window frames, and glass reflections. These elements are blurred to present a soft out-of-focus bokeh, creating a daily urban street atmosphere. The composition uses medium to near close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly below the center, head slightly tilted, creating direct communication with the viewer. Light comes from the upper right, representing the warm slanting afternoon sunlight, with golden beams piercing through the fine dust in the air. At the same time, long shadows are cast on the stone steps and behind her, with strong light and shadow contrasts, natural transitions between light and shadow, bright and transparent highlights in the highlights, deep and rich shadows, and the overall color tone mainly warm yellow and brown, with a vintage film feel. The color saturation is moderate, with a slightly grainy texture, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. The image quality is delicate but retains slight noise and film texture, enhancing realism and nostalgia. The image has no obvious watermarks or decorative elements, and the composition is simple yet powerful, highlighting the emotional expression of the subject. Through the use of light and shadow and the setting of the environment, it creates a quiet, introspective, and story-rich atmosphere, like a moment captured on an ordinary afternoon—both authentic and poetic. The overall visual experience combines the warmth of everyday life with the depth and beauty of artistic photography",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
