        {
          "id": "krea2-960668c5cfa4ed433f0ba6c0",
          "alias": "单女毛衣城市忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window of a café, wearing a striped knit sweater with ruffled cuffs. In the foreground is a drink served in a transparent glass, the liquid in the glass amber, topped with a thick layer of white milk foam. The cup rests on a wooden tabletop, its texture clearly visible, and the background is a blurred indoor environment, accented by warm yellow lighting. It creates a warm and hazy atmosphere. On the right side of the image, there are large areas of green leaves blurred, and in the upper left corner you can see the silhouettes of branches. The entire scene is shot through window glass, with slight reflections and moisture marks on the glass surface, adding layers and realism to the image. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly to the right, with the gaze facing left, creating visual guidance. Drinks and plants in the background serve as visual elements to balance the image. The light comes from warm indoor sources, creating a soft contrast of light and dark. Light and shadow refraction and reflection on the glass enhance spatial depth. The overall tone is mainly warm yellow, brown, and green, presenting a vintage film texture with slight graininess and color shifts, simulating the effects of vintage camera shooting. The lens is an 85mm prime lens with a small aperture of f/2.8, a shallow depth of field, obvious background blur, and distant lighting creating bokeh spots. The overall image is full of life and artistic feel, like a casual snapshot taken with a portable camera. It captures a quiet and poetic moment in city life, conveying a lonely yet tranquil urban sentiment, as if time stands still and only inner thoughts flow",
