        {
          "id": "krea2-1cba211530df77ae952f223d",
          "alias": "单女金连衣裙小巷站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the middle of a narrow city alley, naturally draped over her shoulders, appearing both calm and approachable. She wears a loose yellow linen long dress with natural pleats and textures. The neckline is a stand-up design, with a vertical stripe on the front lapel and wide, flowing sleeves. The overall look is simple yet textured, with a thin chain necklace around her neck adding a touch of refinement. Her posture is relaxed, her hands naturally hanging down, and her body slightly leaning forward. As if about to move forward or just stop, it occupies the main visual center. The middle ground is a small alley and street extending into the distance, flanked by low buildings with slightly weathered walls, windows, air conditioning units, and hanging signs. On the right, a dark porch entrance can be seen; on the left, several bicycles are parked. Next to it is an orange traffic cone. The background gradually blurs, distant building outlines are blurred, and the sky is dyed a bright white by intense backlight, creating a soft halo effect. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical style, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame. The lines of the alley converge deeply, creating a strong sense of perspective and enhancing spatial depth. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by warm golden tones. Sunlight slanting down from above creates a distinct backlighting effect. The character's outline is outlined by the light to create soft glows. The contrast between shadows and highlights on clothing is sharp, emphasizing the texture of the fabric. The entire scene is filled with a tranquil, lazy, and slightly nostalgic Japanese street style with moderate color saturation. With a slight retro filter and warm tones, it creates a gentle atmosphere like afternoon sunlight. The image has a slight film graininess and natural lens distortion, simulating the effect of a real camera. It feels as if an old film camera is capturing a moment on a clear afternoon. The overall image presents a poetic beauty of everyday life, combining the realism of street life with artistic pursuits. Although the architectural details in the background are not clear, you can sense their everyday life, such as utility poles and red curtains, Elements like shop signage together create a realistic and welcoming urban environment. The use of lighting creates a clear hierarchy between the subject and the background—clear foreground, transitions in the middle, and blurred background—reinforcing the visual focal point. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, like a silent urban lyric poem that records the most touching moments in ordinary days",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
