        {
          "id": "krea2-188406df1a677e31e99c8acc",
          "alias": "单女棕高领衫街道微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at a city street intersection, wearing a brown turtleneck knit top and a plaid mini skirt, paired with black stockings and a brown shoulder bag. She wears a gentle smile, naturally leaning against a white road marker, her left hand gently supporting the bar, her right hand naturally hanging down, her posture relaxed and elegant, her body slightly turning to reveal soft curves and youthful energy, revealing her white, neat teeth. Her overall aura is fresh and sweet, full of the warmth of everyday life. In the foreground is a clear full-body image, occupying the center of the painting slightly to the right. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure fully presented above the knees. The background is a typical Japanese street scene: on the left, you can see parked bicycles, blurred shop facades and building facades, and on the right dense green shrubs, creating a vivid color contrast. The road surface is made of dark gray asphalt, with white traffic markings including a large character \"decorative character\" (stop), hinting that this is an intersection requiring parking. The distant outlines of buildings blur, presenting light gray and beige tones, creating a sense of spatial depth. Light comes from cloudy or scattered environments, gently and evenly casting on the figure without strong shadows. The overall atmosphere is calm and warm, carrying the everyday vibe of urban life. The main colors of the image are brown, green, and gray, harmonious and unified, with a realistic texture that feels like shooting with a regular camera. The lens's slight compression creates a natural perspective effect, the background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject, the composition is balanced and dynamic, and the figure's posture guides the gaze to the left, while maintaining a stable visual center of gravity and smooth light and shadow transitions. The details are rich, presenting an overall documentary-style portrait aesthetic, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment, allowing people to feel the innocence of youth and the tranquility of the city. The visuals convey a strong sense of immersion and authenticity, like the warm scene of a girl next door meeting on the street, full of life and cultural warmth",
