        {
          "id": "krea2-5ef68445884c165f00e73fed",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫机场冷淡坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bench in a modern airport lobby, wearing a light blue vertical striped shirt and a beige high-waisted knit mini skirt, white sneakers, and black-rimmed glasses. Her expression is slightly lazy and confident, her body slightly turned to the side, her left hand gently lifting her shirt sleeve and right hand resting on her knee. Her posture is relaxed yet full of tension. The overall look is simple, fashionable, yet distinctive. The background is a spacious and bright airport waiting area, where towering glass curtain walls reflect the clouds and architectural structures, and the ceiling is a complex geometric metal grid ceiling, with smooth and futuristic lines, dark gray non-slip tiles on the floor, faint pedestrian silhouettes and signs visible in the distance, composition using low-angle downward shots, with the figure occupying the center-left position, creating a strong visual focal point. The foreground highlights the figure's silhouette and clothing details, the middle ground shows the airport's depth and ambiance, the background uses blur to enhance the clarity and layering of the subject, and natural light from above and sides, softly and evenly illuminating the figures. Delicate transitions of light and shadow and three-dimensional light and shadow effects are created. Shadows fall on the floor and walls, enhancing the sense of realism and three-dimensionality in the space. The overall color palette is mainly cool white, light blue, and beige, creating a fresh, modern, slightly detached urban atmosphere. The image texture is delicate and lifelike, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the casualness and realism of daily life. It presents a unique style that lies between artistic photography and life documentation. The image details are rich, color saturation is moderate, contrast is natural, and light and shadow transitions are smooth. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, with a slight film graininess that adds a touch of retro and nostalgic charm. The composition is balanced yet dynamic, evoking viewers' associations with travel, time, and space. The entire scene is both realistic and poetic, as if capturing a moment of tranquility and beauty",
