        {
          "id": "krea2-b38eba07cc8cc196ac0c9675",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙椅上沉思站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors among greenery, wearing a deep blue sleeveless dress adorned with white fine thread and pleats. A plaid cloth strap is slung across her shoulder. The strap features a checkered pattern of off-white and brown patterns, partially covered but revealing the blue fabric and a small white pattern. Her arms shine brightly in the sunlight, fingers stretch naturally, and the shadows of plant leaves cast on the backs of her hands and arms creating a mottled light and shadow effect, with an overall relaxed posture that seems to be enjoying the afternoon sun. Surrounded by dense green vines, the leaves are slender and oval-shaped, vibrant and vibrant. The branches intertwine and twist, some hanging down, some growing upward. Some leaves glow in the sunlight with a semi-transparent texture. The background is the exterior wall of an old residential building, grayish-brown with obvious signs of weathering. On the wall is a white Whirlpool air conditioner outdoor unit, with the fan blades clearly visible. Below the air conditioner is a small white plastic stool with some miscellaneous items placed on it, along with wooden boards and cardboard boxes stacked nearby. In the distance, you can see the yellow-framed window with reflective glass, potted plants placed on the windowsill, and a white railing and clothes hanging on the second-floor balcony, one of which is made of blue fabric. The whole scene is full of a sense of everyday life and a sense of everyday life. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center, and dense green leaves partially covering the figure's body, creating a sense of layering. The middle ground is the main subject and nearby plants, with buildings and everyday objects in the background. The extension of green leaves also serves as a guide. Light comes from the upper right, with intense sunlight filtering through the gaps in the leaves, creating a contrast of light and shadow on the figure and the ground. The mottled light and shadow create a warm and realistic summer afternoon atmosphere. The colors are mainly green, blue, and gray, accented with yellow and white. The tone is natural and moderately saturated. The image has a slight graininess and film texture, as if shot with an amateur camera, presenting a sense of everyday and authentic. With a warm documentary style, the overall atmosphere is peaceful, comfortable, and full of life's charm. The details are rich and layered, combining natural beauty with a cultural atmosphere, like a photo capturing beautiful moments in ordinary life",
