        {
          "id": "krea2-190f5f6b98a37aa46129d18e",
          "alias": "单女摄影棚愤怒坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits beside a pile of vintage electronic devices outdoors, with a hint of contemplation and detachment, appearing both cool and approachable. Around her neck is a multi-layered silver necklace, including thin chains, small rings, and heart-shaped pendants. Delicate earrings are worn, creating an overall look that balances laziness and fashion. Her arms are naturally bent, and her body leans slightly forward. The posture is relaxed yet expressive, with a background of several stacked vintage electronic instruments, including a communication receiver with knobs, dials, and displays, oscilloscopes, and signal generators. The device casing is gray-blue and army green, with obvious signs of use and age. One device also holds an old kerosene lamp with a transparent shade, clearly visible inside, along with antennas, metal brackets, and some blurry electronic components. In the distance, several white tents and bare branches can be faintly seen. The background is blurred, presenting a soft bokeh effect. The sky is light blue, bright but not glaring. The overall tone is cool, mainly blue-gray, creating a nostalgic atmosphere where technology and nature blend together. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the character on the right side of the frame, leaving blank space on the left for equipment to create visual balance. The camera angle is slightly overlooked, the background gradually blurs to highlight the subject, with light and shadow from the upper right, delicate shadows, rich layering, and a film-like texture with moderate color saturation and clear details. It presents a style reminiscent of professional studio or outdoor on-site recording, with a strong cinematic feel and storytelling, as if a radio enthusiast is quietly enjoying moments in a wild camp. The entire scene is filled with poetry and a sense of solitary beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
