        {
          "id": "krea2-51a160263968186dabc4f28b",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫露营地愤怒坐持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor camping chair, wearing a white turtleneck zip-up sports top and gray tight sweatpants, along with white platform sneakers with a red \"NO: 2505\" logo on the upper. The overall look is simple yet full of vitality. She leans slightly to the side, hands folded over her knees, and her right hand lightly grips a white smartphone, presenting a naturally relaxed state that adds a sense of movement. A delicate gold necklace is faintly visible around the neck, with delicate details. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the middle frame, with a balanced and layered composition. In the foreground is a wooden folding table made from horizontal wooden strips, with slightly worn edges. The legs are metal brackets, echoing the chair's metal frame. Black connectors are visible at the corners, reflecting the details. On the left side of the background is a blur of yellow shrubs and green plants; behind it are the outlines of red brick buildings and wooden corridor structures; on the right is a dark gray perforated metal panel wall covered with regularly arranged small round holes reflecting specks of light, creating an industrial texture. In the distance, faint string lighting decorations can be seen. The lighting is a warm yellow, creating a soft halo under the sunlight. The entire scene is set in an open outdoor space, with a dark gray asphalt floor with clear texture. The light comes from directly above to the left, representing natural daylight. It is bright but not glaring, with soft and consistent shadows, presenting a sense of depth. The colors are mainly white, gray, and brown, accented with yellow plants and warm lighting, creating a visually harmonious and unified effect. The composition uses a center-offset layout, with figures occupying the main positions. The lines of tables and chairs extend to both sides, enhancing the sense of spatial depth The overall atmosphere is relaxed and cozy, combining modern urban life with outdoor leisure style. It seems to capture everyday moments on a city balcony or outdoor café area in an afternoon. The image texture is delicate and lifelike, as if shot with a professional camera, but retains slight film graininess and natural noise, simulating real photography effects. The light and shadow treatment emphasizes layering and contrast, highlighting the subject while not overlooking environmental details. The warm yet refreshing color tone gives a comfortable, tranquil, and vibrant feeling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
