        {
          "id": "krea2-9feaca424e046dc02e0bc68f",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫困倦蹲注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sat among lush clusters of blue flowers, looking natural and fresh, gazing into the camera as if softly speaking something. She wore a white short-sleeved shirt with a slightly open collar, revealing her collarbones and neckline. The violin was orange-red, with clearly visible wood grain, smooth body, and strings reflecting sunlight. She was surrounded by layers of blue flowers, which grew densely among the green branches and leaves, forming a sea of purple blossoms The flowers in the foreground are partially blurred, creating a depth of field. In the middle is a girl and a violin, half-squatting or sitting, her body slightly turned to one side, her posture relaxed and elegant. The background is a clear blue sky and the blurred outlines of green trees in the distance. The sky appears a bright pale blue without clouds, with sunlight shining down from above, soft and warm. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot, placing the figure slightly to the right of the center of the frame, using the flowers in the foreground as a frame. The visual guide gradually transitions from blurred flowers in the foreground to a clear main figure, then extends to the background blue sky and green plants. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and dreamy, with sunlight filtering through the gaps between the flowers and leaves. The colors are mainly blue, green, and white, accented with the orange-red of the violin, creating a striking contrast. The overall tone is fresh and natural, full of youthful energy and poetic beauty. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a high-resolution camera, with a slight film graininess and soft halo, creating a tranquil, romantic, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. Like a gentle dream on a summer afternoon, it carries strong artistic appeal and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
