        {
          "id": "krea2-8bb9f83243f1dde04fc93740",
          "alias": "单女白旗袍瀑布自信持相机",
          "prompt": "An elegant Eastern woman wore a white embroidered qipao. The fabric featured delicate jacquard patterns and three-dimensional floral embroidery decorations. The flowers were mainly white and light gold, accented with tiny beads and sequins. Gold buttons arranged along the skirt sides, presenting an overall exquisite and luxurious feel. The background is a deep black curtain, with countless fine golden threads hanging down, forming vertical stripes of light and shadow. Under the light, the threads shimmer faintly, creating a waterfall-like flowing visual effect. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center, body slightly turned and head turned toward the camera, creating a strong visual direction. The light comes from the front slightly left, with natural transitions in the shadows. The golden threads in the background reflect starlight in the dim light, forming a sharp contrast with the white qipao. This enhances the sense of layering and depth in the image, creating an elegant and noble atmosphere full of Eastern charm, as if you are at a banquet or celebration. The photography style resembles professional studio shooting, using large-aperture lenses for precise depth control, blurring backgrounds to highlight the subject, warm and soft tones, and delicate light and shadow, presenting a serene yet story-rich artistic aesthetic. The images have strong visual impact and emotional expression, allowing people to feel the perfect fusion of traditional and modern aesthetics, like a carefully painted portrait. Every detail is meticulously designed—from the materials of the clothing to the use of light and shadow, to the posture and expressions of the characters—all convey a restrained yet confident Eastern feminine charm. The entire scene seems frozen by time, frozen in its most beautiful moment, full of poetry and romance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
