        {
          "id": "krea2-afcf73f1b57dbf2bcba3a829",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣城市坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an old corrugated metal rooftop, wearing a loose beige knit sweater with a wide neckline that drapes down naturally, revealing her collarbones and shoulder lines. The sweater is soft and fluffy, presenting a warm texture and delicate texture. She leans slightly against the white wall, lowering her head to gaze at the transparent plastic cup in her hand, which holds a golden drink. A straw is inserted inside, fingers gently gripping the cup, her nails painted light pink nails, revealing a calm and contented expression. Her legs are long, and she wears black stockings. Her right leg bent, left leg straight, wearing a pair of silver pointed high heels, the upper covered with fine glitter, shimmering faintly under the light. She sat at the edge of the roof, her posture relaxed, one hand gently resting on a corrugated metal plate, fingers naturally extended. The metal plate surface was mottled and aged, bearing the marks of time. Some areas were rusted or peeled, forming irregular gray-brown patches. Light and shadow intertwined, intense sunlight shone from above, creating a sharp contrast between light and shadow throughout the scene, casting clear shadows on the left side and behind the figure. The shadows are clearly contoured, forming geometric lines with the walls and roof. The background is a simple white wall, with wooden door frames visible in the corners. The floor is rough cement, scattered with a few dead leaves and small debris. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward view to highlight the figures' figures and spatial layers. The composition mainly uses warm tones and soft lighting, creating a lazy and comfortable afternoon atmosphere, forming a flowing line of sight from top to bottom. It emphasizes the main subject while incorporating environmental details, enhancing realism and a sense of life. The overall style combines everyday casualness with artistic beauty, as if captured with a regular camera, capturing moments of tranquility and comfort in urban life. The images are full of warmth and storytelling, conveying a simple yet profound sense of happiness",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
