        {
          "id": "krea2-f3d9244c020c00ee50668e5a",
          "alias": "单女上衣城市自信站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman's half-length portrait appears natural and vivid. She wears a loose black top made of soft and comfortable material, wide sleeves, a simple neckline design, smooth shoulder lines, and slight wrinkles on the fabric surface. This adds realism and dimensionality to the outfit. Her right hand gently rests on her left shoulder, her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light-colored polish, her posture elegant and natural. She carries a gold chain bag across her shoulder, with a moderate thickness and a strong metallic texture, reflecting a soft sheen under the light. Although the body is not fully visible, its design is simple and stylish, with an overall modern and refined look. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of center in the frame, with the body slightly turned and the head slightly turned toward the camera. The composition uses close-up shots. The background is a blurry city night scene, composed of multiple circular light spots, presenting a typical bokeh effect. These spots come in various colors, including warm yellow, pink, and white, varying in size and distributed in a well-balanced manner, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The edges of the light spots are soft and transitions naturally, and the background is highly blurred, making the main figure stand out more. Light and shadow come from the front and sides, with soft and even light sources, making the outline clear. The shadowed areas transition smoothly without harsh boundaries, and the overall lighting is warm, with tones dominated by warm yellow and pink-orange, creating a warm and romantic nighttime atmosphere. The color saturation in the image is moderate, with low contrast, emphasizing a soft texture and delicate layering. The overall composition is stable, with figures occupying the main space, and background elements as accents enhancing the depth and storytelling of the image, forming a natural flow of sight. The entire image presents a tranquil beauty in an urban nightscape, combining the refinement of artistic photography with the casual moments captured in daily life, as if shooting on a street at night with a professional camera. It preserves realism and a sense of life, while carefully handling lighting, shadow, and color to give the images a strong atmosphere and emotional expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
