        {
          "id": "krea2-437a5737dcb814a4aa0cd562",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫竹林俏皮蹲",
          "prompt": "A woman squats outdoors in front of a gray brick low wall, her expression slightly lazy and playful, creating a subtle atmosphere that is both intimate and distant. She wears a loose white semi-transparent long-sleeved shirt paired with a light blue printed T-shirt underneath, light blue overalls, with slightly rolled-up legs revealing slender calves. On her feet are off-white platform sandals with simple uppers and clear textured details. The overall style is casual and casual, full of summer vibes. She held a half-spherical watermelon with both hands, its skin dark green with light green stripes, the flesh bright red and juicy, and the seeds distinct. A wooden spoon was inserted into the flesh, and in her left hand she held an unfolded bamboo fan. The fan leaves were broad, the handle slender, showing a natural pale yellow wood grain texture. Against the backdrop were dense green vines, with broad leaves of various shapes. Some leaf edges were slightly yellow, climbing along the bamboo poles and wooden frame structures behind, forming a natural green barrier. Behind her was a gray-brown wall. The wall is made of irregular stones or bricks, rough and bearing the marks of time. The floor is neatly laid with square gray tiles, with some dust and small debris mixed in between the gaps. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure sitting in the center and leaning slightly forward, forming a stable visual center. The foreground highlights the interaction between the figure and the watermelon and palm fan, the middle ground shows the contact between the lower body and the ground, and the background is enhanced by blurred greenery and walls to enhance spatial layering, with soft and even lighting. Natural light from above and below creates natural shadow transitions without strong contrast. The overall tone is cool, mainly teal and gray-blue, accented with the bright red of watermelon and warm yellow of the wooden fan, creating a visual color balance. The atmosphere of light and shadow is tranquil and leisurely, as if capturing the most pleasant moment of a summer afternoon. The image presents a poetic beauty of everyday life, with a slight grainy film texture and vintage tones, simulating the effect of amateur photography equipment. The image feels authentic and rich in detail. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of life, conveying a simple, pure summer coolness. The composition is compact but not crowded, and through the watermelon and palm fan in hand, the surrounding environment is extended, forming a complete narrative loop. The plant blurring in the background enhances the prominence of the subject while preserving the realism of the scene. The whole scene feels like a casual snapshot of daily life, yet full of artistic aesthetic interest",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
