        {
          "id": "krea2-2c28d94f556465ee38f59f98",
          "alias": "单女红T恤庭院坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden floor, wearing a red polka-dot camisole and blue jeans, paired with an open denim jacket. She gazes down at the natural wood folk guitar in her arms, her fingers gently resting on the strings, her posture relaxed and natural. Her left ring finger wears a silver ring, and a faint tattoo pattern is visible on her right wrist. Her body leans slightly forward, presenting a tranquil state immersed in music. In the foreground, a few small orange-yellow tomatoes scattered at her feet, with a cushion made of off-white and brown patchwork placed beside it In the background is a light-colored wooden door frame with glass window frames. Behind the door is a dim indoor space, where hangers hanging clothes and woven chandeliers hanging from the ceiling can be faintly seen. On the right side is a small table covered with a beige tablecloth, on which sits a glass bottle of Coca-Cola and half a sliced watermelon, revealing bright red melon flesh and black seeds. Sunlight streams in from the right, casting soft shadows on the floor and figures, creating a strong contrast of light and dark spots, with warm and bright lighting. It presents the grainy texture and slight fading tones unique to film photography. The overall composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, the body extending diagonally, guiding the gaze from the tomato in the foreground to the person and then to the doors and windows in the background, creating a natural visual flow. In the lower right corner of the frame, blurred green plant leaves serve as a blurred element in the foreground, enhancing spatial layering. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, comfortable, and full of the vibe of a summer afternoon, with a strong retro film style and moderate color saturation. Red and blue form a striking contrast, while warm yellow tones of light and shadow are incorporated, creating an image beauty that is both everyday and artistic. It's like casually capturing life moments in a sunny courtyard with an old-fashioned film camera. The details are rich but not chaotic, the transitions of light and shadow are natural, the tones warm and soft, and possess strong emotional resonance and narrative quality, allowing people to feel the beauty of youth, freedom, and simple life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
