        {
          "id": "krea2-c4121f5bdf4cefb434f72f32",
          "alias": "单女紫衬衫室内沉思坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits indoors, wearing a light purple pajama shirt with blue floral patterns, layered with a deep blue loose kimono-style outer robe. The collar and cuffs are decorated with gray webbing, giving the overall look a casual yet distinctly Japanese style. She holds a bitten apple in her right hand, its surface faintly glowing. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, her expression slightly lazy and contemplative, her head slightly tilted, her posture relaxed and natural. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the foreground, occupying the main visual space. The background is a dark gray wall, with an abstract painting hanging on it. The frame is black, mainly in red, yellow, blue, and white, with bold brushstrokes full of artistic flair. Light enters from the right side, casting clear shadows of the figure on the wall. The shadow outlines are distinct, presenting a three-dimensional visual effect. The strong contrast of light and shadow creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure on the left side of the frame and the right side reserved space to display light and background elements, forming an asymmetrical yet balanced visual structure. The image tone tends to be cool, mainly gray-blue and dark tones, but the warm accents on apples and clothing create visual focal points and enhance layering. The light is soft and directional, coming from the sides and rear, while the background wall creates a transition of light and shadow, creating a sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and slightly nostalgic, as if capturing a moment of quiet afternoon solitude. The image texture resembles film photography, with slight graininess and vintage tones. The color saturation is moderate, details are rich, light and shadow are delicate, and the clothing textures are clearly visible. The brushstrokes of the background paintings and the subtle textures on the walls are clearly presented, presenting an unintentional beauty from everyday life, like a snapshot casually taken with an old-fashioned camera, full of storytelling and emotional tension. The images are not overly embellished, preserving the natural authenticity and traces of time, allowing people to feel a quiet, personal comfort and ease",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
