        {
          "id": "krea2-a478dad81aaf2d79e9e4b398",
          "alias": "单女白长裤城市微笑坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a black bench outdoors, wearing a gray tight sports top and white high-waisted leggings, layered with an off-white long plush cardigan. She pairs white platform sneakers with white long socks. The overall look is simple yet fashionable, with a naturally relaxed posture. Smiling at the camera, she exudes youthful energy and elegant temperament. The background is the exterior wall of a building, with a rough light gray texture. The windows have dark green frames and blue English letters reading \"YOU\" printed on the glass \"LIKE THE SEA I LOVE YOU\" is displayed. Decorative curtains made of blue-green circular plates hang by the window, falling like waves, creating a sea-themed atmosphere. White snowflake-shaped decorations are pasted on both sides of the window, and on the right is a blue palm sculpture. These vibrant installations add a playful and modern touch to the image. The figures are positioned slightly to the right center, composed using a three-part method, occupying the main visual space. In the foreground is a gray square floor tile with clear texture. The middle frame features figures, benches, and surrounding colorful sculptures, while the background is the building facade and window decorations, creating a rich sense of layering. The light comes from natural daylight, soft and even, illuminated from the upper left, with natural transitions of shadows. The overall color scheme is mainly gray, white, and blue, accented with yellow and blue. The warm and cool contrast is harmonious, creating a relaxed and pleasant atmosphere, full of urban street art. The details are rich and the texture is realistic, giving the realism of everyday life photos taken with a phone or camera, as if capturing an unintentional moment of life. With a slight grainy film texture and natural lighting, it presents a rustic beauty that lies between professional photography and amateur documentation. The perspective is slightly overlooked, enhancing the person's approachability. The overall composition is balanced, the visual direction is natural, the focus is on the subject, and background elements serve as a complementary contrast without overshadowing the main feature. The color saturation is moderate, the contrast is soft, creating a comfortable and pleasant visual experience. It is suitable for scenes that showcase the fusion of lifestyle attitudes with urban culture, offering strong immersion and dissemination",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
