        {
          "id": "krea2-5da606e5c9918dd61e69319b",
          "alias": "单女和服庭院沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a colorful kimono printed with large red, orange, and purple floral patterns. The fabric is delicate and soft, with the unique luster and texture of traditional Japanese fabrics. She stands slightly to the side, tilting her head lightly, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. Her right hand is gently raised, her posture elegant and natural. In the foreground is a large number of hanging maple leaf branches, the leaves showing a gradient color from tender green to golden yellow to deep red, with clear edges. The veins are distinct, with some leaves illuminated by sunlight revealing a semi-transparent texture that forms bright spots and soft contours. The middle ground shows the woman's upper body, in a slight out-of-focus blur. The body contours and kimono details remain clearly visible, while the background is completely blurred into a hazy green and golden halo, creating a profound sense of space. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, placing the figure slightly to the lower right of the frame, leaving a large space on the left side to display the maple leaves and light, creating visual balance and guidance, with light coming from the upper left, warm backlight penetrates the leaves, forming soft contour light and diffused light. The contrast between light and shadow is soft but not harsh, and the overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, full of autumn warmth and romance. It seems to capture the moment of afternoon sunlight shining into the courtyard. The lens simulates shooting with a 35mm prime lens, giving it a realistic film texture. Color saturation is moderate, highlights retain details, shadows have rich layers, and the image has slight graininess and slight lens distortion, enhancing the realism of everyday amateur photography. The tone is warm yellow, Orange-red is the main color, accented with cool-toned flowers on the kimono, creating a harmonious color contrast that presents an artistic style that is both refined and natural. Like a snapshot of life taken spontaneously in an autumn park, it combines the subtlety and elegance of Eastern aesthetics with the delicacy and warmth of modern photography",
          "description": "",
