        {
          "id": "krea2-62fa507ec599229535675ca8",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫商店愤怒倚靠持书",
          "prompt": "A woman squatted in front of a refrigerated cabinet at 7-Eleven, exuding an unintentional sense of seduction. She wore a tight-fitting white turtleneck short-sleeve top, made of smooth and elastic material that outlined a slender waistline and graceful silhouette. She wore a black high-waisted mini skirt with a simple hem design but side slits revealing her long legs. She wore black patent leather pointed high heels with metal accents on the toe and black stockings visible at the ankles, the surface smooth and shiny. The lines and veins of her legs are faintly visible. On her left wrist, she wears a white jade bracelet, on her right wrist a watch with a metal strap. Her body leans slightly forward, her right leg bent forward, her left leg stretched back. Both hands hold a green plastic bottle, placed on an open newspaper. The newspaper has a blurry English title and picture, with a typical convenience store interior. On the left is a refrigerator cabinet with a transparent glass door, neatly arranged with various drinks and beverages. Lights shine from inside the cabinet. Bright cold light is reflected on the glass, with multi-tiered shelves in the center filled with colorful packaged foods, dairy products, and ready-to-eat products. On the right are black metal shelves displaying snacks and small goods. The walls feature 7-Eleven's red striped logo and brand logo. The ceiling is fitted with fluorescent tubes that emit a uniform and slightly glaring white light. The floor is made of beige tiles arranged in a grid pattern, providing ample light but a cool tone, presenting the lighting texture common in commercial spaces. The composition uses a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, occupying the visual focal point. Her body is positioned diagonally, enhancing the sense of movement. The foreground features the reflection of glass from the refrigerated cabinet and some newspapers, the middle ground shows the subject and the items in her hands, and the background features shelves and brand elements, creating a clear spatial layer. Her hand movements and the text on the newspaper serve as secondary guiding points. The light and shadow mainly come from the fluorescent lamps at the top and the light sources inside the refrigerator, creating a strong contrast between light and shadow. The overall atmosphere blends the casual feel of daily life with deliberately crafted fashion, combining the ordinary vibe of a convenience store with meticulously composed photos reminiscent of a model shoot. It feels like a street portrait shot with a phone or regular camera, authentic and full of storytelling. The color palette is mainly white, black, and green, accented with orange and red brand elements. The color saturation is moderate, with slight noise and compression marks, simulating the authentic texture of amateur equipment shooting. The details are rich, including subtle wrinkles on stockings and reflections from high heels The metallic sheen of the watch and the printed fonts on newspapers—all these elements together create a scene full of modern urban life, combining realism with artistic aesthetic expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
