        {
          "id": "krea2-dcfc18bc9fed0eaaaf18b0ad",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣广场回眸",
          "prompt": "She slightly turns her head to gaze at the camera, her makeup elegant and natural, and her overall aura elegant and approachable. She wears a close-fitting camel vertical stripe knit dress with a high neckline, long sleeves wrapping the arms, and a fitted cut that perfectly outlines her curves. The hem and mid-calf have clearly visible knit textures, presenting a warm texture and three-dimensional woven details. She carries a small black suede square bag crossbody over her shoulder, with a simple and elegant body. Featuring metal buckles and a slender chain that harmonizes with the overall look, she lightly carries the bag strap with her right hand, striking a natural and relaxed posture. She wears a pair of black high-heeled ankle boots with matte material and pointed toe design. The stiletto heels accentuate the leg lines, the boot shaft height is moderate, and paired with black stockings, the overall look looks sharp yet feminine. The background is a modern minimalist interior space, with a light wood floor paved with clear and natural wood grain, reflecting a soft sheen. The right side reveals the edge of a circular white plush carpet. Adding a touch of warmth, behind is a gray fabric sofa with a thick backrest and full cushions with clean lines. Two dark gray cushions rest on the sofa, with a soft texture. The sofa legs are made of slender black metal material with a stable supporting structure. The wall is pure white, clean and simple. A vintage-style wall lamp is installed on the wall, with a lampshade made of milky white glass that emits a warm yellow glow. Light filters through the curtains into the room, creating a soft light and shadow effect. The window is on the left side of the frame, hidden by a semi-transparent white gauze curtain. Sunlight filters through the sheer curtain, casting mottled light and shadow, creating a peaceful and comfortable atmosphere. The entire scene is centered on the figure, using a slightly upward angle to highlight the figure's proportions and presence. The foreground features the main figure, the middle ground features the sofa and some interior furnishings, the background features the walls and window lighting, and transitions to environmental details. The light mainly comes from the left side of the sky and the artificial light from the wall lamp, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The lighting is soft and even, and the overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and elegant. Filled with the sophistication and lived-in atmosphere of modern urban life, the visuals present an unintentional beauty found in daily life, as if they are high-quality portraits taken with a professional camera, yet still retain the authentic texture and warmth of everyday life",
