        {
          "id": "krea2-11dc6f656b84b0c5ab0ba814",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙高塔困倦倚靠演奏",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a red and white plaid Lolita-style dress, wearing a matching plaid beret. Hands on hips, body slightly leaning forward, confident and playful. The dress was short-sleeved, with white ruffles on the collar and cuffs. A large white satin bow was tied at the chest. The hem was layered and made of red and white plaid fabric and white lace. The hem was puffy, revealing part of the thighs, paired with pure white over-the-knee stockings. The sock cuff is decorated with a red thin string strap. On the feet, he wears black patent leather Mary Jane shoes with a simple upper and a white toe toe. On his wrist, he wears a multi-layered pearl bracelet and carries a small white lace woven bag. The overall look is exquisite, sweet, and full of character. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the foreground, occupying about two-thirds of the space. The background is a public plaza in the city, with gray square tiles on the floor. Some water stains reflect light, and on the left stands a green A-shaped warning sign printed with \"Beware of slippery ground.\" The logo and slip icon are displayed next to a beige circular sign labeled \"Wash\" and \"WASH.\" Behind it stands a green guide board clearly displaying Chinese and English inscriptions such as \"Bell Tower,\" \"Tulip Square,\" \"Rose Corridor,\" and \"FLOWERS EXHIBITION HALL.\" Behind the sign, the building entrance and glass curtain wall structure can be faintly seen. In the distance, there are blurry pedestrians walking. On the right side are two dark gray sorting trash bins, each marked with a recycling mark. The surrounding lighting is soft and natural, presenting a diffused light effect on cloudy or evening days. The sky is gray-white with no obvious shadows. The overall color palette is mainly red, white, and gray, with vivid contrast yet harmony. The composition uses medium portrait photography, with a camera angle slightly overlooking to highlight the main subject. Warning signs and indicator signs in the front are used to visually guide the audience's gaze toward the characters, while background elements provide scene information. Enhancing realism, the image features clear layers, a clear foreground, natural mid-shot transitions, and a moderately blurred background, creating a sense of everyday street encounter. The light and shadow are even and delicate, without strong contrasts of light and shadow, creating a relaxed and realistic atmosphere. It feels as if you're casually shooting outdoors with a regular consumer-grade camera, preserving everyday details and texture. The entire image presents a unique visual experience blending anime-style aesthetics with realistic street photography styles, combining the dreamy feeling of role-playing with the lively atmosphere of the real world",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
