        {
          "id": "krea2-5160e9973dada23cb759b337",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫户外困倦坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor stone steps, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt with a black ribbon tied around the collar forming a delicate bow. The hem of the shirt is slightly open, revealing the dark undergarment. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, her fingers gently gripping a silver metal bottle cap, while her right hand carries a black shoulder bag. The strap drapes across her shoulder, giving it a soft sheen. She slightly tilts her head toward the camera, with the main subject on the right side of the frame, body slightly tilted, head slightly raised. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space. The background is blurred green plants and faint reflections on the water, presenting a shallow depth of field. The middle is her arms and part of her body, while the background is a blurred natural environment, including trees, shrubs, and distant bodies of water. Light pours down from the upper left of the frame, creating a soft backlight. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly white and green, accented with black ribbons and wrappers, creating a fresh and natural color scheme Through contrasts of light and shadow, the main contour is emphasized, the composition is balanced and layered, presenting a peaceful, youthful, and beautiful everyday moment, as if capturing a gentle moment of a campus girl resting under the afternoon sun. The film features a slight film texture and natural noise, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting. The details are rich, the light and shadow transitions are natural, full of life and artistic beauty",
