        {
          "id": "krea2-711fc444e683956b4e9d4400",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙海滩俏皮站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the stone wall by the sea, wearing a white spaghetti strap long dress that transitions from white to light blue. The skirt is light and flowing, made of sheer or chiffon, presenting a soft drape and natural pleats, gently pulled to the sides, forming a playful and natural pose. On her feet is a simple pair of silver flip-flops, barefoot on the sand, her posture relaxed and genuine. The overall vibe is fresh and natural, full of the leisurely atmosphere of a summer seaside. Behind her is a white signpost. At the top, a yellow circular arrow marks the left, while the two rectangular signs below are labeled in Chinese, Korean, and English respectively with \"Bathroom\" and \"Shower room.\" The font is clear and simple, with a background of the vast ocean. The water displays varying shades of blue-green, and the waves constantly lap against the rocks on the shore, stirring up fine white splashes. In the distance, the horizon meets the pale blue sky, and in the sky, a white gull soars gracefully, its posture graceful. On the right side of the image, you can see a breakwater made of dark gray volcanic rock. The rock surface is rough and full of holes, giving it a hard texture. Next to it is a section of metal railing, slightly rusted and grayish-white. The ground is fine gravel mixed with a few stones, with a brownish-yellow tone. The composition centers on the figure, shot in a medium shot, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the frame. The gaze is directed to the figure and the signboard behind it, extending to the distant sea-sky meet. Light and shadow come from the sides and rear, representing the soft glow of dusk or dawn. Sunlight slants over the figure, casting a golden halo along the edges of her silhouette. The shadows fall on the ground in front of her, appearing three-dimensional and realistic. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, warm, and healing, carrying the realism and vitality of everyday travel photos. The colors are mainly blue, white, and gray, complemented by yellow signboards as visual focal points, creating a striking contrast. The composition is rich in layers, from the sand, figures, and guardrails in the foreground, to the signboards and stone walls in the middle ground, and then to the ocean and sky in the distance, creating a strong sense of space and delicate attention to detail. The entire image presents a style that is both everyday and artistically beautiful, as if capturing travel moments casually with a regular camera or phone, yet the meticulous arrangement of composition, lighting, and atmosphere makes it especially captivating",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
