        {
          "id": "krea2-b1ae543a5793b0636fdcd553",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤室内神秘坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a simple white cylindrical table, her body slightly tilted to the camera, presenting a dynamic and flowing aura. She wears a gray sports tank top and shorts, showing a healthy and powerful figure. On her feet are white sneakers and knee-high socks, with black brand logos and patterns on the socks. The overall look is full of sporty fashion. Her posture is relaxed and confident, one hand resting gently on her knee, the other naturally hanging down, her expression calm and slightly mysterious, with a background of pure light gray walls. The wall texture is delicate with a slight graininess. Light enters diagonally from the left, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on the wall. The figure's body and legs cast clear shadows, enhancing the spatial sense of depth. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure occupying the main position, the head slightly tilted, forming beautiful lines. At the same time, the extension of the legs and the details of the shoes attract the viewer downward. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and bright, with sunlight streaming through windows or openings, creating a natural contrast of light and dark. It highlights the contours and muscle lines of the figures, with the overall color scheme mainly gray and white, accented with a touch of black and white, creating a simple, modern, and artistic visual effect. The visuals have a strong studio style while maintaining a sense of everyday warmth, as if shot with a professional camera in a quiet indoor setting. The background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject, with moderate color saturation, rich details, and clear layering, presenting an aesthetic style that blends fashion and everyday life. It feels like a model is conducting a relaxed and professional shoot in a studio, with delicate image texture and exquisite lighting and shadow treatment, giving a sense of authenticity and meticulously designed",
