        {
          "id": "krea2-be3d61cc785fe79f68b89874",
          "alias": "单女白旗袍竹林坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright on a wooden bench by the lake, dressed in an off-white modified qipao. The skirt features elegant blue-gray bamboo leaves and purple floral patterns as its base. The collar and cuffs are adorned with delicate gray-white frog buttons and lace trim, layered with a semi-transparent white lace shawl. The fabric is light and flowing, gently rising in the breeze, showcasing an elegant blend of classical and modern style. Her makeup is fresh and natural, looking directly at the camera. She exuded a gentle and serene expression, gently holding an unfolded Chinese folding fan with both hands. The fan surface was supported by brown bamboo ribs, edged with dark green fabric. The fan surface was painted with a simple ink bamboo branch pattern. The handle was slender and smooth, with a warm texture. She sat on a wooden bench, her body slightly tilted, posture dignified and relaxed. In the background was a wide, tranquil lake that shimmered in the sunlight. In the distance, rolling green mountains covered with dense green trees were distinctly layered. At the foot of the mountain, several small boats could be faintly seen floating on the water. The sky appears in a pale blue tone, with thin clouds and bright and soft lighting, creating a fresh and natural overall atmosphere. On the right side of the foreground, there is a dense cluster of green shrubs with clear leaves, some branches extending into the frame, creating a natural framing effect. The composition uses a centered composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The background is blurred to highlight the main subject, with shallow depth of field, making the outline clear and the background a hazy beauty. Light and shadow come slightly from the front slightly above, representing natural daylight. The light is uniform and soft, with no obvious shadows, creating a warm atmosphere, tranquil and poetic atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, gray-blue, emerald green, and light purple, harmoniously unified and rich in Eastern aesthetics. It resembles a classical beauty stepping out of a freehand landscape painting. The texture is delicate and authentic, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the intimacy and artistic atmosphere of daily life, presenting a visual style that combines beauty with everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
