        {
          "id": "krea2-c972cc540b2dc155f1f46526",
          "alias": "单女白外套户外俏皮持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sat on the green tennis court, wearing a loose white sun-protective jacket over a light gray camisole over it. She wore light blue ripped jeans, the cuffs rolled up to reveal her slender ankles. On her feet were brightly colored sneakers, with white, mint green, and pink patchwork uppers. The laces were loosely tied, giving off a casual and casual look. She held a pink badminton racket in both hands, with the mesh lines clearly visible. Her expression is slightly lazy and playful, her posture relaxed and natural, as if she has just finished a relaxing badminton event. The background is a standard tennis court setting, with a black badminton net stretching across the back of the frame, mesh holes arranged in a regular pattern, and behind the net is a pink baffle with slight wear marks along the edges. The ground is a uniform green plastic surface with a slight reflective surface, presenting a soft texture. The overall composition centers on the figure, using a medium perspective. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with the body slightly tilted, creating a dynamic balance. The foreground shows the lower body and racket, the middle ground shows the person's entire body and part of the court, and the background features a net and a barrier, with clear layers. Extending to the entire scene, the light and shadow come from the right, soft and even, like afternoon sunlight filtering through clouds, without strong shadows, creating a warm and fresh atmosphere. The overall color palette is fresh and bright, mainly green, white, and pink, accented with denim blue and colorful details of sneakers. The image is full of youthful energy and the atmosphere of everyday life. It feels like shooting outdoors with a regular digital camera, with a slight film texture and natural noise. The lens focal length is moderate, depth of field is well controlled, the background slightly blurred, and the subject is emphasized. Overall, it presents a realistic, natural, and lifelike imaging style, as if recording an ordinary yet beautiful afternoon",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
