        {
          "id": "krea2-62b09bf01f65eece8fd37db4",
          "alias": "单女山野俏皮跳跃",
          "prompt": "She wears professional bungee jumping safety gear, with black straps and colorful ropes clearly visible in the sunlight. Her body slightly turns sideways, her expression slightly playful and confident. Her makeup is delicate and natural, and her posture is elegant and relaxed, as if she is enjoying the thrill and freedom brought by extreme sports. The foreground figure occupies the main left side of the frame, with a close-up composition, and the middle ground showing a deep canyon landscape. The layered rocky cliffs display a pattern of interwoven brown and gray tones. The rock structure is clearly visible, showing traces of geological age. The distant mountain outlines gradually blur, forming a natural transition of depth of field. The background is a vast, boundless emerald-green lake, crystal clear and reflecting the deep blue sky and silhouettes of the mountains. The lake surface is as calm as a mirror, reflecting soft light. Above, the cloudless blue sky is highly saturated, presenting a strong visual impact. The overall composition uses the contrast between the figures and the natural landscape to create an artistic conception of harmonious coexistence between people and nature, forming a smooth visual flow. The lighting effect comes from the intense daylight at noon, with sunlight shining down from the upper right, while the deep shadow contrast in the canyon's shadows enhances the three-dimensionality and spatial layering of the image. The entire scene is filled with adventurous spirit and youthful vitality, with an atmosphere that is both tense and joyful, combining the thrill of extreme challenges with the tranquil beauty of nature's magnificent scenery. The color palette is mainly cool tones. Blue and green echo each other, creating a fresh and cool visual sensation that makes the subject stand out more. The image presents an aesthetic style where reality and idealism blend together, resembling a real moment taken with a regular phone, but after artistic processing, it becomes more cinematic and impactful",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
