        {
          "id": "krea2-b380738cc25e8f63ca39399f",
          "alias": "单女灰风衣街道忧伤注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose light gray long trench coat layered over a white crew-neck T-shirt and black trousers, lightly carrying a beige leather shoulder bag in her right hand. Her posture is natural and relaxed, with a slightly contemplative and serene expression. The overall temperament is gentle and storytelling. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, occupying the main visual center, with a slightly turned body to create a dynamic sense of balance. In the foreground is a white platform pillar adorned with red and white warning stripes and the Japanese word \"Emergency Stop Button\" (Emergency stop button) signboard, with a yellow emergency button installed nearby. These details enhance the realism and everyday atmosphere of the scene. The middle ground features the female subject and her surroundings, including the tracks behind her, the distant blurred platform structure, and some industrial-style metal frames. The background is further blurred, showing the distant tracks extending into the distance, with faint outlines of trains or buildings visible. The sky appears in a bright gray-white tone, with light streaming from above and sides, creating a soft backlighting effect. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the platform ceiling, casting mottled shadows on the ground and figures, creating a warm and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The composition uses the classic rule of third: the figures are placed on the left one-third, guiding the viewer's gaze toward the unknown space on the right side of the image, creating strong visual guidance. The overall color palette of the painting mainly features warm and cool contrasts, with light gray, white, and black as the main tones, accented by yellow bags and red warning stripes to enhance visual layering. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, forming a distinct contour light. At the same time, the shadows transition naturally, showing a soft scattered light texture. The entire scene looks like everyday street photos taken with a regular digital camera or phone, with slight graininess and realistic exposure, without excessive post-processing, preserving the original texture and sense of life. The lens is similar to a standard zoom lens, with a slightly top-down perspective capturing the subject's entire body and surroundings. The aspect ratio is close to 16:9, suitable for mobile devices. The overall atmosphere is quiet, peaceful, and slightly lonely. It seems to capture an ordinary yet poetic moment, like a quiet moment in a movie, evoking those overlooked subtle emotions and everyday moments of urban life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
