        {
          "id": "krea2-9e50a28053ac7a969fc2e491",
          "alias": "单女橙衬衫城市媚态跪注视",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on a bed covered with white sheets, her body slightly leaning forward. Her left hand gently strokes the cuff of her right arm, her posture elegant yet slightly provocative. She wears a semi-transparent orange-red silk shirt with clearly visible collar and chest buttons. The fabric gleams with a delicate luster under soft light. The hem of the shirt is tucked into a high-waisted black short skirt, which hugs the body and outlines a slender curve. The skirt has slits on the sides to reveal the leg line, paired with black over-the-knee stockings. The stockings have a subtle reflective texture, with cutouts at the knees. The ankles are slender, and one foot gently lifts for a dynamic beauty. She wears a simple silver bracelet on her wrist, adding a touch of delicate detail. The background is the indoor environment, and behind her is a wooden headboard in light wood color. Above the headboard is a blurred city skyline, with distant building silhouettes faintly visible. The overall space is bright and transparent, with light softly streaming in from the left side of the frame, creating a natural transition of light and shadow and a warm and intimate atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The body is in an oblique posture, guiding the gaze from the head to the legs, creating a smooth visual flow. The foreground features the bed and the lower body of the person, the middle ground is the torso and upper body, and the background is layered by the bedside and city view. The colors are mainly orange-red, black, and white, creating a strong contrast yet harmonious unity. The overall style combines fashion and artistic flair, resembling a carefully arranged commercial portrait or private photography. Filled with the charm and independent temperament of modern urban women, the visuals are delicate and detailed, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retain the warmth of everyday life, with cinematic light and shadow storytelling and emotional tension",
