          "id": "krea2-a88b35b092cfad9cbb95c6de",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫神秘倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "In her right hand, she holds a vintage-style magnifying glass. The frame is rose gold, the handle is dark brown wood, with clear and visible grain. The lens is transparent with smooth edges, creating a unique visual effect. The lens reflects faint light spots. She is wearing a white shirt with a neat neckline and smooth shoulder lines Underneath, black clothing is faintly visible. The overall look is simple yet elegant. The background is dark gray, with a blurred finish and subtle light and shadow layers. Some abstract white patterns or text outlines can be faintly seen, creating a mysterious and artistic atmosphere. The composition uses a center-focused style, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, head slightly tilted. The gaze passes through the magnifying glass toward the lens, creating strong visual guidance. The light mainly comes from the front right, creating natural highlights and reflections on the magnifying glass's lens. The shadows transition naturally and with rich layers. The overall tone leans toward coolness, mainly gray, white, and black, accented with rose gold and wood tones. The color combinations are harmonious, blending modernity with vintage vibes. The details are rich, and the metallic texture of the magnifying glass and the texture of the wooden handle are all clearly visible, presenting a high-end photographic feel. It feels like a portrait shot with a professional camera, possessing strong artistic expression and storytelling, while still maintaining the warmth of everyday life, as if on a quiet afternoon. She held a magnifying glass, intently observing something, her expression serious and adorable. The entire scene was filled with a sense of exploration and discovery, with interplay of light and shadow, creating a tranquil and dynamic atmosphere that made people want to explore further",
