          "id": "krea2-1fc8331588875ea483ada9c1",
          "alias": "单女泳装海滩坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the beach, radiating a healthy glow from sunlight, slightly tilting her head to gaze at the camera, exuding a sense of tranquility and confidence. She wears a uniquely designed swimsuit in army green or olive green, with black mesh patchwork on the shoulder straps and chest area, forming an elegant cross structure that highlights the beauty of her body lines while maintaining a moderate subtlety. The swimsuit is tailored to fit her figure, outlining graceful curves. She sits cross-legged on the sand, knees slightly bent, and hands naturally folded over her thighs. Her fingers are long and slender, her nails neatly trimmed, showing a natural pale pink. Her posture is relaxed and dignified, as if enjoying a peaceful moment by the sea. In the foreground is a fine golden sandy beach, with clear grains visible, with slight undulation and footprint marks on the surface. The sandy area near the figure appears bright under the light, while in the distance it gradually transitions into soft shadows. The middle ground stretches into the distance, with a flat and open sandy surface and several shallow puddles reflecting the faint light of the sky. The background is dense green vegetation, with tall and upright trees. The lush branches and leaves form a natural barrier. In the distance, the sky is gray-blue, with thin clouds casting a faint white hue. The overall composition uses a centered composition, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame, creating a visual focal point. The camera angle is slightly overhead to enhance the sense of spatial depth. Light and shadow come from the upper right, with soft and even sunlight, without strong contrast of light and shadow, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The shadowed areas transition delicately, highlighting the texture of the skin. The overall color palette mainly consists of warm yellow, brown-green, and blue-gray, with harmonious and unified colors. Carrying the fresh atmosphere of a summer seaside, the images have the realism of everyday amateur equipment, rich in details and clear layers, presenting a natural, authentic, and lifelike artistic style. It feels like a private portrait capturing beautiful moments, conveying a sense of tranquility, freedom, and youth",
