        {
          "id": "krea2-f859a8d113f2c3825e70ab96",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫窗边忧伤倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways against an old wooden window frame, her head slightly lowered, her expression calm and slightly contemplative. She wears a loose white cotton blouse, her sleeves slightly rolled up, arms naturally bent, elbows gently resting on the windowsill, fingers lightly touching near her temples, her posture lazy and relaxed, as if immersed in some distant memory or thought. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, visually guided by the frame of a dark wooden window frame. The window lines draw the viewer's gaze toward the figure, with rough dark wooden window frames and windowsills in the foreground The edges of the window frames show obvious wear marks and mottled lacquer, presenting a texture weathered by time. The windowsill surface is rough, with weathered textures and fine scratches. Some areas still bear traces of old paint peeling, forming a strong contrast with the background. In the middle is a woman's silhouette, her silhouette outlined by soft light, creating subtle layers of light and shadow. The wrinkles on the white blouse are clearly visible, the fabric texture subtly undulates under the light, and the background is a blurred outdoor scene. The grayish-white walls and distant outlines of buildings are faintly visible, creating a blurred overall effect that creates a sense of spatial depth. The sky appears in a pale blue tone, mixed with some clouds, suggesting that this is early morning or evening. Light slanting in from the right creates a soft backlight effect, creating a hazy halo. At the same time, faint reflections and a slight mist are cast on the window glass, enhancing the atmosphere. The entire scene uses shallow depth of field photography, with background and foreground gradually blurring. While highlighting the main subject, it retains environmental information. The composition employs classic framing styles, using window frames as natural frames to guide the viewer's attention to the figures. The overall color tone of the painting is characterized by warm and cool contrasts, with the dark brown wooden structure in the foreground contrasting with the cool gray tones of the background. The white clothing on the figures becomes the visual focal point, bringing bright visual highlights. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is tranquil and warm, combining the cool texture of daylight with a private, comfortable emotional warmth, as if time itself has frozen in this moment. The entire image presents a poetic moment from everyday life, like an old film camera captured by chance in the afternoon. It has slight graininess and color shift, with a focal length close to 50mm, simulating the texture of medium format film photography. The exposure is slightly underexposed, enhancing dark details and making the overall image feel more realistic and nostalgic. There are no unnecessary decorations, only the most essential elements retained, emphasizing the integration of the character's emotional expression with the ambient atmosphere, conveying a sense of quietness and introspection. A slightly melancholic yet hopeful aesthetic conception",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
