        {
          "id": "krea2-d92f6b8a5b9eaa2b59d25a10",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of dense green leafy shrubs, wearing a light pink Lolita-style dress made of soft cotton fabric with delicate lace trim. Ruffles are designed at the shoulders and neckline, and a matching bow is tied at the chest. The skirt is layered, with delicate lace and pleats along the hem, presenting an overall sweet and elegant temperament. She stands slightly to the side, gently raising her left hand Fingers lightly touch the leaves above the head, right hand naturally hangs down, palm slightly open, posture gentle and serene. Looking directly into the camera, it reveals innocence and tranquility. The background is a dense green plant with leaves of varying sizes and shapes, layered and layered, creating rich textures and layers. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating mottled light and shadow effects on and around the figures. The light is soft and warm, presenting a golden tone reminiscent of morning or evening. The overall color palette is mainly soft pinkish-white and emerald green. It creates a fresh, dreamy, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, body slightly tilted, forming a natural visual guiding line. The foreground is a clear subject, the middle ground is the transitional area between the character and the background, and the background is a blurred green plant, enhancing the depth and spatial sense of the image. Light shines down from the upper left, creating a contrast between light and dark, while the shadows add a sense of three-dimensionality, resulting in an even distribution of light and shadow. There are no overexposed or overly dark areas, and the color saturation is moderate, preserving natural texture and detail. The overall image presents a realistic feeling of everyday photography with a portable camera or phone, as if capturing a beautiful moment unexpectedly, full of life and youthful vitality, while still maintaining artistic beauty, evoking a sense of tranquility, gentleness, and hope",
