        {
          "id": "krea2-fd02b6d8a4e2572ad9fff723",
          "alias": "单女街道忧伤站立出神",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways on a city street at dusk or night, looking natural and casual. She wears a simple black short-sleeved top, with a black leather belt tied around her waist. The belt is adorned with a delicate bow, adding a touch of playfulness and personality. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her right hand naturally extending forward, holding a burning firework stick. The sticker emits bright white sparks that shoot outward, forming a dazzling small glowing sphere accompanied by curling white smoke. The smoke gently drifts upward to the right, tracing a flowing trajectory in the cool-toned night sky. The overall composition presents a tranquil yet slightly mysterious atmosphere. The main figure is positioned about one-third on the left side of the frame, slightly tilted, gazing into the distance, with a focused and calm expression, as if gazing at some distant dream or memory. In the foreground, clear outlines of figures and burning fireworks sticks are richly detailed. The middle ground is a blurry street environment, with faint roadside railings, streetlights, and distant building silhouettes. The background is completely blurred, presenting soft blue patches formed by city lights, varying in size and distributed in a well-arranged manner, creating a dreamlike bokeh effect. The composition uses the classic three-part layout, with the main subject on the left and a large space on the right side reserved to express the extended trajectory of fireworks and the flow of smoke. At the same time, the viewer's gaze extends from the figures to the fireworks, forming a natural visual path. The overall tone of the painting is mainly cool blue, with a slight byanish-gray tone, creating a cool nighttime feeling. However, the warm yellow glow of the fireworks becomes the only bright color, creating a strong contrast with the cool background and enhancing visual impact. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, with the main light source coming from the fireworks themselves, creating local highlights. Against the dark background, a strong contrast of light and shadow is created to highlight the subject. The light is soft and layered, without harsh shadows, making the scene feel more realistic and immersive. The overall atmosphere blends the casual feel of daily life with the ritual of festivals, combining the fleeting brilliance of fireworks with the loneliness and tranquility of urban nights. It seems to capture an ordinary yet poetic moment, like shooting at dusk with a standard consumer-grade camera, with the lens focused on people and fireworks, the background automatically blurred, preserving authentic graininess and slight noise, enhancing the photo's realism and sense of life. The image conveys a gentle, introspective, and slightly melancholic mood, evoking youth, dreams, farewells, or hopes, with strong artistic appeal and emotional resonance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
