          "id": "krea2-c71ba156fa24462f297315a1",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙公园困倦持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a light beige spaghetti strap dress with natural pleats and textures, appearing light and graceful. Her right hand gently supports a pink cherry blossom, as if inhaling its fragrance, adding a touch of playfulness and romance. In the foreground is lush cherry blossom branches, tender pink flowers blooming densely, dotted with green leaves forming a natural arched frame that encircles the figure. The middle ground is a bust of a woman, her body slightly turned to the side, her posture elegant and natural. The background is a deep blue night sky, presenting the unique tranquility and mystery of night. There are no clouds in the sky, pure and profound. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame. Cherry blossom branches extend from above and sides, forming a perfect circular frame that flows toward the flower in hand. The light and shadow atmosphere is soft and dreamy, with the main light source coming from the left front, warm and soft, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. Under the light, cherry blossom petals appear semi-transparent, revealing a faint pink hue. The deep blue night sky in the background contrasts sharply with the pink cherry blossoms in the foreground, creating a strong visual impact. The overall color palette is mainly pink, white, and blue, harmoniously unified and giving a sense of tranquility, romance, and beauty. It feels as if you are in a fairy-tale world on a spring night. The image carries a strong artistic and poetic atmosphere, while retaining the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. It was as if a regular camera had captured moments in a park at night, full of the breath of life and emotional warmth",
