          "id": "krea2-f107100833f40523e6e01f2d",
          "alias": "单女透视黑连衣裙户外愤怒坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a blue-and-white checkered picnic mat on an outdoor lawn. She wears a black velvet-textured long-sleeve dress with a black bow embellished at the collar. The hem of the skirt flares slightly, showcasing elegant tailoring lines and revealing a calm and thoughtful expression. Her hands gently rest on either side of the picnic mat, her posture relaxed and composed, legs long and straight, wearing black sheer stockings and black pointed high heels. The edges of the stockings at the ankles are clearly visible, and the picnic mat spreads out on the lush green lawn The blue and white plaid pattern is orderly and classic. In the upper left corner sits a pair of black sunglasses, reflecting faint light. The background is a vast, boundless green grass with dense and neat leaves, creating rich layers under the sunlight. The distant grass gradually blurs, creating a natural depth of field. The overall composition uses medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, slightly tilted, creating a dynamic sense of balance. The light and shadow extend from her line of sight into the distance, with light and shadow coming from above. The sunlight is bright but not glaring, casting soft shadows. There are subtle shadow transitions on the left side of the figure and beneath the picnic mat, enhancing the sense of depth. Light creates delicate reflections on the velvet fabric, highlighting the material's premium feel and creating a warm and fresh atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly black, blue, and white, with harmonious and layered color combinations. The image presents an elegant moment of casual everyday life, as if on a clear afternoon, she enjoys a moment of solitude, with the lens simulating real camera footage. It features a slight film graininess and natural depth blur, smooth light transitions, rich details, and a realistic texture similar to amateur photography equipment. It emphasizes a lifestyle atmosphere without excessive beautification, retaining natural imperfections and realism, and creating an artistic atmosphere that is both fashionable and close to life",
