        {
          "id": "krea2-90eb97ccbb99672e3f19fd1b",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙水边困倦持镜",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a delicate Lolita-style dress, with a fluffy skirt woven from light blue and white spreading across the floor. Layers of lace, ruffles, and bow decorations created a dreamy aristocratic aura. She sat slightly to her side, her right hand gently raised, fingers elegantly extended, as if inviting the audience into her fairy tale world. Her smile was bright and sincere, revealing her white, neat teeth. The overall posture is both dignified and lively. The foreground is the main figure, occupying the left central position of the composition. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds, with the figure positioned near the golden ratio point. The buildings feature pointed towers and classical arched windows, with simple and solemn lines. The clear and calm lake water reflects the pale blue sky and the building's outline, creating a symmetrical mirror effect. The middle ground features blurred green vegetation and several blooming white flowering trees, possibly cherry or pear blossoms Petals drift in the wind, adding a touch of romantic poetry to the scene. The background extends to distant mountains and sky, which display a soft gray-blue hue. The clouds are thin, and the light is evenly and gentle. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere resembles the faint glow of morning or evening, with sunlight shining from the side and creating natural shadow transitions on the body's side, enhancing the sense of depth. The lens uses a large aperture blur to highlight the subject, while the background presents a beautiful bokeh effect, giving the composition a rich sense of depth. The visual guide line is guided by the characters' gestures toward the viewer, ultimately converging on the buildings and lake in the background, forming a complete visual loop. The overall color palette is mainly cool tones, with blue and white alternating to create a fresh, pure, and dreamlike atmosphere. It carries a slight film texture and vintage filter effects, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a prime lens. It delivers cinematic image quality and delicate detail, presenting a balance between artistic photography and everyday documentation, featuring carefully designed sets and costumes, while preserving natural and authentic light and shadow and emotions, giving a dreamlike yet accessible aesthetic experience",
