        {
          "id": "krea2-ced6d5690e06404d2857f062",
          "alias": "单女兔女郎白连衣裙摄影棚困倦跪注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a white bunny girl outfit looks directly at the camera, as if silently communicating with the viewer. She wears a uniquely designed white sleeveless dress with a wide white shirt collar and a small bow. The cuffs are white long-sleeved faux sleeves adorned with gold buttons, adding a touch of retro and formal feel. She kneels on a soft white plush carpet, legs together, knees slightly bent, body slightly leaning forward, Her hands naturally rest on the armrest of the transparent acrylic chair, while her left hand gently rests on her right wrist. Her fingers are long, her nails painted light pink, her posture relaxed and expressive. On her right leg, she wears pink fishnet stockings, with a faint thin cord at her ankle. The overall look is sweet yet tinged with a hint of sexiness. The foreground centers on the figure, with the outline of the transparent acrylic chair and parts of her body in the center, and the background is an interior space full of futuristic and dreamy colors. Inside the glass display case are various blurred colorful items, including a white case device resembling an old game console or electronic device. Next to it is a pot of green plants placed in a black flowerpot, with soft rainbow-colored halos scattering in the distance, creating a neon-like visual effect. The entire scene is bathed in cool blue-and-white light, mixed with pink-purple light and shadow transitions, creating a strong contrast and harmonious color blend. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, making the figures appear taller and more imposing. At the same time, through shallow depth of field, the focus is focused on the figure, with the background gradually blurring to enhance spatial layering. The visual guide shifts the character's gaze directly toward the audience, combined with her slightly forward-leaning posture and hand position, forming a dynamic line extending from the lower left to the upper right. The lighting atmosphere presents a clean, bright, yet slightly mysterious sci-fi feel. The light mainly comes from the front and above, emphasizing three-dimensionality. The neon lights in the background add flowing colors to the environment. Reflected on transparent materials and smooth surfaces, it produces rich gloss and refraction effects. The overall image combines the refinement of Japanese photo style with the technological feel of cyberpunk elements. It feels like shooting in a carefully arranged studio with professional photography equipment, yet retaining the authentic texture and spontaneity captured by everyday amateur cameras. It is full of realism, rich in detail, rich in atmosphere, full of artistic tension and storytelling",
