        {
          "id": "krea2-236ae92e5a4f6b66a4501764",
          "alias": "单女毛衣楼梯愤怒坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the outdoor metal staircase, leaning slightly forward, her head naturally resting on her arm, presenting a lazy and relaxed posture that adds a touch of sweetness. She wears a colorful plaid sweater woven from deep red, dark green, royal blue, and beige, with clearly visible patterns. The sweater sleeves are slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists, paired with a deep burgundy pleated skirt with distinct pleated layers, soft and textured, and a pair of thick-soled sneakers on her feet The upper is a patchwork of off-white and light gray, with laces loosely and naturally. The sole is thick yet light. She slung a white canvas bag across her shoulder, printed with black English lettering in a simple and modern style. The overall look is both casual and fashionable. In the foreground, several autumn leaves are scattered on the ground, with rich colors including gold, orange-red, deep red, and tender green, each in different shapes and slightly curled edges, as if just falling from a tree. The floor is a metal step with anti-slip stripes, and the surface looks slightly rough. Reflecting faint light, the middle scene shows a female subject, leaning against a white metal railing composed of vertical white pillars and a horizontal silver handrail. The structure is simple, with some rust and wear marks on some surfaces, showing the marks of time. The background is a blurry city street, with faint outlines of buildings and parked vehicles in the distance. The sky is bright but without obvious clouds, with ample light but not glaring. The overall atmosphere is warm and peaceful. The composition is shot at a low angle, with the camera slightly tilted. The figure occupies the left central position of the composition, forming a visual focal point. Light and shadow come from the upper right, sunlight filters through the railing gap onto the figure, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The shadowed areas are delicate and natural, with the overall tone mainly warm yellow, accented by autumn leaves in red, yellow, orange, and other hues, creating a warm, nostalgic, and lively atmosphere. The image texture is authentic, as if shot with a professional camera on a clear afternoon, rich in detail and distinct layers, evoking the intimacy of daily life and artistic aesthetic expression",
