        {
          "id": "krea2-fd27372aa2c59d4e860cbd28",
          "alias": "单女女仆蓝女仆装街道害羞蹲",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in an exquisite blue-and-white maid outfit, a dark blue short skirt paired with a white ruffled apron and lace cuffs, wearing a deep blue headband with white lace trim and a bow tied in a bow. She squats in front of the neatly arranged capsule toy machine, her right hand gently touching the rotating handle, her left hand elegantly resting on her chest. Her overall posture appears playful yet slightly shy. The background is an indoor scene full of Japanese street scenes, with rows of white capsule toy machines neatly arranged, each decorated with promotional posters featuring various anime characters, all in bright colors. The content is rich, with more capsule toy toys displayed in the transparent display cabinet above. The composition combines close-ups and medium shots, with the characters positioned on the right side of the frame, occupying the visual center. The capsule toy machine extends from the lower left corner to the upper right corner, forming a diagonal guide line that enhances the sense of spatial depth. Light comes from the warm tone on the left front, creating natural shadow transitions on the floor and machine surface, creating a warm yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The background is slightly blurred to highlight the main figure, with the overall color scheme mainly blue, white, and beige. Colorful patterns dotted on the capsule toy machine create clear visual layers and delicate light and shadow contrasts, presenting a realistic moment captured in daily life. It feels like a youthful memory accidentally captured on a busy commercial street or arcade. The image texture is close to professional camera shooting, with clear details, moderate color saturation, slight film graininess, and natural motion blur, simulating the imaging effect of real photography equipment in low-light environments. The edges of the frame are slightly darkened to enhance visual focus. The overall atmosphere is warm and story-rich, evoking the era's yearning and pursuit of beautiful things",
          "description": "",
