        {
          "id": "krea2-481d50f7a7a26b52128c4d81",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙街道微笑站立持伞",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a sunny outdoor street, wearing a cream-colored Lolita-style dress with a high-waisted design and an asymmetrical high slit hem. The front is short and the back long, with layers of sheer fabric gently fluttering in the breeze. The dress is adorned with delicate lace lace and bow decorations, with delicate straps and ruffled necklines, presenting an overall sweet and elegant temperament. She wears an off-white woven straw hat with a wide brim and natural texture, and she wears a gentle smile. Revealing her white teeth, she appears friendly and charming. Her right hand gently rests on the brim of her hat, while her left hand holds a white lace umbrella. The umbrella surface is made of transparent lace with layers of pleats, the ribs are slender, and the handle is made of silver metal. She wears a pair of white Mary Jane shoes with bow decorations on the upper, a low-heeled design, paired with white over-the-knee socks. The upper part of the socks has a lace detail, and the leg lines are long and well-proportioned. Her posture is natural and relaxed, with her body slightly turned to the camera, left leg in front and right leg behind, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The background is a dense shrub covered with dense yellow flowers, clustered in clusters. The petals are delicate and delicate, with bright and bright colors, interwoven with the red maple leaves, creating a strong visual contrast. The maple leaves are palmate-shaped, deep red, with some leaf edges yellowing, adding a warm autumn atmosphere. The shrubs grow along the roadside, with a gray asphalt pavement that is smooth and has cement curbstones along the edges. Sunlight streams down from the upper left of the painting, creating a soft and bright light effect that naturally creates a light and shadow effect. The figures have clear shadows, the ground reflects mottled tree shadows and flower shadows, and the overall composition uses a centered composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the image, with the floral wall extending from the upper left corner to the lower right, forming a diagonal visual guideline. The foreground is a clean asphalt pavement, the middle is the main figure and part of the floral wall, and the background is a complete floral wall and distant blurred greenery. The composition is layered and mainly warm tones, with yellow, red, white, and green complementing each other, creating a warm and romantic atmosphere. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, with bright highlights and soft shadows. The overall image has a strong Japanese photography style, with delicate detail processing and authentic texture, as if taken with a professional camera. At the same time, it preserves the authenticity of everyday snapshots. The image is full of youthful energy and a dreamy atmosphere, evoking the beauty of spring or early summer. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and beautiful, like a carefully painted oil painting or a gentle poem.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
