        {
          "id": "krea2-465d8eb3b67f09975be02ef6",
          "alias": "单女庭院害羞站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a simple white modified Hanfu sat upright atop a rustic Taihu stone. Her overall look was gentle and elegant, full of classical charm. Her hands gently held a round white fan, its surface gently glowing with a soft glow. Her fingers were long and fair, her nails painted a pale pink, and her wrists wore a simple silver bracelet. The sleeves were wide and flowing, gently swaying in the wind. Showcasing the unique softness and subtlety of Eastern women, she gazes at the camera, slightly shy and calm, as if telling an ancient story. In the foreground is a gray Taihu stone with a rough texture, its surface uneven and covered with the marks of time, edges sharply defined, texture hard yet realistic. In the middle is a woman sitting upright, positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, her body slightly tilted, forming a natural visual guideline. Behind her is a dense green shrub with layers of leaves, presenting rich layers and vibrant greenery. The background is a typical Chinese garden building, with white walls and black tiles, and clearly visible wooden window lattice. A round moon door on the wall casts a hazy light and shadow. The building's lines are simple and smooth, carrying a traditional aesthetic charm. Above, willow branches hang diagonally from above the painting, with tender green leaves swaying in the breeze. Some leaves are illuminated by sunlight, presenting a transparent texture and creating a poetic atmosphere. The composition adopts the classic three-part layout. The figure, as the visual focal point, occupies the right third of the frame, while the left side leaves ample negative space to enhance the sense of breath and balance. At the same time, the stones in the foreground, the figures in the middle background, and the buildings and plants in the background create spatial depth that moves from near to far. Controlling the depth of field blurs the background, highlighting the main subjects. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with light coming from the upper left, simulating natural afternoon light. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves and falls on the woman, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. The folds of the clothing create subtle shadow changes. It enhances the sense of three-dimensionality, with the overall color scheme mainly white, paired with the cool tones of green plants and gray rocks, creating a fresh and elegant color contrast. The overall scene exudes a tranquil and lingering Eastern aesthetic atmosphere, like a freehand ink painting or a scene from a classical poem. It carries strong artistic appeal and cultural connotations, as if one can hear the breeze brushing willow leaves and feel the faint floral fragrance deep within the courtyard. The entire scene resembles a professionally arranged ancient-style photo shoot, It's also like natural moments casually captured with a casual casual camera—authentic and full of life, rich in detail, distinct layers, interwoven light and shadow, delicate emotions, immersing you and making you want to leave for a long time",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
