        {
          "id": "krea2-a4007c60d5d0e146e3142a16",
          "alias": "单女橙外套森林愤怒坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in an autumn maple forest, wearing a thick orange coat and a yellow turtleneck sweater. She leans slightly, creating mottled light and shadow. In the background, bright red maple leaves and dense branches encircle the canvas in a blurred way, forming a natural frame that draws the viewer's gaze toward the central figure. In the middle is a woman sitting upright, her body slightly leaning forward, legs bent, wearing dark jeans. The posture is relaxed and natural, with a blurred deep green forest in the background, faintly revealing the outlines of other trees and scattered leaves, creating a rich sense of spatial depth. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, surrounded by red leaves, creating a strong visual focal point. At the same time, the shallow depth of field effect highlights the subject, making both the background and foreground appear soft blurred, enhancing the sense of depth and creating a smooth visual path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with golden sunlight piercing through the canopy diagonally from above. It illuminates some leaves and the outlines of figures, creating contrasts of light and shadow, while the shadowed areas appear deep and soft. The overall color scheme is mainly warm tones, with red, orange, and yellow interwoven to create a sharp contrast with deep green and black, creating a rich autumn atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens, offering film-like graininess and color saturation, while also delivering the realism of everyday portable devices. The light is soft and not glaring, with rich details and clear layers. The entire image exudes an atmosphere of tranquility, poetry, and a touch of melancholy, like a carefully composed autumn portrait, capturing tender moments amid the changing seasons, allowing one to feel the serene beauty of time and the inner calm",
