        {
          "id": "krea2-58bd6dcccc65db6994de7ce2",
          "alias": "单女围巾自信站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways under the warm autumn sun, slightly lowering her head to gaze into the distance, exuding a serene and reserved aura. The shawl naturally drapes over her shoulders, with the tassel details clearly visible, adding a touch of laziness and warmth. Her posture is elegant and composed, her body slightly tilted, as if immersed in the golden light and shadow. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the middle shot, forming a visual focal point. In the foreground is a ginkgo branch slanting from the upper left corner into the painting. The branches are slender, with leaves a bright golden yellow shaped like a fan. Some leaves gently sway in the wind, with slightly curled edges. Sunlight filters through the leaves, creating mottled light and shadow, creating a transparent and dreamlike texture. The background is a blurred forest, presenting a richly layered golden hue. The shadows intertwine and the light and shadows are dappled, creating a unified and harmonious overall tone, full of autumn poetry and warmth. The composition uses the classic rule of third, with the main figure occupying the left third of the frame. Light comes from the upper right, representing the soft backlight of the golden hour. Sunlight filters through the leaves onto the figure, creating a bright outline light that outlines the figure's silhouette, creating a strong contrast with the background and enhancing three-dimensionality. The transition of light and shadow is natural, with rich layers of light and shadow, creating an overall atmosphere that is warm, tranquil, romantic, and poetic. It feels as if you've captured a moment forgotten by time. The image has a strong film texture, moderate color saturation, slight graininess and vintage tones, simulating professional photography effects. The background shows a distinct shallow depth blur, highlighting the subject. The composition is meticulous, and the visual direction is smooth. Overall, it presents a high-end, fashionable portrait style, full of storytelling like a movie image, combining the warmth of everyday life with artistic beauty. It's as if an old film camera casually captured these precious moments on an autumn afternoon; every ray of light and every leaf carries the warmth of the season and the accumulation of emotion",
