        {
          "id": "krea2-13ee35dcc387a314c51089ce",
          "alias": "单女白T恤商店沉思站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a convenience store freezer, turning sideways to the camera, her head slightly raised, her expression filled with anticipation and contemplation, appearing fresh and slightly lazy. She wears a loose white short-sleeved T-shirt with a faint green pattern on the chest, an off-white backpack slung over her shoulder, a simple white dial watch on her left wrist, and a chocolate crisp cone ice cream in her right hand. The ice cream is decorated with pink and white cream, topped with a small strawberry. Her fingers are long, Nails are neatly trimmed, as if about to taste that sweet flavor. The main subject is positioned in the center-right section, composed using a three-part method. The figure occupies about one-third of the right side, while the left side features shelves and products, creating visual balance. The foreground features clear ice cream and hand details, the middle is a bust of the person and part of the shelves, and the background is a blurred interior of a convenience store, including neatly arranged refrigerated cabinets, various packaged foods and drinks, as well as distant glass doors and light reflections. The overall background is blurred to highlight the main subject. Light comes from the indoor ceiling lamp and freezer illumination, softly and evenly illuminating the figure, creating a bright and warm atmosphere. Light and shadow shine from the upper left, and the cold glow from the freezer intertwines with warm lighting, creating subtle color contrasts that enhance the sense of layering in the image. The tones are mainly white, beige, and light yellow, accented with pink and red accents from ice cream, presenting a fresh, sweet, and slightly cozy feeling of everyday life. The image texture is similar to shooting with a Canon or Sony full-frame camera, focal length about 85mm, aperture f/ 2.8, ISO 100, shutter speed 1/125 second, slight film graininess and natural noise add realism, the background is slightly out of focus, creating a soft bokeh effect. The mood is natural, as if capturing an ordinary yet blissful moment. The whole scene feels like a page from a life diary—quiet yet moving",
