        {
          "id": "krea2-a430063413b8ec476e2988c1",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔霓虹夜景忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "As if gazing at some distant memory or unresolved thoughts, her expression reveals a quiet contemplation and a faint sadness, presenting an almost transparent texture. She wears a light-colored inner layer and a dark blue denim jacket, with a slightly open collar and clean, natural lines. The overall look exudes a youthful artistic vibe. The foreground features blurred light spots and bokeh effects, which are circular and oval, mainly in pink, purple, and blue-green, varying in size and scattered with blurred edges. Like dust particles or light particles floating in the air, they add a dreamlike sense of layering and visual interest to the scene. The middle shot is the main subject, positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame, with the head slightly tilted. The background is completely covered by abstract light and shadow, presenting flowing gradients of purple, pink, and blue. The colors blend and blend without clear objects or environments, creating an illusory atmosphere. The composition uses an asymmetrical golden ratio layout, with the figure occupying the right half and leaving a large negative space on the left. The handwritten Korean artistic font \"나에게 도 꼼이 있어\" (나에게도 꼼이 있어) and the film title \"decorative character이름은\" are displayed in an orange-yellow tone, with smooth, natural brushstrokes and a hand-drawn feel. They contrast sharply with the cool-toned background, naturally extending along the light and text to the upper left corner of the image, forming a circular visual path. The lighting atmosphere centers on warm and cool contrasts, with the main light source coming from the upper left of the image, simulating neon or stage lighting effects to create a strong dramatic light and shadow effect. Purple and blue form the main cool background, while pink and orange-yellow serve as warm accents, enhancing the image's warmth and emotional tension. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, dreamy, and poetic, with a strong cinematic feel and emotional appeal, as if capturing an inner moment spent alone late at night. The details are rich, while retaining slight graininess and film texture, making it look like a movie still shot with professional photography, perfectly combining realism and artistry. The overall color scheme is highly saturated but not exaggerated, with smooth color transitions, distinct light and shadow layers, and a stable yet unstiff composition. Full of narrative quality, it gives a sense of both everyday and surrealism, as if captured by chance with an amateur camera at a nightclub or on the street, yet it contains profound emotional expression. The whole scene exudes a gentle yet distant lonely beauty, inviting one to explore the story behind this woman",
          "description": "",
