        {
          "id": "krea2-ce623d7d44c92ec0e9336a46",
          "alias": "单女紫连衣裙忧伤站立持花",
          "prompt": "A woman stands before a pure pale blue sky, appearing light and full of life, adding a touch of playfulness and gentleness. She wears a light purple dress with pink and white floral patterns, with delicate lace trim decorations at the collar and cuffs. The overall look is fresh and sweet, full of feeling. She holds a bouquet of blooming pink roses in both hands. The flowers are full and round, with layers of petals that gradually shift from deep pink in the center to light pink at the edges. Green leaves dot the edges, and the branches curve naturally. Her right hand gently supports the bottom of the bouquet, while her left hand gently caresses one of the roses. Her fingers are slender and graceful, with an elegant posture carrying a hint of melancholy and gentleness. The slightly open part seems to whisper. The composition centers on the figure, using medium close-ups that occupy most of the space. The head is slightly tilted, the body slightly tilted, forming a natural S-shaped curve that creates a dynamic beauty. The background is a pure, cloudless blue sky, with tones deepening from top to bottom, presenting a soft gradient effect without unnecessary elements. It highlights the main figure and the bouquet. The light comes from the upper left of the frame, soft natural light. Sunlight filters through the clouds onto the figure, creating warm highlights, while on the other side subtle shadows are created to enhance the sense of three-dimensionality. The transition of light and shadow is natural, with rich details. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, romantic, and healing, carrying a youthful poetry and hazy beauty. The tones are mainly blue, pink, and white, with a harmonious contrast of warm and cool tones, making the visuals fresh and comfortable. The image texture is delicate, as if taken with professional photography equipment. Yet it retains the warmth and authenticity of everyday life, like a carefully composed artistic portrait or a casual photo taken under the afternoon sun, full of the breath of life and emotional warmth, presenting an overall dreamlike tranquil beauty that lets people feel the slow flow of time and inner peace",
