        {
          "id": "krea2-61d3b2679ede163432f47f11",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣庭院沉思坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench in a Japanese courtyard, wearing a red tweed cardigan with white ribbed knit cuffs and a collar. The cardigan features delicate silver buttons and a small metal brooch. She wears a black high-waisted pleated short skirt, shiny red Mary Jane high heels, and black vertical striped tights that outline her long legs. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, and a white quilted chain bag is slung over her shoulder, with a pearl string strap. The overall look is both vintage and elegant, full of festive spirit. Wearing a black headband, her makeup is exquisite His expression was slightly contemplative. The background was a traditional Japanese-style courtyard corner. The wall was light gray, with black calligraphy above inscribed with words such as \"Tea smoke, wutong moon, and the sound of reading.\" Red lanterns and paper pinwheels hung along the walls, decorated with colorful floral patterns. Next to them were green potted pine and cypress and a golden ingot ornament. There was also a doll dressed in Santa Claus costume leaning against a wooden table, which also held a kraft paper bag. The floor was covered with gray gravel and decorated with several irregular stone slabs. The bench was made of dark wood. The surface has clear wood grain, with woven straw mats laid in some areas. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the figure positioned near the center on the right side of the frame, sitting sideways. The left leg is straight and the right leg bent, forming a natural visual guiding line. The decorations in the background are arranged in an orderly manner on both sides, creating a rich sense of layering. Light and shadow come from naturally scattered light, softly and evenly scattered over the figures and scenes without obvious shadows, presenting a warm and tranquil winter afternoon atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly red, black, and white. Complemented by greenery and gold accents, the color contrasts are vivid yet harmonious. The image texture is delicate and rich, combining the realism of everyday street photography with the refinement of artistic photography. It seems to capture a quiet and beautiful moment. The lens uses an 85mm prime portrait lens with well-controlled depth of field, sharp and sharp foreground, and slightly blurred background, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental information. The lighting is soft and natural, colors are faithfully restored, and the image has a slight film grain texture, adding a nostalgic atmosphere. Overall, it presents an Eastern aesthetic that combines fashion sense with cultural charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
