        {
          "id": "krea2-c0dce84a08c0656f4a4a6abc",
          "alias": "单女蓝短裙城市自信坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by a pure white, modern-style bedside. She wears a white short-sleeved top with a deep blue collar and cuff trim, paired with a deep blue high-waisted skirt and black patent leather pointed high heels with striking red soles. The overall look presents a simple yet refined uniform feel. Her right hand rests on the white bedside table behind her, her body slightly leaning to the side, her posture elegant and composed. Her legs are crossed and stretched, right knee bent, and left leg straightened, showing off her long, well-proportioned leg lines. The foreground features pristine white sheets and the edge of the bed, soft and fluffy; the middle features the main figure and bedside furniture; the background features large white vertical blinds, where sunlight filters through the gaps to create soft strip-like shadows, illuminating the entire space. On the left edge, a faint green plant can be seen, adding a touch of vitality to the pure white environment. The composition uses a low-angle shot, with the figure occupying the center-left position. The diagonal lines guide the viewer from the foreground bed to the legs and the background blinds, providing clear and smooth visual guidance. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and transparent, with soft and even lighting. The shadows are richly layered, with white as the main color scheme, accented by deep blue and black, creating a clean, tranquil, and slightly intimate indoor atmosphere. The images are rich in detail and authentic in texture, as if shot with professional photography equipment. They exude a strong sense of artistic beauty and a sense of everyday life. The images are full of the fashionable charm of modern urban women while preserving the naturalness and authenticity of daily life",
