        {
          "id": "krea2-264ba795d5ee383fb43fbd5b",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣森林忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside the outdoor barbed wire fence, wearing a dark blue sweater with red embroidery on her shoulders. She leans slightly to the fence, her right hand gently touching the fence post, pinching a few orange-red autumn leaves between her fingers. The edges of the leaves are yellowed and the veins are clearly visible. The fence is made of green metal mesh, with grids interlaced in a diamond shape. Some grids are illuminated by sunlight, giving a semi-transparent texture. The fence posts are made of light green metal, with fine wear marks on the surface. A string of red-leaf vines is wrapped around them, with the leaf color gradienting from bright red to orange-yellow, with various forms, some curled, some extended, forming a strong contrast with the cool-toned fences. The foreground features clear barbed wire and vines, the middle ground features a female subject with thoughtful expressions, and the background is a blurred urban architectural cluster, mainly in white and gray tones, with faint window and roof structures. In the distance, railway tracks extend deep into the frame, and the ground is scattered with dead leaves and rubble. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame. The barbed wire runs diagonally from the upper left corner to the lower right, forming a strong visual guiding line. Using a shallow depth of field effect to blur the background and highlight the subject, the light comes from a high angle on the right, creating a soft backlight that outlines the figures. At the same time, fine shadows are cast on the fence, creating a sharp contrast of light and shadow that creates a warm yet slightly lonely atmosphere. The color palette is mainly cool blue and warm orange, dominated by cool tones and accented to enhance visual layering. The overall composition presents a tranquil, nostalgic, and story-rich everyday feel, as if capturing a moment of contemplation on an autumn afternoon. It features the grainy texture of film photography and a slightly overexposed retro filter effect. The lens simulates the Canon 5D Mark IV paired with a 24-70mm f/2.8 lens, a focal length of 50mm, an f/1.8 aperture, shutter speed of 1/125 sec, ISO 200, handheld shooting, and a slight shake that brings realism. The overall style is similar to Japanese documentary, emphasizing details of life and emotional expression. The visuals are filled with poetic loneliness, reminiscent of scenes from the movie \"Little Forest.\" Or like the gentle moments casually recorded on the streets and alleys, with moderate color saturation, preserving original light and shadow details, avoiding excessive embellishment, and presenting a natural and authentic visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
