        {
          "id": "krea2-648764e1c23e74d3a5417dbd",
          "alias": "单女毛衣霓虹夜景微笑站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor lawn, wearing a color-blocked knit top with a pink main body paired with an orange collar and cuffs. The sleeves are deep red, presenting a warm and lively color combination. The knit material is delicate and soft, with clear and visible textures. The neckline is designed in a lapel-style style with small button decorations, giving the overall look a fashionable and layered look. She wears a high-waisted blue denim mini skirt with an A-shaped hem, accented by metallic floral buttons at the waist. The dress is covered with natural denim pleats and slight wear marks. She showcased a vintage yet modern style, wearing a pair of white ankle boots with a clean and sharp shaft, a slightly pointed toe, and delicate pearl decorations on the sides, adding a touch of refinement. Her slightly wavy ends rested lightly over her shoulders, and she wore a pair of delicate tassel earrings made of transparent beads and metal chains. With each movement, she wore a gentle smile, looking straight at the camera, her posture elegant and natural, her body slightly turned to one side, her right hand gently clutching the hem of her clothes, and her left hand naturally hanging at her side. Her overall posture was relaxed and confident. In the background is a retro-style ice cream truck, with a silver-gray metallic body with subtle scratches and reflections. Above the car is a black sign with white and blue neon lights reading \"ICE Cream,\" and next to it is an orange ice cream pattern. The windows reflect a blurred image of the surrounding environment. The ground is a green lawn with dense and lush grass, partially covered by shadows, creating a contrast of light and dark. Light comes from a slanting top, softly casting on the figures. It creates a warm and comfortable atmosphere, with consistent shadow directions to enhance the sense of depth. The overall composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The background elements are rich but not cluttered, gradually extending into clothing details and the ice cream truck in the background, creating a smooth flow of sightlines. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, with pink, orange, blue, and white as the main tones, complemented by metallic gray and green. The overall composition is full of youthful energy and the warmth of daily life, as if capturing a leisurely and pleasant moment on a summer afternoon. It has strong artistic appeal and realism, like shooting with a professional camera in natural light. The image quality is delicate, details rich, and color fidelity is high, presenting a scene that is both beautiful and close to life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
