        {
          "id": "krea2-7b28ba55e1c385d0c394dade",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫庭院忧伤坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor wooden chair, wearing a white long-sleeve shirt and a dark blue suspender dress, paired with white stockings and brown Mary Jane shoes. In her left hand is a pen, facing a slightly worn metal table with an open notebook on it. She smiles at the camera, her posture relaxed and elegant, her body slightly turned to the left side of the frame, legs crossed, one foot lightly resting on the other, revealing an effortless youthful vibe. The background is a weathered wall with obvious peeling marks. The color layers of gray-white and blue-green are presented, with some miscellaneous items piled in the corners, including a broom, a tool with a red handle, and part of a bicycle. These elements suggest this is a typical courtyard or street corner full of vibrant life. The floor is concrete, casting clear shadows of tables, chairs, and figures. Sunlight pours in from the upper right of the frame, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The lighting is warm and soft, with the grainy texture and color shifts characteristic of film photography, and the overall tone leans toward a vintage warm tone. The saturation is moderate, the details rich, and the composition uses a medium field of view. The figure is positioned slightly on the left of the frame, leaving space on the right side to showcase the environment. The visual guide line is formed by the structure of tables and chairs and light and shadow lines, highlighting expressions and demeanor. The atmosphere of the image is tranquil and nostalgic, as if capturing an ordinary yet poetic moment. It has the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, simulating the imaging effect of a film camera, preserving slight noise and color transitions, enhancing realism and artistry, and creating a tranquil, A gentle yet slightly melancholic sense of youthful memories, with a moderate background blur that makes the subject stand out clearly while retaining environmental information. The overall composition is balanced and harmonious, full of storytelling, like an old photograph frozen by time, conveying the beauty and innocence found in simple life",
