        {
          "id": "krea2-f33878038c1950afe8e7c835",
          "alias": "单女白内衣椅上害羞坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden rattan chair, wearing white lingerie with fine polka dots, a light gray towel draped over her shoulder, exuding a lazy and slightly shy expression. Her body is slightly turned to the side, her back lines smooth, and the contours of her shoulders and arms clearly visible. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left of the middle frame, with the chair's round rattan backrest in the foreground, its hollowed-out design forming regular geometric patterns that contrast with the figure's body. In the background is a large window fitted with horizontal blinds. Sunlight filters through the blinds into the room, creating a pattern of light and shadow stripes. On the windowsill sits a beige woven flowerpot with a green plant planted inside, its branches and leaves hanging naturally, adding a touch of vitality. Next to it is a ceramic cup with a checkered pattern. The tabletop is made of light-colored wood, creating a warm and homely atmosphere. The composition uses a center-shifted third-division method, with the figure occupying the main position but leaving enough space to display background details. Visual guidance begins with the chair in the foreground. The windows and plants in the background create a natural flow of sight, with soft and directional lighting. Natural light from the left creates delicate highlights and shadows on the figures. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, creating a peaceful, comfortable, and intimate everyday feel. The image looks as if shot with a regular camera, with slight film graininess and realistic light and shadow transitions, without excessive retouching. It feels more like an accidental snapshot, capturing a real moment in the morning or a quiet afternoon. The entire scene is full of life, fresh yet exuding a subtle maturity, as if you can hear the breeze rustling through the leaves outside the window. This is a daily image that is both authentic and artistically beautiful",
