        {
          "id": "krea2-2adf1043c1ebbebcccbd19f7",
          "alias": "单女女仆女仆装酒吧神秘站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a delicate maid outfit stands in front of a vintage-style wooden bar counter, wearing round glasses. She wears a white ruffled maid hat and a black turtleneck uniform adorned with gold buttons and white ruffles, a white apron and long gloves, a gold cross necklace around her neck, and an elegant cup of red \"HOT CRUSH\" brand drink in her right hand, while her left hand gently raises in an invitation gesture. The background features a warm, dark wooden wine cabinet displaying various bottles and glassware. The soft lighting shines from the side, creating a natural transition of light and shadow on the figures, creating a cozy yet slightly mysterious atmosphere. The composition uses a medium close-up, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, slightly tilted toward the camera, and the gaze directly communicates with the viewer. The background is blurred to highlight the subject, with details of the drink cup and hand in the foreground clearly visible. The wine cabinet in the background is rich in layers but not overly crowded, with the light mainly coming from the warm yellow source on the right. Simulating indoor lighting effects, with soft shadows and a strong sense of depth. The overall color palette mainly consists of brown, black, and white. The image texture is close to professional studio shooting, featuring cinematic light and shadow control and color reproduction, while preserving the natural feel of everyday amateur equipment shooting. It feels like a moment captured in a real café or bar, full of life atmosphere and artistic expression. The composition is balanced and harmonious, visual guidance is clear, and the characters' postures are elegant and natural. The entire scene blends elements of fantasy and reality. It presents a unique aesthetic style, combining the charm of ACG culture with the warmth of the real world",
