        {
          "id": "krea2-186c915630cce75a99a43991",
          "alias": "单女白外套椅上忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor wooden bench, her expression calm yet tinged with contemplation, revealing a restrained melancholy and gentleness. She wears an off-white loose coat with a naturally open collar, layered with a white round-neck top. The coat's texture is soft and puffy, the sleeves hang wide, the hem gently fluttering in the wind, hands folded on the knees, fingers long, posture elegant and relaxed. Her body leans slightly forward, head slightly tilted, and the overall posture conveys a quiet sense of contemplation. In the foreground are blurred golden leaves. The edges of the leaves are outlined by sunlight with soft halos, presenting circular bokeh spots of varying sizes, with colors gradient from pale yellow to deep orange. Some spots overlap and intersect, creating a strong sense of depth and a dreamlike atmosphere. The middle ground is a clear main figure, positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame. Light shines diagonally from her right rear, creating a warm backlight effect that envelops her outline in golden halos. The background is a blurred autumn forest, with the ground covered in thick fallen leaves, presenting a brownish-yellow tone. The branches of the trees appear faintly in the blur, with the overall color scheme dominated by warm yellow, golden orange, and off-white, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The composition adopts a classic central symmetrical layout, with the figures occupying the visual focal point. The bokeh light spots in the foreground and the blurring in the background together form a distinctly layered spatial structure. The visual guide converges from the light spots in the foreground to the figures in the middle of the background, then extends to the forest paths in the background, guiding the viewer's gaze deeper and deeper. The overall image presents a texture reminiscent of film photography. With a slight graininess and a low-saturation vintage filter effect, the lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, as if capturing a moment of afternoon sunlight. The air is filled with the unique coolness and tranquility of autumn. The entire scene resembles a carefully composed film photograph, full of storytelling and poetry, with a strong artistic atmosphere and emotional tension, as if recording a private moment of dialogue with time, loneliness, and self-reflection. The details are rich, the layers are strong, the color transitions are natural, and the light and shadow handling is delicate. It presents a beauty that is both realistic and transcendent, suitable for high-resolution cameras paired with large-aperture lenses, simulating the shallow depth of field effect commonly seen in portrait photography. It emphasizes the relationship between subject and environment while preserving enough detail and texture. The overall style leans toward a fusion of Japanese photography and art film aesthetics, creating a gentle, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere that lets people feel the passage of time and inner depth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
