        {
          "id": "krea2-e428ec3a0e9aae903bea2fc5",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙城市媚态坐比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an off-white quilted padded stool, wearing a bright red long-sleeved tight dress with a hem that cuts down to mid-thigh. The chest features a small V-shaped cutout detail, highlighting the balance between elegance and sensuality. She wears a red and black plaid beret, with a smooth sheen and a hint of playfulness and confidence. Her legs are crossed and slightly apart, and she wears red high-heeled sandals with metal uppers and high heels. The overall posture is relaxed and relaxed, showcasing a sense of urban fashion and youthful energy. In the foreground is her body and sitting posture. Occupying the main position, the center features an off-white cushioned stool and a white wall behind her. The wall is simple and flat, with slight textures. On the left side of the floor sits a magazine with the words \"LIFE GOES TO THE MOVIES\" and several portraits. The magazine's cover is richly colored, visually echoing the red clothing. The background is a pure white wall with a delicate texture without obvious decoration. The floor is light gray cement, slightly rough, with fine scratches and stains to enhance realism. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered, body slightly tilted, head facing the lens, light and shadow from the front left, soft and even, with natural transitions of shadows. The right wall and floor form a slight shadow, creating a three-dimensional sense of space. The overall atmosphere is bright and fresh, infused with the everyday feel and artistic flair of modern urban life. The color palette is mainly red, paired with white, off-white, and gray, creating a strong contrast that highlights the subject. The image texture is delicate and richly detailed, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains a sense of realism, presenting photographic works that combine fashionable beauty with everyday atmosphere, suitable for fashion photography or lifestyle displays. The image style leans toward a blend of realism and art, offering strong visual appeal and emotional expression",
