        {
          "id": "krea2-13213de372c0bcd497fcd27e",
          "alias": "单女黑外套公寓沉思坐持包",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the indoor floor, leaning slightly back against the beige wall. She wears a black leather jacket with a smooth, reflective surface, presenting a premium leather texture. Underneath, she wears a black-and-white polka dot silk shirt loosely tied at the collar, adding a touch of vintage elegance. She wears light yellow pleated shorts made of soft and fitted material, highlighting the long and smooth lines of her legs At her waist, she carries a small black bag crossbody. The body is compact and delicate, equipped with a metal chain. The cover features a brand logo. On her feet are a pair of white pointed high heels with simple uppers, medium-height heels, and a modern design. Her legs are crossed, one foot stretched forward, the other bent and raised, a relaxed yet dynamic pose. The floor has a light gray cement texture, with some areas casting shadows. The wall is flat and unadorned, and on the right side of the background, a corner of wooden furniture can be faintly seen. The overall composition was shot from a low angle. The figure occupies the center left of the frame, extending from the feet upward to the head, forming a strong visual guiding line. Light comes from the upper right, sunlight streams through the window, creating a soft side glow, casting clear shadows on the floor and walls. The strong contrast of light and shadow creates a warm and layered atmosphere. The color palette is mainly black, white, and yellow, complemented by beige and brown. The color combinations are harmonious and unified, giving the image a strong sense of fashion and artistry, like a high-end fashion shoot in a professional studio. It also resembles real-life moments captured with a mobile phone, combining the refined beauty of commercial advertising with the casualness and authenticity of everyday life. The images are rich in detail and clear in texture. From the sheen of leather to the folds of fabric, every detail is carefully depicted. The overall atmosphere is both cold and sexy, modern yet retro, full of storytelling and emotional tension. It is suitable for fashion magazine covers or high-end brand promotions, as well as personal portraits or social media sharing, showcasing an independent, confident, and free-spirited urban woman",
