        {
          "id": "krea2-18c3cfcc096c8099326f0ea9",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔公寓站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the rustic stone bridge railing, slightly turning to look back at the camera, as if she is about to speak softly or ponder something. She wears a pink floral spaghetti strap top with a loose hem revealing a flat belly. The sleeves are sleeveless, the shoulder straps are slim, paired with light blue jeans with pleated details at the waist and slightly rolled up at the hem. Her left hand is tucked into her pocket, while her right hand carries a white canvas bag adorned with cute plush decorations. The strap drapes across her shoulder, and she wears a red woven wristband strap on her wrist With long fingers and neatly trimmed nails, the overall posture relaxed and natural, the body slightly tilted, presenting a casual yet elegant beauty. The background features typical Jiangnan water town architecture, with layers of blue-gray tiled roofs arranged in a harmonious manner. In the distance, a traditional-style pavilion can be seen, with upturned eaves and upturned corners. The roof is covered with dark tiles, the ridge lines are smooth, the surrounding trees lush and lush, and sunlight pours down from the upper left of the painting, creating a soft backlight effect. The light passes through the fine dust in the air, creating a hazy halo. The sky shows a gradient of light blue and warm yellow tones, thin clouds casting a bright light. In the foreground, the rough-textured gray stone railings show weathered marks and fine cracks on the surface. The railing's edges are rounded and the structure sturdy. In the middle is a continuous tiled roof and partially wooden houses, with walls built of blue bricks, dark gray in color, and clear grain. Some areas show slight weathering, window frames are made of dark wood, and simple items like potted plants and miscellaneous items are placed on the windowsills, rich in detail. The buildings in the background gradually blur, forming a natural depth transition. The composition uses a third-level method: the figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, with the gaze turning to the right to create visual guidance. The stone railing in the foreground serves as a framework to enhance the sense of spatial layering. Light mainly comes from the upper left, a warm sunset light during the golden hour, with soft shadows and moderate contrast. The overall atmosphere is quiet and cozy, full of life and nostalgia. The color palette is mainly warm yellow, orange-pink, and gray-blue, harmoniously unified. It has a slight film texture that simulates real camera shooting, with detailed image quality and rich details, offering the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The image resolution is high, noise control is well controlled, presenting an overall gentle, romantic, and story-rich visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
