        {
          "id": "krea2-7bab151b5127907362d32836",
          "alias": "单女白礼服公寓愤怒坐书写",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in an elegant white one-shoulder high-neck gown sits gracefully on a black piano bench. Her hands are folded over her knees, her left ring finger wearing a simple silver ring, her right hand lightly resting on her left, her posture dignified and appropriate. Her legs are slightly turned to the side, with her right leg in front and left leg behind. Her ankles reveal a slender line, and she wears a pair of gorgeous silver crystal-decorated high-heeled sandals. The upper is inlaid with numerous shiny rhinestones and metal decorations, and the toes are painted with red nail polish, shining brilliantly under the light. The overall look is both noble and sexy. In the background is a black grand piano. When the lid is opened, the keys are clearly visible. On the music stand sits an open sheet music, the paper yellowed, the writing blurry but faintly legible. The piano's surface is smooth like a mirror, reflecting the light and shadow of the surroundings. The body lines are smooth and the details are exquisite. The piano bench is made of black leather with stitched edges, and the seat is flat. Below is storage space. Behind the piano is a pale yellow wooden wall made of vertically arranged wooden planks. The wood grain is delicate and the colors warm, creating a soft gradient effect. Light enters diagonally from the left side of the frame, creating soft shadows. The floor is a light-colored wood floor with clear grain and moderate reflectivity, reflecting the outlines of the figures and furniture. The entire scene is centered on the figures, shot in a medium shot. The figures occupy about two-thirds of the frame's height and are positioned slightly to the left of the visual center, with the piano positioned behind the figures. A diagonal line extends to the right side of the painting, forming a stable triangular structure. The foreground features figures and a piano bench, the middle is a piano and sheet music, and the background features wooden walls and parts of the piano above. The composition is balanced and layered, with visual guidance lines formed by the characters' line of sight, body posture, and piano lines, then turning backward toward the piano, forming a complete visual loop. The lighting atmosphere is warm and soft, with the main light source coming from the left front, simulating natural light or professional photography lighting to create a bright but not glaring illumination. Shadow transitions are natural, casting light shadows on the sides and legs of the figures, enhancing the sense of depth. The piano's surface highlights contrast with the diffuse reflections on the wooden walls, highlighting the main texture. The overall color scheme is mainly white, black, and warm yellow, harmoniously unified to create an elegant, tranquil, and artistically rich atmosphere. It feels like a brief break before a concert or a carefully arranged music-themed photo shoot, with a strong cinematic and sophisticated feel. It preserves the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment, with the camera slightly grainy and natural depth blur, focusing on the subject. The background is moderately blurred, enhancing the subject's prominence. The overall style blends fashion and classicism, combining the independent charm of modern women with the romantic mood of musical art. The visuals are full of storytelling and emotional tension, making one imagine the woman about to start or the show just finished. The air still seems to be filled with faint piano notes. The entire scene is tranquil and elegant, like a meticulously painted oil painting, yet so realistic that every detail seems to be touched.",
