        {
          "id": "krea2-3f2e57d194d43a9308072703",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙城市沉思跪交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on a soft beige carpet indoors, wearing a simple, form-fitting white short-sleeved dress with a natural skirt that falls to cover her knees, showcasing smooth lines and elegant posture. She leans forward slightly, arms crossed in front of her, hands lightly resting on a light gray cushion or sofa edge in front. Her fingers are long and slender, her ring finger is adorned with a delicate silver ring, and a delicate silver chain bracelet on her wrist adds a touch of understated detail beauty, making her look both neat and a hint of laziness. Looking directly into the camera, it has a slightly moist sheen, and the overall expression is calm yet tinged with tenderness and contemplation. The composition uses a high-angle overhead view, with the main subject positioned slightly below the center of the frame, creating an intimate and intimate visual relationship. In the foreground are her folded hands and some arms, along with the edge of the cushion below. In the middle are her torso, legs, and knees. The background gradually blurs, faintly revealing a glass door or window with a black border. Soft natural light streams in outside, and the interior is evenly warm and bright. It presents a low-saturation gray-white tone, with an overall atmosphere that is quiet, quiet, and full of life. Light and shadow shine from the side and above, highlighting three-dimensionality. The shadows are soft and not harsh. The tones are mainly white, beige, light gray, and dark brown, creating a clean, simple yet warm sense of space. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, offering a slight depth of field effect. The furniture outlines in the background are blurry but recognizable, enhancing the sense of realism in the space. The overall style combines the casual nature of daily life with the refinement of artistic photography, conveying a quiet, restrained, and emotionally charged moment, suitable for expressing the intimate moments of modern urban women or the elegant state of everyday life",
