        {
          "id": "krea2-252f47ad107b43603c74a7dc",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣户外冷淡站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways outdoors in autumn, her head slightly tilted back to the sky, as if savoring nature's gifts and the beauty of life, adding a touch of vitality and softness. She wears an off-white coarse knit sweater, thick and soft, with a collar adorned with fluffy white fur, making it both warm and stylish. She holds a bouquet of colorful wildflowers, mainly red, orange, and deep red, accented with tiny green leaves. This creates a natural and harmonious scene. In the foreground, countless golden and orange-red leaves drift slowly in the air, spinning and falling, each with different postures—some as light as butterflies, others with a lazy rhythm. These leaves add dynamic beauty to the scene and symbolize the changing of seasons and the passage of time. The middle section shows blurred green grass and tree outlines, with light filtering through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect, creating a hazy and dreamlike atmosphere. The background is a more blurred natural environment, with distant woods and a soft sky faintly visible. The entire background presents a faint blue-green tone, contrasting with the warm tones in the background, enhancing the spatial layering of the composition. The composition uses the classic three-part layout: the figure is positioned on the right side of the painting, with the head slightly tilted. The drifting paths of fallen leaves create a visual flow from the upper left corner to the lower right, enhancing the dynamic and rhythm of the composition. The overall composition is simple yet rich, highlighting the emotional expression of the main characters. It also showcases the tranquility and beauty of the natural environment. Visually, the movement follows the trails of falling petals, finally stopping in the blurred background area. This visual path, from near to far, from clear to blurry, gives the image a strong sense of depth and immersion. In terms of lighting atmosphere, the entire image is bathed in warm golden sunlight, with light coming from above, creating bright highlights that enhance the sense of depth. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating mottled light and shadow on the ground and the figures. It creates a dreamlike halo effect, with the overall color scheme mainly warm yellow and orange, complemented by cool green and blue tones for contrast. This gives the image both a warm and approachable feel while retaining a fresh natural atmosphere. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, romantic, and slightly poetic, as if freezing a moment of beauty, allowing one to feel the unique gentleness and healing power of autumn. This is a high-quality portrait shot with professional photography equipment, featuring film-like graininess and slight exposure overflow. The color saturation is moderate yet layered, with rich details and natural transitions of light and shadow, presenting an artistic style reminiscent of a cinematic lens, while also carrying the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting, as if recording an ordinary yet touching moment of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
