          "id": "krea2-9c30e41f0408635bc65a2ca9",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤泳池沉思站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by an outdoor pool, appearing fluffy and layered, with a touch of gentleness and contemplation. She slightly tilts her head toward the camera. She wears a black knitted camisole with a white V-neck underneath. The straps are clearly visible, outlining a graceful shoulder and neck line. She wears dark high-waisted shorts, making the overall look simple and fashionable, full of summer vibes. She holds a black-and-gray sunshade umbrella in her right hand, the umbrella surface unfolding to form a semicircular protective space. The umbrella ribs are clearly visible, and the handle is black. The handle features a metallic button design, giving her hand a natural and relaxed posture. Her fingers are long and her nails are neatly trimmed. On her left wrist, she wears a delicate gold bracelet, adding a touch of refinement. The background is a blue pool tile floor with a regular hexagonal pattern. Light filters through the umbrella, casting mottled shadows on the floor. In the distance, you can faintly see the outlines of green plants. The sky is pale blue with a hint of clouds, and the overall color scheme is mainly cool, creating a cool and comfortable atmosphere. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, head slightly tilted, body forming an S-curve, creating a smooth flow of vision. Light and shadow come from directly above, soft and even, without strong contrast. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, fresh, and romantic, like a leisurely afternoon time, with a sense of realism from daily life and a slight film texture, like an impromptu moment shot with a portable camera. It carries a genuine sense of life and natural beauty, with moderate color saturation and rich details. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the main subject, making the overall composition clean and tidy, full of artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
