        {
          "id": "krea2-e309ca5b1da28c3a59b900bc",
          "alias": "单女衬衫城市俏皮",
          "prompt": "She wears a light gray, semi-transparent pleated chiffon shirt with light and flowing fabric, featuring fine vertical textures and pleated details. The neckline is wide, and the cuffs are decorated with ruffles. The layered fabric creates a soft transition of light and shadow in the light, and the white shirt underneath is faintly visible. On her chest is a slender gold necklace, with a small round pearl pendant. Her earrings are a pair of exquisitely designed pearl tassel earrings, strung together from multiple smooth white pearls. The ends are tied with white ribbon bows, gently swaying with the slight swaying of her head. Her hands are clasped in front of her, fingers long, and her nails are painted with light purple glitter. The hand gestures are elegant and natural, with the car's interior as the background. Bright natural light streams through the window glass, and the view outside is blurred, presenting soft white and light gray tones. The seats inside are made of dark gray leather, with a smooth surface and fine stitching. The seatbacks are clean and modern, with close-up shots in the overall composition. The figures occupy most of the space, extending diagonally from the lower left corner to the upper right, forming a diagonal line. The background and foreground gradually blur, creating a strong sense of depth. Light mainly comes from the left window, providing soft natural light, while the right side forms natural shadows. The contrast between light and dark is moderate, creating a quiet, private, and lively atmosphere. It feels like a casual snapshot taken during daily travel, with cool gray and white tones accented with light purple and gold. The visual scene is fresh and elegant, with the texture and artistic beauty of documentary photography. The images are filled with gentle narrative, as if capturing a tranquil moment, evoking the elegance and composure of urban women",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
