        {
          "id": "krea2-b7cb38ad6c9c81bbdea8d932",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙室内害羞站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, exuding a soft sheen, appearing both sweet and slightly shy. She wears a pink spaghetti strap dress made of light and soft material, decorated with pleats and bows. The straps are slim, revealing collarbones and shoulder lines. The overall look is fresh and cute, full of spirit. She raises both hands, interlacing fingers in a heart-shaped gesture, her movements natural and smooth, as if expressing love or sharing joy. She wears a small accessory on her wrist, with details reflecting refinement. She carries a pink bag crossbody, with the strap extending from the shoulder, visible on the body featuring cute patterns. The background is a light-colored wall with a delicate texture and slight texture. On the wall is a white electronic device, possibly a doorbell or monitor. The screen is off, with simple edges blending seamlessly with the wall. The composition centers on the person, shot in medium shots, with the figure occupying most of the frame. The head is slightly tilted, the body slightly tilted, creating a natural dynamic effect. Light comes from the front slightly above, with slight shadows, creating a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The light and shadow transitions are natural, with the overall color tones mainly pink and off-white. The color combinations are harmonious and unified, giving a warm and tranquil feeling. The images have the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The camera may be a mobile phone or small digital camera, with clear image quality but retaining some subtle noise and compression traces, enhancing realism. The image shows no obvious post-processing marks. She maintained the original filming texture, then focused on the heart-shaped gesture following the finger's movement, and finally noticed the details of her clothing and accessories. The entire scene conveyed a relaxed, cheerful, and youthful vibe, as if capturing the most authentic and beautiful moments of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
