        {
          "id": "krea2-ea29eace87adc51cb5078a7c",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙厨房冷淡站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a corner of a modern kitchen, wearing a form-fitting deep blue silky spaghetti strap long dress. The fabric has a delicate sheen and natural pleats, hugging the body's curves to outline an elegant silhouette. The hem extends from the waist to the ankles, with a side slit adding a touch of sexiness and movement. Her right hand gently rests on the shoulder strap, while her left hand naturally rests on her abdomen. The overall temperament is gentle yet charming. She stands slightly to the side, The background is the kitchen environment. The white countertop is clean and tidy, the wooden cabinet door panels have clear and natural textures, featuring metal round handles. On the countertop sits a black flat device with blue labels on the edge, next to a stainless steel sink. The window sill is fitted with horizontal blinds with neatly arranged blades. Through the gaps, you can see the blurred green plants and architectural outlines outside. Light streams in diagonally, creating a pattern of light and shadow on the blinds, illuminating the entire space. Soft natural light evenly illuminates the figures. At the same time, subtle shadow layers are created in the background. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, slightly tilted to create dynamic balance. The foreground features the kitchen countertop and some cabinets, the middle ground is the main subject, the background is blinds and the view outside the window, extending into the background of light and shadow and spatial structure. The overall atmosphere blends the everyday feel of modern home with the artistic sensibility of fashionable photography, combining a sense of life with refined beauty. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, with blue, white, and wood as the main tones. The harmonious contrast of cool and warm creates a quiet, elegant, and slightly intimate indoor scene. The image texture is close to professional camera shooting, yet retains a touch of natural realism from everyday life. It's as if you were capturing moments under natural light with a high-resolution phone or portable camera, emphasizing realistic light and detail without excessive embellishment, presenting a visual effect that is both realistic and aesthetically pleasing",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
