        {
          "id": "krea2-ef1fc35dd7c46d0bbe0de9d3",
          "alias": "单女黑西装街道倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against the metal handrail beside the stone steps. She wears a black suit jacket with an open purple lace sheer bra underneath, revealing her delicate collarbones and shoulder lines. She wears high-waisted black shorts, matching purple lace-trimmed over-the-knee socks, and black thin-strap high-heeled sandals. The overall look is full of fashion and allure. Her makeup is exquisite: her left hand lightly holds a black crocodile leather handbag, her right hand resting on the silver metal armrest, her body slightly leaning to the side. Her left leg is bent and raised to stand on the steps, while her right leg stands upright for support. The posture is sexy yet elegant. The background is a gray stone staircase and low wall, with clear wall textures. In the distance, there is a green lawn and a few trees. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled shadows, creating a soft and warm atmosphere. In the middle of the frame, you can faintly see a red fire hydrant and a blurred street outline. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The diagonal stone steps and handrails form a guiding line, drawing the gaze toward the subject. Natural daylight comes from the upper right, creating a contrast of light and shadow. Highlights the outlines of the figures and details of the clothing, with soft shadows. The colors are mainly black, purple, and gray, accented with green and red dots, creating rich visual layers. Overall, it presents a style of urban street art, combining everyday realism with a high-end fashion vibe. It feels like a street style shot with a professional camera. The image texture is delicate, details are full, and the atmosphere is strong",
