        {
          "id": "krea2-b2492b66346eb0328b3ac070",
          "alias": "单女黑西装椅上自信坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a woven rattan chair, wearing a black blazer paired with a white shirt and a beige pleated skirt. Her posture is elegant yet slightly lazy, with small heart-shaped patterns on her black stockings. At her feet rests a pair of black leather shoes. The overall look presents a retro collegiate aesthetic. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition, with a slightly turned body to the side, creating a natural visual direction. In the foreground, the figure and shoes at her feet, while in the middle frame, rattan chairs and stacked gift boxes Composed of pumpkin decorations, dried flowers, and candles, the background features display racks filled with festive elements, including pine cones, dried branches, small Christmas trees, deer head ornaments, ceramic vases, and signs written in Korean. The entire space is bathed in warm yellow lighting, gently shining in from the left side, creating a cozy and comfortable indoor atmosphere. The composition uses a central composition, with figures as visual focal points, surrounded by abundant holiday decorations, forming a distinctly layered spatial layout. The colors are mainly brown, beige, black, and red. Dotted with gold and white light points, the overall tone is harmonious and unified, exuding a strong sense of season and life. The light and shadow are handled with delicate detail, while shadows are softly distributed across the background and ground, enhancing the image's three-dimensionality and realism. The overall style blends Japanese photography with holiday themes, preserving the warmth of everyday life while retaining the refined texture of artistic photography. It feels like shooting scenes on a winter afternoon with an old-fashioned film camera, full of nostalgia and warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
