        {
          "id": "krea2-19643b9339ff4f1645d7bbd0",
          "alias": "单女橙T恤街道困倦站立持伞",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street in the rain, wearing an orange camisole and loose blue pants. She gently holds a transparent water bottle in her left hand and a transparent umbrella in her right. The umbrella surface is covered with fine raindrops, with a white handle and clearly visible ribs. She carries a light pink quilted handbag with a light green strap, a black beaded necklace around her neck, and a beige bead necklace on her wrist. The overall look is full of youthful energy and feel, with a blurred city street scene in the background. There is a blue-and-white architectural structure and neon signs. In the distance, the word \"Boy\" can be faintly seen. Nearby, a cluster of blooming blue daisies is densely and vividly colored, with slightly moist petal edges and yellow stamens, complemented by green leaves. On the left side of the painting is a black streetlight pole, while on the right and behind are dense blue flower seas. The composition uses a mid-field portrait, with the figure positioned slightly to the left, forming the visual focal point. The umbrella occupies the upper half of the image, forming a triangular composition with soft and even light and shadow. Natural light filters through the rain and mist, creating a slight scattering effect and creating a hazy, dreamy atmosphere. The colors are mainly orange, blue, and light green, with sharp contrast and harmonious unity, enhancing the texture. The overall image has a strong sense of daily life and life, as if shot with an amateur camera or phone, with slight graininess and real environmental noise, presenting a beautiful moment captured unintentionally. The camera angle slightly tilts upward, highlighting the elegance and composure of the figures, with delicate background blur treatment. Flowers in the foreground form a distinctly layered spatial relationship with the figures, and the unique humid atmosphere of rainy days is captured through detailed depiction. The entire scene is filled with an atmosphere of romance, freshness, and tranquility, as if time itself stands still in this moment, recording a gentle moment in the rain in the city",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
