        {
          "id": "krea2-b432006bab2bb7dd963d8a0d",
          "alias": "单女黑毛衣街道自信坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a stone railing at a city street corner, dressed in a loose black sweater and trousers, wearing light blue sneakers with white socks slightly visible. Her overall look is simple yet modern, fluttering gently in the wind. She tilts her head slightly up at the sky, as if lost in thought or feeling the warmth of the sunlight. Her posture is relaxed yet elegant, one hand in her pocket, the other naturally resting on the railing, her body slightly tilted, showing a casual and composed air. In the foreground is a beige stone railing adorned with classical carvings Its surface is slightly weathered by the passage of time, with clearly visible textures. Below the railing are several stone steps, edges covered in shadow, creating a strong contrast of light and dark. In the middle is the railing where the woman sits and the red brick building wall behind her. The wall is made of neatly arranged orange-red bricks, rough yet warm. Sunlight pours in, casting long shadows on the brick walls, with interwoven light and shadow creating distinct layers. The windows have dark frames, with glass reflecting the faint light from the sky. The window sill edges are decorated with exquisite stone carvings. It adds a touch of retro charm. The background features the outline of a building in the distance and a small shrub, with sparse branches and leaves scattered in the corners of the wall. Next to it is a section of black wrought iron fence, with clean lines that create a material contrast with the red brick wall. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, making the figure stand out more and stretching the vertical lines of the building, enhancing the spatial depth of the scene. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, creating an asymmetrical visual balance. The gaze is guided from the foreground railing to the figure in the middle of the scene. Extending further into the background of buildings and sky, a natural visual flow is formed. Light comes from the upper right, the golden evening sunlight, soft and warm, casting long shadows on the ground and buildings, creating a tranquil and poetic atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and orange-red, paired with the characters' black clothing and light blue shoes, creating a striking color contrast. The transitions of light and shadow are delicate and rich, presenting a fleeting beauty captured by chance in daily life. It feels like a real street photo taken with an amateur camera, with a film texture, slight graininess, and natural underexposure, making the entire scene feel authentic and approachable, full of life and emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
