        {
          "id": "krea2-d7316079020394c7caf2c235",
          "alias": "单女灰外套樱花忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits sideways on a rusted metal railing beside the tracks. She wears a thick gray coarse knitted wool coat, with the collar slightly open to reveal the black turtleneck underneath. Her posture is lazy yet poetic, her body leaning slightly forward, knees bent, one foot on the railing, the other naturally hanging down, displaying an effortless, casual beauty. In the foreground is a rough orange-yellow rusty metal railing. The surface is covered with mottled rust and wear marks, with edges slightly sharp, forming a material contrast with the figure's soft woolen coat. In the middle is a clear female subject, her silhouette outlined by soft backlight forming a golden border, revealing an expression of tranquility immersed in the present moment. The background is blurred, presenting a blurred street scene and blooming cherry trees. Pale pink petals bloom on the branches, forming a hazy sea of pink-white flowers. In the distance, the outlines of city buildings and the faint halo of traffic lights can be seen. On the right side, there is a yellow and black railway warning post whose distinctive stripes add a touch of industrial and realistic elements to the image. The composition uses a diagonal layout, with the figure extending from the lower left corner to the upper right, creating a dynamic balance. The camera angle is slightly lowered, creating an intimate and immersive observation experience. The visual guide is guided from the foreground metal railing to the main subject, then through her gaze upward, the gaze is directed toward the sky and distant cherry blossoms, creating an upward emotional flow. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by warm golden light in the early morning or evening. Sunlight slants from the upper right, casting soft shadows on the figures. The overall tone is warm, with a slight film texture. The color saturation is moderate, and details retain graininess and slight overexposure, creating a nostalgic, gentle, and slightly melancholic Japanese artistic atmosphere. The overall image presents a poetic moment from everyday life, like street photography casually captured with an old film camera. It is rich in everyday life and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
