        {
          "id": "krea2-f8e77a5c41ac031b1b89218f",
          "alias": "单女烟火害羞站立手持物",
          "prompt": "Under the pitch-black night sky, a woman stands sideways, her head slightly lowered, revealing a gentle yet slightly shy smile. With her movements, she appears natural and lively. She wears a light-colored, loose top made of soft fabric, with soft shoulder lines and naturally draped cuffs. The overall look is simple yet full of life. Her right hand holds a burning sparkler, sparks flying, golden points of light flickering in the darkness, forming a warm and dreamy halo. The highlights have a warm orange hue, while the shadows reveal deep layers of shadow, as if hiding countless nights of longing and anticipation. The background blends completely into the boundless darkness, with no unnecessary elements distracting the view—only the light of the sparkler tracing fine trajectories in the air, creating a strong visual focal point. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space, heads slightly tilted, bodies forming an S-shaped curve, postures elegant yet casual, and the background blur handled with great cleanliness. It highlights the emotional expression of the subject. The light mainly comes from the local illumination of the firework stick, combining a single light source with backlight and side lighting. The contrast between warm and cool is strong, with warm yellow light contrasting sharply against the deep black background, enhancing the dramatic tension and emotional intensity of the image. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, carrying a private, warm, and slightly melancholic poetic beauty, as if recording a night moment for just two people. The photography style leans toward everyday amateur equipment shooting, with a film texture and slight noise. The color saturation is moderate but leans toward warmth, with rich detail preservation. The lens is a large-aperture prime lens with an aperture of about f/1.8, making the foreground clear and the background completely blurred. At the same time, you can capture the dynamic light spots and starbursts when fireworks burst. The image has slight motion blur and a sense of breathing, enhancing realism and immediacy. The entire scene is not heavily embellished but is full of emotional tension and storytelling, like an unfinished memory frozen in this moment. Between the interplay of light and shadow, time seems to stop. Only that tiny firework burns a brief yet brilliant light of life in the darkness.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
