        {
          "id": "krea2-22232333c6ac1959c1ad6941",
          "alias": "单女灰外套舞台冷淡站立持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a dark gray coat with a slightly open neckline revealing a light blue sweater underneath, with a soft blue scarf wrapped around her neck, the scarf made of a fluffy texture. The scarf is casually wrapped around her neck, with slightly curled edges, giving a casual and warm look. Her hands are folded over her chest, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, painted with pale pink sequin nails. Her fingertips are slightly bent, lightly touching the edge of the scarf. The movement is elegant and restrained. The main subject is positioned slightly to the left center, with a compact composition. The shot uses medium and close-up shots, with background blur to create a blurred, cool tone—likely a winter outdoor scene. Faintly visible gray and white mottled light and shadows create a tranquil yet slightly chilly atmosphere. The light is soft and even, coming from a slightly higher front position, like diffused light on a cloudy day, without strong shadows. The overall color scheme mainly features cool blue and warm gray, creating contrast that enhances the layering and visual impact of the image. The light and shadow transition is natural, and the composition uses a three-part method. Although the background is blurry, Still, you can feel the depth of the space. The scarf and hand details in the foreground are clearly visible, while the background is completely blurred, creating a strong depth of field effect. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and emotional, carrying a subtle sense of loneliness and poetry, as if capturing a fleeting inner world. The image presents a realistic feel of everyday amateur equipment shooting, with slight film graininess and color shift, simulating the camera's imaging performance in low-light environments. The lens is a 50mm prime lens with an aperture set to f/. 1.8 further enhances the degree of background blur, making the subject stand out more. The overall image has a cinematic texture, with a cool but warm tone, rich details, and clear layering, giving a realistic and dreamlike visual experience",
