        {
          "id": "krea2-9f20536113009e6434d8ce28",
          "alias": "单女粉泳装泳池微笑站立泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a clear blue pool, the water just reaching her waist. She wears a pink one-piece swimsuit with ruffled trim, and the straps and skirt hem are adorned with delicate pleated details. She is turning sideways to look back at the camera, her makeup exquisite, her right hand gently holding a white inflatable float ring. The floating ring is printed with blurry cartoon patterns and golden text. The left hand naturally rests in the water, fingertips lightly touching the surface, creating subtle ripples. The pool's ripples sparkle with sparkling light under the sunlight, while the water reflects the sky and surrounding light and shadows, forming dynamic geometric patterns. In the distance, the pool walls are paved with blue tiles, neatly arranged, reflecting varying shades of blue. In the background, you can faintly see the white railing at the pool's edge and some blurred architectural outlines, but the focus is entirely on the figures. The composition uses a medium shot close-up, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, body slightly tilted, head turned toward the camera, forming a natural visual guideline. Light comes from the upper left, strong daytime direct light, with soft shadows. The reflections and refractions on the water surface enrich the layers of the image. The overall atmosphere is fresh and bright, full of summer vitality and dreaminess. The colors are dominated by blue and pink, forming a striking contrast yet harmonious unity, creating a beauty that is both realistic and slightly surreal, like a classic scene from a youth idol drama. It lets you feel a carefree and happy moment, as if you can hear the sound of splashing water and distant laughter. The entire scene is filled with youthful energy and a fairy-tale-like romantic mood. The shooting angle is slightly lower than in head-to-head view, simulating the realism of everyday handheld camera or mobile photography. The edges of the lens are slightly blurred to enhance focus on the subject, while preserving environmental details, making the images both artistic and lively. The light and shadow transitions are natural, and the color saturation is moderate, presenting a warm and authentic visual experience. It was as if on a sunny afternoon, I had captured the most beautiful moment of my life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
