        {
          "id": "krea2-96e023d2b4121352d8bc622c",
          "alias": "单女摄影棚温柔持相机",
          "prompt": "A close-up half-length portrait of an Eastern woman, with a slightly tilted head with a natural sheen. On her wrist, a ring set with gemstones is visible. The color is light beige or gray-brown, with a thick texture and a certain texture. The background features a wall with repeated geometric patterns, with regular diamond or grid patterns. The material resembles upholstery or fabric, with colors close to the foreground fabric, forming a unified tone. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying the main position. Light comes from the front right, creating a soft side light that creates a warm and gentle atmosphere. The transition between light and shadow is natural, with delicate shadows that enhance the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color tone is mainly warm yellow. It creates a warm, comfortable, and intimate indoor atmosphere. The image quality is close to professional studio shooting, but retains slight film graininess and natural color transitions, as if shooting with a high-end camera in low-light conditions. It has a strong sense of artistry and cinematicism, with rich image details and an overall sense of sophistication, elegance, and tranquility",
