        {
          "id": "krea2-b641b8174e08b865fcf986e6",
          "alias": "单女白T恤森林过肩",
          "prompt": "She wears a simple white V-neck short-sleeve T-shirt layered with a beige, lightweight trench coat. The coat drapes over her shoulders, the sleeves hang naturally, her left hand gently gripping the railing, her right hand hanging naturally. On her wrist is a slender silver necklace, black sunglasses hang on her chest, and brown skinny pants fit her body perfectly, outlining her long legs. She wears a pair of thick-soled white sneakers with delicate decorative details on the upper, paired with high-top gray knit slouch socks. The socks are soft and fluffy, layering over the ankles and calves. Her right leg is bent, knee raised, left leg naturally extended, body slightly leaned side, posture relaxed and elegant. The overall look is relaxed, comfortable, and fashionable. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right in the middle foreground, with the figure occupying about one-third of the frame. The composition uses a three-part method, creating a good visual balance between the figure and the background. In the foreground is a rough stone path and rugged wooden railings, made from thick tree trunks, with surfaces covered in natural cracks and textures, showing traces of time. The middle view is a winding trail extending to the left, leading deep into the distant forest. The background features layers of mountain peaks, covered with dense green vegetation. The distant mountains appear faintly in the mist, layered and distinct, with colors gradually shifting from nearby emerald green to distant gray-blue, creating a profound sense of space. The sky appears pale blue, clouds are thin, and the light is soft and bright. Sunlight slanted down from the upper left of the frame, creating a natural backlighting effect that makes it appear more three-dimensional. At the same time, it casts clear shadows on the ground and railings, with sharp but not awkward contrasts. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and leisurely, combining the free feeling of outdoor adventure with a touch of youthful tranquility and beauty. The main color palette is natural earth tones: off-white, brown, dark green, and light gray harmoniously unified. The color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and the texture is realistic, as if you were casually shooting with a regular camera on a sunny afternoon. It preserves realistic light and shadow changes and environmental details, with a moderately blurred background that highlights the subject without disrupting the overall coherence of the scene. The composition is highly directive, with the line of sight starting from the stone-paved road at the lower left, extending up along the railing, and finally resting on the figure, forming a complete visual loop. The overall scene is full of life and artistic beauty, like a real photo capturing travel moments, capturing precious moments of harmonious coexistence between humans and nature",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
