        {
          "id": "krea2-2132a1378b15e77677fe4ee3",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙厨房沉思坐",
          "prompt": "She wears a white lace spaghetti strap dress, a black thin string collar around her neck, and various accessories on her wrist, including a pearl bracelet, a black woven bracelet, and a silver bracelet, presenting a thoughtful and gentle expression. In front of her sits a deep red cocktail, a tall glass with scale markings on the glass. The surface of the wine floats with a layer of delicate white foam, topped with fresh strawberries and mint leaves. Next to it is a colorful plate of food, possibly a grilled meat or seafood platter served in a yellow ceramic bowl. On the table is a cute cartoon bear-shaped power bank and a set of golden tableware. In the background is a wooden wine rack displaying various bottles, including brands like BRUICHLADDIE. Behind the rack is a glass display case reflecting soft lighting and the surrounding environment. On the right side, you can see a brick wall structure and a door labeled \"KITCHEN.\" Above the door is an orange sign with faintly visible \"COMMUN\" lettering. The overall space is lit in warm yellow tones, with ceiling spotlights and wall lamps emitting soft halos, creating a cozy yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The composition centers on the figures, creating a visual focal point. Drinks and tabletop items in the foreground add depth to the image, the middle scene highlights the interaction between the figures and the bar counter, and the background expands the space through wine racks and kitchen doors. Light and shadow cast from the upper left, while natural reflections on the wine glasses and bottles enhance the texture The overall tone is warm, with moderate saturation and a slight film graininess, resembling everyday moments captured with a professional camera. The images convey authentic life and an artistic cinematic feel, conveying a leisurely, leisurely, slightly contemplative urban aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
