        {
          "id": "krea2-4740fac169aaea492b8234ba",
          "alias": "单女外套屋顶沉思倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "Her expression is slightly contemplative and serene, revealing a restrained yet profound emotion. She wears a dark tweed coat layered with a geometric pattern, the collar revealing the collar of a white shirt, and a warm red knitted scarf around her neck. One end of the scarf falls over her chest, adding a touch of brightness and layering. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly leaning. As if enjoying this moment of tranquility, the foreground is a sturdy tree trunk, with clearly visible bark textures showing deep brown and gray-black mottled textures. The trunk occupies most of the left side of the painting, forming a strong visual guide that draws the viewer's gaze to the figure. The middle ground is the environment of the figure, with a blurred background that clearly shows a quiet street. In the distance, low buildings stand, walls somewhat old, grayish-white in color, and the roof lines are simple, exuding a simple sense of life. On the right, a car covered by a hood can be faintly seen. The surface of the cover has wrinkles and reflections, enhancing the realism of the scene. The sky is a clear pale blue, with sunlight slanting down from the upper right of the frame, creating a strong backlight effect. Golden light penetrates the fine dust in the air, producing distinct halos and lens spots, making the figure's silhouettes more three-dimensional. The contrast between light and shadow is strong, with natural transitions between light and shadow. The overall tone is warm, mainly golden, orange-red, and dark brown, creating a warm and nostalgic atmosphere. The composition uses a three-part method. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right side for the line of sight to extend, creating a balanced and breathable visual structure. The lens uses a mid-range prime lens with a shallow depth of field and a noticeable background blur, highlighting the main subject while preserving detailed environmental information. The image has the texture of film photography, with fine grain and moderate color saturation, presenting a retro and realistic visual style. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, gentle, and poetic, like a moment frozen on a winter afternoon street. It lets you feel the slow flow of time and inner peace and tranquility",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
