        {
          "id": "krea2-4c39bf7bcecd00111dcaa56e",
          "alias": "单女银西装城市冷淡站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside a black sedan, wearing a silver-gray double-breasted suit with delicate textures. The jacket is well-tailored, with a crisp neckline and delicate button decorations on the cuffs. She pairs the same short skirt below, creating a sharp and elegant look that showcases the confidence and charm of an urban professional woman. Her makeup is exquisite, and her posture is natural and composed. In her right hand, she carries an off-white handbag. The design is simple and elegant, adorned with metal buttons and ribbons, adding a touch of sweetness. The background is a blurred outdoor scene. In the distance, you can see lush green trees, lush branches and leaves, and dappled light and shadow. The color scheme is cold and sharp, contrasting with the figures in the foreground. The vehicle's surface is smooth like a mirror, reflecting the surrounding environment. The window glass is clear, showing the figure's outline and the colors of the sky. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, body slightly turned and head turned toward the camera, forming a natural visual guideline. Light comes from the upper right, providing soft natural light. It creates a warm atmosphere for early morning or evening, with delicate shadow transitions and well-handled background blur to highlight the subject. The overall color palette is mainly gray, black, and white, with clear layers and rich texture. The image presents a casual fashion moment from daily life, as if captured on a city street. It has a strong sense of realism and everyday life, while also maintaining artistic beauty. It feels like shooting with a professional camera in low-light environments, using a large aperture lens to achieve a shallow depth of field effect. The edges of the frame have slight noise and film graininess, enhancing realism. Light and shadow are soft, color saturation is moderate, details are preserved, composition is balanced, visual focus is on the people, and background elements serve as backdrops, without overshadowing the main focus. The overall atmosphere is quiet and storytelling, conveying an independent, confident, and elegant image of a modern woman",
