        {
          "id": "krea2-735156b83f41cd2d2d147d23",
          "alias": "单女毛衣困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands with a side profile, adding softness. She wears delicate pearl earrings and a slender silver necklace, with an elegant and flowing neckline. She wears a black mesh long-sleeve top made of transparent knit fabric with fine diamond patterns, lined with a faintly visible light beige bodysuit. The mesh is dotted with tiny, shiny silver beads that sparkle in the light, highlighting the texture and design details of the garment. Her right hand rests gently at her waist, fingers long, painted with deep purple nail polish, her posture calm and confident The left hand hangs naturally, the body leans slightly forward, showing a graceful S-shaped curve. The lower half is paired with light blue jeans, which fit the body perfectly. The waist details are clear, and the pocket edges are neatly stitched. The background is an indoor environment. The wall is light gray or gray-white, smooth with slight texture. In the distance, a faint silhouette in a white T-shirt and light-colored shorts can be seen blurring, creating a sense of spatial layering. The overall composition uses a medium shot, with the figure occupying the main position, fully presented from head to knee. The viewing angle is slightly higher than in head-up view, slightly shifting to the right, highlighting the profile's profile and body curves. The camera focuses on the subject, with background blur to create a strong depth of field effect, forming a smooth visual flow. Light comes from the left, creating delicate transitions between light and shadow. Shadows naturally blend into the body's contours, enhancing three-dimensionality. Bright cool white light shines through windows or light source areas in the background, causing local overexposure and bokeh spots, creating a cool and dreamy atmosphere. The color tones are mainly cool blue and gray-white. The contrast between black clothes and blue jeans creates a harmonious and unified overall color scheme, presenting a realistic style that combines fashion and artistry. It feels like a high-quality portrait shot indoors by a professional photographer using a high-end camera, while preserving the natural and authentic moments of daily life. The composition is rigorous yet lively, the atmosphere is tranquil yet full of tension, evoking a restrained sensuality and independent temperament",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
