          "id": "krea2-6b1c1eae37d4b06c80617f87",
          "alias": "单女白T恤船上俏皮坐比耶",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the deck of a white yacht, wearing a light, transparent white long-sleeved top with a blue camisole underneath and dark blue jeans. She naturally sits sideways by the ship's rail, wearing a gold bracelet on her left wrist and making a playful gesture with her right hand slightly bent in a V-shape. Her overall makeup is fresh and natural, creating a soft three-dimensional effect. In the foreground is the smooth, white yacht deck. The edges are metal railings and black glass panels. The middle ground shows the woman's full-body figure, fully visible from knees to head, with a slightly tilted body presenting a relaxed yet elegant posture. The background is a vast sea surface, with varying shades of blue-green tones. The surface shimmers with subtle ripples and ripples, reflecting the sky's light. The distant water surface and the skyline blend indistinctly, creating a soft gradient effect. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, making the figure stand out and feel approachable. At the same time, the sea and sky are incorporated into the frame, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. Her gestures guide the gaze to the left side of the frame, creating a dynamic visual flow. The light and shadows come from natural light at dusk or dawn, soft and warm. Illuminating from the upper right casts gentle shadows on the right side of the figure and the deck, creating a peaceful and romantic atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly cool, with white, blue, and gray as the main tones, but the warm tones of the skin and the details of the clothing are accented. It brings visual balance and harmony, with a delicate and realistic image texture that feels as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the natural feel and spontaneity of daily life. It features a slight film graininess and a slightly low-saturation retro style, evoking a casual shot from a relaxed and joyful sea trip, full of youthful energy and freedom. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, combining the fashion of modern urban women with innocence and spontaneity. The images are tranquil and full of storytelling. It was as if I could hear the sound of the sea breeze and the distant sound of ships' horns",
