        {
          "id": "krea2-0e4f8b2a414bd2b6124d4c50",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙泳池冷淡站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of a modern outdoor building, wearing a high-necked sleeveless leopard print dress with a slim design. At the waist is a wide beige leather belt with metal buckles and eyelet details, highlighting a slender waistline. The overall look is fashionable and full of wild charm. Her hands are holding a pair of black sunglasses above her head, her fingers long, and on her wrist is a watch with a silver metal strap and a pink bead bracelet, adding a touch of refinement and personality. She wears large metal earrings, The expression is slightly cold and confident, the makeup is exquisite, the background is gray concrete walls and glass windows, the windows reflect blurred light, the ground is rough asphalt, with concrete steps and the edge of a circular pool nearby. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical style, with the figure centered and occupying the main position, creating a strong visual focal point. The camera shoots from a slightly low angle, highlighting the character's upright posture and presence. The light and shadow come from naturally diffused light, softly and evenly casting on the figure, without strong shadows. It creates a quiet and sophisticated atmosphere, with overall tones mainly of brown, beige, and gray. The colors are harmonious and unified, with delicate texture. The image has a strong sense of fashion and urban style, resembling a professional studio outdoor model portrait, while preserving the casual moments of daily life. The lens presents a slight grainy texture and subtle vignetting, simulating the texture of real camera shooting. The background blur is moderately applied to make the subject stand out, and the overall atmosphere is both modern and retro. Combining artistic flair with a sense of everyday life, it is like a carefully captured street fashion blockbuster with a strong trendy aesthetic",
