        {
          "id": "krea2-3b320fb3f977f8a6ba738a77",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔公寓沉思坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in front of a pure white background, wearing a light blue denim jacket with a black top underneath, black mesh fishnet stockings, and classic black-and-white canvas shoes. The overall look blends youthful energy with a sense of fashion. In the foreground are her legs and feet, with the diamond-shaped mesh pattern of the fishnet stockings clearly visible. The laces and rubber soles of the black-and-white canvas shoes are well detailed—one shoe slightly tilted, the other laid flat. The upper shows slight wear marks, giving it a realistic everyday feel. The center shows her upper body and body contour. The pleats and stitching details of the denim jacket are richly detailed, the collar slightly open, revealing the edge of the inner garment. The shoulder lines are smooth, arms naturally extended, elbows supporting the ground, wrists wearing thin chain accessories. The earphone cable extends from the inside of the jacket, connecting to the white earphones in her hand. The earphone shell is smooth and reflective, the cable hangs naturally, and the background is a pure light gray wall with no decorations or clutter, creating a minimalist and clean sense of space. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure centered slightly to the left, the body slightly tilted, creating dynamic balance. Meanwhile, the headphone and hand movements suggest an auditory experience and enhance interaction. The light comes from the front slightly left, soft and even, characteristic of studio soft lighting. Shadows transition delicately, without strong contrast, highlighting three-dimensional contours. The shadowed parts are soft and not abrupt, creating an overall atmosphere that is quiet, private, and slightly artistic. The color palette is mainly cool, with denim blue and black-and-white harmoniously united, creating a fresh yet distinctive visual experience. The image quality is similar to professional portrait photography, but retains slight graininess and film texture, as if shot with a Canon 5D Mark IV or Sony A7R series camera paired with an 85mm f/1.8 lens. The blur outside of focus is natural, depth of field control is precise, background is completely blurred, subjects are sharp and clear, colors are faithfully reproduced, layering is distinct, and there is slight overexposure and low saturation, presenting a retro yet modern aesthetic. The image details are rich, and the denim fabric's wash marks and edge effects are authentic and believable. The lace weaving structure and metallic eyelet details are exquisite, the overall composition is compact, spatial relationships are clear, conveying an independent, music-loving lifestyle",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
