        {
          "id": "krea2-ae7c36f3df771a63966d7633",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙广场站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a modern-style indoor stairwell, wearing a form-fitting light gray high-neck, short-sleeved dress. The hem hugs her body curves, outlining an elegant silhouette. At her waist is a delicate silver metal buckle belt, accentuating her slender waistline. The dress length reaches the mid-thigh, revealing long, well-proportioned legs. On her feet are gold high heels, adding a touch of nobility. Her makeup is refined, carrying a hint of confidence and composure. Her right hand gently rests on the glass railing, while her left hand carries a dark brown leather handbag, which is square in shape. The texture is delicate, the shoulder straps short and sturdy. She stands slightly sideways, her left leg slightly bent, her right leg upright, her posture elegant and relaxed, as if she has just stepped down a staircase, yet also seems ready to move forward. In the foreground are transparent glass railings and metal handrails, the glass surface reflecting blurred light and shadow from the surrounding environment. The metal handrails are dark gray, with clean and sharp lines. In the middle frame, the female subject is positioned slightly to the right of the frame, her body slightly tilted, creating a sense of dynamic balance. The background is a bright indoor space, with white or light gray walls, flat and smooth. With subtle textures, the staircase steps and structure can be seen from afar. The edges of the steps are decorated with metal decorative strips, creating an overall space that is open and transparent, with ample yet soft lighting. Natural light from the top and sides blends with artificial illumination, forming a uniform diffused light. The layers of light and shadow are rich, shadows are soft, without strong contrasts, highlighting skin texture and clothing details. The composition uses diagonal perspective, using the staircase lines to guide the viewer from the lower left corner to the upper right, enhancing the sense of spatial depth while placing the figure in the visual focal point. A stable triangular composition is formed, with visual guidance from the front railing lines leading to the figure, creating a flowing and harmonious visual rhythm. The overall atmosphere is modern, fashionable, minimalist, and high-end. The color palette is mainly gray and white, accented with a touch of black and gold. The color combination is calm and restrained, giving a professional and refined impression. The image has a strong urban life vibe, as if capturing a moment of a professional woman in an office building or a high-end hotel. The image texture is delicate and details are clear. It delivers high-resolution effects similar to professional camera shooting, while preserving the authentic and natural light and shadow changes and material rendering of everyday life, like capturing moments in real scenes with high-quality photography equipment, full of artistic beauty and a realistic style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
