        {
          "id": "krea2-ff80327e0506978e6474d77e",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫温柔站立过肩",
          "prompt": "She wears a white collared shirt paired with a beige knit cardigan, casually draped over her shoulders, appearing both casual and gentle. Looking directly at the camera, she exudes innocence and tenderness. She stands slightly lower in the center of the frame, forming a visual focal point, with an endless sea of pink flowers as the background. Flowers bloom densely, with soft colors. Green leaves dot the space, creating a rich sense of layering. In the distance, the outline of a continuous green forest connects with the sky. The sky appears pale blue, covered with fluffy white clouds. The clouds are distinct in layers, light and shadow intertwine, sunlight pours down from the upper right, soft and directional, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The shadows are delicate and enhance the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall composition uses a center-based method, with the main subject standing out. The foreground is a clear close-up of a person, and the middle ground is a sea of flowers extending into the distance. The background features the sky and distant trees, creating a sense of depth from near to far. The horizontal lines of the sea of flowers guide the gaze to the horizon, creating a sense of open space. The overall atmosphere of the image is fresh, tranquil, and romantic, with a poetic beauty of youth and nature. The tones are mainly pink, green, and blue, harmoniously unified with moderate saturation and a touch of warmth, resembling a real summer afternoon. The shooting style resembles everyday mobile phone or portable camera shooting, with a slight graininess and natural halo, strong realism and rich details. The clothing texture is clear, petal edges are soft, the background is moderately blurred, highlighting the main subject, presenting an overall sense of lifelike and documentary artistic beauty, full of a warm and healing atmosphere",
