        {
          "id": "krea2-e7c39045b170f7cc8e10d948",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道俏皮坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the back of a red Honda S2000 sports car, wearing a pink baseball cap, an off-white loose short-sleeved T-shirt, and white high-waisted shorts. She is barefoot, casually leaning against the black carbon fiber rear wing, her right hand naturally resting on the edge of the wing, her left hand resting by her leg, her expression slightly relaxed and confident. Her right leg is stretched straight forward, her left leg bent, and her ankle crossed, showing off her long leg line. Her overall posture is full of youthful energy and street fashion. The main subject of the image is a woman paired with a red sports car, with the sleek red body of the sports car and the \"NSW TI·66· The license plate reads \"IE Japan Domestic Market,\" along with a black carbon fiber rear wing and exhaust pipe. The middle view shows the woman's full-body image and the rear half of the vehicle. The background features dense green trees and blooming pink-purple flowers. The intertwined branches create a natural shading and frame. In the distance, you can faintly see other parked vehicles and low fences. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the visual impact of the figures and vehicles, placing them slightly to the right of the center of the frame, using the vehicle's lines to guide the viewer's focus toward the figure. At the same time, the curved design of the rear wing creates a visual sense of extension. In terms of light and shadow, the lighting is soft and even, presenting the natural light effect of afternoon or evening. Sunlight pours in from above, creating delicate high-gloss reflections on the paint surface, giving the body a rosy sheen. The carbon fiber rear wing has a matte texture with soft shadows. The leaves and flowers in the background appear layered under the light, with moderate color saturation, creating a realistic and lively atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly red, green, and pink. The contrast is striking yet harmonious, creating strong visual appeal. It resembles a street photo taken with everyday casual equipment, capturing a fleeting moment of beauty in urban life. It is full of freedom, individuality, and the romantic atmosphere of youth. The details are rich, texture is realistic, light and shadow transitions are natural, and the images are balanced and storytelling, presenting a style that is both refined and casual",
