          "id": "krea2-7ec8afc75cc7071d66f7ddfd",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙户外媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors in a natural setting, wearing a sleeveless dress with a deep green velvet texture. The material of the dress shows a delicate sheen and subtle pleats under soft light. The shoulder design is simple yet elegant, while the back features hollowed-out details, presenting a subtle sensuality and noble temperament, adding a touch of liveliness and grace. She wears gold round earrings and a thin chain necklace, with metal accessories that reflect slightly in the light. Adding highlights to the overall look, she sits sideways, arms naturally extended, her posture relaxed and composed, carrying a touch of gentleness and calm. The background is blurred green plants and a soft sky, with blurred depth of field making the subject stand out. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure occupying most of the space, forming the visual center. Light comes from the side slightly above, creating a transition between light and shadow, while soft shadows are cast on the neck and shoulders, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is calm and elegant, carrying an artistic and poetic charm. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, presenting a sophisticated cinematic and artistic feel, as if shot at dusk with professional photography equipment. The lens focuses on the subject, the background blur is well handled, creating a strong sense of depth and immersive visual experience. The image details are rich, and the overall style is both fashionable and natural, combining meticulously crafted beauty with authenticity. Like a private snapshot, it captures the most natural state of the subject, full of storytelling and emotional tension. The overall image presents a tranquil, The gentle yet slightly melancholic aesthetic makes one pause and gaze, savoring the emotions and atmosphere within",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
