        {
          "id": "krea2-ebe539383f373bcb985ae59e",
          "alias": "单女樱花温柔站立出神",
          "prompt": "Her skin is fair and delicate, like a fairy stepping out of an ancient painting. She wears a thin gauze-colored Hanfu with a light and transparent fabric, wide and flowing cuffs, layered hems embroidered with exquisite phoenix patterns, woven with gold and silver threads, shimmering with a faint iridescence sheen, draped over a layer of light blue transparent tulle. As she gently lifted her movements, like clouds and mist, her right hand lightly grasping a branch of cherry blossoms blooming with tender pink blossoms. The blossoms were vibrant and vibrant, with layers of petals and tiny stamens clearly visible. Her left hand gently stroked the edge of her gauze garment, her posture elegant and composed, her body slightly tilted, head slightly lowered, her expression calm and serene, as if lost in thought or waiting for something. In the foreground was a close-up of the woman's half-body, occupying the center right of the frame, with blurred green grass and small purple flowers, and in the distance, the outlines of several trees faintly visible. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled light and shadow, creating a soft bokeh effect. The sky shows a faint transition of blue and white. The overall composition combines close-ups with mid-ground environments. The figures are positioned near the golden ratio point, then flowing along the flowing gauze garments to the lower right corner of the frame, creating a dynamic visual flow. Light comes from the upper left and forms natural shadow transitions on the right. The layering of light and shadow is rich, the atmosphere warm and dreamlike, presenting a poetic and vibrant Eastern aesthetic conception. The colors are mainly pink, white, and blue, accented with green, purple, gold, and other accents. The tones are harmonious and unified, combining classical charm with modern beauty. It resembles a meticulously painted meticulous painting yet carries the texture of authentic photography, as if shooting outdoors under natural light with a professional camera. The focal length is about 85mm, aperture f/1.8, the background is naturally blurred, the subject stands out, and the image is clean and pure, with no unnecessary elements distracting it, presenting a tranquil, beautiful, and ethereal atmosphere. It inevitably brings to mind the gentleness of spring and the beauty of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
