        {
          "id": "krea2-dab18cf9d74713d77a4533e6",
          "alias": "单女礼服窗边困倦站立展示",
          "prompt": "A woman stands gracefully beside a semi-transparent white sheer curtain, wearing a delicate light champagne-colored strapless gown with a delicate gold embroidery lace fabric. The shoulders and sleeves feature light, flowing pink tulle sleeves, and a wide woven gold snakeskin belt at the waist, highlighting a slender waistline. She wears a pair of small gold ring earrings and a simple gold necklace set with an oval amber gemstone. On her finger is a ring set with small diamonds, and her right hand gently rests on the edge of the sheer curtain, her posture dignified and poetic. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned on the right side, leaving ample space on the left to show the folds and changes of light and shadow on the white curtain, creating a sense of visual balance. The background is a pure gray-blue wall with soft tones and no distractions. It creates a tranquil and elegant atmosphere, with light coming from the front left, creating a soft side effect. Delicate shadows are cast on the sheer curtain, enhancing the sense of depth and layering. The overall light and shadow present a warm and dreamy ambiance, as if morning sunlight is streaming through the window screen, giving a sense of tranquility, gentleness, and a touch of mystery. The main tones are warm gold and pale pink, paired with a cool gray background for contrast, highlighting the subject's softness and nobility. The details are handled with great precision. From the textures of clothing to the reflections of accessories, everything is clearly visible, showcasing the texture of high-end photography. The overall style combines artistry with a sense of everyday beauty, like a fashion shot with a professional camera, or like the beautiful moments captured in daily life, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
