        {
          "id": "krea2-20335084da9179a548320ea2",
          "alias": "单女黑和服户外站立手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a black kimono with bright yellow trim on the collar and cuffs, and colorful floral patterns embroidered on the shoulders and sleeves, mainly in pink, purple, and green. The lines are delicate and smooth, presenting the delicate beauty of traditional Japanese embroidery. She stands beside a vintage-style bicycle, gently holding the handlebars with both hands. The handlebars are wood-brown, with metallic bells and brake mechanisms. The orange plastic basket is located below the frame, with clearly visible woven patterns, and the rim of the frame is slightly glossy. She adds a touch of liveliness and softness. The overall look is simple yet elegant, with blurred green plants in the background. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting dappled light and shadow, creating a soft bokeh effect. The light spots vary in size, either round or oval, with colors gradient from light green to dark green, creating a tranquil and natural outdoor atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main position. The diagonal line composition extending from the lower left to the upper right gives the painting dynamism and tension. The shallow depth of field highlights the subject, the background blur enhances spatial layering, light comes from the front and side, shadows transition naturally, without strong contrast. The overall color tone is warm and bright, full of vitality and energy. The whole scene is filled with youthful energy and poetic romance like a tranquil pastoral painting, allowing people to feel the simplicity and purity of life. This genuine and delicate emotional expression makes viewers seem to hear the rustling of leaves and the gentle sound of bicycle wheels, immersing themselves in that peaceful and beautiful moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
