        {
          "id": "krea2-8ca52145ce0f0f2e2882584f",
          "alias": "单女外套咖啡厅媚态坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a dining table in a restaurant, adding an elegant and sensual aura. She wears a beige, loose jacket with subtle jacquard patterns. The material looks soft and glossy, with wide sleeves that drape naturally. On her wrist is a warm white jade bracelet, and is a small pearl earring. The overall look is simple yet sophisticated. Her posture is slightly tilted, head slightly tilted, right hand lightly resting on the table, fingers long, moving naturally and relaxed. The dining table in front of her is covered with a pristine white tablecloth. On display is a set of Western-style tableware, including an empty white porcelain plate with the word \"LUCAS\" printed on the edge. Next to it is a set of tableware and a black smartphone with the phone screen facing down. Next to it is a transparent glass water cup filled with clean water. In the background is a tall glass vase holding several brightly colored carnations in orange, red, and yellow, with flowers in full bloom and vitality. Next to the vase are two metallic seasoning bottles—one is a salt shaker, one is a pepper shaker—and a small vintage-style bell. There are also some food scraps scattered on the table, such as small patches of green vegetables and red petals, adding a touch of authentic life. The entire scene is set indoors, with a light gray curtain with vertical stripes in the background. The texture is clear and the lines are neat, with a hint of deep red curtain peeking out from the right edge, creating a color contrast. Light comes from the left front, creating a warm and cozy atmosphere. The shadows are light and layered, and the composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main left side of the frame. Then moving to the background of flowers and decorations, it creates a visual balance and sense of depth. The overall color palette is mainly warm tones, interwoven with beige, white, red, and orange, creating a cozy and romantic yet slightly luxurious dining atmosphere. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, highlighting the contours of the figures and the texture of the clothing, while preserving the true details of the environment. It feels as if a medium format camera is shooting in low-light conditions, using a large aperture lens to present a shallow depth of field effect, with a natural blurred background and focus on the subject. The visuals have a strong cinematic feel and storytelling, as if capturing a quiet and beautiful moment. The overall style combines artistry with the warmth of everyday life, like a carefully composed documentary photographic work, full of delicate emotional expression and life aesthetics",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
