        {
          "id": "krea2-302362584719d96d5b953e05",
          "alias": "单女白浴袍竹林躺",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in elegant Hanfu lies on a pebble-paved ground. She wears a white lining and a pink sheer robe over it, with wide, flowing cuffs. The pink and white interwoven sleeves are tied with delicate bows, and a light green ribbon is tied at the waist. The skirt is gently lifted, revealing fabric embroidered with intricate patterns. The overall outfit is soft in color and distinct in layers. Full of classical charm, her left hand gently supports the flower wreath, while her right hand naturally stretches out at her side, her posture relaxed and elegant. Beside her lies a finely woven bamboo basket, filled with pink and white flowers. The petals are delicate and delicate, with layers of petals exuding a faint fragrance. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting dappled light and shadow, creating a pattern of interwoven light and shadow, reflecting the texture of the ground and the outlines of the petals. A few pink petals scatter on the floor, gently swaying in the wind, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The shot is shot from a top-down angle, with the figure positioned slightly below the center. The composition is full and layered, with clear details. The center features her body and clothing, while the background features an extended stone path and faint tree shadows. The light transitions into the distance, forming a smooth visual path. The light is soft and bright, presenting a warm golden tone, while the shadowed areas appear deep and natural. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, romantic, and poetic, as if a scene from an ancient painting. It also resembles the beautiful moments casually captured by modern people using their phones or cameras, full of a strong sense of daily life and vitality. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and the fresh scent of flowers permeates the air. The entire scene is filled with the breath of spring and youthful vitality, inspiring longing and wanting to step into this painting and experience this peace and beauty together with her",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
