        {
          "id": "krea2-e22938c89139c190ec1a80ec",
          "alias": "单女短裙困倦站立出神",
          "prompt": "She wears a flowing Hanfu that shifts from pink to light blue, with lightweight and transparent fabric, layered in layers. The cuffs and skirt hem are embroidered with exquisite phoenix patterns, outlined with silver threads that glow faintly, and the dress is adorned with tiny sequins. Under the sunlight, it shimmers with a rainbow-like glow. Her right hand gently holds a slender branch covered in purple flowers. The blossoms are delicate and dripping, the stems slender and natural. Her left hand gently caresses the hem of her skirt, her posture elegant and composed, her body slightly tilted, head slightly lowered, as if lost in thought or waiting for something. The foreground is a close-up of the woman's half-body body, occupying the main position. The background is a shimmering lake surface, reflecting the blue sky and the golden sunlight, forming large bokeh-like light spots that create a dreamy bokeh effect. In the distance, a blurred rock outline can be faintly seen. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds: the figure is positioned on the right side of the painting, leaving space on the left to showcase a wide lake view. At the same time, the contrast between solid and void highlights the subject. The background blur is well handled to make the figure stand out even more. The light comes from the upper left, providing soft natural daylight, warm lighting at dawn or dusk. The entire scene is enveloped in a warm yet hazy halo, with rich layers of light and shadow. The edges of clothing are clearly outlined by light, while the shadowed areas transition softly to create a sense of three-dimensionality. The main colors are pink, blue, and white, complemented by golden accents, creating a harmonious unity. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, beautiful, and poetic, infused with a strong flavor of Eastern classical aesthetics. It resembles a meticulously painted ancient lady or an artistic portrait in modern photography, combining traditional charm with contemporary aesthetics, with a delicate texture in the image. The background is completely blurred, presenting an oil painting-like texture, while preserving the details and textures of the real environment. Overall, it presents a surreal romantic style—both real and dreamy, evoking the ancient poetic scene of \"clouds imagining clothes, flowers imagining beauty.\" The image contains no unnecessary decorations, focusing on the emotional expression of the characters and the details of the clothing. The composition is simple yet layered, with subtle light and shadow changes. The color coordination is meticulously crafted, creating a tranquil, ethereal, and beautiful atmosphere, as if time has stopped at this moment, leaving only this captivating painting.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
