        {
          "id": "krea2-57d0d2292255db73e8bad667",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙摄影棚沉思站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman sat outdoors on the sand, wearing a white lace spaghetti strap dress with a light and flowing hem, delicate lace trim, and cutout designs at the neckline and shoulder straps revealing collarbones and shoulder lines. The overall look was elegant and layered, naturally draped over her shoulders, adding a touch of movement and liveliness. Her makeup was exquisite, her expression calm and slightly contemplative, and she wore a pair of silver bow earrings with slender chains As her head slightly turns, she flickers with a faint light. Her body turns slightly, one hand gently supporting her skirt, her posture natural and relaxed. The background is a blurry forest and a winding path. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, forming soft patches of light. The light is warm and gentle, presenting a golden tone at dusk. Light and shadow create a transition of light and shadow on the figures: highlights are bright and transparent, shadows delicately gradient, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main position, and the perspective slightly tilted downward. It highlights the contours and temperament of the characters, with well-handled background blur to make the subject stand out. The overall color scheme is mainly white, beige, brown, and green, accented with red flowers, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The image has a strong artistic and cinematic feel, resembling a professional studio outdoor photo. Captured using a large-aperture lens, focal length of 85mm, ISO 100, shutter speed of 1/200 second, full-frame mirrorless camera paired with a standard portrait lens, handheld shooting, slight shake for a realistic feel. At the same time, it preserves the clarity of details. Natural bokeh halos appear at the edges of the frame, distant tree outlines are hazy, and nearby sandy textures are clearly visible. The direction of light and shadow comes from the rear diagonally, creating a backlighting effect. The outlines are sharp, and the overall atmosphere is tranquil and romantic, full of poetry, like a frozen afternoon moment, evoking a sense of gentleness and beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
