        {
          "id": "krea2-82acad32d8399ac79ab9aa25",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣街道忧伤站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside a metal pillar on a city street, slightly turning her head out from between two thick gray metal pillars, forming a natural frame composition that looks natural and casual. She wears a warm brown knit sweater with delicate woven details on the shoulders. The material appears soft and thick, looking directly into the camera with a faint melancholy and contemplation, as if waiting for something or recalling something. In the foreground are two thick metal pillars, their surfaces slightly worn and marked by stickers. One of the pillars still bears blurry advertising fragments, presenting a mottled texture that enhances the image's realism and sense of life. The middle ground features a female subject, her silhouette outlined by soft warm light, which shines from the side. The background is a blurred city streetscape, where you can see distant building silhouettes, blurred traffic signs, and faint vehicle outlines. The overall tone is cool, mainly blue-gray, forming a sharp contrast with the warm yellow in the foreground, creating a visual tension where warmth and cool intertwine. The composition uses a center-shifted third-division method, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, leaving ample space on the left side, highlighting the framing of columns and the depth of the street. The shallow depth of field effect focuses on the subject, with the background completely blurred, enhancing the subject's presence. This extends to her environment, creating a soft and warm glow unique to dusk. Sunlight casts long shadows, filling the entire scene with a sense of tranquility, loneliness, and a touch of poetic everyday life. It's as if an old portable camera was accidentally captured on the street, with slight graininess and color shifts that simulate the texture of real shooting. The overall image presents a retro cinematic vibe, with slightly overexposed tones but still detail, and slight vignetting at the edges to enhance immersion and storytelling, like a private diary from a corner of the city, recording extraordinary emotions in ordinary moments",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
