        {
          "id": "krea2-6d7a92ab50bb2f7b0e80f147",
          "alias": "单女红背带裤公园严肃站立泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman stands amid the lush greenery of an outdoor park, wearing red overalls paired with a white inner layer. Her right hand holds a transparent plastic bottle high, its mouth pointing upward and spraying fine droplets that form crystal-clear mist trails in the sunlight. The droplets trace graceful arcs in the air, some of which shimmer faintly under the light, like scattered diamond beads. Her left hand on hips, body slightly tilted, her posture natural relaxed and full of youthful energy, The foreground features a clear main figure and splashing water; the middle is a blurred green bush and mottled light and shadow; the background is a richly layered deep green forest with lush branches and leaves, naturally transitioning between solid and void to create a sense of depth. The composition uses the center-right position of the figure, leaving the left side blank to highlight the dynamic water splash trajectory. At the same time, the character's hand gesture guides the gaze upward to create a visual focal point. The light is soft natural daylight, shining from an upward angle, clearly showing the folds of the clothing. The water droplets appear semi-transparent under the backlight The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and fresh, carrying a warm summer vibe. The main colors are red, green, and white. The overall image has a film-like texture, with slight graininess and color shifts enhancing realism. The lens uses a mid-length prime lens, with a shallow depth of field effect that highlights the subject and a soft background blur, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. It preserves natural exposure and color temperature, with slightly dark corners at the edges to enhance the nostalgic atmosphere. The fleeting capture of water splashes creates a dynamic beauty, while slow-open shooting creates a hazy effect like water droplets. The overall composition is balanced, the emotional expression is sincere, conveying freedom, joy, childlike fun, and the vitality of summer. The atmosphere is relaxed and joyful, like a frozen childhood memory, rich in detail and distinct layers, combining the casual feeling of daily life with the aesthetic conception of artistic photography",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
          "last_used": null,
