        {
          "id": "krea2-f81c3170702337780ca79477",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套海滩沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the beach, wearing black sunglasses casually perched above her head. Her expression is natural yet tinged with a hint of laziness and calm. She wears a light blue lightweight outdoor jacket with a slight reflective texture. The zipper details are clearly visible, and the collar lining is lined with white pleats, adding a touch of softness. Her posture is relaxed, her body slightly turned to the side, and her hands hang naturally at her sides. The overall composition centers on the figure, occupying the right central position of the composition to form a visual focal point, with delicate grain grains in the foreground. Some areas are illuminated by sunlight, creating a granular texture. In the middle is a beige van parked on the beach, its body somewhat aged. The windows reflect blurred images of the surroundings. Next to the car is a vintage-style stall or mobile kiosk with the word \"CALIFORNIA\" and palm tree patterns, with slight wear on the surface. The colors are mottled but full of life. The background is a dense green forest with rich layered leaves, and the shallow depth of field creates a soft bokeh effect. Sunlight pours in from above, creating a warm and soft glow, typical of afternoon daylight, creating a peaceful yet slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm and cool, with a light blue jacket harmoniously matched with the warm yellow beach and green vegetation. The composition uses a three-part layout: the figure is positioned on the right one-third of the time, with the gaze facing left. The vehicles and stalls in the background create visual balance, enhancing the realism of the scene. The photography style resembles everyday handheld camera shooting. With a slight film graininess and natural exposure control, it feels like a casual moment captured during a trip. The lens uses an 85mm prime portrait lens with a large aperture to blur the background and highlight the subject. The overall atmosphere is both lively and artistically beautiful, like a quiet moment in a youth movie, capturing the simple and beautiful poetry of daily life by the summer beach",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
