        {
          "id": "krea2-c9cb80e7cf61bb594db20fb6",
          "alias": "单女兔女郎黑制服摄影棚媚态站立持杯",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a black shiny bunny girl uniform stands gracefully and confidently against a pure white background, wearing a pair of exquisite fine-rimmed glasses. She wears a tight black patent leather bodysuit with a low neckline and pleated details on the chest, paired with a short black blazer with white flanged cuffs. A black bow is tied at the neckline, creating a striking visual contrast. She wears black stockings on the lower body, with long, straight legs. Her right leg is raised at a 45-degree angle, and she wears a pair of high-heeled patent leather pointed shoes. The slender heels reflect soft light. Her left hand steadily holds a silver metal tray, on which sits a bottle of deep green glass champagne with a red label attached. The bottle mouth is sealed with silver foil, and next to it is a transparent martini wine glass. The glass is slender and full-bodied, and the overall composition was shot with a mid-shot portrait. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with the body slightly turned and the head turned toward the camera, creating a strong visual guidance. The middle ground features the torso and legs, while the background is a large area of pure white without any distractions, highlighting the subject. The composition uses the character's diagonal posture and the palette's horizontal line to create a diagonal balance, creating an atmosphere that is both formal and seductive. The light and shadows come from the front left-leaning soft light, with uniform and soft lighting without obvious shadows, highlighting the texture of the material, such as the reflection of the patent leather. The semi-transparent silk stockings and the cool sheen of the metal tray are dominated by black and white, accented with a touch of red and green. The color contrasts are strong yet harmonious, creating an atmosphere that combines the professionalism of fashion photography with a touch of drama and performance, as if capturing a moment from a high-end party or private banquet. The image texture is delicate, the resolution is extremely high, and the details are rich, presenting a refined and realistic feel reminiscent of high-end commercial advertising, while retaining the natural spontaneity of everyday amateur equipment shooting. For example, in a makeshift studio setting, professional photographers hold cameras to capture the shots, emphasizing realistic lighting and natural, fluid movements. The entire scene is full of storytelling, inviting imagination about the identity and context behind this bunny girl",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
