        {
          "id": "krea2-867b7b4cc8813c35f42e30f9",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣害羞持相机",
          "prompt": "A close-up of a woman's half-length reveals a calm yet slightly shy expression. She wears a pink knit sweater with delicate ribbed designs at the collar and cuffs. The material is soft and fluffy, presenting a warm and comfortable texture. Her right hand gently holds an orange-red maple leaf, its edges slightly curled, the color gradient from deep red at the center to orange-yellow at the edges. The veins are clearly visible, as if in a silent dialogue with nature. The background is a blurred outdoor scene, with faint green tree branches and leaves on the left. On the right is an orange-red architectural wall with a rough texture bearing traces of time. The sky is a clear blue, and sunlight pours down from the upper left of the frame, creating a strong backlight effect, producing soft halos and starlight, creating a dreamlike atmosphere of light and shadow. The entire composition uses a shallow depth of field, with the background completely blurred to highlight the main subject's outline and details. The camera is shot with medium telephoto to make the proportions more harmonious, returning to the overall emotional expression. The colors are mainly warm tones, including pink, orange, Yellow and blue form a contrasting yet harmonious pairing, with rich layers of light and shadow. Highlights are bright and transparent, while shadows transition naturally, presenting an overall warm, healing, and poetic autumn atmosphere. The images have the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and color shifts, simulating the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. It feels like recording the most beautiful moment of a sunny afternoon, full of realism without excessive retouching, like a casual snapshot of daily life. Yet it is filled with artistic beauty and emotional warmth",
