        {
          "id": "krea2-50774745a91ed3063dbbb78d",
          "alias": "单女白手套舞台冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "She crosses her arms over her chest, exuding elegance and power. Her hands wear white tactical gloves with black wrist guards and metal fastener details. The costume design is highly tech-savvy, with a dark gray sleeveless bodysuit on the upper body. The shoulders and chest feature white armor structures and silver decorative lines, and a wide white belt with a circular badge pattern at the waist. Wearing long legs wrapped in black stockings, sitting cross-legged on a high-performance sports motorcycle. The motorcycle features a black and gray main color scheme, with the \"CFMOTO\" brand logo printed on the body. The body lines are smooth and muscular, the fuel tank is decorated with red stripes, the seat is made of black leather, and the rear seat has a black rear spoiler. The wheels use red hubs with a clearly visible chain, and the tires are high-performance racing tires, presenting a strong sense of mechanical aesthetics and speed. The background is a solid gradient deep gray-blue tone. It creates a clean and sophisticated visual space, with light streaming diagonally from the upper left, creating a soft contrast of light and shadow that highlights the main subject and the motorcycle's outline. The layers of light and shadow are rich, the atmosphere is cold and mysterious, and the composition uses a low-angle downward view to emphasize the character's aura and the motorcycle's fierce momentum. The focus is at the intersection of the figure and motorcycle, with the front of the motorcycle and its wheels occupying the lower part of the frame, the middle ground showing the main subjects of the person and motorcycle, and the background kept clean and crisp to avoid distracting the visual focus. The overall visuals have a strong visual impact and modern feel, as if stepping out of a sci-fi movie. It combines artistic beauty with refined industrial design details. The colors are mainly cool tones, with a touch of red accented as visual highlights to enhance the layering and dynamism of the image. The photography style resembles professional studio shoots, using soft lights and fill lighting equipment to create a uniform and textured lighting effect, simulating high-end commercial advertisements or fashion blockbuster shooting techniques. The image texture is delicate, details are clear, and the characters' expressions are natural, with smooth movements. It conveys a calm, independent, and powerful female image; the entire scene feels like a frozen moment, capturing the perfect fusion of speed and beauty, exuding a strong atmosphere of cyberpunk and futurism",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
