        {
          "id": "krea2-4cb458c9c021aa8ad8b277ae",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫小径微笑持相机",
          "prompt": "With a playful and gentle smile, she tilted her head slightly toward the camera, holding a smooth, soft-colored pink iced donut in her left hand. The donut's ring shape was clearly visible, with slightly moist and reflective edges, presenting a freshly baked texture. She wore a deep blue long-sleeved shirt with a Peter Pan collar, delicate fabric, slight pleats at the cuffs, naturally draping. She wore a pair of exquisite earrings, with a small red heart-shaped pendant that echoed the donut's color. The background is a blurry city streetscape, with green plants and building silhouettes visible in the distance. A red and blue traffic light is faintly visible but completely blurred, creating a bokeh effect. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, the donut positioned in the upper left, forming a visual focal point. The shallow depth of field highlights the subject, while the background is completely blurred, creating a strong sense of layering. Light comes from the right, representing the warm afternoon sunshine, creating a natural transition between light and dark, with delicate shadows. The overall color scheme mainly features warm and cool contrasts. The deep blue of the characters' clothing contrasts sharply with the pink of the donut. The greenery and gray-white buildings in the background bring a fresh urban atmosphere. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is peaceful and warm, as if capturing a moment full of sweetness and joy in everyday life. The image has the texture of film photography, with moderate color saturation and a slight retro filter effect. The graininess is slight, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting. The composition cleverly uses the donut as a visual guide, returning to her expression. This creates a closed-loop visual path, conveying a relaxed, sweet, and healing everyday aesthetic, as if recording the most genuine joyful moments on an ordinary afternoon",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
