        {
          "id": "krea2-c9786d6c54cd0ad8af46dc93",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙城市微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a light pink lace dress with elegant floral patterns. The neckline and cuffs are adorned with delicate lace trim. The short-sleeved sleeve pairs with a fluffy A-line skirt, with lace accents along the edges. The overall style is sweet and gentle. She stands gracefully sideways, her left hand gently resting on the smooth metal railing, her body slightly leaning forward, head tilted back. With a hint of playfulness and gentle smile, it seems to whisper softly or respond with a smile. The middle is the white steel structure frame of the overpass, composed of multiple intersecting metal beams forming complex geometric lines. Some metal surfaces show slight rust, adding a touch of industrial texture and signs of time. The railings are made of silver stainless steel, smooth and reflective, reflecting the surrounding light and shadow. The background is a blurred urban building, with high-rise residential buildings visible in the distance. The glass curtain walls shimmer with a cold blue-gray hue in the sunlight, contrasting with the soft tones in the foreground. The sky appears a faint blue, mixed with a few white clouds. Light pours down from the upper right, creating a soft natural lighting effect. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the metal structure, casting fine shadows on the ground and the figures, creating rich layers of light and shadow. The overall composition uses a low-angle downward view, highlighting the figure's slender figure and elegant posture. At the same time, the structural lines of the overpass extend upward, enhancing the sense of space and depth in the image. The figures are positioned slightly to the left, leaving space on the right to display the background buildings and sky, creating visual balance. Then, the lines of the metal structure extend outward, ultimately focusing on the entire urban environment. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and bright, presenting a realistic everyday afternoon, as if casually captured with a regular camera. It carries a slight film graininess and moderately saturated color tones, giving the overall image an innocent and romantic atmosphere. It also incorporates the modern urban atmosphere, creating an artistic beauty that is both dreamy and close to everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
