        {
          "id": "krea2-28a38afb4923d6b67160dbff",
          "alias": "单女白T恤高塔愤怒站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the river on Shanghai's Bund, wearing a white camisole and blue jeans, carrying a plush backpack made of beige and pink patchwork. The shoulder straps are brown leather, her right hand gently pulls the strap, while her left hand hangs naturally. She leans slightly to the camera, carrying a touch of playfulness and tenderness. Iconic buildings like the Oriental Pearl Tower, Shanghai Tower, and Jin Mao Tower appear faintly in the mist, while the sky appears in a gray-blue twilight tone The river surface is as calm as a mirror, reflecting the city's outline and the shadows of the bridges. A steel-framed bridge spans the river, with faint pedestrians and vehicles on the bridge. On the right bank is a blue-and-white sightseeing boat, with stepped piers and railings along the shore, and distant green trees dotting the area. The overall composition uses a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the right, occupying about one-third of the space. The high-rise buildings in the background create a strong sense of depth, extending along her line of sight to the distant building clusters, with soft light and shadow. The faint evening light evenly illuminates the figures, with no obvious shadows, creating a tranquil yet slightly hazy urban atmosphere. The images have a documentary feel of everyday life, as if captured with a real phone. The colors are mainly cool, with white, blue, and gray dominating, accented by beige and pink clothing for a warm contrast. The overall texture is delicate and detailed, combining urban modernity with the sweet youthful vibe. The edges of the frame have slight vignetting. Simulating real camera lens effects enhances immersion. The architectural details in the distant view are clearly visible but not glaring, following the perspective rules of human observation. The water surface reflects naturally and smoothly, with delicate ripples, presenting a quiet, authentic, and vibrant urban portrait style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
