        {
          "id": "krea2-b1eee1dae869ba8c85d9af98",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣困倦持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman as the subject of the image creates a natural and casual aesthetic. Looking directly at the camera, she carries a touch of gentleness and calm, holding a golden ginkgo leaf in her hand, as if savoring the breath of autumn. She wears an off-white knit sweater with clearly visible texture and slightly rolled cuffs, presenting a comfortable and casual sense of life, forming a visual focal point. The background is a blurry autumn park scene, where sunlight filters through the leaves casting dappled light and shadows, which appear warm in the light. In the distance, faint trees and paths can be seen, but these are blurred to highlight the main subject. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The shallow depth of field effect blurs the background, enhancing the sense of space and layering. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and warm, with golden sunlight shining from the sides and backlights, creating a backlighting effect that casts a soft halo around the edges of the figures. Light passes through the leaves to create a Tyndall effect, forming beams of light that enhance the dreamy feel. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and brown. It creates a quiet and warm autumn afternoon atmosphere, with images rich in artistry and emotional expression, as if capturing a poetic moment, like shooting with an old film camera, with slight graininess and slightly lower color saturation, simulating the temperature and nostalgia of real photography. The details are rich while retaining natural blurred transitions, giving the entire image both depth and authenticity",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
