        {
          "id": "krea2-be76261315f87077938f407f",
          "alias": "单女蓝连帽衫街道俏皮坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the middle of a city street, wearing a light blue hoodie and loose pants in matching tones, wearing off-white sneakers. Her body leans slightly forward, her legs crossed and curled in front of her, presenting a relaxed yet slightly playful sitting posture. The overall look is simple and comfortable, with a youthful vibe. The figure is positioned slightly below the center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The foreground is a dark gray asphalt pavement. On the road, clear tree shadows dapple through, sunlight streaming through the dense canopy, creating a dynamic effect of light and shadow. Leaves sway gently in the breeze, casting ever-changing shadows and creating a dynamic rhythm of light and shadow. In the middle are vehicles parked on both sides, including white sedans, silver SUVs, and black vans. These vehicles are neatly arranged but slightly staggered, with some bodies reflecting soft light. The background is a tree-lined avenue extending into the distance, flanked by tall trees with lush branches and leaves, forming a natural green arcade. The trunk is thick, the bark texture is clearly visible, and the distant road gradually disappears at the edge of the view, creating a strong sense of perspective and spatial depth. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the character as the visual core. The road lines guide the gaze deeper into the scene, enhancing the sense of layering and depth in the image. At the same time, low-angle shooting angles are used to make the subjects stand out even more. The sky is blocked by the canopy, with only a faint pale blue visible through the gaps. The overall atmosphere is bright and warm, with sunlight streaming through the leaves, forming mottled patches of light. The contrast between light and shadow is strong, with both bright highlights and deep shadows, creating a tranquil, peaceful, and poetic afternoon atmosphere. The image tones are mainly natural green and gray-blue, accented by warm yellow sunlight, creating a harmonious and unified color that is full of everyday life. The overall style leans toward everyday documentary photography, with a slight film texture, slight soft focus at the edges, and realistic graininess in the details, as if shot with an old-fashioned film camera. The lens is slightly out of focus, creating a hazy yet realistic visual experience The background is rendered with natural blur, highlighting the main characters while maintaining the completeness of environmental information. The entire scene is filled with urban greenery and tranquility, allowing people to experience rare leisurely moments in city life. The air seems to be filled with a faint fragrance of grass and trees, the sunlight is warm but not harsh, tree shadows sway, a gentle breeze blows—everything appears peaceful and beautiful. This everyday yet extraordinary scene evokes people's longing and resonance for a simple life. The images convey a gentle, healing, and slightly artistic emotional tone. It makes one stop and gaze, immersed in this tranquil moment belonging to a corner of the city",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
