        {
          "id": "krea2-24f958b2c848d4672e567143",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands under the sunlight on a city street, wearing a black coat and an off-white scarf, leaning slightly to the railing. Her posture is natural and relaxed, hands tucked into her coat pockets, exuding a quiet yet slightly detached aura. Her expression carries a hint of melancholy and contemplation. The overall atmosphere is serene and full of storytelling. The foreground clearly shows the female protagonist, the middle of which features street-side shops with green awnings and some blurred signs and signs, surrounded by lush greenery. The leaves in the sunlight present rich layers of light and shadow. The background is a typical Japanese street scene, with wooden building exteriors and neatly arranged windows. In the distance, blue billboards and some blurred urban elements can be seen. The composition combines close-up of people with mid-to-far environments, with the figures positioned slightly to the right of the frame, creating an asymmetrical yet balanced visual layout. Diagonal light and shadow lines and shadows are cast onto the ground and walls, enhancing the sense of depth and three-dimensionality in the space. The light comes from the upper left. It creates soft highlights and delicate shadow transitions, creating a tranquil atmosphere like a winter afternoon or early spring morning. The colors are mainly black, white, and off-white, accented with green plants and blue and brown backgrounds. The overall tone is cool but adjusted by warm light, creating a contrast of warmth and highlighting the characters' warmth. The image has the texture of film photography, with obvious graininess, moderate color saturation, rich details, and natural light and shadow transitions, as if captured with an old camera. It captures an ordinary yet touching moment of urban life, with the entire scene filled with the atmosphere of life and cultural warmth, evoking a gentle yet lonely beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
