        {
          "id": "krea2-8c71d047e34fddb62020fc0a",
          "alias": "单女黑长裤公寓沉思站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways, gracefully leaning against a beige wall with mottled patterns. She wears a white sleeveless cropped top and black high-waisted skinny pants, draped over her shoulders with a lightweight white sheer shawl that naturally drapes to one side of her body, edged with delicate lace patterns. The overall composition centers on the figure, using a medium perspective that occupies most of the frame and the body is slightly tilted, forming graceful curved lines. The background is a rough-textured wall with irregular white peeling marks and fine cracks, creating a retro and slightly weathered atmosphere. Light softly enters from the left side of the painting, creating a natural transition between light and shadow. The right side of the figure is illuminated, while the shadowed areas appear deep and layered. The contrast between light and shadow is strong but not overly harsh. The overall color tone leans warm, mainly in beige, white, and black, creating a warm and sophisticated visual experience. The composition emphasizes balance and symmetry. The background texture and colors contrast with the characters' simple clothing, highlighting the subject. The entire scene feels as if shot in a private indoor space, possibly an old apartment or an art studio. The wooden floor texture and local reflections on the floor suggest a sense of realism. The image presents the texture of everyday amateur equipment, as if shot with a medium format camera or a high-end mirrorless camera in low-light conditions, using a large-aperture lens to produce soft bokeh effects The background is slightly blurred, enhancing the subject's prominence. The overall atmosphere is both fashionable and retains a sense of life, like a carefully arranged personal portrait while retaining a natural, casual momentary beauty. There are no unnecessary decorations or distractions; all visual focus is on the person themselves, emphasizing their temperament and expression. The composition uses vertical lines on the wall and the curves of the figure's body to create contrast, adding geometric beauty to the composition. The use of light and shadow fills the entire scene with warmth and emotion. It seems to evoke the tranquility and contemplation of that moment, with an overall style leaning toward the elegance and confidence of modern urban women, combining artistry with authenticity",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
