        {
          "id": "krea2-264ca50487997542a91a7b3c",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市微笑跪展示",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on an orange-red carpet, wearing a black sleeveless tight dress and black stockings, wearing glasses and smiling as she looks back at the camera. Her left hand gently strokes her waist, and her right hand rests naturally on her knee, her posture elegant and confident. A white work badge hangs on her chest and a white wristband on her wrist, showcasing a blend of professionalism and fashion. She is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. In the foreground, scattered open magazines and a black filing board with folders suggest scenes of work or creative scenes. The background features modern industrial-style metal hollowed-out railings and brick wall structures. The gray metallic texture contrasts with the warm-toned floor, creating the atmosphere of an urban office space. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the characters occupying the main part of the frame. Low-angle shots enhance the character's three-dimensionality and presence, then move upward to the architectural details in the background. Light and shadow come from natural daylight, softly and evenly cast on the figures, while clear shadows are cast on the floor and railings to enhance the sense of spatial layering. The overall atmosphere combines everyday realism with artistic beauty, as if shot outdoors under natural light with a professional camera, capturing a moment full of storytelling. The colors are mainly black, gray, and orange, with sharp contrasts of warm and cool tones, rich details, and delicate texture. It presents a scene of urban life that is both authentic and slightly dramatic, like an employee of a creative company posing during a break at work. It combines workplace rigor with personal charm, with a stable yet dynamic composition and natural light and shadow transitions. Overall, it presents a high-level photographic feel, like a professional photographer shooting at the softest moment of morning or afternoon sunlight with a medium format camera paired with a large-aperture lens, capturing moments full of narrative and emotional impact. The images are rich in detail, with metal railings and holes in the background arranged in an orderly manner, forming regular geometric patterns that contrast with the curves of the figures, enhancing the visual rhythm of the image. The entire scene seems to take place on the outdoor platform or lounge of a modern office building. It combines the openness of public spaces with the privacy of personal expression, creating a unique atmosphere that lies between formality and casualness. It evokes the self-expression of contemporary people in the workplace and their subtle state of balancing work and life. There are no unnecessary decorations in the painting; all elements serve the theme of expression, forming a portrait full of contemporary urban atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
