        {
          "id": "krea2-da897dba2ae057336c926a8b",
          "alias": "单女红T恤街道微笑站立张开双腿",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor wooden boardwalk, her expression playful and confident. Her right hand is raised in a gesture of waving or greeting, while her left hand hangs naturally, her body slightly tilted, legs spread in a steady posture, exuding youthful energy and a sense of fashion. She wears a red V-neck sports tank top with a Minnie cartoon print and the words \"KEEP YOUR SMILE ON\" on the chest, layered with a blue lightweight sun-protective jacket that reveals the inner layer. She wears a high-waisted denim mini skirt with ruffled hems. A light purple ribbon is tied around the waist, and on his feet are white platform sneakers paired with blue-and-white striped socks. The overall look is full of vibe and street fashion. The composition uses a high-angle overhead view, with the figure occupying the left central position. The composition is dynamic tension, with a dark brown wooden walkway extending into the distance in the background. The wooden plank grain is clearly visible, and sunlight pours in from the upper right, casting long tree shadows and the silhouettes of the figures on the ground. The strong contrast of light and shadow creates a warm and layered visual effect. In the distance, faint trees and fences can be faintly seen. The environment is clean and tidy, the atmosphere relaxed and pleasant, with soft and bright lighting, presenting a warm and tranquil autumn afternoon. The overall color palette is mainly blue, red, and brown, with harmonious and vibrant color combinations. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a professional camera in natural light. The details are rich, the wrinkles on the clothes are clear, and the small decorations on the shoes are also clearly visible. The image has a strong sense of daily life and life, while also possessing artistic beauty. Like a carefully composed street photo, it captures moments brimming with youth, full of storytelling and emotional impact",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
