        {
          "id": "krea2-7d0c1bf7a33068757d1f9a0c",
          "alias": "单女粉袜子床冷淡躺",
          "prompt": "A woman lies on her back on a bedsheet covered with black and white abstract floral patterns, legs raised high and stretched toward the top of the frame. She wears white platform sneakers with shiny decorations and black lettering on the uppers, paired with blue, white, and pink striped long socks. Her legs are long and smooth. She wears a short-sleeved shirt with vertical stripes in black and white, tied with a dark brown bow at the collar, and a deep blue pleated skirt. The background is a somewhat messy indoor space. Behind it is a metal shelf stacked with various cardboard boxes, storage boxes, and clothing. Among them are shoeboxes and red folders printed with the word \"STARTER.\" On the left hangs white lace-trimmed clothing, creating a lived-in and everyday atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, placing the figure slightly below the center of the frame, with legs extending upward to form a strong visual guiding line, creating an intimate and relaxed atmosphere. Light comes from the front side, softly illuminating the subject and creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The subtle shadows highlight the character's outline and detailed texture. The overall color scheme is mainly neutral and cool, accented with fresh colors like white, blue, and pink, creating a strong atmosphere. It seems to capture a private and authentic moment at home, full of vibrant life and youthful energy. The image presents a realistic feel reminiscent of amateur camera shooting, retaining slight noise and imperfect light and shadow transitions, enhancing the scene's authenticity and intimacy while maintaining artistic beauty. The composition is full but not crowded, with rich elements yet clear layering, using a low-angle angle to enhance the beauty of body lines, creating a casual yet carefully designed everyday aesthetic. The overall style blends youthful, fashionable, and everyday elements, presenting a relaxed, individualistic way of expressing oneself",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
