        {
          "id": "krea2-fd434a9c04854e940f09da98",
          "alias": "单女全裸短裙公寓困倦跪",
          "prompt": "Her slightly parted teeth reveal white, neat teeth. Her overall aura is sweet with a hint of playfulness. She wears a sporty pink and white outfit. The top is sleeveless, fitted, with a zipper and V-neck cut, accentuating her graceful collarbones and bust curve. The bottom is a high-waisted short skirt with an A-shaped hem trim trimmed with white trim, paired with semi-transparent nude stockings. Kneeling with legs together on a beige plush carpet, hands naturally placed behind one's back, body slightly leaning forward, posture elegant and relaxed. The foreground features the floor texture details, with fine woven patterns and slight wear marks on the carpet's surface, presenting a lifelike texture. The middle ground is the main subject, occupying the center of the composition. The composition adopts a slightly top-down perspective, making the figure more approachable and visually appealing. On the left side of the background is a corner of green circular upholstered furniture, made of soft and glossy, On the right is a large flat-screen TV displaying blurry color images. Behind it is a potted green plant placed in a black flowerpot, with broad, lush leaves that add a natural touch. The wall behind the TV is illuminated by purple LED strips, creating a soft gradient light effect. Light projects from above and from the sides and rear, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The main light source comes from the front slightly left, with soft shadow transitions that highlight depth. The purple light in the background intertwines with warm-toned lighting, creating a contrast of cool and warm tones and enhancing visual layering. The overall color scheme is mainly pink and white, accented with purple, green, and wood tones, creating a harmonious unity with a stable and balanced composition, focusing on the subject. The background elements are moderately blurred, enriching the sense of space without overpowering the main focus. The light and shadow distribution are delicate, with natural transitions between light and shadow, creating a private, warm, and slightly modern tech home atmosphere. It feels like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera paired with a softbox, while preserving the authentic and natural details and warmth of daily life. It offers a strong artistic appeal and an immersive viewing experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
