        {
          "id": "krea2-636e5526b797d4eab9c49f3a",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道冷淡站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands slightly to the right of the center of the frame, wearing a black cropped leather jacket and black skinny pants, paired with a black inner top and black cycling gloves. She wears a gray baseball cap with patterns, sunglasses tucked under the brim, her makeup exquisite, posture confident and composed, hands tucked into a black tactical satchel at her waist, body slightly turned, showing off her slender figure and smooth lines. The overall look exudes a cool and fashionable vibe. Behind her is a red high-performance motorcycle with smooth lines and wide wheels The exhaust pipe is thick, presenting a strong sense of sportiness and power. The background is a modern architectural wall, with a light gray concrete structure that is simple yet stern. In front of the wall is a green lawn, adding a touch of vitality to the scene. The ground is a dark gray asphalt pavement with white markings along the edges. The entire scene is set in an open outdoor area, with a cloudy gray-white sky. The lighting is soft and even, with no obvious shadows, creating a calm and restrained atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait photography style. The figures occupy the main positions in the composition, with motorcycles in the background serving as visual backdrop, forming a layered relationship between front and back. The foreground highlights the main subject, the middle view shows the motorcycle and parts of the environment, while the background is composed of buildings and lawns. The perspective is level with a slight downward angle, making the figure appear more upright. This extends further to distant buildings and the sky, forming a clear visual flow. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, with the overall tone leaning toward a cool tone, mainly black, white, and gray. The red motorcycle becomes the most striking color accent in the composition, creating a strong visual contrast. The atmosphere is calm and full of tension, like everyday moments shot on a street. It feels realistic and full of life, while maintaining an artistic aesthetic. The image texture is delicate and detailed, presenting an urban motorcycle style that combines fashion, speed, and personality. It feels like real photos taken outdoors on cloudy days with a professional camera, offering high realism and immersion, capturing the modern urban youth's pursuit of freedom and passion.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
