          "id": "krea2-a201d9b04bc7d1cc85ea3ec0",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫竹林坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright in the center of a Japanese-style tatami room, wearing a white long-sleeved shirt with vertical stripes paired with a dark gray knit vest and a matching pleated short skirt. She wears gray tight pants, sits cross-legged, hands naturally folded on her knees, and poses gracefully and calmly. She wears fine-framed glasses, exuding a gentle and intellectual aura, like a modern apprentice immersed in a tranquil atmosphere. In the foreground is a pale yellow tatami mat covering the entire frame, with clear and delicate texture and gold webbing decorations along the edges. It presents the rustic texture of a traditional Japanese room. The center of the scene centers on the figures. On the left is a low woven rattan tea table with a red ceramic teapot, bamboo tea utensils, and a small pot of green plants. Next to it is a wooden plaque inscribed with calligraphy. On the right is a wooden offering table displaying two Chinese-style vases: one painted with landscape deer patterns, the other a painted porcelain jar. On the offering table is a small blue Buddha statue, and the background wall is light beige. On the wall hangs a finely mounted traditional Chinese Guanyin portrait. The Bodhisattva is draped in a golden kasaya and steps on a lotus flower, appearing compassionate and serene. Surrounded by swirling clouds and mist, the composition is centered and symmetrical. The main figure is at the visual center, forming a strong guiding focal point. A close-up perspective with a slight downward view creates a warm and immersive viewing experience. Light comes from the front left of the painting, with soft and warm natural light streaming in from outside the window, casting soft shadows on the wall and floor. The light and shadow are distinct and the transition between light and shadow is natural. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, off-white, and gray-brown, accented with green plants, creating a tranquil, cozy, and Zen-inspired atmosphere full of Eastern Zen. The image texture is delicate and authentic, like shooting with a professional camera in indoor natural light, offering a high degree of realism and artistic appeal. It features a slight film graininess and soft out-of-focus blur, highlighting the subject while preserving environmental details, presenting a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, as if recording a quiet afternoon. Sitting alone in a traditional space to read or meditate, the overall atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, full of poetry and a sense of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
