        {
          "id": "krea2-6db2cdf4fb7173bd045525c2",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣小径冷淡持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a gray beret made of coarse wool with fine textures, the brim slightly draped down, and the rounded shape fitting the curve of the head. She wears a gray off-shoulder knit sweater made of ribbed knitting, with clear texture, loose sleeves, and an off-shoulder neckline. She revealed one shoulder and collarbone. The sweater was soft and comfortable to the touch. She wore a gray pleated skirt with a naturally draped hem, the pleats even, giving the overall look simple and elegant. She crossed her arms over her chest, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, painted with light pink nail polish, fingertips slightly curved, her posture natural relaxed. The building had arched windows with dark frames, dark inside, and no lighting. The ground is paved with irregular stone paths, with varying shades of stone and surface signs of wear. A small amount of moss grows between the gaps, giving the overall environment an ancient and tranquil feel. The composition centers on the figure, who is positioned slightly to the right of the center, occupying the main part. The background is blurred to highlight the main subject, with light and shadow coming from the front slightly left, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. Soft shadows create a sense of depth. The buildings and ground in the background are in shadow, with blurred details but still legible outlines. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, with a touch of retro romance. The tones are mainly gray-blue, with a sharp contrast of warm and cool tones. The colors in the image are harmonious and unified. The blurred background and use of light and shadow enhance the depth and artistic feel of the image, as if it were a night portrait shot with a professional camera—cinematic and sophisticated, yet still retaining the warmth of everyday life",
