        {
          "id": "krea2-5f3cb4418705f9ec8a4d148b",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙公寓冷淡站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a bright red long-sleeved dress stands before a pristine white wall. She turns sideways and tilts her head up, her right hand gently touching the golden floral tufts hanging from above. She slightly lifts her head to gaze at the sky, her expression focused and serene, as if engaged in a silent dialogue with nature. Her figure is stretched by sunlight, casting clear and soft shadows on the white wall. The silhouette of the shadow perfectly matches her posture, creating a visual echo. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right in the lower middle section. The composition uses a low-angle downward perspective to highlight the elegance of the figures and the lush blooming flowers. In the foreground is a cluster of blooming golden flowers, with dense petals as soft as down, layered above the frame, forming a natural arched frame that envelops the figure. The middle ground shows a woman and a white wall, which is smooth and flat, with subtle textures and subtle shadow changes, enhancing the sense of realism in the space. The background is a pale blue sky, faintly visible through gaps in the flowers, clear and bright, with no clouds. The overall color scheme is fresh and transparent, with light and shadow coming from the slanting sunlight at noon or afternoon. The light is warm and soft, shining down from the upper left and forming natural shadow transitions on the left side and back. The golden hues of the flowers glow faintly under the light, creating a strong color contrast with the red dress. Yet, the unified warm atmosphere harmonizes harmoniously. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow, orange-red, and off-white, accented by a pale blue sky as a cool accent, creating a peaceful, cozy, and poetic autumn afternoon atmosphere. The texture of the painting is delicate. It features the graininess of film photography and a slight overexposure, simulating the everyday feel of amateur camera shooting. The lens has slightly blurred edges and slight color shifts, enhancing realism. The composition is simple yet layered. Visually, the flower clusters above naturally flow toward the subject, then extend to her line of sight, forming an upward movement that encourages viewers to feel the intimate relationship between humans and nature. The overall image conveys a tranquil, healing, and vibrant emotion, like a gentle moment frozen in time. It combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
