        {
          "id": "krea2-806243d1787212895f667d66",
          "alias": "单女绿连衣裙窗边坐持食物",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window, wearing a light green sleeveless cotton-linen dress. Her shoulders are soft, her arms naturally curved, and she holds a brown pine cone. The surface of the pine cone has a clear texture, presenting a natural spiral structure with a natural sheen. The overall aura is pure and serene. On the left side of the foreground is a bouquet of blooming zinnias, with rich colors ranging from pink, orange-red, pale yellow, to white. The petals are layered, with a yellow stamens at the center. The slender stem is arranged in a transparent glass vase. The vase contains clear water, with a clear water level. The vase reflects the surrounding light and shadow. The vase is placed on a wooden windowsill, with natural wood grain and slight wear marks on the windowsill. The middle scene is the wooden window frame, with a warm brown frame and natural wood grain and fine scratches along the edges. The window glass lets in outdoor light, while the background is a blurred outdoor greenery, with dense leaves and branches faintly visible. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled light and shadows, creating soft light spots. The entire composition uses close-up shots. The figure occupies about two-thirds of the right side of the painting, with a bouquet in the lower left corner, creating visual balance and creating a warm, tranquil, and poetic atmosphere. Light comes from outside the left window, soft natural light that presents a warm golden tone. Sunlight passes through the window lattice, creating delicate shadow transitions with rich layers of light and shadow. The light spots in the background and the bouquet in the foreground together create a bokeh effect, enhancing the sense of depth in the composition. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and light green, accented by pink and orange-red floral accents, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The image presents a film-like texture, with slight graininess and soft vignetting, as if captured with an old-fashioned camera. It carries a strong sense of nostalgia and a sense of everyday aesthetics, with a quiet and healing atmosphere, like a tranquil summer afternoon, filled with longing for a better life and a subtle sense of longing",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
