        {
          "id": "krea2-2008a3092a2f6b29e8527df5",
          "alias": "单女旗袍城市神秘坐手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a silver-gray hard-shell suitcase, wearing a tight lace qipao in purple and gold tones. The qipao is covered with delicate floral patterns, with a purple base and gold patterns interwoven to create a luxurious and vintage feel. The skirt slits slightly reveal her long leg lines. The high-waisted design accentuates her slender waist. The shoulders are sleeveless halter style, and the neckline is adorned with a string of pearl necklaces, layered and cascading over her chest, adding elegance and luxury. She wears a string of pale pink bracelets on her wrist, blending Eastern classical charm with modern fashion vibes. She poses gracefully, her right leg bent and raised, wearing transparent high-heeled sandals. Her left leg stretches naturally, her body leans slightly forward, her right hand resting lightly on the edge of the suitcase, and her left hand naturally resting on her knee. Her expression is slightly mysterious and confident, with a blurred indoor space in the background—possibly an airport or station hall—where the walls and ceiling have a cool-toned metallic texture, and in the distance, several round warm lights emit a soft glow. This creates a distinct depth blur effect. The foreground is a smooth gray floor reflecting the outlines of the figure and suitcase, while the middle ground features the main subject and the suitcase. The composition uses low-angle shots to make the figures appear more upright and prominent. The visual guide line consists of the body's curves, leg extensions, and the straight lines of the suitcase, creating strong visual tension. The lighting and shadow atmosphere mainly features a warm and cool contrast, while the background is enveloped in a cool blue-purple tone, creating a tranquil urban nighttime atmosphere. The overall composition carries a strong sense of artistry and storytelling, as if capturing a brief yet elegant moment during a journey—like a carefully curated fashion portrait or a snapshot of everyday beauty. The images are rich in detail, with clear color layers, authentic textures, and a sense of sophistication and narrative",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
