        {
          "id": "krea2-2c0e38aa1dd08b27c1ec4be2",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣森林微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a forest slope covered in autumn leaves, wearing a gray knit dress over a loose gray-black woolen coat. The cuffs and collar reveal a soft lambswool lining. Around her neck is a beige and brown striped scarf, and on her feet are dark brown lace-up Martin boots. With a gentle smile, her right hand gently holds a golden maple leaf, while her left hand stretches out naturally, her posture relaxed and dynamic. The entire scene is filled with autumn tranquility and warmth. In the foreground are layers upon layers of fallen leaves, colored in yellow, Orange and reddish-brown are predominant, with leaves of various shapes, some edges curled for a delicate texture. The ground is covered with a thick layer of fallen leaves. In the middle frame, the female subject sits sideways on the fallen leaves, her body slightly leaning forward, her head slightly tilted to one side, presenting a natural, casual posture. The background is blurred green bushes and dead branches, creating a soft blur effect that highlights the main subject. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, placing the figure at the visual center of the frame, while also shortening the distance to the viewer and enhancing immersion. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right side for the line of sight to extend into the background, creating a good visual balance. The lighting is soft and even, coming from cloudy days or scattered light, without strong shadows, creating a hazy and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and earth tones, paired with gray clothing to create a warm and cool contrast, enhancing the sense of layering in the image. The transition of light and shadow is natural, and the faint glow reflected on leaves adds detail and texture, presenting a beautiful moment from everyday life that is unintentional. It feels like autumn photos captured casually with a regular camera, authentic and full of life atmosphere, with slight film graininess and natural noise, simulating amateur photography effects. The color saturation is moderate, not overly vivid, preserving the original texture. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, full of poetry and nostalgia, allowing one to feel the unique romance and tranquility of autumn",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
