        {
          "id": "krea2-ba77b31ffb08cda6df85ee8c",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫街道困倦坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a city street at night, appearing casual yet charming. Her makeup is exquisite and layered. She leans slightly to the side, leaning forward slightly, with an elegant and relaxed posture. She wears a white turtleneck sweater with a soft and fluffy texture, presenting a warm fuzzy texture. At the hem of the sweater, a white lace mini skirt peeks out, with delicate hollow-out patterns and wavy edges, adding a touch of sweetness and romance. She slung a uniquely designed handbag across her left shoulder. The body was mainly beige, embroidered with purple floral patterns. She wore black ankle boots paired with beige knit sock covers. The cuffs had natural pleats, giving a casual and fashionable look. The background was a blurred urban building, with light gray exterior walls and warm yellow light filtering through the windows, creating soft light spots. The street floor reflected a faint light. It creates a tranquil atmosphere of a nighttime city. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figure occupying the left central position, gazing toward the upper right of the frame. The light mainly comes from warm yellow lighting from the background buildings and fill lights from the foreground. The light softly illuminates the figures, highlighting their outlines and clothing textures. The shadowed areas transition delicately to enhance the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is mainly white, beige, and black, accented with silver sequins and bright red shoulder straps, creating a warm and cool contrast. The shallow depth of field effect blurs the background This makes the subject stand out even more, creating an atmosphere that is both everyday and dreamy, as if you were a fashionable girl encountered on a quiet night street, carrying a touch of mystery and gentleness. The entire scene carries a strong sense of artistry and storytelling, like a professional photographer shooting at night with a high-end camera, capturing moments that are both authentic and transcendent",
