        {
          "id": "krea2-d1987d8e16c77f807984d74a",
          "alias": "单女棕连衣裙城市媚态坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the back seat of a car, wearing a form-fitting brown long-sleeve dress. The dress clings to her curves, outlining her full hips and flowing waistline. The neckline is high-cut, with white lettering \"C'EST LA VIE PARIS\" printed on the chest. The font is simple yet elegant, and the overall look is full of modern urban fashion. She leans sideways on a beige leather seat, fingers naturally bent, her posture relaxed and confident, her expression slightly lazy and seductive. Her right leg stretches forward, while her left leg is slightly bent. Her leg lines are graceful, her skin glows softly under the sunlight, and the interior is warm. The slanting sunlight from the windows casts clear shadows on her body and seats, creating a contrast of light and shadow and creating a strong sense of three-dimensionality. The foreground is a close-up of her body, occupying most of the frame and highlighting the main subject. The middle view shows the car's interior, including beige leather seats, black door panels, and some window frames. Details are clearly visible, with delicate seat texture and neat stitching. Parts like door handles and seatbelt buckles are real. The background shows city streetscapes through car windows, with blurred architectural outlines in the distance. The sky is deep blue dotted with a few white clouds. A silver sedan is parked by the roadside, with streetlights and traffic signs nearby. The street is dotted with utility poles and trees. The overall composition combines close-ups with medium and long shots, extending along the body's curves to the legs and then out the window, forming a natural visual flow. The right side of the painting leaves a large space to enhance the composition's balance and sense of breathability. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is dominated by warm tones. Sunlight streams in from the right, creating a soft backlight effect that gently outlines the figures, creating a sense of tranquility and warmth at dusk. The entire scene seems to capture an unintentional moment from daily life, with a sense of realism and life. It resembles real photos taken with an amateur camera or phone, retaining slight noise and natural color reproduction without excessive embellishment, presenting a simple yet authentic beauty. The image texture is delicate, with moderate color saturation and clear layering. It combines artistic compositional beauty with a sense of everyday authenticity, allowing people to feel a relaxed and carefree charm of urban women.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
