        {
          "id": "krea2-0c42cc2c6ae7d139d4fb3f22",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套街道站立过肩",
          "prompt": "She wears a blue-and-white sports jacket with pink stripes on the sleeves. Underneath, she wears a white polka dot dress, black shorts with floral patterns, white stockings, and a small red strawberry-shaped bag slung over her shoulder. The bag is adorned with white floral patterns and plush decorations. The interior is luxurious and comfortable. The red leather seats have a delicate texture and neat stitching. The inside of the doors is also wrapped in red leather, equipped with silver metal handles and control buttons. The roof is black, with a sound system and sunroof. Through the window, you can see the city street outside. In the background, a black sedan is driving. In the distance, faint tall buildings and green trees appear. Sunlight streams in from the window, forming a warm golden glow that gently bathes the girl, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall composition centers on the person, using close-ups to highlight their expressions and details. The background is blurred to make the subject stand out. The view is slightly overhead, shooting from outside the car to inside. The composition is stable and the color scheme harmonious. Red, blue, white, and pink complement each other, creating a rich yet not cluttered visual effect. The light and shadow layers are distinct, the contrast of light and shadow is natural, presenting a beautiful moment captured unintentionally in daily life. It feels like a real photo taken by an amateur camera or mobile phone, with a strong sense of realism and the atmosphere of everyday life. The image texture is authentic, with rich details and clear textures, giving a sense of warmth and a touch of artistry",
