        {
          "id": "krea2-019fc7aa55a65fc19dafde85",
          "alias": "单女白旗袍机场冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the center of a modern airport hall, wearing an elegant modified white qipao adorned with traditional floral and wave patterns interwoven in blue, yellow, and red. The neckline and cuffs are outlined with deep blue piping, and the side slit at the skirt reveals the long leg line. The overall cut fits the figure perfectly, showcasing the gentleness and modern fashion of Eastern women. She crosses her arms over her chest, confident and composed, gently holding a beige square bag in her left hand. The bag is simple and exquisite and adorned with gold metal fasteners. She wears a pair of shiny gold pointed flat shoes, with a simple and elegant design that complements the overall look. Her makeup is natural and understated. The background is a spacious and bright airport hall, with light gray marble tiles laid on the floor. The smooth surface reflects the figure and the surrounding environment, and the wall is made of large blocks of white marble with a natural gray-white texture, giving it a premium feel. On the left is a thick white pillar, and in the distance to the right, a row of check-in counters is visible. Above the counters hang multiple electronic screens showing flight information. Several passengers were lining up at the counter to complete their check-in. They were dressed casually—some carrying suitcases, some carrying backpacks. The crowd had various poses—some looking down at their phones, some chatting with staff—creating a realistic travel scene. The entire space was well-lit, and the uniform ceiling lighting made the images bright and clear, while soft reflections appeared on the floor and walls. The composition used a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figures positioned slightly to the left of center of the frame, their bodies slightly turned and heads facing the camera, creating a visual focal point. The foreground features the main figure and parts of the ground, the middle ground is the check-in area and passengers in the background, and the distant view is the architectural structure and lighting in the distance. The layers are distinct, and visual guidance naturally leads to the camera through the characters' postures and gaze directions. Meanwhile, the horizontal lines and vertical columns in the background also serve as guidance. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and transparent, with a cool texture typical of modern commercial spaces. However, the warm-toned patterns on the characters' clothing and the accents of golden shoes add a touch of warmth and vitality. The overall image presents a unique artistic sense that blends tradition and modernity, Eastern aesthetics with urban life. It resembles a high-resolution photo taken with a professional camera, rich in detail, true colors, and strong visual appeal, while preserving unexpected, authentic moments from daily life. It gives a sense of refinement and familiarity, like a traveler about to set off, carrying anticipation for distant places and inner peace, capturing this gentle scene amid the bustling airport",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
