          "id": "krea2-6e02172ca51f4b3caf750dc2",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫城市温柔站立持包",
          "prompt": "She wears a delicate silver cross-shaped necklace and slender earrings. Her right hand rests gently on a black pillar beside her, while her left hand carries a small black leather handbag adorned with gold metal clasps. On her wrist, a simple silver bracelet is paired with a simple silver bracelet. The overall look exudes a sharp and fashionable aura. She stands in a warm-toned indoor corridor, illuminated by warm lighting. The background features blurred architectural structures and bokeh light spots. Warm yellow lights cast from afar, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on the floor and walls, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. The camera uses a medium shot composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, body slightly tilted, presenting a graceful S-shaped curve. The light mainly comes from the front right, creating a natural contrast of light and shadow that highlights the character's silhouette and the texture of the clothing. The white shirt, due to its translucent material, faintly reveals the outline of the inner layer, and the black short skirt clings to the figure. Highlighting the beauty of curves, black stockings wrap the legs, with smooth lines. The overall color scheme is mainly black and white, complemented by warm orange-yellow background lighting, creating a strong visual contrast that creates a sense of sophistication and modern urban atmosphere. The photography style resembles professional portrait photography, using a large aperture lens for obvious background blur, with a clear focus on the subject, emphasizing the subject's presence. The image has a cinematic texture, rich light and shadow layers, and exquisite detail handling. It feels like a frame taken from a high-end commercial advertisement or fashion magazine, yet carries a sense of realism from everyday life captured with a phone or camera. It captures the elegant and composed side of urban women at work or social events. The composition is balanced and full of tension, the visual guidance is natural and smooth, and the atmosphere is both professional and approachable, presenting an aesthetic expression that combines artistry with everyday life",
