        {
          "id": "krea2-dad6c672ce4773bb884e57b8",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a crosswalk on a city street, slightly tilting her head to look back at the camera, exuding natural warmth and subtle emotional tension. She wears an off-white fitted camisole top, layered with a loose long-sleeved cardigan in the same color scheme. The sleeves are casually rolled up to the elbows, showcasing a casual yet elegant style. She pairs a red and black plaid short skirt with a clean and sharp hem that outlines her long legs. The overall look blends youthful energy with urban fashion sense. She slung an off-white diamond-patterned chain bag across her left shoulder. The body was full and rounded, with the metal double C logo clearly visible. The chain shimmered softly in the sunlight, adding a touch of luxury to the scene. She stood on a crosswalk, with a blurry city street scene in the background, the outlines of trees and faint architectural structures in the distance. Light and shadow filtered through the leaves onto the ground and figures, creating a mottled light spot effect that created a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The light came from the upper left side of the frame. It presents a soft, warm tone typical of early morning or evening. Sunlight penetrates the misty air, enveloping the entire scene in a hazy golden glow. The shadows transition naturally, highlighting the texture of the skin and the details of the folds on clothing. The composition uses a medium shot portrait perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, the body in a three-quarters sideways posture, the head slightly turned toward the camera to create a dynamic visual guide. The direction of sight interacts with the viewer, enhancing immersion. The foreground features a clear road surface and partial zebra crossing, while the middle shot is the main subject. The background is completely blurred, using shallow depth of field to highlight the subject and enhance spatial layering. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, light gray, and light brown, accented with bright red and black checkered elements. The colors are harmonious and unified, visually comfortable, with delicate light and shadow distribution, forming natural contour light that enhances the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is quiet and warm, as if capturing a moment embraced by sunlight, full of life and artistic beauty, like real street photos taken with a high-end portable camera on a sunny afternoon. The image carries a slight grainy film texture and soft color overflow, presenting a blend of vintage and modern intertwined visual textures. The composition is balanced, white space is appropriate, and the figures' poses are naturally relaxed without deliberate posing, conveying an unintentional beauty. Light and tone blend together, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly artistic everyday aesthetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
