          "id": "krea2-4273b280ad67493c4e8107d9",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣街道沉思站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the sidewalk of an autumn street, wearing a gray knit hat and a white printed T-shirt with a black jacket. Her expression is calm and slightly contemplative, gazing upward. Her body slightly turns to the side, her posture naturally relaxed, her hands hanging naturally, as if sensing the flow of air around her. In the foreground, a large number of golden and orange-red fallen leaves flutter in the air, each with distinct shapes and clear edges. Some leaves, due to their blurred movement, show dynamic trajectories, creating a strong visual impact. These fallen leaves drift from different directions in the frame—some clear foreground, some blurred in the background, creating rich layering. The middle ground features a metal guardrail beside the sidewalk, with simple black railings extending along the road. The ground is covered with fallen leaves, varying in color and forming mottled patterns. The background is a city street, clean and tidy, with vehicle tracks in the distance. A yellow taxi is parked by the roadside, its headlights faintly on. On the right stands a traffic sign with a red background and white letters reading \"30\" speed limit. Below is a circular sign prohibiting left turns. Behind the sign are blurred outlines of trees and buildings. The sky is grayish-white, with soft and even lighting. The overall atmosphere is quiet and slightly desolate. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the center of the frame as the visual focal point. The swirling fallen leaves form a radiating visual guide line that draws the viewer's gaze toward the character. At the same time, the shallow depth of field effect blurs the foreground and background, highlighting the main subject. The light and shadow come from diffused light from cloudy days, with no obvious shadows, and the tone is relatively cool. Mainly black, white, and gray, accented with warm-colored fallen leaves to create a warm and cool contrast. The color saturation is moderate, with a slight film grain texture. The overall style has the feel of documentary photography in everyday life, as if captured casually with an amateur camera, yet still full of artistic flair. The images are filled with poetic tranquility and loneliness, evoking the passage of autumn and the fleeting nature of youth. The delicate details make the scene both realistic and imaginative, as if time has been frozen in this moment, with fallen leaves falling like rain and figures standing quietly. Become the most captivating scene of this moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
