        {
          "id": "krea2-ce6538bb5d73d228d0b5130a",
          "alias": "单女灰礼服镜前冷淡倚靠摆拍",
          "prompt": "A female model in a light gray-blue one-shoulder gown gracefully leans in front of a futuristic dark green concept car, her right hand gently touching the smooth hood of the car, while her left hand hangs naturally, striking a calm yet expressive pose. The upper body of the dress is designed to be fitted, outlining graceful curves. The chest is adorned with exquisite white embroidered floral patterns, and one side of the skirt slits high, extending a flowing fabric that drapes down like a cloak, creating a strong visual layering effect. The overall look is both modern and full of artistic flair The background is a bright auto show hall, where the huge \"EXEED\" brand logo is clearly visible under warm-toned lighting. The geometric metal mesh structure decorates the walls, creating an atmosphere where technology and fashion intertwine. Distant blurred silhouettes and booth lighting create a soft bokeh effect, enhancing spatial depth in the image. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure occupying the left central position, body in a diagonal posture, extending to the background brand logo, creating a smooth visual flow. Light mainly comes from above and in front, softly and evenly illuminating the subject, while creating delicate highlight reflections on the car's surface, highlighting its streamlined design and metallic texture. The overall light and shadow present a warm yet slightly cool-toned mixed color temperature, creating a high-end, professional, yet approachable commercial display atmosphere. The image details are rich, the materials are authentic, including the silky sheen of the gown, mirror reflections on car paint, the cool texture of metal trim, and the soft-focus effect of background lighting. The camera uses an 85mm prime lens. Simulating the shallow depth of field effect of professional portrait photography ensures the subject is sharp and clear while the background is moderately blurred. The main tones are gray-blue, deep green, and warm orange, accented with white and black to form a harmonious and unified visual color scheme. The entire image presents a sophisticated blend of fashion, technology, and aesthetics, as if captured from a top-tier international auto show, delivering strong visual impact and artistic appeal",
