        {
          "id": "krea2-df02a3f365b00afb6d0d62ac",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙摄影棚展示",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a bright orange high-neck, sleeveless tight dress. The dress hugged her figure, outlining smooth and graceful curves. The hem reached her calves, with cross-tie designs on the sides creating a cutout effect, adding a sense of sexiness and fashion. She leaned gracefully against a deep brown metal railing, her fingers long, painted with black nail polish, wearing delicate gold chain earrings with the rest naturally draped down. She applied red lipstick, creating a refined makeup that created a warm and bright atmosphere. The background features a dark metal grille structure with geometric patterns, presenting a combination of hexagons and triangles. The lines are simple yet modern. Behind the grille is a blurred outdoor environment, with faint outlines of buildings and greenery. The composition uses medium shots and close-ups, with the figure occupying the main position, fully presented from above the waist to below the knees. The angle of view is slightly tilted, highlighting body curves and clothing details. Light comes from the front to the right, creating natural shadow transitions that enhance the three-dimensional effect of the figures. The color scheme is dominated by orange. It forms a strong contrast with the dark background, creating a strong visual impact. The overall image is full of fashion, modernity, and artistic beauty, resembling a professional studio or high-end commercial shoot, yet retaining the warmth of everyday life. It's like shooting outdoors with a high-quality camera in natural light, presenting a realistic and delicate texture. The lens focuses on the subject, the background is well blurred, and the character is emphasized. The entire scene is visually appealing while maintaining elegance and depth, conveying a sense of confidence, independence, Beautiful femininity, rich layers of light and shadow, warm and harmonious tones, balanced and stable composition, clean and crisp images without unnecessary distractions, every detail serves the theme expression, showcasing a refined aesthetic taste and visual art style",
