        {
          "id": "krea2-2726e4c010c58cb16ca91ce5",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙公园困倦倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "The tips are slightly curled, adding a touch of laziness and vitality. She wears a light-colored plaid spaghetti strap dress with a fresh and elegant blue and white plaid pattern. Her overall posture is elegant and relaxed, her body slightly leaning forward, head tilted back, forming a beautiful S-shaped curve. The composition uses medium to near shots in close-ups. The figure occupies the left central position of the composition, with blurred green plants in the background. The leaves are broad and the edges blurred, presenting soft light spots and layers. Sunlight pours through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. Golden beams of light penetrate the leaves, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The middle frame shows her body and part of her dress, while the background is completely distinct green vegetation, creating a strong depth of field contrast. Details like hairpins and earrings serve as secondary focal points, enriching the image's layers, with light coming from diagonally above. It simulates the scattering of afternoon sunlight filtering through the canopy, with the main light source soft and bright. The shadowed areas transition naturally without harsh edges. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and emerald green, paired with the blue and white tones of the plaid skirt, creating a harmonious color balance. The image texture is delicate, with a slight film graininess, enhancing realism and artistic atmosphere. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and gentle, full of the laziness and poetry of a summer afternoon, as if capturing a moment when the sunlight has accidentally kissed you. Like a snapshot of life taken in a park with an old film camera, it carries a strong sense of everyday aesthetics and emotional warmth",
