          "id": "krea2-3ae37eca1b8f11d2e6507c78",
          "alias": "单女白内衣街道沉思蹲持械",
          "prompt": "A female character dressed in futuristic sci-fi style combat gear crouches low on a city street, wearing a helmet made of metallic spiked earrings, which are embedded with round components resembling speaker units. The overall look is full of technological and aggressive energy. She wears a white cropped sports bra with blue lettering on the chest, paired with a black jacket. The sleeves are made of blue-purple iridescent reflective material, giving a flowing metallic sheen. The lower half is tight black high-elastic leather pants. Her outer thighs are printed with white geometric patterns, and she wears a pair of heavy black chunky-heeled high boots. The boot shaft reaches her knees and the soles are thick. The overall clothing design combines functionality with visual impact. She carries a huge futuristic weapon diagonally on her back. The gun body is streamlined, with a silver-gray main body accented with blue glowing lines and mechanical details. The barrel features metallic edges, giving the overall look a strong sense of intimidation. The figure's posture is full of movement: the right leg bent on the knee, the left leg extended forward, and the body slightly leaning forward. The right hand hangs naturally, the left hand rests on the knee, and the head is slightly tilted, creating strong visual tension. The background is a modern urban street environment, with a gray asphalt pavement that is rough and has a fine grainy texture. In the distance, the reflection of glass curtain walls and buildings reflects blurred silhouettes and the cityscape. Cool-toned lighting faintly seeps through the interior, giving the overall environment a clean and slightly industrial feel. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle to emphasize the character's momentum and sense of pressure, with the figure occupying the center-right position. This forms a visual focal point: the foreground features clear ground textures and partial details of the characters' legs, the middle ground shows the character's full body and weapon, and the background features blurred buildings and street elements. The shallow depth of field effect enhances the subject. In terms of lighting and shadow, natural light shines from a diagonal top, creating a soft transition between light and shadow. The folds of clothing and leather surfaces also show delicate light and shadow changes. The overall atmosphere is calm and tense, blending elements of sci-fi, combat, fashion, and street culture. The colors are mainly cool tones, with silver-gray, blue-purple, and black as the main color palette. White underwear and accented highlights break monotony and enhance visual depth. The visuals have a strong cinematic feel and artistic expression, as if recreating scenes from a cyberpunk animation or game, while preserving the texture of authentic shooting, like shooting outdoors with a professional camera. Every detail captured by the camera is full of storytelling and immersion",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
