        {
          "id": "krea2-24dc854ec772787b82b1125b",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙小径冷淡站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors at night, wearing an off-white lace slip dress with delicate cutout patterns and natural pleats, presenting a soft texture and vintage pastoral style. Holding a burning firework stick, sparks fly everywhere, forming a bright and dazzling star-shaped spot. The spark's trail is clearly visible, sparkling with white and pale yellow light. As tiny sparks scatter in all directions, the scene injects dynamism and vitality. The foreground focuses on the figure and the firework stick, positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with a slightly side-tilted body and a slightly tilted head in a naturally relaxed posture. The firework stick is held high in front left, becoming the visual focal point, creating a contrast of light and shadow that highlights the main contour. The middle ground features blurred silhouettes of trees, with interlaced branches and leaves creating a hazy outline, presenting a transition between deep green and black. The background is city lights in the distance. Scattered warm yellow and cool blue light dots are scattered, with de-focus to form a beautiful circular halo that creates a dreamlike blur effect. The overall composition uses a centered technique, placing the figures at the visual center, while the light from the sparkler guides the viewer from the foreground to the background, enhancing the sense of depth. The lighting atmosphere is mainly dark, with the sky showing a deep deep blue with almost no clouds, emphasizing the quietness and mystery of the night. The main light source comes from the sparkler, whose strong glow creates a sharp contrast in the darkness. Warm localized lighting is created, while the surrounding environment is immersed in deeper shadows. This lighting and shadow treatment not only enhances the drama of the image but also creates a warm, romantic, and slightly nostalgic mood. The tones are mainly warm yellow and cool blue, creating a contrast between cool and warm tones, highlighting the subject while enriching color layers. The overall image has a slight film graininess and low-saturation tones, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, carrying a rustic beauty reminiscent of everyday amateur equipment. The city lights in the background intertwine with natural elements. It hints at the fusion of urban and natural elements, while the figure's gesture of holding a sparkler symbolizes celebration, hope, or fleeting beautiful moments. The entire scene is filled with the atmosphere of youth, dreams, and poetry, as if frozen on an ordinary yet ritualistic night. The visuals are delicate and emotional, evoking a sense of joy and love for life in tranquility",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
