        {
          "id": "krea2-8bad9c88197d7f3ea544f250",
          "alias": "单女战士实验室严肃站立持械",
          "prompt": "A female character dressed in futuristic tech-style tight armor, standing sideways with her body slightly leaned back, holding a sci-fi heavy weapon in her left hand. The gun body features blue-purple energy effects and complex mechanical structures. The stock is curved, covered with intricate lines and luminous elements. Her right hand rests naturally at her waist, exuding a confident yet stern demeanor. Her armor is made of semi-transparent material, giving a texture similar to liquid metal or biological armor, with dark gray and blue circuit patterns spreading like veins. Extending from the neck to the torso, arms, and legs, it forms smooth organic lines. The armor fits the body perfectly, highlighting perfect curves. The overall color scheme is mainly light pink and gray-white, combined with metallic sheen and semi-transparent textures, creating a visual impact that blends high-tech with human aesthetics. The foreground occupies most of the composition, with medium shots in close-ups. The figure extends from the lower left to the upper right, creating diagonal dynamic tension. The background is a pure white, unobtrusive minimalist environment that highlights the subject's details and colors. Light comes from the upper front, softly and evenly illuminating the entire figure, while creating delicate highlight reflections and shadow transitions on the armor's surface, enhancing the sense of depth and realistic materials. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with slight backlight at the edges making the contours clearer. The atmosphere is calm and futuristic, as if you are in a clean laboratory or virtual space. The overall composition is visually guided, with balanced and dynamic composition, harmonious and unified colors, and exquisite details. It presents a visual experience that combines artistic beauty with technological power, suitable for sci-fi illustration creation or character design. The image quality resembles professional studio shooting, using high-end cameras and lighting equipment, offering cinematic clarity and color reproduction. The visuals have no obvious noise, details are fully preserved, and the overall atmosphere is both modern and tinged with mystery and detachment, conveying a calm, rational, and powerful female tech warrior image",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
