        {
          "id": "krea2-1912ad4323f228047ea90953",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣街道困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands between metal pillars on a city street, turning to look back at the camera. She wears a dark brown chunky knit sweater with natural curled textures at the collar and cuffs. The shoulder lines are soft, and the sweater's texture is heavy yet warm, presenting delicate woven details that create a strong contrast of light and shadow. She looks slightly tired but still spirited. She wears simple earrings that reflect slightly in the light, leaning against a white metal pillar. The column surface shows mottled paint peeling marks and fine scratches, showing the weariness of long-term outdoor exposure. Another gray metal column is on the left side of the image, with a simple structure and industrial texture. The background is a blurry city streetscape, distant building outlines blur, scattered pedestrians and vehicle shadows on the street, and a blue-and-white billboard visible with blurred text and patterns. The color saturation is low, and the overall tone is cool, mainly blue and gray-white, creating a cool atmosphere in the early morning or evening. The sky shows a pale blue gradient, with light slanting down from the upper right of the frame, creating a soft backlighting effect. The edges of the figures are enveloped in a golden halo, casting long shadows on the ground and columns. The composition uses a third-division method: the figure is positioned on the right third of the canvas, with the viewer's gaze oriented toward the viewer, forming a visual guide. The column in the foreground forms a natural frame, the middle ground is the interactive space between the figure and the column, and the background uses shallow depth of field treatment to highlight the subject while preserving environmental information. The overall image has the grainy texture and slight noise of film photography, with rich color layers but not overly vivid, presenting a real, natural, and emotionally charged urban daily moment. It feels like an old camera capturing moments of daily life at dusk. The transition of light and shadow is natural, the atmosphere tranquil yet slightly lonely, allowing one to feel the subtle emotions of individuals in the city. The overall image is full of storytelling, as if someone will come to break this brief stillness, and as if everything silently tells a story about waiting, Secret thoughts of recollection or self-reflection lean toward low-saturation cool tones, with a slight teal-blue filter effect that enhances the sense of chill and distance. The lighting is soft but not glaring, and the characters' expressions are calm but contain complex emotions. The entire scene captures an unintentional yet profound moment in urban life like a movie lens",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
