        {
          "id": "krea2-5db733687c5c5d795b6818ec",
          "alias": "单女米外套户外冷淡坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors under the autumn sunlight, adding a touch of gentleness and laziness. Under the warm golden light, she appears as smooth as porcelain. She wears a camel-colored wool coat with a thick and warm texture, sleeves slightly rolled up to reveal slender wrists. On her wrist is a simple silver bracelet and a small blue gemstone ring. Around her neck is a brown and off-white plaid scarf, casually draped over her shoulders with tassel decorations, adding a touch of vintage and artistic flair to the overall look. The background is a blurry autumn forest, with fallen leaves covering the ground, presenting a blend of golden and reddish-brown hues. The distant outlines of trees are hazy, creating a soft bokeh effect. Light pours in from above, creating warm backlight and side lighting, creating a soft silhouette light while casting delicate shadows on the clothes and scarf, enhancing the sense of depth. The composition uses medium to close shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, head slightly tilted, gazing directly at the lens, creating a strong visual direction. The background blur highlights the subject, and details of the scarf and arm can be seen in the foreground, adding depth to the image. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, carrying a strong autumn poetry. The color palette is mainly warm yellow, brown, and beige, complemented by a few cool-toned metal accessories for contrast. The image texture is delicate, as if it was taken with professional photography equipment. Yet it retains a sense of realism from everyday life, like capturing a moment at dusk with a Canon 5D Mark IV paired with an 85mm f/1.2 prime lens. It has a cinematic film texture and slight graininess, making the overall atmosphere feel like a carefully crafted artistic portrait or a snapshot of a friend's life, full of storytelling and emotional warmth",
