        {
          "id": "krea2-44ccb1892363af7a28934518",
          "alias": "单女红短裙商店困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits inside a metal shopping cart, dressed in exquisite Lolita-style attire. Her white knitted long-sleeve top features red ruffle trim and bow details. She wears a red short skirt with white plush trim, and a red beret adorned with white pearls and pink bows. Her makeup is exquisite. She slightly turns to look at the camera, gently resting her left hand on the blue handle of the shopping cart, resting her right hand naturally on her leg, raising and bending her right leg. She wears pink platform wooden clogs paired with white long socks, with bow decorations at the cuffs, and the metal frame of the shopping cart clearly visible Inside, there are blue and white shopping bags. The background is the aisle of a large warehouse-style supermarket. Tall metal shelves are neatly arranged, piled high with brown cardboard boxes, some of which are labeled red and white. The floor is gray cement, with light coming from industrial lighting above, presenting a uniform cool white glow. The overall color scheme is mainly red and white, forming a strong contrast with the harsh industrial environment. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, and the shopping cart extending diagonally to the lower right, creating a visual guiding line. The foreground highlights both the person and the shopping cart. The middle shots showcase shelves and cardboard boxes, with background blur treatment to enhance spatial depth. The light and shadow layers are distinct, shadows are soft, and the wrinkles and material details of clothing are clearly visible. The overall atmosphere blends sweetness with the contrast tension of real commercial spaces, presenting a surreal everyday scene, as if from a fantasy world from a parallel world. It has a slight film texture and the graininess of real shooting, with moderate color saturation and realistic light and shadow transitions, creating a unique visual experience that is both dreamy and down-to-earth",
