        {
          "id": "krea2-d5c6ec564be27492095e368f",
          "alias": "单女黑短裤街道冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits atop a black metallic camera equipment box. She wears a loose black hooded sweatshirt with white stripes on the sleeves, black shorts and knee-high socks, and a pair of platform black-and-white sneakers with white cross patterns on the uppers. The overall look exudes street fashion vibes, slightly messy, with a cold yet confident expression, relaxed yet confident, a relaxed yet confident posture. One hand rests lightly on the edge of the equipment case, the other leg bent and raised, knees close to the body, forming a strong visual visual guideline. In the foreground is a black camera equipment box with the words \"PAYLOAD\" and metal clasp details. Next to it is a black leather chair with a black bag on its backrest. In the middle is the main subject, occupying the left central position, her body slightly tilted, leg lines smooth, and the composition using low-angle upward shots to enhance visual impact and presence. The background is a pure white wall, clean and simple, with \"SANDRA STUDIO\" at the top and a \"Xiaohongshu\" watermark in the lower right corner. However, it does not focus on the main focus. The light and shadow come from the left side, soft and even, creating a professional studio shooting atmosphere that emphasizes three-dimensionality. The overall color palette mainly uses black, white, and gray, with strong contrast. The image is clean and crisp, with a modern fashion and premium feel. It retains the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting, as if captured in an ordinary studio, without excessive embellishment, yet still presenting exquisite image effects. The images present a unique style that lies between commercial advertising and personal portraits. It features professional lighting and composition while maintaining a casual, natural atmosphere. The characters' postures and expressions convey an independent, free-spirited, and unrestrained attitude. The entire scene feels like an unedited filming location—authentic and vivid, full of storytelling and artistic flair. The color palette is cool and the atmosphere quiet yet powerful. The visual focus is on the characters, who express personality and attitude through body language and clothing coordination. The composition is stable and layered, from the equipment box in the foreground to the figures in the middle and then to the wall in the background. This creates a clear sense of spatial depth, with just the right use of light and shadow, highlighting the main contour while maintaining a clean environment. Overall, it presents a minimalist yet sophisticated aesthetic, as if a fashion moment was captured by chance, combining beauty and authenticity",
