        {
          "id": "krea2-f276ac62e638afd7324a3c9e",
          "alias": "单女白T恤广场沉思侧头",
          "prompt": "She wore a simple white short-sleeved T-shirt and light blue high-waisted jeans. Her right hand hung down naturally, touching the seam, while her left ring finger wore a tiny silver ring. Her body was slightly tilted, her head slightly tilted to the rear right, her expression slightly lazy and thoughtful. Her overall posture was relaxed and full of life. Behind her were lush green vines, with pure white roses blooming among the branches and leaves. The blossoms were layered and layered—some budding, others fully in full bloom. The petals were full and rounded, with edges slightly curled naturally. The green leaves are dense and layered, with clear veins. Some leaves display a bright yellow-green hue under the light. On the right side of the painting is a section of black metal railing, with clean vertical lines that contrast materially with the rough concrete wall. The wall is built from neat square cement bricks, with subtle textures and traces of time. Behind the railing, more greenery and architectural structures can be faintly seen. The background is blurred to create a sense of depth, with several clusters of white roses in the foreground almost aligned with the figure's head, creating visual echo and balance. The composition adopts a slightly tilted perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right for walls and railings to enhance depth and spatial layout. At the same time, the left side is filled with numerous flowers and green leaves, preventing the subject from appearing isolated. This extends to the surrounding blooming flowers and spreading branches and leaves, forming a cyclical viewing path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft diffused light, like natural light on cloudy days or under tree shade, evenly illuminating the figures and plants without strong shadows. However, subtle changes in light and shadow remain in the details. White flowers appear crystal clear under the light, while green leaves present rich cool tones. The overall tone is mainly fresh green, pure white, and elegant blue, accented with a touch of warm color to create a peaceful, gentle, and slightly artistic everyday scene. The image texture is similar to film photography, with slight graininess and natural color shifts, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting. The lens focal length approaches the standard 50mm field of view, with backgrounds gradually blurring. While highlighting the main subject, the environment is preserved, and the overall composition conveys a tranquil, private, and life-close aesthetic experience, as if capturing the most casual yet touching moment in an ordinary afternoon garden",
