        {
          "id": "krea2-22309d5a2513c0818b9a7fb9",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔机场自信站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in front of the glass door of a modern airport lobby, wearing a white off-shoulder ruffled cropped top and blue wide-leg jeans. The pants are printed with a repeating LV classic monogram pattern. The overall look is fashionable and visually impactful. Her makeup is clean and neat, holding a yellow phone in her right hand, her left hand naturally hanging down, and a white jacket in her hand. Her posture is elegant and composed, wearing black flat shoes. Her figure is slender and well-proportioned, and the main subject is clearly prominent, positioned slightly to the right of the center of the composition. The foreground features a smooth light gray marble floor that reflects the figures and surrounding environment, creating a mirrored effect that enhances the sense of depth in the space. The middle ground features transparent glass automatic doors and a metal frame structure, with green emergency exit signs above the door. Behind the door, faint indoor lighting and blurred architectural outlines can be seen. In the background is a huge white cylindrical column with a smooth surface and silver metal trim at the base. The column reflects surrounding light and images, creating a clean and modern spatial feel. The entire scene is brightly and evenly lit. Diffused light from the top makes the figures and environmental details clearly visible, without strong shadows, but the floor reflects a soft transition of light and shadow, creating a calm, rational, and slightly detached atmosphere. The composition uses a vertical rectangle, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame. The contrast of depth of field between front and back highlights the subject, while the lines of the glass door guide the gaze, running from left to right through the image. The visual direction is natural and smooth, with white, blue, and gray as the main tones. The yellow phone is used as a decorative accent, bringing a touch of liveliness and warmth. Overall, it presents a daily moment of urban life, as if captured in a street candid style shot with a professional camera or high-end smartphone. The image is delicate and detailed, combining fashion with authenticity, full of contemporary confidence and independence. The atmosphere is calm and focused, like a quiet waiting moment, recording a brief pause during travel. The harmonious unity of light and shadow, the fresh and natural tones, presenting a minimalist yet refined lifestyle aesthetic",
