        {
          "id": "krea2-d9ba3b671c254ba3a9709dc5",
          "alias": "单女衬衫小巷沉思站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a narrow alley, her expression slightly relaxed and confident. She wears a loose leopard-print short-sleeved shirt made of lightweight, breathable material, creating a semi-transparent effect. The sleeves are wide with slightly rolled-up cuffs, paired with off-white high-waisted shorts. The pants are simple and sharp, with legs just above the knee. The overall look is casual yet stylish. In her right hand, she carries a dark handbag with a simple design featuring metal fasteners and slender shoulder straps. The bag's material looks like leather or canvas, with a slight texture on the surface. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly turned to the side, and her head turned toward the camera, giving off a friendly and casual vibe. In the foreground, her full-body image is clear, occupying the main part of the frame. The middle is the entrance to the alley behind her, where the lighting is dim. Inside, some blurry shop signs and lights can be faintly seen. On the right, you can see part of a motorcycle's body and taillight, with reflective metal parts and license plates on the body. In the background is a huge red signboard, with three large characters in bold white letters reading \"Zhixing City.\" The font is striking and powerful. Below the sign is an orange-red corrugated metal panel, with some wear and rust, showing traces of time. On both sides of the alley stand low buildings, with mottled walls and narrow windows that emit dim yellow light. The composition uses a center-to-right approach. The figure is positioned slightly to the right center of the image, creating a sense of depth and focusing on the figure. The red sign in the background and the black alley create a strong color contrast, enhancing the visual impact. In terms of lighting and shadow, the light source comes from the front left, possibly a mix of natural light and streetlights, creating soft shadows. The alley in the background is semi-dark, creating a contrast of light and shadow that creates a tranquil atmosphere before urban nightfall. The overall color scheme is mainly warm tones, with the red sign and yellow lighting bringing a cozy feeling. The leopard print patterns on the characters' clothing and light-colored shorts add layers and visual interest to the image. The images are rich in life atmosphere and humanistic emotion, as if capturing an ordinary yet story-filled moment, like a real street photo taken at dusk with an old film camera. The images have slight graininess and film texture, moderate color saturation, rich details, and a sense of warmth and authenticity from everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
