        {
          "id": "krea2-d3e35bc2f4b806ea6b2626f5",
          "alias": "单女户外忧伤持伞",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a bright red traditional garment, her wide sleeves gently fluttering in the breeze. The fabric showed delicate pleats and a natural drape. The deep red fabric shimmered softly under the sunlight, with a slender collarbone line visible at the neckline. Black ribbons hung down from the shoulders, forming a striking contrast with the red, adding a touch of liveliness and spontaneity, carrying a hint of melancholy and contemplation, appearing gentle and charming. Above her head sat a semi-transparent white gauze umbrella, made of light and light, emitting soft light. The umbrella handle is dark with delicate stitching details along the edges. The umbrella partially blocks the background, creating a subtle sense of layering. The overall composition centers on the person, with close-ups taking up most of the space. The angle of view is slightly upward, enhancing the character's elegant temperament and visual impact. The foreground clearly shows the main subject and the umbrella, the middle is a natural extension of the figure and clothing, and the background is blurred, presenting blurred light spots and soft transitions of light and shadow, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. Light and shadow come from the upper right. Bright natural light filters through the umbrella, creating a natural transition. The overall color scheme is mainly warm red, paired with cool white background light, creating a strong color contrast that enhances the visual tension of the image. The atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, as if capturing a moment of afternoon sunlight. It combines the charm of classical Eastern aesthetics with the refinement of modern photography. The image has a film-like texture, with slight graininess and slight overexposure, simulating real camera shooting effects. It's as if you're shooting with a professional SLR or film camera outdoors in natural light. Choose a 50mm prime lens and a small aperture to control depth of field, making the subject clear and the background soft. The overall composition is balanced and artistic, creating a quiet, gentle, and slightly story-driven atmosphere—like a flowing ancient-style portrait, full of emotional tension and aesthetic conception",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
