        {
          "id": "krea2-1ff2db79af89c50758df5fc4",
          "alias": "单女棕外套户外困倦奔跑注视",
          "prompt": "A woman under the autumn sunshine wears a warm brown plush jacket layered with an off-white turtleneck sweater underneath. The cuffs reveal red and black knit gloves, her right hand gently holding a bright red maple leaf, slightly turning to glance back at the camera, carrying a hint of gentleness and shyness. The background is a blurry autumn forest, where golden, orange-red, and deep green interwoven leaves create dreamy bokeh light spots. Sunlight filters through the treetops, creating a soft backlight effect that creates a warm and romantic atmosphere. The image uses shallow depth of field shooting with blurred foreground to highlight the subject. In composition, the figure is positioned on the right side, leaving space on the left for natural extension of light and background. The visual guide line runs from right to left, forming a subtle diagonal through the subject's gaze and the red leaves in their hands, enhancing the dynamic effect of the image. The layers of light and shadow are rich, with warm tones as the main theme. The contrast between golden sunlight and cool shadows is strong, creating a tranquil and poetic autumn atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with a slight grainy film texture. It's as if you're shooting outdoors with a medium format camera under natural light, full of realism while retaining artistic beauty. Overall, it presents a beautiful moment casually captured in daily life, with both realistic details and surreal atmosphere, like a private diary photo full of storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
