        {
          "id": "krea2-bc25ce9ecb07542e3174f654",
          "alias": "单女白短裙户外忧伤倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a bright red short-sleeved top and a white high-waisted skirt, paired with white stockings. The overall look is simple yet visually striking. She gracefully leans over the reeds, her right hand gently touching a cluster of golden reeds, her expression gentle yet slightly melancholic, as if meditating or having a silent dialogue with nature. Under the sunlight, it glows softly, echoing the colors of the red top. In the foreground, dense reeds stand out, with towering stems and fluffy spike-like inflorescences gently swaying in the breeze. Some reeds are illuminated by sunlight, presenting a translucent golden texture. The details of the nearby reeds are clearly visible, with natural wear marks on the leaf edges, interacting with the movements of the figures' hands. The middle ground features layers of reeds, varying in height, with colors gradient from deep green to pale yellow, creating a rich sense of layering. The distant reeds gradually blur, creating a sense of profound space. The background is a hazy sky and the faint outlines of distant mountains, with the sky showing a transition between pale blue and warm yellow, with sunlight slanting down from the upper right of the frame. A soft backlighting effect is created, with light passing through the gaps in the reeds, casting mottled shadows on the figures, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and dreamlike atmosphere. The composition uses slanted diagonals, with the figure's body forming an S-shaped curve extending from the lower left corner to the upper right, guiding the flow of the gaze. At the same time, the vertical lines of the reeds contrast with the character's movement. Through contrasts of light and color, the main subject is emphasized, creating an overall atmosphere of tranquility, poetry, and a touch of solitude. The tones are warm and soft, dominated by red, white, green, and gold, creating a tranquil beauty reminiscent of autumn evenings. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, emphasizing the diffusion and reflection of natural light, avoiding overexposure or heavy shadows. The image has a film-like texture, with slight graininess and moderate color saturation, preserving authentic light and shadow transitions and detailed layers. The overall style blends fashionable photography with naturalism, combining artistic beauty with a sense of closeness to everyday life. It is like a high-quality portrait photographed outdoors with a professional camera, with no obvious traces of artificial lighting. Relying entirely on the clever use of natural light, it presents a realistic and moving moment. The camera chooses a mid-length perspective with a slightly low angle, making the subject more approachable. It also highlights the height of the reeds and the sense of envelopment of the environment. The depth of field is well controlled, the background is moderately blurred, maintaining the integrity of the environment while reinforcing the prominence of the subject. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and story-rich, as if capturing a forgotten afternoon, allowing one to feel the subtle connection between humans and nature",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
