        {
          "id": "krea2-12628693f37f69eac7d4a2cf",
          "alias": "单女黑西装摄影棚严肃坐交叠",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle downward view, a woman sits on an orange bench, wearing a black blazer and lace-trimmed shorts, legs crossed and raised. Her feet are black high heels, her posture elegant and confident. The overall look is fashionable, capable, yet sexy. In the foreground, a foot in black high heels extends diagonally from the lower left corner of the frame, forming a strong visual guiding line. The composition uses an asymmetrical triangular structure, with the main figure occupying the right side of the frame. The left blank space creates a sense of breathability, with a blurred indoor background that could be a café or leisure venue. The white ceiling and distant tables and chairs are blurred, presenting a cool light atmosphere in a light blue tone. The light is soft and even, with subtle but clear shadows. The overall color scheme is dominated by black, white, and gray, accented by orange benches as visual focal points, enhancing color contrast. The image texture is delicate, with professional studio-level light and shadow control while preserving the natural feel of everyday shooting. It's as if a high-end camera captures a moment in a bright environment. The lens focal length is moderate, the depth of field is shallow, highlighting the main subject. The background blur is just right, creating a strong sense of depth and spatial layering. The relationship between the character and the environment is harmoniously unified, conveying a modern urban woman's independent, autonomous, and confident lifestyle attitude. The overall atmosphere is calm and restrained yet highly attractive, combining artistic beauty with real-life scenes",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
