        {
          "id": "krea2-338312421651f99f882b9091",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙城市倚靠展示",
          "prompt": "A woman gracefully leans against the off-white stone wall, wearing a form-fitting pink long-sleeved tight dress. The upper body is made of soft pink knit, showcasing delicate textures and luster. The lower half is a pure white high-waisted pencil skirt, sharply tailored and with strong lines, highlighting the contours of her long legs and graceful figure. Her makeup is elegant yet spirited, exuding confidence and composure. Her left hand is gently raised behind her head, her arm lines graceful, and her right hand hangs naturally. On her wrist is a slender gold bracelet, and a small pink chain bag is slung across her shoulder. The bag features a metallic zipper and decorations, adding a touch of sophistication and fashion. She wears a pair of pure white pointed high heels, with slender heels. She stands gracefully on one leg with the other slightly bent and raised, forming a graceful S-shaped curve. The overall look is harmonious and unified, with soft pink and white as the main color palette, creating a fresh and refined visual effect. The foreground figure occupies the center right of the frame. The body is slightly turned and the head is slightly tilted, creating a natural visual guide. The background is a blurred outdoor environment, with faint green vegetation and hazy architectural silhouettes visible in the distance. The lighting is bright and soft, presenting the warm natural light effect of early morning or afternoon. Sunlight shines from the right, casting gentle shadows on the walls and figures, enhancing the sense of depth and layering. The composition uses the classic three-part layout, with the main figure positioned near the golden ratio point of the painting. The background blur emphasizes the subject. At the same time, it preserves a sense of spatial extension, with natural light and shadow transitions and balanced contrast between light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is tranquil, elegant, and full of the intellectual charm of modern urban women. It feels like a high-quality portrait photographed with professional photography equipment, possessing strong artistic appeal and visual appeal. The details are rich, texture is authentic, and color saturation is just right, presenting an aesthetic style that is both everyday and sophisticated, like classic moments from magazine covers or high-end fashion shoots, with no unnecessary elements distracting the image. The focus is on the figures' postures, expressions, and costume details, with every detail carefully designed, presenting an overall image of serene and vibrant beauty that invites pause and admiration.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
