        {
          "id": "krea2-975f9c614d90fde0a2da45f4",
          "alias": "单女米连衣裙室内俏皮坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a modern-style indoor setting, wearing a form-fitting beige long-sleeve dress. The material is highly stretchable, hugging the body's curves and showcasing graceful silhouettes. The pleats at the waist and hips add layers and dimension to the garment. The V-neck design accentuates the neckline, highlighting an elegant temperament. It naturally drapes over the shoulders, and her makeup is exquisite. Add a touch of lively beauty. Her right hand gently supports an object adorned with white feathers, possibly a handbag or prop. The feathers are fluffy and soft, showing a pure white appearance. Her left hand rests naturally on her leg, her nails painted red, and the details highlight her taste. She wears a pair of white knee-high boots with a simple and sharp design, heel height that harmonizes with the overall look. She sits gracefully, legs crossed, one foot lightly touching the ground, the other lifted, a relaxed yet dynamic posture. The background is a modern minimalist space. The walls are light gray with delicate texture, and above hangs a square warm yellow light, casting soft light that creates a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. Next to it is a metal-framed shelf with clean lines arranged in geometric shapes, colored in champagne gold, reflecting a subtle sheen that echoes the overall tone. On the left side of the painting, you can see a gray cabinet or side table with a smooth and flat surface and rounded edges. The overall space layout is reasonable, with harmonious elements coordinated. The composition centers on the character, using a medium shot perspective. The figure occupies the main subject, with their heads slightly above the center line and the line of sight slightly tilted toward the camera to form a visual focal point. The foreground highlights the upper body and hand movements, the medium shots showcase their overall posture and clothing details, while the background uses blur to soften environmental information, emphasizing the subject's presence. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from a warm yellow fixture above, with light shining diagonally from above, and shadows concentrated below the body and in the background area. It enhances the sense of three-dimensionality and the realism of the materials. The overall atmosphere is warm and sophisticated, carrying a sense of urban fashion lifestyle. The main colors of the painting are beige, white, gray, and champagne gold, with unified and layered tones, creating a quiet and elegant visual experience. The composition is balanced and stable, with natural and smooth visual guidance, extending along the body lines to the legs and feet, finally returning to the feathered decorations in the hands, forming a complete visual loop. The overall image presents a style that combines artistic beauty with everyday realism, resembling high-quality portraits taken with professional photography equipment, or natural snapshots of everyday scenes. It combines the sophistication of commercial advertising with the warmth of personal emotion",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
