        {
          "id": "krea2-b952c5bab6d4da5f0e0709b6",
          "alias": "单女黑网袜城市倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "The overall look is refined and layered, with a slightly forward-leaning body, smooth back lines, and long legs, presenting a healthy and well-proportioned figure. In the foreground, her full figure occupies the center of the frame From ankle to head, the view is clearly visible. The middle ground features the staircase steps and railing structure, with light-colored tiles extending diagonally into the depths. Metal handrails and transparent glass railings form simple geometric lines. The background is a blurred indoor space, with walls made of large light gray tiles. In the distance, the outline of another floor and a circular decoration can be faintly seen. The composition uses diagonal perspective, with the staircase lines guiding the gaze upward, while placing the figure at the visual focal point, creating a strong sense of depth and spatial layering, The light and shadow come from natural light on the right, filtering through the glass curtain wall, illuminating the right half of the figure and some steps, creating a soft and clear contrast between light and dark. Shadows cast onto the left floor and wall, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and realism. The overall atmosphere is bright and fresh, with urban modernity and a fashionable vibe. The color palette mainly consists of white, beige, and gray, accented with black fishnet textures and metallic sheen, presenting a clean, crisp, and slightly sexy visual effect. The image is delicate and richly detailed. It feels as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains the realism of everyday amateur equipment. The light transitions are natural, color saturation is moderate, and there is no over-processing, creating an artistic atmosphere that is both refined and close to life",
          "description": "",
