        {
          "id": "krea2-b95391e79f6b96bb5770f189",
          "alias": "单女制服城市跪注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese high school girls' uniform: a black blazer paired with a white shirt and blue-and-white checkered tie, a yellow school badge and green badge pinned to her chest, a matching plaid short skirt, white knee-length socks on her legs, and black patent leather loafers. She sat on a white vintage scooter, hands naturally resting on her knees, holding a book with a green cover, her head slightly turned to one side, wearing round fine-rimmed glasses. Her overall posture was elegant and slightly calm, and the motorcycle was designed in classic Italian style. The headlights are rounded, the body lines are smooth, and the white painted surface reflects soft light. The handlebars are fitted with rearview mirrors and orange turn signals, and the wheels feature silver spokes. The background is a city street, with blurred building silhouettes visible in the distance. The walls are light gray, windows are neatly arranged, and greenery dots the roadside. Sunlight pours in from the upper left of the frame, casting clear shadows on the ground. The contrast of light and shadow is striking, and the overall tone is bright and warm, full of youthful energy and urban feel. The composition is shot with medium-length portraits. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with the motorcycle occupying most of the foreground space, forming a visual guide line that draws the gaze toward the subject. The background blur emphasizes the subject, creating a distinct sense of spatial layering. The camera angle slightly tilts upward to enhance the character's uprightness. On the right edge of the frame, there is a vertical row of Japanese text and the number \"04,\" styled in a photography magazine or brochure. The overall atmosphere blends campus innocence, urban modernity, and the romantic charm of retro motorcycles. It presents an imaging style that is both everyday and artistically beautiful, as if taken with a professional camera on a sunny afternoon. The photos are rich in detail, texture is realistic, light and shadow transitions are natural, color saturation is moderate, and it has strong visual appeal and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
