        {
          "id": "krea2-0110ec14bd63f1727c39dfe9",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙霓虹夜景困倦手持物",
          "prompt": "She knelt on one knee, her body slightly turned to the side, her right hand gently holding a black furry tail, while her left hand hung naturally. Her posture was elegant and full of tension. She wore a black short skirt with white lace and ruffle trim, a white bow at the collar, light blue suspenders on the shoulders, and white pleated cuffs with distinct layers, edges adorned with delicate white lace, paired with white over-the-knee socks and black leather shoes. The overall design blends cuteness and sexiness, presenting the typical Japanese-style maid character image. In the foreground is a metal diamond wire mesh, with a clearly visible grid extending diagonally, framing the figure within it to create a strong visual divide. The middle frame is the main subject, positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, with a blurred city night scene in the background. The outlines of distant skyscrapers are faintly visible, and the neon lights are mainly blue-purple and pink, creating a warm and cool halo effect. In the upper left corner, there is a bright light source area. It could be billboard or architectural lighting, producing soft light spots and bokeh to create a dreamy urban atmosphere. The entire scene uses a low-angle downward view to enhance the visual impact of the characters. The lighting mainly comes from background neon and ambient light, creating strong backlight and side effects. At the same time, fine shadows are cast on the wire mesh, with interlaced light and shadow and high color saturation. The interwoven blue-green and pink tones create a cyberpunk-style futuristic and romantic atmosphere. The image has a film-like texture, slight graininess, and noise in dark areas simulates the shooting effect of professional photography equipment, with an 85mm prime portrait lens with an f/1.8 aperture to achieve a shallow depth of field, completely blurring the background and highlighting the subject. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with the subject's head positioned at the top third of the frame, facing the viewer for direct emotional exchange. The overall atmosphere is both innocent and alluring, yet also carries the loneliness and detachment of urban nightlife, as if a virtual character hidden in a corner of the city suddenly enters the real world. Capturing this story-rich moment instantly conveys an ambiguous beauty between virtual and real, as narrative as cinematic shots, with delicate light and shadow transitions and rich color layers giving the images a powerful artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
