        {
          "id": "krea2-91624af67b060df6206d2152",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套户外微笑倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle downward view, the main subject is a woman. She is positioned at the lower right of the frame, her body slightly leaning forward, head slightly tilted, facing the camera with a confident and playful smile, adding a sense of dynamism and authenticity. She wears a thick dark blue jacket made of windproof and waterproof nylon or cotton, with a slightly raised collar and visible outline of the inner garment at the cuffs. A black backpack strap is slung across her shoulder with clean and sharp lines, and around her neck is a wide, black-and-white striped knitted scarf with clear texture. Solid and warm, with clear layers, her right hand clenched into a fist, raised high above her head, her arm stretched out powerfully, her posture full of strength and youthful vitality, as if celebrating victory or expressing firm belief. Her left hand does not appear in the frame, so the overall movement is natural and expressive. The foreground centers on the figure, occupying the main position and highlighting their emotions and state. The middle ground is the transition of air and light around the figure, with light shining from above and subtle shadows cast in the folds of clothing, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The background is a vast, boundless blue sky, pure and transparent in color, with almost no clouds. Only in the upper right corner of the frame is a small patch of fluffy, pure white cumulus clouds, naturally spreading out like cotton candy, forming a striking contrast with the blue sky. The composition uses an asymmetrical layout, with the figure leaning to the right, leaving plenty of space on the left side for the sky, creating a sense of openness and visual extension. Using a wide-angle lens creates a strong perspective effect, making the figure appear taller and more upright. The sky occupies most of the upper part of the frame, emphasizing the ambient atmosphere. Drawing attention, her raised fist extends upward, guiding the gaze toward the sky, finally resting on the tranquil clouds, creating an emotional elevation. The light and shadow are natural daylight, with sunlight shining from directly above to behind—a typical sunny day top light. The overall lighting intensity is moderate, with no overexposure. The atmosphere is fresh and bright, full of freedom, optimism, and hope. It combines the warmth of everyday life with the aesthetic pursuit of artistic photography, presenting a youthful, positive, and uplifting attitude toward life. The image style combines documentary and aesthetic appeal, as if casually shooting outdoors with a regular phone, yet capturing the most moving moments. The color tone mainly uses warm and cool contrasts, harmonious without conflict. The overall image is clean and fresh, rich in detail, and well-layered, conveying a simple and pure beauty, allowing people to feel the vitality and inner strength under the sunlight.",
