        {
          "id": "krea2-1d717ffa52f0de1f0f1855a3",
          "alias": "单女礼服沙发困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright in a vintage wooden armchair, dressed in a gorgeous one-shoulder gown. Her upper body is fitted with a blend of white lace and sequins, with delicate beads and sparkling crystals adorning the chest and shoulders. The skirt is made of silver-gray sequin fabric, presenting a delicate fishtail silhouette that shimmers like a starry river under the light. The gown's texture appears both light and luxurious under the light. Around her neck is a triple-layered pearl necklace. Each pearl is round and full, radiating a gentle luster. The overall look is elegant and noble. She sits gracefully sideways, her right hand resting lightly on the armrest of the chair, her left hand naturally resting on her knee, as if gazing into a distant dream. The background is a dark stone wall, slightly mottled and revealing a vintage texture. On the right is a large bouquet of softly colored floral decorations, in light pink, off-white, Light purple roses and hydrangeas dominate, with rich layers of flowers and green leaves scattered throughout, creating a romantic and cozy atmosphere. On the left is a translucent white gauze curtain gently swaying in the breeze, adding a touch of haziness to the composition. The composition uses the classic three-part method, with the figure positioned to the right to form the visual focal point, while the left side is left to showcase environmental details. Light streams diagonally from the upper left, creating a soft contrast of light and shadow, while leaving deep shadows in the background and shadows. This enhances the three-dimensionality and dramatic quality of the image. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and dreamy, featuring cinematic-level lighting effects. The tones are mainly warm white, beige, and gray-blue, creating an elegant, romantic, and slightly mysterious atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with a high-end cinematic feel, as if shot with a professional camera and a large aperture lens, presenting depth of field blur and soft out-of-focus halos. The overall image is full of artistic flair and storytelling, like a carefully conceived portrait that embodies the pursuit of beauty found in everyday life. There are also authentic moments of light and emotion that amateur equipment can capture",
