          "id": "krea2-63e2f57cfe17385c4f7ed641",
          "alias": "单女红T恤沙发媚态站立躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways, her posture elegant and relaxed. Her right hand is raised high, elbow bent, fingers gently touching the back of her head, showing a natural sense of stretch and lazy beauty. She slightly lowers her head, her expression thoughtful and gentle, showing a natural pink tone with a slight sheen. On her right shoulder and arm, faint droplets of sweat or water sparkle under the light, as if she has just finished a workout or bathed in a refreshing state. She wears a deep red tight camisole The material is soft and fits the body's curves, with gold trim trimming. The shoulder straps feature a black transparent mesh patchwork design, creating a striking contrast and adding a touch of sensuality and refinement. The background is a white brick wall, with neatly arranged bricks and clear gaps. The wall surface is slightly rough, presenting a minimalist yet modern industrial feel. In the lower left corner, a brown velvet sofa peeks out, with obvious quilting patterns on the surface. The cushion is full and thick, adding warmth and comfort to the scene. The overall composition centers on the figure. Located slightly to the right of the frame, it forms the visual center of gravity, leaving space on the left side to give the image a more breathable and balanced feel. The camera uses medium to close shots with a slightly lower angle, with light and shadow coming from the upper left of the frame. Soft natural light evenly spreads over the subject, creating a delicate transition between light and shadow. The shadowed parts naturally blend into the background without feeling awkward. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and slightly intimate, as if capturing the most authentic and casual moments of daily life. The color palette is mainly warm tones. It creates a warm and layered visual effect. The image doesn't have strong color contrasts, but subtle changes in light, shadow, and materials enhance three-dimensionality and realism. The composition is simple yet detailed, returning to the brick wall and sofa in the background, forming a smooth visual path. The entire scene looks like it was casually shot with an ordinary home camera, preserving a lifelike texture and untouched realism, presenting a sense of intimacy and casualness in everyday photography, while also embodying an artistic aesthetic pursuit. The scene is filled with serene poetry and gentle emotions, allowing people to feel a beauty and tranquility within the ordinary",
