        {
          "id": "krea2-9c17bd6e2aabd7bdb8cd0295",
          "alias": "单女毛衣雪地冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways in the winter snowy landscape, looking especially fresh and charming. She wears a thick sweater jacket made from a patchwork of dark brown, taupe, and orange-red, with clearly visible knit textures. The cuffs feature distinct ribbed designs, and she wears a white turtleneck sweater with a slightly exposed neckline. Wrapped in a soft, fluffy off-white scarf with a delicate velvet edge, she gently gathers the scarf with her fingers long, moving naturally and gracefully The body leans slightly forward, the head slightly turned toward the camera, as if immersed in a tranquil snowy scene. The background is a blurry winter forest, with intertwined branches and some fallen leaves. The remaining sparse yellow-green leaves appear faintly in the sunlight, while distant tree shadows blur into soft light spots, creating a beautiful bokeh effect. Snowflakes drift down from the sky, creating a dynamic visual effect. The overall composition uses shallow depth of field, with the background completely blurred to highlight the main subject. The composition uses a third-division method, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame. The left side is left with space to enhance breathability. Light comes from above, creating a gentle transition between highlights and shadows for the warm afternoon sun. The rich layering of light and shadow enhances the sense of three-dimensionality, making the figure stand out from the background. The overall color tone leans toward warmth, mainly brown, off-white, and pale yellow, paired with cool blue-gray snowy fields and backgrounds, creating a warm and cool atmosphere that creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere in winter. The image has a strong film texture, moderate color saturation, slight graininess, and a retro filter effect. It simulates the texture of professional photography while preserving natural details and realism. The overall style combines artistry with everyday feel, as if a real photo taken with an amateur camera or phone in a winter park, full of life and emotional warmth",
