        {
          "id": "krea2-aee8fd70073e1afdbb6a3bdc",
          "alias": "单女红礼服城市媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman wearing a deep red pleated spaghetti strap gown sat gracefully on the wooden deck. Her right leg was bent and raised, while her left leg was naturally extended. Her posture was composed and full of tension, exuding a blend of urban fashion and sensuality. She wore a burgundy leather cropped jacket casually draped over her shoulders, with sleeves naturally draped down, revealing slender arms and exquisite black manicures. She wore large silver hoop earrings, her makeup exquisite, and her expression calm with a hint of coolness. The overall look was full of modernity and artistic flair. She sits on a brown wooden box, whose surface shows signs of wear, giving it a vintage feel. The background is a wide river, calm and reflecting the city skyline on the opposite bank. In the distance, tall buildings stand tall, with modern architectural styles. The glass curtain wall reflects the sky's light, creating rich layers of light and shadow. Several white yachts and ships are moored along the riverbank, one of which displays the Chinese national flag. On the right side of the painting, part of the hull structure and blue awning can be seen, while in the foreground is a gray metal railing arranged in parallel lines. Extending into the depths of the painting, it enhances the sense of spatial depth. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, body slightly tilted, head slightly raised. The direction of the gaze guides the viewer toward the distance, creating an open and free atmosphere. Light comes from the upper right, bright natural daylight, which shines on the figures, creating clear contrasts between highlights and shadows. The skirt hem and leather jacket surface also show a delicate sheen and texture under the light, while shadows fall on the wooden floor and the figure's legs, adding a sense of depth. The overall color scheme is dominated by red, creating a strong visual contrast with the gray-blue city and river in the background, enriching the color layers. The visual atmosphere combines urban modernity, fashionable avant-garde, and serene poetry, as if capturing a moment of elegance and solitude on a sunny afternoon. The image presents a professional photographic texture, with clear details and high color saturation without exaggeration, embodying the aesthetic characteristics of a high-end fashion shoot while retaining the realism of everyday shooting. It's as if you're shooting outdoors with a high-end camera in natural light, with the lens slightly blurring the background to highlight the subject. The composition is balanced, elements are rich but not chaotic, and the visual guidance is smooth and progressive, conveying an independent, confident, and powerful female image",
