        {
          "id": "krea2-a7117baf383ff74d2227b7df",
          "alias": "单女橙浴袍忧伤躺",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways on rocks covered in white fur, wearing a loose orange-red robe of rough texture. The fabric hangs naturally to form soft pleats, with sleeves slightly rolled up to reveal slender wrists. Her expression is calm yet tinged with melancholy. Her posture is relaxed yet full of tension, her body slightly leaning, arms supporting her upper body, fingers lightly touching the ground. The composition centers on the figure, using close-ups, with soft, fluffy white fur interwoven with rough stones in the foreground, creating a strong textured contrast. The middle ground features the main subject and some clothing outlines, while the background blurs into a bright snowy or icy surface. Under sunlight, numerous starburst light spots and highlights overflow, creating a dreamy, hazy visual effect. The overall light comes from a slanting top, creating a soft transition between light and shadow, with delicate shadows and moderate color saturation. The orange-red and pure white form a strong contrast of warm and cool tones, creating a quiet, ethereal, and poetic atmosphere, with slight film graininess and traces of natural overexposure. It's as if an old camera is capturing a moment in time. The lens focal length is close to 85mm, and the shallow depth of field completely blurs the background, creating an emotional connection. Overall, it presents a surreal romantic style, combining the authentic texture of everyday photography with the refined beauty of artistic creation. There is slight vignetting at the edges of the frame to enhance center focus, and the color layers are rich but not overly vibrant, preserving real light and shadow changes, as if capturing the gentlest moment of a winter afternoon, as if time seems to stand still. The world is left with only her dialogue with this pure white world, the visuals full of storytelling and emotional tension, like classic scenes in movies, with strong visual impact and psychological resonance",
