        {
          "id": "krea2-bd0142aa5149c388ef31e0d5",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫教室沉思坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the classroom floor, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt and a dark gray pleated skirt. She wears delicate silver earrings on her earlobes. She leans slightly to the side, her left hand gently touching the tie, while her right hand naturally rests on a stack of heavy books, presenting a thoughtful expression. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her legs naturally bent, and her body slightly leaning forward, creating a warm and intellectual atmosphere. In the foreground is a neatly stacked pile of books. The top one has a brown cover, while the lower ones have white covers. Text is faintly visible on the spine, and beside it is a dark wooden chair with a light brown backrest. In the middle is a woman, positioned slightly to the left of the center of the scene. In the background is a huge blackboard covered with white mathematical formulas and geometric shapes, including pi, trigonometric functions, calculus symbols, and more. On the right side of the blackboard is a large pile of old books and documents, the paper yellowed and the edges worn. Shows signs of long-term use. The composition uses the classic three-section method, with the main figure positioned on the left third and the gaze directed to the upper right of the frame, creating a sense of visual balance and extension. The overall color scheme is mainly black, white, and gray, accented with red, white, and blue stripes from ties and warm tones of the characters' skin, creating a calm and knowledgeable atmosphere. Light and shadow come from the front left of the painting, with natural shadow transitions without rigid outlines. The blackboard and books in the background show subtle light and shadow changes under the light. This enhances spatial layering. The entire scene feels as if shot in a quiet study room or library, with a strong academic atmosphere and a youthful campus vibe. The photography style leans toward professional portraiture while retaining the simplicity of everyday life. The camera uses a medium-focus lens with well-controlled depth of field, making the subjects stand out clearly and the background moderately blurred, while retaining enough details for the audience to interpret. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, contrast is gentle, and overall it presents a warm and serene artistic atmosphere. Like a carefully curated campus-themed photography work, it is both fashionable and rich in cultural significance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
