        {
          "id": "krea2-7204b118ae3c120c12cc0434",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙床忧伤跪过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on a bed covered with white lace sheets, wearing a bright red Lolita-style dress. The dress is made of high-gloss satin, presenting a silky texture and delicate pleated layers. The hem features multi-layered ruffles, edges trimmed with black tulle for a striking visual contrast. The upper body is fitted with a cinched waist with complex dark red lace patterns and black decorative details. The thin straps outline a graceful shoulder and neck line, naturally draping over her shoulders as she gazes at the pomegranate in her hand. Her expression is calm yet slightly melancholic, gently holding a plump, round pomegranate with both hands. The surface of the fruit is smooth and bright, with the green stem at the top clearly visible. She kneels with her legs crossed, wearing red fishnet stockings with diamond-shaped plaid patterns echoing the red. In the background is a window with white lace curtains, light and light streaming through the frame. Outside, a blurred green scene can be faintly seen, and light streams in from the left, creating a soft transition of light and shadow on the figure. It creates a tranquil, dreamy, and slightly mysterious atmosphere. The overall tone of the painting is cool, mainly gray-blue and white. The red dress becomes the visual focal point, and the strong color contrast enhances the dramatic tension of the scene. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned on the right side of the painting, body in a side pose, head slightly turned to the left front. The direction of sight guides the viewer to focus on the pomegranate in their hand, forming the visual center. On the foreground left are scattered several red carnations, with full petals and rich colors, echoing the skirt. In the lower right corner, there is a bouquet of dried flowers and candles, adding a touch of retro and ceremonial feel. The overall light and shadow treatment is delicate, with the light source coming from the upper left, creating natural shadows and highlights, highlighting the texture of the clothing and the three-dimensionality of the character. The image has the graininess of film photography and slight lens distortion, as if shot with an old camera, with slight overexposure and color shifts, simulating the texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting, emphasizing realism and a sense of life while preserving artistic composition and atmosphere. Overall, it presents a visual narrative that blends Gothic aesthetics, Lolita culture, and poetic metaphor, like a still life portrait, full of symbolic meaning and emotional depth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
