        {
          "id": "krea2-3870fc98a1d5ab5caf23fae2",
          "alias": "单女黑风衣街道忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a city street at night, appearing natural yet slightly melancholic, her expression thoughtful. Her overall posture is relaxed and full of storytelling. She wears a black trench coat with a light blue shirt underneath, dark pants, a thin leather belt tied around her waist, white gloves on her hands, fingers slightly bent, as if about to grasp something or just put it down. Her figure is slender and well-defined, but this imperfection only enhances the sense of realism and life. In the foreground, she occupies the center right of the frame, her body slightly tilted The head turns to the left, creating a dynamic visual balance. The background is a flowing street, with blurred lights and architectural silhouettes creating a distinct motion blur, evoking a sense of time passing and city noise. In the distance, warm yellow circular light sources—possibly streetlights or shop signs—stretch into horizontal lines, forming warm light strips that contrast with the figures in the foreground. In the background, you can faintly see the light and shadow reflected from glass display windows, along with some blurred silhouettes of people and vehicles. This increases the realism and depth of the scene. The composition uses a mid-shot shot, with the character entering from above the waist, leaving enough space to express the atmosphere. The overall composition presents a cinematic narrative style, while the light trajectories in the background also reinforce this directionality. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from the warm yellow background lighting, casting a warm tone on the entire frame and creating soft contour light on the figures. The foreground is accented with a cool blue neon light, contrasting with the warm color and enhancing visual layering The overall atmosphere is quiet and slightly lonely, like a city night returnee walking alone on the way home, full of poetry and philosophical thought. The image texture is delicate, with slight graininess and film texture, simulating amateur photography with moderate color saturation. Shadows retain rich details, highlights are not overexposed, presenting a realistic night street photography atmosphere. The overall composition is stable, the person is center-right, background blur is well handled, and the dynamic blur contrasts sharply with the static foreground. It highlights the emotional expression of the subject, presenting a realistic aesthetic of modern urban life that combines artistic and everyday elements",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
