        {
          "id": "krea2-eadbd01cce7fcd5f739b7154",
          "alias": "单女白围巾摄影棚冷淡侧头",
          "prompt": "An oriental classical beauty dressed in exquisite Hanfu turns sideways to gaze at the camera. She wears a white wide-sleeved Hanfu with colorful geometric patterns embroidered on the collar and cuffs. A red brocade lining is revealed at the collar, and on her shoulders is an off-white hollowed-out embroidered shawl. The stitching is fine, the texture as soft as clouds. Her makeup is elegant and refined, with fair and flawless skin adding a touch of classical charm. The composition uses a medium close-up, with the figure positioned on the right side, head slightly tilted, gazing straight ahead, creating a strong visual direction. The background features a blurred blue-green gradient, with faintly blurred light spots and soft transitions of light and shadow, creating a dreamlike atmosphere and natural contrast of light and shadow. The overall color palette is elegant and warm, with harmonious contrasts of warm and cool tones. It combines the solemnity of traditional Eastern aesthetics with a touch of delicate modern photography, as if shot in a studio with a professional camera. Using softboxes and reflectors, it presents cinematic-level high-definition images. The visuals have strong artistic appeal, like behind-the-scenes footage from a costume drama, yet still retaining the realism of everyday amateur equipment. Details are rich, layers are distinct, and the overall atmosphere is tranquil and noble, full of poetry and storytelling",
