        {
          "id": "krea2-db9335b83b3fda2dbf54cabb",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫困倦持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman, as the subject of the painting, adds a touch of liveliness and laziness, carrying a hint of thoughtful tranquility that makes her look delicate and natural. She wears a white turtleneck sweater with soft and fluffy texture, clearly visible knit texture, and subtle pleats and light changes on the shoulders and sleeves, presenting a realistic sense of clothing. Around her neck is a blue beaded necklace, round and smooth, with a blue radiating pattern in the center. The design is simple yet detailed, and she wears a pair of round blue and white earrings on her earlobes. Echoing the necklace in color, the overall look is fresh and elegant. In the foreground, a transparent soap bubble floats in the front left, reflecting a rainbow-like halo on its surface. The edges are covered with fine colored halos, adding a dreamy and dynamic touch to the scene. The background is an outdoor street scene, with a string of retro-style decorative bulbs hanging above. The bulbs are oval-shaped, available in white, orange, and yellow respectively. The bulbs are connected by fine threads, arranged in an orderly manner in the air, creating a warm festive atmosphere. In the distance, lush green trees sway gently in the wind, their shadows dappled on the ground and figures. Behind them, a partial outline of a light-colored building is simple, windows faintly visible, and some vague signs or decorations beside the building are not fully visible. The overall environment is bright, the sky is a deep blue, and sunlight streams down from the upper right, creating rich layers of light and shadow. The contrast between the warm-toned sunlight and the cool-toned blue accessories enhances the visual impact. The composition uses close-ups. The figure occupies most of the composition, with the head and upper body clearly prominent. The perspective slightly tilts upward, making the figure appear more elongated and elegant. The background blur is well handled, using shallow depth of field to highlight the subject, while retaining enough environmental information to explain the scene. The focus of light and color attracts viewers' attention, while blue accessories and soap bubbles serve as accents, dispersing the view and adding interest. The overall atmosphere is calm and warm, carrying the warmth of everyday life and the fresh vibe of youth. It feels like a real moment shot with a regular phone, retaining slight noise and natural overexposure, enhancing the documentary and realistic feel. The visuals present a unique beauty between artistic photography and life documentation, combining meticulous composition with a casual, natural everyday charm",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
