        {
          "id": "krea2-337553ba56de8db30e89fc80",
          "alias": "单女女仆蓝女仆装室内俏皮坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the center of a black leather sofa, wearing a blue-and-white maid outfit. A white apron paired with a blue short-sleeved dress is adorned with delicate white lace trim at the cuffs and hem. Her right hand gently strokes the apron at her chest, while her left hand hangs naturally by her thigh, her legs slightly turned to the side. She wears smooth, delicate white stockings, walks barefoot on pure white ground, her posture elegant yet slightly reserved. The overall composition is centered and symmetrical, with the figure occupying the center of the painting, forming a visual focal point. The foreground features the main figure and part of the floor; the middle features a black sofa and the lower body of the figure; the background is a pure white wall. The spatial layers are distinct, with light coming from the front slightly left, soft and even, creating a bright and clean atmosphere. Shadows are subtle and transitions naturally. The overall color palette is mainly white, black, and blue, simple and bright, highlighting the character's image. The visual style is realistic with a commercial photography texture, similar to a professional studio shoot. Details are clear, clothing folds look natural, stockings have a noticeable sheen, and the composition is stable. Emphasizing its expressions and clothing features, the overall atmosphere is calm, sweet, and tinged with playfulness, like a fleeting moment captured in a tranquil indoor scene, presenting a carefully arranged aesthetic moment from daily life, like a high-quality portrait shot with a regular camera, full of life and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
