        {
          "id": "krea2-236d9d4b548ba888c1b86b11",
          "alias": "单女白礼服困倦持相机",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman gently holding a sparkling yellow crystal in her mouth, her fingers long and slender, nails neatly trimmed, her hand naturally holding the crystal, as if savoring a subtle emotion or secret. She wears a multi-layered pearl necklace, the pearls lustrous and rounded, layered around her neck. She wears a white gown adorned with sequins and lace details, with elegant shoulder straps and delicate beads and embroidery on the chest. The overall design is gorgeous yet gentle, with a background of blurred stone wall textures presenting a retro gray tone. The wall surface is rough yet textured, with light slanting in from the right side of the painting creating a soft side lighting effect. The highlights are bright and warm, while the shadows are deep and soft, creating a dreamy and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space, guiding viewers to focus on their expressions and movements. The overall color palette is mainly warm gold and off-white, paired with a cool gray background. This creates a sense of visual balance and layering. The visuals have a strong cinematic and artistic aesthetic, as if they come from a classical-style art film, while also infusing the delicacy and delicacy of modern fashion photography. The use of light and shadow is extremely meticulous, highlighting the three-dimensionality of the subjects and the richness of materials. The entire scene is tranquil and full of storytelling, giving a sense of nobility and familiarity, like a moment frozen in a private moment, full of poetry and romance, as if you can hear soft breathing and distant music. The edges of the frame have a slight film graininess and natural lens distortion, simulating the realistic texture of professional camera shooting. Overall, it presents an aesthetic style that blends sophistication and everyday life, combining the refinement of commercial blockbusters with the warmth and authenticity of everyday records.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
