        {
          "id": "krea2-c9ef0c59b8aad412d6c425c3",
          "alias": "单女外套山野忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands among the reeds by the lake, wearing a thick jacket with red and blue checkered patterns and dark clothes underneath. Her overall look is simple yet full of life's atmosphere. Her posture is relaxed yet somewhat lonely, as if in a conversation with nature. In the foreground are several tall, withered yellow reeds, slender stems and fluffy spike-like inflorescences gently swaying in the breeze. Some reeds are outside the scorch, forming soft blurred light spots that add depth and layering to the scene. In the middle is a clear lake water, shimmering on the surface. Reflecting the pale blue sky and the distant mountain peaks, the lakeshore is faintly visible. The lake water displays a cool-toned blue-gray, contrasting with the warm yellow tones in the foreground. The background is the majestic and magnificent Mount Fuji, whose summit is covered in pure white snow, standing out clearly under the clear sky. The mountain's contours are distinct, and the foot is gently shrouded in mist, creating a peaceful and sacred atmosphere. The sky is light blue, with almost no clouds. The light is soft and bright, and sunlight slants in from the right side of the painting, creating a warm backlight effect. Its silhouette edges glow with a golden halo, casting a faint shadow on her body to enhance the sense of three-dimensionality. The composition uses a center-right position of the figure, using the reeds in the foreground as a framework to guide the gaze to the figure, while leaving enough space to showcase the grandeur of the background. The overall color scheme mainly features a contrast of warm and cool tones, with the warm yellow in the foreground harmoniously blending with the cool blue in the middle and the blue-white in the background. The light and shadow treatment is delicate, emphasizing the soft light in the early morning or evening, creating a quiet and profound atmosphere. It carries a poetic sense of solitude and reverence for nature. The overall style resembles the real scenes shot by a daily amateur camera, with a slight film texture and graininess. The tone is slightly warm, with slightly overexposed exposure to enhance sunlight clarity. The image does not pursue perfect sharpness but retains a certain degree of blur and randomness, simulating the randomness and emotional expression found in real shooting. The composition is not deliberately symmetrical, focusing more on capturing moments in natural conditions. The visual guidance starts from the foreground reeds and ultimately extends to the distant mountains. This forms a clear visual pathway, conveying an overall atmosphere of fusion between humans and nature, inner tranquility intertwined with the grandeur of the outside world. It is suitable for expressing themes such as travel, self-reflection, and emotional settling. There are no obvious artificial traces in the painting; all elements appear natural and authentic, as if precious moments were casually recorded on an ordinary day",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
