        {
          "id": "krea2-36ff80bf61d8211bc158ac20",
          "alias": "单女泳装摄影棚戏谑倚靠演奏",
          "prompt": "She wore a one-piece swimsuit combining deep blue and white. The design was simple yet sporty, with smooth and natural shoulder straps and side lines. The small brand logo was on the chest, and the overall look hugged her figure, showcasing youthful energy and elegant curves. Her hands were raised above her head, her arms long and strong, her posture relaxed and relaxed, her body slightly leaning, presenting a dynamic balance with a gentle yet slightly teasing expression. Wearing pale pink lipstick, her skin is fair and delicate with a natural sheen. The background features pure white walls and floors, creating a clean and simple spatial environment. Light softly pours down from above, creating a uniform and bright illumination effect. The shadows are subtle and natural, highlighting the three-dimensional contours of the main subject. The composition uses diagonal lines, with the figure extending from the upper left corner to the lower right, forming a strong visual guiding line. The foreground highlights the upper body and head details, while the middle frame showcases the torso and leg lines. The background is completely blurred into a pure light gray tone, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The overall atmosphere is fresh, bright, full of summer vibes, with smooth light and shadow transitions and a realistic texture, as if shooting with a professional camera in an indoor studio environment. It offers a high degree of realism and artistic beauty, while retaining the natural feel of everyday amateur equipment shooting, such as slight noise and soft depth blur, making the images more lifelike and authentic. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, with blue and white as the main tones, creating a striking contrast yet maintaining harmony. The composition is full but not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space. The visual focus is on the person themselves, conveying a confident, healthy, and sunny youthful image. It is suitable for fashion photography, role-playing displays, or personal artistic creations, presenting a unique charm that combines commercial aesthetics with personal style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
