        {
          "id": "krea2-6b5c149d50ea3b1c922c1299",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔桥坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of an ancient stone bridge, wearing a blue denim jacket over a colorful knit sweater, loose shorts with matching patterns, and white sneakers. She sits naturally relaxed on the brick-paved bridge edge, her shoulders hanging naturally. She slightly turns to look back at the camera, as if immersed in a quiet afternoon. Her right hand gently holds a small black bag, her fingers long, wearing a simple ring. The main figure is positioned in the center-right foreground. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, highlighting the person's affinity and the depth of the scene. The background is a historic stone arch bridge, built from gray-brown stone blocks. The bridge arch is semicircular, sturdy and rustic. Behind the bridge, a pointed tower can be faintly seen, with a roof made of dark gray tiles. On the left side is dense green shrubs, whose leaves reflect crystalline outlines in the backlight, forming a natural blurred foreground. Light slanted in from the upper left of the frame, representing the warm, golden sunshine moment, creating delicate transitions between highlights and shadows, creating a bright and transparent lighting atmosphere. The overall color palette mainly consists of warm yellow, off-white, light blue, and gray-green, harmoniously unified with a film-like texture. The image shows slight graininess and dynamic range control, simulating the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. The depth of field is relatively shallow, the background gradually blurs, creating a beautiful bokeh effect. The composition is balanced and layered, creating a quiet and cozy atmosphere. Like a nostalgic photo capturing travel moments, full of life and humanistic warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
