        {
          "id": "krea2-5aa10018839e815b8111591b",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙城市害羞坐持包",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor staircase, looking both elegant and slightly shy. Her left hand rests gently on her shoulder, while her right hand rests naturally on the steps, looking relaxed and composed. She wears a wine-red, semi-transparent long-sleeve dress. The fabric is thin and breathable, with a subtle sheer effect that outlines her curves. A gold chain belt is tied at the waist, adding a touch of vintage and luxury. She wears black high heels with smooth, reflective tops, and pointed toes that accentuate her leg lines. A slender ankle chain is revealed at the ankle. The overall look is fashionable and sexy. She carries a small black-and-white plaid bag crossbody, which is compact and delicate, perfectly complementing the overall style. The background is a stone staircase set in a city nightscape. The steps are made of gray stone, each step embedded with warm yellow light strips, softly and evenly illuminating the entire scene, creating a warm and layered light and shadow effect. In the distance, blurred outlines of city buildings and some green plants can be seen, with the lights scattered throughout, creating blurred light spots that add depth and a dreamy atmosphere to the scene. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot to highlight the character's tall figure and aura. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with the body extending diagonally. The right leg is straight, the left leg bent, forming a graceful S-shaped curve that gradually descends along the arms, body, and legs, finally focusing on the high heels, creating a smooth flow of vision. Light and shadow mainly come from the warm glow inside the steps, softly casting on the figure, creating a natural transition of light and shadow that enhances the sense of three-dimensionality. At the same time, the bokeh light spots in the background add a romantic touch to the image. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow and burgundy, paired with dark clothing and black high heels, creating a strong color contrast that creates a sense of privacy and sophistication at an urban night. The image texture is delicate and realistic, as if shot with a professional camera. The details are clear and noise well controlled, presenting cinematic image quality while preserving the beauty of everyday moments. It's like capturing a gentle moment of a woman sitting quietly on a street staircase on a quiet night. The whole scene is full of storytelling. It makes one imagine what she is waiting for or pondering. The atmosphere is tranquil and enchanting, combining the coldness of a modern city with the unique softness and strength of women. The composition is balanced yet dynamic, and the alternating light and shadow reveal a subtle luxury and restrained confidence, like a carefully crafted art photograph, yet also like a snapshot of real life—unforgettable at first glance",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
