        {
          "id": "krea2-794020eef4ee4ff729943de0",
          "alias": "单女制服街道微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the back seat of a car, with a hint of playfulness and innocence, looking directly at the camera as if about to speak or chuckle. She wears a typical Japanese sailor uniform: a beige short-sleeved shirt with a deep blue collar and white stripes, a pink bow tied at the collar, dark stripes on the cuffs, and a dark gray pleated short skirt. Her legs are together, her right leg slightly bent, wearing black stockings that naturally show her toes. Her left knee is bent, her calf raised, toes touching the ground, both hands naturally placed on either side of her thighs, and her right hand clenched at her side Her posture is natural and relaxed, with a hint of deliberately crafted refinement. She is in the rear seats of a modern car, made of dark gray leather with stitched textures. The headrest is wide and comfortable, and on the right side, you can see seatbelt buckles and red buttons. The roof lining is light gray, and when the sunroof opens, the city's buildings above are visible. In the background, you can see high-rise residential buildings. The exterior walls are beige and gray, windows are neatly arranged, and in the distance, green trees dot the area. The ground is a city road, with green belts and shrubs along the roadside. Sunlight streams in from outside, creating soft natural light. Light slants from the left into the cabin, casting light shadows on the seats and doors. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, creating a peaceful yet everyday atmosphere. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure centered slightly to the left, occupying the main position. The windows and sunroof form a frame structure, guiding the gaze toward the people. The scenery outside extends as a background, adding spatial depth. The color scheme is mainly warm tones, with beige, pink, deep blue, and gray-black creating a harmonious contrast. Overall, it presents a blend of youthful campus style and urban life. The image texture is realistic and delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, yet retains authentic details of everyday life. There is a slight film graininess and natural noise, enhancing the photo's realism and artistic atmosphere. The color tone is slightly cool, highlighting the soft light of morning or evening, creating a quiet yet slightly melancholic everyday mood. The entire scene seems to be frozen in an ordinary yet story-filled moment. It evokes images of the return journey after school or a chance encounter, with rich details in the images—from the expressions of the figures and the folds of clothing to the textures of the car interiors—all clearly visible, conveying a gentle yet authentic sense of youth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
