        {
          "id": "krea2-f7556d414ad680e666b78027",
          "alias": "单女蓝礼服广场冷淡坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors on a brick windowsill, wearing a light blue spaghetti strap gown. The hem of the skirt hangs naturally, the material light and flowing, presenting soft folds and shifting light and shadow. She leans relaxedly against the wall, legs crossed, wearing black leather shoes and white ankle socks. She holds a pink drink in her hand, the liquid glistening faintly, resembling a chilled drink or fruit tea, somewhat messy. Looking at the camera, her expression carries a faint sense of detachment and laziness. The background is a beige tiled wall, mottled and weathered. There are signs of age. There is a square opening on the wall, resembling an old window or ventilation opening. Inside, you can faintly see green plants. The foreground and sides are surrounded by dense greenery, with broad leaves of various shapes, including palmate and slender leaves. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating mottled shadows on the walls and figures. The light is warm and soft, presenting a golden summer afternoon tone. The overall tone of the painting is warm, with a slight film texture, moderate color saturation, and a slight retro filter effect. The composition uses an asymmetrical layout with the center slightly left. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center, with the body slightly to the right, their heads facing the camera. Their gazes meet, forming a visual focal point. The green leaves in the foreground block the edges of the frame, adding depth and layering. The middle ground features the figures and windowsill area, while the background features walls, plants, and distant blurred architectural outlines, creating a semi-enclosed courtyard or balcony atmosphere. Light and shadow slanted down from above, creating strong light and shadow spots that highlight the figure's outline and the texture of the clothing. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, leisurely, and full of life, as if capturing the most authentic and poetic moment of an ordinary afternoon. The images feature the graininess and color transitions unique to film photography, with rich details, clear layering, and a full, uncrowded composition. The visuals guide nature, from green leaves in the foreground to figures in the middle to walls and plants in the background, creating a visual flow from near to far. The use of light and shadow enhances the image's sense of depth and warmth, presenting an unintentional beauty found in everyday life. Like precious memories casually captured with an old camera, it carries a strong sense of nostalgia and artistic atmosphere, with mainly blue, green, and yellow tones, harmonious contrasts of warm and cool tones, and the images are tranquil yet full of vitality",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
