        {
          "id": "krea2-594010b9c8493b34e6731f6e",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫户外沉思侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman presents her profile from the side, adding a touch of casualness and gentleness. She wears a pair of fine-rimmed glasses made of light gold metal, with transparent lenses that reflect the blurred light and shadow of the surrounding environment. Her expression is thoughtful, as if immersed in a thought or scene. She wears a blue and white plaid shirt with neat and even patterns, alternating shades of blue, presenting a classic vintage style. The shirt collar is open, revealing the white crew-neck T-shirt underneath. The hem is slightly loose, and the cuffs are rolled up above the elbows. It appears casual yet layered, with overall clothing that is simple yet stylish. The background is an indoor environment, slightly blurred. Behind it is a light gray wall and a large window. Soft natural light streams in outside, forming a bright halo area. The window frame lines are simple, faintly revealing the outlines of outdoor scenery, creating a sense of tranquility and transparency. The foreground focuses on the main subject, with medium and close-up shots in composition. The figure occupies most of the space on the right side of the painting, with the head slightly tilted, creating a sense of visual flow. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the outlines and details of the characters while preserving environmental information to enhance realism. Light comes from the front left, soft and even, creating a natural transition between light and dark, enhancing three-dimensionality and highlighting texture. The overall atmosphere is quiet, rational, and slightly artistic. The color tone is mainly cool, with blue-white checkered and gray-white tones harmoniously unified, creating a fresh and clean visual impression. The image has the realistic texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting, such as accurate camera focus but slight noise, and natural color reproduction. The details are rich, the transitions between light and shadow are smooth, without excessive sharpening or embellishment, presenting a lifelike, documentary aesthetic. The composition is balanced, the main subject is prominent, and the background is moderately blank, giving a sense of breath and room for imagination.",
