        {
          "id": "krea2-136497e620d0fdf24e9d1052",
          "alias": "单女白外套雪地困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white sofa, wearing a white plush hooded jacket with fluffy white fur trimmed at the edges. She wears white plush boots on the lower half, her feet slightly raised, looking relaxed and relaxed. She gently holds a transparent glass Christmas ball in both hands, with snowflake patterns printed inside the sphere reflecting soft light dots. Her fingers are long and fair, her nails neatly trimmed and painted with light pink polish. She leans against an off-white coarse knit blanket, whose texture is clearly visible. The sofa is made of pure white leather, smooth and soft. On the right side is a thick white cushion, and in the background is a tall Christmas tree. Its dense crown and branches are covered with a thin layer of white artificial snow, making it look crystal clear. Multiple red round glass spheres hang from the tree, some of which feature white spots or snowflake relief patterns on their surfaces. There is also a transparent sphere containing white balls and ribbons inside, with golden cords hanging from it. At the top is a red ribbon shaped like a bow. The trunk is partially covered, but green pine needles and white snow intertwine. In the upper right corner of the painting is a light beige wood-framed poster or calendar with blurred text. The wall is light gray, and soft natural light streams through the right window, creating a warm side backlighting effect. Light pours down from the upper right, and a warm yellow halo envelops the space, creating a cozy and peaceful festive atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the center left, body slightly tilted and head slightly raised. The viewer's gaze guides the audience to focus on her expression and the Christmas ball in her hand. In the foreground, her raised white plush boots occupy a large area below the frame, creating a sense of visual layering. The middle ground features the main figure with the sofa and blanket, while the background features a Christmas tree and walls, giving a clear sense of spatial depth. The overall color scheme is mainly white and off-white, accented with bright red and green. The color scheme is harmonious and unified, with delicate light and shadow handling. Highlights and shadows transition naturally, presenting a realistic texture reminiscent of everyday photography, as if capturing a warm family moment. It carries a slight film graininess and realistic exposure details, creating a festive atmosphere that is both dreamy and close to life. The images have strong narrative and emotional warmth, allowing people to feel the joy and tranquility of Christmas",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
