          "id": "krea2-b2eafa51e4791a296528f681",
          "alias": "单女短裤街道困倦站立持相机",
          "prompt": "She wears a light beige two-piece outfit. The top features a cropped cropped top with delicate pleats and tie decorations on the chest. The sleeves are short-sleeved puff sleeves, light and flowing. She pairs matching high-waisted shorts with elastic pleats at the waist, creating a fresh and sweet yet fashionable look. Her body is slightly turned to the camera, and her left hand naturally rests on her thigh. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, her right hand hanging at her side, fingers long and slender. Sunlight streams in from the left side of the frame, forming a soft golden halo on her body. The rich layers of light and shadow create a warm and dreamy visual effect. In the foreground is a wide dark gray asphalt pavement, with clear white traffic markings and yellow lane markings. Several cars are parked by the roadside. On the left is the rear of a white SUV, its headlights lit up, the body lines smooth and modern, and the center is a green belt along the sidewalk. Low green shrubs are planted, and next to it stands a sturdy phoenix tree. Its trunk is grayish-white, with clearly visible bark grain. The branches stretch upward, with dense green leaves forming a natural sunshade. Through the glass window, you can see the store's furnishings and blurry figures. A man wearing an orange T-shirt sits on a chair outside, looking down at his phone, with a city street scene in the background. In the distance, there are other building silhouettes and pedestrians. The sky appears pale blue with a hint of clouds, and the lighting is soft and even. The entire scene is shot from a head-up perspective, with the main focus on the person, using the golden ratio to arrange the main subjects. Through vehicles in the foreground, trees and shops in the center, and buildings in the background create a sense of spatial depth. The visual guide line extends from the ground markings and streets to the shop signs in the distance. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, carrying the lazy vibe of a summer evening, with warm yellow tones as the main color. Contrasting with cool-toned buildings and roads, it enhances the layering and realism of the image. The overall style combines the documentary feel of daily life with the artistic beauty of light and shadow, as if capturing moments casually on the street with a high-end smartphone, offering strong immersion and storytelling",
