        {
          "id": "krea2-d70a86fa70f664c24b2508c1",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道注视",
          "prompt": "A woman squatted on the asphalt road of a city street, wearing a white short-sleeved T-shirt and dark blue denim shorts, paired with black-and-white platform sneakers, and a dark blue baseball cap with white lettering on the hat. On her right shoulder, she slung a dark blue denim backpack diagonally, with the classic Chanel double C embroidery on the front and a wide matching color strap. The overall design is simple yet stylish. The figure is positioned slightly to the left in the lower middle part of the painting, forming a visual focal point. A thick tree trunk extends diagonally from the upper left corner to the upper right. The bark texture is rough, the surface is covered with mottled moss and a few green leaves. Some branches and leaves hang down, forming a natural frame structure that blocks part of the sky, creating an atmosphere where nature and city blend together. The background is a quiet residential alley, with buildings with light pink walls on the left, decorated with colorful graffiti above the walls. It features a blue star-shaped pattern and some Chinese characters. Beneath the wall is a low wall made of gray stone bricks, with two bulletin boards bordered by wooden frames, filled with various posters and notices. Behind the bulletin boards are dense green vines climbing along the wall. On the right is another white building with a simple wall, featuring a round window and an open doorway. Inside the doorway, parked vehicles and interior furnishings can be faintly seen. The ground is paved with reddish-brown square tiles and a sidewalk connected to the dark gray asphalt pavement. On the road surface, there are clear white traffic markings and several round manhole covers, scattered with a few withered yellow leaves. The overall lighting is soft, presenting the warm afternoon sunshine. The sky is blocked by leaves, with only a few bright spots visible. The interplay of light and shadow creates a natural contrast of light and dark. The colors are mainly warm yellow, mixed with green, blue, white, and gray, creating a harmonious and unified tone. The image has a slight film grain texture and a retro filter effect. The overall composition uses low-angle shots, with the perspective close to the ground, highlighting the characters' postures. Using branches in the foreground to form visual guiding lines that draw the gaze to the subject, the background is blurred, enhancing spatial layering and creating a casual moment of everyday beauty. It feels like a real street scene captured with an old-fashioned film camera, full of life and youthful vitality, while retaining a retro artistic cinematic feel. The details are rich, from the folds of the characters' clothing to the textures of the ground, all clearly visible. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and natural, full of storytelling, conveying a casual yet beautiful street photography style",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
