        {
          "id": "krea2-8318c0e4fc1efe3e0b792556",
          "alias": "单女困倦侧头",
          "prompt": "The headband clearly displays the \"Panasonic\" logo, and the earphone cable naturally hangs down to her chest. She wears a white spaghetti-strap lace-trimmed pajama or loungewear, with slender straps and delicate lace trim decorations on the neckline and cuffs. The fabric is lightweight and breathable, presenting a soft pleated texture. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the right side of the frame, the head slightly tilted, forming graceful curves. The background features blurred green plants and mottled light and shadow, presenting a light green bokeh effect that creates a dreamy atmosphere. The light comes from the upper left, softly scattered natural light, creating warm highlight areas. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, the tone fresh and bright, full of the lazy atmosphere of a summer afternoon. The image has a slight film graininess and slight lens distortion, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, with a retro film texture. The background is completely blurred, creating a strong depth of field contrast. The composition is breathable and dynamic, and the overall atmosphere is peaceful, gentle, and healing. It feels as if capturing a private moment under the afternoon sun, allowing people to feel the pure joy and inner peace brought by music. The image is rich in detail yet retains a soft-focused, hazy beauty. The entire image exudes a subtle beauty found in everyday life Like precious moments casually captured with a portable camera, full of life and artistic charm",
