        {
          "id": "krea2-f09a41f071181ab8d8c4033f",
          "alias": "单女衬衫摄影棚微笑坐书写",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the soft indoor light, adding a touch of gentleness and laziness. She wears a pair of fine-framed round glasses, with transparent and non-reflective lenses. The frames have a delicate metallic texture, revealing a subtle smile. She wears a loose shirt in light beige or cream with slightly puffed sleeves, making the material look soft and comfortable. The collar is slightly open, giving off a casual yet elegant vibe. Fingers are long and slender, nails neatly trimmed, posture natural and relaxed, body slightly tilted, presenting a state of contemplation or tranquility. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right center of the composition, forming a visual focal point. The background is a blurred indoor environment, possibly a corner of a café, study, or studio. The walls are light gray or off-white, with subtle textures and changes in light and shadow. In the distance, vertical wooden or metal strip-like structures are blurred into soft lines, creating a sense of spatial depth. The overall background tones are mainly warm yellow and grayish-white. Light enters from the left or upper left, creating a soft side light. The shadow transitions are natural, enhancing the separation between subject and background. The composition uses close-ups, focusing on the upper body of the subject, leaving a moderate negative space to avoid crowding, creating a smooth visual path. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, carrying a poetic sense of everyday life, as if capturing a quiet moment of study or writing. The image texture is delicate, color saturation is moderate, and the tone leans toward warmth. With a slight retro filter effect, it simulates a combination of professional studio lighting and natural light, presenting clear details and realistic texture similar to high-resolution camera photography. The overall style combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life, making it suitable for scenes with intellectual and gentle charm, focus, or artistic themes",
