        {
          "id": "krea2-58d0b7c59236a72e3a185153",
          "alias": "单女白礼服摄影棚持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a white strapless gown with fluffy ruffled gauze sleeves on the shoulders. The dress was adorned with large red and pink floral embroidery patterns and delicate patterns outlined with fine gold threads, presenting an overall romantic and elegant palace style. She stood slightly to the side, her head slightly turned toward the camera, adding a touch of laziness and liveliness. The background was a warm indoor environment, with wooden door frames or walls visible on the left The texture is clear and natural. The right background is blurred with warm yellow curtains or fabric curtains, and above, a chandelier or wall lamp can be faintly seen casting a soft halo, creating a hazy bokeh effect. Light streams diagonally from the front left of the image, creating a contrast of light and shadow, highlighting the delicate texture of the skin and the three-dimensional layers of the clothing. At the same time, a rich focus blur is created in the background, creating a sense of depth and space. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the image, creating a dynamic visual balance and an overall warm and romantic atmosphere. Full of sophistication and artistic atmosphere, it feels like capturing a moment at a private and luxurious dinner venue. The image presents a texture that is both realistic and dreamlike, blending professional studio lighting with natural light. The colors are mainly warm tones, with brown and beige backgrounds further enhancing the cozy atmosphere. The details are handled with extreme finesse, presenting high-resolution visual quality, with a strong cinematic feel and a fashionable blockbuster vibe, reminiscent of portraits taken with high-end cameras and large-aperture lenses. It emphasizes the perfect blend of character expressions and the ambient atmosphere, presenting a serene and enchanting Eastern aesthetic",
