        {
          "id": "krea2-5a80398258cda884fb58896a",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣舞台沉思倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways against a light-colored wall in the room, adding a touch of laziness and casualness. She wears an off-white knit cardigan layered with a light-colored lace slip dress underneath. The sleeves of the knit cardigan are slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists. Her hand gently rests on the cardigan, her fingers long and natural, her posture relaxed and graceful, carrying a hint of shyness and contemplation, presenting a natural soft pink hue. Light streams in from the left, like natural light streaming through the window in the morning or afternoon, creating a soft transition between highlights and shadows. The background is a simple light beige wall with no unnecessary decoration, creating a clean and pure sense of space. The composition uses medium to close-up shots, with the figures occupying the main subjects. The slightly slanted body lines bring dynamic beauty. At the same time, light enters from the upper left corner, casting clear light and shadow contours on the wall and figures, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality and spatial depth. The overall atmosphere is quiet and warm, full of life and artistic flair, as if capturing a tranquil everyday moment, creating a soft and comfortable visual experience. The image texture is delicate and authentic. Like shooting with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens, it features slight film graininess and natural depth of field blur. The light and shadow are soft and layered, presenting an overall aesthetic style that is gentle, serene, and healing. It reflects the aesthetic tendencies of Japanese portraits or independent photographers. The edges of the frame are slightly overexposed to natural overexposure, simulating the real camera's performance under strong light, enhancing the sense of presence and documentary quality. While preserving enough detail and color fidelity, the subject appears both authentic and artistically beautiful. The composition emphasizes blank space and balance, avoiding overcrowding, so the viewer's gaze naturally focuses on the characters' expressions and postures. The overall atmosphere conveys a quiet sense of self-companionship and inner peace, as if on an ordinary afternoon, a person quietly enjoys their own time, with no unnecessary elements distracting the image, focusing on capturing the most natural state of the subject, presenting a simple yet moving beauty",
