        {
          "id": "krea2-c6808b047d818ac8310337c4",
          "alias": "单女天使红毛衣桥微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor stone railing, adding a touch of liveliness and naturalness. She shows off her white, neat teeth, and her smile is sweet and sincere, full of infectiousness. She wears a red knitted cardigan, soft and thick in texture, warm and rich in color, layered with white underneath. She wears a dress with vintage floral patterns, vibrant but not noisy. The overall style is elegant and layered, with her left hand steadily holding a bouquet of flowers wrapped in white semi-transparent wrapping paper, with yellow and pale pink roses visible inside. The flowers are full and delicate, with green leaves scattered throughout. The bouquet is tied with a white ribbon printed with the words \"Just for you,\" written in delicate and elegant style, rich in detail. She wears delicate gold earrings, with a red round gemstone pendant that echoes the color of her clothes. Around her neck is a delicate gold necklace with a heart-shaped pendant and little angel wings. The design is unique, adding a romantic touch. The composition centers on the figure, using medium shots that occupy the main part of the frame, with the head slightly tilted. The gaze gently looks toward the camera, creating a warm visual exchange. The background is a blurred cityscape, with the silhouettes of tall buildings and a bridge structure visible in the distance. The water surface reflects light and buildings, presenting a soft light and shadow effect. The sky is clear and sunny, with light shining from the front and side, creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The overall tone of the painting is harmonious and unified, dominated by warm tones, with red, yellow, beige, and other colors complementing each other, conveying a warm and romantic feeling. The light and shadow transitions are natural, details rich, and texture is authentic. It feels as if a real scene was shot with a professional camera, giving it a cinematic texture while preserving the intimacy and realism of daily life. It seems to record an ordinary yet beautiful moment. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and joyful, full of youthful energy and love, giving a warm and healing feeling. The composition is balanced, the subject is prominent, the background is well rendered, and the visual guidance is clear, presenting a peaceful and happy state. The images are full of the breath of life and artistic beauty, like a carefully captured urban portrait. It combines modernity with warmth, allowing people to experience the simplest and purest beauty in life.",
