        {
          "id": "krea2-f1d01bf7cba60c93590504ad",
          "alias": "单女制服户外坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the concrete steps outdoors, dressed in a Japanese high school girls' uniform: a white shirt paired with a dark bow tie, over which she wears a loose dark gray hooded sweatshirt. The sleeves and hem have natural pleats and wear marks, giving her a casual yet authentic look, adding a touch of softness and vividness. She leans slightly to the side, knees together, hands naturally resting on them, fingers relaxed, posture natural and unpretentious. On her feet are brown leather loafers, black stockings wrapping her legs, giving the legs a smooth line. The overall look presents a youthful campus daily vibe, showing neat white teeth and a friendly and natural expression, as if silently communicating with the audience. The background is a blurred beach or sandy surface in a soft beige color, contrasting with the figures and highlighting the main subject. The middle ground shows the concrete steps she sits on, with a slightly rough surface with fine textures and mottled marks. The edges show slight wear and stains, enhancing the scene's realism. The composition uses a centered composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. The body is slightly tilted, creating a visually dynamic balance. At the same time, the shallow depth of field effect blurs the background, highlighting the main subject. This is then guided to the floor and steps, creating a complete sense of spatial layering. Light and shadow come from the front and sides, with soft natural light evenly illuminating the figure. The shadow transitions are delicate without strong contrasts of light and dark, presenting a warm and tranquil atmosphere that adds texture and dimension. The overall color palette is mainly gray, white, and black, accented with brown shoes and a green backpack. The color combination is harmonious and unified, creating a warm and cozy atmosphere. Tranquil and full of youthful energy, the images have a documentary feel of everyday life, as if taken casually with an amateur camera. The details are rich and authentic, capturing moments of leisure and beauty of youth outside the campus. The images present a simple yet moving beauty, allowing people to feel the passage of time and the preciousness of youth",
