        {
          "id": "krea2-76c75a92d72d34e60141bc81",
          "alias": "单女米连体衣健身房坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a gray yoga mat in the gym, wearing light yellow skinny sweatpants and a beige long-sleeve bodysuit, with white mid-calf socks. She is holding up a white smartphone in her right hand for a selfie, looking slightly fluffy. Her body is slightly tilted, her right leg bent close to the ground, left leg straight, and knee slightly bent, presenting a relaxed yet dynamic posture. Her legs are smooth and graceful, with clearly defined leg muscles, showing good posture and athletic condition. Her left hand rests naturally on her left knee, fingers long Nails are neatly trimmed, and the overall posture is both casual and full of design sense. The foreground is the main subject, occupying the center right of the frame. The background is the gym environment, and on the left is a large mirror reflecting blue fitness balls, black training equipment, and a neat row of equipment racks on the other side of the room. The mirror's edges have a slight reflection, enhancing the sense of spatial layering. On the right is indoor lighting, with a bar-shaped light strip on the ceiling that emits a soft warm yellow glow, illuminating the entire space and creating a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. The ground is paved with green artificial turf contrasting with gray yoga mats, with white lines outlining the edges to enhance visual guidance. The middle ground is the training area around the figures, including a blue foam roller leaning against the wall, with a power outlet and a black charging cable nearby. The details are authentic and believable. In the background, more fitness equipment such as barbell racks and bench benches can be seen, but these are blurred to highlight the main subject. The composition uses a diagonal layout, with the figure tilting from the lower left to the upper right, the gaze facing the camera, creating strong visual guidance The camera angle is slightly overlooked, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The light and shadows come from warm yellow lights from the top and sides, soft and even. The figures have delicate shadow transitions, emphasizing a sense of three-dimensionality. The mirror in the background reflects light sources and objects, creating rich light and shadow effects. The overall atmosphere is warm and comfortable, full of life. It combines the realism of daily fitness with the refined beauty of artistic photography. The main color tones are warm yellow, gray-white, and green, harmonious and unified, with delicate texture and rich details, presenting a healthy and The vibrant and fashionable modern lifestyle seems to capture an ordinary yet precious moment, allowing people to feel the joy and confidence that exercise brings",
