        {
          "id": "krea2-27d110c2c2f66a370acd7da5",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服庭院害羞坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an outdoor wooden bench, dressed in a deep blue sailor uniform with white stripes on the collar and cuffs, paired with pure white pantyhose and black leather shoes. Her posture is natural and relaxed, legs crossed, and her expression is slightly shy and contemplative. The overall look presents a typical Japanese style: her left hand gently rests on her right knee, fingers bent slightly, her movements delicate and expressive. Beside her is an orange teddy bear doll, adding childlike fun and warmth to the scene. The background is lush green plants and blooming flowers, including pink, Purple, yellow, and white flowers form a richly layered flower wall. Some flowers are blurred to create a dreamlike depth effect. On the right, a golden butterfly ornament hangs among the branches and leaves, its wings semi-transparent, reflecting a warm halo that enhances the fairy-tale atmosphere. The entire scene is set in a well-lit courtyard or garden, with gray wooden floorboards laid on the floor. The benches are made of light yellow wood with slightly worn edges, giving off a sense of life. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating mottled light and shadow. At the same time, soft shadows are cast on the ground and object surfaces, with light coming from the upper left to simulate the effect of a slanting afternoon sun. The overall color scheme is mainly green, blue, and white, accented with warm yellow and orange, creating harmonious and layered colors. The composition uses a centered left-leaning main figure layout, using a bench in the foreground and flower beds in the background to form a natural frame, guiding the gaze to the figure. Flowers and butterflies in the background serve as secondary elements, enriching the composition without overshadowing the main picture. The light and shadow transitions are delicate, with clear highlights and shadows that are distinct but not awkward. It creates a warm, tranquil, and slightly romantic atmosphere. The overall image features a strong Japanese photo style, blending youth, sweetness, and natural beauty. It feels like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, while preserving the intimacy and authentic texture of everyday life. The image is highly clear, rich in detail, and the color saturation is moderate without being overly flashy, presenting a fresh and natural aesthetic. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and beautiful, like a gentle memory on a summer afternoon. It allows people to feel the beauty of youth and the poetry of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
