        {
          "id": "krea2-b39c7c8cc273a0c7daeb087b",
          "alias": "单女公寓倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, her posture elegant and relaxed. On her feet are beige flat sandals with nails painted in light pink. The overall look is fresh and natural, full of youthful energy. Her body leans slightly forward, presenting a friendly and approachable posture. The background is a clear blue sky, with bright sunshine streaming down from above and the sides. Clear shadows cast on the ground and the figures create a strong contrast of light and shadow, emphasizing the subject's three-dimensional effect. In the distance, you can see blurred trees, streetlights, utility poles, and some industrial-style gray cabinet equipment. These elements create a typical urban street scene. The composition uses low-angle shots, making the characters appear more prominent and tall, while enhancing visual impact. The foreground features a rough asphalt pavement with rich detail and obvious graininess, while the middle ground is the main subject, occupying the center of the frame. It becomes the absolute visual focal point, with the background moderately blurred, creating a shallow depth effect. This creates a distinct spatial relationship between the characters and the environment. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is bright and warm, emitting a soft sheen, with moderate color saturation. The black-and-white clothing contrasts strongly with the bright sky, creating a harmonious and unified overall tone. The image conveys a leisurely and leisurely daily atmosphere on a summer afternoon, as if capturing an ordinary yet beautiful moment, with a strong sense of reality and a sense of life. Just like a real-life scene casually captured with a regular digital camera, there are no deliberate signs of posing, making it appear more natural and captivating. The composition is stable and balanced, with the subject centered slightly to the left, leaving space on the right side for the viewer to extend their gaze, guiding viewers to focus on their surroundings without distracting their attention from the subject. The overall composition is full of vitality, combining artistic beauty with a realistic everyday texture, presenting a unique charm that lies between professional photography and amateur documentation",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
