        {
          "id": "krea2-948a97832646a8725f992f1a",
          "alias": "单女毛衣街道自信站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A curvy woman stands by a metal railing on a city street, naturally draped over her shoulders and chest. She wears a gray short-sleeved, high-neck tight knit top that hugs her body, showing off her graceful shoulders and neck lines and slender waist. She pairs it with light blue high-waisted skinny jeans that perfectly outline the curves of her hips and legs. She wears a pair of white pointed stiletto heels, with long, straight heels, giving the whole look a stylish and captivating look. She leans sideways against a metal railing, her left hand lightly resting on it, body slightly leaning back, right leg bent and raised, toes touching the ground, presenting an elegant and confident posture. The background is a red brick wall with a noticeably rough texture, neatly arranged bricks that look somewhat aged. Beside the wall is a black sculpture or decoration with an abstract shape and textured details. On the right stands a poster with the words \"STREET SCENE\" printed on several portraits, with a warm tone of the image. The ground is a blue asphalt pavement, with faint figures moving in the distance. The lighting throughout the scene is soft, like natural light at dusk. Sunlight pours down from above, creating a warm golden outline glow on the figures. The rich layers of light and shadow create a realistic urban street atmosphere. The composition uses a vertical perspective, with the figure occupying the center right, body forming an S-shaped curve. The foreground is the main figure, the middle ground features railings, posters, and parts of the street, while the background features red brick walls and distant pedestrians. The overall visual focus is on the figures, with harmonious color combinations. The contrast between gray, blue, and white and the warm tones of red brick creates a strong visual impact and artistic feel, while retaining the realism of everyday street photography. It feels like a high-quality photo taken with a professional camera, with clear details, authentic texture, and a warm and story-rich atmosphere",
