        {
          "id": "krea2-2c904f0a518a29a540cc962d",
          "alias": "单女绿浴袍竹林自信坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in traditional Chinese attire sits quietly atop a stone wall. She wears a light green wide-sleeved robe layered with a white cross-collar garment. The fabric is light and soft, naturally pleated and drapes. The sleeves are slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists. Her right hand gently holds an unfolded yellow oil-paper umbrella. The umbrella surface is a warm yellow tone, with the ribs clearly visible. The top of the umbrella tilts slightly upward, forming a gentle curve, casting a faint shadow beneath the umbrella. The figure is given a layer of hazy beauty. The woman sits sideways, legs naturally bent, wearing plain cloth shoes, her posture elegant and composed. Beside her sits a finely woven bamboo basket, filled with freshly picked wildflowers and green leaves. The flowers are mainly pale yellow and pale white, with lush branches and rich details. The stone wall is made of irregular black rocks, with a rough and uneven surface and clear texture. Some stones are illuminated by sunlight, showing a grayish-brown sheen, while the rest are hidden in shadow, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The background features rolling green mountains, covered with dense vegetation and displaying varying shades of green. The distant peaks are indistinctly outlined, gradually blending into the mist. The sky is a bright pale blue, with a soft white halo near the horizon. The overall light comes from the front left, representing slanting sunlight in the early morning or evening. Golden light shines on the figure, outlining a soft outline, while long shadows cast on the stone wall enhance the sense of spatial depth in the composition. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the composition, leaving a large space on the right to depict distant mountains and sky, creating a broad visual extension. The stone wall and bamboo basket in the foreground serve as guiding elements, drawing the gaze toward the main figure. In the middle scene, the figure and oil-paper umbrella form the visual focal point. The mountain range in the background progresses step by step, creating a profound depth effect. The natural distribution of light and shadow, combined with backlight and side lighting, gives the painting both a sense of depth and softness. The atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, full of poetic and classical charm, resembling a scene from a traditional Chinese landscape painting. It carries a strong sense of Eastern aesthetics, with tones mainly of green, yellow, and brown, complemented by white and light blue. The colors are harmoniously unified, presenting an overall calm, leisurely, and slightly nostalgic emotional tone. The images are delicate and refined, with rich details. From the texture of clothing to the shapes of plants to the texture of stones, everything is clearly visible, possessing strong artistic appeal. It feels like a high-quality photographic work taken with a professional camera, or like a realistic illustration by a master, combining realism with artistry. It evokes the beautiful moments when time stands still",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
