        {
          "id": "krea2-63d31ee7893cacbcda3dbf27",
          "alias": "单女困倦站立侧头（2）",
          "prompt": "From a low-angle downward view, a woman stands among blooming pink flowers. She slightly tilts her head up, as if gently embracing the sunlight and floral fragrance, adding a touch of laziness and naturalness. She appears to be about to lightly smell the floral scent. She wears a loose, light-colored garment, with faint white lace patterns visible at the edges of her sleeves. Her hands are gently raised, fingers bent slightly, as if touching or lifting the surrounding petals. Her posture is elegant and poetic, with dense pink flowers in the foreground. Layer upon layer, cascading down from above and sides, forms a natural wreath frame that frames the figure at the center. The flowers are full in shape, with petal edges slightly transparent. The color gradually shifts from deep pink at the center to light pink at the edges. Some petals appear semi-transparent under light, rich in detail and distinct layers. The center is the main subject, with her head and upper body clearly visible. The background is a bright blue sky, pure and cloudless, forming a strong contrast with the pink flowers, creating a fresh and dreamy visual effect. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame, surrounded by flowers to create a strong visual focus. The natural border formed by the flowers also guides the gaze toward the figure. In terms of lighting and shadow, the light source comes from the upper right side, which is shot against the light. Sunlight penetrates the petals, highlighting areas with warm golden tones, while the shadowed areas transition naturally and with rich layering. The overall atmosphere is warm and romantic, full of spring vibes. The main color tones are warm pink, pale blue, and golden yellow, with moderate color saturation. It is both vivid and soft, presenting a dreamlike film texture with a slight graininess and vintage filter effect. It feels like a moment shot with an old-fashioned camera, with the lens slightly out of focus and soft bokeh spots at the edges, enhancing the hazy beauty of the image. The overall style combines the qualities of artistic photography and daily life documentation—it resembles a carefully crafted portrait or a chance capture of a natural moment, conveying tranquility, beauty, and a cherishing of the beauty of life.",
