        {
          "id": "krea2-36011038cf0ffdb61447d4c1",
          "alias": "单女红高领衫窗边微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the window, smiling brightly as she gazes at the sky. She wears a light beige beret with a slightly slanted brim, adding a playful and artistic touch. She wears a red-and-white striped turtleneck knitwear. The red stripes vary in width, while the white stripes are delicate and even. The knit texture is clearly visible, presenting a soft and comfortable texture. She leans slightly to the side, tilting her head back, full of hope and longing for the future, showing neat, white teeth, and a warm and sincere smile. It feels as if you're touched by the sunlight and beautiful moments outside the window. In the foreground is a translucent white gauze curtain gently hanging on both sides of the window. The shadows of trees can be faintly seen on the curtain, gently swaying in the breeze, casting soft light and creating a hazy, dreamy atmosphere. The middle ground features the main subject, positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame. The composition uses close-ups, with a bright view outside the window. Although blurry, you can still feel the distant architectural silhouettes and blue sky and white clouds. Sunlight pours in from outside, creating a soft backlight effect. The outline of the figure is enveloped in a golden halo, with rich layers of light and shadow. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and off-white, creating a cozy and peaceful afternoon atmosphere. The light is soft and penetrating, presenting a beautiful moment in everyday life that is unexpected. The composition has a strong visual guidance, evoking innocence and joy. The overall image presents a lifelike, realistic amateur shooting style, as if casually captured with a phone, filled with warmth, with slight graininess and natural exposure transitions The color saturation is moderate, not overly flashy, preserving the authentic texture of light and shadow. Although the curtains in the background and the scenery outside the window are blurred, they still provide enough spatial information, enhancing the depth and ambiance of the image. Overall, it presents a gentle, healing, and hopeful visual experience, like a simple yet precious moment of happiness being frozen in time",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
