        {
          "id": "krea2-490965cb6c29ebd62f1320ea",
          "alias": "单女绿连衣裙城市忧伤坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the indoor floor, her body slightly turned to the camera, her posture relaxed and natural. She wears a form-fitting olive green ribbed short-sleeve dress that fits her body tightly, showcasing smooth curves. The material is delicate and soft, with a slight sheen. The cuffs and hem have clear pleated details, highlighting the fabric's texture and drape. She sits cross-legged, her feet bare, toes naturally extended, right knee slightly bent, left leg bent forward, presenting an effortlessly lazy beauty. Looking directly into the camera, her expression is calm with a hint of melancholy and contemplation. Her overall temperament is gentle and reserved. The foreground is her low-angle body and legs, occupying about one-third of the lower part of the frame. The background is a light gray wallpaper printed with elegant floral patterns, with clean lines and soft tones. On the right is a metal shelf made of silver stainless steel. The surface is smooth and reflective, with a multi-layered grid structure. On the top shelf sits a book with a white cover, clearly visible with the title \"CEREAL\" and \"LAME SOEUR.\" The middle layer holds other books or magazines, with some spines exposed. The colors are mainly white and beige, with distinct layers. Next to the shelves is a pair of white high heels, with elegant shapes, slender heels, smooth uppers, reflecting soft light. The floor is covered with a dark gray carpet featuring regular geometric diamond patterns. The lines are straight and clear, with vivid color contrasts that enhance the sense of three-dimensionality in the space. The composition uses a low-angle shot, with the main subject positioned slightly to the left of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The right side is reserved for the background elements, creating a balanced yet dynamic layout. The subject's head is slightly tilted, then turns toward objects in the background, creating a natural visual flow path. Light and shadow come from the left, with soft and even light sources, like indoor lighting or diffused light from outside the window. The shadow transitions are smooth, without strong contrast. The objects on the background wall and shelves are also illuminated by the same light, creating subtle changes in light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is quiet, private, and full of everyday life, carrying an artistic feel of everyday life. It feels like a real snapshot casually taken at home with an amateur camera. The colors are mainly cool, with olive green, gray, white, and silver as the main palette, harmonious and unified, with a realistic texture and rich details, strong immersion and emotional tension, conveying a modern urban woman image that is quiet, gentle, yet slightly detached",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
