        {
          "id": "krea2-c9206dd60fa16fafbbcbe438",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣桌边沉思坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at a wooden table by the window in a café. She wears an olive-green coarse knit sweater, with clearly visible patterns. The collar and cuffs feature delicate ribbed designs, and the shoulders and sleeves feature woven diamond patterns, giving the whole atmosphere a warm and comfortable feel. She is secured by a black-and-white striped headband. She lowers her head slightly, holding a small silver fork in her right hand, ready to taste. Her expression is calm and focused, carrying a subtle sense of contemplation and satisfaction. On the wooden table in front of her are two exquisite desserts. One piece is a cheesecake topped with bright red strawberry jam, the other is a multi-layered cake decorated with chocolate. Next to it is a deep red vase with several white and blue flowers. The flowers are delicate and fresh, adding a splash of color to the scene. The smooth surface of the table reflects the light and shadow of the surroundings. The background is a blurry café interior, where you can see warm yellow lights, wooden ceilings and wall panels, some blurred menu signs, and glass windows, with soft natural light streaming in outside. Light enters diagonally from the left, creating a contrast of light and shadow on the subject, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The entire shot uses a shallow depth of field, focusing on the person and the sweet spot in the foreground. The background is blurred, and the composition shows the person on the right side, leaving space on the left to display the light outside the window and part of the indoor environment, creating visual balance. The camera angle is slightly lower than the level view, and through the glass window, reflections and slight mist enhance the image's realism and layering. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft. The color palette is mainly warm yellow and green, creating a leisurely and pleasant afternoon atmosphere. The overall image carries the warmth of everyday life, as if captured by accident in an ordinary yet beautiful moment, like a casual snapshot taken with a regular camera in a real environment. It is full of authenticity and warmth, rich in detail, harmonious colors, and natural composition, conveying a quiet, comfortable, and lively atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
