        {
          "id": "krea2-0804496d94e47db0700009cf",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫室内微笑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a warm indoor setting, wearing a white shirt paired with a knit cardigan featuring red stripes and heart patterns. She looks both fresh and soft, carrying a subtle yet gentle smile, as if quietly listening to a melody or immersing herself in a beautiful memory. The figure is positioned slightly toward the center on the left side of the frame, her body slightly turned to the side, presenting a natural half-body posture. The garment's texture is delicate and visible, with the pleats of the white shirt and the knitted cardigan clearly visible, and the sleeves slightly rolled up. It presents a casual yet refined sense of life. The middle section features a wooden tabletop where she sits, smooth with subtle wood grain. The edges faintly reveal the outline of a cup of coffee or a drink, hinting at a leisurely café scene. The background is blurred to create a soft bokeh effect. Warm yellow circular light spots are scattered in the background, resembling hanging chandeliers or light streaming through the window, creating a warm, hazy, and layered spatial atmosphere. The composition uses the classic three-part layout. The figure occupies the left half of the frame, with the right third reserved to guide the gaze to extend, enhancing the sense of breath and storytelling in the image, moving viewers' attention accordingly, evoking association and imagination. The overall lighting is warm tones, with the main light source coming from the right front of the figure, creating a natural transition of light and shadow that enhances three-dimensionality. Meanwhile, light spots in the background serve as accents, enhancing the dreamy and artistic atmosphere. The overall lighting is uniform and comfortable, with no strong contrasts, presenting a cinematic soft-focus texture. The overall atmosphere is calm and warm, full of youthful energy and gentle emotions. It is suitable for modern urban life, artistic youth, love stories, or healing themes. The style blends Japanese photobooks with Korean portrait aesthetics, combining freshness and elegance. The color scheme centers on white and red, complemented by warm yellow in the background and blurred cold gray, creating a harmonious and dynamic visual contrast. The entire composition conveys a tranquil, comfortable, and slightly hopeful mood, evoking a moment of relaxation and inner satisfaction",
