          "id": "krea2-b89d076418703c62c1e0650c",
          "alias": "单女棕礼服水边沉思持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman as the subject of the painting wears exquisite yet natural makeup, presenting an elegant and confident aura. Her body is slightly turned sideways, her shoulders smooth, and she wears a dark brown one-shoulder gown with delicate fabric that drapes and fits well. One side features a unique strap design, while the other side reveals the shoulder and collarbone. The waist features a clever slit that highlights her figure. The necklace is made of metal with a smooth, reflective surface, forming a visual focal point. The foreground is a close-up of the upper body of the figure, occupying the main part of the composition. The background is the city skyline, with towering buildings and a modern architectural style. The glass curtain wall reflects the warm tones of dusk, and in the distance, the water surface shimmers. Several boats quietly moored within, and the sky shifts from orange-yellow to pale blue at dusk. The layers of light and shadow are rich. The composition combines close-ups with the middle ground environment. The figures are positioned slightly to the right of the frame, forming an asymmetrical yet balanced visual structure that creates a sense of spatial depth. Light comes from the slanting rear, representing the soft backlighting of the golden hour, outlining the figure's outline with warm light and creating a slight halo effect. Details are clear, shadow transitions are natural, and the overall atmosphere combines urban fashion with romantic poetry. The colors are mainly warm brown, golden yellow, and gray-blue, with a unified and harmonious tone that exudes cinematic photography quality. It feels like shooting with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens, simulating a portrait lens at 35mm or 85mm focal lengths, emphasizing depth control, natural background blur, and highlighting the subject. The visuals possess strong artistic expression and a sense of sophistication, like high-end fashion magazine covers or brand advertisements, full of storytelling and emotional tension, while preserving moments from real life, like an elegant encounter by a city river. The entire scene presents an aesthetic experience that is both luxurious and close to everyday life. The lighting is soft and layered, the color saturation is moderate, and the effect is not excessive embellishment, creating an immersive visual experience that makes one feel as if they are in that quiet and enchanting twilight moment",
