        {
          "id": "krea2-94f268f52a70c4b35b730eac",
          "alias": "单女白T恤窗边微笑坐摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white windowsill by the window, leaning slightly back, bending and raising her legs, with her left leg draped over her right, presenting a relaxed and relaxed posture. Her left hand rests gently near her knee, looking elegant and natural. She wears a white lace camisole pajama with delicate lace lace trim at the neckline and shoulder straps. The fabric is lightweight and breathable, featuring fine vertical stripes. The waist is slightly cinched, highlighting a slender waistline. She wears white knee-high socks with elastic bands at the top. The sock surface is smooth and delicate, harmonizing with the pajamas' color. The overall look is simple yet full of feminine charm, revealing a subtle smile that looks both innocent and slightly shy. In the background is a large window, outside which are faint green plants and trees. Sunlight filters through the leaves into the room, creating mottled light effects on the walls and figures. The light is soft and bright, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The edge of the windowsill shows slight wear marks, adding realism and a sense of life to the scene. The composition uses a medium perspective. The figures occupy the center to the right, with bodies arranged diagonally, forming a natural visual guide line that extends from the feet to the head, highlighting the character's expression and demeanor. The foreground features the details of the figure and clothing, the middle is the windowsill and some legs, and the background is the natural scenery outside the window. The layers are distinct, the contrast between solid and void is strong, and the light and shadow treatment is delicate. The main light source comes from the left, simulating natural light effects, with soft shadow transitions that highlight the character's contours and three-dimensionality. The overall color scheme is mainly white and light tones, paired with a green background. The colors are fresh and natural, and the image texture is close to everyday amateur equipment, with slight noise and graininess, as if captured with a regular camera in a real environment. It conveys a private, warm, and tranquil moment of life, full of youthful energy and everyday beauty. The image presents a quiet afternoon time, creating a relaxed and pleasant atmosphere. The composition is stable and full of tension, and the figures' postures are naturally relaxed, without any forced posing—more like an unintentional freeze. The entire scene is filled with gentle storytelling and delicate emotional expression",
          "description": "",
