        {
          "id": "krea2-6d9c422d9c0e645e6051183f",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣窗边专注倚靠泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in an off-white loose sweater and black apron is focused on pouring coffee with her head down. Her right hand holds a brass fine-spout kettle with hammer patterns, with water slowly pouring coffee grounds into the dripper below. The movement is gentle yet professional, showing extreme attention to detail and immersion. The figure is positioned slightly in the center on the left side of the frame, leaning slightly forward, with a natural and authentic posture, as if capturing a quiet moment in everyday life. In the foreground are clear hand movements, a copper kettle, and a dripper. The copper kettle's surface reflects a warm metallic sheen, the coffee grounds inside the dripper are dark brown, surrounded by a few coffee beans. Next to it are a light blue ceramic baby bottle and a dark ceramic jar filled with tea leaves or coffee beans. These elements together create a scene full of everyday life in coffee-making scenes. The center features a woman's upper body and part of the workbench, with a simple indoor background and a light gray-white wall with a slightly weathered texture. On the right, a white power cord hangs from a wall socket. The upper left corner faintly reveals the window frame, with soft natural light streaming in, making the overall space simple yet cozy. The composition uses close-ups combined with central shots of the characters, creating a visual layer from foreground actions to the characters' expressions. Diagonal lines and postures create a sense of dynamic balance. The visual guide starts from the coffee utensils in the lower right, with light coming from the upper left, simulating natural window light to create a soft side light effect. Shadows are delicate, warm yellow tones run throughout the image, with a warm tone and moderate saturation. It presents a vintage film texture, with natural light and shadow transitions, rich details preserved in shadows, and an overall atmosphere that is quiet, warm, and healing. It is full of the poetry and ritual of everyday life, with a strong aesthetic of everyday life. It feels like a real snapshot shot with an amateur camera, with slight noise and graininess, enhancing realism and intimacy. The overall image presents a low-saturation yet emotionally warm visual style, allowing people to feel the tranquility and focus of coffee culture",
