        {
          "id": "krea2-c198f085637e1b3d26daf22e",
          "alias": "单女黑西装街道忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands at the corner of a city street, adding a touch of vitality and naturalness, carrying a hint of melancholy and gentleness, as if telling an inner story. She wears a black blazer layered with a white shirt and a gray knit vest, adorned with a delicate silver letter badge. The overall look is simple yet elegant, showcasing a blend of intellect and fashion. Her hands gently hold a black-and-white plaid wool coat, which is thick and clearly visible, giving it a warm and textured feel. The foreground is a half-body close-up, occupying the main part of the frame. The composition uses close-ups: the middle is the sidewalk and roadside utility poles, which are equipped with surveillance cameras and some small devices. The background is a blurry city streetscape, with shaded green streets in the distance. The trees and leaves are lush, presenting a rich green. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled shadows. There are vehicles and pedestrians passing along the street, and a blue electric bike passes by on the left, adding dynamism to the composition. The composition uses a shallow depth of field effect. This makes the main subject stand out clearly, with background blur treatment enhancing visual layering. Light comes from the upper right, with soft golden sunlight slanting down, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The contrast between light and shadow is strong but not excessive, preserving rich details. The overall tone leans toward warmth, dominated by gold, brown, and gray, accented with green and white elements. The color coordination is harmonious and unified, presenting a beautiful moment from everyday life, as if captured casually with a regular camera. It has a strong sense of documentary and everyday life, while also retaining artistic beauty, conveying a quiet, contemplative, and slightly nostalgic mood, allowing people to feel a sense of gentleness and tranquility in the city. The entire scene is full of storytelling and evokes imagination, as if one can hear the distant sound of traffic and the rustling of leaves in the wind, creating an immersive experience.",
