        {
          "id": "krea2-47405486b5a4049777272b53",
          "alias": "单女毛衣商场站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on a modern-style white marble spiral staircase, wearing an off-shoulder knit dress with vertical ribbed patterns. The fitted cut perfectly outlines her slender waistline and long legs. The shoulders feature an asymmetrical off-shoulder neckline, revealing one shoulder and collarbone. The shoulder is adorned with metal buttons for a refined touch. The long sleeves drape naturally, fitting the body perfectly. The hem reaches mid-thigh, accentuating her leg curves. She wears a pair of light gray over-the-knee boots. The boots are made of matte suede, with a leg high to the knees, natural pleats at the opening, and a medium-height chunky heel. The overall look is elegant and fashionable. She carries a pink quilted small handbag in her right hand. The body is small and delicate, equipped with a metal chain and leather handle. Her left hand rests gently on the transparent glass railing, looking natural and relaxed. The background is inside a high-end clothing store, with white marble walls and floors featuring natural textures. On the left, you can see a row of white clothes hanging from the shelves. Neatly arranged on black hangers, creating a striking contrast. On the right is a spiral staircase's curved structure. The glass railing is transparent and smooth, reflecting the surrounding environment. The light is bright and soft, and the uniform lighting from above makes the entire space feel clean and transparent. Light and shadow create delicate transitions of light and shadow on the figures, highlighting the texture of the clothing and the contours of the body. The composition uses a low-angle upward angle to emphasize the figure's height proportions and presence. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, with a slightly tilted body creating a dynamic balance. Then, the staircase lines curve upward, creating a sense of visual flow. The overall atmosphere combines sophistication with everyday beauty, as if shot with a professional camera in a high-end mall or boutique. The details are rich and colors harmonious, presenting a lifestyle aesthetic that is both fashionable and approachable",
