        {
          "id": "krea2-fe87cd14fdff611e97654536",
          "alias": "单女蓝高领衫冷淡",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman adds a touch of casualness and laziness, presenting an almost transparent texture. She wears a deep blue turtleneck knit sweater, with clearly visible textures. The vertical ribbed weave reveals delicate texture and layering. Her arms bend naturally, with a small piece of skin exposed at the wrist. The overall composition centers on the figure. Using a close-up approach, the background is a pure gray gradient, transitioning naturally from light gray to dark gray, creating a clean yet sophisticated visual effect. The light comes from a slightly left front position, with moderate contrast between light and shadow, no strong contrast between light and dark. The overall atmosphere is quiet, restrained, and artistic. The color palette is mainly cool, with dark blue and gray creating a calm and serene feeling, creating a subtle contrast of warm and cool tones. The composition uses a slightly tilted perspective, making the scene more dynamic and visually appealing, sparking associations The overall style combines fashion and artistic flair, like high-quality portraits shot in professional studios, yet retaining realism and a sense of everyday life. It feels as if high-end cameras and professional lighting equipment were used to shoot in a carefully arranged environment. The details are rich and exquisite, with every element carefully arranged to create a peaceful, focused, and story-filled atmosphere",
