        {
          "id": "krea2-85df8d4a69ec9a95b9486c45",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙教堂叛逆持花",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a vintage-style dress in light blue and white, with an off-shoulder puff-sleeve top on top. The waist was cinched with pleated details, and the hem was a loose white long skirt with delicate lace trim. The overall look was elegant and layered. She tilted her head slightly, her expression calm and intoxicated, as if immersed in a beautiful mood. The slender stems were gently held at her fingertips, her fingers long. The nails are neatly trimmed with a natural sheen, adding a touch of liveliness and rebelliousness. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying the left center position. The body forms an S-shaped curve with smooth and graceful lines. Looking up from below, the figure appears tall and full of sacredness. Details are clearly visible, with light penetrating from above and behind, forming a soft halo on her silhouette. The interplay of light and shadow creates a dreamlike texture. The middle ground features the figure's torso and clothing. The folds and textures of the fabric show delicate light and shadow changes under the light. The clothes are light and flowing, gently swaying in the wind. The background is a space with Gothic architectural style. Tall arched windows let in bright natural light, the window frames are simple yet powerful, and the distant walls appear grayish-white, slightly mottled, revealing traces of time. Many transparent bubbles float in the air, varying in size, some reflecting light and flickering softly, adding fairy-tale and surreal charm to the scene. The overall lighting mainly comes from the backlight in the background, creating a strong contour effect that envelops the figure in golden light. At the same time, there is a small amount of fill light in the front, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow but a natural transition. The atmosphere is warm and tranquil, carrying a sense of religious sanctity and poetic romance. The color palette is mainly cool white and light blue, accented with warm yellow halos, ultimately focusing on a bouquet of pure white flowers. The composition is balanced and full of tension, presenting an overall dreamlike cinematic texture, as if freezing an afternoon sunlight falling on a church, both artistic and everyday shooting, combining realism with amateur cameras or mobile phones with professional aesthetics. The lens is a medium-focus portrait lens with an aperture of about f/1.8 to achieve a shallow depth of field effect. The background blur is soft, the subject is clear and prominent, and the shutter speed is moderate to capture slight motion blur, enhancing realism. Color reproduction is true, saturation is moderate, and original light and shadow details are preserved. The overall image is full of storytelling, emotional warmth, and artistic beauty, like a silent poem telling a story about beauty, The eternal theme of hope and freedom",
          "description": "",
