        {
          "id": "krea2-f0ce6e931e4cae247a352338",
          "alias": "单女蓝制服雪地忧伤站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a deep blue sailor uniform, with white stripes on the shoulders and cuffs, and delicate lace trim along the collar. She stands in the snowy winter night, looking directly at the camera, her expression showing a hint of calm and contemplation. She tightly holds a rustic kerosene lamp, its body made of metal, featuring a vintage handle and protective iron frame. The lampshade emits a warm orange-yellow glow, creating a striking contrast between cold and warm. The background is a blurry snowy night, with fine snowflakes drifting in the sky where deep blue and dark purple intertwine. In the distance, a bright circular light spot can be faintly seen, resembling another lantern or streetlamp, creating a dreamlike depth of field effect. In the foreground, snowflakes appear as golden light spots under the light, enhancing the realism and delicacy of the image. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical style, with the figure centered and the kerosene lamp positioned slightly to the left below the frame, forming a visual focal point. The background blur highlights the subject, while shallow depth of field enhances spatial layering. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the kerosene lamp's warm yellow glow, illuminating the figure from both the front and side, with soft shadows and a background dominated by cool tones, creating a strong contrast of warm and cool tones, creating a peaceful and mysterious atmosphere. The overall tone of the image leans toward coolness, but the warm light of the kerosene lamp makes it feel warm and moving. It has a Japanese photo style, rich in details and realistic texture, as if shot with a professional camera, while retaining the natural feel and livelihood of everyday amateur equipment. The images are full of poetry and storytelling, evoking the image of a lonely watchman on a winter night or a gentle encounter between memories and waiting. The entire scene is filled with a tranquil, nostalgic, and slightly melancholic atmosphere, as if time has frozen in this moment, with only snowflakes silently falling. The glow of the kerosene lamp flickers slowly in the darkness, illuminating the secret world within the heart, unknown to others",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
