        {
          "id": "krea2-4f21d72b4c87969d65d3ac7b",
          "alias": "单女白T恤窗边坐出神",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in the driver's seat, her body slightly turned toward the window, her left hand gently resting on the edge of the car door, creating a natural, casual dynamic aesthetic. She wears a simple white loose short-sleeve T-shirt paired with a beige pleated midi skirt. The overall style is fresh and artistic, full of summer vibe, as if feeling the breeze or lost in thought. Light streams in diagonally through the window, presenting a warm golden tone. The composition uses close-ups, with the window frame serving as a natural visual framework. The main subject is placed slightly to the right center of the frame, with the foreground being the inside of the car door and part of the dashboard. The color is dark gray, made of plastic and leather patchwork, with clear details. The middle ground features a female subject, occupying the main space and creating a dynamic contrast with the static car body. The background is a blurred green vegetation, presenting a bokeh effect. The interlaced trees and leaves create rich color layers, gradients from dark green to light green, suggesting this is an outdoor natural environment, possibly on a suburban or forest road, with natural light coming from the upper left. It simulates afternoon sunlight, creating mottled light and shadow through the gaps in leaves, while also producing slight reflections on the car window glass, enhancing realism. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and soft, with a slight backlight effect, making the character outlines more three-dimensional. The tones are mainly warm yellow and green, creating a tranquil, pleasant, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The image quality is close to everyday amateur photography, such as shooting with a phone or portable camera. There is slight noise and low saturation but still feels realistic. The lens is a medium prime lens with a shallow depth of field. Highlights the subject, blurs the background naturally, and uses the rule of thirds. The figure is positioned in the right third, leaving space on the left for the car window and exterior environment, enhancing the dynamic feel of the image. The overall style leans toward a blend of everyday life, documentary, and artistic elements, capturing a moment of tranquility and freedom, conveying a youthful, lazy, and vibrant mood. It is suitable for expressing themes such as travel, growth, and self-exploration. The images are rich in detail, with leaves in the background of various shapes and subtle light and shadow changes. Overall, it presents a visual experience that is both authentic and poetic",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
