        {
          "id": "krea2-e9c25366bd2e84e6917cf64b",
          "alias": "单女窗边专注躺",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a traditional pale blue Hanfu, with light and flowing fabric, wide sleeves, and ink-wash floral patterns embroidered on the body. The collar and cuffs were trimmed with black lace trim, adding a touch of retro elegance. She held a ceramic teacup with a white background and blue flowers in both hands, her fingers slender and long, her nails neatly trimmed. She looked at the camera with a calm and focused expression, and a simple wooden folding fan slung diagonally behind her left shoulder The golden ribs are exposed, and the background is a red-toned tapestry wall covered with geometric and circular patterns. The colors are rich, presenting a warm orange-red gradient, creating a strong traditional Eastern atmosphere. In the foreground is an open ancient book or scroll, with yellowed pages and a delicate texture, slightly worn edges, hinting at the marks of time. Next to the book, a faintly lit oil lamp or candlestick emits a soft warm yellow glow. The light shines from the right front, creating a contrast of light and shadow and making the figure's outline clear, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right side to display the background and props, creating visual balance. The background is blurred to highlight the main subject while retaining detailed layers to form a visual guiding line. The overall color palette is mainly warm red, light blue, and off-white, harmoniously unified to create a warm and tranquil classical atmosphere. The lighting and shadow atmosphere are soft and warm, as if afternoon sunlight streaming through the window lattice into the room, bringing a poetic beauty that makes time freeze. The image texture is delicate, It features the graininess of film photography and a slight overshoot effect, simulating the texture of real camera shooting. It features slight lens distortion and edge halos to enhance realism. The overall image is full of Eastern aesthetic charm, combining the elegance of traditional clothing with the refinement of modern photography, presenting a unique style that lies between artistic creation and everyday recording, like a fleeting moment captured with an old-fashioned film camera. It is filled with the atmosphere of life and cultural warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
