        {
          "id": "krea2-a68f49118d6e1a329861eef7",
          "alias": "单女西装烟火困倦倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman holding a sparkler, dressed in a dark suit jacket and white shirt, leans forward slightly, extends her right hand forward, and holds a burning sparkler. Sparks fly, bright points of light trace dynamic trajectories in the air, creating a warm light and shadow effect. The background is the sky at dusk or night, presenting a deep blue-purple tone with subtle cloud textures and bokeh light spots. In the distance, the outline of a wooden railing is faintly visible. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying most of the space on the right side of the frame. The left side leaves ample negative space to highlight the dynamism of the fireworks. The strong light source in the foreground creates obvious camera halos and starbursts. Light enters the frame diagonally from the upper left, creating a strong contrast between light and dark, while shadows are gently distributed on the sides and background. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, combining festive joy with youthful restraint and reflection. The colors mainly feature warm and cool contrasts, with a blue background and warm yellow sparks creating a strong visual impact. Soft-focus treatment makes the edges slightly blurred. It creates a dreamy, hazy texture, as if shooting at night with an amateur camera, preserving noise and slight out-of-focus from real scenes, enhancing the sense of realism and life. The composition is layered, with the subject on the right and the gaze directed to the fireworks in the left front, forming a diagonal dynamic with natural light and shadow transitions and rich details. It captures the fleeting brilliance of fireworks while freezing the tranquility and complexity of the characters' inner worlds. The entire composition presents a unique beauty that lies between artistic photography and everyday documentation. It feels like a precious moment accidentally captured on an ordinary night, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
