        {
          "id": "krea2-4645fb886fece72634ddf6d3",
          "alias": "单女庭院微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "She wears simple green earrings, revealing a serene and reserved smile. She wears a soft, gradient-colored Hanfu with a sheer fabric, presenting a gentle transition from light green to pale yellow. The sleeves are wide and flowing, edges decorated with fine beaded edges. The fabric feels light and translucent, gently swaying in the wind. The overall design is full of classical charm, with a background blur treatment that presents a warm, warm halo. Amid the blurred light and shadow, faint architectural outlines and natural scenery can be seen, creating a hazy and dreamlike atmosphere. The composition uses close-up shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center of the frame, and the gaze slightly tilted to the left to form a visual guide. Light comes from the front side, carrying a slight sheen that adds a touch of delicate charm. The clear layering of highlights and shadows enhances the image's three-dimensionality and realism. The overall color palette features warm yellow, light green, Off-white is the main theme, with harmonious and unified color schemes to create a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses shallow depth of field effects to make the foreground figures stand out clearly and the background completely blurred, creating a strong contrast between front and back, guiding viewers to focus on their expressions and emotional expressions. The overall composition presents a poetic, gentle Eastern aesthetic conception, as if capturing a spring afternoon when sunlight streams through the window lattice, illuminating the courtyard with a subtle sense of nostalgia and romance, like a meticulously crafted meticulous brushwork. It also resembles a classic scene from a costume drama, combining artistic beauty with a sense of everyday warmth. It looks like a real photo taken with a regular camera under natural light, preserving subtle noise and authentic light and shadow transitions, making the entire scene more authentic and moving, full of the warmth of daily life and delicate emotional expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
