        {
          "id": "krea2-2523e19181e84ab773283156",
          "alias": "单女学生制服车厢忧伤坐持手机",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a typical Japanese high school girl's sailor uniform sits inside a subway carriage. White wired earphones hang and connect to her phone. She holds her phone with both hands, her fingers lightly tapping and swiping on the screen, seemingly browsing messages or listening to music. Her sailor uniform is a white long-sleeved top with a deep blue bow tie and striped cuffs. She wears a dark blue pleated short skirt, dark blue over-the-knee socks with a school emblem pattern in red and white, and black leather loafers. Beside her sat a deep blue canvas-textured backpack, adorned with metal rivets. She sat upright on a purple fabric bench, leaning forward slightly, her posture naturally relaxed. The background was a typical Japanese subway carriage interior. The carriage doors were made of silver-gray metal with transparent glass windows, yellow warning stripes and multiple logo stickers along the door. The armrest next to the door was a stainless steel column, and the rear window reflected her own blurred reflection and the outline of the seat opposite. Above the window hangs a blue-and-white promotional poster, with the content faintly visible. The interior lighting is cool white, evenly and softly, creating a quiet and everyday atmosphere. The camera uses a medium shot, with the character positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame, slightly tilted, presenting a documentary and everyday atmosphere. The foreground clearly highlights the main subject, with the middle shot including seats, backpacks, and parts of the carriage structure. The background is composed of interior details, creating a good sense of spatial layering. The visual guide naturally leads the person looking down at their phone to the device in their hand, then extends to the entire carriage environment. Light and shadow come from the fluorescent lights on the carriage roof, casting light from above to create a quiet, slightly lonely urban daily atmosphere. The main color palette is blue, white, and purple, accented with metallic gray and yellow-brown tones. The color combination is harmonious and unified, presenting a photographic style that is both realistic and artistic, as if capturing a real moment in a subway station with an ordinary digital camera. With a slight graininess and natural exposure control, it captures subtle moments of youth, loneliness, and modern urban life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
