        {
          "id": "krea2-54273558f98bef8523d8c105",
          "alias": "单女室内微笑过肩",
          "prompt": "Her smile was bright and sincere, revealing neat, white teeth, full of energy and warmth. She wore a loose off-white hooded sweatshirt made of soft and puffy fabric, with slight pleats at the cuffs and hem. The hat naturally draped over her shoulders, and the sweatshirt was slightly loose, outlining a slender silhouette. Underneath, she wore light blue low-rise briefs, with the hem clearly visible, creating a striking color contrast. The overall look is casual and casual yet sexy. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, with a slightly twisted body, their backs facing the camera and their heads turning backward, creating a natural feeling as if the moment is suddenly captured. The foreground is the main subject, occupying the main visual area of the frame with rich details. The middle scene is an indoor setting, with a blurred background, faintly visible light on light walls and soft lighting. Above, there is a circular chandelier outline, warm and soft light reflecting through windows or glass, creating a warm and comfortable home atmosphere. The composition uses a center-offset style to create a smooth visual flow. The spatial sense created by the character's turning motion enhances the depth of the image. Light and shadow come from the left, blending natural light and indoor warm light. The main light source is soft and even, with delicate shadow transitions. The back and waist create subtle contrasts of light and shadow, highlighting body curves. The overall color palette is mainly off-white, light blue, and warm yellow, with harmonious and unified colors and a realistic image texture, as if shot with a high-resolution camera, with slight film graininess and natural noise. It presents the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment shooting, without excessive embellishment, preserving a sense of life. The atmosphere is relaxed and joyful, full of youthful energy, like a private portrait capturing beautiful moments, evoking warmth, relaxation, and genuine beauty",
