        {
          "id": "krea2-817bafed2063eab6c7c588a3",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套海滩冷淡站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on the beach, wearing a light blue lightweight hooded jacket. The material has a slight sheen, presenting the texture of outdoor functional clothing. The collar is slightly raised, and she wears a white pleated collar shirt underneath. The collar drapes naturally, adding a touch of softness and layering. On the left chest of the jacket is a small brand logo. The zipper design is simple and practical, making the overall look both fashionable and suitable for the seaside setting. Black sunglasses rest on top of her head. The lens reflects lightly, blocking part of the view. She stands sideways, her body slightly tilted, her head turned toward the camera, her posture relaxed and natural. Her hands are in her coat pockets, appearing casual yet elegant. The foreground is sandy with fine grains, a light beige color, with slight undulation and footprint marks on the surface, adding realism and a sense of life. In the middle is an off-white van with a slightly worn body and transparent windows. You can see the blurred outline inside the car, with simple decorative lines on the door. The car parked on the beach contrasts with the figures. On the right is a retro-style snack stall or mobile kiosk, with a white exterior printed with the words \"CALIFORNIA\" and palm tree patterns. The lettering is orange with a hand-drawn feel, and next to it are letters like \"SURF,\" hinting at California beach charm. The background is a dense green forest with layers of leaves, forming a dense green barrier. Sunlight streams through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. The sky is light blue with a hint of white clouds, creating bright and soft light. The overall color scheme mainly features a contrast of warm and cool tones, with light blue, beige, green, and white interwoven to create a fresh and tranquil atmosphere. The composition uses a center-to-right main figure, using the rule of thirds. The figure occupies the main position in the painting but leaves enough space to display the environment. The background is blurred to focus on the person while preserving sufficient environmental information. A natural visual pathway is formed, with light and shadow coming from the upper right, sunlight slanting, enhancing the sense of depth and realism. The overall atmosphere is warm and leisurely, like a sunny afternoon, with a gentle sea breeze and peaceful time. The image has a strong sense of daily life and a documentary style, as if shot with a professional camera paired with a large aperture, capturing an unexpectedly beautiful moment. The details are rich, colors harmonious, combining artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life—like a classic shot in a youth film, full of storytelling and emotional impact",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
