        {
          "id": "krea2-77d3a2d892933c12446f8bd8",
          "alias": "单女蓝牛仔城市媚态站立持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman stands against a pure black background, her body slightly turned to the camera. Her left hand gently strokes the back of her head, while her right hand hangs naturally on a white horizontal railing in front of her. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, revealing an effortless sensuality and confidence. She wears a light pink sleeveless, fitted short top that fits her skin perfectly, presenting delicate pleats and a soft sheen, highlighting her slender waistline and graceful shoulder and neck curves. She pairs her with high-waisted blue skinny jeans, which are tailored to fit perfectly. Perfectly outlining the smooth contours of the hips and legs, the fabric has a natural washed texture and subtle texture details. The overall look is simple yet fashionable. She wears delicate silver earrings, with delicate makeup and a calm expression that carries a hint of allure. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait style, with the figure occupying the main subject, fully visible from head to knee. The body slightly tilts to form an S-shaped curve, with visual guidance lines naturally extending from her arms, torso, and legs, and the background is pure black. There are no distracting elements, except for a blurred circular warm light source far off the right rear, creating a slight bokeh effect that enhances the sense of depth in the space. Light mainly comes from the front left position, using soft ring lighting or softbox lighting, with natural shadow transitions without overly sharp edges. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere appears sophisticated, calm, and dramatic, with mainly pink, blue, and black tones. The contrast is vivid yet harmonious, creating a sense of independence and charm for modern urban women. The image texture is close to that of professional studio works, with rich details and clear layering, delivering strong visual impact. It preserves realistic human proportions and dynamic beauty, as if shot with a high-end camera in a darkroom, with a natural light and realistic texture that even amateur equipment can capture in daily life. The overall image is both artistic and retains a sense of life, presenting a unique style that lies between commercial advertising and personal portraits",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
