        {
          "id": "krea2-2c0be59b021db7a7852c028c",
          "alias": "单女制服船上持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a classic Japanese sailor uniform: a white short-sleeved top with a deep blue bow tie and striped edges, a deep blue ribbon with a badge tied around the neckline, a white pleated skirt and white tights, and a white sailor hat secured with a dark blue ribbon. The sky displays a soft gray-blue tone, with thin and even clouds. On the left, an orange lifebuoy hangs along the ship's rail. The hull is white, with a simple and modern internal structure. The gray fabric seats have a delicate texture. The overall composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the right center, forming a visual focal point. The foreground features the yacht's internal sunshade and seat details, the middle ground shows the main body and parts of the hull, while the background features calm water and hazy urban buildings. The light comes from natural diffuse light, making the overall lighting uniform and soft. There are no obvious shadows, creating a fresh and tranquil atmosphere. The colors are mainly white, blue, and gray, accented with an orange lifebuoy ring as a visual highlight. The tones are harmonious and unified, presenting a realistic feel of everyday life, as if you were casually capturing photos with a regular camera or phone on a sunny day. It retains a slight depth of field effect and realistic light and shadow transitions. The composition is balanced and stable, the visual guidance is clear, conveying youthful vitality and a leisurely and comfortable lifestyle atmosphere. The overall style combines realism with artistic beauty. It is like a photographic work capturing the tranquil moments of urban waterfront life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
