        {
          "id": "krea2-ba8133bbd7e18c7bc665eceb",
          "alias": "双女棕毛衣街道沉思站立泼洒",
          "prompt": "A woman stands next to a self-service ID photo booth on a Japanese street. She wears a warm brown chunky knit sweater with soft and natural shoulder lines. The sweater's texture looks delicate under the sunlight, and the neckline is slightly open, revealing the graceful curves of her collarbone and neck. She wears a pair of simple gold round earrings that glow gently under the light, with a natural blush and a gentle blush looking straight into the camera. She stands sideways, her body slightly tilted. One hand naturally rests on the camera's white metal frame, relaxed and elegant. In the foreground is the camera's white body, smooth and slightly reflective. On the side of the camera are Japanese logos reading \"ID Photo\" and colorful promotional posters. One poster with a pink background features samples of two women's ID photos, another green vertical poster with the words \"キレイな\" (キレイな), and a small yellow sticker featuring a cute cartoon rabbit illustration with Japanese captions. The middle shot shows the green curtain inside the camera, printed with white Japanese characters. The edges of the curtain cast soft shadows due to the light, and the folded details of the curtain are clearly visible. Behind the curtain, the silhouette of a figure faintly peeks through, creating an interesting visual echo with the woman in the foreground. The background is a corner of the street, where you can see part of the building's exterior walls and the green sign above. The sign is written in white letters such as \"スタート\" in Japanese characters, making the surrounding environment somewhat blurred. But you can sense this is a city street scene full of everyday life. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, making the main subject appear taller and more prominent. The camera's vertical lines guide the gaze upward. The FUJIFILM brand logo and multiple ID photo samples are neatly arranged on the left side of the frame, adding realism and detail to the scene. The lighting atmosphere is dominated by the warm afternoon sun, pouring down from the upper right, creating a strong contrast between light and dark. The highlight areas are bright and transparent. The shadowed areas are deep and soft, creating a warm, tranquil, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere. The overall color palette leans toward warmth, mainly brown, green, white, and pink, with harmonious and layered color combinations. The images present a fleeting, unintentional beauty from daily life, as if captured casually with a regular camera, full of life atmosphere and humanistic emotion. The image texture is delicate and detailed, preserving the graininess and light and shadow transitions of real photography while incorporating artistic compositional treatment. It makes you feel as if you are on a quiet afternoon on the streets of Tokyo, feeling the gentleness and poetry of urban life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
