        {
          "id": "krea2-1af013e6a4283d30b718ecf7",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣庭院俏皮坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench outdoors, looking lively and dynamic. She wears a light pink sleeveless cotton-linen top with a simple and elegant neckline, layered with a white lace cutout knit cardigan. The sleeves casually slide down to her elbows, adding a touch of lazy and effortless charm. She holds an open book in both hands, its pages slightly curled to a natural curve. Her fingers are long and slender, gently touching the pages, as if immersed in a world of reading, with a background of hazy green plants. The leaves glow softly under the sunlight, with mottled light and shadow creating a peaceful and warm atmosphere. The composition uses medium to near shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, the head slightly tilted, creating a strong visual direction. Light shines diagonally from the right, transitioning naturally in the shadows, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and pale pink, complemented by turquoise tones in the background, creating a warm and cool contrast that makes the subject stand out more. The composition has a distinct depth of field effect and a sharp foreground. The background blurs into a soft green light spot, with delicate bokeh grain creating a dreamlike visual experience. The photography style is close to everyday amateur equipment, with a slight film texture and natural noise. The exposure is slightly overexposed but not excessive, preserving detailed layers. The overall atmosphere is warm and healing, full of youthful energy and artistic flair, as if capturing a tranquil afternoon sunlight filling the courtyard, allowing one to feel the slow flow of time and inner peace",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
