        {
          "id": "krea2-ba8031e97041c9898291c095",
          "alias": "单女白礼服森林困倦坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an ancient stone steps, dressed in a gorgeous white feathered gown made of layers of soft white feathers, light and fluffy. The slender and transparent straps outline the elegant collarbone, and the chest and hem are adorned with exquisite sequins and crystal decorations, faintly shimmering in the light. The overall look resembles a white-feathered fairy bird flying out from the depths of the forest—dreamy and noble, adding a touch of gentleness and laziness. She leans slightly to the side, leaning forward slightly, with her hands naturally resting on her knees. Her fingers are long, her nails painted light pink, her posture calm and dignified. Looking directly at the camera, she carries a hint of melancholy and contemplation, appearing delicate and alluring. The background is a quiet stone wall in the forest, with a rough and uneven surface covered with cracks and moss left by time, giving her a gray-brown texture. Some areas are covered with green vegetation, giving her a vibrant appearance. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves. Dappled light and shadow are cast, casting soft shadows on the ground and rocks. The light is warm and gentle, creating a peaceful and mysterious atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot close-up, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center, her body forming an S-shaped curve, showcasing a graceful posture. In the foreground, she wears a feathered gown and details of her lower body and hands, while the background is a blurred stone wall and green plants, creating a clear depth of field and forming a cyclical visual focal point. The overall color palette is mainly white, gray, and green, harmoniously and unified, full of artistic flair, like a carefully shot fashion photoshoot, captured with professional photography equipment, presenting a beauty that is both authentic and extraordinary",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
