        {
          "id": "krea2-4339b1ae855313d348e80731",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙泳池微笑持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman turns sideways and looks back with a smile, creating a natural and lively dynamic feel. She wears a white pinstripe slip dress with slender straps revealing fair shoulder lines. The fabric is light and soft, with subtle wrinkles and light and shadow changes, presenting a cool summer feeling. Her smile is bright and sincere, full of youthful energy. She wears a pair of uniquely designed earrings made of irregular metal pieces and pearl-like decorations, reflecting a faint sheen in the light. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the scene. The head is slightly tilted, the body is three-quarters to the side, forming a graceful curve. The background is blurred, presenting a blurred blue-green tone. A round blue basin or pool edge can be faintly seen, with soft light reflected on the water's surface. The background also reveals the outlines of some green plants. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow and cool blue, creating a striking contrast. Light and shadow come from the upper right, and the strong backlighting effect makes the figure's silhouette glow, creating distinct halos and light spots. The air seems to be floating with golden dust, highlighting the texture of the skin The overall atmosphere of the image is warm, dreamy, and romantic, filled with the comfort and freedom of a summer afternoon sun. It has the texture of film photography, with moderate color saturation and a slight retro filter effect. The background gradually blurs, the depth of field is shallow, and then extends to the blue water in the background, forming a smooth visual flow. The overall image resembles a daily moment taken with an amateur camera, with slight noise and graininess, authentic and natural, full of life atmosphere, without any deliberate staged shots, capturing an unexpectedly beautiful moment. It lets people feel pure joy and vitality",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
