        {
          "id": "krea2-8c7e07bfed6e80e8e758bebe",
          "alias": "单女透视白衬衫城市神秘坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits upright in a modern, minimalist interior space. She wears a white short-sleeved shirt with a beige ribbon bow tied at the collar, paired with a light beige high-waisted hip-hugging mini skirt. The overall look is elegant and sharp, showcasing the intellectual and composed qualities of a professional woman. Her legs are long and well-proportioned, sheer stockings naturally folded on the sofa, her posture relaxed and confident. Her left hand rests lightly on the edge of the sofa, her right hand slightly bent on her thigh, and her wrist wears a delicate silver bracelet. Adding a touch of detail beauty. Looking directly into the camera, her expression is calm and slightly mysterious. She sits on a light gray fabric sofa with a wide and comfortable backrest, featuring delicate horizontal textures that feel soft. The background is a light wood vertical striped wall, and on the right side, a staircase structure with black metal handrails is visible. The lines are clean and sharp, and in the distance, glass partitions or floor-to-ceiling windows let in soft natural light. The outline of the outdoor building is faintly visible, and the floor is covered with a taupe carpet with fine woven patterns, creating a color contrast with the sofa The composition uses a medium shot perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, body slightly turned and head facing the camera, creating a visual focal point. The foreground shows the sofa and the character's legs; the middle ground is the main body and the sofa; the background is the stairs, walls, and outside the window. The layers are distinct, and the light and shadow come from the natural light source on the left, creating a soft and even light transition that creates subtle shadow transitions that highlight three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, elegant, modern, and full of life, as if capturing an unintentional moment in daily life. It presents a sense of both professional and private privacy, with tones dominated by white, beige, and light gray, accented with black, creating a harmonious unity. The image is clean and crisp, rich in detail, and has the texture of authentic photography. It's like high-quality photos taken with a high-resolution camera in natural light, while retaining slight film graininess and slight lens distortion, enhancing realism and artistry. The composition is stable, extending to body curves and leg lines, ultimately landing on the geometric structure of the background, forming a smooth visual path. Overall, she presents a temperament that combines independence, confidence, and gentleness typical of urban women, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
