        {
          "id": "krea2-c8be2af731fa399a48eeeb1e",
          "alias": "单女金连衣裙沙发冷淡坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the edge of a deep blue fabric sofa, wearing a vibrant lemon-yellow sleeveless long dress. The dress is tailored to fit her figure, showcasing an elegant and flowing silhouette. The hem naturally drapes to the floor, creating soft pleats and transitions of light and shadow. She slightly turns to look back at the camera, adding a touch of laziness and allure. She wears gold round-ring earrings and a slender necklace, with a deep brown wooden bracelet and a delicate ring on her wrist. Her posture is relaxed and confident, her left hand lightly resting on a round woven handbag beside her. The bag body is mainly brown, with metal fasteners and leather straps. The background is a modern, minimalist interior space. On the left is a sofa covered with matching dark blue fabric covers, casually stacked with several heavy books. The spines vary in color, and two abstract art paintings hang on the walls, vibrant yet restrained. On the right is a dark wooden coffee table with clear texture, on which sits a magazine with a red cover and a white ceramic vase. In the distance, another blue single sofa and the staircase leading to the second floor can be seen. The stair railings are made of dark metal, with a set of chandeliers hanging above, emitting a warm yellow glow. The wall recessed wall lamps emit a soft halo, creating rich layers of light throughout the space. The warm-toned lighting contrasts with the cool-toned furniture, creating a cozy and sophisticated home atmosphere. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying the left central position, body forming an S-shaped curve. The foreground visually extends her lower body and skirt flow, and the middle ground includes a sofa The coffee table and some background furnishings reveal a more distant spatial layer, including stairs, decorations, and ceiling details. The overall light and shadow come from multiple sources, with the main light coming from the right front, soft shadows, and delicate light and shadow changes between skirts and sofas. The overall image presents a tranquil, elegant, and lifelike everyday scene, as if shot with a professional camera, featuring cinematic color tones and natural light and shadow flow, while preserving subtle imperfections and textures from the real environment. For example, the texture of fabric, the sheen of leather, the texture of wood, and tiny scratches on walls enhance realism and immersion. The color tones are dominated by blue and yellow, creating strong visual contrasts, while warm light balances to create a harmonious and dynamic scene. The overall atmosphere is both fashionable and inviting, combining artistic beauty with the warmth of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
