        {
          "id": "krea2-3c1c979be1621637bf411803",
          "alias": "单女短裙庭院严肃注视",
          "prompt": "She gently holds a jade-green oil-paper umbrella, with red tassels tied at the end of the handle. Her flowing hem is tied around her waist, with matching ribbons tied around her waist. The wide sleeves hang naturally, and the hem of her skirt spreads across the steps. Her overall posture is elegant and composed, like a lady stepping out of an ancient painting. Her presence is the central subject of the painting, positioned slightly to the left in the lower middle part of the scene, forming a visual focal point with the background. In the foreground is a blurred patch of golden ginkgo leaves. Layers of leaves cover the upper right and upper left of the painting, with some leaf edges blurred to create a strong sense of depth, as if the wind is blowing, the leaves fluttering in the air, creating a dynamic visual guide. These golden leaves contrast sharply with the woman's green clothes, complementing each other to create a harmonious color unity. The middle scene features stone steps leading to the ancient building, built of gray stone, rough on the surface, with mottled fallen leaves scattered in the gaps. On both sides of the steps are reddish-brown wooden railings, carved with simple patterns. The stone steps extend backward, leading to a traditional Chinese building. The door frame is deep red, and the wooden door is adorned with hollowed-out window lattice, revealing the dark interior space. The structure is solemn and elegant, revealing a sense of historical depth. The background features parts of the building and more trees, with faint distant greenery and distinct layers. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center. The stone steps extend diagonally to guide the gaze upward, while the leaves in the foreground are used for a framing composition, enhancing the depth of the scene. Visually, the guide flows from the golden leaves in the foreground to the figures in the center, then extends to the buildings in the background, forming a clear visual path. The light and shadow are soft and layered, with light coming from the upper left, presenting the warm slanting glow of an autumn afternoon. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled shadows on the stone steps and the woman's body, making the figure's outline clear. The folds of the clothing create delicate light and shadow changes, creating an overall atmosphere of tranquility and nostalgia, full of poetry and nostalgia, carrying a strong sense of Eastern aesthetics. The color palette is warm yellow, Dark green and deep red are the main colors, creating a vibrant autumn atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography and slight color shifts, as if taken with an old camera. The details are rich, every texture is clearly visible—from the wear marks on the stone steps to the veins of the leaves, from the texture of the fabric to the sheen of the umbrella surface, all reflecting a high degree of realism and artistry. The entire scene resembles both a meticulous painting and a real photograph, combining classical charm with modern aesthetics. It makes one feel as if they are in a tranquil autumn courtyard, feeling the slow flow of time and the accumulation of years.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
