        {
          "id": "krea2-11a5a55b5ed6e94e18b3a346",
          "alias": "单女上衣室内微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands indoors, smiling brightly. Her fingers are long, her nails painted white, and a simple gold ring on her ring finger, while the rest naturally drapes over her shoulders, giving off a casual yet refined look. She wears a blue-and-white striped off-shoulder top with unique sleeve designs featuring ruffles and pleated details. The cuffs are decorated with blue fine stripes, giving the overall look a fresh and sweet vibe. Around her neck is a black thin cord choker and a gold chain necklace, adding a touch of fashion. Her smile reveals youthful energy and confidence. The background is a blurred indoor space, possibly a makeup room or backstage area, where some wooden structures and glass reflections can be seen, and another person's back is faintly visible. Wearing a white top, the ambient lighting is soft and even, with the main light coming from the upper front. The shadow transitions are smooth, creating an overall relaxed and pleasant atmosphere full of life. The composition uses close-ups. The figures occupy most of the composition, with slightly tilted body postures that add a dynamic feel. The background blur highlights the subject, with blue and white as the main color tones, creating a harmonious and comfortable visual experience. The image presents a realistic and beautiful moment from daily life, as if taken casually with a regular camera, with a slight film texture and subtle noise to enhance realism. The overall style leans toward a blend of everyday life, documentary, and artistic beauty, capturing the most natural and relaxed state of the characters. It conveys a positive and optimistic mood, with rich details in the image—from clothing textures to the glossy trim of accessories—with distinct layers of light and shadow, creating a warm and intimate atmosphere. Like a friend's playful moments amid busy schedules, it evokes the vitality of youth and the beauty of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
