        {
          "id": "krea2-1d5d1dd00d3c1456b00c12fb",
          "alias": "单女泳装海滩愤怒坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the beach, wearing a bright fuchsia bikini. The triangular top design highlights the graceful shoulder and neck lines and full bust contours. The slender shoulder strap reflects slightly in the sunlight, and the right shoulder strap has a silver metal fastener connected below with a black text tag. Her hands rest on the sand in front of her, fingers naturally extended, nails neatly trimmed. She is half-squatting sideways facing the camera. The body leans slightly forward, the head tilts slightly, and the expression is calm with a hint of laziness. There is a small amount of fine sand on the body. The right knee is bent, and the calf and foot are partially buried in the sand. The upper thigh and the curve of the hips are clearly visible. The back is slightly arched, the abdomen flat. The overall posture is elegant and full of strength. The foreground is a fine pale yellow beach with slight undulation and fine grains. Near the figure, there are traces of pressure and water stains reflecting light. The middle is clear seawater, showing a gradient from light blue to milky white. The water surface sparkles, with tiny waves continuously surging toward the shore. In the distance, the sea meets the sky, forming a blurred horizontal line. The background is a bright pale blue sky, with almost no clouds, and the light is soft and even. The overall composition adopts a center-left-side visual layout, with the characters occupying the main position, their bodies extending diagonally, creating a sense of dynamic balance. The camera's angle is slightly lower, close to the ground, enhancing the character's visual height and presence. Light and shadow come from directly above to the right, providing ample sunlight but not glaring. Shadows are gently cast onto the sand, highlighting a sense of depth. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and full of summer vibes. The color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and the texture is realistic—as if taken with a professional camera, while preserving natural light and shadow changes and environmental textures, giving it strong visual appeal and artistic appeal",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
