        {
          "id": "krea2-e1aa9fda23eb47842d1dd654",
          "alias": "单女透视连衣裙摄影棚专注坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white plush cushion, wearing a light beige fitted short-sleeve polo collar dress with a knee-length hem. The fabric features delicate vertical textures that create a soft pleat. The overall look is simple yet elegant, with her hands folded on her left knee, her left wrist wearing a slender gold bracelet. Her fingers are long, her nails neatly trimmed, her legs crossed, right leg draped over her left, and sheer stockings on her feet. Her toes are clearly contoured, her posture naturally relaxed, and her body leans slightly back against the pure white wall. On the left side of the background is a magazine, and on the right wall hangs a black-and-white landscape painting depicting trees and rocks. The painting features an Eastern ink wash style, with a light gray wood grain floor with clear texture. The entire scene is bright and soft, illuminated by facade soft lighting, with light sources evenly distributed around the subject, creating a clean and transparent visual effect. The transitions of light and shadow are natural, with subtle shadows concentrated below and at the edges, highlighting the subject's three-dimensionality. The composition is centered on the middle shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the center, occupying the main position in the composition. Forms a stable visual center. The foreground is a close-up of the subject's legs and feet, rich in detail; the middle ground features the upper body and sitting posture; the background features simple walls and decorations with distinct layers. The colors are mainly white, light beige, and gray, with unified and harmonious tones. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, fresh, and everyday, as if shot at home or in a studio with professional equipment. The image texture is delicate, details are realistic, and it features high resolution and natural skin texture. It presents the elegant temperament and comfortable living state of modern urban women, with balanced compositions and horizontal perspectives, focusing on the expressions and postures of the figures, conveying a quiet, gentle, and slightly intimate everyday beauty",
