        {
          "id": "krea2-67235427d3795f1703064bbc",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙樱花坐侧头",
          "prompt": "Her fingers are long, and natural shadows blend along her wrists. She wears a light blue spaghetti strap dress with white floral patterns on a thin strap and a light and flowing fabric, presenting natural pleats and drapes. She wears two pink cherry blossom petals, with the petals curled slightly, the color gradient from pale pink to white. The texture is soft, as if just plucked from a tree. She sits on a reddish-brown wooden bench, with clear grain and a slightly rough surface. The background is blurred green plants, and the leaves gently sway in the breeze, forming a soft green blurred background. In the distance, some white light spots can be faintly seen, like sunlight shining through the leaves. The entire composition uses medium shots, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, the body slightly leaning forward and the head slightly tilted to the right, creating a warm and natural feeling. The background blur treatment highlights the subject, creating a smooth visual path. The light comes from the right side, soft natural light. Sunlight filters through the leaves, creating mottled shadows, while casting a faint halo in the background. The overall light and shadow layers are rich, with moderate contrast between light and shadow, creating a quiet and cozy atmosphere. The color palette is mainly fresh green and soft pink, paired with a light blue dress, creating a romantic atmosphere reminiscent of a spring afternoon. The image has a slight film texture, low color saturation, and a retro filter effect. It feels as if taken with an old-fashioned camera, with realistic details and natural textures. The overall style is artistic and fresh, full of life energy, suitable for expressing themes of youth, beauty, and healing. The images present beautiful moments casually captured in daily life, like photos casually taken with a phone or portable camera, without any deliberate staged shots, yet full of genuine emotion and warmth",
          "description": "",
