        {
          "id": "krea2-ac17d3b23ec0d9bc99419589",
          "alias": "单女灰外套城市忧伤自拍",
          "prompt": "A woman is presented in a low-angle upward view, adding a touch of laziness and casualness. She wears round metal-framed glasses that reflect a soft blue-purple halo. The \"CAPIN\" brand logo is clearly visible on the temples. She wears a dark gray wool coat, Underneath, he wears an off-white ribbed knit turtleneck sweater with slightly exposed cuffs, creating clear layers and a delicate texture. The background is a simple light gray-white wall, and on the right side, the outline of white furniture is faintly visible, possibly a corner of a cabinet or bookshelf. The space is clean and tidy, with no unnecessary decoration, creating a minimalist indoor atmosphere. Light comes from the left side of the frame, creating a natural transition between light and dark, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. At the same time, delicate reflections appear on the eyeglass lenses, with consistent light and shadow directions that are not awkward. The overall tone is cool, mainly gray, white, and black, dotted with a splash of bright red, the composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the frame, the head slightly tilted, gazing directly at the lens, creating a strong sense of interaction. The background blur is well handled, highlighting the subject while retaining enough environmental information to enhance realism. The overall atmosphere is quiet, restrained, artistic, and slightly melancholic, as if capturing the most authentic and intimate moment of daily life, like a selfie casually taken at home with an old digital camera. It features a slight graininess and a low-saturation color texture, presenting a genuine beauty that feels like everyday life. The image details are rich, light and shadow transitions are natural, and the color combinations are harmonious and unified, embodying a strong film photography style and the lifestyle atmosphere of contemporary urban youth",
