        {
          "id": "krea2-6cf629919f889c96279efbc2",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣窗边愤怒坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the indoor floor, sitting cross-legged, leaning slightly forward, hands naturally folded on her knees, presenting a quiet and contemplative posture. She wears a loose deep blue chunky knit sweater featuring classic twisted floral patterns, with clear and visible patterns, thick and layered stitching, and ribbed trim designs on the cuffs and hem, giving a solid and warm impression The sweater material looks soft and fluffy, providing good warmth and comfort. She wears black stockings, with long and well-proportioned leg lines. The surface of the stockings is smooth with a slight sheen, forming a sharp contrast with the sweater. The background is a simple white wall with a large multi-pane window framed in white. The window frames are neat, allowing soft, even natural light to flow in. Light streams in from outside, illuminating the entire space and creating a bright and fresh atmosphere. The geometric structure of the window frame contrasts with the rounded outline of the figures. This enhances the visual tension of the image. The floor is a light-colored wooden floor with delicate texture and elegant colors, harmonizing with the overall tone. The composition uses medium shot portraits, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The head is slightly tilted, creating direct visual contact with the viewer. The foreground shows the figure's body and legs, rich in detail. The middle ground shows the upper body and sweater texture, while the background features windows and walls, with clear layering. In terms of lighting and shadow, the main light source comes from the left window, which is soft and without strong shadows. The shadow transitions are natural, and the sweater's woven texture creates rich contrasts of light and shadow under the light, highlighting the texture of the material. The overall color scheme mainly features warm and cool contrasts. The deep blue sweater creates a strong visual contrast with the white background, while the soft natural light blends to make the scene both fresh and warm. The color saturation is moderate, not glaring, giving a peaceful and comfortable feeling. The atmosphere is quiet, cozy, and slightly artistic, as if capturing a quiet moment spent alone on an afternoon. The overall style leans toward a blend of everyday realism and artistic photography, blending a sense of life with beauty. The images are rich in detail and authentic in texture, presenting a realism similar to amateur camera or mobile phone shooting, while retaining professional photography composition and light control, allowing viewers to experience authentic and delicate moments of life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
