        {
          "id": "krea2-da0dc9e9098129143c40edd9",
          "alias": "单女透视蓝连衣裙城市神秘持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a tight blue long-sleeved dress, gracefully bent over, her posture full of allure and confidence. Her makeup was exquisite, exuding a mysterious yet alluring aura. She wore black sheer stockings printed with the repeated \"BALENCIAGA\" brand, paired with silver high heels that shimmered metallicly in the light. The overall look was fashionable and avant-garde, with a bright indoor space in the background. Through the large window, one could see the blurred city skyline, with light streaming in from outside creating a soft natural glow. It illuminates the entire scene. The floor is wood textured with strip-like splicing design, while the window frames and railings are made of white metal, simple and modern. The composition uses a medium angle angle, with the figures occupying the main part of the frame and bodies tilted diagonally, creating a dynamic aesthetic. The layers of light and shadow are rich, the subject receives even light, and the shadows are soft, creating a warm and sophisticated atmosphere. The overall style combines artistic flair with the realism of everyday shooting, as if captured by a professional camera in natural light. The image texture is delicate, and the color saturation is moderate. It presents a high-end fashion blockbuster visual effect",
