        {
          "id": "krea2-cd7a0bf671fe982cd23300c5",
          "alias": "单女灰西装酒吧严肃倚靠展示",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a light gray tailored suit dress, paired with black stockings and silver-gray high heels. She leans confidently sideways against the edge of a modern-style wooden bar counter, leaning slightly forward, her right hand gently supporting the edge of the bar, while her left hand hangs naturally. Her leg lines are smooth and graceful, showcasing elegant and sexy curves. In the foreground is a dark carpet with geometric patterns, with clearly visible grain. In the middle is the female figure and the bar area, which is made of dark brown wood with a smooth surface. Above, blue and white ceramic decorations and black-and-white checkered coffee cups are placed. The background is the indoor environment, with a modular wall design of off-white and deep brown. The embedded TV screen displays blurred city night lights. The overall spatial layout is simple and modern, with a low-angle downward view highlighting the figure's height and posture. The figure is positioned slightly in the center on the right side of the frame, forming the visual focal point. The left side is blank to create a sense of breathing, and light and shadow shine from the front left. The soft warm glow outlines the figures, with natural shadow transitions. It creates a warm and intimate atmosphere, with the main tones of gray, brown, and black, accented with blue and red. The layers are rich and the details are exquisite, giving it the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. The camera simulates real shooting effects, with moderate focal length, reasonable depth control, slightly blurred backgrounds to highlight the subject, natural lighting, and no obvious post-processing marks, presenting an overall realistic aesthetic that blends urban fashion with privacy",
