        {
          "id": "krea2-40932abb49ed9cf7bcfccc74",
          "alias": "单女窗边忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits by the window, wearing a loose white crew-neck sweatshirt with sleeves slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists. She leans relaxedly against the windowsill, her fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, gazing at the camera. Her expression reveals a faint melancholy and contemplation, appearing especially clear amid the interplay of light and shadow. At the same time, deep shadows are cast in the background, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. The light outside the window appears in warm golden tones. The interior is surrounded by cool-toned gray-green walls, which look somewhat aged and show signs of age. The window frames are made of light-colored wood or metal with slight wear along the edges. The window sill surface is rough, showing fine scratches and dust. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space, heads slightly tilted, creating direct visual contact with the viewer and creating a strong emotional connection. The slightly lower perspective enhances the characters' affinity and immersion. In the upper right corner of the painting, there is a large shadowed area that adds depth to the space. It highlights the texture and three-dimensionality of the clothing, while the shadowed areas retain rich layered details. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic, like a solitary afternoon moment, full of artistic vibe and the warmth of everyday life. The photography style leans toward film texture, with moderate color saturation, slight graininess, and warm tone shifts, as if shooting daily records with an old-fashioned camera. It captures the intertwining of light, shadow, and emotion. The images are simple and authentic, without excessive decoration. Emphasizing the use of natural light and the expression of the characters' inner worlds, the composition is compact but not crowded, with just the right amount of blank space. The visual direction runs from left to right, starting from the light source, drawing viewers into her thoughts. The entire scene is filled with a quiet, introspective, slightly melancholic yet warm and tranquil atmosphere, like a forgotten corner of youthful memories gently awakened by a beam of light.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
