        {
          "id": "krea2-80bbc460783fc11e8d0d9cbf",
          "alias": "单女白T恤城市忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in a corner of an outdoor building, wearing a loose white short-sleeved T-shirt with three simple cartoon animal heads printed on the chest. She pairs it with light khaki casual shorts. The overall style is fresh and natural, full of everyday charm, with subtle curls that look lively and full of vitality. She leans slightly forward, leaning sideways against the rough beige concrete wall. The wall texture is clearly visible, showing grainy texture and the mottled marks left by time. She looks down at the camera, Adding a touch of warm brightness to the overall cool tone: her right hand gently rests on her waist, her left hand naturally hangs down, her posture relaxed yet elegant. The composition combines close-ups with the environment. The figure is positioned on the left side, occupying about one-third of the space, while the right side leaves a large negative space, creating visual balance and tension. The background is blurred, presenting a blurred street scene. The outline of a parked motorcycle and distant architectural structures can be faintly seen. The ground is a gray cement pavement, slightly damp. The light reflects a faint sheen, enhancing the realism of the scene. Light comes from above, belonging to natural light, possibly diffused light from cloudy or evening days, resulting in uniform and soft lighting without strong shadows. The color transitions are natural, with rich but not abrupt light and shadow layers. The overall tone of the image leans toward a cool tone, mainly gray-white, beige, and light blue, creating a tranquil and slightly melancholic urban atmosphere while retaining youthful vitality. The photographer used a large-aperture lens to achieve an extremely shallow depth of field, making the subject stand out sharply The background is completely blurred, creating a soft-focus texture similar to film photography. The entire scene feels like a moment captured on the street with a portable camera, full of life and realism, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment of daily life. The composition cleverly uses walls as guiding lines to draw the viewer's gaze toward the characters, while through the characters' tilted postures and backward glances, a dynamic intimacy is created. The overall atmosphere is both quiet and full of storytelling, like a sunshine on an afternoon. The girl inadvertently glances back at the camera, capturing the beauty of that moment. The exquisite details of the visuals and the rough texture of the walls all demonstrate a high degree of authenticity, conveying an aesthetic close to everyday life and allowing people to feel a simple yet sincere emotional warmth",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
