        {
          "id": "krea2-4fe6e8058bdd298b61fe58db",
          "alias": "单女黑西装城市神秘站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a black fitted suit jacket and short skirt stands by the window inside. She wears a white fitted camisole underneath, black stockings that wrap her long legs, and her signature black high heels with bright red soles creating a striking visual contrast. She lifts one leg, touching the ground with her toes, her posture elegant and full of tension. Her left hand gently rests on the glass window, her right hand naturally hangs down, fingers slightly bent, head slightly tilted, exuding a calm yet slightly mysterious aura. The overall look is sharp yet sexy. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center, occupying the primary visual space. The foreground features a clear full-body outline of the figure with rich details. The middle ground features transparent glass windows and reflected images. The window frame lines are simple, and the glass reflects blurred reflections of the figures, enhancing the sense of spatial layering. The background features curtains with blue abstract patterns, with blue and white patterns distributed in waves for a delicate texture. The edges of the curtains have slight wrinkles, creating a lived-in atmosphere. Outside the window, faint city night lights can be faintly seen, blurring into dot-like light spots that add to the urban atmosphere. The composition uses a vertical rectangular proportion, with the figure presented in three-quarters of the profile. The body is slightly tilted, forming an S-shaped curve that enhances dynamic beauty. The movement traces upward to hand movements, creating a cyclical visual path. Light and shadow come from the front and sides, with soft, warm tones illuminating the figure's front, creating natural shadow transitions that highlight three-dimensional contours. At the same time, a faint reflection is created on the glass surface, enhancing the image's realism. The overall atmosphere blends the calmness of a modern city with the gentleness of private spaces, combining the professionalism of a professional woman. It retains the softness of feminine charm, presenting a realistic style that balances fashion and art. It feels as if shot with a professional camera, with moderate focal length, precise depth control, high image clarity, just the right amount of color saturation, and rich detail. Overall, it presents a visual experience that blends sophistication and everyday life, like capturing a moment in a hotel room or high-end apartment, full of storytelling and emotional tension",
