        {
          "id": "krea2-a05b903442525ba8c5685dd0",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫摄影棚冷淡倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "Her expression carries a hint of coldness and detachment, as if immersed in a world of music or ready to sing. Her overall posture is elegant and powerful. She wears a loose blue and white striped shirt with an open collar and sleeves rolled up to her elbows, revealing slender arms and shoulder lines. She wears low-rise denim shorts paired with a matching denim bikini, creating a casual yet sexy style. Her hands naturally grip a black electric guitar. The body features a classic double-angled design, equipped with a white guard, three single-coil pickups, three control knobs, and a vibrato system. The neck is made of dark wood, with clear frets. The headstock has six silver tuning pins. Her left hand rests on the neck while her right hand gently rests near the body, as if ready to play at any moment. Her body leans slightly, left leg bent forward, right leg extended back, knee touching the ground, creating a dynamic sense of balance. The composition centers on the character, shot from a slightly top-down angle to highlight the character's three-dimensionality and spatial layering. The foreground features the lower half of the guitar and the legs, the middle is the body, upper body, and the background is a pure, undisturbed white wall. The light is soft and even, coming from the upper front to create bright and delicate highlights, creating a clean and crisp tonal effect. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is cool and modern, with a strong sense of fashion and artistic flair. The color palette is mainly blue and white, accented with black guitars. The color contrasts are sharp yet not jarring, following her gaze to the guitar in her hand, then flowing down to the curves of her body and leg movements, forming a smooth S-shaped movement. The image texture is delicate, the clothing wrinkles natural, and the details rich, giving it the refined feel of professional studio shooting. At the same time, it retains the casual and realistic feel of everyday life, as if casually captured with a regular camera in a studio afternoon, yet the character's temperament and the purity of the scene make it especially moving. The overall composition embodies a youthful and rebellious rock spirit while maintaining a gentle and restrained aesthetic, presenting a unique atmosphere that lies between reality and ideals",
