        {
          "id": "krea2-152b9baf46dc48903256d70a",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙废墟忧伤倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She lowers her head and gazes, her expression slightly melancholic and contemplative, presenting a quiet and reserved emotional state. Her neck is graceful, wearing a deep blue or black long-sleeved dress with white ruffles at the neckline, with wavy edges creating a striking visual contrast. The ruffle is lightweight, soft in texture, and gently undulates, adding a touch of vintage elegance. The figure is positioned slightly to the right of the center of the painting. The body is slightly tilted, the head slightly lowered, and the posture is naturally relaxed, creating a quiet yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The background is a mottled concrete wall covered with tiny holes, cracks, and irregular patterns. The color is grayish-brown, bearing the marks of time. Light and shadow shine in from the left, casting heavy shadows on the wall and figures. The light is sharply angled, creating a strong contrast of light and dark. The sunlight shows a warm golden hue, while the shadowed areas are deep and dark. Almost pure black, with sharp edges of the beam, cutting through space like blades to form geometric light and shadow patterns. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame but retaining enough blank space. The overall composition is highly visually guided, with light entering from the upper left, creating a diagonal flow of light and shadow. The overall tone of the image leans toward a cool tone, dominated by gray, black, and blue. But the warm yellow tones in the light become the visual focal point, bringing temperature contrasts and creating a sense of both calm and warm, contradictory beauty. The photographic style resembles film texture, with slight graininess and natural noise. The color saturation is moderate, not overly vivid, preserving true light and shadow details, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera in the early morning or evening. The light is soft yet intense, the image is full of storytelling and emotional tension. The overall atmosphere is calm, profound, and poetic, like a silent poem. Capturing a moment of inner monologue, the setting is set inside an abandoned old building, possibly a basement or a corner room. Light filters through cracks or windows, time freezes at the moment before sunset, the air is filled with tranquility and loneliness. The visuals contain no unnecessary decorations or distractions, and the minimalist approach makes emotional expression purer. Light and shadow, as the main characters, together build a visual world full of narrative",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
