        {
          "id": "krea2-9f92b2ae988e68b3bd345703",
          "alias": "单女上衣忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "The tips curl slightly, adding a touch of playfulness and liveliness. Her fingers are long, and a piece of beige fabric is wrapped around her wrist, casually knotted, presenting a casual yet slightly vintage style. She wears a loose light gray top with wide sleeves and light, soft material, with natural pleats and layers at the cuffs. Over her shoulders is an orange-brown coat with a thick texture and warm colors. In stark contrast to the light gray top, she wears light blue jeans with natural hanging legs. The overall look is simple yet comfortable, carrying a hint of melancholy and contemplation. Her calm expression reveals restrained emotion. She sits relaxed, leans slightly forward, and tilts her head slightly, giving the whole posture a lazy yet authentic feel. The foreground is a close-up of the upper body of the subject, occupying most of the space. The details are rich, with blurred green plants and natural light spots in the background, presenting a soft bokeh effect. In the blurred background, the outlines of trees and shrubs can be faintly seen, with interlaced light and shadow creating a tranquil and poetic atmosphere. The composition uses a central composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame. The left side of the painting leaves a lot of blank space, while the right side is filled with the figure's body and clothing, creating visual balance and tension. The light comes from the upper right, soft natural light, filtering through the leaves, transitioning naturally with moderate light and shadow, creating a warm and fresh feeling. The overall color palette is mainly soft warm yellow and cool green The color coordination is harmonious, combining the warmth of sunlight with the freshness of greenery. The atmosphere of the images is tranquil, gentle, and slightly artistic, as if capturing a moment under the afternoon sun. It is full of storytelling and emotional tension. The image texture is delicate, with a slight film graininess and a retro tone with low color saturation, like everyday photos taken with an old camera. It carries a sense of life and authenticity, while retaining the aesthetic pursuit of artistic photography. Overall, it presents a subtle balance between everyday life and art. It evokes a quiet beauty and inner emotional flow",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
