        {
          "id": "krea2-43a1c398930f5d906b608e78",
          "alias": "单女和服广场自信侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wears a kimono in light blue with pink cherry blossom patterns. The kimono fabric has a silky smoothness and a slight sheen. The sleeves are wide and flowing, the collar reveals the edge of the white inner garment, and a wide pale pink belt hangs down at the waist. The belt naturally drapes down the back, forming soft pleats. The overall look is elegant and dignified, showcasing the refined beauty of traditional Japanese attire. A cluster of real pink cherry blossoms adorns the bun, with distinct petals and delicate stamens. Echoing the cherry blossom pattern on the kimono, it adds a touch of liveliness and naturalness. She turns sideways to look back at the camera, her head slightly tilted, her posture elegant and composed. The main subject is positioned slightly to the right of the center, using the classic three-part composition. The figure occupies the main visual focus, clear and sharp, with rich details. The middle scene features the kimono's sleeves and obi, with smooth lines and natural color transitions. The background is a typical Japanese indoor scene. On the left is a square Japanese paper lantern emitting a soft, warm yellow glow. The lantern's light diffuses through the translucent paper, forming a warm halo. In the background, there are several blurred circular light spots, like distant candles or lights, creating a hazy atmosphere. Behind is a traditional Japanese lattice sliding door, with a clearly visible wooden frame and a light brown tone that harmonizes with the overall warm tones. The floor is covered with tatami mats with delicate texture and a light beige color. The entire space layout is simple yet Zen-like. The composition uses a shallow depth effect, with clear figures in the foreground and gradually blurred backgrounds, highlighting the main subject while creating spatial layering. Then, following the lines of the kimono and the lantern's light into the background, it forms a quiet and profound visual flow. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is mainly warm yellow, with the light source coming from the lantern on the left, creating a contrast of light and shadow. The shadowed areas delicately outline the body's outline, creating a warm feeling reminiscent of dusk, as soft as the afterglow of the setting sun. The overall composition exudes a sense of tranquility, The aesthetic and poetic Eastern aesthetic mood seems to capture a moment of tranquility, full of artistic atmosphere that blends classical charm with modern aesthetics, while also carrying the realism of everyday photography with a mobile phone or regular camera. Slight noise and natural color transitions enhance the sense of realism, yet maintain artistic treatment, making the images both visually appealing and close to everyday life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
