          "id": "krea2-539014e6baaf12a62f683b73",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫床害羞坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a bed covered with blue and white checkered sheets, wearing a loose light blue plaid shirt with a dark blue striped vest underneath, and gray shorts below. Her posture is natural and relaxed, hands crossed behind her head, and she slightly tilts her head back to look at the camera, presenting a lazy yet slightly shy expression that adds softness and spontaneity. Her legs are crossed, right leg on top and left leg below, ankles lightly touching the ground. The overall posture appears both casual and attractive, with the foreground showing her midsection and legs. The sleeves of the plaid shirt are rolled up high, revealing the slender lines of the arms. In the background is a window framed with wooden windows. Soft natural light streams in outside, filtering through the curtains and creating a mottled effect of light and shadow, creating a warm and tranquil atmosphere. On the windowsill, you can faintly see the outlines of some greenery, adding a touch of vitality to the scene. The room is simply and cozy, with a round wooden table by the bed holding a white cup and a cushion with polka dot patterns nearby. These details enrich the sense of spatial layering. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait style, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, body slightly tilted, head slightly raised, forming a subtle angle between the gaze and the camera, enhancing visual guidance. The window and bed in the background form a symmetrical frame structure, making the image more stable. At the same time, the shallow depth of field effect focuses the focus on the figure, while the background gradually blurs, emphasizing the subject's presence. In terms of light and shadow, the main light source comes from the window on the right, which is side lighting. The other side is shrouded in soft shadows, creating a sharp contrast of light and shadow that enhances the sense of depth. Sunlight streams through the glass, casting soft shadows on the floor and sheets, adding realism and warmth to the image. The overall color scheme is mainly blue, white, and wood, harmoniously unified to create a fresh, comfortable, and slightly nostalgic home atmosphere. The overall image presents a subtle beauty from everyday life, as if capturing a peaceful moment when morning or afternoon sunlight fills the room. It evokes a warm, relaxed, and pleasant atmosphere of life, as if you can hear the breeze rustling through the leaves outside the window and the faint scent of sunlight in the air. The entire scene is filled with everyday details and emotional warmth, like a quiet scene from an art film, evoking imagination.",
