        {
          "id": "krea2-3365efff686082ca35b4ee86",
          "alias": "单女制服公园愤怒倚靠张开双腿",
          "prompt": "A woman is wearing a Japanese-style sailor uniform: a white short-sleeved top paired with a dark blue pleated skirt, a red bow at the collar, and a deep blue scarf with white stripes. The overall look is classic and full of youthful energy. Looking directly at the camera, she exudes playfulness and confidence. Her left hand is raised above her head in a V-shape, fingers are long, nails painted light-colored, right hand on hip, striking a lively and expressive pose. She carries a black leather shoulder bag with the strap draped over her shoulder, a gold fine chain bracelet on her wrist, and shiny black loafers on her feet. Paired with white mid-calf socks, the slender calf line is revealed. The background is a bright yellow circular structure, resembling a large installation in an amusement park or theme park. The surface is smooth and metallic, with riveted edges presenting an industrial design style. Behind it, you can faintly see the outlines of other facilities in blue-green and orange. The floor is a colored floor made of yellow and brown patchwork, offering rich color layers. The composition uses a high-angle overhead view, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame, body slightly leaning forward, legs spread in a stable stance. This forms a visual focal point: the foreground highlights the main subject, the middle frame showcases their full body shape and clothing details, and the background is dominated by large areas of warm yellow tones, creating a warm and lively atmosphere. Light and shadow come from the upper front, with subtle and natural transitions. The overall lighting is bright but not glaring, with high color saturation. The yellow background contrasts strongly with the red, white, and blue school uniforms, enhancing visual impact. The overall composition presents a vibrant, youthful, and everyday vibe. It feels like an impromptu photo shot at an amusement park on a sunny afternoon, featuring a slight film grain texture and natural depth blur effect. The lens has a focal length of about 85mm and an aperture of f/2.8, capturing moments of beauty in real life. The warm and slightly retro color tones emphasize the interaction between the subject and the environment, conveying a relaxed and joyful mood. The overall image combines the refinement of artistic photography with the natural realism of amateur equipment, like youthful memories casually captured with a portable camera.",
