          "id": "krea2-1884bb039dbc982c0f9e775d",
          "alias": "单女全裸橙T恤摄影棚冷淡坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a white cube booth, wearing a bright orange short-sleeved T-shirt and light blue denim shorts, paired with nude stockings and bright yellow flats. She wears a black-and-white polka dot bow headband and delicate pearl earrings, her expression slightly cool and calm. She sits gracefully sideways, with her right leg bent and raised, left leg naturally hanging down, right hand gently holding the yellow shoe at her side, left hand resting naturally on her thigh. The overall look is simple, stylish, and full of youthful energy, with a background of rough gray cement walls. The surface has fine cracks and mottled marks, presenting an atmosphere of industrial or modern art spaces. The floor is made of dark gray concrete, echoing the walls and forming a unified spatial tone. On the left side, another white cube stands a white ceramic vase with withered branches inserted, adding a touch of wabi-sabi aesthetic and artistic feel. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figure occupying the center-right position, forming a visual focal point. The contrast of geometric forms — the white cube and the cold gray wall The warm tones of orange clothing and yellow shoes create a strong visual impact, creating a strong color contrast and sense of layering. Light comes from the front left of the image, with soft natural light or studio lighting illuminating the subject, creating a clear transition between light and shadow. Shadows fall to the right of the figure and behind the display, enhancing three-dimensionality and spatial depth. The direction of light and shadow is clear, making the character outlines distinct while preserving the authentic texture of the environment. The overall atmosphere blends the calmness of modern cities with the warmth of personal style, combining the refinement of an art exhibition. It retains the spontaneity and authenticity of daily life. The images have a grainy texture and slight noise reminiscent of film photography, simulating amateur camera shooting effects. The color saturation is moderate, but key elements like orange and yellow stand out, enhancing visual appeal. The composition is stable and balanced, with reasonable blank space, forming a smooth visual flow. Overall, it presents a realistic image that blends fashion, art, and lifestyle, as if a street photographer captured a moment in a corner of the city—both authentic and story-rich, with rich details and no clutter.",
