          "id": "krea2-adb081c89e49709203c67fa8",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙微笑站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by the sea, wearing black sunglasses and glasses perched on her head, looking directly at the camera. She wears a faint, almost imperceptible smile with a hint of sheen, presenting a natural, healthy feel. She wears a simple black spaghetti strap dress with smooth lines that hug her figure. The thin straps outline a graceful shoulder and neck curve, her arms hang naturally, her hands not in the frame, her body slightly turned to the camera, her posture elegant and composed. The foreground is a close-up of the upper body of the person, occupying the main position, while the middle is the shimmering sea. The sea is deep blue, with subtle white waves crashing against the shore. In the distance, the horizon is faintly visible where sea meets sky. The background is heavy clouds, the sky is gloomy and oppressive, but a strong beam of light pierces through the clouds in the center, creating a dramatic backlighting effect and a sacred and dreamlike atmosphere. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned center-right, while light and shadow contrast highlights the subject. The colors are mainly cool tones, with black, gray, and deep blue intertwined, dotted with warm sunlight, creating a strong visual impact and rich layers of light and shadow Backlighting creates a soft halo at the edges of the figure, with clear details. The overall atmosphere is both melancholic and tranquil, like a moment of tranquility before a storm. It has a cinematic visual texture, similar to the combination of professional studios and natural scenes. Using high-resolution cameras and large aperture lenses to capture scenes, it emphasizes depth blur and detail restoration. The image style leans toward a blend of realism and artistry, presenting a beauty that is both everyday and surreal, like high-quality portraits shot with top-tier equipment. While preserving the realism of the natural environment and the sense of capturing dynamic moments, the visuals are full of storytelling and emotional tension, conveying an independent, confident, and slightly mysterious feminine temperament. The cloud textures in the background are delicate and distinct, with natural light and shadow transitions. The sea surface reflects faint light, enhancing the sense of spatial depth. The overall color tone is cool but warm, and precise light and shadow control creates a strong visual focus and emotional resonance",
