        {
          "id": "krea2-bc1725d4dac0de067d74801b",
          "alias": "单女全裸白毛衣咖啡厅温柔坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of a wooden windowsill, wearing a white plush cardigan with light-colored tight clothes underneath. She sits cross-legged with her hands folded on her knees, her posture naturally relaxed, exuding a quiet and warm aura. On her left wrist, she wears a slender gold bracelet, adding a touch of refinement. On her feet, she wears nude stockings, her feet hang down naturally, toes slightly bent, presenting a true daily state. On the left side of the painting sits an orange-red basketball with a clearly visible texture, and beside it is a closed book. The cover is white, and on the right side are a bag of green-packaged snacks and a transparent wine glass, which appears to be filled with liquid. The background is a white wall with a sunflower pattern decoration hanging on it, bright and full of vitality. On the wall hangs a white lace curtain adorned with deer, pine cones, and other ornaments, along with a photo printed with the word \"CAFE.\" The overall environment is warm and comfortable, with soft and bright lighting, diffused by natural light from outside the window. This gives the entire scene a warm beige tone, with natural light and shadow transitions and soft shadows without strong contrasts. The composition uses a mid-field perspective, with the main subject positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, forming a visual focal point. The foreground features windowsills and objects, the middle ground is the main figure, and the background consists of wall decorations and hangings. The layers are distinct and the sense of space is strong, creating an intimate and tranquil atmosphere. The overall style combines a sense of life with artistic beauty, as if captured with a regular camera, with a slight film texture and natural noise. The color tone is slightly warm, details rich, and texture authentic. The image conveys a sense of homely warmth, youthful innocence, and the comfort of life, allowing people to feel a simple yet beautiful everyday moment",
