          "id": "krea2-8f8d10dc9ee163c472cd9481",
          "alias": "单女白外套街道忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "adding a touch of liveliness and laziness. She glances slightly to the right side of the frame, as if gazing into a distant scene that makes her ponder, presenting a natural, effortless state radiating a healthy glow. She wears a white inner layer over a dark blue jacket with a prominent black trim at the collar, creating a distinct layering effect. She also carries an off-white backpack on her shoulder, with the straps clearly visible, slung from her left shoulder to her right waist, adding a sense of everyday life and everyday life. The background is blurred, presenting blurry cool tones of light and shadow—possibly from an outdoor street or a corner of a park. Faint light spots and lines can be seen, creating a peaceful yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, the head slightly tilted, forming a graceful S-shaped curve, with light coming from the left side of the frame. Soft natural light hits from the side, creating a contrast of light and shadow, while shadows are naturally distributed on the other side, enhancing the sense of depth. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere is quiet and warm, with a subtle sense of nostalgia. The tone is mainly cool blue, creating a tranquil winter afternoon or dusk atmosphere. The image texture is delicate, with the graininess of film photography and slight underexposure, as if taken with an old camera. The background presents beautiful bokeh, the out-of-focus image is soft, and the edges are blurred. Highlighting the clarity of the subject, the overall composition is full of poetry and storytelling, making one imagine herself listening to a moving song, immersed in her own world, enjoying moments of tranquility and solitude",
