        {
          "id": "krea2-c0f0baeaf3d4015ef560283e",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道忧伤站立持相机（2）",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beside a bus stop on a city street, wearing a loose long black coat made of thick wool fabric. The collar is slightly open, revealing a white turtleneck sweater underneath. The cuffs and hem hang naturally, with smooth and layered lines. Her right hand gently holds a black professional DSLR camera, the lens pointing out of the frame, while her left hand rests naturally on the camera. Her fingers are long and her nails neatly trimmed, presenting a focused and calm posture that adds a touch of laziness and casual beauty Her expression was slightly serious, as if immersed in her own world. Around her neck was a thick knit scarf with a gradient of blue-purple hues. The scarf was soft and fluffy, with colors transitioning from light blue to deep purple. The edges were decorated with fine tassels, adding a splash of brightness and warmth to the overall look. She stood with her legs together, wearing a pair of black flat leather shoes with smooth uppers and low heels, making them both comfortable and elegant. A small piece of black pantying peeked out at her ankles, forming a dark tone that matched the coat and shoes. On the ground beside her lay a brown leather tote bag. The body was simple and elegant, with slight wear marks and signs of use, giving it a vintage yet practical look. The handle and shoulder strap were leather in the same color family, with understated and delicate metal fasteners. The background was a blurry city street, with zebra crossings, green belts, and a few bare trees visible in the distance. The sky was gray and hazy, like a cloudy day or early morning. The light was soft and even, without strong shadows. The overall color palette was mainly cool tones—black, blue, The gray is interwoven to create a tranquil yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition uses a medium shot of portraits, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, body slightly angled to the lens, head slightly turned toward the viewer, creating a subtle sense of interaction. The foreground is the ground and tote bag, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background is blurred, highlighting the character's outline and expression. The camera, as an important prop in the frame, not only hints at the person's identity as a photographer or enthusiast but also adds storytelling and narrative value to the image. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is soft and even, with no obvious light direction, presenting a natural scattered light effect that gives a quiet and contemplative feeling. The entire image is filled with the breath of everyday life, as if captured from an ordinary person's phone album. It is authentic and rich in life texture, while also reflecting the aesthetic pursuit of artistic photography, conveying an emotional state of urban youth seeking moments of tranquility and self-expression amid busy lives",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
