        {
          "id": "krea2-7ba694c915a516d5341f7355",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "She slightly tilts her head up to the upper right of the frame, radiating a healthy glow. She wears a loose white dress with red polka dot patterns on a white base, a ruffled neckline, and short sleeves. The overall style is fresh and sweet, full of pastoral charm. In the foreground are several plant branches blooming with small white flowers. The flowers are small and dense, with slender stems and leaves, creating natural shade and layering. The background is a blurry green vegetation, presenting a soft bokeh effect. Light pours down from the upper left of the frame, creating a warm backlight and creating a dreamlike halo. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating mottled light and shadow that highlights the main subject. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the space, and the heads slightly tilted, creating a sense of visual flow. The overall tone of the painting leans toward warmth, mainly green, white, and red, with harmonious color combinations and a quiet and romantic atmosphere. It feels as if capturing the gentlest moment of a summer afternoon. The lens texture resembles film camera shooting, with slight graininess and soft color transitions. Light and shadow are soft, details rich, and it has a strong cinematic and artistic atmosphere. The edges of the frame are slightly blurred, enhancing the focus effect, presenting an overall tranquil, beautiful, and poetic visual experience, as if time has frozen in this moment, allowing one to feel the beauty and innocence of youth",
