        {
          "id": "krea2-32d5fdd99c19808a062a58bb",
          "alias": "单女上衣樱花困倦站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands beneath a blooming cherry tree, wearing a loose white top paired with a light yellow skirt. The fabric is light and flowing, with wide sleeves that create natural pleats and drapes. The shoulder straps are light yellow with fine ruffled decorations, giving the overall look a fresh and elegant look full of springtime charm. In the foreground is her clear half-body silhouette, occupying the main spot, with lush cherry blossom trees in the background. The branches are covered with pink flowers, with petals layered densely and full, forming a sea of pink flowers. The branches crisscross, some of which are dark brown, contrasting with the pink flowers. The sky is a bright pale blue with no clouds. Sunlight pours down from above, soft and even, illuminating the entire scene and creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, highlighting the figure's elegant posture and the tall and upright cherry trees. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the painting, leaving space on the right to showcase the extension of the cherry blossoms, forming a smooth visual path, with colors dominated by pink, white, pale yellow, and blue, harmoniously unified in tone, presenting an overall tranquil, romantic, and beautiful spring scene. It resembles a photographic work combining realism and art, featuring a strong Japanese aesthetic style. The image texture is delicate and detailed, combining the realism of everyday shooting with carefully designed artistic beauty. It is like a natural portrait taken with a professional camera on a clear spring afternoon, capturing the most beautiful moments of youth and spring",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
