        {
          "id": "krea2-3f644e56ca00ab54c5497653",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫家中愤怒坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the white steps indoors, leaning slightly back against the wall, her right hand naturally resting at her knee. Her posture is elegant and relaxed, exuding a casual yet slightly alluring aura. She wears slim-rimmed glasses that reflect soft light, her expression calm yet tinged with tenderness and thought. She wears a semi-transparent white shirt with a slightly open neckline revealing her collarbones and neckline, sleeves rolled up to her elbows, and a black high-waisted short skirt that hugs her hips, accentuating her body proportions. Her legs are crossed. One foot is on the ground, the other knee bent and raised, ankle exposed, wearing light-colored stockings with toes naturally extended. On the left side of the foot sits a pair of black Mary Jane shoes with bow decorations on the upper, giving a vintage yet refined look. The background is a simple and bright interior space, with pure white walls. On the right side is a light wood open bookshelf with several books, one of which has the cover printed \"COCO CHANEL,\" and next to it is a magazine or picture booklet. The bookshelf design is simple and modern, The overall color scheme is mainly white and light wood, creating a clean and refreshing atmosphere. The floor is made of light-colored wood with clear and visible grain. The composition uses a mid-angle perspective, with the figures positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, their bodies in a diagonal posture, forming a natural visual guiding line. The gaze is naturally directed toward the main subject, with light and shadow from the left, soft and even, creating a delicate transition between light and shadow. Shadows fall lightly on the walls and figures, highlighting a sense of three-dimensionality. The overall lighting is bright but not glaring, presenting a warm and comfortable indoor environment. The tones are fresh and elegant, with moderate color saturation, emphasizing authentic texture and details. The images evoke the atmosphere of everyday life, as if shot with a regular camera, without excessive embellishment, preserving natural imperfections and texture. At the same time, precise lighting and composition create a quiet, private, and story-rich atmosphere, allowing viewers to feel the independence and composure of urban women. The entire scene is full of artistic beauty that feels both fashionable and approachable. It presents a moment of modern women showcasing their charm in a home environment, with rich details, clear layers, and a comfortable and thought-provoking visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
