          "id": "krea2-44949885ec918914797c4249",
          "alias": "单女黑高领衫城市忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors on gray concrete steps, wearing a black turtleneck knit sweater, paired with light-colored stockings and a pair of rose-gold pointed stilettos. At her feet are another pair of identical high heels, creating a simple yet elegant look. Her expression reveals a subtle shyness and approachability, adding softness and casualness. The background is a blurred stepped structure, presenting a cool gray-blue light and shadow, creating a tranquil yet slightly melancholic urban atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward angle, with the figure positioned slightly toward the center on the right side of the frame, forming the visual center. The left blank space is just right, enhancing the sense of breath and layering. The foreground clearly shows her leg lines, foot details, and the metallic sheen of her high heels. The background uses blur to highlight the subject while preserving the contours of environmental elements. Light comes from above, creating a highlight that guides the viewer. The overall tone is cool, dominated by blue-gray, accented by the deep contrast of black clothing and the warm rose gold shoes creating a visual tension where warmth and cool intertwine. The atmosphere in the images is tranquil and full of storytelling, as if capturing a leisurely moment on an afternoon city street. It combines the realistic texture of daily life with an artistic sense of light and shadow. The photography style resembles real records taken with amateur cameras or mobile phones, with slight graininess and natural noise, emphasizing the chance and warmth of real life. The background gradually loses focus, highlighting the subject's three-dimensionality and emotional expression. The overall image conveys a sense of youthfulness, gentleness, The image of a restrained and slightly artistic urban woman features balanced yet dynamic composition, harmonious color schemes, natural light and shadow transitions, rich details, and clearly visible clothing textures to mottled marks on the floor, presenting a highly realistic visual texture suitable for portraying the lifestyle and emotional state of modern urban youth",
