        {
          "id": "krea2-0950bfd635455a96f7f47d7a",
          "alias": "单女灰外套车厢忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways at the edge of a subway platform at night. She wears a long dark gray wool coat paired with a white turtleneck sweater. She lowers her head slightly, her fingers gently touching the string lights, as if savoring the faint yet warm glow. Her figure is reflected in a blurry yet symmetrical shadow by the glass curtain wall, with her silhouette appearing somewhat hazy, creating a visual effect of intertwining reality and illusion with her real figure. In the background, a red subway train speeds by, its body causing noticeable dynamic blurring due to movement. A long light strip and flowing light and shadow trails are presented. The glass surface reflects the lights of trains and platforms, creating a dynamic urban nighttime atmosphere. The ground is made of gray square tiles, neatly joined, with slight reflections along the edges. The entire scene is set at dusk or late at night, with the sky in a deep gray-blue tone. The light is dim but layered. In the foreground, the woman and her reflection are in the background; in the middle is a fast-moving train and platform structure; and in the background, the distant blurred outlines of city buildings and dim streetlights. The composition uses a vertical partition layout, with the glass curtain wall dividing the image into left and right parts. The left side features a physical figure, while the right side is a virtual reflection, creating a strong contrast and echo. The visual guide spreads outward from the light source in the woman's hand, gradually transitioning from the warm glow of her hand to the cool tones in the background, creating a contrast between cool and warm tones. The atmosphere of light and shadow is filled with tranquility and loneliness. The warm lighting contrasts sharply with the icy urban environment, creating a poetic moment of individual contemplation and self-dialogue in the modern city. The overall image texture is delicate, with graininess reminiscent of film photography and low-saturation colors, as if shot at night with an old full-frame camera. The lens has slight vignetting and vignetting, enhancing the image's realism and nostalgia. The tone is on the cool side, but there are warm light accents in some areas. The details are rich and layered, presenting a quiet, melancholic, yet hopeful artistic atmosphere",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
