        {
          "id": "krea2-b96da2fc6aae2ab710e61677",
          "alias": "单女灰外套小巷忧伤倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a loose dark gray coat layered with a light brown lace knit top with ruffles, the neckline showing soft layers. Around her neck is a gray-green plaid scarf casually wrapped around her neck, the edges hanging naturally, and the material looks soft and thick. The overall style is retro yet full of everyday life, creating an artistic yet lazy atmosphere. Her hands are naturally tucked into her coat pockets, her posture relaxed yet slightly distant, her body slightly leaning forward, forming a subtle visual focal point. The composition uses a centrally symmetrical layout, with the figure positioned at the very center of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The background features towering old buildings on both sides, with mottled walls showing gray-blue tones. Some walls show obvious signs of aging, faded billboards and blurred signage faintly visible on the walls. Above the alley, multiple power lines crisscross in a network, adding details and realism to urban life. The distant alley narrows, creating a strong perspective effect that guides the gaze deeper and enhances the sense of spatial depth. Light slants down from the upper left of the frame, creating a bright backlight. Sunlight passes through the gaps in the wires and falls on the figures' heads and shoulders, creating soft contour light that enhances the sense of depth. The buildings in the background are placed in darker shadows. The cool-toned blue-gray contrasts sharply with the warm sunlight in the foreground, highlighting the main figure. In the lower right corner of the painting is a small table with some blurred items like snacks or fruits, injecting a sense of life into the scene. The overall color scheme mainly features warm and cool contrasts, with a warm foreground and a cool background, creating an atmosphere that is both tranquil and slightly lonely. The image texture is delicate, with a grainy texture reminiscent of film photography and slight overexposure. The color saturation is moderate, presenting a vintage and gentle tone. The lens is similar to a 35mm prime lens, with a shallow depth of field, well-handled background blur, highlighting the main subject, while preserving environmental details. The composition is stable and storytelling, ultimately resting on the sunlight piercing the clouds. The entire scene is filled with poetic tranquility and nostalgia, like a film photo from old times, capturing the gentlest moment of an ordinary afternoon",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
