        {
          "id": "krea2-29416af114cdad1fbfb6f22c",
          "alias": "单女红和服窗边忧伤倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "She wears a red and white kimono covered in geometric red stripes interwoven with a white base color creating a rhythmic visual texture. The sleeves are wide and flowing, naturally draping down one side of her body. A deep blue obi belt is tied around her waist, creating a striking color contrast. Her posture leans slightly forward, her left hand gently resting on the windowsill, fingers long, nails neatly trimmed, carrying a hint of thoughtful calm and subtle melancholy. In the backlight, she appears semi-transparent, her expression calm and reserved. As if lost in her own thoughts, the space she was in was dimly lit, and most of the room was shrouded in shadow. Only the natural light streaming in through the window outlined her silhouette and the folds of her clothes, creating a strong contrast of light and dark. The window was made of traditional Japanese wooden frames, clearly visible. The wooden frame was dark brown, with fine scratches and wear marks left by time. The windowsill was thick and sturdy, with slightly rough edges. Behind the woman, a dark backpack or clothes could be vaguely seen stacked on a chair. Add a touch of life. The background through the window reveals a blurred outdoor scene, with hazy hills and trees in the distance. The leaves display the unique yellow-green tones of autumn. The outlines of several low houses are faintly visible, and the roofs are light-colored tiles. The overall scene is blended to create a profound sense of space and a dreamlike atmosphere. The composition uses the classic rule of thirds: the figure is positioned slightly to the center on the left side of the frame, with the gaze turning to the right, creating a dialogue between interior and exterior spaces. The use of light and shadow is extremely skillful. Soft natural light from outside the window streams in diagonally from the upper right, forming deep shadows behind and to her left, enhancing the sense of depth and drama. As the light passes through the window, it creates subtle halos and scattering effects, filling the entire scene with a warm yet slightly cool tone. The overall atmosphere is quiet, contemplative, and slightly nostalgic, like a film photograph capturing fleeting emotions. It has a strong Japanese aesthetic style, with delicate texture, moderate color saturation, and rich details, as if you can hear the gentle sound of wind rustling through leaves, feeling time freeze at this moment, this is a high-resolution photo taken with professional photography equipment, shot with a large aperture lens, with a noticeable background blur effect and precise focus on the subject, showcasing a high level of artistry and emotional expression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
