        {
          "id": "krea2-153ee888db1fd2219920445c",
          "alias": "单女T恤摄影棚困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman presents a dreamy and mysterious atmosphere. Her fingers are long, her nails painted dark polish, a black butterfly resting on the back of her hand, with white spots dotted on the wings, casting a faint glow under blue light. The butterfly is motionless, forming a subtle interaction with the figure, forming a strong contrast with the cool-toned environment. She wears a light-colored camisole with soft shoulder lines, On the arm, you can see faint light and shadow textures and color transitions. The background is a pure blue gradient, from deep blue to light blue, with slight halos and scattering effects. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center slightly to the right, head slightly tilted, gazing directly at the lens, creating a strong visual impact. The light mainly comes from the upper front, with cool blue as the main tone, accented by warm yellow light sources on the back of the hand and the butterfly area, creating rich layers of light and shadow and strong contrast between light and shadow. The image features obvious light spots and halo effects, enhancing the dreamlike and artistic feel. The composition is compact, and the background is blurred, making the subject stand out more. The overall atmosphere is poetic, solitary, and beautiful, as if capturing a moment of emotional outburst. It has a strong cinematic and surreal style, with a cool blue color scheme that creates visual tension. The details are rich, while some areas of blur and out-of-focus are retained to add depth and layering, presenting an overall sophisticated fashion portrait photography style. Like a professional photographer using high-end equipment in a carefully arranged studio, yet with a sense of casual and realistic everyday amateur photography. The lighting is soft and varied, without harsh shadows. The subjects' expressions are natural and emotionally rich, as if telling an unfinished story. The entire scene is full of narrative and emotional tension, inviting one to explore the meaning behind it. The tones are unified and harmonious, with the cold sharpness of blue colliding with the passionate red, creating a unique visual experience. The interplay of light and shadow reveals delicate emotional expression. The composition is exquisite, the main subject stands out, the background is simple, and the visual guide is natural. After hands and butterflies, it finally lands on a slipping teardrop, forming a complete emotional thread. The overall composition presents a quiet yet intense sense of contradictory beauty, combining the avant-garde feel of modern art with the delicate brushstrokes of classical oil painting. It resembles a digital painting blending sci-fi and romantic elements, yet possesses the texture and warmth of authentic photography. The image quality is extremely high, and the details are rich. The color saturation is moderate, with no signs of over-processing, maintaining a natural sense of authenticity. The overall atmosphere is dreamy and captivating",
          "description": "",
