          "id": "krea2-5560d2d54d1857cb5425d489",
          "alias": "单女和服小径害羞蹲侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman wore a traditional Japanese yukata with light blue and white intertwined colors. The yukata was printed with elegant floral patterns, mainly white and light yellow. The fabric had a silky smoothness and natural folds. She was squatting beside a path paved with black cobblestones, gently lifting the front of her yukata to reveal her purple undergarment. Her posture was elegant yet slightly shy, adorned with blue tassel accessories that added a touch of softness. Looking directly at the camera, her expression was gentle yet playful, wearing a delicate gold necklace around her neck. The pendant is a simple teardrop design, with a thin chain bracelet on the wrist and a ring on the finger. The overall design blends traditional and modern elements. The background is a blurred courtyard landscape, with green shrubs and distant building silhouettes faintly visible. The ground is paved with gray stone bricks, and the black pebbles in the foreground contrast with the black wooden clogs worn by the woman. The composition uses a medium close-up, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center, body slightly tilted, head slightly tilted, and soft and even light from naturally scattered light. It creates a tranquil atmosphere in the early morning or evening, with light and shadow creating delicate transitions of light and shadow in the folds of clothing, highlighting the texture and three-dimensionality of the fabric. The overall color palette is mainly cool blue, white, and green, harmoniously unified. The image has a high artistic beauty while retaining the realism and lived-in feel of everyday shooting. It feels like a moment captured with a professional camera paired with a large aperture lens. The depth of field effect is obvious, background blur is well handled, the subject is clear and prominent, and the overall atmosphere is quiet and elegant, full of Eastern charm and rich details. The layers are distinct, combining the elegance of traditional attire with the fashionable feel of modern aesthetics. The composition is balanced, the visual focus is focused, conveying a gentle, serene, and slightly intimate emotional tension, as if telling a tender story about a summer courtyard",
