        {
          "id": "krea2-c807a8986e43c0036f400324",
          "alias": "单女灰连衣裙温泉坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the edge of the hot spring pool, wearing a light gray sleeveless tight dress that hugs her figure, outlining graceful curves. The material features delicate knit textures and a slight sheen. The neckline is round and elegant, simple yet elegant. The hem and mid-thigh reveal long, straight legs. She wears black high heels with pointed toes, slender red heels that contrast sharply with the black upper. Delicate metal chains decorate the ankles, adding a touch of sexiness and forming a delicate low bun. Her makeup is exquisite, her right hand gently touching her chest, her left hand naturally resting on her knee, a simple gold bracelet on her wrist, fingers painted with light pink nail polish, her posture dignified yet slightly alluring. The hot spring pool is round, with walls built from beige stone bricks, giving the surface a noticeably rough texture. The water surface inside is calm, with tiny bubbles floating on the surface. The pool floor is covered with blue-green mosaic tiles dotted with white spots. There are two metal faucets along the poolside, one with a blue knob and another red. The pool platform is made of light gray stone. The edges are smooth, and the woman sits on it, her body slightly leaning forward. Her left leg is bent, her right leg straight, and her feet touching the ground. The background is a wooden wall and partition, with a light brownish-yellow wood color and clearly visible grain. Some areas have natural knotted scars and cracks, creating a warm and rustic atmosphere. In the distance, green plant branches and leaves are faintly visible, with soft and even light coming from above slightly to the left, simulating natural daylight effects. The overall color scheme is mainly warm yellow, blending gray, white, black, and red, with natural transitions of light and shadow, and soft shadows. The background is slightly blurred to highlight the main subject, the composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned on the right side of the frame, occupying the main visual space. The left side leaves the hot spring pool and background space to create a sense of balance. The camera angle slightly looks down to enhance perspective, extending along body lines to the legs and high heels, finally returning to the hot spring pool and background, forming a circular viewing path. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, combining modern fashion with natural comfort, as if capturing a private afternoon relaxation moment. It offers professional studio-level light and shadow control and detail presentation, while preserving the authentic texture of everyday shooting. The image resolution is extremely high, details are rich, and color saturation is moderate, presenting a sophisticated portrait style. It features slight film graininess and soft out-of-focus blur, creating a gentle and nostalgic visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
