        {
          "id": "krea2-1077740ebe0408b055d5fbe4",
          "alias": "单女透视黑短裙广场冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in an indoor corridor, wearing a tight purple high-neck short-sleeved top with delicate vertical textures that presents a soft sheen. The top is tailored to fit the figure, accentuating graceful curves. She pairs a black pencil mini skirt with a clean and neat hem, the material smooth and drapey, forming a striking color contrast with the top. The overall look is sharp and fashionable. She wears sheer stockings, her legs are long and smooth, her right hand naturally hanging down, and her left hand lightly carries a black leather handbag. The bag is square and classic, featuring metal fasteners and slender shoulder straps, giving it a refined and textured look. She wears slim-rimmed glasses with transparent lenses and metal frames with slender and elegant lines. On her earlobes are a pair of long tassel earrings made of multiple layers of metal chains, which gently sway with movement, adding movement and detail. Her makeup is refined and natural, looking directly into the camera and creating a strong visual impact. The background is a dim indoor corridor, and the walls on both sides are finished with dark brown wood with subtle wood grain patterns. The floor is paved with dark gray tiles or carpets, reflecting faint light. In the distance, a row of warm yellow wall lamps or ground lamps can be seen, with light arranged linearly and gradually extending deeper into the distance, creating a clear perspective effect. At the end of the corridor, there is a green glowing sign, which may be an emergency exit indicator light, bringing a splash of brightness to the cool-toned environment. The lighting and shadow treatment throughout the scene is extremely meticulous, with the main light source coming from the left in front of the figure, simulating side lighting in professional studios and creating soft shadow transitions. At the same time, subtle contour light forms on the back and sides, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The background is relatively dark, and the shallow depth of field effect focuses entirely on the subject. The background is highly blurred, and the blurred lighting and structural lines create a sense of depth and space. The composition uses a centered composition, with the figure positioned slightly to the right of the center of the frame, body slightly tilted, head turned toward the camera, posture naturally relaxed yet dignified, with the gaze directed directly at the viewer, creating a strong visual guidance. The overall color palette of the painting is purple, black, Brown is the main color, accented with warm yellow and cool green. The color combination is harmonious and unified, creating a calm yet modern urban atmosphere. The lighting is warm and soft, creating a private, quiet, and slightly sexy ambiance, as if shooting in the corridor of a high-end hotel or private club, with the realistic texture of everyday amateur equipment. The lens looks like it was shot with a medium format camera or a high-end smartphone, with high image clarity, good noise control, and sharp edges, presenting an overall style that combines artistic beauty with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
