        {
          "id": "krea2-0d8be4284774752816206aa1",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫庭院冷淡站立躲藏",
          "prompt": "A woman stands in the ancient courtyard of a Jiangnan water town, wearing a light, flowing light blue semi-transparent shirt layered with a white knit vest. She wears a pure white multi-layered long lace skirt, the hem blooming like flower petals. The overall look is fresh, elegant, and full of artistic flair. She leans slightly against the weathered wooden railing, her left hand gently caressing the hem of her skirt, her right hand naturally hanging down, holding a transparent glass wind chime decorated with red patterns inside. Below hangs a white tag, and she wears exquisite silver earrings and a gold bracelet, as if lost in thought or longing for something. In the foreground is rough stone walls and lush green plant branches and leaves. On the left, lush greenery peeks out from cracks in the rocks, and on the right, low green plants dot the area. The background is a typical Jiangnan residential roof, with blue-gray tiles neatly arranged, forming graceful geometric lines. In the distance, you can faintly see clusters of buildings with white walls and black tiles, along with bare branches. The sky appears in a soft gray-blue tone, with bright and even light. For example, natural light in the early morning or evening shines from the upper right, creating soft highlights and shadows on the figures. The transitions between light and shadow are natural and delicate. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned slightly to the right, with the body slightly tilted, guiding the viewer's gaze toward the upper left, creating a sense of tranquil and distant space. The overall color palette is mainly blue, white, and gray, accented with green plants. The color coordination is harmonious and unified, creating a cool and elegant visual atmosphere with a poetic Eastern aesthetic charm. It also combines modern fashion with a medium shot with moderate focal length, well-handled background blur, highlighting the main character while preserving environmental details. The overall style resembles a quiet scene in an art film, with a strong sense of realism, as if shot with a professional camera in natural light, offering the authentic texture of everyday amateur equipment. The details are rich, the layers are distinct, the light and shadow are fine, the atmosphere is tranquil and far-reaching, full of storytelling and artistic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
