        {
          "id": "krea2-0ea76c983641f16458adf516",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜城市沉思坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on the edge of a beige leather sofa, legs elegantly folded and stretched forward. Her legs, wrapped in black stockings, look smooth, delicate and naturally lustrous under soft light. The leg lines are smooth and graceful, feet slightly raised, toes clearly visible. The black stockings have a slight reflective and pleated details, highlighting the authentic texture. She wears a light brown short-sleeved top with a slightly low neckline and simple shoulder design. The overall look is simple yet fashionable, with a calm expression that carries a hint of gentleness and confidence. The background features a light gray brick wall texture, with fine graininess and irregular joints, creating a textured urban interior space. The floor is light wood-colored with clear and natural wood grain, with slight reflections and shadow transitions. The sofa backrest is curved with stitched edges, giving the overall tone a warm tone. Light shines from the upper left of the frame, creating a soft sidelight effect. Shadows fall on the right side of the body and the floor, presenting a natural three-dimensional effect. The light source comes from an unseen window or lighting fixture. This fills the entire scene with a warm and comfortable atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle shooting angle to emphasize the extension and visual impact of the legs. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with the legs extending from foreground to the center, forming a strong guiding line. The dynamic posture of the legs enhances the tension and dynamism of the image. The color scheme mainly uses earth tones, including off-white, light brown, gray-green, and deep black, with harmonious tones and rich light and shadow layers, smoothly transitioning from bright to dark areas. It creates a quiet, private, and slightly lazy home atmosphere. The overall image has the texture of everyday life, as if taken casually with a regular camera, preserving authentic details and slight noise, without excessive beautification, presenting a natural and authentic aesthetic. The walls and floor in the background emphasize the main subjects under the blur treatment, yet still maintain a certain degree of texture detail, giving the image both depth and realism. The overall atmosphere is peaceful and relaxed, as if capturing an ordinary yet charming moment. Suitable for expressing the daily life and fashion taste of modern urban women",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
