        {
          "id": "krea2-feac0c364da7e9cbbe8d0457",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙椅上冷淡侧头",
          "prompt": "Her posture was elegant and natural, wearing a V-neck short-sleeved dress with a white base and black floral patterns. The fabric was light and flowing, slightly sheer, subtly revealing the dark undergarments. The hem of the skirt naturally hung down with her posture, forming soft pleats. Her legs were together, toes pointing down, barefoot on the floor. Her legs were long and well-proportioned, and sunlight streamed in from the left, shining on her legs. On the arms and the white tiled wall in the background, clear strips of light and shadow are cast, creating a visual effect of alternating light and shadow. The background is a light gray small grid tile wall, clean and tidy, reflecting soft light. On the right side, there is a white chair, matching the style of the chair in the foreground but slightly blurred, creating a sense of spatial layering. The entire scene is dominated by white, accented with a few black floral accents, presenting a fresh and minimalist summer atmosphere. The composition is shot in a medium shot, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center of the frame. The body is slightly tilted, the head slightly tilted, creating a dynamic visual balance. The light comes from the upper left, belonging to natural light, bright and soft, without strong shadows. The overall light and shadow transitions are delicate, highlighting the contours of the figure and skin texture. The color saturation is moderate, with a cool tone and a slight blue tone, enhancing the image's freshness and tranquility. The details are rich, as if shot with a high-resolution camera in the early morning or afternoon, evoking a sense of everyday intimacy and the refined beauty of artistic photography. The overall image is clean, Pure and poetic, it evokes a quiet and beautiful moment",
