        {
          "id": "krea2-0e3ef2fcdb076195afec7553",
          "alias": "单女浴袍广场忧伤站立指向",
          "prompt": "A woman wore an elegant white Hanfu, her wide-sleeved long robe flowing like water. The fabric was light and breathable, with delicate and natural patterns. The collar lined with a faint pink inner garment, adding a touch of gentleness. She stood gracefully under the deep night sky, her expression calm yet slightly melancholic. The lantern was square-shaped, woven from fine bamboo strips forming a diamond-shaped grid. Inside, warm yellow light softly streamed through the gaps, creating a warm and hazy contrast between light and shadow. It creates a quiet and mysterious atmosphere. The lantern's halo gently diffuses in the surrounding air, as if dust is drifting. The woman steadily supports the bottom of the lantern with her right hand while her left hand gently strokes the edge of the lampshade, her movements gentle and focused, as if guarding some precious emotion or memory. The background is a pure deep blue night sky, with even and deep tones without any cluttered elements, making the main figure and lantern stand out even more. The composition uses a golden ratio with the center slightly left, with the figure occupying the main position in the composition. The lantern serves as the visual focal point at the upper left of the image, guiding the gaze upward to form a dynamic line from bottom to top. At the same time, the warm light of the lantern contrasts sharply with the cool background colors to enhance the layering and visual impact of the image. The overall use of light and shadow is clever: the light source comes from the lantern itself, serving as a single-point main light source, creating a backlighting effect that gently outlines the figure's outline and creates a sense of three-dimensionality. The overall composition presents a poetic Eastern aesthetic concept, combining classical charm with the texture of modern photography. It feels like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, with clear focus, sharp details, realistic color reproduction, well-controlled depth of field, delicate background blur to highlight the subject, while retaining sufficient environmental information. The overall atmosphere is quiet, lonely, yet full of emotional tension, like a monologue at night, making one feel the stagnation of time and the accumulation of inner thoughts. The painting mainly uses blue and yellow tones, with a striking contrast of warm and cool tones, harmonious yet dramatic. The composition is simple yet deep, with clear visual guidance. Starting from the glow of the lanterns, it sparks endless imagination in viewers, as if she is standing in a corner of an ancient courtyard or at the end of a mountain path, waiting for something or reminiscing about something. The entire scene exudes a faint sense of nostalgia and Eastern philosophical reflection, like a carefully crafted artistic photographic work combining realism and symbolism, leaving a lasting impression",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
