        {
          "id": "krea2-617f57fc59ecb1b29830d67d",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫桌边忧伤躺跳舞",
          "prompt": "A woman lies sideways on a wooden table covered with vintage book pages and yellowed paper. She wears a loose white shirt with a slightly open collar and sleeves casually rolled up to her elbows, revealing slender arms. She gently holds a bright red poppy flower in her hand. The stems are green, and the leaves have a subtle soft texture, creating a subtle visual effect. Looking directly at the camera, she carries a hint of curiosity and tenderness. As if she was about to whisper a secret, the overall look exuded a youthful yet slightly melancholic temperament. In the foreground, her hands stood out in close-up: she wore a gold bracelet with a thin gold chain on her wrist. Her fingers were long and neatly trimmed, and the back of her hand was covered with a sheer, transparent mesh fabric covered with tiny shimmering particles that shimmered under the light, like stars in the night sky. Symbolizing the stagnation or passage of time, a bouquet of artificial red roses is placed next to the clock. The petals are full and the colors rich, echoing the poppy in the foreground. The overall tone of the painting leans toward warmth, mainly red, white, and brown, creating a nostalgic, romantic, and slightly melancholic atmosphere. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, with the figure occupying most of the space. Light and shadow come from the upper left of the image, soft and warm, creating a natural transition of light and shadow. The shadows are delicate and layered, enhancing the sense of depth and realism. The overall image has the texture of film photography, with slight grain noise and color shifts, simulating the effect of everyday amateur camera shooting. The tone is slightly overexposed, with slight halos and chromatic differences at the edges, further reinforcing the aesthetic style of vintage film. The overall image is poetic and story-rich, as if freezing a summer afternoon, contemplating among piles of old books and dancing with flowers in a tranquil moment—combining youthful innocence with a faint melancholy of the passage of time The composition is compact yet breathable, forming a diagonal line extending from the lower left corner to the upper right. The clock and roses in the background serve as secondary elements, enriching the narrative depth and making the entire scene more immersive and artistically appealing",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
