        {
          "id": "krea2-5f7552552073a3398721aa20",
          "alias": "单女外套户外忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman sits outdoors in the light and shadow, with a natural blush and a hint of melancholy and contemplation, as if in a silent dialogue with the viewer, presenting a soft pink. She wears a dark loose coat with slightly rolled cuffs, revealing slender wrists. Around her neck is a plaid scarf in gray-green and off-white, soft and vintage. The other hand rests on the knee, fingers long, posture natural and relaxed, with a background of blurred blue walls or sky. The tone is cold and pure, creating a strong contrast of warm and cool tones. The foreground is a clear close-up of the character, the middle ground is a partial body detail and the scarf details, and the background is completely blurred to highlight the subject. The composition uses a central composition: the figure is positioned slightly to the left of the center of the frame, with the head slightly tilted, creating a dynamic sense of balance. Then, moving down to hand movements, a smooth line of sight is formed. Light comes from above and below, soft natural light, with rich layers of light and shadow that enhance the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and poetic. It carries a nostalgic film texture, with cool blue tones and warm gold tones forming a striking contrast. The tones are warm yet restrained, with slight graininess and the unique color shifts of film, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera. The background blur is very soft, the depth of field is shallow, highlighting the clarity and detail of the subject. The overall style blends Japanese photoshoot, artistic atmosphere, and film photography aesthetics, giving a sense of tranquility, gentleness, and a touch of melancholy. It was as if she had captured the most authentic moment under the afternoon sun, the images full of storytelling and emotional tension, making people want to explore her inner world",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
