        {
          "id": "krea2-5d868a450bd723da94b85e92",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙室内忧伤侧头",
          "prompt": "She tilts her head slightly, light streaming in from the left, sunlight filtering through the window lattices or leaf gaps, creating mottled points of light and striped shadows, while the other side is hidden in soft shadows, creating a tranquil and dreamlike atmosphere. The white dress she wears features a multi-layered pleated design, Layers of ruffled leaf edges present rich textures and three-dimensionality under light and shadow. The sleeves are wide and puffy, the material is thin and transparent, soft as clouds. The background is blurred, presenting a warm yellow tone with a blurred outline, possibly from wooden furniture or walls in the indoor environment. The overall color scheme is mainly white and warm yellow, accented with soft shadows and golden halos. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space, the head slightly tilted, creating direct communication with the viewer. At the same time, the flow of light and shadow and the folds of clothing guide the gaze downward. The camera angle is slightly upward, enhancing the subject's elegant temperament and sense of sacredness. Using professional photography equipment, such as a full-frame DSLR camera paired with a large-aperture prime lens, it captures delicate light and shadow details and soft skin texture, simulating low-angle backlighting shooting under natural sunlight, creating a warm, romantic, and poetic atmosphere. The image has a film-like texture, moderate color saturation, and preserves realistic light and shadow layers and slight noise. It presents a retro yet sophisticated visual style, with an overall atmosphere that is tranquil, gentle, and full of storytelling. It is as if an afternoon sunlight filling the room is frozen in time, like a classic scene from the film \"Little Women,\" or like an impressionist oil painting, where interplay of light and shadow reveals the innocence of youth and a subtle sadness",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
