        {
          "id": "krea2-1337da3265e2498f2930d823",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫小径困倦倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman wearing a wide-brimmed straw hat, with the brim casting mottled light and shadow, creating a warm and dreamy atmosphere that adds a touch of movement and spontaneity. She wears a white sleeveless shirt with a slightly open neckline, revealing a slender neckline. The overall look is simple yet elegant, with a blurred light green background, possibly outdoor greenery or a beach, giving a summer afternoon feeling. The composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying most of the space and gazing slightly downward. It presents a natural reddish hue, with light coming from the upper and side corners. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the straw hat, creating a mix of light and shadow, enhancing the sense of depth and layering. The overall tone of the image leans toward warmth, mainly off-white, light brown, and light green, with moderate color saturation that creates a peaceful and poetic atmosphere. The lens uses a high-resolution camera with background blur treatment, making the subject stand out more and details clearly visible. Pores and tiny freckles are clearly visible, with natural and smooth light and shadow transitions without obvious hard shadows. The overall image has the texture of film photography, with a slight graininess and vintage tones, like a precious moment captured with an old-fashioned camera. The composition is asymmetrical yet balanced, with the subject's head slightly tilted, forming a natural visual path that adds interest and artistic appeal. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and storyful, like a forgotten summer memory capturing a moment when time stands still. The image is filled with tenderness and nostalgia, as if you can hear the wind blowing through a straw hat and feel the warmth of sunlight. And that moment of peace and beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
