        {
          "id": "krea2-86c9e86a7419b708b7e9d318",
          "alias": "单女透视粉连衣裙摄影棚好奇站立出神",
          "prompt": "Her expression is naturally relaxed, as if lost in thought or curious about a moment. She wears a light pink sheer dress with a large bow decoration at the neckline. The bow is made from a light, toned fabric in the same color family, with rich pleats and distinct layers. The sleeves are puffy puff sleeves, light and flowing, and the hem of the skirt is adorned with exquisite hand-embroidered patterns. Featuring orange-yellow flowers and green vines, the details are rich and elegant. The overall clothing style is sweet and romantic with a retro vibe. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with the body slightly turned and the head turned to the right, forming a soft S-shaped curve. The composition uses a medium close-up style. The background is a pure light beige wall with a smooth surface free of any texture or debris. The clean background makes the subject stand out, with light coming from the front slightly left, creating a delicate shadow transition. The direction of light and shadow is consistent, with moderate contrast between light and shadow, highlighting the sense of three-dimensionality The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and full of feeling. The color palette is mainly pink, yellow, and white, soft and warm. The focus is on the large bow on the chest, and finally extending to the embroidery details on the hem. The whole scene presents a realistic moment captured in daily life, as if a fashion blockbuster shot in a studio with a professional camera, while maintaining a balance between everyday life and artistic feel. The lens is a 50mm standard prime lens with an f/2.8 aperture, shutter speed of 1/125 second, ISO 100. Ensure the background is naturally blurred, the subject is clear and sharp, the image quality is delicate, details are rich, and there is no trace of excessive embellishment. The overall image has strong visual appeal, resembling both a carefully planned fashion photography and a beautiful moment captured casually, full of youthful energy and gentle temperament",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
