        {
          "id": "krea2-509f4aeed620023ff3ba644e",
          "alias": "单女蓝连帽衫室内冷淡坐展示",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a modern-style light-colored fabric sofa, wearing a loose blue hoodie printed with yellow and white lettering. She pairs shorts with her bare feet naturally resting on the edge of the sofa, looking relaxed and lazy. The overall look is fresh and natural, full of youthful energy. The sofa is off-white, soft in texture, topped with several gray and dark gray cushions, one of which is a square cushion with a zippered design. Below the sofa is a deep brown textured carpet, with a delicate woven pattern on the surface that creates a soft color contrast with the sofa. In the background is a large floor-to-ceiling window framed in black metal, with clean and sharp lines. Bright natural light streams in outside, softly and evenly illuminating the entire space, making both the figure and the environment appear transparent and bright. The composition uses a low-angle downward view, shot diagonally from the ground, highlighting the character's long legs and body lines, while also blending the sofa and The window and the main figure are cleverly incorporated into the composition, creating a strong sense of visual depth. The foreground features the carpet and the figure's feet, the middle ground features the sofa and the torso, and the background is the window and the blurred outdoor scene. The light and shadow are distributed naturally, with the light source coming from outside the left window, creating a soft side lighting effect. The transition of shadows is smooth, without harsh contrasts between light and dark. The overall atmosphere is warm and comfortable, combining the breath of life with artistic beauty. The main color palettes are blue, gray, and off-white, with a harmonious contrast of warm and cool to create a tranquil, The relaxing and modern home scene is rich in details and distinct layers, as if taken with a professional camera paired with a large-aperture lens in a natural indoor light environment. It offers a high sense of realism and immersion, capturing the most authentic and touching moments of daily life. The image is clean and tidy, with no unnecessary distractions, highlighting the main subject while showcasing the minimalist aesthetics of a modern home environment. The overall composition is balanced and harmonious, the visual direction flows naturally and smoothly, and the light falling outside the window is the ultimate This forms a complete visual pathway, making people pause to appreciate this moment full of warmth and storytelling",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
