        {
          "id": "krea2-07f29558c24eba068a71cb85",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣俏皮站立侧头",
          "prompt": "She wears a soft pink knit sweater with delicate and clear texture, giving off a warm feel. Her right hand holds a piece of white cake placed on a delicate white porcelain plate. The cake's surface is smooth and white, topped with several blue fruit decorations. Her fingers are long, and her nails are painted gold, reflecting gently in the sunlight. Light slanted in from behind her, with a blurry city street scene in the background. You could see several light-colored residential buildings. The exterior walls looked somewhat old but were clean and tidy, windows neatly arranged, surrounded by dense green trees and vines. The branches and leaves were lush, some of which appeared bright green in the sunlight. In the distance, utility poles and interlaced wires made the sky a clear blue without clouds. The overall tone of the scene was warm and soft, dominated by pink, white, and green, creating a fresh, natural, and lively atmosphere. The composition uses close-ups, with the character positioned slightly to the right of the frame, body slightly angled to the camera, head slightly tilted, creating an interactive visual direction with the viewer. The foreground highlights the main subject and the cake in hand, the middle ground shows the person's body and arm, and the background is a blurred urban environment. The shallow depth of field effect makes the subject stand out even more. Strong backlighting and side lighting are used to make the character outlines clear. Highlights are bright but not overexposed, shadows are soft and unobtrusive, creating a warm and healing atmosphere. It feels as if you've captured an ordinary yet precious everyday moment, like a photo taken with an old film camera. It has slight graininess and low color saturation, with slight halos and light leakage at the edges, enhancing the retro nostalgia feel. The whole scene is full of youthful energy and a love for life, giving a warm, welcoming feeling, like a spring breeze",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
