        {
          "id": "krea2-89ae8e4de76303803e1dd558",
          "alias": "单女棕高领衫酒吧冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits at the high bar in a café, wearing a soft brown turtleneck knit sweater with slightly rolled cuffs revealing slender wrists. She pairs a deep blue high-waisted A-line skirt with the hem naturally draped over black stockings and black ankle boots. The overall look is simple yet layered, appearing lazy yet full of vitality. Adding a touch of refinement to the overall look, a tempting burger sits on the wooden bar in front of her. Golden bread dough wraps juicy patties, fresh lettuce, and melted cheese. Next to it is a dark cold drink served in a transparent glass with a black straw stuck in it. Fine droplets of water condense on the rim, and the background is a blurred indoor space, where you can see blue seatbacks and soft white curtains. Light streams in through the window, creating a warm backlight effect and a peaceful and comfortable atmosphere. The floor is paved with blue and white geometric tiles, echoing the colors of the characters' clothing. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure occupying about two-thirds of the left side of the frame, slightly tilted, interacting with the viewer. The middle shot shows the food on the bar counter and some environmental details, while the background is blurred to highlight the subject. Light and shadow come from the right rear, creating soft contour light and subtle shadow transitions. The overall color palette is warm brown, deep blue, and wood tones, creating a warm, everyday, and slightly fashionable living scene The image presents a realistic and delicate photographic texture, as if a magazine-style portrait shot with a professional camera under natural light, offering strong visual guidance. The image then follows her gaze and posture to the food on the bar counter, finally lingering in the soft light and shadow of the background. The entire scene is full of life and artistic beauty, like a carefully composed urban leisure portrait, conveying a relaxed and enjoyable mood of the moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
