        {
          "id": "krea2-e7c0ff5175ad1968483be3ab",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道温柔站立",
          "prompt": "Her expression is gentle and serene. She wears a white shirt with a neat, upright neckline and loose, comfortable sleeves. Over it is an off-white knit tank top. The shoulder lines are smooth, and the material looks soft and thick, with delicate textures. On her left shoulder is a brown leather backpack strap slung diagonally. The strap feels authentic, with clear edges that contrast with the clothing. She stands slightly to the side, her body slightly tilted, and her posture relaxed and natural. The background is a blurry golden forest, with leaves showing rich autumn hues. Sunlight filters through the leaves, casting mottled light and shadow, creating a warm and gentle atmosphere. The entire shot uses a shallow depth of field technique, with the foreground figures clearly prominent, the background blurred into a hazy golden halo. In composition, the figure is positioned slightly to the right, leaving space on the left to create a sense of visual balance. Light comes from the side and rear, either backlighting or side backlighting, with sunlight shining from behind the figure, creating a natural transition of light and shadow with a moderate contrast between light and shadow. The overall color palette is mainly warm yellow and white, creating a peaceful, cozy, and slightly poetic autumn atmosphere. The image has a strong film texture, as if shot with an old-fashioned camera, with slight graininess and natural color temperature shifts. The color saturation is moderate, not overly vivid, preserving realistic light and shadow layers. The lens is a 50mm prime portrait lens that simulates real photography effects, capturing the most natural state of the subject. The overall image presents a beautiful moment moments moments that are unintentionally frozen in everyday life. Like a street photo full of everyday life, it is both artistic and intimate, as if you can feel the warmth of the breeze and the warmth of sunlight on your body. The entire scene is filled with a subtle sense of nostalgia and a cherishing of beautiful times. The details are rich: although the leaves in the background are blurry, their shapes and color changes can still be distinguished. The reflections and refractions of light and shadow on different surfaces are authentic and natural. The whole image is full of vitality and emotional warmth, making you want to stop and walk. Quietly enjoy this beautiful moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
