        {
          "id": "krea2-28f88244267f7cbddadaf6ef",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣摄影棚困倦跳舞",
          "prompt": "She wears a white coarse knit sweater and scarf. The thick fabric texture is clearly visible, warm and soft, forming a sharp contrast with the cold rainy night. The handle of the black umbrella slants through the frame, forming a visual guiding line. The background is a blurry deep blue night sky, with raindrops dancing on the umbrella surface and air, creating dynamic light spots. In the distance, the blurred halo of city lights can be faintly seen, creating a hazy, dreamy atmosphere. The overall composition uses close-ups, with the figure occupying the center to the right, heads slightly tilted. Light and shadow softly cast from the right, creating a contrast of light and shadow that highlights three-dimensionality. The left side is in shadow, enhancing spatial layering. The light is warm like the afterglow of dusk, creating a contrast with the cool-toned background and creating an atmosphere that is both cozy and lonely. The entire scene is full of cinematic feel, like a professional studio shoot, using a large-aperture lens to capture shallow depth of field. The details are rich, the texture delicate, and has a slight film graininess. It presents a literary retro style, as if recording a fleeting emotion on a quiet night. Raindrops trace fine tracks in the air, frozen by flashes to form dot-like light spots, adding dynamism and poetry to the scene. The characters' expressions are natural and authentic, without excessive embellishment, showcasing an unintentional beauty found in everyday life. The overall color scheme is mainly cool blue, accented with warm yellow light sources, creating a complex blend of winter night's chill and inner warmth. The composition cleverly uses the edge of an umbrella and the figure's posture to form a triangular structure, stable yet full of tension, guiding viewers to feel their inner world. Raindrops and light spots in the background are randomly distributed, enhancing the image's realism and sense of life. The overall atmosphere is quiet and heartfelt, as if time has stopped at this moment, leaving only the sound of rain and heartbeat. The images have strong narrative and artistic appeal, like a carefully composed photographic work, combining the refinement of commercial photography with the expression of personal emotions. The color saturation is moderate, avoiding over-rendering to maintain a natural and authentic texture, with soft light and shadow transitions. The attention to detail is spot-on, showcasing superb photography skills and aesthetic taste. The overall composition is like a silent poem, telling a story about waiting, longing, or loneliness",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
