        {
          "id": "krea2-040278d15c63113f45dedaa9",
          "alias": "单女黑西装摄影棚冷淡坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on an orange plastic chair, dressed in a black blazer and black lace shorts. Her makeup is exquisite, her posture elegant and confident. The background is pure white walls and ceiling, clean and simple, without unnecessary decoration. On the left side, there is the outline of some filming equipment, including a black reflector and some cables. These elements suggest that this is a studio setting. In the foreground, a blurry black object can be seen, possibly the photographer's feet or part of the equipment, adding realism and a sense of presence. The composition uses low-angle downward shots to highlight the tall figure and aura. The visual guide gradually transitions from the blurry object in the foreground to the main figure, then extends to the clean background space. The lighting and shadow effects are mainly bright white, paired with soft shadows, enhancing the image's sense of depth and layering. The overall tone leans toward a cool tone. It gives a modern, minimalist, and slightly mysterious feel, with images that have the texture of a professional studio while preserving authentic details from everyday shooting, such as slight noise and natural light and shadow changes, making the images more authentic and artistic",
