        {
          "id": "krea2-719a5c63c9dfa98f705b20bf",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣街道忧伤站立出神",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a crosswalk on a city street, wearing a loose brown knit sweater with a soft and voluminous texture that presents a warm deep brown tone. The neckline is slightly cinched, and the sleeves hang naturally. The overall look is simple and comfortable, with a subtle detachment and calmness in her expression. She wears a pair of round metal earrings that glint gently in the sunlight, adding a touch of refinement to the overall look. Her body is slightly turned and her right hand rests gently on the metal railing beside her, her posture natural and relaxed, as if she has just stopped, gazing into the distance or waiting for something. The foreground is a clear main figure, occupying the left central position of the composition. The composition uses a low-angle downward shot, making the figure appear more upright and presentable. The background is a blurry city streetscape composed of multi-story buildings. On the right is a modern-style glass curtain wall building reflecting the warm yellow sunset sunlight, creating a soft interplay of light and shadow. On the left is a grayish-white residential building with neatly arranged windows, some of which emit indoor light. In the distance, utility poles and power lines crossing the street can be seen. The interlaced lines add spatial layers to the image. The middle ground is a street paved with dark gray asphalt. The white zebra crossing is clearly visible, with slightly worn edges, showing signs of daily use. The road is also scattered with some fallen leaves and small debris, enhancing realism. The sky shows a gradient of light orange and light blue, indicating that dusk is approaching. Light shines diagonally from the upper right, creating a strong backlighting effect. The figure's outline is outlined in a soft golden halo, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. It creates a warm yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. The entire picture is dominated by warm tones, with brown, orange-yellow, off-white, and gray-blue interwoven in harmony, forming a visual flow from near to far. The composition uses shallow depth of field to highlight the subject, and the background is well blurred, preserving environmental information without interfering with the subject. The overall image has a cinematic texture, as if shot with a professional camera, featuring slight graininess and a retro filter effect with low color saturation. It presents a fleeting beauty captured casually in daily life, full of the poetry and loneliness of urban life, while also possessing a personal temperament that blends fashion and spontaneity. It is suitable for expressing themes of youth, growth, urban life, and inner monologue. The images are rich in detail, from clothing textures to building materials clearly distinguishable, with natural transitions of light and shadow. The overall atmosphere is quiet and profound, evoking a brief pause on the way home in the evening or some reflection and anticipation for the future",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
