        {
          "id": "krea2-e8fe28c290afe5d721fb18b4",
          "alias": "单女俏皮倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "Her posture is relaxed and full of energy, her body slightly leaning forward, head slightly tilted, exuding a youthful playfulness. The background features blurry green leaves, with interlaced light and shadow creating a warm and soft atmosphere. Light slants down from above, and the overall composition uses a medium shot. The figure occupies the left central position, leaving ample negative space on the right side, focusing on the expressions and movements. The foreground features a clear camera and some hand details, the middle ground is the main subject, and the background features blurred greenery and faintly visible fan outlines, enhancing the spatial layering of the image. The use of light and shadow is skillful. It presents a grainy texture and vintage tones reminiscent of film photography, with warm yellow tones as the main color, complemented by vivid red and white checkered patterns and fresh green plants, creating a warm and cozy summer afternoon atmosphere. The images feature slight overexposure and film-specific color shifts, simulating the realism of everyday amateur equipment shooting. It feels like a snapshot taken casually yet full of vitality. The overall style combines a sense of life and artistic beauty, conveying freedom, happiness, and a love for life.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
