        {
          "id": "krea2-862d7ff61bd08d062e51bc5c",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣室内坐",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a vintage-style indoor setting, her makeup natural and sheer, her overall aura elegant and calm. She wears a deep blue sleeveless tight knit top that fits her body and showcases graceful curves. She pairs a light yellow high-waisted pleated midi skirt, the hem naturally draping to create smooth pleats and layers. The material is light and flowing, presenting a silky sheen. Her body leans slightly back against the armrest of a beige fabric single sofa, with her left arm naturally resting on the sofa backrest. The right arm rests relaxedly on the thigh, with a relaxed and relaxed posture, exuding a lazy elegance. The foreground features the main figure occupying the center-left position, with a medium perspective that presents the figure from head to knee in full. The background is orange-brown wallpaper with golden Baroque patterns, delicate and intricate, creating a classical and luxurious atmosphere. On the left is a white-framed multi-pane glass window, from which faint greenery and architectural outlines can be faintly seen. Light softly streams through the window into the interior, creating a natural side lighting. On the right side is a small round white carved side table with exquisite hollowed-out decorations along the tabletop. Nearby hangs heavy beige curtains with golden patterns, gently tied with straps to create an elegant drape. The floor is covered with a dark brown carpet, soft in texture and connected to the wooden floor. The entire space is warm and harmonious, mainly in warm orange, beige, and deep blue, with natural transitions of light and shadow, soft contrasts of light and shadow, and the light source coming from the front left window, creating subtle shadows and highlights, resulting in a stable and balanced composition. At the same time, the flowing lines of the skirt extend to the lower right of the frame, creating a visual extension. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, blending vintage charm with modern fashion. It feels like a high-quality portrait shot with a professional camera, featuring cinematic texture and delicate detail. The image is extremely clear and moderately saturated, presenting a realistic and artistically rich image effect, like a carefully arranged indoor portrait capturing the subject's natural state and inner temperament in a private space",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
          "usage_count": 0,
