        {
          "id": "krea2-5f7a256efcb32634f8256fec",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣椅上忧伤倚靠手持物",
          "prompt": "A woman leans sideways on a wooden chair, her body slightly leaning forward. Her left hand rests lightly on the wooden armrest of the chair, fingers naturally bent, her posture relaxed and lazy, displaying an effortless elegance and spontaneity. She wears a light blue loose knit sweater with clearly visible texture, presenting a warm and soft texture. The shoulders are off-shoulder, revealing one shoulder and collarbone line, adding a touch of sexiness and playfulness. The look is voluminous and layered, carrying a faint melancholy and contemplation, slightly open, revealing a subtle emotion of wanting to speak but holding back. Her head tilts slightly, as if silently communicating with the viewer, creating an intimate and genuine emotional connection. The main subject is positioned near the center on the right side of the composition, forming a visual focal point. The foreground features details of the upper body and hands, including the texture of sweaters, finger joints, and the wooden structure of the wooden chair. The chair's material is rough yet natural, with obvious wood grain and wear marks on the surface, showing the accumulation of time. The middle ground is the blurred areas of the figure's body and background. The background is a warm indoor environment, with light slanting in from the left, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow. Objects in the background are blurred, with faint outlines of wooden furniture or walls. The tones are mainly warm yellow and orange, creating a tranquil atmosphere at dusk. The composition uses close-ups, with diagonal light and shadows guiding the view. The visual direction works together with the figure's posture, with light shining down from the upper left and soft shadows on the other side. It enhances the sense of three-dimensionality and space, with a warm and soft lighting atmosphere, reminiscent of vintage film photography. The tones are warm, color saturation is moderate, with slight graininess and noise, simulating the effects of everyday amateur equipment. The overall image presents a quiet, warm, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere, as if capturing an ordinary yet touching moment, conveying the delicate emotions of youth, innocence, and inner world. The entire scene feels like a quiet moment in a movie, full of poetry and storytelling.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
