        {
          "id": "krea2-546011ff1168211774a74d60",
          "alias": "单女制服公园困倦站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman dressed in a Japanese school uniform, wearing a white short-sleeved shirt paired with a green plaid pleated skirt, stands beside a thick tree trunk, her body slightly leaning against the tree. Her left hand gently supports the trunk, her right hand hangs naturally, carrying a white backpack with the strap slung over her shoulder. Her overall posture is elegant and natural, full of youthful energy. In the foreground, the main figure occupies the center-left position, in the middle the ground is the thick trunk and some branches and leaves. The bark grain is clearly visible, the trunk surface shows natural cracks and mottled marks, and the background is dense forest. Layers of leaves create varying shades of green. Sunlight filters through the gaps and casts mottled light and shadow, creating soft light spots. Light shines down from the upper right, creating a contrast of light and shadow and creating a warm and bright atmosphere. The composition uses a three-part method: the figure is positioned on the left third of the canvas, with tree trunks vertically running through the center to form a visual guideline. The background blur highlights the subject, and the layers between foreground and background are distinct. The visual direction flows naturally and smoothly, creating a warm and soft lighting atmosphere. The light spots formed by sunlight filtering through the leaves add a dreamy feel to the image. The overall tone is fresh and natural, complemented by brown trunks and gray shadows, creating a harmonious and unified color scheme. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, rich in detail and high-resolution presentation, with a strong sense of everyday realism and artistic beauty. It feels like a photographer accidentally capturing beautiful moments in a park—authentic and full of life, while also featuring cinematic light and shadow aesthetics. The characters' expressions are natural, their movements free, as if they have just finished a day of study. Enjoying a moment of tranquility and freedom, the entire scene is filled with youthful energy and poetic beauty",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
