        {
          "id": "krea2-4f4de34972fd3e26c2d10c16",
          "alias": "单女透视黑高跟鞋摄影棚俏皮脱衣",
          "prompt": "Her left hand holds a silver metal tray holding a deep green glass bottle of champagne and an empty martini glass. Her right hand naturally rises in a light fist pose, her body slightly turned to the side, her right leg bent and raised, toes touching the ground, showing off her long leg lines, dressed in black high heels and sheer stockings. The overall look blends sexiness with professionalism. Costume details include a black cropped jacket, white shirt collar, and black bow. The chest features a low slit that reveals part of the skin, with a long black ribbon hanging down the back. The composition uses a mid-shot full-body perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left center, creating a visual focal point. The simple white background highlights the main contour, with light coming from the upper front, softly illuminating the figure and creating slight shadows to enhance the three-dimensional effect. The transition between light and shadow is delicate. The overall atmosphere is fashionable, alluring, and professional. The color palette is mainly black and white, accented with the deep green of champagne bottles and silver-gray of metal trays. The color contrast is sharp yet harmonious, creating a clean and crisp image without unnecessary elements, presenting the texture of a high-end studio shoot, reminiscent of classic looks from professional models in high-end commercial advertisements or fashion portraits. At the same time, it retains a touch of realism typical of everyday amateur equipment, making the images more lively and authentic",
