        {
          "id": "krea2-8d07d0409d2124e4cc779274",
          "alias": "单女白外套街道忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands on an outdoor street, wearing a white and black patchwork sports jacket. The shoulders and sleeves of the jacket are decorated with distinct white stripes, and underneath a light-colored shirt. The neckline is slightly open, revealing the neck line. The overall outfit presents a typical campus style. She carries an off-white backpack with the strap slung across her right shoulder. The material of the backpack looks soft and slightly wrinkled, giving off a natural and casual vibe, accented with a natural brown accent. Looking directly at the camera, her expression is natural and friendly, full of youthful energy. The figure is positioned slightly to the left center of the frame, with the head slightly tilted and the body slightly angled to the side, creating a dynamic sense of balance. The composition uses a medium shot close-up, with the background blurred, presenting a blurry city street scene. The outlines of buildings and some vertical line structures can be faintly seen, possibly railings or building columns. The background tones are mainly cool gray and deep blue, creating a peaceful yet slightly melancholic atmosphere. Light comes from the left front of the figure, creating a delicate transition of light and shadow that makes the character's outline stand out even more. The overall light and shadow distribution is even, with no strong contrast, presenting a warm and soft texture. The image tones tend to be cool, creating a warm contrast. The image has a high degree of realism, as if shot with a professional camera. The lens focus is precise, background blur is natural, presenting a shallow depth of field photography style. The details are rich, with pores and tiny freckles realistically presented. The wrinkles and fabric texture of the clothing are very well rendered. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and full of storytelling, as if capturing a daily moment, full of life and youthful memories. The image texture is delicate, with rich color layers. It combines the graininess and retro charm of film photography with the clarity and color accuracy of modern digital imaging. The composition is stable and full of tension, with naturally relaxed poses without forced posing, giving a sense of authenticity, warmth, and warmth. The entire scene is filled with a subtle nostalgia and the pure beauty of youth",
