        {
          "id": "krea2-8ae878ec99d907ff61f7ae07",
          "alias": "单女白高领衫室内坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a cozy indoor setting, wearing an off-white turtleneck chunky knit sweater. The sweater's texture is clearly visible, presenting a classic twisted pattern with wide and soft sleeves, naturally draping over her arms. The sweater material looks thick and warm, giving a comfortable feeling. She wears a white turtleneck base layer underneath, paired with a plaid mini skirt that weaves light and dark lines to showcase the classic Scottish plaid design. The plaid pattern appears layered under the light, the hem of the skirt slightly unfolding, revealing her legs clad in gray tight pants. The gray pants fit the body perfectly, with a delicate texture that softly contrasts with the warm tones of the sweater, adding a touch of softness and laziness. Her makeup is exquisite, and as she gazes at the camera, her fingers are long, her posture elegant. Her left hand rests naturally on her knee, her body leaning slightly forward, creating a warm and relaxed atmosphere. The background is a bedroom scene, with a neat bed and light-colored sheets. The headboard is a curved metal headboard, with smooth and decorative lines. The wall behind the headboard is a soft off-white, with a small decorative painting hanging in a wooden frame. The content is blurry but faintly reveals some vintage elements. On the right side of the room is a woven basket containing several books or magazines, each with different covers, adding a sense of life. The entire space is enveloped in warm yellow lighting, with the light source coming from the left side of the image—possibly natural light streaming through the window or warm indoor lighting. Light softly falls on the figure, creating a natural transition between light and shadow. The shadows are soft, enhancing the sense of three-dimensionality. The overall composition centers on the figure, using medium and close-up shots. The figure occupies most of the image, with a slightly tilted head to interact with the viewer. The foreground highlights details of the upper body and hands, while the middle shot shows her lower body and part of the bedding environment. The lighting and shadow atmosphere is warm and tranquil, with main tones of off-white, light brown, gray, and orange-red. The harmonious color combinations create a comfortable, relaxed, and slightly artistic living scene. The overall image presents a beautiful moment of daily life, as if capturing a tranquil afternoon sunlight filling the room. The image style is realistic and natural, rich in life atmosphere and artistic beauty, suitable for themes such as youth, gentleness, home, and art",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
