        {
          "id": "krea2-3effc2e99ea6000292f4bae8",
          "alias": "单女女仆女仆装公园叉腰",
          "prompt": "A woman wore an exquisite maid outfit, a black silk top with a white Peter Pan collar and cuffs, four neatly arranged black buttons on the chest, puff sleeves, and a wide white apron at the waist. The skirt was voluminous and naturally draped down, the overall outfit was well-tailored with meticulous details. She wore a white lace headband adorned with a small bow decoration. She stood slightly sideways, left hand on hip, right hand naturally hanging down. Her makeup was exquisite but not overly heavy, with an outdoor park or courtyard setting in the background. Blurred green plants and trees create a soft bokeh effect. Sunlight slants down from the upper right of the frame, creating a warm and bright backlight. Light passes through the gaps in the leaves, casting mottled shadows on the figures, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The foreground features the main figure, with a mid-angle portrait position. The figure is positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right. The visual guide naturally extends from the figure's posture and gaze direction outward, creating rich layers of light and shadow, while the shadows transition softly. The overall color scheme is mainly black and white, supplemented by natural green and warm yellow tones. The image texture is delicate, as if shot with a professional camera, with a strong sense of artistry and a sense of everyday life. It presents a scene that is both everyday and full of fantasy, capturing the co-performer's elegant moments in the sunlight. The whole picture is full of youthful energy and gentle temperament, with balanced composition, clear focus, and well-handled background blur, highlighting the main subject. The use of light and shadow is skillful, creating a peaceful and beautiful afternoon atmosphere",
