        {
          "id": "krea2-ad20c485f06c03f9b6f8be04",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙公园困倦坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench in the park, adding a touch of liveliness and casualness. She wears a light, flowing white dress adorned with small pink floral patterns. The flowers vary in shape, size, and are evenly distributed, creating a fresh and sweet pastoral style. The short-sleeved design reveals slender arms, and the hem spreads out in an A-shape, creating rich layers that look elegant and energetic. She holds a cute vintage camera in both hands, with a soft pink body and a fresh sky blue lens The edges are decorated with white, and the side of the device features a kitten paw print pattern, paired with a pink strap. The overall design is full of playful and dreamy charm. She leans slightly to the side, carrying a hint of playfulness and shyness. Her makeup is natural and fresh. She sits on a brown wooden bench, whose surface looks slightly worn and the wood grain is clearly visible. Some areas show slight wear. The background is a dense green forest, and the leaves under the sunlight create rich layers, ranging from dark green to light green, with mottled light and shadow creating a soft bokeh effect. In the distance, faint tree trunks and shrubs can be faintly seen, adding depth to the scene. Light comes from above, simulating the warm natural glow of an afternoon. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating soft highlights and shadows on the figures. The overall color scheme is mainly pink, white, and green, with harmonious and cozy color combinations. The composition uses a medium perspective, with the figure positioned slightly to the left of the frame, leaving space on the right side to display the background environment. The shallow depth of field effect makes the foreground figures stand out clearly, while the background blurs out, creating a sense of tranquility. The romantic and sentimental atmosphere presents an overall beauty of casual moments in daily life, as if captured with a portable camera, with a slight film graininess and soft exposure transitions that enhance realism and nostalgia, while preserving delicate details. The entire image is full of youthful vitality and pure beauty, evoking the comfort and tenderness of a summer afternoon",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
