        {
          "id": "krea2-5c6805b12e9adbd2f58d0f50",
          "alias": "单女蓝毛衣窗边冷淡持相机",
          "prompt": "A woman is shown in a half-body close-up, wearing a light blue chunky knit sweater whose texture is clearly visible, presenting a warm and soft texture. The V-neck design naturally outlines the neckline, with intricate and delicate details on the cuffs and shoulders. The variations in yarn thickness and the layered knitting techniques appear vivid under light and shadow, adding a touch of laziness and casual beauty. Her hand posture is elegant, her nails neatly trimmed, and her overall movements smooth and natural. The background is a blurred indoor environment, with a faint white wall and a window. Soft natural light streams in from the left, creating a natural transition of light and shadow that creates a warm and tranquil atmosphere. The overall color tone of the painting mainly features a contrast of warm and cool tones. The white wall in the background and the halo outside the window enhance the sense of depth in the space. The composition uses close-ups, with the figures occupying most of the image, their heads slightly tilted, creating direct communication with the viewer. There is a slight shadow area in the upper right corner of the painting and soft highlights in the lower left corner. The light and shadow are evenly distributed, creating a realistic and delicate light and shadow effect. The overall atmosphere is quiet, warm, and healing, carrying a sense of warmth from everyday life. It feels like a moment when afternoon sunlight fills the room, capturing the most natural and natural moments of youth. At its most authentic state, the image presents a texture similar to amateur camera shooting, with rich details and moderate color saturation, no excessive embellishment, preserving the original light, shadow, and texture, giving an immersive feeling as if you can feel the sweater's warmth and the breeze in the air.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
