        {
          "id": "krea2-3a53b2dec33bc6c150b154fd",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙森林站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands outdoors in a sun-dappled forest, naturally falling over her shoulders. She wears a white spaghetti-strap slip dress, the delicate straps outlining a graceful collarbone, giving a fresh and natural look. Her right hand gently rests a leaf of a lush fern, its edges clearly visible, veins distinct. Her posture is relaxed and natural, her body slightly turned to the side, and her head tilted slightly. It presents an effortless elegance, with rich details. The background is a blurred green canopy, with layers of leaves presenting varying shades of green. Sunlight filters through the gaps in the leaves, creating a mottled light and shadow effect. Light spots scatter across the frame, creating a dreamlike atmosphere. The middle is her upper body and surroundings, with light slanting down from above, creating a strong contrast of light and shadow, while the other half is in shadow, enhancing the sense of depth and depth. The background blur is handled very gently, highlighting the main subject. The composition uses a center-left golden ratio layout, with the figure occupying the main position but leaving ample breathing space. The visual guide extends from her fingers to the leaves, forming a smooth visual path. The overall tone is mainly warm yellow-green, blending the golden yellow of sunlight with the emerald green of leaves. The color saturation is moderate—neither too bright nor too dull. The lighting and shadow atmosphere are bright and soft, and the Tyndall effect created by sunlight passing through leaves fills the entire painting with vitality and energy. You can almost feel the coolness of a summer breeze. The image has the texture of film photography, with slight graininess and natural color fading, simulating the realism of everyday amateur camera shooting. The overall image presents a peaceful, poetic, and slightly nostalgic atmosphere, as if capturing the most beautiful moment of a summer afternoon, full of youthful vitality and love for nature",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
