        {
          "id": "krea2-585828f7e2e5d0246a448aab",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙摄影棚俏皮坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman sits in a classic-style beige carved armchair, wearing a simple yet elegant black spaghetti strap dress. The skirt fits her figure, showcasing smooth curves and exquisite tailoring. The slender straps highlight her long collarbones and shoulder line. The overall look is both modern and vintage-rich. A large black satin bow hairpiece is tied atop her head, adding a playful and lively touch. She leans slightly to the side, fingers long, nails painted in light pink or sheer nails, her right hand hangs naturally, and she wears a string of pearl bracelets on her wrist The beads are round and full, emitting a gentle luster. She wears a pair of large, round pearl earrings, whose smooth surfaces reflect a soft halo. Around her neck is a delicate necklace, possibly made of silver or gilded material, echoing the earrings. Looking directly at the camera, she carries a hint of laziness and deep thought, appearing delicate and full of vitality. Her posture is relaxed and confident, her body slightly leaned, legs crossed, knees slightly bent, right leg pressed over left. It creates a casual yet elegant sitting posture. The background is a pure gray gradient wall, transitioning naturally from light gray to dark gray, without unnecessary decoration, highlighting the main figure. Light comes from the front slightly left, soft and even, like studio lighting. The shadows are delicate and layered, presenting a natural gloss that enhances the three-dimensional effect. The composition uses a mid-shot portrait, with the figure occupying the main part of the frame, positioned on the right side, leaving space on the left side to create visual balance. The background is moderately blurred, highlighting the subject. It also retains some details of the chair, such as carved patterns and the curved armrests, adding depth to the image. The color scheme is dominated by black, white, and gray, creating a classic and sophisticated visual effect. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and elegant, combining fashion and artistic flair. It feels like a carefully crafted commercial portrait, yet it also exudes a sense of realism for everyday shooting. It's like shooting in an indoor studio with a professional camera paired with a softbox, with natural light and shadow transitions, clear details, and delicate texture. It presents an imaging style that is both stylish and warm, with a sense of everyday life",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
