        {
          "id": "krea2-48d2043fdcf330df7157108c",
          "alias": "单女灰高领衫城市忧伤站立",
          "prompt": "A woman stands sideways by the window, wearing a thick gray turtleneck knit sweater whose texture is clearly visible, presenting a warm and soft texture. The sleeves are slightly rolled up, revealing slender wrists. Her body leans slightly forward, her back to the camera, forming a layered silhouette, with the main figure in the foreground. Occupying most of the right side of the painting, the composition uses a rule of thirds: the figure is positioned in the right third, leaving a large amount of blank space on the left to highlight spatial sense and visual extension. The background features a city of skyscrapers, with buildings blurring into hazy geometric shapes in the distance. The glass curtain wall reflects the light from the sky, presenting a cool blue-gray tone. The window frame is clearly visible, and a corner of the white curtain hangs in the upper left corner of the painting, with soft edges contrasting with indoor lighting. The overall lighting and shadow atmosphere leans toward natural light. Soft light from outside the window illuminates the figure from the side, creating a subtle transition between light and shadow that enhances the sense of depth. At the same time, the strong light in the background contrasts with the character's low light, creating a serene, lonely, and poetic atmosphere. The overall tone of the painting leans toward a cool tone, mainly gray-blue, accented with warm gray from sweaters, creating a warm and cool contrast that enhances visual tension. The details are handled with delicate detail, the composition is simple yet emotionally expressive, and the visual guide follows the character's line of sight outside the window, extending to the distant architectural clusters. forming a coherent spatial pathway. The entire image has a strong cinematic and film-like texture, as if a quiet moment from everyday life, like real life clips shot with an amateur camera, with slight graininess and color distortion, simulating the retro style of vintage film photography. The image contains no unnecessary decorations or distractions, focusing purely on the relationship between the characters and their environment, conveying a sense of alienation and inner monologue commonly found in urban life. The overall atmosphere is quiet, contemplative, gentle, and slightly melancholic. Like a silent poem, it immerses people in that private, personal moment",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
