        {
          "id": "krea2-ff73e3c3ae923de61a3c595b",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤困倦侧头",
          "prompt": "A close-up portrait of a woman, carrying a touch of gentleness and calmness, presents a natural pink hue with a healthy glow. She wears a black spaghetti-strap camisole top, with clean and elegant lines. Her hands gently hold a string of warm yellow LED lights. Her fingers are slender and long, her nails neatly trimmed. The light casts a warm glow on her fingertips and the back of her hand, creating soft highlights and delicate transitions of light and shadow. The small bulbs on the string emit a bright and warm golden glow. Some bulbs are blurred into circular light spots due to depth of field, creating a dreamlike bokeh effect. The foreground features dense strings of lights and blurred light spots, while the background completely blurs into a deep dark tone, almost indistinguishable. The composition uses a center composition, with the figure positioned slightly below the center of the frame, head slightly tilted, gazing directly at the camera, creating strong visual guidance. The foreground string lights extend diagonally from the lower left corner to the upper right corner, forming a diagonal composition that enhances the dynamic and depth of the image. The light mainly comes from the string lights themselves, which are backlight and side backlighting, softly outlining the character's outline. The overall atmosphere is warm, romantic, dreamy, and slightly melancholic. The color tone is warm yellow, with moderate color saturation and rich layering. The image has a strong film texture, with slight graininess and low contrast, simulating the realism of amateur camera shooting. The lens is a 50mm prime lens with an aperture set to f/1.8, achieving an extremely shallow depth of field, making the subject clear and the background completely blurred. The shooting angle is set at a slightly low level view, highlighting the person's affinity and presence, presenting an intimate, tranquil, and emotionally charged moment capture. It feels as if on a quiet night, she is alone immersed in a world of light, her thoughts drifting far away, emotions restrained yet profound, with no unnecessary elements distracting the frame. Every detail serves to create an immersive and poetic visual experience",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
