        {
          "id": "krea2-ccc85c94cbf22b78e5cbef67",
          "alias": "单女短裙公寓困倦跪",
          "prompt": "A woman kneels on an indoor carpet, wearing a sporty short top and skirt in pink and white. The top is sleeveless with a zippered front neckline, and a high-waisted pleated mini skirt with white trim. Her makeup is delicate and natural, her posture elegant and dignified. Her hands rest lightly on the floor behind her, her body leans slightly forward, creating a warm and focused interaction. The foreground focuses on the main figure, while in the middle ground, a light beige plush carpet spreads out, with delicate and realistic textures. The background environment is a modern home space, with wooden walls or cabinets on the left, a large flat-screen TV placed behind the right side, displaying a blurry image and emitting a purple cool light. Below the TV is a black flowerpot planted with green plants, and nearby are white air purifiers and other everyday appliances. The overall lighting is soft and warm, with the main light source coming from the front slightly left, creating uniform frontal lighting. At the same time, the purple lighting background creates a sense of technology and a dreamy atmosphere. The layers of light and shadow are rich, the transition between light and dark is natural, and the colors include pink, white, Beige is the main tone, accented by a purple halo in the background, creating a striking contrast yet harmonious unity. The composition adopts a centrally symmetrical layout, with characters centered and prominent, and a slightly overhead perspective enhancing visual affinity. The edges of the frame are slightly blurred to enhance focus, creating an overall atmosphere that combines the warmth of daily life with the futuristic feel of a virtual world, as if capturing a moment between a game streamer or online idol during a live stream. The real scene blends with digital aesthetics, creating strong visual appeal and emotional appeal. It is similar to high-quality portrait works shot with professional cameras paired with softboxes, but retains a sense of everyday texture and detail, presenting an aesthetic style that is both refined and close to reality",
